Section Container\n<section className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24\">\n  {/* content */}\n</section>\n\n// Card Base\n<div className=\"bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border border-border p-6\">\n  {/* content */}\n</div>\n\n// Button","body":"# Tailwind CSS Component Patterns\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-14\n**Tailwind Compatibility**: v3.x and v4.x\n**Source**: Production projects, shadcn/ui patterns\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Essential Patterns\n\n```tsx\n// Section Container\n<section className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24\">\n  {/* content */}\n</section>\n\n// Card Base\n<div className=\"bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border border-border p-6\">\n  {/* content */}\n</div>\n\n// Button Primary\n<button className=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors\">\n  Click me\n</button>\n\n// Responsive Grid\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n  {/* items */}\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Spacing Scale\n\nConsistent spacing prevents design drift:\n\n| Usage | Classes | Output |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| **Tight spacing** | `gap-2 p-2 space-y-2` | 0.5rem (8px) |\n| **Standard spacing** | `gap-4 p-4 space-y-4` | 1rem (16px) |\n| **Comfortable** | `gap-6 p-6 space-y-6` | 1.5rem (24px) |\n| **Loose** | `gap-8 p-8 space-y-8` | 2rem (32px) |\n| **Section spacing** | `py-16 sm:py-24` | 4rem/6rem (64px/96px) |\n\n**Standard Pattern**: Use increments of 4 (4, 6, 8, 12, 16, 24)\n\n---\n\n## Responsive Breakpoints\n\nMobile-first approach (base styles = mobile, add larger breakpoints):\n\n| Breakpoint | Min Width | Pattern | Example |\n|------------|-----------|---------|---------|\n| **Base** | 0px | No prefix | `text-base` |\n| **sm** | 640px | `sm:` | `sm:text-lg` |\n| **md** | 768px | `md:` | `md:grid-cols-2` |\n| **lg** | 1024px | `lg:` | `lg:px-8` |\n| **xl** | 1280px | `xl:` | `xl:max-w-7xl` |\n| **2xl** | 1536px | `2xl:` | `2xl:text-6xl` |\n\n```tsx\n// Mobile: 1 column, Tablet: 2 columns, Desktop: 3 columns\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n```\n\n---\n\n## Container Patterns\n\n### Standard Page Container\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n  {/* content */}\n</div>\n```\n\n**Variations**:\n- `max-w-4xl` - Narrow content (blog posts)\n- `max-w-5xl` - Medium content\n- `max-w-6xl` - Wide content\n- `max-w-7xl` - Full width (default)\n\n### Section Spacing\n\n```tsx\n<section className=\"py-16 sm:py-24\">\n  <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    {/* content */}\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Card Patterns\n\n### Basic Card\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border border-border p-6\">\n  <h3 className=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Card Title</h3>\n  <p className=\"text-muted-foreground\">Card description goes here.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Feature Card with Icon\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n  <div className=\"h-12 w-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n    {/* Icon */}\n  </div>\n  <h3 className=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Feature Title</h3>\n  <p className=\"text-muted-foreground\">Feature description.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Pricing Card\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border-2 border-border p-8 relative\">\n  <div className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary mb-2\">Pro Plan</div>\n  <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-1\">$29<span className=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground\">/mo</span></div>\n  <p className=\"text-muted-foreground mb-6\">For growing teams</p>\n  <button className=\"w-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90\">\n    Get Started\n  </button>\n</div>\n```\n\nSee `references/card-patterns.md` for more variants.\n\n---\n\n## Grid Layouts\n\n### Auto-Responsive Grid\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n  {items.map(item => <Card key={item.id} {...item} />)}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Auto-Fit Grid (Dynamic Columns)\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))] gap-6\">\n  {/* Automatically adjusts columns based on available space */}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Masonry-Style Grid\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"columns-1 md:columns-2 lg:columns-3 gap-6 space-y-6\">\n  {items.map(item => (\n    <div key={item.id} className=\"break-inside-avoid\">\n      <Card {...item} />\n    </div>\n  ))}\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Button Patterns\n\n```tsx\n// Primary\n<button className=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors\">\n  Primary\n</button>\n\n// Secondary\n<button className=\"bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-secondary/80\">\n  Secondary\n</button>\n\n// Outline\n<button className=\"border border-border bg-transparent px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-accent\">\n  Outline\n</button>\n\n// Ghost\n<button className=\"bg-transparent px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground\">\n  Ghost\n</button>\n\n// Destructive\n<button className=\"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-destructive/90\">\n  Delete\n</button>\n```\n\n**Size Variants**:\n- Small: `px-3 py-1.5 text-sm`\n- Default: `px-4 py-2`\n- Large: `px-6 py-3 text-lg`\n\nSee `references/button-patterns.md` for full reference.\n\n---\n\n## Form Patterns\n\n### Input Field\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"space-y-2\">\n  <label htmlFor=\"email\" className=\"text-sm font-medium\">\n    Email\n  </label>\n  <input\n    id=\"email\"\n    type=\"email\"\n    className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 bg-background border border-border rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary\"\n    placeholder=\"you@example.com\"\n  />\n</div>\n```\n\n### Select Dropdown\n\n```tsx\n<select className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 bg-background border border-border rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary\">\n  <option>Option 1</option>\n  <option>Option 2</option>\n</select>\n```\n\n### Checkbox\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n  <input\n    id=\"terms\"\n    type=\"checkbox\"\n    className=\"h-4 w-4 rounded border-border text-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary\"\n  />\n  <label htmlFor=\"terms\" className=\"text-sm\">\n    I agree to the terms\n  </label>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Error State\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"space-y-2\">\n  <label htmlFor=\"password\" className=\"text-sm font-medium\">\n    Password\n  </label>\n  <input\n    id=\"password\"\n    type=\"password\"\n    className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 bg-background border border-destructive rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-destructive\"\n  />\n  <p className=\"text-sm text-destructive\">Password must be at least 8 characters</p>\n</div>\n```\n\nSee `references/form-patterns.md` for complete patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Typography Patterns\n\n### Headings\n\n```tsx\n<h1 className=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold\">\n  Page Title\n</h1>\n\n<h2 className=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold\">\n  Section Title\n</h2>\n\n<h3 className=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold\">\n  Subsection\n</h3>\n\n<h4 className=\"text-xl font-semibold\">\n  Card Title\n</h4>\n```\n\n### Body Text\n\n```tsx\n<p className=\"text-base text-muted-foreground\">\n  Regular paragraph text.\n</p>\n\n<p className=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">\n  Larger body text with comfortable line height.\n</p>\n\n<p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n  Small supporting text or captions.\n</p>\n```\n\n### Lists\n\n```tsx\n<ul className=\"space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\">\n  <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n    <CheckIcon className=\"h-5 w-5 text-primary mr-2 mt-0.5\" />\n    <span>Feature one</span>\n  </li>\n  <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n    <CheckIcon className=\"h-5 w-5 text-primary mr-2 mt-0.5\" />\n    <span>Feature two</span>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\nSee `references/typography-patterns.md` for complete guide.\n\n---\n\n## Navigation Patterns\n\n### Header with Logo\n\n```tsx\n<header className=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full border-b border-border bg-background/95 backdrop-blur\">\n  <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div className=\"flex h-16 items-center justify-between\">\n      <div className=\"flex items-center gap-8\">\n        {/* Logo */}\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-bold text-xl\">Brand</a>\n\n        {/* Desktop Nav */}\n        <nav className=\"hidden md:flex gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"text-sm hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Features</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"text-sm hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"text-sm hover:text-primary transition-colors\">About</a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* CTA */}\n      <button className=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm\">\n        Sign Up\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n```\n\n### Footer\n\n```tsx\n<footer className=\"border-t border-border bg-muted/50\">\n  <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <div>\n        <h4 className=\"font-semibold mb-4\">Product</h4>\n        <ul className=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          <li><a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-primary\">Features</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-primary\">Pricing</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      {/* More columns */}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n```\n\nSee `references/navigation-patterns.md` for mobile menus and dropdowns.\n\n---\n\n## Dark Mode Support\n\nAll patterns use semantic color tokens that automatically adapt:\n\n| Token | Light Mode | Dark Mode |\n|-------|------------|-----------|\n| `bg-background` | White | Dark gray |\n| `text-foreground` | Dark gray | White |\n| `bg-card` | White | Slightly lighter gray |\n| `text-muted-foreground` | Gray | Light gray |\n| `border-border` | Light gray | Dark gray |\n| `bg-primary` | Brand color | Lighter brand color |\n\n**Never use raw colors** like `bg-blue-500` - always use semantic tokens.\n\nSee `references/dark-mode-patterns.md` for theme toggle implementation.\n\n---\n\n## Common Class Combinations\n\n### Section with Heading\n\n```tsx\n<section className=\"py-16 sm:py-24\">\n  <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <h2 className=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">\n      Section Title\n    </h2>\n    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      {/* content */}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n### Centered Content\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Centered Title</h1>\n  <p className=\"text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl\">Centered description</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Hover Effects\n\n```tsx\n// Lift on hover\n<div className=\"transition-transform hover:scale-105\">\n\n// Shadow on hover\n<div className=\"transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg\">\n\n// Color change on hover\n<button className=\"transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90\">\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### ✅ Always Do\n\n1. Use semantic color tokens (`bg-card`, `text-foreground`)\n2. Apply mobile-first responsive design (`base → sm: → md:`)\n3. Use consistent spacing scale (4, 6, 8, 12, 16, 24)\n4. Add `transition-*` classes for smooth interactions\n5. Test in both light and dark modes\n\n### ❌ Never Do\n\n1. Use raw Tailwind colors (`bg-blue-500` breaks themes)\n2. Skip responsive prefixes (mobile users suffer)\n3. Mix spacing scales randomly (creates visual chaos)\n4. Forget hover states on interactive elements\n5. Use fixed px values for text (`text-base` not `text-[16px]`)\n\n---\n\n## Template Components\n\nReady-to-use components in `templates/components/`:\n\n- **hero-section.tsx** - Responsive hero with CTA\n- **feature-grid.tsx** - 3-column feature grid with icons\n- **contact-form.tsx** - Full form with validation styles\n- **footer.tsx** - Multi-column footer with links\n\nCopy and customize for your project.\n\n---\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nDetailed patterns in `references/` directory:\n\n- **layout-patterns.md** - Containers, grids, flexbox layouts\n- **card-patterns.md** - All card variants and states\n- **navigation-patterns.md** - Headers, menus, breadcrumbs, footers\n- **form-patterns.md** - Complete form styling guide\n- **button-patterns.md** - All button variants and sizes\n- **typography-patterns.md** - Text styles and hierarchies\n- **dark-mode-patterns.md** - Theme switching implementation\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Tailwind CSS**: https://tailwindcss.com/docs\n- **shadcn/ui**: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- **Tailwind UI**: https://tailwindui.com (premium examples)\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-14\n**Skill Version**: 1.0.0\n**Production**: Tested across 10+ projects\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:50:40.702Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient Tailwind CSS component generation.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的 Tailwind CSS 组件生成的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンド エージェントが効率的な Tailwind CSS コンポーネント生成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 Tailwind CSS 컴포넌트 생성이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una generación eficiente de componentes de Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une génération efficace de composants Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente Erstellung von Tailwind-CSS-Komponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de geração eficiente de componentes Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, которым требуется эффективная генерация компонентов Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد كفء لمكونات Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly develop responsive UI components using pre-defined Tailwind CSS patterns, including section containers, card bases, and buttons, all compatible with Tailwind v3.x and v4.x.","zh":"赋予代理快速开发响应式 UI 组件的能力，使用预定义的 Tailwind CSS 模式，包括节容器、卡片基础和按钮，所有这些都与 Tailwind v3.x 和 v4.x 兼容。","ja":"エージェントが事前に定義された Tailwind CSS パターンを使用して、セクション コンテナー、カード ベース、ボタンなど、レスポンシブ UI コンポーネントを迅速に開発できるようにします。Tailwind v3.x および v4.x と互換性があります。","ko":"에이전트가 사전 정의된 Tailwind CSS 패턴을 사용하여 섹션 컨테이너, 카드 베이스, 버튼 등 응답형 UI 컴포넌트를 신속하게 개발할 수 있도록 합니다. Tailwind v3.x 및 v4.x와 호환됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar rápidamente componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos utilizando patrones predefinidos de Tailwind CSS, incluyendo contenedores de sección, bases de tarjetas y botones, todos compatibles con Tailwind v3.x y v4.x.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer rapidement des composants d''interface utilisateur responsifs en utilisant des modèles de Tailwind CSS prédéfinis, notamment des conteneurs de section, des bases de cartes et des boutons, tous compatibles avec Tailwind v3.x et v4.x.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, schnelle responsitive Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mithilfe von vordefinierten Tailwind-CSS-Mustern zu entwickeln, einschließlich Sektionscontainer, Kartenbasen und Schaltflächen, die alle mit Tailwind v3.x und v4.x kompatibel sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver rapidamente componentes de UI responsivos usando padrões Tailwind CSS pré-definidos, incluindo contêineres de seção, bases de cartão e botões, todos compatíveis com Tailwind v3.x e v4.x.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро разрабатывать отзывчивые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью предопределенных шаблонов Tailwind CSS, включая контейнеры разделов, базы карточек и кнопки, все совместимые с Tailwind v3.x и v4.x.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطوير مكونات واجهة المستخدم المستجيبة بسرعة باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS المحددة مسبقًا، بما في ذلك حاويات القسم وأسس البطاقة والأزرار، كلها متوافقة مع Tailwind v3.x و v4.x."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating responsive section containers with max-width and padding","Creating customizable card components with background and text colors","Designing consistent button styles with border and rounded corners"],"zh":["生成具有最大宽度和填充的响应式节容器","创建具有背景和文本颜色的可自定义卡片组件","设计具有边框和圆角的一致按钮样式"],"ja":["最大幅とパディングを持つレスポンシブ セクション コンテナーを生成する","背景とテキスト カラーを持つカスタマイズ可能なカード コンポーネントを作成する","ボーダーと丸みを持つ一貫したボタン スタイルを設計する"],"ko":["최대 너비와 패딩을 가진 응답형 섹션 컨테이너를 생성한다","배경과 텍스트 색상을 가진 커스터마이즈 가능한 카드 컴포넌트를 생성한다","테두리와 둥근 모서리를 가진 일관된 버튼 스타일을 설계한다"],"es":["Generar contenedores de sección responsivos con ancho máximo y relleno","Crear componentes de tarjeta personalizables con fondo y colores de texto","Diseñar estilos de botón coherentes con bordes y esquinas redondeadas"],"fr":["Générer des conteneurs de section responsifs avec une largeur maximale et un remplissage","Créer des composants de carte personnalisables avec des couleurs de fond et de texte","Concevoir des styles de bouton cohérents avec des bordures et des coins arrondis"],"de":["Generierung responsiver Sektionscontainer mit Maximalbreite und Polsterung","Erstellen von anpassbaren Kartenkomponenten mit Hintergrund- und Textfarben","Entwerfen konsistenter Schaltflächenstile mit Rahmen und abgerundeten Ecken"],"pt":["Gerar contêineres de seção responsivos com largura máxima e preenchimento","Criar componentes de cartão personalizáveis com cores de fundo e texto","Projetar estilos de botão consistentes com borda e cantos arredondados"],"ru":["Генерировать отзывчивые контейнеры разделов с максимальной шириной и внутренним отступом","Создавать настраиваемые компоненты карточек с фоновыми и текстовыми цветами","Разрабатывать последовательные стили кнопок с границей и закругленными углами"],"ar":["توليد حاويات قسم مستجيبة مع الحد الأقصى للعرض والPadding","إنشاء مكونات بطاقة قابلة للتعديل مع ألوان الخلفية والنص","تصميم أساليب زر متسقة مع الحدود والزوايا المستديرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS v3.x or v4.x","Limited to CSS-based component design"],"zh":["需要 Tailwind CSS v3.x 或 v4.x","仅限 CSS 基础组件设计"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v3.x または v4.x が必要","CSS ベースのコンポーネント デザインのみ"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v3.x 또는 v4.x가 필요","CSS 기반 컴포넌트 디자인만 가능"],"es":["Requiere Tailwind CSS v3.x o v4.x","Limitado al diseño de componentes basados en CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite Tailwind CSS v3.x ou v4.x","Limité à la conception de composants basés sur CSS"],"de":["Benötigt Tailwind CSS v3.x oder v4.x","Begrenzt auf die Gestaltung von CSS-basierten Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige Tailwind CSS v3.x ou v4.x","Limitado ao design de componentes baseados em CSS"],"ru":["Требует Tailwind CSS v3.x или v4.x","Ограничен дизайном компонентов на основе CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب Tailwind CSS v3.x أو v4.x","محدود بتصميم المكونات القائمة على CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/react:components', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'react:components', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z', '2026-02-18T13:51:11.934Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/react:components","name":"react:components","description":{"zh":"React 组件开发技能，用于构建高质量的 React 应用","ja":"React コンポーネント開発スキルを使用して、高品質の React アプリケーションを構築します","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트 개발 스킬을 사용하여 높은 품질의 리액트 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Los componentes React son fundamentales para una arquitectura de frontend sólida. Aprende a utilizar herramientas automatizadas para mejorar tu código.","fr":"Les composants React sont essentiels pour une architecture frontend solide. Découvrez comment utiliser des outils automatisés pour améliorer votre code.","de":"React-Komponenten sind grundlegend für eine solide Frontend-Architektur. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie automatisierte Tools nutzen können, um Ihren Code zu verbessern.","pt":"Stitch é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar componentes React modulares e de alta qualidade. Ela permite que você transforme designs em código limpo e eficiente.","ru":"Stitch - это инструмент, который помогает создавать модульные и высококачественные компоненты React. Он позволяет вам преобразовывать дизайны в чистый и эффективный код.","ar":"Stitch هي أداة تساعد على إنشاء مكونات React متعددة وذات جودة عالية. وهي تسمح لك بتحويل التصاميم إلى код نظيف وفعّال.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"React 组件开发技能","ja":"React コンポーネント開発スキル","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트 개발 스킬","es":"Componentes React: Guía para Desarrolladores","fr":"Composants React: Guide pour Développeurs","de":"React-Komponenten: Entwicklerleitfaden","pt":"Criar Componentes React com Stitch","ru":"Разработка компонентов React с Stitch","ar":"إنشاء مكونات React مع Stitch","en":"react:components"},"description":{"zh":"React 组件开发技能，用于构建高质量的 React 应用","ja":"React コンポーネント開発スキルを使用して、高品質の React アプリケーションを構築します","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트 개발 스킬을 사용하여 높은 품질의 리액트 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Los componentes React son fundamentales para una arquitectura de frontend sólida. Aprende a utilizar herramientas automatizadas para mejorar tu código.","fr":"Les composants React sont essentiels pour une architecture frontend solide. Découvrez comment utiliser des outils automatisés pour améliorer votre code.","de":"React-Komponenten sind grundlegend für eine solide Frontend-Architektur. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie automatisierte Tools nutzen können, um Ihren Code zu verbessern.","pt":"Stitch é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar componentes React modulares e de alta qualidade. Ela permite que você transforme designs em código limpo e eficiente.","ru":"Stitch - это инструмент, который помогает создавать модульные и высококачественные компоненты React. Он позволяет вам преобразовывать дизайны в чистый и эффе...","ar":"Stitch هي أداة تساعد على إنشاء مكونات React متعددة وذات جودة عالية. وهي تسمح لك بتحويل التصاميم إلى код نظيف وفعّال.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["模块化开发方法","自动化工具支持","高质量代码生成","设计转换为 React 代码","命名空间发现和元数据获取"],"ja":["モジュラー開発方法","自動化ツールのサポート","高品質コード生成","設計を React コードに変換","名前空間の発見とメタデータの取得"],"ko":["모듈화 개발 방법","자동화 도구 지원","높은 품질의 코드 생성","디자인을 리액트 코드로 변환","네임스페이스 발견 및 메타데이터 获取"],"es":["Namespace discovery","Metadata fetch","High-reliability download","Automatización de código","Mejora de la calidad del código","Arquitectura de frontend modular"],"fr":["Découverte d''espace de noms","Récupération de métadonnées","Téléchargement de haute fiabilité","Automatisation de code","Amélioration de la qualité de code","Architecture frontend modulaire"],"de":["Namespace-Erkennung","Metadatenabruf","High-Reliability-Download","Codeautomatisierung","Codequalitätsverbesserung","Modulare Frontend-Architektur"],"pt":["Criação de componentes React modulares","Transformação de designs em código limpo","Uso de ferramentas automatizadas para garantir a qualidade do código","Namespace discovery para encontrar o prefixo Stitch","Metadata fetch para recuperar o design JSON","High-reliability download para downloads confiáveis"],"ru":["Создание модульных компонентов React","Преобразование дизайнов в чистый код","Использование автоматизированных инструментов для обеспечения качества кода","Namespace discovery для поиска префикса Stitch","Metadata fetch для получения дизайна JSON","High-reliability download для надёжных загрузок"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات React متعددة","تحويل التصاميم إلى 코드 نظيف","استخدام أدوات تلقائية لضمان جودة الكود","Namespace discovery للعثور على بادئة Stitch","Metadata fetch لاسترجاع تصميم JSON","High-reliability download للتحميلات الموثوقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 组件开发","模块化开发","自动化工具","代码质量","设计转换","命名空间发现","元数据获取","React 代码生成"],"ja":["React コンポーネント開発","モジュラー開発","自動化ツール","コード品質","設計変換","名前空間の発見","メタデータの取得","React コード生成"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트 개발","모듈화 개발","자동화 도구","코드 품질","디자인 변환","네임스페이스 발견","메타데이터 获取","리액트 코드 생성"],"es":["componentes React","desarrollo frontend","herramientas automatizadas","arquitectura modular","calidad de código","React para desarrolladores","guias de React","mejora de código"],"fr":["composants React","développement frontend","outils automatisés","architecture modulaire","qualité de code","React pour développeurs","guides React","amélioration de code"],"de":["React-Komponenten","Frontend-Entwicklung","automatisierte Tools","modulare Architektur","Codequalität","React für Entwickler","React-Anleitungen","Codeverbesserung"],"pt":["componentes React","desenvolvimento frontend","Stitch","modularidade","qualidade do código","ferramentas automatizadas","namespace discovery","metadata fetch","high-reliability download"],"ru":["компоненты React","frontend-разработка","Stitch","модульность","качество кода","автоматизированные инструменты","namespace discovery","metadata fetch","high-reliability download"],"ar":["مكونات React","تطوير أمامي","Stitch","التنظيم","جودة الكود","أدوات تلقائية","namespace discovery","metadata fetch","high-reliability download"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react:components","description":"Converts Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation.","bodyPreview":"# Stitch to React Components\n\nYou are a frontend engineer focused on transforming designs into clean React code. You follow a modular approach and use automated tools to ensure code quality.\n\n## Retrieval and networking\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n2. **Metadata fetch**: Call `[prefix]:get_screen` to retrieve the design JSON.\n3. **High-reliability download**: Internal AI fetch tools can fai","body":"# Stitch to React Components\n\nYou are a frontend engineer focused on transforming designs into clean React code. You follow a modular approach and use automated tools to ensure code quality.\n\n## Retrieval and networking\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n2. **Metadata fetch**: Call `[prefix]:get_screen` to retrieve the design JSON.\n3. **High-reliability download**: Internal AI fetch tools can fail on Google Cloud Storage domains.\n   - Use the `Bash` tool to run: `bash scripts/fetch-stitch.sh \"[htmlCode.downloadUrl]\" \"temp/source.html\"`.\n   - This script handles the necessary redirects and security handshakes.\n4. **Visual audit**: Check `screenshot.downloadUrl` to confirm the design intent and layout details.\n\n## Architectural rules\n* **Modular components**: Break the design into independent files. Avoid large, single-file outputs.\n* **Logic isolation**: Move event handlers and business logic into custom hooks in `src/hooks/`.\n* **Data decoupling**: Move all static text, image URLs, and lists into `src/data/mockData.ts`.\n* **Type safety**: Every component must include a `Readonly` TypeScript interface named `[ComponentName]Props`.\n* **Project specific**: Focus on the target project''s needs and constraints. Leave Google license headers out of the generated React components.\n* **Style mapping**:\n    * Extract the `tailwind.config` from the HTML `<head>`.\n    * Sync these values with `resources/style-guide.json`.\n    * Use theme-mapped Tailwind classes instead of arbitrary hex codes.\n\n## Execution steps\n1. **Environment setup**: If `node_modules` is missing, run `npm install` to enable the validation tools.\n2. **Data layer**: Create `src/data/mockData.ts` based on the design content.\n3. **Component drafting**: Use `resources/component-template.tsx` as a base. Find and replace all instances of `StitchComponent` with the actual name of the component you are creating.\n4. **Application wiring**: Update the project entry point (like `App.tsx`) to render the new components.\n5. **Quality check**:\n    * Run `npm run validate <file_path>` for each component.\n    * Verify the final output against the `resources/architecture-checklist.md`.\n    * Start the dev server with `npm run dev` to verify the live result.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n* **Fetch errors**: Ensure the URL is quoted in the bash command to prevent shell errors.\n* **Validation errors**: Review the AST report and fix any missing interfaces or hardcoded styles."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:51:11.934Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to transform designs into modular React code with automated quality assurance.","zh":"非常适合需要将设计转换为模块化React代码的前端代理，具有自动化质量保证。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがデザインをモジュラー化されたReactコードに変換する必要がある場合に最適です。自動化された品質保証を備えています。","ko":"디자인을 모듈화된 리액트 코드로 변환해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 자동화된 품질 보증을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to transform designs into modular React code with automated quality assurance.","fr":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to transform designs into modular React code with automated quality assurance.","de":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to transform designs into modular React code with automated quality assurance.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam transformar designs em código React modular com garantia de qualidade automatizada.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимо преобразовывать дизайны в модульный код React с автоматизированным контролем качества.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل التصاميم إلى رمز رياكت معماري مع ضمان جودة آلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch design metadata using the Stitch MCP prefix, ensuring high-reliability downloads and streamlined namespace discovery, all while utilizing automated tools for code quality and modular React component generation.","zh":"赋予代理使用Stitch MCP前缀获取设计元数据的能力，确保高可靠性下载和流畅的命名空间发现，同时利用自动化工具实现代码质量和模块化React组件生成。","ja":"Stitch MCP接頭辞を使用してデザインメタデータを取得するエージェントの能力を強化し、高信頼性のダウンロードとスムーズな名前空間の発見を保証し、自動化ツールを使用してコード品質とモジュラー化されたReactコンポーネントを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 스티치 MCP 접두사를 사용하여 디자인 메타데이터를 가져올 수 있도록 해주어, 높은 신뢰성의 다운로드와 효율적인 네임스페이스 발견을 보장하며, 자동화 도구를 통해 코드 품질과 모듈화된 리액트 컴포넌트 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to fetch design metadata using the Stitch MCP prefix, ensuring high-reliability downloads and streamlined namespace discovery, all while utilizing automated tools for code quality and modular React component generation.","fr":"Empowers agents to fetch design metadata using the Stitch MCP prefix, ensuring high-reliability downloads and streamlined namespace discovery, all while utilizing automated tools for code quality and modular React component generation.","de":"Empowers agents to fetch design metadata using the Stitch MCP prefix, ensuring high-reliability downloads and streamlined namespace discovery, all while utilizing automated tools for code quality and modular React component generation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar metadados de design usando o prefixo Stitch MCP, garantindo downloads de alta confiabilidade e descoberta de namespace otimizada, tudo isso utilizando ferramentas automatizadas para qualidade de código e geração de componentes React modulares.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать метаданные дизайна с помощью префикса Stitch MCP, обеспечивая скачивания с высокой надежностью и оптимизированное обнаружение пространства имен, все это при использовании автоматизированных инструментов для контроля качества кода и генерации модульных компонентов React.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من استرجاع بيانات وصف التصميم باستخدام بادئة Stitch MCP، مما يضمن تنزيلات موثوقة واكتشاف مساحة الاسمات المُتَصَلِف، مع استخدام أدوات آلية لضمان جودة الشفرة وتوليد مكونات رياكت المعمارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating modular React components from design JSON","Automating namespace discovery for efficient metadata retrieval","Ensuring code quality through automated tools and high-reliability downloads"],"zh":["从设计JSON生成模块化React组件","自动化命名空间发现以实现高效的元数据检索","通过自动化工具和高可靠性下载确保代码质量"],"ja":["デザインJSONからモジュラー化されたReactコンポーネントを生成する","自動化された名前空間の発見による効率的なメタデータの取得","自動化ツールと高信頼性のダウンロードを使用したコード品質の確保"],"ko":["디자인 JSON에서 모듈화된 리액트 컴포넌트를 생성한다","자동화된 네임스페이스 발견을 통해 효율적인 메타데이터 검색을 수행한다","자동화 도구와 높은 신뢰성의 다운로드를 통해 코드 품질을 보장한다"],"es":["Generating modular React components from design JSON","Automating namespace discovery for efficient metadata retrieval","Ensuring code quality through automated tools and high-reliability downloads"],"fr":["Generating modular React components from design JSON","Automating namespace discovery for efficient metadata retrieval","Ensuring code quality through automated tools and high-reliability downloads"],"de":["Generating modular React components from design JSON","Automating namespace discovery for efficient metadata retrieval","Ensuring code quality through automated tools and high-reliability downloads"],"pt":["Geração de componentes React modulares a partir de design JSON","Automatização da descoberta de namespace para recuperação eficiente de metadados","Garantia de qualidade de código por meio de ferramentas automatizadas e downloads de alta confiabilidade"],"ru":["Генерация модульных компонентов React из дизайна JSON","Автоматизация обнаружения пространства имен для эффективного извлечения метаданных","Обеспечение качества кода с помощью автоматизированных инструментов и скачиваний с высокой надежностью"],"ar":["توليد مكونات رياكت المعمارية من تصاميم JSON","آليّة اكتشاف مساحة الاسمات من أجل استرجاع بيانات وصف كفء","ضمان جودة الشفرة من خلال أدوات آلية وتنزيلات موثوقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Stitch MCP prefix","Dependent on internal AI fetch tools for high-reliability downloads"],"zh":["需要了解Stitch MCP前缀","依赖于内部AI获取工具以实现高可靠性下载"],"ja":["Stitch MCP接頭辞の知識が必要","高信頼性のダウンロードを実現するために内部AI取得ツールに依存する"],"ko":["스티치 MCP 접두사를 이해해야 한다","높은 신뢰성의 다운로드를 구현하기 위해 내부 AI 가져오기 도구에 의존한다"],"es":["Requires knowledge of Stitch MCP prefix","Dependent on internal AI fetch tools for high-reliability downloads"],"fr":["Requires knowledge of Stitch MCP prefix","Dependent on internal AI fetch tools for high-reliability downloads"],"de":["Requires knowledge of Stitch MCP prefix","Dependent on internal AI fetch tools for high-reliability downloads"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do prefixo Stitch MCP","Dependente de ferramentas de busca de IA internas para downloads de alta confiabilidade"],"ru":["Требует знания префикса Stitch MCP","Зависит от внутренних инструментов поиска ИИ для скачиваний с высокой надежностью"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بادئة Stitch MCP","يعتمد على أدوات البحث عن الذكاء الاصطناعي الداخلية من أجل التنزيلات الموثوقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
