を確保するためのデータ品質チェックの実装方法です。Great Expectations、dbtテスト、データ契約などを含みます","ko":"데이터 품질 프레임워크는 데이터 파이프라인의 안정성과 정확성을 보장하기 위한 데이터 품질 검사의 구현 방법입니다. Great Expectations, dbt 테스트, 데이터 계약 등을 포함합니다","es":"Patrones de producción para implementar la calidad de los datos con Great Expectations, pruebas dbt y contratos de datos","fr":"Modèles de production pour mettre en œuvre la qualité des données avec Great Expectations, des tests dbt et des contrats de données","de":"Produktionsmuster für die Implementierung von Datenqualität mit Great Expectations, dbt-Tests und Datenverträgen","pt":"Frameworks de qualidade de dados para implementar padrões de produção com Great Expectations, dbt tests e contratos de dados","ru":"Фреймворки качества данных для реализации производственных стандартов с помощью Great Expectations, dbt tests и данных контрактов","ar":"إطارات جودة البيانات لتنفيذ معايير الإنتاج مع Great Expectations و dbt tests و عقود البيانات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Great Expectations集成","dbt测试支持","数据契约管理","数据质量指标监控","自动化数据验证","CI/CD集成"],"ja":["Great Expectationsの統合","dbtテストのサポート","データ契約の管理","データ品質メトリクスの監視","自動化されたデータ検証","CI/CDの統合"],"ko":["Great Expectations 통합","dbt 테스트 지원","데이터 계약 관리","데이터 품질 지표 모니터링","자동화된 데이터 검증","CI/CD 통합"],"es":["Implementación de controles de calidad de datos en pipelines","Validación con Great Expectations","Creación de suites de pruebas dbt","Establecimiento de contratos de datos entre equipos","Monitoreo de métricas de calidad de datos","Automatización de la validación de datos en CI/CD"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de contrôles de qualité de données dans les pipelines","Validation avec Great Expectations","Création de suites de tests dbt","Établissement de contrats de données entre les équipes","Surveillance des métriques de qualité de données","Automatisation de la validation des données dans CI/CD"],"de":["Implementierung von Qualitätskontrollen für Daten in Pipelines","Validierung mit Great Expectations","Erstellung von dbt-Test-Suiten","Einrichtung von Datenverträgen zwischen Teams","Überwachung von Datenqualitätsmetriken","Automatisierung der Datenvalidierung in CI/CD"],"pt":["Implementação de verificações de qualidade de dados","Configuração de validação do Great Expectations","Criação de conjuntos de testes dbt abrangentes","Estabelecimento de contratos de dados entre equipes","Monitoramento de métricas de qualidade de dados","Automação de validação de dados em CI/CD"],"ru":["Реализация проверок качества данных","Настройка валидации Great Expectations","Создание всесторонних наборов тестов dbt","Установление данных контрактов между командами","Мониторинг метрик качества данных","Автоматизация проверки данных в CI/CD"],"ar":["تنفيذ فحص جودة البيانات","تكوين التحقق من Great Expectations","إنشاء مجموعات اختبار dbt شاملة","إقامة عقود البيانات بين الفرق","مراقبة مقاييس جودة البيانات","تأتمة التحقق من البيانات في CI/CD"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据质量框架","Great Expectations","dbt测试","数据契约","数据质量指标","自动化数据验证","CI/CD","数据管道","可靠性","准确性"],"ja":["データ品質フレームワーク","Great Expectations","dbtテスト","データ契約","データ品質メトリクス","自動化されたデータ検証","CI/CD","データパイプライン","信頼性","正確性"],"ko":["데이터 품질 프레임워크","Great Expectations","dbt 테스트","데이터 계약","데이터 품질 지표","자동화된 데이터 검증","CI/CD","데이터 파이프라인","안정성","정확성"],"es":["calidad de datos","Great Expectations","pruebas dbt","contratos de datos","pipelines de datos","validación de datos","automatización de datos","ciudadanos de datos","gobierno de datos"],"fr":["qualité de données","Great Expectations","tests dbt","contrats de données","pipelines de données","validation des données","automatisation des données","citoyens des données","gouvernance des données"],"de":["Datenqualität","Great Expectations","dbt-Tests","Datenverträge","Datenpipelines","Datenvalidierung","Datenautomatisierung","Datenbürger","Datenregierung"],"pt":["qualidade de dados","frameworks de qualidade de dados","Great Expectations","dbt tests","contratos de dados","pipelines de dados","confiabilidade de dados"],"ru":["качество данных","фреймворки качества данных","Great Expectations","dbt tests","данные контракты","данные трубопроводы","надежность данных"],"ar":["جودة البيانات","إطارات جودة البيانات","Great Expectations","dbt tests","عقود البيانات","خطوط أنابيب البيانات","موثوقية البيانات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-quality-frameworks","description":"Implement data quality validation with Great Expectations, dbt tests, and data contracts. Use when building data quality pipelines, implementing validation rules, or establishing data contracts.","bodyPreview":"# Data Quality Frameworks\n\nProduction patterns for implementing data quality with Great Expectations, dbt tests, and data contracts to ensure reliable data pipelines.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing data quality checks in pipelines\n- Setting up Great Expectations validation\n- Building comprehensive dbt test suites\n- Establishing data contracts between teams\n- Monitoring data quality metrics\n- Automating data validation in CI/CD\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Data Quality Dimensions\n\n| Dime","body":"# Data Quality Frameworks\n\nProduction patterns for implementing data quality with Great Expectations, dbt tests, and data contracts to ensure reliable data pipelines.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing data quality checks in pipelines\n- Setting up Great Expectations validation\n- Building comprehensive dbt test suites\n- Establishing data contracts between teams\n- Monitoring data quality metrics\n- Automating data validation in CI/CD\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Data Quality Dimensions\n\n| Dimension        | Description              | Example Check                                      |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Completeness** | No missing values        | `expect_column_values_to_not_be_null`              |\n| **Uniqueness**   | No duplicates            | `expect_column_values_to_be_unique`                |\n| **Validity**     | Values in expected range | `expect_column_values_to_be_in_set`                |\n| **Accuracy**     | Data matches reality     | Cross-reference validation                         |\n| **Consistency**  | No contradictions        | `expect_column_pair_values_A_to_be_greater_than_B` |\n| **Timeliness**   | Data is recent           | `expect_column_max_to_be_between`                  |\n\n### 2. Testing Pyramid for Data\n\n```\n          /\\\n         /  \\     Integration Tests (cross-table)\n        /────\\\n       /      \\   Unit Tests (single column)\n      /────────\\\n     /          \\ Schema Tests (structure)\n    /────────────\\\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Great Expectations Setup\n\n```bash\n# Install\npip install great_expectations\n\n# Initialize project\ngreat_expectations init\n\n# Create datasource\ngreat_expectations datasource new\n```\n\n```python\n# great_expectations/checkpoints/daily_validation.yml\nimport great_expectations as gx\n\n# Create context\ncontext = gx.get_context()\n\n# Create expectation suite\nsuite = context.add_expectation_suite(\"orders_suite\")\n\n# Add expectations\nsuite.add_expectation(\n    gx.expectations.ExpectColumnValuesToNotBeNull(column=\"order_id\")\n)\nsuite.add_expectation(\n    gx.expectations.ExpectColumnValuesToBeUnique(column=\"order_id\")\n)\n\n# Validate\nresults = context.run_checkpoint(checkpoint_name=\"daily_orders\")\n```\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Great Expectations Suite\n\n```python\n# expectations/orders_suite.py\nimport great_expectations as gx\nfrom great_expectations.core import ExpectationSuite\nfrom great_expectations.core.expectation_configuration import ExpectationConfiguration\n\ndef build_orders_suite() -> ExpectationSuite:\n    \"\"\"Build comprehensive orders expectation suite\"\"\"\n\n    suite = ExpectationSuite(expectation_suite_name=\"orders_suite\")\n\n    # Schema expectations\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_table_columns_to_match_set\",\n        kwargs={\n            \"column_set\": [\"order_id\", \"customer_id\", \"amount\", \"status\", \"created_at\"],\n            \"exact_match\": False  # Allow additional columns\n        }\n    ))\n\n    # Primary key\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_values_to_not_be_null\",\n        kwargs={\"column\": \"order_id\"}\n    ))\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_values_to_be_unique\",\n        kwargs={\"column\": \"order_id\"}\n    ))\n\n    # Foreign key\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_values_to_not_be_null\",\n        kwargs={\"column\": \"customer_id\"}\n    ))\n\n    # Categorical values\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_values_to_be_in_set\",\n        kwargs={\n            \"column\": \"status\",\n            \"value_set\": [\"pending\", \"processing\", \"shipped\", \"delivered\", \"cancelled\"]\n        }\n    ))\n\n    # Numeric ranges\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_values_to_be_between\",\n        kwargs={\n            \"column\": \"amount\",\n            \"min_value\": 0,\n            \"max_value\": 100000,\n            \"strict_min\": True  # amount > 0\n        }\n    ))\n\n    # Date validity\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_values_to_be_dateutil_parseable\",\n        kwargs={\"column\": \"created_at\"}\n    ))\n\n    # Freshness - data should be recent\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_max_to_be_between\",\n        kwargs={\n            \"column\": \"created_at\",\n            \"min_value\": {\"$PARAMETER\": \"now - timedelta(days=1)\"},\n            \"max_value\": {\"$PARAMETER\": \"now\"}\n        }\n    ))\n\n    # Row count sanity\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_table_row_count_to_be_between\",\n        kwargs={\n            \"min_value\": 1000,  # Expect at least 1000 rows\n            \"max_value\": 10000000\n        }\n    ))\n\n    # Statistical expectations\n    suite.add_expectation(ExpectationConfiguration(\n        expectation_type=\"expect_column_mean_to_be_between\",\n        kwargs={\n            \"column\": \"amount\",\n            \"min_value\": 50,\n            \"max_value\": 500\n        }\n    ))\n\n    return suite\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Great Expectations Checkpoint\n\n```yaml\n# great_expectations/checkpoints/orders_checkpoint.yml\nname: orders_checkpoint\nconfig_version: 1.0\nclass_name: Checkpoint\nrun_name_template: \"%Y%m%d-%H%M%S-orders-validation\"\n\nvalidations:\n  - batch_request:\n      datasource_name: warehouse\n      data_connector_name: default_inferred_data_connector_name\n      data_asset_name: orders\n      data_connector_query:\n        index: -1 # Latest batch\n    expectation_suite_name: orders_suite\n\naction_list:\n  - name: store_validation_result\n    action:\n      class_name: StoreValidationResultAction\n\n  - name: store_evaluation_parameters\n    action:\n      class_name: StoreEvaluationParametersAction\n\n  - name: update_data_docs\n    action:\n      class_name: UpdateDataDocsAction\n\n  # Slack notification on failure\n  - name: send_slack_notification\n    action:\n      class_name: SlackNotificationAction\n      slack_webhook: ${SLACK_WEBHOOK}\n      notify_on: failure\n      renderer:\n        module_name: great_expectations.render.renderer.slack_renderer\n        class_name: SlackRenderer\n```\n\n```python\n# Run checkpoint\nimport great_expectations as gx\n\ncontext = gx.get_context()\nresult = context.run_checkpoint(checkpoint_name=\"orders_checkpoint\")\n\nif not result.success:\n    failed_expectations = [\n        r for r in result.run_results.values()\n        if not r.success\n    ]\n    raise ValueError(f\"Data quality check failed: {failed_expectations}\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: dbt Data Tests\n\n```yaml\n# models/marts/core/_core__models.yml\nversion: 2\n\nmodels:\n  - name: fct_orders\n    description: Order fact table\n    tests:\n      # Table-level tests\n      - dbt_utils.recency:\n          datepart: day\n          field: created_at\n          interval: 1\n      - dbt_utils.at_least_one\n      - dbt_utils.expression_is_true:\n          expression: \"total_amount >= 0\"\n\n    columns:\n      - name: order_id\n        description: Primary key\n        tests:\n          - unique\n          - not_null\n\n      - name: customer_id\n        description: Foreign key to dim_customers\n        tests:\n          - not_null\n          - relationships:\n              to: ref(''dim_customers'')\n              field: customer_id\n\n      - name: order_status\n        tests:\n          - accepted_values:\n              values:\n                [\"pending\", \"processing\", \"shipped\", \"delivered\", \"cancelled\"]\n\n      - name: total_amount\n        tests:\n          - not_null\n          - dbt_utils.expression_is_true:\n              expression: \">= 0\"\n\n      - name: created_at\n        tests:\n          - not_null\n          - dbt_utils.expression_is_true:\n              expression: \"<= current_timestamp\"\n\n  - name: dim_customers\n    columns:\n      - name: customer_id\n        tests:\n          - unique\n          - not_null\n\n      - name: email\n        tests:\n          - unique\n          - not_null\n          # Custom regex test\n          - dbt_utils.expression_is_true:\n              expression: \"email ~ ''^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$''\"\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Custom dbt Tests\n\n```sql\n-- tests/generic/test_row_count_in_range.sql\n{% test row_count_in_range(model, min_count, max_count) %}\n\nwith row_count as (\n    select count(*) as cnt from {{ model }}\n)\n\nselect cnt\nfrom row_count\nwhere cnt < {{ min_count }} or cnt > {{ max_count }}\n\n{% endtest %}\n\n-- Usage in schema.yml:\n-- tests:\n--   - row_count_in_range:\n--       min_count: 1000\n--       max_count: 10000000\n```\n\n```sql\n-- tests/generic/test_sequential_values.sql\n{% test sequential_values(model, column_name, interval=1) %}\n\nwith lagged as (\n    select\n        {{ column_name }},\n        lag({{ column_name }}) over (order by {{ column_name }}) as prev_value\n    from {{ model }}\n)\n\nselect *\nfrom lagged\nwhere {{ column_name }} - prev_value != {{ interval }}\n  and prev_value is not null\n\n{% endtest %}\n```\n\n```sql\n-- tests/singular/assert_orders_customers_match.sql\n-- Singular test: specific business rule\n\nwith orders_customers as (\n    select distinct customer_id from {{ ref(''fct_orders'') }}\n),\n\ndim_customers as (\n    select customer_id from {{ ref(''dim_customers'') }}\n),\n\norphaned_orders as (\n    select o.customer_id\n    from orders_customers o\n    left join dim_customers c using (customer_id)\n    where c.customer_id is null\n)\n\nselect * from orphaned_orders\n-- Test passes if this returns 0 rows\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Data Contracts\n\n```yaml\n# contracts/orders_contract.yaml\napiVersion: datacontract.com/v1.0.0\nkind: DataContract\nmetadata:\n  name: orders\n  version: 1.0.0\n  owner: data-platform-team\n  contact: data-team@company.com\n\ninfo:\n  title: Orders Data Contract\n  description: Contract for order event data from the ecommerce platform\n  purpose: Analytics, reporting, and ML features\n\nservers:\n  production:\n    type: snowflake\n    account: company.us-east-1\n    database: ANALYTICS\n    schema: CORE\n\nterms:\n  usage: Internal analytics only\n  limitations: PII must not be exposed in downstream marts\n  billing: Charged per query TB scanned\n\nschema:\n  type: object\n  properties:\n    order_id:\n      type: string\n      format: uuid\n      description: Unique order identifier\n      required: true\n      unique: true\n      pii: false\n\n    customer_id:\n      type: string\n      format: uuid\n      description: Customer identifier\n      required: true\n      pii: true\n      piiClassification: indirect\n\n    total_amount:\n      type: number\n      minimum: 0\n      maximum: 100000\n      description: Order total in USD\n\n    created_at:\n      type: string\n      format: date-time\n      description: Order creation timestamp\n      required: true\n\n    status:\n      type: string\n      enum: [pending, processing, shipped, delivered, cancelled]\n      description: Current order status\n\nquality:\n  type: SodaCL\n  specification:\n    checks for orders:\n      - row_count > 0\n      - missing_count(order_id) = 0\n      - duplicate_count(order_id) = 0\n      - invalid_count(status) = 0:\n          valid values: [pending, processing, shipped, delivered, cancelled]\n      - freshness(created_at) < 24h\n\nsla:\n  availability: 99.9%\n  freshness: 1 hour\n  latency: 5 minutes\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Automated Quality Pipeline\n\n```python\n# quality_pipeline.py\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any\nimport great_expectations as gx\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n@dataclass\nclass QualityResult:\n    table: str\n    passed: bool\n    total_expectations: int\n    failed_expectations: int\n    details: List[Dict[str, Any]]\n    timestamp: datetime\n\nclass DataQualityPipeline:\n    \"\"\"Orchestrate data quality checks across tables\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, context: gx.DataContext):\n        self.context = context\n        self.results: List[QualityResult] = []\n\n    def validate_table(self, table: str, suite: str) -> QualityResult:\n        \"\"\"Validate a single table against expectation suite\"\"\"\n\n        checkpoint_config = {\n            \"name\": f\"{table}_validation\",\n            \"config_version\": 1.0,\n            \"class_name\": \"Checkpoint\",\n            \"validations\": [{\n                \"batch_request\": {\n                    \"datasource_name\": \"warehouse\",\n                    \"data_asset_name\": table,\n                },\n                \"expectation_suite_name\": suite,\n            }],\n        }\n\n        result = self.context.run_checkpoint(**checkpoint_config)\n\n        # Parse results\n        validation_result = list(result.run_results.values())[0]\n        results = validation_result.results\n\n        failed = [r for r in results if not r.success]\n\n        return QualityResult(\n            table=table,\n            passed=result.success,\n            total_expectations=len(results),\n            failed_expectations=len(failed),\n            details=[{\n                \"expectation\": r.expectation_config.expectation_type,\n                \"success\": r.success,\n                \"observed_value\": r.result.get(\"observed_value\"),\n            } for r in results],\n            timestamp=datetime.now()\n        )\n\n    def run_all(self, tables: Dict[str, str]) -> Dict[str, QualityResult]:\n        \"\"\"Run validation for all tables\"\"\"\n        results = {}\n\n        for table, suite in tables.items():\n            print(f\"Validating {table}...\")\n            results[table] = self.validate_table(table, suite)\n\n        return results\n\n    def generate_report(self, results: Dict[str, QualityResult]) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Generate quality report\"\"\"\n        report = [\"# Data Quality Report\", f\"Generated: {datetime.now()}\", \"\"]\n\n        total_passed = sum(1 for r in results.values() if r.passed)\n        total_tables = len(results)\n\n        report.append(f\"## Summary: {total_passed}/{total_tables} tables passed\")\n        report.append(\"\")\n\n        for table, result in results.items():\n            status = \"✅\" if result.passed else \"❌\"\n            report.append(f\"### {status} {table}\")\n            report.append(f\"- Expectations: {result.total_expectations}\")\n            report.append(f\"- Failed: {result.failed_expectations}\")\n\n            if not result.passed:\n                report.append(\"- Failed checks:\")\n                for detail in result.details:\n                    if not detail[\"success\"]:\n                        report.append(f\"  - {detail[''expectation'']}: {detail[''observed_value'']}\")\n            report.append(\"\")\n\n        return \"\\n\".join(report)\n\n# Usage\ncontext = gx.get_context()\npipeline = DataQualityPipeline(context)\n\ntables_to_validate = {\n    \"orders\": \"orders_suite\",\n    \"customers\": \"customers_suite\",\n    \"products\": \"products_suite\",\n}\n\nresults = pipeline.run_all(tables_to_validate)\nreport = pipeline.generate_report(results)\n\n# Fail pipeline if any table failed\nif not all(r.passed for r in results.values()):\n    print(report)\n    raise ValueError(\"Data quality checks failed!\")\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Test early** - Validate source data before transformations\n- **Test incrementally** - Add tests as you find issues\n- **Document expectations** - Clear descriptions for each test\n- **Alert on failures** - Integrate with monitoring\n- **Version contracts** - Track schema changes\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t test everything** - Focus on critical columns\n- **Don''t ignore warnings** - They often precede failures\n- **Don''t skip freshness** - Stale data is bad data\n- **Don''t hardcode thresholds** - Use dynamic baselines\n- **Don''t test in isolation** - Test relationships too\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Great Expectations Documentation](https://docs.greatexpectations.io/)\n- [dbt Testing Documentation](https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/tests)\n- [Data Contract Specification](https://datacontract.com/)\n- [Soda Core](https://docs.soda.io/soda-core/overview.html)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:51:19.183Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing robust data validation and quality control with Great Expectations and dbt tests.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的数据验证和质量控制的数据分析代理，支持 Great Expectations 和 dbt 测试。","ja":"データ分析エージェントが堅牢なデータ検証と品質管理を必要とする場合に最適です。Great Expectations と dbt テストを使用できます。","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 강력한 데이터 검증과 품질 관리를 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. Great Expectations와 dbt 테스트를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan una validación de datos robusta y control de calidad con Great Expectations y pruebas dbt.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant une validation de données robuste et un contrôle de qualité avec Great Expectations et des tests dbt.","de":"Perfekt für Data Analysis Agents, die eine robuste Datenvalidierung und Qualitätskontrolle mit Great Expectations und dbt-Tests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de validação de dados robusta e controle de qualidade com Great Expectations e testes dbt.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходима надежная проверка данных и контроль качества с помощью Great Expectations и тестов dbt.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى التحقق من البيانات والتأكد من جودتها باستخدام Great Expectations واختبارات dbt."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement comprehensive data quality frameworks, ensuring reliable data pipelines through automated validation with Great Expectations, dbt tests, and data contracts, while monitoring key data quality metrics in CI/CD environments.","zh":"赋予代理实现全面数据质量框架的能力，通过 Great Expectations、dbt 测试和数据合同的自动化验证，确保可靠的数据管道，同时在 CI/CD 环境中监控关键数据质量指标。","ja":"エージェントが包括的なデータ品質フレームワークを実装する能力を提供し、Great Expectations、dbt テスト、データ契約による自動化検証により、信頼性の高いデータパイプラインを確保し、CI/CD 環境で重要なデータ品質メトリクスを監視します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 데이터 품질 프레임워크를 구현할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 Great Expectations, dbt 테스트 및 데이터 계약을 통한 자동화된 검증을 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 데이터 파이프라인을 보장하고 CI/CD 환경에서 중요한 데이터 품질 메트릭스를 모니터링합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar marcos de calidad de datos integrales, garantizando tuberías de datos confiables a través de la validación automatizada con Great Expectations, pruebas dbt y contratos de datos, mientras se supervisan las métricas clave de calidad de datos en entornos de CI/CD.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des cadres de qualité de données complets, garantissant des pipelines de données fiables grâce à la validation automatisée avec Great Expectations, des tests dbt et des contrats de données, tout en surveillant les métriques clés de qualité de données dans les environnements CI/CD.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Datenqualitätsrahmen zu implementieren, wodurch zuverlässige Datenpipelines durch automatisierte Validierung mit Great Expectations, dbt-Tests und Datenverträgen gewährleistet werden, während wichtige Datenqualitätsmetriken in CI/CD-Umgebungen überwacht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementarem estruturas abrangentes de qualidade de dados, garantindo tubulações de dados confiáveis por meio da validação automatizada com Great Expectations, testes dbt e contratos de dados, enquanto monitora as principais métricas de qualidade de dados em ambientes de CI/CD.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать комплексные框架 качества данных, гарантируя надежные трубопроводы данных посредством автоматизированной проверки с помощью Great Expectations, тестов dbt и договоров данных, а также отслеживая ключевые метрики качества данных в средах CI/CD.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ إطارات شاملة لجودة البيانات، مما يضمن труб أنابيب بيانات موثوقة من خلال التحقق التلقائي باستخدام Great Expectations واختبارات dbt وعقود البيانات، مع مراقبة معايير جودة البيانات الرئيسية في بيئات CI/CD."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing data quality checks in ETL pipelines","Building and validating dbt test suites for data integrity","Establishing and enforcing data contracts between teams for consistent data exchange"],"zh":["在 ETL 管道中实现数据质量检查","为数据完整性构建和验证 dbt 测试套件","在团队之间建立和执行数据合同以实现一致的数据交换"],"ja":["ETL パイプラインでデータ品質チェックを実装する","データ整合性のための dbt テストスイートを構築して検証する","チーム間で一貫したデータ交換を実現するためにデータ契約を確立して強制する"],"ko":["ETL 파이프라인에서 데이터 품질 확인을 구현하는 것","데이터 무결성을 위한 dbt 테스트 스위트를 구축하고 검증하는 것","팀 간的一致한 데이터 교환을 달성하기 위해 데이터 계약을 설정하고 시행하는 것"],"es":["Implementar controles de calidad de datos en pipelines ETL","Crear y validar conjuntos de pruebas dbt para la integridad de los datos","Establecer y hacer cumplir contratos de datos entre equipos para un intercambio de datos coherente"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des contrôles de qualité de données dans les pipelines ETL","Construire et valider des ensembles de tests dbt pour l''intégrité des données","Établir et faire appliquer des contrats de données entre les équipes pour un échange de données cohérent"],"de":["Implementierung von Datenqualitätskontrollen in ETL-Pipelines","Erstellung und Validierung von dbt-Test-Suiten für die Datenintegrität","Festlegung und Durchsetzung von Datenverträgen zwischen Teams für einen konsistenten Datenaustausch"],"pt":["Implementação de verificações de qualidade de dados em tubulações ETL","Construção e validação de conjuntos de testes dbt para integridade de dados","Estabelecimento e aplicação de contratos de dados entre equipes para troca de dados consistente"],"ru":["Реализация проверок качества данных в трубопроводах ETL","Создание и проверка наборов тестов dbt для целостности данных","Установление и обеспечение договоров данных между командами для согласованного обмена данными"],"ar":["تنفيذ فحوصات جودة البيانات في الأنابيب ETL","بناء وتأكيد مجموعات اختبارات dbt لسلامة البيانات","إنشاء وتطبيق عقود البيانات بين الفرق من أجل تبادل البيانات المتسق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Great Expectations and dbt setup","Python environment necessary for implementation"],"zh":["需要 Great Expectations 和 dbt 设置","需要 Python 环境来实现"],"ja":["Great Expectations と dbt の設定が必要","実装には Python 環境が必要"],"ko":["Great Expectations와 dbt 설정이 필요합니다.","구현을 위해 Python 환경이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de Great Expectations y dbt","Entorno de Python necesario para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Great Expectations et dbt","Environnement Python nécessaire pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von Great Expectations und dbt","Python-Umgebung erforderlich für die Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Great Expectations e dbt","Ambiente Python necessário para implementação"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Great Expectations и dbt","Необходима среда Python для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Great Expectations و dbt","بيئة بايثون ضرورية للتطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
