für Echtzeit-KI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Agentes de texto e voz","Fluxos de trabalho multiagentes","Ferramentas e guardrails para desenvolvimento","Padrões de human-in-the-loop","Suporte a Node.js, Deno, Bun e Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Текстовые и голосовые агенты","Многоагентные рабочие процессы","Инструменты и ограничители для разработки","Паттерны human-in-the-loop","Поддержка Node.js, Deno, Bun и Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["وكلاء النص والصوت","تدفقات العمل المتعددة الوكلاء","أدوات وحماية للاستخدام","أنماط الإنسان في الحلقة","دعم Node.js، Deno، Bun و Cloudflare Workers"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI Agents SDK","AI 应用","文本代理","语音代理","多代理工作流","工具","安全保障"],"ja":["OpenAI Agents SDK","AI アプリケーション","テキスト エージェント","音声エージェント","多エージェント ワークフロー","ツール","ガードレール"],"ko":["OpenAI 에이전트 SDK","AI 애플리케이션","텍스트 에이전트","음성 에이전트","다중 에이전트 워크플ロー","도구","가드레일"],"es":["desarrollo de ia","openai agents","sdk de ia","agentes de texto y voz","flujos de trabajo multiagente","desarrollo de aplicaciones de ia","ia en tiempo real","nodejs","deno","bun"],"fr":["développement d''ia","openai agents","sdk d''ia","agents de texte et de voix","flux de travail multi-agents","développement d''applications d''ia","ia en temps réel","nodejs","deno","bun"],"de":["ki-entwicklung","openai agents","sdk für ki","text- und sprachagenten","multiagent-workflows","entwicklung von ki-anwendungen","ki in echtzeit","nodejs","deno","bun"],"pt":["OpenAI Agents","Desenvolvimento de IA","Agentes de texto e voz","Fluxos de trabalho multiagentes","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Node.js","Deno","Bun","Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["OpenAI Agents","Разработка ИИ","Текстовые и голосовые агенты","Многоагентные рабочие процессы","Инструменты разработки","Node.js","Deno","Bun","Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["OpenAI Agents","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء النص والصوت","تدفقات العمل المتعددة الوكلاء","أدوات التطوير","Node.js","Deno","Bun","Cloudflare Workers"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-agents","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Agents SDK\n\nBuild AI applications with text agents, voice agents (realtime), multi-agent workflows, tools, guardrails, and human-in-the-loop patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install @openai/agents zod@4  # v0.4.0+ requires Zod 4 (breaking change)\nnpm install @openai/agents-realtime  # Voice agents\nexport OPENAI_API_KEY=\"your-key\"\n```\n\n**Breaking Change (v0.4.0)**: Zod 3 no longer supported. Upgrade to `zod@4`.\n\n**Runtimes**: Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun, Cloudflare Workers (experim","body":"# OpenAI Agents SDK\n\nBuild AI applications with text agents, voice agents (realtime), multi-agent workflows, tools, guardrails, and human-in-the-loop patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install @openai/agents zod@4  # v0.4.0+ requires Zod 4 (breaking change)\nnpm install @openai/agents-realtime  # Voice agents\nexport OPENAI_API_KEY=\"your-key\"\n```\n\n**Breaking Change (v0.4.0)**: Zod 3 no longer supported. Upgrade to `zod@4`.\n\n**Runtimes**: Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun, Cloudflare Workers (experimental)\n\n---\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n**Agents**: LLMs with instructions + tools\n```typescript\nimport { Agent } from ''@openai/agents'';\nconst agent = new Agent({ name: ''Assistant'', tools: [myTool], model: ''gpt-5-mini'' });\n```\n\n**Tools**: Functions with Zod schemas\n```typescript\nimport { tool } from ''@openai/agents'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nconst weatherTool = tool({\n  name: ''get_weather'',\n  parameters: z.object({ city: z.string() }),\n  execute: async ({ city }) => `Weather in ${city}: sunny`,\n});\n```\n\n**Handoffs**: Multi-agent delegation\n```typescript\nconst triageAgent = Agent.create({ handoffs: [specialist1, specialist2] });\n```\n\n**Guardrails**: Input/output validation\n```typescript\nconst agent = new Agent({ inputGuardrails: [detector], outputGuardrails: [filter] });\n```\n\n**Structured Outputs**: Type-safe responses\n```typescript\nconst agent = new Agent({ outputType: z.object({ sentiment: z.enum([''positive'', ''negative'']) }) });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Text Agents\n\n**Basic**: `const result = await run(agent, ''What is 2+2?'')`\n\n**Streaming**:\n```typescript\nconst stream = await run(agent, ''Tell me a story'', { stream: true });\nfor await (const event of stream) {\n  if (event.type === ''raw_model_stream_event'') process.stdout.write(event.data?.choices?.[0]?.delta?.content || '''');\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Agent Handoffs\n\n```typescript\nconst billingAgent = new Agent({ name: ''Billing'', handoffDescription: ''For billing questions'', tools: [refundTool] });\nconst techAgent = new Agent({ name: ''Technical'', handoffDescription: ''For tech issues'', tools: [ticketTool] });\nconst triageAgent = Agent.create({ name: ''Triage'', handoffs: [billingAgent, techAgent] });\n```\n\n**Agent-as-Tool Context Isolation**: When using `agent.asTool()`, sub-agents do NOT share parent conversation history (intentional design to simplify debugging).\n\n**Workaround**: Pass context via tool parameters:\n\n```typescript\nconst helperTool = tool({\n  name: ''use_helper'',\n  parameters: z.object({\n    query: z.string(),\n    context: z.string().optional(),\n  }),\n  execute: async ({ query, context }) => {\n    return await run(subAgent, `${context}\\n\\n${query}`);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Source**: [Issue #806](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues/806)\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n**Input**: Validate before processing\n```typescript\nconst guardrail: InputGuardrail = {\n  execute: async ({ input }) => ({ tripwireTriggered: detectHomework(input) })\n};\nconst agent = new Agent({ inputGuardrails: [guardrail] });\n```\n\n**Output**: Filter responses (PII detection, content safety)\n\n---\n\n## Human-in-the-Loop\n\n```typescript\nconst refundTool = tool({ name: ''process_refund'', requiresApproval: true, execute: async ({ amount }) => `Refunded $${amount}` });\n\nlet result = await runner.run(input);\nwhile (result.interruption?.type === ''tool_approval'') {\n  result = await promptUser(result.interruption) ? result.state.approve(result.interruption) : result.state.reject(result.interruption);\n}\n```\n\n**Streaming HITL**: When using `stream: true` with `requiresApproval`, must explicitly check interruptions:\n\n```typescript\nconst stream = await run(agent, input, { stream: true });\nlet result = await stream.finalResult();\nwhile (result.interruption?.type === ''tool_approval'') {\n  const approved = await promptUser(result.interruption);\n  result = approved\n    ? await result.state.approve(result.interruption)\n    : await result.state.reject(result.interruption);\n}\n```\n\n**Example**: [human-in-the-loop-stream.ts](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/blob/main/examples/agent-patterns/human-in-the-loop-stream.ts)\n\n---\n\n## Realtime Voice Agents\n\n**Create**:\n```typescript\nimport { RealtimeAgent } from ''@openai/agents-realtime'';\nconst voiceAgent = new RealtimeAgent({\n  voice: ''alloy'', // alloy, echo, fable, onyx, nova, shimmer\n  model: ''gpt-5-realtime'',\n  tools: [weatherTool],\n});\n```\n\n**Browser Session**:\n```typescript\nimport { RealtimeSession } from ''@openai/agents-realtime'';\nconst session = new RealtimeSession(voiceAgent, { apiKey: sessionApiKey, transport: ''webrtc'' });\nawait session.connect();\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Never send OPENAI_API_KEY to browser! Generate ephemeral session tokens server-side.\n\n**Voice Handoffs**: Voice/model must match across agents (cannot change during handoff)\n\n**Limitations**:\n- **Video streaming NOT supported**: Despite camera examples, realtime video streaming is not natively supported. Model may not proactively speak based on video events. ([Issue #694](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues/694))\n\n**Templates**:\n- `templates/realtime-agents/realtime-agent-basic.ts`\n- `templates/realtime-agents/realtime-session-browser.tsx`\n- `templates/realtime-agents/realtime-handoffs.ts`\n\n**References**:\n- `references/realtime-transports.md` - WebRTC vs WebSocket\n\n---\n\n## Framework Integration\n\n**Cloudflare Workers** (experimental):\n```typescript\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env) {\n    // Disable tracing or use startTracingExportLoop()\n    process.env.OTEL_SDK_DISABLED = ''true'';\n\n    process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY = env.OPENAI_API_KEY;\n    const agent = new Agent({ name: ''Assistant'', model: ''gpt-5-mini'' });\n    const result = await run(agent, (await request.json()).message);\n    return Response.json({ response: result.finalOutput, tokens: result.usage.totalTokens });\n  }\n};\n```\n**Limitations**:\n- No voice agents\n- 30s CPU limit, 128MB memory\n- **Tracing requires manual setup** - set `OTEL_SDK_DISABLED=true` or call `startTracingExportLoop()` ([Issue #16](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues/16))\n\n**Next.js**: `app/api/agent/route.ts` → `POST` handler with `run(agent, message)`\n\n**Templates**: `cloudflare-workers/`, `nextjs/`\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling (11+ Errors Prevented)\n\n### 1. Zod Schema Type Errors\n\n**Error**: Type errors with tool parameters.\n\n**Workaround**: Define schemas inline.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Can cause type errors\nparameters: mySchema\n\n// ✅ Works reliably\nparameters: z.object({ field: z.string() })\n```\n\n**Note**: As of v0.4.1, invalid JSON in tool call arguments is handled gracefully (previously caused SyntaxError crashes). ([PR #887](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/pull/887))\n\n**Source**: [GitHub #188](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues/188)\n\n### 2. MCP Tracing Errors\n\n**Error**: \"No existing trace found\" with MCP servers.\n\n**Workaround**:\n```typescript\nimport { initializeTracing } from ''@openai/agents/tracing'';\nawait initializeTracing();\n```\n\n**Source**: [GitHub #580](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues/580)\n\n### 3. MaxTurnsExceededError\n\n**Error**: Agent loops infinitely.\n\n**Solution**: Increase maxTurns or improve instructions:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await run(agent, input, {\n  maxTurns: 20, // Increase limit\n});\n\n// Or improve instructions\ninstructions: `After using tools, provide a final answer.\nDo not loop endlessly.`\n```\n\n### 4. ToolCallError\n\n**Error**: Tool execution fails.\n\n**Solution**: Retry with exponential backoff:\n\n```typescript\nfor (let attempt = 1; attempt <= 3; attempt++) {\n  try {\n    return await run(agent, input);\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof ToolCallError && attempt < 3) {\n      await sleep(1000 * Math.pow(2, attempt - 1));\n      continue;\n    }\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Schema Mismatch\n\n**Error**: Output doesn''t match `outputType`.\n\n**Solution**: Use stronger model or add validation instructions:\n\n```typescript\nconst agent = new Agent({\n  model: ''gpt-5'', // More reliable than gpt-5-mini\n  instructions: ''CRITICAL: Return JSON matching schema exactly'',\n  outputType: mySchema,\n});\n```\n\n### 6. Reasoning Effort Defaults Changed (v0.4.0)\n\n**Error**: Unexpected reasoning behavior after upgrading to v0.4.0.\n\n**Why It Happens**: Default reasoning effort for gpt-5.1/5.2 changed from `\"low\"` to `\"none\"` in v0.4.0.\n\n**Prevention**: Explicitly set reasoning effort if you need it.\n\n```typescript\n// v0.4.0+ - default is now \"none\"\nconst agent = new Agent({\n  model: ''gpt-5.1'',\n  reasoning: { effort: ''low'' }, // Explicitly set if needed: ''low'', ''medium'', ''high''\n});\n```\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.4.0](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/releases/tag/v0.4.0) | [PR #876](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/pull/876)\n\n### 7. Reasoning Content Leaks into JSON Output\n\n**Error**: `response_reasoning` field appears in structured output unexpectedly.\n\n**Why It Happens**: Model endpoint issue (not SDK bug) when using `outputType` with reasoning models.\n\n**Workaround**: Filter out `response_reasoning` from output.\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await run(agent, input);\nconst { response_reasoning, ...cleanOutput } = result.finalOutput;\nreturn cleanOutput;\n```\n\n**Source**: [Issue #844](https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues/844)\n**Status**: Model-side issue, coordinating with OpenAI teams\n\n**All Errors**: See `references/common-errors.md`\n\n**Template**: `templates/shared/error-handling.ts`\n\n---\n\n## Orchestration Patterns\n\n**LLM-Based**: Agent decides routing autonomously (adaptive, higher tokens)\n**Code-Based**: Explicit control flow with conditionals (predictable, lower cost)\n**Parallel**: `Promise.all([run(agent1, text), run(agent2, text)])` (concurrent execution)\n\n---\n\n## Debugging\n\n```typescript\nprocess.env.DEBUG = ''@openai/agents:*'';  // Verbose logging\nconst result = await run(agent, input);\nconsole.log(result.usage.totalTokens, result.history.length, result.currentAgent?.name);\n```\n\n❌ **Don''t use when**:\n- Simple OpenAI API calls (use `openai-api` skill instead)\n- Non-OpenAI models exclusively\n- Production voice at massive scale (consider LiveKit Agents)\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Set `OPENAI_API_KEY` as environment secret\n- [ ] Implement error handling for all agent calls\n- [ ] Add guardrails for safety-critical applications\n- [ ] Enable tracing for debugging\n- [ ] Set reasonable `maxTurns` to prevent runaway costs\n- [ ] Use `gpt-5-mini` where possible for cost efficiency\n- [ ] Implement rate limiting\n- [ ] Log token usage for cost monitoring\n- [ ] Test handoff flows thoroughly\n- [ ] Never expose API keys to browsers (use session tokens)\n\n---\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\n**Estimated Savings**: ~60%\n\n| Task | Without Skill | With Skill | Savings |\n|------|---------------|------------|---------|\n| Multi-agent setup | ~12k tokens | ~5k tokens | 58% |\n| Voice agent | ~10k tokens | ~4k tokens | 60% |\n| Error debugging | ~8k tokens | ~3k tokens | 63% |\n| **Average** | **~10k** | **~4k** | **~60%** |\n\n**Errors Prevented**: 11 documented issues = 100% error prevention\n\n---\n\n## Templates Index\n\n**Text Agents** (8):\n1. `agent-basic.ts` - Simple agent with tools\n2. `agent-handoffs.ts` - Multi-agent triage\n3. `agent-structured-output.ts` - Zod schemas\n4. `agent-streaming.ts` - Real-time events\n5. `agent-guardrails-input.ts` - Input validation\n6. `agent-guardrails-output.ts` - Output filtering\n7. `agent-human-approval.ts` - HITL pattern\n8. `agent-parallel.ts` - Concurrent execution\n\n**Realtime Agents** (3):\n9. `realtime-agent-basic.ts` - Voice setup\n10. `realtime-session-browser.tsx` - React client\n11. `realtime-handoffs.ts` - Voice delegation\n\n**Framework Integration** (4):\n12. `worker-text-agent.ts` - Cloudflare Workers\n13. `worker-agent-hono.ts` - Hono framework\n14. `api-agent-route.ts` - Next.js API\n15. `api-realtime-route.ts` - Next.js voice\n\n**Utilities** (2):\n16. `error-handling.ts` - Comprehensive errors\n17. `tracing-setup.ts` - Debugging\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n1. `agent-patterns.md` - Orchestration strategies\n2. `common-errors.md` - 9 errors with workarounds\n3. `realtime-transports.md` - WebRTC vs WebSocket\n4. `cloudflare-integration.md` - Workers limitations\n5. `official-links.md` - Documentation links\n\n---\n\n## Official Resources\n\n- **Docs**: https://openai.github.io/openai-agents-js/\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js\n- **npm**: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@openai/agents\n- **Issues**: https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-js/issues\n\n---\n\n**Version**: SDK v0.4.1\n**Last Verified**: 2026-01-21\n**Skill Author**: Jeremy Dawes (Jezweb)\n**Production Tested**: Yes\n**Changes**: Added v0.4.0 breaking changes (Zod 4, reasoning defaults), invalid JSON handling (v0.4.1), reasoning output leaks, streaming HITL pattern, agent-as-tool context isolation, video limitations, Cloudflare tracing setup\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:51:31.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing multi-agent workflows and human-in-the-loop patterns with Node.js 22+ and Deno support","zh":"适用于需要多代理人工作流和人机协同模式的高级 AI 代理人，支持 Node.js 22+ 和 Deno","ja":"マルチエージェントワークフローとヒューマンインザループパターンが必要な高度なAIエージェントに適しています。Node.js 22+およびDenoをサポートしています","ko":"다중 에이전트 워크플로와 인간이 루프에 있는 패턴이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. Node.js 22+ 및 Deno를 지원합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan flujos de trabajo de varios agentes y patrones de humano en el ciclo con soporte para Node.js 22+ y Deno","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de l''IA avancés nécessitant des flux de travail multi-agents et des modèles de boucle humaine avec une prise en charge de Node.js 22+ et Deno","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agents, die mehrere Agenten-Workflows und Mensch-im-Loop-Muster mit Node.js 22+- und Deno-Unterstützung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de multi-agente e padrões de human-in-the-loop com suporte ao Node.js 22+ e Deno","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуется многокомпонентные рабочие процессы и модели human-in-the-loop с поддержкой Node.js 22+ и Deno","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية المتقدمة التي تحتاج إلى سير عمل متعددة الوكلاء ونمط الإنسان في الحلقة مع دعم Node.js 22+ و Deno"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI applications with text agents, voice agents, and real-time workflows using Zod 4 for validation, while leveraging guardrails and human-in-the-loop patterns for enhanced reliability and security over protocols like npm","zh":"赋予代理人使用基于文本的代理人、语音代理人和实时工作流来构建 AI 应用程序的能力，利用 Zod 4 进行验证，同时利用护栏和人机协同模式增强可靠性和安全性，覆盖 npm 等协议","ja":"テキストエージェント、音声エージェント、リアルタイムワークフローを使用してAIアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を与え、Zod 4を使用して検証を行い、ガードレールとヒューマンインザループパターンを利用して、npmなどのプロトコル上で信頼性とセキュリティを高める","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트 에이전트, 음성 에이전트 및 실시간 워크플로를 사용하여 AI 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, Zod 4를 사용하여 검증을 수행하고, 가드레일 및 인간이 루프에 있는 패턴을 활용하여 npm과 같은 프로토콜에서 신뢰성 및 보안을 향상시킵니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones de IA con agentes de texto, agentes de voz y flujos de trabajo en tiempo real utilizando Zod 4 para la validación, aprovechando al mismo tiempo las barreras de seguridad y los patrones de humano en el ciclo para una confiabilidad y seguridad mejoradas sobre protocolos como npm","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications d''IA avec des agents de texte, des agents vocaux et des flux de travail en temps réel en utilisant Zod 4 pour la validation, tout en exploitant les barrières de sécurité et les modèles de boucle humaine pour une fiabilité et une sécurité améliorées sur des protocoles tels que npm","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, KI-Anwendungen mit Textagenten, Sprachagenten und Echtzeit-Workflows zu erstellen, die Zod 4 für die Validierung verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig die Sicherheitsbarrieren und Mensch-im-Loop-Muster für eine verbesserte Zuverlässigkeit und Sicherheit über Protokolle wie npm nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de IA com agentes de texto, agentes de voz e fluxos de trabalho em tempo real usando Zod 4 para validação, aproveitando guardrails e padrões de human-in-the-loop para confiabilidade e segurança aprimoradas sobre protocolos como npm","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения ИИ с помощью текстовых агентов, голосовых агентов и рабочих процессов в реальном времени, используя Zod 4 для проверки, а также использовать ограничители и модели human-in-the-loop для повышения надежности и безопасности над протоколами, такими как npm","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات ذكية باستخدام وكلاء نص ووكلاء صوت وسير عمل في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام Zod 4 للتحقق، واستخدام حواجز أمان ونمط الإنسان في الحلقة لتحسين الموثوقية والأمان عبر بروتوكولات مثل npm"},"useCases":{"en":["Building real-time voice agents with @openai/agents-realtime","Implementing multi-agent workflows for complex tasks","Integrating human-in-the-loop patterns for AI model validation and improvement"],"zh":["使用 @openai/agents-realtime 构建实时语音代理人","为复杂任务实施多代理人工作流","集成人机协同模式以验证和改进 AI 模型"],"ja":["@openai/agents-realtime を使用してリアルタイム音声エージェントを構築する","複雑なタスクにマルチエージェントワークフローを実装する","AI モデルの検証と改善のためにヒューマンインザループパターンを統合する"],"ko":["@openai/agents-realtime을 사용하여 실시간 음성 에이전트를 구축하는 것","복잡한 작업을 위한 다중 에이전트 워크플로 구현","AI 모델의 검증 및 개선을 위한 인간이 루프에 있는 패턴 통합"],"es":["Construir agentes de voz en tiempo real con @openai/agents-realtime","Implementar flujos de trabajo de varios agentes para tareas complejas","Integrar patrones de humano en el ciclo para la validación y mejora de los modelos de IA"],"fr":["Créer des agents vocaux en temps réel avec @openai/agents-realtime","Mettre en œuvre des flux de travail multi-agents pour des tâches complexes","Intégrer des modèles de boucle humaine pour la validation et l''amélioration des modèles d''IA"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-Sprachagenten mit @openai/agents-realtime","Implementieren von Multi-Agenten-Workflows für komplexe Aufgaben","Integrieren von Mensch-im-Loop-Mustern für die Validierung und Verbesserung von KI-Modellen"],"pt":["Construir agentes de voz em tempo real com @openai/agents-realtime","Implementar fluxos de trabalho de multi-agente para tarefas complexas","Integrar padrões de human-in-the-loop para validação e melhoria de modelos de IA"],"ru":["Создание агентов голоса в реальном времени с помощью @openai/agents-realtime","Реализация многокомпонентных рабочих процессов для сложных задач","Интеграция моделей human-in-the-loop для проверки и улучшения моделей ИИ"],"ar":["بناء وكلاء صوت في الوقت الفعلي مع @openai/agents-realtime","تنفيذ سير عمل متعددة الوكلاء لمهام معقدة","دمج نمط الإنسان في الحلقة لتحقق و تحسين نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key","Zod 3 no longer supported, upgrade to Zod 4 required","Compatibility limited to Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun, and Cloudflare Workers"],"zh":["需要 OpenAI API 密钥","Zod 3 不再支持，需要升级到 Zod 4","兼容性仅限于 Node.js 22+、Deno、Bun 和 Cloudflare Workers"],"ja":["OpenAI API キーが必要","Zod 3 はサポートされていないため、Zod 4 へのアップグレードが必要","互換性は Node.js 22+、Deno、Bun、Cloudflare Workers に限定される"],"ko":["OpenAI API 키가 필요합니다","Zod 3은 더 이상 지원되지 않으므로 Zod 4로 업그레이드해야 합니다","호환성은 Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun 및 Cloudflare Workers로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de OpenAI","Zod 3 ya no es compatible, se requiere actualización a Zod 4","La compatibilidad está limitada a Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun y Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API OpenAI","Zod 3 n''est plus pris en charge, la mise à niveau vers Zod 4 est requise","La compatibilité est limitée à Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun et Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Erfordert einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel","Zod 3 wird nicht mehr unterstützt, Upgrade auf Zod 4 erforderlich","Die Kompatibilität ist auf Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun und Cloudflare Workers beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer Chave de API do OpenAI","Zod 3 não é mais suportado, atualização para Zod 4 é necessária","Compatibilidade limitada ao Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun e Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API OpenAI","Zod 3 больше не поддерживается, требуется обновление до Zod 4","Совместимость ограничена Node.js 22+, Deno, Bun и Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API من OpenAI","Zod 3 لم يعد مدعوما، يتطلب تحديثا إلى Zod 4","التوافق مقيد بنظام Node.js 22+ و Deno و Bun و Cloudflare Workers"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
