,"Balanceamento entre recall e velocidade","Escala para bilhões de vetores"],"ru":["Настройка параметров HNSW","Реализация квантования","Оптимизация использования памяти","Снижение задержки поиска","Баланс между recall и скоростью","Масштабирование до миллиардов векторов"],"ar":["ضبط 매개变量 HNSW","تنفيذ الكمية","تحسين استخدام الذاكرة","تقليل تأخر البحث","التوازن بين الاسترجاع والسرعة","التنمية إلى مليارات المتجهات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["向量索引优化","生产性能","HNSW","量化","内存使用","搜索延迟","召回率","速度平衡"],"ja":["ベクトルインデックスチューニング","プロダクションパフォーマンス","HNSW","量子化","メモリ使用","検索遅延","リコール率","速度バランス"],"ko":["벡터 인덱스 튜닝","프로덕션 성능","HNSW","양자화","메모리 사용","검색 지연","재현율","속도 균형"],"es":["ajuste de índices vectoriales","optimización de rendimiento","tunificación de parámetros HNSW","cuantización","optimización de memoria","reducción de latencia de búsqueda","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["réglage d''index vectoriels","optimisation de performances","tunification des paramètres HNSW","quantification","optimisation de la mémoire","réduction de la latence de recherche","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Feinabstimmung von Vektor-Indizes","Optimierung der Leistung","Feinabstimmung der HNSW-Parameter","Quantisierung","Optimierung der Speicherauslastung","Reduzierung der Suchlatenz","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["otimização de índices vetoriais","desempenho em produção","parâmetros HNSW","quantização","uso de memória","latência de busca","recall e velocidade"],"ru":["настройка векторных индексов","производительность в производстве","параметры HNSW","квантование","использование памяти","задержка поиска","recall и скорость"],"ar":["تحسين فهارس المتجهات","أداء الإنتاج","معايير HNSW","الكمية","استخدام الذاكرة","تأخر البحث","الاسترجاع والسرعة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vector-index-tuning","description":"Optimize vector index performance for latency, recall, and memory. Use when tuning HNSW parameters, selecting quantization strategies, or scaling vector search infrastructure.","bodyPreview":"# Vector Index Tuning\n\nGuide to optimizing vector indexes for production performance.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Tuning HNSW parameters\n- Implementing quantization\n- Optimizing memory usage\n- Reducing search latency\n- Balancing recall vs speed\n- Scaling to billions of vectors\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Index Type Selection\n\n```\nData Size           Recommended Index\n────────────────────────────────────────\n< 10K vectors  →    Flat (exact search)\n10K - 1M       →    HNSW\n1M - 100M      →    HNSW","body":"# Vector Index Tuning\n\nGuide to optimizing vector indexes for production performance.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Tuning HNSW parameters\n- Implementing quantization\n- Optimizing memory usage\n- Reducing search latency\n- Balancing recall vs speed\n- Scaling to billions of vectors\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Index Type Selection\n\n```\nData Size           Recommended Index\n────────────────────────────────────────\n< 10K vectors  →    Flat (exact search)\n10K - 1M       →    HNSW\n1M - 100M      →    HNSW + Quantization\n> 100M         →    IVF + PQ or DiskANN\n```\n\n### 2. HNSW Parameters\n\n| Parameter          | Default | Effect                                               |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **M**              | 16      | Connections per node, ↑ = better recall, more memory |\n| **efConstruction** | 100     | Build quality, ↑ = better index, slower build        |\n| **efSearch**       | 50      | Search quality, ↑ = better recall, slower search     |\n\n### 3. Quantization Types\n\n```\nFull Precision (FP32): 4 bytes × dimensions\nHalf Precision (FP16): 2 bytes × dimensions\nINT8 Scalar:           1 byte × dimensions\nProduct Quantization:  ~32-64 bytes total\nBinary:                dimensions/8 bytes\n```\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: HNSW Parameter Tuning\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom typing import List, Tuple\nimport time\n\ndef benchmark_hnsw_parameters(\n    vectors: np.ndarray,\n    queries: np.ndarray,\n    ground_truth: np.ndarray,\n    m_values: List[int] = [8, 16, 32, 64],\n    ef_construction_values: List[int] = [64, 128, 256],\n    ef_search_values: List[int] = [32, 64, 128, 256]\n) -> List[dict]:\n    \"\"\"Benchmark different HNSW configurations.\"\"\"\n    import hnswlib\n\n    results = []\n    dim = vectors.shape[1]\n    n = vectors.shape[0]\n\n    for m in m_values:\n        for ef_construction in ef_construction_values:\n            # Build index\n            index = hnswlib.Index(space=''cosine'', dim=dim)\n            index.init_index(max_elements=n, M=m, ef_construction=ef_construction)\n\n            build_start = time.time()\n            index.add_items(vectors)\n            build_time = time.time() - build_start\n\n            # Get memory usage\n            memory_bytes = index.element_count * (\n                dim * 4 +  # Vector storage\n                m * 2 * 4  # Graph edges (approximate)\n            )\n\n            for ef_search in ef_search_values:\n                index.set_ef(ef_search)\n\n                # Measure search\n                search_start = time.time()\n                labels, distances = index.knn_query(queries, k=10)\n                search_time = time.time() - search_start\n\n                # Calculate recall\n                recall = calculate_recall(labels, ground_truth, k=10)\n\n                results.append({\n                    \"M\": m,\n                    \"ef_construction\": ef_construction,\n                    \"ef_search\": ef_search,\n                    \"build_time_s\": build_time,\n                    \"search_time_ms\": search_time * 1000 / len(queries),\n                    \"recall@10\": recall,\n                    \"memory_mb\": memory_bytes / 1024 / 1024\n                })\n\n    return results\n\n\ndef calculate_recall(predictions: np.ndarray, ground_truth: np.ndarray, k: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculate recall@k.\"\"\"\n    correct = 0\n    for pred, truth in zip(predictions, ground_truth):\n        correct += len(set(pred[:k]) & set(truth[:k]))\n    return correct / (len(predictions) * k)\n\n\ndef recommend_hnsw_params(\n    num_vectors: int,\n    target_recall: float = 0.95,\n    max_latency_ms: float = 10,\n    available_memory_gb: float = 8\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Recommend HNSW parameters based on requirements.\"\"\"\n\n    # Base recommendations\n    if num_vectors < 100_000:\n        m = 16\n        ef_construction = 100\n    elif num_vectors < 1_000_000:\n        m = 32\n        ef_construction = 200\n    else:\n        m = 48\n        ef_construction = 256\n\n    # Adjust ef_search based on recall target\n    if target_recall >= 0.99:\n        ef_search = 256\n    elif target_recall >= 0.95:\n        ef_search = 128\n    else:\n        ef_search = 64\n\n    return {\n        \"M\": m,\n        \"ef_construction\": ef_construction,\n        \"ef_search\": ef_search,\n        \"notes\": f\"Estimated for {num_vectors:,} vectors, {target_recall:.0%} recall\"\n    }\n```\n\n### Template 2: Quantization Strategies\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom typing import Optional\n\nclass VectorQuantizer:\n    \"\"\"Quantization strategies for vector compression.\"\"\"\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def scalar_quantize_int8(\n        vectors: np.ndarray,\n        min_val: Optional[float] = None,\n        max_val: Optional[float] = None\n    ) -> Tuple[np.ndarray, dict]:\n        \"\"\"Scalar quantization to INT8.\"\"\"\n        if min_val is None:\n            min_val = vectors.min()\n        if max_val is None:\n            max_val = vectors.max()\n\n        # Scale to 0-255 range\n        scale = 255.0 / (max_val - min_val)\n        quantized = np.clip(\n            np.round((vectors - min_val) * scale),\n            0, 255\n        ).astype(np.uint8)\n\n        params = {\"min_val\": min_val, \"max_val\": max_val, \"scale\": scale}\n        return quantized, params\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def dequantize_int8(\n        quantized: np.ndarray,\n        params: dict\n    ) -> np.ndarray:\n        \"\"\"Dequantize INT8 vectors.\"\"\"\n        return quantized.astype(np.float32) / params[\"scale\"] + params[\"min_val\"]\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def product_quantize(\n        vectors: np.ndarray,\n        n_subvectors: int = 8,\n        n_centroids: int = 256\n    ) -> Tuple[np.ndarray, dict]:\n        \"\"\"Product quantization for aggressive compression.\"\"\"\n        from sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n\n        n, dim = vectors.shape\n        assert dim % n_subvectors == 0\n        subvector_dim = dim // n_subvectors\n\n        codebooks = []\n        codes = np.zeros((n, n_subvectors), dtype=np.uint8)\n\n        for i in range(n_subvectors):\n            start = i * subvector_dim\n            end = (i + 1) * subvector_dim\n            subvectors = vectors[:, start:end]\n\n            kmeans = KMeans(n_clusters=n_centroids, random_state=42)\n            codes[:, i] = kmeans.fit_predict(subvectors)\n            codebooks.append(kmeans.cluster_centers_)\n\n        params = {\n            \"codebooks\": codebooks,\n            \"n_subvectors\": n_subvectors,\n            \"subvector_dim\": subvector_dim\n        }\n        return codes, params\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def binary_quantize(vectors: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n        \"\"\"Binary quantization (sign of each dimension).\"\"\"\n        # Convert to binary: positive = 1, negative = 0\n        binary = (vectors > 0).astype(np.uint8)\n\n        # Pack bits into bytes\n        n, dim = vectors.shape\n        packed_dim = (dim + 7) // 8\n\n        packed = np.zeros((n, packed_dim), dtype=np.uint8)\n        for i in range(dim):\n            byte_idx = i // 8\n            bit_idx = i % 8\n            packed[:, byte_idx] |= (binary[:, i] << bit_idx)\n\n        return packed\n\n\ndef estimate_memory_usage(\n    num_vectors: int,\n    dimensions: int,\n    quantization: str = \"fp32\",\n    index_type: str = \"hnsw\",\n    hnsw_m: int = 16\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Estimate memory usage for different configurations.\"\"\"\n\n    # Vector storage\n    bytes_per_dimension = {\n        \"fp32\": 4,\n        \"fp16\": 2,\n        \"int8\": 1,\n        \"pq\": 0.05,  # Approximate\n        \"binary\": 0.125\n    }\n\n    vector_bytes = num_vectors * dimensions * bytes_per_dimension[quantization]\n\n    # Index overhead\n    if index_type == \"hnsw\":\n        # Each node has ~M*2 edges, each edge is 4 bytes (int32)\n        index_bytes = num_vectors * hnsw_m * 2 * 4\n    elif index_type == \"ivf\":\n        # Inverted lists + centroids\n        index_bytes = num_vectors * 8 + 65536 * dimensions * 4\n    else:\n        index_bytes = 0\n\n    total_bytes = vector_bytes + index_bytes\n\n    return {\n        \"vector_storage_mb\": vector_bytes / 1024 / 1024,\n        \"index_overhead_mb\": index_bytes / 1024 / 1024,\n        \"total_mb\": total_bytes / 1024 / 1024,\n        \"total_gb\": total_bytes / 1024 / 1024 / 1024\n    }\n```\n\n### Template 3: Qdrant Index Configuration\n\n```python\nfrom qdrant_client import QdrantClient\nfrom qdrant_client.http import models\n\ndef create_optimized_collection(\n    client: QdrantClient,\n    collection_name: str,\n    vector_size: int,\n    num_vectors: int,\n    optimize_for: str = \"balanced\"  # \"recall\", \"speed\", \"memory\"\n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Create collection with optimized settings.\"\"\"\n\n    # HNSW configuration based on optimization target\n    hnsw_configs = {\n        \"recall\": models.HnswConfigDiff(m=32, ef_construct=256),\n        \"speed\": models.HnswConfigDiff(m=16, ef_construct=64),\n        \"balanced\": models.HnswConfigDiff(m=16, ef_construct=128),\n        \"memory\": models.HnswConfigDiff(m=8, ef_construct=64)\n    }\n\n    # Quantization configuration\n    quantization_configs = {\n        \"recall\": None,  # No quantization for max recall\n        \"speed\": models.ScalarQuantization(\n            scalar=models.ScalarQuantizationConfig(\n                type=models.ScalarType.INT8,\n                quantile=0.99,\n                always_ram=True\n            )\n        ),\n        \"balanced\": models.ScalarQuantization(\n            scalar=models.ScalarQuantizationConfig(\n                type=models.ScalarType.INT8,\n                quantile=0.99,\n                always_ram=False\n            )\n        ),\n        \"memory\": models.ProductQuantization(\n            product=models.ProductQuantizationConfig(\n                compression=models.CompressionRatio.X16,\n                always_ram=False\n            )\n        )\n    }\n\n    # Optimizer configuration\n    optimizer_configs = {\n        \"recall\": models.OptimizersConfigDiff(\n            indexing_threshold=10000,\n            memmap_threshold=50000\n        ),\n        \"speed\": models.OptimizersConfigDiff(\n            indexing_threshold=5000,\n            memmap_threshold=20000\n        ),\n        \"balanced\": models.OptimizersConfigDiff(\n            indexing_threshold=20000,\n            memmap_threshold=50000\n        ),\n        \"memory\": models.OptimizersConfigDiff(\n            indexing_threshold=50000,\n            memmap_threshold=10000  # Use disk sooner\n        )\n    }\n\n    client.create_collection(\n        collection_name=collection_name,\n        vectors_config=models.VectorParams(\n            size=vector_size,\n            distance=models.Distance.COSINE\n        ),\n        hnsw_config=hnsw_configs[optimize_for],\n        quantization_config=quantization_configs[optimize_for],\n        optimizers_config=optimizer_configs[optimize_for]\n    )\n\n\ndef tune_search_parameters(\n    client: QdrantClient,\n    collection_name: str,\n    target_recall: float = 0.95\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Tune search parameters for target recall.\"\"\"\n\n    # Search parameter recommendations\n    if target_recall >= 0.99:\n        search_params = models.SearchParams(\n            hnsw_ef=256,\n            exact=False,\n            quantization=models.QuantizationSearchParams(\n                ignore=True,  # Don''t use quantization for search\n                rescore=True\n            )\n        )\n    elif target_recall >= 0.95:\n        search_params = models.SearchParams(\n            hnsw_ef=128,\n            exact=False,\n            quantization=models.QuantizationSearchParams(\n                ignore=False,\n                rescore=True,\n                oversampling=2.0\n            )\n        )\n    else:\n        search_params = models.SearchParams(\n            hnsw_ef=64,\n            exact=False,\n            quantization=models.QuantizationSearchParams(\n                ignore=False,\n                rescore=False\n            )\n        )\n\n    return search_params\n```\n\n### Template 4: Performance Monitoring\n\n```python\nimport time\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import List\nimport numpy as np\n\n@dataclass\nclass SearchMetrics:\n    latency_p50_ms: float\n    latency_p95_ms: float\n    latency_p99_ms: float\n    recall: float\n    qps: float\n\n\nclass VectorSearchMonitor:\n    \"\"\"Monitor vector search performance.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, ground_truth_fn=None):\n        self.latencies = []\n        self.recalls = []\n        self.ground_truth_fn = ground_truth_fn\n\n    def measure_search(\n        self,\n        search_fn,\n        query_vectors: np.ndarray,\n        k: int = 10,\n        num_iterations: int = 100\n    ) -> SearchMetrics:\n        \"\"\"Benchmark search performance.\"\"\"\n        latencies = []\n\n        for _ in range(num_iterations):\n            for query in query_vectors:\n                start = time.perf_counter()\n                results = search_fn(query, k=k)\n                latency = (time.perf_counter() - start) * 1000\n                latencies.append(latency)\n\n        latencies = np.array(latencies)\n        total_queries = num_iterations * len(query_vectors)\n        total_time = sum(latencies) / 1000  # seconds\n\n        return SearchMetrics(\n            latency_p50_ms=np.percentile(latencies, 50),\n            latency_p95_ms=np.percentile(latencies, 95),\n            latency_p99_ms=np.percentile(latencies, 99),\n            recall=self._calculate_recall(search_fn, query_vectors, k) if self.ground_truth_fn else 0,\n            qps=total_queries / total_time\n        )\n\n    def _calculate_recall(self, search_fn, queries: np.ndarray, k: int) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Calculate recall against ground truth.\"\"\"\n        if not self.ground_truth_fn:\n            return 0\n\n        correct = 0\n        total = 0\n\n        for query in queries:\n            predicted = set(search_fn(query, k=k))\n            actual = set(self.ground_truth_fn(query, k=k))\n            correct += len(predicted & actual)\n            total += k\n\n        return correct / total\n\n\ndef profile_index_build(\n    build_fn,\n    vectors: np.ndarray,\n    batch_sizes: List[int] = [1000, 10000, 50000]\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Profile index build performance.\"\"\"\n    results = {}\n\n    for batch_size in batch_sizes:\n        times = []\n        for i in range(0, len(vectors), batch_size):\n            batch = vectors[i:i + batch_size]\n            start = time.perf_counter()\n            build_fn(batch)\n            times.append(time.perf_counter() - start)\n\n        results[batch_size] = {\n            \"avg_batch_time_s\": np.mean(times),\n            \"vectors_per_second\": batch_size / np.mean(times)\n        }\n\n    return results\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Benchmark with real queries** - Synthetic may not represent production\n- **Monitor recall continuously** - Can degrade with data drift\n- **Start with defaults** - Tune only when needed\n- **Use quantization** - Significant memory savings\n- **Consider tiered storage** - Hot/cold data separation\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t over-optimize early** - Profile first\n- **Don''t ignore build time** - Index updates have cost\n- **Don''t forget reindexing** - Plan for maintenance\n- **Don''t skip warming** - Cold indexes are slow\n\n## Resources\n\n- [HNSW Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.09320)\n- [Faiss Wiki](https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/wiki)\n- [ANN Benchmarks](https://ann-benchmarks.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:51:39.217Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing optimized vector index performance, particularly those utilizing HNSW parameters and quantization for production environments.","zh":"适合需要优化向量索引性能的AI代理，特别是那些在生产环境中使用HNSW参数和量化的代理。","ja":"HNSWパラメータや量化を使用して生産環境で動作するAIエージェントが、最適化されたベクトルインデックスのパフォーマンスを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"생산 환경에서 HNSW 매개 변수 및 양자화를 사용하는 AI 에이전트가 최적화된 벡터 인덱스 성능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un rendimiento de índice de vector optimizado, particularmente aquellos que utilizan parámetros HNSW y cuantificación para entornos de producción.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des performances de index de vecteur optimisées, en particulier ceux utilisant des paramètres HNSW et de la quantification pour les environnements de production.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die ein optimiertes Vektorindex-Performance benötigen, insbesondere solche, die HNSW-Parameter und Quantisierung für Produktionsumgebungen verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de desempenho de índice de vetor otimizado, particularmente aqueles que utilizam parâmetros HNSW e quantização para ambientes de produção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется оптимизированное производительность индекса вектора, особенно тех, кто использует параметры HNSW и квантование для производственных сред.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى أداء فهرس متجه محسّن، ولا سيما تلك التي تستخدم معلمات HNSW والكمية للبيئات الإنتاجية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fine-tune vector indexes for reduced search latency, optimized memory usage, and balanced recall vs speed, leveraging techniques such as index type selection and quantization to achieve high-performance search capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理人调整向量索引以减少搜索延迟、优化内存使用和平衡召回与速度的能力，利用索引类型选择和量化等技术来实现高性能搜索功能。","ja":"エージェントに、インデックスタイプの選択や量化などの手法を利用して、検索の待ち時間を短縮し、メモリ使用量を最適化し、リコールとスピードのバランスをとった、アプリケーション固有のユースケースを実現するためのベクトルインデックスの微調整を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 인덱스 유형 선택 및 양자화와 같은 기술을 사용하여 검색 대기 시간을 줄이고 메모리 사용량을 최적화하고 회수 및 속도의 균형을 맞춘 애플리케이션별 사용 사례를 달성하기 위해 벡터 인덱스를 미세 조정 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ajustar con precisión los índices de vectores para reducir la latencia de búsqueda, optimizar el uso de memoria y equilibrar la recuperación y la velocidad, aprovechando técnicas como la selección del tipo de índice y la cuantificación para lograr capacidades de búsqueda de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de peaufiner les index de vecteurs pour réduire la latence de recherche, optimiser l''utilisation de la mémoire et équilibrer la rappel et la vitesse, en exploitant des techniques telles que la sélection du type d''index et la quantification pour atteindre des capacités de recherche de haute performance.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Vektorindizes fein abzustimmen, um die Suchlatenz zu reduzieren, den Speicherbedarf zu optimieren und die Trefferquote und Geschwindigkeit auszugleichen, indem Techniken wie die Auswahl des Indextyps und die Quantisierung genutzt werden, um Hochleistungs-Suchfunktionen zu erreichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ajustar os índices de vetor para reduzir a latência de pesquisa, uso de memória otimizado e equilíbrio de recall versus velocidade, utilizando técnicas como seleção de tipo de índice e quantização para alcançar capacidades de pesquisa de alto desempenho.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать индексы векторов для снижения задержки поиска, оптимизации использования памяти и балансировки между recall и скоростью, используя методы, такие как выбор типа индекса и квантование, для достижения высокопроизводительных возможностей поиска.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من ضبط فهارس المتجهات لتقليل تأخير البحث، واستخدام الذاكرة الأمثل، والتوازن بين الاسترجاع والسرعة، باستخدام تقنيات مثل اختيار نوع الفهرس والكمية لتحقيق قدرات بحثعالية الأداء."},"useCases":{"en":["Tuning HNSW parameters for optimal search performance","Implementing quantization for reduced memory footprint","Optimizing vector indexes for large-scale datasets exceeding 1M vectors","Balancing recall and speed for application-specific use cases","Scaling vector search to billions of vectors while maintaining performance"],"zh":["为实现最佳搜索性能而调整HNSW参数","为减少内存占用而实现量化","为大规模数据集（超过1M个向量）优化向量索引","为应用程序特定用例平衡回忆和速度","将向量搜索扩展到数十亿个向量同时保持性能"],"ja":["検索性能を最適化するためにHNSWパラメータを調整する","メモリフットプリントを削減するために量化を実装する","大規模データセット（1Mを超えるベクトル）向けにベクトルインデックスを最適化する","アプリケーション固有のユースケースにリコールとスピードのバランスをとる","ベクトル検索を数十億のベクトルに拡大し、同時にパフォーマンスを維持する"],"ko":["최적의 검색 성능을 달성하기 위한 HNSW 매개 변수 조정","메모리 사용량을 줄이기 위한 양자화 구현","1M 이상의 벡터를超える 대규모 데이터 세트를 위한 벡터 인덱스 최적화","애플리케이션별 사용 사례에 대한 회수 및 속도의 균형","성능을 유지하면서 수십억개의 벡터로 벡터 검색 확장"],"es":["Ajustar parámetros HNSW para un rendimiento de búsqueda óptimo","Implementar la cuantificación para reducir la huella de memoria","Optimizar los índices de vectores para conjuntos de datos de gran escala que superan los 1M de vectores","Equilibrar la recuperación y la velocidad para casos de uso específicos de la aplicación","Escalabilidad de la búsqueda de vectores a miles de millones de vectores manteniendo el rendimiento"],"fr":["Ajuster les paramètres HNSW pour des performances de recherche optimales","Mettre en œuvre la quantification pour réduire l''empreinte mémoire","Optimiser les index de vecteurs pour des jeux de données de grande échelle dépassant 1M de vecteurs","Équilibrer la rappel et la vitesse pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques à l''application","Mettre à l''échelle la recherche de vecteurs à des milliards de vecteurs tout en maintenant les performances"],"de":["HNSW-Parameter für optimale Suchleistung anpassen","Quantisierung implementieren, um den Speicherbedarf zu reduzieren","Vektorindizes für große Datenmengen mit über 1M Vektoren optimieren","Trefferquote und Geschwindigkeit für anwendungsspezifische Use-Cases ausgleichen","Vektorsuche auf Milliarden von Vektoren skalieren und dabei die Leistung beibehalten"],"pt":["Ajuste de parâmetros HNSW para desempenho de pesquisa ótimo","Implementação de quantização para reduzir a pegada de memória","Otimização de índices de vetor para conjuntos de dados de grande escala que excedem 1M de vetores","Equilíbrio de recall e velocidade para casos de uso específicos de aplicativos","Escala de pesquisa de vetor para bilhões de vetores, mantendo o desempenho"],"ru":["Настройка параметров HNSW для оптимальной производительности поиска","Реализация квантования для уменьшения размера памяти","Оптимизация индексов векторов для больших наборов данных, превышающих 1М векторов","Балансировка между recall и скоростью для конкретных случаев использования приложений","Масштабирование поиска векторов до миллиардов векторов, сохраняя при этом производительность"],"ar":["ضبط معلمات HNSW لأداء بحث مثالي","تنفيذ الكمية لتقليل بصمة الذاكرة","تحسين فهارس المتجهات لمجموعات بيانات كبيرة النطاق تتجاوز 1M متجه","توازن الاسترجاع والسرعة لحالات استخدام تطبيقات محددة","تمكين البحث عن المتجهات بمليارات المتجهات مع الحفاظ على الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of vector index types, including Flat and HNSW","Optimized for datasets with specific size ranges (< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M vectors)","May require additional computational resources for large-scale datasets"],"zh":["需要了解向量索引类型，包括平面和HNSW","针对特定大小范围的数据集进行优化（< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M向量）","可能需要额外的计算资源来处理大规模数据集"],"ja":["ベクトルインデックスタイプ（フラット、HNSWなど）を理解する必要がある","特定のサイズ範囲（< 10K、10K - 1M、1M - 100Mベクトル）のデータセットに最適化されている","大規模データセットでは追加のコンピューティングリソースが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["벡터 인덱스 유형（평면 및 HNSW)을 이해해야 함","특정 크기 범위(< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M 벡터)의 데이터 세트에 최적화됨","대규모 데이터 세트의 경우 추가 컴퓨팅 리소스가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los tipos de índice de vector, incluyendo Flat y HNSW","Optimizado para conjuntos de datos con rangos de tamaño específicos (< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M vectores)","Puede requerir recursos computacionales adicionales para conjuntos de datos de gran escala"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des types d''index de vecteur, y compris Flat et HNSW","Optimisé pour des jeux de données avec des plages de taille spécifiques (< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M vecteurs)","Peut nécessiter des ressources de calcul supplémentaires pour les jeux de données de grande échelle"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Vektorindextypen, einschließlich Flat und HNSW","Optimiert für Datenmengen mit spezifischen Größenbereichen (< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M Vektoren)","Kann für große Datenmengen zusätzliche Rechenressourcen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de tipos de índice de vetor, incluindo Flat e HNSW","Otimizado para conjuntos de dados com intervalos de tamanho específicos (< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M vetores)","Pode requerer recursos computacionais adicionais para conjuntos de dados de grande escala"],"ru":["Требует понимания типов индекса вектора, включая Flat и HNSW","Оптимизирован для наборов данных с определенными диапазонами размеров (< 10K, 10K - 1M, 1M - 100M векторов)","Может потребовать дополнительных вычислительных ресурсов для больших наборов данных"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لأنواع فهارس المتجهات، بما في ذلك Flat و HNSW","محسّن لمجموعات البيانات ذات مدى الحجم المحدد (< 10K، 10K - 1M، 1M - 100M متجه)","يمكن أن يتطلب موارد حاسوبية إضافية لمجموعات البيانات الكبيرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/game-changing-features', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'game-changing-features', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z', '2026-02-18T13:52:17.969Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/game-changing-features","name":"game-changing-features","description":{"es":"Las características innovadoras son clave para aumentar el valor del producto y hacer que los usuarios lo necesiten. Descubre cómo implementarlas","fr":"Les fonctionnalités révolutionnaires sont essentielles pour augmenter la valeur du produit et le rendre indispensable aux utilisateurs. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre","de":"Wertsteigernde Produktfunktionen sind entscheidend, um den Wert des Produkts zu steigern und die Benutzer von ihm abhängig zu machen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie implementieren","pt":"Recursos de mudança de jogo aumentam o valor do produto em 10 vezes. Estratégias de desenvolvimento de produtos inovadoras para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Функции, меняющие игру, увеличивают ценность продукта в 10 раз. Инновационные стратегии разработки продуктов для разработчиков.","ar":"ميزات تغيير اللعبة تزيد من قيمة المنتج 10 مرات. استراتيجيات تطوير المنتجات المبتكرة للمطورين.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Características innovadoras para multiplicar el valor del...","fr":"Fonctionnalités révolutionnaires pour multiplier la valeu...","de":"Wertsteigernde Produktfunktionen für ein 10x-Erlebnis","pt":"Recursos de Mudança de Jogo para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Игровые Изменения для Разработчиков","ar":"ميزات تغيير اللعبة للمطورين","en":"game-changing-features"},"description":{"es":"Las características innovadoras son clave para aumentar el valor del producto y hacer que los usuarios lo necesiten. Descubre cómo implementarlas","fr":"Les fonctionnalités révolutionnaires sont essentielles pour augmenter la valeur du produit et le rendre indispensable aux utilisateurs. Découvrez comment les...","de":"Wertsteigernde Produktfunktionen sind entscheidend, um den Wert des Produkts zu steigern und die Benutzer von ihm abhängig zu machen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie s...","pt":"Recursos de mudança de jogo aumentam o valor do produto em 10 vezes. Estratégias de desenvolvimento de produtos inovadoras para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Функции, меняющие игру, увеличивают ценность продукта в 10 раз. Инновационные стратегии разработки продуктов для разработчиков.","ar":"ميزات تغيير اللعبة تزيد من قيمة المنتج 10 مرات. استراتيجيات تطوير المنتجات المبتكرة للمطورين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Análisis de valor del producto","Identificación de características innovadoras","Desarrollo de estrategias de implementación","Análisis de resultados y ajustes","Integración con la visión del producto","Enfoque en la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Analyse de la valeur du produit","Identification de fonctionnalités révolutionnaires","Développement de stratégies de mise en œuvre","Analyse des résultats et ajustements","Intégration avec la vision du produit","Focalisation sur l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Wertanalyse des Produkts","Identifizierung wertsteigernder Funktionen","Entwicklung von Implementierungsstrategien","Analyse der Ergebnisse und Anpassungen","Integration mit der Produktvision","Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Aumento do valor do produto em 10 vezes","Estratégias de desenvolvimento de produtos inovadoras","Análise de necessidades do usuário","Desenvolvimento de funcionalidades chave","Otimização do produto para uso intensivo"],"ru":["Увеличение ценности продукта в 10 раз","Инновационные стратегии разработки продуктов","Анализ потребностей пользователя","Разработка ключевых функций","Оптимизация продукта для интенсивного использования"],"ar":["زيادة قيمة المنتج 10 مرات","استراتيجيات تطوير المنتجات المبتكرة","تحليل احتياجات المستخدم","تطوير الوظائف الرئيسية","تحسين المنتج للاستخدام المكثف"]},"keywords":{"es":["características innovadoras","valor del producto","estrategia de producto","desarrollo de producto","experiencia del usuario","análisis de valor","innovación en productos","crecimiento del producto","optimización del producto"],"fr":["fonctionnalités révolutionnaires","valeur du produit","stratégie de produit","développement de produit","expérience utilisateur","analyse de valeur","innovation dans les produits","croissance du produit","optimisation du produit"],"de":["wertsteigernde Funktionen","Wert des Produkts","Produktstrategie","Produktentwicklung","Benutzererfahrung","Wertanalyse","Innovation im Produkt","Produktwachstum","Produktoptimierung"],"pt":["recursos de mudança de jogo","desenvolvimento de produtos","estratégias inovadoras","aumento do valor do produto","análise de necessidades do usuário","desenvolvimento de funcionalidades chave"],"ru":["функции, меняющие игру","разработка продуктов","инновационные стратегии","увеличение ценности продукта","анализ потребностей пользователя","разработка ключевых функций"],"ar":["ميزات تغيير اللعبة","تطوير المنتجات","استراتيجيات مبتكرة","زيادة قيمة المنتج","تحليل احتياجات المستخدم","تطوير الوظائف الرئيسية"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-changing-features","description":"Find 10x product opportunities and high-leverage improvements. Use when user wants strategic product thinking, mentions 10x, wants to find high-impact features, or says what would make this 10x better, product strategy, or what should we build next.","bodyPreview":"# 10x Mode\n\nYou are a product strategist with founder mentality. We''re not here to add features—we''re here to find the moves that 10x the product''s value. Think like you own this. What would make users unable to live without it?\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md`\n> **No Code**: This is pure strategy. Implementation comes later.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nMost product work is incremental: fix bugs, add requested features, polish edges. That''s","body":"# 10x Mode\n\nYou are a product strategist with founder mentality. We''re not here to add features—we''re here to find the moves that 10x the product''s value. Think like you own this. What would make users unable to live without it?\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md`\n> **No Code**: This is pure strategy. Implementation comes later.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nMost product work is incremental: fix bugs, add requested features, polish edges. That''s necessary but not sufficient.\n\nThis mode forces a different question: **What would make this 10x more valuable?**\n\nNot 10% better. Not \"nice to have.\" Game-changing. The kind of thing that makes users say \"how did I live without this?\"\n\n---\n\n## Session Setup\n\nUser provides:\n- **Product/Area**: What we''re thinking about\n- **Current state** (optional): Brief description of what exists\n- **Constraints** (optional): Technical limits, timeline, team size\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Understand Current Value\n\nBefore proposing additions, understand what value exists:\n\n1. **What problem does this solve today?**\n2. **Who uses it and why?**\n3. **What''s the core action users take?**\n4. **Where do users spend most time?**\n5. **What do users complain about / request most?**\n\nResearch the codebase, look at existing features, understand the shape of the product.\n\n### Step 2: Find the 10x Opportunities\n\nThink across three scales:\n\n#### Massive (High effort, transformative)\nFeatures that fundamentally expand what the product can do. New markets, new use cases, new capabilities that weren''t possible before.\n\nAsk:\n- What adjacent problem could we solve that would make this indispensable?\n- What would make this a platform instead of a tool?\n- What would make users bring their team/friends/family?\n- What''s the feature that would make competitors nervous?\n\n#### Medium (Moderate effort, high leverage)\nFeatures that significantly enhance the core experience. Force multipliers on what already works.\n\nAsk:\n- What would make the core action 10x faster/easier?\n- What data do we have that we''re not using?\n- What workflow is painful that we could automate?\n- What would turn casual users into power users?\n\n#### Small (Low effort, disproportionate value)\nTiny changes that punch way above their weight. Often overlooked because they seem \"too simple.\"\n\nAsk:\n- What single button/shortcut would save users minutes daily?\n- What information is users hunting for that we could surface?\n- What anxiety do users have that we could eliminate with one indicator?\n- What''s the thing users do manually that we could remember/automate?\n\n### Step 3: Evaluate Ruthlessly\n\nFor each idea, assess:\n\n| Criteria | Question |\n|----------|----------|\n| **Impact** | How much more valuable does this make the product? |\n| **Reach** | What % of users would this affect? |\n| **Frequency** | How often would users encounter this value? |\n| **Differentiation** | Does this set us apart or just match competitors? |\n| **Defensibility** | Is this easy to copy or does it compound over time? |\n| **Feasibility** | Can we actually build this? |\n\nUse a simple scoring:\n- 🔥 **Must do** — High impact, clearly worth it\n- 👍 **Strong** — Good impact, should prioritize\n- 🤔 **Maybe** — Interesting but needs more thought\n- ❌ **Pass** — Not worth it right now\n\n### Step 4: Identify the Highest-Leverage Moves\n\nLook for:\n\n**Quick wins with outsized impact**\n- Small effort, big value\n- Often overlooked because they''re \"obvious\"\n- Can ship fast, validate fast\n\n**Strategic bets**\n- Larger effort, potentially transformative\n- Opens new possibilities\n- Worth the investment if it works\n\n**Compounding features**\n- Get more valuable over time\n- Network effects, data effects, habit formation\n- Build moats\n\n### Step 5: Prioritize\n\nDon''t just list ideas—stack rank them:\n\n```\n## Recommended Priority\n\n### Do Now (Quick wins)\n1. [Feature] — Why: [reason], Impact: [what changes]\n\n### Do Next (High leverage)\n1. [Feature] — Why: [reason], Unlocks: [what becomes possible]\n\n### Explore (Strategic bets)\n1. [Feature] — Why: [reason], Risk: [what could go wrong], Upside: [what we gain]\n\n### Backlog (Good but not now)\n1. [Feature] — Why later: [reason]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Idea Categories to Explore\n\nForce yourself through each category:\n\n| Category | Question | Example |\n|----------|----------|---------|\n| **Speed** | What takes too long? | Instant search, predictive loading |\n| **Automation** | What''s repetitive? | Auto-scheduling, smart defaults |\n| **Intelligence** | What could be smarter? | Recommendations, anomaly detection |\n| **Integration** | What else do users use? | Calendar sync, export options |\n| **Collaboration** | How do users work together? | Sharing, comments, real-time |\n| **Personalization** | How is everyone different? | Custom views, preferences |\n| **Visibility** | What''s hidden that shouldn''t be? | Dashboards, progress tracking |\n| **Confidence** | What creates anxiety? | Confirmations, undo, previews |\n| **Delight** | What could spark joy? | Animations, celebrations, polish |\n| **Access** | Who can''t use this yet? | Mobile, offline, accessibility |\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# 10x Analysis: <Product/Area>\nSession N | Date: YYYY-MM-DD\n\n## Current Value\nWhat the product does today and for whom.\n\n## The Question\nWhat would make this 10x more valuable?\n\n---\n\n## Massive Opportunities\n\n### 1. [Feature Name]\n**What**: Description\n**Why 10x**: Why this is transformative\n**Unlocks**: What becomes possible\n**Effort**: High/Very High\n**Risk**: What could go wrong\n**Score**: 🔥/👍/🤔/❌\n\n### 2. ...\n\n---\n\n## Medium Opportunities\n\n### 1. [Feature Name]\n**What**: Description\n**Why 10x**: Why this matters more than it seems\n**Impact**: What changes for users\n**Effort**: Medium\n**Score**: 🔥/👍/🤔/❌\n\n### 2. ...\n\n---\n\n## Small Gems\n\n### 1. [Feature Name]\n**What**: Description (one line)\n**Why powerful**: Why this punches above its weight\n**Effort**: Low\n**Score**: 🔥/👍/🤔/❌\n\n### 2. ...\n\n---\n\n## Recommended Priority\n\n### Do Now\n1. ...\n\n### Do Next\n1. ...\n\n### Explore\n1. ...\n\n---\n\n## Questions\n\n### Answered\n- **Q**: ... **A**: ...\n\n### Blockers\n- **Q**: ... (need user input)\n\n## Next Steps\n- [ ] Validate assumption: ...\n- [ ] Research: ...\n- [ ] Decide: ...\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **THINK BIG FIRST**—don''t self-censor with \"that''s too hard.\" Capture the idea, evaluate later.\n- **SMALL CAN BE HUGE**—don''t dismiss simple ideas. Sometimes one button changes everything.\n- **USER VALUE, NOT FEATURE COUNT**—10 features that add 1% each ≠ 1 feature that adds 10x.\n- **BE SPECIFIC**—\"better UX\" is not an idea. \"One-click rescheduling from notification\" is.\n- **QUESTION ASSUMPTIONS**—\"users want X\" may be wrong. What do they actually need?\n- **COMPOUND THINKING**—prefer features that get better over time.\n- **NO SAFE IDEAS**—if every idea is \"obviously good,\" you''re not thinking hard enough.\n- **CITE EVIDENCE**—if you saw something in the codebase or research, reference it.\n\n---\n\n## Prompts to Unstick Thinking\n\nIf stuck, ask yourself:\n\n- \"What would make a user tell their friend about this?\"\n- \"What''s the thing users do every day that''s slightly annoying?\"\n- \"What would we build if we had 10x the engineering team? 1/10th?\"\n- \"What would a competitor need to build to beat us?\"\n- \"What do power users do manually that we could make native?\"\n- \"What''s the insight we have from data that users don''t see?\"\n- \"What would make this addictive (in a good way)?\"\n- \"What''s the feature that sounds crazy but might work?\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:52:17.969Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Product Strategy Agents needing to generate breakthrough product concepts rather than incremental improvements.","zh":"非常适合需要生成突破性产品概念而非渐进式改进的产品策略代理。","ja":"漸進的な改善ではなく、画期的な製品コンセプトを生成する必要がある製品戦略エージェントに最適です。","ko":"점진적인 개선이 아닌 돌파구적인 제품 개념을 생성해야 하는 제품 전략 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de estrategia de producto que necesitan generar conceptos de producto innovadores en lugar de mejoras incrementales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de stratégie de produit ayant besoin de générer des concepts de produit révolutionnaires plutôt que des améliorations incrémentielles.","de":"Perfekt für Produktstrategieagenten, die bahnbrechende Produktkonzepte generieren müssen, anstatt inkrementelle Verbesserungen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Estratégia de Produto que precisam gerar conceitos de produto inovadores em vez de melhorias incrementais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по стратегии продукта, которым необходимо генерировать прорывные концепции продукта, а не инкрементальные улучшения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استراتيجية المنتج الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مفاهيم منتج كاسرة بدلاً من التحسينات التكميلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to adopt founder mentality and generate pure strategic output focused exclusively on 10x value propositions. Directs all output to structured documentation at `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` without chat distractions.","zh":"使代理能够采用创始人思维模式，生成专注于10倍价值主张的纯粹战略输出。将所有输出直接记录到结构化文档`.claude/docs/ai/<产品-或-领域>/10x/session-N.md`中，避免聊天干扰。","ja":"エージェントが創業者マインドセットを採用し、10倍の価値提案に特化した純粋な戦略的アウトプットを生成できるようにします。チャットの気晴らしを排除し、すべての出力を構造化されたドキュメント`.claude/docs/ai/<製品-または-領域>/10x/session-N.md`に直接記録します。","ko":"에이전트가 창업자 mentality를 채택하고 10배 가치 제안에 집중하는 순수 전략적 출력을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 채팅 방해 없이 모든 출력을 구조화된 문서 `.claude/docs/ai/<제품-또는-영역>/10x/session-N.md`로 직접 기록합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes adoptar la mentalidad de fundador y generar una salida estratégica pura centrada exclusivamente en propuestas de valor 10x. Dirige toda la salida a la documentación estructurada en `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` sin distracciones de chat.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''adopter une mentalité de fondateur et de générer une sortie stratégique pure axée exclusivement sur les propositions de valeur 10x. Dirige toute la sortie vers la documentation structurée à `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` sans distractions de chat.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Gründer-Mentalität zu übernehmen und reine strategische Ausgaben zu generieren, die ausschließlich auf 10x-Wertvorschläge fokussiert sind. Leitet alle Ausgaben an die strukturierte Dokumentation in `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` weiter, ohne Chat-Ablenkungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes adotem a mentalidade de fundador e gerem saída estratégica pura focada exclusivamente em proposições de valor 10x. Direciona toda a saída para documentação estruturada em `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` sem distrações de bate-papo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам принять менталитет основателя и генерировать чистый стратегический вывод, ориентированный исключительно на предложения ценности 10х. Направляет весь вывод в структурированную документацию по адресу `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` без отвлечений чата.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تبني عقلية المؤسس وتوليد مخرجات إستراتيجية نقية تركز حصرياً على مقترحات قيمة 10x. يوجه كل المخرجات إلى توثيق منظم في `.claude/docs/ai/<product-or-area>/10x/session-N.md` بدون إلهاءات الدردشة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating disruptive product strategies","Creating 10x value propositions","Developing founder-level strategic documentation","Producing non-incremental feature concepts"],"zh":["生成颠覆性产品策略","创建10倍价值主张","制定创始人级别的战略文档","产生非渐进式的功能概念"],"ja":["破壊的な製品戦略の生成","10倍の価値提案の作成","創業者レベルの戦略文書の開発","非漸進的な機能コンセプトの生産"],"ko":["파괴적인 제품 전략 생성","10배 가치 제안 생성","창업자 수준의 전략 문서 개발","비점진적 기능 개념 생성"],"es":["Generación de estrategias de producto disruptivas","Creación de propuestas de valor 10x","Desarrollo de documentación estratégica de nivel de fundador","Producción de conceptos de características no incrementales"],"fr":["Génération de stratégies de produit disruptives","Création de propositions de valeur 10x","Développement de documentation stratégique de niveau de fondateur","Production de concepts de fonctionnalités non incrémentielles"],"de":["Generierung disruptiver Produktstrategien","Erstellung von 10x-Wertvorschlägen","Entwicklung von strategischer Dokumentation auf Gründer-Ebene","Produktion von nicht inkrementalen Feature-Konzepten"],"pt":["Geração de estratégias de produto disruptivas","Criação de proposições de valor 10x","Desenvolvimento de documentação estratégica de nível de fundador","Produção de conceitos de recursos não incrementais"],"ru":["Генерация дискриптивных стратегий продукта","Создание предложений ценности 10х","Разработка стратегической документации уровня основателя","Производство неинкрементальных концепций функций"],"ar":["توليد استراتيجيات منتج كاسرة","إنشاء مقترحات قيمة 10x","تطوير توثيق إستراتيجي على مستوى المؤسس","إنتاج مفاهيم ميزات غير تكميلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["No code implementation capabilities","Output restricted to markdown files only","Pure strategy mode only - no execution","Requires filesystem access for documentation"],"zh":["无代码实现能力","输出仅限于markdown文件","仅为纯策略模式 - 无执行功能","需要文件系统访问权限以进行文档记录"],"ja":["コード実装機能なし","出力はマークダウンファイルのみに制限","純粋な戦略モードのみ - 実行機能なし","ドキュメント作成にファイルシステムアクセスが必要"],"ko":["코드 구현 기능 없음","출력은 markdown 파일로만 제한됨","순수 전략 모드만 - 실행 기능 없음","문서화를 위한 파일 시스템 접근 필요"],"es":["No tiene capacidad de implementación de código","La salida está restringida a archivos markdown solo","Modo de estrategia pura solo - sin ejecución","Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para la documentación"],"fr":["N''a pas de capacité d''implémentation de code","La sortie