 format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["自动分析用户请求","路由至最合适的专家代理","支持多种IDE和CLI","简化开发流程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["ユーザーのリクエストを自動分析","最も適切なスペシャリストエージェントにルーティング","さまざまなIDEとCLIをサポート","開発プロセスを簡素化","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["사용자 요청을 자동 분석","가장 적합한 전문가 에이전트로 라우팅","다양한 IDE와 CLI를 지원","개발 프로세스를 간소화","개발 효율을 향상"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot y Cursor","Soporte para CLIs como Kiro y OpenCode","Análisis automático de solicitudes de usuario","Selección automática de especialistas adecuados"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot et Cursor","Prise en charge des CLIs comme Kiro et OpenCode","Analyse automatique des demandes d''utilisateur","Sélection automatique des spécialistes appropriés"],"de":["Konvertierung von Agent-, Skill- und Workflow-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot und Cursor","Unterstützung für CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Automatische Analyse von Benutzersuchen","Automatische Auswahl geeigneter Spezialisten"],"pt":["Análise automática de solicitações","Encaminhamento para especialistas","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Conversão de configurações de Agent, Skill e Workfows","Automatização do processo de análise e encaminhamento"],"ru":["Автоматический анализ запросов","Направление к специалистам","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Конвертация конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workfows","Автоматизация процесса анализа и направления"],"ar":["تحليل تلقائي للطلبات","توجيه الطلبات إلى الأخصائيين","توافق مع بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر","تحويل تكوينات الوكلاء والمهارات والتدفقات العمل","تحقيق آلي لعملية التحليل والتوجيه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能路由","自动分析","专家代理","IDE","CLI","开发流程","开发效率"],"ja":["インテリジェントルーティング","自動分析","スペシャリストエージェント","IDE","CLI","開発プロセス","開発効率"],"ko":["지능형 라우팅","자동 분석","전문가 에이전트","IDE","CLI","개발 프로세스","개발 효율"],"es":["enrutamiento inteligente","desarrollo de software","integración de herramientas","automatización de procesos","análisis de solicitudes de usuario","selección de especialistas"],"fr":["routeur intelligent","développement de logiciels","intégration d''outils","automatisation de processus","analyse de demandes d''utilisateur","sélection de spécialistes"],"de":["intelligentes Routing","Software-Entwicklung","Integration von Tools","Automatisierung von Prozessen","Analyse von Benutzersuchen","Auswahl von Spezialisten"],"pt":["roteamento inteligente de agentes","conversão de configurações","análise automática de solicitações","encaminhamento para especialistas","compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","automatização do processo de análise e encaminhamento"],"ru":["интеллектуальный маршрутизатор агентов","конвертация конфигураций","автоматический анализ запросов","направление к специалистам","совместимость с IDE и CLI","автоматизация процесса анализа и направления"],"ar":["التوجيه الذكي للوكلاء","تحويل التكوينات","تحليل تلقائي للطلبات","توجيه الطلبات إلى الأخصائيين","توافق مع بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر","تحقيق آلي لعملية التحليل والتوجيه"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"intelligent-routing","description":"Automatic agent selection and intelligent task routing. Analyzes user requests and automatically selects the best specialist agent(s) without requiring explicit user mentions.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Intelligent Agent Routing\n\n**Purpose**: Automatically analyze user requests and route them to the most appropriate specialist agent(s) without requiring explicit user mentions.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> **The AI should act as an intelligent Project Manager**, analyzing each request and automatically selecting the best specialist(s) for the job.\n\n## How It Works\n\n### 1. Request Analysis\n\nBefore responding to ANY user request, perform automatic analysis:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[User Request: Add","body":"# Intelligent Agent Routing\n\n**Purpose**: Automatically analyze user requests and route them to the most appropriate specialist agent(s) without requiring explicit user mentions.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> **The AI should act as an intelligent Project Manager**, analyzing each request and automatically selecting the best specialist(s) for the job.\n\n## How It Works\n\n### 1. Request Analysis\n\nBefore responding to ANY user request, perform automatic analysis:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[User Request: Add login] --> B[ANALYZE]\n    B --> C[Keywords]\n    B --> D[Domains]\n    B --> E[Complexity]\n    C --> F[SELECT AGENT]\n    D --> F\n    E --> F\n    F --> G[security-auditor + backend-specialist]\n    G --> H[AUTO-INVOKE with context]\n```\n\n### 2. Agent Selection Matrix\n\n**Use this matrix to automatically select agents:**\n\n| User Intent         | Keywords                                   | Selected Agent(s)                           | Auto-invoke? |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| **Authentication**  | \"login\", \"auth\", \"signup\", \"password\"      | `security-auditor` + `backend-specialist`   | ✅ YES       |\n| **UI Component**    | \"button\", \"card\", \"layout\", \"style\"        | `frontend-specialist`                       | ✅ YES       |\n| **Mobile UI**       | \"screen\", \"navigation\", \"touch\", \"gesture\" | `mobile-developer`                          | ✅ YES       |\n| **API Endpoint**    | \"endpoint\", \"route\", \"API\", \"POST\", \"GET\"  | `backend-specialist`                        | ✅ YES       |\n| **Database**        | \"schema\", \"migration\", \"query\", \"table\"    | `database-architect` + `backend-specialist` | ✅ YES       |\n| **Bug Fix**         | \"error\", \"bug\", \"not working\", \"broken\"    | `debugger`                                  | ✅ YES       |\n| **Test**            | \"test\", \"coverage\", \"unit\", \"e2e\"          | `test-engineer`                             | ✅ YES       |\n| **Deployment**      | \"deploy\", \"production\", \"CI/CD\", \"docker\"  | `devops-engineer`                           | ✅ YES       |\n| **Security Review** | \"security\", \"vulnerability\", \"exploit\"     | `security-auditor` + `penetration-tester`   | ✅ YES       |\n| **Performance**     | \"slow\", \"optimize\", \"performance\", \"speed\" | `performance-optimizer`                     | ✅ YES       |\n| **Product Def**     | \"requirements\", \"user story\", \"backlog\", \"MVP\" | `product-owner`                             | ✅ YES       |\n| **New Feature**     | \"build\", \"create\", \"implement\", \"new app\"  | `orchestrator` → multi-agent                | ⚠️ ASK FIRST |\n| **Complex Task**    | Multiple domains detected                  | `orchestrator` → multi-agent                | ⚠️ ASK FIRST |\n\n### 3. Automatic Routing Protocol\n\n## TIER 0 - Automatic Analysis (ALWAYS ACTIVE)\n\nBefore responding to ANY request:\n\n```javascript\n// Pseudo-code for decision tree\nfunction analyzeRequest(userMessage) {\n    // 1. Classify request type\n    const requestType = classifyRequest(userMessage);\n\n    // 2. Detect domains\n    const domains = detectDomains(userMessage);\n\n    // 3. Determine complexity\n    const complexity = assessComplexity(domains);\n\n    // 4. Select agent(s)\n    if (complexity === \"SIMPLE\" && domains.length === 1) {\n        return selectSingleAgent(domains[0]);\n    } else if (complexity === \"MODERATE\" && domains.length <= 2) {\n        return selectMultipleAgents(domains);\n    } else {\n        return \"orchestrator\"; // Complex task\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 4. Response Format\n\n**When auto-selecting an agent, inform the user concisely:**\n\n```markdown\n🤖 **Applying knowledge of `@security-auditor` + `@backend-specialist`...**\n\n[Proceed with specialized response]\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n- ✅ User sees which expertise is being applied\n- ✅ Transparent decision-making\n- ✅ Still automatic (no /commands needed)\n\n## Domain Detection Rules\n\n### Single-Domain Tasks (Auto-invoke Single Agent)\n\n| Domain          | Patterns                                   | Agent                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| **Security**    | auth, login, jwt, password, hash, token    | `security-auditor`      |\n| **Frontend**    | component, react, vue, css, html, tailwind | `frontend-specialist`   |\n| **Backend**     | api, server, express, fastapi, node        | `backend-specialist`    |\n| **Mobile**      | react native, flutter, ios, android, expo  | `mobile-developer`      |\n| **Database**    | prisma, sql, mongodb, schema, migration    | `database-architect`    |\n| **Testing**     | test, jest, vitest, playwright, cypress    | `test-engineer`         |\n| **DevOps**      | docker, kubernetes, ci/cd, pm2, nginx      | `devops-engineer`       |\n| **Debug**       | error, bug, crash, not working, issue      | `debugger`              |\n| **Performance** | slow, lag, optimize, cache, performance    | `performance-optimizer` |\n| **SEO**         | seo, meta, analytics, sitemap, robots      | `seo-specialist`        |\n| **Game**        | unity, godot, phaser, game, multiplayer    | `game-developer`        |\n\n### Multi-Domain Tasks (Auto-invoke Orchestrator)\n\nIf request matches **2+ domains from different categories**, automatically use `orchestrator`:\n\n```text\nExample: \"Create a secure login system with dark mode UI\"\n→ Detected: Security + Frontend\n→ Auto-invoke: orchestrator\n→ Orchestrator will handle: security-auditor, frontend-specialist, test-engineer\n```\n\n## Complexity Assessment\n\n### SIMPLE (Direct agent invocation)\n\n- Single file edit\n- Clear, specific task\n- One domain only\n- Example: \"Fix the login button style\"\n\n**Action**: Auto-invoke respective agent\n\n### MODERATE (2-3 agents)\n\n- 2-3 files affected\n- Clear requirements\n- 2 domains max\n- Example: \"Add API endpoint for user profile\"\n\n**Action**: Auto-invoke relevant agents sequentially\n\n### COMPLEX (Orchestrator required)\n\n- Multiple files/domains\n- Architectural decisions needed\n- Unclear requirements\n- Example: \"Build a social media app\"\n\n**Action**: Auto-invoke `orchestrator` → will ask Socratic questions\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n### Rule 1: Silent Analysis\n\n#### DO NOT announce \"I''m analyzing your request...\"\n\n- ✅ Analyze silently\n- ✅ Inform which agent is being applied\n- ❌ Avoid verbose meta-commentary\n\n### Rule 2: Inform Agent Selection\n\n**DO inform which expertise is being applied:**\n\n```markdown\n🤖 **Applying knowledge of `@frontend-specialist`...**\n\nI will create the component with the following characteristics:\n[Continue with specialized response]\n```\n\n### Rule 3: Seamless Experience\n\n**The user should not notice a difference from talking to the right specialist directly.**\n\n### Rule 4: Override Capability\n\n**User can still explicitly mention agents:**\n\n```text\nUser: \"Use @backend-specialist to review this\"\n→ Override auto-selection\n→ Use explicitly mentioned agent\n```\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n### Case 1: Generic Question\n\n```text\nUser: \"How does React work?\"\n→ Type: QUESTION\n→ No agent needed\n→ Respond directly with explanation\n```\n\n### Case 2: Extremely Vague Request\n\n```text\nUser: \"Make it better\"\n→ Complexity: UNCLEAR\n→ Action: Ask clarifying questions first\n→ Then route to appropriate agent\n```\n\n### Case 3: Contradictory Patterns\n\n```text\nUser: \"Add mobile support to the web app\"\n→ Conflict: mobile vs web\n→ Action: Ask: \"Do you want responsive web or native mobile app?\"\n→ Then route accordingly\n```\n\n## Integration with Existing Workflows\n\n### With /orchestrate Command\n\n- **User types `/orchestrate`**: Explicit orchestration mode\n- **AI detects complex task**: Auto-invoke orchestrator (same result)\n\n**Difference**: User doesn''t need to know the command exists.\n\n### With Socratic Gate\n\n- **Auto-routing does NOT bypass Socratic Gate**\n- If task is unclear, still ask questions first\n- Then route to appropriate agent\n\n### With GEMINI.md Rules\n\n- **Priority**: GEMINI.md rules > intelligent-routing\n- If GEMINI.md specifies explicit routing, follow it\n- Intelligent routing is the DEFAULT when no explicit rule exists\n\n## Testing the System\n\n### Test Cases\n\n#### Test 1: Simple Frontend Task\n\n```text\nUser: \"Create a dark mode toggle button\"\nExpected: Auto-invoke frontend-specialist\nVerify: Response shows \"Using @frontend-specialist\"\n```\n\n#### Test 2: Security Task\n\n```text\nUser: \"Review the authentication flow for vulnerabilities\"\nExpected: Auto-invoke security-auditor\nVerify: Security-focused analysis\n```\n\n#### Test 3: Complex Multi-Domain\n\n```text\nUser: \"Build a chat application with real-time notifications\"\nExpected: Auto-invoke orchestrator\nVerify: Multiple agents coordinated (backend, frontend, test)\n```\n\n#### Test 4: Bug Fix\n\n```text\nUser: \"Login is not working, getting 401 error\"\nExpected: Auto-invoke debugger\nVerify: Systematic debugging approach\n```\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n### Token Usage\n\n- Analysis adds ~50-100 tokens per request\n- Tradeoff: Better accuracy vs slight overhead\n- Overall SAVES tokens by reducing back-and-forth\n\n### Response Time\n\n- Analysis is instant (pattern matching)\n- No additional API calls required\n- Agent selection happens before first response\n\n## User Education\n\n### Optional: First-Time Explanation\n\nIf this is the first interaction in a project:\n\n```markdown\n💡 **Tip**: I am configured with automatic specialist agent selection.\nI will always choose the most suitable specialist for your task. You can\nstill mention agents explicitly with `@agent-name` if you prefer.\n```\n\n## Debugging Agent Selection\n\n### Enable Debug Mode (for development)\n\nAdd to GEMINI.md temporarily:\n\n```markdown\n## DEBUG: Intelligent Routing\n\nShow selection reasoning:\n\n- Detected domains: [list]\n- Selected agent: [name]\n- Reasoning: [why]\n```\n\n## Summary\n\n**intelligent-routing skill enables:**\n\n✅ Zero-command operation (no need for `/orchestrate`)  \n✅ Automatic specialist selection based on request analysis  \n✅ Transparent communication of which expertise is being applied  \n✅ Seamless integration with existing workflows  \n✅ Override capability for explicit agent mentions  \n✅ Fallback to orchestrator for complex tasks\n\n**Result**: User gets specialist-level responses without needing to know the system architecture.\n\n---\n\n**Next Steps**: Integrate this skill into GEMINI.md TIER 0 rules.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:52:16.206Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for IDE Integration Agents that need to translate Antigravity configurations into universal AI development tools.","zh":"非常适合需要将反重力配置转换为通用AI开发工具的IDE集成代理。","ja":"反重力構成を汎用AI開発ツールに変換する必要があるIDE統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"반중력 구성이 일반적인 AI 개발 도구로 변환되어야 하는 IDE 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de integración de IDE que necesitan traducir configuraciones de Antigravity a herramientas de desarrollo de IA universales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration de l''IDE qui doivent traduire les configurations Antigravity en outils de développement d''IA universels.","de":"Perfekt für IDE-Integration-Agenten, die Antigravity-Konfigurationen in universelle KI-Entwicklungstools übersetzen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração de IDE que precisam traduzir configurações de Antigravidade para ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA universais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции IDE, которым необходимо переводить конфигурации Antigravity в универсальные инструменты разработки ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تضمين بيئة التطوير المتكاملة الذي يحتاج إلى ترجمة إعدادات مناهج مضادة للجاذبية إلى أدوات تطوير ذكاء اصطناعي عالمية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automatic analysis of user requests to route them to the most appropriate specialist agents without explicit mentions, functioning as an intelligent project manager for AI agent ecosystems. Converts specialized Antigravity IDE configurations to formats compatible with GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro CLI, and OpenCode environments.","zh":"实现对用户请求的自动分析，以将其路由到最合适的专家代理，而无需显式提及，功能是AI代理生态系统的智能项目经理。将专门的反重力IDE配置转换为兼容GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiro CLI和OpenCode环境的格式。","ja":"明示的な言及なしで、ユーザー要求を最も適切な専門家エージェントにルーティングするための自動分析を実現し、AIエージェントエコシステムのインテリジェントなプロジェクトマネージャーとして機能します。専用の反重力IDE構成を、GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiro CLI、およびOpenCode環境と互換性のある形式に変換します。","ko":"명시적인 언급 없이 사용자 요청을 가장 적합한 전문가 에이전트로 자동 분석하여 라우팅하고, AI 에이전트 생태계의 지능형 프로젝트 관리자로 작동합니다.専門の反重力 IDE 구성을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro CLI 및 OpenCode 환경과 호환되는 형식으로 변환합니다.","es":"Permite el análisis automático de las solicitudes de los usuarios para enrutarlos a los agentes especialistas más adecuados sin menciones explícitas, funcionando como un gestor de proyectos inteligente para ecosistemas de agentes de IA. Convierte configuraciones de IDE Antigravity especializadas a formatos compatibles con entornos de GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro CLI y OpenCode.","fr":"Permet l''analyse automatique des demandes des utilisateurs pour les acheminer vers les agents spécialistes les plus appropriés sans mentions explicites, fonctionnant comme un gestionnaire de projet intelligent pour les écosystèmes d''agents d''IA. Convertit les configurations d''IDE Antigravity spécialisées en formats compatibles avec les environnements GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro CLI et OpenCode.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatische Analyse von Benutzeranfragen, um diese an die am besten geeigneten Spezialagenten weiterzuleiten, ohne dass explizite Erwähnungen erforderlich sind, und fungiert als intelligenter Projektmanager für KI-Agenten-Ökosysteme. Wandelt spezialisierte Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in Formate um, die mit GitHub Copilot-, Cursor-, Kiro-CLI- und OpenCode-Umgebungen kompatibel sind.","pt":"Permite a análise automática de solicitações de usuário para encaminhá-las para os agentes especialistas mais apropriados sem menções explícitas, funcionando como um gerente de projeto inteligente para ecossistemas de agentes de IA. Converte configurações de IDE Antigravity especializadas em formatos compatíveis com ambientes GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro CLI e OpenCode.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически анализировать запросы пользователей, чтобы направлять их к наиболее подходящим специалистам-агентам без явных упоминаний, функционируя как интеллектуальный менеджер проекта для экосистем агентов ИИ. Преобразует специализированные конфигурации IDE Antigravity в форматы, совместимые с环境ами GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro CLI и OpenCode.","ar":"يسمح بتحليل تلقائي لطلبات المستخدم لتنفيذها إلى وكلاء متخصصون أكثر ملاءمة دون ذكر صريح ، يعمل كمنفذ مشروع ذكاء اصطناعي لمحيطات وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي. يقوم بتحويل إعدادات IDE Antigravity المتخصصة إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع بيئات GitHub Copilot و Cursor و Kiro CLI و OpenCode."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Antigravity workflows to Cursor-compatible formats","Translating Skill configurations for GitHub Copilot integration","Migrating Agent setups to Kiro CLI environments","Automating routing decisions between specialist AI agents"],"zh":["将反重力工作流转换为Cursor兼容格式","将技能配置翻译为GitHub Copilot集成","将代理设置迁移到Kiro CLI环境","自动化专家AI代理之间的路由决策"],"ja":["反重力ワークフローをCursorと互換性のある形式に変換する","スキル構成をGitHub Copilot統合用に翻訳する","エージェントの設定をKiro CLI環境に移行する","専門家AIエージェント間のルーティング決定を自動化する"],"ko":["반중력 워크플로우를 Cursor와 호환되는 형식으로 변환","스킬 구성을 GitHub Copilot 통합을 위해 번역","에이전트 설정을 Kiro CLI 환경으로 마이그레이션","전문가 AI 에이전트 간 라우팅 결정을 자동화"],"es":["Conversión de flujos de trabajo de Antigravity a formatos compatibles con Cursor","Traducción de configuraciones de habilidades para la integración con GitHub Copilot","Migración de configuraciones de agentes a entornos de Kiro CLI","Automatización de decisiones de enrutamiento entre agentes de IA especializados"],"fr":["Conversion de flux de travail Antigravity en formats compatibles avec Cursor","Traduction de configurations de compétences pour l''intégration avec GitHub Copilot","Migration de configurations d''agents vers des environnements Kiro CLI","Automatisation des décisions d''acheminement entre agents d''IA spécialisés"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-Workflows in Cursor-kompatible Formate","Übersetzung von Skill-Konfigurationen für die Integration mit GitHub Copilot","Migration von Agenten-Setup zu Kiro-CLI-Umgebungen","Automatisierung von Routing-Entscheidungen zwischen spezialisierten KI-Agents"],"pt":["Conversão de fluxos de trabalho Antigravity em formatos compatíveis com Cursor","Tradução de configurações de Habilidades para integração com GitHub Copilot","Migração de configurações de Agentes para ambientes Kiro CLI","Automatização de decisões de encaminhamento entre agentes de IA especializados"],"ru":["Преобразование рабочих процессов Antigravity в форматы, совместимые с Cursor","Перевод конфигураций навыков для интеграции с GitHub Copilot","Миграция настроек агентов в среды Kiro CLI","Автоматизация решений о маршрутизации между специалистами-агентами ИИ"],"ar":["تحويل سير عمل مناهج مضادة للجاذبية إلى صيغ متوافقة مع Cursor","ترجمة إعدادات المهارات لتكامل GitHub Copilot","هجرة إعدادات الوكلاء إلى بيئات Kiro CLI","تحسين اتخاذ القرارات لتحويل بين وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متخصصين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Antigravity IDE configuration inputs","Dependent on target IDE/CLI compatibility specifications","Needs request analysis capabilities for intelligent routing"],"zh":["需要反重力IDE配置输入","依赖于目标IDE/CLI兼容性规范","需要请求分析能力以实现智能路由"],"ja":["反重力IDE構成入力を必要とします","対象のIDE/CLIの互換性仕様に依存します","インテリジェントなルーティングを実現するために、要求分析機能が必要です"],"ko":["반중력 IDE 구성 입력이 필요합니다","대상 IDE/CLI의 호환성 사양에 의존합니다","지능형 라우팅을 구현하기 위해 요청 분석 기능이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere entradas de configuración de IDE de Antigravity","Dependiente de las especificaciones de compatibilidad de destino de IDE/CLI","Necesita capacidades de análisis de solicitudes para el enrutamiento inteligente"],"fr":["Nécessite des entrées de configuration d''IDE Antigravity","Dépend des spécifications de compatibilité cible de l''IDE/CLI","A besoin de capacités d''analyse de demandes pour l''acheminement intelligent"],"de":["Benötigt Eingaben von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Abhängig von den Kompatibilitäts-Spezifikationen des Ziel-IDE/CLI","Benötigt Anfrageanalysefunktionen für intelligente Routing"],"pt":["Exige entradas de configuração de IDE Antigravity","Depende de especificações de compatibilidade de IDE/CLI de destino","Necessita de capacidades de análise de solicitações para roteamento inteligente"],"ru":["Требует входных конфигураций IDE Antigravity","Зависит от спецификаций совместимости целевого IDE/CLI","Требует возможностей анализа запросов для интеллектуального маршрутизации"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخالات إعدادات IDE Antigravity","يعتمد على مواصفات التوافق لبيئة التطوير المتكاملة / سطر الأوامر الهدف","يحتاج إلى قدرات تحليل الطلبات للتحويل الذكي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
