t essentiel pour créer des collections et des marketplaces de NFT","de":"Das Beherrschen der NFT-Standards ERC-721 und ERC-1155 ist für die Erstellung von NFT-Sammlungen und -Marktplätzen von entscheidender Bedeutung","pt":"Entenda os padrões NFT ERC-721 e ERC-1155, incluindo metadados e recursos avançados.","ru":"Поймите стандарты NFT ERC-721 и ERC-1155, включая метаданные и продвинутые функции.","ar":"افهم معايير NFT ERC-721 و ERC-1155، بما في ذلك البيانات الوصفية والميزات المتقدمة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["ERC-721 和 ERC-1155 标准","元数据最佳实践","高级 NFT 功能","创建和管理 NFT 集合","实现市场功能","创建灵魂绑定令牌"],"ja":["ERC-721 と ERC-1155 標準","メタデータのベストプラクティス","高度な NFT 機能","NFT コレクションの作成と管理","マーケット機能の実装","ソウルバウンドトークンの作成"],"ko":["ERC-721 및 ERC-1155 표준","메타데이터 최적화","고급 NFT 기능","NFT 컬렉션 생성 및 관리","마켓 기능 구현","소울바운드 토큰 생성"],"es":["Implementación de ERC-721 y ERC-1155","Creación de colecciones de NFT","Desarrollo de marketplaces de NFT","Gestión de metadatos en cadena y fuera de cadena","Creación de tokens con alma (no transferibles)","Implementación de regalías y reparto de ingresos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de ERC-721 et ERC-1155","Création de collections de NFT","Développement de marketplaces de NFT","Gestion de métadonnées en chaîne et hors chaîne","Création de jetons à âme (non transférables)","Mise en œuvre de redevances et de partage de revenus"],"de":["Implementierung von ERC-721 und ERC-1155","Erstellung von NFT-Sammlungen","Entwicklung von NFT-Marktplätzen","Verwaltung von Metadaten in der Kette und außerhalb der Kette","Erstellung von Seelentoken (nicht übertragbar)","Implementierung von Lizenzgebühren und Umsatzbeteiligung"],"pt":["Criação de coleções NFT","Implementação de funcionalidades de marketplace","Criação de metadados on-chain e off-chain","Criação de tokens soulbound","Implementação de royalties e compartilhamento de receita","Desenvolvimento de NFTs dinâmicos"],"ru":["Создание коллекций NFT","Реализация функциональности marketplace","Создание метаданных on-chain и off-chain","Создание токенов soulbound","Реализация роялти и разделения доходов","Разработка динамических NFT"],"ar":["إنشاء مجموعات NFT","تنفيذ وظائف سوق","إنشاء بيانات وصفية على السلسلة وخارج السلسلة","إنشاء رموز غير قابلة للتحويل","تنفيذ العوائد وتقاسم الإيرادات","تطوير NFTs ديناميكي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NFT 标准","ERC-721","ERC-1155","非同质化代币","元数据","NFT 市场","灵魂绑定令牌"],"ja":["NFT 標準","ERC-721","ERC-1155","非同質化トークン","メタデータ","NFT マーケット","ソウルバウンドトークン"],"ko":["NFT 표준","ERC-721","ERC-1155","비동형 토큰","메타데이터","NFT 마켓","소울바운드 토큰"],"es":["estándares NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","desarrollo de blockchain","colecciones de NFT","marketplaces de NFT","metadatos","tokens con alma","regalías"],"fr":["normes NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","développement de blockchain","collections de NFT","marketplaces de NFT","métadonnées","jetons à âme","redevances"],"de":["NFT-Standards","ERC-721","ERC-1155","Blockchain-Entwicklung","NFT-Sammlungen","NFT-Marktplätze","Metadaten","Seelentoken","Lizenzgebühren"],"pt":["NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","metadados NFT","mercado de NFT","tokens não fungíveis","desenvolvimento de NFT","padrões NFT","criação de NFT"],"ru":["NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","метаданные NFT","рынок NFT","нефунгируемые токены","разработка NFT","стандарты NFT","создание NFT"],"ar":["NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","بيانات وصفية NFT","سوق NFT","رموز غير قابلة للتبادل","تطوير NFT","معايير NFT","إنشاء NFT"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nft-standards","description":"Implement NFT standards (ERC-721, ERC-1155) with proper metadata handling, minting strategies, and marketplace integration. Use when creating NFT contracts, building NFT marketplaces, or implementing digital asset systems.","bodyPreview":"# NFT Standards\n\nMaster ERC-721 and ERC-1155 NFT standards, metadata best practices, and advanced NFT features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating NFT collections (art, gaming, collectibles)\n- Implementing marketplace functionality\n- Building on-chain or off-chain metadata\n- Creating soulbound tokens (non-transferable)\n- Implementing royalties and revenue sharing\n- Developing dynamic/evolving NFTs\n\n## ERC-721 (Non-Fungible Token Standard)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma s","body":"# NFT Standards\n\nMaster ERC-721 and ERC-1155 NFT standards, metadata best practices, and advanced NFT features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating NFT collections (art, gaming, collectibles)\n- Implementing marketplace functionality\n- Building on-chain or off-chain metadata\n- Creating soulbound tokens (non-transferable)\n- Implementing royalties and revenue sharing\n- Developing dynamic/evolving NFTs\n\n## ERC-721 (Non-Fungible Token Standard)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/extensions/ERC721URIStorage.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/extensions/ERC721Enumerable.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/access/Ownable.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Counters.sol\";\n\ncontract MyNFT is ERC721URIStorage, ERC721Enumerable, Ownable {\n    using Counters for Counters.Counter;\n    Counters.Counter private _tokenIds;\n\n    uint256 public constant MAX_SUPPLY = 10000;\n    uint256 public constant MINT_PRICE = 0.08 ether;\n    uint256 public constant MAX_PER_MINT = 20;\n\n    constructor() ERC721(\"MyNFT\", \"MNFT\") {}\n\n    function mint(uint256 quantity) external payable {\n        require(quantity > 0 && quantity <= MAX_PER_MINT, \"Invalid quantity\");\n        require(_tokenIds.current() + quantity <= MAX_SUPPLY, \"Exceeds max supply\");\n        require(msg.value >= MINT_PRICE * quantity, \"Insufficient payment\");\n\n        for (uint256 i = 0; i < quantity; i++) {\n            _tokenIds.increment();\n            uint256 newTokenId = _tokenIds.current();\n            _safeMint(msg.sender, newTokenId);\n            _setTokenURI(newTokenId, generateTokenURI(newTokenId));\n        }\n    }\n\n    function generateTokenURI(uint256 tokenId) internal pure returns (string memory) {\n        // Return IPFS URI or on-chain metadata\n        return string(abi.encodePacked(\"ipfs://QmHash/\", Strings.toString(tokenId), \".json\"));\n    }\n\n    // Required overrides\n    function _beforeTokenTransfer(\n        address from,\n        address to,\n        uint256 tokenId,\n        uint256 batchSize\n    ) internal override(ERC721, ERC721Enumerable) {\n        super._beforeTokenTransfer(from, to, tokenId, batchSize);\n    }\n\n    function _burn(uint256 tokenId) internal override(ERC721, ERC721URIStorage) {\n        super._burn(tokenId);\n    }\n\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId) public view override(ERC721, ERC721URIStorage) returns (string memory) {\n        return super.tokenURI(tokenId);\n    }\n\n    function supportsInterface(bytes4 interfaceId)\n        public\n        view\n        override(ERC721, ERC721Enumerable)\n        returns (bool)\n    {\n        return super.supportsInterface(interfaceId);\n    }\n\n    function withdraw() external onlyOwner {\n        payable(owner()).transfer(address(this).balance);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## ERC-1155 (Multi-Token Standard)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC1155/ERC1155.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/access/Ownable.sol\";\n\ncontract GameItems is ERC1155, Ownable {\n    uint256 public constant SWORD = 1;\n    uint256 public constant SHIELD = 2;\n    uint256 public constant POTION = 3;\n\n    mapping(uint256 => uint256) public tokenSupply;\n    mapping(uint256 => uint256) public maxSupply;\n\n    constructor() ERC1155(\"ipfs://QmBaseHash/{id}.json\") {\n        maxSupply[SWORD] = 1000;\n        maxSupply[SHIELD] = 500;\n        maxSupply[POTION] = 10000;\n    }\n\n    function mint(\n        address to,\n        uint256 id,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external onlyOwner {\n        require(tokenSupply[id] + amount <= maxSupply[id], \"Exceeds max supply\");\n\n        _mint(to, id, amount, \"\");\n        tokenSupply[id] += amount;\n    }\n\n    function mintBatch(\n        address to,\n        uint256[] memory ids,\n        uint256[] memory amounts\n    ) external onlyOwner {\n        for (uint256 i = 0; i < ids.length; i++) {\n            require(tokenSupply[ids[i]] + amounts[i] <= maxSupply[ids[i]], \"Exceeds max supply\");\n            tokenSupply[ids[i]] += amounts[i];\n        }\n\n        _mintBatch(to, ids, amounts, \"\");\n    }\n\n    function burn(\n        address from,\n        uint256 id,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external {\n        require(from == msg.sender || isApprovedForAll(from, msg.sender), \"Not authorized\");\n        _burn(from, id, amount);\n        tokenSupply[id] -= amount;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Metadata Standards\n\n### Off-Chain Metadata (IPFS)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"NFT #1\",\n  \"description\": \"Description of the NFT\",\n  \"image\": \"ipfs://QmImageHash\",\n  \"attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"trait_type\": \"Background\",\n      \"value\": \"Blue\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trait_type\": \"Rarity\",\n      \"value\": \"Legendary\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trait_type\": \"Power\",\n      \"value\": 95,\n      \"display_type\": \"number\",\n      \"max_value\": 100\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### On-Chain Metadata\n\n```solidity\ncontract OnChainNFT is ERC721 {\n    struct Traits {\n        uint8 background;\n        uint8 body;\n        uint8 head;\n        uint8 rarity;\n    }\n\n    mapping(uint256 => Traits) public tokenTraits;\n\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId) public view override returns (string memory) {\n        Traits memory traits = tokenTraits[tokenId];\n\n        string memory json = Base64.encode(\n            bytes(\n                string(\n                    abi.encodePacked(\n                        ''{\"name\": \"NFT #'', Strings.toString(tokenId), ''\",'',\n                        ''\"description\": \"On-chain NFT\",'',\n                        ''\"image\": \"data:image/svg+xml;base64,'', generateSVG(traits), ''\",'',\n                        ''\"attributes\": ['',\n                        ''{\"trait_type\": \"Background\", \"value\": \"'', Strings.toString(traits.background), ''\"},'',\n                        ''{\"trait_type\": \"Rarity\", \"value\": \"'', getRarityName(traits.rarity), ''\"}'',\n                        '']}''\n                    )\n                )\n            )\n        );\n\n        return string(abi.encodePacked(\"data:application/json;base64,\", json));\n    }\n\n    function generateSVG(Traits memory traits) internal pure returns (string memory) {\n        // Generate SVG based on traits\n        return \"...\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Royalties (EIP-2981)\n\n```solidity\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/IERC2981.sol\";\n\ncontract NFTWithRoyalties is ERC721, IERC2981 {\n    address public royaltyRecipient;\n    uint96 public royaltyFee = 500; // 5%\n\n    constructor() ERC721(\"Royalty NFT\", \"RNFT\") {\n        royaltyRecipient = msg.sender;\n    }\n\n    function royaltyInfo(uint256 tokenId, uint256 salePrice)\n        external\n        view\n        override\n        returns (address receiver, uint256 royaltyAmount)\n    {\n        return (royaltyRecipient, (salePrice * royaltyFee) / 10000);\n    }\n\n    function setRoyalty(address recipient, uint96 fee) external onlyOwner {\n        require(fee <= 1000, \"Royalty fee too high\"); // Max 10%\n        royaltyRecipient = recipient;\n        royaltyFee = fee;\n    }\n\n    function supportsInterface(bytes4 interfaceId)\n        public\n        view\n        override(ERC721, IERC165)\n        returns (bool)\n    {\n        return interfaceId == type(IERC2981).interfaceId ||\n               super.supportsInterface(interfaceId);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Soulbound Tokens (Non-Transferable)\n\n```solidity\ncontract SoulboundToken is ERC721 {\n    constructor() ERC721(\"Soulbound\", \"SBT\") {}\n\n    function _beforeTokenTransfer(\n        address from,\n        address to,\n        uint256 tokenId,\n        uint256 batchSize\n    ) internal virtual override {\n        require(from == address(0) || to == address(0), \"Token is soulbound\");\n        super._beforeTokenTransfer(from, to, tokenId, batchSize);\n    }\n\n    function mint(address to) external {\n        uint256 tokenId = totalSupply() + 1;\n        _safeMint(to, tokenId);\n    }\n\n    // Burn is allowed (user can destroy their SBT)\n    function burn(uint256 tokenId) external {\n        require(ownerOf(tokenId) == msg.sender, \"Not token owner\");\n        _burn(tokenId);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Dynamic NFTs\n\n```solidity\ncontract DynamicNFT is ERC721 {\n    struct TokenState {\n        uint256 level;\n        uint256 experience;\n        uint256 lastUpdated;\n    }\n\n    mapping(uint256 => TokenState) public tokenStates;\n\n    function gainExperience(uint256 tokenId, uint256 exp) external {\n        require(ownerOf(tokenId) == msg.sender, \"Not token owner\");\n\n        TokenState storage state = tokenStates[tokenId];\n        state.experience += exp;\n\n        // Level up logic\n        if (state.experience >= state.level * 100) {\n            state.level++;\n        }\n\n        state.lastUpdated = block.timestamp;\n    }\n\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId) public view override returns (string memory) {\n        TokenState memory state = tokenStates[tokenId];\n\n        // Generate metadata based on current state\n        return generateMetadata(tokenId, state);\n    }\n\n    function generateMetadata(uint256 tokenId, TokenState memory state)\n        internal\n        pure\n        returns (string memory)\n    {\n        // Dynamic metadata generation\n        return \"\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Gas-Optimized Minting (ERC721A)\n\n```solidity\nimport \"erc721a/contracts/ERC721A.sol\";\n\ncontract OptimizedNFT is ERC721A {\n    uint256 public constant MAX_SUPPLY = 10000;\n    uint256 public constant MINT_PRICE = 0.05 ether;\n\n    constructor() ERC721A(\"Optimized NFT\", \"ONFT\") {}\n\n    function mint(uint256 quantity) external payable {\n        require(_totalMinted() + quantity <= MAX_SUPPLY, \"Exceeds max supply\");\n        require(msg.value >= MINT_PRICE * quantity, \"Insufficient payment\");\n\n        _mint(msg.sender, quantity);\n    }\n\n    function _baseURI() internal pure override returns (string memory) {\n        return \"ipfs://QmBaseHash/\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/erc721.md**: ERC-721 specification details\n- **references/erc1155.md**: ERC-1155 multi-token standard\n- **references/metadata-standards.md**: Metadata best practices\n- **references/enumeration.md**: Token enumeration patterns\n- **assets/erc721-contract.sol**: Production ERC-721 template\n- **assets/erc1155-contract.sol**: Production ERC-1155 template\n- **assets/metadata-schema.json**: Standard metadata format\n- **assets/metadata-uploader.py**: IPFS upload utility\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use OpenZeppelin**: Battle-tested implementations\n2. **Pin Metadata**: Use IPFS with pinning service\n3. **Implement Royalties**: EIP-2981 for marketplace compatibility\n4. **Gas Optimization**: Use ERC721A for batch minting\n5. **Reveal Mechanism**: Placeholder → reveal pattern\n6. **Enumeration**: Support walletOfOwner for marketplaces\n7. **Whitelist**: Merkle trees for efficient whitelisting\n\n## Marketplace Integration\n\n- OpenSea: ERC-721/1155, metadata standards\n- LooksRare: Royalty enforcement\n- Rarible: Protocol fees, lazy minting\n- Blur: Gas-optimized trading\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:53:23.598Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Blockchain Agents specializing in digital asset creation and management, particularly those utilizing ERC-721 and ERC-1155 standards","zh":"非常适合专门从事数字资产创建和管理的区块链代理，特别是那些使用ERC-721和ERC-1155标准的代理","ja":"デジタルアセットの作成と管理を専門とするブロックチェーンエージェント、特にERC-721とERC-1155規格を使用するものに最適","ko":"디지털 자산 생성 및 관리를 전문으로 하는 블록체인 에이전트, 특히 ERC-721 및 ERC-1155 표준을 사용하는 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Blockchain especializados en la creación y gestión de activos digitales, particularmente aquellos que utilizan los estándares ERC-721 y ERC-1155","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de blockchain spécialisés dans la création et la gestion d''actifs numériques, en particulier ceux qui utilisent les normes ERC-721 et ERC-1155","de":"Perfekt für Blockchain-Agenten, die sich auf die Erstellung und Verwaltung digitaler Vermögenswerte spezialisieren, insbesondere solche, die die ERC-721- und ERC-1155-Standards verwenden","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Blockchain especializados em criação e gerenciamento de ativos digitais, particularmente aqueles que utilizam os padrões ERC-721 e ERC-1155","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов блокчейна, специализирующихся на создании и управлении цифровыми активами, в частности тех, кто использует стандарты ERC-721 и ERC-1155","ar":"مثالي لعمilities البلوكشين المتخصصة في إنشاء وإدارة الأصول الرقمية، ولا سيما تلك التي تستخدم معايير ERC-721 و ERC-1155"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master NFT standards, implement metadata best practices, and develop advanced features like soulbound tokens and dynamic NFTs using Solidity, leveraging ERC-721 and ERC-1155 protocols","zh":"赋予代理掌握NFT标准、实施元数据最佳实践、并使用Solidity开发像灵魂绑定令牌和动态NFT这样的高级功能，利用ERC-721和ERC-1155协议","ja":"エージェントにNFT規格をマスターする、メタデータのベストプラクティスを実装する、そしてSolidityを使用してソウルバウンドトークンや動的NFTのような高度な機能を開発する力を与え、ERC-721とERC-1155のプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 NFT 표준을 마스터하고 메타데이터 최선의 관행을 구현하며 Solidity를 사용하여 소울바운드 토큰 및 동적 NFT와 같은 고급 기능을 개발할 수 있도록 해주는 것으로, ERC-721 및 ERC-1155 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes dominar los estándares NFT, implementar las mejores prácticas de metadatos y desarrollar características avanzadas como tokens vinculados al alma y NFT dinámicos utilizando Solidity, aprovechando los protocolos ERC-721 y ERC-1155","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les normes NFT, de mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de métadonnées et de développer des fonctionnalités avancées comme les jetons à âme liée et les NFT dynamiques en utilisant Solidity, en exploitant les protocoles ERC-721 et ERC-1155","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, NFT-Standards zu meistern, Metadaten-Best-Practices umzusetzen und erweiterte Funktionen wie Seelengebundene Token und dynamische NFTs mithilfe von Solidity zu entwickeln, indem sie die ERC-721- und ERC-1155-Protokolle nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar os padrões NFT, implementar as melhores práticas de metadados e desenvolver recursos avançados, como tokens vinculados à alma e NFTs dinâmicos, usando Solidity, aproveitando os protocolos ERC-721 e ERC-1155","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить стандарты NFT, реализовать лучшие практики метаданных и разработать продвинутые функции, такие как токены, привязанные к душе, и динамические NFT, используя Solidity,借助 протоколов ERC-721 и ERC-1155","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إتقان معايير NFT وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لبيانات التعريف وتنمية الميزات المتقدمة مثل رموز الارتباط بالروح والرموز غير القابلة للاستبدال الديناميكية باستخدام Solidity، والاستفادة من بروتوكولات ERC-721 و ERC-1155"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and managing NFT collections for art, gaming, and collectibles","Implementing on-chain and off-chain metadata solutions","Developing and integrating marketplace functionality with royalty and revenue sharing mechanisms"],"zh":["为艺术、游戏和收藏品创建和管理NFT集合","实施链上和链下元数据解决方案","开发和集成具有版税和收入分享机制的市场功能"],"ja":["アート、ゲーム、コレクターズアイテムのNFTコレクションの作成と管理","オンチェーンとオフチェーンのメタデータソリューションの実装","マーケットプレイス機能の開発と統合、ロイヤリティと収益シェアメカニズムを含む"],"ko":["아트, 게임, 수집품을 위한 NFT 컬렉션 생성 및 관리","체인 상 및 체인 하 메타데이터 솔루션 구현","로열티 및 수익 공유 메커니즘을 포함한 마켓플레이스 기능 개발 및 통합"],"es":["Crear y gestionar colecciones de NFT para arte, juegos y objetos de colección","Implementar soluciones de metadatos en cadena y fuera de cadena","Desarrollar e integrar funcionalidad de mercado con mecanismos de participación en regalías y generación de ingresos"],"fr":["Créer et gérer des collections de NFT pour l''art, les jeux et les objets de collection","Mettre en œuvre des solutions de métadonnées en chaîne et hors chaîne","Développer et intégrer une fonctionnalité de marché avec des mécanismes de partage de royalties et de génération de revenus"],"de":["Erstellen und Verwalten von NFT-Sammlungen für Kunst, Spiele und Sammelobjekte","Umsetzen von On-Chain- und Off-Chain-Metadatenlösungen","Entwickeln und Integrieren von Marktfunktionen mit Verfahren für den Verkauf von Lizenzgebühren und Umsatz"],"pt":["Criar e gerenciar coleções de NFT para arte, jogos e itens colecionáveis","Implementar soluções de metadados em cadeia e fora da cadeia","Desenvolver e integrar funcionalidade de marketplace com mecanismos de participação nos royalties e receita"],"ru":["Создание и управление коллекциями NFT для искусства, игр и коллекционных предметов","Реализация решений для метаданных в цепи и вне цепи","Разработка и интеграция функциональности рынка с механизмами разделения роялти и доходов"],"ar":["إنشاء وإدارة مجموعات الرموز غير القابلة للاستبدال للفنون والألعاب والقطع الجميلة","تنفيذ حلول بيانات التعريف في السلسلة وخارج السلسلة","تطوير وتكامل وظيفة السوق مع آليات المشاركة في العوائد والإيرادات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Solidity programming language","Limited to Ethereum-based NFT standards (ERC-721 and ERC-1155)"],"zh":["需要Solidity编程语言的知识","仅限于以太坊基于的NFT标准（ERC-721和ERC-1155）"],"ja":["Solidityプログラミング言語の知識が必要","イーサリアムベースのNFT規格（ERC-721とERC-1155）に限定"],"ko":["Solidity 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식이 필요","이더리움 기반의 NFT 표준(ERC-721 및 ERC-1155)으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Solidity","Limitado a estándares NFT basados en Ethereum (ERC-721 y ERC-1155)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage de programmation Solidity","Limité aux normes NFT basées sur Ethereum (ERC-721 et ERC-1155)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Programmiersprache Solidity","Begrenzt auf Ethereum-basierte NFT-Standards (ERC-721 und ERC-1155)"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da linguagem de programação Solidity","Limitado a padrões NFT baseados em Ethereum (ERC-721 e ERC-1155)"],"ru":["Требует знания языка программирования Solidity","Ограничен стандартами NFT на основе Ethereum (ERC-721 и ERC-1155)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغة البرمجة Solidity","محدود بمعايير الرموز غير القابلة للاستبدال القائمة على Ethereum (ERC-721 و ERC-1155)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
