enção aos detalhes estéticos e criativos","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas web","Implementação de designs responsivos e adaptáveis","Otimização para dispositivos móveis e desktop","Integração com tecnologias de backend"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов frontend","Учет эстетических и творческих деталей","Разработка компонентов и веб-страниц","Реализация адаптивного и отзывчивого дизайна","Оптимизация для мобильных и настольных устройств","Интеграция с backend-технологиями"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات مستخدم أمامية مخصصة","اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية والإبداعية","تنمية المكونات وصفحات الويب","تنفيذ التصاميم المستجيبة والتكيفية","تحسين الأداء لأجهزة الموبايل والesktop","دمج التكنولوجيا الخلفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","AI美学","设计思维","实用代码","美学细节","创意选择","独特界面","前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのインターフェイス","AI美学","設計思考","動作コード","美学的細部","創造的な選択","独自のインターフェイス","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","AI 미학","디자인 사고","작동 코드","미학적 세부 사항","창의적인 선택","독특한 인터페이스","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","aplicaciones móviles","creación de componentes","diseño de páginas","estética de la inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","applications mobiles","création de composants","conception de pages","esthétique de l''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Mobile-Anwendungen","Komponenten-Erstellung","Seitendesign","Ästhetik der künstlichen Intelligenz"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces de usuário","design responsivo","otimização para dispositivos móveis","tecnologias de backend","desenvolvimento web","frontend personalizado","criação de interfaces","desenvolvimento de componentes"],"ru":["разработка frontend","пользовательские интерфейсы","адаптивный дизайн","оптимизация для мобильных устройств","технологии backend","веб-разработка","индивидуальный frontend","создание интерфейсов","разработка компонентов"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات المستخدم المخصصة","تصميم مستجيب","تحسين الأداء لأجهزة الموبايل","تكنولوجيا الخلفية","تنمية الويب","واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","إنشاء واجهات","تنمية المكونات"]}},"owner":"DevLitchi","repo":"chavi","repoPath":"DevLitchi/chavi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:54:28.061Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interface creation with exceptional aesthetic details","zh":"适合需要生产级前端界面创建的UI焦点代理，具有出色的美学细节","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントが、プロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成するのに最適で、優れた美的細節を持っている","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성이 필요한 UI 중심 에이전트에게 적합하며, 예외적인 미적 세부 사항을 가지고 있다","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan la creación de interfaces de frontend de grado de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant la création d''interfaces frontend de grade de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels","de":"Perfekt für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten, die eine erstklassige Erstellung von Frontend-Oberflächen mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details benötigen","pt":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interface creation with exceptional aesthetic details","ru":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interface creation with exceptional aesthetic details","ar":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interface creation with exceptional aesthetic details"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with bold aesthetic directions, implementing interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to bring creative visions to life","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的、真正可用的代码的能力，拥有大胆的美学方向，实现避免通用''AI乱码''美学的接口，利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript将创造性愿景变为现实","ja":"エージェントが独自の、実際に動作するコードを作成する能力を与え、ボールドな美的方向を実現し、汎用的な''AIスロップ''美学を避けたインターフェイスを実装し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して創造的なビジョンを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 대담한 미적 방향을 갖춘 고유한 실제 작동 코드를 작성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 일반적인 ''AI乱码'' 미학을避けた 인터페이스를 구현하고, HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 창의적인 비전을 실현한다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear código real y funcional con direcciones estéticas audaces, implementando interfaces que evitan la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA'', utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para dar vida a visiones creativas","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code réel et fonctionnel avec des directions esthétiques audacieuses, en implementant des interfaces qui évitent l''esthétique générique de ''bazar d''IA'', en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour donner vie à des visions créatives","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eigenständigen, funktionierenden Code mit kühnen ästhetischen Richtungen zu erstellen, indem sie Schnittstellen implementieren, die eine generische ''KI-Schlamperei''-Ästhetik vermeiden, und HTML, CSS und JavaScript verwenden, um kreative Visionen zum Leben zu erwecken","pt":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with bold aesthetic directions, implementing interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to bring creative visions to life","ru":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with bold aesthetic directions, implementing interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to bring creative visions to life","ar":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with bold aesthetic directions, implementing interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to bring creative visions to life"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating visually appealing page layouts"],"zh":["设计响应式网页应用","构建自定义UI组件","创建视觉上吸引人的页面布局"],"ja":["レスポンシブWebアプリケーションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの構築","視覚的に魅力的なページレイアウトの作成"],"ko":["반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","사용자 지정 UI 구성 요소 빌드","시각적으로 매력적인 페이지 레이아웃 생성"],"es":["Diseño de aplicaciones web responsivas","Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados","Creación de diseños de página visualmente atractivos"],"fr":["Conception d''applications web responsives","Création de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Création de mises en page de page visuellement attrayantes"],"de":["Entwurf responsiver Webanwendungen","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Erstellung visuell ansprechender Seitendesigns"],"pt":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating visually appealing page layouts"],"ru":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating visually appealing page layouts"],"ar":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating visually appealing page layouts"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires detailed frontend requirements","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要详细的前端要求","可能需要额外的技术约束以实现最佳实现"],"ja":["詳細なフロントエンド要件が必要","最適な実装には追加の技術的制約が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["상세한 프론트엔드 요구 사항이 필요","최적의 구현을 위해 추가 기술 제약이 필요할 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend detallados","Puede necesitar restricciones técnicas adicionales para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend détaillées","Peut nécessiter des contraintes techniques supplémentaires pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Benötigt detaillierte Anforderungen an die Benutzeroberfläche","Kann zusätzliche technische Einschränkungen für eine optimale Implementierung benötigen"],"pt":["Requires detailed frontend requirements","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"ru":["Requires detailed frontend requirements","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"ar":["Requires detailed frontend requirements","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
