dungen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas e inovadoras","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas","Implementação de aplicações e interfaces","Consideração de contextos e restrições técnicas"],"ru":["Создание уникальных интерфейсов frontend","Внимание к деталям и эстетике","Творческие и инновационные решения","Разработка компонентов и страниц","Реализация приложений и интерфейсов","Учет контекста и технических ограничений"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","الاهتمام بال细يات الجمالية","الخيارات الإبداعية والمبتكرة","تطوير المكونات والصفحات","تنفيذ التطبيقات والواجهات","الاعتبار السياق والقيود الفنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","独特设计","美学细节","创意选择","技术约束","前端开发","界面设计","用户体验"],"ja":["フロントエンド設計","生産性の高いインターフェース","ユニークな設計","美学的な詳細","創造的な選択","技術的な制約","フロントエンド開発","インターフェース設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","생산급 인터페이스","특별한 디자인","미적 세부 사항","창의적인 선택","기술적 제약","프론트엔드 개발","인터페이스 디자인","사용자 경험"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo de aplicaciones","creación de componentes","estética de frontend","diseño de página","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de frontend","frameworks de frontend"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement d''applications","création de composants","esthétique de frontend","conception de page","développement de logiciels","technologies de frontend","frameworks de frontend"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Komponenten-Erstellung","Frontend-Ästhetik","Seiten-Design","Software-Entwicklung","Frontend-Technologien","Frontend-Frameworks"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces personalizadas","estéticas frontend","design thinking","desenvolvimento de aplicações","tecnologias frontend","componentes reutilizáveis","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["разработка frontend","уникальные интерфейсы","эстетика frontend","дизайн-мышление","разработка приложений","технологии frontend","переиспользуемые компоненты","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم","واجهات مخصصة","جماليات واجهات المستخدم","تفكير التصميم","تطوير التطبيقات","تقنيات واجهات المستخدم","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"erimkun","repo":"erimodasi","repoPath":"erimkun/erimodasi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:54:55.204Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing production-grade frontend interface design capabilities with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端界面设计能力并注重美观细节的视觉AI代理。","ja":"ビジュアルAIエージェントが生産レベルのフロントエンドインターフェイス設計能力と美的細部への注意を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 디자인 능력과 미적 세부사항에 주의를 요하는 비주얼 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial visuales que necesitan capacidades de diseño de interfaz de usuario de grado de producción con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle visuels nécessitant des capacités de conception d''interface frontend de grade de production avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle KI-Agents, die produktionsreife Frontend-Schnittstellen-Designfähigkeiten mit Aufmerksamkeit auf ästhetische Details benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que necessitam de capacidades de design de interface de usuário de produção de grade com atenção a detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы возможности проектирования интерфейса пользователя высокого уровня с учетом эстетических деталей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المرئية التي تحتاج إلى قابليات تصميم واجهة المستخدم من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create distinctive, real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, utilizing design thinking and bold aesthetic directions, and implementing interfaces with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有优异美观细节和创意选择的独特、真实可用的代码的能力，利用设计思维和大胆的美学方向，并以HTML、CSS和JavaScript实现接口。","ja":"独自の、実際に動作するコードを作成するエージェントを可能にし、優れた美的細部と創造的な選択肢を実現し、デザイン思考と大胆な美的方向を利用し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptでインターフェイスを実装します。","ko":"대리人が 예외적인 미적 세부사항과 창의적인 선택을 가진 고유한 실제 작동하는 코드를 만들 수 있도록 권장하며, 디자인 사고와 대담한 미적 방향을 사용하고 HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript로 인터페이스를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear código de trabajo real y distintivo con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y opciones creativas, utilizando el pensamiento de diseño y direcciones estéticas atrevidas, e implementando interfaces con HTML, CSS y JavaScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code de travail réel et distinctif avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en utilisant la pensée de conception et les directions esthétiques audacieuses, et en mettant en œuvre des interfaces avec HTML, CSS et JavaScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eindeutigen, echten Arbeitscode mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit auf ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von Design-Denken und kühnen ästhetischen Richtungen, und implementiert Schnittstellen mit HTML, CSS und JavaScript.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar códigos distintos, funcionais e reais, com atenção excepcional a detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas, utilizando o pensamento de design e direções estéticas ousadas, e implementando interfaces com HTML, CSS e JavaScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительные, рабочие коды с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям и творческим выборам, используя принципы дизайн-мышления и смелые эстетические направления, и реализуя интерфейсы с помощью HTML, CSS и JavaScript.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء رموز متميزة ووظيفية وفعّالة، مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية، مستخدمين مبدأ التفكير بالتصميم والإتجاهات الجمالية الجريئة، وتنفيذ الواجهات باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web application interfaces","Building custom UI components with CSS and JavaScript","Creating visually appealing page layouts for various audiences and purposes"],"zh":["为各种网页应用程序设计响应式接口","使用CSS和JavaScript构建自定义UI组件","为不同受众和目的创建视觉上吸引人的页面布局"],"ja":["様々なWebアプリケーションのレスポンシブインターフェイスを設計する","CSSとJavaScriptを使用してカスタムUIコンポーネントを構築する","様々なオーディエンスや目的のための視覚的に魅力的なページレイアウトを作成する"],"ko":["다양한 웹 애플리케이션의 반응형 인터페이스를 디자인하는 것","CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 사용자 지정 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","다양한 대상 및 목적을 위한 시각적으로 매력적인 페이지 레이아웃을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de aplicaciones web responsivas","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con CSS y JavaScript","Crear diseños de página visualmente atractivos para diversas audiencias y propósitos"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces d''applications web responsives","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec CSS et JavaScript","Créer des mises en page de page visuellement attrayantes pour diverses audiences et objectifs"],"de":[" Responsives Webanwendungsoberflächen entwerfen","Benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit CSS und JavaScript erstellen","Visuell ansprechende Seitengestaltungen für verschiedene Zielgruppen und Zwecke erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar interfaces de aplicativos web responsivas","Construir componentes de UI personalizados com CSS e JavaScript","Criar layouts de página visualmente atraentes para várias audiências e propósitos"],"ru":["Проектировать интерфейсы веб-приложений, адаптированные для различных устройств","Создавать настраиваемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью CSS и JavaScript","Создавать визуально привлекательные макеты страниц для различных аудиторий и целей"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات تطبيقات الويب المستجيبة","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة باستخدام CSS و JavaScript","إنشاء تخطيطات صفحة بصرية جذابة لمختلف الجماهير والأغراض"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements and context","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求和上下文","可能需要额外的技术约束以实现最佳实现"],"ja":["ユーザーが提供するフロントエンドの要件とコンテキストが必要","最適な実装には追加の技術的制約が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항 및 컨텍스트가 필요","최적의 구현을 위해 추가 기술 제약이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere requisitos y contexto de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Puede necesitar restricciones técnicas adicionales para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences et un contexte de frontend fournis par l''utilisateur","Peut nécessiter des contraintes techniques supplémentaires pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Benötigt von Benutzern bereitgestellte Anforderungen und Kontext für Frontend","Kann zusätzliche technische Einschränkungen für eine optimale Implementierung benötigen"],"pt":["Exige requisitos e contexto de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Pode precisar de restrições técnicas adicionais para implementação ótima"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем требований и контекста frontend","Может потребовать дополнительных технических ограничений для оптимальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات وسياق واجهة المستخدم المقدمة من قبل المستخدم","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى قيود تقنية إضافية من أجل التنفيذ الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
