细节","避免通用AI美学","支持设计思维"," Commit到大胆的美学方向"],"ja":["独自のプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","実際の動作コードを実現","優れた美学的細部","汎用的なAIエステティックを避ける","設計思想をサポート","大胆な美学方向にコミット"],"ko":["독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","실제 작동 코드를 구현","卓越한 미학적 세부","일반적인 AI 미학을 피함","디자인 사고를 지원","대담한 미학 방향에 커밋"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de frontend personalizadas","Atención al detalle y opciones creativas","Evitación de estéticas genéricas","Implementación de código de trabajo real","Diseño centrado en el usuario"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces de frontend sur mesure","Attention aux détails et choix créatifs","Évitement d''esthétiques génériques","Mise en œuvre de code de travail réel","Conception centrée sur l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Frontend-Schnittstellen","Besondere Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Optionen","Vermeidung von generischer Ästhetik","Implementierung von funktionellem Code","Benutzerzentriertes Design"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端界面","AI美学","设计思维","前端开发","用户界面设计","用户体验设计"],"ja":["フロントエンド設計","プロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイス","AIエステティック","設計思想","フロントエンド開発","ユーザーインターフェイス設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","AI 미학","디자인 사고","프론트엔드 개발","사용자 인터페이스 디자인","사용자 경험 디자인"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","experiencia del usuario","diseño centrado en el usuario","frontend personalizado"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","expérience utilisateur","conception centrée sur l''utilisateur","frontend sur mesure"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Benutzererfahrung","benutzerzentriertes Design","benutzerdefiniertes Frontend"]}},"owner":"Kujikuu","repo":"reality-accelerator","repoPath":"Kujikuu/reality-accelerator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:55:00.722Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing advanced frontend interface creation capabilities with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"非常适合需要高级前端界面创建功能并注重美观细节的UI专注代理。","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントが、高度なフロントエンドインターフェイス作成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성 기능과 미적 세부 사항에 주의를 기울이는 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de interfaces de frontend con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant des capacités de création d''interface frontend avancées avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Perfekt für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Erstellung von Frontend-Schnittstellen mit Blick für ästhetische Details benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de interface de frontend com atenção a detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности создания интерфейса frontend с учетом эстетических деталей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعنيين بالواجهة الرسومية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية مع اهتمام بال细يات الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate production-grade frontend interfaces with exceptional attention to detail, utilizing design thinking principles and implementing real working code with creative choices, all while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics through protocols like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.","zh":"赋予代理生成生产级的前端接口的能力，具有出色的细节注意力，利用设计思维原则，并实现真正的工作代码和创造性的选择，同时避免通过HTML、CSS和JavaScript等协议的通用''AI slop''美学。","ja":"エージェントに、デザイン思考の原則を利用し、実際の動作コードと創造的な選択肢を実現し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptなどのプロトコルを通じて一般的な「AIスロップ」美学を避けることで、細部への注意を払ったプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを生成する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 디자인 사고 원칙을 사용하여 실제 작동 코드와 창의적인 선택을 구현하고, HTML, CSS, JavaScript 등의 프로토콜을 통해 일반적인 ''AI 슬롭'' 미학을 피함으로써 세부 사항에 주의를 기울인 프로덕션 등급의 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar interfaces de frontend de calidad de producción con una atención excepcional al detalle, utilizando principios de diseño y implementando código de trabajo real con elecciones creativas, todo ello evitando estéticas genéricas de ''suciedad de IA'' a través de protocolos como HTML, CSS y JavaScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des interfaces frontend de qualité de production avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails, en utilisant des principes de conception et en mettant en œuvre du code de travail réel avec des choix créatifs, le tout en évitant les esthétiques génériques de ''bavure d''IA'' à travers des protocoles tels que HTML, CSS et JavaScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Frontend-Schnittstellen der Produktionsqualität mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für Details zu generieren, indem Design-Denken-Prinzipien verwendet und funktionierender Code mit kreativen Entscheidungen implementiert werden, all dies unter Vermeidung generischer ''KI-Schund''-Ästhetik durch Protokolle wie HTML, CSS und JavaScript.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem interfaces de frontend de produção de alta qualidade com atenção excepcional ao detalhe, utilizando princípios de design thinking e implementando código de trabalho real com escolhas criativas, tudo isso enquanto evita estéticas genéricas de ''slop de IA'' por meio de protocolos como HTML, CSS e JavaScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерфейсы frontend производственного уровня с исключительным вниманием к деталям, используя принципы дизайн-мышления и реализуя рабочий код с творческими решениями, все это при одновременном избегании общих эстетических решений ''AI-slop'' посредством протоколов như HTML, CSS и JavaScript.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات أمامية من الدرجة الأولى مع اهتمام استثنائي بال细يات، مستخدمين مبادئ التصميم والتفكير وتطبيقا رمز العمل الحقيقي مع خيارات إبداعية، كل ذلك مع تجنب الجماليات العامة لترaki ''slop العقل الاصطناعي'' من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTML و CSS و JavaScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing distinctive web application interfaces","Creating custom frontend components with bold aesthetic directions","Developing responsive and adaptive UI layouts for various audiences and purposes"],"zh":["设计独特的Web应用程序接口","创建具有大胆美学方向的自定义前端组件","为各种受众和目的开发响应式和自适应的UI布局"],"ja":["独自のWebアプリケーションインターフェイスを設計する","大胆な美学的な方向性を持つカスタムフロントエンドコンポーネントを作成する","様々なオーディエンスや目的のためのレスポンシブでアダプティブなUIレイアウトを開発する"],"ko":["독특한 웹 애플리케이션 인터페이스를 설계하는 것","대담한 미적 방향을 가진 사용자 정의 프론트엔드 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","다양한 대상과 목적을 위한 응답성과 적응성을 가진 UI 레이아웃을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de aplicaciones web distintivas","Crear componentes personalizados de frontend con direcciones estéticas atrevidas","Desarrollar diseños de interfaz de usuario receptivos y adaptables para varios públicos y propósitos"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces d''applications web distinctives","Créer des composants personnalisés de frontend avec des directions esthétiques audacieuses","Développer des dispositions d''interface utilisateur réactives e