 "],"ja":["Vercel React Native","React Native","Expo","Reanimated","","React Native "],"ko":["Vercel React Native","React Native","Expo","Reanimated","","React Native "],"es":["React Native","Expo","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","optimización del rendimiento","animaciones","UI patterns"],"fr":["React Native","Expo","meilleures pratiques","développement d''applications","optimisation des performances","animations","modèles d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["React Native","Expo","beste Praktiken","Anwendungsentwicklung","Leistungsoptimierung","Animationen","Benutzeroberflächen-Muster"],"pt":["React Native","Expo","desempenho","animações","UI","otimizações de plataforma","monorepo","imagens","mídia"],"ru":["React Native","Expo","производительность","анимации","UI","платформенные оптимизации","монорепо","изображения","медиа"],"ar":["ري액ت نيتيف","إكسبو","الأداء","الرسوم المتحركة","الواجهة","تحسينات المنصة","مونوريبو","الصور","الوسائط"]}},"owner":"LeeCuongg","repo":"stock-flow-qt-food","repoPath":"LeeCuongg/stock-flow-qt-food","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-native-skills","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with na","body":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with native dependencies\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category         | Impact   | Prefix               |\n| -------- | ---------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 1        | List Performance | CRITICAL | `list-performance-`  |\n| 2        | Animation        | HIGH     | `animation-`         |\n| 3        | Navigation       | HIGH     | `navigation-`        |\n| 4        | UI Patterns      | HIGH     | `ui-`                |\n| 5        | State Management | MEDIUM   | `react-state-`       |\n| 6        | Rendering        | MEDIUM   | `rendering-`         |\n| 7        | Monorepo         | MEDIUM   | `monorepo-`          |\n| 8        | Configuration    | LOW      | `fonts-`, `imports-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. List Performance (CRITICAL)\n\n- `list-performance-virtualize` - Use FlashList for large lists\n- `list-performance-item-memo` - Memoize list item components\n- `list-performance-callbacks` - Stabilize callback references\n- `list-performance-inline-objects` - Avoid inline style objects\n- `list-performance-function-references` - Extract functions outside render\n- `list-performance-images` - Optimize images in lists\n- `list-performance-item-expensive` - Move expensive work outside items\n- `list-performance-item-types` - Use item types for heterogeneous lists\n\n### 2. Animation (HIGH)\n\n- `animation-gpu-properties` - Animate only transform and opacity\n- `animation-derived-value` - Use useDerivedValue for computed animations\n- `animation-gesture-detector-press` - Use Gesture.Tap instead of Pressable\n\n### 3. Navigation (HIGH)\n\n- `navigation-native-navigators` - Use native stack and native tabs over JS navigators\n\n### 4. UI Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `ui-expo-image` - Use expo-image for all images\n- `ui-image-gallery` - Use Galeria for image lightboxes\n- `ui-pressable` - Use Pressable over TouchableOpacity\n- `ui-safe-area-scroll` - Handle safe areas in ScrollViews\n- `ui-scrollview-content-inset` - Use contentInset for headers\n- `ui-menus` - Use native context menus\n- `ui-native-modals` - Use native modals when possible\n- `ui-measure-views` - Use onLayout, not measure()\n- `ui-styling` - Use StyleSheet.create or Nativewind\n\n### 5. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `react-state-minimize` - Minimize state subscriptions\n- `react-state-dispatcher` - Use dispatcher pattern for callbacks\n- `react-state-fallback` - Show fallback on first render\n- `react-compiler-destructure-functions` - Destructure for React Compiler\n- `react-compiler-reanimated-shared-values` - Handle shared values with compiler\n\n### 6. Rendering (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-text-in-text-component` - Wrap text in Text components\n- `rendering-no-falsy-and` - Avoid falsy && for conditional rendering\n\n### 7. Monorepo (MEDIUM)\n\n- `monorepo-native-deps-in-app` - Keep native dependencies in app package\n- `monorepo-single-dependency-versions` - Use single versions across packages\n\n### 8. Configuration (LOW)\n\n- `fonts-config-plugin` - Use config plugins for custom fonts\n- `imports-design-system-folder` - Organize design system imports\n- `js-hoist-intl` - Hoist Intl object creation\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/list-performance-virtualize.md\nrules/animation-gpu-properties.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:54:59.877Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Agents needing comprehensive React Native and Expo application development skills","zh":"非常适合需要全面React Native和Expo应用开发技能的移动代理","ja":"React NativeとExpoアプリケーション開発の包括的なスキルを必要とするモバイルエージェントに最適","ko":"전체적인 React Native와 Expo 애플리케이션 개발 스킬이 필요한 모바일 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Móviles que necesitan habilidades de desarrollo de aplicaciones comprehensivas de React Native y Expo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles ayant besoin de compétences de développement d''applications React Native et Expo complètes","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Agents, die umfassende Fähigkeiten im Bereich React Native- und Expo-Anwendungsentwicklung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis que necessitam de habilidades abrangentes de desenvolvimento de aplicativos React Native e Expo","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов, которым необходимы всесторонние навыки разработки приложений React Native и Expo","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى مهارات شاملة لتطوير تطبيقات React Native و Expo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize list and scroll performance, implement animations with Reanimated, and configure native modules or fonts, leveraging best practices for React Native and Expo applications, including UI patterns and platform-specific optimizations","zh":"赋予代理商优化列表和滚动性能、使用Reanimated实现动画以及配置本地模块或字体的能力，利用React Native和Expo应用程序的最佳实践，包括UI模式和平台特定优化","ja":"リストとスクロールのパフォーマンスを最適化し、Reanimatedを使用してアニメーションを実装し、ネイティブモジュールまたはフォントを構成するためにエージェントをEmpowerし、React NativeとExpoアプリケーションのベストプラクティスを活用し、UIパターンとプラットフォーム固有の最適化を含む","ko":"리스트와 스크롤 성능을 최적화하고, Reanimated를 사용하여 애니메이션을 구현하며, 네이티브 모듈 또는 글꼴을 구성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여, React Native와 Expo 애플리케이션의 최선의 관행을 활용하며, UI 패턴과 플랫폼 특정 최적화를 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el rendimiento de las listas y el desplazamiento, implementar animaciones con Reanimated y configurar módulos o fuentes nativos, aprovechando las mejores prácticas para aplicaciones de React Native y Expo, incluyendo patrones de interfaz de usuario y optimizaciones específic