ru":"i18n-localization: Инструмент для интернационализации","ar":"i18n-localization: أداة للتوحيد العالمي","en":"i18n-localization"},"description":{"zh":"i18n-localization工具是将Antigravity IDE配置转换为兼容IDE和CLI的格式，实现国际化和本地化","ja":"i18nローカライズツールは、Antigravity IDEの設定をIDEとCLIと互換性のある形式に変換し、国際化とローカライズを実現します","ko":"i18n-로컬라이제이션 도구는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 IDE 및 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하여 국제화와 지역화를 구현합니다","es":"Convierta configuraciones de Agent, Skill y Workflows de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con IDEs y CLIs","fr":"Convertissez les configurations de l''Agent, de la Compétence et des Workflows d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec les IDE et les CLIs","de":"Konvertieren Sie Konfigurationen von Agent, Skill und Workflows von Antigravity IDE in Formate, die mit IDEs und CLIs kompatibel sind","pt":"A ferramenta i18n-localization é uma solução para converter configurações de Agent, Skill e Workfows para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs.","ru":"Инструмент i18n-localization является решением для конвертации конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workfows в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI.","ar":"أداة i18n-localization هي حل لتحويل تكوينات Agent و Skill و Workfows إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI.","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持多种IDE和CLI","实现应用程序的国际化和本地化","简化配置转换过程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["複数のIDEとCLIをサポート","応用 프로그램の国際化とローカライズを実現","設定の変換プロセスを簡素化","開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":["다중 IDE 및 CLI 지원","응용 프로그램의 국제화와 지역화를 구현","설정 변환 프로세스 단순화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con IDEs y CLIs","Mejores prácticas de i18n y L10n","Soporte para lenguajes de derecha a izquierda","Configuración de locale y región"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec les IDE et les CLIs","Meilleures pratiques de i18n et L10n","Prise en charge des langues de droite à gauche","Configuration du locale et de la région"],"de":["Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE","Kompatibilität mit IDEs und CLIs","Best Practices für i18n und L10n","Unterstützung für Rechts-nach-Links-Sprachen","Konfiguration von Locale und Region"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações de Agent, Skill e Workfows","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Suporte a internacionalização e localização","Fácil integração com projetos existentes","Melhoria da experiência do usuário em diferentes idiomas e regiões"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workfows","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Поддержка интернационализации и локализации","Легкая интеграция с существующими проектами","Улучшение пользовательского опыта на разных языках и в разных регионах"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات Agent و Skill و Workfows","التوافق مع IDE و CLI","دعم التوحيد العالمي والتحويل اللغوي","تكامل سهل مع المشاريع الحالية","تحسين تجربة المستخدم في اللغات والمناطق المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["i18n","本地化","国际化","应用程序开发","IDE","CLI"],"ja":["i18n","ローカライズ","国際化","応用 프로그램開発","IDE","CLI"],"ko":["i18n","로컬라이제이션","국제화","응용 프로그램 개발","IDE","CLI"],"es":["i18n","L10n","internacionalización","localización","desarrollo de aplicaciones","compatibilidad con IDEs","compatibilidad con CLIs","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["i18n","L10n","internationalisation","localisation","développement d''applications","compatibilité avec les IDE","compatibilité avec les CLIs","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["i18n","L10n","Internationalisierung","Lokalisierung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Kompatibilität mit IDEs","Kompatibilität mit CLIs","Best Practices"],"pt":["i18n-localization","internacionalização","localização","conversão de configurações","IDEs","CLIs","desenvolvimento de software","experiência do usuário","idiomas e regiões"],"ru":["i18n-localization","интернационализация","локализация","конвертация конфигураций","IDE","CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","пользовательский опыт","языки и регионы"],"ar":["i18n-localization","توحيد عالمي","تحويل لغوي","تحويل تكوينات","IDE","CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","تجربة المستخدم","اللغات والمناطق"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"i18n-localization","description":"Internationalization and localization patterns. Detecting hardcoded strings, managing translations, locale files, RTL support.","bodyPreview":"# i18n & Localization\n\n> Internationalization (i18n) and Localization (L10n) best practices.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Core Concepts\n\n| Term | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| **i18n** | Internationalization - making app translatable |\n| **L10n** | Localization - actual translations |\n| **Locale** | Language + Region (en-US, tr-TR) |\n| **RTL** | Right-to-left languages (Arabic, Hebrew) |\n\n---\n\n## 2. When to Use i18n\n\n| Project Type | i18n Needed? |\n|--------------|--------------|\n| Public web app | ✅ Yes |\n| Sa","body":"# i18n & Localization\n\n> Internationalization (i18n) and Localization (L10n) best practices.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Core Concepts\n\n| Term | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| **i18n** | Internationalization - making app translatable |\n| **L10n** | Localization - actual translations |\n| **Locale** | Language + Region (en-US, tr-TR) |\n| **RTL** | Right-to-left languages (Arabic, Hebrew) |\n\n---\n\n## 2. When to Use i18n\n\n| Project Type | i18n Needed? |\n|--------------|--------------|\n| Public web app | ✅ Yes |\n| SaaS product | ✅ Yes |\n| Internal tool | ⚠️ Maybe |\n| Single-region app | ⚠️ Consider future |\n| Personal project | ❌ Optional |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Implementation Patterns\n\n### React (react-i18next)\n\n```tsx\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next'';\n\nfunction Welcome() {\n  const { t } = useTranslation();\n  return <h1>{t(''welcome.title'')}</h1>;\n}\n```\n\n### Next.js (next-intl)\n\n```tsx\nimport { useTranslations } from ''next-intl'';\n\nexport default function Page() {\n  const t = useTranslations(''Home'');\n  return <h1>{t(''title'')}</h1>;\n}\n```\n\n### Python (gettext)\n\n```python\nfrom gettext import gettext as _\n\nprint(_(\"Welcome to our app\"))\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. File Structure\n\n```\nlocales/\n├── en/\n│   ├── common.json\n│   ├── auth.json\n│   └── errors.json\n├── tr/\n│   ├── common.json\n│   ├── auth.json\n│   └── errors.json\n└── ar/          # RTL\n    └── ...\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Best Practices\n\n### DO ✅\n\n- Use translation keys, not raw text\n- Namespace translations by feature\n- Support pluralization\n- Handle date/number formats per locale\n- Plan for RTL from the start\n- Use ICU message format for complex strings\n\n### DON''T ❌\n\n- Hardcode strings in components\n- Concatenate translated strings\n- Assume text length (German is 30% longer)\n- Forget about RTL layout\n- Mix languages in same file\n\n---\n\n## 6. Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Missing translation | Fallback to default language |\n| Hardcoded strings | Use linter/checker script |\n| Date format | Use Intl.DateTimeFormat |\n| Number format | Use Intl.NumberFormat |\n| Pluralization | Use ICU message format |\n\n---\n\n## 7. RTL Support\n\n```css\n/* CSS Logical Properties */\n.container {\n  margin-inline-start: 1rem;  /* Not margin-left */\n  padding-inline-end: 1rem;   /* Not padding-right */\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .icon {\n  transform: scaleX(-1);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. Checklist\n\nBefore shipping:\n\n- [ ] All user-facing strings use translation keys\n- [ ] Locale files exist for all supported languages\n- [ ] Date/number formatting uses Intl API\n- [ ] RTL layout tested (if applicable)\n- [ ] Fallback language configured\n- [ ] No hardcoded strings in components\n\n---\n\n## Script\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/i18n_checker.py` | Detect hardcoded strings & missing translations | `python scripts/i18n_checker.py <project_path>` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:55:22.142Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multilingual AI Agents requiring seamless integration of Internationalization (i18n) and Localization (L10n) best practices.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成国际化（i18n）和本地化（L10n）最佳实践的多语言AI代理。","ja":"国際化（i18n）とローカライゼーション（L10n）のベストプラクティスをシームレスに統合する必要があるマルチリンガルAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"국제화(i18n)와 지역화(L10n) 최선의實踐을無縫に統合해야 하는 다국어 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Multilingües que requieren una integración sin problemas de las mejores prácticas de Internacionalización (i18n) y Localización (L10n).","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA Multilingues nécessitant une intégration transparente des meilleures pratiques d''Internationalisation (i18n) et de Localisation (L10n).","de":"Ideal für multilinguale KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration der besten Praktiken für Internationalisierung (i18n) und Lokalisierung (L10n) erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA multilíngues que exigem uma integração perfeita das melhores práticas de Internacionalização (i18n) e Localização (L10n).","ru":"Идеально подходит для многоязычных ИИ-агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции лучших практик интернационализации (i18n) и локализации (L10n).","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي متعددي اللغات الذين يتطلبون تكاملاً سلساً لأفضل ممارسات التدويل (i18n) والتعريب (L10n)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert configurations from Antigravity IDE to formats compatible with GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and other IDEs and CLIs, utilizing locale-specific translations and right-to-left (RTL) language support.","zh":"赋予代理转换Antigravity IDE的配置为与GitHub Copilot、Cursor和其他IDE和CLI兼容的格式，利用区域特定翻译和从右到左（RTL）语言支持。","ja":"エージェントがAntigravity IDEの構成をGitHub Copilot、Cursor、その他のIDEおよびCLIと互換性のある形式に変換できるようにし、ロケール固有の翻訳と右から左（RTL）言語サポートを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Antigravity IDE의 구성파일을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 및 기타 IDE 및 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환할 수 있도록 하여 지역별 번역 및 오른쪽에서 왼쪽(RTL) 언어 지원을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir configuraciones desde Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y otros IDE y CLIs, utilizando traducciones específicas del idioma y soporte de lenguaje de derecha a izquierda (RTL).","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir les configurations depuis Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et d''autres IDE et CLIs, en utilisant des traductions spécifiques à la localisation et un support de langage de droite à gauche (RTL).","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in Formate zu konvertieren, die mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und anderen IDEs und CLIs kompatibel sind, unter Verwendung von lokalisierungsspezifischen Übersetzungen und Rechts-nach-Links-Sprachunterstützung (RTL).","pt":"Capacita os agentes a converter configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com GitHub Copilot, Cursor e outros IDEs e CLIs, utilizando traduções específicas de localidade e suporte a idiomas da direita para a esquerda (RTL).","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать конфигурации из Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с GitHub Copilot, Cursor и другими IDE и CLI, используя переводы для конкретных локалей и поддержку языков с написанием справа налево (RTL).","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل التكوينات من Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot و Cursor وبيئات التطوير المتكاملة والأطرافيات الأخرى، باستخدام الترجمات الخاصة باللغة المحلية ودعم اللغات من اليمين إلى اليسار (RTL)."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Agent configurations for multilingual support","Translating Skill and Workflow configurations for global compatibility","Enabling RTL language support for Arabic and Hebrew languages"],"zh":["转换代理配置以支持多语言","将技能和工作流配置翻译为全球兼容性","为阿拉伯语和希伯来语等语言启用从右到左的语言支持"],"ja":["マルチリンガルサポートのためのエージェント構成の変換","グローバルな互換性のためのスキルとワークフロー構成の翻訳","アラビア語やヘブライ語などの言語の右から左の言語サポートの有効化"],"ko":["다국어 지원을 위한 에이전트 구성 변환","전세계 호환성을 위한 스킬 및 워크플로우 구성 번역","아랍어 및 히브리어 등 언어의 오른쪽에서 왼쪽 언어 지원 활성화"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Agentes para soporte multilingüe","Traducción de configuraciones de Habilidad y Flujo de trabajo para compatibilidad global","Habilitación del soporte de lenguaje de derecha a izquierda (RTL) para los idiomas árabe y hebreo"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Agents pour un support multilingue","Traduction des configurations de Compétence et de Workflow pour une compatibilité mondiale","Activation du support de langage de droite à gauche (RTL) pour les langues arabe et hébreu"],"de":["Konvertierung von Agentenkonfigurationen für multilinguale Unterstützung","Übersetzung von Fähigkeits- und Workflow-Konfigurationen für globale Kompatibilität","Aktivierung der Rechts-nach-Links-Sprachunterstützung (RTL) für die arabischen und hebräischen Sprachen"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações de Agente para suporte multilíngue","Tradução de configurações de Habilidades e Fluxos de trabalho para compatibilidade global","Habilitar suporte a idiomas RTL para árabe e hebraico"],"ru":["Преобразование конфигураций Агента для поддержки нескольких языков","Перевод конфигураций Навыков и Рабочих процессов для глобальной совместимости","Включение поддержки языков с написанием справа налево (RTL) для арабского и иврита"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات الوكيل لدعم تعدد اللغات","ترجمة تكوينات المهارات وسير العمل لتكون متوافقة عالمياً","تمكين دعم اللغات من اليمين إلى اليسار (RTL) للغتي العربية والعبرية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with target IDEs and CLIs","Limited to locale-specific translations (e.g., en-US, tr-TR)"],"zh":["需要与目标IDE和CLI兼容","仅限区域特定翻译（例如en-US，tr-TR）"],"ja":["対象のIDEおよびCLIとの互換性が必要","ロケール固有の翻訳（例：en-US、tr-TR）に限定される"],"ko":["목표 IDE 및 CLI와의 호환성이 필요","로케일 특정 번역(예: en-US, tr-TR)으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con los IDE y CLIs de destino","Limitado a traducciones específicas de la localización (por ejemplo, en-US, tr-TR)"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec les IDE et CLIs cibles","Limité aux traductions spécifiques à la localisation (par exemple, en-US, tr-TR)"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Ziel-IDEs und CLIs","Begrenzt auf lokalisierungsspezifische Übersetzungen (z. B. en-US, tr-TR)"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com os IDEs e CLIs de destino","Limitado a traduções específicas de localidade (por exemplo, pt-BR, en-US)"],"ru":["Требуется совместимость с целевыми IDE и CLI","Ограничено переводами для конкретных локалей (например, en-US, tr-TR)"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع بيئات التطوير المتكاملة والأطرافيات المستهدفة","يقتصر على الترجمات الخاصة باللغة المحلية (مثل en-US, tr-TR)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Siddharth-Khattar/holmes/typography-system', 'community', 'Siddharth-Khattar', 'holmes', 'Siddharth-Khattar/holmes', 'typography-system', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z', '2026-02-18T13:55:24.403Z', NULL, '{"id":"Siddharth-Khattar/holmes/typography-system","name":"typography-system","description":{"zh":"本文介绍了字体系统的核心方法，包括字体选择、尺寸调整和可读性优化","ja":"タイポグラフィシステムの基本を解説，フォント選択、サイズ調整、読みやすさの最適化など","ko":"타입그래피 시스템의 핵심을 소개합니다. 폰트 선택, 크기 조정, 가독성 최적화 등","es":"El sistema de tipografía es fundamental para la interfaz de usuario, ya que comunica jerarquía y tono","fr":"Le système de typographie est essentiel pour l''interface utilisateur, car il communique la hiérarchie et le ton","de":"Das Typografiesystem ist für die Benutzeroberfläche von entscheidender Bedeutung, da es Hierarchie und Ton vermittelt","pt":"O sistema de tipografia é fundamental para uma experiência de usuário agradável","ru":"Система типографики необходима для приятного пользовательского опыта","ar":"نظام الطباعة ضروري لتنظيم المحتوى الرقمي","en":"Project implementation of the legal and investigation project for Gemini 3 Hackathon 2026"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"字体系统入门","ja":"タイポグラフィシステム","ko":"타입グラ피 시스템","es":"Sistema de tipografía para interfaces","fr":"Système de typographie pour interfaces","de":"Typografiesystem für Benutzeroberflächen","pt":"Sistema de Tipografia","ru":"Система типографики","ar":"نظام الطباعة","en":"typography-system"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍了字体系统的核心方法，包括字体选择、尺寸调整和可读性优化","ja":"タイポグラフィシステムの基本を解説，フォント選択、サイズ調整、読みやすさの最適化など","ko":"타입그래피 시스템의 핵심을 소개합니다. 폰트 선택, 크기 조정, 가독성 최적화 등","es":"El sistema de tipografía es fundamental para la interfaz de usuario, ya que comunica jerarquía y tono","fr":"Le système de typographie est essentiel pour l''interface utilisateur, car il communique la hiérarchie et le ton","de":"Das Typografiesystem ist für die Benutzeroberfläche von entscheidender Bedeutung, da es Hierarchie und Ton vermittelt","pt":"O sistema de tipografia é fundamental para uma experiência de usuário agradável","ru":"Система типографики необходима для приятного пользовательского опыта","ar":"نظام الطباعة ضروري لتنظيم المحتوى الرقمي","en":"Project implementation of the legal and investigation project for Gemini 3 Hackathon 2026"},"definition":{"en":"Project implementation of the legal and investigation project for Gemini 3 Hackathon 2026"},"features":{"zh":["字体选择","尺寸调整","可读性优化","层次结构","无障碍设计"],"ja":["フォント選択","サイズ調整","読みやすさの最適化","階層構造","アクセシビリティ設計"],"ko":["폰트 선택","크기 조정","가독성 최적화","계층 구조","접근성 설계"],"es":["Diseño de escalas de tipo naturales","Elección de fuentes con intención","Establecimiento de jerarquía clara","Garantía de legibilidad y accesibilidad"],"fr":["Conception d''échelles de type naturelles","Choix de polices avec intention","Établissement d''une hiérarchie claire","Garantie de lisibilité et d''accessibilité"],"de":["Entwurf von natürlichen Schriftgrößen","Auswahl von Schriftarten mit Absicht","Festlegung einer klaren Hierarchie","Gewährleistung von Lesbarkeit und Zugänglichkeit"],"pt":["Escolha de fontes com intenção","Criação de escalas naturais","Estabelecimento de hierarquia clara","Garantia de legibilidade e acessibilidade"],"ru":["Выбор шрифтов с намерением","Создание естественных масштабов","Установление четкой иерархии","Обеспечение читаемости и доступности"],"ar":["اختيار الخطوط بحكمة","إنشاء مقياس طبيعي","إنشاء هرمية واضحة","ضمان سهولة القراءة والوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["字体系统","字体设计","界面设计","用户体验","可读性","无障碍设计"],"ja":["タイポグラフィシステム","フォント設計","インターフェース設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","読みやすさ","アクセシビリティ設計"],"ko":["타입그래피 시스템","폰트 설계","인터페이스 설계","사용자 경험","가독성","접근성 설계"],"es":["sistema de tipografía","diseño de interfaz","tipografía para interfaces","jerarquía y tono","legibilidad y accesibilidad","escala de tipo"],"fr":["système de typographie","conception d''interface","typographie pour interfaces","hiérarchie et ton","lisibilité et accessibilité","échelle de type"],"de":["Typografiesystem","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Typografie für Benutzeroberflächen","Hierarchie und Ton","Lesbarkeit und Zugänglichkeit","Schriftgröße"],"pt":["sistema de tipografia","tipografia para interfaces","escolha de fontes","criação de escalas","hierarquia de conteúdo","legibilidade e acessibilidade"],"ru":["система типографики","типография для интерфейсов","выбор шрифтов","создание масштабов","иерархия контента","читаемость и доступность"],"ar":["نظام الطباعة","طباعة للواجهات","اختيار الخطوط","إنشاء مقياس","هرمية المحتوى","سهولة القراءة والوصول"]}},"owner":"Siddharth-Khattar","repo":"holmes","repoPath":"Siddharth-Khattar/holmes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"typography-system","description":"Master typography design with font selection, type scales, hierarchy, readability, and accessibility. Create consistent, beautiful typography that works across all devices and contexts. Includes modular scales, fluid typography, variable fonts, and accessibility best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Typography System\n\n## Overview\n\nTypography is the voice of your interface. It communicates hierarchy, establishes tone, and guides users through your content. Great typography is invisible—users don''t notice it because it works so well.\n\nThis skill teaches you to think about typography systematically: choosing fonts with intention, creating scales that feel natural, establishing clear hierarchy, and ensuring readability and accessibility across all contexts.\n\n## Core Methodology: Type Scales a","body":"# Typography System\n\n## Overview\n\nTypography is the voice of your interface. It communicates hierarchy, establishes tone, and guides users through your content. Great typography is invisible—users don''t notice it because it works so well.\n\nThis skill teaches you to think about typography systematically: choosing fonts with intention, creating scales that feel natural, establishing clear hierarchy, and ensuring readability and accessibility across all contexts.\n\n## Core Methodology: Type Scales and Hierarchy\n\nRather than choosing font sizes arbitrarily, use a **modular scale**—a mathematical progression of sizes that feels harmonious and intentional.\n\n### Modular Scales\n\nA modular scale is a sequence of sizes derived from a base size and a ratio. Common ratios:\n\n| Ratio | Name | Use Case | Example (16px base) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1.125 | Major Second | Subtle, minimal | 16, 18, 20, 23, 26, 29, 33, 37, 42, 47 |\n| 1.25 | Major Third | Balanced, harmonious | 16, 20, 25, 31, 39, 49, 61, 76, 95 |\n| 1.5 | Perfect Fifth | Bold, dramatic | 16, 24, 36, 54, 81, 122 |\n| 1.618 | Golden Ratio | Natural, elegant | 16, 26, 42, 68, 110 |\n\n**Choosing a Scale:**\n- **1.125 (Major Second)** — For subtle, minimal designs\n- **1.25 (Major Third)** — For balanced, harmonious designs (most common)\n- **1.5 (Perfect Fifth)** — For bold, dramatic designs\n- **1.618 (Golden Ratio)** — For natural, elegant designs\n\n**Example: Major Third Scale (1.25 ratio)**\n```\nBase: 16px\nScale: 16, 20, 25, 31, 39, 49, 61, 76, 95\n\nPractical sizes:\n- Caption: 12px (smaller than base)\n- Body: 16px (base)\n- Body Large: 18px (between base and next)\n- Heading 6: 20px\n- Heading 5: 25px\n- Heading 4: 31px\n- Heading 3: 39px\n- Heading 2: 49px\n- Heading 1: 61px\n- Display: 76px (for hero sections)\n```\n\n### Implementing Type Scales in Tailwind\n\n```javascript\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    fontSize: {\n      // Captions and small text\n      ''xs'': [''12px'', { lineHeight: ''1.5'' }],\n      ''sm'': [''14px'', { lineHeight: ''1.5'' }],\n      \n      // Body text\n      ''base'': [''16px'', { lineHeight: ''1.6'' }],\n      ''lg'': [''18px'', { lineHeight: ''1.6'' }],\n      \n      // Headings (modular scale 1.25)\n      ''h6'': [''20px'', { lineHeight: ''1.3'', fontWeight: ''600'' }],\n      ''h5'': [''25px'', { lineHeight: ''1.3'', fontWeight: ''600'' }],\n      ''h4'': [''31px'', { lineHeight: ''1.2'', fontWeight: ''700'' }],\n      ''h3'': [''39px'', { lineHeight: ''1.2'', fontWeight: ''700'' }],\n      ''h2'': [''49px'', { lineHeight: ''1.1'', fontWeight: ''700'' }],\n      ''h1'': [''61px'', { lineHeight: ''1.1'', fontWeight: ''700'' }],\n      \n      // Display (for hero sections)\n      ''display'': [''76px'', { lineHeight: ''1'', fontWeight: ''800'' }],\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Font Selection\n\n### Choosing Fonts\n\n**Font Pairing Principles:**\n1. **Contrast** — Pair fonts with different characteristics (serif + sans-serif, or geometric + humanist)\n2. **Personality Match** — Fonts should match your brand personality\n3. **Readability** — Prioritize readability over style\n4. **Versatility** — Fonts should work across sizes and weights\n\n### Common Font Pairings\n\n| Heading Font | Body Font | Personality | Use Case |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Playfair Display | Inter | Elegant, sophisticated | Luxury, editorial |\n| Montserrat | Open Sans | Modern, geometric | Tech, SaaS |\n| Merriweather | Lato | Warm, friendly | Publishing, lifestyle |\n| Space Mono | Space Grotesk | Futuristic, technical | Developer tools, tech |\n| Poppins | Poppins | Contemporary, friendly | Startups, consumer apps |\n\n### Font Loading Strategy\n\nUse system fonts first, then web fonts as fallback:\n\n```css\n/* System fonts (fast, no network request) */\nfont-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', Roboto, ''Helvetica Neue'', Arial, sans-serif;\n\n/* Or use web fonts (Google Fonts, Typekit, etc.) */\n@import url(''https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap'');\n\nbody {\n  font-family: ''Inter'', system-ui, sans-serif;\n}\n```\n\n**Font Loading Best Practices:**\n- Use `font-display: swap` to avoid invisible text while fonts load\n- Preload critical fonts: `<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" href=\"font.woff2\" crossorigin>`\n- Limit to 2-3 font families and 3-4 weights\n- Use variable fonts to reduce file size\n\n## Hierarchy and Emphasis\n\n### Creating Visual Hierarchy\n\nUse these properties to create hierarchy:\n\n1. **Size** — Larger text is more prominent\n2. **Weight** — Bolder text is more prominent\n3. **Color** — Brighter or more saturated colors are more prominent\n4. **Spacing** — More space around text makes it more prominent\n5. **Position** — Top-left is more prominent than bottom-right\n\n**Example: Hierarchy in a Card**\n```html\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <h2 class=\"card-title\">Card Title</h2>\n  <p class=\"card-description\">This is a description of the card content.</p>\n  <p class=\"card-meta\">Published on January 16, 2026</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n```css\n.card-title {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.card-description {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card-meta {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n```\n\n### Emphasis Techniques\n\n- **Bold** — Use for emphasis, not entire paragraphs\n- **Italic** — Use for citations, asides, or emphasis\n- **Color** — Use to highlight important information\n- **ALL CAPS** — Use sparingly for labels or buttons\n- **Underline** — Use only for links (to avoid confusion)\n\n## Readability and Accessibility\n\n### Line Height\n\nLine height affects readability. Tighter line heights for headings, looser for body text:\n\n```css\nh1, h2, h3 {\n  line-height: 1.2; /* Tight for headings */\n}\n\np, li {\n  line-height: 1.6; /* Loose for body text */\n}\n\n.caption {\n  line-height: 1.4; /* Medium for captions */\n}\n```\n\n### Line Length\n\nOptimal line length is 50-75 characters. Too long and reading becomes difficult:\n\n```css\nmain {\n  max-width: 65ch; /* ~65 characters */\n}\n```\n\n### Letter Spacing\n\nAdjust letter spacing for different contexts:\n\n```css\nh1 {\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em; /* Tighter for large headings */\n}\n\n.label {\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em; /* Looser for labels */\n}\n\n.caption {\n  letter-spacing: 0; /* Normal for body text */\n}\n```\n\n### Text Contrast\n\nEnsure sufficient contrast for readability (WCAG AA: 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text):\n\n```css\n/* Good contrast */\ncolor: #030712; /* dark text */\nbackground-color: #F9FAFB; /* light background */\n/* Contrast ratio: 19:1 ✓ */\n\n/* Poor contrast */\ncolor: #9CA3AF; /* medium gray text */\nbackground-color: #F9FAFB; /* light background */\n/* Contrast ratio: 2.5:1 ✗ */\n```\n\n### Responsive Typography\n\nUse fluid typography to scale smoothly across devices:\n\n```css\n/* Fixed sizes (old approach) */\nh1 {\n  font-size: 24px; /* mobile */\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 32px; /* tablet */\n  }\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 1024px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 40px; /* desktop */\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fluid typography (modern approach) */\nh1 {\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 40px);\n  /* min: 24px, preferred: 5% of viewport width, max: 40px */\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Typography Techniques\n\n### Variable Fonts\n\nVariable fonts allow multiple weights and styles in a single file:\n\n```css\n@import url(''https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100..900&display=swap'');\n\nbody {\n  font-family: ''Inter'', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 400;\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.light {\n  font-weight: 300;\n}\n```\n\n### Font Features\n\nUse OpenType features for advanced typography:\n\n```css\n/* Ligatures (fi, fl, etc.) */\nbody {\n  font-feature-settings: ''liga'' 1;\n}\n\n/* Tabular numbers (for tables) */\n.table {\n  font-feature-settings: ''tnum'' 1;\n}\n\n/* Small caps */\n.label {\n  font-feature-settings: ''smcp'' 1;\n}\n```\n\n## Common Typography Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Article Typography\n```css\narticle {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  max-width: 65ch;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 2rem 1rem;\n}\n\narticle h1 {\n  font-size: 49px;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  margin-top: 2rem;\n}\n\narticle h2 {\n  font-size: 39px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n}\n\narticle p {\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\narticle a {\n  color: var(--interactive-primary);\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: UI Typography\n```css\n/* Buttons */\nbutton {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  letter-spacing: 0;\n}\n\n/* Labels */\nlabel {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n/* Captions */\n.caption {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Responsive Headings\n```css\nh1 {\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 61px);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 49px);\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 39px);\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n```\n\n## How to Use This Skill with Claude Code\n\n### Create a Type Scale\n\n```\n\"I''m using the typography-system skill. Can you create a type scale for me?\n- Base font size: 16px\n- Ratio: 1.25 (Major Third)\n- Font family: Inter for body, Playfair Display for headings\n- Include sizes for: captions, body, headings, display\n- Ensure accessibility (contrast, line height, line length)\"\n```\n\n### Audit Your Typography\n\n```\n\"Can you audit my current typography?\n- Are my font sizes following a modular scale?\n- Is my line height appropriate?\n- Is my line length too long?\n- Are my color contrasts sufficient?\n- Are my fonts accessible?\n- What improvements would you suggest?\"\n```\n\n### Implement Responsive Typography\n\n```\n\"Can you help me implement responsive typography?\n- Create fluid typography using clamp()\n- Ensure readability at all breakpoints\n- Test at mobile (320px), tablet (768px), desktop (1024px)\n- Provide CSS code I can use\"\n```\n\n### Create Typography Documentation\n\n```\n\"Can you create comprehensive typography documentation?\n- Type scale with all sizes\n- Font pairings and usage\n- Hierarchy guidelines\n- Accessibility guidelines\n- Code examples for each style\n- Responsive behavior\"\n```\n\n## Design Critique: Evaluating Your Typography\n\nClaude Code can critique your typography:\n\n```\n\"Can you evaluate my typography?\n- Is my type scale harmonious?\n- Is my hierarchy clear?\n- Is my readability good?\n- Are my color contrasts sufficient?\n- Are my fonts accessible?\n- What''s one thing I could improve immediately?\"\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **design-foundation** — Typography tokens and scales\n- **layout-system** — Responsive typography scales\n- **color-system** — Text color and contrast\n- **component-architecture** — Typography in components\n- **accessibility-excellence** — Font sizes, contrast, line height\n- **interaction-design** — Typography in animations\n\n## Key Principles\n\n**1. Type Scale Brings Harmony**\nA modular scale feels natural and intentional. It''s the foundation of great typography.\n\n**2. Hierarchy Guides Users**\nClear hierarchy helps users understand what''s important and what to read next.\n\n**3. Readability is Non-Negotiable**\nBeautiful typography that''s hard to read is not beautiful. Readability comes first.\n\n**4. Accessibility is Foundational**\nFont sizes, contrast, and line height must meet accessibility standards.\n\n**5. Consistency Builds Trust**\nConsistent typography across your product builds trust and reduces cognitive load.\n\n## Checklist: Is Your Typography System Ready?\n\n- [ ] Type scale is defined and modular\n- [ ] Font families are chosen with intention\n- [ ] Font sizes are consistent across components\n- [ ] Line heights are appropriate for context\n- [ ] Line length is 50-75 characters for body text\n- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA standards\n- [ ] Hierarchy is clear and intentional\n- [ ] Responsive typography uses fluid scaling\n- [ ] Fonts are loaded efficiently\n- [ ] Typography works well on all devices\n- [ ] Typography is documented and shared with the team\n\nGreat typography is the voice of your interface. Make it count.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:55:24.403Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing advanced typography system implementation for clear hierarchy and readability","zh":"非常适合需要高级排版系统实现以获得清晰层次和可读性的 UI/UX 代理","ja":"UI/UX エージェントが明確な階層と読みやすさを持つために高度な組版システムの実装を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"明确한 계층과 가독성을 위한 고급 타이포그래피 시스템 구현이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan una implementación avanzada de sistema de tipografía para una jerarquía clara y legibilidad","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée du système de typographie pour une hiérarchie claire et une lisibilité","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Implementierung des Typografiesystems für eine klare Hierarchie und Lesbarkeit benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de implementação de sistema de tipografia avançada para hierarquia clara e legibilidade","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым необходима реализация системы продвинутой типографики для ясной иерархии и читаемости","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء UI/UX الذين يحتاجون إلى نظام طباعة متقدم لتحقيق التسلسل الهرمي الواضح والقابلية للقراءة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create intentional font choices, natural type scales, and clear hierarchy using typography systems, ensuring readability and accessibility across all contexts, including establishing tone and guiding users through content with great typography","zh":"赋予代理创建有意的字体选择、自然的字体比例和清晰的层次结构，使用排版系统，以确保所有情况下的可读性和无障碍性，包括建立语气和通过出色的排版引导用户浏览内容","ja":"エージェントが意図的なフォントの選択、自然なフォントの尺度、明確な階層構造を作成できるようにし、組版システムを使用して、すべての状況での読みやすさとアクセシビリティを確保し、トーンを確立し、優れた組版でコンテンツをユーザーに導く","ko":"에이전트가 의도적인 글꼴 선택, 자연스러운 글꼴 크기 및 명확한 계층 구조를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 타이포그래피 시스템을 사용하여 모든 상황에서 가독성 및 접근성을 보장하고, 음색을 설정하고,優れた 타이포그래피로 사용자가 콘텐츠를 탐색하도록 안내","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear elecciones de fuentes intencionales, escalas de tipo naturales y una jerarquía clara utilizando sistemas de tipografía, garantizando la legibilidad y la accesibilidad en todos los contextos, incluyendo el establecimiento del tono y la guía de los usuarios a través del contenido con una gran tipografía","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des choix de polices intentionnels, des échelles de type naturelles et une hiérarchie claire en utilisant des systèmes de typographie, garantissant la lisibilité et l''accessibilité dans tous les contextes, y compris l''établissement du ton et la guidage des utilisateurs à travers le contenu avec une grande typographie","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, bewusste Schriftauswahl, natürliche Schriftgrößen und eine klare Hierarchie unter Verwendung von Typografiesystemen zu erstellen, um Lesbarkeit und Zugänglichkeit in allen Kontexten sicherzustellen, einschließlich der Festlegung des Tons und der Anleitung der Benutzer durch den Inhalt mit einer großartigen Typografie","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar escolhas de fonte intencionais, escalas de tipo naturais e hierarquia clara usando sistemas de tipografia, garantindo legibilidade e acessibilidade em todos os contextos, incluindo o estabelecimento do tom e orientação dos usuários pelo conteúdo com uma ótima tipografia","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать намеренные выборы шрифтов, естественные шкалы типографии и ясную иерархию с помощью систем типографики, гарантируя читаемость и доступность во всех контекстах, включая установление тона и руководство пользователями через контент с помощью отличной типографики","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من création خيارات خط متعمدة ومقاييس نوع طبيعية والتسلسل الهرمي الواضح باستخدام أنظمة الطباعة، مما يضمن قابلية القراءة والوصول إلى جميع السياقات، بما في ذلك إنشاء النبرة وتوجيه المستخدمين من خلال المحتوى بطباعة رائعة"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating systematic typography for web interfaces","Establishing clear hierarchy in digital content","Ensuring readability and accessibility in mobile applications"],"zh":["为网页接口创建系统化的排版","在数字内容中建立清晰的层次","确保移动应用中的可读性和无障碍性"],"ja":["Web インターフェイスのための体系的な組版の作成","デジタル コンテンツにおける明確な階層の確立","モバイル アプリケーションの読みやすさとアクセシビリティの確保"],"ko":["웹 인터페이스 위한 체계적인 타이포그래피 생성","디지털 콘텐츠에서 명확한 계층 구조 설정","모바일 애플리케이션의 가독성 및 접근성 보장"],"es":["Creación de tipografía sistemática para interfaces web","Establecimiento de una jerarquía clara en contenido digital","Garantía de legibilidad y accesibilidad en aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Création de typographie systématique pour les interfaces web","Établissement d''une hiérarchie claire dans le contenu numérique","Assurance de la lisibilité et de l''accessibilité dans les applications mobiles"],"de":["Erstellung systematischer Typografie für Web-Oberflächen","Festlegung einer klaren Hierarchie in digitalem Inhalt","Sicherstellung von Lesbarkeit und Zugänglichkeit in mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de tipografia sistemática para interfaces da web","Estabelecimento de hierarquia clara em conteúdo digital","Garantia de legibilidade e acessibilidade em aplicações móveis"],"ru":["Создание системной типографики для веб-интерфейсов","Установление ясной иерархии в цифровом контенте","Обеспечение читаемости и доступности в мобильных приложениях"],"ar":["إنشاء طباعة منهجية للواجهات الإلكترونية","إنشاء التسلسل الهرمي الواضح في المحتوى الرقمي","ضمان قابلية القراءة والوصول إلى التطبيقات المحمولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of typography principles","Limited to digital interfaces"],"zh":["需要了解排版原则","仅限于数字接口"],"ja":["組版の原則の理解が必要","デジタル インターフェイスに限定される"],"ko":["타이포그래피 원리의 이해가 필요","디지털 인터페이스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de la tipografía","Limitado a interfaces digitales"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de la typographie","Limité aux interfaces numériques"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis der Prinzipien der Typografie","Begrenzt auf digitale Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Requer entendimento dos princípios de tipografia","Limitado a interfaces digitais"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов типографики","Ограничен цифровыми интерфейсами"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ الطباعة","محدود بالواجهات الرقمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
