to de templates","Prevenção de erros comuns","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de ícones","Integração com bibliotecas de ícones populares"],"ru":["Сопоставление понятий с иконками","Предоставление шаблонов","Предотвращение распространенных ошибок","Поддержка нескольких форматов иконок","Интеграция с популярными библиотеками иконок"],"ar":["ربط المفاهيم بالرموز","توفير قوالب","تجنب الأخطاء الشائعة","دعم صيغ رموز متعددة","التكامل مع مكتبات الرموز الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["图标设计","icon design","图标库","icon library","用户体验","ux design","界面设计","ui design"],"ja":["アイコンデザイン","icon design","アイコンライブラリ","icon library","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ux design","インターフェースデザイン","ui design"],"ko":["아이콘 디자인","icon design","아이콘 라이브러리","icon library","사용자 경험","ux design","인터페이스 디자인","ui design"],"es":["diseño de iconos","selección de iconos","bibliotecas de iconos","Lucide","Heroicons","Phosphor","guias de diseño","mejores prácticas de diseño"],"fr":["conception d''icônes","sélection d''icônes","bibliothèques d''icônes","Lucide","Heroicons","Phosphor","guides de conception","bonnes pratiques de conception"],"de":["Icon-Design","Auswahl von Icons","Icon-Bibliotheken","Lucide","Heroicons","Phosphor","Designleitfäden","Best Practices für Design"],"pt":["design de ícones","criação de ícones","ícones visuais","conceitos e ideias","templates de ícones","bibliotecas de ícones"],"ru":["дизайн иконок","создание иконок","визуальные иконки","понятия и идеи","шаблоны иконок","библиотеки иконок"],"ar":["تصميم الأيقونة","إنشاء الأيقونات","رموز بصرية","المفاهيم والأفكار","قوالب الرموز","مكتبات الرموز"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"icon-design","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Icon Design\n\nSelect the right icon for the job. Maps concepts to icons, provides templates, prevents common mistakes.\n\n## Quick Reference (Top 20 Concepts)\n\n| Concept | Lucide | Heroicons | Phosphor |\n|---------|--------|-----------|----------|\n| Award/Quality | `Trophy` | `trophy` | `Trophy` |\n| Price/Value | `Tag` | `tag` | `Tag` |\n| Location | `MapPin` | `map-pin` | `MapPin` |\n| Expertise | `GraduationCap` | `academic-cap` | `GraduationCap` |\n| Support | `MessageCircle` | `chat-bubble-left-","body":"# Icon Design\n\nSelect the right icon for the job. Maps concepts to icons, provides templates, prevents common mistakes.\n\n## Quick Reference (Top 20 Concepts)\n\n| Concept | Lucide | Heroicons | Phosphor |\n|---------|--------|-----------|----------|\n| Award/Quality | `Trophy` | `trophy` | `Trophy` |\n| Price/Value | `Tag` | `tag` | `Tag` |\n| Location | `MapPin` | `map-pin` | `MapPin` |\n| Expertise | `GraduationCap` | `academic-cap` | `GraduationCap` |\n| Support | `MessageCircle` | `chat-bubble-left-right` | `ChatCircle` |\n| Security | `Shield` | `shield-check` | `Shield` |\n| Speed | `Zap` | `bolt` | `Lightning` |\n| Phone | `Phone` | `phone` | `Phone` |\n| Email | `Mail` | `envelope` | `Envelope` |\n| User/Profile | `User` | `user` | `User` |\n| Team | `Users` | `user-group` | `Users` |\n| Settings | `Settings` | `cog-6-tooth` | `Gear` |\n| Home | `Home` | `home` | `House` |\n| Search | `Search` | `magnifying-glass` | `MagnifyingGlass` |\n| Check/Success | `Check` | `check` | `Check` |\n| Close/Cancel | `X` | `x-mark` | `X` |\n| Menu | `Menu` | `bars-3` | `List` |\n| Calendar | `Calendar` | `calendar` | `Calendar` |\n| Clock/Time | `Clock` | `clock` | `Clock` |\n| Heart/Favourite | `Heart` | `heart` | `Heart` |\n\n## Library Selection\n\n| Library | Best For | Package |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| **Lucide** | General use, React projects | `lucide-react` |\n| **Heroicons** | Tailwind projects, minimal style | `@heroicons/react` |\n| **Phosphor** | Weight variations needed | `@phosphor-icons/react` |\n\n**Default recommendation**: Lucide (1,400+ icons, excellent React integration)\n\nSee `references/library-comparison.md` for detailed comparison.\n\n## Icon Style Rules\n\n### Sizing\n\n| Context | Tailwind Class | Pixels |\n|---------|----------------|--------|\n| Inline with text | `w-4 h-4` or `w-5 h-5` | 16-20px |\n| Feature cards | `w-8 h-8` | 32px |\n| Hero sections | `w-10 h-10` or `w-12 h-12` | 40-48px |\n| Large decorative | `w-16 h-16` | 64px |\n\n### Consistency Rules\n\n1. **Never mix styles** - Use all outline OR all solid in a section\n2. **Never use emoji** - Use proper icon components (tree-shakeable)\n3. **Use currentColor** - Icons inherit text color via `stroke=\"currentColor\"`\n4. **Semantic colours** - Use `text-primary`, not `text-blue-500`\n\n### Tree-Shaking (Critical)\n\nDynamic icon selection breaks tree-shaking. Use explicit maps:\n\n```tsx\n// BAD - all icons bundled\nimport * as Icons from ''lucide-react''\nconst Icon = Icons[iconName]  // Tree-shaken away!\n\n// GOOD - explicit map\nimport { Home, Users, Settings, type LucideIcon } from ''lucide-react''\nconst ICON_MAP: Record<string, LucideIcon> = { Home, Users, Settings }\nconst Icon = ICON_MAP[iconName]\n```\n\n## Selection Process\n\n1. **Identify the concept** - What does the label/title communicate?\n2. **Check semantic mapping** - See `references/semantic-mapping.md`\n3. **Choose library** - Lucide (default), Heroicons (Tailwind), Phosphor (weights)\n4. **Apply template** - See `references/icon-templates.md`\n5. **Verify consistency** - Same style, same size in section\n\n## Decision Tree\n\nWhen unsure which icon:\n\n```\nIs it about recognition/awards? → Trophy, Star, Award\nIs it about money/price? → Tag, DollarSign, CreditCard\nIs it about location? → MapPin, Globe, Map\nIs it about people/team? → Users, UserGroup, User\nIs it about communication? → MessageCircle, Phone, Mail\nIs it about safety/trust? → Shield, Lock, ShieldCheck\nIs it about speed/time? → Zap, Clock, Timer\nIs it trade-specific? → Check semantic-mapping.md\nStill unsure? → CheckCircle (generic positive) or Sparkles (generic feature)\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- `references/semantic-mapping.md` - Full concept→icon tables by category\n- `references/icon-templates.md` - React/HTML patterns with Tailwind\n- `references/library-comparison.md` - Lucide vs Heroicons vs Phosphor\n- `references/migration-guide.md` - FA/Material → modern equivalents\n- `rules/icon-design.md` - Correction rules for projects\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:56:01.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing precise icon mapping and template management for Lucide, Heroicons, and Phosphor icon sets.","zh":"非常适合需要精确图标映射和模板管理的 UI/UX 代理，支持 Lucide、Heroicons 和 Phosphor 图标集。","ja":"UI/UX エージェントが Lucide、Heroicons、Phosphor アイコンセットの正確なアイコンマッピングとテンプレート管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Lucide, Heroicons, Phosphor 아이콘 세트의 정확한 아이콘 매핑 및 템플릿 관리가 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 매우 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan un mapeo de iconos preciso y gestión de plantillas para los conjuntos de iconos Lucide, Heroicons y Phosphor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin d''un mappage d''icônes précis et d''une gestion de modèles pour les jeux d''icônes Lucide, Heroicons et Phosphor.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agents, die ein präzises Icon-Mapping und eine Template-Verwaltung für die Icon-Sets Lucide, Heroicons und Phosphor benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que precisam de mapeamento de ícones preciso e gerenciamento de modelos para os conjuntos de ícones Lucide, Heroicons e Phosphor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, которым необходим точное сопоставление иконок и управление шаблонами для наборов иконок Lucide, Heroicons и Phosphor.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء UI/UX التي تحتاج إلى تعيين دقيق للأيقونات وإدارة القوالب لنصوص الأيقونات Lucide و Heroicons و Phosphor."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to map concepts to icons accurately using libraries like Lucide and Heroicons, preventing common mistakes and providing templates for Award, Price, Location, Expertise, and Support concepts, all in standardized SVG formats.","zh":"赋予代理准确地使用 Lucide 和 Heroicons 等库将概念映射到图标，防止常见错误，并为奖励、价格、位置、专业知识和支持概念提供标准化的 SVG 格式模板。","ja":"Lucide や Heroicons などのライブラリを使用して、概念をアイコンに正確にマッピングし、一般的な間違いを防ぎ、賞、価格、場所、専門知識、サポートなどの概念に対して標準化された SVG 形式のテンプレートを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Lucide 및 Heroicons 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 개념을 아이콘에 정확히 매핑할 수 있도록 하며, 일반적인 오류를 방지하고,賞, 가격, 위치, 전문 지식 및 지원과 같은 개념에 대한 표준화된 SVG 형식 템플릿을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mapear conceptos a iconos con precisión utilizando bibliotecas como Lucide y Heroicons, evitando errores comunes y proporcionando plantillas para conceptos de Premio, Precio, Ubicación, Pericia y Soporte, todos en formatos SVG estandarizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mapper des concepts à des icônes avec précision en utilisant des bibliothèques comme Lucide et Heroicons, évitant les erreurs courantes et fournissant des modèles pour les concepts de Prix, Tarif, Emplacement, Expertise et Support, le tout dans des formats SVG standardisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Konzepte auf Icons genau abzubilden, indem sie Bibliotheken wie Lucide und Heroicons nutzen, verbreitete Fehler vermeiden und Vorlagen für Konzepte wie Auszeichnung, Preis, Standort, Expertise und Support bereitstellen, alles in standardisierten SVG-Formaten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a mapear conceitos para ícones com precisão usando bibliotecas como Lucide e Heroicons, prevenindo erros comuns e fornecendo modelos para conceitos de Prêmio, Preço, Localização, Especialização e Suporte, todos em formatos SVG padronizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сопоставлять понятия с иконками точно с помощью библиотек, таких как Lucide и Heroicons, предотвращая распространенные ошибки и предоставляя шаблоны для понятий Награда, Цена, Место, Экспертиза и Поддержка, все в стандартизированных форматах SVG.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعيين المفاهيم إلى الأيقونات بدقة باستخدام المكتبات مثل Lucide و Heroicons، ومنع الأخطاء الشائعة وتوفير قوالب لمفاهيم الجائزة والسعر والموقع والخبرة والدعم، جميعها في تنسيقات SVG стандартية."},"useCases":{"en":["Mapping concepts to icons for web applications","Generating icon templates for design systems","Preventing common icon misuse in UI designs"],"zh":["将概念映射到 Web 应用程序的图标","为设计系统生成图标模板","防止 UI 设计中的常见图标误用"],"ja":["Web アプリケーションのアイコンに概念をマッピングする","デザインシステムのアイコンテンプレートを生成する","UI デザインにおける一般的なアイコンの誤用を防ぐ"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션의 아이콘에 개념을 매핑하는 것","디자인 시스템의 아이콘 템플릿을 생성하는 것","UI 디자인에서 일반적인 아이콘 오남용을 방지하는 것"],"es":["Mapear conceptos a iconos para aplicaciones web","Generar plantillas de iconos para sistemas de diseño","Prevenir el mal uso común de iconos en diseños de UI"],"fr":["Mapper des concepts à des icônes pour les applications web","Générer des modèles d''icônes pour les systèmes de conception","Prévenir une mauvaise utilisation courante des icônes dans les conceptions de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Konzepte auf Icons für Webanwendungen abbilden","Icon-Vorlagen für Designsysteme generieren","Vermeiden Sie den häufigen Missbrauch von Icons in Benutzeroberflächendesigns"],"pt":["Mapeamento de conceitos para ícones em aplicações web","Geração de modelos de ícones para sistemas de design","Prevenção do uso indevido comum de ícones em designs de UI"],"ru":["Сопоставление понятий с иконками для веб-приложений","Генерация шаблонов иконок для систем дизайна","Предотвращение распространенного неправильного использования иконок в дизайнах UI"],"ar":["تعيين المفاهيم إلى الأيقونات في التطبيقات الويب","جعل قوالب الأيقونات لأنظمة التصميم","منع سوء استخدام الأيقونات الشائع في تصاميم واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Lucide, Heroicons, and Phosphor icon sets","Requires knowledge of icon concept mapping"],"zh":["仅限 Lucide、Heroicons 和 Phosphor 图标集","需要图标概念映射知识"],"ja":["Lucide、Heroicons、Phosphor アイコンセットのみに限定される","アイコン概念マッピングの知識が必要"],"ko":["Lucide, Heroicons, Phosphor 아이콘 세트만 해당","아이콘 개념 매핑 지식이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a los conjuntos de iconos Lucide, Heroicons y Phosphor","Requiere conocimiento de mapeo de conceptos de iconos"],"fr":["Limité aux jeux d''icônes Lucide, Heroicons et Phosphor","Nécessite des connaissances en matière de mappage de concepts d''icônes"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Icon-Sets Lucide, Heroicons und Phosphor","Benötigt Kenntnisse im Icon-Konzept-Mapping"],"pt":["Limitado aos conjuntos de ícones Lucide, Heroicons e Phosphor","Requer conhecimento de mapeamento de conceitos de ícones"],"ru":["Ограничен наборами иконок Lucide, Heroicons и Phosphor","Требует знания сопоставления понятий иконок"],"ar":["محدود بمجموعات الأيقونات Lucide و Heroicons و Phosphor","يتطلب معرفة بمapping المفاهيم للأيقونات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
