on Sicherheitsprinzipien","Überprüfung der Sicherheits-Checkliste","Unterstützung für mehrere Code-Formate","Integration mit IDEs und CLIs"],"pt":["Execução de scripts de validação automática","Verificação de princípios de segurança","Compatibilidade com OWASP Top 10","Suporte a Auth, API e Data protection","Integração com IDEs e CLIs","Referência a arquivos de checklist"],"ru":["Запуск скриптов автоматической проверки","Проверка принципов безопасности","Совместимость с OWASP Top 10","Поддержка Auth, API и Data protection","Интеграция с IDE и CLI","Ссылка на файлы чек-листов"],"ar":["تشغيل البرامج النصية للتحقق التلقائي","التحقق من مبادئ الأمان","التوافق مع OWASP Top 10","دعم Auth و API و Data protection","التكامل مع IDE و CLIs","مرجع إلى ملفات قائمة التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["漏洞扫描工具","自动化安全验证","OWASP Top 10","安全扫描","脚本执行","IDE集成","CLI集成","安全开发"],"ja":["脆弱性スキャナー","自動化セキュリティ検証","OWASP Top 10","セキュリティスキャン","スクリプトの実行","IDE統合","CLI統合","セキュア開発"],"ko":["취약점 스캐너","자동화된 보안 검증","OWASP Top 10","보안 스캔","스크립트 실행","IDE 통합","CLI 통합","보안 개발"],"es":["escáner de vulnerabilidades","seguridad del código","análisis de seguridad","validación de seguridad"," OWASP Top 10","seguridad de la API"],"fr":["analyseur de vulnérabilités","sécurité du code","analyse de sécurité","validation de sécurité","OWASP Top 10","sécurité de l''API"],"de":["Sicherheitslückenscanner","Sicherheit des Codes","Sicherheitsanalyse","Sicherheitsvalidierung","OWASP Top 10","Sicherheit der API"],"pt":["vulnerability scanner","segurança de código","OWASP Top 10","Auth","API","Data protection","validação automática","scripts de segurança"],"ru":["Сканирование уязвимостей","безопасность кода","OWASP Top 10","Auth","API","Data protection","автоматическая проверка","скрипты безопасности"],"ar":["ماسح التهديدات","أمان الكود","OWASP Top 10","Auth","API","Data protection","التحقق التلقائي","برامج نصية أمان"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vulnerability-scanner","description":"Advanced vulnerability analysis principles. OWASP 2025, Supply Chain Security, attack surface mapping, risk prioritization.","bodyPreview":"# Vulnerability Scanner\n\n> Think like an attacker, defend like an expert. 2025 threat landscape awareness.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute for automated validation:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/security_scan.py` | Validate security principles applied | `python scripts/security_scan.py <project_path>` |\n\n## 📋 Reference Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| [checklists.md](checklists.md) | OWASP Top 10, Auth, API, Data protection checklists |","body":"# Vulnerability Scanner\n\n> Think like an attacker, defend like an expert. 2025 threat landscape awareness.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute for automated validation:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/security_scan.py` | Validate security principles applied | `python scripts/security_scan.py <project_path>` |\n\n## 📋 Reference Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| [checklists.md](checklists.md) | OWASP Top 10, Auth, API, Data protection checklists |\n\n---\n\n## 1. Security Expert Mindset\n\n### Core Principles\n\n| Principle | Application |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| **Assume Breach** | Design as if attacker already inside |\n| **Zero Trust** | Never trust, always verify |\n| **Defense in Depth** | Multiple layers, no single point |\n| **Least Privilege** | Minimum required access only |\n| **Fail Secure** | On error, deny access |\n\n### Threat Modeling Questions\n\nBefore scanning, ask:\n1. What are we protecting? (Assets)\n2. Who would attack? (Threat actors)\n3. How would they attack? (Attack vectors)\n4. What''s the impact? (Business risk)\n\n---\n\n## 2. OWASP Top 10:2025\n\n### Risk Categories\n\n| Rank | Category | Think About |\n|------|----------|-------------|\n| **A01** | Broken Access Control | Who can access what? IDOR, SSRF |\n| **A02** | Security Misconfiguration | Defaults, headers, exposed services |\n| **A03** | Software Supply Chain 🆕 | Dependencies, CI/CD, build integrity |\n| **A04** | Cryptographic Failures | Weak crypto, exposed secrets |\n| **A05** | Injection | User input → system commands |\n| **A06** | Insecure Design | Flawed architecture |\n| **A07** | Authentication Failures | Session, credential management |\n| **A08** | Integrity Failures | Unsigned updates, tampered data |\n| **A09** | Logging & Alerting | Blind spots, no monitoring |\n| **A10** | Exceptional Conditions 🆕 | Error handling, fail-open states |\n\n### 2025 Key Changes\n\n```\n2021 → 2025 Shifts:\n├── SSRF merged into A01 (Access Control)\n├── A02 elevated (Cloud/Container configs)\n├── A03 NEW: Supply Chain (major focus)\n├── A10 NEW: Exceptional Conditions\n└── Focus shift: Root causes > Symptoms\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Supply Chain Security (A03)\n\n### Attack Surface\n\n| Vector | Risk | Question to Ask |\n|--------|------|-----------------|\n| **Dependencies** | Malicious packages | Do we audit new deps? |\n| **Lock files** | Integrity attacks | Are they committed? |\n| **Build pipeline** | CI/CD compromise | Who can modify? |\n| **Registry** | Typosquatting | Verified sources? |\n\n### Defense Principles\n\n- Verify package integrity (checksums)\n- Pin versions, audit updates\n- Use private registries for critical deps\n- Sign and verify artifacts\n\n---\n\n## 4. Attack Surface Mapping\n\n### What to Map\n\n| Category | Elements |\n|----------|----------|\n| **Entry Points** | APIs, forms, file uploads |\n| **Data Flows** | Input → Process → Output |\n| **Trust Boundaries** | Where auth/authz checked |\n| **Assets** | Secrets, PII, business data |\n\n### Prioritization Matrix\n\n```\nRisk = Likelihood × Impact\n\nHigh Impact + High Likelihood → CRITICAL\nHigh Impact + Low Likelihood  → HIGH\nLow Impact + High Likelihood  → MEDIUM\nLow Impact + Low Likelihood   → LOW\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Risk Prioritization\n\n### CVSS + Context\n\n| Factor | Weight | Question |\n|--------|--------|----------|\n| **CVSS Score** | Base severity | How severe is the vuln? |\n| **EPSS Score** | Exploit likelihood | Is it being exploited? |\n| **Asset Value** | Business context | What''s at risk? |\n| **Exposure** | Attack surface | Internet-facing? |\n\n### Prioritization Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs it actively exploited (EPSS >0.5)?\n├── YES → CRITICAL: Immediate action\n└── NO → Check CVSS\n         ├── CVSS ≥9.0 → HIGH\n         ├── CVSS 7.0-8.9 → Consider asset value\n         └── CVSS <7.0 → Schedule for later\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. Exceptional Conditions (A10 - New)\n\n### Fail-Open vs Fail-Closed\n\n| Scenario | Fail-Open (BAD) | Fail-Closed (GOOD) |\n|----------|-----------------|---------------------|\n| Auth error | Allow access | Deny access |\n| Parsing fails | Accept input | Reject input |\n| Timeout | Retry forever | Limit + abort |\n\n### What to Check\n\n- Exception handlers that catch-all and ignore\n- Missing error handling on security operations\n- Race conditions in auth/authz\n- Resource exhaustion scenarios\n\n---\n\n## 7. Scanning Methodology\n\n### Phase-Based Approach\n\n```\n1. RECONNAISSANCE\n   └── Understand the target\n       ├── Technology stack\n       ├── Entry points\n       └── Data flows\n\n2. DISCOVERY\n   └── Identify potential issues\n       ├── Configuration review\n       ├── Dependency analysis\n       └── Code pattern search\n\n3. ANALYSIS\n   └── Validate and prioritize\n       ├── False positive elimination\n       ├── Risk scoring\n       └── Attack chain mapping\n\n4. REPORTING\n   └── Actionable findings\n       ├── Clear reproduction steps\n       ├── Business impact\n       └── Remediation guidance\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. Code Pattern Analysis\n\n### High-Risk Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Risk | Look For |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| **String concat in queries** | Injection | `\"SELECT * FROM \" + user_input` |\n| **Dynamic code execution** | RCE | `eval()`, `exec()`, `Function()` |\n| **Unsafe deserialization** | RCE | `pickle.loads()`, `unserialize()` |\n| **Path manipulation** | Traversal | User input in file paths |\n| **Disabled security** | Various | `verify=False`, `--insecure` |\n\n### Secret Patterns\n\n| Type | Indicators |\n|------|-----------|\n| API Keys | `api_key`, `apikey`, high entropy |\n| Tokens | `token`, `bearer`, `jwt` |\n| Credentials | `password`, `secret`, `key` |\n| Cloud | `AWS_`, `AZURE_`, `GCP_` prefixes |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Cloud Security Considerations\n\n### Shared Responsibility\n\n| Layer | You Own | Provider Owns |\n|-------|---------|---------------|\n| Data | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Application | ✅ | ❌ |\n| OS/Runtime | Depends | Depends |\n| Infrastructure | ❌ | ✅ |\n\n### Cloud-Specific Checks\n\n- IAM: Least privilege applied?\n- Storage: Public buckets?\n- Network: Security groups tightened?\n- Secrets: Using secrets manager?\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Scan without understanding | Map attack surface first |\n| Alert on every CVE | Prioritize by exploitability + asset |\n| Ignore false positives | Maintain verified baseline |\n| Fix symptoms only | Address root causes |\n| Scan once before deploy | Continuous scanning |\n| Trust third-party deps blindly | Verify integrity, audit code |\n\n---\n\n## 11. Reporting Principles\n\n### Finding Structure\n\nEach finding should answer:\n1. **What?** - Clear vulnerability description\n2. **Where?** - Exact location (file, line, endpoint)\n3. **Why?** - Root cause explanation\n4. **Impact?** - Business consequence\n5. **How to fix?** - Specific remediation\n\n### Severity Classification\n\n| Severity | Criteria |\n|----------|----------|\n| **Critical** | RCE, auth bypass, mass data exposure |\n| **High** | Data exposure, privilege escalation |\n| **Medium** | Limited scope, requires conditions |\n| **Low** | Informational, best practice |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Vulnerability scanning finds issues. Expert thinking prioritizes what matters. Always ask: \"What would an attacker do with this?\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:56:27.558Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security Analysis Agents needing advanced vulnerability detection and threat landscape awareness capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级漏洞检测和威胁景观意识能力的安全分析代理。","ja":"高度な脆弱性検出および脅威状況認識機能を必要とするセキュリティ分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 취약점 탐지 및 위협 경관 인식 기능을 필요로 하는 보안 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de seguridad que necesitan capacidades de detección de vulnerabilidades avanzadas y conocimiento del paisaje de amenazas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de sécurité ayant besoin de capacités de détection de vulnérabilités avancées et de connaissance du paysage de menaces.","de":"Ideal für Sicherheitsanalyseagenten, die erweiterte Schwachstellenerkennung und Bedrohungslandschaftskenntnisse benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Segurança que necessitam de detecção avançada de vulnerabilidades e capacidades de conscientização do cenário de ameaças.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа безопасности, требующих передовых возможностей обнаружения уязвимостей и осведомленности о ландшафте угроз.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل الأمن الذين يحتاجون إلى كشف متقدم عن نقاط الضعف والقدرات على الوعي بمنظور التهديدات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute automated security scans using Python scripts, validating security principles and checking for OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, and providing data protection and authentication checklists.","zh":"使代理能够使用Python脚本执行自动化安全扫描，验证安全原则并检查OWASP Top 10漏洞，并提供数据保护和身份验证检查清单。","ja":"エージェントがPythonスクリプトを使用して自動化されたセキュリティスキャンを実行できるようにし、セキュリティ原則を検証し、OWASP Top 10の脆弱性をチェックし、データ保護と認証のチェックリストを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 파이썬 스크립트를 사용하여 자동화된 보안 スキャン을 실행할 수 있도록 하여 보안 원칙을 검증하고 OWASP Top 10의 취약점을 확인하며 데이터 보호 및 인증 체크리스트를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar análisis de seguridad automatizados utilizando scripts de Python, validando principios de seguridad y comprobando las vulnerabilidades del Top 10 de OWASP, y proporcionando listas de verificación de protección de datos y autenticación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des analyses de sécurité automatisées à l''aide de scripts Python, en validant les principes de sécurité et en vérifiant les vulnérabilités du Top 10 d''OWASP, et en fournissant des listes de vérification de protection des données et d''authentification.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, automatisierte Sicherheitstests mit Python-Skripten auszuführen, Sicherheitsgrundsätze zu validieren und auf OWASP-Top-10-Schwachstellen zu prüfen und Checklisten für Datensicherheit und Authentifizierung bereitzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar varreduras de segurança automatizadas usando scripts Python, validando princípios de segurança e verificando as vulnerabilidades do OWASP Top 10, e fornecendo listas de verificação de proteção de dados e autenticação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять автоматические проверки безопасности с использованием скриптов Python, проверяя принципы безопасности и выявляя уязвимости из OWASP Top 10, а также предоставляя чек-листы защиты данных и аутентификации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل فحوصات أمنية خودمية باستخدام البرامج النصية Python، والتحقق من مبدأ الأمن والتحقق من نقاط الضعف في قائمة OWASP Top 10، وتوفير قوائم التحقق من حماية البيانات والتحقق من الصحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating vulnerability assessments for project repositories","Validating security principles applied in agent workflows","Generating compliance reports based on OWASP checklists"],"zh":["自动化项目仓库的漏洞评估","验证代理工作流中应用的安全原则","根据OWASP检查清单生成合规报告"],"ja":["プロジェクトリポジトリの脆弱性評価の自動化","エージェントワークフローで適用されたセキュリティ原則の検証","OWASPチェックリストに基づくコンプライアンスレポートの生成"],"ko":["프로젝트 저장소의 취약점 평가 자동화","에이전트 워크플로에서 적용된 보안 원칙 검증","OWASP 체크리스트를 기준으로 한 컴플라이언스 보고서 생성"],"es":["Automatizar evaluaciones de vulnerabilidades para repositorios de proyectos","Validar principios de seguridad aplicados en flujos de trabajo de agentes","Generar informes de cumplimiento basados en listas de verificación de OWASP"],"fr":["Automatiser les évaluations de vulnérabilités pour les référentiels de projets","Valider les principes de sécurité appliqués dans les flux de travail des agents","Générer des rapports de conformité basés sur les listes de vérification d''OWASP"],"de":["Automatisierung von Schwachstellentests für Projekt-Repositorys","Validierung von Sicherheitsgrundsätzen in Agenten-Workflows","Erstellung von Konformitätsberichten auf Basis von OWASP-Checklisten"],"pt":["Automatizar avaliações de vulnerabilidades para repositórios de projetos","Validar princípios de segurança aplicados em fluxos de trabalho de agentes","Gerar relatórios de conformidade com base em listas de verificação do OWASP"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценку уязвимостей для репозиториев проектов","Проверять принципы безопасности, применяемые в рабочих процессах агентов","Генерировать отчеты о соответствии на основе чек-листов OWASP"],"ar":["تحسين التقييم التلقائي لنقاط الضعف لمخازن المشاريع","التحقق من مبادئ الأمن المطبقة في تدفقات عمل الوكلاء","توليد تقارير التوافق على أساس قوائم التحقق من OWASP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x environment","Limited to scanning Python-based projects","Dependent on OWASP Top 10 and other reference checklists for validation"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x环境","仅限于扫描基于Python的项目","依赖于OWASP Top 10和其他参考检查清单进行验证"],"ja":["Python 3.x環境が必要","Pythonベースのプロジェクトのみをスキャン","OWASP Top 10およびその他の参考チェックリストに依存して検証"],"ko":["파이썬 3.x 환경이 필요","파이썬 기반 프로젝트만을 스캔","OWASP Top 10 및 기타 参考 체크리스트에 의존하여 검증"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python 3.x","Limitado a la exploración de proyectos basados en Python","Dependiente de las listas de verificación de OWASP Top 10 y otras referencias para la validación"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python 3.x","Limité à la analyse de projets basés sur Python","Dépendant des listes de vérification d''OWASP Top 10 et d''autres références pour la validation"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Python-basierten Projekten","Abhängig von den OWASP-Top-10- und anderen Referenz-Checklisten für die Validierung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python 3.x","Limitado à digitalização de projetos baseados em Python","Dependente das listas de referência do OWASP Top 10 e outras para validação"],"ru":["Требует среды Python 3.x","Ограничен сканированием проектов на основе Python","Зависит от справочных списков OWASP Top 10 и других для проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python 3.x","محدود بالمسح الضوئي لمشاريع تعتمد على Python","يعتمد على قوائم المراجع من OWASP Top 10 وغيرها للتحقق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
