مكن من تشغيل المهام بصور أكثر كفاءة","متوافقة مع Claude Code","سهلة الاستخدام والتنفيذ","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP CLI脚本","开发效率","tsx开发环境","命令行工具","MCP服务器","开发生产力"],"ja":["MCP CLIスクリプト","開発効率","tsx開発環境","コマンドラインツール","MCPサーバー","開発生産性"],"ko":["MCP CLI 스크립트","개발 효율성","tsx 개발 환경","명령줄 도구","MCP 서버","개발 생산성"],"es":["scripts de CLI de MCP","servidores MCP","Claude Code","tsx","terminal","funcionalidad extendida","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["scripts CLI MCP","serveurs MCP","Claude Code","tsx","terminal","fonctionnalité étendue","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["MCP-CLI-Skripte","MCP-Server","Claude Code","tsx","Terminal","erweiterte Funktionalität","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["scripts CLI MCP","ferramentas de linha de comando","desenvolvedores","produtividade","funcionalidades estendidas","ambientes de terminal","Claude Code"],"ru":["скрипты MCP CLI","инструменты командной строки","разработчики","производительность","расширенные функции","терминальные среды","Claude Code"],"ar":["سكريبتات CLI MCP","أدوات سطر الأوامر","مطورين","إنتاجية","وظائف موسعة","بيئات الطرفية","Claude Code"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-cli-scripts","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# MCP CLI Scripts Pattern\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-09\n**Dependencies**: tsx (dev dependency)\n**Current Versions**: tsx@4.21.0\n\n---\n\n## Why CLI Scripts Alongside MCP Servers?\n\nWhen building MCP servers, also create companion CLI scripts that provide the same (and often extended) functionality for use with Claude Code in terminal environments.\n\n| Aspect | Remote MCP (Claude.ai) | CLI Scripts (Claude Code) |\n|--------|------------------------|-------------------------","body":"# MCP CLI Scripts Pattern\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-09\n**Dependencies**: tsx (dev dependency)\n**Current Versions**: tsx@4.21.0\n\n---\n\n## Why CLI Scripts Alongside MCP Servers?\n\nWhen building MCP servers, also create companion CLI scripts that provide the same (and often extended) functionality for use with Claude Code in terminal environments.\n\n| Aspect | Remote MCP (Claude.ai) | CLI Scripts (Claude Code) |\n|--------|------------------------|---------------------------|\n| Context | Results flow through model context window | Results stay local, only relevant parts shared |\n| File System | No access | Full read/write access |\n| Batch Operations | One call at a time | Can process files of inputs |\n| Caching | Stateless | Can cache results locally |\n| Output | JSON to model | JSON, CSV, table, file, or stdout |\n| Chaining | Model orchestrates | Scripts can pipe/chain directly |\n\n---\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nmcp-{name}/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts              # MCP server (for Claude.ai, remote clients)\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── {tool-name}.ts        # One script per tool\n│   ├── {another-tool}.ts\n│   └── _shared.ts            # Shared auth/config helpers (optional)\n├── SCRIPTS.md                # Documents available scripts for Claude Code\n├── package.json\n└── README.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## The 5 Design Principles\n\n### 1. One Script Per Tool\n\nEach script does one thing well, matching an MCP tool but with extended capabilities.\n\n### 2. JSON Output by Default\n\nScripts output JSON to stdout for easy parsing. Claude Code can read and use the results.\n\n```typescript\n// Good - structured output\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({ success: true, data: result }, null, 2));\n\n// Avoid - unstructured text (unless --format text requested)\nconsole.log(\"Found 5 results:\");\n```\n\n### 3. Extended Capabilities for Local Use\n\nCLI scripts can offer features that don''t make sense for remote MCP:\n\n```typescript\n// Input/Output files\n--input data.csv          // Batch process from file\n--output results.json     // Save results to file\n--append                  // Append to existing file\n\n// Caching\n--cache                   // Use local cache\n--cache-ttl 3600          // Cache for 1 hour\n--no-cache                // Force fresh request\n\n// Output formats\n--format json|csv|table   // Different output formats\n--quiet                   // Suppress non-essential output\n--verbose                 // Extra debugging info\n\n// Batch operations\n--batch                   // Process multiple items\n--concurrency 5           // Parallel processing limit\n```\n\n### 4. Consistent Argument Patterns\n\nUse consistent patterns across all scripts:\n\n```bash\n# Standard patterns\n--input <file>            # Read input from file\n--output <file>           # Write output to file\n--format <type>           # Output format\n--profile <name>          # Auth profile (for multi-account)\n--verbose                 # Debug output\n--help                    # Show usage\n```\n\n### 5. Shebang and Direct Execution\n\nScripts should be directly executable:\n\n```typescript\n#!/usr/bin/env npx tsx\n/**\n * Brief description of what this script does\n *\n * Usage:\n *   npx tsx scripts/tool-name.ts <required-arg>\n *   npx tsx scripts/tool-name.ts --option value\n *\n * Examples:\n *   npx tsx scripts/tool-name.ts 12345\n *   npx tsx scripts/tool-name.ts --input batch.csv --output results.json\n */\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Use `#!/usr/bin/env npx tsx` shebang (not node or ts-node)\n✅ Output JSON to stdout by default\n✅ Use consistent argument patterns across all scripts\n✅ Document scripts in SCRIPTS.md\n✅ Handle errors with structured JSON: `{ success: false, error: \"...\" }`\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `console.log()` for prose output (use structured JSON)\n❌ Use different argument patterns per script\n❌ Forget to document the script in SCRIPTS.md\n❌ Use `node` or `ts-node` in shebang (tsx handles ESM+TypeScript)\n\n---\n\n## When to Use Scripts vs MCP\n\n**Use CLI scripts when:**\n- Working in terminal/Claude Code environment\n- Need to save results to files\n- Processing batch inputs from files\n- Chaining multiple operations\n- Need caching for repeated lookups\n- Want richer output formats\n\n**Use MCP tools when:**\n- In Claude.ai web interface\n- Simple one-off lookups\n- No file I/O needed\n- Building conversational flows\n\n---\n\n## Shared Code Between MCP and Scripts\n\nIf you want to share logic between MCP and scripts, extract to a core module:\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── core/\n│   ├── lookup.ts         # Pure function, no I/O assumptions\n│   └── index.ts          # Export all core functions\n├── mcp/\n│   └── index.ts          # MCP handlers, import from core\n└── cli/\n    └── lookup.ts         # CLI wrapper, import from core\n```\n\nHowever, keeping them separate is also fine - the scripts may evolve to have capabilities the MCP can''t support, and that''s okay.\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n**script-template.ts**: Complete TypeScript script template with argument parsing, JSON output, and file I/O patterns.\n\n```bash\n# Copy to your project\ncp ~/.claude/skills/mcp-cli-scripts/templates/script-template.ts scripts/new-tool.ts\n```\n\n**SCRIPTS-TEMPLATE.md**: Template for documenting available scripts in an MCP server repo.\n\n```bash\n# Copy to your project\ncp ~/.claude/skills/mcp-cli-scripts/templates/SCRIPTS-TEMPLATE.md SCRIPTS.md\n```\n\n### Rules (rules/)\n\n**mcp-cli-scripts.md**: Correction rules for script files. Copy to `.claude/rules/` in projects:\n\n```bash\ncp ~/.claude/skills/mcp-cli-scripts/rules/mcp-cli-scripts.md .claude/rules/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required**:\n- tsx@4.21.0 - TypeScript execution without compilation\n\nAdd to package.json:\n```json\n{\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.21.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **tsx**: https://github.com/privatenumber/tsx\n- **Node.js CLI**: https://nodejs.org/api/cli.html\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-09)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.21.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\n- [ ] Create `scripts/` directory in MCP server project\n- [ ] Add tsx to devDependencies\n- [ ] Create first script from template\n- [ ] Create SCRIPTS.md from template\n- [ ] Test script: `npx tsx scripts/tool-name.ts --help`\n- [ ] Verify JSON output format\n- [ ] Document all scripts in SCRIPTS.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:56:32.093Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Terminal-based Agents needing extended functionality with Claude Code and MCP servers.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Claude Code 和 MCP 服务器的基于终端的代理扩展功能。","ja":"Claude Code および MCP サーバーを使用して拡張機能を必要とするターミナルベースのエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클로드 코드 및 MCP 서버를 사용하여 확장 기능을 필요한 터미널 기반 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en terminal que necesitan funcionalidades extendidas con Claude Code y servidores MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur terminal nécessitant des fonctionnalités étendues avec Claude Code et des serveurs MCP.","de":"Perfekt für Terminal-basierte Agenten, die erweiterte Funktionalitäten mit Claude Code und MCP-Servern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em Terminal que necessitam de funcionalidades estendidas com Claude Code e servidores MCP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, основанных на терминале, которым необходимы расширенные функции с Claude Code и серверами MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Terminal الذي يحتاج إلى وظائف موسعة مع Claude Code وخوادم MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute MCP CLI scripts alongside MCP servers, providing the same and often extended functionality for use with Claude Code in terminal environments, leveraging dependencies like tsx for development.","zh":"赋予代理在终端环境中执行 MCP CLI 脚本的能力，提供与 MCP 服务器相同且经常扩展的功能，用于与 Claude Code 一起使用，利用 tsx 等依赖项进行开发。","ja":"エージェントがターミナル環境で MCP CLI スクリプトを実行する機能を提供し、MCP サーバーと同等の機能、および Claude Code を使用してよく拡張された機能を提供し、開発のために tsx などの依存関係を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 터미널 환경에서 MCP CLI 스크립트를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 MCP 서버와 동일한 기능 및 클로드 코드를 사용하여 자주 확장된 기능을 제공하며, 개발을 위해 tsx와 같은 종속성을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar scripts de CLI de MCP junto con los servidores MCP, proporcionando la misma y a menudo funcionalidad extendida para su uso con Claude Code en entornos de terminal, aprovechando dependencias como tsx para el desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des scripts CLI MCP aux côtés des serveurs MCP, fournissant la même et souvent une fonctionnalité étendue pour une utilisation avec Claude Code dans des environnements de terminal, en exploitant des dépendances comme tsx pour le développement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, MCP-CLI-Skripte neben MCP-Servern auszuführen, wodurch dieselbe und oft erweiterte Funktionalität für die Verwendung mit Claude Code in Terminalumgebungen bereitgestellt wird, indem Abhängigkeiten wie tsx für die Entwicklung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar scripts CLI MCP ao lado dos servidores MCP, fornecendo a mesma funcionalidade e, muitas vezes, funcionalidade estendida para uso com Claude Code em ambientes de terminal, aproveitando dependências como tsx para desenvolvimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять скрипты CLI MCP наряду с серверами MCP, предоставляя те же и часто расширенные функции для использования с Claude Code в терминальных средах, используя зависимости, такие как tsx, для разработки.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل نصوص MCP CLI إلى جانب خوادم MCP، مع تقديم نفس الوظائف وأحيانًا وظائف موسعة لاستخدامها مع Claude Code في بيئات الطرفية، واستخدام التبعيات مثل tsx للتنمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating companion CLI scripts for MCP servers","Extending MCP server functionality with Claude Code","Automating tasks with CLI scripts in terminal environments"],"zh":["为 MCP 服务器创建伴侣 CLI 脚本","使用 Claude Code 扩展 MCP 服务器功能","在终端环境中使用 CLI 脚本自动执行任务"],"ja":["MCP サーバー用のコンパニオン CLI スクリプトを作成する","Claude Code を使用して MCP サーバーの機能を拡張する","ターミナル環境で CLI スクリプトを使用してタスクを自動化する"],"ko":["MCP 서버를 위한 동반 CLI 스크립트 만들기","클로드 코드를 사용하여 MCP 서버 기능 확장","터미널 환경에서 CLI 스크립트를 사용하여 태스크 자동화"],"es":["Crear scripts de CLI de acompañamiento para servidores MCP","Extender la funcionalidad del servidor MCP con Claude Code","Automatizar tareas con scripts de CLI en entornos de terminal"],"fr":["Créer des scripts CLI de compagnon pour les serveurs MCP","Étendre la fonctionnalité du serveur MCP avec Claude Code","Automatiser des tâches avec des scripts CLI dans des environnements de terminal"],"de":["Erstellen von Begleit-CLI-Skripten für MCP-Server","Erweitern der Funktionalität des MCP-Servers mit Claude Code","Automatisieren von Aufgaben mit CLI-Skripten in Terminalumgebungen"],"pt":["Criar scripts CLI companion para servidores MCP","Estender a funcionalidade do servidor MCP com Claude Code","Automatizar tarefas com scripts CLI em ambientes de terminal"],"ru":["Создание компаньонских скриптов CLI для серверов MCP","Расширение функциональности сервера MCP с помощью Claude Code","Автоматизация задач с помощью скриптов CLI в терминальных средах"],"ar":["إنشاء نصوص CLI مصاحبة لخوادم MCP","تمديد وظائف خادم MCP مع Claude Code","توفير المهام مع نصوص CLI في بيئات الطرفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires tsx as a dev dependency","Compatibility limited to specific versions of tsx (e.g., tsx@4.21.0)"],"zh":["需要 tsx 作为开发依赖项","兼容性仅限于 tsx 的特定版本（例如 tsx@4.21.0）"],"ja":["開発の依存関係として tsx が必要","tsx の特定のバージョン（たとえば tsx@4.21.0）のみと互換性がある"],"ko":["개발 종속성으로 tsx 필요","tsx의 특정 버전(예: tsx@4.21.0)과의 호환성만 제한"],"es":["Requiere tsx como dependencia de desarrollo","Compatibilidad limitada a versiones específicas de tsx (por ejemplo, tsx@4.21.0)"],"fr":["Nécessite tsx comme dépendance de développement","Compatibilité limitée à des versions spécifiques de tsx (par exemple, tsx@4.21.0)"],"de":["Benötigt tsx als Entwicklungsabhängigkeit","Kompatibilität auf bestimmte Versionen von tsx beschränkt (z. B. tsx@4.21.0)"],"pt":["Requer tsx como dependência de desenvolvimento","Compatibilidade limitada a versões específicas de tsx (por exemplo, tsx@4.21.0)"],"ru":["Требует tsx в качестве зависимости для разработки","Совместимость ограничена конкретными версиями tsx (например, tsx@4.21.0)"],"ar":["يتطلب tsx كاعتمادية لتنمية","التوافق مقيد بالإصدارات المحددة من tsx (على سبيل المثال، tsx@4.21.0)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
