lladores mejorar su productividad y eficiencia","fr":"Les compétences de superpuissance dans Claude Code permettent aux développeurs d''améliorer leur productivité et leur efficacité","de":"Die Superkräfte-Fähigkeiten in Claude Code ermöglichen es Entwicklern, ihre Produktivität und Effizienz zu steigern","pt":"O Skill using-superpowers é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a usá-la para melhorar sua produtividade e eficiência.","ru":"Навык using-superpowers является мощным инструментом для разработчиков. Узнайте, как использовать его для улучшения своей производительности и эффективности.","ar":"المهارة using-superpowers هي أداة قوية للمطورين. تعلم كيفية استخدامها لتحسين إنتاجيتك وفعاليتك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["必须使用相关技能","提高开发效率","开发过程中必不可少","使用方法简单易懂","开发者必备技能"],"ja":["関連スキルを必ず使用","開発の効率を上げる","開発の際に必不可欠","使用方法が簡単","開発者必須スキル"],"ko":["관련 스킬을 반드시 사용","개발 효율을 높임","개발 과정에서 필수","사용 방법이 간단","개발자必备 스킬"],"es":["Mejora de la productividad","Acceso a habilidades avanzadas","Integración con Claude Code","Uso obligatorio cuando aplicable","Presentación de contenido de habilidad","Seguimiento directo de la habilidad"],"fr":["Amélioration de la productivité","Accès à des compétences avancées","Intégration à Claude Code","Utilisation obligatoire lorsqu''elle s''applique","Présentation du contenu de la compétence","Suivi direct de la compétence"],"de":["Steigerung der Produktivität","Zugriff auf erweiterte Fähigkeiten","Integration in Claude Code","Verpflichtende Verwendung wenn anwendbar","Präsentation von Fähigkeitsinhalten","Direktes Befolgen der Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Acesso a ferramentas avançadas","Melhoria da produtividade","Eficiência aumentada","Desenvolvimento acelerado","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Доступ к продвинутым инструментам","Улучшение производительности","Повышение эффективности","Ускорение разработки","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["الوصول إلى أدوات متقدمة","تحسين الإنتاجية","زيادة الفعالية","تسريع التطوير","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["超能力技能","开发效率","开发过程","必备技能","开发者工具","提高生产力"],"ja":["スーパーパワースキル","開発効率","開発プロセス","必須スキル","開発者ツール","生産性の向上"],"ko":["슈퍼파워 스킬","개발 효율","개발 과정","필수 스킬","개발자 도구","생산성 향상"],"es":["habilidades de superpoder","desarrollo de software","productividad del desarrollador","Claude Code","mejora de la eficiencia","competencias avanzadas"],"fr":["compétences de superpuissance","développement de logiciels","productivité du développeur","Claude Code","amélioration de l''efficacité","compétences avancées"],"de":["Superkräfte-Fähigkeiten","Software-Entwicklung","Entwickler-Produktivität","Claude Code","Effizienzsteigerung","erweiterte Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","eficiência","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Claude Code","using-superpowers"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","эффективность","инструменты разработки","Claude Code","using-superpowers"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","الفعالية","أدوات التطوير","Claude Code","using-superpowers"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-superpowers","description":"Use when starting any conversation - establishes how to find and use skills, requiring Skill tool invocation before ANY response including clarifying questions","bodyPreview":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n**In Claude Code:** Use the `Skill` tool. When you invoke a skill, its content is loaded and presented to you—follow it directly. Never use","body":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n**In Claude Code:** Use the `Skill` tool. When you invoke a skill, its content is loaded and presented to you—follow it directly. Never use the Read tool on skill files.\n\n**In other environments:** Check your platform''s documentation for how skills are loaded.\n\n# Using Skills\n\n## The Rule\n\n**Invoke relevant or requested skills BEFORE any response or action.** Even a 1% chance a skill might apply means that you should invoke the skill to check. If an invoked skill turns out to be wrong for the situation, you don''t need to use it.\n\n```dot\ndigraph skill_flow {\n    \"User message received\" [shape=doublecircle];\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Invoke Skill tool\" [shape=box];\n    \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\" [shape=box];\n    \"Has checklist?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" [shape=box];\n    \"Follow skill exactly\" [shape=box];\n    \"Respond (including clarifications)\" [shape=doublecircle];\n\n    \"User message received\" -> \"Might any skill apply?\";\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" -> \"Invoke Skill tool\" [label=\"yes, even 1%\"];\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" -> \"Respond (including clarifications)\" [label=\"definitely not\"];\n    \"Invoke Skill tool\" -> \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\";\n    \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\" -> \"Has checklist?\";\n    \"Has checklist?\" -> \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Has checklist?\" -> \"Follow skill exactly\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" -> \"Follow skill exactly\";\n}\n```\n\n## Red Flags\n\nThese thoughts mean STOP—you''re rationalizing:\n\n| Thought | Reality |\n|---------|---------|\n| \"This is just a simple question\" | Questions are tasks. Check for skills. |\n| \"I need more context first\" | Skill check comes BEFORE clarifying questions. |\n| \"Let me explore the codebase first\" | Skills tell you HOW to explore. Check first. |\n| \"I can check git/files quickly\" | Files lack conversation context. Check for skills. |\n| \"Let me gather information first\" | Skills tell you HOW to gather information. |\n| \"This doesn''t need a formal skill\" | If a skill exists, use it. |\n| \"I remember this skill\" | Skills evolve. Read current version. |\n| \"This doesn''t count as a task\" | Action = task. Check for skills. |\n| \"The skill is overkill\" | Simple things become complex. Use it. |\n| \"I''ll just do this one thing first\" | Check BEFORE doing anything. |\n| \"This feels productive\" | Undisciplined action wastes time. Skills prevent this. |\n| \"I know what that means\" | Knowing the concept ≠ using the skill. Invoke it. |\n\n## Skill Priority\n\nWhen multiple skills could apply, use this order:\n\n1. **Process skills first** (brainstorming, debugging) - these determine HOW to approach the task\n2. **Implementation skills second** (frontend-design, mcp-builder) - these guide execution\n\n\"Let''s build X\" → brainstorming first, then implementation skills.\n\"Fix this bug\" → debugging first, then domain-specific skills.\n\n## Skill Types\n\n**Rigid** (TDD, debugging): Follow exactly. Don''t adapt away discipline.\n\n**Flexible** (patterns): Adapt principles to context.\n\nThe skill itself tells you which.\n\n## User Instructions\n\nInstructions say WHAT, not HOW. \"Add X\" or \"Fix Y\" doesn''t mean skip workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:57:00.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Compliance Agents enforcing mandatory skill invocation protocols in Claude Code environments.","zh":"适用于强制执行必要技能调用协议的合规代理在 Claude Code 环境中的基本要求。","ja":"Claude Code 環境で必須のスキル呼び出しプロトコルを強制するコンプライアンス エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"클라우드 코드 환경에서 필수적인 스킬 호출 프로토콜을 적용하는 컴플라이언스 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de cumplimiento que aplican protocolos de invocación de habilidades obligatorias en entornos de Claude Code.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de conformité qui appliquent des protocoles d''invocation de compétences obligatoires dans les environnements Claude Code.","de":"Wesentlich für Compliance-Agents, die obligatorische Skill-Aufrufprotokolle in Claude-Code-Umgebungen durchsetzen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Conformidade que aplicam protocolos de invocação de habilidades obrigatórias em ambientes de Claude Code.","ru":"Необходим для агентов соблюдения требований, обеспечивающих обязательное вызов навыков в средах Claude Code.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء المتوافقين الذين يفرضون بروتوكولات استدعاء المهارات الإلزامية في بيئات Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces absolute mandatory skill invocation when any relevance threshold is met, eliminating agent discretion. Provides direct Claude Code Skill tool integration with automatic content loading and execution protocols for compliant operations.","zh":"在任何相关性阈值达到时强制执行绝对必需的技能调用，消除代理人的自由裁量。提供直接的 Claude Code 技能工具集成，具有自动内容加载和执行协议，用于合规操作。","ja":"関連性しきい値が満たされたときに絶対必須のスキル呼び出しを強制実行し、エージェントの裁量を排除します。コンプライアントな操作のための自動コンテンツの読み込みと実行プロトコルを備えた、Claude Code スキルツールとの直接的な統合を提供します。","ko":"관련성 임계값에 도달할 때 절대적으로 필수적인 스킬 호출을 강제로 실행하여 에이전트의 재량을 제거합니다. 규정 준수 작업을 위한 자동 컨텐츠 로딩 및 실행 프로토콜을 갖춘 Claude Code 스킬 도구와의 직접적인 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Aplica la invocación de habilidades absolutamente obligatoria cuando se cumple cualquier umbral de relevancia, eliminando el discernimiento del agente. Proporciona integración directa de herramientas de habilidades de Claude Code con protocolos de carga y ejecución de contenido automáticos para operaciones cumplidoras.","fr":"Applique l''invocation de compétences absolument obligatoire lorsque tout seuil de pertinence est atteint, éliminant la discrétion de l''agent. Fournit une intégration directe des outils de compétences Claude Code avec des protocoles de chargement et d''exécution de contenu automatiques pour des opérations conformes.","de":"Zwingt die absolute obligatorische Fertigkeitsanwendung auf, wenn ein beliebiger Relevanzschwellenwert erreicht wird, wodurch die Ermessensspielräume des Agents eliminiert werden. Bietet direkte Integration von Claude-Code-Fertigkeitstools mit automatischen Inhaltsladeprotokollen und Ausführungsprotokollen für konforme Betriebsabläufe.","pt":"Exige a invocação absoluta de habilidades obrigatórias quando qualquer limite de relevância é atingido, eliminando a discrição do agente. Fornece integração direta da ferramenta de habilidades Claude Code com protocolos de carregamento e execução de conteúdo automáticos para operações conformes.","ru":"Обеспечивает абсолютное обязательное вызов навыков при достижении любого порога релевантности, исключая дискрецию агента. Предоставляет прямую интеграцию инструмента навыков Claude Code с автоматическими протоколами загрузки и выполнения контента для соответствующих операций.","ar":"يفرض استدعاء المهارات الإلزامية المطلق عند بلوغ أي حد من حدود الأهمية، مما ي消除 إمكانية اتخاذ القرارات من قبل الوكيل. يوفر تكاملًا مباشرًا لأداة مهارات Claude Code مع بروتوكولات تحميل المحتوى وتشغيلها التلقائية لعمليات متوافقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing compliance protocols in Claude Code","Automating mandatory skill invocation decisions","Processing skill-relevant tasks without agent discretion"],"zh":["在 Claude Code 中执行合规协议","自动化强制性技能调用决策","在不需要代理人自由裁量的情况下处理与技能相关的任务"],"ja":["Claude Code でコンプライアンス プロトコルを実施する","必須のスキル呼び出し決定を自動化する","エージェントの裁量なしでスキル関連タスクを処理する"],"ko":["클라우드 코드에서 컴플라이언스 프로토콜을 수행하는 것","필수적인 스킬 호출 결정을 자동화하는 것","에이전트의 재량 없이 스킬 관련 작업을 처리하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar protocolos de cumplimiento en Claude Code","Automatizar decisiones de invocación de habilidades obligatorias","Procesar tareas relevantes para las habilidades sin discreción del agente"],"fr":["Appliquer des protocoles de conformité dans Claude Code","Automatiser les décisions d''invocation de compétences obligatoires","Traiter les tâches pertinentes pour les compétences sans discrétion de l''agent"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Compliance-Protokollen in Claude-Code-Umgebungen","Automatisieren von Entscheidungen zur Aufrufung obligatorischer Fertigkeiten","Verarbeiten von fertigkeitsrelevanten Aufgaben ohne Ermessensspielraum des Agents"],"pt":["Aplicação de protocolos de conformidade em Claude Code","Automatização de decisões de invocação de habilidades obrigatórias","Processamento de tarefas relevantes para habilidades sem discrição do agente"],"ru":["Применение протоколов соблюдения требований в Claude Code","Автоматизация решений о вызове обязательных навыков","Обработка задач, связанных с навыками, без дискреции агента"],"ar":["تطبيق بروتوكولات التوافق في Claude Code","تأتمة قرارات استدعاء المهارات الإلزامية","معالجة المهام ذات الصلة بالمهارات دون إمكانية اتخاذ القرارات من قبل الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Claude Code exclusive implementation","Requires Skill tool access","No applicability threshold flexibility"],"zh":["仅限 Claude Code 的实现","需要技能工具访问","无应用阈值灵活性"],"ja":["Claude Code 専用実装","スキルツールへのアクセスが必要","適用しきい値の柔軟性なし"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 전용 구현","스킬 도구 액세스가 필요","적용 임계값 유연성 없음"],"es":["Implementación exclusiva de Claude Code","Requiere acceso a la herramienta de habilidades","No hay flexibilidad en el umbral de aplicabilidad"],"fr":["Implémentation exclusive de Claude Code","Nécessite un accès à l''outil de compétences","Pas de flexibilité dans le seuil d''applicabilité"],"de":["Exklusive Implementierung von Claude Code","Erfordert Zugriff auf das Fertigkeitstool","Keine Flexibilität bei der Anwendbarkeitsschwelle"],"pt":["Implementação exclusiva de Claude Code","Requer acesso à ferramenta de habilidades","Nenhuma flexibilidade no limiar de aplicabilidade"],"ru":["Эксклюзивная реализация в Claude Code","Требуется доступ к инструменту навыков","Нет гибкости в пороге применения"],"ar":["تنفيذ حصرية لبرنامج Claude Code","يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة المهارات","لا مرونة في عتبة التطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
