 GitLab Runners"],"ru":["Организация стадий конвейера","Кэширование и оптимизация производительности","Стратегии развертывания в Kubernetes","Реализация рабочих процессов GitOps","Автоматизация тестирования и сборки приложений","Интеграция с GitLab Runners"],"ar":["تنظيم مراحل خط الأنابيب","التخزين المؤقت وتحسين الأداء","استراتيجيات نشر إلى Kubernetes","تنفيذ سير عمل GitOps","الاختبارات الآلية والبناء للتطبيقات","التكامل مع GitLab Runners"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitLab CI","CI/CD"," ","Kubernetes","GitOps"," "," "],"ja":["GitLab CI","CI/CD","","Kubernetes","GitOps","",""],"ko":["GitLab CI","CI/CD"," ","Kubernetes","GitOps"," "," "],"es":["GitLab CI","pipelines de CI/CD","automatización de pruebas","compilación automática","despliegue en Kubernetes","GitOps","patrones de GitLab CI","estrategias de caché","organización de etapas de pipeline"],"fr":["GitLab CI","pipelines de CI/CD","automatisation des tests","construction automatique","déploiement sur Kubernetes","GitOps","modèles de GitLab CI","stratégies de cache","organisation des étapes de pipeline"],"de":["GitLab CI","CI/CD-Pipelines","Automatisierung von Tests","Automatisierung von Builds","Deployment in Kubernetes","GitOps","GitLab CI-Muster","Cachestrategien","Organisierung von Pipeline-Stufen"],"pt":["GitLab CI","Pipeline de CI/CD","Automatização de testes","Build e deploy de aplicações","Kubernetes","GitOps","GitLab Runners","Desenvolvimento de software","Engenharia de software"],"ru":["GitLab CI","Конвейер CI/CD","Автоматизация тестирования","Сборка и развертывание приложений","Kubernetes","GitOps","GitLab Runners","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["GitLab CI","خط أنابيب CI/CD","الاختبارات الآلية","بناء ونشر التطبيقات","Kubernetes","GitOps","GitLab Runners","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gitlab-ci-patterns","description":"Build GitLab CI/CD pipelines with multi-stage workflows, caching, and distributed runners for scalable automation. Use when implementing GitLab CI/CD, optimizing pipeline performance, or setting up automated testing and deployment.","bodyPreview":"# GitLab CI Patterns\n\nComprehensive GitLab CI/CD pipeline patterns for automated testing, building, and deployment.\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate efficient GitLab CI pipelines with proper stage organization, caching, and deployment strategies.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Automate GitLab-based CI/CD\n- Implement multi-stage pipelines\n- Configure GitLab Runners\n- Deploy to Kubernetes from GitLab\n- Implement GitOps workflows\n\n## Basic Pipeline Structure\n\n```yaml\nstages:\n  - build\n  - test\n  - deploy\n\nvariables:\n  DOCK","body":"# GitLab CI Patterns\n\nComprehensive GitLab CI/CD pipeline patterns for automated testing, building, and deployment.\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate efficient GitLab CI pipelines with proper stage organization, caching, and deployment strategies.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Automate GitLab-based CI/CD\n- Implement multi-stage pipelines\n- Configure GitLab Runners\n- Deploy to Kubernetes from GitLab\n- Implement GitOps workflows\n\n## Basic Pipeline Structure\n\n```yaml\nstages:\n  - build\n  - test\n  - deploy\n\nvariables:\n  DOCKER_DRIVER: overlay2\n  DOCKER_TLS_CERTDIR: \"/certs\"\n\nbuild:\n  stage: build\n  image: node:20\n  script:\n    - npm ci\n    - npm run build\n  artifacts:\n    paths:\n      - dist/\n    expire_in: 1 hour\n  cache:\n    key: ${CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG}\n    paths:\n      - node_modules/\n\ntest:\n  stage: test\n  image: node:20\n  script:\n    - npm ci\n    - npm run lint\n    - npm test\n  coverage: ''/Lines\\s*:\\s*(\\d+\\.\\d+)%/''\n  artifacts:\n    reports:\n      coverage_report:\n        coverage_format: cobertura\n        path: coverage/cobertura-coverage.xml\n\ndeploy:\n  stage: deploy\n  image: bitnami/kubectl:latest\n  script:\n    - kubectl apply -f k8s/\n    - kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app\n  only:\n    - main\n  environment:\n    name: production\n    url: https://app.example.com\n```\n\n## Docker Build and Push\n\n```yaml\nbuild-docker:\n  stage: build\n  image: docker:24\n  services:\n    - docker:24-dind\n  before_script:\n    - docker login -u $CI_REGISTRY_USER -p $CI_REGISTRY_PASSWORD $CI_REGISTRY\n  script:\n    - docker build -t $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_SHA .\n    - docker build -t $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:latest .\n    - docker push $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_SHA\n    - docker push $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:latest\n  only:\n    - main\n    - tags\n```\n\n## Multi-Environment Deployment\n\n```yaml\n.deploy_template: &deploy_template\n  image: bitnami/kubectl:latest\n  before_script:\n    - kubectl config set-cluster k8s --server=\"$KUBE_URL\" --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true\n    - kubectl config set-credentials admin --token=\"$KUBE_TOKEN\"\n    - kubectl config set-context default --cluster=k8s --user=admin\n    - kubectl config use-context default\n\ndeploy:staging:\n  <<: *deploy_template\n  stage: deploy\n  script:\n    - kubectl apply -f k8s/ -n staging\n    - kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app -n staging\n  environment:\n    name: staging\n    url: https://staging.example.com\n  only:\n    - develop\n\ndeploy:production:\n  <<: *deploy_template\n  stage: deploy\n  script:\n    - kubectl apply -f k8s/ -n production\n    - kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app -n production\n  environment:\n    name: production\n    url: https://app.example.com\n  when: manual\n  only:\n    - main\n```\n\n## Terraform Pipeline\n\n```yaml\nstages:\n  - validate\n  - plan\n  - apply\n\nvariables:\n  TF_ROOT: ${CI_PROJECT_DIR}/terraform\n  TF_VERSION: \"1.6.0\"\n\nbefore_script:\n  - cd ${TF_ROOT}\n  - terraform --version\n\nvalidate:\n  stage: validate\n  image: hashicorp/terraform:${TF_VERSION}\n  script:\n    - terraform init -backend=false\n    - terraform validate\n    - terraform fmt -check\n\nplan:\n  stage: plan\n  image: hashicorp/terraform:${TF_VERSION}\n  script:\n    - terraform init\n    - terraform plan -out=tfplan\n  artifacts:\n    paths:\n      - ${TF_ROOT}/tfplan\n    expire_in: 1 day\n\napply:\n  stage: apply\n  image: hashicorp/terraform:${TF_VERSION}\n  script:\n    - terraform init\n    - terraform apply -auto-approve tfplan\n  dependencies:\n    - plan\n  when: manual\n  only:\n    - main\n```\n\n## Security Scanning\n\n```yaml\ninclude:\n  - template: Security/SAST.gitlab-ci.yml\n  - template: Security/Dependency-Scanning.gitlab-ci.yml\n  - template: Security/Container-Scanning.gitlab-ci.yml\n\ntrivy-scan:\n  stage: test\n  image: aquasec/trivy:latest\n  script:\n    - trivy image --exit-code 1 --severity HIGH,CRITICAL $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_SHA\n  allow_failure: true\n```\n\n## Caching Strategies\n\n```yaml\n# Cache node_modules\nbuild:\n  cache:\n    key: ${CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG}\n    paths:\n      - node_modules/\n    policy: pull-push\n\n# Global cache\ncache:\n  key: ${CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG}\n  paths:\n    - .cache/\n    - vendor/\n\n# Separate cache per job\njob1:\n  cache:\n    key: job1-cache\n    paths:\n      - build/\n\njob2:\n  cache:\n    key: job2-cache\n    paths:\n      - dist/\n```\n\n## Dynamic Child Pipelines\n\n```yaml\ngenerate-pipeline:\n  stage: build\n  script:\n    - python generate_pipeline.py > child-pipeline.yml\n  artifacts:\n    paths:\n      - child-pipeline.yml\n\ntrigger-child:\n  stage: deploy\n  trigger:\n    include:\n      - artifact: child-pipeline.yml\n        job: generate-pipeline\n    strategy: depend\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `assets/gitlab-ci.yml.template` - Complete pipeline template\n- `references/pipeline-stages.md` - Stage organization patterns\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use specific image tags** (node:20, not node:latest)\n2. **Cache dependencies** appropriately\n3. **Use artifacts** for build outputs\n4. **Implement manual gates** for production\n5. **Use environments** for deployment tracking\n6. **Enable merge request pipelines**\n7. **Use pipeline schedules** for recurring jobs\n8. **Implement security scanning**\n9. **Use CI/CD variables** for secrets\n10. **Monitor pipeline performance**\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `github-actions-templates` - For GitHub Actions\n- `deployment-pipeline-design` - For architecture\n- `secrets-management` - For secrets handling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:57:32.102Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing efficient GitLab CI/CD pipeline automation and management.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的GitLab CI/CD管道自动化和管理的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントがGitLab CI/CDパイプラインの自動化と管理を効率的に行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 GitLab CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화 및 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una automatización y gestión eficientes de la canalización de CI/CD de GitLab.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une automatisation et d''une gestion efficaces de la canalisation de CI/CD de GitLab.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine effiziente Automatisierung und Verwaltung von GitLab CI/CD-Pipelines benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que necessitam de automação e gestão eficientes de pipelines GitLab CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходима эффективная автоматизация и управление конвейерами GitLab CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديڤوبس الذي يحتاج إلى آليّة و إدارة كفؤة لخطوط أنابيب جيت لاب سي/سي دي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create efficient GitLab CI pipelines with proper stage organization, caching, and deployment strategies using YAML configurations and GitLab Runners, facilitating automated testing, building, and deployment to Kubernetes.","zh":"赋予代理创建高效的GitLab CI管道的能力，具有适当的阶段组织、缓存和部署策略，使用YAML配置和GitLab Runner，促进自动化测试、构建和部署到Kubernetes。","ja":"エージェントがYAML構成とGitLab Runnerを使用して、適切なステージの組織化、キャッシュ、デプロイ戦略を備えた効率的なGitLab CIパイプラインを作成できるようにします。Kubernetesへの自動テスト、ビルド、デプロイを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 YAML 구성 및 GitLab Runner를 사용하여 효율적인 GitLab CI 파이프라인을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 적절한 단계 조직, 캐싱 및 배포 전략을 사용하여 Kubernetes로 자동화된 테스트, 빌드 및 배포를 촉진합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear canalizaciones de CI de GitLab eficientes con una organización de etapas adecuada, almacenamiento en caché y estrategias de implementación utilizando configuraciones YAML y ejecutores de GitLab, lo que facilita las pruebas automatizadas, la compilación y la implementación en Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des canalizations de CI de GitLab efficaces avec une organisation d''étapes appropriée, un cache et des stratégies de déploiement utilisant des configurations YAML et des exécuteurs GitLab, ce qui facilite les tests automatisés, la construction et le déploiement sur Kubernetes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, effiziente GitLab-CI-Pipelines mit einer geeigneten Stage-Organisation, Caching und Bereitstellungsstrategien unter Verwendung von YAML-Konfigurationen und GitLab-Runnern zu erstellen, was die automatisierte Tests, Erstellung und Bereitstellung in Kubernetes erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar pipelines GitLab CI eficientes com organização de estágios apropriada, cache e estratégias de implantação usando configurações YAML e GitLab Runners, facilitando testes automatizados, compilação e implantação no Kubernetes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать эффективные конвейеры GitLab CI с правильной организацией этапов, кэшированием и стратегиями развертывания с использованием конфигураций YAML и GitLab Runners, что облегчает автоматизированное тестирование, сборку и развертывание в Kubernetes.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء خطوط أنابيب جيت لاب سي آي فعالة مع تنظيم المراحل المناسب و التخزين المؤقت و استراتيجيات النشر باستخدام تكوينات ياميل و جيت لاب رانرز، و تسهيل الاختبارات الآلية و البناء و النشر إلى كوبيرنتس"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitLab-based CI/CD workflows","Implementing multi-stage pipelines for complex projects","Deploying applications to Kubernetes from GitLab","Configuring GitLab Runners for optimized pipeline execution","Implementing GitOps workflows for version-controlled infrastructure"],"zh":["自动化基于GitLab的CI/CD工作流","为复杂项目实施多阶段管道","从GitLab部署应用程序到Kubernetes","配置GitLab Runner以优化管道执行","实施GitOps工作流以进行版本控制的基础设施"],"ja":["GitLabベースのCI/CDワークフローの自動化","複雑なプロジェクトのマルチステージパイプラインの実装","GitLabからKubernetesへのアプリケーションのデプロイ","パイプラインの実行を最適化するためのGitLab Runnerの構成","バージョン管理されたインフラストラクチャのためのGitOpsワークフローの実装"],"ko":["GitLab 기반의 CI/CD 워크플로 자동화","복잡한 프로젝트를 위한 多단계 파이프라인 구현","GitLab에서 Kubernetes로 애플리케이션 배포","파이프라인 실행 최적화를 위한 GitLab Runner 구성","버전 관리 인프라를 위한 GitOps 워크플로 구현"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de CI/CD basados en GitLab","Implementación de canalizaciones multietapa para proyectos complejos","Implementación de aplicaciones en Kubernetes desde GitLab","Configuración de ejecutores de GitLab para una ejecución de canalización optimizada","Implementación de flujos de trabajo de GitOps para infraestructuras controladas por versiones"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de CI/CD basés sur GitLab","Mise en œuvre de canalisations multistages pour des projets complexes","Déploiement d''applications sur Kubernetes à partir de GitLab","Configuration des exécuteurs GitLab pour une exécution de canalisation optimisée","Mise en œuvre de flux de travail de GitOps pour des infrastructures contrôlées par version"],"de":["Automatisierung von CI/CD-Workflows auf Basis von GitLab","Implementierung von Mehrstufen-Pipelines für komplexe Projekte","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen in Kubernetes aus GitLab","Konfiguration von GitLab-Runnern für eine optimierte Pipeline-Ausführung","Implementierung von GitOps-Workflows für versionskontrollierte Infrastrukturen"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD baseados em GitLab","Implementar pipelines multi-etapa para projetos complexos","Implantar aplicações no Kubernetes a partir do GitLab","Configurar GitLab Runners para execução de pipeline otimizada","Implementar fluxos de trabalho de GitOps para infraestrutura controlada por versão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы CI/CD на основе GitLab","Реализовать многоэтапные конвейеры для сложных проектов","Развертывать приложения в Kubernetes из GitLab","Настроить GitLab Runners для оптимизированной выполнения конвейера","Реализовать рабочие процессы GitOps для инфраструктуры с контролем версий"],"ar":["آليّة تدفقات العمل من سي/سي دي القائمة على جيت لاب","تنفيذ خطوط أنابيب متعددة المراحل لمشاريع معقدة","نشر التطبيقات إلى كوبيرنتس من جيت لاب","تكوين جيت لاب رانرز لتنفيذ خطوط أنابيب محسّنة","تنفيذ تدفقات العمل جيت أوبس للبنية التحتية الخاضعة للرقابة الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitLab account and access to GitLab CI/CD","YAML configuration knowledge necessary","Kubernetes deployment requires additional setup"],"zh":["需要GitLab帐户和访问GitLab CI/CD","需要YAML配置知识","Kubernetes部署需要额外的设置"],"ja":["GitLabアカウントとGitLab CI/CDへのアクセスが必要","YAML構成の知識が必要","Kubernetesへのデプロイには追加の設定が必要"],"ko":["GitLab 계정 및 GitLab CI/CD에 접근할 필요가 있음","YAML 구성 지식이 필요함","Kubernetes 배포에는 추가 설정이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de GitLab y acceso a GitLab CI/CD","Conocimiento de configuración YAML necesario","El despliegue en Kubernetes requiere una configuración adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte GitLab et un accès à GitLab CI/CD","Connaissances de configuration YAML nécessaires","Le déploiement sur Kubernetes nécessite une configuration supplémentaire"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitLab-Konto und Zugriff auf GitLab CI/CD","YAML-Konfigurationskenntnisse erforderlich","Die Bereitstellung in Kubernetes erfordert eine zusätzliche Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige conta GitLab e acesso ao GitLab CI/CD","Conhecimento de configuração YAML necessário","Implantação no Kubernetes requer configuração adicional"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи GitLab и доступа к GitLab CI/CD","Необходимо знание конфигурации YAML","Развертывание в Kubernetes требует дополнительной настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب جيت لاب ووصول إلى جيت لاب سي/سي دي","معرفة تكوين ياميل ضرورية","نشر كوبيرنتس يتطلب إعداد إضافي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/secrets-management', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'secrets-management', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z', '2026-02-18T13:57:26.102Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/secrets-management","name":"secrets-management","description":{"zh":"Secrets 管理是指在 CI/CD 管道中安全地存储和管理敏感信息的实践。使用 Vault 和 AWS Secrets Manager 等工具可以实现自动化的密钥轮换和最小权限访问","ja":"シークレツ管理は、CI/CD パイプラインで機密情報を安全に保管および管理するための実践です。Vault や AWS Secrets Manager などのツールを使用すると、自動化されたシークレツのローテーションと最小権限アクセスが実現できます","ko":"시크릿 관리는 CI/CD 파이프라인에서 민감한 정보를 안전하게 저장하고 관리하는 방법입니다. Vault 및 AWS Secrets Manager 등을 사용하면 자동화된 시크릿轮换과 최소 권한 접근이 가능합니다","es":"La gestión de secretos es crucial para proteger datos sensibles en pipelines de CI/CD. Aprende a implementar prácticas seguras con herramientas como Vault y AWS Secrets Manager","fr":"La gestion des secrets est essentielle pour protéger les données sensibles dans les pipelines de CI/CD. Découvrez comment mettre en œuvre des pratiques sécurisées avec des outils comme Vault et AWS Secrets Manager","de":"Die Geheimnisverwaltung ist entscheidend für den Schutz von sensiblen Daten in CI/CD-Pipelines. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sichere Praktiken mit Tools wie Vault und AWS Secrets Manager implementieren","pt":"Gerenciamento de segredos é uma prática essencial para proteger informações sensíveis em pipelines CI/CD. Aprenda a implementar soluções seguras com as principais ferramentas.","ru":"Управление секретами является важной практикой для защиты конфиденциальной информации в конвейерах CI/CD. Узнайте, как реализовать безопасные решения с помощью ведущих инструментов.","ar":"إدارة الأسرار هي ممارسة أساسية لحماية المعلومات الحساسة في أنابيب CI/CD. تعلم كيفية تنفيذ حلول آمنة مع الأدوات الرئيسية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Secrets 管理 - 安全的 CI/CD 管道解决方案","ja":"シークレツ管理 - セキュアな CI/CD パイプライン ソリューション","k