릿 관리","複数의 시크릿 유형 지원","Vault 및 AWS Secrets Manager 통합"],"es":["Almacenamiento centralizado de secretos","Administración de claves API y contraseñas","Gestión de certificados TLS","Rotación automática de secretos","Acceso con privilegios mínimos"],"fr":["Stockage centralisé des secrets","Gestion des clés API et des mots de passe","Gestion des certificats TLS","Rotation automatique des secrets","Accès avec des privilèges minimum"],"de":["Zentralisiertes Speichern von Geheimnissen","Verwaltung von API-Schlüsseln und Passwörtern","Verwaltung von TLS-Zertifikaten","Automatische Rotation von Geheimnissen","Mindestprivilegien-Zugriff"],"pt":["Armazenamento centralizado de segredos","Gestão de chaves de API e credenciais","Manipulação de certificados TLS","Rotação automática de segredos","Implementação de acesso com privilégios mínimos"],"ru":["Централизованное управление секретами","Управление ключами API и учетными данными","Обработка сертификатов TLS","Автоматическое вращение секретов","Реализация доступа с минимальными привилегиями"],"ar":["تخزين مركزي للأسرار","إدارة مفاتيح API والاعتمادات","تعامل مع شهادات TLS","دوران تلقائي للأسرار","تنفيذ الوصول بسلطات 최소"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Secrets 管理","CI/CD 管道","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","自动化密钥轮换","最小权限访问"],"ja":["シークレツ管理","CI/CD パイプライン","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","自動化されたシークレツのローテーション","最小権限アクセス"],"ko":["시크릿 관리","CI/CD 파이프라인","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","자동화된 시크릿轮换","최소 권한 접근"],"es":["gestión de secretos","seguridad de datos","pipelines de CI/CD","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","seguridad de la información","protección de datos","autenticación y autorización"],"fr":["gestion des secrets","sécurité des données","pipelines de CI/CD","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","sécurité de l''information","protection des données","authentification et autorisation"],"de":["Geheimnisverwaltung","Daten-Sicherheit","CI/CD-Pipelines","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","Informationssicherheit","Datenschutz","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de segredos","CI/CD","segurança de pipeline","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","chaves de API","senhas de banco de dados"],"ru":["управление секретами","CI/CD","безопасность конвейера","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","ключи API","пароли баз данных"],"ar":["إدارة الأسرار","CI/CD","أمان الأنابيب","Vault","AWS Secrets Manager","مفاتيح API","كلمات مرور قواعد البيانات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"secrets-management","description":"Implement secure secrets management for CI/CD pipelines using Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, or native platform solutions. Use when handling sensitive credentials, rotating secrets, or securing CI/CD environments.","bodyPreview":"# Secrets Management\n\nSecure secrets management practices for CI/CD pipelines using Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, and other tools.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement secure secrets management in CI/CD pipelines without hardcoding sensitive information.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Store API keys and credentials\n- Manage database passwords\n- Handle TLS certificates\n- Rotate secrets automatically\n- Implement least-privilege access\n\n## Secrets Management Tools\n\n### HashiCorp Vault\n\n- Centralized secrets management\n- Dynam","body":"# Secrets Management\n\nSecure secrets management practices for CI/CD pipelines using Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, and other tools.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement secure secrets management in CI/CD pipelines without hardcoding sensitive information.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Store API keys and credentials\n- Manage database passwords\n- Handle TLS certificates\n- Rotate secrets automatically\n- Implement least-privilege access\n\n## Secrets Management Tools\n\n### HashiCorp Vault\n\n- Centralized secrets management\n- Dynamic secrets generation\n- Secret rotation\n- Audit logging\n- Fine-grained access control\n\n### AWS Secrets Manager\n\n- AWS-native solution\n- Automatic rotation\n- Integration with RDS\n- CloudFormation support\n\n### Azure Key Vault\n\n- Azure-native solution\n- HSM-backed keys\n- Certificate management\n- RBAC integration\n\n### Google Secret Manager\n\n- GCP-native solution\n- Versioning\n- IAM integration\n\n## HashiCorp Vault Integration\n\n### Setup Vault\n\n```bash\n# Start Vault dev server\nvault server -dev\n\n# Set environment\nexport VAULT_ADDR=''http://127.0.0.1:8200''\nexport VAULT_TOKEN=''root''\n\n# Enable secrets engine\nvault secrets enable -path=secret kv-v2\n\n# Store secret\nvault kv put secret/database/config username=admin password=secret\n```\n\n### GitHub Actions with Vault\n\n```yaml\nname: Deploy with Vault Secrets\n\non: [push]\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Import Secrets from Vault\n        uses: hashicorp/vault-action@v2\n        with:\n          url: https://vault.example.com:8200\n          token: ${{ secrets.VAULT_TOKEN }}\n          secrets: |\n            secret/data/database username | DB_USERNAME ;\n            secret/data/database password | DB_PASSWORD ;\n            secret/data/api key | API_KEY\n\n      - name: Use secrets\n        run: |\n          echo \"Connecting to database as $DB_USERNAME\"\n          # Use $DB_PASSWORD, $API_KEY\n```\n\n### GitLab CI with Vault\n\n```yaml\ndeploy:\n  image: vault:latest\n  before_script:\n    - export VAULT_ADDR=https://vault.example.com:8200\n    - export VAULT_TOKEN=$VAULT_TOKEN\n    - apk add curl jq\n  script:\n    - |\n      DB_PASSWORD=$(vault kv get -field=password secret/database/config)\n      API_KEY=$(vault kv get -field=key secret/api/credentials)\n      echo \"Deploying with secrets...\"\n      # Use $DB_PASSWORD, $API_KEY\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/vault-setup.md`\n\n## AWS Secrets Manager\n\n### Store Secret\n\n```bash\naws secretsmanager create-secret \\\n  --name production/database/password \\\n  --secret-string \"super-secret-password\"\n```\n\n### Retrieve in GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\n- name: Configure AWS credentials\n  uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n  with:\n    aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}\n    aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}\n    aws-region: us-west-2\n\n- name: Get secret from AWS\n  run: |\n    SECRET=$(aws secretsmanager get-secret-value \\\n      --secret-id production/database/password \\\n      --query SecretString \\\n      --output text)\n    echo \"::add-mask::$SECRET\"\n    echo \"DB_PASSWORD=$SECRET\" >> $GITHUB_ENV\n\n- name: Use secret\n  run: |\n    # Use $DB_PASSWORD\n    ./deploy.sh\n```\n\n### Terraform with AWS Secrets Manager\n\n```hcl\ndata \"aws_secretsmanager_secret_version\" \"db_password\" {\n  secret_id = \"production/database/password\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_db_instance\" \"main\" {\n  allocated_storage    = 100\n  engine              = \"postgres\"\n  instance_class      = \"db.t3.large\"\n  username            = \"admin\"\n  password            = jsondecode(data.aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db_password.secret_string)[\"password\"]\n}\n```\n\n## GitHub Secrets\n\n### Organization/Repository Secrets\n\n```yaml\n- name: Use GitHub secret\n  run: |\n    echo \"API Key: ${{ secrets.API_KEY }}\"\n    echo \"Database URL: ${{ secrets.DATABASE_URL }}\"\n```\n\n### Environment Secrets\n\n```yaml\ndeploy:\n  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n  environment: production\n  steps:\n    - name: Deploy\n      run: |\n        echo \"Deploying with ${{ secrets.PROD_API_KEY }}\"\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/github-secrets.md`\n\n## GitLab CI/CD Variables\n\n### Project Variables\n\n```yaml\ndeploy:\n  script:\n    - echo \"Deploying with $API_KEY\"\n    - echo \"Database: $DATABASE_URL\"\n```\n\n### Protected and Masked Variables\n\n- Protected: Only available in protected branches\n- Masked: Hidden in job logs\n- File type: Stored as file\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Never commit secrets** to Git\n2. **Use different secrets** per environment\n3. **Rotate secrets regularly**\n4. **Implement least-privilege access**\n5. **Enable audit logging**\n6. **Use secret scanning** (GitGuardian, TruffleHog)\n7. **Mask secrets in logs**\n8. **Encrypt secrets at rest**\n9. **Use short-lived tokens** when possible\n10. **Document secret requirements**\n\n## Secret Rotation\n\n### Automated Rotation with AWS\n\n```python\nimport boto3\nimport json\n\ndef lambda_handler(event, context):\n    client = boto3.client(''secretsmanager'')\n\n    # Get current secret\n    response = client.get_secret_value(SecretId=''my-secret'')\n    current_secret = json.loads(response[''SecretString''])\n\n    # Generate new password\n    new_password = generate_strong_password()\n\n    # Update database password\n    update_database_password(new_password)\n\n    # Update secret\n    client.put_secret_value(\n        SecretId=''my-secret'',\n        SecretString=json.dumps({\n            ''username'': current_secret[''username''],\n            ''password'': new_password\n        })\n    )\n\n    return {''statusCode'': 200}\n```\n\n### Manual Rotation Process\n\n1. Generate new secret\n2. Update secret in secret store\n3. Update applications to use new secret\n4. Verify functionality\n5. Revoke old secret\n\n## External Secrets Operator\n\n### Kubernetes Integration\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1\nkind: SecretStore\nmetadata:\n  name: vault-backend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  provider:\n    vault:\n      server: \"https://vault.example.com:8200\"\n      path: \"secret\"\n      version: \"v2\"\n      auth:\n        kubernetes:\n          mountPath: \"kubernetes\"\n          role: \"production\"\n\n---\napiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1\nkind: ExternalSecret\nmetadata:\n  name: database-credentials\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  refreshInterval: 1h\n  secretStoreRef:\n    name: vault-backend\n    kind: SecretStore\n  target:\n    name: database-credentials\n    creationPolicy: Owner\n  data:\n    - secretKey: username\n      remoteRef:\n        key: database/config\n        property: username\n    - secretKey: password\n      remoteRef:\n        key: database/config\n        property: password\n```\n\n## Secret Scanning\n\n### Pre-commit Hook\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# .git/hooks/pre-commit\n\n# Check for secrets with TruffleHog\ndocker run --rm -v \"$(pwd):/repo\" \\\n  trufflesecurity/trufflehog:latest \\\n  filesystem --directory=/repo\n\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Secret detected! Commit blocked.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### CI/CD Secret Scanning\n\n```yaml\nsecret-scan:\n  stage: security\n  image: trufflesecurity/trufflehog:latest\n  script:\n    - trufflehog filesystem .\n  allow_failure: false\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/vault-setup.md` - HashiCorp Vault configuration\n- `references/github-secrets.md` - GitHub Secrets best practices\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `github-actions-templates` - For GitHub Actions integration\n- `gitlab-ci-patterns` - For GitLab CI integration\n- `deployment-pipeline-design` - For pipeline architecture\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:57:26.102Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-Oriented Agents requiring advanced secrets management capabilities in CI/CD pipelines using tools like HashiCorp Vault and AWS Secrets Manager.","zh":"适合需要在CI/CD管道中使用诸如HashiCorp Vault和AWS Secrets Manager等工具进行高级秘密管理的面向安全的代理。","ja":"CI/CDパイプラインでHashiCorp VaultやAWS Secrets Managerなどのツールを使用して高度なシークレット管理機能を必要とするセキュリティ志向のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"CI/CD 파이프라인에서 HashiCorp Vault 및 AWS Secrets Manager와 같은 도구를 사용하여 고급 시크릿 관리 기능을 요구하는 보안 지향 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes con orientación a la seguridad que requieren capacidades avanzadas de administración de secretos en tuberías de CI/CD que utilizan herramientas como HashiCorp Vault y AWS Secrets Manager.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur la sécurité nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion des secrets dans les pipelines CI/CD utilisant des outils tels que HashiCorp Vault et AWS Secrets Manager.","de":"Ideal für sicherheitsorientierte Agenten, die erweiterte Geheimnisverwaltungsfunktionen in CI/CD-Pipelines benötigen, die Tools wie HashiCorp Vault und AWS Secrets Manager verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes com Orientação para Segurança que exigem capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de segredos em pipelines CI/CD utilizando ferramentas como HashiCorp Vault e AWS Secrets Manager.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на безопасность, требующих передовых возможностей управления секретами в конвейерах CI/CD с использованием инструментов, таких как HashiCorp Vault и AWS Secrets Manager.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتوجهين للأمان الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الأسرار في أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام أدوات مثل HashiCorp Vault و AWS Secrets Manager."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely store and manage sensitive information such as API keys, database passwords, and TLS certificates, enabling automated secret rotation and least-privilege access control through protocols like Vault''s centralized secrets management and AWS Secrets Manager''s secure storage.","zh":"赋予代理安全存储和管理敏感信息（如API密钥、数据库密码和TLS证书）的能力，实现自动秘密轮换和最小权限访问控制，通过类似Vault的集中式秘密管理和AWS Secrets Manager的安全存储等协议。","ja":"APIキー、データベースパスワード、TLS証明書などの機密情報を安全に格納および管理するエージェントの能力を付与し、Vaultの集中管理されたシークレット管理やAWS Secrets Managerの安全なストレージなどのプロトコルを介して自動シークレットローテーションと最小権限アクセス制御を実現します。","ko":"API 키, 데이터베이스 암호, TLS 인증서 등의 민감한 정보를 안전하게 저장하고 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여, Vault의 중앙 집중식 시크릿 관리 및 AWS Secrets Manager의 안전한 저장소 등과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 자동 시크릿轮换 및 최소 권한 액세스 제어를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes almacenar y gestionar de forma segura información sensible, como claves de API, contraseñas de base de datos y certificados TLS, lo que permite la rotación automática de secretos y el control de acceso con los privilegios mínimos necesarios a través de protocolos como la gestión centralizada de secretos de Vault y el almacenamiento seguro de AWS Secrets Manager.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stocker et de gérer de manière sécurisée des informations sensibles telles que des clés API, des mots de passe de base de données et des certificats TLS, permettant ainsi la rotation automatique des secrets et le contrôle d''accès avec les privilèges minimum nécessaires via des protocoles tels que la gestion centralisée des secrets de Vault et le stockage sécurisé d''AWS Secrets Manager.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sensible Informationen wie API-Schlüssel, Datenbankpasswörter und TLS-Zertifikate sicher zu speichern und zu verwalten, wodurch eine automatisierte Rotation von Geheimnissen und eine Zugriffskontrolle mit den Mindestprivilegien durch Protokolle wie die zentrale Geheimnisverwaltung von Vault und den sicheren Speicher von AWS Secrets Manager ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a armazenar e gerenciar informações sensíveis, como chaves de API, senhas de banco de dados e certificados TLS, permitindo rotação automática de segredos e controle de acesso de privilégios mínimos por meio de protocolos como gerenciamento centralizado de segredos do Vault e armazenamento seguro do AWS Secrets Manager.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно хранить и управлять конфиденциальной информацией, такой как ключи API, пароли баз данных и сертификаты TLS, обеспечивая автоматическую ротацию секретов и контроль доступа с минимальными привилегиями через протоколы, такие как централизованное управление секретами Vault и безопасное хранение AWS Secrets Manager.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تخزين وإدارة المعلومات الحساسة مثل مفاتيح API وكلمات مرور قواعد البيانات وشهادات TLS، مما يسمح بالدوران التلقائي للأسرار والتحكم في الوصول بأقل صلاحيات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل إدارة الأسرار المركزية من Vault وتخزين AWS Secrets Manager الآمن."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API key management for secure access control","Rotating database passwords to prevent unauthorized access","Implementing least-privilege access for CI/CD pipeline security","Storing and managing TLS certificates for secure data transmission"],"zh":["自动化API密钥管理以实现安全的访问控制","轮换数据库密码以防止未经授权的访问","实现CI/CD管道的最小权限访问控制","存储和管理TLS证书以实现安全的数据传输"],"ja":["セキュアなアクセス制御のためのAPIキーの自動化管理","未認可アクセスの防止のためのデータベースパスワードのローテーション","CI/CDパイプラインのセキュリティのための最小権限アクセス制御の実現","セキュアなデータ転送のためのTLS証明書の格納および管理"],"ko":["보안 액세스 제어를 위한 API 키 자동화 관리","미승인 된 액세스를 방지하기 위한 데이터베이스 암호轮换","CI/CD 파이프라인 보안을 위한 최소 권한 액세스 제어實現","보안 데이터 전송을 위한 TLS 인증서 저장 및 관리"],"es":["Automatizar la administración de claves de API para el control de acceso seguro","Rotar contraseñas de base de datos para prevenir el acceso no autorizado","Implementar el acceso con los privilegios mínimos necesarios para la seguridad de la tubería de CI/CD","Almacenar y gestionar certificados TLS para la transmisión de datos segura"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion des clés API pour le contrôle d''accès sécurisé","Faire tourner les mots de passe de base de données pour empêcher l''accès non autorisé","Mettre en œuvre l''accès avec les privilèges minimum nécessaires pour la sécurité du pipeline CI/CD","Stockage et gestion des certificats TLS pour la transmission de données sécurisée"],"de":["Automatisieren der API-Schlüsselverwaltung für sicheren Zugriff","Rotieren von Datenbankpasswörtern, um unbefugten Zugriff zu verhindern","Implementieren des Zugriffs mit den Mindestprivilegien für die CI/CD-Pipeline-Sicherheit","Speichern und Verwalten von TLS-Zertifikaten für sichere Datenübertragung"],"pt":["Automatizar o gerenciamento de chaves de API para controle de acesso seguro","Rotacionar senhas de banco de dados para prevenir acesso não autorizado","Implementar acesso de privilégios mínimos para segurança de pipeline CI/CD","Armazenar e gerenciar certificados TLS para transmissão de dados segura"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление ключами API для безопасного контроля доступа","Ротировать пароли баз данных для предотвращения несанкционированного доступа","Реализовать доступ с минимальными привилегиями для безопасности конвейера CI/CD","Хранить и управлять сертификатами TLS для безопасной передачи данных"],"ar":["تأتمتة إدارة مفاتيح API للتحكم في الوصول الآمن","الدورة سنويا لكلمات مرور قواعد البيانات لمنع الوصول غير المصرح به","تنفيذ الوصول بأقل صلاحيات لأمان أنابيب CI/CD","تخزين وإدارة شهادات TLS لنقل البيانات الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with secrets management tools like HashiCorp Vault or AWS Secrets Manager","Needs access to sensitive information for secure storage and management"],"zh":["需要与秘密管理工具（如HashiCorp Vault或AWS Secrets Manager）集成","需要访问敏感信息以实现安全存储和管理"],"ja":["HashiCorp VaultまたはAWS Secrets Managerなどのシークレット管理ツールとの統合が必要","セキュアなストレージおよび管理のために機密情報へのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["HashiCorp Vault 또는 AWS Secrets Manager와 같은 시크릿 관리 도구와의 통합이 필요합니다.","안전한 저장소 및 관리를 위해 민감한 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere integración con herramientas de administración de secretos como HashiCorp Vault o AWS Secrets Manager","Necesita acceso a información sensible para el almacenamiento y la gestión seguros"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des outils de gestion de secrets tels que HashiCorp Vault ou AWS Secrets Manager","Besoin d''accès à des informations sensibles pour le stockage et la gestion sécurisés"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Geheimnisverwaltungstools wie HashiCorp Vault oder AWS Secrets Manager","Benötigt Zugriff auf sensible Informationen für sicheren Speicher und Verwaltung"],"pt":["Exige integração com ferramentas de gerenciamento de segredos como HashiCorp Vault ou AWS Secrets Manager","Necessita acesso a informações sensíveis para armazenamento e gerenciamento seguro"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с инструментами управления секретами, такими как HashiCorp Vault или AWS Secrets Manager","Требует доступа к конфиденциальной информации для безопасного хранения и управления"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع أدوات إدارة الأسرار مثل HashiCorp Vault أو AWS Secrets Manager","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى المعلومات الحساسة لتخزين وإدارة آمنة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
