bilität mit IDEs wie GitHub Copilot","Kompatibilität mit CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Netzwerkarichtektur und Synchronisationsprinzipien","Auswahl von Architektur für Multiplayer-Spiele"],"pt":["Arquitetura de rede escalável","Princípios de sincronização eficazes","Desenvolvimento de jogos competitivos e cooperativos","Integração com plataformas de jogo populares","Otimização de desempenho e latência"],"ru":["Масштабируемая сетевая архитектура","Эффективные принципы синхронизации","Разработка конкурентных и кооперативных игр","Интеграция с популярными игровыми платформами","Оптимизация производительности и задержки"],"ar":["هيكل شبكي قابل للتحجيم","مبادئ التزامن فعالة","تطوير ألعاب منافسة وتعاونية","تكامل مع منصات ألعاب شعبية","تحسين الأداء والتأخير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["多人游戏开发","网络架构","同步原则","游戏开发工具","竞争性游戏","合作游戏","游戏开发框架","游戏引擎"],"ja":["マルチプレイヤーゲーム開発","ネットワークアーキテクチャ","同期原則","ゲーム開発ツール","コンペティティブゲーム","コ-operativeゲーム","ゲーム開発フレームワーク","ゲームエンジン"],"ko":["멀티플레이어 게임 개발","네트워크 아키텍처","동기화 원리","게임 개발 도구","경쟁 게임","협력 게임","게임 개발 프레임워크","게임 엔진"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos multiplayer","conversion de configuraciones","compatibilidad con IDEs","compatibilidad con CLIs","arquitectura de red","principios de sincronización","juegos en línea"],"fr":["développement de jeux multiplayer","conversion des configurations","compatibilité avec les IDE","compatibilité avec les CLIs","architecture de réseau","principes de synchronisation","jeux en ligne"],"de":["Entwicklung von Multiplayer-Spielen","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit IDEs","Kompatibilität mit CLIs","Netzwerkarichtektur","Synchronisationsprinzipien","Online-Spiele"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos multiplayer","arquitetura de rede","princípios de sincronização","jogos competitivos","jogos cooperativos","plataformas de jogo","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["мультиплеерная разработка игр","сетевая архитектура","принципы синхронизации","конкурентные игры","кооперативные игры","игровые платформы","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب متعددة اللاعبين","هيكل شبكي","مبادئ التزامن","ألعاب منافسة","ألعاب تعاونية","منصات ألعاب","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"multiplayer","description":"Multiplayer game development principles. Architecture, networking, synchronization.","bodyPreview":"# Multiplayer Game Development\n\n> Networking architecture and synchronization principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Architecture Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat type of multiplayer?\n│\n├── Competitive / Real-time\n│   └── Dedicated Server (authoritative)\n│\n├── Cooperative / Casual\n│   └── Host-based (one player is server)\n│\n├── Turn-based\n│   └── Client-server (simple)\n│\n└── Massive (MMO)\n    └── Distributed servers\n```\n\n### Comparison\n\n| Architecture | Latency | Cost | Security |\n|--------------|-------","body":"# Multiplayer Game Development\n\n> Networking architecture and synchronization principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Architecture Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat type of multiplayer?\n│\n├── Competitive / Real-time\n│   └── Dedicated Server (authoritative)\n│\n├── Cooperative / Casual\n│   └── Host-based (one player is server)\n│\n├── Turn-based\n│   └── Client-server (simple)\n│\n└── Massive (MMO)\n    └── Distributed servers\n```\n\n### Comparison\n\n| Architecture | Latency | Cost | Security |\n|--------------|---------|------|----------|\n| **Dedicated** | Low | High | Strong |\n| **P2P** | Variable | Low | Weak |\n| **Host-based** | Medium | Low | Medium |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Synchronization Principles\n\n### State vs Input\n\n| Approach | Sync What | Best For |\n|----------|-----------|----------|\n| **State Sync** | Game state | Simple, few objects |\n| **Input Sync** | Player inputs | Action games |\n| **Hybrid** | Both | Most games |\n\n### Lag Compensation\n\n| Technique | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **Prediction** | Client predicts server |\n| **Interpolation** | Smooth remote players |\n| **Reconciliation** | Fix mispredictions |\n| **Lag compensation** | Rewind for hit detection |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Network Optimization\n\n### Bandwidth Reduction\n\n| Technique | Savings |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **Delta compression** | Send only changes |\n| **Quantization** | Reduce precision |\n| **Priority** | Important data first |\n| **Area of interest** | Only nearby entities |\n\n### Update Rates\n\n| Type | Rate |\n|------|------|\n| Position | 20-60 Hz |\n| Health | On change |\n| Inventory | On change |\n| Chat | On send |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Security Principles\n\n### Server Authority\n\n```\nClient: \"I hit the enemy\"\nServer: Validate → did projectile actually hit?\n         → was player in valid state?\n         → was timing possible?\n```\n\n### Anti-Cheat\n\n| Cheat | Prevention |\n|-------|------------|\n| Speed hack | Server validates movement |\n| Aimbot | Server validates sight line |\n| Item dupe | Server owns inventory |\n| Wall hack | Don''t send hidden data |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Matchmaking\n\n### Considerations\n\n| Factor | Impact |\n|--------|--------|\n| **Skill** | Fair matches |\n| **Latency** | Playable connection |\n| **Wait time** | Player patience |\n| **Party size** | Group play |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Trust the client | Server is authority |\n| Send everything | Send only necessary |\n| Ignore latency | Design for 100-200ms |\n| Sync exact positions | Interpolate/predict |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Never trust the client. The server is the source of truth.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:56:54.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT needing expertise in multiplayer game development with networking architecture and synchronization principles.","zh":"适合像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，需要在多人游戏开发中具有网络架构和同步原则的专业知识。","ja":"Cursor および AutoGPT などのマルチプレイヤーゲーム開発でネットワークアーキテクチャおよび同期原則の専門知識を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트가 멀티플레이어 게임 개발에서 네트워크 아키텍처 및 동기화 원칙에 대한 전문 지식을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que necesitan experiencia en desarrollo de juegos multijugador con arquitectura de red y principios de sincronización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant une expertise dans le développement de jeux multijoueurs avec une architecture de réseau et des principes de synchronisation.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die Expertenwissen im Bereich der Entwicklung von Multiplayer-Spielen mit Netzwerarchitektur und Synchronisationsprinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que necessitam de especialização em desenvolvimento de jogos multiplayer com arquitetura de rede e princípios de sincronização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, которым необходима экспертиза в области разработки многопользовательских игр с сетевой архитектурой и принципами синхронизации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و AutoGPT الذي يحتاج الى خبرة في تطوير ألعاب متعددة اللاعبين مع هندسة الشبكة ومبادئ التزامن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement dedicated server architectures for competitive multiplayer games, host-based models for cooperative play, and distributed servers for massive multiplayer online games, utilizing decision trees and comparisons to optimize latency, cost, and security.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实施专用服务器架构用于竞争性多人游戏、基于主机的模型用于合作游戏以及用于大规模多人在线游戏的分布式服务器，利用决策树和比较来优化延迟、成本和安全性。","ja":"エージェントに、競合マルチプレイヤーゲームのための専用サーバーアーキテクチャの設計と実装、協力プレイのためのホストベースのモデル、および大規模マルチプレイヤーオンラインゲームのための分散サーバーの設計と実装を可能にし、遅延、コスト、セキュリティを最適化するための決定木と比較を利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 경쟁적 멀티플레이어 게임을 위한 전용 서버 아키텍처, 협력 게임을 위한 호스트 기반 모델 및 대규모 멀티플레이어 온라인 게임을 위한 분산 서버를 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 지연, 비용, 보안을 최적화하는 결정 트리 및 비교를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar e implementar arquitecturas de servidores dedicados para juegos multijugador competitivos, modelos basados en hosts para juego cooperativo y servidores distribuidos para juegos en línea multijugador masivos, utilizando árboles de decisión y comparaciones para optimizar la latencia, el costo y la seguridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des architectures de serveurs dédiés pour les jeux multijoueurs compétitifs, des modèles basés sur des hôtes pour le jeu coopératif et des serveurs distribués pour les jeux en ligne multijoueurs massifs, en utilisant des arbres de décision et des comparaisons pour optimiser la latence, le coût et la sécurité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, dedizierte Serverarchitekturen für kompetitive Multiplayer-Spiele, hostbasierte Modelle für kooperatives Spiel und verteilte Server für massive Online-Multiplayer-Spiele zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem Entscheidungsbäume und Vergleiche verwendet werden, um Latenz, Kosten und Sicherheit zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar arquiteturas de servidor dedicado para jogos multiplayer competitivos, modelos baseados em host para jogo cooperativo e servidores distribuídos para jogos online multiplayer em massa, utilizando árvores de decisão e comparações para otimizar a latência, o custo e a segurança.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать архитектуры выделенных серверов для конкурентных многопользовательских игр, модели на основе хоста для кооперативной игры и распределенные серверы для массовых многопользовательских онлайн-игр, используя деревья решений и сравнения для оптимизации задержки, стоимости и безопасности.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تصميم وتنفيذ هندسة خادم مخصص للعبة متعددة اللاعبين التنافسية، ونماذج استضافة لمodes اللعب التعاوني، وخادم موزع للعبة متعددة اللاعبين عبر الإنترنت الكبيرة، باستخدام أشجار القرار والمقارنات لتحسين التأخر والتكلفة والأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting competitive multiplayer games with dedicated servers","Implementing host-based models for cooperative gameplay","Designing distributed server architectures for massive multiplayer online games"],"zh":["为竞争性多人游戏设计专用服务器架构","实施基于主机的模型用于合作游戏","为大规模多人在线游戏设计分布式服务器架构"],"ja":["競合マルチプレイヤーゲームのための専用サーバーアーキテクチャの設計","協力プレイのためのホストベースのモデルの実装","大規模マルチプレイヤーオンラインゲームのための分散サーバーアーキテクチャの設計"],"ko":["경쟁적 멀티플레이어 게임을 위한 전용 서버 아키텍처 설계","협력 게임을 위한 호스트 기반 모델 구현","대규모 멀티플레이어 온라인 게임을 위한 분산 서버 아키텍처 설계"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de juegos multijugador competitivos con servidores dedicados","Implementar modelos basados en hosts para juego cooperativo","Diseñar arquitecturas de servidores distribuidos para juegos en línea multijugador masivos"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de jeux multijoueurs compétitifs avec des serveurs dédiés","Mettre en œuvre des modèles basés sur des hôtes pour le jeu coopératif","Concevoir des architectures de serveurs distribués pour les jeux en ligne multijoueurs massifs"],"de":["Entwerfen von Architekturen für kompetitive Multiplayer-Spiele mit dedizierten Servern","Implementieren von hostbasierten Modellen für kooperatives Spiel","Entwerfen von Architekturen für verteilte Server für massive Online-Multiplayer-Spiele"],"pt":["Arquitetura de jogos multiplayer competitivos com servidores dedicados","Implementação de modelos baseados em host para jogo cooperativo","Projeto de arquiteturas de servidor distribuído para jogos online multiplayer em massa"],"ru":["Проектирование конкурентных многопользовательских игр с выделенными серверами","Реализация моделей на основе хоста для кооперативной игры","Проектирование распределенных архитектур серверов для массовых многопользовательских онлайн-игр"],"ar":["هندسة لعبة متعددة اللاعبين التنافسية مع خادم مخصص","تنفيذ نماذج استضافة للعبة التعاونية","تصميم هندسة خادم موزع للعبة متعددة اللاعبين عبر الإنترنت الكبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of networking principles and synchronization","Limited to multiplayer game development","May require additional expertise in specific game engines or programming languages"],"zh":["需要理解网络原则和同步","仅限于多人游戏开发","可能需要特定游戏引擎或编程语言的额外专业知识"],"ja":["ネットワーク原則と同期の理解が必要","マルチプレイヤーゲーム開発に限定される","特定のゲームエンジンまたはプログラミング言語の追加の専門知識が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["네트워크 원칙 및 동기화를 이해해야 함","멀티플레이어 게임 개발에만 국한됨","특정 게임 엔진 또는 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 추가 전문 지식이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de principios de red y sincronización","Limitado al desarrollo de juegos multijugador","Puede requerir experiencia adicional en motores de juego o lenguajes de programación específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de réseau et de synchronisation","Limité au développement de jeux multijoueurs","Peut nécessiter une expertise supplémentaire dans des moteurs de jeu ou des langages de programmation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Netzwerkprinzipien und Synchronisation","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Multiplayer-Spielen","Kann zusätzliches Fachwissen in bestimmten Spiel-Engines oder Programmiersprachen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de princípios de rede e sincronização","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de jogos multiplayer","Pode requerer conhecimento adicional em motores de jogo ou linguagens de programação específicas"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов сети и синхронизации","Ограничен разработкой многопользовательских игр","Может требовать дополнительной экспертизы в конкретных игровых движках или языках программирования"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ الشبكة والزامن","محدود بتطوير ألعاب متعددة اللاعبين","يمكن أن يتطلب معرفة إضافية في محركات ألعاب أو لغات برمجة محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/using-git-worktrees', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'using-git-worktrees', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z', '2026-02-18T13:57:36.879Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/using-git-worktrees","name":"using-git-worktrees","description":{"zh":"Git工作树允许您在同一个仓库中创建多个隔离的工作空间，实现多分支同时开发","ja":"Gitワークツリーは同一のリポジトリ内で複数の独立したワークスペースを作成し、複数のブランチを同時に開発","ko":"Git 작업 트리는 동일한 저장소에서 여러 개의 분리된 작업 공간을 생성하여 여러 분기를 동시에 개발","es":"Git Worktrees te permite crear espacios de trabajo aislados para trabajar en múltiples ramas simultáneamente","fr":"Les Git Worktrees vous permettent de créer des espaces de travail isolés pour travailler sur plusieurs branches en même temps","de":"Git Worktrees ermöglichen die Erstellung isolierter Arbeitsbereiche, um an mehreren Branches gleichzeitig zu arbeiten","pt":"Git Worktrees permite criar espaços de trabalho isolados para desenvolver múltiplos branches simultaneamente","ru":"Git Worktrees позволяет создавать изолированные рабочие пространства для параллельной разработки нескольких веток","ar":"Git Worktrees يسمح بإنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة للعمل على عدة فروع في نفس الوقت","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git工作树使用指南","ja":"Gitワークツリーの使い方","ko":"Git 작업 트리 사용법","es":"Trabajar con Git Worktrees","fr":"Utiliser les Git Worktrees","de":"Git Worktrees verwenden","pt":"Usando Git Worktrees para Desenvolvimento Paralelo","ru":"Использование Git Worktrees для параллельной разработки","ar":"استخدام Git Worktrees للعمل التطويعي المتوازي","en":"using-git-worktrees"},"description":{"zh":"Git工作树允许您在同一个仓库中创建多个隔离的工作空间，实现多分支同时开发","ja":"Gitワークツリーは同一のリポジトリ内で複数の独立したワークスペースを作成し、複数のブランチを同時に開発","ko":"Git 작업 트리는 동일한 저장소에서 여러 개의 분리된 작업 공간을 생성하여 여러 분기를 동시에 개발","es":"Git Worktrees te permite crear espacios de trabajo aislados para trabajar en múltiples ramas simultáneamente","fr":"Les Git Worktrees vous permettent de créer des espaces de travail isolés pour travailler sur plusieurs branches en même temps","de":"Git Worktrees ermöglichen die Erstellung isolierter Arbeitsbereiche, um an mehreren Branches gleichzeitig zu arbeiten","pt":"Git Worktrees permite criar espaços de trabalho isolados para desenvolver múltiplos branches simultaneamente","ru":"Git Worktrees позволяет создавать изолированные рабочие пространства для параллельной разработки нескольких веток","ar":"Git Worktrees يسمح بإنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة للعمل على عدة فروع في نفس الوقت","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建隔离的工作空间","同时开发多个分支","系统化的目录选择","安全性验证"],"ja":["独立したワークスペースの作成","複数のブランチを同時に開発","システム化されたディレクトリ選択","安全性の検証"],"ko":["분리된 작업 공간 생성","여러 개의 분기를 동시에 개발","시스템화된 디렉토리 선택","안전성 검증"],"es":["Crear espacios de trabajo aislados","Trabajar en múltiples ramas simultáneamente","Seleccionar directorios de manera sistemática","Verificar la seguridad para garantizar la isolación","Mejorar el flujo de trabajo","Reducir la complejidad del desarrollo"],"fr":["Créer des espaces de travail isolés","Travailler sur plusieurs branches en même temps","Sélectionner des répertoires de manière systématique","Vérifier la sécurité pour garantir l''isolation","Améliorer le flux de travail","Réduire la complexité du développement"],"de":["Erstellen isolierter Arbeitsbereiche","An mehreren Branches gleichzeitig arbeiten","Verzeichnisse systematisch auswählen","Sicherheit überprüfen, um Isolation zu gewährleisten","Arbeitsablauf verbessern","Komplexität der Entwicklung reduzieren"],"pt":["Criação de espaços de trabalho isolados","Desenvolvimento paralelo de múltiplos branches","Segurança e verificação de diretórios","Prioridade de seleção de diretórios","Compatibilidade com comandos Git"],"ru":["Создание изолированных рабочих пространств","Параллельная разработка нескольких веток","Безопасность и проверка директорий","Приоритет выбора директорий","Совместимость с командами Git"],"ar":["إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة","التطوير المتوازي للفروع المتعددة","أمان وتحقق من الدلائل","أولوية اختيار الدلائل","التوافق مع أوامر Git"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git工作树","多分支开发","隔离工作空间","Git仓库管理","版本控制","代码管理"],"ja":["Gitワークツリー","複数ブランチ開発","独立したワークスペース","Gitリポジトリ管理","バージョン管理","コード管理"],"ko":["Git 작업 트리","여러 분기 개발","분리된 작업 공간","Git 저장소 관리","버전 관리","코드 관리"],"es":["Git Worktrees","espacios de trabajo aislados","ramas simultáneas","desarrollo de software","flujo de trabajo","gestión de código","desarrollo ágil","control de versiones"],"fr":["Git Worktrees","espaces de travail isolés","branches simultanées","développement de logiciels","flux de travail","gestion de code","développement agile","contrôle de version"],"de":["Git Worktrees","isolierte Arbeitsbereiche","Branches gleichzeitig","Softwareentwicklung","Arbeitsablauf","Codeverwaltung","agiles Entwicklung","Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Git Worktrees","desenvolvimento paralelo","espaços de trabalho isolados","repositório Git","branches","segurança","verificação de diretórios"],"ru":["Git Worktrees","параллельная разработка","изолированные рабочие пространства","репозиторий Git","ветки","безопасность","проверка директорий"],"ar":["Git Worktrees","التطوير المتوازي","مساحات عمل معزولة","مستودع Git","الفروع","أمان","تحقق من الدلائل"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-git-worktrees","description":"Use when starting feature work that needs isolation from current workspace or before executing implementation plans - creates isolated git worktrees with smart directory selection and safety verification","bodyPreview":"# Using Git Worktrees\n\n## Overview\n\nGit worktrees create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing work on multiple branches simultaneously without switching.\n\n**Core principle:** Systematic directory selection + safety verification = reliable isolation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n\n## Directory Selection Process\n\nFollow this priority order:\n\n### 1. Check Existing Directories\n\n```bash\n# Check in priority order","body":"# Using Git Worktrees\n\n## Overview\n\nGit worktrees create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing work on multiple branches simultaneously without switching.\n\n**Core principle:** Systematic directory selection + safety verification = reliable isolation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n\n## Directory Selection Process\n\nFollow this priority order:\n\n### 1. Check Existing Directories\n\n```bash\n# Check in priority order\nls -d .worktrees 2>/dev/null     # Preferred (hidden)\nls -d worktrees 2>/dev/null      # Alternative\n```\n\n**If found:** Use that directory. If both exist, `.worktrees` wins.\n\n### 2. Check CLAUDE.md\n\n```bash\ngrep -i \"worktree.*director\" CLAUDE.md 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**If preference specified:** Use it without asking.\n\n### 3. Ask User\n\nIf no directory exists and no CLAUDE.md preference:\n\n```\nNo worktree directory found. Where should I create worktrees?\n\n1. .worktrees/ (project-local, hidden)\n2. ~/.config/superpowers/worktrees/<project-name>/ (global location)\n\nWhich would you prefer?\n```\n\n## Safety Verification\n\n### For Project-Local Directories (.worktrees or worktrees)\n\n**MUST verify directory is ignored before creating worktree:**\n\n```bash\n# Check if directory is ignored (respects local, global, and system gitignore)\ngit check-ignore -q .worktrees 2>/dev/null || git check-ignore -q worktrees 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**If NOT ignored:**\n\nPer Jesse''s rule \"Fix broken things immediately\":\n1. Add appropriate line to .gitignore\n2. Commit the change\n3. Proceed with worktree creation\n\n**Why critical:** Prevents accidentally committing worktree contents to repository.\n\n### For Global Directory (~/.config/superpowers/worktrees)\n\nNo .gitignore verification needed - outside project entirely.\n\n## Creation Steps\n\n### 1. Detect Project Name\n\n```bash\nproject=$(basename \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\")\n```\n\n### 2. Create Worktree\n\n```bash\n# Determine full path\ncase $LOCATION in\n  .worktrees|worktrees)\n    path=\"$LOCATION/$BRANCH_NAME\"\n    ;;\n  ~/.config/superpowers/worktrees/*)\n    path=\"~/.config/superpowers/worktrees/$project/$BRANCH_NAME\"\n    ;;\nesac\n\n# Create worktree with new branch\ngit worktree add \"$path\" -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\ncd \"$path\"\n```\n\n### 3. Run Project Setup\n\nAuto-detect and run appropriate setup:\n\n```bash\n# Node.js\nif [ -f package.json ]; then npm install; fi\n\n# Rust\nif [ -f Cargo.toml ]; then cargo build; fi\n\n# Python\nif [ -f requirements.txt ]; then pip install -r requirements.txt; fi\nif [ -f pyproject.toml ]; then poetry install; fi\n\n# Go\nif [ -f go.mod ]; then go mod download; fi\n```\n\n### 4. Verify Clean Baseline\n\nRun tests to ensure worktree starts clean:\n\n```bash\n# Examples - use project-appropriate command\nnpm test\ncargo test\npytest\ngo test ./...\n```\n\n**If tests fail:** Report failures, ask whether to proceed or investigate.\n\n**If tests pass:** Report ready.\n\n### 5. Report Location\n\n```\nWorktree ready at <full-path>\nTests passing (<N> tests, 0 failures)\nReady to implement <feature-name>\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| `.worktrees/` exists | Use it (verify ignored) |\n| `worktrees/` exists | Use it (verify ignored) |\n| Both exist | Use `.worktrees/` |\n| Neither exists | Check CLAUDE.md → Ask user |\n| Directory not ignored | Add to .gitignore + commit |\n| Tests fail during baseline | Report failures + ask |\n| No package.json/Cargo.toml | Skip dependency install |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### Skipping ignore verification\n\n- **Problem:** Worktree contents get tracked, pollute git status\n- **Fix:** Always use `git check-ignore` before creating project-local worktree\n\n### Assuming directory location\n\n- **Problem:** Creates inconsistency, violates project conventions\n- **Fix:** Follow priority: existing > CLAUDE.md > ask\n\n### Proceeding with failing tests\n\n- **Problem:** Can''t distinguish new bugs from pre-existing issues\n- **Fix:** Report failures, get explicit permission to proceed\n\n### Hardcoding setup commands\n\n- **Problem:** Breaks on projects using different tools\n- **Fix:** Auto-detect from project files (package.json, etc.)\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\n\n[Check .worktrees/ - exists]\n[Verify ignored - git check-ignore confirms .worktrees/ is ignored]\n[Create worktree: git worktree add .worktrees/auth -b feature/auth]\n[Run npm install]\n[Run npm test - 47 passing]\n\nWorktree ready at /Users/jesse/myproject/.worktrees/auth\nTests passing (47 tests, 0 failures)\nReady to implement auth feature\n```\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Create worktree without verifying it''s ignored (project-local)\n- Skip baseline test verification\n- Proceed with failing tests without asking\n- Assume directory location when ambiguous\n- Skip CLAUDE.md check\n\n**Always:**\n- Follow directory priority: existing > CLAUDE.md > ask\n- Verify directory is ignored for project-local\n- Auto-detect and run project setup\n- Verify clean test baseline\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n- **brainstorming** (Phase 4) - REQUIRED when design is approved and implementation follows\n- Any skill needing isolated workspace\n\n**Pairs with:**\n- **finishing-a-development-branch** - REQUIRED for cleanup after work complete\n- **executing-plans** or **subagent-driven-development** - Work happens in this worktree\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:57:36.879Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents needing simultaneous branch management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要同时分支管理功能的版本控制代理的理想选择。","ja":"同時ブランチ管理機能を必要とするバージョン管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"동시 분기 관리 기능이 필요한 버전 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan capacidades de gestión de ramas simultáneas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant des capacités de gestion de branches simultanées.","de":"Ideal für Version-Control-Agents, die simultane Branch-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de branches simultâneos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов системы контроля версий, требующих возможностей одновременного управления ветками.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدار الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة الفرع المتزامن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, utilizing systematic directory selection and safety verification for reliable isolation, and seamlessly working with multiple branches using Git worktrees.","zh":"赋予代理创建共享同一存储库的隔离工作空间的能力，利用系统目录选择和安全性验证以实现可靠的隔离，并使用Git工作树无缝地处理多个分支。","ja":"エージェントが同じリポジトリを共有する隔離されたワークスペースを作成する機能を提供し、システムディレクトリの選択と安全性の検証を使用して信頼性の高い隔離を実現し、Gitのワークツリーを使用して複数のブランチをシームレスに処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 동일한 저장소를 공유하는 격리된 작업공간을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 시스템 디렉토리 선택 및 안전성 검증을 사용하여 안정적인 격리를 구현하고, Git 워크트리를 사용하여 여러 분기를 無縫로 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear espacios de trabajo aislados que comparten el mismo repositorio, utilizando la selección de directorios sistemáticos y la verificación de seguridad para un aislamiento confiable, y trabajando de forma fluida con múltiples ramas utilizando Git worktrees.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des espaces de travail isolés partageant le même référentiel, en utilisant une sélection de répertoires systématique et une vérification de sécurité pour une isolation fiable, et en travaillant de manière fluide avec plusieurs branches à l''aide de Git worktrees.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, isolierte Arbeitsbereiche zu erstellen, die das gleiche Repository teilen, indem sie systematische Verzeichnisauswahl und Sicherheitsüberprüfung für zuverlässige Isolation nutzen und nahtlos mit mehreren Branches unter Verwendung von Git worktrees arbeiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar espaços de trabalho isolados que compartilham o mesmo repositório, utilizando seleção sistemática de diretórios e verificação de segurança para isolamento confiável, e trabalhando de forma transparente com várias branches usando Git worktrees.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать изолированные рабочие пространства, которые共享 одно и то же хранилище, используя систематический выбор каталогов и проверку безопасности для надежной изоляции, и бесшовно работать с несколькими ветками с помощью Git worktrees.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة تشترك في نفس المستودع، باستخدام اختيار دليل منهجي وتحقق من السلامة من أجل عزل موثوق، ويعمل بشكل متسلسل مع فروع متعددة باستخدام Git worktrees."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing multiple feature branches simultaneously","Isolating experimental code changes","Streamlining collaborative development workflows"],"zh":["同时管理多个功能分支","隔离实验代码更改","简化协作开发工作流"],"ja":["複数の機能ブランチを同時に管理する","実験的なコード変更を隔離する","共同開発のワークフローを簡素化する"],"ko":["동시에 여러 기능 분기를 관리한다","실험적인 코드 변경을 격리한다","협력 개발 워크플로를 단순화한다"],"es":["Gestión de varias ramas de características simultáneamente","Aislamiento de cambios de código experimentales","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo colaborativo"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs branches de fonctionnalités simultanément","Isolement de modifications de code expérimentales","Optimisation de flux de travail de développement collaboratif"],"de":["Verwaltung mehrerer Feature-Branches simultan","Isolierung experimenteller Code-Änderungen","Optimierung von Collaborative-Development-Workflows"],"pt":["Gerenciar várias branches de recursos simultaneamente","Isolar alterações de código experimentais","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento colaborativo"],"ru":["Управлять несколькими ветками функций одновременно","Изолировать экспериментальные изменения кода","Оптимизировать потоки работ сотрудничества"],"ar":["إدارة فروع متعددة للميزات في نفس الوقت","عزل تحسينات الكود التجريبية","تبسيط تدفقات العمل التشاركية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要Git安装","仅限于Git版本控制系统"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","Gitのバージョン管理システムに限定される"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요하다","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Begrenzt auf Git-Version-Control-System"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует установки Git","Ограничен система контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","محدود بنظام التحكم في الإصدار Git"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
