iciencia y reduce costos","fr":"L''optimisation des coûts cloud consiste à mettre en œuvre des stratégies systématiques pour réduire les dépenses cloud. Améliorez l''efficacité et réduisez le...","de":"Die Cloud-Kostenoptimierung beinhaltet die Implementierung systematischer Strategien zur Reduzierung von Cloud-Ausgaben. Verbessern Sie die Effizienz und red...","pt":"Otimização de custo em nuvem para reduzir gastos e manter o desempenho.","ru":"Оптимизация облачных затрат для снижения расходов и поддержания производительности.","ar":"تحسين التكلفة السحابية لتقليل النفقات والحفاظ على الأداء.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实现成本分配标签","使用云成本管理","右侧资源","实施成本治理","优化多云成本"],"ja":["コスト割り当てタグの実施","クラウドコスト管理の使用","リソースの右サイズ","コストガバナンスの実施","マルチクラウドコストの最適化"],"ko":["비용 할당 태그 구현","클라우드 비용 관리 사용","리소스 오른쪽 크기 조정","비용 治理 구현","다중 클라우드 비용 최적화"],"es":["Implementación de etiquetas de asignación de costos","Uso de herramientas de gestión de costos en la nube","Optimización de recursos","Implementación de gobernanza de costos","Optimización de costos en multicloud"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''étiquettes d''allocation de coûts","Utilisation d''outils de gestion de coûts cloud","Optimisation des ressources","Mise en œuvre de la gouvernance des coûts","Optimisation des coûts en multicloud"],"de":["Implementierung von Kostenzuweisungstags","Verwendung von Cloud-Kostenmanagementtools","Optimierung von Ressourcen","Implementierung von Kostenregierung","Optimierung von Cloud-Kosten in Multicloud"],"pt":["Visibilidade de custos","Otimização de recursos","Governança de custos","Otimização de custos multi-nuvem","Redução de gastos em nuvem"],"ru":["Видимость затрат","Оптимизация ресурсов","Управление затратами","Оптимизация затрат multi-облака","Снижение облачных затрат"],"ar":["رؤية التكلفة","تحسين الموارد","حوكمة التكلفة","تحسين التكلفة السحابية متعددة","تقليل النفقات السحابية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云成本优化","云计算成本","成本分配标签","云成本管理","右侧资源","成本治理"],"ja":["クラウドコスト最適化","クラウドコンピューティングコスト","コスト割り当てタグ","クラウドコスト管理","リソースの右サイズ","コストガバナンス"],"ko":["클라우드 비용 최적화","클라우드 컴퓨팅 비용","비용 할당 태그","클라우드 비용 관리","리소스 오른쪽 크기 조정","비용 治理"],"es":["optimización de costos en la nube","reducción de gastos en la nube","eficiencia en la nube","gestión de costos en la nube","cloud computing","AWS","Azure","GCP"],"fr":["optimisation des coûts cloud","réduction des dépenses cloud","efficacité cloud","gestion des coûts cloud","informatique en nuage","AWS","Azure","GCP"],"de":["Cloud-Kostenoptimierung","Reduzierung von Cloud-Ausgaben","Cloud-Effizienz","Cloud-Kostenmanagement","Cloud-Computing","AWS","Azure","GCP"],"pt":["otimização de custo em nuvem","redução de gastos em nuvem","aws","azure","gcp","cloud cost optimization","gestão de custos em nuvem","otimização de recursos em nuvem"],"ru":["оптимизация облачных затрат","снижение облачных затрат","aws","azure","gcp","cloud cost optimization","управление затратами в облаке","оптимизация ресурсов в облаке"],"ar":["تحسين التكلفة السحابية","تقليل النفقات السحابية","aws","azure","gcp","cloud cost optimization","إدارة التكلفة السحابية","تحسين الموارد السحابية"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.524Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cost-optimization","description":"Optimize cloud costs through resource rightsizing, tagging strategies, reserved instances, and spending analysis. Use when reducing cloud expenses, analyzing infrastructure costs, or implementing cost governance policies.","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Cost Optimization\n\nStrategies and patterns for optimizing cloud costs across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement systematic cost optimization strategies to reduce cloud spending while maintaining performance and reliability.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Reduce cloud spending\n- Right-size resources\n- Implement cost governance\n- Optimize multi-cloud costs\n- Meet budget constraints\n\n## Cost Optimization Framework\n\n### 1. Visibility\n\n- Implement cost allocation tags\n- Use cloud cost management","body":"# Cloud Cost Optimization\n\nStrategies and patterns for optimizing cloud costs across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement systematic cost optimization strategies to reduce cloud spending while maintaining performance and reliability.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Reduce cloud spending\n- Right-size resources\n- Implement cost governance\n- Optimize multi-cloud costs\n- Meet budget constraints\n\n## Cost Optimization Framework\n\n### 1. Visibility\n\n- Implement cost allocation tags\n- Use cloud cost management tools\n- Set up budget alerts\n- Create cost dashboards\n\n### 2. Right-Sizing\n\n- Analyze resource utilization\n- Downsize over-provisioned resources\n- Use auto-scaling\n- Remove idle resources\n\n### 3. Pricing Models\n\n- Use reserved capacity\n- Leverage spot/preemptible instances\n- Implement savings plans\n- Use committed use discounts\n\n### 4. Architecture Optimization\n\n- Use managed services\n- Implement caching\n- Optimize data transfer\n- Use lifecycle policies\n\n## AWS Cost Optimization\n\n### Reserved Instances\n\n```\nSavings: 30-72% vs On-Demand\nTerm: 1 or 3 years\nPayment: All/Partial/No upfront\nFlexibility: Standard or Convertible\n```\n\n### Savings Plans\n\n```\nCompute Savings Plans: 66% savings\nEC2 Instance Savings Plans: 72% savings\nApplies to: EC2, Fargate, Lambda\nFlexible across: Instance families, regions, OS\n```\n\n### Spot Instances\n\n```\nSavings: Up to 90% vs On-Demand\nBest for: Batch jobs, CI/CD, stateless workloads\nRisk: 2-minute interruption notice\nStrategy: Mix with On-Demand for resilience\n```\n\n### S3 Cost Optimization\n\n```hcl\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_lifecycle_configuration\" \"example\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.example.id\n\n  rule {\n    id     = \"transition-to-ia\"\n    status = \"Enabled\"\n\n    transition {\n      days          = 30\n      storage_class = \"STANDARD_IA\"\n    }\n\n    transition {\n      days          = 90\n      storage_class = \"GLACIER\"\n    }\n\n    expiration {\n      days = 365\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Azure Cost Optimization\n\n### Reserved VM Instances\n\n- 1 or 3 year terms\n- Up to 72% savings\n- Flexible sizing\n- Exchangeable\n\n### Azure Hybrid Benefit\n\n- Use existing Windows Server licenses\n- Up to 80% savings with RI\n- Available for Windows and SQL Server\n\n### Azure Advisor Recommendations\n\n- Right-size VMs\n- Delete unused resources\n- Use reserved capacity\n- Optimize storage\n\n## GCP Cost Optimization\n\n### Committed Use Discounts\n\n- 1 or 3 year commitment\n- Up to 57% savings\n- Applies to vCPUs and memory\n- Resource-based or spend-based\n\n### Sustained Use Discounts\n\n- Automatic discounts\n- Up to 30% for running instances\n- No commitment required\n- Applies to Compute Engine, GKE\n\n### Preemptible VMs\n\n- Up to 80% savings\n- 24-hour maximum runtime\n- Best for batch workloads\n\n## Tagging Strategy\n\n### AWS Tagging\n\n```hcl\nlocals {\n  common_tags = {\n    Environment = \"production\"\n    Project     = \"my-project\"\n    CostCenter  = \"engineering\"\n    Owner       = \"team@example.com\"\n    ManagedBy   = \"terraform\"\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_instance\" \"example\" {\n  ami           = \"ami-12345678\"\n  instance_type = \"t3.medium\"\n\n  tags = merge(\n    local.common_tags,\n    {\n      Name = \"web-server\"\n    }\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/tagging-standards.md`\n\n## Cost Monitoring\n\n### Budget Alerts\n\n```hcl\n# AWS Budget\nresource \"aws_budgets_budget\" \"monthly\" {\n  name              = \"monthly-budget\"\n  budget_type       = \"COST\"\n  limit_amount      = \"1000\"\n  limit_unit        = \"USD\"\n  time_period_start = \"2024-01-01_00:00\"\n  time_unit         = \"MONTHLY\"\n\n  notification {\n    comparison_operator        = \"GREATER_THAN\"\n    threshold                  = 80\n    threshold_type            = \"PERCENTAGE\"\n    notification_type         = \"ACTUAL\"\n    subscriber_email_addresses = [\"team@example.com\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Cost Anomaly Detection\n\n- AWS Cost Anomaly Detection\n- Azure Cost Management alerts\n- GCP Budget alerts\n\n## Architecture Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Serverless First\n\n- Use Lambda/Functions for event-driven\n- Pay only for execution time\n- Auto-scaling included\n- No idle costs\n\n### Pattern 2: Right-Sized Databases\n\n```\nDevelopment: t3.small RDS\nStaging: t3.large RDS\nProduction: r6g.2xlarge RDS with read replicas\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Tier Storage\n\n```\nHot data: S3 Standard\nWarm data: S3 Standard-IA (30 days)\nCold data: S3 Glacier (90 days)\nArchive: S3 Deep Archive (365 days)\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Auto-Scaling\n\n```hcl\nresource \"aws_autoscaling_policy\" \"scale_up\" {\n  name                   = \"scale-up\"\n  scaling_adjustment     = 2\n  adjustment_type        = \"ChangeInCapacity\"\n  cooldown              = 300\n  autoscaling_group_name = aws_autoscaling_group.main.name\n}\n\nresource \"aws_cloudwatch_metric_alarm\" \"cpu_high\" {\n  alarm_name          = \"cpu-high\"\n  comparison_operator = \"GreaterThanThreshold\"\n  evaluation_periods  = \"2\"\n  metric_name         = \"CPUUtilization\"\n  namespace           = \"AWS/EC2\"\n  period              = \"60\"\n  statistic           = \"Average\"\n  threshold           = \"80\"\n  alarm_actions       = [aws_autoscaling_policy.scale_up.arn]\n}\n```\n\n## Cost Optimization Checklist\n\n- [ ] Implement cost allocation tags\n- [ ] Delete unused resources (EBS, EIPs, snapshots)\n- [ ] Right-size instances based on utilization\n- [ ] Use reserved capacity for steady workloads\n- [ ] Implement auto-scaling\n- [ ] Optimize storage classes\n- [ ] Use lifecycle policies\n- [ ] Enable cost anomaly detection\n- [ ] Set budget alerts\n- [ ] Review costs weekly\n- [ ] Use spot/preemptible instances\n- [ ] Optimize data transfer costs\n- [ ] Implement caching layers\n- [ ] Use managed services\n- [ ] Monitor and optimize continuously\n\n## Tools\n\n- **AWS:** Cost Explorer, Cost Anomaly Detection, Compute Optimizer\n- **Azure:** Cost Management, Advisor\n- **GCP:** Cost Management, Recommender\n- **Multi-cloud:** CloudHealth, Cloudability, Kubecost\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/tagging-standards.md` - Tagging conventions\n- `assets/cost-analysis-template.xlsx` - Cost analysis spreadsheet\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `terraform-module-library` - For resource provisioning\n- `multi-cloud-architecture` - For cloud selection\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:58:23.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing advanced cost optimization strategies across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","zh":"非常适合需要在AWS、Azure和GCP上进行高级成本优化策略的云管理代理。","ja":"AWS、Azure、GCPで高度なコスト最適化戦略を必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"AWS, Azure, GCP에서 고급 비용 최적화 전략이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de cloud que necesitan estrategias de optimización de costos avanzadas en AWS, Azure y GCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de cloud ayant besoin de stratégies d''optimisation de coûts avancées sur AWS, Azure et GCP.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Kostenoptimierungsstrategien über AWS, Azure und GCP benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing advanced cost optimization strategies across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","ru":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing advanced cost optimization strategies across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","ar":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing advanced cost optimization strategies across AWS, Azure, and GCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement systematic cost optimization using cloud cost management, cost allocation tags, and multi-cloud governance, ensuring reduced cloud spending while maintaining performance and reliability.","zh":"赋予代理实施系统的成本优化，利用云成本管理、成本分配标签和多云治理，确保在保持性能和可靠性的同时减少云支出。","ja":"エージェントに、クラウドコスト管理、コスト割り当てタグ、及びマルチクラウドガバナンスを利用した体系的なコスト最適化の実施を可能にし、パフォーマンスと信頼性を維持しながらクラウド支出を削減します。","ko":"에이전트가 클라우드 비용 관리, 비용 할당 태그 및 멀티 클라우드 거버넌스를 이용한 체계적인 비용 최적화를 구현하도록 하여, 성능과 안정성을 유지하면서 클라우드 비용을 줄일 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una optimización sistemática de costos utilizando la administración de costos de cloud, etiquetas de asignación de costos y gobernanza de multicloud, garantizando una reducción del gasto en cloud mientras se mantiene el rendimiento y la confiabilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une optimisation systématique des coûts en utilisant la gestion des coûts de cloud, les étiquettes d''allocation de coûts et la gouvernance de multicloud, garantissant une réduction des dépenses de cloud tout en maintenant les performances et la fiabilité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine systematische Kostenoptimierung mithilfe von Cloud-Kostenmanagement, Kostenzuweisungstags und Multicloud-Governance durchzuführen, wodurch eine Verringerung der Cloud-Ausgaben bei gleichzeitiger Wahrung von Leistung und Zuverlässigkeit gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to implement systematic cost optimization using cloud cost management, cost allocation tags, and multi-cloud governance, ensuring reduced cloud spending while maintaining performance and reliability.","ru":"Empowers agents to implement systematic cost optimization using cloud cost management, cost allocation tags, and multi-cloud governance, ensuring reduced cloud spending while maintaining performance and reliability.","ar":"Empowers agents to implement systematic cost optimization using cloud cost management, cost allocation tags, and multi-cloud governance, ensuring reduced cloud spending while maintaining performance and reliability."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cost allocation and tagging for better visibility","Optimizing resource sizing to reduce unnecessary cloud expenses","Implementing cost governance policies to meet budget constraints"],"zh":["自动执行成本分配和标记以提高可见性","优化资源大小以减少不必要的云费用","实施成本治理政策以满足预算约束"],"ja":["可視性を高めるためにコスト割り当てとタグ付けを自動化する","不必要なクラウド費用を削減するためにリソースサイズを最適化する","予算の制約を満たすためにコストガバナンスポリシーを実施する"],"ko":["가시성을 높이기 위해 비용 할당 및 태그 지정 자동화","불필요한 클라우드 비용을 줄이기 위해 리소스 크기 최적화","예산 제약을 충족하기 위해 비용 거버넌스 정책 구현"],"es":["Automatizar la asignación y etiquetado de costos para una mejor visibilidad","Optimizar el tamaño de los recursos para reducir los gastos de cloud innecesarios","Implementar políticas de gobernanza de costos para cumplir con las restricciones presupuestarias"],"fr":["Automatiser l''allocation et l''étiquetage des coûts pour une meilleure visibilité","Optimiser la taille des ressources pour réduire les dépenses de cloud inutiles","Mettre en œuvre des politiques de gouvernance de coûts pour répondre aux contraintes budgétaires"],"de":["Automatisieren der Kostenzuweisung und -etikettierung für eine bessere Sichtbarkeit","Optimieren der Ressourcengröße, um unnötige Cloud-Ausgaben zu reduzieren","Umsetzen von Kostenregierungsrichtlinien, um Budgetbeschränkungen zu erfüllen"],"pt":["Automating cost allocation and tagging for better visibility","Optimizing resource sizing to reduce unnecessary cloud expenses","Implementing cost governance policies to meet budget constraints"],"ru":["Automating cost allocation and tagging for better visibility","Optimizing resource sizing to reduce unnecessary cloud expenses","Implementing cost governance policies to meet budget constraints"],"ar":["Automating cost allocation and tagging for better visibility","Optimizing resource sizing to reduce unnecessary cloud expenses","Implementing cost governance policies to meet budget constraints"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to cloud cost management platforms","Limited to AWS, Azure, and GCP cloud services"],"zh":["需要访问云成本管理平台","仅限AWS、Azure和GCP云服务"],"ja":["クラウドコスト管理プラットフォームへのアクセスが必要","AWS、Azure、GCPクラウドサービスのみに限定される"],"ko":["클라우드 비용 관리 플랫폼에 대한 액세스가 필요함","AWS, Azure, GCP 클라우드 서비스만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a plataformas de administración de costos de cloud","Limitado a los servicios de cloud AWS, Azure y GCP"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux plateformes de gestion des coûts de cloud","Limité aux services de cloud AWS, Azure et GCP"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Cloud-Kostenmanagement-Plattformen","Begrenzt auf die Cloud-Dienste AWS, Azure und GCP"],"pt":["Requires access to cloud cost management platforms","Limited to AWS, Azure, and GCP cloud services"],"ru":["Requires access to cloud cost management platforms","Limited to AWS, Azure, and GCP cloud services"],"ar":["Requires access to cloud cost management platforms","Limited to AWS, Azure, and GCP cloud services"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
