 slides avec des paramètres de police personnalisés","de":"draw.io ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Diagrammen in Quarto-Folien mit benutzerdefinierten Schriftarteneinstellungen","pt":"O draw.io é uma ferramenta de diagramação que permite criar diagramas de alta qualidade.","ru":"draw.io - это инструмент для создания диаграмм, который позволяет создавать высококачественные диаграммы.","ar":"draw.io هو أداة مخططات تمكنك من إنشاء مخططات عالية الجودة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持编辑 `.drawio` 文件","自动生成 `.drawio.png` 文件","自定义字体设置","用于 Quarto 幻灯片的默认字体设置","支持文本元素样式设置","用于开发者的最佳实践指南"],"ja":["`.drawio` ファイルの編集をサポート","`.drawio.png` ファイルを自動生成","フォント設定のカスタマイズ","Quarto スライド用のデフォルトフォント設定","テキスト要素のスタイル設定のサポート","開発者向けのベストプラクティスガイド"],"ko":[".drawio 파일 편집 지원",".drawio.png 파일 자동 생성","글꼴 설정 사용자 지정","Quarto 슬라이드용 기본 글꼴 설정","텍스트 요소 스타일 설정 지원","개발자용 모범 사례 가이드"],"es":["Edición de archivos `.drawio`","Uso de fuentes personalizadas","Generación automática de imágenes `.drawio.png`","Compatibilidad con Quarto slides","Configuración de fuente con `defaultFontFamily`","Estilo de texto personalizable"],"fr":["Édition de fichiers `.drawio`","Utilisation de polices personnalisées","Génération automatique d''images `.drawio.png`","Compatibilité avec Quarto slides","Configuration de police avec `defaultFontFamily`","Style de texte personnalisable"],"de":["Bearbeitung von `.drawio`-Dateien","Verwendung von benutzerdefinierten Schriftarten","Automatische Generierung von `.drawio.png`-Bildern","Kompatibilität mit Quarto-Folien","Schriftarteneinstellung mit `defaultFontFamily`","Benutzerdefinierter Textstil"],"pt":["Edição de arquivos .drawio","Geração automática de imagens .drawio.png","Configuração de fontes personalizadas","Compatibilidade com Quarto slides","Suporte a pré-commit hook"],"ru":["Редактирование файлов .drawio","Автоматическая генерация изображений .drawio.png","Настройка пользовательских шрифтов","Совместимость с Quarto слайдами","Поддержка pré-commit hook"],"ar":["تحرير ملفات .drawio","توليد تلقائي لصور .drawio.png","ضبط خطوط مخصصة","توافق مع شرائح Quarto","دعم hook مسبق للالتزام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["draw.io","图表编辑","开发者工具","Quarto 幻灯片","字体设置","自动生成","开发最佳实践","开源工具"],"ja":["draw.io","図表編集","開発者ツール","Quarto スライド","フォント設定","自動生成","開発ベストプラクティス","オープンソースツール"],"ko":["draw.io","다이어그램 편집","개발자 도구","Quarto 슬라이드","글꼴 설정","자동 생성","개발 모범 사례","오픈소스 도구"],"es":["draw.io","diagramas","Quarto slides","fuentes personalizadas","generación automática de imágenes","compatibilidad con Quarto","configuración de fuente","estilo de texto","herramienta de diagramación"],"fr":["draw.io","diagrammes","Quarto slides","polices personnalisées","génération automatique d''images","compatibilité avec Quarto","configuration de police","style de texte","outil de diagramme"],"de":["draw.io","Diagramme","Quarto-Folien","benutzerdefinierte Schriftarten","automatische Generierung von Bildern","Kompatibilität mit Quarto","Schriftarteneinstellung","Textstil","Diagrammwerkzeug"],"pt":["draw.io","diagramação","edição de diagramas","Quarto slides","pré-commit hook","fontes personalizadas","geração de imagens"],"ru":["draw.io","диаграммирование","редактирование диаграмм","Quarto слайды","pré-commit hook","пользовательские шрифты","генерация изображений"],"ar":["draw.io","مخططات","تحرير مخططات","شرائح Quarto","hook مسبق للالتزام","خطوط مخصصة","توليد صور"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"draw-io","description":"draw.io diagram creation, editing, and review. Use for .drawio XML editing, PNG conversion, layout adjustment, and AWS icon usage.","bodyPreview":"# draw.io Diagram Skill\n\n## 1. Basic Rules\n\n- Edit only `.drawio` files\n- Do not directly edit `.drawio.png` files\n- Use auto-generated `.drawio.png` by pre-commit hook in slides\n\n## 2. Font Settings\n\nFor diagrams used in Quarto slides,\nspecify `defaultFontFamily` in mxGraphModel tag:\n\n```xml\n<mxGraphModel defaultFontFamily=\"Noto Sans JP\" ...>\n```\n\nAlso explicitly specify `fontFamily` in each text element''s style attribute:\n\n```xml\nstyle=\"text;html=1;fontSize=27;fontFamily=Noto Sans JP;\"\n```\n\n##","body":"# draw.io Diagram Skill\n\n## 1. Basic Rules\n\n- Edit only `.drawio` files\n- Do not directly edit `.drawio.png` files\n- Use auto-generated `.drawio.png` by pre-commit hook in slides\n\n## 2. Font Settings\n\nFor diagrams used in Quarto slides,\nspecify `defaultFontFamily` in mxGraphModel tag:\n\n```xml\n<mxGraphModel defaultFontFamily=\"Noto Sans JP\" ...>\n```\n\nAlso explicitly specify `fontFamily` in each text element''s style attribute:\n\n```xml\nstyle=\"text;html=1;fontSize=27;fontFamily=Noto Sans JP;\"\n```\n\n## 3. Conversion Commands\n\nSee conversion script at [scripts/convert-drawio-to-png.sh](scripts/convert-drawio-to-png.sh).\n\n```sh\n# Convert all .drawio files\nmise exec -- pre-commit run --all-files\n\n# Convert specific .drawio file\nmise exec -- pre-commit run convert-drawio-to-png --files assets/my-diagram.drawio\n\n# Run script directly (using skill''s script)\nbash ~/.claude/skills/draw-io/scripts/convert-drawio-to-png.sh assets/diagram1.drawio\n```\n\nInternal command used:\n\n```sh\ndrawio -x -f png -s 2 -t -o output.drawio.png input.drawio\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `-x` | Export mode |\n| `-f png` | PNG format output |\n| `-s 2` | 2x scale (high resolution) |\n| `-t` | Transparent background |\n| `-o` | Output file path |\n\n## 4. Layout Adjustment\n\n### 4.1. Coordinate Adjustment Steps\n\n1. Open `.drawio` file in text editor (plain XML format)\n2. Find `mxCell` for element to adjust (search by `value` attribute for text)\n3. Adjust coordinates in `mxGeometry` tag\n   - `x`: Position from left\n   - `y`: Position from top\n   - `width`: Width\n   - `height`: Height\n4. Run conversion and verify\n\n### 4.2. Coordinate Calculation\n\n- Element center coordinate = `y + (height / 2)`\n- To align multiple elements, calculate and match center coordinates\n\n## 5. Design Principles\n\n### 5.1. Basic Principles\n\n- Clarity: Create simple, visually clean diagrams\n- Consistency: Unify colors, fonts, icon sizes, line thickness\n- Accuracy: Do not sacrifice accuracy for simplification\n\n### 5.2. Element Rules\n\n- Label all elements\n- Use arrows to indicate direction\n  (prefer 2 unidirectional arrows over bidirectional)\n- Use latest official icons\n- Add legend to explain custom symbols\n\n### 5.3. Accessibility\n\n- Ensure sufficient color contrast\n- Use patterns in addition to colors\n\n### 5.4. Progressive Disclosure\n\nSeparate complex systems into staged diagrams:\n\n| Diagram Type | Purpose |\n|--------------|---------|\n| Context Diagram | System overview from external perspective |\n| System Diagram | Main components and relationships |\n| Component Diagram | Technical details and integration points |\n| Deployment Diagram | Infrastructure configuration |\n| Data Flow Diagram | Data flow and transformation |\n| Sequence Diagram | Time-series interactions |\n\n### 5.5. Metadata\n\nInclude title, description, last updated, author, and version in diagrams.\n\n## 6. Best Practices\n\n### 6.1. Background Color\n\n- Remove `background=\"#ffffff\"`\n- Transparent background adapts to various themes\n\n### 6.2. Font Size\n\n- Use 1.5x standard font size (around 18px) for PDF readability\n\n### 6.3. Japanese Text Width\n\n- Allow 30-40px per character\n- Insufficient width causes unintended line breaks\n\n```xml\n<!-- For 10-character text, allow 300-400px -->\n<mxGeometry x=\"140\" y=\"60\" width=\"400\" height=\"40\" />\n```\n\n### 6.4. Arrow Placement\n\n- Always place arrows at back (position in XML right after Title)\n- Position arrows to avoid overlapping with labels\n- Keep arrow start/end at least 20px from label bottom edge\n\n```xml\n<!-- Title -->\n<mxCell id=\"title\" value=\"...\" .../>\n\n<!-- Arrows (back layer) -->\n<mxCell id=\"arrow1\" style=\"edgeStyle=...\" .../>\n\n<!-- Other elements (front layer) -->\n<mxCell id=\"box1\" .../>\n```\n\n### 6.5. Arrow Connection to Text Labels\n\nFor text elements, exitX/exitY don''t work, so use explicit coordinates:\n\n```xml\n<!-- Good: Explicit coordinates with sourcePoint/targetPoint -->\n<mxCell id=\"arrow\" style=\"...\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\">\n  <mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\">\n    <mxPoint x=\"1279\" y=\"500\" as=\"sourcePoint\"/>\n    <mxPoint x=\"119\" y=\"500\" as=\"targetPoint\"/>\n    <Array as=\"points\">\n      <mxPoint x=\"1279\" y=\"560\"/>\n      <mxPoint x=\"119\" y=\"560\"/>\n    </Array>\n  </mxGeometry>\n</mxCell>\n```\n\n### 6.6. edgeLabel Offset Adjustment\n\nAdjust offset attribute to distance arrow labels from arrows:\n\n```xml\n<!-- Place above arrow (negative value to distance) -->\n<mxPoint x=\"0\" y=\"-40\" as=\"offset\"/>\n\n<!-- Place below arrow (positive value to distance) -->\n<mxPoint x=\"0\" y=\"40\" as=\"offset\"/>\n```\n\n### 6.7. Remove Unnecessary Elements\n\n- Remove decorative icons irrelevant to context\n- Example: If ECR exists, separate Docker icon is unnecessary\n\n### 6.8. Labels and Headings\n\n- Service name only: 1 line\n- Service name + supplementary info: 2 lines with line break\n- Redundant notation (e.g., ECR Container Registry): shorten to 1 line\n- Use `&lt;br&gt;` tag for line breaks\n\n### 6.9. Background Frame and Internal Element Placement\n\nWhen placing elements inside background frames (grouping boxes),\nensure sufficient margin.\n\n- YOU MUST: Internal elements must have at least 30px margin from frame boundary\n- YOU MUST: Account for rounded corners (`rounded=1`) and stroke width\n- YOU MUST: Always visually verify PNG output for overflow\n\nCoordinate calculation verification:\n\n```text\nBackground frame: y=20, height=400 -> range is y=20-420\nInternal element top: frame y + 30 or more (e.g., y=50)\nInternal element bottom: frame y + height - 30 or less (e.g., up to y=390)\n```\n\nBad example (may overflow):\n\n```xml\n<!-- Background frame -->\n<mxCell id=\"bg\" style=\"rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;...\">\n  <mxGeometry x=\"500\" y=\"20\" width=\"560\" height=\"400\" />\n</mxCell>\n<!-- Text: y=30 is too close to frame top (y=20) -->\n<mxCell id=\"label\" value=\"Title\" style=\"text;...\">\n  <mxGeometry x=\"510\" y=\"30\" width=\"540\" height=\"35\" />\n</mxCell>\n```\n\nGood example (sufficient margin):\n\n```xml\n<!-- Background frame -->\n<mxCell id=\"bg\" style=\"rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;...\">\n  <mxGeometry x=\"500\" y=\"20\" width=\"560\" height=\"430\" />\n</mxCell>\n<!-- Text: y=50 is 30px from frame top (y=20) -->\n<mxCell id=\"label\" value=\"Title\" style=\"text;...\">\n  <mxGeometry x=\"510\" y=\"50\" width=\"540\" height=\"35\" />\n</mxCell>\n```\n\n## 7. Reference\n\n- [Layout Guidelines](references/layout-guidelines.md)\n- [AWS Icons](references/aws-icons.md)\n- [AWS Icon Search Script](scripts/find_aws_icon.py)\n\nAWS icon search examples:\n\n```sh\npython ~/.claude/skills/draw-io/scripts/find_aws_icon.py ec2\npython ~/.claude/skills/draw-io/scripts/find_aws_icon.py lambda\n```\n\n## 8. Checklist\n\n- [ ] No background color set (page=\"0\")\n- [ ] Font size appropriate (larger recommended)\n- [ ] Arrows placed at back layer\n- [ ] Arrows not overlapping labels (verify in PNG)\n- [ ] Arrow start/end sufficiently distant from labels (at least 20px)\n- [ ] Arrows not penetrating boxes or icons (verify in PNG)\n- [ ] Internal elements not overflowing background frame (verify in PNG)\n- [ ] 30px+ margin between background frame and internal elements\n- [ ] AWS service names are official names/correct abbreviations\n- [ ] AWS icons are latest version (mxgraph.aws4.*)\n- [ ] No unnecessary elements remaining\n- [ ] Visually verified PNG conversion\n\n## 9. Image Display in reveal.js Slides\n\nAdd `auto-stretch: false` to YAML header:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: \"Your Presentation\"\nformat:\n  revealjs:\n    auto-stretch: false\n---\n```\n\nThis ensures correct image display on mobile devices.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:59:16.678Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visualization Agents needing advanced diagram editing capabilities with .drawio files.","zh":"适合需要高级图表编辑功能的可视化代理，特别是使用.drawio文件。","ja":"可視化エージェントが.drawioファイルを使用して高度な図の編集機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시각화 에이전트가 다이어그램 편집 기능을 사용하여 .drawio 파일을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de visualización que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de edición de diagramas con archivos .drawio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de visualisation ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées d''édition de diagrammes avec des fichiers .drawio.","de":"Perfekt für Visualisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Diagrammbearbeitungsfunktionen mit .drawio-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização que precisam de capacidades avançadas de edição de diagramas com arquivos .drawio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуализации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности редактирования диаграмм с файлами .drawio.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحرير المخططات باستخدام ملفات .drawio."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and edit diagrams using mxGraphModel tags, specifying defaultFontFamily and fontFamily in text elements'' style attributes, and leveraging auto-generated .drawio.png files through pre-commit hooks.","zh":"赋予代理创建和编辑图表的能力，使用mxGraphModel标签，指定文本元素样式属性中的默认字体和字体系列，并通过预提交钩子利用自动生成的.drawio.png文件。","ja":"エージェントに、mxGraphModelタグを使用して図を生成および編集し、テキスト要素のスタイル属性でdefaultFontFamilyとfontFamilyを指定し、事前コミットフックを介して自動生成された.drawio.pngファイルを利用する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 mxGraphModel 태그를 사용하여 다이어그램을 생성하고 편집하며, 텍스트 요소의 스타일 속성에서 기본 글꼴과 글꼴을 지정하고, 사전 커밋 후크를 통해 자동 생성된 .drawio.png 파일을 활용하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y editar diagramas utilizando etiquetas mxGraphModel, especificando defaultFontFamily y fontFamily en los atributos de estilo de los elementos de texto, y aprovechando los archivos .drawio.png generados automáticamente a través de ganchos pre-compromiso.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de modifier des diagrammes en utilisant des balises mxGraphModel, en spécifiant defaultFontFamily et fontFamily dans les attributs de style des éléments de texte, et en exploitant les fichiers .drawio.png générés automatiquement via des hooks pré-engagement.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Diagramme zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten, indem sie mxGraphModel-Tags verwenden, defaultFontFamily und fontFamily in den Stilattributen von Textelementen angeben und automatisch generierte .drawio.png-Dateien über Vorab-Commit-Hooks nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e editar diagramas usando tags mxGraphModel, especificando defaultFontFamily e fontFamily nos atributos de estilo dos elementos de texto, e aproveitando arquivos .drawio.png gerados automaticamente por meio de ganchos pré-compromisso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и редактировать диаграммы с помощью тегов mxGraphModel, указывая defaultFontFamily и fontFamily в атрибутах стиля текстовых элементов, и используя автоматически сгенерированные файлы .drawio.png через крючки предкоммита.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مخططات وتحريرها باستخدام علامات mxGraphModel، وتحديد العائلة الافتراضية للخط والخط في سمات نمط عناصر النص، وتفعيل الملفات .drawio.png المُنشأة تلقائيًا عبر مشابك ما قبل الالتزام."},"useCases":{"en":["Editing .drawio files for precise diagram control","Generating diagrams with custom font settings for Quarto slides","Automating .drawio.png file generation for presentation slides"],"zh":["用于精确图表控制的.drawio文件编辑","用于Quarto幻灯片的自定义字体设置生成图表","用于演示幻灯片的.drawio.png文件自动生成"],"ja":["正確な図の制御のための.drawioファイルの編集","Quartoスライド用のカスタムフォント設定による図の生成","プレゼンテーションスライド用の.drawio.pngファイルの自動生成"],"ko":["정확한 다이어그램 제어를 위한 .drawio 파일 편집","Quarto 슬라이드에 대한 사용자 정의 글꼴 설정을 사용한 다이어그램 생성","프레젠테이션 슬라이드에 대한 .drawio.png 파일 자동 생성"],"es":["Edición de archivos .drawio para un control de diagrama preciso","Generación de diagramas con configuraciones de fuentes personalizadas para diapositivas de Quarto","Automatización de la generación de archivos .drawio.png para diapositivas de presentación"],"fr":["Édition de fichiers .drawio pour un contrôle de diagramme précis","Génération de diagrammes avec des paramètres de police personnalisés pour les diapositives Quarto","Automatisation de la génération de fichiers .drawio.png pour les diapositives de présentation"],"de":["Bearbeitung von .drawio-Dateien für eine präzise Diagrammsteuerung","Generierung von Diagrammen mit benutzerdefinierten Schriftarteinstellungen für Quarto-Folien","Automatisierung der Generierung von .drawio.png-Dateien für Präsentationsfolien"],"pt":["Edição de arquivos .drawio para controle preciso de diagramas","Geração de diagramas com configurações de fonte personalizadas para slides Quarto","Geração automática de arquivos .drawio.png para slides de apresentação"],"ru":["Редактирование файлов .drawio для точного контроля диаграмм","Генерация диаграмм с настраиваемыми настройками шрифта для слайдов Quarto","Автоматическая генерация файлов .drawio.png для слайдов презентации"],"ar":["تحرير ملفات .drawio لمراقبة دقيقة للمخططات","إنشاء مخططات بإعدادات خط مخصصة لشرائح كوارتو","توليد ملفات .drawio.png تلقائيًا لشرائح العرض"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to editing .drawio files","Requires pre-commit hook for auto-generated .drawio.png files","Specific font settings required for Quarto slides"],"zh":["仅限编辑.drawio文件","需要预提交钩子来生成.drawio.png文件","Quarto幻灯片需要特定的字体设置"],"ja":[".drawioファイルの編集のみ","自動生成された.drawio.pngファイルのために事前コミットフックが必要","Quartoスライドには特定のフォント設定が必要"],"ko":[".drawio 파일 편집만 가능","자동 생성된 .drawio.png 파일을 위해 사전 커밋 후크가 필요","Quarto 슬라이드에는 특정 글꼴 설정이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a la edición de archivos .drawio","Requiere un gancho pre-compromiso para archivos .drawio.png generados automáticamente","Configuraciones de fuente específicas requeridas para diapositivas de Quarto"],"fr":["Limité à l''édition de fichiers .drawio","Nécessite un hook pré-engagement pour les fichiers .drawio.png générés automatiquement","Paramètres de police spécifiques requis pour les diapositives Quarto"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Bearbeitung von .drawio-Dateien","Benötigt einen Vorab-Commit-Hook für automatisch generierte .drawio.png-Dateien","Spezifische Schriftarteinstellungen erforderlich für Quarto-Folien"],"pt":["Limitado à edição de arquivos .drawio","Exige gancho pré-compromisso para arquivos .drawio.png gerados automaticamente","Configurações de fonte específicas necessárias para slides Quarto"],"ru":["Ограничен редактированием файлов .drawio","Требует крючка предкоммита для автоматически сгенерированных файлов .drawio.png","Требуются специальные настройки шрифта для слайдов Quarto"],"ar":["محدود بتحرير ملفات .drawio","يتطلب مشبكًا قبل الالتزام لملفات .drawio.png المُنشأة تلقائيًا","إعدادات خط معينة مطلوبة لشرائح كوارتو"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/google-spaces-updates', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'google-spaces-updates', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z', '2026-02-18T14:00:09.133Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/google-spaces-updates","name":"google-spaces-updates","description":{"zh":"Google Spaces 更新允许您通过 webhook 将更新发布到团队 Google Chat Space","ja":"Google Spaces アップデートでは、Webhook を使用してチームの Google Chat Space に更新を投稿できます","ko":"구글 스페이스 업데이트에서는 웹후크를 사용하여 팀의 구글 채팅 공간에 업데이트를 게시할 수 있습니다","pt":"O Google Spaces Updates é uma ferramenta que permite postar atualizações em um espaço de equipe do Google Chat via webhook, melhorando a colaboração e a comunicação da equipe.","ru":"Обновления Google Spaces — это инструмент, который позволяет размещать обновления в командном чате Google Spaces через вебхук, улучшая командную работу и связь.","ar":"تحديثات مساحات جوجل هي أداة تمكن من نشر التحديثات إلى مساحة فريق جوجل شات عبر الويب هوك، مما يحسن من التعاون والتواصل الفريق.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Google Spaces 更新","ja":"Google Spaces アップデート","ko":"구글 스페이스 업데이트","pt":"Atualizações do Google Spaces: Integração com Webhook","ru":"Обновления Google Spaces: интеграция с вебхуком","ar":"تحديثات مساحات جوجل: دمج مع الويب هوك","en":"google-spaces-updates"},"description":{"zh":"Google Spaces 更新允许您通过 webhook 将更新发布到团队 Google Chat Space","ja":"Google Spaces アップデートでは、Webhook を使用してチームの Google Chat Space に更新を投稿できます","ko":"구글 스페이스 업데이트에서는 웹후크를 사용하여 팀의 구글 채팅 공간에 업데이트를 게시할 수 있습니다","pt":"O Google Spaces Updates é uma ferramenta que permite postar atualizações em um espaço de equipe do Google Chat via webhook, melhorando a colaboração e a comu...","ru":"Обновления Google Spaces — это инструмент, который позволяет размещать обновления в командном чате Google Spaces через вебхук, улучшая командную работу и связь.","ar":"تحديثات مساحات جوجل هي أداة تمكن من نشر التحديثات إلى مساحة فريق جوجل شات عبر الويب هوك، مما يحسن من التعاون والتواصل الفريق.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["通过 webhook 将更新发布到团队 Google Chat Space","支持设置和管理 Google Chat Space 的 webhook","提供快速入门指南和设置说明","支持多语言和区域设置"],"ja":["Webhook を使用してチームの Google Chat Space に更新を投稿","Google Chat Space の webhook を設定および管理","クイックスタートガイドと設定手順を提供","複数言語とロケールをサポート"],"ko":["웹후크를 사용하여 팀의 구글 채팅 공간에 업데이트를 게시","구글 채팅 공간의 웹후크를 설정 및 관리","快速 시작 가이드와 설정 지침을 제공","複数 언어와 로케일을 지원"],"pt":["Integração com o Google Chat","Envio de atualizações via webhook","Configuração rápida e fácil","Melhoria da colaboração e comunicação da equipe","Compatibilidade com projetos em produção"],"ru":["Интеграция с Google Chat","Отправка обновлений через вебхук","Быстрая и легкая настройка","Улучшение командной работы и связи","Совместимость с проектами в производстве"],"ar":["دمج مع جوجل شات","إرسال التحديثات عبر الويب هوك","إعداد سريع وسهل","تحسين التعاون والتواصل الفريق","التوافق مع المشاريع في الإنتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Google Spaces 更新","Google Chat Space","webhook","团队协作","项目管理","开发工具"],"ja":["Google Spaces アップデート","Google Chat Space","Webhook","チームコラボレーション","プロジェクト管理","開発ツール"],"ko":["구글 스페이스 업데이트","구글 채팅 공간","웹후크","팀 협업","프로젝트 관리","개발 도구"],"pt":["google spaces updates","integração com google chat","webhook","colaboração em equipe","comunicação em equipe","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["обновления google spaces","интеграция с google chat","вебхук","командная работа","связь в команде","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تحديثات مساحات جوجل","دمج مع جوجل شات","الويب هوك","تعاون الفريق","تواصل الفريق","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-spaces-updates","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Google Spaces Updates\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-09\n\nPost updates to a team Google Chat Space via webhook.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Setup (first time per project)\n\nRun `/google-spaces-updates setup` or manually create `.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": {\n    \"name\": \"my-project\",\n    \"repo\": \"github.com/org/my-project\"\n  },\n  \"team\": {\n    \"chat_webhook\": \"https://chat.googleapis.com/v1/spaces/SPACE_ID/messages?key=KEY&token=TOKEN\",\n    \"members\":","body":"# Google Spaces Updates\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-09\n\nPost updates to a team Google Chat Space via webhook.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Setup (first time per project)\n\nRun `/google-spaces-updates setup` or manually create `.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": {\n    \"name\": \"my-project\",\n    \"repo\": \"github.com/org/my-project\"\n  },\n  \"team\": {\n    \"chat_webhook\": \"https://chat.googleapis.com/v1/spaces/SPACE_ID/messages?key=KEY&token=TOKEN\",\n    \"members\": [\"Deepinder\", \"Joshua\", \"Raquel\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Post an update\n\n```\n\"Post deployment update to team\"\n\"Tell the team about the new feature\"\n\"Ask the team about the auth approach\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## How It Works\n\n### Step 1: Check for project settings\n\nLook for `.claude/settings.json` in the current project directory:\n\n```bash\ncat .claude/settings.json 2>/dev/null || echo \"NOT_FOUND\"\n```\n\nIf NOT_FOUND, ask the user:\n> \"This project doesn''t have Google Spaces configured. Would you like me to set it up? I''ll need the webhook URL for your team''s Google Space.\"\n\nThen create the file using the template in `templates/settings-template.json`.\n\n### Step 2: Determine update type\n\nBased on the command or context, determine the update type:\n\n| Type | When to use |\n|------|-------------|\n| `deployment` | After pushing to production/staging, deploying to Vercel/etc |\n| `bugfix` | After fixing a bug, especially one reported by team |\n| `feature` | After completing a feature that''s ready for review/use |\n| `question` | When blocked or need team input on a decision |\n| `custom` | For anything else |\n\n### Step 3: Gather context\n\nCollect relevant information to include:\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits (for context)\ngit log --oneline -3 2>/dev/null\n\n# Current branch\ngit branch --show-current 2>/dev/null\n\n# Changed files (if recent changes)\ngit diff --name-only HEAD~1 2>/dev/null | head -10\n```\n\nAlso use context from the conversation:\n- What was just completed\n- Any preview/production URLs\n- Relevant file paths\n- Who might need to know\n\n### Step 4: Format the message\n\nUse the appropriate template from `templates/` directory.\n\n**Key formatting rules for Google Chat:**\n- Use `*bold*` for emphasis (not **markdown bold**)\n- Use `_italic_` for secondary text\n- Newlines work as expected\n- Keep messages concise but informative\n- Include actionable links when relevant\n\n### Step 5: Post to webhook\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"WEBHOOK_URL\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"text\": \"MESSAGE_HERE\"}''\n```\n\nReplace:\n- `WEBHOOK_URL` with value from `.claude/settings.json` → `team.chat_webhook`\n- `MESSAGE_HERE` with the formatted message (escape quotes properly)\n\n### Step 6: Confirm to user\n\nAfter posting, tell the user:\n> \"Posted update to team chat: [brief summary of what was posted]\"\n\n---\n\n## Message Templates\n\n### Deployment\n```\n🚀 *Deployed: [PROJECT_NAME]*\n\n[WHAT_CHANGED - 1-2 sentences]\n\n• Branch: `[BRANCH]`\n• Commit: `[COMMIT_HASH]`\n[• Preview: URL (if applicable)]\n[• Production: URL (if applicable)]\n\n_Posted by [USER] via Claude Code_\n```\n\n### Bug Fix\n```\n🐛 *Bug Fixed: [PROJECT_NAME]*\n\n*Problem:* [What was broken]\n*Solution:* [How it was fixed]\n*Files:* [Key files changed]\n\n[• Commit: `[COMMIT_HASH]`]\n\n_Please verify if you reported this issue._\n```\n\n### Feature Complete\n```\n✨ *Feature Complete: [PROJECT_NAME]*\n\n*[FEATURE_NAME]*\n\n[DESCRIPTION - what it does, 1-2 sentences]\n\n[• Demo: URL]\n[• Files: key files]\n\n_Ready for review/testing._\n```\n\n### Question\n```\n❓ *Question: [PROJECT_NAME]*\n\n[QUESTION - clear and specific]\n\n*Context:*\n[Relevant background - what you''re working on, what you''ve tried]\n\n*Options considered:*\n1. [Option A]\n2. [Option B]\n\n_@[PERSON] - would appreciate your input_\n```\n\n### Custom\n```\n📢 *Update: [PROJECT_NAME]*\n\n[MESSAGE]\n\n_Posted by [USER] via Claude Code_\n```\n\n---\n\n## Setup Command\n\nWhen user runs `/google-spaces-updates setup`:\n\n1. Ask for the Google Spaces webhook URL\n2. Ask for project name (or detect from package.json/repo)\n3. Ask for team members (optional)\n4. Create `.claude/settings.json` using the template\n5. Add `.claude/` to `.gitignore` if not already there\n6. Confirm setup is complete\n\n---\n\n## Proactive Suggestions\n\nSuggest posting an update when:\n- User says \"done\", \"finished\", \"completed\" after significant work\n- After a `git push` to main/master/production\n- User mentions team members by name\n- User seems blocked and might benefit from team input\n\nAsk: \"Would you like me to post an update to the team about this?\"\n\n---\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- Minor refactors, typo fixes\n- WIP commits that aren''t ready for review\n- Internal debugging/testing\n- Anything that would just be noise\n\n---\n\n## Getting a Webhook URL\n\n1. Open Google Chat\n2. Navigate to your Space\n3. Click Space name → **Apps & integrations** → **Webhooks**\n4. Click **Add webhook**\n5. Name it (e.g., \"Claude Code Updates\")\n6. Copy the webhook URL\n\nThe URL format: `https://chat.googleapis.com/v1/spaces/SPACE_ID/messages?key=KEY&token=TOKEN`\n\n**Security**: Keep webhook URLs private. Add `.claude/settings.json` to `.gitignore`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:00:09.133Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for DevOps Automation Agents requiring real-time team notifications via Google Chat Spaces.","zh":"适用于需要通过Google Chat Spaces进行实时团队通知的DevOps自动化代理。","ja":"Google Chat Spaces経由でリアルタイムのチーム通知を必要とするDevOps自動化エージェントに不可欠。","ko":"Google Chat Spaces를 통해 실시간 팀 알림이 필요한 DevOps 자동화 에이전트에 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de automatización de DevOps que requieren notificaciones de equipo en tiempo real a través de Google Chat Spaces.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps nécessitant des notifications d''équipe en temps réel via Google Chat Spaces.","de":"Wesentlich für DevOps-Automatisierungsagenten, die Echtzeit-Teambenachrichtigungen über Google Chat Spaces erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Automação de DevOps que requerem notificações em tempo real da equipe por meio de espaços do Google Chat.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов автоматизации DevOps, требующих уведомлений команды в режиме реального времени через Google Chat Spaces.","ar":"ضروري لعميل آلي آلي DevOps الذي يتطلب إخطارات الفريق في الوقت الفعلي عبر مساحات دردشة جوجل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct webhook integration with Google Chat Spaces using the Google Chat API v1 endpoint, allowing agents to post structured updates and deployment notifications without manual intervention. Streamlines team communication by automating status reports directly to designated team channels.","zh":"通过Google Chat API v1端点实现与Google Chat Spaces的直接Webhook集成，允许代理在无需手动干预的情况下发布结构化更新和部署通知。通过直接将状态报告自动发送到指定的团队频道来简化团队沟通。","ja":"Google Chat API v1エンドポイントを使用してGoogle Chat Spacesとの直接的なWebhook統合を可能にし、エージェントが手動介入なしに構造化された更新とデプロイ通知を投稿できるようにします。ステータスレポートを指定されたチームチャンネルに直接自動送信することでチームコミュニケーションを合理化します。","ko":"Google Chat API v1 엔드포인트를 사용하여 Google Chat Spaces와 직접적인 웹후크 통합을 가능하게 하여 에이전트가 수동 개입 없이 구조화된 업데이트와 배포 알림을 게시할 수 있도록 합니다. 상태 보고서를 지정된 팀 채널에 직접 자동으로 보냄으로써 팀 의사소통을 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa de webhook con Google Chat Spaces utilizando el punto de conexión de la API de Google Chat v1, lo que permite a los agentes publicar actualizaciones estructuradas y notificaciones de implementación sin intervención manual. Establece la comunicación del equipo mediante la automatización de informes de estado directamente a los canales de equipo designados.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe de webhook avec Google Chat Spaces en utilisant le point de terminaison de l''API Google Chat v1, ce qui permet aux agents de publier des mises à jour structurées et des notifications de déploiement sans intervention manuelle. Rationalise la communication d''équipe en automatisant les rapports d''état directement aux canaux d''équipe désignés.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Webhook-Integration mit Google Chat Spaces unter Verwendung des Google Chat API v1-Endpunkts, wodurch Agenten strukturierte Updates und Bereitstellungsbenachrichtigungen ohne manuelle Eingriffe posten können. Rationalisiert die Teamkommunikation durch die Automatisierung von Statusberichten direkt an die dafür vorgesehenen Teamkanäle.","pt":"Permite integração direta de webhook com Google Chat Spaces usando o endpoint da API do Google Chat v1, permitindo que os agentes publiquem atualizações estruturadas e notificações de implantação sem intervenção manual. Otimize a comunicação da equipe, automatizando relatórios de status diretamente para canais de equipe designados.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую интегрировать webhook с Google Chat Spaces, используя конечную точку API Google Chat v1, что позволяет агентам публиковать структурированные обновления и уведомления о развертывании без ручного вмешательства. Упрощает командную коммуникацию, автоматизируя отчеты о статусе непосредственно в назначенные командные каналы.","ar":"يمكن التكامل المباشر للويب هوك مع مساحات دردشة جوجل باستخدام نهاية نقطة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جوجل تشات v1، مما يسمح للعميل النشر التحديثات المتوازنة والإشعارات الإنشائية دون تدخل يدوي. ي简 化 التواصل الفريق من خلال تلقائية تقارير الحالة مباشرة إلى القنوات الفريقية المحددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Posting deployment status updates","Automating CI/CD pipeline notifications","Sending real-time error alerts","Broadcasting system health reports"],"zh":["发布部署状态更新","自动化CI/CD管道通知","发送实时错误警报","广播系统运行状况报告"],"ja":["デプロイ状態の更新を投稿する","CI/CDパイプラインの通知を自動化する","リアルタイムのエラーアラートを送信する","システムの正常性レポートを放送する"],"ko":["배포 상태 업데이트를 게시합니다","CI/CD 파이프라인 알림을 자동화합니다","실시간 오류 경보를发送합니다","시스템 상태 보고서를 방송합니다"],"es":["Publicar actualizaciones de estado de implementación","Automatizar notificaciones de canalización de CI/CD","Enviar alertas de error en tiempo real","Transmitir informes de salud del sistema"],"fr":["Publier des mises à jour de l''état de déploiement","Automatiser les notifications de pipeline CI/CD","Envoyer des alertes d''erreur en temps réel","Diffuser des rapports de santé du système"],"de":["Bereitstellungsstatus-Updates posten","CI/CD-Pipeline-Benachrichtigungen automatisieren","Echtzeit-Fehlerwarnungen senden","Systemgesundheitsberichte übertragen"],"pt":["Publicar atualizações de status de implantação","Automatizar notificações de pipeline de CI/CD","Enviar alertas de erro em tempo real","Transmitir relatórios de saúde do sistema"],"ru":["Публиковать обновления статуса развертывания","Автоматизировать уведомления о конвейере CI/CD","Отправлять уведомления об ошибках в режиме реального времени","Транслировать отчеты о здоровье системы"],"ar":["نشر تحديثات حالة النشر","توفير إشعارات أنابيب CI/CD","إرسال تنبيهات خطأ في الوقت الفعلي","بث تقارير حالة النظام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pre-configured webhook URL","Needs Google Space permissions setup","Depends on .claude/settings.json configuration"],"zh":["需要预先配置的Webhook URL","需要Google空间权限设置","依赖.claude/settings.json配置"],"ja":["事前に設定されたWebhook URLが必要","Googleスペースの権限設定が必要",".claude/settings.jsonの構成に依存"],"ko":["사전 구성된 웹후크 URL이 필요합니다","구글 공간 권한 설정이 필요합니다",".claude/settings.json 구성에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere una URL de webhook preconfigurada","Necesita la configuración de permisos de Google Space","Depende de la configuración de .claude/settings.json"],"fr":["Nécessite une URL de webhook préconfigurée","Nécessite la configuration des autorisations de Google Space","Dépend de la configuration de .claude/settings.json"],"de":["Benötigt eine vorkonfigurierte Webhook-URL","Benötigt die Einrichtung von Google Space-Berechtigungen","Hängt von der Konfiguration von .claude/settings.json ab"],"pt":["Requer URL de webhook pré-configurado","Necessita configuração de permissões do Google Space","Depende da configuração .claude/settings.json"],"ru":["Требует предварительно настроенного URL-адреса вебхука","Требует настройки разрешений Google Space","Зависит от конфигурации .claude/settings.json"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان Url للويب هوك مسبقا","يحتاج إلى إعداد صلاحيات مساحة جوجل","يعتمد على إعدادات .claude/settings.json"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/typescript-advanced-types', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'typescript-advanced-types', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z', '2026-02-18T14:00:02.347Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/typescript-advanced-types","name":"typescript-advanced-types","description":{"zh":"TypeScript 高级类型提供了强大的类型安全功能，包括泛型、条件类型、映射类型、模板字面量类型和实用类型","ja":"TypeScript の高級タイプは、ジェネリック、条件付きタイプ、マップタイプ、テンプレートリテラルタイプ、ユーティリティタイプを提供し、強力なタイプセーフな機能を実現","ko":"타입스크립트 고급 타입은 제네릭, 조건부 타입, 매핑 타입, 템플릿 리터럴 타입, 유틸리티 타입을 제공하여 강력한 타입 안전한 기능을 제공","es":"Tipos avanzados de TypeScript para aplicaciones robustas y seguras.","fr":"Types avancés de TypeScript pour des applications robustes et sécurisées.","de":"Erweiterte Typen von TypeScript für robuste und sichere Anwendungen.","pt":"O sistema de tipos avançados do TypeScript é fundamental para construir aplicações robustas e seguras. Aprenda a usar generics, tipos condicionais e mais.","ru":"Система расширенных типов TypeScript является основой для создания надежных и безопасных приложений. Узнайте, как использовать generics, условные типы и многое другое.","ar":"نظام الأنواع المتقدمة في TypeScript هو الأساس لبناء تطبيقات قوية وآمنة. تعلم كيفية استخدام generics و أنواع الشرطية وغيرها.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TypeScript 高级类型","ja":"TypeScript 高级タイプ","ko":"타입스크립트 고급 타입","es":"Tipos avanzados de TypeScript","fr":"Types avancés de TypeScript","de":"Erweiterte Typen von TypeScript","pt":"Tipos Avançados TypeScript - Guia Completa","ru":"Расширенные типы TypeScript - полное руководство","ar":"أنواع TypeScript المتقدمة - دليل شاملة","en":"typescript-advanced-types"},"description":{"zh":"TypeScript 高级类型提供了强大的类型安全功能，包括泛型、条件类型、映射类型、模板字面量类型和实用类型","ja":"TypeScript の高級タイプは、ジェネリック、条件付きタイプ、マップタイプ、テンプレートリテラルタイプ、ユーティリティタイプを提供し、強力なタイプセーフな機能を実現","ko":"타입스크립트 고급 타입은 제네릭, 조건부 타입, 매핑 타입, 템플릿 리터럴 타입, 유틸리티 타입을 제공하여 강력한 타입 안전한 기능을 제공","es":"Tipos avanzados de TypeScript para aplicaciones robustas y seguras.","fr":"Types avancés de TypeScript pour des applications robustes et sécurisées.","de":"Erweiterte Typen von TypeScript für robuste und sichere Anwendungen.","pt":"O sistema de tipos avançados do TypeScript é fundamental para construir aplicações robustas e seguras. Aprenda a usar generics, tipos condicionais e mais.","ru":"Система расширенных типов TypeScript является основой для создания надежных и безопасных приложений. Узнайте, как использовать generics, условные типы и мног...","ar":"نظام الأنواع المتقدمة في TypeScript هو الأساس لبناء تطبيقات قوية وآمنة. تعلم كيفية استخدام generics و أنواع الشرطية وغيرها.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["泛型","条件类型","映射类型","模板字面量类型","实用类型"],"ja":["ジェネリック","条件付きタイプ","マップタイプ","テンプレートリテラルタイプ","ユーティリティタイプ"],"ko":["제네릭","조건부 타입","매핑 타입","템플릿 리터럴 타입","유틸리티 타입"],"es":["Generics","Tipos condicionales","Tipos mapeados","Tipos de literal de plantilla","Tipos de utilidad"],"fr":["Generics","Types conditionnels","Types mappés","Types de littéral de modèle","Types d''utilité"],"de":["Generics","Bedingte Typen","Zugeordnete Typen","Vorlagenliteraltypen","Hilfstypen"],"pt":["Generics","Tipos condicionais","Tipos mapeados","Tipos de literal de modelo","Tipos de utilidade"],"ru":["Generics","Условные типы","Отображаемые типы","Типы шаблонных литералов","Типы утилит"],"ar":["Generics","أنواع الشرطية","أنواع المapped","أنواع Literal Template","أنواع Utility"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript 高级类型","泛型","条件类型","映射类型","模板字面量类型","实用类型","类型安全","强大的类型系统"],"ja":["TypeScript 高級タイプ","ジェネリック","条件付きタイプ","マップタイプ","テンプレートリテラルタイプ","ユーティリティタイプ","タイプセーフ","強力なタイプシステム"],"ko":["타입스크립트 고급 타입","제네릭","조건부 타입","매핑 타입","템플릿 리터럴 타입","유틸리티 타입","타입 안전","강력한 타입 시스템"],"es":["TypeScript avanzado","Tipos seguros","Aplicaciones robustas","Bibliotecas de TypeScript","Frameworks de TypeScript","Tipos de utilidad"],"fr":["TypeScript avancé","Types sûrs","Applications robustes","Bibliothèques de TypeScript","Frameworks de TypeScript","Types d''utilité"],"de":["Erweitertes TypeScript","Sichere Typen","Robuste Anwendungen","TypeScript-Bibliotheken","TypeScript-Frameworks","Hilfstypen"],"pt":["TypeScript","Tipos avançados","Generics","Tipos condicionais","Desenvolvimento de software","Segurança de aplicações"],"ru":["TypeScript","Расширенные типы","Generics","Условные типы","Разработка программного обеспечения","Безопасность приложений"],"ar":["TypeScript","أنواع متقدمة","Generics","أنواع الشرطية","تطوير البرمجيات","أمان التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"typescript-advanced-types","description":"Master TypeScripts advanced type system including generics, conditional types, mapped types, template literals, and utility types for building type-safe applications. Use when implementing complex type logic, creating reusable type utilities, or ensuring compile-time type safety in TypeScript projects.","bodyPreview":"# TypeScript Advanced Types\n\nComprehensive guidance for mastering TypeScript''s advanced type system including generics, conditional types, mapped types, template literal types, and utility types for building robust, type-safe applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building type-safe libraries or frameworks\n- Creating reusable generic components\n- Implementing complex type inference logic\n- Designing type-safe API clients\n- Building form validation systems\n- Creating strongly-typed configura","body":"# TypeScript Advanced Types\n\nComprehensive guidance for mastering TypeScript''s advanced type system including generics, conditional types, mapped types, template literal types, and utility types for building robust, type-safe applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building type-safe libraries or frameworks\n- Creating reusable generic components\n- Implementing complex type inference logic\n- Designing type-safe API clients\n- Building form validation systems\n- Creating strongly-typed configuration objects\n- Implementing type-safe state management\n- Migrating JavaScript codebases to TypeScript\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Generics\n\n**Purpose:** Create reusable, type-flexible components while maintaining type safety.\n\n**Basic Generic Function:**\n\n```typescript\nfunction identity<T>(value: T): T {\n  return value;\n}\n\nconst num = identity<number>(42); // Type: number\nconst str = identity<string>(\"hello\"); // Type: string\nconst auto = identity(true); // Type inferred: boolean\n```\n\n**Generic Constraints:**\n\n```typescript\ninterface HasLength {\n  length: number;\n}\n\nfunction logLength<T extends HasLength>(item: T): T {\n  console.log(item.length);\n  return item;\n}\n\nlogLength(\"hello\"); // OK: string has length\nlogLength([1, 2, 3]); // OK: array has length\nlogLength({ length: 10 }); // OK: object has length\n// logLength(42);             // Error: number has no length\n```\n\n**Multiple Type Parameters:**\n\n```typescript\nfunction merge<T, U>(obj1: T, obj2: U): T & U {\n  return { ...obj1, ...obj2 };\n}\n\nconst merged = merge({ name: \"John\" }, { age: 30 });\n// Type: { name: string } & { age: number }\n```\n\n### 2. Conditional Types\n\n**Purpose:** Create types that depend on conditions, enabling sophisticated type logic.\n\n**Basic Conditional Type:**\n\n```typescript\ntype IsString<T> = T extends string ? true : false;\n\ntype A = IsString<string>; // true\ntype B = IsString<number>; // false\n```\n\n**Extracting Return Types:**\n\n```typescript\ntype ReturnType<T> = T extends (...args: any[]) => infer R ? R : never;\n\nfunction getUser() {\n  return { id: 1, name: \"John\" };\n}\n\ntype User = ReturnType<typeof getUser>;\n// Type: { id: number; name: string; }\n```\n\n**Distributive Conditional Types:**\n\n```typescript\ntype ToArray<T> = T extends any ? T[] : never;\n\ntype StrOrNumArray = ToArray<string | number>;\n// Type: string[] | number[]\n```\n\n**Nested Conditions:**\n\n```typescript\ntype TypeName<T> = T extends string\n  ? \"string\"\n  : T extends number\n    ? \"number\"\n    : T extends boolean\n      ? \"boolean\"\n      : T extends undefined\n        ? \"undefined\"\n        : T extends Function\n          ? \"function\"\n          : \"object\";\n\ntype T1 = TypeName<string>; // \"string\"\ntype T2 = TypeName<() => void>; // \"function\"\n```\n\n### 3. Mapped Types\n\n**Purpose:** Transform existing types by iterating over their properties.\n\n**Basic Mapped Type:**\n\n```typescript\ntype Readonly<T> = {\n  readonly [P in keyof T]: T[P];\n};\n\ninterface User {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ntype ReadonlyUser = Readonly<User>;\n// Type: { readonly id: number; readonly name: string; }\n```\n\n**Optional Properties:**\n\n```typescript\ntype Partial<T> = {\n  [P in keyof T]?: T[P];\n};\n\ntype PartialUser = Partial<User>;\n// Type: { id?: number; name?: string; }\n```\n\n**Key Remapping:**\n\n```typescript\ntype Getters<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T as `get${Capitalize<string & K>}`]: () => T[K];\n};\n\ninterface Person {\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n}\n\ntype PersonGetters = Getters<Person>;\n// Type: { getName: () => string; getAge: () => number; }\n```\n\n**Filtering Properties:**\n\n```typescript\ntype PickByType<T, U> = {\n  [K in keyof T as T[K] extends U ? K : never]: T[K];\n};\n\ninterface Mixed {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n  active: boolean;\n}\n\ntype OnlyNumbers = PickByType<Mixed, number>;\n// Type: { id: number; age: number; }\n```\n\n### 4. Template Literal Types\n\n**Purpose:** Create string-based types with pattern matching and transformation.\n\n**Basic Template Literal:**\n\n```typescript\ntype EventName = \"click\" | \"focus\" | \"blur\";\ntype EventHandler = `on${Capitalize<EventName>}`;\n// Type: \"onClick\" | \"onFocus\" | \"onBlur\"\n```\n\n**String Manipulation:**\n\n```typescript\ntype UppercaseGreeting = Uppercase<\"hello\">; // \"HELLO\"\ntype LowercaseGreeting = Lowercase<\"HELLO\">; // \"hello\"\ntype CapitalizedName = Capitalize<\"john\">; // \"John\"\ntype UncapitalizedName = Uncapitalize<\"John\">; // \"john\"\n```\n\n**Path Building:**\n\n```typescript\ntype Path<T> = T extends object\n  ? {\n      [K in keyof T]: K extends string ? `${K}` | `${K}.${Path<T[K]>}` : never;\n    }[keyof T]\n  : never;\n\ninterface Config {\n  server: {\n    host: string;\n    port: number;\n  };\n  database: {\n    url: string;\n  };\n}\n\ntype ConfigPath = Path<Config>;\n// Type: \"server\" | \"database\" | \"server.host\" | \"server.port\" | \"database.url\"\n```\n\n### 5. Utility Types\n\n**Built-in Utility Types:**\n\n```typescript\n// Partial<T> - Make all properties optional\ntype PartialUser = Partial<User>;\n\n// Required<T> - Make all properties required\ntype RequiredUser = Required<PartialUser>;\n\n// Readonly<T> - Make all properties readonly\ntype ReadonlyUser = Readonly<User>;\n\n// Pick<T, K> - Select specific properties\ntype UserName = Pick<User, \"name\" | \"email\">;\n\n// Omit<T, K> - Remove specific properties\ntype UserWithoutPassword = Omit<User, \"password\">;\n\n// Exclude<T, U> - Exclude types from union\ntype T1 = Exclude<\"a\" | \"b\" | \"c\", \"a\">; // \"b\" | \"c\"\n\n// Extract<T, U> - Extract types from union\ntype T2 = Extract<\"a\" | \"b\" | \"c\", \"a\" | \"b\">; // \"a\" | \"b\"\n\n// NonNullable<T> - Exclude null and undefined\ntype T3 = NonNullable<string | null | undefined>; // string\n\n// Record<K, T> - Create object type with keys K and values T\ntype PageInfo = Record<\"home\" | \"about\", { title: string }>;\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Type-Safe Event Emitter\n\n```typescript\ntype EventMap = {\n  \"user:created\": { id: string; name: string };\n  \"user:updated\": { id: string };\n  \"user:deleted\": { id: string };\n};\n\nclass TypedEventEmitter<T extends Record<string, any>> {\n  private listeners: {\n    [K in keyof T]?: Array<(data: T[K]) => void>;\n  } = {};\n\n  on<K extends keyof T>(event: K, callback: (data: T[K]) => void): void {\n    if (!this.listeners[event]) {\n      this.listeners[event] = [];\n    }\n    this.listeners[event]!.push(callback);\n  }\n\n  emit<K extends keyof T>(event: K, data: T[K]): void {\n    const callbacks = this.listeners[event];\n    if (callbacks) {\n      callbacks.forEach((callback) => callback(data));\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst emitter = new TypedEventEmitter<EventMap>();\n\nemitter.on(\"user:created\", (data) => {\n  console.log(data.id, data.name); // Type-safe!\n});\n\nemitter.emit(\"user:created\", { id: \"1\", name: \"John\" });\n// emitter.emit(\"user:created\", { id: \"1\" });  // Error: missing ''name''\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Type-Safe API Client\n\n```typescript\ntype HTTPMethod = \"GET\" | \"POST\" | \"PUT\" | \"DELETE\";\n\ntype EndpointConfig = {\n  \"/users\": {\n    GET: { response: User[] };\n    POST: { body: { name: string; email: string }; response: User };\n  };\n  \"/users/:id\": {\n    GET: { params: { id: string }; response: User };\n    PUT: { params: { id: string }; body: Partial<User>; response: User };\n    DELETE: { params: { id: string }; response: void };\n  };\n};\n\ntype ExtractParams<T> = T extends { params: infer P } ? P : never;\ntype ExtractBody<T> = T extends { body: infer B } ? B : never;\ntype ExtractResponse<T> = T extends { response: infer R } ? R : never;\n\nclass APIClient<Config extends Record<string, Record<HTTPMethod, any>>> {\n  async request<Path extends keyof Config, Method extends keyof Config[Path]>(\n    path: Path,\n    method: Method,\n    ...[options]: ExtractParams<Config[Path][Method]> extends never\n      ? ExtractBody<Config[Path][Method]> extends never\n        ? []\n        : [{ body: ExtractBody<Config[Path][Method]> }]\n      : [\n          {\n            params: ExtractParams<Config[Path][Method]>;\n            body?: ExtractBody<Config[Path][Method]>;\n          },\n        ]\n  ): Promise<ExtractResponse<Config[Path][Method]>> {\n    // Implementation here\n    return {} as any;\n  }\n}\n\nconst api = new APIClient<EndpointConfig>();\n\n// Type-safe API calls\nconst users = await api.request(\"/users\", \"GET\");\n// Type: User[]\n\nconst newUser = await api.request(\"/users\", \"POST\", {\n  body: { name: \"John\", email: \"john@example.com\" },\n});\n// Type: User\n\nconst user = await api.request(\"/users/:id\", \"GET\", {\n  params: { id: \"123\" },\n});\n// Type: User\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Builder Pattern with Type Safety\n\n```typescript\ntype BuilderState<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]: T[K] | undefined;\n};\n\ntype RequiredKeys<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]-?: {} extends Pick<T, K> ? never : K;\n}[keyof T];\n\ntype OptionalKeys<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]-?: {} extends Pick<T, K> ? K : never;\n}[keyof T];\n\ntype IsComplete<T, S> =\n  RequiredKeys<T> extends keyof S\n    ? S[RequiredKeys<T>] extends undefined\n      ? false\n      : true\n    : false;\n\nclass Builder<T, S extends BuilderState<T> = {}> {\n  private state: S = {} as S;\n\n  set<K extends keyof T>(key: K, value: T[K]): Builder<T, S & Record<K, T[K]>> {\n    this.state[key] = value;\n    return this as any;\n  }\n\n  build(this: IsComplete<T, S> extends true ? this : never): T {\n    return this.state as T;\n  }\n}\n\ninterface User {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  age?: number;\n}\n\nconst builder = new Builder<User>();\n\nconst user = builder\n  .set(\"id\", \"1\")\n  .set(\"name\", \"John\")\n  .set(\"email\", \"john@example.com\")\n  .build(); // OK: all required fields set\n\n// const incomplete = builder\n//   .set(\"id\", \"1\")\n//   .build();  // Error: missing required fields\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Deep Readonly/Partial\n\n```typescript\ntype DeepReadonly<T> = {\n  readonly [P in keyof T]: T[P] extends object\n    ? T[P] extends Function\n      ? T[P]\n      : DeepReadonly<T[P]>\n    : T[P];\n};\n\ntype DeepPartial<T> = {\n  [P in keyof T]?: T[P] extends object\n    ? T[P] extends Array<infer U>\n      ? Array<DeepPartial<U>>\n      : DeepPartial<T[P]>\n    : T[P];\n};\n\ninterface Config {\n  server: {\n    host: string;\n    port: number;\n    ssl: {\n      enabled: boolean;\n      cert: string;\n    };\n  };\n  database: {\n    url: string;\n    pool: {\n      min: number;\n      max: number;\n    };\n  };\n}\n\ntype ReadonlyConfig = DeepReadonly<Config>;\n// All nested properties are readonly\n\ntype PartialConfig = DeepPartial<Config>;\n// All nested properties are optional\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Type-Safe Form Validation\n\n```typescript\ntype ValidationRule<T> = {\n  validate: (value: T) => boolean;\n  message: string;\n};\n\ntype FieldValidation<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]?: ValidationRule<T[K]>[];\n};\n\ntype ValidationErrors<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]?: string[];\n};\n\nclass FormValidator<T extends Record<string, any>> {\n  constructor(private rules: FieldValidation<T>) {}\n\n  validate(data: T): ValidationErrors<T> | null {\n    const errors: ValidationErrors<T> = {};\n    let hasErrors = false;\n\n    for (const key in this.rules) {\n      const fieldRules = this.rules[key];\n      const value = data[key];\n\n      if (fieldRules) {\n        const fieldErrors: string[] = [];\n\n        for (const rule of fieldRules) {\n          if (!rule.validate(value)) {\n            fieldErrors.push(rule.message);\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (fieldErrors.length > 0) {\n          errors[key] = fieldErrors;\n          hasErrors = true;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    return hasErrors ? errors : null;\n  }\n}\n\ninterface LoginForm {\n  email: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\nconst validator = new FormValidator<LoginForm>({\n  email: [\n    {\n      validate: (v) => v.includes(\"@\"),\n      message: \"Email must contain @\",\n    },\n    {\n      validate: (v) => v.length > 0,\n      message: \"Email is required\",\n    },\n  ],\n  password: [\n    {\n      validate: (v) => v.length >= 8,\n      message: \"Password must be at least 8 characters\",\n    },\n  ],\n});\n\nconst errors = validator.validate({\n  email: \"invalid\",\n  password: \"short\",\n});\n// Type: { email?: string[]; password?: string[]; } | null\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Discriminated Unions\n\n```typescript\ntype Success<T> = {\n  status: \"success\";\n  data: T;\n};\n\ntype Error = {\n  status: \"error\";\n  error: string;\n};\n\ntype Loading = {\n  status: \"loading\";\n};\n\ntype AsyncState<T> = Success<T> | Error | Loading;\n\nfunction handleState<T>(state: AsyncState<T>): void {\n  switch (state.status) {\n    case \"success\":\n      console.log(state.data); // Type: T\n      break;\n    case \"error\":\n      console.log(state.error); // Type: string\n      break;\n    case \"loading\":\n      console.log(\"Loading...\");\n      break;\n  }\n}\n\n// Type-safe state machine\ntype State =\n  | { type: \"idle\" }\n  | { type: \"fetching\"; requestId: string }\n  | { type: \"success\"; data: any }\n  | { type: \"error\"; error: Error };\n\ntype Event =\n  | { type: \"FETCH\"; requestId: string }\n  | { type: \"SUCCESS\"; data: any }\n  | { type: \"ERROR\"; error: Error }\n  | { type: \"RESET\" };\n\nfunction reducer(state: State, event: Event): State {\n  switch (state.type) {\n    case \"idle\":\n      return event.type === \"FETCH\"\n        ? { type: \"fetching\", requestId: event.requestId }\n        : state;\n    case \"fetching\":\n      if (event.type === \"SUCCESS\") {\n        return { type: \"success\", data: event.data };\n      }\n      if (event.type === \"ERROR\") {\n        return { type: \"error\", error: event.error };\n      }\n      return state;\n    case \"success\":\n    case \"error\":\n      return event.type === \"RESET\" ? { type: \"idle\" } : state;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Type Inference Techniques\n\n### 1. Infer Keyword\n\n```typescript\n// Extract array element type\ntype ElementType<T> = T extends (infer U)[] ? U : never;\n\ntype NumArray = number[];\ntype Num = ElementType<NumArray>; // number\n\n// Extract promise type\ntype PromiseType<T> = T extends Promise<infer U> ? U : never;\n\ntype AsyncNum = PromiseType<Promise<number>>; // number\n\n// Extract function parameters\ntype Parameters<T> = T extends (...args: infer P) => any ? P : never;\n\nfunction foo(a: string, b: number) {}\ntype FooParams = Parameters<typeof foo>; // [string, number]\n```\n\n### 2. Type Guards\n\n```typescript\nfunction isString(value: unknown): value is string {\n  return typeof value === \"string\";\n}\n\nfunction isArrayOf<T>(\n  value: unknown,\n  guard: (item: unknown) => item is T,\n): value is T[] {\n  return Array.isArray(value) && value.every(guard);\n}\n\nconst data: unknown = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"];\n\nif (isArrayOf(data, isString)) {\n  data.forEach((s) => s.toUpperCase()); // Type: string[]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Assertion Functions\n\n```typescript\nfunction assertIsString(value: unknown): asserts value is string {\n  if (typeof value !== \"string\") {\n    throw new Error(\"Not a string\");\n  }\n}\n\nfunction processValue(value: unknown) {\n  assertIsString(value);\n  // value is now typed as string\n  console.log(value.toUpperCase());\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use `unknown` over `any`**: Enforce type checking\n2. **Prefer `interface` for object shapes**: Better error messages\n3. **Use `type` for unions and complex types**: More flexible\n4. **Leverage type inference**: Let TypeScript infer when possible\n5. **Create helper types**: Build reusable type utilities\n6. **Use const assertions**: Preserve literal types\n7. **Avoid type assertions**: Use type guards instead\n8. **Document complex types**: Add JSDoc comments\n9. **Use strict mode**: Enable all strict compiler options\n10. **Test your types**: Use type tests to verify type behavior\n\n## Type Testing\n\n```typescript\n// Type assertion tests\ntype AssertEqual<T, U> = [T] extends [U]\n  ? [U] extends [T]\n    ? true\n    : false\n  : false;\n\ntype Test1 = AssertEqual<string, string>; // true\ntype Test2 = AssertEqual<string, number>; // false\ntype Test3 = AssertEqual<string | number, string>; // false\n\n// Expect error helper\ntype ExpectError<T extends never> = T;\n\n// Example usage\ntype ShouldError = ExpectError<AssertEqual<string, number>>;\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Over-using `any`**: Defeats the purpose of TypeScript\n2. **Ignoring strict null checks**: Can lead to runtime errors\n3. **Too complex types**: Can slow down compilation\n4. **Not using discriminated unions**: Misses type narrowing opportunities\n5. **Forgetting readonly modifiers**: Allows unintended mutations\n6. **Circular type references**: Can cause compiler errors\n7. **Not handling edge cases**: Like empty arrays or null values\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n- Avoid deeply nested conditional types\n- Use simple types when possible\n- Cache complex type computations\n- Limit recursion depth in recursive types\n- Use build tools to skip type checking in production\n\n## Resources\n\n- **TypeScript Handbook**: https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/\n- **Type Challenges**: https://github.com/type-challenges/type-challenges\n- **TypeScript Deep Dive**: https://basarat.gitbook.io/typescript/\n- **Effective TypeScript**: Book by Dan Vanderkam\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:00:02.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing advanced TypeScript type manipulation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级TypeScript类型操作能力的代码生成代理。","ja":"高度なTypeScriptの型操作機能を必要とするコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 TypeScript 유형 조작 기능이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de tipos de TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de code nécessitant des capacités avancées de manipulation de types TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte TypeScript-Typ-Manipulationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de manipulação de tipos TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, которым требуются продвинутые возможности манипулирования типами TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء генераコード التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتعامل مع أنواع TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create robust, type-safe applications using generics, conditional types, mapped types, template literal types, and utility types, ensuring accurate type inference and validation for building reusable components and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理创建强健、类型安全的应用程序的能力，使用泛型、条件类型、映射类型、模板字面量类型和实用类型，确保准确的类型推断和验证，以构建可重用组件和库。","ja":"ジェネリクス、条件付き型、写像型、テンプレートリテラル型、ユーティリティ型を使用して、ロバストで型安全なアプリケーションを作成するエージェントをEmpowerし、再利用可能なコンポーネントやライブラリを構築するための正確な型推論や検証を確保します。","ko":"일반화, 조건부 유형, 매핑 유형, 템플릿 리터럴 유형 및 유틸리티 유형을 사용하여 강력하고 유형 안전한 응용 프로그램을 만들 수 있는 에이전트를赋予하고 재사용 가능한 구성 요소 및 라이브러리 구축을 위한 정확한 유형 추론 및 유효성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones robustas y seguras mediante tipos, utilizando genéricos, tipos condicionales, tipos mapeados, tipos de literal de plantilla y tipos de utilidad, garantizando una inferencia y validación de tipos precisas para la creación de componentes y bibliotecas reutilizables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications robustes et sécurisées en utilisant des types, en exploitant les génériques, les types conditionnels, les types mappés, les types de littéraux de modèle et les types d''utilité, garantissant une inférence et une validation de types précises pour la construction de composants et de bibliothèques réutilisables.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste, typsichere Anwendungen zu erstellen, die Generics, bedingte Typen, zugeordnete Typen, Template-Literal-Typen und Utility-Typen verwenden, um eine genaue Typinferenz und -validierung für den Bau wiederverwendbarer Komponenten und Bibliotheken sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicações robustas e seguras em termos de tipo, utilizando genéricos, tipos condicionais, tipos mapeados, tipos de literal de modelo e tipos de utilidade, garantindo inferência e validação de tipo precisas para construir componentes e bibliotecas reutilizáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные и типобезопасные приложения, используя обобщенные типы, условные типы, сопоставленные типы, типы буквальных шаблонов и утилитные типы, обеспечивая точную выводку и проверку типов для построения многократно используемых компонентов и библиотек.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات قوية وآمنة من الناحية النوعية، باستخدام الأنواع العامة والأنواع الشرطية والأنواع المapped والأنواع الحرفية للنموذج والأنواع المرتبطة بالمرافق، مما يضمن استنتاجًا دقيقًا وتحققًا للنوع لبناء المكونات والمكتبات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing complex type inference logic for API clients","Building strongly-typed configuration systems","Creating reusable generic components with advanced type safety","Designing type-safe form validation systems","Developing type-safe libraries and frameworks"],"zh":["实现API客户端的复杂类型推断逻辑","构建强类型配置系统","创建具有高级类型安全性的可重用通用组件","设计类型安全的表单验证系统","开发类型安全的库和框架"],"ja":["APIクライアントの複雑な型推論ロジックを実装する","強い型付けの構成システムを構築する","高度な型安全性を持つ再利用可能な汎用コンポーネントを作成する","型安全なフォーム検証システムを設計する","型安全なライブラリやフレームワークを開発する"],"ko":["API 클라이언트를 위한 복잡한 유형 추론 논리를 구현","강력한 유형 지정 구성 시스템을 구축","고급 유형 안전성을 갖춘 재사용 가능한 일반 구성 요소를 만들기","유형 안전한 양식 유효성 검사 시스템을 설계","유형 안전한 라이브러리 및 프레임워크 개발"],"es":["Implementar lógica de inferencia de tipo compleja para clientes de API","Crear sistemas de configuración con tipos fuertes","Crear componentes genéricos reutilizables con seguridad de tipo avanzada","Diseñar sistemas de validación de formularios seguros","Desarrollar bibliotecas y marcos seguros"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une logique d''inférence de type complexe pour les clients API","Construire des systèmes de configuration fortement typés","Créer des composants génériques réutilisables avec une sécurité de type avancée","Concevoir des systèmes de validation de formulaire sécurisés","Développer des bibliothèques et des cadres sécurisés"],"de":["Implementierung komplexer Typinferenzlogik für API-Clients","Erstellung stark typisierter Konfigurationssysteme","Erstellung wiederverwendbarer generischer Komponenten mit erweiterter Typsicherheit","Entwurf typsicherer Formularvalidierungssysteme","Entwicklung typsicherer Bibliotheken und Frameworks"],"pt":["Implementar lógica de inferência de tipo complexa para clientes de API","Construir sistemas de configuração fortemente tipados","Criar componentes genéricos reutilizáveis com segurança de tipo avançada","Projetar sistemas de validação de formulários seguros em termos de tipo","Desenvolver bibliotecas e estruturas de tipo seguro"],"ru":["Реализация сложной логики вывода типа для клиентов API","Построение сильно типизированных систем конфигурации","Создание многократно используемых компонентов с продвинутой безопасностью типа","Проектирование типобезопасных систем валидации форм","Разработка типобезопасных библиотек и фреймворков"],"ar":["تنفيذ منطق استنتاج أنواع معقدة لعملاء API","بناء أنظمة تكوين قوية النوع","إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع أمان نوع متقدم","تصميم أنظمة التحقق من صحة النماذج آمنة من الناحية النوعية","تطوير المكتبات والإطارات النوعية الآمنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Advanced knowledge of TypeScript type system recommended"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","建议具备TypeScript类型系统的高级知识"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","TypeScriptの型システムに関する高度な知識が推奨される"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요","TypeScript 유형 시스템에 대한 고급 지식이 권장"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript","Conocimientos avanzados del sistema de tipos de TypeScript recomendados"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Connaissances avancées du système de types TypeScript recommandées"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Erweitertes Wissen über das TypeScript-Typsystem wird empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript","Conhecimento avançado do sistema de tipo TypeScript recomendado"],"ru":["Требуется среда TypeScript","Рекомендуется продвинутый уровень знаний системы типов TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","مستوى متقدم من المعرفة بنظام الأنواع TypeScriptcommended"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
