ticamente requisitos vagos en PRDs acciónables","fr":"La compétence de clarté des exigences transforme automatiquement les exigences vagues en PRDs actionnables","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur Anforderungs-Klarheit wandelt vage Anforderungen automatisch in handhabbare PRDs um","pt":"A habilidade de Clareza de Requisitos transforma requisitos vagos em PRDs açãoaveis com um sistema de pontuação de 100 pontos.","ru":"Навык Ясности требований преобразует неясные требования в действенные ПРД с помощью системы оценки в 100 баллов.","ar":"متطلبات واضحة تحول المتطلبات الغير واضحة إلى برامج تعريف قابلة للتنفيذ","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动转换模糊需求","系统化的澄清过程","100分评分系统","支持技术上下文的缺失","支持集成点的缺失"],"ja":["自動で曖昧な要件を明確化","システム化された明確化プロセス","100点評価システム","技術的なコンテキストの欠如をサポート","統合ポイントの欠如をサポート"],"ko":["자동으로 애매한 요구사항을 명확화","시스템화된澄清 프로세스","100점 평가 시스템","기술적인 컨텍스트의 부족을 지원","통합 포인트의 부족을 지원"],"es":["Detección de requisitos vagos","Sistema de puntuación de 100 puntos","Transformación automática de requisitos","Especificación de tecnologías y restricciones","Integración con tecnologías existentes"],"fr":["Détection des exigences vagues","Système de notation de 100 points","Transformation automatique des exigences","Spécification des technologies et des contraintes","Intégration avec les technologies existantes"],"de":["Erkennung vager Anforderungen","100-Punkte-Bewertungssystem","Automatische Umwandlung von Anforderungen","Spezifizierung von Technologien und Einschränkungen","Integration mit bestehenden Technologien"],"pt":["Detecção de requisitos vagos","Sistema de pontuação de 100 pontos","Transformação de requisitos em PRDs açãoaveis","Integração com tecnologias de desenvolvimento","Clarificação sistemática de requisitos"],"ru":["Обнаружение неясных требований","Система оценки в 100 баллов","Преобразование требований в действенные ПРД","Интеграция с технологиями разработки","Систематическая ясность требований"],"ar":["اكتشاف المتطلبات الغير واضحة","نظام التقييم بنقاط 100","تحويل المتطلبات إلى برامج تعريف قابلة للتنفيذ","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا التطوير","وضوح متطلبات منهجي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["需求清晰度","自动转换","模糊需求","PRD","技术上下文","集成点"],"ja":["要件の明確性","自動変換","曖昧な要件","PRD","技術的なコンテキスト","統合ポイント"],"ko":["요구사항 명확성","자동 변환","애매한 요구사항","PRD","기술적인 컨텍스트","통합 포인트"],"es":["claridad de requisitos","requisitos vagos","PRDs acciónables","sistema de puntuación","transformación automática","tecnologías y restricciones"],"fr":["clarté des exigences","exigences vagues","PRDs actionnables","système de notation","transformation automatique","technologies et contraintes"],"de":["Anforderungs-Klarheit","vage Anforderungen","handhabbare PRDs","100-Punkte-Bewertungssystem","automatische Umwandlung","Technologien und Einschränkungen"],"pt":["clareza de requisitos","requisitos vagos","PRDs açãoaveis","sistema de pontuação","desenvolvimento de software","requisitos de software"],"ru":["ясность требований","неясные требования","действенные ПРД","система оценки","разработка программного обеспечения","требования программного обеспечения"],"ar":["وضوح المتطلبات","متطلبات غير واضحة","برامج تعريف قابلة للتنفيذ","نظام التقييم","تطوير البرمجيات","متطلبات البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"requirements-clarity","description":"Clarify ambiguous requirements through focused dialogue before implementation. Use when requirements are unclear, features are complex (>2 days), or involve cross-team coordination. Ask two core questions - Why? (YAGNI check) and Simpler? (KISS check) - to ensure clarity before coding.","bodyPreview":"# Requirements Clarity Skill\n\n## Description\n\nAutomatically transforms vague requirements into actionable PRDs through systematic clarification with a 100-point scoring system.\n\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, detect vague requirements:\n\n1. **Vague Feature Requests**\n   - User says: \"add login feature\", \"implement payment\", \"create dashboard\"\n   - Missing: How, with what technology, what constraints?\n\n2. **Missing Technical Context**\n   - No technology stack mentioned\n   - No integration points","body":"# Requirements Clarity Skill\n\n## Description\n\nAutomatically transforms vague requirements into actionable PRDs through systematic clarification with a 100-point scoring system.\n\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, detect vague requirements:\n\n1. **Vague Feature Requests**\n   - User says: \"add login feature\", \"implement payment\", \"create dashboard\"\n   - Missing: How, with what technology, what constraints?\n\n2. **Missing Technical Context**\n   - No technology stack mentioned\n   - No integration points identified\n   - No performance/security constraints\n\n3. **Incomplete Specifications**\n   - No acceptance criteria\n   - No success metrics\n   - No edge cases considered\n   - No error handling mentioned\n\n4. **Ambiguous Scope**\n   - Unclear boundaries (\"user management\" - what exactly?)\n   - No distinction between MVP and future enhancements\n   - Missing \"what''s NOT included\"\n\n**Do NOT activate when**:\n- Specific file paths mentioned (e.g., \"auth.go:45\")\n- Code snippets included\n- Existing functions/classes referenced\n- Bug fixes with clear reproduction steps\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Systematic Questioning**\n   - Ask focused, specific questions\n   - One category at a time (2-3 questions per round)\n   - Build on previous answers\n   - Avoid overwhelming users\n\n2. **Quality-Driven Iteration**\n   - Continuously assess clarity score (0-100)\n   - Identify gaps systematically\n   - Iterate until ≥ 90 points\n   - Document all clarification rounds\n\n3. **Actionable Output**\n   - Generate concrete specifications\n   - Include measurable acceptance criteria\n   - Provide executable phases\n   - Enable direct implementation\n\n## Clarification Process\n\n### Step 1: Initial Requirement Analysis\n\n**Input**: User''s requirement description\n\n**Tasks**:\n1. Parse and understand core requirement\n2. Generate feature name (kebab-case format)\n3. Determine document version (default `1.0` unless user specifies otherwise)\n4. Ensure `./docs/prds/` exists for PRD output\n5. Perform initial clarity assessment (0-100)\n\n**Assessment Rubric**:\n```\nFunctional Clarity: /30 points\n- Clear inputs/outputs: 10 pts\n- User interaction defined: 10 pts\n- Success criteria stated: 10 pts\n\nTechnical Specificity: /25 points\n- Technology stack mentioned: 8 pts\n- Integration points identified: 8 pts\n- Constraints specified: 9 pts\n\nImplementation Completeness: /25 points\n- Edge cases considered: 8 pts\n- Error handling mentioned: 9 pts\n- Data validation specified: 8 pts\n\nBusiness Context: /20 points\n- Problem statement clear: 7 pts\n- Target users identified: 7 pts\n- Success metrics defined: 6 pts\n```\n\n**Initial Response Format**:\n```markdown\nI understand your requirement. Let me help you refine this specification.\n\n**Current Clarity Score**: X/100\n\n**Clear Aspects**:\n- [List what''s clear]\n\n**Needs Clarification**:\n- [List gaps]\n\nLet me systematically clarify these points...\n```\n\n### Step 2: Gap Analysis\n\nIdentify missing information across four dimensions:\n\n**1. Functional Scope**\n- What is the core functionality?\n- What are the boundaries?\n- What is out of scope?\n- What are edge cases?\n\n**2. User Interaction**\n- How do users interact?\n- What are the inputs?\n- What are the outputs?\n- What are success/failure scenarios?\n\n**3. Technical Constraints**\n- Performance requirements?\n- Compatibility requirements?\n- Security considerations?\n- Scalability needs?\n\n**4. Business Value**\n- What problem does this solve?\n- Who are the target users?\n- What are success metrics?\n- What is the priority?\n\n### Step 3: Interactive Clarification\n\n**Question Strategy**:\n1. Start with highest-impact gaps\n2. Ask 2-3 questions per round\n3. Build context progressively\n4. Use user''s language\n5. Provide examples when helpful\n\n**Question Format**:\n```markdown\nI need to clarify the following points to complete the requirements document:\n\n1. **[Category]**: [Specific question]?\n   - For example: [Example if helpful]\n\n2. **[Category]**: [Specific question]?\n\n3. **[Category]**: [Specific question]?\n\nPlease provide your answers, and I''ll continue refining the PRD.\n```\n\n**After Each User Response**:\n1. Update clarity score\n2. Capture new information in the working PRD outline\n3. Identify remaining gaps\n4. If score < 90: Continue with next round of questions\n5. If score ≥ 90: Proceed to PRD generation\n\n**Score Update Format**:\n```markdown\nThank you for the additional information!\n\n**Clarity Score Update**: X/100 → Y/100\n\n**New Clarified Content**:\n- [Summarize new information]\n\n**Remaining Points to Clarify**:\n- [List remaining gaps if score < 90]\n\n[If score < 90: Continue with next round of questions]\n[If score ≥ 90: \"Perfect! I will now generate the complete PRD document...\"]\n```\n\n### Step 4: PRD Generation\n\nOnce clarity score ≥ 90, generate comprehensive PRD.\n\n**Output File**:\n\n1. **Final PRD**: `./docs/prds/{feature_name}-v{version}-prd.md`\n\nUse the `Write` tool to create or update this file. Derive `{version}` from the document version recorded in the PRD (default `1.0`).\n\n## PRD Document Structure\n\n```markdown\n# {Feature Name} - Product Requirements Document (PRD)\n\n## Requirements Description\n\n### Background\n- **Business Problem**: [Describe the business problem to solve]\n- **Target Users**: [Target user groups]\n- **Value Proposition**: [Value this feature brings]\n\n### Feature Overview\n- **Core Features**: [List of main features]\n- **Feature Boundaries**: [What is and isn''t included]\n- **User Scenarios**: [Typical usage scenarios]\n\n### Detailed Requirements\n- **Input/Output**: [Specific input/output specifications]\n- **User Interaction**: [User operation flow]\n- **Data Requirements**: [Data structures and validation rules]\n- **Edge Cases**: [Edge case handling]\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Technical Approach\n- **Architecture Choice**: [Technical architecture decisions and rationale]\n- **Key Components**: [List of main technical components]\n- **Data Storage**: [Data models and storage solutions]\n- **Interface Design**: [API/interface specifications]\n\n### Constraints\n- **Performance Requirements**: [Response time, throughput, etc.]\n- **Compatibility**: [System compatibility requirements]\n- **Security**: [Security considerations]\n- **Scalability**: [Future expansion considerations]\n\n### Risk Assessment\n- **Technical Risks**: [Potential technical risks and mitigation plans]\n- **Dependency Risks**: [External dependencies and alternatives]\n- **Schedule Risks**: [Timeline risks and response strategies]\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n### Functional Acceptance\n- [ ] Feature 1: [Specific acceptance conditions]\n- [ ] Feature 2: [Specific acceptance conditions]\n- [ ] Feature 3: [Specific acceptance conditions]\n\n### Quality Standards\n- [ ] Code Quality: [Code standards and review requirements]\n- [ ] Test Coverage: [Testing requirements and coverage]\n- [ ] Performance Metrics: [Performance test pass criteria]\n- [ ] Security Review: [Security review requirements]\n\n### User Acceptance\n- [ ] User Experience: [UX acceptance criteria]\n- [ ] Documentation: [Documentation delivery requirements]\n- [ ] Training Materials: [If needed, training material requirements]\n\n## Execution Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Preparation\n**Goal**: Environment preparation and technical validation\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific task description]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific task description]\n- **Deliverables**: [Phase deliverables]\n- **Time**: [Estimated time]\n\n### Phase 2: Core Development\n**Goal**: Implement core functionality\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific task description]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific task description]\n- **Deliverables**: [Phase deliverables]\n- **Time**: [Estimated time]\n\n### Phase 3: Integration & Testing\n**Goal**: Integration and quality assurance\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific task description]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific task description]\n- **Deliverables**: [Phase deliverables]\n- **Time**: [Estimated time]\n\n### Phase 4: Deployment\n**Goal**: Release and monitoring\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific task description]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific task description]\n- **Deliverables**: [Phase deliverables]\n- **Time**: [Estimated time]\n\n---\n\n**Document Version**: 1.0\n**Created**: {timestamp}\n**Clarification Rounds**: {clarification_rounds}\n**Quality Score**: {quality_score}/100\n```\n\n## Behavioral Guidelines\n\n### DO\n- Ask specific, targeted questions\n- Build on previous answers\n- Provide examples to guide users\n- Maintain conversational tone\n- Summarize clarification rounds within the PRD\n- Use clear, professional English\n- Generate concrete specifications\n- Stay in clarification mode until score ≥ 90\n\n### DON''T\n- Ask all questions at once\n- Make assumptions without confirmation\n- Generate PRD before 90+ score\n- Skip any required sections\n- Use vague or abstract language\n- Proceed without user responses\n- Exit skill mode prematurely\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Clarity score ≥ 90/100\n- All PRD sections complete with substance\n- Acceptance criteria checklistable (using `- [ ]` format)\n- Execution phases actionable with concrete tasks\n- User approves final PRD\n- Ready for development handoff\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:59:40.225Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise project requirement definitions through systematic clarification with scoring systems.","zh":"适合需要通过系统化澄清和评分系统来定义项目要求的开发代理的理想选择。","ja":"開発エージェントがプロジェクト要件の定義を正確に行うために、システム的な明確化とスコアリングシステムを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시스템적인 明確化와 평가 시스템을 통해 프로젝트 요구 사항을 정의해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren definiciones precisas de requisitos de proyecto a través de una aclaración sistemática con sistemas de puntuación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des définitions précises des exigences de projet via une clarification systématique avec des systèmes de notation.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die präzise Projektanforderungsdefinitionen durch systematische Klärung mit Bewertungssystemen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem definições precisas de requisitos de projeto por meio de esclarecimento sistemático com sistemas de pontuação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих точных определений требований проекта посредством системного разъяснения с системами подсчета баллов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجي الذين يتطلبون تعريفات دقيقة للمتطلبات المشروع من خلال توضيح منهجي مع أنظمة التقييم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform vague requirements into actionable PRDs, utilizing a 100-point scoring system for systematic clarification, and handling missing technical context such as undefined technology stacks or integration points.","zh":"赋予代理人将模糊的要求转化为可执行的PRD的能力，利用100分评分系统进行系统化澄清，并处理缺失的技术背景，如未定义的技术栈或集成点。","ja":"エージェントが漠然とした要件を実行可能なPRDに変換できるようにし、システム的な明確化のために100点のスコアリングシステムを使用し、未定義のテクノロジースタックや統合ポイントなどの欠落している技術的背景を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 모호한 요구 사항을 실행 가능한 PRD로 변환 할 수 있도록 하며, 시스템적인 명확화에 100 점 평가 시스템을 사용하고, 정의되지 않은 기술 스택 또는 통합 지점 등의 기술적 배경이 누락된 경우를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar requisitos vagos en PRD accionables, utilizando un sistema de puntuación de 100 puntos para la clarificación sistemática y el manejo de contexto técnico perdido, como pilas de tecnología o puntos de integración no definidos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des exigences vagues en PRD actionnables, en utilisant un système de notation de 100 points pour la clarification systématique et la gestion du contexte technique manquant, telles que des piles de technologie ou des points d''intégration non définis.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vage Anforderungen in umsetzbare PRD umzuwandeln, indem sie ein 100-Punkte-Bewertungssystem für eine systematische Klärung verwenden und fehlenden technischen Kontext wie undefinierte Technologiestapel oder Integrationspunkte verwalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes transformem requisitos vagos em PRDs executáveis, utilizando um sistema de pontuação de 100 pontos para esclarecimento sistemático e tratamento de contexto técnico ausente, como pilhas de tecnologia ou pontos de integração não definidos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить расплывчатые требования в действенные PRD, используя систему подсчета баллов в 100 пунктов для системного разъяснения и обработки отсутствующего технического контекста, такого как неопределенные технологические стеки или точки интеграции.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تحويل المتطلبات الغامضة إلى وثائق متطلبات المنتج القابلة للتنفيذ، باستخدام نظام تقييم بنقاط 100 لنوضح بشكل منهجي ومعالجة السياق الفني الناقص، مثل معايير التكنولوجيا أو نقاط التكامل غير المحددة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating requirement clarification for project planning","Generating detailed PRDs from vague feature requests","Detecting missing technical context in project requirements"],"zh":["项目规划的要求明確化自动化","从模糊的功能请求生成详细的PRD","检测项目要求中的缺失技术背景"],"ja":["プロジェクト計画の要件明確化の自動化","漠然とした機能要求から詳細なPRDを生成する","プロジェクト要件の中の欠落している技術的背景を検出する"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획을 위한 요구 사항 명확화 자동화","모호한 기능 요청에서 상세한 PRD 생성","프로젝트 요구 사항中的 기술적 배경 누락 감지"],"es":["Automatización de la clarificación de requisitos para la planificación de proyectos","Generación de PRD detallados a partir de solicitudes de características vagas","Detección de contexto técnico perdido en los requisitos del proyecto"],"fr":["Automatisation de la clarification des exigences pour la planification de projet","Génération de PRD détaillés à partir de demandes de fonctionnalités vagues","Détection du contexte technique manquant dans les exigences de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung der Anforderungsklärung für die Projektplanung","Erzeugung detaillierter PRD aus vagen Funktionsanforderungen","Erfassung fehlenden technischen Kontexts in den Projektanforderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a clarificação de requisitos para planejamento de projeto","Gerar PRDs detalhados a partir de solicitações de recursos vagas","Detectar contexto técnico ausente nos requisitos do projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разъяснение требований для планирования проекта","Генерировать подробные PRD из расплывчатых запросов функций","Обнаруживать отсутствующий технический контекст в требованиях проекта"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتوضيح المتطلبات لخطط المشروع","generar وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة من طلبات الميزات الغامضة","اكتشاف السياق الفني الناقص في متطلبات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project requirement documents or user input","May need additional context for highly complex or ambiguous requirements"],"zh":["需要访问项目要求文档或用户输入","可能需要额外的背景以处理高度复杂或模糊的要求"],"ja":["プロジェクト要件文書またはユーザー入力へのアクセスが必要","非常に複雑または曖昧な要件を処理するには追加の背景が必要かもしれない"],"ko":["프로젝트 요구 사항 문서 또는 사용자 입력에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","상당히 복잡하거나 모호한 요구 사항을 처리하는 데 추가적인 배경이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a documentos de requisitos de proyecto o entrada de usuario","Puede necesitar contexto adicional para requisitos complejos o ambiguos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux documents d''exigences de projet ou à la saisie utilisateur","Peut nécessiter un contexte supplémentaire pour les exigences complexes ou ambiguës"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Projektanforderungsdokumente oder Benutzereingaben","Kann für komplexe oder mehrdeutige Anforderungen zusätzlichen Kontext benötigen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a documentos de requisitos do projeto ou entrada do usuário","Pode precisar de contexto adicional para requisitos complexos ou ambíguos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документам требований проекта или ввода пользователя","Может потребовать дополнительного контекста для сложных или неоднозначных требований"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق متطلبات المشروع أو إدخال المستخدم","يمكن أن يتطلب سياقًا إضافيًا لمتطلبات معقدة أو غامضة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
