e de techniques audio avancées","Intégration avec des outils de développement de jeux","Optimisation des performances audio"],"de":["Sound-Design und Musikintegration für immersive Erfahrungen","Kategorisierung von Audio in Musik, Soundeffekten, Ambient und Sprache","Implementierung von erweiterten Audio-Techniken","Integration mit Spiel-Entwicklungstools","Optimierung der Audio-Leistung"],"pt":["Sistema de categorias de áudio","Definições de categorias de som","Exemplos de música e efeitos sonoros","Integração de som e música em jogos","Técnicas de design de áudio imersivo"],"ru":["Система категорий звука","Определения категорий звука","Примеры музыки и звуковых эффектов","Интеграция звука и музыки в играх","Техники иммерсивного звукового дизайна"],"ar":["نظام فئات الصوت","تعريفات فئات الصوت","أمثلة للموسيقى والأصوات","تكامل الصوت والموسيقى في الألعاب","تقنيات تصميم صوت غامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏音频","音频设计","音乐集成","音效","环境音","语音","游戏开发"],"ja":["ゲームオーディオ","オーディオ設計","音楽統合","音効","環境音","ボイス","ゲーム開発"],"ko":["게임 오디오","오디오 디자인","음악 통합","음效","환경음","보이스","게임 개발"],"es":["audio de juegos","diseño de sonido","música para juegos","experiencias inmersivas","desarrollo de juegos","tecnologías de audio","implementación de audio","optimización del audio"],"fr":["audio de jeu","conception sonore","musique pour jeux","expériences immersives","développement de jeux","technologies audio","mise en œuvre de l''audio","optimisation de l''audio"],"de":["Spiel-Audio","Sound-Design","Musik für Spiele","immersive Erfahrungen","Spiel-Entwicklung","Audio-Technologien","Implementierung von Audio","Optimierung der Audio-Leistung"],"pt":["áudio de jogos","som de jogos","música de jogos","design de áudio","experiências imersivas","jogos imersivos","tecnologia de áudio","desenvolvimento de jogos"],"ru":["звуковой дизайн игр","музыка для игр","звуковые эффекты для игр","иммерсивные trải nghiệm","игры с иммерсивным звуком","технология звука","разработка игр"],"ar":["صوت الألعاب","موسيقى الألعاب","أصوات الألعاب","تجارب غامرة","ألعاب غامرة","تكنولوجيا الصوت","تطوير الألعاب"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-audio","description":"Game audio principles. Sound design, music integration, adaptive audio systems.","bodyPreview":"# Game Audio Principles\n\n> Sound design and music integration for immersive game experiences.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Audio Category System\n\n### Category Definitions\n\n| Category | Behavior | Examples |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Music** | Looping, crossfade, ducking | BGM, combat music |\n| **SFX** | One-shot, 3D positioned | Footsteps, impacts |\n| **Ambient** | Looping, background layer | Wind, crowd, forest |\n| **UI** | Immediate, non-3D | Button clicks, notifications |\n| **Voice** | Priority,","body":"# Game Audio Principles\n\n> Sound design and music integration for immersive game experiences.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Audio Category System\n\n### Category Definitions\n\n| Category | Behavior | Examples |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Music** | Looping, crossfade, ducking | BGM, combat music |\n| **SFX** | One-shot, 3D positioned | Footsteps, impacts |\n| **Ambient** | Looping, background layer | Wind, crowd, forest |\n| **UI** | Immediate, non-3D | Button clicks, notifications |\n| **Voice** | Priority, ducking trigger | Dialogue, announcer |\n\n### Priority Hierarchy\n\n```\nWhen sounds compete for channels:\n\n1. Voice (highest - always audible)\n2. Player SFX (feedback critical)\n3. Enemy SFX (gameplay important)\n4. Music (mood, but duckable)\n5. Ambient (lowest - can drop)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Sound Design Decisions\n\n### SFX Creation Approach\n\n| Approach | When to Use | Trade-offs |\n|----------|-------------|------------|\n| **Recording** | Realistic needs | High quality, time intensive |\n| **Synthesis** | Sci-fi, retro, UI | Unique, requires skill |\n| **Library samples** | Fast production | Common sounds, licensing |\n| **Layering** | Complex sounds | Best results, more work |\n\n### Layering Structure\n\n| Layer | Purpose | Example: Gunshot |\n|-------|---------|------------------|\n| **Attack** | Initial transient | Click, snap |\n| **Body** | Main character | Boom, blast |\n| **Tail** | Decay, room | Reverb, echo |\n| **Sweetener** | Special sauce | Shell casing, mechanical |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Music Integration\n\n### Music State System\n\n```\nGame State → Music Response\n│\n├── Menu → Calm, loopable theme\n├── Exploration → Ambient, atmospheric\n├── Combat detected → Transition to tension\n├── Combat engaged → Full battle music\n├── Victory → Stinger + calm transition\n├── Defeat → Somber stinger\n└── Boss → Unique, multi-phase track\n```\n\n### Transition Techniques\n\n| Technique | Use When | Feel |\n|-----------|----------|------|\n| **Crossfade** | Smooth mood shift | Gradual |\n| **Stinger** | Immediate event | Dramatic |\n| **Stem mixing** | Dynamic intensity | Seamless |\n| **Beat-synced** | Rhythmic gameplay | Musical |\n| **Queue point** | Next natural break | Clean |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Adaptive Audio Decisions\n\n### Intensity Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Affects | Example |\n|-----------|---------|---------|\n| **Threat level** | Music intensity | Enemy count |\n| **Health** | Filter, reverb | Low health = muffled |\n| **Speed** | Tempo, energy | Racing speed |\n| **Environment** | Reverb, EQ | Cave vs outdoor |\n| **Time of day** | Mood, volume | Night = quieter |\n\n### Vertical vs Horizontal\n\n| System | What Changes | Best For |\n|--------|--------------|----------|\n| **Vertical (layers)** | Add/remove instrument layers | Intensity scaling |\n| **Horizontal (segments)** | Different music sections | State changes |\n| **Combined** | Both | AAA adaptive scores |\n\n---\n\n## 5. 3D Audio Decisions\n\n### Spatialization\n\n| Element | 3D Positioned? | Reason |\n|---------|----------------|--------|\n| Player footsteps | No (or subtle) | Always audible |\n| Enemy footsteps | Yes | Directional awareness |\n| Gunfire | Yes | Combat awareness |\n| Music | No | Mood, non-diegetic |\n| Ambient zone | Yes (area) | Environmental |\n| UI sounds | No | Interface feedback |\n\n### Distance Behavior\n\n| Distance | Sound Behavior |\n|----------|----------------|\n| **Near** | Full volume, full frequency |\n| **Medium** | Volume falloff, high-freq rolloff |\n| **Far** | Low volume, low-pass filter |\n| **Max** | Silent or ambient hint |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Platform Considerations\n\n### Format Selection\n\n| Platform | Recommended Format | Reason |\n|----------|-------------------|--------|\n| PC | OGG Vorbis, WAV | Quality, no licensing |\n| Console | Platform-specific | Certification |\n| Mobile | MP3, AAC | Size, compatibility |\n| Web | WebM/Opus, MP3 fallback | Browser support |\n\n### Memory Budget\n\n| Game Type | Audio Budget | Strategy |\n|-----------|--------------|----------|\n| Mobile casual | 10-50 MB | Compressed, fewer variants |\n| PC indie | 100-500 MB | Quality focus |\n| AAA | 1+ GB | Full quality, many variants |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Mix Hierarchy\n\n### Volume Balance Reference\n\n| Category | Relative Level | Notes |\n|----------|----------------|-------|\n| **Voice** | 0 dB (reference) | Always clear |\n| **Player SFX** | -3 to -6 dB | Prominent but not harsh |\n| **Music** | -6 to -12 dB | Foundation, ducks for voice |\n| **Enemy SFX** | -6 to -9 dB | Important but not dominant |\n| **Ambient** | -12 to -18 dB | Subtle background |\n\n### Ducking Rules\n\n| When | Duck What | Amount |\n|------|-----------|--------|\n| Voice plays | Music, Ambient | -6 to -9 dB |\n| Explosion | All except explosion | Brief duck |\n| Menu open | Gameplay audio | -3 to -6 dB |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Play same sound repeatedly | Use variations (3-5 per sound) |\n| Max volume everything | Use proper mix hierarchy |\n| Ignore silence | Silence creates contrast |\n| One music track loops forever | Provide variety, transitions |\n| Skip audio in prototype | Placeholder audio matters |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** 50% of the game experience is audio. A muted game loses half its soul.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:59:54.680Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in game development needing immersive audio experiences with sound design and music integration.","zh":"非常适合专门从事游戏开发并需要沉浸式音频体验的音频设计和音乐集成的AI代理。","ja":"ゲーム開発における没入感のあるオーディオ体験を必要とするゲーム開発に特化したAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"게임 개발에서 몰입형 오디오 경험과 사운드 디자인 및 음악 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA especializados en desarrollo de juegos que necesitan experiencias de audio inmersivas con diseño de sonido e integración de música.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA spécialisés dans le développement de jeux nécessitant des expériences audio immersives avec conception sonore et intégration musicale.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die auf Spieleentwicklung spezialisiert sind und immersive Audio-Erlebnisse mit Sound-Design und Musikintegration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA especializados em desenvolvimento de jogos que necessitam de experiências de áudio imersivas com design de som e integração de música.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на разработке игр, требующих погружающих аудиоопытов с дизайном звука и интеграцией музыки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين في تطوير الألعاب التي تحتاج إلى تجارب صوتية غامرة مع تصميم الصوت وتكامل الموسيقى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create engaging game audio by leveraging audio category systems, including music, SFX, ambient, UI, and voice, utilizing techniques like looping, crossfading, and 3D positioning.","zh":"通过利用音频分类系统（包括音乐、音效、环境音、UI和语音），并使用循环、交叉渐变和3D定位等技术，赋予代理创建吸引人游戏音频的能力。","ja":"音楽、SE、環境音、UI、ボイスなどのオーディオカテゴリーシステムを利用し、ループ、クロスフェード、3Dポジショニングなどのテクニックを使用して、エージェントが魅力的ゲームオーディオを作成できるようにします。","ko":"음악, 음效, 환경음, UI, 보이스 등을 포함한 오디오 카테고리 시스템을 활용하고 루핑, 크로스페이드, 3D 포지셔닝 등의 기술을 사용하여 에이전트가 매력적인 게임 오디오를 만들 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear audio de juego atractivo aprovechando sistemas de categorías de audio, incluyendo música, efectos de sonido, ambient, UI y voz, utilizando técnicas como bucle, crossfading y posicionamiento 3D.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un audio de jeu engageant en exploitant les systèmes de catégorisation audio, y compris la musique, les effets sonores, l''ambiance, l''UI et la voix, en utilisant des techniques comme la boucle, le crossfading et la position 3D.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ansprechendes Spiel-Audio zu erstellen, indem sie Audiosysteme wie Musik, Soundeffekte, Ambient, UI und Sprache nutzen und Techniken wie Schleifen, Crossfading und 3D-Positionierung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar áudio de jogo atraente, utilizando sistemas de categorias de áudio, incluindo música, efeitos sonoros, ambiental, interface do usuário e voz, utilizando técnicas como looping, crossfading e posicionamento 3D.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательный игровой аудио, используя системы аудиокатегорий, включая музыку, звуковые эффекты, фон, интерфейс пользователя и голос, используя техники, такие как зацикливание, перекрестное затухание и трехмерное позиционирование.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء صوت ألعاب جذاب من خلال استخدام أنظمة فئات الصوت، بما في ذلك الموسيقى والأصوات والخلفية وواجهة المستخدم والصوت، باستخدام تقنيات مثل التكرار والتلاشي المتقاطع والتنسيق ثلاثي الأبعاد."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing immersive music integration for game levels","Implementing realistic sound effects for character interactions","Creating ambient layers for environmental immersion"],"zh":["为游戏关卡设计沉浸式音乐集成","为角色互动实现真实的音效","为环境沉浸创建环境层"],"ja":["ゲームステージの没入感のある音楽統合を設計する","キャラクターのやり取りのリアルなサウンドエフェクトを実現する","環境の没入感を高める環境層を作成する"],"ko":["게임 레벨의 몰입형 음악 통합을 설계한다","캐릭터 상호작용을 위한 실제적인 음향 효과 구현","환경적 몰입을 위한 환경 레이어 생성"],"es":["Diseñar una integración de música inmersiva para niveles de juego","Implementar efectos de sonido realistas para interacciones de personajes","Crear capas ambientales para inmersión ambiental"],"fr":["Concevoir une intégration musicale immersive pour les niveaux de jeu","Mettre en œuvre des effets sonores réalistes pour les interactions de personnages","Créer des couches ambiantes pour l''immersion environnementale"],"de":["Entwerfen einer immersiven Musikintegration für Spiellevel","Implementieren realistischer Soundeffekte für Charakterinteraktionen","Erstellen von Ambient-Schichten für Umgebungsimmersion"],"pt":["Projetar integração de música imersiva para níveis de jogos","Implementar efeitos sonoros realistas para interações de personagens","Criar camadas ambientais para imersão ambiental"],"ru":["Проектировать погружающую музыкальную интеграцию для уровней игр","Реализовывать реалистичные звуковые эффекты для взаимодействий персонажей","Создавать фонические слои для окружающей иммерсии"],"ar":["تصميم دمج الموسيقى الغامرة لأحجام الألعاب","تطبيق أصوات واقعية للتفاعلات الشخصية","إنشاء طبقات محيطة للاستغراق البيئي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of audio design principles","Compatibility issues with certain game engines or IDEs"],"zh":["需要了解音频设计原则","可能与某些游戏引擎或IDE存在兼容性问题"],"ja":["オーディオデザインの原則を理解する必要がある","一部のゲームエンジンまたはIDEと互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["오디오 디자인 원리를 이해해야 함","일부 게임 엔진 또는 IDE와의 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de diseño de audio","Problemas de compatibilidad con ciertos motores de juego o IDE"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de conception audio","Problèmes de compatibilité avec certains moteurs de jeu ou IDE"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis für Audio-Design-Prinzipien","Kompatibilitätsprobleme mit bestimmten Spiel-Engines oder IDE"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de design de áudio","Problemas de compatibilidade com certos motores de jogo ou IDEs"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов аудиодизайна","Проблемы совместимости с определенными игровыми движками или IDE"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ تصميم الصوت","مشاكل في التوافق مع بعض محركات الألعاب أو بيئات التطوير المتكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
