-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Temporal工作流编排模式提供了构建可靠分布式系统的解决方案，包括基本设计决策、弹性模式和最佳实践","ja":"ワークフロー・オーケストレーション・パターンは、分散システムを構築するための基本的な設計の決定、弾性パターン、ベストプラクティスを提供します","ko":"Temporal 워크플로 오케스트레이션 패턴은 안정적인 분산 시스템을 구축하는 데 필요한 기본 디자인 결정, 탄력성 패턴 및 모범 사례를 제공합니다","es":"Descubre los patrones de orquestación de flujo de trabajo para diseñar sistemas distribuidos confiables con Temporal","fr":"Découvrez les modèles d''orchestration de workflow pour concevoir des systèmes distribués fiables avec Temporal","de":"Entdecken Sie die Workflow-Orchestrierungsmuster, um zuverlässige verteilte Systeme mit Temporal zu entwerfen","pt":"Aprenda a orquestrar fluxos de trabalho com Temporal, cobrindo decisões de design fundamentais, padrões de resiliência e boas práticas para construir sistema...","ru":"Узнайте, как оркестровать рабочие процессы с помощью Temporal, охватывая основные решения по проектированию, шаблоны устойчивости и лучшие практики для постр...","ar":"تعلم كيفية أوركسترا سير العمل مع Temporal، تغطية قرارات التصميم الأساسية وأنماط الاستمرارية وأفضل الممارسات لبناء نظم موزعة موثوقة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["多步骤过程管理","分布式事务支持","长时间运行工作流自动状态管理","弹性模式支持","基本设计决策指导"],"ja":["マルチステップ・プロセスの管理","分散トランザクションのサポート","長時間実行ワークフローの自動状態管理","弾性パターンのサポート","基本的な設計の決定のガイダンス"],"ko":["여러 단계의 프로세스 관리","분산 트랜잭션 지원","장기간 실행 워크플로우의 자동 상태 관리","탄력성 패턴 지원","기본 디자인 결정 가이드"],"es":["Diseño de arquitectura de orquestación de flujo de trabajo","Patrones de resiliencia para sistemas distribuidos","Mejora de la confiabilidad de los sistemas","Gestión de procesos complejos","Soporte para transacciones distribuidas","Integración con Temporal"],"fr":["Conception d''architecture d''orchestration de workflow","Modèles de résilience pour les systèmes distribués","Amélioration de la fiabilité des systèmes","Gestion de processus complexes","Support pour les transactions distribuées","Intégration avec Temporal"],"de":["Entwurf der Workflow-Orchestrierungsarchitektur","Resilienzmuster für verteilte Systeme","Verbesserung der Zuverlässigkeit der Systeme","Verwaltung komplexer Prozesse","Unterstützung für verteilte Transaktionen","Integration mit Temporal"],"pt":["Decisões de design fundamentais para orquestração de fluxo de trabalho","Padrões de resiliência para sistemas distribuídos","Boas práticas para construir sistemas confiáveis","Suporte a processos de vários passos","Suporte a transações distribuídas","Suporte a fluxos de trabalho de longa duração"],"ru":["Основные решения по проектированию для оркестровки рабочих процессов","Шаблоны устойчивости для распределенных систем","Лучшие практики для построения надежных систем","Поддержка многоступенчатых процессов","Поддержка распределенных транзакций","Поддержка долгосрочных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["قرارات التصميم الأساسية لأوركسترا سير العمل","أنماط الاستمرارية لنظم موزعة","أفضل الممارسات لبناء نظم موثوقة","دعم العمليات متعددة المراحل","دعم المعاملات الموزعة","دعم سير العمل لمدة طويلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["工作流编排","Temporal","分布式系统","弹性模式","长时间运行工作流","多步骤过程","分布式事务"],"ja":["ワークフロー・オーケストレーション","Temporal","分散システム","弾性パターン","長時間実行ワークフロー","マルチステップ・プロセス","分散トランザクション"],"ko":["워크플로우 오케스트레이션","Temporal","분산 시스템","탄력성 패턴","장기간 실행 워크플로우","여러 단계의 프로세스","분산 트랜잭션"],"es":["orquestación de flujo de trabajo","patrones de diseño","sistemas distribuidos","temporal","resiliencia","confiabilidad","procesos complejos","transacciones distribuidas"],"fr":["orchestration de workflow","modèles de conception","systèmes distribués","temporal","résilience","fiabilité","processus complexes","transactions distribuées"],"de":["workflow-orchestrierung","entwurfsmuster","verteilte systeme","temporal","resilienz","zuverlässigkeit","komplexe prozesse","verteilte transaktionen"],"pt":["orquestração de fluxo de trabalho","sistemas distribuídos","resiliência","boas práticas","processos de vários passos","transações distribuídas","fluxos de trabalho de longa duração","temporal","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["оркестровка рабочих процессов","распределенные системы","устойчивость","лучшие практики","многоступенчатые процессы","распределенные транзакции","долгосрочные рабочие процессы","temporal","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أوركسترا سير العمل","نظم موزعة","استمرارية","أفضل الممارسات","عمليات متعددة المراحل","معاملات موزعة","سير العمل لمدة طويلة","temporal","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow-orchestration-patterns","description":"Design durable workflows with Temporal for distributed systems. Covers workflow vs activity separation, saga patterns, state management, and determinism constraints. Use when building long-running processes, distributed transactions, or microservice orchestration.","bodyPreview":"# Workflow Orchestration Patterns\n\nMaster workflow orchestration architecture with Temporal, covering fundamental design decisions, resilience patterns, and best practices for building reliable distributed systems.\n\n## When to Use Workflow Orchestration\n\n### Ideal Use Cases (Source: docs.temporal.io)\n\n- **Multi-step processes** spanning machines/services/databases\n- **Distributed transactions** requiring all-or-nothing semantics\n- **Long-running workflows** (hours to years) with automatic state","body":"# Workflow Orchestration Patterns\n\nMaster workflow orchestration architecture with Temporal, covering fundamental design decisions, resilience patterns, and best practices for building reliable distributed systems.\n\n## When to Use Workflow Orchestration\n\n### Ideal Use Cases (Source: docs.temporal.io)\n\n- **Multi-step processes** spanning machines/services/databases\n- **Distributed transactions** requiring all-or-nothing semantics\n- **Long-running workflows** (hours to years) with automatic state persistence\n- **Failure recovery** that must resume from last successful step\n- **Business processes**: bookings, orders, campaigns, approvals\n- **Entity lifecycle management**: inventory tracking, account management, cart workflows\n- **Infrastructure automation**: CI/CD pipelines, provisioning, deployments\n- **Human-in-the-loop** systems requiring timeouts and escalations\n\n### When NOT to Use\n\n- Simple CRUD operations (use direct API calls)\n- Pure data processing pipelines (use Airflow, batch processing)\n- Stateless request/response (use standard APIs)\n- Real-time streaming (use Kafka, event processors)\n\n## Critical Design Decision: Workflows vs Activities\n\n**The Fundamental Rule** (Source: temporal.io/blog/workflow-engine-principles):\n\n- **Workflows** = Orchestration logic and decision-making\n- **Activities** = External interactions (APIs, databases, network calls)\n\n### Workflows (Orchestration)\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Contain business logic and coordination\n- **MUST be deterministic** (same inputs → same outputs)\n- **Cannot** perform direct external calls\n- State automatically preserved across failures\n- Can run for years despite infrastructure failures\n\n**Example workflow tasks:**\n\n- Decide which steps to execute\n- Handle compensation logic\n- Manage timeouts and retries\n- Coordinate child workflows\n\n### Activities (External Interactions)\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Handle all external system interactions\n- Can be non-deterministic (API calls, DB writes)\n- Include built-in timeouts and retry logic\n- **Must be idempotent** (calling N times = calling once)\n- Short-lived (seconds to minutes typically)\n\n**Example activity tasks:**\n\n- Call payment gateway API\n- Write to database\n- Send emails or notifications\n- Query external services\n\n### Design Decision Framework\n\n```\nDoes it touch external systems? → Activity\nIs it orchestration/decision logic? → Workflow\n```\n\n## Core Workflow Patterns\n\n### 1. Saga Pattern with Compensation\n\n**Purpose**: Implement distributed transactions with rollback capability\n\n**Pattern** (Source: temporal.io/blog/compensating-actions-part-of-a-complete-breakfast-with-sagas):\n\n```\nFor each step:\n  1. Register compensation BEFORE executing\n  2. Execute the step (via activity)\n  3. On failure, run all compensations in reverse order (LIFO)\n```\n\n**Example: Payment Workflow**\n\n1. Reserve inventory (compensation: release inventory)\n2. Charge payment (compensation: refund payment)\n3. Fulfill order (compensation: cancel fulfillment)\n\n**Critical Requirements:**\n\n- Compensations must be idempotent\n- Register compensation BEFORE executing step\n- Run compensations in reverse order\n- Handle partial failures gracefully\n\n### 2. Entity Workflows (Actor Model)\n\n**Purpose**: Long-lived workflow representing single entity instance\n\n**Pattern** (Source: docs.temporal.io/evaluate/use-cases-design-patterns):\n\n- One workflow execution = one entity (cart, account, inventory item)\n- Workflow persists for entity lifetime\n- Receives signals for state changes\n- Supports queries for current state\n\n**Example Use Cases:**\n\n- Shopping cart (add items, checkout, expiration)\n- Bank account (deposits, withdrawals, balance checks)\n- Product inventory (stock updates, reservations)\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n- Encapsulates entity behavior\n- Guarantees consistency per entity\n- Natural event sourcing\n\n### 3. Fan-Out/Fan-In (Parallel Execution)\n\n**Purpose**: Execute multiple tasks in parallel, aggregate results\n\n**Pattern:**\n\n- Spawn child workflows or parallel activities\n- Wait for all to complete\n- Aggregate results\n- Handle partial failures\n\n**Scaling Rule** (Source: temporal.io/blog/workflow-engine-principles):\n\n- Don''t scale individual workflows\n- For 1M tasks: spawn 1K child workflows × 1K tasks each\n- Keep each workflow bounded\n\n### 4. Async Callback Pattern\n\n**Purpose**: Wait for external event or human approval\n\n**Pattern:**\n\n- Workflow sends request and waits for signal\n- External system processes asynchronously\n- Sends signal to resume workflow\n- Workflow continues with response\n\n**Use Cases:**\n\n- Human approval workflows\n- Webhook callbacks\n- Long-running external processes\n\n## State Management and Determinism\n\n### Automatic State Preservation\n\n**How Temporal Works** (Source: docs.temporal.io/workflows):\n\n- Complete program state preserved automatically\n- Event History records every command and event\n- Seamless recovery from crashes\n- Applications restore pre-failure state\n\n### Determinism Constraints\n\n**Workflows Execute as State Machines**:\n\n- Replay behavior must be consistent\n- Same inputs → identical outputs every time\n\n**Prohibited in Workflows** (Source: docs.temporal.io/workflows):\n\n- ❌ Threading, locks, synchronization primitives\n- ❌ Random number generation (`random()`)\n- ❌ Global state or static variables\n- ❌ System time (`datetime.now()`)\n- ❌ Direct file I/O or network calls\n- ❌ Non-deterministic libraries\n\n**Allowed in Workflows**:\n\n- ✅ `workflow.now()` (deterministic time)\n- ✅ `workflow.random()` (deterministic random)\n- ✅ Pure functions and calculations\n- ✅ Calling activities (non-deterministic operations)\n\n### Versioning Strategies\n\n**Challenge**: Changing workflow code while old executions still running\n\n**Solutions**:\n\n1. **Versioning API**: Use `workflow.get_version()` for safe changes\n2. **New Workflow Type**: Create new workflow, route new executions to it\n3. **Backward Compatibility**: Ensure old events replay correctly\n\n## Resilience and Error Handling\n\n### Retry Policies\n\n**Default Behavior**: Temporal retries activities forever\n\n**Configure Retry**:\n\n- Initial retry interval\n- Backoff coefficient (exponential backoff)\n- Maximum interval (cap retry delay)\n- Maximum attempts (eventually fail)\n\n**Non-Retryable Errors**:\n\n- Invalid input (validation failures)\n- Business rule violations\n- Permanent failures (resource not found)\n\n### Idempotency Requirements\n\n**Why Critical** (Source: docs.temporal.io/activities):\n\n- Activities may execute multiple times\n- Network failures trigger retries\n- Duplicate execution must be safe\n\n**Implementation Strategies**:\n\n- Idempotency keys (deduplication)\n- Check-then-act with unique constraints\n- Upsert operations instead of insert\n- Track processed request IDs\n\n### Activity Heartbeats\n\n**Purpose**: Detect stalled long-running activities\n\n**Pattern**:\n\n- Activity sends periodic heartbeat\n- Includes progress information\n- Timeout if no heartbeat received\n- Enables progress-based retry\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Workflow Design\n\n1. **Keep workflows focused** - Single responsibility per workflow\n2. **Small workflows** - Use child workflows for scalability\n3. **Clear boundaries** - Workflow orchestrates, activities execute\n4. **Test locally** - Use time-skipping test environment\n\n### Activity Design\n\n1. **Idempotent operations** - Safe to retry\n2. **Short-lived** - Seconds to minutes, not hours\n3. **Timeout configuration** - Always set timeouts\n4. **Heartbeat for long tasks** - Report progress\n5. **Error handling** - Distinguish retryable vs non-retryable\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Workflow Violations**:\n\n- Using `datetime.now()` instead of `workflow.now()`\n- Threading or async operations in workflow code\n- Calling external APIs directly from workflow\n- Non-deterministic logic in workflows\n\n**Activity Mistakes**:\n\n- Non-idempotent operations (can''t handle retries)\n- Missing timeouts (activities run forever)\n- No error classification (retry validation errors)\n- Ignoring payload limits (2MB per argument)\n\n### Operational Considerations\n\n**Monitoring**:\n\n- Workflow execution duration\n- Activity failure rates\n- Retry attempts and backoff\n- Pending workflow counts\n\n**Scalability**:\n\n- Horizontal scaling with workers\n- Task queue partitioning\n- Child workflow decomposition\n- Activity batching when appropriate\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n**Official Documentation**:\n\n- Temporal Core Concepts: docs.temporal.io/workflows\n- Workflow Patterns: docs.temporal.io/evaluate/use-cases-design-patterns\n- Best Practices: docs.temporal.io/develop/best-practices\n- Saga Pattern: temporal.io/blog/saga-pattern-made-easy\n\n**Key Principles**:\n\n1. Workflows = orchestration, Activities = external calls\n2. Determinism is non-negotiable for workflows\n3. Idempotency is critical for activities\n4. State preservation is automatic\n5. Design for failure and recovery\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:00:16.444Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Distributed System Agents needing reliable workflow orchestration with Temporal","zh":"非常适合需要利用Temporal实现可靠工作流编排的分布式系统智能体","ja":"Temporalを使用した信頼性の高いワークフローオーケストレーションを必要とする分散システムエージェントに最適","ko":"Temporal을 통한 신뢰할 수 있는 워크플로 오케스트레이션이 필요한 분산 시스템 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Sistemas Distribuidos que necesitan una orquestación de flujo de trabajo confiable con Temporal","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Systèmes Distribués ayant besoin d''une orchestration de workflow fiable avec Temporal","de":"Perfekt für verteilte Systemagenten, die eine zuverlässige Workflow-Orchestrierung mit Temporal benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas Distribuídos que necessitam de orquestração de fluxo de trabalho confiável com Temporal","ru":"Идеально для агентов распределенных систем, требующих надежной оркестрации рабочих процессов с Temporal","ar":"مثالي لعميل نظام موزع بحاجة إلى تنسيق موثوق للتدفقات العملية مع Temporal"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design resilient workflow orchestration architectures, leveraging fundamental design decisions, resilience patterns, and best practices for building reliable distributed systems with Temporal, covering multi-step processes, distributed transactions, and long-running workflows","zh":"赋能智能体设计弹性工作流编排架构，利用基本设计决策、弹性模式和最佳实践，通过Temporal构建可靠分布式系统，涵盖多步骤流程、分布式事务和长时间运行的工作流","ja":"基本的な設計判断、回復力パターン、およびTemporalを使用した信頼性の高い分散システム構築のベストプラクティスを活用し、マルチステッププロセス、分散トランザクション、長時間実行ワークフローをカバーする、回復力のあるワークフローオーケストレーションアーキテクチャの設計をエージェントに可能にする","ko":"기본 설계 결정, 복원력 패턴 및 Temporal을 사용한 신뢰할 수 있는 분산 시스템 구축을 위한 모범 사례를 활용하여 다단계 프로세스, 분산 트랜잭션 및 장기 실행 워크플로를涵盖하는 복원력 있는 워크플로 오케스트레이션 아키텍처를 설계할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar arquitecturas de orquestación de flujo de trabajo resistentes, aprovechando decisiones de diseño fundamentales, patrones de resistencia y mejores prácticas para la construcción de sistemas distribuidos confiables con Temporal, que abarcan procesos multietapa, transacciones distribuidas y flujos de trabajo de larga duración","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures d''orchestration de workflow résilientes, en exploitant les décisions de conception fondamentales, les modèles de résilience et les meilleures pratiques pour la construction de systèmes distribués fiables avec Temporal, couvrant les processus multétapes, les transactions distribuées et les flux de travail à long terme","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, widerstandsfähige Workflow-Orchestrierungsarchitekturen zu entwerfen, indem grundlegende Designentscheidungen, Resilienzmuster und Best Practices für den Bau zuverlässiger verteilter Systeme mit Temporal genutzt werden, die mehrstufige Prozesse, verteilte Transaktionen und lang laufende Workflows abdecken","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem arquiteturas de orquestração de fluxo de trabalho resilientes, aproveitando decisões fundamentais de design, padrões de resiliência e boas práticas para construir sistemas distribuídos confiáveis com Temporal, abrangendo processos de múltiplos passos, transações distribuídas e fluxos de trabalho de longa duração","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать устойчивые архитектуры оркестрации рабочих процессов, используя основные решения по проектированию, шаблоны устойчивости и лучшие практики для построения надежных распределенных систем с Temporal, охватывающие многоступенчатые процессы, распределенные транзакции и долгосрочные рабочие процессы","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم هندسة تنسيق تدفقات عمل متينة، مستفيدة من قرارات التصميم الأساسية وأنساق المتانة وأفضل الممارسات لبناء أنظمة موزعة موثوقة مع Temporal، وتغطية العمليات متعددة المراحل والتعاملات الموزعة والتدفقات العملية المستمرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating multi-step processes across machines and services","Managing distributed transactions with all-or-nothing semantics","Automating long-running workflows with automatic state management"],"zh":["跨机器和服务编排多步骤流程","管理具有全有或全无语义的分布式事务","通过自动状态管理实现长时间运行工作流的自动化"],"ja":["マシンとサービスにわたるマルチステッププロセスのオーケストレーション","オールオアナッシングセマンティクスによる分散トランザクションの管理","自動状態管理による長時間実行ワークフローの自動化"],"ko":["기계 및 서비스 전반의 다단계 프로세스 오케스트레이션","전부 또는 전무(all-or-nothing) 의미론을 사용한 분산 트랜잭션 관리","자동 상태 관리로 장기 실행 워크플로 자동화"],"es":["Orquestar procesos multietapa en máquinas y servicios","Gestionar transacciones distribuidas con semántica de todo o nada","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de larga duración con gestión de estado automática"],"fr":["Orchestrer des processus multétapes sur des machines et des services","Gérer des transactions distribuées avec une sémantique tout ou rien","Automatiser des flux de travail à long terme avec une gestion d''état automatique"],"de":["Mehrstufige Prozesse auf Maschinen und Diensten orchestrieren","Verteilte Transaktionen mit All-oder-Keine-Semantik verwalten","Lang laufende Workflows mit automatischer Statusverwaltung automatisieren"],"pt":["Orquestrando processos de múltiplos passos em máquinas e serviços","Gerenciando transações distribuídas com semântica all-or-nothing","Automatizando fluxos de trabalho de longa duração com gerenciamento de estado automático"],"ru":["Оркестрация многоступенчатых процессов на машинах и службах","Управление распределенными транзакциями с семантикой all-or-nothing","Автоматизация долгосрочных рабочих процессов с автоматическим управлением состоянием"],"ar":["تنسيق العمليات متعددة المراحل عبر الآلات والخدمات","إدارة التعاملات الموزعة ذات الصياغة all-or-nothing","توفير أتمتة للتدفقات العملية المستمرة مع إدارة الحالة التلقائية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Temporal workflow orchestration architecture","Ideal for distributed systems with complex workflows"],"zh":["需要Temporal工作流编排架构","非常适合具有复杂工作流的分布式系统"],"ja":["Temporalワークフローオーケストレーションアーキテクチャが必要","複雑なワークフローを伴う分散システムに理想的"],"ko":["Temporal 워크플로 오케스트레이션 아키텍처 필요","복잡한 워크플로를 가진 분산 시스템에 이상적"],"es":["Requiere arquitectura de orquestación de flujo de trabajo de Temporal","Ideal para sistemas distribuidos con flujos de trabajo complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite une architecture d''orchestration de workflow Temporal","Idéal pour les systèmes distribués avec des flux de travail complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Temporal-Workflow-Orchestrierungsarchitektur","Ideal für verteilte Systeme mit komplexen Workflows"],"pt":["Requer arquitetura de orquestração de fluxo de trabalho Temporal","Ideal para sistemas distribuídos com fluxos de trabalho complexos"],"ru":["Требует архитектуры оркестрации рабочих процессов Temporal","Идеально для распределенных систем с сложными рабочими процессами"],"ar":["يتطلب هندسة تنسيق تدفقات عمل Temporal","مثالي لأنظمة موزعة ذات تدفقات عمل معقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/firebase-auth', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'firebase-auth', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z', '2026-02-18T14:00:33.847Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/firebase-auth","name":"firebase-auth","description":{"zh":"Firebase Authentication是一个用于用户身份验证和授权的技能，支持多种身份提供者","ja":"Firebase Authenticationはユーザー認証と認可を行うスキルで、複数のアイデンティティプロバイダーをサポート","ko":"파이어베이스 인증은 사용자 인증 및 인가에 사용되는 스킬로 여러 인증 제공자를 지원","es":"La autenticación de Firebase es una solución de autenticación escalable y segura para aplicaciones web y móviles. Configure la autenticación de Firebase en 5 minutos.","fr":"L''authentification Firebase est une solution d''authentification évolutiva et sécurisée pour les applications web et mobiles. Configurez l''authentification Firebase en 5 minutes.","de":"Die Firebase-Authentifizierung ist eine skalierbare und sichere Authentifizierungslösung für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen. Konfigurieren Sie die Firebase-Authentifizierung in 5 Minuten.","pt":"O Firebase Auth é uma solução de autenticação escalável e segura para aplicativos web e móveis. Aprenda a configurá-lo em apenas 5 minutos.","ru":"Firebase Auth — это масштабируемое и безопасное решение для аутентификации веб- и мобильных приложений. Узнайте, как настроить его всего за 5 минут.","ar":"التحقق من Firebase هو حل التحقق الآمن والمقابل للتحديث لتطبيقات الويب والجوال. تعلم كيفية تكوينه في غضون 5 دقائق.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Firebase Authentication技能","ja":"Firebase Authenticationスキル","ko":"파이어베이스 인증 스킬","es":"Autenticación de Firebase: Guía Rápida para Desarrolladores","fr":"Authentification Firebase : Guide Rapide pour les Dévelop...","de":"Firebase-Authentifizierung: Schnellstart für Entwickler","pt":"Autenticação Firebase: Guia Rápido para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Firebase Аутентификация: Быстрый Старт для Разработчиков","ar":"التحقق من Firebase: دليل سريع للمطورين","en":"firebase-auth"},"description":{"zh":"Firebase Authentication是一个用于用户身份验证和授权的技能，支持多种身份提供者","ja":"Firebase Authenticationはユーザー認証と認可を行うスキルで、複数のアイデンティティプロバイダーをサポート","ko":"파이어베이스 인증은 사용자 인증 및 인가에 사용되는 스킬로 여러 인증 제공자를 지원","es":"La autenticación de Firebase es una solución de autenticación escalable y segura para aplicaciones web y móviles. Configure la autenticación de Firebase en 5...","fr":"L''authentification Firebase est une solution d''authentification évolutiva et sécurisée pour les applications web et mobiles. Configurez l''authentification Fi...","de":"Die Firebase-Authentifizierung ist eine skalierbare und sichere Authentifizierungslösung für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen. Konfigurieren Sie die Firebase-Auth...","pt":"O Firebase Auth é uma solução de autenticação escalável e segura para aplicativos web e móveis. Aprenda a configurá-lo em apenas 5 minutos.","ru":"Firebase Auth — это масштабируемое и безопасное решение для аутентификации веб- и мобильных приложений. Узнайте, как настроить его всего за 5 минут.","ar":"التحقق من Firebase هو حل التحقق الآمن والمقابل للتحديث لتطبيقات الويب والجوال. تعلم كيفية تكوينه في غضون 5 دقائق.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多种身份提供者（Email/Password、Google等）","可配置OAuth提供者","客户端和服务器端SDK","快速开始使用（5分钟）","与Firebase Console集成"],"ja":["複数のアイデンティティプロバイダー（Email/Password、Google等）をサポート","OAuthプロバイダーを設定可能","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのSDK","クイックスタート（5分）","Firebase Consoleとの統合"],"ko":["여러 인증 제공자 지원（이메일/암호, 구글 등）","OAuth 제공자 설정 가능","클라이언트 및 서버 SDK","快速 시작（5분）","파이어베이스 콘솔과 통합"],"es":["Autenticación con proveedores de inicio de sesión múltiples","Soporte para OAuth y autenticación con contraseña","Configuración sencilla en la consola de Firebase","Integración con aplicaciones web y móviles","Seguridad y escalabilidad garantizadas"],"fr":["Authentification avec plusieurs fournisseurs de connexion","Prise en charge d''OAuth et d''authentification par mot de passe","Configuration simple dans la console Firebase","Intégration avec les applications web et mobiles","Sécurité et évolutivité garanties"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit mehreren Anmeldeanbietern","Unterstützung für OAuth und Passwortauthentifizierung","Einfache Konfiguration in der Firebase-Konsole","Integration mit Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit garantiert"],"pt":["Habilitação de provedores de autenticação","Inicialização do Firebase Auth","Suporte a múltiplos provedores de autenticação","Gerenciamento de contas de usuário","Autenticação segura com OAuth"],"ru":["Включение провайдеров аутентификации","Инициализация Firebase Auth","Поддержка нескольких провайдеров аутентификации","Управление учетными записями пользователей","Безопасная аутентификация с OAuth"],"ar":["تمكين مزودي التحقق","ال初始化 التحقق من Firebase","دعم مزودي التحقق المتعددين","إدارة حسابات المستخدمين","التحقق الآمن مع OAuth"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Firebase Authentication","用户身份验证","授权","身份提供者","OAuth","Firebase Console"],"ja":["Firebase Authentication","ユーザー認証","認可","アイデンティティプロバイダー","OAuth","Firebase Console"],"ko":["파이어베이스 인증","사용자 인증","인가","인증 제공자","OAuth","파이어베이스 콘솔"],"es":["autenticación de firebase","desarrollo web","desarrollo móvil","seguridad de aplicaciones","autenticación escalable","configuración de firebase","proveedores de inicio de sesión","oauth"],"fr":["authentification firebase","développement web","développement mobile","sécurité des applications","authentification évolutiva","configuration de firebase","fournisseurs de connexion","oauth"],"de":["firebase-authentifizierung","webentwicklung","mobileentwicklung","anwendungssicherheit","skalierbare authentifizierung","firebase-konfiguration","anmeldeanbieter","oauth"],"pt":["autenticação firebase","firebase auth","provedores de autenticação","inicialização do firebase auth","gerenciamento de contas de usuário","autenticação segura","oauth","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","soluções de autenticação"],"ru":["аутентификация firebase","firebase auth","провайдеры аутентификации","инициализация firebase auth","управление учетными записями пользователей","безопасная аутентификация","oauth","разработка приложений","решения для аутентификации"],"ar":["التحقق من firebase","التحقق من firebase auth","مزودي التحقق","ال初始化 التحقق من firebase","إدارة حسابات المستخدمين","التحقق الآمن","oauth","تطوير التطبيقات","حلول التحقق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"firebase-auth","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Firebase Authentication\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-25\n**Dependencies**: None (standalone skill)\n**Latest Versions**: firebase@12.8.0, firebase-admin@13.6.0\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Enable Auth Providers in Firebase Console\n\n1. Go to Firebase Console > Authentication > Sign-in method\n2. Enable desired providers (Email/Password, Google, etc.)\n3. Configure OAuth providers with client ID/secret\n\n### 2. Initialize Firebase Auth (Client)\n\n```typescript\n//","body":"# Firebase Authentication\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-25\n**Dependencies**: None (standalone skill)\n**Latest Versions**: firebase@12.8.0, firebase-admin@13.6.0\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Enable Auth Providers in Firebase Console\n\n1. Go to Firebase Console > Authentication > Sign-in method\n2. Enable desired providers (Email/Password, Google, etc.)\n3. Configure OAuth providers with client ID/secret\n\n### 2. Initialize Firebase Auth (Client)\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/firebase.ts\nimport { initializeApp } from ''firebase/app'';\nimport { getAuth } from ''firebase/auth'';\n\nconst firebaseConfig = {\n  apiKey: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY,\n  authDomain: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN,\n  projectId: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID,\n  // ... other config\n};\n\nconst app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);\nexport const auth = getAuth(app);\n```\n\n### 3. Initialize Firebase Admin (Server)\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/firebase-admin.ts\nimport { initializeApp, cert, getApps } from ''firebase-admin/app'';\nimport { getAuth } from ''firebase-admin/auth'';\n\nif (!getApps().length) {\n  initializeApp({\n    credential: cert({\n      projectId: process.env.FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID,\n      clientEmail: process.env.FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL,\n      privateKey: process.env.FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY?.replace(/\\\\n/g, ''\\n''),\n    }),\n  });\n}\n\nexport const adminAuth = getAuth();\n```\n\n---\n\n## Email/Password Authentication\n\n### Sign Up\n\n```typescript\nimport { createUserWithEmailAndPassword, sendEmailVerification, updateProfile } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function signUp(email: string, password: string, displayName: string) {\n  try {\n    const userCredential = await createUserWithEmailAndPassword(auth, email, password);\n    const user = userCredential.user;\n\n    // Update display name\n    await updateProfile(user, { displayName });\n\n    // Send verification email\n    await sendEmailVerification(user);\n\n    return user;\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    switch (error.code) {\n      case ''auth/email-already-in-use'':\n        throw new Error(''Email already registered'');\n      case ''auth/invalid-email'':\n        throw new Error(''Invalid email address'');\n      case ''auth/weak-password'':\n        throw new Error(''Password must be at least 6 characters'');\n      default:\n        throw new Error(''Sign up failed'');\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Sign In\n\n```typescript\nimport { signInWithEmailAndPassword } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function signIn(email: string, password: string) {\n  try {\n    const userCredential = await signInWithEmailAndPassword(auth, email, password);\n    return userCredential.user;\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    switch (error.code) {\n      case ''auth/user-not-found'':\n      case ''auth/wrong-password'':\n      case ''auth/invalid-credential'':\n        throw new Error(''Invalid email or password'');\n      case ''auth/user-disabled'':\n        throw new Error(''Account has been disabled'');\n      case ''auth/too-many-requests'':\n        throw new Error(''Too many attempts. Try again later.'');\n      default:\n        throw new Error(''Sign in failed'');\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Sign Out\n\n```typescript\nimport { signOut } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function handleSignOut() {\n  await signOut(auth);\n  // Redirect to login page\n}\n```\n\n### Password Reset\n\n```typescript\nimport { sendPasswordResetEmail, confirmPasswordReset } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\n// Send reset email\nasync function resetPassword(email: string) {\n  await sendPasswordResetEmail(auth, email);\n}\n\n// Confirm reset (from email link)\nasync function confirmReset(oobCode: string, newPassword: string) {\n  await confirmPasswordReset(auth, oobCode, newPassword);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## OAuth Providers (Google, GitHub, etc.)\n\n### Google Sign-In\n\n```typescript\nimport { signInWithPopup, signInWithRedirect, GoogleAuthProvider } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nconst googleProvider = new GoogleAuthProvider();\ngoogleProvider.addScope(''email'');\ngoogleProvider.addScope(''profile'');\n\n// Popup method (recommended for desktop)\nasync function signInWithGoogle() {\n  try {\n    const result = await signInWithPopup(auth, googleProvider);\n    const credential = GoogleAuthProvider.credentialFromResult(result);\n    const token = credential?.accessToken;\n    return result.user;\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    if (error.code === ''auth/popup-closed-by-user'') {\n      // User closed popup - not an error\n      return null;\n    }\n    if (error.code === ''auth/popup-blocked'') {\n      // Fallback to redirect\n      await signInWithRedirect(auth, googleProvider);\n      return null;\n    }\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n\n// Redirect method (for mobile or popup-blocked)\nasync function signInWithGoogleRedirect() {\n  await signInWithRedirect(auth, googleProvider);\n}\n```\n\n### Handle Redirect Result\n\n```typescript\nimport { getRedirectResult, GoogleAuthProvider } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\n// Call on page load\nasync function handleRedirectResult() {\n  try {\n    const result = await getRedirectResult(auth);\n    if (result) {\n      const credential = GoogleAuthProvider.credentialFromResult(result);\n      return result.user;\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''Redirect sign-in error:'', error);\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n```\n\n### Other OAuth Providers\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  GithubAuthProvider,\n  TwitterAuthProvider,\n  FacebookAuthProvider,\n  OAuthProvider,\n} from ''firebase/auth'';\n\n// GitHub\nconst githubProvider = new GithubAuthProvider();\ngithubProvider.addScope(''read:user'');\n\n// Microsoft\nconst microsoftProvider = new OAuthProvider(''microsoft.com'');\nmicrosoftProvider.addScope(''email'');\nmicrosoftProvider.addScope(''profile'');\n\n// Apple\nconst appleProvider = new OAuthProvider(''apple.com'');\nappleProvider.addScope(''email'');\nappleProvider.addScope(''name'');\n```\n\n---\n\n## Auth State Management\n\n### Listen to Auth State Changes\n\n```typescript\nimport { onAuthStateChanged, User } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\n// React hook example\nfunction useAuth() {\n  const [user, setUser] = useState<User | null>(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const unsubscribe = onAuthStateChanged(auth, (user) => {\n      setUser(user);\n      setLoading(false);\n    });\n\n    return () => unsubscribe();\n  }, []);\n\n  return { user, loading };\n}\n```\n\n### Auth Context Provider (React)\n\n```typescript\n// src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState, ReactNode } from ''react'';\nimport { onAuthStateChanged, User } from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''@/lib/firebase'';\n\ninterface AuthContextType {\n  user: User | null;\n  loading: boolean;\n}\n\nconst AuthContext = createContext<AuthContextType>({ user: null, loading: true });\n\nexport function AuthProvider({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {\n  const [user, setUser] = useState<User | null>(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const unsubscribe = onAuthStateChanged(auth, (user) => {\n      setUser(user);\n      setLoading(false);\n    });\n\n    return () => unsubscribe();\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <AuthContext.Provider value={{ user, loading }}>\n      {children}\n    </AuthContext.Provider>\n  );\n}\n\nexport const useAuth = () => useContext(AuthContext);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Token Management\n\n### Get ID Token (for API calls)\n\n```typescript\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function getIdToken() {\n  const user = auth.currentUser;\n  if (!user) throw new Error(''Not authenticated'');\n\n  // Force refresh to get fresh token\n  const token = await user.getIdToken(/* forceRefresh */ true);\n  return token;\n}\n\n// Use in API calls\nasync function callProtectedAPI() {\n  const token = await getIdToken();\n\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/protected'', {\n    headers: {\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,\n    },\n  });\n\n  return response.json();\n}\n```\n\n### Verify ID Token (Server-side)\n\n```typescript\n// API route (Next.js example)\nimport { adminAuth } from ''@/lib/firebase-admin'';\n\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const authHeader = request.headers.get(''authorization'');\n  if (!authHeader?.startsWith(''Bearer '')) {\n    return Response.json({ error: ''Unauthorized'' }, { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  const token = authHeader.split(''Bearer '')[1];\n\n  try {\n    const decodedToken = await adminAuth.verifyIdToken(token);\n    const uid = decodedToken.uid;\n\n    // User is authenticated, proceed with request\n    return Response.json({ uid, message: ''Authenticated'' });\n  } catch (error) {\n    return Response.json({ error: ''Invalid token'' }, { status: 401 });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Session Cookies (Server-Side Rendering)\n\n```typescript\nimport { adminAuth } from ''@/lib/firebase-admin'';\n\n// Create session cookie\nasync function createSessionCookie(idToken: string) {\n  const expiresIn = 60 * 60 * 24 * 5 * 1000; // 5 days\n\n  const sessionCookie = await adminAuth.createSessionCookie(idToken, {\n    expiresIn,\n  });\n\n  return sessionCookie;\n}\n\n// Verify session cookie\nasync function verifySessionCookie(sessionCookie: string) {\n  try {\n    const decodedClaims = await adminAuth.verifySessionCookie(sessionCookie, true);\n    return decodedClaims;\n  } catch (error) {\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\n// Revoke session\nasync function revokeSession(uid: string) {\n  await adminAuth.revokeRefreshTokens(uid);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Custom Claims & Roles\n\n### Set Custom Claims (Admin SDK)\n\n```typescript\nimport { adminAuth } from ''@/lib/firebase-admin'';\n\n// Set admin role\nasync function setAdminRole(uid: string) {\n  await adminAuth.setCustomUserClaims(uid, {\n    admin: true,\n    role: ''admin'',\n  });\n}\n\n// Set custom permissions\nasync function setUserPermissions(uid: string, permissions: string[]) {\n  await adminAuth.setCustomUserClaims(uid, {\n    permissions,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Check Custom Claims (Client)\n\n```typescript\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function checkAdminStatus() {\n  const user = auth.currentUser;\n  if (!user) return false;\n\n  // Force token refresh to get latest claims\n  const tokenResult = await user.getIdTokenResult(true);\n  return tokenResult.claims.admin === true;\n}\n\n// In component\nconst isAdmin = await checkAdminStatus();\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:** Custom claims are cached in the ID token. After setting claims, the user must:\n1. Sign out and sign in again, OR\n2. Force refresh the token with `getIdTokenResult(true)`\n\n---\n\n## Phone Authentication\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  signInWithPhoneNumber,\n  RecaptchaVerifier,\n  ConfirmationResult,\n} from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\nlet confirmationResult: ConfirmationResult;\n\n// Step 1: Setup reCAPTCHA (required)\nfunction setupRecaptcha() {\n  window.recaptchaVerifier = new RecaptchaVerifier(auth, ''recaptcha-container'', {\n    size: ''normal'',\n    callback: () => {\n      // reCAPTCHA solved\n    },\n  });\n}\n\n// Step 2: Send verification code\nasync function sendVerificationCode(phoneNumber: string) {\n  const appVerifier = window.recaptchaVerifier;\n  confirmationResult = await signInWithPhoneNumber(auth, phoneNumber, appVerifier);\n}\n\n// Step 3: Verify code\nasync function verifyCode(code: string) {\n  const result = await confirmationResult.confirm(code);\n  return result.user;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  multiFactor,\n  PhoneAuthProvider,\n  PhoneMultiFactorGenerator,\n  getMultiFactorResolver,\n} from ''firebase/auth'';\nimport { auth } from ''./firebase'';\n\n// Enroll phone as second factor\nasync function enrollPhoneMFA(phoneNumber: string) {\n  const user = auth.currentUser;\n  if (!user) throw new Error(''Not authenticated'');\n\n  const multiFactorSession = await multiFactor(user).getSession();\n\n  const phoneAuthProvider = new PhoneAuthProvider(auth);\n  const verificationId = await phoneAuthProvider.verifyPhoneNumber(\n    { phoneNumber, session: multiFactorSession },\n    window.recaptchaVerifier\n  );\n\n  // Return verificationId to complete enrollment after user enters code\n  return verificationId;\n}\n\n// Complete enrollment\nasync function completeEnrollment(verificationId: string, verificationCode: string) {\n  const user = auth.currentUser;\n  if (!user) throw new Error(''Not authenticated'');\n\n  const credential = PhoneAuthProvider.credential(verificationId, verificationCode);\n  const multiFactorAssertion = PhoneMultiFactorGenerator.assertion(credential);\n\n  await multiFactor(user).enroll(multiFactorAssertion, ''Phone Number'');\n}\n\n// Handle MFA during sign-in\nasync function handleMFASignIn(error: any) {\n  if (error.code !== ''auth/multi-factor-auth-required'') {\n    throw error;\n  }\n\n  const resolver = getMultiFactorResolver(auth, error);\n  // Show UI to select MFA method and enter code\n  return resolver;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Protected Routes (Next.js)\n\n### Middleware Protection\n\n```typescript\n// middleware.ts\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport type { NextRequest } from ''next/server'';\n\nexport function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const sessionCookie = request.cookies.get(''session'')?.value;\n\n  // Protect /dashboard routes\n  if (request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(''/dashboard'')) {\n    if (!sessionCookie) {\n      return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/login'', request.url));\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Redirect authenticated users away from /login\n  if (request.nextUrl.pathname === ''/login'') {\n    if (sessionCookie) {\n      return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/dashboard'', request.url));\n    }\n  }\n\n  return NextResponse.next();\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [''/dashboard/:path*'', ''/login''],\n};\n```\n\n### Client-Side Route Guard\n\n```typescript\n// components/ProtectedRoute.tsx\nimport { useAuth } from ''@/contexts/AuthContext'';\nimport { useRouter } from ''next/navigation'';\nimport { useEffect } from ''react'';\n\nexport function ProtectedRoute({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const { user, loading } = useAuth();\n  const router = useRouter();\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!loading && !user) {\n      router.push(''/login'');\n    }\n  }, [user, loading, router]);\n\n  if (loading) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  if (!user) {\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  return <>{children}</>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Common Auth Errors\n\n| Error Code | Description | User-Friendly Message |\n|------------|-------------|----------------------|\n| `auth/invalid-credential` | Wrong email/password | Invalid email or password |\n| `auth/user-not-found` | Email not registered | Invalid email or password |\n| `auth/wrong-password` | Incorrect password | Invalid email or password |\n| `auth/email-already-in-use` | Email registered | This email is already registered |\n| `auth/weak-password` | Password < 6 chars | Password must be at least 6 characters |\n| `auth/invalid-email` | Malformed email | Please enter a valid email |\n| `auth/user-disabled` | Account disabled | Your account has been disabled |\n| `auth/too-many-requests` | Rate limited | Too many attempts. Try again later |\n| `auth/popup-closed-by-user` | User closed popup | Sign-in cancelled |\n| `auth/popup-blocked` | Browser blocked popup | Please allow popups |\n| `auth/requires-recent-login` | Sensitive operation | Please sign in again |\n| `auth/network-request-failed` | Network error | Please check your connection |\n\n### Error Handler Utility\n\n```typescript\nexport function getAuthErrorMessage(error: any): string {\n  const errorMessages: Record<string, string> = {\n    ''auth/invalid-credential'': ''Invalid email or password'',\n    ''auth/user-not-found'': ''Invalid email or password'',\n    ''auth/wrong-password'': ''Invalid email or password'',\n    ''auth/email-already-in-use'': ''This email is already registered'',\n    ''auth/weak-password'': ''Password must be at least 6 characters'',\n    ''auth/invalid-email'': ''Please enter a valid email address'',\n    ''auth/user-disabled'': ''Your account has been disabled'',\n    ''auth/too-many-requests'': ''Too many attempts. Please try again later'',\n    ''auth/popup-closed-by-user'': ''Sign-in was cancelled'',\n    ''auth/network-request-failed'': ''Network error. Please check your connection'',\n  };\n\n  return errorMessages[error.code] || ''An unexpected error occurred'';\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **12** documented Firebase Auth errors:\n\n| Issue # | Error/Issue | Description | How to Avoid | Source |\n|---------|-------------|-------------|--------------|--------|\n| **#1** | `auth/invalid-credential` | Generic error for wrong email/password | Show generic \"invalid email or password\" message | Common |\n| **#2** | `auth/popup-blocked` | Browser blocks OAuth popup | Implement redirect fallback | [Docs](https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/web/google-signin#redirect-mode) |\n| **#3** | `auth/requires-recent-login` | Sensitive operations need fresh login | Re-authenticate before password change, delete | [Docs](https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/web/manage-users#re-authenticate_a_user) |\n| **#4** | Custom claims not updating | Claims cached in ID token | Force token refresh after setting claims | [Docs](https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/admin/custom-claims) |\n| **#5** | Token expiration | ID tokens expire after 1 hour | Always call `getIdToken()` before API calls | Common |\n| **#6** | Memory leak from auth listener | Not unsubscribing from `onAuthStateChanged` | Return cleanup function in useEffect | Common |\n| **#7** | CORS errors on localhost | Auth domain mismatch | Add localhost to authorized domains in console | Common |\n| **#8** | Private key newline issue | Escaped `\\n` in env var | Use `.replace(/\\\\n/g, ''\\n'')` | Common |\n| **#9** | Session cookie not persisting | Cookie settings wrong | Set `secure: true`, `sameSite: ''lax''` in production | Common |\n| **#10** | OAuth state mismatch | User navigates away during OAuth | Handle `auth/popup-closed-by-user` gracefully | Common |\n| **#11** | Rate limiting | Too many auth attempts | Implement exponential backoff | [Docs](https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/limits) |\n| **#12** | Email enumeration | Different errors for existing/non-existing emails | Use same message for both | Security best practice |\n\n---\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n### Always Do\n\n1. **Use HTTPS in production** - Required for secure cookies\n2. **Validate tokens server-side** - Never trust client claims alone\n3. **Handle token expiration** - Refresh before API calls\n4. **Implement rate limiting** - Prevent brute force attacks\n5. **Use same error message** for wrong email/password - Prevent enumeration\n6. **Enable email verification** - Verify user owns email\n7. **Use session cookies for SSR** - More secure than ID tokens in cookies\n8. **Revoke tokens on password change** - Invalidate old sessions\n\n### Never Do\n\n1. **Never expose private key** in client code\n2. **Never trust client-provided claims** - Always verify server-side\n3. **Never store ID tokens in localStorage** - Use httpOnly cookies\n4. **Never disable email enumeration protection** in production\n5. **Never skip CORS configuration** for your domains\n\n---\n\n## Firebase CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# Initialize Firebase project\nfirebase init\n\n# Enable auth emulator\nfirebase emulators:start --only auth\n\n# Export auth users\nfirebase auth:export users.json --format=json\n\n# Import auth users\nfirebase auth:import users.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-25)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"firebase\": \"^12.8.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"firebase-admin\": \"^13.6.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Firebase Auth Overview**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth\n- **Web Get Started**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/web/start\n- **Admin Auth**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/admin\n- **Custom Claims**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/admin/custom-claims\n- **Session Cookies**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/admin/manage-cookies\n- **Security Rules**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/rules\n\n---\n\n**Last verified**: 2026-01-25 | **Skill version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:00:33.847Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring secure authentication and authorization using Firebase Authentication","zh":"适用于需要使用 Firebase 身份验证进行安全身份验证和授权的云代理","ja":"Firebase Authentication を使用してセキュアな認証と認可が必要なクラウド エージェントに適しています","ko":"파이어베이스 인증을 사용하여 보안 인증 및 인가가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes en la Nube que requieren autenticación y autorización seguras utilizando Firebase Authentication","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées à l''aide de Firebase Authentication","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agenten, die eine sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mit Firebase Authentication erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que requerem autenticação e autorização seguras usando a Autenticação do Firebase","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих безопасной аутентификации и авторизации с помощью Firebase Authentication","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيين الذين يطلبون مصادقة وتصريح آمن باستخدام مصادقة Firebase"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage user authentication with multiple providers like Email/Password, Google, and others, utilizing the firebase-admin library and configuring OAuth providers with client ID/secret","zh":"赋予代理管理用户身份验证的能力，支持多个提供商，如电子邮件/密码、谷歌等，利用 firebase-admin 库，并使用客户端 ID/密钥配置 OAuth 提供商","ja":"エージェントに、メール/パスワード、Google などの複数のプロバイダーを使用したユーザー認証の管理機能を提供します。firebase-admin ライブラリを利用し、クライアント ID/シークレットを使用して OAuth プロバイダーを構成します","ko":"에이전트에 여러 제공업체(이메일/암호, 구글 등)를 사용한 사용자 인증 관리 기능을 제공합니다. firebase-admin 라이브러리를 사용하여 클라이언트 ID/시크릿을 사용하여 OAuth 제공업체를 구성합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar la autenticación de usuarios con múltiples proveedores como Email/Contraseña, Google y otros, utilizando la biblioteca firebase-admin y configurando proveedores de OAuth con ID de cliente/secret","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''authentification des utilisateurs avec plusieurs fournisseurs tels que Email/Mot de passe, Google et d''autres, en utilisant la bibliothèque firebase-admin et en configurant les fournisseurs OAuth avec l''ID client/secret","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Benutzerauthentifizierung mit mehreren Anbietern wie E-Mail/Kennwort, Google und anderen zu verwalten, indem sie die Bibliothek firebase-admin verwenden und OAuth-Anbieter mit Client-ID/Geheimnis konfigurieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar a autenticação do usuário com vários provedores, como E-mail/Senha, Google e outros, utilizando a biblioteca firebase-admin e configurando provedores OAuth com ID do cliente/segredo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять аутентификацией пользователей с помощью нескольких провайдеров, таких как Электронная почта/Пароль, Google и других, используя библиотеку firebase-admin и настраивая провайдеров OAuth с идентификатором клиента/секретом","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة مصادقة المستخدم مع مزودي متعددين مثل البريد الإلكتروني / كلمة المرور و Google وغيرهم، باستخدام مكتبة firebase-admin وتهيئة مزودي OAuth مع معرف العميل / السر"},"useCases":{"en":["Enabling multi-provider authentication for web applications","Configuring OAuth providers for secure login","Managing user sessions with Firebase Authentication"],"zh":["为 Web 应用程序启用多提供商身份验证","配置 OAuth 提供商以实现安全登录","使用 Firebase 身份验证管理用户会话"],"ja":["Web アプリケーション用のマルチプロバイダー認証を有効にする","セキュアなログイン用の OAuth プロバイダーを構成する","Firebase Authentication を使用したユーザー セッションの管理"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 멀티 제공업체 인증을 활성화하는 것","보안 로그인을 위한 OAuth 제공업체를 구성하는 것","파이어베이스 인증을 사용한 사용자 세션 관리"],"es":["Habilitar la autenticación de múltiples proveedores para aplicaciones web","Configurar proveedores de OAuth para un inicio de sesión seguro","Gestionar sesiones de usuario con Firebase Authentication"],"fr":["Activer l''authentification multi-fournisseur pour les applications Web","Configurer les fournisseurs OAuth pour un connexion sécurisée","Gérer les sessions d''utilisateur avec Firebase Authentication"],"de":["Aktivieren der Authentifizierung mit mehreren Anbietern für Webanwendungen","Konfigurieren von OAuth-Anbietern für sichere Anmeldung","Verwalten von Benutzersitzungen mit Firebase Authentication"],"pt":["Habilitar a autenticação de vários provedores para aplicativos web","Configurar provedores OAuth para login seguro","Gerenciar sessões de usuário com a Autenticação do Firebase"],"ru":["Включение аутентификации с несколькими провайдерами для веб-приложений","Настройка провайдеров OAuth для безопасного входа","Управление сессиями пользователей с помощью Firebase Authentication"],"ar":["تمكين المصادقة لمزودي متعددين لتطبيقات الويب","تهيئة مزودي OAuth لتسجيل الدخول الآمن","إدارة جلسات المستخدم مع مصادقة Firebase"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firebase Console setup and configuration","Dependent on firebase and firebase-admin libraries"],"zh":["需要 Firebase 控制台设置和配置","依赖于 firebase 和 firebase-admin 库"],"ja":["Firebase コンソールの設定と構成が必要","firebase と firebase-admin ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["파이어베이스 콘솔 설정 및 구성이 필요합니다","파이어베이스 및 firebase-admin 라이브러리에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere la configuración y el establecimiento de la consola de Firebase","Dependiente de las bibliotecas firebase y firebase-admin"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place de la console Firebase","Dépend des bibliothèques firebase et firebase-admin"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung und Konfiguration der Firebase-Konsole","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken firebase und firebase-admin"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Console do Firebase","Dependente das bibliotecas firebase e firebase-admin"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации консоли Firebase","Зависит от библиотек firebase и firebase-admin"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين консول Firebase","يعتمد على مكتبات firebase و firebase-admin"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/analytics-tracking', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'analytics-tracking', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z', '2026-02-18T14:00:35.514Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/analytics-tracking","name":"analytics-tracking","description":{"zh":"分析跟踪专家帮助设置跟踪以提供营销和产品决策的数据洞察。了解业务目标和产品背景以实现有效的分析跟踪","ja":"分析トラッキングエキスパートは、マーケティングと製品の意思決定にデータ洞察を提供するためのトラッキングを設定するのに役立ちます。ビジネス目標と製品の背景を理解して、効果的な分析トラッキングを実現します","ko":"분석 추적 전문가는 마케팅 및 제품 의사 결정에 대한 데이터洞察을 제공하기 위한 추적 설정에 도움을 줍니다. 비즈니스 목표와 제품 배경을 이해하여 효과적인 분석 추적을 구현합니다","es":"El seguimiento de análisis te permite tomar decisiones informadas de marketing y producto. Aprende a implementarlo con nuestra guía","fr":"Le suivi d''analyse vous permet de prendre des décisions éclairées de marketing et de produit. Apprenez à le mettre en place avec notre guide","de":"Das Analyse-Tracking ermöglicht es Ihnen, informierte Marketing- und Produktentscheidungen zu treffen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es implementieren können, mit unserer Anleitung","pt":"O rastreamento de análise é fundamental para obter insights ação para decisões de marketing e produto. Aprenda a implementá-lo corretamente","ru":"Отслеживание аналитики является фундаментальным для получения информации для принятия решений по маркетингу и продукту. Узнайте, как реализовать его правильно","ar":"تتبع التحليلات هو أساسي للحصول على رؤى العمل لاتخاذ قرارات التسويق والمنتج. تعلم كيفية تنفيذه بشكل صحيح","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"分析跟踪专家 - 为营销和产品决策提供数据洞察","ja":"分析トラッキングエキスパート - マーケティングと製品の意思決定にデータ洞察を提供","ko":"분석 추적 전문가 - 마케팅 및 제품 의사 결정에 대한 데이터洞察 제공","es":"Seguimiento de Análisis para Desarrolladores","fr":"Suivi d''Analyse pour Développeurs","de":"Analyse-Tracking für Entwickler","pt":"Rastreamento de Análise: Otimização de Dados para Desenvo...","ru":"Аналитика отслеживания: оптимизация данных для