 von Daten für informierte Entscheidungen","Analyse des Nutzerverhaltens","Optimierung von Marketing-Kampagnen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Implementação de rastreamento de análise","Coleta e análise de dados","Otimização de dados para decisões de marketing e produto","Integração com ferramentas de análise","Relatórios personalizados"],"ru":["Реализация отслеживания аналитики","Сбор и анализ данных","Оптимизация данных для принятия решений по маркетингу и продукту","Интеграция с инструментами аналитики","Пользовательские отчеты"],"ar":["تنفيذ تتبع التحليلات","جمع وتحليل البيانات","تحسين البيانات لاتخاذ قرارات التسويق والمنتج","التكامل مع أدوات التحليل","تقارير مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["分析跟踪","数据洞察","营销决策","产品决策","业务目标","产品背景","跟踪代码"],"ja":["分析トラッキング","データ洞察","マーケティングの意思決定","製品の意思決定","ビジネス目標","製品の背景","トラッキングコード"],"ko":["분석 추적","데이터洞察","마케팅 의사 결정","제품 의사 결정","비즈니스 목표","제품 배경","추적 코드"],"es":["seguimiento de análisis","análisis de datos","marketing digital","optimización de campañas","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web"],"fr":["suivi d''analyse","analyse de données","marketing digital","optimisation de campagnes","expérience utilisateur","développement web"],"de":["Analyse-Tracking","Datenanalyse","digitales Marketing","Kampagnen-Optimierung","Benutzererfahrung","Web-Entwicklung"],"pt":["rastreamento de análise","otimização de dados","decisões de marketing","decisões de produto","análise de dados","ferramentas de análise"],"ru":["отслеживание аналитики","оптимизация данных","решения по маркетингу","решения по продукту","анализ данных","инструменты аналитики"],"ar":["تتبع التحليلات","تحسين البيانات","قرارات التسويق","قرارات المنتج","تحليل البيانات","أدوات التحليل"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"analytics-tracking","description":"When the user wants to set up, improve, or audit analytics tracking and measurement. Also use when the user mentions set up tracking, GA4, Google Analytics, conversion tracking, event tracking, UTM parameters, tag manager, GTM, analytics implementation, or tracking plan. For A/B test measurement, see ab-test-setup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Analytics Tracking\n\nYou are an expert in analytics implementation and measurement. Your goal is to help set up tracking that provides actionable insights for marketing and product decisions.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing tracking, understand:\n\n1. **Business Con","body":"# Analytics Tracking\n\nYou are an expert in analytics implementation and measurement. Your goal is to help set up tracking that provides actionable insights for marketing and product decisions.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing tracking, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context** - What decisions will this data inform? What are key conversions?\n2. **Current State** - What tracking exists? What tools are in use?\n3. **Technical Context** - What''s the tech stack? Any privacy/compliance requirements?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Track for Decisions, Not Data\n- Every event should inform a decision\n- Avoid vanity metrics\n- Quality > quantity of events\n\n### 2. Start with the Questions\n- What do you need to know?\n- What actions will you take based on this data?\n- Work backwards to what you need to track\n\n### 3. Name Things Consistently\n- Naming conventions matter\n- Establish patterns before implementing\n- Document everything\n\n### 4. Maintain Data Quality\n- Validate implementation\n- Monitor for issues\n- Clean data > more data\n\n---\n\n## Tracking Plan Framework\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nEvent Name | Category | Properties | Trigger | Notes\n---------- | -------- | ---------- | ------- | -----\n```\n\n### Event Types\n\n| Type | Examples |\n|------|----------|\n| Pageviews | Automatic, enhanced with metadata |\n| User Actions | Button clicks, form submissions, feature usage |\n| System Events | Signup completed, purchase, subscription changed |\n| Custom Conversions | Goal completions, funnel stages |\n\n**For comprehensive event lists**: See [references/event-library.md](references/event-library.md)\n\n---\n\n## Event Naming Conventions\n\n### Recommended Format: Object-Action\n\n```\nsignup_completed\nbutton_clicked\nform_submitted\narticle_read\ncheckout_payment_completed\n```\n\n### Best Practices\n- Lowercase with underscores\n- Be specific: `cta_hero_clicked` vs. `button_clicked`\n- Include context in properties, not event name\n- Avoid spaces and special characters\n- Document decisions\n\n---\n\n## Essential Events\n\n### Marketing Site\n\n| Event | Properties |\n|-------|------------|\n| cta_clicked | button_text, location |\n| form_submitted | form_type |\n| signup_completed | method, source |\n| demo_requested | - |\n\n### Product/App\n\n| Event | Properties |\n|-------|------------|\n| onboarding_step_completed | step_number, step_name |\n| feature_used | feature_name |\n| purchase_completed | plan, value |\n| subscription_cancelled | reason |\n\n**For full event library by business type**: See [references/event-library.md](references/event-library.md)\n\n---\n\n## Event Properties\n\n### Standard Properties\n\n| Category | Properties |\n|----------|------------|\n| Page | page_title, page_location, page_referrer |\n| User | user_id, user_type, account_id, plan_type |\n| Campaign | source, medium, campaign, content, term |\n| Product | product_id, product_name, category, price |\n\n### Best Practices\n- Use consistent property names\n- Include relevant context\n- Don''t duplicate automatic properties\n- Avoid PII in properties\n\n---\n\n## GA4 Implementation\n\n### Quick Setup\n\n1. Create GA4 property and data stream\n2. Install gtag.js or GTM\n3. Enable enhanced measurement\n4. Configure custom events\n5. Mark conversions in Admin\n\n### Custom Event Example\n\n```javascript\ngtag(''event'', ''signup_completed'', {\n  ''method'': ''email'',\n  ''plan'': ''free''\n});\n```\n\n**For detailed GA4 implementation**: See [references/ga4-implementation.md](references/ga4-implementation.md)\n\n---\n\n## Google Tag Manager\n\n### Container Structure\n\n| Component | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Tags | Code that executes (GA4, pixels) |\n| Triggers | When tags fire (page view, click) |\n| Variables | Dynamic values (click text, data layer) |\n\n### Data Layer Pattern\n\n```javascript\ndataLayer.push({\n  ''event'': ''form_submitted'',\n  ''form_name'': ''contact'',\n  ''form_location'': ''footer''\n});\n```\n\n**For detailed GTM implementation**: See [references/gtm-implementation.md](references/gtm-implementation.md)\n\n---\n\n## UTM Parameter Strategy\n\n### Standard Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Purpose | Example |\n|-----------|---------|---------|\n| utm_source | Traffic source | google, newsletter |\n| utm_medium | Marketing medium | cpc, email, social |\n| utm_campaign | Campaign name | spring_sale |\n| utm_content | Differentiate versions | hero_cta |\n| utm_term | Paid search keywords | running+shoes |\n\n### Naming Conventions\n- Lowercase everything\n- Use underscores or hyphens consistently\n- Be specific but concise: `blog_footer_cta`, not `cta1`\n- Document all UTMs in a spreadsheet\n\n---\n\n## Debugging and Validation\n\n### Testing Tools\n\n| Tool | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| GA4 DebugView | Real-time event monitoring |\n| GTM Preview Mode | Test triggers before publish |\n| Browser Extensions | Tag Assistant, dataLayer Inspector |\n\n### Validation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Events firing on correct triggers\n- [ ] Property values populating correctly\n- [ ] No duplicate events\n- [ ] Works across browsers and mobile\n- [ ] Conversions recorded correctly\n- [ ] No PII leaking\n\n### Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Check |\n|-------|-------|\n| Events not firing | Trigger config, GTM loaded |\n| Wrong values | Variable path, data layer structure |\n| Duplicate events | Multiple containers, trigger firing twice |\n\n---\n\n## Privacy and Compliance\n\n### Considerations\n- Cookie consent required in EU/UK/CA\n- No PII in analytics properties\n- Data retention settings\n- User deletion capabilities\n\n### Implementation\n- Use consent mode (wait for consent)\n- IP anonymization\n- Only collect what you need\n- Integrate with consent management platform\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Tracking Plan Document\n\n```markdown\n# [Site/Product] Tracking Plan\n\n## Overview\n- Tools: GA4, GTM\n- Last updated: [Date]\n\n## Events\n\n| Event Name | Description | Properties | Trigger |\n|------------|-------------|------------|---------|\n| signup_completed | User completes signup | method, plan | Success page |\n\n## Custom Dimensions\n\n| Name | Scope | Parameter |\n|------|-------|-----------|\n| user_type | User | user_type |\n\n## Conversions\n\n| Conversion | Event | Counting |\n|------------|-------|----------|\n| Signup | signup_completed | Once per session |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What tools are you using (GA4, Mixpanel, etc.)?\n2. What key actions do you want to track?\n3. What decisions will this data inform?\n4. Who implements - dev team or marketing?\n5. Are there privacy/consent requirements?\n6. What''s already tracked?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key analytics tools:\n\n| Tool | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **GA4** | Web analytics, Google ecosystem | ✓ | [ga4.md](../../tools/integrations/ga4.md) |\n| **Mixpanel** | Product analytics, event tracking | - | [mixpanel.md](../../tools/integrations/mixpanel.md) |\n| **Amplitude** | Product analytics, cohort analysis | - | [amplitude.md](../../tools/integrations/amplitude.md) |\n| **PostHog** | Open-source analytics, session replay | - | [posthog.md](../../tools/integrations/posthog.md) |\n| **Segment** | Customer data platform, routing | - | [segment.md](../../tools/integrations/segment.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **ab-test-setup**: For experiment tracking\n- **seo-audit**: For organic traffic analysis\n- **page-cro**: For conversion optimization (uses this data)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:00:35.514Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced analytics implementation and measurement capabilities for informed marketing and product decisions.","zh":"非常适合需要高级分析实现和测量能力的AI代理，以便为明智的营销和产品决策提供信息。","ja":"高度な分析の実装と測定能力が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。情報に基づいたマーケティングと製品の決定を下すために。","ko":"고급 분석 구현 및 측정 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 정보에 기반한 마케팅 및 제품 의사 결정을 위해.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan implementación y capacidades de medición de análisis avanzados para decisiones de marketing y producto informadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre et de capacités de mesure d''analyse avancées pour des décisions de marketing et de produit éclairées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Analyse-Implementierung und Messfunktionen für fundierte Marketing- und Produktentscheidungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de implementação avançada de análise e capacidades de medição para decisões de marketing e produto informadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходима продвинутая реализация аналитики и возможности измерения для обоснованных маркетинговых и продуктовых решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ تحليل متقدم وقدرات القياس لاتخاذ قرارات تسويقية ومنتجة مستنيرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide actionable insights through tracking setup, utilizing product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files and understanding business concepts for data-driven decisions, leveraging markdown files for context and implementation details.","zh":"赋予代理提供可行的洞察力，通过跟踪设置，利用产品营销背景从 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文件中，并理解业务概念以实现数据驱动的决策，利用markdown文件进行背景和实现细节。","ja":"エージェントが実行可能な洞察を提供できるようにします。トラッキングの設定を通じて、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ファイルから製品マーケティングのコンテキストを利用し、ビジネス概念を理解してデータドリブンの意思決定を行うことを可能にします。コンテキストと実装の詳細については、マークダウンファイルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 실행 가능한 통찰력을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. 추적 설정을 통해 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일에서 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하고 비즈니스 개념을 이해하여 데이터 주도적인 의사 결정을 내릴 수 있도록 합니다. 컨텍스트와 구현 세부 정보는 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 제공됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar información útil a través de la configuración de seguimiento, utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos de los archivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y comprendiendo conceptos comerciales para decisiones basadas en datos, aprovechando archivos markdown para contexto y detalles de implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des informations exploitables grâce à la configuration du suivi, en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits à partir des fichiers `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en comprenant les concepts commerciaux pour des décisions fondées sur les données, en exploitant les fichiers markdown pour le contexte et les détails de mise en œuvre.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, durch die Einrichtung der Nachverfolgung, unter Verwendung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts aus Dateien `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` und unter Berücksichtigung von Geschäftskonzepten für datengetriebene Entscheidungen, durch Nutzung von Markdown-Dateien für Kontext und Implementierungsdetails, wertvolle Erkenntnisse zu liefern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer insights ações através da configuração de rastreamento, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produtos a partir de arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e compreendendo conceitos comerciais para decisões baseadas em dados, aproveitando arquivos markdown para contexto e detalhes de implementação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять действенные идеи через настройку отслеживания, используя контекст маркетинга продукции из файлов `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и понимание бизнес-кoncepcий для принятия решений на основе данных, используя файлы markdown для контекста и деталей реализации.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تقديم رؤى قابلة للتنفيذ من خلال إعداد التتبع، باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وفهم المفاهيم التجارية لاتخاذ قرارات مدعومة بالبيانات، واستخدام ملفات markdown للسياق و细节 التنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing tracking for marketing campaigns","Setting up analytics for product launches","Measuring business conversion rates"],"zh":["为营销活动实现跟踪","为产品发布设置分析","衡量业务转换率"],"ja":["マーケティングキャンペーンのトラッキングの実装","製品ローンチの分析の設定","ビジネス転換率の測定"],"ko":["마케팅 캠페인의 트래킹 구현","제품 출시의 분석 설정","비즈니스 전환률 측정"],"es":["Implementación de seguimiento para campañas de marketing","Configuración de análisis para lanzamientos de productos","Medición de tasas de conversión comerciales"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre du suivi pour les campagnes de marketing","Configuration de l''analyse pour les lancements de produits","Mesure des taux de conversion commerciaux"],"de":["Implementierung der Nachverfolgung für Marketingkampagnen","Einrichtung der Analyse für Produktstarts","Messung der Geschäfts-Umwandlungsrate"],"pt":["Implementação de rastreamento para campanhas de marketing","Configuração de análise para lançamentos de produtos","Medição de taxas de conversão de negócios"],"ru":["Реализация отслеживания для маркетинговых кампаний","Настройка аналитики для запуска продуктов","Измерение темпов конверсии бизнеса"],"ar":["تنفيذ التتبع لحملات التسويق","إعداد التحليلات لإطلاق المنتجات","قياس معدلات تحويل الأعمال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Dependent on understanding of business concepts and goals"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件","依赖于对业务概念和目标的理解"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルへのアクセスが必要","ビジネス概念と目標の理解に依存"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","비즈니스 개념 및 목표에 대한 이해에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos","Dependiente de la comprensión de conceptos y objetivos comerciales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits","Dépend de la compréhension des concepts et des objectifs commerciaux"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Produktmarketing-Kontextdateien","Abhängig vom Verständnis von Geschäftskonzepten und Zielen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos","Dependente da compreensão de conceitos e objetivos comerciais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукции","Зависит от понимания бизнес-koncepcий и целей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج","يعتمد على فهم المفاهيم والأهداف التجارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
