integration testing, replay testing, and local development setup. Use when implementing Temporal workflow tests or debugging test failures.","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Python Testing Strategies\n\nComprehensive testing approaches for Temporal workflows using pytest, progressive disclosure resources for specific testing scenarios.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- **Unit testing workflows** - Fast tests with time-skipping\n- **Integration testing** - Workflows with mocked activities\n- **Replay testing** - Validate determinism against production histories\n- **Local development** - Set up Temporal server and pytest\n- **CI/CD integration** - Automated testing","body":"# Temporal Python Testing Strategies\n\nComprehensive testing approaches for Temporal workflows using pytest, progressive disclosure resources for specific testing scenarios.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- **Unit testing workflows** - Fast tests with time-skipping\n- **Integration testing** - Workflows with mocked activities\n- **Replay testing** - Validate determinism against production histories\n- **Local development** - Set up Temporal server and pytest\n- **CI/CD integration** - Automated testing pipelines\n- **Coverage strategies** - Achieve ≥80% test coverage\n\n## Testing Philosophy\n\n**Recommended Approach** (Source: docs.temporal.io/develop/python/testing-suite):\n\n- Write majority as integration tests\n- Use pytest with async fixtures\n- Time-skipping enables fast feedback (month-long workflows → seconds)\n- Mock activities to isolate workflow logic\n- Validate determinism with replay testing\n\n**Three Test Types**:\n\n1. **Unit**: Workflows with time-skipping, activities with ActivityEnvironment\n2. **Integration**: Workers with mocked activities\n3. **End-to-end**: Full Temporal server with real activities (use sparingly)\n\n## Available Resources\n\nThis skill provides detailed guidance through progressive disclosure. Load specific resources based on your testing needs:\n\n### Unit Testing Resources\n\n**File**: `resources/unit-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Testing individual workflows or activities in isolation\n**Contains**:\n\n- WorkflowEnvironment with time-skipping\n- ActivityEnvironment for activity testing\n- Fast execution of long-running workflows\n- Manual time advancement patterns\n- pytest fixtures and patterns\n\n### Integration Testing Resources\n\n**File**: `resources/integration-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Testing workflows with mocked external dependencies\n**Contains**:\n\n- Activity mocking strategies\n- Error injection patterns\n- Multi-activity workflow testing\n- Signal and query testing\n- Coverage strategies\n\n### Replay Testing Resources\n\n**File**: `resources/replay-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Validating determinism or deploying workflow changes\n**Contains**:\n\n- Determinism validation\n- Production history replay\n- CI/CD integration patterns\n- Version compatibility testing\n\n### Local Development Resources\n\n**File**: `resources/local-setup.md`\n**When to load**: Setting up development environment\n**Contains**:\n\n- Docker Compose configuration\n- pytest setup and configuration\n- Coverage tool integration\n- Development workflow\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### Basic Workflow Test\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom temporalio.testing import WorkflowEnvironment\nfrom temporalio.worker import Worker\n\n@pytest.fixture\nasync def workflow_env():\n    env = await WorkflowEnvironment.start_time_skipping()\n    yield env\n    await env.shutdown()\n\n@pytest.mark.asyncio\nasync def test_workflow(workflow_env):\n    async with Worker(\n        workflow_env.client,\n        task_queue=\"test-queue\",\n        workflows=[YourWorkflow],\n        activities=[your_activity],\n    ):\n        result = await workflow_env.client.execute_workflow(\n            YourWorkflow.run,\n            args,\n            id=\"test-wf-id\",\n            task_queue=\"test-queue\",\n        )\n        assert result == expected\n```\n\n### Basic Activity Test\n\n```python\nfrom temporalio.testing import ActivityEnvironment\n\nasync def test_activity():\n    env = ActivityEnvironment()\n    result = await env.run(your_activity, \"test-input\")\n    assert result == expected_output\n```\n\n## Coverage Targets\n\n**Recommended Coverage** (Source: docs.temporal.io best practices):\n\n- **Workflows**: ≥80% logic coverage\n- **Activities**: ≥80% logic coverage\n- **Integration**: Critical paths with mocked activities\n- **Replay**: All workflow versions before deployment\n\n## Key Testing Principles\n\n1. **Time-Skipping** - Month-long workflows test in seconds\n2. **Mock Activities** - Isolate workflow logic from external dependencies\n3. **Replay Testing** - Validate determinism before deployment\n4. **High Coverage** - ≥80% target for production workflows\n5. **Fast Feedback** - Unit tests run in milliseconds\n\n## How to Use Resources\n\n**Load specific resource when needed**:\n\n- \"Show me unit testing patterns\" → Load `resources/unit-testing.md`\n- \"How do I mock activities?\" → Load `resources/integration-testing.md`\n- \"Setup local Temporal server\" → Load `resources/local-setup.md`\n- \"Validate determinism\" → Load `resources/replay-testing.md`\n\n## Additional References\n\n- Python SDK Testing: docs.temporal.io/develop/python/testing-suite\n- Testing Patterns: github.com/temporalio/temporal/blob/main/docs/development/testing.md\n- Python Samples: github.com/temporalio/samples-python\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:02:54.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring advanced Temporal workflow testing capabilities with pytest","zh":"适合需要高级时间流程测试功能的工作流自动化代理，特别是使用pytest的代理","ja":"pytestを使用するTemporalワークフローに高度なテスト機能を必要とするワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"pytest를 사용하는 Temporal 워크플로우에 고급 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de flujo de trabajo que requieren capacidades de prueba de flujo de trabajo temporal avanzadas con pytest","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow nécessitant des capacités de test de workflow temporel avancées avec pytest","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte zeitliche Workflow-Testfunktionen mit pytest erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que exigem capacidades avançadas de teste de fluxo de trabalho temporal com pytest","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, требующих продвинутых возможностей тестирования временных рабочих процессов с помощью pytest","ar":"مثالي لعميل автоматиة تدفق العمل الذي يتطلب إمكانيات اختبار متقدمة لتدفق العمل الزمني باستخدام pytest"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform unit testing, integration testing, and replay testing of Temporal workflows using pytest, with features like time-skipping and mocked activities, facilitating comprehensive validation of workflow determinism against production histories","zh":"使代理能够使用pytest执行单元测试、集成测试和时间流程的重放测试，具有时间跳过和模拟活动等功能，从而能够对生产历史进行全面验证","ja":"エージェントがpytestを使用してユニットテスト、統合テスト、Temporalワークフローのリプレイテストを実行できるようにし、タイムスキップやモックアクティビティなどの機能を提供して、ワークフローの決定性を生産履歴に対して包括的に検証する","ko":"에이전트가 pytest를 사용하여 단위 테스트, 통합 테스트 및 Temporal 워크플로우의 재생 테스트를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 시간 생략 및 모의 활동과 같은 기능을 제공하여 워크플로우의 결정성을 생산 기록에 대해 포괄적으로 검증할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar pruebas unitarias, pruebas de integración y pruebas de reproducción de flujos de trabajo temporales con pytest, con características como el salto de tiempo y actividades simuladas, lo que facilita la validación integral del determinismo del flujo de trabajo frente a historias de producción","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des tests unitaires, des tests d''intégration et des tests de replay de workflows temporels avec pytest, avec des fonctionnalités telles que le saut dans le temps et les activités mockées, ce qui facilite la validation complète du déterminisme du workflow par rapport aux historiques de production","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Einheitentests, Integrationstests und Wiedergabetests von zeitlichen Workflows mit pytest durchzuführen, mit Funktionen wie Zeitsprung und simulierten Aktivitäten, was eine umfassende Überprüfung des Determinismus des Workflows gegenüber Produktionsverläufen erleichtert","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem testes unitários, testes de integração e testes de replay de fluxos de trabalho temporais usando pytest, com recursos como pulo de tempo e atividades simuladas, facilitando a validação abrangente do determinismo do fluxo de trabalho contra históricos de produção","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять модульное тестирование, интеграционное тестирование и тестирование воспроизведения временных рабочих процессов с помощью pytest, с функциями, такими как прыжок во времени и模拟 actividades, что облегчает всестороннюю проверку детерминизма рабочего процесса против производственных историй","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من أداء اختبار الوحدات واختبار التكامل واختبار إعادة التشغيل لتدفقات العمل الزمنية باستخدام pytest، مع ميزات مثل تخطي الوقت والأنشطة المحاكاة، مما يسهل التحقق الشامل من تحديدية تدفق العمل مقابل سجلات الإنتاج"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating unit tests for Temporal workflows with time-skipping","Mocking activities for integration testing","Replaying production histories for validation"],"zh":["使用时间跳过自动化Temporal工作流的单元测试","模拟活动以进行集成测试","重放生产历史以进行验证"],"ja":["タイムスキップを使用したTemporalワークフローのユニットテストの自動化","モックアクティビティを使用した統合テスト","生産履歴のリプレイを使用した検証"],"ko":["시간 생략을 사용한 Temporal 워크플로우의 단위 테스트 자동화","모의 활동을 사용한 통합 테스트","생산 기록의 재생을 사용한 검증"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas unitarias para flujos de trabajo temporales con salto de tiempo","Simulación de actividades para pruebas de integración","Reproducción de historias de producción para validación"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests unitaires pour les workflows temporels avec saut dans le temps","Mockage d''activités pour les tests d''intégration","Rejouer les historiques de production pour la validation"],"de":["Automatisierung von Einheitentests für zeitliche Workflows mit Zeitsprung","Simulieren von Aktivitäten für Integrationstests","Wiedergabe von Produktionsverläufen zur Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar testes unitários para fluxos de trabalho temporais com pulo de tempo","Simular atividades para testes de integração","Reproduzir históricos de produção para validação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать модульные тесты для временных рабочих процессов с прыжком во времени","Моделировать активности для интеграционных тестов","Воспроизводить производственные истории для проверки"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار الوحدات لتدفقات العمل الزمنية مع تخطي الوقت","محاكاة الأنشطة لاختبار التكامل","إعادة تشغيل سجلات الإنتاج للتحقق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Temporal server setup","Pytest dependency","Limited to Temporal workflows"],"zh":["需要Temporal服务器设置","依赖pytest","仅限Temporal工作流"],"ja":["Temporalサーバーの設定が必要","pytestに依存","Temporalワークフローのみ"],"ko":["Temporal 서버 설정이 필요","pytest에 의존","Temporal 워크플로우만 해당"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor Temporal","Dependencia de pytest","Limitado a flujos de trabajo temporales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur Temporal","Dépendance de pytest","Limité aux workflows temporels"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration des Temporal-Servers","Abhängigkeit von pytest","Begrenzt auf zeitliche Workflows"],"pt":["Exige configuração do servidor Temporal","Dependência do pytest","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho temporais"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера Temporal","Зависимость от pytest","Ограничен для временных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم Temporal","اعتمادية على pytest","محدود لتدفقات العمل الزمنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
