 - AI駆動のフロントエンド開発ツール","ko":"웹 아티팩트 빌더 - AI 기반의 프론트엔드 개발 도구","es":"Constructor de artefactos web: herramienta de desarrollo","fr":"Constructeur d''artefacts web: outil de développement","de":"Web-Artifakt-Builder: Entwicklungstool","pt":"Construtor de Artefatos Web - Crie Artefatos Poderosos","ru":"Конструктор Веб-Артефактов - Создайте Мощные Артефакты","ar":"بناء منقحات الويب - إنشاء منقحات قوية","en":"web-artifacts-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Web Artifacts Builder是一个AI驱动的前端开发工具，帮助开发者构建强大的前端应用程序。","ja":"Web Artifact Builderは、フロントエンド開発者が強力なフロントエンドアプリケーションを構築するのを支援するAI駆動のツールです。","ko":"웹 아티팩트 빌더는 강력한 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 도움을 주는 AI 기반의 프론트엔드 개발 도구입니다.","es":"La herramienta de desarrollo web-artifacts-builder permite a los desarrolladores crear artefactos web potentes con React y TypeScript. Sigue estos pasos para...","fr":"L''outil de développement web-artifacts-builder permet aux développeurs de créer des artefacts web puissants avec React et TypeScript. Suivez ces étapes pour ...","de":"Das Entwicklungstool web-artifacts-builder ermöglicht es Entwicklern, mächtige Web-Artifakte mit React und TypeScript zu erstellen. Befolgen Sie diese Schrit...","pt":"O Construtor de Artefatos Web é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar artefatos web poderosos, utilizando tecnologias como React 18, TypeScript e Vite.","ru":"Конструктор Веб-Артефактов - это инструмент, который помогает создать мощные веб-артефакты, используя технологии như React 18, TypeScript и Vite.","ar":"بناء منقحات الويب هو أداة تساعد على إنشاء منقحات الويب القوية، مع استخدام tecnologias مثل React 18 و TypeScript و Vite.","en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"definition":{"en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"features":{"zh":["支持React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel（打包）+ Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui","初始化前端仓库使用scripts/init-artifact.sh","开发者可以编辑生成的代码","将所有代码打包成单个HTML文件使用scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","显示构建的前端应用程序","可选的测试功能"],"ja":["React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel（バンドル）+ Tailwind CSS + shadcn/uiをサポート","フロントエンドリポジトリの初期化にscripts/init-artifact.shを使用","開発者は生成されたコードを編集できます","すべてのコードを単一のHTMLファイルにバンドルするにはscripts/bundle-artifact.shを使用","構築されたフロントエンドアプリケーションを表示","オプションのテスト機能"],"ko":["React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel（번들링）+ Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui 지원","프론트엔드 저장소를 초기화하는 데 scripts/init-artifact.sh 사용","개발자는 생성된 코드를 편집할 수 있습니다","모든 코드를 단일 HTML 파일로 번들링하는 데 scripts/bundle-artifact.sh 사용","구축된 프론트엔드 애플리케이션 표시","옵션 테스트 기능"],"es":["Inicialización de repositorio de frontend con scripts/init-artifact.sh","Desarrollo de artefactos con React y TypeScript","Empaquetado de código en un solo archivo HTML con scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","Visualización de artefactos para el usuario","Pruebas opcionales de artefactos"],"fr":["Initialisation du référentiel de frontend avec scripts/init-artifact.sh","Développement d''artefacts avec React et TypeScript","Empaquetage de code en un seul fichier HTML avec scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","Affichage d''artefacts pour l''utilisateur","Tests optionnels d''artefacts"],"de":["Initialisierung des Frontend-Repositorys mit scripts/init-artifact.sh","Entwicklung von Artefakten mit React und TypeScript","Paketierung von Code in eine einzelne HTML-Datei mit scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","Anzeige von Artefakten für den Benutzer","Optionale Tests von Artefakten"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos web personalizados","Utilização de React 18 e TypeScript","Otimização com Vite e Parcel","Estilização com Tailwind CSS e shadcn/ui","Suporte à testes e depuração"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых веб-артефактов","Использование React 18 и TypeScript","Оптимизация с помощью Vite и Parcel","Стилизация с помощью Tailwind CSS и shadcn/ui","Поддержка тестирования и отладки"],"ar":["إنشاء منقحات الويب المخصصة","استخدام React 18 و TypeScript","تحسين الأداء باستخدام Vite و Parcel","تصميم الواجهة باستخدام Tailwind CSS و shadcn/ui","دعم الاختبارات والتصحيح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web Artifacts Builder","AI驱动的前端开发","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","前端开发工具"],"ja":["Web Artifact Builder","AI駆動のフロントエンド開発","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","フロントエンド開発ツール"],"ko":["웹 아티팩트 빌더","AI 기반의 프론트엔드 개발","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","프론트엔드 개발 도구"],"es":["constructor de artefactos web","desarrollo de frontend","React","TypeScript","empaquetado de código","visualización de artefactos","pruebas de artefactos","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["constructeur d''artefacts web","développement de frontend","React","TypeScript","empaquetage de code","affichage d''artefacts","tests d''artefacts","outils de développement"],"de":["Web-Artifakt-Builder","Frontend-Entwicklung","React","TypeScript","Paketierung von Code","Anzeige von Artefakten","Tests von Artefakten","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["construtor de artefatos web","react 18","typeScript","vite","parcel","tailwind css","shadcn/ui","desenvolvimento web","artefatos web"],"ru":["конструктор веб-артефактов","react 18","typeScript","vite","parcel","tailwind css","shadcn/ui","веб-разработка","веб-артефакты"],"ar":["بناء منقحات الويب","react 18","typeScript","vite","parcel","tailwind css","shadcn/ui","تطوير الويب","منقحات الويب"]}},"owner":"rongma1sheng","repo":"kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant","repoPath":"rongma1sheng/kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-artifacts-builder","description":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components - not for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts.","bodyPreview":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what","body":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what is often referred to as \"AI slop\", avoid using excessive centered layouts, purple gradients, uniform rounded corners, and Inter font.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Initialize Project\n\nRun the initialization script to create a new React project:\n```bash\nbash scripts/init-artifact.sh <project-name>\ncd <project-name>\n```\n\nThis creates a fully configured project with:\n- ✅ React + TypeScript (via Vite)\n- ✅ Tailwind CSS 3.4.1 with shadcn/ui theming system\n- ✅ Path aliases (`@/`) configured\n- ✅ 40+ shadcn/ui components pre-installed\n- ✅ All Radix UI dependencies included\n- ✅ Parcel configured for bundling (via .parcelrc)\n- ✅ Node 18+ compatibility (auto-detects and pins Vite version)\n\n### Step 2: Develop Your Artifact\n\nTo build the artifact, edit the generated files. See **Common Development Tasks** below for guidance.\n\n### Step 3: Bundle to Single HTML File\n\nTo bundle the React app into a single HTML artifact:\n```bash\nbash scripts/bundle-artifact.sh\n```\n\nThis creates `bundle.html` - a self-contained artifact with all JavaScript, CSS, and dependencies inlined. This file can be directly shared in Claude conversations as an artifact.\n\n**Requirements**: Your project must have an `index.html` in the root directory.\n\n**What the script does**:\n- Installs bundling dependencies (parcel, @parcel/config-default, parcel-resolver-tspaths, html-inline)\n- Creates `.parcelrc` config with path alias support\n- Builds with Parcel (no source maps)\n- Inlines all assets into single HTML using html-inline\n\n### Step 4: Share Artifact with User\n\nFinally, share the bundled HTML file in conversation with the user so they can view it as an artifact.\n\n### Step 5: Testing/Visualizing the Artifact (Optional)\n\nNote: This is a completely optional step. Only perform if necessary or requested.\n\nTo test/visualize the artifact, use available tools (including other Skills or built-in tools like Playwright or Puppeteer). In general, avoid testing the artifact upfront as it adds latency between the request and when the finished artifact can be seen. Test later, after presenting the artifact, if requested or if issues arise.\n\n## Reference\n\n- **shadcn/ui components**: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:03:13.361Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced web artifact development with React 18, TypeScript, and Vite.","zh":"适用于需要使用React 18、TypeScript和Vite进行高级Web工件开发的前端代理。","ja":"React 18、TypeScript、Viteを使用した高度なWebアーティファクト開発を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 18, TypeScript 및 Vite를 사용한 고급 웹 아티팩트 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren desarrollo avanzado de artefactos web con React 18, TypeScript y Vite.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant un développement avancé d''artefacts web avec React 18, TypeScript et Vite.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Entwicklung von Webartefakten mit React 18, TypeScript und Vite erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem desenvolvimento avançado de artefatos web com React 18, TypeScript e Vite.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, требующих продвинутого развития веб-артефактов с использованием React 18, TypeScript и Vite.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذي يتطلب تطويرًا متقدمًا لعناصر الويب باستخدام React 18 و TypeScript و Vite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build powerful frontend artifacts using React 18 + TypeScript + Vite, bundled with Parcel, and styled with Tailwind CSS, enabling seamless integration with claude.ai and other AI-driven systems via HTML files.","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的前端工件的能力，使用React 18 + TypeScript + Vite，打包Parcel，并使用Tailwind CSS进行样式设计，实现与claude.ai和其他AI驱动系统的无缝集成，通过HTML文件。","ja":"React 18 + TypeScript + Viteを使用して強力なフロントエンドアーティファクトを構築するエージェントの能力を付与します。Parcelでバンドルされ、Tailwind CSSでスタイル設定され、HTMLファイルを介してclaude.aiおよびその他のAI駆動システムとのシームレスな統合が可能になります。","ko":"React 18 + TypeScript + Vite를 사용하여 강력한 프론트엔드 아티팩트를 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. Parcel로 번들되고 Tailwind CSS로 스타일이 지정되며 HTML 파일을 통해 claude.ai 및 기타 AI 구동 시스템과 무縫 통합이 가능합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear poderosos artefactos frontend utilizando React 18 + TypeScript + Vite, empaquetado con Parcel y estilizado con Tailwind CSS, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con claude.ai y otros sistemas impulsados por IA a través de archivos HTML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des artefacts frontend puissants en utilisant React 18 + TypeScript + Vite, empaqueté avec Parcel et stylisé avec Tailwind CSS, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec claude.ai et d''autres systèmes alimentés par l''IA via des fichiers HTML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, leistungsstarke Frontend-Artefakte zu erstellen, die React 18 + TypeScript + Vite verwenden, mit Parcel gebündelt und mit Tailwind CSS gestaltet, was eine nahtlose Integration mit claude.ai und anderen künstlich intelligente Systeme über HTML-Dateien ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir artefatos frontend poderosos usando React 18 + TypeScript + Vite, empacotados com Parcel e estilizados com Tailwind CSS, permitindo uma integração sem problemas com claude.ai e outros sistemas impulsionados por IA via arquivos HTML.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мощные фронтенд-артефакты, используя React 18 + TypeScript + Vite,捆izzato с Parcel и стилизованный с помощью Tailwind CSS, что обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию с claude.ai и другими системами, управляемыми ИИ, через файлы HTML.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء عناصر واجهة المستخدم الأمامية القوية باستخدام React 18 + TypeScript + Vite، مع حزمة Parcel وتنسيقها مع Tailwind CSS، مما يُمكن من التكامل السلس مع claude.ai ونظم أخرى مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي عبر ملفات HTML."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom frontend artifacts for claude.ai","Generating single-page HTML applications with Parcel","Developing responsive UI components using Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui"],"zh":["为claude.ai构建自定义前端工件","使用Parcel生成单页HTML应用程序","使用Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui开发响应式UI组件"],"ja":["claude.ai用のカスタムフロントエンドアーティファクトを構築する","Parcelを使用してシングルページHTMLアプリケーションを生成する","Tailwind CSSとshadcn/uiを使用してレスポンシブUIコンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["claude.ai를 위한 사용자 정의 프론트엔드 아티팩트를 구축하는 것","Parcel을 사용하여 단일 페이지 HTML 응용 프로그램을 생성하는 것","Tailwind CSS 및 shadcn/ui를 사용하여 반응형 UI 구성 요소를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Creación de artefactos frontend personalizados para claude.ai","Generación de aplicaciones HTML de una sola página con Parcel","Desarrollo de componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos con Tailwind CSS y shadcn/ui"],"fr":["Création d''artefacts frontend personnalisés pour claude.ai","Génération d''applications HTML à page unique avec Parcel","Développement de composants d''interface utilisateur responsifs avec Tailwind CSS et shadcn/ui"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Frontend-Artefakten für claude.ai","Generierung von Single-Page-HTML-Anwendungen mit Parcel","Entwicklung von responsiven Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui"],"pt":["Construir artefatos frontend personalizados para claude.ai","Gerar aplicações HTML de página única com Parcel","Desenvolver componentes de UI responsivos usando Tailwind CSS e shadcn/ui"],"ru":["Построение пользовательских фронтенд-артефактов для claude.ai","Генерация одностраницных HTML-приложений с помощью Parcel","Разработка отзывчивых компонентов UI, используя Tailwind CSS и shadcn/ui"],"ar":["بناء عناصر واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة لبرنامج claude.ai","генерация تطبيقات HTML من صفحة واحدة مع حزمة Parcel","تطوير مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتجاوبة باستخدام Tailwind CSS و shadcn/ui"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initialization with scripts/init-artifact.sh","Dependent on specific tech stack: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["需要使用scripts/init-artifact.sh初始化","依赖于特定的技术栈：React 18、TypeScript、Vite、Parcel和Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["scripts/init-artifact.shを使用して初期化する必要がある","特定のテクノロジースタックに依存しています：React 18、TypeScript、Vite、Parcel、Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["scripts/init-artifact.sh를 사용하여 초기화해야 함","특정 기술 스택에 의존함: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel 및 Tailwind CSS"],"es":["Requiere inicialización con scripts/init-artifact.sh","Dependiente de una pila tecnológica específica: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite une initialisation avec scripts/init-artifact.sh","Dépend d''une pile technologique spécifique : React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Erfordert Initialisierung mit scripts/init-artifact.sh","Abhängig von einem bestimmten Technologie-Stack: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel und Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Exige inicialização com scripts/init-artifact.sh","Dependente de uma pilha de tecnologia específica: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Требует инициализации с помощью scripts/init-artifact.sh","Зависит от конкретного технологического стека: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة مع سكريبتات/init-artifact.sh","يعتمد على مجموعة تقنية محددة: React 18 و TypeScript و Vite و Parcel و Tailwind CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
