용 방법을 알아보세요","es":"Invocar habilidades es crucial para el éxito. Aprende a hacerlo con confianza.","fr":"L''invocation de compétences est cruciale pour le succès. Apprenez à le faire avec confiance.","de":"Das Abrufen von Fähigkeiten ist für den Erfolg entscheidend. Lernen Sie, es mit Zuversicht zu tun.","pt":"O using-superpowers é uma habilidade fundamental que deve ser invocada sempre que aplicável. Aprenda a utilizá-la para melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Using-superpowers — это базовая способность, которую необходимо вызывать всякий раз, когда это применимо. Узнайте, как ею пользоваться, чтобы повысить эффект...","ar":"(using-superpowers) هو مهارة أساسية يجب استدعاؤها دائمًا عند الطلب. تعلم كيفية استخدامها لتحسين الفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高开发效率","调用特定技能","Claude代码必备","开发者必备技能","提高代码质量"],"ja":["開発効率の向上","特定のスキルの呼び出し","Claudeコードの必須","開発者の必須スキル","コード品質の向上"],"ko":["개발 효율성 향상","특정 스킬 호출","Claude 코드 필수","개발자 필수 스킬","코드 품질 향상"],"es":["Invocación de habilidades avanzadas","Acceso a capacidades exclusivas","Mejora de la productividad del desarrollador","Integración con Claude Code","Uso obligatorio cuando es relevante"],"fr":["Invocation de compétences avancées","Accès à des capacités exclusives","Amélioration de la productivité du développeur","Intégration avec Claude Code","Utilisation obligatoire lorsqu''elle est pertinente"],"de":["Abrufen von erweiterten Fähigkeiten","Zugriff auf exklusive Fähigkeiten","Steigerung der Entwicklerproduktivität","Integration mit Claude Code","Verpflichtende Verwendung bei Relevanz"],"pt":["Invocação obrigatória de habilidades quando aplicável","Aumento da eficiência do trabalho","Orientação clara sobre o uso de skills","Integração com Claude Code","Uso do tool Skill para invocar habilidades"],"ru":["Обязательный вызов навыков, когда это применимо","Повышение эффективности работы","Ясные рекомендации по использованию навыков","Интеграция с Claude Code","Использование инструмента Skill для вызова навыков"],"ar":["استدعاء обязательي للمهارات عند الطلب","زيادة فعالية العمل","إرشادات واضحة حول استخدام المهارات","التكامل مع Claude Code","استخدام أداة Skill لاستدعاء المهارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude代码","超级力量技能","开发效率","开发者必备","代码质量","开发工具","技能调用"],"ja":["Claudeコード","スーパーパワースキル","開発効率","開発者の必須","コード品質","開発ツール","スキルの呼び出し"],"ko":["Claude 코드","슈퍼파워 스킬","개발 효율성","개발자 필수","코드 품질","개발 도구","스킬 호출"],"es":["desarrollo de software","invocación de habilidades","superpoderes en desarrollo","productividad del desarrollador","Claude Code","desarrollo avanzado"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","invocation de compétences","superpouvoirs de développement","productivité du développeur","Claude Code","développement avancé"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Abrufen von Fähigkeiten","Superkräfte im Entwicklungsprozess","Entwicklerproduktivität","Claude Code","erweitertes Entwickeln"],"pt":["using-superpowers","invocar habilidades","eficiência do trabalho","Claude Code","Skill tool","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de processo"],"ru":["using-superpowers","вызов навыков","эффективность работы","Claude Code","инструмент Skill","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация процесса"],"ar":["using-superpowers","استدعاء المهارات","فعالية العمل","Claude Code","أداة Skill","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين العملية"]}},"owner":"dwalleck","repo":"kiro-starter-kit","repoPath":"dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-superpowers","description":"Use when starting any conversation - establishes how to find and use skills, requiring Skill tool invocation before ANY response including clarifying questions","bodyPreview":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n**In Claude Code:** Use the `Skill` tool. When you invoke a skill, its content is loaded and presented to you—follow it directly. Never use","body":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n**In Claude Code:** Use the `Skill` tool. When you invoke a skill, its content is loaded and presented to you—follow it directly. Never use the Read tool on skill files.\n\n**In other environments:** Check your platform''s documentation for how skills are loaded.\n\n# Using Skills\n\n## The Rule\n\n**Invoke relevant or requested skills BEFORE any response or action.** Even a 1% chance a skill might apply means that you should invoke the skill to check. If an invoked skill turns out to be wrong for the situation, you don''t need to use it.\n\n```dot\ndigraph skill_flow {\n    \"User message received\" [shape=doublecircle];\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Invoke Skill tool\" [shape=box];\n    \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\" [shape=box];\n    \"Has checklist?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" [shape=box];\n    \"Follow skill exactly\" [shape=box];\n    \"Respond (including clarifications)\" [shape=doublecircle];\n\n    \"User message received\" -> \"Might any skill apply?\";\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" -> \"Invoke Skill tool\" [label=\"yes, even 1%\"];\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" -> \"Respond (including clarifications)\" [label=\"definitely not\"];\n    \"Invoke Skill tool\" -> \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\";\n    \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\" -> \"Has checklist?\";\n    \"Has checklist?\" -> \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Has checklist?\" -> \"Follow skill exactly\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" -> \"Follow skill exactly\";\n}\n```\n\n## Red Flags\n\nThese thoughts mean STOP—you''re rationalizing:\n\n| Thought | Reality |\n|---------|---------|\n| \"This is just a simple question\" | Questions are tasks. Check for skills. |\n| \"I need more context first\" | Skill check comes BEFORE clarifying questions. |\n| \"Let me explore the codebase first\" | Skills tell you HOW to explore. Check first. |\n| \"I can check git/files quickly\" | Files lack conversation context. Check for skills. |\n| \"Let me gather information first\" | Skills tell you HOW to gather information. |\n| \"This doesn''t need a formal skill\" | If a skill exists, use it. |\n| \"I remember this skill\" | Skills evolve. Read current version. |\n| \"This doesn''t count as a task\" | Action = task. Check for skills. |\n| \"The skill is overkill\" | Simple things become complex. Use it. |\n| \"I''ll just do this one thing first\" | Check BEFORE doing anything. |\n| \"This feels productive\" | Undisciplined action wastes time. Skills prevent this. |\n| \"I know what that means\" | Knowing the concept ≠ using the skill. Invoke it. |\n\n## Skill Priority\n\nWhen multiple skills could apply, use this order:\n\n1. **Process skills first** (brainstorming, debugging) - these determine HOW to approach the task\n2. **Implementation skills second** (frontend-design, mcp-builder) - these guide execution\n\n\"Let''s build X\" → brainstorming first, then implementation skills.\n\"Fix this bug\" → debugging first, then domain-specific skills.\n\n## Skill Types\n\n**Rigid** (TDD, debugging): Follow exactly. Don''t adapt away discipline.\n\n**Flexible** (patterns): Adapt principles to context.\n\nThe skill itself tells you which.\n\n## User Instructions\n\nInstructions say WHAT, not HOW. \"Add X\" or \"Fix Y\" doesn''t mean skip workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:03:28.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for all AI Agents requiring mandatory compliance with skill-based workflows.","zh":"适用于所有需要遵守基于技能的工作流的必备合规性的 AI 代理。","ja":"スキルベースのワークフローに必須のコンプライアンスを必要とするすべてのAIエージェントに不可欠。","ko":"스킬 기반 워크플로에 대한 필수적 인 규정 준수를 필요로하는 모든 AI 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para todos los agentes de IA que requieren cumplimiento obligatorio con flujos de trabajo basados en habilidades.","fr":"Essentiel pour tous les agents IA nécessitant un respect obligatoire des flux de travail basés sur les compétences.","de":"Wesentlich für alle KI-Agents, die eine obligatorische Einhaltung von fähigkeitsbasierten Workflows erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para todos os Agentes de IA que requerem conformidade obrigatória com fluxos de trabalho baseados em habilidades.","ru":"Необходимо для всех ИИ-агентов, требующих обязательного соблюдения потоков работы на основе навыков.","ar":"ضروري لجميع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون امتثالًا إجباريًا لتدفقات العمل القائمة على المهارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces absolute skill invocation compliance through mandatory execution protocols. Provides deterministic skill loading via Claude''s `Skill` tool integration, eliminating agent discretion in applicable scenarios.","zh":"通过强制执行协议强制执行绝对的技能调用合规性。通过 Claude 的 `Skill` 工具集成提供确定性的技能加载，消除代理人在适用场景中的自由裁量。","ja":"マンダトリーな実行プロトコルを通じて絶対的なスキル呼び出しのコンプライアンスを強制します。 Claude の `Skill` ツールの統合を通じて、決定的なスキルロードを提供し、適用可能なシナリオでエージェントの裁量を排除します。","ko":"强制 실행 프로토콜을 통해 절대적인 스킬 호출 규정 준수를 강제합니다. Claude 의 `스킬` 툴 통합을 통해 결정적 인 스킬 로드를 제공하여 적용 가능한 시나리오에서 에이전트의 재량을 제거합니다.","es":"Hace cumplir el cumplimiento absoluto de la invocación de habilidades a través de protocolos de ejecución obligatorios. Proporciona una carga de habilidades determinista a través de la integración de la herramienta `Skill` de Claude, eliminando la discreción del agente en escenarios aplicables.","fr":"Force le respect absolu de l''invocation des compétences via des protocoles d''exécution obligatoires. Fournit un chargement de compétences déterministe via l''intégration de l''outil `Skill` de Claude, éliminant la discrétion de l''agent dans les scénarios applicables.","de":"Zwingt die absolute Einhaltung der Fähigkeitsaufruf durch obligatorische Ausführungsprotokolle. Bietet deterministisches Fähigkeitsladen via Claude''s `Skill`-Tool-Integration, eliminiert die Ermessensspielräume des Agents in anwendbaren Szenarien.","pt":"Impõe cumprimento absoluto da invocação de habilidades por meio de protocolos de execução obrigatórios. Fornece carregamento de habilidades determinístico via integração da ferramenta `Skill` do Claude, eliminando a discrição do agente em cenários aplicáveis.","ru":"Принудительно обеспечивает соблюдение вызова навыков посредством обязательных протоколов выполнения. Предоставляет детерминированную загрузку навыков через интеграцию инструмента `Skill` от Claude, исключая усмотрение агента в применимых сценариях.","ar":"ينفذ امتثالًا مطلقًا لاستدعاء المهارات من خلال بروتوكولات تنفيذ إجبارية. يوفر تحميلًا محددًا للمهارات من خلال دمج أداة `Skill` من Claude ، مما يزيل裁量 الوكيل في السيناريوهات القابلة للتطبيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing compliance protocols in regulated workflows","Automating skill selection for complex multi-step tasks","Implementing fail-safe execution patterns in agent ecosystems"],"zh":["在受监管的工作流中强制执行合规协议","自动执行复杂的多步骤任务的技能选择","在代理生态系统中实施故障安全的执行模式"],"ja":["規制されたワークフローでコンプライアンスプロトコルを強制する","複雑なマルチステップタスクのスキル選択を自動化する","エージェントエコシステムでフェイルセーフな実行パターンを実装する"],"ko":["규제 된 워크플로에서 규정 준수 프로토콜을 강제 적용","복잡한 다단계 작업의 스킬 선택 자동화","에이전트 생태계에서 실패 방지 실행 패턴 구현"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los protocolos de cumplimiento en flujos de trabajo regulados","Automatizar la selección de habilidades para tareas complejas de varios pasos","Implementar patrones de ejecución de seguridad en ecosistemas de agentes"],"fr":["Faire respecter les protocoles de conformité dans les flux de travail réglementés","Automatiser la sélection de compétences pour les tâches complexes à plusieurs étapes","Mettre en œuvre des modèles d''exécution sécurisés dans les écosystèmes d''agents"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Einhaltungsprotokollen in regulierten Workflows","Automatisieren der Fähigkeitsauswahl für komplexe Mehrschritt-Aufgaben","Implementieren von Fehlersicheren Ausführungsmustern in Agenten-Ökosystemen"],"pt":["Impor protocolos de conformidade em fluxos de trabalho regulamentados","Automatizar a seleção de habilidades para tarefas complexas multi-etapas","Implementar padrões de execução seguros em ecossistemas de agentes"],"ru":["Принудительное соблюдение протоколов соответствия в регулируемых потоках работы","Автоматизация выбора навыков для сложных многоступенчатых задач","Реализация шаблонов безопасного выполнения в экосистемах агентов"],"ar":["فرض بروتوكولات الامتثال في تدفقات العمل المنظمة","توفير تحديد المهارات آليًا للمهام المعقدة متعددة الخطوات","تنفيذ أنماط تنفيذ آمنة في بيئات وكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Claude Code exclusive (Skill tool dependency)","Requires predefined skill library","No agent discretion permitted for applicable tasks"],"zh":["仅限 Claude 代码（Skill 工具依赖）","需要预定义的技能库","不允许代理人在适用任务中进行自由裁量"],"ja":["Claude コード専用（スキルツール依存）","事前に定義されたスキルライブラリが必要","適用タスクではエージェントの裁量を許可しない"],"ko":["Claude 코드 전용 (스킬 툴 의존성)","사전 정의 된 스킬 라이브러리가 필요","적용 태스크에서는 에이전트의 재량을 허용하지 않음"],"es":["Exclusivo de Claude Code (dependencia de la herramienta Skill)","Requiere una biblioteca de habilidades predefinida","No se permite discreción del agente para tareas aplicables"],"fr":["Exclusif de Claude Code (dépendance de l''outil Skill)","Nécessite une bibliothèque de compétences prédéfinie","Aucune discrétion de l''agent n''est autorisée pour les tâches applicables"],"de":["Exklusiv für Claude Code (Abhängigkeit von Skill-Tool)","Benötigt eine vordefinierte Fähigkeitsbibliothek","Keine Ermessensspielräume des Agents für anwendbare Aufgaben"],"pt":["Código Claude exclusivo (dependência da ferramenta Skill)","Requer biblioteca de habilidades predefinida","Não é permitida discrição do agente para tarefas aplicáveis"],"ru":["Исключительно код Claude (зависимость от инструмента Skill)","Требуется предварительно определенная библиотека навыков","Не допускается усмотрение агента для применимых задач"],"ar":["كود كلود الحصري (اعتماد أداة المهارات)","يتطلب مكتبة مهارات محددة مسبقًا","لا يسمح بال裁量 الوكيل للمهام القابلة للتطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
