cesibilidad","fr":"Ce skill guide la création d''interfaces frontend qui combinent technologie et accessibilité","de":"Dieses Skill leitet die Erstellung von Frontend-Interfaces, die Technologie und Zugänglichkeit kombinieren","pt":"O skill de design de frontend da Dynamous guia a criação de interfaces que combinam tecnologia e acessibilidade.","ru":"Навык динамического фронтенд-дизайна руководит созданием интерфейсов, которые сочетают технику и доступность.","ar":"مهارة تصميم واجهة المستخدم الديناميكي توجيه إنشاء واجهات تجمع بين التكنولوجيا والوصول","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["前端设计","Dynamous 品牌身份","技术感和亲和力","可访问性和 sophistication"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","Dynamous ブランドアイデンティティ","技術的かつアプローチャブル","アクセシビリティと sophistication"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","다이나모스 브랜드 아이덴티티","기술적이고 접근 가능","접근성과 sophistication"],"es":["Guía de creación de interfaces frontend","Identidad de marca Dynamous","Tecnología y accesibilidad","Ejemplos de componentes y CSS en vivo","Filosofía de marca y especificaciones completas"],"fr":["Guide de création d''interfaces frontend","Identité de marque Dynamous","Technologie et accessibilité","Exemples de composants et CSS en direct","Philosophie de marque et spécifications complètes"],"de":["Anleitung zur Erstellung von Frontend-Interfaces","Marke Dynamous","Technologie und Zugänglichkeit","Beispiele für Komponenten und Live-CSS","Markenphilosophie und vollständige Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces técnicas e acessíveis","Integração da identidade da marca Dynamous","Design de componentes e exemplos de CSS","Guia de filosofia da marca e especificações","Exemplos de código e recursos adicionais"],"ru":["Создание технических и доступных интерфейсов","Интеграция идентичности бренда Dynamous","Дизайн компонентов и примеры CSS","Руководство по философии бренда и спецификациям","Примеры кода и дополнительные ресурсы"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات تقنية ويمكن الوصول إليها","دمج هويتها العلامة التجارية Dynamous","تصميم المكونات وأمثلة CSS","دليل فلسفة العلامة التجارية والمواصفات","أمثلة الشفرة والموارد الإضافية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","Dynamous","品牌身份","技术感","亲和力","可访问性","sophistication"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","Dynamous","ブランドアイデンティティ","技術的","アプローチャブル","アクセシビリティ","sophistication"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","다이나모스","브랜드 아이덴티티","기술적","접근 가능","접근성","sophistication"],"es":["diseño frontend","identidad de marca","tecnología y accesibilidad","interfaces frontend","desarrollo web","marca Dynamous"],"fr":["conception frontend","identité de marque","technologie et accessibilité","interfaces frontend","développement web","marque Dynamous"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Markenidentität","Technologie und Zugänglichkeit","Frontend-Interfaces","Webentwicklung","Marke Dynamous"],"pt":["design de frontend","dynamous","identidade da marca","interfaces técnicas","acessibilidade","css","componentes","filosofia da marca"],"ru":["динамический фронтенд-дизайн","dynamous","идентичность бренда","технические интерфейсы","доступность","css","компоненты","философия бренда"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم الديناميكي","dynamous","هويتها العلامة التجارية","واجهات تقنية","الوصول","css","المكونات","فلسفة العلامة التجارية"]}},"owner":"coleam00","repo":"obsidian-voice-agent","repoPath":"coleam00/obsidian-voice-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design-skill","description":"Create production-grade frontend interfaces following the Dynamous brand system. Use when building web components, pages, or applications for Dynamous. Implements a sophisticated dark-mode-first design language with glass morphism, signature blue accents, and technical-but-approachable aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"# Dynamous Frontend Design\r\n\r\n**Skill Location:** `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill`\r\n\r\nThis skill guides creation of frontend interfaces that embody the **Dynamous brand identity**. Every interface should feel technical yet approachable, sophisticated yet accessible.\r\n\r\n**Required reading for implementation details:**\r\n- **Brand philosophy & complete specifications**: See `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill/resources/brand-system.md`\r\n- **Live CSS reference & component examples**: See `.kiro/","body":"# Dynamous Frontend Design\r\n\r\n**Skill Location:** `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill`\r\n\r\nThis skill guides creation of frontend interfaces that embody the **Dynamous brand identity**. Every interface should feel technical yet approachable, sophisticated yet accessible.\r\n\r\n**Required reading for implementation details:**\r\n- **Brand philosophy & complete specifications**: See `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill/resources/brand-system.md`\r\n- **Live CSS reference & component examples**: See `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill/resources/design-system.html`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Brand Philosophy\r\n\r\nBefore coding, internalize these core principles:\r\n\r\n### 1. Technical but Approachable\r\nComplex AI topics made accessible without dumbing them down. Show sophistication, explain it clearly. The interface should feel like it was built by engineers who care about craft.\r\n\r\n### 2. Clean over Flashy\r\nNo unnecessary decoration. Every visual element has a purpose. Elegance through restraint. One well-placed glow effect beats ten scattered animations.\r\n\r\n### 3. Dark Mode by Default\r\nModern, developer-focused aesthetic. Easy on the eyes for people who stare at screens all day. The dark canvas makes the content shine.\r\n\r\n### 4. Intentional Design Choices\r\nBold decisions executed with precision. If something glows, it should glow for a reason. If something moves, it should move purposefully.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Essential Design Tokens\r\n\r\n### Colors — Dynamous Blue is the Hero\r\n\r\n```css\r\n/* Primary — Use sparingly for maximum impact */\r\n--dynamous-blue: #3B82F6;      /* Primary buttons, links, hero accents */\r\n--dynamous-dark: #2563EB;      /* Hover states, outlines */\r\n--dynamous-light: #60A5FA;     /* Secondary accents, highlights */\r\n\r\n/* Dark Theme (Default) */\r\n--background: #07090F;         /* Near-black with subtle blue tint */\r\n--background-alt: #080A13;     /* Slightly warmer alternative */\r\n--surface: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); /* Glass card backgrounds */\r\n--border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n\r\n/* Text Hierarchy */\r\n--text-primary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);   /* Headings */\r\n--text-secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);  /* Body text */\r\n--text-muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);      /* Meta, labels */\r\n\r\n/* Semantic (use only for meaning, not decoration) */\r\n--success: #047857;  --success-bg: #A7F3D0;\r\n--warning: #B45309;  --warning-bg: #FEF3C7;\r\n--error: #B91C1C;    --error-bg: #FECACA;\r\n--ai-purple: #6D28D9; --ai-purple-bg: #DDD6FE;  /* AI/LLM elements */\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Rule**: Dynamous Blue is the hero. Use it for actions and emphasis. Don''t dilute by overusing.\r\n\r\n### Typography — The Dynamous Stack\r\n\r\n```css\r\n--font-sans: ''Inter'', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n--font-mono: ''JetBrains Mono'', ui-monospace, monospace;\r\n--font-display: ''Montserrat'', var(--font-sans);  /* Thumbnails, bold headlines */\r\n```\r\n\r\n| Element | Font | Weight | Notes |\r\n|---------|------|--------|-------|\r\n| Hero/Display | Inter | 700 | Large, impactful headings |\r\n| H1 | Inter | 700 | Page titles |\r\n| H2-H3 | Inter | 600 | Section headers |\r\n| Body | Inter | 400 | Readable paragraphs |\r\n| Buttons | Inter | 500 | Clear CTAs |\r\n| Code | JetBrains Mono | 400 | Developer-friendly |\r\n| Thumbnails | Montserrat | 800 | Maximum impact only |\r\n\r\n### Spacing — Multiples of 8px\r\n\r\n```css\r\n--space-xs: 4px;   --space-sm: 8px;   --space-md: 12px;\r\n--space-base: 16px; --space-lg: 24px;  --space-xl: 32px;\r\n--space-2xl: 48px;  --space-3xl: 64px;\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Border Radius\r\n\r\n```css\r\n--radius-sm: 4px;   --radius-md: 8px;   --radius-lg: 12px;\r\n--radius-xl: 16px;  --radius-full: 9999px;\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Signature Elements\r\n\r\nThese define the Dynamous visual identity. Use them consistently.\r\n\r\n### Glass Card — The Defining Pattern\r\n\r\nFrosted glass over dark backgrounds. The signature container for content.\r\n\r\n```css\r\n.glass-card {\r\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\r\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\r\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\r\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Use for**: Content cards, video containers, feature highlights, testimonials.\r\n**Do NOT use for**: Buttons, navigation, form inputs (these need clarity).\r\n\r\n### Blue Glow — Signature Emphasis\r\n\r\nCreates a soft halo around important elements.\r\n\r\n```css\r\n.blue-glow {\r\n  box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5),\r\n              0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.text-glow {\r\n  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5),\r\n               0 0 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Use for**: Hero text highlights, primary buttons, featured content, logo in hero sections.\r\n**Rule**: Use sparingly. If everything glows, nothing does.\r\n\r\n### Primary Button\r\n\r\n```css\r\n.btn-primary {\r\n  background: var(--dynamous-blue);\r\n  color: white;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  padding: 8px 16px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -4px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);\r\n  transition: all 200ms cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-primary:hover {\r\n  background: var(--dynamous-dark);\r\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px -4px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Hero Gradient Background\r\n\r\n```css\r\nbackground: linear-gradient(to bottom, #07090f, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.9), #080a13);\r\nbackground-attachment: fixed;\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Grid Pattern (Subtle Background Texture)\r\n\r\n```css\r\n.grid-pattern {\r\n  background-image:\r\n    linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\r\n    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\r\n  background-size: 40px 40px;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Motion Guidelines\r\n\r\nNothing should take longer than 600ms. Snappy > smooth.\r\n\r\n```css\r\n--duration-micro: 150ms;  /* Button states, toggles */\r\n--duration-fast: 200ms;   /* Dropdowns, small transitions */\r\n--duration-normal: 300ms; /* Cards, modals */\r\n--duration-slow: 600ms;   /* Page transitions, fade-ins */\r\n\r\n--ease-out: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1);  /* Entrances */\r\n--ease-in: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1);   /* Exits */\r\n/* Never use linear for UI — feels robotic */\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Signature Animations\r\n\r\n```css\r\n/* Float — decorative elements */\r\n@keyframes float {\r\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }\r\n  50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }\r\n}\r\nanimation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n\r\n/* Fade-in — content entrance */\r\n@keyframes fade-in {\r\n  0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\r\n  100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\r\n}\r\nanimation: fade-in 0.6s ease-out forwards;\r\n\r\n/* Shimmer — button hover effect */\r\n.btn::before {\r\n  content: '''';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  inset: 0;\r\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent);\r\n  transform: translateX(-100%);\r\n  transition: transform 0.5s ease;\r\n}\r\n.btn:hover::before { transform: translateX(100%); }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What Moves vs. What Doesn''t\r\n\r\n**Moves**: Buttons, cards on hover, decorative logos, page sections on scroll, modals.\r\n**Stays grounded**: Body text, navigation, form inputs, critical UI.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Anti-Patterns — What to Avoid\r\n\r\n### Generic AI Aesthetics (AI Slop)\r\n- Cliched purple gradients on white backgrounds\r\n- Overused generic illustrations\r\n- Cookie-cutter layouts without context\r\n- Random floating geometric shapes\r\n- Excessive glossy 3D elements\r\n\r\n### Breaking Brand Consistency\r\n- Using colors outside the Dynamous palette\r\n- Light mode as default (always dark-first)\r\n- Fonts other than Inter/Montserrat/JetBrains Mono\r\n- Rounded corners that don''t match the system (8px, 12px, 16px)\r\n- Borders thicker than 1px for subtle elements\r\n\r\n### Motion Mistakes\r\n- Animations longer than 600ms\r\n- Linear easing for UI transitions\r\n- Animating body text\r\n- Everything moving at once (use stagger delays)\r\n\r\n### Glow Overuse\r\n- Glowing everything (dilutes impact)\r\n- Glow on non-interactive elements\r\n- Multiple glow colors competing\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Implementation Workflow\r\n\r\n1. **Start with the dark canvas**: `background: #07090F`\r\n2. **Establish text hierarchy**: Primary (98%), secondary (80%), muted (70%)\r\n3. **Add glass cards for containers**: The signature frosted effect\r\n4. **Use Dynamous Blue for actions**: Buttons, links, highlights only\r\n5. **Apply glow effects sparingly**: Hero elements, primary CTAs\r\n6. **Add motion last**: Entrance animations, hover states\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## When to Consult Reference Files\r\n\r\n**Read `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill/resources/brand-system.md` when you need:**\r\n- Complete color specifications with HSL values\r\n- Full typography rules and line heights\r\n- Icon specifications (Lucide React, sizes)\r\n- YouTube thumbnail specifications\r\n- Diagram colors for Excalidraw\r\n- Image treatment guidelines\r\n- Complete CSS variables reference\r\n\r\n**Read `.kiro/skills/frontend-design-skill/resources/design-system.html` when you need:**\r\n- Live component examples to reference\r\n- Exact CSS implementations\r\n- Interactive demos of animations\r\n- Color swatches you can inspect\r\n- Complete button/input/card variants\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n| Element | Implementation |\r\n|---------|----------------|\r\n| Background | `#07090F` or hero gradient |\r\n| Card | Glass morphism with `rgba(0,0,0,0.4)` + blur |\r\n| Primary action | Dynamous Blue `#3B82F6` |\r\n| Text | 98%/80%/70% white opacity hierarchy |\r\n| Borders | `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` always |\r\n| Corners | 8px buttons, 12px cards |\r\n| Emphasis | Blue glow, use once per viewport |\r\n| Motion | ≤600ms, ease-out for entrances |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRemember: Dynamous interfaces should feel like they were crafted by engineers who deeply care about both technical excellence and visual design. Every pixel has purpose. Every animation has intent. Every glow creates focus.\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T20:54:26.425Z","qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/design-system-patterns', 'community', 'yashvinthan', 'DuskSpendr', 'yashvinthan/DuskSpendr', 'design-system-patterns', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z', '2026-02-18T14:03:38.901Z', NULL, '{"id":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/design-system-patterns","name":"design-system-patterns","description":{"zh":"设计系统模式是创建一致的UI基础的关键，帮助开发者打造可维护和可扩展的UI","ja":"デザインシステムパターンは、開発者が一貫したUI基盤を作成するための重要な概念です","ko":"디자인 시스템 패턴은 일관된 UI 기본을 구축하는 데 중요한 역할을 하며 개발자에게 유지 보수와 확장성이 뛰어난 UI를 제공","es":"Los patrones de sistema de diseño permiten crear fundamentos de UI consistentes y escalables. Aprende a implementarlos en tus proyectos","fr":"Les modèles de système de conception permettent de créer des fondations d''UI cohérentes et évolutives. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre dans vos projets","de":"Design-System-Muster ermöglichen die Erstellung konsistenter und skalierbarer UI-Grundlagen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie in Ihren Projekten umsetzen","pt":"Domine a arquitetura de sistema de design para criar fundamentos de UI consistentes e escaláveis","ru":"Освойте архитектуру системы дизайна, чтобы создавать последовательные и масштабируемые основы UI","ar":"استحوذ على هندسة نظام التصميم لإنشاء أساسيات واجهة المستخدم المتسقة والقابلة للتحجيم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"设计系统模式 - 创建一致的UI基础","ja":"デザインシステムパターン - 一貫したUI基盤を作成","ko":"디자인 시스템 패턴 - 일관된 UI 基盤を作成","es":"Patrones de sistema de diseño para UI escalable","fr":"Modèles de système de conception pour UI évolutif","de":"Design-System-Muster für skalierbare UI","pt":"Padrões de Sistema de Design","ru":"Шаблоны системы дизайна","ar":"أنماط نظام التصميم","en":"design-system-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"设计系统模式是创建一致的UI基础的关键，帮助开发者打造可维护和可扩展的UI","ja":"デザインシステムパターンは、開発者が一貫したUI基盤を作成するための重要な概念です","ko":"디자인 시스템 패턴은 일관된 UI 기본을 구축하는 데 중요한 역할을 하며 개발자에게 유지 보수와 확장성이 뛰어난 UI를 제공","es":"Los patrones de sistema de diseño permiten crear fundamentos de UI consistentes y escalables. Aprende a implementarlos en tus proyectos","fr":"Les modèles de système de conception permettent de créer des fondations d''UI cohérentes et évolutives. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre dans vos projets","de":"Design-System-Muster ermöglichen die Erstellung konsistenter und skalierbarer UI-Grundlagen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie in Ihren Projekten umsetzen","pt":"Domine a arquitetura de sistema de design para criar fundamentos de UI consistentes e escaláveis","ru":"Освойте архитектуру системы дизайна, чтобы создавать последовательные и масштабируемые основы UI","ar":"استحوذ على هندسة نظام التصميم لإنشاء أساسيات واجهة المستخدم المتسقة والقابلة للتحجيم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建设计令牌以实现一致的颜色、字体和间距","使用CSS自定义属性实现浅色/深色主题切换","构建多品牌主题系统","建立设计到代码的工作流","创建语义化的组件库"],"ja":["デザイントークンを作成して一貫した色、フォント、間隔を実現","CSSカスタムプロパティを使用してライト/ダークテーマ切替を実装","マルチブランドテーマシステムを構築","デザインからコードへのワークフローを確立","セマンティックなコンポーネントライブラリを作成"],"ko":["디자인 토큰을 생성하여 일관된 색상, 글꼴 및 간격을 구현","CSS 커스텀 속성을 사용하여 라이트/다크 테마 전환을 구현","다중 브랜드 테마 시스템을 구축","디자인에서 코드로의 워크플ロー 구축","시맨틱한 컴포넌트 라이브러리를 생성"],"es":["Creación de tokens de diseño para colores, tipografía y espaciado","Implementación de temas claros y oscuros con propiedades personalizadas de CSS","Creación de sistemas de temas multi-marca","Arquitectura de bibliotecas de componentes con APIs coherentes","Establecimiento de flujos de trabajo de diseño a código con tokens de Figma","Creación de componentes semánticos"],"fr":["Création de jetons de conception pour les couleurs, la typographie et l''espacement","Mise en œuvre de thèmes clairs et sombres avec des propriétés CSS personnalisées","Création de systèmes de thèmes multi-marque","Architecture de bibliothèques de composants avec des API cohérentes","Établissement de flux de travail de conception à code avec des jetons Figma","Création de composants sémantiques"],"de":["Erstellung von Design-Tokens für Farben, Typografie und Abstände","Implementierung von Hell- und Dunkelthemen mit CSS-Eigenschaften","Erstellung von Multi-Marken-Themen-Systemen","Architektur von Komponentenbibliotheken mit konsistenten APIs","Einrichtung von Design-to-Code-Workflows mit Figma-Tokens","Erstellung von semantischen Komponenten"],"pt":["Criação de tokens de design","Implementação de tema claro/escuro com propriedades personalizadas de CSS","Criação de sistemas de marca múltipla","Arquitetura de bibliotecas de componentes com APIs consistentes","Estabelecimento de fluxos de trabalho de design para código com tokens do Figma","Criação de componentes semânticos"],"ru":["Создание токенов дизайна","Реализация светлой/темной темы с помощью пользовательских свойств CSS","Создание многобрендовых систем","Архитектура библиотек компонентов с последовательными API","Установление рабочих процессов дизайна-кода с помощью токенов Figma","Создание семантических компонентов"],"ar":["إنشاء رموز التصميم","تنفيذ نمط明/مظلم باستخدام خصائص مخصصة من CSS","إنشاء أنظمة علامة متعددة","هندسة مكتبات المكونات ذات واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتسقة","إنشاء سير عمل التصميم-الرمز مع رموز الفيجما","إنشاء مكونات دلالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计系统模式","UI基础","一致性","可维护性","可扩展性","Web开发","移动开发","设计到代码"],"ja":["デザインシステムパターン","UI基盤","一貫性","メンテナンス性","拡張性","Web開発","モバイル開発","デザインからコード"],"ko":["디자인 시스템 패턴","UI 基盤","일관성","유지 보수성","확장성","웹 개발","모바일 개발","디자인에서 코드"],"es":["patrones de sistema de diseño","UI escalable","diseño de UI","tokens de diseño","temas claros y oscuros","bibliotecas de componentes","flujos de trabajo de diseño a código","desarrollo de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["modèles de système de conception","UI évolutif","conception d''UI","jetons de conception","thèmes clairs et sombres","bibliothèques de composants","flux de travail de conception à code","développement d''applications web et mobiles"],"de":["Design-System-Muster","skalierbare UI","UI-Design","Design-Tokens","Hell- und Dunkelthemen","Komponentenbibliotheken","Design-to-Code-Workflows","Entwicklung von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["padrões de sistema de design","arquitetura de ui","design tokens","tema claro/escuro","sistemas de marca múltipla","bibliotecas de componentes","fluxos de trabalho de design para código"],"ru":["шаблоны системы дизайна","архитектура ui","токены дизайна","светлая/темная тема","многобрендовые системы","библиотеки компонентов","рабочие процессы дизайна-кода"],"ar":["أنماط نظام التصميم","هندسة واجهة المستخدم","رموز التصميم","نمط明/مظلم","أنظمة علامة متعددة","مكتبات المكونات","سير عمل التصميم-الرمز"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-system-patterns","description":"Build scalable design systems with design tokens, theming infrastructure, and component architecture patterns. Use when creating design tokens, implementing theme switching, building component libraries, or establishing design system foundations.","bodyPreview":"# Design System Patterns\n\nMaster design system architecture to create consistent, maintainable, and scalable UI foundations across web and mobile applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating design tokens for colors, typography, spacing, and shadows\n- Implementing light/dark theme switching with CSS custom properties\n- Building multi-brand theming systems\n- Architecting component libraries with consistent APIs\n- Establishing design-to-code workflows with Figma tokens\n- Creating semantic","body":"# Design System Patterns\n\nMaster design system architecture to create consistent, maintainable, and scalable UI foundations across web and mobile applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating design tokens for colors, typography, spacing, and shadows\n- Implementing light/dark theme switching with CSS custom properties\n- Building multi-brand theming systems\n- Architecting component libraries with consistent APIs\n- Establishing design-to-code workflows with Figma tokens\n- Creating semantic token hierarchies (primitive, semantic, component)\n- Setting up design system documentation and guidelines\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Design Tokens\n\n- Primitive tokens (raw values: colors, sizes, fonts)\n- Semantic tokens (contextual meaning: text-primary, surface-elevated)\n- Component tokens (specific usage: button-bg, card-border)\n- Token naming conventions and organization\n- Multi-platform token generation (CSS, iOS, Android)\n\n### 2. Theming Infrastructure\n\n- CSS custom properties architecture\n- Theme context providers in React\n- Dynamic theme switching\n- System preference detection (prefers-color-scheme)\n- Persistent theme storage\n- Reduced motion and high contrast modes\n\n### 3. Component Architecture\n\n- Compound component patterns\n- Polymorphic components (as prop)\n- Variant and size systems\n- Slot-based composition\n- Headless UI patterns\n- Style props and responsive variants\n\n### 4. Token Pipeline\n\n- Figma to code synchronization\n- Style Dictionary configuration\n- Token transformation and formatting\n- CI/CD integration for token updates\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\n// Design tokens with CSS custom properties\nconst tokens = {\n  colors: {\n    // Primitive tokens\n    gray: {\n      50: \"#fafafa\",\n      100: \"#f5f5f5\",\n      900: \"#171717\",\n    },\n    blue: {\n      500: \"#3b82f6\",\n      600: \"#2563eb\",\n    },\n  },\n  // Semantic tokens (reference primitives)\n  semantic: {\n    light: {\n      \"text-primary\": \"var(--color-gray-900)\",\n      \"text-secondary\": \"var(--color-gray-600)\",\n      \"surface-default\": \"var(--color-white)\",\n      \"surface-elevated\": \"var(--color-gray-50)\",\n      \"border-default\": \"var(--color-gray-200)\",\n      \"interactive-primary\": \"var(--color-blue-500)\",\n    },\n    dark: {\n      \"text-primary\": \"var(--color-gray-50)\",\n      \"text-secondary\": \"var(--color-gray-400)\",\n      \"surface-default\": \"var(--color-gray-900)\",\n      \"surface-elevated\": \"var(--color-gray-800)\",\n      \"border-default\": \"var(--color-gray-700)\",\n      \"interactive-primary\": \"var(--color-blue-400)\",\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Token Hierarchy\n\n```css\n/* Layer 1: Primitive tokens (raw values) */\n:root {\n  --color-blue-500: #3b82f6;\n  --color-blue-600: #2563eb;\n  --color-gray-50: #fafafa;\n  --color-gray-900: #171717;\n\n  --space-1: 0.25rem;\n  --space-2: 0.5rem;\n  --space-4: 1rem;\n\n  --font-size-sm: 0.875rem;\n  --font-size-base: 1rem;\n  --font-size-lg: 1.125rem;\n\n  --radius-sm: 0.25rem;\n  --radius-md: 0.5rem;\n  --radius-lg: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* Layer 2: Semantic tokens (meaning) */\n:root {\n  --text-primary: var(--color-gray-900);\n  --text-secondary: var(--color-gray-600);\n  --surface-default: white;\n  --interactive-primary: var(--color-blue-500);\n  --interactive-primary-hover: var(--color-blue-600);\n}\n\n/* Layer 3: Component tokens (specific usage) */\n:root {\n  --button-bg: var(--interactive-primary);\n  --button-bg-hover: var(--interactive-primary-hover);\n  --button-text: white;\n  --button-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  --button-padding-x: var(--space-4);\n  --button-padding-y: var(--space-2);\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Theme Switching with React\n\n```tsx\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\n\ntype Theme = \"light\" | \"dark\" | \"system\";\n\ninterface ThemeContextValue {\n  theme: Theme;\n  resolvedTheme: \"light\" | \"dark\";\n  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => void;\n}\n\nconst ThemeContext = createContext<ThemeContextValue | null>(null);\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<Theme>(() => {\n    if (typeof window !== \"undefined\") {\n      return (localStorage.getItem(\"theme\") as Theme) || \"system\";\n    }\n    return \"system\";\n  });\n\n  const [resolvedTheme, setResolvedTheme] = useState<\"light\" | \"dark\">(\"light\");\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = document.documentElement;\n\n    const applyTheme = (isDark: boolean) => {\n      root.classList.remove(\"light\", \"dark\");\n      root.classList.add(isDark ? \"dark\" : \"light\");\n      setResolvedTheme(isDark ? \"dark\" : \"light\");\n    };\n\n    if (theme === \"system\") {\n      const mediaQuery = window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\");\n      applyTheme(mediaQuery.matches);\n\n      const handler = (e: MediaQueryListEvent) => applyTheme(e.matches);\n      mediaQuery.addEventListener(\"change\", handler);\n      return () => mediaQuery.removeEventListener(\"change\", handler);\n    } else {\n      applyTheme(theme === \"dark\");\n    }\n  }, [theme]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    localStorage.setItem(\"theme\", theme);\n  }, [theme]);\n\n  return (\n    <ThemeContext.Provider value={{ theme, resolvedTheme, setTheme }}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeContext.Provider>\n  );\n}\n\nexport const useTheme = () => {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeContext);\n  if (!context) throw new Error(\"useTheme must be used within ThemeProvider\");\n  return context;\n};\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Variant System with CVA\n\n```tsx\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\";\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\";\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  // Base styles\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive:\n          \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline:\n          \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground\",\n        secondary:\n          \"bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80\",\n        ghost: \"hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground\",\n        link: \"text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        sm: \"h-9 px-3 text-sm\",\n        md: \"h-10 px-4 text-sm\",\n        lg: \"h-11 px-8 text-base\",\n        icon: \"h-10 w-10\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"md\",\n    },\n  },\n);\n\ninterface ButtonProps\n  extends\n    React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport function Button({ className, variant, size, ...props }: ButtonProps) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Style Dictionary Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// style-dictionary.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  source: [\"tokens/**/*.json\"],\n  platforms: {\n    css: {\n      transformGroup: \"css\",\n      buildPath: \"dist/css/\",\n      files: [\n        {\n          destination: \"variables.css\",\n          format: \"css/variables\",\n          options: {\n            outputReferences: true, // Preserve token references\n          },\n        },\n      ],\n    },\n    scss: {\n      transformGroup: \"scss\",\n      buildPath: \"dist/scss/\",\n      files: [\n        {\n          destination: \"_variables.scss\",\n          format: \"scss/variables\",\n        },\n      ],\n    },\n    ios: {\n      transformGroup: \"ios-swift\",\n      buildPath: \"dist/ios/\",\n      files: [\n        {\n          destination: \"DesignTokens.swift\",\n          format: \"ios-swift/class.swift\",\n          className: \"DesignTokens\",\n        },\n      ],\n    },\n    android: {\n      transformGroup: \"android\",\n      buildPath: \"dist/android/\",\n      files: [\n        {\n          destination: \"colors.xml\",\n          format: \"android/colors\",\n          filter: { attributes: { category: \"color\" } },\n        },\n      ],\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Name Tokens by Purpose**: Use semantic names (text-primary) not visual descriptions (dark-gray)\n2. **Maintain Token Hierarchy**: Primitives > Semantic > Component tokens\n3. **Document Token Usage**: Include usage guidelines with token definitions\n4. **Version Tokens**: Treat token changes as API changes with semver\n5. **Test Theme Combinations**: Verify all themes work with all components\n6. **Automate Token Pipeline**: CI/CD for Figma-to-code synchronization\n7. **Provide Migration Paths**: Deprecate tokens gradually with clear alternatives\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Token Sprawl**: Too many tokens without clear hierarchy\n- **Inconsistent Naming**: Mixed conventions (camelCase vs kebab-case)\n- **Missing Dark Mode**: Tokens that don''t adapt to theme changes\n- **Hardcoded Values**: Using raw values instead of tokens\n- **Circular References**: Tokens referencing each other in loops\n- **Platform Gaps**: Tokens missing for some platforms (web but not mobile)\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Style Dictionary Documentation](https://amzn.github.io/style-dictionary/)\n- [Tokens Studio for Figma](https://tokens.studio/)\n- [Design Tokens W3C Spec](https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/)\n- [Radix UI Themes](https://www.radix-ui.com/themes)\n- [shadcn/ui Theming](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/theming)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:03:38.901Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced UI foundation architecture and design system implementation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI 基础架构和设计系统实现的前端智能体。","ja":"高度なUI基盤アーキテクチャとデザインシステムの実装を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 UI 기반 아키텍처 및 디자인 시스템 구현이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren una arquitectura de base de interfaz de usuario avanzada y una implementación de sistema de diseño.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant une architecture de base d''interface utilisateur avancée et une mise en œuvre de système de conception.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Benutzeroberflächen-Architektur und eine Implementierung eines Designsystems benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que requerem uma arquitetura de fundação de interface do usuário avançada e implementação de sistema de design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, требующих продвинутой архитектуры пользовательского интерфейса и реализации системы дизайна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى أساس معماري متقدم لويب وتنفيذ نظام التصميم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create consistent and scalable UI foundations by implementing design tokens, CSS custom properties, and multi-brand theming systems, while establishing seamless design-to-code workflows with Figma tokens and architecting component libraries with consistent APIs.","zh":"通过实现设计令牌、CSS 自定义属性和多品牌主题系统，使智能体能够创建一致且可扩展的 UI 基础，同时利用 Figma 令牌建立无缝的设计到代码工作流程，并使用一致的 API 构建组件库。","ja":"デザイントークン、CSSカスタムプロパティ、マルチブランドテーマシステムを実装することで、エージェントが一貫性と拡張性のあるUI基盤を作成できるようにし、Figmaトークンを使用したシームレスなデザインからコードへのワークフローを確立し、一貫したAPIでコンポーネントライブラリを構築します。","ko":"디자인 토큰, CSS 사용자 지정 속성 및 다중 브랜드 테마 시스템을 구현하여 에이전트가 일관되고 확장 가능한 UI 기반을 생성할 수 있도록 지원하며, Figma 토큰을 사용하여 원활한 디자인-코드 워크플로를 구축하고 일관된 API로 구성 요소 라이브러리를 설계합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear bases de interfaz de usuario consistentes y escalables implementando tokens de diseño, propiedades personalizadas de CSS y sistemas de temáticas multi-marca, al tiempo que establecen flujos de trabajo de diseño a código sin problemas con tokens de Figma y arquitectura de bibliotecas de componentes con API coherentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fondations d''interface utilisateur cohérentes et évolutives en mettant en œuvre des jetons de conception, des propriétés CSS personnalisées et des systèmes de thèmes multi-marque, tout en établissant des flux de travail de conception à code sans rupture avec des jetons Figma et en architecturant des bibliothèques de composants avec des API cohérentes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, konsistente und skalierbare Benutzeroberflächenbasen zu erstellen, indem Design-Tokens, benutzerdefinierte CSS-Eigenschaften und Multi-Brand-Theming-Systeme implementiert werden, während nahtlose Design-to-Code-Workflows mit Figma-Tokens und die Architektur von Komponentenbibliotheken mit konsistenten APIs etabliert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar fundamentos de interface do usuário consistentes e escaláveis implementando tokens de design, propriedades personalizadas CSS e sistemas de temas multi-marcas, enquanto estabelece fluxos de trabalho de design para código sem problemas com tokens Figma e arquitetura de bibliotecas de componentes com APIs consistentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать последовательные и масштабируемые основы пользовательского интерфейса, реализуя токены дизайна, пользовательские свойства CSS и системы тем для нескольких брендов, а также устанавливая беспрепятственные рабочие процессы дизайна-кода с помощью токенов Figma и архитектуры библиотек компонентов с последовательными API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء أسس لويب متسقة ومقabweة من خلال تنفيذ رموز التصميم والخصائص المخصصة لسي إس إس وأنظمة التمثيل المتعددة للعلامات التجارية، مع تقديم سير عمل التصميم إلى التعليمات البرمجية بسلاسة مع رموز Figma وتصميم مكتبات المكونات مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متسقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing light and dark theme switching with CSS custom properties","Building multi-brand theming systems for diverse applications","Establishing design-to-code workflows with Figma tokens for efficient development"],"zh":["使用 CSS 自定义属性实现明暗主题切换","为多样化应用程序构建多品牌主题系统","利用 Figma 令牌建立高效的设计到代码工作流程"],"ja":["CSSカスタムプロパティを使用したライト/ダークテーマの切り替えの実装","多様なアプリケーション向けのマルチブランドテーマシステムの構築","効率的な開発のためのFigmaトークンを使用したデザインからコードへのワークフローの確立"],"ko":["CSS 사용자 지정 속성을 사용한 라이트 및 다크 테마 전환 구현","다양한 애플리케이션을 위한 다중 브랜드 테마 시스템 구축","효율적인 개발을 위해 Figma 토큰으로 디자인-코드 워크플로 구축"],"es":["Implementar la conmutación de temas claros y oscuros con propiedades personalizadas de CSS","Crear sistemas de temáticas multi-marca para aplicaciones diversas","Establecer flujos de trabajo de diseño a código con tokens de Figma para un desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la commutation de thèmes clairs et sombres avec des propriétés CSS personnalisées","Créer des systèmes de thèmes multi-marque pour des applications diverses","Établir des flux de travail de conception à code avec des jetons Figma pour un développement efficace"],"de":["Umsetzen des Umschaltens zwischen hellen und dunklen Designs mit benutzerdefinierten CSS-Eigenschaften","Erstellen von Multi-Brand-Theming-Systemen für verschiedene Anwendungen","Einrichten von Design-to-Code-Workflows mit Figma-Tokens für eine effiziente Entwicklung"],"pt":["Implementação de alternância de temas claros e escuros com propriedades personalizadas CSS","Construção de sistemas de temas multi-marcas para aplicações diversas","Estabelecimento de fluxos de trabalho de design para código com tokens Figma para desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Реализация переключения светлой и темной темы с помощью пользовательских свойств CSS","Создание систем тем для нескольких брендов для различных приложений","Установление беспрепятственных рабочих процессов дизайна-кода с помощью токенов Figma для эффективного развития"],"ar":["تنفيذ تبديل المواضيع الفاتحة والداكنة باستخدام الخصائص المخصصة لسي إس إس","بناء أنظمة التمثيل المتعددة للعلامات التجارية لتطبيقات متنوعة","تحقيق سير عمل التصميم إلى التعليمات البرمجية بسلاسة مع رموز Figma من أجل التطوير الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of CSS and design principles","Limited to web and mobile application UI design"],"zh":["需要具备 CSS 和设计原则的知识","仅限于 Web 和移动应用程序的 UI 设计"],"ja":["CSSとデザイン原則の知識が必要","WebおよびモバイルアプリケーションのUIデザインに限定される"],"ko":["CSS 및 디자인 원칙에 대한 지식 필요","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 UI 디자인으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de CSS y principios de diseño","Limitado al diseño de interfaz de usuario de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en CSS et des principes de conception","Limité à la conception d''interface utilisateur d''applications web et mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von CSS und Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf die Benutzeroberflächengestaltung von Web- und Mobilanwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de CSS e princípios de design","Limitado ao design de interface do usuário para aplicativos web e móveis"],"ru":["Требует знания CSS и принципов дизайна","Ограничен дизайном пользовательского интерфейса для веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة سي إس إس ومبادئ التصميم","محدود بتصميم واجهة المستخدم لتطبيقات الويب والجوال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
