iew TypeScript und React","pt":"Revisão de Código TypeScript e React 19","ru":"Проверка кода TypeScript и React 19","ar":"مراجعة كود TypeScript و React 19","en":"typescript-react-reviewer"},"description":{"zh":"TypeScript React 代码审查专家，提供专业的代码审查服务，确保代码质量和可维护性","ja":"TypeScript React コードレビューエキスパート、専門的なコードレビューサービスを提供して、コードの品質とメンテナンス性を確保","ko":"타입스크립트 리액트 코드 리뷰 전문가, 전문적인 코드 리뷰 서비스를 제공하여 코드 품질과 유지 보수성을 보장","es":"Nuestro experto en revisión de código TypeScript y React ayuda a identificar y solucionar problemas críticos en su código, mejorando la arquitectura y el ren...","fr":"Notre expert en révision de code TypeScript et React aide à identifier et résoudre les problèmes critiques dans votre code, améliorant l''architecture et les ...","de":"Unser Experte für Code-Review TypeScript und React hilft bei der Identifizierung und Lösung kritischer Probleme in Ihrem Code, verbessert die Architektur und...","pt":"O especialista em revisão de código TypeScript e React 19 é um expert em revisar códigos com conhecimento profundo das novas funcionalidades do React 19 e da...","ru":"Проверка кода TypeScript и React 19 - это эксперт в проверке кода с глубоким пониманием новых функций React 19 и лучших практик TypeScript.","ar":"خبير مراجعة كود TypeScript و React 19 هو خبير في مراجعة الأكواد مع معرفة عميقة بالخصائص الجديدة ل React 19 وأفضل الممارسات ل TypeScript.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持React 19的新功能","遵循TypeScript最佳实践","状态管理模式优化","常见反模式检测","代码质量和可维护性保证"],"ja":["React 19の新機能をサポート","TypeScriptのベストプラクティスに従う","状態管理パターンの最適化","一般的な反パターンの検出","コードの品質とメンテナンス性の保証"],"ko":["리액트 19의 새로운 기능 지원","타입스크립트 모범 사례 준수","상태 관리 패턴 최적화","일반적인 반 패턴 감지","코드 품질과 유지 보수성 보장"],"es":["Revisión de código crítico","Identificación de problemas de arquitectura","Mejora del rendimiento","Análisis de patrones de estado","Detección de anti-patrones comunes"],"fr":["Révision de code critique","Identification de problèmes d''architecture","Amélioration des performances","Analyse de modèles d''état","Détection de anti-modèles courants"],"de":["Überprüfung von kritischen Code","Identifizierung von Architekturproblemen","Leistungsverbesserung","Analyse von Zustandsmustern","Erkennung von häufigen Anti-Mustern"],"pt":["Conhecimento profundo das novas funcionalidades do React 19","Melhores práticas do TypeScript","Padrões de gerenciamento de estado","Anti-padrões comuns","Revisão de código crítica para evitar bugs e vazamentos de memória"],"ru":["Глубокое понимание новых функций React 19","Лучшие практики TypeScript","Шаблоны управления состоянием","Распространенные анти-паттерны","Критическая проверка кода для предотвращения ошибок и утечек памяти"],"ar":["معرفة عميقة بالخصائص الجديدة ل React 19","أفضل الممارسات ل TypeScript","أنماط إدارة الحالة","المواضيع المضادة الشائعة","مراجعة كود حرجة لتجنب الأخطاء وتسربات الذاكرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript","React","代码审查","代码质量","可维护性","状态管理","反模式","最佳实践"],"ja":["TypeScript","React","コードレビュー","コード品質","メンテナンス性","状態管理","反パターン","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["타입스크립트","리액트","코드 리뷰","코드 품질","유지 보수성","상태 관리","반 패턴","모범 사례"],"es":["revisión de código","TypeScript","React","arquitectura de software","patrones de estado","anti-patrones","optimización de código","mejora de rendimiento"],"fr":["révision de code","TypeScript","React","architecture logicielle","modèles d''état","anti-modèles","optimisation de code","amélioration des performances"],"de":["Code-Review","TypeScript","React","Softwarearchitektur","Zustandsmuster","Anti-Muster","Code-Optimierung","Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["TypeScript","React 19","revisão de código","melhores práticas","gerenciamento de estado","anti-padrões","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","manutenção de código"],"ru":["TypeScript","React 19","проверка кода","лучшие практики","управление состоянием","анти-паттерны","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","обслуживание кода"],"ar":["TypeScript","React 19","مراجعة كود","أفضل الممارسات","إدارة الحالة","المواضيع المضادة","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","صيانة الكود"]}},"owner":"multideskio","repo":"vinha_admin_center","repoPath":"multideskio/vinha_admin_center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"typescript-react-reviewer","description":"Expert code reviewer for TypeScript + React 19 applications. Use when reviewing React code, identifying anti-patterns, evaluating state management, or assessing code maintainability. Triggers: code review requests, PR reviews, React architecture evaluation, identifying code smells, TypeScript type safety checks, useEffect abuse detection, state management review.","bodyPreview":"# TypeScript + React 19 Code Review Expert\n\nExpert code reviewer with deep knowledge of React 19''s new features, TypeScript best practices, state management patterns, and common anti-patterns.\n\n## Review Priority Levels\n\n### 🚫 Critical (Block Merge)\n\nThese issues cause bugs, memory leaks, or architectural problems:\n\n| Issue                                          | Why It''s Critical                   |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `","body":"# TypeScript + React 19 Code Review Expert\n\nExpert code reviewer with deep knowledge of React 19''s new features, TypeScript best practices, state management patterns, and common anti-patterns.\n\n## Review Priority Levels\n\n### 🚫 Critical (Block Merge)\n\nThese issues cause bugs, memory leaks, or architectural problems:\n\n| Issue                                          | Why It''s Critical                   |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `useEffect` for derived state                  | Extra render cycle, sync bugs       |\n| Missing cleanup in `useEffect`                 | Memory leaks                        |\n| Direct state mutation (`.push()`, `.splice()`) | Silent update failures              |\n| Conditional hook calls                         | Breaks Rules of Hooks               |\n| `key={index}` in dynamic lists                 | State corruption on reorder         |\n| `any` type without justification               | Type safety bypass                  |\n| `useFormStatus` in same component as `<form>`  | Always returns false (React 19 bug) |\n| Promise created inside render with `use()`     | Infinite loop                       |\n\n### ⚠️ High Priority\n\n| Issue                                         | Impact                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| Incomplete dependency arrays                  | Stale closures, missing updates |\n| Props typed as `any`                          | Runtime errors                  |\n| Unjustified `useMemo`/`useCallback`           | Unnecessary complexity          |\n| Missing Error Boundaries                      | Poor error UX                   |\n| Controlled input initialized with `undefined` | React warning                   |\n\n### 📝 Architecture/Style\n\n| Issue                             | Recommendation                |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Component > 300 lines             | Split into smaller components |\n| Prop drilling > 2-3 levels        | Use composition or context    |\n| State far from usage              | Colocate state                |\n| Custom hooks without `use` prefix | Follow naming convention      |\n\n## Quick Detection Patterns\n\n### useEffect Abuse (Most Common Anti-Pattern)\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Derived state in useEffect\nconst [firstName, setFirstName] = useState('''')\nconst [fullName, setFullName] = useState('''')\nuseEffect(() => {\n  setFullName(firstName + '' '' + lastName)\n}, [firstName, lastName])\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Compute during render\nconst fullName = firstName + '' '' + lastName\n```\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Event logic in useEffect\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (product.isInCart) showNotification(''Added!'')\n}, [product])\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Logic in event handler\nfunction handleAddToCart() {\n  addToCart(product)\n  showNotification(''Added!'')\n}\n```\n\n### React 19 Hook Mistakes\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: useFormStatus in form component (always returns false)\nfunction Form() {\n  const { pending } = useFormStatus();\n  return <form action={submit}><button disabled={pending}>Send</button></form>;\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: useFormStatus in child component\nfunction SubmitButton() {\n  const { pending } = useFormStatus();\n  return <button type=\"submit\" disabled={pending}>Send</button>;\n}\nfunction Form() {\n  return <form action={submit}><SubmitButton /></form>;\n}\n```\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Promise created in render (infinite loop)\nfunction Component() {\n  const data = use(fetch(''/api/data'')) // New promise every render!\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Promise from props or state\nfunction Component({ dataPromise }: { dataPromise: Promise<Data> }) {\n  const data = use(dataPromise)\n}\n```\n\n### State Mutation Detection\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Mutations (no re-render)\nitems.push(newItem)\nsetItems(items)\n\narr[i] = newValue\nsetArr(arr)\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Immutable updates\nsetItems([...items, newItem])\nsetArr(arr.map((x, idx) => (idx === i ? newValue : x)))\n```\n\n### TypeScript Red Flags\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Red flags to catch\nconst data: any = response // Unsafe any\nconst items = arr[10] // Missing undefined check\nconst App: React.FC<Props> = () => {} // Discouraged pattern\n\n// ✅ Preferred patterns\nconst data: ResponseType = response\nconst items = arr[10] // with noUncheckedIndexedAccess\nconst App = ({ prop }: Props) => {} // Explicit props\n```\n\n## Review Workflow\n\n1. **Scan for critical issues first** - Check for the patterns in \"Critical (Block Merge)\" section\n2. **Check React 19 usage** - See [react19-patterns.md](references/react19-patterns.md) for new API patterns\n3. **Evaluate state management** - Is state colocated? Server state vs client state separation?\n4. **Assess TypeScript safety** - Generic components, discriminated unions, strict config\n5. **Review for maintainability** - Component size, hook design, folder structure\n\n## Reference Documents\n\nFor detailed patterns and examples:\n\n- **[react19-patterns.md](references/react19-patterns.md)** - React 19 new hooks (useActionState, useOptimistic, use), Server/Client Component boundaries\n- **[antipatterns.md](references/antipatterns.md)** - Comprehensive anti-pattern catalog with fixes\n- **[checklist.md](references/checklist.md)** - Full code review checklist for thorough reviews\n\n## State Management Quick Guide\n\n| Data Type                  | Solution                                   |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Server/async data          | TanStack Query (never copy to local state) |\n| Simple global UI state     | Zustand (~1KB, no Provider)                |\n| Fine-grained derived state | Jotai (~2.4KB)                             |\n| Component-local state      | useState/useReducer                        |\n| Form state                 | React 19 useActionState                    |\n\n### TanStack Query Anti-Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER copy server data to local state\nconst { data } = useQuery({ queryKey: [''todos''], queryFn: fetchTodos })\nconst [todos, setTodos] = useState([])\nuseEffect(() => setTodos(data), [data])\n\n// ✅ Query IS the source of truth\nconst { data: todos } = useQuery({ queryKey: [''todos''], queryFn: fetchTodos })\n```\n\n## TypeScript Config Recommendations\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true,\n    \"noImplicitReturns\": true,\n    \"exactOptionalPropertyTypes\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`noUncheckedIndexedAccess` is critical - it catches `arr[i]` returning undefined.\n\n## Immediate Red Flags\n\nWhen reviewing, flag these immediately:\n\n| Pattern                                      | Problem                     | Fix                |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `eslint-disable react-hooks/exhaustive-deps` | Hides stale closure bugs    | Refactor logic     |\n| Component defined inside component           | Remounts every render       | Move outside       |\n| `useState(undefined)` for inputs             | Uncontrolled warning        | Use empty string   |\n| `React.FC` with generics                     | Generic inference breaks    | Use explicit props |\n| Barrel files (`index.ts`) in app code        | Bundle bloat, circular deps | Direct imports     |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:04:23.577Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expert TypeScript and React 19 code review capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要专家级 TypeScript 和 React 19 代码审查能力的前端智能体。","ja":"TypeScript と React 19 の専門的なコードレビュー機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전문적인 TypeScript 및 React 19 코드 검토 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de revisión de código expertas en TypeScript y React 19.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités d''examen de code expertes en TypeScript et React 19.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Expertenfähigkeiten zur Code-Überprüfung in TypeScript und React 19 benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de especialistas em revisão de código TypeScript e React 19.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются экспертные возможности проверки кода TypeScript и React 19.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلىخبراء في مراجعة كود TypeScript و React 19."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify critical issues in React 19 codebases, applying TypeScript best practices and state management patterns to prevent bugs, memory leaks, and architectural problems, ensuring high-quality code deployments using TypeScript and React 19''s new features.","zh":"赋能智能体识别 React 19 代码库中的关键问题，应用 TypeScript 最佳实践和状态管理模式，以防止错误、内存泄漏和架构问题，确保利用 TypeScript 和 React 19 的新功能进行高质量的代码部署。","ja":"React 19 コードベースの重大な問題を特定し、TypeScript のベストプラクティスと状態管理パターンを適用して、バグ、メモリリーク、アーキテクチャ上の問題を防止し、TypeScript と React 19 の新機能を使用した高品質なコードデプロイを保証するようにエージェントを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 React 19 코드베이스의 중요한 문제를 식별하고, TypeScript 최적의 방법 및 상태 관리 패턴을 적용하여 버그, 메모리 누수 및 아키텍처 문제를 방지하며, TypeScript와 React 19의 새로운 기능을 사용하여 고품질 코드 배포를 보장하도록 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas críticos en las bases de código de React 19, aplicando las mejores prácticas de TypeScript y patrones de gestión de estado para prevenir errores, fugas de memoria y problemas arquitectónicos, garantizando implementaciones de código de alta calidad utilizando las nuevas funciones de TypeScript y React 19.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes critiques dans les bases de code React 19, en appliquant les meilleures pratiques de TypeScript et les modèles de gestion d''état pour prévenir les bogues, les fuites de mémoire et les problèmes d''architecture, en garantissant des déploiements de code de haute qualité en utilisant les nouvelles fonctionnalités de TypeScript et React 19.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kritische Probleme in React-19-Codebasen zu identifizieren, indem es die besten Praktiken von TypeScript und Muster zur Zustandsverwaltung anwendet, um Fehler, Speicherlecks und Architekturprobleme zu vermeiden und eine hochwertige Code-Implementierung unter Verwendung der neuen Funktionen von TypeScript und React 19 sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas críticos em repositórios de código React 19, aplicando as melhores práticas do TypeScript e padrões de gerenciamento de estado para prevenir bugs, vazamentos de memória e problemas arquiteturais, garantindo implantações de código de alta qualidade usando os novos recursos do TypeScript e React 19.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять критические проблемы в кодовых базах React 19, применяя лучшие практики TypeScript и шаблоны управления состоянием для предотвращения ошибок, утечек памяти и архитектурных проблем, обеспечивая высококачественные развертывания кода с использованием новых функций TypeScript и React 19.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد المشاكل الحرجة في قواعد كود React 19، بتطبيق أفضل الممارسات ل TypeScript وأنماط إدارة الحالة لمنع العلل وتسربات الذاكرة والمشاكل المعمارية، وضمان نشرات كود عالية الجودة باستخدام الميزات الجديدة من TypeScript و React 19."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing React 19 code for critical issues","Applying TypeScript best practices to existing codebases","Identifying and preventing common anti-patterns in state management"],"zh":["审查 React 19 代码以发现关键问题","将 TypeScript 最佳实践应用于现有代码库","识别并防止状态管理中的常见反模式"],"ja":["React 19 コードの重大な問題のレビュー","既存のコードベースへの TypeScript ベストプラクティスの適用","状態管理における一般的なアンチパターンの特定と防止"],"ko":["React 19 코드의 중요한 문제 검토","기존 코드베이스에 TypeScript 최적의 방법 적용","상태 관리에서 일반적인 안티패턴 식별 및 방지"],"es":["Revisar el código de React 19 en busca de problemas críticos","Aplicar las mejores prácticas de TypeScript a bases de código existentes","Identificar y prevenir patrones comunes antipatrones en la gestión de estado"],"fr":["Examiner le code React 19 pour les problèmes critiques","Appliquer les meilleures pratiques de TypeScript aux bases de code existantes","Identifier et prévenir les antipatrons courants dans la gestion d''état"],"de":["Überprüfen des React-19-Codes auf kritische Probleme","Anwenden der besten Praktiken von TypeScript auf bestehende Codebasen","Identifizieren und Vermeiden häufiger Antimuster in der Zustandsverwaltung"],"pt":["Revisar o código React 19 para problemas críticos","Aplicar as melhores práticas do TypeScript a repositórios de código existentes","Identificar e prevenir anti-padrões comuns no gerenciamento de estado"],"ru":["Проверка кода React 19 на критические проблемы","Применение лучших практик TypeScript к существующим кодовым базам","Определение и предотвращение распространенных анти-шаблонов в управлении состоянием"],"ar":["مراجعة كود React 19 للعثور على المشاكل الحرجة","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات ل TypeScript على قواعد كود موجودة","تحديد ومنع أنماط مضادة شائعة في إدارة الحالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React 19 and TypeScript","Focused on code review and not code generation or development"],"zh":["需要具备 React 19 和 TypeScript 的知识","专注于代码审查而非代码生成或开发"],"ja":["React 19 と TypeScript の知識が必要","コード生成や開発ではなく、コードレビューに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["React 19 및 TypeScript 지식 필요","코드 생성이나 개발이 아닌 코드 검토에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React 19 y TypeScript","Se centra en la revisión de código y no en la generación o desarrollo de código"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React 19 et TypeScript","Se concentre sur l''examen de code et non sur la génération ou le développement de code"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React 19 und TypeScript","Konzentriert sich auf die Code-Überprüfung und nicht auf die Code-Generierung oder -Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React 19 e TypeScript","Focado em revisão de código e não em geração ou desenvolvimento de código"],"ru":["Требует знаний React 19 и TypeScript","Сосредоточен на проверке кода, а не на генерации или разработке кода"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React 19 و TypeScript","مركز على مراجعة الكود وليس على توليد أو تطوير الكود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
