e alta carga de tokens","Baja densidad de información","Delegación a subagentes para evitar el agotamiento del presupuesto de contexto","Optimización del rendimiento","Compatibilidad con archivos JSON de gran tamaño"],"fr":["Fichiers JSON à forte charge de tokens","Faible densité d''information","Délégation aux sous-agents pour éviter l''épuisement du budget de contexte","Optimisation des performances","Compatibilité avec des fichiers JSON de grande taille"],"de":["JSON-Dateien mit hoher Tokenlast","Niedrige Informationsdichte","Delegation an Subagenten, um den Verbrauch des Kontextbudgets zu vermeiden","Leistungsoptimierung","Kompatibilität mit großen JSON-Dateien"],"pt":["Otimização de arquivos JSON","Redução do custo de tokens","Melhoria do desempenho","Delegação a subagentes","Isolamento do consumo de contexto","Suporte a arquivos grandes"],"ru":["Оптимизация файлов JSON","Снижение стоимости токенов","Улучшение производительности","Делегирование субагентам","Изоляция потребления контекста","Поддержка крупных файлов"],"ar":["تحسين ملفات JSON","تقليل تكلفة الرموز","تحسين الأداء","تفويض الوكلاء الفرعيين","تحديد استهلاك السياق","دعم الملفات الكبيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Excalidraw","子代理委托","开发最佳实践","Excalidraw 文件读取","上下文消耗","开发效率"],"ja":["Excalidraw","サブエージェント委任","開発ベストプラクティス","Excalidraw ファイルの読み取り","コンテキスト消費","開発効率"],"ko":["Excalidraw","서브 에이전트 위임","개발 모범 사례","Excalidraw 파일 읽기","컨텍스트 소비","개발 효율성"],"es":["Excalidraw","optimización de archivos JSON","delegación a subagentes","presupuesto de contexto","rendimiento","desarrollo de software","herramientas de diagramación"],"fr":["Excalidraw","optimisation des fichiers JSON","délégation aux sous-agents","budget de contexte","performances","développement de logiciels","outils de diagramme"],"de":["Excalidraw","Optimierung von JSON-Dateien","Delegation an Subagenten","Kontextbudget","Leistung","Softwareentwicklung","Diagrammtools"],"pt":["Excalidraw","Otimização de arquivos JSON","Redução do custo de tokens","Melhoria do desempenho","Desenvolvimento de software","Arquivos JSON","Subagentes","Isolamento do consumo de contexto"],"ru":["Excalidraw","Оптимизация файлов JSON","Снижение стоимости токенов","Улучшение производительности","Разработка программного обеспечения","Файлы JSON","Субагенты","Изоляция потребления контекста"],"ar":["إكسكاليDRAW","تحسين ملفات JSON","تقليل تكلفة الرموز","تحسين الأداء","تطوير البرمجيات","ملفات JSON","الوكلاء الفرعيين","تحديد استهلاك السياق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.525Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"excalidraw","description":"Use when working with *.excalidraw or *.excalidraw.json files, user mentions diagrams/flowcharts, or requests architecture visualization - delegates all Excalidraw operations to subagents to prevent context exhaustion from verbose JSON (single files: 4k-22k tokens, can exceed read limits)","bodyPreview":"# Excalidraw Subagent Delegation\n\n## Overview\n\n**Core principle:** Main agents NEVER read Excalidraw files directly. Always delegate to subagents to isolate context consumption.\n\nExcalidraw files are JSON with high token cost but low information density. Single files range from 4k-22k tokens (largest can exceed read tool limits). Reading multiple diagrams quickly exhausts context budget (7 files = 67k tokens = 33% of budget).\n\n## The Problem\n\nExcalidraw JSON structure:\n- Each shape has 20+ prope","body":"# Excalidraw Subagent Delegation\n\n## Overview\n\n**Core principle:** Main agents NEVER read Excalidraw files directly. Always delegate to subagents to isolate context consumption.\n\nExcalidraw files are JSON with high token cost but low information density. Single files range from 4k-22k tokens (largest can exceed read tool limits). Reading multiple diagrams quickly exhausts context budget (7 files = 67k tokens = 33% of budget).\n\n## The Problem\n\nExcalidraw JSON structure:\n- Each shape has 20+ properties (x, y, width, height, strokeColor, seed, version, etc.)\n- Most properties are visual metadata (positioning, styling, roughness)\n- Actual content: text labels and element relationships (<10% of file)\n- **Signal-to-noise ratio is extremely low**\n\nExample: 14-element diagram = 596 lines, 16K, ~4k tokens. 79-element diagram = 2,916 lines, 88K, ~22k tokens (exceeds read limit).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Trigger on ANY of these:**\n- File path contains `.excalidraw` or `.excalidraw.json`\n- User requests: \"explain/update/create diagram\", \"show architecture\", \"visualize flow\"\n- User mentions: \"flowchart\", \"architecture diagram\", \"Excalidraw file\"\n- Architecture/design documentation tasks involving visual artifacts\n\n**Use delegation even for:**\n- \"Small\" files (smallest is 4k tokens - still significant)\n- \"Quick checks\" (checking component names still loads full JSON)\n- Single file operations (isolation prevents context pollution)\n- Modifications (don''t need full format understanding in main context)\n\n## Delegation Pattern\n\n### Main Agent Responsibilities\n\n**NEVER:**\n- ❌ Use Read tool on *.excalidraw files\n- ❌ Parse Excalidraw JSON in main context\n- ❌ Load multiple diagrams for comparison\n- ❌ Inspect file to \"understand the format\"\n\n**ALWAYS:**\n- ✅ Delegate ALL Excalidraw operations to subagents\n- ✅ Provide clear task description to subagent\n- ✅ Request text-only summaries (not raw JSON)\n- ✅ Keep diagram analysis isolated from main work\n\n### Subagent Task Templates\n\n#### Read/Understand Operation\n```\nTask: Extract and explain the components in [file.excalidraw.json]\n\nApproach:\n1. Read the Excalidraw JSON\n2. Extract only text elements (ignore positioning/styling)\n3. Identify relationships between components\n4. Summarize architecture/flow\n\nReturn:\n- List of components/services with descriptions\n- Connection/dependency relationships\n- Key insights about the architecture\n- DO NOT return raw JSON or verbose element details\n```\n\n#### Modify Operation\n```\nTask: Add [component] to [file.excalidraw.json], connected to [existing-component]\n\nApproach:\n1. Read file to identify existing elements\n2. Find [existing-component] and its position\n3. Create new element JSON for [component]\n4. Add arrow elements for connections\n5. Write updated file\n\nReturn:\n- Confirmation of changes made\n- Position of new element\n- IDs of created elements\n```\n\n#### Create Operation\n```\nTask: Create new Excalidraw diagram showing [description]\n\nApproach:\n1. Design layout for [number] components\n2. Create rectangle elements with text labels\n3. Add arrows showing relationships\n4. Use consistent styling (colors, fonts)\n5. Write to [file.excalidraw.json]\n\nReturn:\n- Confirmation of file created\n- Summary of components included\n- File location\n```\n\n#### Compare Operation\n```\nTask: Compare architecture approaches in [file1] vs [file2]\n\nApproach:\n1. Read both files\n2. Extract text labels from each\n3. Identify structural differences\n4. Compare component relationships\n\nReturn:\n- Key differences in architecture\n- Components unique to each approach\n- Relationship/flow differences\n- DO NOT return full element details from both files\n```\n\n## Common Rationalizations (STOP and Delegate Instead)\n\n| Excuse | Reality | What to Do |\n|--------|---------|------------|\n| \"Direct reading is most efficient\" | Consumes 4k-22k tokens unnecessarily | Delegate to subagent |\n| \"It''s token-efficient to read directly\" | Baseline tests showed 9-45% budget used | Always delegate |\n| \"This is optimal for one-time analysis\" | \"One-time\" still pollutes main context | Subagent isolation |\n| \"The JSON is straightforward\" | Simplicity ≠ token efficiency | Delegate anyway |\n| \"I need to understand the format\" | Format understanding not needed in main agent | Subagent handles format |\n| \"Within reasonable bounds\" (18k tokens) | \"Reasonable\" is subjective rationalization | Hard rule: delegate |\n| \"Just a quick check of components\" | \"Quick check\" still loads full JSON | Extract text via subagent |\n| \"File is small (16K)\" | 4k tokens is NOT small | Size threshold doesn''t matter |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP and Delegate\n\nCatch yourself about to:\n- Use Read tool on .excalidraw file\n- \"Quickly check\" what components exist\n- \"Understand the structure\" before modifying\n- Load file to \"see what''s there\"\n- Compare multiple diagrams side-by-side\n- Parse JSON to \"extract just the text\"\n\n**All of these mean: Use Task tool with subagent instead.**\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Operation | Main Agent Action | Subagent Returns |\n|-----------|-------------------|------------------|\n| **Understand diagram** | Delegate with \"Extract and explain\" template | Component list + relationships |\n| **Modify diagram** | Delegate with \"Add [X] connected to [Y]\" template | Confirmation + changes made |\n| **Create diagram** | Delegate with \"Create showing [description]\" template | File location + summary |\n| **Compare diagrams** | Delegate with \"Compare [A] vs [B]\" template | Key differences (not raw JSON) |\n\n## Token Analysis (Why This Matters)\n\nReal data from baseline testing:\n\n| Scenario | Without Delegation | With Delegation | Savings |\n|----------|-------------------|-----------------|---------|\n| Single large file | 22k tokens (45% budget) | ~500 tokens (subagent summary) | 98% |\n| Two-file comparison | 18k tokens (9% budget) | ~800 tokens (diff summary) | 96% |\n| Modification task | 14k tokens (7% budget) | ~300 tokens (confirmation) | 98% |\n\n**Context pollution impact:**\n- Reading all 7 project diagrams: 67k tokens (33% of 200k budget)\n- With delegation: ~2k tokens (isolated in subagents)\n- **Savings: 97% context budget preserved**\n\n## Implementation Example\n\n**❌ BAD (Direct Read):**\n```\nUser: \"What architecture is shown in detailed-architecture.excalidraw.json?\"\nAgent: Let me read that file... [reads 22k tokens into main context]\n```\n\n**✅ GOOD (Subagent Delegation):**\n```\nUser: \"What architecture is shown in detailed-architecture.excalidraw.json?\"\nAgent: I''ll use a subagent to extract the architecture details.\n\n[Dispatches Task tool with general-purpose subagent]\nTask: Extract and explain components in .ryanquinn3/ticketing/detailed-architecture.excalidraw.json\n\n[Receives ~500 token summary with component list and relationships]\n[Responds to user with architecture explanation, main context preserved]\n```\n\n## Why \"Straightforward JSON\" Doesn''t Matter\n\nAgents often rationalize: \"The format is simple, I can just read it.\"\n\n**The problem isn''t complexity - it''s verbosity:**\n- Simple structure with 20+ properties per element\n- Repetitive metadata (seed, version, nonce, roughness)\n- Positioning data (x, y, width, height) not semantically useful\n- Visual styling (strokeColor, opacity, fillStyle) irrelevant to content\n\n**Token cost comes from volume, not complexity.**\n\nEven \"straightforward\" JSON consumes 4k-22k tokens because:\n- 79 elements × ~280 tokens/element = 22k tokens\n- Most tokens are metadata noise\n- Only text labels and relationships matter (~10% of content)\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n**Main agents NEVER read Excalidraw files. No exceptions.**\n\nNot for:\n- \"Quick checks\"\n- \"Small files\"\n- \"Understanding format\"\n- \"One-time analysis\"\n- \"Optimal efficiency\"\n\n**Always delegate. Isolation is free via subagents.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:04:26.495Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual Analysis Agents requiring advanced diagram parsing and JSON handling capabilities with Excalidraw files","zh":"适用于需要高级图表解析和JSON处理能力的视觉分析代理，特别是处理Excalidraw文件","ja":"Excalidrawファイルを含む高度な図形解析とJSON処理機能を必要とするビジュアル分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Excalidraw 파일을 포함한 고급 도형 구문 분석 및 JSON 처리 기능이 필요한 시각적 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis Visual que requieren capacidades avanzadas de análisis de diagramas y manejo de JSON con archivos Excalidraw","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse visuelle nécessitant des capacités avancées d''analyse de diagrammes et de gestion de JSON avec des fichiers Excalidraw","de":"Ideal für Visuelle Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Diagramm- und JSON-Verarbeitungsfunktionen mit Excalidraw-Dateien erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise Visual que requerem análise avançada de diagramas e capacidades de manipulação de JSON com arquivos Excalidraw","ru":"Идеально для Визуальных Аналитических Агентов, требующих продвинутого парсинга диаграмм и возможностей обработки JSON с файлами Excalidraw","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل المرئي التي تتطلب تحليلًا متقدمًا للرسوم البيانية وقدرات التعامل مع JSON مع ملفات Excalidraw"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to delegate Excalidraw file processing to subagents, efficiently handling high token costs and low information density within JSON structures, including parsing shape properties and navigating large files up to 22k tokens","zh":"赋予代理将Excalidraw文件处理委托给子代理的能力，高效处理JSON结构中的高令牌成本和低信息密度，包括解析形状属性和导航大型文件，最高可达22k令牌","ja":"Excalidrawファイルの処理をサブエージェントに委任することで、JSON構造内の高トークンコストと低情報密度を効率的に処理し、形状プロパティの解析や最大22kトークンの大規模ファイルのナビゲーションを可能にする","ko":"Excalidraw 파일 처리를 하위 에이전트에게 위임하여 JSON 구조 내의 높은 토큰 비용 및 낮은 정보 밀도를 효율적으로 처리할 수 있으며, 도형 속성의 구문 분석 및 최대 22k 토큰의 대형 파일의 내비게이션도 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a delegar el procesamiento de archivos Excalidraw a subagentes, manejando de manera eficiente los altos costos de tokens y la baja densidad de información dentro de las estructuras JSON, incluyendo el análisis de propiedades de formas y la navegación de archivos grandes de hasta 22k tokens","fr":"Permet aux agents de déléguer le traitement des fichiers Excalidraw à des sous-agents, gérant efficacement les coûts de jetons élevés et la faible densité d''informations au sein des structures JSON, y compris l''analyse des propriétés de formes et la navigation de fichiers importants jusqu''à 22k jetons","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Verarbeitung von Excalidraw-Dateien an Subagenten zu delegieren, wodurch hohe Tokenkosten und eine geringe Informationsdichte innerhalb von JSON-Strukturen effizient gehandhabt werden, einschließlich der Analyse von Formeneigenschaften und der Navigation in großen Dateien bis zu 22k Token","pt":"Habilita os agentes a delegar o processamento de arquivos Excalidraw a subagentes, lidando eficientemente com altos custos de token e baixa densidade de informações dentro de estruturas JSON, incluindo a análise de propriedades de formas e navegação em arquivos grandes de até 22k tokens","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью делегировать обработку файлов Excalidraw субагентам, эффективно обрабатывая высокие затраты на токены и низкую плотность информации внутри структур JSON, включая парсинг свойств форм и навигацию по большим файлам до 22к токенов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تفويض معالجة ملفات Excalidraw إلى وكلاء فرعيين، معالجة فعالة للتكاليف العالية لأحجار الزخرفة والكثافة المنخفضة للمعلومات داخل هياكل JSON، بما في ذلك تحليل خواص الأشكال والملاحة في الملفات الكبيرة التي تصل إلى 22 ألف رمز"},"useCases":{"en":["Parsing Excalidraw JSON files to extract shape properties","Delegating diagram processing to subagents for context isolation","Optimizing context budget usage when handling multiple Excalidraw files"],"zh":["解析Excalidraw JSON文件以提取形状属性","将图表处理委托给子代理以实现上下文隔离","优化处理多个Excalidraw文件时的上下文预算使用"],"ja":["Excalidraw JSONファイルを解析して形状プロパティを抽出する","図形処理をサブエージェントに委任してコンテキストの分離を実現する","複数のExcalidrawファイルを処理する際のコンテキスト予算の使用を最適化する"],"ko":["Excalidraw JSON 파일을 구문 분석하여 도형 속성을 추출함","하위 에이전트에게 도형 처리를 위임하여 컨텍스트 분리를 달성함","여러 개의 Excalidraw 파일을 처리할 때 컨텍스트 예산 사용을 최적화함"],"es":["Análisis de archivos JSON de Excalidraw para extraer propiedades de formas","Delegar el procesamiento de diagramas a subagentes para aislar el contexto","Optimizar el uso del presupuesto de contexto al manejar varios archivos Excalidraw"],"fr":["Analyse de fichiers JSON Excalidraw pour extraire les propriétés de formes","Délegation du traitement de diagrammes à des sous-agents pour isoler le contexte","Optimisation de l''utilisation du budget de contexte lors de la gestion de plusieurs fichiers Excalidraw"],"de":["Analyse von Excalidraw-JSON-Dateien zum Extrahieren von Formeneigenschaften","Delegierung der Diagrammverarbeitung an Subagenten zur Kontextisolation","Optimierung der Kontextbudgetnutzung bei der Verarbeitung mehrerer Excalidraw-Dateien"],"pt":["Análise de arquivos JSON do Excalidraw para extrair propriedades de formas","Delegar o processamento de diagramas a subagentes para isolamento de contexto","Otimizar o uso do orçamento de contexto ao lidar com vários arquivos Excalidraw"],"ru":["Парсинг файлов JSON Excalidraw для извлечения свойств форм","Делегирование обработки диаграмм субагентам для изоляции контекста","Оптимизация использования бюджета контекста при обработке нескольких файлов Excalidraw"],"ar":["تحليل ملفات JSON من Excalidraw لاستخراج خصائص الأشكال","تفويض معالجة الرسوم البيانية إلى وكلاء فرعيين لتحقيق عزل السياق","تحسين استخدام ميزانية السياق عند التعامل مع ملفات متعددة من Excalidraw"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires subagent delegation to handle Excalidraw files","Limited by context budget constraints, with large files potentially exceeding read tool limits","Excalidraw file size can range from 4k-22k tokens, impacting processing efficiency"],"zh":["需要子代理委托来处理Excalidraw文件","受限于上下文预算约束，大文件可能超过读取工具限制","Excalidraw文件大小可以从4k到22k令牌不等，影响处理效率"],"ja":["Excalidrawファイルの処理にはサブエージェントの委任が必要","コンテキスト予算の制約を受け、大規模ファイルは読み取りツールの制限を超える可能性がある","Excalidrawファイルのサイズは4kから22kトークンの範囲になり、処理効率に影響を与える"],"ko":["Excalidraw 파일 처리를 위해 하위 에이전트 위임이 필요함","컨텍스트 예산 제약으로 인해 대형 파일은 읽기 도구의 제한을 초과할 수 있음","Excalidraw 파일 크기는 4k에서 22k 토큰까지이며 처리 효율에 영향을 미침"],"es":["Requiere la delegación de subagentes para manejar archivos Excalidraw","Limitado por las restricciones del presupuesto de contexto, con archivos grandes que potencialmente exceden los límites de las herramientas de lectura","El tamaño de los archivos Excalidraw puede variar desde 4k hasta 22k tokens, lo que afecta la eficiencia del procesamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite la délégation de sous-agents pour gérer les fichiers Excalidraw","Limité par les contraintes de budget de contexte, avec des fichiers importants qui dépassent potentiellement les limites des outils de lecture","La taille des fichiers Excalidraw peut aller de 4k à 22k jetons, ce qui a un impact sur l''efficacité du traitement"],"de":["Erfordert die Delegierung von Subagenten zur Verarbeitung von Excalidraw-Dateien","Eingeschränkt durch die Kontextbudget-Beschränkungen, wobei große Dateien die Lesetool-Grenzwerte potenziell überschreiten","Die Größe von Excalidraw-Dateien kann von 4k bis 22k Token reichen, was die Verarbeitungseffizienz beeinträchtigt"],"pt":["Exige a delegação de subagentes para lidar com arquivos Excalidraw","Limitado por restrições de orçamento de contexto, com arquivos grandes que podem exceder os limites da ferramenta de leitura","O tamanho do arquivo Excalidraw pode variar de 4k-22k tokens, impactando a eficiência do processamento"],"ru":["Требует делегирования субагентов для обработки файлов Excalidraw","Ограничен ограничениями бюджета контекста, при этом большие файлы могут превышать пределы инструмента чтения","Размер файла Excalidraw может варьироваться от 4к до 22к токенов, что влияет на эффективность обработки"],"ar":["يتطلب تفويض وكلاء فرعيين لمعالجة ملفات Excalidraw","محدود بقيود ميزانية السياق، مع الملفات الكبيرة التي يمكن أن تتجاوز حدود أداة القراءة","يمكن أن تتراوح حجم ملف Excalidraw من 4 ألف إلى 22 ألف رمز، مما يؤثر على كفاءة المعالجة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
