jekt","Anpassbare Optionen","Genaue Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Geração de opções criativas","Verificação de disponibilidade de registro","Ajuda na criação de marcas pessoais","Otimização para projetos e produtos","Suporte à rebranding de projetos existentes","Encontrar alternativas quando a primeira escolha está indisponível"],"ru":["Генерация творческих вариантов","Проверка доступности регистрации","Помощь в создании личных брендов","Оптимизация для проектов и продуктов","Поддержка ребрендинга существующих проектов","Поиск альтернатив когда первый выбор недоступен"],"ar":["توليد خيارات إبداعية","التحقق من توفر التسجيل","مساعدة في إنشاء علامات تجارية شخصية","تحسين الأداء لمشاريع والمنتجات","دعم إعادة التسويق لمشاريع موجودة","العثور على بديلات عندما تكون الخيار الأول غير متاح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["域名注册","域名想法","项目域名","创业域名","品牌域名","个人网站域名"],"ja":["ドメイン登録","ドメイン名アイデア","プロジェクトドメイン","起業ドメイン","ブランドドメイン","個人サイトドメイン"],"ko":["도메인 등록","도메인 이름 아이디어","프로젝트 도메인","창업 도메인","브랜드 도메인","개인 웹사이트 도메인"],"es":["nombres de dominio","generador de nombres de dominio","dominios disponibles","nombres de dominio creativos","herramientas de desarrollo web","registro de dominios"],"fr":["noms de domaine","générateur de noms de domaine","domaines disponibles","noms de domaine créatifs","outils de développement web","enregistrement de domaines"],"de":["Domain-Namen","Domain-Namen-Generator","verfügbare Domains","kreative Domain-Namen","Webentwicklungstools","Domain-Registrierung"],"pt":["gerador de nomes de domínio","nome de domínio perfeito","registro de domínio","criação de marcas","rebranding","projetos de desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento de produtos"],"ru":["генератор имен доменов","идеальное имя домена","регистрация домена","создание брендов","ребрендинг","веб-разработка","разработка продуктов"],"ar":["مولد أسماء النطاق","الاسم المثالي للنطاق","تسجيل النطاق","إنشاء العلامات التجارية","إعادة التسويق","تطوير الويب","تطوير المنتجات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"domain-name-brainstormer","description":"Generates creative domain name ideas for your project and checks availability across multiple TLDs (.com, .io, .dev, .ai, etc.). Saves hours of brainstorming and manual checking.","bodyPreview":"# Domain Name Brainstormer\n\nThis skill helps you find the perfect domain name for your project by generating creative options and checking what''s actually available to register.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Starting a new project or company\n- Launching a product or service\n- Creating a personal brand or portfolio site\n- Rebranding an existing project\n- Registering a domain for a side project\n- Finding available alternatives when your first choice is taken\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Understa","body":"# Domain Name Brainstormer\n\nThis skill helps you find the perfect domain name for your project by generating creative options and checking what''s actually available to register.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Starting a new project or company\n- Launching a product or service\n- Creating a personal brand or portfolio site\n- Rebranding an existing project\n- Registering a domain for a side project\n- Finding available alternatives when your first choice is taken\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Understands Your Project**: Analyzes what you''re building and who it''s for\n2. **Generates Creative Names**: Creates relevant, memorable domain options\n3. **Checks Availability**: Verifies which domains are actually available across multiple TLDs\n4. **Multiple Extensions**: Suggests .com, .io, .dev, .ai, .app, and more\n5. **Provides Alternatives**: Offers variations if top choices are taken\n6. **Branding Insights**: Explains why certain names work well\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Brainstorming\n\n```\nI''m building a project management tool for remote teams. \nSuggest domain names.\n```\n\n```\nHelp me brainstorm domain names for a personal finance app\n```\n\n### Specific Preferences\n\n```\nI need a domain name for my AI writing assistant. \nPrefer short names with .ai or .io extension.\n```\n\n### With Keywords\n\n```\nSuggest domain names using the words \"pixel\" or \"studio\" \nfor my design agency\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User**: \"I''m building a tool for developers to share code snippets. Suggest creative domain names.\"\n\n**Output**:\n```\nAnalyzing your project...\nTarget audience: Developers\nKey features: Code sharing, snippets, collaboration\n\n🎯 Domain Name Suggestions\n\n## Available (.com)\n1. ✓ snippetbox.com - Clear, memorable, available!\n   Why: Directly describes the product, easy to remember\n\n2. ✓ codeclip.com - Short and snappy\n   Why: Implies quick code sharing, only 8 characters\n\n3. ✓ devpaste.com - Developer-focused\n   Why: Familiar to devs (like pastebin), clear purpose\n\n## Available (Alternative TLDs)\n4. ✓ snippet.dev - Perfect extension for developers\n   Why: .dev extension signals developer tool\n\n5. ✓ codebox.io - Tech-forward\n   Why: .io popular with tech startups, clean name\n\n6. ✓ sharecode.app - Descriptive\n   Why: .app extension, clearly states the action\n\n## Premium/Taken (.com)\n- codeshare.com (Taken, est. $2,500)\n- snippets.com (Taken, premium domain)\n\n## Recommendations\n\n🏆 Top Pick: snippet.dev\n- Perfect for developer audience\n- Short and memorable  \n- .dev extension adds credibility\n- Available now!\n\n🥈 Runner-up: snippetbox.com\n- .com is universally recognized\n- Slightly longer but descriptive\n- Great brandability\n\nNext steps:\n1. Register your favorite before someone else does!\n2. Want me to check more variations?\n3. Need help with logo ideas for these names?\n```\n\n**Inspired by:** Ben Aiad''s use case from Lenny''s Newsletter\n\n## Domain Naming Tips\n\n### What Makes a Good Domain\n\n✓ **Short**: Under 15 characters ideal\n✓ **Memorable**: Easy to recall and spell\n✓ **Pronounceable**: Can be said in conversation\n✓ **Descriptive**: Hints at what you do\n✓ **Brandable**: Unique enough to stand out\n✓ **No hyphens**: Easier to share verbally\n\n### TLD Guide\n\n- **.com**: Universal, trusted, great for businesses\n- **.io**: Tech startups, developer tools\n- **.dev**: Developer-focused products\n- **.ai**: AI/ML products\n- **.app**: Mobile or web applications\n- **.co**: Alternative to .com\n- **.xyz**: Modern, creative projects\n- **.design**: Creative/design agencies\n- **.tech**: Technology companies\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### Check Similar Variations\n\n```\nCheck availability for \"codebase\" and similar variations \nacross .com, .io, .dev\n```\n\n### Industry-Specific\n\n```\nSuggest domain names for a sustainable fashion brand, \nchecking .eco and .fashion TLDs\n```\n\n### Multilingual Options\n\n```\nBrainstorm domain names in English and Spanish for \na language learning app\n```\n\n### Competitor Analysis\n\n```\nShow me domain patterns used by successful project \nmanagement tools, then suggest similar available ones\n```\n\n## Example Workflows\n\n### Startup Launch\n1. Describe your startup idea\n2. Get 10-15 domain suggestions across TLDs\n3. Review availability and pricing\n4. Pick top 3 favorites\n5. Register immediately\n\n### Personal Brand\n1. Share your name and profession\n2. Get variations (firstname.com, firstnamelastname.dev, etc.)\n3. Check social media handle availability too\n4. Register consistent brand across platforms\n\n### Product Naming\n1. Describe product and target market\n2. Get creative, brandable names\n3. Check trademark conflicts\n4. Verify domain and social availability\n5. Test names with target audience\n\n## Tips for Success\n\n1. **Act Fast**: Good domains get taken quickly\n2. **Register Variations**: Get .com and .io to protect brand\n3. **Avoid Numbers**: Hard to communicate verbally\n4. **Check Social Media**: Make sure @username is available too\n5. **Say It Out Loud**: Test if it''s easy to pronounce\n6. **Check Trademarks**: Ensure no legal conflicts\n7. **Think Long-term**: Will it still make sense in 5 years?\n\n## Pricing Context\n\nWhen suggesting domains, I''ll note:\n- Standard domains: ~$10-15/year\n- Premium TLDs (.io, .ai): ~$30-50/year\n- Taken domains: Market price if listed\n- Premium domains: $hundreds to $thousands\n\n## Related Tools\n\nAfter picking a domain:\n- Check logo design options\n- Verify social media handles\n- Research trademark availability\n- Plan brand identity colors/fonts\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:04:42.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing creative domain name suggestions and availability checks.","zh":"非常适合需要创意域名建议和可用性检查的Web开发代理。","ja":"ウェブ開発エージェントが創造的なドメイン名の提案と可用性の確認が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 창의적인 도메인 이름 제안과 가용성 확인이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan sugerencias creativas de nombres de dominio y comprobaciones de disponibilidad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Web qui ont besoin de suggestions créatives de noms de domaine et de vérifications de disponibilité.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die kreative Vorschläge für Domänennamen und Verfügbarkeitsprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que precisam de sugestões criativas de nomes de domínio e verificações de disponibilidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы творческие предложения имен доменов и проверки их доступности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون الويب وهم بحاجة إلى اقتراحات أسماء نطاق إبداعية واختبارات للتوافر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate creative domain name options and check availability using WHOIS protocols and DNS resolution, streamlining the domain registration process for projects and personal brands.","zh":"赋予代理生成创意域名选项的能力，并使用WHOIS协议和DNS解析检查可用性，从而简化项目和个人品牌的域名注册流程。","ja":"エージェントに創造的なドメイン名のオプションを生成し、WHOISプロトコルとDNS解決を使用して可用性を確認する機能を提供し、プロジェクトや個人のブランドのドメイン登録プロセスを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 창의적인 도메인 이름 옵션을 생성하고 WHOIS 프로토콜 및 DNS 해석을 사용하여 가용성을 확인할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 프로젝트 및 개인 브랜드의 도메인 등록 절차를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar opciones creativas de nombres de dominio y a comprobar la disponibilidad mediante protocolos WHOIS y resolución DNS, simplificando el proceso de registro de dominios para proyectos y marcas personales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des options créatives de noms de domaine et de vérifier la disponibilité à l''aide des protocoles WHOIS et de la résolution DNS, simplifiant le processus d''enregistrement de domaine pour les projets et les marques personnelles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, kreative Optionen für Domänennamen zu generieren und die Verfügbarkeit mithilfe von WHOIS-Protokollen und DNS-Auflösung zu überprüfen, wodurch der Registrierungsprozess für Domains für Projekte und persönliche Marken vereinfacht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar opções criativas de nomes de domínio e verificar a disponibilidade usando protocolos WHOIS e resolução DNS, simplificando o processo de registro de domínio para projetos e marcas pessoais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать творческие варианты имен доменов и проверять их доступность с использованием протоколов WHOIS и разрешения DNS, упрощая процесс регистрации доменов для проектов и личных брендов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتوليد خيارات أسماء نطاق إبداعية واختبار التوافر باستخدام بروتوكولات WHOIS وضبط DNS، مبسطًا عملية تسجيل النطاقات لمشاريع والعلامات التجارية الشخصية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating alternative domain names when first choice is taken","Finding available domain names for new projects or companies","Registering domain names for side projects or personal portfolio sites"],"zh":["生成替代域名，当首选域名已被占用时","为新项目或公司找到可用的域名","为副项目或个人作品集网站注册域名"],"ja":["最初の選択肢が取られているときに代替ドメイン名を生成する","新しいプロジェクトや会社のために利用可能なドメイン名を見つける","副プロジェクトや個人のポートフォリオサイトのためにドメイン名を登録する"],"ko":["첫 번째 선택이 이미 사용 중인 경우 대체 도메인 이름을 생성하는 것","새로운 프로젝트 또는 회사에 대한 사용 가능한 도메인 이름을 찾는 것","부 프로젝트 또는 개인 포트폴리오 사이트에 대한 도메인 이름 등록"],"es":["Generar nombres de dominio alternativos cuando la primera opción está ocupada","Encontrar nombres de dominio disponibles para nuevos proyectos o empresas","Registrar nombres de dominio para proyectos laterales o sitios web de portafolio personal"],"fr":["Générer des noms de domaine alternatifs lorsque le premier choix est pris","Trouver des noms de domaine disponibles pour de nouveaux projets ou entreprises","Enregistrer des noms de domaine pour des projets secondaires ou des sites web de portfolio personnel"],"de":["Generieren von alternativen Domänennamen, wenn die erste Wahl belegt ist","Finden von verfügbaren Domänennamen für neue Projekte oder Unternehmen","Registrieren von Domänennamen für Nebenprojekte oder persönliche Website-Portfolios"],"pt":["Gerar nomes de domínio alternativos quando a primeira escolha está ocupada","Encontrar nomes de domínio disponíveis para novos projetos ou empresas","Registrar nomes de domínio para projetos paralelos ou sites de portfolio pessoal"],"ru":["Генерировать альтернативные имена доменов, когда первый выбор занят","Находить доступные имена доменов для новых проектов или компаний","Регистрировать имена доменов для побочных проектов или личных сайтов-портфолио"],"ar":["توليد أسماء نطاق بديلة عندما يتم احتجاز الخيار الأول","إيجاد أسماء نطاق متوفرة لمشاريع أو شركات جديدة","تسجيل أسماء النطاقات لمشاريع جانبية أو مواقع محفظة شخصية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet connection for WHOIS lookups and DNS resolution","Limited to checking availability of top-level domains"],"zh":["需要互联网连接以进行WHOIS查找和DNS解析","仅限检查顶级域名的可用性"],"ja":["WHOISの検索とDNS解決を行うためにインターネット接続が必要","トップレベルドメインの可用性のみを確認することが可能"],"ko":["WHOIS 조회 및 DNS 해석을 수행하기 위해 인터넷 연결이 필요함","최상위 도메인의 가용성만 확인할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conexión a Internet para búsquedas WHOIS y resolución DNS","Limitado a la comprobación de la disponibilidad de dominios de nivel superior"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Internet pour les recherches WHOIS et la résolution DNS","Limité à la vérification de la disponibilité des domaines de niveau supérieur"],"de":["Benötigt Internetverbindung für WHOIS-Abfragen und DNS-Auflösung","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung der Verfügbarkeit von Top-Level-Domains"],"pt":["Requer conexão com a internet para consultas WHOIS e resolução DNS","Limitado à verificação de disponibilidade de domínios de alto nível"],"ru":["Требует подключения к интернету для запросов WHOIS и разрешения DNS","Ограничен проверкой доступности доменов верхнего уровня"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصالًا بالإنترنت لاستفسارات WHOIS وضبط DNS","محدود بالتحقق من توافر نطاقات المستوى الأعلى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
