리케이션의 성능을 최적화 하기 위한 45개의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리를 제공합니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 45 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 45 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js, com 45 regras em 8 categorias.","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для React и Next.js, содержащее 45 правил в 8 категориях.","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لرياكت ونكست.جس، يحتوي على 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["45 条性能优化规则","8 个类别，涵盖 React 和 Next.js 应用","自动重构和代码生成","优化 bundling 和代码分割","提高应用加载速度和响应性"],"ja":["45 のパフォーマンス最適化ルール","8 つのカテゴリ、React と Next.js アプリを含む","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","バンドル最適化とコード分割","アプリの読み込み速度と応答性の向上"],"ko":["45개의 성능 최적화 규칙","8개의 카테고리, React와 Next.js 애플리케이션을 포함","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","번들 최적화와 코드 분할","애플리케이션 로딩 속도와 응답성 향상"],"es":["45 reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","8 categorías para una optimización estructurada","Guía para la refactorización automática y la generación de código","Optimización de la búsqueda de datos","Mejora del rendimiento de React y Next.js"],"fr":["45 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour une optimisation structurée","Guide pour la réfactorisation automatique et la génération de code","Optimisation de la recherche de données","Amélioration des performances de React et Next.js"],"de":["45 Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine strukturierte Optimierung","Leitfaden für die automatische Refaktorierung und Codegenerierung","Optimierung der Datensuche","Leistungsverbesserung von React und Next.js"],"pt":["45 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias de regras","Priorização de regras por impacto","Refatoração automática de código","Geração automática de código"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий правил","Приоритизация правил по влиянию","Автоматическая рефакторинг кода","Автоматическая генерация кода"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات من القواعد","توجيه القواعد حسب التأثير","إعادة هيكلة التلقائية للكود","توليد التلقائي للكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 性能优化","Next.js 性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","bundling 优化","代码分割"],"ja":["Vercel React","React パフォーマンス最適化","Next.js パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","バンドル最適化","コード分割"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","번들 최적화","코드 분할"],"es":["Vercel React","Mejores prácticas de React","Optimización de rendimiento","React y Next.js","Desarrollo de aplicaciones web","Optimización de código"],"fr":["Vercel React","Meilleures pratiques de React","Optimisation des performances","React et Next.js","Développement d''applications web","Optimisation de code"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices für React","Leistungsoptimierung","React und Next.js","Webanwendungsentwicklung","Codeoptimierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Melhores práticas"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Лучшие практики"],"ar":["فيرسل رياكت","تحسين الأداء","رياكت","نكست.جس","تطوير الويب","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"tansolo-qa","repo":"project-unknow","repoPath":"tansolo-qa/project-unknow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:04:26.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js applications, seeking to optimize performance and adhere to best practices.","zh":"适用于专门从事 React 和 Next.js 应用程序的前端代理，旨在优化性能并遵循最佳实践。","ja":"React と Next.js アプリケーションを専門とするフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。パフォーマンスを最適化し、ベスト プラクティスに従うことを目指しています。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 성능을 최적화하고 최선의 관행을 따르는 것을 목표로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se especializan en aplicaciones de React y Next.js, y que buscan optimizar el rendimiento y cumplir con las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans les applications React et Next.js, qui cherchent à optimiser les performances et à respecter les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen spezialisieren und die Leistung optimieren und den Best Practices entsprechen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em aplicações React e Next.js, que buscam otimizar o desempenho e seguir as melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на приложениях React и Next.js, стремящихся оптимизировать производительность и следовать лучшим практикам.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصص في تطبيقات React و Next.js، الذين يبحثون عن تحسين الأداء والامتثال لأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories, including data fetching and bundling optimization, to significantly improve application performance and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 45 条规则跨 8 个类别，包括数据获取和打包优化，以显著提高应用程序性能和可维护性。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、データ取得やバンドル最適化を含む 8 つのカテゴリにわたる 45 のルールを利用して、アプリケーションのパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を大幅に改善します。","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지에 대한 자동 리팩터링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함한 8개의 범주에 걸친 45개의 규칙을 활용하여 애플리케이션의 성능 및 유지 보수성을 크게 개선합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la reestructuración y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, incluida la optimización de la obtención de datos y la agrupación, para mejorar significativamente el rendimiento y la mantenibilidad de la aplicación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement, pour améliorer considérablement les performances et la maintenabilité de l''application.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Neustrukturierung und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung, um die Anwendungsleistung und Wartbarkeit erheblich zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento, para melhorar significativamente o desempenho e a manutenção da aplicação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и упаковки, для значительного улучшения производительности и поддерживаемости приложения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير автоматية لتحديث وإنشاء رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستخدمين 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، بما في ذلك تحسين جلب البيانات وتعبئة الحزم، لتحسين الأداء وقابلية الصيانة للتطبيق بشكل كبير."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React applications","Generating optimized Next.js pages with client or server-side data fetching","Refactoring existing React and Next.js codebases for better performance and maintainability","Optimizing bundling for faster application load times"],"zh":["自动化 React 应用程序的代码审查以解决性能问题","使用客户端或服务器端数据获取生成优化的 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码库以获得更好的性能和可维护性","优化打包以实现更快的应用程序加载时间"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題に対処する React アプリケーションのコード レビューを自動化する","クライアント側またはサーバー側のデータ取得を使用して最適化された Next.js ページを生成する","既存の React と Next.js コード ベースをリファクタリングして、パフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる","バンドルを最適化して、アプリケーションのロード時間を短縮する"],"ko":["성능 문제를 해결하기 위한 리액트 애플리케이션 코드 리뷰 자동화","클라이언트 측 또는 서버 측 데이터 가져오기를 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지 생성","기존 리액트 및 Next.js 코드베이스를 리팩터링하여 성능 및 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것","번들을 최적화하여 애플리케이션 로드 시간을 단축하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con obtención de datos del lado del cliente o del servidor","Reestructurar las bases de código de React y Next.js existentes para un mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad","Optimizar la agrupación para tiempos de carga de aplicaciones más rápidos"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les applications React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec une obtention de données côté client ou côté serveur","Réorganiser les bases de code React et Next.js existantes pour de meilleures performances et maintenabilité","Optimiser le regroupement pour des temps de chargement d''applications plus rapides"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Anwendungen","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Client- oder Server-seitigem Datenabruf","Neustrukturieren von bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codebasen für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit","Optimieren des Bündelns für schnellere Ladezeiten von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em aplicações React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com busca de dados do lado do cliente ou servidor","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho e manutenção","Otimizar empacotamento para tempos de carregamento de aplicativos mais rápidos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в приложениях React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с извлечением данных на стороне клиента или сервера","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности и поддерживаемости","Оптимизировать упаковку для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["توفير автомاتية لمراجعة الشفرة حول مشاكل الأداء في تطبيقات React","إنشاء صفحات Next.js المُحسّنة بجلب البيانات من جانب العميل أو الخادم","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة الحالية لReact و Next.js لتحسين الأداء وقابلية الصيانة","تحسين التعبئة للحصول على أوقات تحميل للتطبيقات أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel or utilizing similar performance optimization guidelines"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js 生态系统的知识","仅限于托管在 Vercel 或使用类似性能优化指南的应用程序"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムに関する知識が必要","Vercel にホストされているアプリケーションまたは同等のパフォーマンス最適化ガイドラインを使用するアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["리액트 및 Next.js 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요","Vercel에 호스팅되거나 유사한 성능 최적화 지침을 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en Vercel o que utilizan directrices de optimización de rendimiento similares"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances des écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux applications hébergées sur Vercel ou utilisant des directives d''optimisation des performances similaires"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die auf Vercel gehostet werden oder ähnliche Leistungs-Optimierungsrichtlinien verwenden"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações hospedadas no Vercel ou que utilizam diretrizes de otimização de desempenho semelhantes"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен приложениями, размещенными на Vercel или использующими аналогичные рекомендации по оптимизации производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببيئات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المضيفة على Vercel أو التي تستخدم إرشادات تحسين الأداء المماثلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/subagent-driven-development', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'subagent-driven-development', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z', '2026-02-18T14:04:58.854Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/subagent-driven-development","name":"subagent-driven-development","description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发法是一种通过分配新子代理来执行任务的开发方法，采用两阶段审核机制以确保高质量和快速迭代","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、新しいサブエージェントを割り当てることでタスクを実行する開発方法で、2段階のレビュー機構を採用して高い品質と迅速なイテレーションを実現する","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하여 태스크를 실행하는 개발 방법으로, 2단계 리뷰 메커니즘을採用하여 높은 품질과 빠른 반복을 실현한다","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica para ejecutar planes de manera eficiente.","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agents est une technique pour exécuter des plans de manière efficace.","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik zur Ausführung von Plänen auf effiziente Weise.","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio de subagentes frescos para tarefas independentes com revisão de dois estágios.","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы с помощью свежих субагентов для независимых задач с двухэтапной проверкой.","ar":"التطوير بواسطة وكلاء فرعيين هو نهج ينفذ الخطط من خلال وكلاء فرعيين جدد للمهام المستقلة مع مراجعة مرحلتين.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发法","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발","es":"Desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","fr":"Développement piloté par sous-agents","de":"Subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Subagentes","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов","ar":"التطوير بواسطة وكلاء فرعيين","en":"subagent-driven-development"},"description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发法是一种通过分配新子代理来执行任务的开发方法，采用两阶段审核机制以确保高质量和快速迭代","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、新しいサブエージェントを割り当てることでタスクを実行する開発方法で、2段階のレビュー機構を採用して高い品質と迅速なイテレーションを実現する","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하여 태스크를 실행하는 개발 방법으로, 2단계 리뷰 메커니즘을採用하여 높은 품질과 빠른 반복을 실현한다","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica para ejecutar planes de manera eficiente.","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agents est une technique pour exécuter des plans de manière efficace.","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik zur Ausführung von Plänen auf effiziente Weise.","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio de subagentes frescos para tarefas independentes com revisão de dois es...","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы с помощью свежих субагентов для независимых задач с двухэтапной проверкой.","ar":"التطوير بواسطة وكلاء فرعيين هو نهج ينفذ الخطط من خلال وكلاء فرعيين جدد للمهام المستقلة مع مراجعة مرحلتين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["新子代理分配","两阶段审核机制","高质量代码","快速迭代","提高开发效率"],"ja":["新しいサブエージェントの割り当て","2段階のレビュー機構","高品質コード","迅速なイテレーション","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["새로운 서브 에이전트 할당","2단계 리뷰 메커니즘","높은 품질 코드","빠른 반복","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Ejecución de planes con subagentes frescos por tarea","Revisión de dos etapas: cumplimiento de especificaciones y calidad del código","Iteración rápida y resultados de alta calidad","Tareas independientes","Permanencia en la sesión actual"],"fr":["Exécution de plans avec des sous-agents frais par tâche","Examen en deux étapes : conformité aux spécifications et qualité du code","Itération rapide et résultats de haute qualité","Tâches indépendantes","Maintien dans la session actuelle"],"de":["Ausführung von Plänen mit frischen Subagenten pro Aufgabe","Zweistufige Überprüfung: Spezifikationskonformität und Codequalität","Schnelle Iteration und Ergebnisse hoher Qualität","Unabhängige Aufgaben","Beibehaltung der aktuellen Sitzung"],"pt":["Execução de planos por meio de subagentes frescos","Tarefas independentes com revisão de dois estágios","Revisão de spec e qualidade","Iteração rápida e de alta qualidade","Desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Выполнение планов с помощью свежих субагентов","Независимые задачи с двухэтапной проверкой","Проверка spec и качества","Быстрая и высококачественная итерация","Эффективная разработка"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط من خلال وكلاء فرعيين جدد","مهام مستقلة مع مراجعة مرحلتين","مراجعة المواصفات والجودة","تكرار سريع وعالية الجودة","تطوير فعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["子代理驱动开发法","开发方法","代码质量","开发效率","快速迭代","两阶段审核"],"ja":["サブエージェント駆動開発","開発方法","コードの品質","開発効率","迅速なイテレーション","2段階のレビュー"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 주도 개발","개발 방법","코드 품질","개발 효율","빠른 반복","2단계 리뷰"],"es":["desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","subagentes frescos","revisión de dos etapas","cumplimiento de especificaciones","calidad del código","iteración rápida","resultados de alta calidad"],"fr":["développement piloté par sous-agents","sous-agents frais","examen en deux étapes","conformité aux spécifications","qualité du code","itération rapide","résultats de haute qualité"],"de":["subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","frische Subagenten","zweistufige Überprüfung","Spezifikationskonformität","Codequalität","schnelle Iteration","Ergebnisse hoher Qualität"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes","subagentes frescos","tarefas independentes","revisão de dois estágios","desenvolvimento de software","técnica de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка на основе субагентов","свежие субагенты","независимые задачи","двухэтапная проверка","разработка программного обеспечения","техника разработки"],"ar":["التطوير بواسطة وكلاء فرعيين","وكلاء فرعيين جدد","مهام مستقلة","مراجعة مرحلتين","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنية التطوير"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"subagent-driven-development","description":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session","bodyPreview":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with two-stage review after each: spec compliance review first, then code quality review.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then quality) = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"subagent-driven-d","body":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with two-stage review after each: spec compliance review first, then code quality review.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then quality) = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"subagent-driven-development\" [shape=box];\n    \"executing-plans\" [shape=box];\n    \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" -> \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" -> \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" -> \"Stay in this session?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" -> \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [label=\"no - tightly coupled\"];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" -> \"subagent-driven-development\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" -> \"executing-plans\" [label=\"no - parallel session\"];\n}\n```\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Two-stage review after each task: spec compliance first, then code quality\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n## The Process\n\n```dot\ndigraph process {\n    rankdir=TB;\n\n    subgraph cluster_per_task {\n        label=\"Per Task\";\n        \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Answer questions, provide context\" [shape=box];\n        \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" [shape=box];\n        \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" [shape=box];\n        \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" [shape=box];\n        \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" [shape=box];\n    }\n\n    \"Read plan, extract all tasks with full text, note context, create TodoWrite\" [shape=box];\n    \"More tasks remain?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\" [shape=box style=filled fillcolor=lightgreen];\n\n    \"Read plan, extract all tasks with full text, note context, create TodoWrite\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\";\n    \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" -> \"Answer questions, provide context\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Answer questions, provide context\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" -> \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" -> \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\";\n    \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" -> \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" -> \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"re-review\"];\n    \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" -> \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\";\n    \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" -> \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" -> \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"re-review\"];\n    \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" -> \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" -> \"More tasks remain?\";\n    \"More tasks remain?\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"More tasks remain?\" -> \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" -> \"Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\";\n}\n```\n\n## Prompt Templates\n\n- `./implementer-prompt.md` - Dispatch implementer subagent\n- `./spec-reviewer-prompt.md` - Dispatch spec compliance reviewer subagent\n- `./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md` - Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using Subagent-Driven Development to execute this plan.\n\n[Read plan file once: docs/plans/feature-plan.md]\n[Extract all 5 tasks with full text and context]\n[Create TodoWrite with all tasks]\n\nTask 1: Hook installation script\n\n[Get Task 1 text and context (already extracted)]\n[Dispatch implementation subagent with full task text + context]\n\nImplementer: \"Before I begin - should the hook be installed at user or system level?\"\n\nYou: \"User level (~/.config/superpowers/hooks/)\"\n\nImplementer: \"Got it. Implementing now...\"\n[Later] Implementer:\n  - Implemented install-hook command\n  - Added tests, 5/5 passing\n  - Self-review: Found I missed --force flag, added it\n  - Committed\n\n[Dispatch spec compliance reviewer]\nSpec reviewer: ✅ Spec compliant - all requirements met, nothing extra\n\n[Get git SHAs, dispatch code quality reviewer]\nCode reviewer: Strengths: Good test coverage, clean. Issues: None. Approved.\n\n[Mark Task 1 complete]\n\nTask 2: Recovery modes\n\n[Get Task 2 text and context (already extracted)]\n[Dispatch implementation subagent with full task text + context]\n\nImplementer: [No questions, proceeds]\nImplementer:\n  - Added verify/repair modes\n  - 8/8 tests passing\n  - Self-review: All good\n  - Committed\n\n[Dispatch spec compliance reviewer]\nSpec reviewer: ❌ Issues:\n  - Missing: Progress reporting (spec says \"report every 100 items\")\n  - Extra: Added --json flag (not requested)\n\n[Implementer fixes issues]\nImplementer: Removed --json flag, added progress reporting\n\n[Spec reviewer reviews again]\nSpec reviewer: ✅ Spec compliant now\n\n[Dispatch code quality reviewer]\nCode reviewer: Strengths: Solid. Issues (Important): Magic number (100)\n\n[Implementer fixes]\nImplementer: Extracted PROGRESS_INTERVAL constant\n\n[Code reviewer reviews again]\nCode reviewer: ✅ Approved\n\n[Mark Task 2 complete]\n\n...\n\n[After all tasks]\n[Dispatch final code-reviewer]\nFinal reviewer: All requirements met, ready to merge\n\nDone!\n```\n\n## Advantages\n\n**vs. Manual execution:**\n- Subagents follow TDD naturally\n- Fresh context per task (no confusion)\n- Parallel-safe (subagents don''t interfere)\n- Subagent can ask questions (before AND during work)\n\n**vs. Executing Plans:**\n- Same session (no handoff)\n- Continuous progress (no waiting)\n- Review checkpoints automatic\n\n**Efficiency gains:**\n- No file reading overhead (controller provides full text)\n- Controller curates exactly what context is needed\n- Subagent gets complete information upfront\n- Questions surfaced before work begins (not after)\n\n**Quality gates:**\n- Self-review catches issues before handoff\n- Two-stage review: spec compliance, then code quality\n- Review loops ensure fixes actually work\n- Spec compliance prevents over/under-building\n- Code quality ensures implementation is well-built\n\n**Cost:**\n- More subagent invocations (implementer + 2 reviewers per task)\n- Controller does more prep work (extracting all tasks upfront)\n- Review loops add iterations\n- But catches issues early (cheaper than debugging later)\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Skip reviews (spec compliance OR code quality)\n- Proceed with unfixed issues\n- Dispatch multiple implementation subagents in parallel (conflicts)\n- Make subagent read plan file (provide full text instead)\n- Skip scene-setting context (subagent needs to understand where task fits)\n- Ignore subagent questions (answer before letting them proceed)\n- Accept \"close enough\" on spec compliance (spec reviewer found issues = not done)\n- Skip review loops (reviewer found issues = implementer fixes = review again)\n- Let implementer self-review replace actual review (both are needed)\n- **Start code quality review before spec compliance is ✅** (wrong order)\n- Move to next task while either review has open issues\n\n**If subagent asks questions:**\n- Answer clearly and completely\n- Provide additional context if needed\n- Don''t rush them into implementation\n\n**If reviewer finds issues:**\n- Implementer (same subagent) fixes them\n- Reviewer reviews again\n- Repeat until approved\n- Don''t skip the re-review\n\n**If subagent fails task:**\n- Dispatch fix subagent with specific instructions\n- Don''t try to fix manually (context pollution)\n\n## Integration\n\n**Required workflow skills:**\n- **superpowers:writing-plans** - Creates the plan this skill executes\n- **superpowers:requesting-code-review** - Code review template for reviewer subagents\n- **superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch** - Complete development after all tasks\n\n**Subagents should use:**\n- **superpowers:test-driven-development** - Subagents follow TDD for each task\n\n**Alternative workflow:**\n- **superpowers:executing-plans** - Use for parallel session instead of same-session execution\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:04:58.854Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring efficient task management and high-quality iteration through subagent-driven development","zh":"适合需要高效任务管理和通过子代理驱动开发实现高质量迭代的自主代理","ja":"タスク管理が効率的であり、サブエージェント駆動開発を通じての高品質なイテレーションが必要な自律エージェントに適している","ko":"효율적인 작업 관리와 하위 에이전트 주도 개발을 통해 고품질의 반복이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes autónomos que requieren una gestión de tareas eficiente y una iteración de alta calidad a través del desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents autonomes nécessitant une gestion de tâches efficiente et une itération de haute qualité à travers le développement piloté par des sous-agents","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung und eine hochwertige Iteration durch die subagenten-gesteuerte Entwicklung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que exigem gestão de tarefas eficiente e iteração de alta qualidade por meio do desenvolvimento impulsionado por subagentes","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих эффективного управления задачами и высококачественной итерации посредством разработки, управляемой субагентами","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يتطلبون إدارة مهمة فعالة و تكرار عالي الجودة من خلال التطوير القائم على وكلاء فرعيين"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute plans by dispatching fresh subagents per task, leveraging two-stage review processes for spec compliance and code quality, ensuring high-quality and fast iteration through protocols like dispatching and reviewing","zh":"使代理能够通过分派每个任务的新子代理来执行计划，利用两阶段审查流程来确保规格合规性和代码质量，从而通过分派和审查等协议实现高质量和快速的迭代","ja":"エージェントが各タスクごとに新しいサブエージェントを派遣して計画を実行できるようにし、仕様の遵守性とコード品質のための2段階のレビュープロセスを利用して、高品質で迅速なイテレーションを実現するためのプロトコルである派遣とレビューを活用する","ko":"에이전트가 각 작업마다 새로운 하위 에이전트를派遣하여 계획을 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 규격 준수 및 코드 품질을 위한 2단계 검토 프로세스를 활용하여,派遣 및 검토와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 높은 품질과 빠른 반복을 구현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar planes mediante el envío de nuevos subagentes por tarea, aprovechando procesos de revisión de dos etapas para el cumplimiento de especificaciones y la calidad del código, asegurando una iteración de alta calidad y rápida a través de protocolos como el envío y la revisión","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des plans en envoyant de nouveaux sous-agents par tâche, en exploitant des processus de révision en deux étapes pour la conformité aux spécifications et la qualité du code, assurant une itération de haute qualité et rapide à travers des protocoles tels que l''envoi et la révision","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Pläne auszuführen, indem sie pro Aufgabe neue Subagenten entsenden, zweistufige Überprüfungsprozesse für Spezifikationskonformität und Codequalität nutzend, um eine hochwertige und schnelle Iteration durch Protokolle wie Entsenden und Überprüfen sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar planos, encaminhando novos subagentes por tarefa, aproveitando processos de revisão em duas etapas para conformidade de especificação e qualidade de código, garantindo iteração rápida e de alta qualidade por meio de protocolos como encaminhamento e revisão","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять планы, направляя новых субагентов на каждую задачу, используя двухэтапные процессы рассмотрения для соответствия спецификации и качества кода, обеспечивая высококачественную и быструю итерацию посредством протоколов, таких как направление и рассмотрение","ar":"يؤهل الوكلاء لتنفيذ الخطط من خلال إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، و الاستفادة من عمليات المراجعة على مرحلتين للامتثال للمواصفات وجودة الشفرة، و ضمان التكرار السريع و العالي الجودة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل الإرسال و المراجعة"},"useCases":{"en":["Dispatching fresh subagents for independent tasks","Implementing two-stage review for spec compliance and code quality","Enhancing iteration speed and quality through subagent-driven development"],"zh":["为独立任务分派新的子代理","实施两阶段审查以确保规格合规性和代码质量","通过子代理驱动开发提高迭代速度和质量"],"ja":["独立したタスクのために新しいサブエージェントを派遣する","仕様の遵守性とコード品質のための2段階のレビューを実施する","サブエージェント駆動開発を通じてイテレーションの速度と品質を向上させる"],"ko":["독립적인 작업을 위한 새로운 하위 에이전트를派遣하는 것","규격 준수 및 코드 품질을 위한 2단계 검토를 구현하는 것","하위 에이전트 주도 개발을 통해 반복의 속도와 品質을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Envío de nuevos subagentes para tareas independientes","Implementación de una revisión de dos etapas para el cumplimiento de especificaciones y la calidad del código","Mejora de la velocidad y la calidad de la iteración a través del desarrollo impulsado por subagentes"],"fr":["Envoi de nouveaux sous-agents pour des tâches indépendantes","Mise en œuvre d''une révision en deux étapes pour la conformité aux spécifications et la qualité du code","Amélioration de la vitesse et de la qualité de l''itération à travers le développement piloté par des sous-agents"],"de":["Entsenden neuer Subagenten für unabhängige Aufgaben","Implementierung eines zweistufigen Überprüfungsprozesses für Spezifikationskonformität und Codequalität","Verbesserung der Iterationsgeschwindigkeit und -qualität durch die subagenten-gesteuerte Entwicklung"],"pt":["Encaminhar novos subagentes para tarefas independentes","Implementar revisão em duas etapas para conformidade de especificação e qualidade de código","Aumentar a velocidade e a qualidade da iteração por meio do desenvolvimento impulsionado por subagentes"],"ru":["Направление новых субагентов на независимые задачи","Реализация двухэтапного рассмотрения для соответствия спецификации и качества кода","Ускорение и повышение качества итерации посредством разработки, управляемой субагентами"],"ar":["إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد للمهام المستقلة","تنفيذ مراجعة على مرحلتين للامتثال للمواصفات وجودة الشفرة","تعزيز سرعة و جودة التكرار من خلال التطوير القائم على وكلاء فرعيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation plan with mostly independent tasks","Needs ability to stay in session for review processes"],"zh":["需要大多数任务独立的实施计划","需要在审查过程中保持会话的能力"],"ja":["ほとんどのタスクが独立している実装計画が必要","レビュープロセスのためにセッションを維持する能力が必要"],"ko":["대부분의 작업이 독립적인 구현 계획이 필요합니다","검토 프로세스에 대한 세션을 유지하는 능력이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere un plan de implementación con tareas mayoritariamente independientes","Necesita la capacidad de permanecer en sesión para los procesos de revisión"],"fr":["Nécessite un plan de mise en œuvre avec des tâches majoritairement indépendantes","A besoin de la capacité de rester en session pour les processus de révision"],"de":["Erfordert einen Implementierungsplan mit überwiegend unabhängigen Aufgaben","Benötigt die Fähigkeit, während der Überprüfungsprozesse in der Sitzung zu bleiben"],"pt":["Exige plano de implementação com tarefas principalmente independentes","Necessita capacidade de permanecer na sessão para processos de revisão"],"ru":["Требует плана реализации с в основном независимыми задачами","Требует возможности оставаться в сеансе для процессов рассмотрения"],"ar":["يتطلب خطة تنفيذ بمهام مستقلة بشكل رئيسي","يحتاج القدرة على البقاء في الجلسة لعملية المراجعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
