ique de vérifier les tests, de présenter des options et d''exécuter le choix","de":"Das Abschließen eines Entwicklungszweigs beinhaltet das Überprüfen von Tests, das Anzeigen von Optionen und das Ausführen der Wahl","pt":"O skill finishing-a-development-branch ajuda a concluir o trabalho de desenvolvimento de forma clara e eficiente","ru":"Навык finishing-a-development-branch помогает завершить разработку rõчно и эффективно","ar":"المهارة finishing-a-development-branch تساعد في إكمال عمل التطوير بطريقة واضحة وفعالة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证测试","呈现选项","执行选择","清理","提高开发效率","简化开发流程"],"ja":["テストの検証","オプションの提示","選択の実行","クリーンアップ","開発効率の向上","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["테스트 검증","옵션 제시","선택 실행","정리","개발 효율성 향상","개발 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Verificación de tests","Presentación de opciones","Ejecución de la elección","Limpieza de recursos","Notificación de inicio","Guía de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Vérification des tests","Présentation des options","Exécution du choix","Nettoyage des ressources","Notification de début","Guide de flux de travail"],"de":["Überprüfung von Tests","Anzeige von Optionen","Ausführung der Wahl","Bereinigung von Ressourcen","Benachrichtigung zum Start","Leitfaden für den Arbeitsablauf"],"pt":["Verificação de testes","Apresentação de opções","Execução de workflows","Limpeza de recursos","Automatização de processos"],"ru":["Проверка тестов","Представление вариантов","Выполнение рабочих процессов","Очистка ресурсов","Автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["تحقق الاختبارات","عرض الخيارات","تشغيل سير العمل","تنظيف الموارد","أتمتة العمليات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["完成开发分支","开发工作流","测试验证","选项呈现","开发效率","开发流程","代码管理","软件开发"],"ja":["開発ブランチの完了","開発作業の効率化","テストの検証","オプションの提示","開発プロセスの簡素化","コード管理","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["개발 분기 완료","개발 작업의 효율화","테스트 검증","옵션 제시","개발 프로세스의 간소화","코드 관리","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["finalizar rama de desarrollo","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","herramientas de desarrollo","mejores prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["finaliser une branche de développement","développement de logiciel","tests de logiciel","flux de travail de développement","outils de développement","meilleures pratiques de développement"],"de":["Entwicklungszweig abschließen","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests","Arbeitsablauf der Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Best Practices der Entwicklung"],"pt":["finalizar ramo de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados","workflows","automatização de processos","desenvolvimento ágil"],"ru":["завершение ветки разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование","рабочие процессы","автоматизация процессов","гибкая разработка"],"ar":["إكمال فرع التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية","سير العمل","أتمتة العمليات","تطوير مرن"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"finishing-a-development-branch","description":"Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work - guides completion of development work by presenting structured options for merge, PR, or cleanup","bodyPreview":"# Finishing a Development Branch\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide completion of development work by presenting clear options and handling chosen workflow.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify tests → Present options → Execute choice → Clean up.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Tests\n\n**Before presenting options, verify tests pass:**\n\n```bash\n# Run project''s test suite\nnpm test / cargo test / pytest / go test ./...\n`","body":"# Finishing a Development Branch\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide completion of development work by presenting clear options and handling chosen workflow.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify tests → Present options → Execute choice → Clean up.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Tests\n\n**Before presenting options, verify tests pass:**\n\n```bash\n# Run project''s test suite\nnpm test / cargo test / pytest / go test ./...\n```\n\n**If tests fail:**\n```\nTests failing (<N> failures). Must fix before completing:\n\n[Show failures]\n\nCannot proceed with merge/PR until tests pass.\n```\n\nStop. Don''t proceed to Step 2.\n\n**If tests pass:** Continue to Step 2.\n\n### Step 2: Determine Base Branch\n\n```bash\n# Try common base branches\ngit merge-base HEAD main 2>/dev/null || git merge-base HEAD master 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nOr ask: \"This branch split from main - is that correct?\"\n\n### Step 3: Present Options\n\nPresent exactly these 4 options:\n\n```\nImplementation complete. What would you like to do?\n\n1. Merge back to <base-branch> locally\n2. Push and create a Pull Request\n3. Keep the branch as-is (I''ll handle it later)\n4. Discard this work\n\nWhich option?\n```\n\n**Don''t add explanation** - keep options concise.\n\n### Step 4: Execute Choice\n\n#### Option 1: Merge Locally\n\n```bash\n# Switch to base branch\ngit checkout <base-branch>\n\n# Pull latest\ngit pull\n\n# Merge feature branch\ngit merge <feature-branch>\n\n# Verify tests on merged result\n<test command>\n\n# If tests pass\ngit branch -d <feature-branch>\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n#### Option 2: Push and Create PR\n\n```bash\n# Push branch\ngit push -u origin <feature-branch>\n\n# Create PR\ngh pr create --title \"<title>\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<2-3 bullets of what changed>\n\n## Test Plan\n- [ ] <verification steps>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n#### Option 3: Keep As-Is\n\nReport: \"Keeping branch <name>. Worktree preserved at <path>.\"\n\n**Don''t cleanup worktree.**\n\n#### Option 4: Discard\n\n**Confirm first:**\n```\nThis will permanently delete:\n- Branch <name>\n- All commits: <commit-list>\n- Worktree at <path>\n\nType ''discard'' to confirm.\n```\n\nWait for exact confirmation.\n\nIf confirmed:\n```bash\ngit checkout <base-branch>\ngit branch -D <feature-branch>\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n### Step 5: Cleanup Worktree\n\n**For Options 1, 2, 4:**\n\nCheck if in worktree:\n```bash\ngit worktree list | grep $(git branch --show-current)\n```\n\nIf yes:\n```bash\ngit worktree remove <worktree-path>\n```\n\n**For Option 3:** Keep worktree.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Option | Merge | Push | Keep Worktree | Cleanup Branch |\n|--------|-------|------|---------------|----------------|\n| 1. Merge locally | ✓ | - | - | ✓ |\n| 2. Create PR | - | ✓ | ✓ | - |\n| 3. Keep as-is | - | - | ✓ | - |\n| 4. Discard | - | - | - | ✓ (force) |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Skipping test verification**\n- **Problem:** Merge broken code, create failing PR\n- **Fix:** Always verify tests before offering options\n\n**Open-ended questions**\n- **Problem:** \"What should I do next?\" → ambiguous\n- **Fix:** Present exactly 4 structured options\n\n**Automatic worktree cleanup**\n- **Problem:** Remove worktree when might need it (Option 2, 3)\n- **Fix:** Only cleanup for Options 1 and 4\n\n**No confirmation for discard**\n- **Problem:** Accidentally delete work\n- **Fix:** Require typed \"discard\" confirmation\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Proceed with failing tests\n- Merge without verifying tests on result\n- Delete work without confirmation\n- Force-push without explicit request\n\n**Always:**\n- Verify tests before offering options\n- Present exactly 4 options\n- Get typed confirmation for Option 4\n- Clean up worktree for Options 1 & 4 only\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n- **subagent-driven-development** (Step 7) - After all tasks complete\n- **executing-plans** (Step 5) - After all batches complete\n\n**Pairs with:**\n- **using-git-worktrees** - Cleans up worktree created by that skill\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:04:52.177Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined project completion workflows, particularly those utilizing npm, cargo, pytest, or go test.","zh":"适用于需要简化项目完成工作流的开发代理，特别是那些使用npm、cargo、pytest或go test的代理。","ja":"npm、cargo、pytest、またはgo testを使用する開発エージェントがプロジェクトの完了ワークフローを簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"npm, cargo, pytest 또는 go test를 사용하는 개발 에이전트가 프로젝트 완성 워크플ロー 를 단순화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren flujos de trabajo de finalización de proyectos optimizados, particularmente aquellos que utilizan npm, cargo, pytest o go test.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des flux de travail de finalisation de projet rationalisés, en particulier ceux utilisant npm, cargo, pytest ou go test.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittelstände, die optimierte Arbeitsabläufe für die Projektfertigstellung benötigen, insbesondere solche, die npm, cargo, pytest oder go test verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem fluxos de trabalho de conclusão de projetos otimizados, particularmente aqueles que utilizam npm, cargo, pytest ou go test.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенных рабочих процессов завершения проектов, особенно тех, которые используют npm, cargo, pytest или go test.","ar":"مثالية لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون سير عمل إكمال المشروع المُبسّطة، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم npm، cargo، pytest، أو go test."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently finish development branches by verifying tests, presenting clear options, and executing chosen workflows, leveraging tools like npm test, cargo test, pytest, and go test.","zh":"赋予代理高效完成开发分支的能力，通过验证测试、呈现清晰的选项和执行所选的工作流，利用像npm test、cargo test、pytest和go test这样的工具。","ja":"npm test、cargo test、pytest、go testなどのツールを利用して、テストの検証、明確なオプションの提示、選択されたワークフローの実行を行い、開発ブランチを効率的に完了できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"npm test, cargo test, pytest 및 go test와 같은 도구를 사용하여 테스트驗證, 명확한 옵션 제시 및 선택된 워크플로우 실행을 통해 개발 브랜치를 효율적으로 완료할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes finalizar de manera eficiente las ramas de desarrollo verificando pruebas, presentando opciones claras y ejecutando flujos de trabajo elegidos, aprovechando herramientas como npm test, cargo test, pytest y go test.","fr":"Permet aux agents de terminer efficacement les branches de développement en vérifiant les tests, en présentant des options claires et en exécutant les flux de travail choisis, en exploitant des outils tels que npm test, cargo test, pytest et go test.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entwicklungszweige effizient abzuschließen, indem sie Tests überprüfen, klare Optionen präsentieren und ausgewählte Arbeitsabläufe ausführen, unter Nutzung von Tools wie npm test, cargo test, pytest und go test.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a concluir eficientemente os ramos de desenvolvimento, verificando os testes, apresentando opções claras e executando os fluxos de trabalho escolhidos, utilizando ferramentas como npm test, cargo test, pytest e go test.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно завершать ветки разработки, проверяя тесты, представляя четкие варианты и выполняя выбранные рабочие процессы, используя инструменты, такие как npm test, cargo test, pytest и go test.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إكمال الفروع التطويرية بفعالية من خلال التحقق من الاختبارات، وتقديم خيارات واضحة، وتنفيذ سير العمل المختار، مستخدماً أدوات مثل npm test، cargo test، pytest، و go test."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test verification for development branches","Streamlining workflow options presentation","Executing chosen workflows with cleanup"],"zh":["为开发分支自动化测试驗證","简化工作流选项的呈现","执行所选工作流并进行清理"],"ja":["開発ブランチのテスト検証の自動化","ワークフローオプションの提示の簡素化","選択されたワークフローの実行とクリーンアップ"],"ko":["개발 브랜치의 테스트驗證 자동화","워크플로우 옵션의 제시 단순화","선택된 워크플로우의 실행 및 정리"],"es":["Automatización de la verificación de pruebas para ramas de desarrollo","Presentación optimizada de opciones de flujo de trabajo","Ejecución de flujos de trabajo elegidos con limpieza"],"fr":["Automatisation de la vérification des tests pour les branches de développement","Présentation optimisée des options de flux de travail","Exécution des flux de travail choisis avec nettoyage"],"de":["Automatisierung der Testüberprüfung für Entwicklungszweige","Optimierung der Arbeitsablauf-Optionenpräsentation","Ausführung der ausgewählten Arbeitsabläufe mit Bereinigung"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação de testes para ramos de desenvolvimento","Otimizar a apresentação de opções de fluxo de trabalho","Executar fluxos de trabalho escolhidos com limpeza"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку тестов для веток разработки","Упростить представление вариантов рабочего процесса","Выполнять выбранные рабочие процессы с очисткой"],"ar":["تأتمتة التحقق من الاختبارات للفروع التطويرية","تبسيط عرض خيارات سير العمل","تنفيذ سير العمل المختار مع التنظيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project test suite setup","Limited to supported testing frameworks like npm, cargo, pytest, and go test"],"zh":["需要项目测试套件的设置","仅限于支持的测试框架，如npm、cargo、pytest和go test"],"ja":["プロジェクトのテストスイートの設定が必要","サポートされているテストフレームワークのみ（npm、cargo、pytest、go testなど）"],"ko":["프로젝트 테스트 스위트 설정이 필요합니다","지원되는 테스트 프레임워크만 해당됨(npm, cargo, pytest, go test 등)"],"es":["Requiere la configuración del conjunto de pruebas del proyecto","Limitado a marcos de pruebas compatibles como npm, cargo, pytest y go test"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du jeu de tests du projet","Limité aux cadres de tests pris en charge tels que npm, cargo, pytest et go test"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung des Test-Suiten-Setups des Projekts","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Testframeworks wie npm, cargo, pytest und go test"],"pt":["Exige configuração do conjunto de testes do projeto","Limitado a estruturas de teste compatíveis, como npm, cargo, pytest e go test"],"ru":["Требует настройки тестового набора проекта","Ограничен поддерживаемыми фреймворками тестирования, такими как npm, cargo, pytest и go test"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مجموعة اختبار المشروع","محدود بالإطارات الاختبارية المدعومة، مثل npm، cargo، pytest، و go test"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
