"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"k8s-security-policies","description":"Implement Kubernetes security policies including NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, and RBAC for production-grade security. Use when securing Kubernetes clusters, implementing network isolation, or enforcing pod security standards.","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes Security Policies\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards in Kubernetes.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement defense-in-depth security for Kubernetes clusters using network policies, pod security standards, and RBAC.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implement network segmentation\n- Configure pod security standards\n- Set up RBAC for least-privilege access\n- Create security policies for compliance\n- Implement admission control\n- Secure","body":"# Kubernetes Security Policies\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards in Kubernetes.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement defense-in-depth security for Kubernetes clusters using network policies, pod security standards, and RBAC.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implement network segmentation\n- Configure pod security standards\n- Set up RBAC for least-privilege access\n- Create security policies for compliance\n- Implement admission control\n- Secure multi-tenant clusters\n\n## Pod Security Standards\n\n### 1. Privileged (Unrestricted)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: privileged-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: privileged\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: privileged\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: privileged\n```\n\n### 2. Baseline (Minimally restrictive)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: baseline-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: baseline\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: baseline\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: baseline\n```\n\n### 3. Restricted (Most restrictive)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: restricted-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: restricted\n```\n\n## Network Policies\n\n### Default Deny All\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: default-deny-all\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n    - Ingress\n    - Egress\n```\n\n### Allow Frontend to Backend\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend-to-backend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: backend\n  policyTypes:\n    - Ingress\n  ingress:\n    - from:\n        - podSelector:\n            matchLabels:\n              app: frontend\n      ports:\n        - protocol: TCP\n          port: 8080\n```\n\n### Allow DNS\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-dns\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n    - Egress\n  egress:\n    - to:\n        - namespaceSelector:\n            matchLabels:\n              name: kube-system\n      ports:\n        - protocol: UDP\n          port: 53\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/network-policy-template.yaml`\n\n## RBAC Configuration\n\n### Role (Namespace-scoped)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Role\nmetadata:\n  name: pod-reader\n  namespace: production\nrules:\n  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\n    resources: [\"pods\"]\n    verbs: [\"get\", \"watch\", \"list\"]\n```\n\n### ClusterRole (Cluster-wide)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: ClusterRole\nmetadata:\n  name: secret-reader\nrules:\n  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\n    resources: [\"secrets\"]\n    verbs: [\"get\", \"watch\", \"list\"]\n```\n\n### RoleBinding\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: RoleBinding\nmetadata:\n  name: read-pods\n  namespace: production\nsubjects:\n  - kind: User\n    name: jane\n    apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n  - kind: ServiceAccount\n    name: default\n    namespace: production\nroleRef:\n  kind: Role\n  name: pod-reader\n  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/rbac-patterns.md`\n\n## Pod Security Context\n\n### Restricted Pod\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\n  name: secure-pod\nspec:\n  securityContext:\n    runAsNonRoot: true\n    runAsUser: 1000\n    fsGroup: 1000\n    seccompProfile:\n      type: RuntimeDefault\n  containers:\n    - name: app\n      image: myapp:1.0\n      securityContext:\n        allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n        readOnlyRootFilesystem: true\n        capabilities:\n          drop:\n            - ALL\n```\n\n## Policy Enforcement with OPA Gatekeeper\n\n### ConstraintTemplate\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: templates.gatekeeper.sh/v1\nkind: ConstraintTemplate\nmetadata:\n  name: k8srequiredlabels\nspec:\n  crd:\n    spec:\n      names:\n        kind: K8sRequiredLabels\n      validation:\n        openAPIV3Schema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            labels:\n              type: array\n              items:\n                type: string\n  targets:\n    - target: admission.k8s.gatekeeper.sh\n      rego: |\n        package k8srequiredlabels\n        violation[{\"msg\": msg, \"details\": {\"missing_labels\": missing}}] {\n          provided := {label | input.review.object.metadata.labels[label]}\n          required := {label | label := input.parameters.labels[_]}\n          missing := required - provided\n          count(missing) > 0\n          msg := sprintf(\"missing required labels: %v\", [missing])\n        }\n```\n\n### Constraint\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: constraints.gatekeeper.sh/v1beta1\nkind: K8sRequiredLabels\nmetadata:\n  name: require-app-label\nspec:\n  match:\n    kinds:\n      - apiGroups: [\"apps\"]\n        kinds: [\"Deployment\"]\n  parameters:\n    labels: [\"app\", \"environment\"]\n```\n\n## Service Mesh Security (Istio)\n\n### PeerAuthentication (mTLS)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: PeerAuthentication\nmetadata:\n  name: default\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  mtls:\n    mode: STRICT\n```\n\n### AuthorizationPolicy\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: AuthorizationPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: backend\n  action: ALLOW\n  rules:\n    - from:\n        - source:\n            principals: [\"cluster.local/ns/production/sa/frontend\"]\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Implement Pod Security Standards** at namespace level\n2. **Use Network Policies** for network segmentation\n3. **Apply least-privilege RBAC** for all service accounts\n4. **Enable admission control** (OPA Gatekeeper/Kyverno)\n5. **Run containers as non-root**\n6. **Use read-only root filesystem**\n7. **Drop all capabilities** unless needed\n8. **Implement resource quotas** and limit ranges\n9. **Enable audit logging** for security events\n10. **Regular security scanning** of images\n\n## Compliance Frameworks\n\n### CIS Kubernetes Benchmark\n\n- Use RBAC authorization\n- Enable audit logging\n- Use Pod Security Standards\n- Configure network policies\n- Implement secrets encryption at rest\n- Enable node authentication\n\n### NIST Cybersecurity Framework\n\n- Implement defense in depth\n- Use network segmentation\n- Configure security monitoring\n- Implement access controls\n- Enable logging and monitoring\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**NetworkPolicy not working:**\n\n```bash\n# Check if CNI supports NetworkPolicy\nkubectl get nodes -o wide\nkubectl describe networkpolicy <name>\n```\n\n**RBAC permission denied:**\n\n```bash\n# Check effective permissions\nkubectl auth can-i list pods --as system:serviceaccount:default:my-sa\nkubectl auth can-i ''*'' ''*'' --as system:serviceaccount:default:my-sa\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `assets/network-policy-template.yaml` - Network policy examples\n- `assets/pod-security-template.yaml` - Pod security policies\n- `references/rbac-patterns.md` - RBAC configuration patterns\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `k8s-manifest-generator` - For creating secure manifests\n- `gitops-workflow` - For automated policy deployment\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:05:30.762Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Security Agents requiring advanced Kubernetes security policy management and NetworkPolicy implementation.","zh":"适用于需要高级Kubernetes安全策略管理和NetworkPolicy实现的云安全代理。","ja":"Kubernetesのセキュリティポリシー管理とNetworkPolicyの実装が必要なクラウドセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Kubernetes 보안 정책 관리 및 NetworkPolicy 구현이 필요한 클라우드 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad en la nube que requieren una gestión de políticas de seguridad de Kubernetes avanzada y una implementación de NetworkPolicy.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité cloud nécessitant une gestion avancée des stratégies de sécurité Kubernetes et une mise en œuvre de NetworkPolicy.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die eine erweiterte Kubernetes-Sicherheitsrichtlinienverwaltung und eine NetworkPolicy-Implementierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que requerem gerenciamento avançado de políticas de segurança do Kubernetes e implementação da NetworkPolicy.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности облака, требующих продвинутого управления политикой безопасности Kubernetes и реализации NetworkPolicy.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة متقدمة لسياسات أمان Kubernetes وتنفيذ سياسة الشبكة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce defense-in-depth security for Kubernetes clusters using PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards, ensuring compliance and least-privilege access through admission control and security policy configuration.","zh":"赋予代理执行Kubernetes集群的深度防御安全功能，使用PodSecurityPolicy、RBAC和Pod安全标准，确保合规性和最小特权访问通过入站控制和安全策略配置。","ja":"エージェントに、PodSecurityPolicy、RBAC、Podセキュリティスタンダードを使用してKubernetesクラスターのディープディフェンスセキュリティを実施する機能を提供し、入場制御とセキュリティポリシーの構成を介して、コンプライアンスと最小限の特権アクセスを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC 및 Pod 보안 표준을 사용하여 Kubernetes 클러스터의 심층 방어 보안을 시행할 수 있도록 하며, 입장 제어 및 보안 정책 구성 통해 규정 준수 및 최소 특권 접근을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar una seguridad de defensa en profundidad para clústeres de Kubernetes utilizando PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC y normas de seguridad de pods, garantizando el cumplimiento y el acceso con los privilegios mínimos necesarios a través del control de admisión y la configuración de políticas de seguridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une sécurité de défense en profondeur pour les clusters Kubernetes en utilisant PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC et les normes de sécurité des pods, garantissant ainsi la conformité et l''accès avec les privilèges minimum nécessaires via le contrôle d''admission et la configuration des stratégies de sécurité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine verteidigungstiefe-Sicherheit für Kubernetes-Cluster mit PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC und Pod-Sicherheitsstandards durchzusetzen, um die Einhaltung und den least-privilege-Zugriff durch Zulassungskontrolle und Sicherheitsrichtlinienkonfiguration sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor segurança em profundidade para clusters do Kubernetes usando PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC e Padrões de Segurança de Pod, garantindo conformidade e acesso com os privilégios mínimos necessários por meio do controle de admissão e configuração de política de segurança.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать защиту в глубину для кластеров Kubernetes с помощью PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC и стандартов безопасности под, обеспечивая соответствие и доступ с минимальными привилегиями через контроль приема и конфигурацию политики безопасности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض أمان متعمق للعقد السحابية باستخدام PodSecurityPolicy و RBAC ومعايير أمان الحاويات، مما يضمن المطابقة والوصول بأقل صلاحيات ضرورية من خلال مراقبة القبول وتكوين سياسة الأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing network segmentation using NetworkPolicy","Configuring pod security standards for compliance","Setting up RBAC for least-privilege access control","Creating security policies for Kubernetes clusters","Enforcing admission control for secure pod deployment"],"zh":["使用NetworkPolicy实现网络分段","为合规性配置Pod安全标准","设置RBAC用于最小特权访问控制","为Kubernetes集群创建安全策略","执行入站控制以实现安全Pod部署"],"ja":["NetworkPolicyを使用したネットワークセグメンテーションの実装","コンプライアンスのためにPodセキュリティスタンダードを構成する","最小特権アクセス制御のためのRBACの設定","Kubernetesクラスターのセキュリティポリシーの作成","安全なPodデプロイのための入場制御の実施"],"ko":["NetworkPolicy를 사용한 네트워크 분할 구현","준수성을 위한 Pod 보안 표준 구성","최소 특권 접근 제어를 위한 RBAC 설정","Kubernetes 클러스터의 보안 정책 생성","안전한 Pod 배포를 위한 입장 제어 시행"],"es":["Implementar la segmentación de red mediante NetworkPolicy","Configurar los estándares de seguridad de pods para el cumplimiento","Configurar RBAC para el control de acceso con los privilegios mínimos","Crear políticas de seguridad para clústeres de Kubernetes","Aplicar el control de admisión para una implementación de pods segura"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la segmentation du réseau à l''aide de NetworkPolicy","Configurer les normes de sécurité des pods pour la conformité","Configurer RBAC pour le contrôle d''accès avec les privilèges minimum","Créer des stratégies de sécurité pour les clusters Kubernetes","Mettre en œuvre le contrôle d''admission pour un déploiement de pods sécurisé"],"de":["Netzsegmentierung mithilfe von NetworkPolicy implementieren","Pod-Sicherheitsstandards für die Einhaltung konfigurieren","RBAC für least-privilege-Zugriffskontrolle konfigurieren","Sicherheitsrichtlinien für Kubernetes-Cluster erstellen","Zulassungskontrolle für sichere Pod-Bereitstellung durchsetzen"],"pt":["Implementação de segmentação de rede usando NetworkPolicy","Configuração de padrões de segurança de pod para conformidade","Configuração do RBAC para controle de acesso com privilégios mínimos","Criação de políticas de segurança para clusters do Kubernetes","Aplicação do controle de admissão para implantação segura de pods"],"ru":["Реализация сегментации сети с помощью NetworkPolicy","Настройка стандартов безопасности под для соответствия","Настройка RBAC для контроля доступа с минимальными привилегиями","Создание политик безопасности для кластеров Kubernetes","Применение контроля приема для безопасного развертывания под"],"ar":["تنفيذ تجزئة الشبكة باستخدام سياسة الشبكة","تكوين معايير أمان الحاويات للمطابقة","تهيئة RBAC للتحكم في الوصول بأقل صلاحيات ضرورية","إنشاء سياسات أمان للعقد السحابية","تطبيق مراقبة القبول لنشر حاويات آمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kubernetes cluster access","Knowledge of Kubernetes security concepts necessary","Compatibility with specific Kubernetes versions may vary"],"zh":["需要Kubernetes集群访问","需要Kubernetes安全概念的知识","与特定Kubernetes版本的兼容性可能会有所不同"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスターへのアクセスが必要","Kubernetesセキュリティ概念の知識が必要","特定のKubernetesバージョンとの互換性は異なる場合があります"],"ko":["Kubernetes 클러스터 액세스가 필요합니다","Kubernetes 보안 개념에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","특정 Kubernetes 버전과의 호환성은 다를 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al clúster de Kubernetes","Conocimiento de conceptos de seguridad de Kubernetes necesario","La compatibilidad con versiones específicas de Kubernetes puede variar"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au cluster Kubernetes","Connaissances des concepts de sécurité Kubernetes nécessaires","La compatibilité avec des versions spécifiques de Kubernetes peut varier"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Kubernetes-Cluster","Kenntnisse von Kubernetes-Sicherheitskonzepten erforderlich","Die Kompatibilität mit bestimmten Kubernetes-Versionen kann variieren"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao cluster do Kubernetes","Conhecimento de conceitos de segurança do Kubernetes necessário","Compatibilidade com versões específicas do Kubernetes pode variar"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кластеру Kubernetes","Необходимо знание концепций безопасности Kubernetes","Совместимость с определенными версиями Kubernetes может варьироваться"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى العقدة السحابية","معلومات ضرورية عن مفاهيم أمان Kubernetes","قد تختلف متطلبات التوافق مع إصدارات Kubernetes المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
