та трафика с помощью Wireshark","Анализ сетевых протоколов","Документация протоколов для взаимодействия","Отладка сетевых проблем","Использование фильтров для захвата específico трафика","Создание буферов колец для захвата трафика"],"ar":["تقنيات التقاط حركة المرور باستخدام Wireshark","تحليل بروتوكولات الشبكة","توثيق بروتوكولات للتفاعل","إصلاح مشاكل الشبكة","استخدام المرشحات لالتقاط حركة مرور محددة","إنشاء حلقات緩冲 لالتقاط حركة المرور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["协议逆向工程","网络协议分析","安全研究","互操作性","Wireshark","tcpdump","tshark","网络调试"],"ja":["プロトコル逆向エンジニアリング","ネットワークプロトコル分析","セキュリティ研究","相互運用性","Wireshark","tcpdump","tshark","ネットワークデバッグ"],"ko":["프로토콜 역공학","네트워크 프로토콜 분석","보안 연구","상호 운용성","Wireshark","tcpdump","tshark","네트워크 디버깅"],"es":["ingeniería inversa de protocolos","captura de tráfico de red","análisis de protocolos","Wireshark","tcpdump","seguridad de protocolos","interoperabilidad","depuración de red"],"fr":["ingénierie inverse de protocoles","capture de trafic réseau","analyse de protocoles","Wireshark","tcpdump","sécurité des protocoles","interopérabilité","débogage de réseau"],"de":["Protokoll-Reverse-Engineering","Erfassung von Netzwerkverkehr","Analyse von Protokollen","Wireshark","tcpdump","Sicherheit von Protokollen","Interoperabilität","Fehlersuche bei Netzwerkproblemen"],"pt":["engenharia reversa de protocolos","captura de tráfego","análise de protocolos","wireshark","depuração de rede","interoperabilidade","protocolos de rede","segurança de rede","desenvolvimento de rede"],"ru":["обратная инженерия протоколов","захват трафика","анализ протоколов","wireshark","отладка сети","взаимодействие","сетевые протоколы","безопасность сети","разработка сети"],"ar":["هندسة البروتوكول العكسية","التقاط حركة المرور","تحليل بروتوكولات","wireshark","إصلاح الشبكة","التفاعل","بروتوكولات الشبكة","أمن الشبكة","تطوير الشبكة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"protocol-reverse-engineering","description":"Master network protocol reverse engineering including packet analysis, protocol dissection, and custom protocol documentation. Use when analyzing network traffic, understanding proprietary protocols, or debugging network communication.","bodyPreview":"# Protocol Reverse Engineering\n\nComprehensive techniques for capturing, analyzing, and documenting network protocols for security research, interoperability, and debugging.\n\n## Traffic Capture\n\n### Wireshark Capture\n\n```bash\n# Capture on specific interface\nwireshark -i eth0 -k\n\n# Capture with filter\nwireshark -i eth0 -k -f \"port 443\"\n\n# Capture to file\ntshark -i eth0 -w capture.pcap\n\n# Ring buffer capture (rotate files)\ntshark -i eth0 -b filesize:100000 -b files:10 -w capture.pcap\n```\n\n### tcpdu","body":"# Protocol Reverse Engineering\n\nComprehensive techniques for capturing, analyzing, and documenting network protocols for security research, interoperability, and debugging.\n\n## Traffic Capture\n\n### Wireshark Capture\n\n```bash\n# Capture on specific interface\nwireshark -i eth0 -k\n\n# Capture with filter\nwireshark -i eth0 -k -f \"port 443\"\n\n# Capture to file\ntshark -i eth0 -w capture.pcap\n\n# Ring buffer capture (rotate files)\ntshark -i eth0 -b filesize:100000 -b files:10 -w capture.pcap\n```\n\n### tcpdump Capture\n\n```bash\n# Basic capture\ntcpdump -i eth0 -w capture.pcap\n\n# With filter\ntcpdump -i eth0 port 8080 -w capture.pcap\n\n# Capture specific bytes\ntcpdump -i eth0 -s 0 -w capture.pcap  # Full packet\n\n# Real-time display\ntcpdump -i eth0 -X port 80\n```\n\n### Man-in-the-Middle Capture\n\n```bash\n# mitmproxy for HTTP/HTTPS\nmitmproxy --mode transparent -p 8080\n\n# SSL/TLS interception\nmitmproxy --mode transparent --ssl-insecure\n\n# Dump to file\nmitmdump -w traffic.mitm\n\n# Burp Suite\n# Configure browser proxy to 127.0.0.1:8080\n```\n\n## Protocol Analysis\n\n### Wireshark Analysis\n\n```\n# Display filters\ntcp.port == 8080\nhttp.request.method == \"POST\"\nip.addr == 192.168.1.1\ntcp.flags.syn == 1 && tcp.flags.ack == 0\nframe contains \"password\"\n\n# Following streams\nRight-click > Follow > TCP Stream\nRight-click > Follow > HTTP Stream\n\n# Export objects\nFile > Export Objects > HTTP\n\n# Decryption\nEdit > Preferences > Protocols > TLS\n  - (Pre)-Master-Secret log filename\n  - RSA keys list\n```\n\n### tshark Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Extract specific fields\ntshark -r capture.pcap -T fields -e ip.src -e ip.dst -e tcp.port\n\n# Statistics\ntshark -r capture.pcap -q -z conv,tcp\ntshark -r capture.pcap -q -z endpoints,ip\n\n# Filter and extract\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"http\" -T json > http_traffic.json\n\n# Protocol hierarchy\ntshark -r capture.pcap -q -z io,phs\n```\n\n### Scapy for Custom Analysis\n\n```python\nfrom scapy.all import *\n\n# Read pcap\npackets = rdpcap(\"capture.pcap\")\n\n# Analyze packets\nfor pkt in packets:\n    if pkt.haslayer(TCP):\n        print(f\"Src: {pkt[IP].src}:{pkt[TCP].sport}\")\n        print(f\"Dst: {pkt[IP].dst}:{pkt[TCP].dport}\")\n        if pkt.haslayer(Raw):\n            print(f\"Data: {pkt[Raw].load[:50]}\")\n\n# Filter packets\nhttp_packets = [p for p in packets if p.haslayer(TCP)\n                and (p[TCP].sport == 80 or p[TCP].dport == 80)]\n\n# Create custom packets\npkt = IP(dst=\"target\")/TCP(dport=80)/Raw(load=\"GET / HTTP/1.1\\r\\n\")\nsend(pkt)\n```\n\n## Protocol Identification\n\n### Common Protocol Signatures\n\n```\nHTTP        - \"HTTP/1.\" or \"GET \" or \"POST \" at start\nTLS/SSL     - 0x16 0x03 (record layer)\nDNS         - UDP port 53, specific header format\nSMB         - 0xFF 0x53 0x4D 0x42 (\"SMB\" signature)\nSSH         - \"SSH-2.0\" banner\nFTP         - \"220 \" response, \"USER \" command\nSMTP        - \"220 \" banner, \"EHLO\" command\nMySQL       - 0x00 length prefix, protocol version\nPostgreSQL  - 0x00 0x00 0x00 startup length\nRedis       - \"*\" RESP array prefix\nMongoDB     - BSON documents with specific header\n```\n\n### Protocol Header Patterns\n\n```\n+--------+--------+--------+--------+\n|  Magic number / Signature         |\n+--------+--------+--------+--------+\n|  Version       |  Flags          |\n+--------+--------+--------+--------+\n|  Length        |  Message Type   |\n+--------+--------+--------+--------+\n|  Sequence Number / Session ID     |\n+--------+--------+--------+--------+\n|  Payload...                       |\n+--------+--------+--------+--------+\n```\n\n## Binary Protocol Analysis\n\n### Structure Identification\n\n```python\n# Common patterns in binary protocols\n\n# Length-prefixed message\nstruct Message {\n    uint32_t length;      # Total message length\n    uint16_t msg_type;    # Message type identifier\n    uint8_t  flags;       # Flags/options\n    uint8_t  reserved;    # Padding/alignment\n    uint8_t  payload[];   # Variable-length payload\n};\n\n# Type-Length-Value (TLV)\nstruct TLV {\n    uint8_t  type;        # Field type\n    uint16_t length;      # Field length\n    uint8_t  value[];     # Field data\n};\n\n# Fixed header + variable payload\nstruct Packet {\n    uint8_t  magic[4];    # \"ABCD\" signature\n    uint32_t version;\n    uint32_t payload_len;\n    uint32_t checksum;    # CRC32 or similar\n    uint8_t  payload[];\n};\n```\n\n### Python Protocol Parser\n\n```python\nimport struct\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass\nclass MessageHeader:\n    magic: bytes\n    version: int\n    msg_type: int\n    length: int\n\n    @classmethod\n    def from_bytes(cls, data: bytes):\n        magic, version, msg_type, length = struct.unpack(\n            \">4sHHI\", data[:12]\n        )\n        return cls(magic, version, msg_type, length)\n\ndef parse_messages(data: bytes):\n    offset = 0\n    messages = []\n\n    while offset < len(data):\n        header = MessageHeader.from_bytes(data[offset:])\n        payload = data[offset+12:offset+12+header.length]\n        messages.append((header, payload))\n        offset += 12 + header.length\n\n    return messages\n\n# Parse TLV structure\ndef parse_tlv(data: bytes):\n    fields = []\n    offset = 0\n\n    while offset < len(data):\n        field_type = data[offset]\n        length = struct.unpack(\">H\", data[offset+1:offset+3])[0]\n        value = data[offset+3:offset+3+length]\n        fields.append((field_type, value))\n        offset += 3 + length\n\n    return fields\n```\n\n### Hex Dump Analysis\n\n```python\ndef hexdump(data: bytes, width: int = 16):\n    \"\"\"Format binary data as hex dump.\"\"\"\n    lines = []\n    for i in range(0, len(data), width):\n        chunk = data[i:i+width]\n        hex_part = '' ''.join(f''{b:02x}'' for b in chunk)\n        ascii_part = ''''.join(\n            chr(b) if 32 <= b < 127 else ''.''\n            for b in chunk\n        )\n        lines.append(f''{i:08x}  {hex_part:<{width*3}}  {ascii_part}'')\n    return ''\\n''.join(lines)\n\n# Example output:\n# 00000000  48 54 54 50 2f 31 2e 31  20 32 30 30 20 4f 4b 0d  HTTP/1.1 200 OK.\n# 00000010  0a 43 6f 6e 74 65 6e 74  2d 54 79 70 65 3a 20 74  .Content-Type: t\n```\n\n## Encryption Analysis\n\n### Identifying Encryption\n\n```python\n# Entropy analysis - high entropy suggests encryption/compression\nimport math\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef entropy(data: bytes) -> float:\n    if not data:\n        return 0.0\n    counter = Counter(data)\n    probs = [count / len(data) for count in counter.values()]\n    return -sum(p * math.log2(p) for p in probs)\n\n# Entropy thresholds:\n# < 6.0: Likely plaintext or structured data\n# 6.0-7.5: Possibly compressed\n# > 7.5: Likely encrypted or random\n\n# Common encryption indicators\n# - High, uniform entropy\n# - No obvious structure or patterns\n# - Length often multiple of block size (16 for AES)\n# - Possible IV at start (16 bytes for AES-CBC)\n```\n\n### TLS Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Extract TLS metadata\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"ssl.handshake\" \\\n    -T fields -e ip.src -e ssl.handshake.ciphersuite\n\n# JA3 fingerprinting (client)\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"ssl.handshake.type == 1\" \\\n    -T fields -e ssl.handshake.ja3\n\n# JA3S fingerprinting (server)\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"ssl.handshake.type == 2\" \\\n    -T fields -e ssl.handshake.ja3s\n\n# Certificate extraction\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"ssl.handshake.certificate\" \\\n    -T fields -e x509sat.printableString\n```\n\n### Decryption Approaches\n\n```bash\n# Pre-master secret log (browser)\nexport SSLKEYLOGFILE=/tmp/keys.log\n\n# Configure Wireshark\n# Edit > Preferences > Protocols > TLS\n# (Pre)-Master-Secret log filename: /tmp/keys.log\n\n# Decrypt with private key (if available)\n# Only works for RSA key exchange\n# Edit > Preferences > Protocols > TLS > RSA keys list\n```\n\n## Custom Protocol Documentation\n\n### Protocol Specification Template\n\n```markdown\n# Protocol Name Specification\n\n## Overview\n\nBrief description of protocol purpose and design.\n\n## Transport\n\n- Layer: TCP/UDP\n- Port: XXXX\n- Encryption: TLS 1.2+\n\n## Message Format\n\n### Header (12 bytes)\n\n| Offset | Size | Field   | Description             |\n| ------ | ---- | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| 0      | 4    | Magic   | 0x50524F54 (\"PROT\")     |\n| 4      | 2    | Version | Protocol version (1)    |\n| 6      | 2    | Type    | Message type identifier |\n| 8      | 4    | Length  | Payload length in bytes |\n\n### Message Types\n\n| Type | Name      | Description            |\n| ---- | --------- | ---------------------- |\n| 0x01 | HELLO     | Connection initiation  |\n| 0x02 | HELLO_ACK | Connection accepted    |\n| 0x03 | DATA      | Application data       |\n| 0x04 | CLOSE     | Connection termination |\n\n### Type 0x01: HELLO\n\n| Offset | Size | Field      | Description              |\n| ------ | ---- | ---------- | ------------------------ |\n| 0      | 4    | ClientID   | Unique client identifier |\n| 4      | 2    | Flags      | Connection flags         |\n| 6      | var  | Extensions | TLV-encoded extensions   |\n\n## State Machine\n```\n\n[INIT] --HELLO--> [WAIT_ACK] --HELLO_ACK--> [CONNECTED]\n|\nDATA/DATA\n|\n[CLOSED] <--CLOSE--+\n\n```\n\n## Examples\n### Connection Establishment\n```\n\nClient -> Server: HELLO (ClientID=0x12345678)\nServer -> Client: HELLO_ACK (Status=OK)\nClient -> Server: DATA (payload)\n\n```\n\n```\n\n### Wireshark Dissector (Lua)\n\n```lua\n-- custom_protocol.lua\nlocal proto = Proto(\"custom\", \"Custom Protocol\")\n\n-- Define fields\nlocal f_magic = ProtoField.string(\"custom.magic\", \"Magic\")\nlocal f_version = ProtoField.uint16(\"custom.version\", \"Version\")\nlocal f_type = ProtoField.uint16(\"custom.type\", \"Type\")\nlocal f_length = ProtoField.uint32(\"custom.length\", \"Length\")\nlocal f_payload = ProtoField.bytes(\"custom.payload\", \"Payload\")\n\nproto.fields = { f_magic, f_version, f_type, f_length, f_payload }\n\n-- Message type names\nlocal msg_types = {\n    [0x01] = \"HELLO\",\n    [0x02] = \"HELLO_ACK\",\n    [0x03] = \"DATA\",\n    [0x04] = \"CLOSE\"\n}\n\nfunction proto.dissector(buffer, pinfo, tree)\n    pinfo.cols.protocol = \"CUSTOM\"\n\n    local subtree = tree:add(proto, buffer())\n\n    -- Parse header\n    subtree:add(f_magic, buffer(0, 4))\n    subtree:add(f_version, buffer(4, 2))\n\n    local msg_type = buffer(6, 2):uint()\n    subtree:add(f_type, buffer(6, 2)):append_text(\n        \" (\" .. (msg_types[msg_type] or \"Unknown\") .. \")\"\n    )\n\n    local length = buffer(8, 4):uint()\n    subtree:add(f_length, buffer(8, 4))\n\n    if length > 0 then\n        subtree:add(f_payload, buffer(12, length))\n    end\nend\n\n-- Register for TCP port\nlocal tcp_table = DissectorTable.get(\"tcp.port\")\ntcp_table:add(8888, proto)\n```\n\n## Active Testing\n\n### Fuzzing with Boofuzz\n\n```python\nfrom boofuzz import *\n\ndef main():\n    session = Session(\n        target=Target(\n            connection=TCPSocketConnection(\"target\", 8888)\n        )\n    )\n\n    # Define protocol structure\n    s_initialize(\"HELLO\")\n    s_static(b\"\\x50\\x52\\x4f\\x54\")  # Magic\n    s_word(1, name=\"version\")       # Version\n    s_word(0x01, name=\"type\")       # Type (HELLO)\n    s_size(\"payload\", length=4)     # Length field\n    s_block_start(\"payload\")\n    s_dword(0x12345678, name=\"client_id\")\n    s_word(0, name=\"flags\")\n    s_block_end()\n\n    session.connect(s_get(\"HELLO\"))\n    session.fuzz()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n### Replay and Modification\n\n```python\nfrom scapy.all import *\n\n# Replay captured traffic\npackets = rdpcap(\"capture.pcap\")\nfor pkt in packets:\n    if pkt.haslayer(TCP) and pkt[TCP].dport == 8888:\n        send(pkt)\n\n# Modify and replay\nfor pkt in packets:\n    if pkt.haslayer(Raw):\n        # Modify payload\n        original = pkt[Raw].load\n        modified = original.replace(b\"client\", b\"CLIENT\")\n        pkt[Raw].load = modified\n        # Recalculate checksums\n        del pkt[IP].chksum\n        del pkt[TCP].chksum\n        send(pkt)\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Analysis Workflow\n\n1. **Capture traffic**: Multiple sessions, different scenarios\n2. **Identify boundaries**: Message start/end markers\n3. **Map structure**: Fixed header, variable payload\n4. **Identify fields**: Compare multiple samples\n5. **Document format**: Create specification\n6. **Validate understanding**: Implement parser/generator\n7. **Test edge cases**: Fuzzing, boundary conditions\n\n### Common Patterns to Look For\n\n- Magic numbers/signatures at message start\n- Version fields for compatibility\n- Length fields (often before variable data)\n- Type/opcode fields for message identification\n- Sequence numbers for ordering\n- Checksums/CRCs for integrity\n- Timestamps for timing\n- Session/connection identifiers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:05:41.490Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Network Analysis Agents needing advanced protocol reverse engineering capabilities with tools like Wireshark and tcpdump.","zh":"适用于需要高级协议逆向工程能力的网络分析代理，特别是使用Wireshark和tcpdump等工具。","ja":"ネットワーク分析エージェントが高度なプロトコル逆向エンジニアリング機能を必要とする場合に適しています。例えば、Wiresharkやtcpdumpなどのツールを使用します。","ko":"고급 프로토콜 역공학 기능이 필요한 네트워크 분석 에이전트에게 적합하며, Wireshark 및 tcpdump와 같은 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Red que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería inversa de protocolos con herramientas como Wireshark y tcpdump.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Réseau nécessitant des capacités avancées de rétro-ingénierie de protocoles avec des outils comme Wireshark et tcpdump.","de":"Ideal für Netzwerkanalyse-Agenten, die fortgeschrittene Fähigkeiten zur Protokoll-Reverse-Engineering mit Tools wie Wireshark und tcpdump benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Rede que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia reversa de protocolos com ferramentas como Wireshark e tcpdump.","ru":"Идеально для агентов сетевого анализа, которым необходимы расширенные возможности逆ной разработки протоколов с помощью инструментов, таких как Wireshark и tcpdump.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشبكة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة للهندسة العكسية للبروتوكولات باستخدام أدوات مثل Wireshark و tcpdump."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture, analyze, and document network protocols using techniques like traffic capture and protocol analysis, leveraging tools such as Wireshark and tcpdump to improve security research, interoperability, and debugging with protocols like TCP and HTTP.","zh":"赋予代理捕获、分析和记录网络协议的能力，使用流量捕获和协议分析等技术，利用Wireshark和tcpdump等工具提高安全研究、互操作性和调试，支持TCP和HTTP等协议。","ja":"エージェントがネットワークプロトコルをキャプチャ、分析、文書化する機能を提供します。トラフィックキャプチャやプロトコル分析などの手法を使用し、Wiresharkやtcpdumpなどのツールを利用して、セキュリティ研究、相互運用性、デバッグを改善します。TCPやHTTPなどのプロトコルに対応しています。","ko":"에이전트가 네트워크 프로토콜을 캡처, 분석 및 문서화할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여, 트래픽 캡처 및 프로토콜 분석과 같은 기술을 사용하고, Wireshark 및 tcpdump와 같은 도구를 활용하여 보안 연구, 상호 운용性 및 디버깅을 개선하며, TCP 및 HTTP와 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para capturar, analizar y documentar protocolos de red utilizando técnicas como captura de tráfico y análisis de protocolos, aprovechando herramientas como Wireshark y tcpdump para mejorar la investigación de seguridad, interoperabilidad y depuración con protocolos como TCP y HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer, analyser et documenter les protocoles réseau en utilisant des techniques comme la capture de trafic et l''analyse de protocoles, en tirant parti d''outils tels que Wireshark et tcpdump pour améliorer la recherche en sécurité, l''interopérabilité et le débogage avec des protocoles comme TCP et HTTP.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten das Erfassen, Analysieren und Dokumentieren von Netzwerkprotokollen mit Techniken wie Traffic-Erfassung und Protokollanalyse unter Nutzung von Tools wie Wireshark und tcpdump, um die Sicherheitsforschung, Interoperabilität und Fehlerbehebung bei Protokollen wie TCP und HTTP zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar, analisar e documentar protocolos de rede usando técnicas como captura de tráfego e análise de protocolos, aproveitando ferramentas como Wireshark e tcpdump para melhorar a pesquisa de segurança, interoperabilidade e depuração com protocolos como TCP e HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить, проанализировать и задокументировать сетевые протоколы, используя методы, такие как захват трафика и анализ протоколов, используя инструменты, такие как Wireshark и tcpdump, для улучшения исследований безопасности, взаимодействия и отладки с протоколами, такими как TCP и HTTP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التقاط وتحليل ووثائق بروتوكولات الشبكة باستخدام تقنيات مثل التقاط حركة المرور وتحليل البروتوكول، واستخدام أدوات مثل Wireshark و tcpdump لتحسين أبحاث الأمان والتشغيل البيني وتصحيح الأخطاء مع بروتوكولات مثل TCP و HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Capturing and analyzing network traffic with Wireshark","Debugging protocol issues with tcpdump","Documenting network protocols for security research and interoperability"],"zh":["使用Wireshark捕获和分析网络流量","使用tcpdump调试协议问题","记录网络协议以进行安全研究和互操作性"],"ja":["Wiresharkを使用してネットワークトラフィックをキャプチャ、分析する","tcpdumpを使用してプロトコル問題をデバッグする","セキュリティ研究と相互運用性のためにネットワークプロトコルを文書化する"],"ko":["Wireshark를 사용하여 네트워크 트래픽을 캡처 및 분석하는 것","tcpdump를 사용하여 프로토콜 문제를 디버깅하는 것","보안 연구 및 상호 운용성을 위해 네트워크 프로토콜을 문서화하는 것"],"es":["Captura y análisis de tráfico de red con Wireshark","Depuración de problemas de protocolo con tcpdump","Documentación de protocolos de red para investigación de seguridad e interoperabilidad"],"fr":["Capture et analyse du trafic réseau avec Wireshark","Débogage des problèmes de protocole avec tcpdump","Documentation des protocoles réseau pour la recherche en sécurité et l''interopérabilité"],"de":["Erfassen und Analysieren von Netzwerkverkehr mit Wireshark","Behebung von Protokollproblemen mit tcpdump","Dokumentation von Netzwerkprotokollen für Sicherheitsforschung und Interoperabilität"],"pt":["Capturar e analisar tráfego de rede com Wireshark","Depurar problemas de protocolo com tcpdump","Documentar protocolos de rede para pesquisa de segurança e interoperabilidade"],"ru":["Захват и анализ сетевого трафика с помощью Wireshark","Отладка проблем протокола с помощью tcpdump","Документирование сетевых протоколов для исследований безопасности и взаимодействия"],"ar":["التقاط وتحليل حركة المرور عبر الشبكة باستخدام Wireshark","تصحيح أخطاء بروتوكول باستخدام tcpdump","توثيق بروتوكولات الشبكة لأبحاث الأمان والتشغيل البيني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires network interface access","Dependent on Wireshark and tcpdump installation","Limited to network protocol analysis"],"zh":["需要网络接口访问","依赖于Wireshark和tcpdump的安装","仅限于网络协议分析"],"ja":["ネットワークインターフェイスへのアクセスが必要","Wiresharkとtcpdumpのインストールに依存している","ネットワークプロトコル分析のみに限定される"],"ko":["네트워크 인터페이스 접근이 필요함","Wireshark 및 tcpdump 설치에 의존함","네트워크 프로토콜 분석에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de red","Depende de la instalación de Wireshark y tcpdump","Limitado al análisis de protocolos de red"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface réseau","Dépend de l''installation de Wireshark et tcpdump","Limité à l''analyse des protocoles réseau"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Netzwerkschnittstelle","Abhängig von der Installation von Wireshark und tcpdump","Beschränkt auf die Analyse von Netzwerkprotokollen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à interface de rede","Dependente da instalação do Wireshark e tcpdump","Limitado à análise de protocolos de rede"],"ru":["Требует доступа к сетевому интерфейсу","Зависит от установки Wireshark и tcpdump","Ограничен анализ сетевых протоколов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة الشبكة","يعتمد على تثبيت Wireshark و tcpdump","محدود بتحليل بروتوكولات الشبكة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/tailwind-design-system', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'tailwind-design-system', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z', '2026-02-18T14:05:34.893Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/tailwind-design-system","name":"tailwind-design-system","description":{"zh":"Tailwind 设计系统是一个用于构建生产就绪的设计系统的工具，包括设计令牌、组件变体、响应式模式和无障碍功能","ja":"Tailwind デザインシステムは、デザイン トークン、コンポーネント バリアント、レスポンシブ パターン、無障碍機能を含む生産就緒のデザイン システムを構築するためのツールです","ko":"Tailwind 디자인 시스템은 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 변형, 반응형 패턴 및無障碍 기능을 포함한 생산 준비 디자인 시스템을 구축하기 위한 도구입니다","es":"El sistema de diseño Tailwind es una herramienta para crear sistemas de diseño de producción con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Le système de conception Tailwind est un outil pour créer des systèmes de conception de production avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Das Tailwind Design System ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von produktionsbereiten Designsystemen mit Tailwind CSS.","pt":"O sistema de design Tailwind é uma ferramenta para criar componentes UI personalizados e consistentes com Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Система дизайна Tailwind — это инструмент для создания пользовательских и последовательных компонентов UI с помощью Tailwind CSS.","ar":"نظام تصميم تايلويند هو أداة لإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة والمتسقة مع تايلويند سي إس إس.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind 设计系统 - 构建生产就绪的设计系统","ja":"Tailwind デザインシステム - 生産就緒のデザインシステムを構築","ko":"Tailwind 디자인 시스템 - 생산 준비 디자인 시스템 구축","es":"Sistema de Diseño Tailwind","fr":"Système de Design Tailwind","de":"Tailwind Design System","pt":"Sistema de Design Tailwind","ru":"Система дизайна Tailwind","ar":"نظام تصميم تايلويند","en":"tailwind-design-system"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind 设计系统是一个用于构建生产就绪的设计系统的工具，包括设计令牌、组件变体、响应式模式和无障碍功能","ja":"Tailwind デザインシステムは、デザイン トークン、コンポーネント バリアント、レスポンシブ パターン、無障碍機能を含む生産就緒のデザイン システムを構築するためのツールです","ko":"Tailwind 디자인 시스템은 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 변형, 반응형 패턴 및無障碍 기능을 포함한 생산 준비 디자인 시스템을 구축하기 위한 도구입니다","es":"El sistema de diseño Tailwind es una herramienta para crear sistemas de diseño de producción con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Le système de conception Tailwind est un outil pour créer des systèmes de conception de production avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Das Tailwind Design System ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von produktionsbereiten Designsystemen mit Tailwind CSS.","pt":"O sistema de design Tailwind é uma ferramenta para criar componentes UI personalizados e consistentes com Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Система дизайна Tailwind — это инструмент для создания пользовательских и последовательных компонентов UI с помощью Tailwind CSS.","ar":"نظام تصميم تايلويند هو أداة لإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة والمتسقة مع تايلويند سي إس إس.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计令牌","组件变体","响应式模式","无障碍功能","暗黑模式","颜色方案"],"ja":["デザイン トークン","コンポーネント バリアント","レスポンシブ パターン","無障碍機能","ダーク モード","カラースキーム"],"ko":["디자인 토큰","컴포넌트 변형","반응형 패턴","无障碍 기능","다크 모드","컬러 스키마"],"es":["Tokens de diseño personalizables","Componentes responsivos y accesibles","Patrones de diseño reutilizables","Implementación de temas y modos oscuros","Establecimiento de patrones de interfaz de usuario estandarizados"],"fr":["Jetons de conception personnalisables","Composants responsives et accessibles","Modèles de conception réutilisables","Mise en œuvre de thèmes et de modes sombres","Établissement de modèles d''interface utilisateur standardisés"],"de":["Anpassbare Design-Tokens","Responsives und zugängliche Komponenten","Wiederverwendbare Designmuster","Implementierung von Themen und Dunkelmodus","Festlegung standardisierter Benutzeroberflächenmuster"],"pt":["Criação de bibliotecas de componentes com Tailwind","Implementação de tokens de design e temas","Criação de componentes responsivos e acessíveis","Padrões de UI personalizados","Migração para ou extensão do Tailwind CSS","Configuração de modo escuro e esquemas de cor"],"ru":["Создание библиотек компонентов с Tailwind","Реализация токенов дизайна и тем","Создание отзывчивых и доступных компонентов","Пользовательские паттерны UI","Миграция на или расширение Tailwind CSS","Настройка темного режима и схем цвета"],"ar":["إنشاء مكتبات المكونات مع تايلويند","تنفيذ رموز التصميم والأشكال","إنشاء مكونات قابلة للاستجابة وقابلة للوصول","أنماط واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","هجرة إلى أو توسيع تايلويند سي إس إس","ضبط وضع الغامق ومخططات الألوان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","设计系统","生产就绪","设计令牌","组件变体","响应式模式","无障碍功能"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","デザイン システム","生産就緒","デザイン トークン","コンポーネント バリアント","レスポンシブ パターン","無障碍機能"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","디자인 시스템","생산 준비","디자인 토큰","컴포넌트 변형","반응형 패턴","无障碍 기능"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","sistema de diseño","tokens de diseño","componentes responsivos","accesibilidad","patrones de diseño"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","système de conception","jetons de conception","composants responsives","accessibilité","modèles de conception"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Designsystem","Design-Tokens","responsives Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Designmuster"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","sistema de design","componentes UI","tokens de design","temas","responsivo","acessibilidade","modo escuro","esquemas de cor"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","система дизайна","компоненты UI","токены дизайна","темы","отзывчивый","доступность","темный режим","схемы цвета"],"ar":["تايلويند سي إس إس","نظام التصميم","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","رموز التصميم","الأشكال","قابل للاستجابة","قابل للوصول","وضع الغامق","مخططات الألوان"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-design-system","description":"Build scalable design systems with Tailwind CSS, design tokens, component libraries, and responsive patterns. Use when creating component libraries, implementing design systems, or standardizing UI patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind Design System\n\nBuild production-ready design systems with Tailwind CSS, including design tokens, component variants, responsive patterns, and accessibility.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating a component library with Tailwind\n- Implementing design tokens and theming\n- Building responsive and accessible components\n- Standardizing UI patterns across a codebase\n- Migrating to or extending Tailwind CSS\n- Setting up dark mode and color schemes\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Design Token Hie","body":"# Tailwind Design System\n\nBuild production-ready design systems with Tailwind CSS, including design tokens, component variants, responsive patterns, and accessibility.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating a component library with Tailwind\n- Implementing design tokens and theming\n- Building responsive and accessible components\n- Standardizing UI patterns across a codebase\n- Migrating to or extending Tailwind CSS\n- Setting up dark mode and color schemes\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Design Token Hierarchy\n\n```\nBrand Tokens (abstract)\n    └── Semantic Tokens (purpose)\n        └── Component Tokens (specific)\n\nExample:\n    blue-500 → primary → button-bg\n```\n\n### 2. Component Architecture\n\n```\nBase styles → Variants → Sizes → States → Overrides\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\n// tailwind.config.ts\nimport type { Config } from \"tailwindcss\";\n\nconst config: Config = {\n  content: [\"./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}\"],\n  darkMode: \"class\",\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        // Semantic color tokens\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n};\n\nexport default config;\n```\n\n```css\n/* globals.css */\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: CVA (Class Variance Authority) Components\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority''\nimport { forwardRef } from ''react''\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  // Base styles\n  ''inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50'',\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: ''bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90'',\n        destructive: ''bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90'',\n        outline: ''border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground'',\n        secondary: ''bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80'',\n        ghost: ''hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground'',\n        link: ''text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline'',\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: ''h-10 px-4 py-2'',\n        sm: ''h-9 rounded-md px-3'',\n        lg: ''h-11 rounded-md px-8'',\n        icon: ''h-10 w-10'',\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: ''default'',\n      size: ''default'',\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : ''button''\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = ''Button''\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n\n// Usage\n<Button variant=\"destructive\" size=\"lg\">Delete</Button>\n<Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n<Button asChild><Link href=\"/home\">Home</Link></Button>\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Compound Components\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/card.tsx\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\nimport { forwardRef } from ''react''\n\nconst Card = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(\n        ''rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm'',\n        className\n      )}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCard.displayName = ''Card''\n\nconst CardHeader = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardHeader.displayName = ''CardHeader''\n\nconst CardTitle = forwardRef<HTMLHeadingElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLHeadingElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <h3\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardTitle.displayName = ''CardTitle''\n\nconst CardDescription = forwardRef<HTMLParagraphElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLParagraphElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <p\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''text-sm text-muted-foreground'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardDescription.displayName = ''CardDescription''\n\nconst CardContent = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div ref={ref} className={cn(''p-6 pt-0'', className)} {...props} />\n  )\n)\nCardContent.displayName = ''CardContent''\n\nconst CardFooter = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''flex items-center p-6 pt-0'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardFooter.displayName = ''CardFooter''\n\nexport { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter }\n\n// Usage\n<Card>\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Account</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Manage your account settings</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <form>...</form>\n  </CardContent>\n  <CardFooter>\n    <Button>Save</Button>\n  </CardFooter>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Components\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/input.tsx\nimport { forwardRef } from ''react''\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\n\nexport interface InputProps extends React.InputHTMLAttributes<HTMLInputElement> {\n  error?: string\n}\n\nconst Input = forwardRef<HTMLInputElement, InputProps>(\n  ({ className, type, error, ...props }, ref) => {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"relative\">\n        <input\n          type={type}\n          className={cn(\n            ''flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50'',\n            error && ''border-destructive focus-visible:ring-destructive'',\n            className\n          )}\n          ref={ref}\n          aria-invalid={!!error}\n          aria-describedby={error ? `${props.id}-error` : undefined}\n          {...props}\n        />\n        {error && (\n          <p\n            id={`${props.id}-error`}\n            className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-destructive\"\n            role=\"alert\"\n          >\n            {error}\n          </p>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n)\nInput.displayName = ''Input''\n\n// components/ui/label.tsx\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority''\n\nconst labelVariants = cva(\n  ''text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70''\n)\n\nconst Label = forwardRef<HTMLLabelElement, React.LabelHTMLAttributes<HTMLLabelElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <label ref={ref} className={cn(labelVariants(), className)} {...props} />\n  )\n)\nLabel.displayName = ''Label''\n\n// Usage with React Hook Form\nimport { useForm } from ''react-hook-form''\nimport { zodResolver } from ''@hookform/resolvers/zod''\nimport * as z from ''zod''\n\nconst schema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(''Invalid email address''),\n  password: z.string().min(8, ''Password must be at least 8 characters''),\n})\n\nfunction LoginForm() {\n  const { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors } } = useForm({\n    resolver: zodResolver(schema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n      <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n        <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n        <Input\n          id=\"email\"\n          type=\"email\"\n          {...register(''email'')}\n          error={errors.email?.message}\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n        <Label htmlFor=\"password\">Password</Label>\n        <Input\n          id=\"password\"\n          type=\"password\"\n          {...register(''password'')}\n          error={errors.password?.message}\n        />\n      </div>\n      <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Sign In</Button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Responsive Grid System\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/grid.tsx\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority''\n\nconst gridVariants = cva(''grid'', {\n  variants: {\n    cols: {\n      1: ''grid-cols-1'',\n      2: ''grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2'',\n      3: ''grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3'',\n      4: ''grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4'',\n      5: ''grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5'',\n      6: ''grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6'',\n    },\n    gap: {\n      none: ''gap-0'',\n      sm: ''gap-2'',\n      md: ''gap-4'',\n      lg: ''gap-6'',\n      xl: ''gap-8'',\n    },\n  },\n  defaultVariants: {\n    cols: 3,\n    gap: ''md'',\n  },\n})\n\ninterface GridProps\n  extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof gridVariants> {}\n\nexport function Grid({ className, cols, gap, ...props }: GridProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={cn(gridVariants({ cols, gap, className }))} {...props} />\n  )\n}\n\n// Container component\nconst containerVariants = cva(''mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8'', {\n  variants: {\n    size: {\n      sm: ''max-w-screen-sm'',\n      md: ''max-w-screen-md'',\n      lg: ''max-w-screen-lg'',\n      xl: ''max-w-screen-xl'',\n      ''2xl'': ''max-w-screen-2xl'',\n      full: ''max-w-full'',\n    },\n  },\n  defaultVariants: {\n    size: ''xl'',\n  },\n})\n\ninterface ContainerProps\n  extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof containerVariants> {}\n\nexport function Container({ className, size, ...props }: ContainerProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={cn(containerVariants({ size, className }))} {...props} />\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Container>\n  <Grid cols={4} gap=\"lg\">\n    {products.map((product) => (\n      <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />\n    ))}\n  </Grid>\n</Container>\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Animation Utilities\n\n```typescript\n// lib/animations.ts - Tailwind CSS Animate utilities\nimport { cn } from ''./utils''\n\nexport const fadeIn = ''animate-in fade-in duration-300''\nexport const fadeOut = ''animate-out fade-out duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromTop = ''animate-in slide-in-from-top duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromBottom = ''animate-in slide-in-from-bottom duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromLeft = ''animate-in slide-in-from-left duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromRight = ''animate-in slide-in-from-right duration-300''\nexport const zoomIn = ''animate-in zoom-in-95 duration-300''\nexport const zoomOut = ''animate-out zoom-out-95 duration-300''\n\n// Compound animations\nexport const modalEnter = cn(fadeIn, zoomIn, ''duration-200'')\nexport const modalExit = cn(fadeOut, zoomOut, ''duration-200'')\nexport const dropdownEnter = cn(fadeIn, slideInFromTop, ''duration-150'')\nexport const dropdownExit = cn(fadeOut, ''slide-out-to-top'', ''duration-150'')\n\n// components/ui/dialog.tsx\nimport * as DialogPrimitive from ''@radix-ui/react-dialog''\n\nconst DialogOverlay = forwardRef<\n  React.ElementRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Overlay>,\n  React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Overlay>\n>(({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n  <DialogPrimitive.Overlay\n    ref={ref}\n    className={cn(\n      ''fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80'',\n      ''data-[state=open]:animate-in data-[state=closed]:animate-out'',\n      ''data-[state=closed]:fade-out-0 data-[state=open]:fade-in-0'',\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  />\n))\n\nconst DialogContent = forwardRef<\n  React.ElementRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>,\n  React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>\n>(({ className, children, ...props }, ref) => (\n  <DialogPortal>\n    <DialogOverlay />\n    <DialogPrimitive.Content\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(\n        ''fixed left-[50%] top-[50%] z-50 grid w-full max-w-lg translate-x-[-50%] translate-y-[-50%] gap-4 border bg-background p-6 shadow-lg'',\n        ''data-[state=open]:animate-in data-[state=closed]:animate-out'',\n        ''data-[state=closed]:fade-out-0 data-[state=open]:fade-in-0'',\n        ''data-[state=closed]:zoom-out-95 data-[state=open]:zoom-in-95'',\n        ''data-[state=closed]:slide-out-to-left-1/2 data-[state=closed]:slide-out-to-top-[48%]'',\n        ''data-[state=open]:slide-in-from-left-1/2 data-[state=open]:slide-in-from-top-[48%]'',\n        ''sm:rounded-lg'',\n        className\n      )}\n      {...props}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </DialogPrimitive.Content>\n  </DialogPortal>\n))\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Dark Mode Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// providers/ThemeProvider.tsx\n''use client''\n\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from ''react''\n\ntype Theme = ''dark'' | ''light'' | ''system''\n\ninterface ThemeProviderProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTheme?: Theme\n  storageKey?: string\n}\n\ninterface ThemeContextType {\n  theme: Theme\n  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => void\n  resolvedTheme: ''dark'' | ''light''\n}\n\nconst ThemeContext = createContext<ThemeContextType | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({\n  children,\n  defaultTheme = ''system'',\n  storageKey = ''theme'',\n}: ThemeProviderProps) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<Theme>(defaultTheme)\n  const [resolvedTheme, setResolvedTheme] = useState<''dark'' | ''light''>(''light'')\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const stored = localStorage.getItem(storageKey) as Theme | null\n    if (stored) setTheme(stored)\n  }, [storageKey])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = window.document.documentElement\n    root.classList.remove(''light'', ''dark'')\n\n    let resolved: ''dark'' | ''light''\n\n    if (theme === ''system'') {\n      resolved = window.matchMedia(''(prefers-color-scheme: dark)'').matches\n        ? ''dark''\n        : ''light''\n    } else {\n      resolved = theme\n    }\n\n    root.classList.add(resolved)\n    setResolvedTheme(resolved)\n  }, [theme])\n\n  const value = {\n    theme,\n    setTheme: (newTheme: Theme) => {\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, newTheme)\n      setTheme(newTheme)\n    },\n    resolvedTheme,\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <ThemeContext.Provider value={value}>{children}</ThemeContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport const useTheme = () => {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useTheme must be used within ThemeProvider'')\n  return context\n}\n\n// components/ThemeToggle.tsx\nimport { Moon, Sun } from ''lucide-react''\nimport { useTheme } from ''@/providers/ThemeProvider''\n\nexport function ThemeToggle() {\n  const { resolvedTheme, setTheme } = useTheme()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      variant=\"ghost\"\n      size=\"icon\"\n      onClick={() => setTheme(resolvedTheme === ''dark'' ? ''light'' : ''dark'')}\n    >\n      <Sun className=\"h-5 w-5 rotate-0 scale-100 transition-all dark:-rotate-90 dark:scale-0\" />\n      <Moon className=\"absolute h-5 w-5 rotate-90 scale-0 transition-all dark:rotate-0 dark:scale-100\" />\n      <span className=\"sr-only\">Toggle theme</span>\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Utility Functions\n\n```typescript\n// lib/utils.ts\nimport { type ClassValue, clsx } from \"clsx\";\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\";\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs));\n}\n\n// Focus ring utility\nexport const focusRing = cn(\n  \"focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2\",\n  \"focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2\",\n);\n\n// Disabled utility\nexport const disabled = \"disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50\";\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Use CSS variables** - Enable runtime theming\n- **Compose with CVA** - Type-safe variants\n- **Use semantic colors** - `primary` not `blue-500`\n- **Forward refs** - Enable composition\n- **Add accessibility** - ARIA attributes, focus states\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t use arbitrary values** - Extend theme instead\n- **Don''t nest @apply** - Hurts readability\n- **Don''t skip focus states** - Keyboard users need them\n- **Don''t hardcode colors** - Use semantic tokens\n- **Don''t forget dark mode** - Test both themes\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Tailwind CSS Documentation](https://tailwindcss.com/docs)\n- [CVA Documentation](https://cva.style/docs)\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/)\n- [Radix Primitives](https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:05:34.893Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined CSS development with Tailwind CSS","zh":"非常适合需要使用Tailwind CSS进行流畅CSS开发的前端代理","ja":"Tailwind CSSを使用したスムーズなCSS開発が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 효율적인 CSS 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de CSS optimizado con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''un développement de CSS rationalisé avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes CSS-Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de CSS simplificado com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим упрощенный разработка CSS с помощью Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تطور CSS مبسط مع Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready design systems with Tailwind CSS, including design tokens, component variants, responsive patterns, and accessibility, utilizing CSS libraries and responsive design protocols","zh":"赋予代理构建生产就绪的设计系统的能力，包括使用Tailwind CSS、设计令牌、组件变体、响应式模式和无障碍功能，利用CSS库和响应式设计协议","ja":"Tailwind CSSを使用して、デザイントークン、コンポーネントバリアント、レスポンシブパターン、アクセシビリティなどを含む生産就緒のデザインシステムを構築するエージェントの能力を付与します。CSSライブラリとレスポンシブデザインプロトコルを利用","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 변형, 반응형 패턴 및 접근성 등 포함된 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 디자인 시스템을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. CSS 라이브러리 및 반응형 디자인 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear sistemas de diseño listos para producción con Tailwind CSS, incluyendo tokens de diseño, variantes de componentes, patrones responsivos y accesibilidad, utilizando bibliotecas de CSS y protocolos de diseño responsivo","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes de conception prêts pour la production avec Tailwind CSS, y compris des jetons de conception, des variantes de composants, des modèles responsifs et une acessibilité, en utilisant des bibliothèques CSS et des protocoles de conception responsifs","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionssreife Designsysteme mit Tailwind CSS zu erstellen, einschließlich Design-Tokens, Komponenten-Varianten, responsiver Muster und Zugänglichkeit, unter Verwendung von CSS-Bibliotheken und responsiven Design-Protokollen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar sistemas de design de produção prontos com Tailwind CSS, incluindo tokens de design, variantes de componentes, padrões responsivos e acessibilidade, utilizando bibliotecas CSS e protocolos de design responsivo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать системы дизайна, готовые к производству, с помощью Tailwind CSS, включая токены дизайна, варианты компонентов, отзывчивые шаблоны и доступность, используя библиотеки CSS и протоколы отзывчивого дизайна","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية بناء أنظمة التصميم الجاهزة للانتاج مع Tailwind CSS، بما في ذلك رموز التصميم ومتغيرات المكونات وأنماط الاستجابة وسهولة الوصول، باستخدام مكتبات CSS وبروتوكولات التصميم الاستجابي"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating a component library with Tailwind","Implementing design tokens and theming","Building responsive and accessible components","Standardizing UI patterns across a codebase"],"zh":["使用Tailwind创建组件库","实施设计令牌和主题","构建响应式和无障碍组件","在代码库中标准化UI模式"],"ja":["Tailwindを使用したコンポーネントライブラリの作成","デザイントークンとテーマの実装","レスポンシブでアクセシブルなコンポーネントの構築","コードベース全体でUIパターンを標準化"],"ko":["Tailwind를 사용하여 컴포넌트 라이브러리를 생성","디자인 토큰 및 테마 구현","반응형 및 접근성 있는 컴포넌트 구축","코드베이스 전반에서 UI 패턴 표준화"],"es":["Crear una biblioteca de componentes con Tailwind","Implementar tokens de diseño y temas","Crear componentes responsivos y accesibles","Establecer patrones de interfaz de usuario estandarizados en una base de código"],"fr":["Créer une bibliothèque de composants avec Tailwind","Mettre en œuvre des jetons de conception et des thèmes","Construire des composants responsifs et accessibles","Normaliser les modèles d''interface utilisateur dans une base de code"],"de":["Erstellen einer Komponentenbibliothek mit Tailwind","Implementieren von Design-Tokens und Themen","Erstellen responsiver und zugänglicher Komponenten","Standardisieren von Benutzeroberflächen-Mustern in einem Codebase"],"pt":["Criar uma biblioteca de componentes com Tailwind","Implementar tokens de design e temas","Construir componentes responsivos e acessíveis","Padronizar padrões de UI em todo o código"],"ru":["Создание библиотеки компонентов с Tailwind","Реализация токенов дизайна и тем","Строительство отзывчивых и доступных компонентов","Стандартизация шаблонов UI на всём коде"],"ar":["إنشاء مكتبة مكونات مع Tailwind","تنفيذ رموز التصميم والتسمية","بناء المكونات المستجيبة وسهلة الوصول","تقييس أنماط واجهة المستخدم في جميع أنحاء الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS setup","Limited to CSS-based design systems"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS设置","仅限于基于CSS的设计系统"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSの設定が必要","CSSベースのデザインシステムに限定"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 설정이 필요","CSS 기반 디자인 시스템에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Tailwind CSS","Limitado a sistemas de diseño basados en CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Tailwind CSS","Limité aux systèmes de conception basés sur CSS"],"de":["Benötigt Tailwind CSS-Setup","Begrenzt auf CSS-basierte Designsysteme"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Tailwind CSS","Limitado a sistemas de design baseados em CSS"],"ru":["Требует настройки Tailwind CSS","Ограничен системами дизайна, основанными на CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Tailwind CSS","محدود بنظم التصميم القائمة على CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/tailwind-patterns', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'agent-bridge-kit', 'HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit', 'tailwind-patterns', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z', '2026-02-18T14:05:24.982Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/tailwind-patterns","name":"tailwind-patterns","description":{"zh":"Tailwind Patterns 是一种工具，用于转换 Antigravity IDE 配置，支持 GitHub Copilot、Cursor 等 IDE 和 Kiro、OpenCode 等 CLI。","ja":"Tailwind Patternsは、Antigravity IDEの設定を変換するツールで、GitHub Copilot、CursorなどのIDEやKiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIをサポートしています。","ko":"Tailwind Patterns는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 전환하는 도구로 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등의 IDE와 Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI를 지원합니다.","es":"Tailwind Patterns es una herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con otros entornos de desarrollo","fr":"Tailwind Patterns est un outil pour convertir les configurations d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec d''autres environnements de développement","de":"Tailwind Patterns ist ein Werkzeug zum Konvertieren von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in kompatible Formate für andere Entwicklungsumgebungen","pt":"A ferramenta tailwind-patterns é uma solução para converter configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs","ru":"Инструмент tailwind-patterns является решением для конвертации конфигураций Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI","ar":"أداة tailwind-patterns هي حل لتحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind Patterns：Antigravity IDE 配置转换工具","ja":"Tailwind Patterns：Antigravity IDE設定をCLIやIDEに変換","ko":"Tailwind Patterns: Antigravity IDE 설정 전환 도구","es":"Patrones de Tailwind: Conversión de configuraciones","fr":"Modèles Tailwind: Conversion de configurations","de":"Tailwind-Muster: Konfigurationskonvertierung","pt":"Padrões Tailwind: Ferramenta de Conversão","ru":"Шаблоны Tailwind: Инструмент Конвертации","ar":"نماذج Tailwind: أداة التحويل","en":"tailwind-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind Patterns 是一种工具，用于转换 Antigravity IDE 配置，支持 GitHub Copilot、Cursor 等 IDE 和 Kiro、OpenCode 等 CLI。","ja":"Tailwind Patternsは、Antigravity IDEの設定を変換するツールで、GitHub Copilot、CursorなどのIDEやKiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIをサポートしています。","ko":"Tailwind Patterns는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 전환하는 도구로 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등의 IDE와 Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI를 지원합니다.","es":"Tailwind Patterns es una herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con otros entornos de desarrollo","fr":"Tailwind Patterns est un outil pour convertir les configurations d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec d''autres environnements de développement","de":"Tailwind Patterns ist ein Werkzeug zum Konvertieren von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in kompatible Formate für andere Entwicklungsumgebungen","pt":"A ferramenta tailwind-patterns é uma solução para converter configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs","ru":"Инструмент tailwind-patterns является решением для конвертации конфигураций Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI","ar":"أداة tailwind-patterns هي حل لتحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持 Antigravity IDE 配置转换","兼容 GitHub Copilot、Cursor 等 IDE","兼容 Kiro、OpenCode 等 CLI","高性能的 Oxide 引擎","CSS-native 特性"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE設定の変換をサポート","GitHub Copilot、CursorなどのIDEと互換性","Kiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIと互換性","高速なOxideエンジン","CSSネイティブ機能"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 설정 전환 지원","GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등의 IDE와 호환","Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI와 호환","고성능 Oxide 엔진","CSS 네이티브 기능"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot y otros entornos de desarrollo","Soporte para Tailwind CSS v4","Arquitectura de Tailwind v4","Conceptos básicos de v4"],"fr":["Conversion de configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot et d''autres environnements de développement","Prise en charge de Tailwind CSS v4","Architecture de Tailwind v4","Concepts de base de v4"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot und anderen Entwicklungsumgebungen","Unterstützung für Tailwind CSS v4","Tailwind-v4-Architektur","Grundkonzepte von v4"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidade com IDEs como GitHub Copilot e Cursor","Compatibilidade com CLIs como Kiro e OpenCode","Arquitetura Tailwind v4","Oxide engine para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Antigravity IDE","Совместимость с IDE, такими как GitHub Copilot и Cursor","Совместимость с CLI, такими как Kiro и OpenCode","Архитектура Tailwind v4","Движок Oxide для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["تحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE","التوافق مع IDE مثل GitHub Copilot و Cursor","التوافق مع CLIs مثل Kiro و OpenCode","هندسة Tailwind v4","محرك Oxide لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind Patterns","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","CSS","Oxide 引擎"],"ja":["Tailwind Patterns","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","CSS","Oxideエンジン"],"ko":["Tailwind Patterns","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","CSS","Oxide 엔진"],"es":["Tailwind Patterns","Conversión de configuraciones","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Tailwind CSS v4","Desarrollo web","Herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Tailwind Patterns","Conversion de configurations","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Tailwind CSS v4","Développement web","Outils de développement"],"de":["Tailwind Patterns","Konfigurationskonvertierung","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Tailwind CSS v4","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["tailwind-patterns","conversão de configurações","Antigravity IDE","IDEs","CLIs","Tailwind v4","Oxide engine","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["tailwind-patterns","конвертация конфигураций","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","Tailwind v4","движок Oxide","веб-разработка"],"ar":["نماذج Tailwind","تحويل إعدادات","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","Tailwind v4","محرك Oxide","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-patterns","description":"Tailwind CSS v4 principles. CSS-first configuration, container queries, modern patterns, design token architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Patterns (v4 - 2025)\n\n> Modern utility-first CSS with CSS-native configuration.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Tailwind v4 Architecture\n\n### What Changed from v3\n\n| v3 (Legacy) | v4 (Current) |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| `tailwind.config.js` | CSS-based `@theme` directive |\n| PostCSS plugin | Oxide engine (10x faster) |\n| JIT mode | Native, always-on |\n| Plugin system | CSS-native features |\n| `@apply` directive | Still works, discouraged |\n\n### v4 Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Description |\n|---","body":"# Tailwind CSS Patterns (v4 - 2025)\n\n> Modern utility-first CSS with CSS-native configuration.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Tailwind v4 Architecture\n\n### What Changed from v3\n\n| v3 (Legacy) | v4 (Current) |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| `tailwind.config.js` | CSS-based `@theme` directive |\n| PostCSS plugin | Oxide engine (10x faster) |\n| JIT mode | Native, always-on |\n| Plugin system | CSS-native features |\n| `@apply` directive | Still works, discouraged |\n\n### v4 Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **CSS-first** | Configuration in CSS, not JavaScript |\n| **Oxide Engine** | Rust-based compiler, much faster |\n| **Native Nesting** | CSS nesting without PostCSS |\n| **CSS Variables** | All tokens exposed as `--*` vars |\n\n---\n\n## 2. CSS-Based Configuration\n\n### Theme Definition\n\n```\n@theme {\n  /* Colors - use semantic names */\n  --color-primary: oklch(0.7 0.15 250);\n  --color-surface: oklch(0.98 0 0);\n  --color-surface-dark: oklch(0.15 0 0);\n  \n  /* Spacing scale */\n  --spacing-xs: 0.25rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-md: 1rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 2rem;\n  \n  /* Typography */\n  --font-sans: ''Inter'', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: ''JetBrains Mono'', monospace;\n}\n```\n\n### When to Extend vs Override\n\n| Action | Use When |\n|--------|----------|\n| **Extend** | Adding new values alongside defaults |\n| **Override** | Replacing default scale entirely |\n| **Semantic tokens** | Project-specific naming (primary, surface) |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Container Queries (v4 Native)\n\n### Breakpoint vs Container\n\n| Type | Responds To |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Breakpoint** (`md:`) | Viewport width |\n| **Container** (`@container`) | Parent element width |\n\n### Container Query Usage\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| Define container | `@container` on parent |\n| Container breakpoint | `@sm:`, `@md:`, `@lg:` on children |\n| Named containers | `@container/card` for specificity |\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Scenario | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Page-level layouts | Viewport breakpoints |\n| Component-level responsive | Container queries |\n| Reusable components | Container queries (context-independent) |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Responsive Design\n\n### Breakpoint System\n\n| Prefix | Min Width | Target |\n|--------|-----------|--------|\n| (none) | 0px | Mobile-first base |\n| `sm:` | 640px | Large phone / small tablet |\n| `md:` | 768px | Tablet |\n| `lg:` | 1024px | Laptop |\n| `xl:` | 1280px | Desktop |\n| `2xl:` | 1536px | Large desktop |\n\n### Mobile-First Principle\n\n1. Write mobile styles first (no prefix)\n2. Add larger screen overrides with prefixes\n3. Example: `w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3`\n\n---\n\n## 5. Dark Mode\n\n### Configuration Strategies\n\n| Method | Behavior | Use When |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| `class` | `.dark` class toggles | Manual theme switcher |\n| `media` | Follows system preference | No user control |\n| `selector` | Custom selector (v4) | Complex theming |\n\n### Dark Mode Pattern\n\n| Element | Light | Dark |\n|---------|-------|------|\n| Background | `bg-white` | `dark:bg-zinc-900` |\n| Text | `text-zinc-900` | `dark:text-zinc-100` |\n| Borders | `border-zinc-200` | `dark:border-zinc-700` |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Modern Layout Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| Center (both axes) | `flex items-center justify-center` |\n| Vertical stack | `flex flex-col gap-4` |\n| Horizontal row | `flex gap-4` |\n| Space between | `flex justify-between items-center` |\n| Wrap grid | `flex flex-wrap gap-4` |\n\n### Grid Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| Auto-fit responsive | `grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr))]` |\n| Asymmetric (Bento) | `grid grid-cols-3 grid-rows-2` with spans |\n| Sidebar layout | `grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr]` |\n\n> **Note:** Prefer asymmetric/Bento layouts over symmetric 3-column grids.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Modern Color System\n\n### OKLCH vs RGB/HSL\n\n| Format | Advantage |\n|--------|-----------|\n| **OKLCH** | Perceptually uniform, better for design |\n| **HSL** | Intuitive hue/saturation |\n| **RGB** | Legacy compatibility |\n\n### Color Token Architecture\n\n| Layer | Example | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| **Primitive** | `--blue-500` | Raw color values |\n| **Semantic** | `--color-primary` | Purpose-based naming |\n| **Component** | `--button-bg` | Component-specific |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Typography System\n\n### Font Stack Pattern\n\n| Type | Recommended |\n|------|-------------|\n| Sans | `''Inter'', ''SF Pro'', system-ui, sans-serif` |\n| Mono | `''JetBrains Mono'', ''Fira Code'', monospace` |\n| Display | `''Outfit'', ''Poppins'', sans-serif` |\n\n### Type Scale\n\n| Class | Size | Use |\n|-------|------|-----|\n| `text-xs` | 0.75rem | Labels, captions |\n| `text-sm` | 0.875rem | Secondary text |\n| `text-base` | 1rem | Body text |\n| `text-lg` | 1.125rem | Lead text |\n| `text-xl`+ | 1.25rem+ | Headings |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Animation & Transitions\n\n### Built-in Animations\n\n| Class | Effect |\n|-------|--------|\n| `animate-spin` | Continuous rotation |\n| `animate-ping` | Attention pulse |\n| `animate-pulse` | Subtle opacity pulse |\n| `animate-bounce` | Bouncing effect |\n\n### Transition Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| All properties | `transition-all duration-200` |\n| Specific | `transition-colors duration-150` |\n| With easing | `ease-out` or `ease-in-out` |\n| Hover effect | `hover:scale-105 transition-transform` |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Component Extraction\n\n### When to Extract\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| Same class combo 3+ times | Extract component |\n| Complex state variants | Extract component |\n| Design system element | Extract + document |\n\n### Extraction Methods\n\n| Method | Use When |\n|--------|----------|\n| **React/Vue component** | Dynamic, JS needed |\n| **@apply in CSS** | Static, no JS needed |\n| **Design tokens** | Reusable values |\n\n---\n\n## 11. Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Arbitrary values everywhere | Use design system scale |\n| `!important` | Fix specificity properly |\n| Inline `style=` | Use utilities |\n| Duplicate long class lists | Extract component |\n| Mix v3 config with v4 | Migrate fully to CSS-first |\n| Use `@apply` heavily | Prefer components |\n\n---\n\n## 12. Performance Principles\n\n| Principle | Implementation |\n|-----------|----------------|\n| **Purge unused** | Automatic in v4 |\n| **Avoid dynamism** | No template string classes |\n| **Use Oxide** | Default in v4, 10x faster |\n| **Cache builds** | CI/CD caching |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Tailwind v4 is CSS-first. Embrace CSS variables, container queries, and native features. The config file is now optional.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:05:24.982Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to convert and utilize Tailwind CSS configurations in modern IDEs and CLIs.","zh":"非常适合需要在现代IDE和CLI中转换和利用Tailwind CSS配置的前端代理。","ja":"モダンなIDEとCLIでTailwind CSSの設定を変換して利用する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"현대적인 IDE와 CLI에서 Tailwind CSS 구성 파일을 변환하여 사용해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que necesitan convertir y utilizar configuraciones de Tailwind CSS en IDEs y CLIs modernos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de convertir et d''utiliser des configurations Tailwind CSS dans des IDE et des CLIs modernes.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die Tailwind-CSS-Konfigurationen in modernen IDEs und CLIs konvertieren und nutzen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que precisam converter e utilizar configurações do Tailwind CSS em IDEs e CLIs modernos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимо преобразовывать и использовать конфигурации Tailwind CSS в современных IDE и CLI.","ar":"مثالي لوكلات الواجهة الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى تحويل واستخدام تكوينات Tailwind CSS في بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وأطراف سطر الأوامر الحديثة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Tailwind v4''s CSS-native configuration, utilizing the Oxide engine for faster processing and native JIT mode, while converting legacy `tailwind.config.js` files to the new CSS-based `@theme` directive format.","zh":"使代理能够利用Tailwind v4的CSS原生配置，利用Oxide引擎进行更快的处理和原生JIT模式，同时将传统的`tailwind.config.js`文件转换为新的CSS基于`@theme`指令格式。","ja":"エージェントがTailwind v4のCSSネイティブ構成を利用できるようにし、Oxideエンジンを使用して高速な処理とネイティブJITモードを実現し、伝統的な`tailwind.config.js`ファイルを新しいCSSベースの`@theme`ディレクティブ形式に変換します。","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind v4의 CSS 네이티브 구성 기능을 활용할 수 있도록 하며, Oxide 엔진을 사용하여 더 빠른 처리와 네이티브 JIT 모드를 제공하며, 전통적인 `tailwind.config.js` 파일을 새로운 CSS 기반의 `@theme` 지시어 형식으로 변환합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la configuración nativa de CSS de Tailwind v4, utilizando el motor Oxide para un procesamiento más rápido y el modo JIT nativo, al mismo tiempo que convierte los archivos de configuración legados `tailwind.config.js` al nuevo formato de directiva `@theme` basado en CSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter la configuration native CSS de Tailwind v4, en utilisant le moteur Oxide pour un traitement plus rapide et le mode JIT natif, tout en convertissant les fichiers de configuration hérités `tailwind.config.js` au nouveau format de directive `@theme` basé sur CSS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tailwind v4s natives CSS-Konfigurationsformat zu nutzen, indem es den Oxide-Motor für ein schnelleres Verarbeiten und den nativen JIT-Modus verwendet und gleichzeitig die veralteten `tailwind.config.js`-Konfigurationsdateien in das neue CSS-basierte `@theme`-Direktivformat konvertiert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes aproveitem a configuração nativa de CSS do Tailwind v4, utilizando o mecanismo Oxide para processamento mais rápido e modo JIT nativo, enquanto converte os arquivos legados `tailwind.config.js` para o novo formato baseado em CSS com a diretiva `@theme`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать собственную CSS-конфигурацию Tailwind v4, используя движок Oxide для более быстрой обработки и собственный режим JIT, одновременно преобразуя устаревшие файлы `tailwind.config.js` в новый формат на основе CSS с директивой `@theme`.","ar":"يمكن الوكلات من الاستفادة من تكوين Tailwind v4 الأصلي لـ CSS، باستخدام محرك Oxide للمعالجة الأسرع والوضع الأصلي JIT، مع تحويل ملفات `tailwind.config.js` القديمة إلى تنسيق توجيه `@theme` الجديد القائم على CSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to GitHub Copilot compatible formats","Migrating legacy Tailwind v3 projects to v4''s CSS-native features","Utilizing the Oxide engine for faster CSS processing in CLI tools like Kiro and OpenCode"],"zh":["将Antigravity IDE配置转换为GitHub Copilot兼容格式","将遗留的Tailwind v3项目迁移到v4的CSS原生功能","在CLI工具（如Kiro和OpenCode）中利用Oxide引擎进行更快的CSS处理"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE構成をGitHub Copilotと互換性のある形式に変換する","レガシーのTailwind v3プロジェクトをv4のCSSネイティブ機能に移行する","CLIツール（KiroやOpenCodeなど）でOxideエンジンを使用して高速なCSS処理を行う"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 GitHub Copilot와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 것","기존의 Tailwind v3 프로젝트를 v4의 CSS 네이티브 기능으로 마이그레이션하는 것","CLI 도구(Kiro 및 OpenCode 등)에서 Oxide 엔진을 사용하여 더 빠른 CSS 처리를 하는 것"],"es":["Convertir configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot","Migrar proyectos legados de Tailwind v3 a las características nativas de CSS de v4","Utilizar el motor Oxide para un procesamiento de CSS más rápido en herramientas de CLI como Kiro y OpenCode"],"fr":["Convertir les configurations d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot","Migrer les projets hérités de Tailwind v3 vers les fonctionnalités natives CSS de v4","Utiliser le moteur Oxide pour un traitement de CSS plus rapide dans des outils de ligne de commande comme Kiro et OpenCode"],"de":["Konvertieren von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in GitHub-Copilot-kompatible Formate","Migrieren von veralteten Tailwind-v3-Projekten zu den CSS-nativen Funktionen von v4","Verwenden des Oxide-Motors für ein schnelleres CSS-Verarbeiten in CLI-Tools wie Kiro und OpenCode"],"pt":["Converter configurações da IDE Antigravity para formatos compatíveis com o GitHub Copilot","Migrar projetos legados do Tailwind v3 para os recursos nativos de CSS do v4","Utilizar o mecanismo Oxide para processamento CSS mais rápido em ferramentas CLI como Kiro e OpenCode"],"ru":["Преобразование конфигураций IDE Antigravity в форматы, совместимые с GitHub Copilot","Миграция устаревших проектов Tailwind v3 на собственные CSS-функции v4","Использование движка Oxide для более быстрой обработки CSS в CLI-инструментах, таких как Kiro и OpenCode"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات بيئة التطوير المتكاملة Antigravity إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot","ترحيل مشاريع Tailwind v3 القديمة إلى ميزات v4 الأصلية لـ CSS","استخدام محرك Oxide للمعالجة الأسرع لـ CSS في أدوات سطر الأوامر مثل Kiro و OpenCode"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Tailwind CSS and its configuration files","Limited to converting configurations for Tailwind v4 and compatible IDEs/CLIs"],"zh":["需要了解Tailwind CSS及其配置文件","仅限于转换Tailwind v4和兼容的IDE/CLI的配置"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSとその構成ファイルの理解が必要","Tailwind v4と互換性のあるIDE/CLIの構成ファイルの変換のみ"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 및 그 구성 파일에 대한理解가 필요함","Tailwind v4 및 호환되는 IDE/CLI의 구성 파일을 변환하는 것만 가능"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de Tailwind CSS y sus archivos de configuración","Limitado a la conversión de configuraciones para Tailwind v4 y IDE/CLI compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de Tailwind CSS et de ses fichiers de configuration","Limité à la conversion de configurations pour Tailwind v4 et les IDE/CLI compatibles"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis von Tailwind CSS und dessen Konfigurationsdateien","Begrenzt auf die Konvertierung von Konfigurationen für Tailwind v4 und kompatible IDE/CLI"],"pt":["Requer compreensão do Tailwind CSS e seus arquivos de configuração","Limitado à conversão de configurações para o Tailwind v4 e IDEs/CLIs compatíveis"],"ru":["Требует понимания Tailwind CSS и его конфигурационных файлов","Ограничено преобразованием конфигураций для Tailwind v4 и совместимых IDE/CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم Tailwind CSS وملفات التكوين الخاصة به","يقتصر على تحويل التكوينات لإصدار Tailwind v4 وبيئات التطوير المتكاملة/أطراف سطر الأوامر المتوافقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
