he","Definition der Struktur und des Stils eines Projekts","Verwendung von visuellen Beschreibungen und spezifischen Farbwerten","Generierung neuer Bildschirme, die sich an die bestehende Designsprache anpassen","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Produktivität in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos DESIGN.md","Geração de telas alinhadas com a linguagem de design","Suporte a descrições visuais com valores de cor específicos","Integração com a plataforma Stitch","Definição de um Sistema de Design Semântico","Melhoria da consistência do design"],"ru":["Создание файлов DESIGN.md","Генерация экранов, идеально соответствующих существующему языку дизайна","Поддержка визуальных описаний с конкретными цветовыми значениями","Интеграция с платформой Stitch","Определение Семантической Системы Дизайна","Улучшение согласованности дизайна"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md","إنشاء شاشات متوافقة مع لغة التصميم الحالية","دعم الوصف البصري مع قيم الألوان المحددة","التكامل مع منصة Stitch","تحديد نظام تصميم семантиكي","تحسين اتساق التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DESIGN.md 技术技能","设计系统","自动化","设计语言","单一真实来源","Visual Descriptions","颜色值","设计一致性"],"ja":["DESIGN.md 技術スキル","デザインシステム","自動化","デザイン言語","単一の真実の源","Visual Descriptions","色値","デザインの一貫性"],"ko":["DESIGN.md 기술 스킬","디자인 시스템","자동화","디자인 언어","단일 진실 源","Visual Descriptions","색상 값","디자인 일관성"],"es":["sistema de diseño semántico","DESIGN.md","desarrollo de software","lenguaje de diseño","coherencia de diseño","eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["système de conception de design sémantique","DESIGN.md","développement de logiciels","langage de design","cohérence de design","efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["semantisches Design-System","DESIGN.md","Software-Entwicklung","Designsprache","Design-Kohärenz","Effizienz in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["DESIGN.md","Sistema de Design Semântico","Linguagem de design","Geração de telas","Stitch","Desenvolvimento de design","Consistência do design","Arquivos de design","Sistema de design"],"ru":["DESIGN.md","Семантическая Система Дизайна","Язык дизайна","Генерация экранов","Stitch","Разработка дизайна","Согласованность дизайна","Файлы дизайна","Система дизайна"],"ar":["DESIGN.md","نظام تصميم семантиكي","لغة التصميم","إنشاء شاشات","Stitch","تطوير التصميم","اتساق التصميم","ملفات التصميم","نظام التصميم"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-md","description":"Analyze Stitch projects and synthesize a semantic design system into DESIGN.md files","bodyPreview":"# Stitch DESIGN.md Skill\n\nYou are an expert Design Systems Lead. Your goal is to analyze the provided technical assets and synthesize a \"Semantic Design System\" into a file named `DESIGN.md`.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you create `DESIGN.md` files that serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Acc","body":"# Stitch DESIGN.md Skill\n\nYou are an expert Design Systems Lead. Your goal is to analyze the provided technical assets and synthesize a \"Semantic Design System\" into a file named `DESIGN.md`.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you create `DESIGN.md` files that serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Access to the Stitch MCP Server\n- A Stitch project with at least one designed screen\n- Access to the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\n## The Goal\n\nThe `DESIGN.md` file will serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with the existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Retrieval and Networking\n\nTo analyze a Stitch project, you must retrieve screen metadata and design assets using the Stitch MCP Server tools:\n\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `mcp_stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n\n2. **Project lookup** (if Project ID is not provided):\n   - Call `[prefix]:list_projects` with `filter: \"view=owned\"` to retrieve all user projects\n   - Identify the target project by title or URL pattern\n   - Extract the Project ID from the `name` field (e.g., `projects/13534454087919359824`)\n\n3. **Screen lookup** (if Screen ID is not provided):\n   - Call `[prefix]:list_screens` with the `projectId` (just the numeric ID, not the full path)\n   - Review screen titles to identify the target screen (e.g., \"Home\", \"Landing Page\")\n   - Extract the Screen ID from the screen''s `name` field\n\n4. **Metadata fetch**: \n   - Call `[prefix]:get_screen` with both `projectId` and `screenId` (both as numeric IDs only)\n   - This returns the complete screen object including:\n     - `screenshot.downloadUrl` - Visual reference of the design\n     - `htmlCode.downloadUrl` - Full HTML/CSS source code\n     - `width`, `height`, `deviceType` - Screen dimensions and target platform\n     - Project metadata including `designTheme` with color and style information\n\n5. **Asset download**:\n   - Use `web_fetch` or `read_url_content` to download the HTML code from `htmlCode.downloadUrl`\n   - Optionally download the screenshot from `screenshot.downloadUrl` for visual reference\n   - Parse the HTML to extract Tailwind classes, custom CSS, and component patterns\n\n6. **Project metadata extraction**:\n   - Call `[prefix]:get_project` with the project `name` (full path: `projects/{id}`) to get:\n     - `designTheme` object with color mode, fonts, roundness, custom colors\n     - Project-level design guidelines and descriptions\n     - Device type preferences and layout principles\n\n## Analysis & Synthesis Instructions\n\n### 1. Extract Project Identity (JSON)\n- Locate the Project Title\n- Locate the specific Project ID (e.g., from the `name` field in the JSON)\n\n### 2. Define the Atmosphere (Image/HTML)\nEvaluate the screenshot and HTML structure to capture the overall \"vibe.\" Use evocative adjectives to describe the mood (e.g., \"Airy,\" \"Dense,\" \"Minimalist,\" \"Utilitarian\").\n\n### 3. Map the Color Palette (Tailwind Config/JSON)\nIdentify the key colors in the system. For each color, provide:\n- A descriptive, natural language name that conveys its character (e.g., \"Deep Muted Teal-Navy\")\n- The specific hex code in parentheses for precision (e.g., \"#294056\")\n- Its specific functional role (e.g., \"Used for primary actions\")\n\n### 4. Translate Geometry & Shape (CSS/Tailwind)\nConvert technical `border-radius` and layout values into physical descriptions:\n- Describe `rounded-full` as \"Pill-shaped\"\n- Describe `rounded-lg` as \"Subtly rounded corners\"\n- Describe `rounded-none` as \"Sharp, squared-off edges\"\n\n### 5. Describe Depth & Elevation\nExplain how the UI handles layers. Describe the presence and quality of shadows (e.g., \"Flat,\" \"Whisper-soft diffused shadows,\" or \"Heavy, high-contrast drop shadows\").\n\n## Output Guidelines\n\n- **Language:** Use descriptive design terminology and natural language exclusively\n- **Format:** Generate a clean Markdown file following the structure below\n- **Precision:** Include exact hex codes for colors while using descriptive names\n- **Context:** Explain the \"why\" behind design decisions, not just the \"what\"\n\n## Output Format (DESIGN.md Structure)\n\n```markdown\n# Design System: [Project Title]\n**Project ID:** [Insert Project ID Here]\n\n## 1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere\n(Description of the mood, density, and aesthetic philosophy.)\n\n## 2. Color Palette & Roles\n(List colors by Descriptive Name + Hex Code + Functional Role.)\n\n## 3. Typography Rules\n(Description of font family, weight usage for headers vs. body, and letter-spacing character.)\n\n## 4. Component Stylings\n* **Buttons:** (Shape description, color assignment, behavior).\n* **Cards/Containers:** (Corner roundness description, background color, shadow depth).\n* **Inputs/Forms:** (Stroke style, background).\n\n## 5. Layout Principles\n(Description of whitespace strategy, margins, and grid alignment.)\n```\n\n## Usage Example\n\nTo use this skill for the Furniture Collection project:\n\n1. **Retrieve project information:**\n   ```\n   Use the Stitch MCP Server to get the Furniture Collection project\n   ```\n\n2. **Get the Home page screen details:**\n   ```\n   Retrieve the Home page screen''s code, image, and screen object information\n   ```\n\n3. **Reference best practices:**\n   ```\n   Review the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide at:\n   https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n   ```\n\n4. **Analyze and synthesize:**\n   - Extract all relevant design tokens from the screen\n   - Translate technical values into descriptive language\n   - Organize information according to the DESIGN.md structure\n\n5. **Generate the file:**\n   - Create `DESIGN.md` in the project directory\n   - Follow the prescribed format exactly\n   - Ensure all color codes are accurate\n   - Use evocative, designer-friendly language\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Be Descriptive:** Avoid generic terms like \"blue\" or \"rounded.\" Use \"Ocean-deep Cerulean (#0077B6)\" or \"Gently curved edges\"\n- **Be Functional:** Always explain what each design element is used for\n- **Be Consistent:** Use the same terminology throughout the document\n- **Be Visual:** Help readers visualize the design through your descriptions\n- **Be Precise:** Include exact values (hex codes, pixel values) in parentheses after natural language descriptions\n\n## Tips for Success\n\n1. **Start with the big picture:** Understand the overall aesthetic before diving into details\n2. **Look for patterns:** Identify consistent spacing, sizing, and styling patterns\n3. **Think semantically:** Name colors by their purpose, not just their appearance\n4. **Consider hierarchy:** Document how visual weight and importance are communicated\n5. **Reference the guide:** Use language and patterns from the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide\n\n## Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n- ❌ Using technical jargon without translation (e.g., \"rounded-xl\" instead of \"generously rounded corners\")\n- ❌ Omitting color codes or using only descriptive names\n- ❌ Forgetting to explain functional roles of design elements\n- ❌ Being too vague in atmosphere descriptions\n- ❌ Ignoring subtle design details like shadows or spacing patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:05:53.865Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Design Agents needing to generate new screens aligned with existing design language through Semantic Design Systems","zh":"非常适合需要通过语义设计系统根据现有设计语言生成新屏幕的视觉设计代理","ja":"視覚デザインエージェントが既存のデザイン言語に合わせて新しい画面を生成する必要がある場合に最適です。セマンティックデザインシステムを通じて","ko":"기존 디자인 언어와 일치하는 새 화면을 생성해야 하는 시각 디자인 에이전트에게 완벽합니다. 의미 디자인 시스템을 통해","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Diseño Visual que necesitan generar nuevas pantallas alineadas con el lenguaje de diseño existente a través de Sistemas de Diseño Semántico","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception visuelle ayant besoin de générer de nouveaux écrans alignés sur le langage de conception existant via des systèmes de conception sémantique","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Design-Agenten, die neue Bildschirme generieren müssen, die mit der bestehenden Designsprache übereinstimmen, über semantische Designsysteme","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design Visual que precisam gerar novas telas alinhadas com a linguagem de design existente por meio de Sistemas de Design Semântico","ru":"Идеально для Визуальных Дизайн Агентов, которым необходимо генерировать новые экраны, соответствующие существующему языку дизайна через Семантические Системы Дизайна","ar":"مثالي لعميل التصميم المرئي الذي يحتاج إلى توليد شاشات جديدة مطابقة للغة التصميم الحالية من خلال أنظمة التصميم الدلالي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create DESIGN.md files serving as the source of truth for prompting new screen generations, supported by specific color values and Visual Descriptions","zh":"赋予代理创建 DESIGN.md 文件的能力，这些文件作为提示新屏幕生成的真实来源，支持特定的颜色值和视觉描述","ja":"エージェントがデザインシステムの真実の源となるDESIGN.mdファイルを作成することを可能にします。これは、特定の色値と視覚的な説明によってサポートされ、新しい画面の生成を促します","ko":"에이전트가 DESIGN.md 파일을 생성할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 이는 새로운 화면 생성을 위한 진실의 원천으로서 특정 색상 값과 시각적 설명을 지원하는 파일입니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear archivos DESIGN.md que sirven como fuente de verdad para la generación de nuevas pantallas, respaldados por valores de color específicos y Descripciones Visuales","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fichiers DESIGN.md servant de source de vérité pour la génération de nouveaux écrans, étayés par des valeurs de couleur spécifiques et des descriptions visuelles","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, DESIGN.md-Dateien zu erstellen, die als Wahrheitsquelle für die Generierung neuer Bildschirme dienen, unterstützt durch spezifische Farbwerte und visuelle Beschreibungen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar arquivos DESIGN.md que servem como a fonte de verdade para a geração de novas telas, apoiada por valores de cor específicos e Descrições Visuais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать файлы DESIGN.md, служащие источником истинной информации для генерации новых экранов, поддерживаемой конкретными цветовыми значениями и Визуальными Описаниями","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md التي تعمل كمصدر للحقيقة لتحفيز توليد الشاشات الجديدة، مدعومة بقيم الألوان المحددة والوصف المرئي"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating new screens that align with existing design language","Creating DESIGN.md files as a single source of truth for design systems","Interpreting design through Visual Descriptions"],"zh":["生成与现有设计语言一致的新屏幕","创建 DESIGN.md 文件作为设计系统的单一真实来源","通过视觉描述解释设计"],"ja":["既存のデザイン言語と一致する新しい画面を生成する","デザインシステムの単一の真実の源となるDESIGN.mdファイルを作成する","視覚的な説明を通じてデザインを解釈する"],"ko":["기존 디자인 언어와 일치하는 새로운 화면을 생성한다","디자인 시스템의 단일 진실의 원천인 DESIGN.md 파일을 생성한다","시각적 설명을 통해 디자인을 해석한다"],"es":["Generar nuevas pantallas que se alineen con el lenguaje de diseño existente","Crear archivos DESIGN.md como fuente única de verdad para los sistemas de diseño","Interpretar el diseño a través de Descripciones Visuales"],"fr":["Générer de nouveaux écrans alignés sur le langage de conception existant","Créer des fichiers DESIGN.md en tant que source unique de vérité pour les systèmes de conception","Interpréter la conception à travers des descriptions visuelles"],"de":["Erzeugen neuer Bildschirme, die mit der bestehenden Designsprache übereinstimmen","Erstellen von DESIGN.md-Dateien als einzige Wahrheitsquelle für Designsysteme","Interpretieren des Designs durch visuelle Beschreibungen"],"pt":["Gerar novas telas que estejam alinhadas com a linguagem de design existente","Criar arquivos DESIGN.md como uma fonte única de verdade para os sistemas de design","Interpretar o design por meio de Descrições Visuais"],"ru":["Генерировать новые экраны, соответствующие существующему языку дизайна","Создавать файлы DESIGN.md как единственный источник истинной информации для систем дизайна","Интерпретировать дизайн через Визуальные Описания"],"ar":["توليد شاشات جديدة مطابقة للغة التصميم الحالية","إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md كمصدر وحيد للحقيقة لأنظمة التصميم","تفسير التصميم من خلال الوصف المرئي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires technical assets for analysis","Specific color values and Visual Descriptions needed for design interpretation"],"zh":["需要技术资产进行分析","需要特定的颜色值和视觉描述来解释设计"],"ja":["分析のために技術アセットが必要です","デザインの解釈には特定の色値と視覚的な説明が必要です"],"ko":["분석을 위해 기술 자산이 필요합니다","디자인 해석을 위해 특정 색상 값과 시각적 설명이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere activos técnicos para el análisis","Se necesitan valores de color específicos y Descripciones Visuales para la interpretación del diseño"],"fr":["Nécessite des actifs techniques pour l''analyse","Des valeurs de couleur spécifiques et des descriptions visuelles sont nécessaires pour l''interprétation de la conception"],"de":["Benötigt technische Assets für die Analyse","Spezifische Farbwerte und visuelle Beschreibungen sind erforderlich für die Designinterpretation"],"pt":["Exige ativos técnicos para análise","Valores de cor específicos e Descrições Visuais necessários para interpretação do design"],"ru":["Требует технических активов для анализа","Конкретные цветовые значения и Визуальные Описания необходимы для интерпретации дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب أصول تقنية للتحليل","قيم الألوان المحددة والوصف المرئي مطلوبة لتحليل التصميم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
