 statiques","Flux de travail basé sur Git","Solution légère (<500 KB)","Compatibilité avec Markdown, YAML, TOML et JSON","Prêt pour la production avec plus de 270 problèmes résolus"],"de":["Integration in statische Seitenprojekte","Git-basierter Workflow","Leichte Lösung (<500 KB)","Kompatibilität mit Markdown, YAML, TOML und JSON","Produktionsreif mit über 270 gelösten Problemen"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho baseado em Git","Solução leve (<500 KB)","Suporte a Markdown, YAML, TOML e JSON","Pronto para produção (270+ problemas resolvidos)","Versão pública beta disponível"],"ru":["Рабочий процесс на основе Git","Легкое решение (<500 КБ)","Поддержка Markdown, YAML, TOML и JSON","Готов к производству (270+ проблем решено)","Доступна публичная бета-версия"],"ar":["تدفق عمل على أساس جيت","حل خفيف (<500 كيلوبايت)","دعم لملفات ماركداون، ياميل، تومل و جيسون","جاهز للانتاج (270+ مشكلة محلولة)","الإصدار التجريبي العام متاح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sveltia CMS","静态网站项目","内容管理系统","Git 基础工作流","轻量级解决方案","静态网站生成"],"ja":["Sveltia CMS","静的サイトプロジェクト","コンテンツ管理システム","Git ベースのワークフロー","軽量級ソリューション","静的サイト生成"],"ko":["Sveltia CMS","정적 사이트 프로젝트","콘텐츠 관리 시스템","Git 기반 워크플로우","경량급 솔루션","정적 사이트 생성"],"es":["Sveltia CMS","sitios estáticos","flujo de trabajo basado en Git","solución ligera","gestión de contenido","desarrollo web","integración de CMS"],"fr":["Sveltia CMS","sites statiques","flux de travail basé sur Git","solution légère","gestion de contenu","développement web","intégration de CMS"],"de":["Sveltia CMS","statische Seiten","Git-basierter Workflow","leichte Lösung","Content-Management","Webentwicklung","CMS-Integration"],"pt":["Sveltia CMS","CMS para sites estáticos","Fluxo de trabalho baseado em Git","Solução leve","Gerenciamento de conteúdo","Desenvolvimento web","Projetos de sites estáticos"],"ru":["Sveltia CMS","CMS для статических сайтов","Рабочий процесс на основе Git","Легкое решение","Управление контентом","Веб-разработка","Проекты статических сайтов"],"ar":["سفلتيا سي إم إس","نظام إدارة المحتوى لمواقع ثابتة","تدفق عمل على أساس جيت","حل خفيف","إدارة المحتوى","تطوير الويب","مشاريع المواقع الثابتة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sveltia-cms","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Sveltia CMS Skill\n\nComplete skill for integrating Sveltia CMS into static site projects.\n\n---\n\n## Current Versions\n\n- **@sveltia/cms**: 0.128.5 (verified January 2026)\n- **Status**: Public Beta (v1.0 expected early 2026)\n- **Maturity**: Production-ready (270+ issues solved from predecessor)\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n### ✅ Use Sveltia CMS When:\n\n- Git-based workflow desired (content as Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON in repository)\n- Lightweight solution required (<500 KB vs 1.5-2.6 MB for compe","body":"# Sveltia CMS Skill\n\nComplete skill for integrating Sveltia CMS into static site projects.\n\n---\n\n## Current Versions\n\n- **@sveltia/cms**: 0.128.5 (verified January 2026)\n- **Status**: Public Beta (v1.0 expected early 2026)\n- **Maturity**: Production-ready (270+ issues solved from predecessor)\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n### ✅ Use Sveltia CMS When:\n\n- Git-based workflow desired (content as Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON in repository)\n- Lightweight solution required (<500 KB vs 1.5-2.6 MB for competitors)\n- Migrating from Decap/Netlify CMS (drop-in replacement, change 1 line)\n- Non-technical editors need access without Git knowledge\n\n### ❌ Don''t Use Sveltia CMS When:\n\n- Real-time collaboration needed (multiple users editing simultaneously) - Use Sanity, Contentful, or TinaCMS instead\n- Visual page building required (drag-and-drop) - Use Webflow, Builder.io instead\n- React-specific visual editing needed - Use TinaCMS instead\n\n---\n\n## Breaking Changes & Updates (v0.105.0+)\n\n### v0.127.0 (December 29, 2025) - slug_length Deprecation\n\n**DEPRECATION**: The `slug_length` collection option is deprecated and will be removed in v1.0.\n\n**Migration**:\n```yaml\n# ❌ Deprecated (pre-v0.127.0)\ncollections:\n  - name: posts\n    slug_length: 50\n\n# ✅ New (v0.127.0+)\nslug:\n  maxlength: 50\n```\n\n**Timeline**: Will be removed in Sveltia CMS 1.0 (expected early 2026).\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.127.0](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/releases/tag/v0.127.0)\n\n---\n\n### v0.120.0 (November 24, 2025) - Author Template Tags\n\n**New Feature**: Hidden widget now supports author template tags:\n- `{{author-email}}` - Signed-in user''s email\n- `{{author-login}}` - Signed-in user''s login name\n- `{{author-name}}` - Signed-in user''s display name\n\n**Usage**:\n```yaml\nfields:\n  - label: Author Email\n    name: author_email\n    widget: hidden\n    default: ''{{author-email}}''\n```\n\n**Commit message templates** also support `{{author-email}}` tag.\n\n---\n\n### v0.119.0 (November 16, 2025) - TOML Config Support\n\n**New Feature**: Configuration files can now be written in TOML format (previously YAML-only).\n\n**Migration**:\n```toml\n# admin/config.toml (NEW)\n[backend]\nname = \"github\"\nrepo = \"owner/repo\"\nbranch = \"main\"\n\nmedia_folder = \"static/images/uploads\"\npublic_folder = \"/images/uploads\"\n```\n\n**Recommendation**: YAML is still preferred for better tooling support.\n\n---\n\n### v0.118.0 (November 15, 2025) - TypeScript Breaking Change\n\n**BREAKING**: Renamed `SiteConfig` export to `CmsConfig` for compatibility with Netlify/Decap CMS.\n\n**Migration**:\n```typescript\n// ❌ Old (v0.117.x)\nimport type { SiteConfig } from ''@sveltia/cms'';\n\n// ✅ New (v0.118.0+)\nimport type { CmsConfig } from ''@sveltia/cms'';\n\nconst config: CmsConfig = {\n  backend: { name: ''github'', repo: ''owner/repo'' },\n  collections: [/* ... */],\n};\n```\n\n**Impact**: TypeScript users only. Breaking change for type imports.\n\n---\n\n### v0.117.0 (November 14, 2025) - Enhanced Validation\n\n**New Features**:\n- Exported `CmsConfig` type for direct TypeScript import\n- Enhanced config validation for collection names, field types, and relation references\n- Better error messages for invalid configurations\n\n---\n\n### v0.115.0 (November 5, 2025) - Field-Specific Media Folders\n\n**New Feature**: Override `media_folder` at the field level (not just collection level).\n\n**Usage**:\n```yaml\ncollections:\n  - name: posts\n    label: Blog Posts\n    folder: content/posts\n    media_folder: static/images/posts  # Collection-level default\n    fields:\n      - label: Featured Image\n        name: image\n        widget: image\n        media_folder: static/images/featured  # ← Field-level override\n        public_folder: /images/featured\n\n      - label: Author Avatar\n        name: avatar\n        widget: image\n        media_folder: static/images/avatars  # ← Another override\n        public_folder: /images/avatars\n```\n\n**Use case**: Different media folders for different image types in same collection.\n\n---\n\n### v0.113.5 (October 27, 2025) - Logo Deprecation\n\n**DEPRECATION**: `logo_url` option is now deprecated. Migrate to `logo.src`.\n\n**Migration**:\n```yaml\n# ❌ Deprecated\nlogo_url: https://yourdomain.com/logo.svg\n\n# ✅ New (v0.113.5+)\nlogo:\n  src: https://yourdomain.com/logo.svg\n```\n\n---\n\n### v0.105.0 (September 15, 2024) - Security Breaking Change\n\n**BREAKING**: `sanitize_preview` default changed to `true` for Markdown widget (XSS prevention).\n\n**Impact**:\n- **Before v0.105.0**: `sanitize_preview: false` (compatibility with Netlify/Decap CMS, but vulnerable to XSS)\n- **After v0.105.0**: `sanitize_preview: true` (secure by default)\n\n**Migration**:\n```yaml\ncollections:\n  - name: posts\n    fields:\n      - label: Body\n        name: body\n        widget: markdown\n        sanitize_preview: false  # ← Add ONLY if you trust all CMS users\n```\n\n**Recommendation**: Keep default (`true`) unless disabling fixes broken preview AND you fully trust all CMS users.\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Options\n\n### Global Slug Options (v0.128.0+)\n\nConfigure slug generation behavior globally:\n\n```yaml\nslug:\n  encoding: unicode-normalized\n  clean_accents: false\n  sanitize_replacement: ''-''\n  lowercase: true   # Default: convert to lowercase (v0.128.0+)\n  maxlength: 50     # Default: unlimited (v0.127.0+)\n```\n\n**lowercase** (v0.128.0+): Set to `false` to preserve original casing in slugs (e.g., \"MyBlogPost\" instead of \"myblogpost\").\n\n**Use case**: Mixed-case URLs or file names where case matters.\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.128.0](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/releases/tag/v0.128.0), [GitHub Issue #594](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/594)\n\n---\n\n### Raw Format for Text Files (v0.126.0+)\n\nNew `raw` format allows editing files without front matter (CSV, JSON, YAML, plain text). Must have single `body` field with widget type: `code`, `markdown`, `richtext`, or `text`.\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Edit configuration files (JSON, YAML)\n- Manage CSV data\n- Edit plain text files\n\n**Configuration**:\n```yaml\ncollections:\n  - name: config\n    label: Configuration Files\n    files:\n      - label: Site Config\n        name: site_config\n        file: config.json\n        format: raw  # ← NEW format type\n        fields:\n          - label: Config\n            name: body\n            widget: code\n            default_language: json\n```\n\n**Restrictions**:\n- Only one field allowed (must be named `body`)\n- Widget must be: `code`, `markdown`, `richtext`, or `text`\n- No front matter parsing\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.126.0](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/releases/tag/v0.126.0)\n\n---\n\n### Number Field String Encoding (v0.125.0+)\n\nNew `value_type` option for Number field accepts `int/string` and `float/string` to save numbers as strings instead of numbers in front matter.\n\n**Use Case**: Some static site generators or schemas require numeric values stored as strings (e.g., `age: \"25\"` instead of `age: 25`).\n\n**Configuration**:\n```yaml\nfields:\n  - label: Age\n    name: age\n    widget: number\n    value_type: int/string  # Saves as \"25\" not 25\n\n  - label: Price\n    name: price\n    widget: number\n    value_type: float/string  # Saves as \"19.99\" not 19.99\n```\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.125.0](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/releases/tag/v0.125.0), [GitHub Issue #574](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/574)\n\n---\n\n### Editor Pane Locale via URL Query (v0.126.0+)\n\nOverride editor locale via URL query parameter `?_locale=fr` to get edit links for specific locales.\n\n**Use Case**: Generate direct edit links for translators or content editors for specific languages.\n\n**Example**:\n```\nhttps://yourdomain.com/admin/#/collections/posts/entries/my-post?_locale=fr\n```\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.126.0](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/releases/tag/v0.126.0), [GitHub Issue #585](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/585)\n\n---\n\n### Richtext Field Type Alias (v0.124.0+)\n\nAdded `richtext` as an alias for `markdown` widget to align with Decap CMS terminology. Both work identically.\n\n**Configuration**:\n```yaml\nfields:\n  - label: Body\n    name: body\n    widget: richtext  # ← NEW alias for markdown\n```\n\n**Future**: HTML output support planned for `richtext` field type.\n\n**Source**: [Release v0.124.0](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/releases/tag/v0.124.0)\n\n---\n\n## Setup Pattern (Framework-Agnostic)\n\n**All frameworks follow the same pattern:**\n\n1. **Create admin directory in public/static folder:**\n   - Hugo: `static/admin/`\n   - Jekyll: `admin/`\n   - 11ty: `admin/` (with passthrough copy)\n   - Astro: `public/admin/`\n   - Next.js: `public/admin/`\n\n2. **Create admin/index.html:**\n   ```html\n   <!doctype html>\n   <html lang=\"en\">\n     <head>\n       <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n       <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n       <title>Content Manager</title>\n     </head>\n     <body>\n       <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms@0.128.5/dist/sveltia-cms.js\" type=\"module\"></script>\n     </body>\n   </html>\n   ```\n\n3. **Create admin/config.yml:**\n   ```yaml\n   backend:\n     name: github\n     repo: owner/repo\n     branch: main\n     base_url: https://your-worker.workers.dev  # OAuth proxy (required)\n\n   media_folder: static/images/uploads  # Framework-specific path\n   public_folder: /images/uploads\n\n   collections:\n     - name: posts\n       label: Blog Posts\n       folder: content/posts\n       create: true\n       fields:\n         - { label: ''Title'', name: ''title'', widget: ''string'' }\n         - { label: ''Date'', name: ''date'', widget: ''datetime'' }\n         - { label: ''Body'', name: ''body'', widget: ''markdown'' }\n   ```\n\n4. **Access admin:** `http://localhost:<port>/admin/`\n\n**Framework-specific details**: See `templates/` directory for complete examples.\n\n---\n\n## Authentication: Cloudflare Workers OAuth (Recommended)\n\n**Why Cloudflare Workers**: Fastest, free tier available, works with any deployment platform.\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. **Deploy Worker:**\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms-auth\n   cd sveltia-cms-auth\n   npm install\n   npx wrangler deploy\n   ```\n\n2. **Register OAuth App on GitHub:**\n   - Go to https://github.com/settings/developers\n   - Click \"New OAuth App\"\n   - **Authorization callback URL**: `https://your-worker.workers.dev/callback`\n   - Save Client ID and Client Secret\n\n3. **Configure Worker Environment Variables:**\n   ```bash\n   npx wrangler secret put GITHUB_CLIENT_ID\n   # Paste your Client ID\n\n   npx wrangler secret put GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET\n   # Paste your Client Secret\n   ```\n\n4. **Update CMS config:**\n   ```yaml\n   backend:\n     name: github\n     repo: owner/repo\n     branch: main\n     base_url: https://your-worker.workers.dev  # ← Add this line\n   ```\n\n5. **Test authentication:**\n   - Open `/admin/`\n   - Click \"Login with GitHub\"\n   - Should redirect to GitHub → Authorize → Back to CMS\n\n**Alternative**: Vercel serverless functions - See `templates/vercel-serverless/`\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors & Solutions\n\nThis skill prevents **10 common errors** encountered when setting up Sveltia CMS.\n\n### 1. ❌ OAuth Authentication Failures\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"Error: Failed to authenticate\"\n- Redirect to `https://api.netlify.com/auth` instead of GitHub login\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Login button does nothing\n- Authentication popup closes immediately\n\n**Causes:**\n- Missing `base_url` in backend config\n- Incorrect OAuth proxy URL\n- Wrong GitHub OAuth callback URL\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Step 1: Verify config.yml has `base_url`:**\n```yaml\nbackend:\n  name: github\n  repo: owner/repo\n  branch: main\n  base_url: https://your-worker.workers.dev  # ← Must be present\n```\n\n**Step 2: Check GitHub OAuth App callback:**\n- Should be: `https://your-worker.workers.dev/callback`\n- NOT: `https://yourdomain.com/callback`\n\n**Step 3: Test Worker directly:**\n```bash\ncurl https://your-worker.workers.dev/health\n# Should return: {\"status\": \"ok\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. ❌ TOML Front Matter Errors\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"Parse error: Invalid TOML\"\n- Files missing `+++` delimiters\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- New files created by CMS don''t parse in Hugo\n- Content appears above body separator\n\n**Causes:**\n- Sveltia''s TOML generation is buggy in beta\n- Mixed TOML/YAML in same collection\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Use YAML instead of TOML** (recommended):\n```yaml\ncollections:\n  - name: posts\n    folder: content/posts\n    format: yaml  # or md (Markdown with YAML frontmatter)\n    # NOT: format: toml\n```\n\n**If you must use TOML:**\n1. Manually fix delimiters after CMS saves\n2. Use pre-commit hook to validate TOML\n3. Wait for beta fixes (track GitHub issues)\n\n---\n\n### 3. ❌ YAML Parse Errors\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"YAML parse error: Invalid YAML\"\n- \"Error: Duplicate key ''field_name''\"\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Existing posts won''t load in CMS\n- CMS shows empty fields\n\n**Causes:**\n- Sveltia is stricter than Hugo/Jekyll about YAML formatting\n- Incorrect indentation or smart quotes\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Step 1: Validate YAML:**\n```bash\npip install yamllint\nfind content -name \"*.md\" -exec yamllint {} \\;\n```\n\n**Step 2: Common fixes:**\n\n**Problem**: Smart quotes\n```yaml\n# ❌ Bad - smart quotes from copy-paste\ntitle: \"Hello World\"  # Curly quotes\n\n# ✅ Good - straight quotes\ntitle: \"Hello World\"  # Straight quotes\n```\n\n**Step 3: Auto-fix with yamlfmt:**\n```bash\ngo install github.com/google/yamlfmt/cmd/yamlfmt@latest\nfind content -name \"*.md\" -exec yamlfmt {} \\;\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. ❌ Content Not Listing in CMS\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"No entries found\"\n- \"Failed to load entries\"\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Admin loads but shows no content\n- Files exist in repository but CMS doesn''t see them\n\n**Causes:**\n- Format mismatch (config expects TOML, files are YAML)\n- Incorrect folder path\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Step 1: Verify folder path:**\n```yaml\n# Config says:\ncollections:\n  - name: posts\n    folder: content/posts  # Expects files here\n\n# Check actual location:\nls -la content/posts  # Files must exist here\n```\n\n**Step 2: Match format to actual files:**\n```yaml\n# If files are: content/posts/hello.md with YAML frontmatter\ncollections:\n  - name: posts\n    folder: content/posts\n    format: yaml  # or md (same as yaml for .md files)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. ❌ \"SVELTIA is not defined\" Error\n\n**Error Message:**\n- Console error: `Uncaught ReferenceError: SVELTIA is not defined`\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Admin page shows white screen\n\n**Causes:**\n- Missing `type=\"module\"` attribute\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Use correct script tag:**\n```html\n<!-- ✅ Correct -->\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms/dist/sveltia-cms.js\" type=\"module\"></script>\n\n<!-- ❌ Wrong - missing type=\"module\" -->\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms/dist/sveltia-cms.js\"></script>\n```\n\n**Use version pinning (recommended):**\n```html\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms@0.128.5/dist/sveltia-cms.js\" type=\"module\"></script>\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. ❌ 404 on /admin\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"404 Not Found\" when visiting `/admin/`\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Works locally but not in production\n\n**Causes:**\n- Admin directory not in correct location for framework\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Framework-specific fixes:**\n\n**Hugo**: Files in `static/` are automatically copied\n\n**Jekyll**: Add to `_config.yml`:\n```yaml\ninclude:\n  - admin\n```\n\n**11ty**: Add to `.eleventy.js`:\n```javascript\nmodule.exports = function(eleventyConfig) {\n  eleventyConfig.addPassthroughCopy(''admin'');\n};\n```\n\n**Astro**: Files in `public/` are automatically copied\n\n---\n\n### 7. ❌ Images Not Uploading (HEIC Format)\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"Unsupported file format\"\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- iPhone photos won''t upload\n\n**Causes:**\n- HEIC format not supported by browsers\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**On iPhone:**\n- Settings > Camera > Formats > Most Compatible\n- This saves photos as JPEG instead of HEIC\n\n**Or enable image optimization:**\n```yaml\nmedia_libraries:\n  default:\n    config:\n      max_file_size: 10485760  # 10 MB\n      transformations:\n        raster_image:\n          format: webp  # Auto-converts to WebP\n          quality: 85\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. ❌ Datetime Widget Format Strictness\n\n**Error Message:**\n- Silent data loss (no error shown)\n- Date fields show blank in CMS\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Posts with existing dates appear blank when editing\n- Saving overwrites dates with blank values\n- Hugo marks posts as \"future\" and skips building them\n\n**Causes:**\n- Default datetime widget outputs timestamps WITHOUT timezone suffix\n- When `format` is specified, Sveltia becomes **strict** - existing entries with different formats show as blank\n- Hugo infers UTC when timezone missing, causing timezone issues\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Format Strictness Warning (v0.124.1+)**\n\nWhen you specify a `format` option, Sveltia becomes **strict**:\n- Existing entries with different formats show as **blank**\n- Saving will **overwrite** with blank value (SILENT DATA LOSS)\n- No error message shown\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Option 1: Use picker_utc (Recommended)**\n```yaml\nfields:\n  - label: Date\n    name: date\n    widget: datetime\n    picker_utc: true  # Most flexible - outputs with timezone\n```\n\n**Option 2: Specify format with timezone (RISKY - see warning above)**\n```yaml\nfields:\n  - label: Date\n    name: date\n    widget: datetime\n    format: \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.SSSZ\"  # Only if ALL existing dates match this format\n```\n\n**Option 3: Configure Hugo to accept missing timezone**\n```toml\n# config.toml\n[frontmatter]\n  date = [\":default\", \":fileModTime\"]\n```\n\n**Prevention**:\n1. Don''t specify `format` if you have mixed date formats\n2. Normalize all dates first before adding `format`\n3. Use `picker_utc: true` instead (more flexible)\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #565](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/565), fixed in v0.126.0 (improved date parser but format strictness remains)\n\n---\n\n### 9. ❌ GDPR Violation: Google Fonts CDN\n\n**Error Message:**\n- No error shown (privacy compliance issue)\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Privacy-focused sites blocked from using Sveltia\n- EU public sector cannot adopt\n- GDPR non-compliance\n\n**Causes:**\n- Sveltia loads Google Fonts and Material Symbols from Google CDN without user consent\n- Google tracks font usage and collects IP addresses\n- Violates EU data protection law\n\n**⚠️ Impact**: Blocking issue for EU public sector and privacy-focused sites\n\n**Solution (Vite Plugin - Recommended)**:\n\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig, type Plugin } from ''vite''\n\nfunction ensureGDPRCompliantFonts(): Plugin {\n  const fontsURLRegex = /fonts\\.googleapis\\.com\\/css2/g\n  const replacement = ''fonts.bunny.net/css''\n  return {\n    name: ''gdpr-compliant-fonts'',\n    enforce: ''post'',\n    transform(code) {\n      if (fontsURLRegex.test(code)) {\n        return code.replaceAll(fontsURLRegex, replacement)\n      }\n    },\n  }\n}\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [ensureGDPRCompliantFonts()],\n})\n```\n\n**Alternative Solutions**:\n\n**Option 2: Bunny Fonts** (1:1 Google Fonts replacement)\n- Use https://fonts.bunny.net instead of fonts.googleapis.com\n- EU-based, GDPR-compliant\n- Same API as Google Fonts\n\n**Option 3: Self-hosted fonts**\n- Use `@fontsource` npm packages\n- Bundle fonts with application\n- No external requests\n\n**Maintainer Response**:\n- Acknowledged issue\n- Plans to add system font option (post-v1.0)\n- Sveltia itself collects no data (fonts are only concern)\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #443](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/443)\n\n---\n\n### 10. ❌ CORS / COOP Policy Errors\n\n**Error Message:**\n- \"Authentication Aborted\"\n- \"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy blocked\"\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- OAuth popup opens then closes\n\n**Causes:**\n- Strict `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` header blocking OAuth\n\n**Solution:**\n\n**Cloudflare Pages** (_headers file):\n```\n/*\n  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups\n  # NOT: same-origin (this breaks OAuth)\n```\n\n**Netlify** (_headers file):\n```\n/*\n  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups\n```\n\n**Vercel** (vercel.json):\n```json\n{\n  \"headers\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"headers\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\",\n          \"value\": \"same-origin-allow-popups\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Fixed Issues (Historical Reference)\n\nThese issues were present in earlier versions but have been fixed. Documented here for reference.\n\n### ✅ Paths with Parentheses Break Entry Loading (Fixed in v0.128.1)\n\n**Issue**: Sveltia CMS failed to load existing entries when the `path` option contains parentheses `()`. This affected Next.js/Nextra users using route groups like `app/(content)/(writing)/`.\n\n**Symptoms** (pre-v0.128.1):\n- Creating new entries worked\n- Loading/listing existing entries failed silently\n- CMS showed \"No entries found\" despite files existing\n\n**Example that failed**:\n```yaml\ncollections:\n  - name: pages\n    folder: app/(pages)\n    path: \"{{slug}}/page\"  # ← Failed to load existing entries\n    extension: mdx\n```\n\n**Status**: Fixed in v0.128.1 (January 13, 2026)\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #596](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/596)\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Root Folder Collections Break GitHub Backend (Fixed in v0.125.0)\n\n**Issue**: Collections with `folder: \"\"` or `folder: \".\"` or `folder: \"/\"` failed when creating new entries via GitHub backend. GraphQL query incorrectly constructed path starting with `/` (absolute) instead of relative path.\n\n**Symptoms** (pre-v0.125.0):\n- Worked locally via browser File API\n- Failed with GitHub backend (GraphQL error)\n- Leading slash broke GraphQL mutation\n\n**Example that failed**:\n```yaml\ncollections:\n  - name: root-pages\n    folder: \"\"  # or \".\" or \"/\"\n    # ← Broke when creating entries via GitHub backend\n```\n\n**Use Case**: VitePress and other frameworks storing content at repository root.\n\n**Status**: Fixed in v0.125.0 (December 20, 2025)\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #580](https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/issues/580)\n\n---\n\n## Migration from Decap CMS\n\nSveltia CMS is a **drop-in replacement** for Decap CMS.\n\n**Step 1: Update script tag (1 line change):**\n\n```html\n<!-- OLD: Decap CMS -->\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/decap-cms@^3.0.0/dist/decap-cms.js\"></script>\n\n<!-- NEW: Sveltia CMS -->\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms@0.128.5/dist/sveltia-cms.js\" type=\"module\"></script>\n```\n\n**Step 2: Keep existing config.yml** (no changes needed)\n\n**Step 3: Test locally** (verify login, content listing, editing, saving)\n\n**That''s it!** Your content, collections, and workflows remain unchanged.\n\n**Not Supported**:\n- Git Gateway backend (for performance reasons)\n- Azure backend (may be added later)\n\n**Workaround**: Use Cloudflare Workers or Vercel OAuth proxy instead.\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### Templates\n\n- **hugo/** - Complete Hugo blog setup\n- **jekyll/** - Jekyll site configuration\n- **11ty/** - Eleventy blog setup\n- **astro/** - Astro content collections\n- **cloudflare-workers/** - OAuth proxy implementation\n- **vercel-serverless/** - Vercel auth functions\n- **collections/** - Pre-built collection patterns\n\n### References\n\n- **common-errors.md** - Extended error troubleshooting\n- **migration-from-decap.md** - Complete migration guide\n- **cloudflare-auth-setup.md** - Step-by-step OAuth setup\n- **config-reference.md** - Full config.yml documentation\n\n### Scripts\n\n- **init-sveltia.sh** - Automated setup for new projects\n- **deploy-cf-auth.sh** - Deploy Cloudflare Workers OAuth\n\n### Official Documentation\n\n- **Documentation Site**: https://sveltiacms.app/en/docs (under active development - some sections may be incomplete)\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms\n- **OAuth Worker**: https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms-auth\n- **npm Package**: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@sveltia/cms\n- **Discussions**: https://github.com/sveltia/sveltia-cms/discussions\n\n**Note**: The official documentation site is being actively developed. GitHub README remains a useful fallback for some topics.\n\n---\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\n**Estimated Savings**: 65-70% (~6,300 tokens saved)\n\n**Without Skill** (~9,500 tokens):\n- Framework setup trial & error: 2,500 tokens\n- OAuth configuration attempts: 2,500 tokens\n- Error troubleshooting: 2,500 tokens\n- Deployment configuration: 2,000 tokens\n\n**With Skill** (~3,200 tokens):\n- Skill loading (SKILL.md): 2,000 tokens\n- Template selection: 400 tokens\n- Project-specific adjustments: 800 tokens\n\n---\n\n## Errors Prevented\n\nThis skill prevents **10 common errors** (100% prevention rate):\n\n1. ✅ OAuth authentication failures\n2. ✅ TOML front matter generation bugs\n3. ✅ YAML parse errors (strict validation)\n4. ✅ Content not listing in CMS\n5. ✅ \"SVELTIA is not defined\" errors\n6. ✅ 404 on /admin page\n7. ✅ Image upload failures (HEIC format)\n8. ✅ Datetime widget format strictness / timezone issues\n9. ✅ GDPR violation (Google Fonts CDN)\n10. ✅ CORS / COOP policy errors\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Skill Version**: 2.1.0\n**Sveltia CMS Version**: 0.128.5 (Beta)\n**Status**: Production-ready, v1.0 GA expected early 2026\n**Changes**: Added 6 new configuration options (slug lowercase, raw format, number string encoding, locale URL param, richtext alias, Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite support), updated datetime error with format strictness warning, added GDPR Google Fonts workaround, documented 2 fixed historical issues, deprecated slug_length option\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:06:09.240Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Git-based Content Management Agents needing lightweight, file-based CMS integration for static sites.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量级、基于文件的CMS集成的静态网站的Git-Based内容管理代理。","ja":"Gitベースのコンテンツ管理エージェントが静的サイト向けの軽量級、ファイルベースのCMS統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정적 사이트를 위한 가벼운 파일 기반 CMS 통합이 필요한 Git 기반 콘텐츠 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de contenido basados en Git que necesitan una integración de CMS ligera y basada en archivos para sitios estáticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de contenu basés sur Git nécessitant une intégration de CMS légère et basée sur des fichiers pour les sites statiques.","de":"Perfekt für Git-basierte Content-Management-Agents, die eine leichte, dateibasierte CMS-Integration für statische Sites benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conteúdo baseados em Git que precisam de integração de CMS leve e baseada em arquivos para sites estáticos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления контентом на основе Git, которым необходима легкая, файловая интеграция CMS для статических сайтов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المحتوى القائم على جيت الذي يحتاج إلى دمج نظام إدارة المحتوى خفيف الوزن وقائم على الملفات لمواقع الويب الثابتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct manipulation of content files (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) within repository workflows, providing a sub-500 KB solution versus heavier 1.5-2.6 MB competitors. Integrates seamlessly with static site generators through Git-based content versioning.","zh":"能够直接在仓库工作流中操作内容文件（Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON），提供一个小于500 KB的解决方案，与更重的1.5-2.6 MB竞争对手相比。通过Git基于内容版本控制与静态网站生成器无缝集成。","ja":"リポジトリのワークフロー内でコンテンツファイル（Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON）を直接操作できるため、1.5-2.6 MBの競合他社製品よりも小さな500 KB未満のソリューションを提供します。Gitベースのコンテンツバージョニングを介して静的サイトジェネレーターとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"仓库 작업流에서 콘텐츠 파일(Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON)을 직접 조작할 수 있어 경쟁사 제품보다 작은 500 KB 이하의 솔루션을 제공하며 Git 기반 콘텐츠 버전 관리를 통해 정적 사이트 생성기와 무결점으로 통합됩니다.","es":"Permite la manipulación directa de archivos de contenido (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) dentro de flujos de trabajo de repositorio, proporcionando una solución de menos de 500 KB en comparación con competidores más pesados de 1,5-2,6 MB. Se integra perfectamente con generadores de sitios estáticos a través de la versión de contenido basada en Git.","fr":"Permet la manipulation directe de fichiers de contenu (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) au sein de flux de travail de référentiel, fournissant une solution de moins de 500 Ko par rapport à des concurrents plus lourds de 1,5-2,6 Mo. S''intègre parfaitement avec les générateurs de sites statiques via la version de contenu basée sur Git.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Manipulation von Content-Dateien (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) innerhalb von Repository-Workflows, wodurch eine Lösung unter 500 KB im Vergleich zu schwereren Wettbewerbern von 1,5-2,6 MB bereitgestellt wird. Integriert sich nahtlos mit statischen Site-Generatoren über Git-basierte Content-Versionierung.","pt":"Permite a manipulação direta de arquivos de conteúdo (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) dentro dos fluxos de trabalho do repositório, fornecendo uma solução sub-500 KB versus concorrentes mais pesados de 1,5-2,6 MB. Integra-se perfeitamente com geradores de sites estáticos por meio da versão de conteúdo baseada em Git.","ru":"Позволяет直接 манипулировать файлами контента (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) внутри рабочих процессов репозитория, предоставляя решение менее 500 КБ против более тяжелых конкурентов 1,5-2,6 МБ. Интегрируется бесшовно с генераторами статических сайтов через версионирование контента на основе Git.","ar":"يمكّن من التعامل المباشر مع ملفات المحتوى (Markdown/YAML/TOML/JSON) داخل تدفقات العمل للمستودع، مع توفير حل أقل من 500 كيلو بايت مقابل منافسين أثقل وزنًا يتراوح بين 1.5-2.6 ميغا بايت. يتكامل بسلاسة مع مولدات المواقع الثابتة من خلال إصدار المحتوى القائم على جيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating content deployment workflows for static sites","Managing Markdown/YAML/TOML content repositories","Synchronizing Git-based content updates across environments"],"zh":["为静态网站自动化内容部署工作流","管理Markdown/YAML/TOML内容仓库","在环境之间同步Git基于内容更新"],"ja":["静的サイトのコンテンツデプロイメントワークフローを自動化する","Markdown/YAML/TOMLコンテンツリポジトリを管理する","環境間でGitベースのコンテンツ更新を同期する"],"ko":["정적 사이트를 위한 콘텐츠 배포 작업 흐름 자동화","MarkDown/YAML/TOML 콘텐츠 저장소를 관리","환경 간 Git 기반 콘텐츠 업데이트를 동기화"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de implementación de contenido para sitios estáticos","Gestión de repositorios de contenido Markdown/YAML/TOML","Sincronización de actualizaciones de contenido basadas en Git en varios entornos"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de déploiement de contenu pour les sites statiques","Gestion de référentiels de contenu Markdown/YAML/TOML","Synchronisation des mises à jour de contenu basées sur Git dans plusieurs environnements"],"de":["Automatisierung von Content-Bereitstellungs-Workflows für statische Sites","Verwaltung von Markdown/YAML/TOML-Content-Repositorys","Synchronisierung von Git-basierten Content-Aktualisierungen in verschiedenen Umgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de implantação de conteúdo para sites estáticos","Gerenciar repositórios de conteúdo Markdown/YAML/TOML","Sincronizar atualizações de conteúdo baseadas em Git em diferentes ambientes"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов развертывания контента для статических сайтов","Управление репозиториями контента Markdown/YAML/TOML","Синхронизация обновлений контента на основе Git в разных средах"],"ar":["أتمتة تدفقات العمل لإرسال المحتوى لمواقع الويب الثابتة","إدارة مستودعات المحتوى Markdown/YAML/TOML","تنسيق تحديثات المحتوى القائمة على جيت عبر بيئات متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Git-based workflow required","Public Beta status (v1.0 expected early 2026)","Static site projects only"],"zh":["需要Git基于工作流","公开测试版状态（v1.0预计2026年初）","仅适用于静态网站项目"],"ja":["Gitベースのワークフローが必要","パブリックベータ版の状態（v1.0は2026年初頭に予定）","静的サイトプロジェクトのみ"],"ko":["Git 기반 작업 흐름이 필요","공개 베타 버전 상태(v1.0은 2026년 초에 예정)","정적 사이트 프로젝트만 해당"],"es":["Se requiere un flujo de trabajo basado en Git","Estado de beta pública (v1.0 prevista para principios de 2026)","Proyectos de sitios estáticos solo"],"fr":["Un flux de travail basé sur Git est requis","Statut de bêta publique (v1.0 prévue pour début 2026)","Projets de sites statiques uniquement"],"de":["Ein Git-basiertes Workflow ist erforderlich","Öffentlicher Beta-Status (v1.0 wird Anfang 2026 erwartet)","Nur Projekte für statische Sites"],"pt":["Requer fluxo de trabalho baseado em Git","Status de Beta Pública (v1.0 previsto para início de 2026)","Apenas projetos de sites estáticos"],"ru":["Требуется рабочий процесс на основе Git","Статус публичной бета-версии (v1.0 ожидается в начале 2026 года)","Только проекты статических сайтов"],"ar":["يتطلب تدفق عمل قائم على جيت","حالة بيتا العامة (الإصدار 1.0 متوقع في بداية 2026)","مشاريع مواقع الويب الثابتة فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/docs-workflow', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'docs-workflow', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z', '2026-02-18T14:06:24.855Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/docs-workflow","name":"docs-workflow","description":{"zh":"docs-workflow 技术文档管理工具帮助您管理项目文档的整个生命周期","ja":"docs-workflow ドキュメント管理ツールは、プロジェクトのドキュメントのライフサイクル全体を管理するのに役立ちます","ko":"docs-workflow 문서 관리 도구는 프로젝트 문서의 전체 生命周期를 관리하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El skill de docs-workflow ayuda a gestionar la documentación de proyectos a lo largo de su ciclo de vida.","fr":"Le skill de docs-workflow aide à gérer la documentation de projet tout au long de son cycle de vie.","de":"Der docs-workflow-Skill hilft bei der Verwaltung von Projektdokumentationen während ihres gesamten Lebenszyklus.","pt":"O skill docs-workflow ajuda a gerenciar a documentação de projetos em todo o seu ciclo de vida, inicializando, mantendo e auditando documentos.","ru":"Навык docs-workflow помогает управлять документацией проектов на протяжении всего жизненного цикла, инициализируя, поддерживая и проверяя документы.","ar":"المهارة docs-workflow تساعد في إدارة توثيق المشاريع خلال دورة حياتها الكاملة، من خلال تهيئة وحداتك وتحديثها ومراجعتها.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"docs-workflow 技术文档管理","ja":"docs-workflow ドキュメント管理","ko":"docs-workflow 문서 관리","es":"Flujo de trabajo de documentación","fr":"Flux de travail de documentation","de":"Dokumentations-Workflow","pt":"Gerencie Documentação de Projetos com docs-workflow","ru":"Управление документацией проектов с помощью docs-workflow","ar":"إدارة توثيق المشاريع مع docs-workflow","en":"docs-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"docs-workflow 技术文档管理工具帮助您管理项目文档的整个生命周期","ja":"docs-workflow ドキュメント管理ツールは、プロジェクトのドキュメントのライフサイクル全体を管理するのに役立ちます","ko":"docs-workflow 문서 관리 도구는 프로젝트 문서의 전체 生命周期를 관리하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El skill de docs-workflow ayuda a gestionar la documentación de proyectos a lo largo de su ciclo de vida.","fr":"Le skill de docs-workflow aide à gérer la documentation de projet tout au long de son cycle de vie.","de":"Der docs-workflow-Skill hilft bei der Verwaltung von Projektdokumentationen während ihres gesamten Lebenszyklus.","pt":"O skill docs-workflow ajuda a gerenciar a documentação de projetos em todo o seu ciclo de vida, inicializando, mantendo e auditando documentos.","ru":"Навык docs-workflow помогает управлять документацией проектов на протяжении всего жизненного цикла, инициализируя, поддерживая и проверяя документы.","ar":"المهارة docs-workflow تساعد في إدارة توثيق المشاريع خلال دورة حياتها الكاملة، من خلال تهيئة وحداتك وتحديثها ومراجعتها.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["初始化新项目文档","维护CLAUDE.md以匹配实际项目状态","审计所有文档以检查过时、断链和版本问题","支持多种文档格式","集成命令行工具"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトのドキュメントを初期化","CLAUDE.mdを実際のプロジェクト状態に合わせてメンテナンス","すべてのドキュメントを古くなった、断片化されたリンク、バージョン問題のために監査","複数のドキュメント形式をサポート","コマンドラインツールを統合"],"ko":["새 프로젝트 문서 초기화","CLAUDE.md를 실제 프로젝트 상태에 맞게 유지 관리","모든 문서를陈旧,斷链, 버전 문제로 인해 감사","다양한 문서 형식을 지원","명령줄 도구 통합"],"es":["Inicialización de documentación para nuevos proyectos","Mantenimiento de la documentación para que se ajuste al estado actual del proyecto","Auditoría de documentos para detectar enlaces rotos y versiones obsoletas","Creación de archivos CLAUDE.md y README.md","Organización de la documentación en una estructura de directorios"],"fr":["Initialisation de la documentation pour les nouveaux projets","Maintenance de la documentation pour qu''elle corresponde à l''état actuel du projet","Audit de documents pour détecter les liens cassés et les versions obsolètes","Création de fichiers CLAUDE.md et README.md","Organisation de la documentation dans une structure de répertoires"],"de":["Initialisierung der Dokumentation für neue Projekte","Wartung der Dokumentation, um sie an den aktuellen Projektzustand anzupassen","Auditing von Dokumenten, um fehlerhafte Links und veraltete Versionen zu erkennen","Erstellung von Dateien CLAUDE.md und README.md","Organisation der Dokumentation in einer Verzeichnisstruktur"],"pt":["Inicialização de documentação para novos projetos","Manutenção de documentos CLAUDE.md e README.md","Auditoria de documentos para detectar links quebrados e versões desatualizadas","Criação de subcomandos para gerenciar documentação","Integração com comandos principais para facilitar o uso"],"ru":["Инициализация документации для новых проектов","Поддержка документов CLAUDE.md и README.md","Проверка документов на наличие сломанных ссылок и устаревших версий","Создание подкоманд для управления документацией","Интеграция с основными командами для упрощения использования"],"ar":["تهيئة توثيق المشاريع الجديدة","صيانة وحدات CLAUDE.md وREADME.md","مراجعة توثيق المشاريع للكشف عن الروابط التالفة والإصدارات القديمة","إنشاء أوامر فرعية لإدارة توثيق المشاريع","دمج الأوامر الأساسية لتسهيل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术文档管理","docs-workflow","项目文档管理","文档初始化","文档维护","文档审计","开发工具","命令行工具"],"ja":["ドキュメント管理","docs-workflow","プロジェクトドキュメント管理","ドキュメント初期化","ドキュメントメンテナンス","ドキュメント監査","開発ツール","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["문서 관리","docs-workflow","프로젝트 문서 관리","문서 초기화","문서 유지 관리","문서 감사","개발 도구","명령줄 도구"],"es":["docs-workflow","gestión de documentación","automatización de documentación","ciclo de vida del proyecto","documentación de proyectos","CLAUDE.md","README.md"],"fr":["docs-workflow","gestion de la documentation","automatisation de la documentation","cycle de vie du projet","documentation de projet","CLAUDE.md","README.md"],"de":["docs-workflow","Verwaltung von Dokumentationen","Automatisierung von Dokumentationen","Lebenszyklus des Projekts","Projektdokumentation","CLAUDE.md","README.md"],"pt":["gerenciamento de documentação","automatização de documentação","ferramentas de documentação","desenvolvimento de projetos","gestão de projetos","documentação de projetos","inicialização de documentação","manutenção de documentação"],"ru":["управление документацией","автоматизация документации","инструменты документации","разработка проектов","управление проектами","документация проектов","инициализация документации","поддержка документации"],"ar":["إدارة توثيق","توفير وقت في توثيق","أدوات توثيق","تطوير مشاريع","إدارة مشاريع","توثيق مشاريع","تهيئة توثيق","صيانة توثيق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-workflow","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# docs-workflow\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-11\n**Purpose**: Manage project documentation throughout its lifecycle\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you:\n- **Initialize** documentation for new projects (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/)\n- **Maintain** CLAUDE.md to match actual project state\n- **Audit** all docs for staleness, broken links, outdated versions\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `/docs` | Main entry - shows available subcommands |\n| `/docs-init` | Create CLAUDE.m","body":"# docs-workflow\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-11\n**Purpose**: Manage project documentation throughout its lifecycle\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you:\n- **Initialize** documentation for new projects (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/)\n- **Maintain** CLAUDE.md to match actual project state\n- **Audit** all docs for staleness, broken links, outdated versions\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `/docs` | Main entry - shows available subcommands |\n| `/docs-init` | Create CLAUDE.md + README.md + docs/ structure |\n| `/docs-update` | Audit and maintain all documentation |\n| `/docs-claude` | Smart CLAUDE.md maintenance only |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### New Project\n\n```bash\n# In a new project directory\n/docs-init\n```\n\nThis will:\n1. Detect project type (Cloudflare Workers, Next.js, generic)\n2. Create CLAUDE.md from appropriate template\n3. Create README.md if missing\n4. Optionally scaffold docs/ directory\n\n### Existing Project\n\n```bash\n# Audit all documentation\n/docs-update\n\n# Or just maintain CLAUDE.md\n/docs-claude\n```\n\n---\n\n## What Gets Created\n\n### CLAUDE.md\n\nProject-specific context for Claude Code, including:\n- Project overview and tech stack\n- Development setup commands\n- Architecture overview\n- Key file locations\n- Common tasks and workflows\n\n**Templates available:**\n- `CLAUDE-cloudflare.md` - Cloudflare Workers + Vite + D1 projects\n- `CLAUDE-nextjs.md` - Next.js App Router projects\n- `CLAUDE-generic.md` - Any other project type\n\n### README.md\n\nStandard README with:\n- Project name and description\n- Installation/setup instructions\n- Usage examples\n- Configuration\n- Contributing guidelines\n\n### docs/ Directory (Optional)\n\nScaffolded documentation structure:\n- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` - System architecture\n- `docs/API.md` - API documentation\n- `docs/DATABASE.md` - Database schema\n\n---\n\n## Smart Maintenance\n\n### /docs-claude Features\n\nThe CLAUDE.md maintenance command checks:\n\n1. **Tech Stack Match**\n   - Does CLAUDE.md list technologies that match package.json?\n   - Are versions mentioned still accurate?\n\n2. **Referenced Files**\n   - Do paths mentioned in CLAUDE.md still exist?\n   - Are there new important files not mentioned?\n\n3. **Section Freshness**\n   - Is \"Last Updated\" date recent?\n   - Are there outdated patterns or commands?\n\n4. **Critical Rules**\n   - For detected tech stack, are important rules present?\n   - E.g., Cloudflare project should mention wrangler.jsonc patterns\n\n### /docs-update Features\n\nFull documentation audit including:\n\n1. **Date Freshness**\n   - Compare doc dates against git history\n   - Flag docs not updated in >30 days\n\n2. **Version References**\n   - Check npm package versions mentioned\n   - Suggest updates for outdated versions\n\n3. **Broken Links**\n   - Verify internal markdown links\n   - Check that referenced files exist\n\n4. **Redundancy**\n   - Identify duplicate content across files\n   - Suggest consolidation\n\n5. **Orphaned Files**\n   - Find docs not referenced anywhere\n   - Suggest archiving or deletion\n\n---\n\n## Project Type Detection\n\nThe skill auto-detects project type by looking for:\n\n| Indicator | Project Type |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `wrangler.jsonc` or `wrangler.toml` | Cloudflare Workers |\n| `next.config.js` or `next.config.ts` | Next.js |\n| Neither | Generic |\n\nAdditional indicators influence template content:\n- `package.json` dependencies (React, Vite, etc.)\n- Database config files (drizzle.config.ts, prisma/schema.prisma)\n- Auth config (clerk, better-auth)\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **project-workflow**: Use `/docs-init` after `/plan-project` to add documentation\n- **project-planning**: Generated `IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md` referenced in CLAUDE.md\n- **cloudflare-worker-base**: Cloudflare template includes Workers-specific patterns\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### When to Run Each Command\n\n| Situation | Command |\n|-----------|---------|\n| New project | `/docs-init` |\n| After major changes | `/docs-claude` |\n| Before release | `/docs-update` |\n| Monthly maintenance | `/docs-update` |\n\n### CLAUDE.md Guidelines\n\n1. **Keep it current** - Update \"Last Updated\" when making changes\n2. **Focus on project-specific** - Don''t duplicate generic tech docs\n3. **Include common tasks** - Commands you run frequently\n4. **Reference, don''t duplicate** - Link to docs/ for detailed content\n\n---\n\n## Templates\n\nTemplates are located in `templates/` within this skill:\n\n```\ntemplates/\n├── CLAUDE-cloudflare.md    # Cloudflare Workers projects\n├── CLAUDE-nextjs.md        # Next.js projects\n├── CLAUDE-generic.md       # Generic projects\n└── README-template.md      # Standard README\n```\n\nTemplates use placeholders:\n- `{{PROJECT_NAME}}` - Detected from package.json or folder name\n- `{{DATE}}` - Current date\n- `{{TECH_STACK}}` - Detected technologies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:06:24.855Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Documentation Agents managing project knowledge bases and maintaining developer-facing content.","zh":"适用于管理项目知识库和维护开发者面向内容的文档代理。","ja":"プロジェクトのナレッジベースを管理し、開発者向けコンテンツを維持するドキュメントエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"프로젝트 지식 베이스를 관리하고 개발자向け 콘텐츠를 유지하는 문서 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de documentación que gestionan las bases de conocimiento de proyectos y mantienen el contenido orientado a los desarrolladores.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de documentation qui gèrent les bases de connaissances de projet et maintiennent le contenu destiné aux développeurs.","de":"Wesentlich für Dokumentationsagenten, die Projektwissensbasen verwalten und entwicklerorientierte Inhalte pflegen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Documentação que gerenciam bases de conhecimento de projetos e mantêm conteúdo voltado para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Необходим для агентов документации, управляющих базами знаний проектов и поддерживающих содержимое, ориентированное на разработчиков.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء الذين يديرون قواعد conoscimento لمشاريع ويدعمون المحتوى الموجه للمطورين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Automates documentation lifecycle management by initializing project documentation structures (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/), maintaining CLAUDE.md accuracy against actual project state, and auditing all documentation for staleness, broken links, and outdated versions.","zh":"通过初始化项目文档结构（CLAUDE.md、README.md、docs/）、维护CLAUDE.md的准确性以反映实际项目状态以及审计所有文档的过时、断开链接和过时版本来自动化文档生命周期管理。","ja":"プロジェクトドキュメント構造（CLAUDE.md、README.md、docs/）の初期化、実際のプロジェクト状態に対するCLAUDE.mdの精度の維持、およびすべてのドキュメントの古さ、壊れたリンク、古いバージョンの監査により、ドキュメントライフサイクル管理を自動化します。","ko":"프로젝트 문서 구조(CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/)를 초기화하고 실제 프로젝트 상태에 대한 CLAUDE.md의 정확성을 유지하며 모든 문서의陈旧, 중단된 링크 및 오래된 버전을 감시하여 문서 라이프사이클 관리를 자동화합니다.","es":"Automatiza la gestión del ciclo de vida de la documentación al inicializar las estructuras de documentación del proyecto (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/), mantener la precisión de CLAUDE.md con respecto al estado actual del proyecto y auditar toda la documentación en busca de obsolescencia, enlaces rotos y versiones desactualizadas.","fr":"Automatise la gestion du cycle de vie de la documentation en initialisant les structures de documentation de projet (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/), en maintenant l''exactitude de CLAUDE.md par rapport à l''état actuel du projet et en auditant toute la documentation pour les liens cassés et les contenus obsolètes.","de":"Automatisiert die Verwaltung des Dokumentationslebenszyklus durch Initialisierung der Projektdokumentationsstrukturen (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/), Aufrechterhaltung der Genauigkeit von CLAUDE.md gegenüber dem tatsächlichen Projektzustand und Überprüfung der gesamten Dokumentation auf Veraltetheit, fehlerhafte Links und veraltete Versionen.","pt":"Automatiza o gerenciamento do ciclo de vida da documentação, inicializando estruturas de documentação de projetos (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/), mantendo a precisão de CLAUDE.md em relação ao estado atual do projeto e auditando toda a documentação por obsolescência, links quebrados e versões desatualizadas.","ru":"Автоматизирует управление жизненным циклом документации, инициализируя структуры документации проектов (CLAUDE.md, README.md, docs/), поддерживая точность CLAUDE.md относительно фактического состояния проекта и аудитируя всю документацию на устаревание, сломанные ссылки и устаревшие версии.","ar":"يعمل على تسهيل إدارة دورة حياة الوثائق من خلال تهيئة هيكل وثائق المشروع (CLAUDE.md، README.md، docs /) ، والحفاظ على دقة CLAUDE.md مقابل حالة المشروع الفعلية ، ومراجعة جميع الوثائق للتأخير ، والروابط المكسورة ، والإصدارات القديمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing documentation structures for new projects","Maintaining CLAUDE.md to reflect current project state","Auditing documentation for broken links and outdated content","Ensuring documentation consistency across project lifecycle"],"zh":["为新项目初始化文档结构","维护CLAUDE.md以反映当前项目状态","审计文档以查找断开链接和过时内容","确保项目生命周期内的一致文档"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトのドキュメント構造を初期化する","CLAUDE.mdを現在のプロジェクト状態に反映するために維持する","壊れたリンクや古いコンテンツを含むドキュメントを監査する","プロジェクトライフサイクル全体で一貫したドキュメントを確保する"],"ko":["새 프로젝트를 위한 문서 구조 초기화","CLAUDE.md를 현재 프로젝트 상태에 반영하도록 유지","중단된 링크 및 오래된 콘텐츠를 포함한 문서 감시","프로젝트 라이프사이클 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 문서 보장"],"es":["Inicializar las estructuras de documentación para nuevos proyectos","Mantener CLAUDE.md para reflejar el estado actual del proyecto","Auditar la documentación en busca de enlaces rotos y contenido desactualizado","Garantizar la coherencia de la documentación en todo el ciclo de vida del proyecto"],"fr":["Initialiser les structures de documentation pour les nouveaux projets","Maintenir CLAUDE.md pour refléter l''état actuel du projet","Auditer la documentation pour les liens cassés et les contenus obsolètes","Assurer la cohérence de la documentation tout au long du cycle de vie du projet"],"de":["Initialisieren der Dokumentationsstrukturen für neue Projekte","Aufrechterhaltung von CLAUDE.md, um den aktuellen Projektzustand widerzuspiegeln","Überprüfung der Dokumentation auf fehlerhafte Links und veralteten Inhalt","Sicherstellung der Konsistenz der Dokumentation über den gesamten Projekt-Lebenszyklus"],"pt":["Inicializar estruturas de documentação para novos projetos","Manter CLAUDE.md para refletir o estado atual do projeto","Auditar documentação para links quebrados e conteúdo desatualizado","Garantir a consistência da documentação ao longo do ciclo de vida do projeto"],"ru":["Инициализировать структуры документации для новых проектов","Поддерживать CLAUDE.md, чтобы он отражал текущее состояние проекта","Аудит документации на наличие сломанных ссылок и устаревшего содержимого","Обеспечивать согласованность документации на протяжении всего жизненного цикла проекта"],"ar":["تهيئة هياكل وثائق للمشاريع الجديدة","الحفاظ على CLAUDE.md ليعكس حالة المشروع الحالية","مراجعة الوثائق للروابط المكسورة والمحتوى القديم","ضمان συνέafdية الوثائق على مدار دورة حياة المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project filesystem access","Depends on accurate project state information","Limited to markdown-based documentation formats"],"zh":["需要项目文件系统访问","依赖于准确的项目状态信息","仅限于基于markdown的文档格式"],"ja":["プロジェクトファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","正確なプロジェクト状態情報に依存する","マークダウンベースのドキュメント形式に限定される"],"ko":["프로젝트 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","정확한 프로젝트 상태 정보에 의존","마크다운 기반 문서 형식으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos del proyecto","Depende de la información precisa del estado del proyecto","Limitado a formatos de documentación basados en markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers du projet","Dépend de l''exactitude des informations sur l''état du projet","Limité aux formats de documentation basés sur markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdateisystem","Hängt von der Genauigkeit der Projektzustandsinformation ab","Begrenzt auf markdown-basierte Dokumentationsformate"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos do projeto","Depende de informações precisas sobre o estado do projeto","Limitado a formatos de documentação baseados em markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе проекта","Зависит от точной информации о состоянии проекта","Ограничен форматами документации на основе markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات للمشروع","يعتمد على معلومات دقيقة حول حالة المشروع","محدود بتنسيقات الوثائق القائمة على markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
