para ofrecer una solución de validación de formularios eficiente y fácil de usar en React","fr":"React Hook Form et Zod s''allient pour offrir une solution de validation de formulaire efficace et facile à utiliser dans React","de":"React Hook Form und Zod bieten gemeinsam eine effiziente und benutzerfreundliche Lösung für die Formularvalidierung in React","pt":"O react-hook-form-zod é uma combinação poderosa para a criação de formulários validados em React","ru":"React Hook Form и Zod - это мощная комбинация для создания валидационных форм в React","ar":"react-hook-form-zod هو مزيج قوي لإنشاء نماذج محكمة الصحة في React","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["高效的表单验证","支持多种验证规则","易于集成到 React 项目","提供清晰的错误信息","支持自定义验证逻辑"],"ja":["効率的なフォームバリデーション","複数のバリデーションルールをサポート","React プロジェクトへの簡単な統合","明確なエラー情報を提供","カスタムバリデーションロジックをサポート"],"ko":["효율적인 폼 유효성 검사","다양한 유효성 검사 규칙 지원","React 프로젝트에 쉽게 통합","명확한 오류 정보 제공","사용자 정의 유효성 검사 로직 지원"],"es":["Validación de formularios robusta y escalable","Integración con React Hook Form","Uso de Zod para la validación de esquemas","Compatibilidad con las últimas versiones de React","Fácil de usar y configurar"],"fr":["Validation de formulaire robuste et évolutiva","Intégration avec React Hook Form","Utilisation de Zod pour la validation de schémas","Compatibilité avec les dernières versions de React","Facile à utiliser et à configurer"],"de":["Robuste und skalierbare Formularvalidierung","Integration mit React Hook Form","Verwendung von Zod für die Validierung von Schemata","Kompatibilität mit den neuesten Versionen von React","Einfach zu verwenden und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Criação de formulários validados de forma eficiente","Integração com React Hook Form","Suporte a Zod para validação de esquemas","Tipagem de dados segura com z.infer","Mensagens de erro personalizáveis"],"ru":["Эффективная валидация форм","Интеграция с React Hook Form","Поддержка Zod для валидации схем","Безопасная типизация данных с z.infer","Настраиваемые сообщения об ошибках"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج محكمة الصحة بفعالية","التكامل مع React Hook Form","دعم Zod للتحقق من صحة السchemes","تنميط بيانات آمن مع z.infer","رسائل الخطأ المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Hook Form","Zod","表单验证","React 表单","前端开发","表单处理"],"ja":["React Hook Form","Zod","フォームバリデーション","React フォーム","フロントエンド開発","フォーム処理"],"ko":["React Hook Form","Zod","폼 유효성 검사","React 폼","프론트엔드 개발","폼 처리"],"es":["React Hook Form","Zod","validación de formularios","React","formularios","validación","esquemas","integración"],"fr":["React Hook Form","Zod","validation de formulaire","React","formulaire","validation","schémas","intégration"],"de":["React Hook Form","Zod","Formularvalidierung","React","Formulare","Validierung","Schemata","Integration"],"pt":["react hook form","zod","validação de formulários","react hook form zod","formulários validados","biblioteca de validação"],"ru":["react hook form","zod","валидация форм","react hook form zod","валидационные формы","библиотека валидации"],"ar":["react hook form","zod","تحقق من صحة النماذج","react hook form zod","نماذج محكمة الصحة","مكتبة التحقق من الصحة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-hook-form-zod","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# React Hook Form + Zod Validation\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Verified**: 2026-01-20\n**Latest Versions**: react-hook-form@7.71.1, zod@4.3.5, @hookform/resolvers@5.2.2\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install react-hook-form@7.70.0 zod@4.3.5 @hookform/resolvers@5.2.2\n```\n\n**Basic Form Pattern**:\n```typescript\nconst schema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  password: z.string().min(8),\n})\n\ntype FormData = z.infer<typeof schema>\n\nconst { register, handleSubmit, formState: { er","body":"# React Hook Form + Zod Validation\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Verified**: 2026-01-20\n**Latest Versions**: react-hook-form@7.71.1, zod@4.3.5, @hookform/resolvers@5.2.2\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install react-hook-form@7.70.0 zod@4.3.5 @hookform/resolvers@5.2.2\n```\n\n**Basic Form Pattern**:\n```typescript\nconst schema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  password: z.string().min(8),\n})\n\ntype FormData = z.infer<typeof schema>\n\nconst { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors } } = useForm<FormData>({\n  resolver: zodResolver(schema),\n  defaultValues: { email: '''', password: '''' }, // REQUIRED to prevent uncontrolled warnings\n})\n\n<form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>\n  <input {...register(''email'')} />\n  {errors.email && <span role=\"alert\">{errors.email.message}</span>}\n</form>\n```\n\n**Server Validation** (CRITICAL - never skip):\n```typescript\n// SAME schema on server\nconst data = schema.parse(await req.json())\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**useForm Options** (validation modes):\n- `mode: ''onSubmit''` (default) - Best performance\n- `mode: ''onBlur''` - Good balance\n- `mode: ''onChange''` - Live feedback, more re-renders\n- `shouldUnregister: true` - Remove field data when unmounted (use for multi-step forms)\n\n**Zod Refinements** (cross-field validation):\n```typescript\nz.object({ password: z.string(), confirm: z.string() })\n  .refine((data) => data.password === data.confirm, {\n    message: \"Passwords don''t match\",\n    path: [''confirm''], // CRITICAL: Error appears on this field\n  })\n```\n\n**Zod Transforms**:\n```typescript\nz.string().transform((val) => val.toLowerCase()) // Data manipulation\nz.string().transform(parseInt).refine((v) => v > 0) // Chain with refine\n```\n\n**Zod v4.3.0+ Features**:\n```typescript\n// Exact optional (can omit field, but NOT undefined)\nz.string().exactOptional()\n\n// Exclusive union (exactly one must match)\nz.xor([z.string(), z.number()])\n\n// Import from JSON Schema\nz.fromJSONSchema({ type: \"object\", properties: { name: { type: \"string\" } } })\n```\n\n**zodResolver** connects Zod to React Hook Form, preserving type safety\n\n---\n\n## Registration\n\n**register** (for standard HTML inputs):\n```typescript\n<input {...register(''email'')} /> // Uncontrolled, best performance\n```\n\n**Controller** (for third-party components):\n```typescript\n<Controller\n  name=\"category\"\n  control={control}\n  render={({ field }) => <CustomSelect {...field} />} // MUST spread {...field}\n/>\n```\n\n**When to use Controller**: React Select, date pickers, custom components without ref. Otherwise use `register`.\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**Display errors**:\n```typescript\n{errors.email && <span role=\"alert\">{errors.email.message}</span>}\n{errors.address?.street?.message} // Nested errors (use optional chaining)\n```\n\n**Server errors**:\n```typescript\nconst onSubmit = async (data) => {\n  const res = await fetch(''/api/submit'', { method: ''POST'', body: JSON.stringify(data) })\n  if (!res.ok) {\n    const { errors: serverErrors } = await res.json()\n    Object.entries(serverErrors).forEach(([field, msg]) => setError(field, { message: msg }))\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n**useFieldArray** (dynamic lists):\n```typescript\nconst { fields, append, remove } = useFieldArray({ control, name: ''contacts'' })\n\n{fields.map((field, index) => (\n  <div key={field.id}> {/* CRITICAL: Use field.id, NOT index */}\n    <input {...register(`contacts.${index}.name` as const)} />\n    {errors.contacts?.[index]?.name && <span>{errors.contacts[index].name.message}</span>}\n    <button onClick={() => remove(index)}>Remove</button>\n  </div>\n))}\n<button onClick={() => append({ name: '''', email: '''' })}>Add</button>\n```\n\n**Async Validation** (debounce):\n```typescript\nconst debouncedValidation = useDebouncedCallback(() => trigger(''username''), 500)\n```\n\n**Multi-Step Forms**:\n```typescript\nconst step1 = z.object({ name: z.string(), email: z.string().email() })\nconst step2 = z.object({ address: z.string() })\nconst fullSchema = step1.merge(step2)\n\nconst nextStep = async () => {\n  const isValid = await trigger([''name'', ''email'']) // Validate specific fields\n  if (isValid) setStep(2)\n}\n```\n\n**Conditional Validation**:\n```typescript\nz.discriminatedUnion(''accountType'', [\n  z.object({ accountType: z.literal(''personal''), name: z.string() }),\n  z.object({ accountType: z.literal(''business''), companyName: z.string() }),\n])\n```\n\n**Conditional Fields with shouldUnregister**:\n```typescript\nconst form = useForm({\n  resolver: zodResolver(schema),\n  shouldUnregister: false, // Keep values when fields unmount (default)\n})\n\n// Or use conditional schema validation:\nz.object({\n  showAddress: z.boolean(),\n  address: z.string(),\n}).refine((data) => {\n  if (data.showAddress) {\n    return data.address.length > 0;\n  }\n  return true;\n}, {\n  message: \"Address is required\",\n  path: [\"address\"],\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## shadcn/ui Integration\n\n**Note**: shadcn/ui deprecated the Form component. Use the Field component for new implementations (check latest docs).\n\n**Common Import Mistake**: IDEs/AI may auto-import `Form` from \"react-hook-form\" instead of from shadcn. Always import:\n```typescript\n// ✅ Correct:\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\";\nimport { Form, FormField, FormItem } from \"@/components/ui/form\"; // shadcn\n\n// ❌ Wrong (auto-import mistake):\nimport { useForm, Form } from \"react-hook-form\";\n```\n\n**Legacy Form component**:\n```typescript\n<FormField control={form.control} name=\"username\" render={({ field }) => (\n  <FormItem>\n    <FormControl><Input {...field} /></FormControl>\n    <FormMessage />\n  </FormItem>\n)} />\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance\n\n- Use `register` (uncontrolled) over `Controller` (controlled) for standard inputs\n- Use `watch(''email'')` not `watch()` (isolates re-renders to specific fields)\n- `shouldUnregister: true` for multi-step forms (clears data on unmount)\n\n### Large Forms (300+ Fields)\n\n**Warning**: Forms with 300+ fields using a resolver (Zod/Yup) AND reading `formState` properties can freeze for 10-15 seconds during registration. ([Issue #13129](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/13129))\n\n**Performance Characteristics**:\n- Clean (no resolver, no formState read): Almost immediate\n- With resolver only: Almost immediate\n- With formState read only: Almost immediate\n- With BOTH resolver + formState read: ~9.5 seconds for 300 fields\n\n**Workarounds**:\n\n1. **Avoid destructuring formState** - Read properties inline only when needed:\n```typescript\n// ❌ Slow with 300+ fields:\nconst { isDirty, isValid } = form.formState;\n\n// ✅ Fast:\nconst handleSubmit = () => {\n  if (!form.formState.isValid) return; // Read inline only when needed\n};\n```\n\n2. **Use mode: \"onSubmit\"** - Don''t validate on every change:\n```typescript\nconst form = useForm({\n  resolver: zodResolver(largeSchema),\n  mode: \"onSubmit\", // Validate only on submit, not onChange\n});\n```\n\n3. **Split into sub-forms** - Multiple smaller forms with separate schemas:\n```typescript\n// Instead of one 300-field form, use 5-6 forms with 50-60 fields each\nconst form1 = useForm({ resolver: zodResolver(schema1) }); // Fields 1-50\nconst form2 = useForm({ resolver: zodResolver(schema2) }); // Fields 51-100\n```\n\n4. **Lazy render fields** - Use tabs/accordion to mount only visible fields:\n```typescript\n// Only mount fields for active tab, reduces initial registration time\n{activeTab === ''personal'' && <PersonalInfoFields />}\n{activeTab === ''address'' && <AddressFields />}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n✅ **Always set defaultValues** (prevents uncontrolled→controlled warnings)\n\n✅ **Validate on BOTH client and server** (client can be bypassed - security!)\n\n✅ **Use `field.id` as key** in useFieldArray (not index)\n\n✅ **Spread `{...field}`** in Controller render\n\n✅ **Use `z.infer<typeof schema>`** for type inference\n\n❌ **Never skip server validation** (security vulnerability)\n\n❌ **Never mutate values directly** (use `setValue()`)\n\n❌ **Never mix controlled + uncontrolled** patterns\n\n❌ **Never use index as key** in useFieldArray\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues (20 Prevented)\n\n1. **Zod v4 Type Inference** - [#13109](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/13109): Use `z.infer<typeof schema>` explicitly. Resolved in v7.66.x+. **Note**: @hookform/resolvers has TypeScript compatibility issues with Zod v4 ([#813](https://github.com/react-hook-form/resolvers/issues/813)). Workaround: Use `import { z } from ''zod/v3''` or wait for resolver update.\n\n2. **Uncontrolled→Controlled Warning** - Always set `defaultValues` for all fields\n\n3. **Nested Object Errors** - Use optional chaining: `errors.address?.street?.message`\n\n4. **Array Field Re-renders** - Use `key={field.id}` in useFieldArray (not index)\n\n5. **Async Validation Race Conditions** - Debounce validation, cancel pending requests\n\n6. **Server Error Mapping** - Use `setError()` to map server errors to fields\n\n7. **Default Values Not Applied** - Set `defaultValues` in useForm options (not useState)\n\n8. **Controller Field Not Updating** - Always spread `{...field}` in render function\n\n9. **useFieldArray Key Warnings** - Use `field.id` as key (not index)\n\n10. **Schema Refinement Error Paths** - Specify `path` in refinement: `refine(..., { path: [''fieldName''] })`\n\n11. **Transform vs Preprocess** - Use `transform` for output, `preprocess` for input\n\n12. **Multiple Resolver Conflicts** - Use single resolver (zodResolver), combine schemas if needed\n\n13. **Zod v4 Optional Fields Bug** - [#13102](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/13102): Setting optional fields (`.optional()`) to empty string `\"\"` incorrectly triggers validation errors. Workarounds: Use `.nullish()`, `.or(z.literal(\"\"))`, or `z.preprocess((val) => val === \"\" ? undefined : val, z.email().optional())`\n\n14. **useFieldArray Primitive Arrays Not Supported** - [#12570](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/12570): Design limitation. `useFieldArray` only works with arrays of objects, not primitives like `string[]`. Workaround: Wrap primitives in objects: `[{ value: \"string\" }]` instead of `[\"string\"]`\n\n15. **useFieldArray SSR ID Mismatch** - [#12782](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/12782): Hydration mismatch warnings with SSR (Remix, Next.js). Field IDs generated on server don''t match client. Workaround: Use client-only rendering for field arrays or wait for V8 (uses deterministic `key`)\n\n16. **Next.js 16 reset() Validation Bug** - [#13110](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/13110): Calling `form.reset()` after Server Actions submission causes validation errors on next submit. Fixed in v7.65.0+. Before fix: Use `setValue()` instead of `reset()`\n\n17. **Validation Race Condition** - [#13156](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/13156): During resolver validation, intermediate render where `isValidating=false` but `errors` not populated yet. Don''t derive validity from errors alone. Use: `!errors.field && !isValidating`\n\n18. **ZodError Thrown in Beta Versions** - [#12816](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/12816): Zod v4 beta versions throw `ZodError` directly instead of capturing in `formState.errors`. Fixed in stable Zod v4.1.x+. Avoid beta versions\n\n19. **Large Form Performance** - [#13129](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/13129): 300+ fields with resolver + formState read freezes for 10-15 seconds. See Performance section for 4 workarounds\n\n20. **shadcn Form Import Confusion** - IDEs/AI may auto-import `Form` from \"react-hook-form\" instead of shadcn. Always import `Form` components from `@/components/ui/form`\n\n---\n\n## Upcoming Changes in V8 (Beta)\n\nReact Hook Form v8 (currently in beta as of v8.0.0-beta.1, released 2026-01-11) introduces breaking changes. [RFC Discussion #7433](https://github.com/orgs/react-hook-form/discussions/7433)\n\n**Breaking Changes**:\n\n1. **useFieldArray: `id` → `key`**:\n```typescript\n// V7:\nconst { fields } = useFieldArray({ control, name: \"items\" });\nfields.map(field => <div key={field.id}>...</div>)\n\n// V8:\nconst { fields } = useFieldArray({ control, name: \"items\" });\nfields.map(field => <div key={field.key}>...</div>)\n// keyName prop removed\n```\n\n2. **Watch component: `names` → `name`**:\n```typescript\n// V7:\n<Watch names={[\"email\", \"password\"]} />\n\n// V8:\n<Watch name={[\"email\", \"password\"]} />\n```\n\n3. **watch() callback API removed**:\n```typescript\n// V7:\nwatch((data, { name, type }) => {\n  console.log(data, name, type);\n});\n\n// V8: Use useWatch or manual subscription\nconst data = useWatch({ control });\nuseEffect(() => {\n  console.log(data);\n}, [data]);\n```\n\n4. **setValue() no longer updates useFieldArray**:\n```typescript\n// V7:\nsetValue(\"items\", newArray); // Updates field array\n\n// V8: Must use replace() API\nconst { replace } = useFieldArray({ control, name: \"items\" });\nreplace(newArray);\n```\n\n**V8 Benefits**:\n- Fixes SSR hydration mismatch (deterministic `key` instead of random `id`)\n- Improved performance\n- Better TypeScript inference\n\n**Migration Timeline**: V8 is in beta. Stable release date TBD. Monitor [releases](https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/releases) for stable version.\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n**Templates**: basic-form.tsx, advanced-form.tsx, shadcn-form.tsx, server-validation.ts, async-validation.tsx, dynamic-fields.tsx, multi-step-form.tsx, package.json\n\n**References**: zod-schemas-guide.md, rhf-api-reference.md, error-handling.md, performance-optimization.md, shadcn-integration.md, top-errors.md\n\n**Docs**: https://react-hook-form.com/ | https://zod.dev/ | https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/form\n\n---\n\n**License**: MIT | **Last Verified**: 2026-01-20 | **Skill Version**: 2.1.0 | **Changes**: Added 8 new known issues (Zod v4 optional fields bug, useFieldArray primitives limitation, SSR hydration mismatch, performance guidance for large forms, Next.js 16 reset() bug, validation race condition, ZodError thrown in beta, shadcn import confusion), added Zod v4.3.0 features (.exactOptional(), .xor(), z.fromJSONSchema()), added conditional field patterns with shouldUnregister, added V8 beta breaking changes section, expanded Zod v4 resolver compatibility notes, updated to react-hook-form@7.71.1\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:09:02.217Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing robust form validation and management with React Hook Form and Zod","zh":"非常适合需要使用 React Hook Form 和 Zod 进行强大的表单验证和管理的前端代理","ja":"React Hook Form と Zod を使用した堅牢なフォームの検証と管理が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"React Hook Form과 Zod를 사용하여 강력한 폼 검증 및 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una validación y gestión de formularios robustas con React Hook Form y Zod","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent une validation et une gestion de formulaires robustes avec React Hook Form et Zod","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine robuste Formularvalidierung und -verwaltung mit React Hook Form und Zod benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de validação e gerenciamento de formulários robustos com React Hook Form e Zod","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима надежная проверка и управление формами с помощью React Hook Form и Zod","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تحقق متين وإدارة للنماذج مع React Hook Form و Zod"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex forms with ease, leveraging the power of Zod validation schemas and react-hook-form''s intuitive API, including libraries like @hookform/resolvers and zod@4.3.5","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理复杂表单的能力，利用 Zod 验证模式和 react-hook-form 的直观 API 的强大功能，包括 @hookform/resolvers 和 zod@4.3.5 之类的库","ja":"Zod の検証スキーマと react-hook-form の直感的な API の力を利用して、エージェントが複雑なフォームを作成および管理できるようにし、@hookform/resolvers や zod@4.3.5 などのライブラリを含む","ko":"Zod의 검증 스키마와 react-hook-form의 직관적 API의 강력한 기능을 활용하여 에이전트가 복잡한 폼을 쉽게 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @hookform/resolvers와 zod@4.3.5 같은 라이브러리를 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar formularios complejos con facilidad, aprovechando el poder de los esquemas de validación de Zod y la API intuitiva de react-hook-form, incluyendo bibliotecas como @hookform/resolvers y zod@4.3.5","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des formulaires complexes avec facilité, en exploitant le pouvoir des schémas de validation Zod et de l''API intuitive de react-hook-form, y compris des bibliothèques comme @hookform/resolvers et zod@4.3.5","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Formulare mit Leichtigkeit zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem es die Kraft der Zod-Validierungsschemata und der intuitiven react-hook-form-API nutzt, einschließlich Bibliotheken wie @hookform/resolvers und zod@4.3.5","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem e gerenciarem formulários complexos com facilidade, aproveitando o poder dos esquemas de validação do Zod e da API intuitiva do react-hook-form, incluindo bibliotecas como @hookform/resolvers e zod@4.3.5","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять сложными формами с легкостью, используя силу схем валидации Zod и интуитивно понятного API react-hook-form, включая библиотеки seperti @hookform/resolvers и zod@4.3.5","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء وإدارة نماذج معقدة بسهولة، مستفيداً من قوة مخططات التحقق من Zod وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتوفرة من react-hook-form، بما في ذلك المكتبات مثل @hookform/resolvers و zod@4.3.5"},"useCases":{"en":["Building and validating complex form structures with Zod schemas","Handling form submissions and errors with react-hook-form''s handleSubmit and formState","Integrating with existing React applications to enhance form functionality"],"zh":["使用 Zod 模式构建和验证复杂的表单结构","使用 react-hook-form 的 handleSubmit 和 formState 处理表单提交和错误","将其集成到现有的 React 应用程序中以增强表单功能"],"ja":["Zod スキーマを使用して複雑なフォーム構造を構築および検証する","react-hook-form の handleSubmit と formState を使用してフォームの送信とエラーを処理する","既存の React アプリケーションに統合してフォームの機能を強化する"],"ko":["Zod 스키마를 사용하여 복잡한 폼 구조를 구축하고 검증","react-hook-form의 handleSubmit과 formState를 사용하여 폼 제출과 오류를 처리","기존의 React 애플리케이션에 통합하여 폼 기능을 강화"],"es":["Crear y validar estructuras de formularios complejos con esquemas de Zod","Gestionar envíos de formularios y errores con handleSubmit y formState de react-hook-form","Integrarse con aplicaciones React existentes para mejorar la funcionalidad de los formularios"],"fr":["Créer et valider des structures de formulaires complexes avec des schémas Zod","Gérer les soumissions de formulaires et les erreurs avec handleSubmit et formState de react-hook-form","Intégrer avec des applications React existantes pour améliorer la fonctionnalité des formulaires"],"de":["Erstellen und Validieren komplexer Formularstrukturen mit Zod-Schemata","Formulareinreichungen und Fehler mit handleSubmit und formState von react-hook-form verwalten","In bestehende React-Anwendungen integrieren, um die Funktionalität von Formularen zu verbessern"],"pt":["Construir e validar estruturas de formulários complexas com esquemas do Zod","Lidar com envios de formulários e erros com handleSubmit e formState do react-hook-form","Integrar com aplicativos React existentes para melhorar a funcionalidade dos formulários"],"ru":["Построение и проверка сложных структур форм с помощью схем Zod","Обработка отправки форм и ошибок с помощью handleSubmit и formState react-hook-form","Интеграция с существующими приложениями React для улучшения функциональности форм"],"ar":["بناء وتحقق من هيكل النماذج المعقدة باستخدام مخططات Zod","التعامل مع إرسال النماذج والأخطاء باستخدام handleSubmit و formState من react-hook-form","التكامل مع التطبيقات القائمة على React لتحسين وظيفة النماذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Hook Form and Zod installation","Compatible with specific versions of react-hook-form, zod, and @hookform/resolvers"],"zh":["需要安装 React Hook Form 和 Zod","仅与 react-hook-form、zod 和 @hookform/resolvers 的特定版本兼容"],"ja":["React Hook Form と Zod のインストールが必要","react-hook-form、zod、@hookform/resolvers の特定のバージョンとのみ互換性がある"],"ko":["React Hook Form과 Zod의 설치가 필요","react-hook-form, zod, @hookform/resolvers의 특정 버전만과 호환"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de React Hook Form y Zod","Compatible con versiones específicas de react-hook-form, zod y @hookform/resolvers"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de React Hook Form et Zod","Compatible avec des versions spécifiques de react-hook-form, zod et @hookform/resolvers"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von React Hook Form und Zod","Kompatibel mit bestimmten Versionen von react-hook-form, zod und @hookform/resolvers"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do React Hook Form e do Zod","Compatível com versões específicas do react-hook-form, zod e @hookform/resolvers"],"ru":["Требует установки React Hook Form и Zod","Совместим со специфическими версиями react-hook-form, zod и @hookform/resolvers"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت React Hook Form و Zod","متوافق مع إصدارات محددة من react-hook-form و zod و @hookform/resolvers"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
