os, áudio e fontes","Otimização de desempenho para vídeos","Customização de layouts e designs","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание 3D-контента с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Основные анимации для Remotion","Импорт изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов","Оптимизация производительности для видео","Настройка макетов и дизайнов","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية لريموشن","استيراد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط","تحسين الأداء للفيديوهات","تخصيص التخطيطات والتصاميم","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","最佳实践","开发指南","代码质量","开发效率","3D 内容","动画技能"],"ja":["Remotion","ベストプラクティス","開発ガイド","コード品質","開発効率","3D コンテンツ","アニメーションスキル"],"ko":["Remotion","최적의 실천 방법","개발 가이드","코드 품질","개발 효율","3D 콘텐츠","애니메이션 스킬"],"es":["Remotion","desarrollo de video","animaciones","Three.js","React Three Fiber","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de contenido","creación de video","animación 3D"],"fr":["Remotion","développement de vidéo","animations","Three.js","React Three Fiber","bonnes pratiques","développement de contenu","création de vidéo","animation 3D"],"de":["Remotion","Video-Entwicklung","Animationen","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Best Practices","Inhaltsentwicklung","Video-Erstellung","3D-Animation"],"pt":["Remotion","Melhores práticas","Desenvolvimento de vídeo","3D","Animações","Importação de ativos","Otimização de desempenho","Customização de layouts","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Remotion","Лучшие практики","Разработка видео","3D","Анимации","Импорт активов","Оптимизация производительности","Настройка макетов","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الفيديو","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","تحسين الأداء","تخصيص التخطيطات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/transparent-videos.md](rules/transparent-videos.md) - Rendering out a video with transparency\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:09:50.054Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Video Generation Agents leveraging Remotion to produce high-quality, domain-specific video content.","zh":"适用于利用 Remotion 生成高质量、特定领域视频内容的视频生成代理。","ja":"Remotion を使用して高品質なドメイン固有のビデオコンテンツを生成するビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Remotion을 사용하여 고품질의 도메인별 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de video que utilizan Remotion para producir contenido de video de alta calidad y específico de dominio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de vidéos utilisant Remotion pour produire du contenu vidéo de haute qualité et spécifique à un domaine.","de":"Ideal für Videogenerierungsagenten, die Remotion nutzen, um hochwertige, domänen-spezifische Videoinhalte zu erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que utilizam Remotion para produzir conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade e específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по генерации видео, использующих Remotion для создания высококачественного видеоконтента, специфичного для конкретной области.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الفيديو الذي يستفيد من Remotion لإنتاج محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة ومحدد للنطاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master Remotion best practices, leveraging Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content, and fundamental animation skills for engaging video experiences, while efficiently importing images, videos, audio, and fonts.","zh":"赋予代理掌握 Remotion 最佳实践的能力，利用 Three.js 和 React Three Fiber 进行 3D 内容的生成，并通过基本的动画技能创建引人入胜的视频体验，同时高效地导入图像、视频、音频和字体。","ja":"エージェントが Remotion のベストプラクティスをマスターできるようにし、Three.js と React Three Fiber を使用して 3D コンテンツを生成し、基本的なアニメーションスキルを使用して魅力的なビデオ体験を作成し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントを効率的にインポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion의最佳實踐을 마스터할 수 있도록 하며, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하고, 기본적인 애니메이션 스킬을 사용하여 매력적인 비디오 경험을 만들며, 이미지를 효율적으로 가져옵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dominar las mejores prácticas de Remotion, aprovechando Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido 3D y habilidades de animación fundamentales para experiencias de video atractivas, mientras importa eficientemente imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les meilleures pratiques de Remotion, en exploitant Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu 3D et les compétences en animation fondamentales pour des expériences vidéo engageantes, tout en important efficacement des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Remotion-Best-Practices zu meistern, indem sie Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte und grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten für ansprechende Videoumgebungen nutzen und gleichzeitig effizient Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten importieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as melhores práticas de Remotion, utilizando Three.js e React Three Fiber para conteúdo 3D, e habilidades de animação fundamentais para experiências de vídeo atraentes, além de importar eficientemente imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить лучшие практики Remotion, используя Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-контента, и базовые навыки анимации для увлекательных видеоопытов, а также эффективно импортировать изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إتقان أفضل الممارسات لبرنامج Remotion، باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber لإنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد، ومهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية لتجارب الفيديو المثيرة، بالإضافة إلى استيراد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط بفعالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Generating smooth animations for video projects","Importing and managing media assets in Remotion"],"zh":["使用 Three.js 在 Remotion 中优化 3D 内容","为视频项目生成平滑的动画","在 Remotion 中导入和管理媒体资产"],"ja":["Remotion で Three.js を使用して 3D コンテンツを最適化する","ビデオプロジェクトのなすっと動画を生成する","Remotion でメディアアセットをインポートして管理する"],"ko":["Remotion에서 Three.js를 사용하여 3D 콘텐츠를 최적화하는 것","비디오 프로젝트를 위한 매끄러운 애니메이션 생성","Remotion에서 미디어 자산을 가져오고 관리"],"es":["Optimizar contenido 3D en Remotion mediante Three.js","Generar animaciones suaves para proyectos de video","Importar y gestionar activos multimedia en Remotion"],"fr":["Optimiser le contenu 3D dans Remotion à l''aide de Three.js","Générer des animations fluides pour les projets de vidéo","Importer et gérer les actifs multimédias dans Remotion"],"de":["3D-Inhalte in Remotion mit Three.js optimieren","Sanfte Animationen für Videoprojekte generieren","Medienassets in Remotion importieren und verwalten"],"pt":["Otimizar conteúdo 3D no Remotion usando Three.js","Gerar animações suaves para projetos de vídeo","Importar e gerenciar ativos de mídia no Remotion"],"ru":["Оптимизация 3D-контента в Remotion с помощью Three.js","Генерация плавных анимаций для видеопроектов","Импорт и управление мультимедиа-активами в Remotion"],"ar":["تحسين المحتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد في برنامج Remotion باستخدام Three.js","توليد رسوم متحركة ناعمة لمشاريع الفيديو","استيراد وإدارة الأصول الإعلامية في برنامج Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion and its ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Remotion 代码库访问权限","仅适用于 Remotion 及其生态系统"],"ja":["Remotion コードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotion 及びそのエコシステムに特有"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 액세스 권한이 필요합니다.","Remotion 및 해당 생태계에만 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Específico de Remotion y su ecosistema"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au codebase de Remotion","Spécifique à Remotion et son écosystème"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebase","Spezifisch für Remotion und sein Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código-base do Remotion","Específico para Remotion e seu ecossistema"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Специфичен для Remotion и его экосистемы"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الكود الخاصة ببرنامج Remotion","محدد لبرنامج Remotion ونظامه البيئي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/ab-test-setup', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'ab-test-setup', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z', '2026-02-18T14:09:49.782Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/ab-test-setup","name":"ab-test-setup","description":{"zh":"A/B ,","ja":"A/B,","ko":"A/B ","es":"La configuración de pruebas A/B es crucial para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y aumentar la conversión","fr":"La configuration de tests A/B est cruciale pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et augmenter la conversion","de":"Die Einrichtung von A/B-Tests ist entscheidend, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern und die Konversion zu steigern","pt":"O teste A/B é uma técnica para comparar duas versões de uma aplicação. A configuração correta é crucial para obter resultados precisos.","ru":"Тест А/Б - это техника для сравнения двух версий приложения. Правильная настройка имеет решающее значение для получения точных результатов.","ar":"اختبار أ/ب هو تقنية لمقارنة إصدارين من تطبيق. الإعداد الصحيح هو أمر بالغ الأهمية للحصول على نتائج دقيقة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"A/B ","ja":"A/B","ko":"A/B ","es":"Configuración de pruebas A/B para desarrolladores","fr":"Configuration de tests A/B pour les développeurs","de":"Einrichtung von A/B-Tests für Entwickler","pt":"Configuração de Teste A/B","ru":"Настройка теста А/Б","ar":"إعداد اختبار أ/ب","en":"ab-test-setup"},"description":{"zh":"A/B ,","ja":"A/B,","ko":"A/B ","es":"La configuración de pruebas A/B es crucial para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y aumentar la conversión","fr":"La configuration de tests A/B est cruciale pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et augmenter la conversion","de":"Die Einrichtung von A/B-Tests ist entscheidend, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern und die Konversion zu steigern","pt":"O teste A/B é uma técnica para comparar duas versões de uma aplicação. A configuração correta é crucial para obter resultados precisos.","ru":"Тест А/Б - это техника для сравнения двух версий приложения. Правильная настройка имеет решающее значение для получения точных результатов.","ar":"اختبار أ/ب هو تقنية لمقارنة إصدارين من تطبيق. الإعداد الصحيح هو أمر بالغ الأهمية للحصول على نتائج دقيقة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["A/B ","","",""],"ja":["A/B","","",""],"ko":["A/B ","","",""],"es":["Diseño de experimentos","Análisis de datos","Optimización de la conversión","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Integración con herramientas de análisis","Informes y recomendaciones personalizados"],"fr":["Conception d''expériences","Analyse de données","Optimisation de la conversion","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec des outils d''analyse","Rapports et recommandations personnalisés"],"de":["Experimentdesign","Datenanalyse","Optimierung der Konversion","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit Analyse-Tools","Personalisierte Berichte und Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de testes estatisticamente válidos","Análise de resultados para tomada de decisões informadas","Otimização de aplicações com base em dados","Integração com ferramentas de análise de desempenho","Criação de experimentos personalizados"],"ru":["Разработка статистически достоверных тестов","Анализ результатов для принятия обоснованных решений","Оптимизация приложений на основе данных","Интеграция с инструментами анализа производительности","Создание индивидуальных экспериментов"],"ar":["تطوير اختبارات إحصائية صالحة","تحليل النتائج لأخذ قرارات مدروسة","تحسين التطبيقات بناءً على البيانات","دمج أدوات تحليل الأداء","إنشاء تجارب مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["A/B ","","","","",""],"ja":["A/B","","","","",""],"ko":["A/B ","","","","",""],"es":["pruebas A/B","experimentación","optimización de la conversión","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","análisis de datos","diseño de experimentos","herramientas de análisis","informes personalizados"],"fr":["tests A/B","expérimentation","optimisation de la conversion","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","analyse de données","conception d''expériences","outils d''analyse","rapports personnalisés"],"de":["A/B-Tests","Experimentierung","Optimierung der Konversion","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Datenanalyse","Experimentdesign","Analyse-Tools","personalisierte Berichte"],"pt":["teste a/b","experimentação","análise de dados","otimização de aplicações","desenvolvimento de software","análise estatística"],"ru":["тест а/б","экспериментирование","анализ данных","оптимизация приложений","разработка программного обеспечения","статистический анализ"],"ar":["اختبار أ/ب","التجريب","تحليل البيانات","تحسين التطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات","التحليل الإحصائي"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.526Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ab-test-setup","description":"When the user wants to plan, design, or implement an A/B test or experiment. Also use when the user mentions A/B test, split test, experiment, test this change, variant copy, multivariate test, or hypothesis. For tracking implementation, see analytics-tracking.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# A/B Test Setup\n\nYou are an expert in experimentation and A/B testing. Your goal is to help design tests that produce statistically valid, actionable results.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a test, understand:\n\n1. **Test Context** - What are you trying to improve? W","body":"# A/B Test Setup\n\nYou are an expert in experimentation and A/B testing. Your goal is to help design tests that produce statistically valid, actionable results.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a test, understand:\n\n1. **Test Context** - What are you trying to improve? What change are you considering?\n2. **Current State** - Baseline conversion rate? Current traffic volume?\n3. **Constraints** - Technical complexity? Timeline? Tools available?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Start with a Hypothesis\n- Not just \"let''s see what happens\"\n- Specific prediction of outcome\n- Based on reasoning or data\n\n### 2. Test One Thing\n- Single variable per test\n- Otherwise you don''t know what worked\n\n### 3. Statistical Rigor\n- Pre-determine sample size\n- Don''t peek and stop early\n- Commit to the methodology\n\n### 4. Measure What Matters\n- Primary metric tied to business value\n- Secondary metrics for context\n- Guardrail metrics to prevent harm\n\n---\n\n## Hypothesis Framework\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nBecause [observation/data],\nwe believe [change]\nwill cause [expected outcome]\nfor [audience].\nWe''ll know this is true when [metrics].\n```\n\n### Example\n\n**Weak**: \"Changing the button color might increase clicks.\"\n\n**Strong**: \"Because users report difficulty finding the CTA (per heatmaps and feedback), we believe making the button larger and using contrasting color will increase CTA clicks by 15%+ for new visitors. We''ll measure click-through rate from page view to signup start.\"\n\n---\n\n## Test Types\n\n| Type | Description | Traffic Needed |\n|------|-------------|----------------|\n| A/B | Two versions, single change | Moderate |\n| A/B/n | Multiple variants | Higher |\n| MVT | Multiple changes in combinations | Very high |\n| Split URL | Different URLs for variants | Moderate |\n\n---\n\n## Sample Size\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n| Baseline | 10% Lift | 20% Lift | 50% Lift |\n|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| 1% | 150k/variant | 39k/variant | 6k/variant |\n| 3% | 47k/variant | 12k/variant | 2k/variant |\n| 5% | 27k/variant | 7k/variant | 1.2k/variant |\n| 10% | 12k/variant | 3k/variant | 550/variant |\n\n**Calculators:**\n- [Evan Miller''s](https://www.evanmiller.org/ab-testing/sample-size.html)\n- [Optimizely''s](https://www.optimizely.com/sample-size-calculator/)\n\n**For detailed sample size tables and duration calculations**: See [references/sample-size-guide.md](references/sample-size-guide.md)\n\n---\n\n## Metrics Selection\n\n### Primary Metric\n- Single metric that matters most\n- Directly tied to hypothesis\n- What you''ll use to call the test\n\n### Secondary Metrics\n- Support primary metric interpretation\n- Explain why/how the change worked\n\n### Guardrail Metrics\n- Things that shouldn''t get worse\n- Stop test if significantly negative\n\n### Example: Pricing Page Test\n- **Primary**: Plan selection rate\n- **Secondary**: Time on page, plan distribution\n- **Guardrail**: Support tickets, refund rate\n\n---\n\n## Designing Variants\n\n### What to Vary\n\n| Category | Examples |\n|----------|----------|\n| Headlines/Copy | Message angle, value prop, specificity, tone |\n| Visual Design | Layout, color, images, hierarchy |\n| CTA | Button copy, size, placement, number |\n| Content | Information included, order, amount, social proof |\n\n### Best Practices\n- Single, meaningful change\n- Bold enough to make a difference\n- True to the hypothesis\n\n---\n\n## Traffic Allocation\n\n| Approach | Split | When to Use |\n|----------|-------|-------------|\n| Standard | 50/50 | Default for A/B |\n| Conservative | 90/10, 80/20 | Limit risk of bad variant |\n| Ramping | Start small, increase | Technical risk mitigation |\n\n**Considerations:**\n- Consistency: Users see same variant on return\n- Balanced exposure across time of day/week\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Client-Side\n- JavaScript modifies page after load\n- Quick to implement, can cause flicker\n- Tools: PostHog, Optimizely, VWO\n\n### Server-Side\n- Variant determined before render\n- No flicker, requires dev work\n- Tools: PostHog, LaunchDarkly, Split\n\n---\n\n## Running the Test\n\n### Pre-Launch Checklist\n- [ ] Hypothesis documented\n- [ ] Primary metric defined\n- [ ] Sample size calculated\n- [ ] Variants implemented correctly\n- [ ] Tracking verified\n- [ ] QA completed on all variants\n\n### During the Test\n\n**DO:**\n- Monitor for technical issues\n- Check segment quality\n- Document external factors\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Peek at results and stop early\n- Make changes to variants\n- Add traffic from new sources\n\n### The Peeking Problem\nLooking at results before reaching sample size and stopping early leads to false positives and wrong decisions. Pre-commit to sample size and trust the process.\n\n---\n\n## Analyzing Results\n\n### Statistical Significance\n- 95% confidence = p-value < 0.05\n- Means <5% chance result is random\n- Not a guarantee—just a threshold\n\n### Analysis Checklist\n\n1. **Reach sample size?** If not, result is preliminary\n2. **Statistically significant?** Check confidence intervals\n3. **Effect size meaningful?** Compare to MDE, project impact\n4. **Secondary metrics consistent?** Support the primary?\n5. **Guardrail concerns?** Anything get worse?\n6. **Segment differences?** Mobile vs. desktop? New vs. returning?\n\n### Interpreting Results\n\n| Result | Conclusion |\n|--------|------------|\n| Significant winner | Implement variant |\n| Significant loser | Keep control, learn why |\n| No significant difference | Need more traffic or bolder test |\n| Mixed signals | Dig deeper, maybe segment |\n\n---\n\n## Documentation\n\nDocument every test with:\n- Hypothesis\n- Variants (with screenshots)\n- Results (sample, metrics, significance)\n- Decision and learnings\n\n**For templates**: See [references/test-templates.md](references/test-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### Test Design\n- Testing too small a change (undetectable)\n- Testing too many things (can''t isolate)\n- No clear hypothesis\n\n### Execution\n- Stopping early\n- Changing things mid-test\n- Not checking implementation\n\n### Analysis\n- Ignoring confidence intervals\n- Cherry-picking segments\n- Over-interpreting inconclusive results\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current conversion rate?\n2. How much traffic does this page get?\n3. What change are you considering and why?\n4. What''s the smallest improvement worth detecting?\n5. What tools do you have for testing?\n6. Have you tested this area before?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **page-cro**: For generating test ideas based on CRO principles\n- **analytics-tracking**: For setting up test measurement\n- **copywriting**: For creating variant copy\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:09:49.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data-Driven Agents needing statistically valid A/B testing capabilities for informed decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要统计有效的A/B测试能力以实现明智决策的数据驱动代理","ja":"データドリブンのエージェントが情報に基づいた意思決定を行うために、統計的に有効なA/Bテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"데이터 주도 에이전트가 정보에基づいた 의사 결정を行うために 통계적으로 유효한 A/B 테스트 기능이 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes impulsados por datos que necesitan capacidades de prueba A/B estadísticamente válidas para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur les données qui nécessitent des capacités de test A/B statistiquement valides pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Perfekt für datengetriebene Agenten, die statistisch gültige A/B-Testfunktionen für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes baseados em dados que necessitam de capacidades de teste A/B estatisticamente válidas para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, основанных на данных, которым необходимы статистически обоснованные возможности тестирования А/Б для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يعتمدون على البيانات وهم بحاجة إلى القدرات الصالحة إحصائياً لاختبار أ/ب لاتخاذ قرارات مدروسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design tests that produce actionable results by understanding test context, checking for product marketing context, and validating test requirements using Markdown files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","zh":"使代理能够通过了解测试上下文、检查产品营销上下文并使用Markdown文件（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）验证测试要求来设计产生可行结果的测试","ja":"テストのコンテキストを理解し、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを確認し、Markdownファイル（例：`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）を使用してテスト要件を検証することで、エージェントが実行可能な結果を生み出すテストを設計できるようにする","ko":"테스트 컨텍스트를 이해하고 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 확인하며 Markdown 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)을 사용하여 테스트 요구사항을 검증함으로써 에이전트가 실행 가능한 결과를 생성하는 테스트를 설계할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar pruebas que produzcan resultados accionables al comprender el contexto de la prueba, comprobar el contexto de marketing de productos y validar los requisitos de la prueba utilizando archivos Markdown como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des tests qui produisent des résultats exploitables en comprenant le contexte du test, en vérifiant le contexte de marketing de produits et en validant les exigences du test en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tests zu entwerfen, die handhabbare Ergebnisse produzieren, indem sie den Testkontext verstehen, den Produktmarketing-Kontext überprüfen und die Testanforderungen mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` validieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar testes que produzem resultados ações por compreender o contexto do teste, verificar o contexto de marketing de produto e validar os requisitos do teste usando arquivos Markdown como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать тесты, которые дают действенные результаты, понимая контекст теста, проверяя контекст маркетинга продукта и проверяя требования теста с помощью файлов Markdown, таких как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم اختبارات تنتج نتائج قابلة للتنفيذ من خلال فهم سياق الاختبار والتحقق من سياق تسويق المنتج و التحقق من متطلبات الاختبار باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing A/B tests for product marketing campaigns","Validating test requirements for statistically significant results","Checking product marketing context before test setup"],"zh":["为产品营销活动设计A/B测试","验证测试要求以获得统计学上显著的结果","在测试设置之前检查产品营销上下文"],"ja":["製品マーケティングキャンペーンのためのA/Bテストを設計する","統計的に有意な結果を得るためにテスト要件を検証する","テスト設定前に製品マーケティングのコンテキストを確認する"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 캠페인에 대한 A/B 테스트 설계","통계적으로 유의한 결과를 얻기 위해 테스트 요구사항을 검증","테스트 설정 전에 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 확인"],"es":["Diseño de pruebas A/B para campañas de marketing de productos","Validación de los requisitos de la prueba para resultados estadísticamente significativos","Comprobación del contexto de marketing de productos antes de la configuración de la prueba"],"fr":["Conception de tests A/B pour les campagnes de marketing de produits","Validation des exigences du test pour des résultats statistiquement significatifs","Vérification du contexte de marketing de produits avant la configuration du test"],"de":["Entwurf von A/B-Tests für Produktmarketing-Kampagnen","Validierung der Testanforderungen für statistisch signifikante Ergebnisse","Überprüfung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts vor der Testkonfiguration"],"pt":["Projeto de testes A/B para campanhas de marketing de produto","Validação de requisitos de teste para resultados estatisticamente significativos","Verificação do contexto de marketing de produto antes da configuração do teste"],"ru":["Проектирование тестов А/Б для кампаний маркетинга продукта","Проверка требований теста для статистически значимых результатов","Проверка контекста маркетинга продукта перед настройкой теста"],"ar":["تصميم اختبارات أ/ب لعمليات تسويق المنتج","التحقق من متطلبات الاختبار للحصول على نتائج ذات دلالة إحصائية","التحقق من سياق تسويق المنتج قبل إعداد الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Needs understanding of test context and goals"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销上下文文件，例如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","需要了解测试上下文和目标"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキストファイル（例：`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）へのアクセスが必要","テストのコンテキストと目標を理解する必要がある"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)에 대한 액세스가 필요","테스트 컨텍스트와 목표를 이해해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Necesita comprensión del contexto y los objetivos de la prueba"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Nécessite une compréhension du contexte et des objectifs du test"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Produktmarketing-Kontext-Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Benötigt Verständnis des Testkontexts und der Testziele"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produto como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Necessita de compreensão do contexto do teste e dos objetivos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта, таким как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Требует понимания контекста теста и целей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","يتطلب فهم سياق الاختبار والأهداف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
