zaje adaptativo","ejecución de código seguro","gamificación","aprendizaje social","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Remotion","éducation de codage","intelligence artificielle","apprentissage adaptatif","exécution de code sécurisée","gamification","apprentissage social","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Remotion","Codier-Unterricht","künstliche Intelligenz","adaptives Lernen","sichere Code-Ausführung","Gamification","soziales Lernen","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Remotion","Educação de codificação","Agentes de IA","Aprendizado adaptativo","Execução de código seguro","Gamificação","Aprendizado social","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker"],"ru":["Remotion","Обучение программированию","Агенты ИИ","Адаптивное обучение","Безопасная выполнение кода","Геймификация","Социальное обучение","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker"],"ar":["موشن","تعليم البرمجة","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التعلم المرن","تشغيل الرمز الآمن","اللعب","التعلم الاجتماعي","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker"]}},"owner":"khushparag","repo":"agentic_learning_coach","repoPath":"khushparag/agentic_learning_coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/transparent-videos.md](rules/transparent-videos.md) - Rendering out a video with transparency\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:10:45.850Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent System Developers needing domain-specific knowledge in Remotion coding education","zh":"非常适合需要Remotion编程教育领域专业知识的多智能体系统开发者","ja":"Remotionコーディング教育における分野固有の知識を必要とするマルチエージェントシステム開発者に最適","ko":"Remotion 코딩 교육에 대한 도메인별 지식이 필요한 다중 에이전트 시스템 개발자에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Sistemas de Agentes Múltiples que necesitan conocimientos específicos del dominio en educación de codificación Remotion","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs de Systèmes d''Agents Multiples ayant besoin de connaissances spécifiques au domaine dans l''éducation de codage Remotion","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler von Multi-Agenten-Systemen, die domänen-spezifisches Wissen in Remotion-Coding-Ausbildung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Sistemas Multi-Agentes que necessitam de conhecimento específico de domínio em educação de codificação Remotion","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков многоагентных систем, которым необходимы знания в области разработки кода Remotion","ar":"مثالي لمطوري نظام متعدد الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى معرفة محددة المجال في تعليم برمجة Remotion"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive 3D content using Three.js and React Three Fiber, while leveraging adaptive learning, secure code execution, and gamification features in Remotion, utilizing FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, and Docker","zh":"使智能体能够使用Three.js和React Three Fiber创建交互式3D内容，同时利用Remotion中的自适应学习、安全代码执行和游戏化功能，并使用FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL和Docker","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用してインタラクティブな3Dコンテンツを作成するエージェントを強化し、FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL、Dockerを利用して、Remotionの適応学習、安全なコード実行、ゲーミフィケーション機能を活用します","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 인터랙티브 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하도록 지원하며, FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL 및 Docker를 활용하여 Remotion의 적응형 학습, 보안 코드 실행 및 게이미피케이션 기능을 활용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido interactivo 3D utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, aprovechando al mismo tiempo las características de aprendizaje adaptativo, ejecución de código segura y gamificación en Remotion, utilizando FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL y Docker","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu interactif 3D en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, tout en exploitant les fonctionnalités d''apprentissage adaptatif, d''exécution de code sécurisée et de gamification dans Remotion, en utilisant FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL et Docker","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, interaktive 3D-Inhalte mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, während sie gleichzeitig adaptive Lernfunktionen, sichere Codeausführung und Gamification-Funktionen in Remotion nutzen, unter Verwendung von FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL und Docker","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar conteúdo interativo 3D usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, aproveitando recursos de aprendizado adaptativo, execução de código segura e gamificação no Remotion, utilizando FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL e Docker","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интерактивный 3D-контент, используя Three.js и React Three Fiber, а также использовать адаптивное обучение, безопасную выполнение кода и функции геймификации в Remotion, используя FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL и Docker","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى تفاعلي ثلاثي الأبعاد باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، مع الاستفادة من ميزات التعلم التكيفي وتنفيذ التعليمات البرمجية الآمنة وأسلوب اللعبة في Remotion، باستخدام FastAPI و React و PostgreSQL و Docker"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing 3D animations in Remotion projects","Optimizing Remotion code for secure execution and performance","Developing personalized coding education experiences with adaptive learning"],"zh":["在Remotion项目中实现3D动画","优化Remotion代码以实现安全执行和性能","利用自适应学习开发个性化编程教育体验"],"ja":["Remotionプロジェクトでの3Dアニメーションの実装","安全な実行とパフォーマンスのためのRemotionコードの最適化","適応学習を用いたパーソナライズされたコーディング教育体験の開発"],"ko":["Remotion 프로젝트에서 3D 애니메이션 구현","보안 실행 및 성능을 위한 Remotion 코드 최적화","적응형 학습을 통한 맞춤형 코딩 교육 경험 개발"],"es":["Implementar animaciones 3D en proyectos Remotion","Optimizar el código Remotion para una ejecución segura y un rendimiento óptimo","Desarrollar experiencias de educación de codificación personalizadas con aprendizaje adaptativo"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des animations 3D dans les projets Remotion","Optimiser le code Remotion pour une exécution sécurisée et des performances optimales","Développer des expériences d''éducation de codage personnalisées avec un apprentissage adaptatif"],"de":["Implementierung von 3D-Animationen in Remotion-Projekten","Optimierung von Remotion-Code für sichere Ausführung und Leistung","Entwicklung personalisierter Codierungs-Erfahrungen mit adaptivem Lernen"],"pt":["Implementação de animações 3D em projetos Remotion","Otimização do código Remotion para execução segura e desempenho","Desenvolvimento de experiências de educação de codificação personalizadas com aprendizado adaptativo"],"ru":["Реализация 3D-анимаций в проектах Remotion","Оптимизация кода Remotion для безопасного выполнения и производительности","Разработка персонализированных trải nghiệm обучения программированию с адаптивным обучением"],"ar":["تنفيذ الرسوم المتحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد في مشاريع Remotion","تحسين كود Remotion لتنفيذ آمن وتحقيق الأداء","تطوير تجارب تعليم برمجة مخصصة مع تعلم تكيفي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Remotion and its ecosystem","Dependent on FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, and Docker for development"],"zh":["需要了解Remotion及其生态系统","开发依赖于FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL和Docker"],"ja":["Remotionとそのエコシステムの知識が必要","開発はFastAPI、React、PostgreSQL、Dockerに依存"],"ko":["Remotion 및 해당 생태계에 대한 지식 필요","개발 시 FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, Docker에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Remotion y su ecosistema","Dependiente de FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL y Docker para el desarrollo"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur Remotion et son écosystème","Dépend de FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL et Docker pour le développement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über Remotion und sein Ökosystem","Abhängig von FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL und Docker für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Remotion e seu ecossistema","Dependente de FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL e Docker para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Требует знаний Remotion и его экосистемы","Зависит от FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL и Docker для разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Remotion ونظامه البيئي","يعتمد على FastAPI و React و PostgreSQL و Docker من أجل التطوير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/gepetto', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'gepetto', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:10:41.427Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/gepetto","name":"gepetto","description":{"zh":"Gepetto, AI, ","ja":"Gepetto, AI, ","ko":"Gepetto, AI, ","es":"Gepetto es una herramienta de planificación de implementación asistida por IA que sigue un proceso de múltiples pasos para garantizar la eficiencia","fr":"Gepetto est un outil de planification d''implémentation assisté par IA qui suit un processus mult étapes pour assurer l''efficacité","de":"Gepetto ist ein Tool für die KI-gestützte Implementierungsplanung, das einen mehrstufigen Prozess verfolgt, um Effizienz zu gewährleisten","pt":"O Gepetto é uma ferramenta de planejamento de implementação assistida por IA que orquestra um processo em múltiplas etapas","ru":"Джепетто - это инструмент планирования реализации с помощью ИИ, который оркестрирует многоступенчатый процесс","ar":"جيبوتو هو أداة تخطيط التنفيذ بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تنسق عملية متعددة المراحل","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Gepetto: AI","ja":"Gepetto: AI","ko":"Gepetto: AI","es":"Gepetto: Planeación de implementación asistida por IA","fr":"Gepetto : Planification d''implémentation assistée par IA","de":"Gepetto: AI-gestützte Implementierungsplanung","pt":"Gepetto: Planejamento de Implementação Assistido por IA","ru":"Джепетто: Планирование реализации с помощью ИИ","ar":"جيبوتو: تخطيط التنفيذ بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"gepetto"},"description":{"zh":"Gepetto, AI, ","ja":"Gepetto, AI, ","ko":"Gepetto, AI, ","es":"Gepetto es una herramienta de planificación de implementación asistida por IA que sigue un proceso de múltiples pasos para garantizar la eficiencia","fr":"Gepetto est un outil de planification d''implémentation assisté par IA qui suit un processus mult étapes pour assurer l''efficacité","de":"Gepetto ist ein Tool für die KI-gestützte Implementierungsplanung, das einen mehrstufigen Prozess verfolgt, um Effizienz zu gewährleisten","pt":"O Gepetto é uma ferramenta de planejamento de implementação assistida por IA que orquestra um processo em múltiplas etapas","ru":"Джепетто - это инструмент планирования реализации с помощью ИИ, который оркестрирует многоступенчатый процесс","ar":"جيبوتو هو أداة تخطيط التنفيذ بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تنسق عملية متعددة المراحل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["AI","","","","",""],"ja":["AI","","","","",""],"ko":["AI","","","","",""],"es":["Proceso de planificación de múltiples pasos","Asistencia de IA para la toma de decisiones","Simplificación del proceso de implementación","Mejora de la eficiencia y productividad","Análisis y revisión externa"],"fr":["Processus de planification mult étapes","Assistance IA pour la prise de décision","Simplification du processus d''implémentation","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la productivité","Analyse et révision externe"],"de":["Mehrstufiger Planungsprozess","KI-Unterstützung für die Entscheidungsfindung","Vereinfachung des Implementierungsprozesses","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Produktivität","Analyse und externe Überprüfung"],"pt":["Planejamento em múltiplas etapas","Pesquisa e entrevista","Síntese de especificações","Plano e revisão externa","Seções personalizadas"],"ru":["Многоступенчатое планирование","Исследование и интервью","Синтез спецификаций","План и внешний обзор","Настраиваемые разделы"],"ar":["تخطيط متعدد المراحل","البحث والمقابلة","التحليل المُجمَع للواصفات","الخطة والاستعراض الخارجي","الأقسام المُخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gepetto","AI","","","","",""],"ja":["Gepetto","AI","","","","",""],"ko":["Gepetto","AI","","","","",""],"es":["planificación de implementación","herramienta de planificación","inteligencia artificial","proceso de múltiples pasos","asistencia de IA","eficiencia y productividad"],"fr":["planification d''implémentation","outil de planification","intelligence artificielle","processus mult étapes","assistance IA","efficacité et productivité"],"de":["Implementierungsplanung","Planungstool","künstliche Intelligenz","mehrstufiger Prozess","KI-Unterstützung","Effizienz und Produktivität"],"pt":["planejamento de implementação","ia","ferramenta de planejamento","processo em múltiplas etapas","pesquisa e entrevista","síntese de especificações"],"ru":["планирование реализации","ИИ","инструмент планирования","многоступенчатый процесс","исследование и интервью","синтез спецификаций"],"ar":["تخطيط التنفيذ","الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداة التخطيط","عملية متعددة المراحل","البحث والمقابلة","التحليل المُجمَع للواصفات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gepetto","description":"Creates detailed, sectionized implementation plans through research, stakeholder interviews, and multi-LLM review. Use when planning features that need thorough pre-implementation analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Gepetto\n\nOrchestrates a multi-step planning process: Research → Interview → Spec Synthesis → Plan → External Review → Sections\n\n## CRITICAL: First Actions\n\n**BEFORE anything else**, do these in order:\n\n### 1. Print Intro\n\nPrint intro banner immediately:\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nGEPETTO: AI-Assisted Implementation Planning\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nResearch → Interview → Spec Synthesis → Plan → External Review → Se","body":"# Gepetto\n\nOrchestrates a multi-step planning process: Research → Interview → Spec Synthesis → Plan → External Review → Sections\n\n## CRITICAL: First Actions\n\n**BEFORE anything else**, do these in order:\n\n### 1. Print Intro\n\nPrint intro banner immediately:\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nGEPETTO: AI-Assisted Implementation Planning\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nResearch → Interview → Spec Synthesis → Plan → External Review → Sections\n\nNote: GEPETTO will write many .md files to the planning directory you pass it\n```\n\n### 2. Validate Spec File Input\n\n**Check if user provided @file at invocation AND it''s a spec file (ends with `.md`).**\n\nIf NO @file was provided OR the path doesn''t end with `.md`, output this and STOP:\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nGEPETTO: Spec File Required\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nThis skill requires a markdown spec file path (must end with .md).\nThe planning directory is inferred from the spec file''s parent directory.\n\nTo start a NEW plan:\n  1. Create a markdown spec file describing what you want to build\n  2. It can be as detailed or as vague as you like\n  3. Place it in a directory where gepetto can save planning files\n  4. Run: /gepetto @path/to/your-spec.md\n\nTo RESUME an existing plan:\n  1. Run: /gepetto @path/to/your-spec.md\n\nExample: /gepetto @planning/my-feature-spec.md\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n```\n**Do not continue. Wait for user to re-invoke with a .md file path.**\n\n### 3. Setup Planning Session\n\nDetermine session state by checking existing files:\n\n1. Set `planning_dir` = parent directory of the spec file\n2. Set `initial_file` = the spec file path\n3. Scan for existing planning files:\n   - `claude-research.md`\n   - `claude-interview.md`\n   - `claude-spec.md`\n   - `claude-plan.md`\n   - `claude-integration-notes.md`\n   - `claude-ralph-loop-prompt.md`\n   - `claude-ralphy-prd.md`\n   - `reviews/` directory\n   - `sections/` directory\n\n4. Determine mode and resume point:\n\n| Files Found | Mode | Resume From |\n|-------------|------|-------------|\n| None | new | Step 4 |\n| research only | resume | Step 6 (interview) |\n| research + interview | resume | Step 8 (spec synthesis) |\n| + spec | resume | Step 9 (plan) |\n| + plan | resume | Step 10 (external review) |\n| + reviews | resume | Step 11 (integrate) |\n| + integration-notes | resume | Step 12 (user review) |\n| + sections/index.md | resume | Step 14 (write sections) |\n| all sections complete | resume | Step 15 (execution files) |\n| + claude-ralph-loop-prompt.md + claude-ralphy-prd.md | complete | Done |\n\n5. Create TODO list with TodoWrite based on current state\n\nPrint status:\n```\nPlanning directory: {planning_dir}\nMode: {mode}\n```\n\nIf resuming:\n```\nResuming from step {N}\nTo start fresh, delete the planning directory files.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Logging Format\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSTEP {N}/17: {STEP_NAME}\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n{details}\nStep {N} complete: {summary}\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 4. Research Decision\n\nSee [research-protocol.md](references/research-protocol.md).\n\n1. Read the spec file\n2. Extract potential research topics (technologies, patterns, integrations)\n3. Ask user about codebase research needs\n4. Ask user about web research needs (present derived topics as multi-select)\n5. Record which research types to perform in step 5\n\n### 5. Execute Research\n\nSee [research-protocol.md](references/research-protocol.md).\n\nBased on decisions from step 4, launch research subagents:\n- **Codebase research:** `Task(subagent_type=Explore)`\n- **Web research:** `Task(subagent_type=Explore)` with WebSearch\n\nIf both are needed, launch both Task tools in parallel (single message with multiple tool calls).\n\n**Important:** Subagents return their findings - they do NOT write files directly. After collecting results from all subagents, combine them and write to `<planning_dir>/claude-research.md`.\n\nSkip this step entirely if user chose no research in step 4.\n\n### 6. Detailed Interview\n\nSee [interview-protocol.md](references/interview-protocol.md)\n\nRun in main context (AskUserQuestion requires it). The interview should be informed by:\n- The initial spec\n- Research findings (if any)\n\n### 7. Save Interview Transcript\n\nWrite Q&A to `<planning_dir>/claude-interview.md`\n\n### 8. Write Initial Spec (Spec Synthesis)\n\nCombine into `<planning_dir>/claude-spec.md`:\n- **Initial input** (the spec file)\n- **Research findings** (if step 5 was done)\n- **Interview answers** (from step 6)\n\nThis synthesizes the user''s raw requirements into a complete specification.\n\n### 9. Generate Implementation Plan\n\nCreate detailed plan → `<planning_dir>/claude-plan.md`\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Write for an unfamiliar reader. The plan must be fully self-contained - an engineer or LLM with no prior context should understand *what* we''re building, *why*, and *how* just from reading this document.\n\n### 10. External Review\n\nSee [external-review.md](references/external-review.md)\n\nLaunch TWO subagents in parallel to review the plan:\n1. **Gemini** via Bash\n2. **Codex** via Bash\n\nBoth receive the plan content and return their analysis. Write results to `<planning_dir>/reviews/`.\n\n### 11. Integrate External Feedback\n\nAnalyze the suggestions in `<planning_dir>/reviews/`.\n\nYou are the authority on what to integrate or not. It''s OK if you decide to not integrate anything.\n\n**Step 1:** Write `<planning_dir>/claude-integration-notes.md` documenting:\n- What suggestions you''re integrating and why\n- What suggestions you''re NOT integrating and why\n\n**Step 2:** Update `<planning_dir>/claude-plan.md` with the integrated changes.\n\n### 12. User Review of Integrated Plan\n\nUse AskUserQuestion:\n```\nThe plan has been updated with external feedback. You can now review and edit claude-plan.md.\n\nIf you want Claude''s help editing the plan, open a separate Claude session - this session\nis mid-workflow and can''t assist with edits until the workflow completes.\n\nWhen you''re done reviewing, select \"Done\" to continue.\n```\n\nOptions: \"Done reviewing\"\n\nWait for user confirmation before proceeding.\n\n### 13. Create Section Index\n\nSee [section-index.md](references/section-index.md)\n\nRead `claude-plan.md`. Identify natural section boundaries and create `<planning_dir>/sections/index.md`.\n\n**CRITICAL:** index.md MUST start with a SECTION_MANIFEST block. See the reference for format requirements.\n\nWrite `index.md` before proceeding to section file creation.\n\n### 14. Write Section Files — Parallel Subagents\n\nSee [section-splitting.md](references/section-splitting.md)\n\n**Launch parallel subagents** - one Task per section for maximum efficiency:\n\n1. First, parse `sections/index.md` to get the SECTION_MANIFEST list\n2. Then launch ALL section Tasks in a single message (parallel execution):\n\n```\n# Launch all in ONE message for parallel execution:\n\nTask(\n  subagent_type=\"general-purpose\",\n  prompt=\"\"\"\n  Write section file: section-01-{name}\n\n  Inputs:\n  - <planning_dir>/claude-plan.md\n  - <planning_dir>/sections/index.md\n\n  Output: <planning_dir>/sections/section-01-{name}.md\n\n  The section file must be COMPLETELY SELF-CONTAINED. Include:\n  - Background (why this section exists)\n  - Requirements (what must be true when complete)\n  - Dependencies (requires/blocks)\n  - Implementation details (from the plan)\n  - Acceptance criteria (checkboxes)\n  - Files to create/modify\n\n  The implementer should NOT need to reference any other document.\n  \"\"\"\n)\n\nTask(\n  subagent_type=\"general-purpose\",\n  prompt=\"Write section file: section-02-{name} ...\"\n)\n\nTask(\n  subagent_type=\"general-purpose\",\n  prompt=\"Write section file: section-03-{name} ...\"\n)\n\n# ... one Task per section in the manifest\n```\n\nWait for ALL subagents to complete before proceeding.\n\n### 15. Generate Execution Files — Subagent\n\n**Delegate to subagent** to reduce main context token usage:\n\n```\nTask(\n  subagent_type=\"general-purpose\",\n  prompt=\"\"\"\n  Generate two execution files for autonomous implementation.\n\n  Input files:\n  - <planning_dir>/sections/index.md (has SECTION_MANIFEST)\n  - <planning_dir>/sections/section-*.md (all section files)\n\n  OUTPUT 1: <planning_dir>/claude-ralph-loop-prompt.md\n  For ralph-loop plugin. EMBED all section content inline.\n\n  Structure:\n  - Mission statement\n  - Full content of sections/index.md\n  - Full content of EACH section file (embedded, not referenced)\n  - Execution rules (dependency order, verify acceptance criteria)\n  - Completion signal: <promise>ALL-SECTIONS-COMPLETE</promise>\n\n  OUTPUT 2: <planning_dir>/claude-ralphy-prd.md\n  For Ralphy CLI. REFERENCE section files (don''t embed).\n\n  Structure:\n  - PRD header\n  - How to use (ralphy --prd command)\n  - Context explanation\n  - Checkbox task list: one \"- [ ] Section NN: {name}\" per section\n\n  Write both files.\n  \"\"\"\n)\n```\n\nWait for subagent completion before proceeding.\n\n### 16. Final Status\n\nVerify all files were created successfully:\n- All section files from SECTION_MANIFEST\n- `claude-ralph-loop-prompt.md`\n- `claude-ralphy-prd.md`\n\n### 17. Output Summary\n\nPrint generated files and next steps:\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nGEPETTO: Planning Complete\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nGenerated files:\n  - claude-research.md (research findings)\n  - claude-interview.md (Q&A transcript)\n  - claude-spec.md (synthesized specification)\n  - claude-plan.md (implementation plan)\n  - claude-integration-notes.md (feedback decisions)\n  - reviews/ (external LLM feedback)\n  - sections/ (implementation units)\n  - claude-ralph-loop-prompt.md (for ralph-loop plugin)\n  - claude-ralphy-prd.md (for Ralphy CLI)\n\nHow to implement:\n\nOption A - Manual (recommended for learning/control):\n  1. Read sections/index.md to understand dependencies\n  2. Implement each section file in order\n  3. Each section is self-contained with acceptance criteria\n\nOption B - Autonomous with ralph-loop (Claude Code plugin):\n  /ralph-loop @<planning_dir>/claude-ralph-loop-prompt.md --completion-promise \"COMPLETE\" --max-iterations 100\n\nOption C - Autonomous with Ralphy (external CLI):\n  ralphy --prd <planning_dir>/claude-ralphy-prd.md\n  # Or: cp <planning_dir>/claude-ralphy-prd.md ./PRD.md && ralphy\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:10:41.427Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Planning Agents needing structured multi-step project orchestration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化多步骤项目编排能力的规划代理。","ja":"構造化されたマルチステップのプロジェクトオーケストレーション機能を必要とする計画エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 다단계 프로젝트 오케스트레이션 기능이 필요한 플래닝 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de planificación que necesitan capacidades de orquestación de proyectos estructurados y multi-etapa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de planification nécessitant des capacités d''orchestration de projets structurés et multi-étapes.","de":"Perfekt für Planungsagenten, die strukturierte Multi-Schritt-Projekt-Orchestrierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Planejamento que necessitam de capacidades de orquestração de projetos multi-etapas estruturadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Планирующих Агентов, требующих структурированных возможностей оркестровки многоэтапных проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخطيط الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات توجيه مشروع متعدد الخطوات منظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex projects through a phased approach, including Research, Interview, Spec Synthesis, Plan, External Review, and Sections, utilizing sequential execution and review protocols.","zh":"使代理能够通过分阶段方法管理复杂项目，包括研究、访谈、规格综合、计划、外部评审和章节，利用顺序执行和评审协议。","ja":"研究、インタビュー、仕様合成、計画、外部レビュー、セクションといった段階的アプローチを通じて、順次実行とレビュープロトコルを利用し、複雑なプロジェクトを管理するエージェントを強化します。","ko":"연구, 인터뷰, 스펙 종합, 계획, 외부 검토, 섹션을 포함한 단계적 접근 방식을 활용하고 순차적 실행 및 검토 프로토콜을 사용하여 복잡한 프로젝트를 관리할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar proyectos complejos a través de un enfoque por fases, que incluye Investigación, Entrevista, Síntesis de especificaciones, Plan, Revisión externa y Secciones, utilizando protocolos de ejecución y revisión secuenciales.","fr":"Habilite les agents à gérer des projets complexes à travers une approche par phases, comprenant Recherche, Entretien, Synthèse de spécifications, Plan, Revue externe et Sections, en utilisant des protocoles d''exécution et de revue séquentiels.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, komplexe Projekte durch einen phasenweisen Ansatz zu verwalten, einschließlich Forschung, Interview, Spezifikationssynthese, Plan, externe Überprüfung und Abschnitte, unter Verwendung sequenzieller Ausführungs- und Überprüfungsprotokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar projetos complexos por meio de uma abordagem faseada, incluindo Pesquisa, Entrevista, Síntese de Especificações, Plano, Revisão Externa e Seções, utilizando protocolos de execução e revisão sequenciais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными проектами посредством фазового подхода, включая Исследование, Интервью, Синтез Спецификаций, План, Внешний Обзор и Разделы, используя протоколы последовательной выполнения и обзора.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إدارة مشاريع معقدة من خلال نهج مرحلي ، بما في ذلك البحث والمقابلة وتنسيق المواصفات والخطة والاستعراض الخارجي والأقسام ، باستخدام بروتوكولات التنفيذ والاستعراض المتسلسل."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating multi-step planning processes","Generating sequential project plans","Facilitating External Review cycles"],"zh":["编排多步骤规划流程","生成顺序项目计划","促进外部评审周期"],"ja":["マルチステップの計画プロセスのオーケストレーション","順次的なプロジェクト計画の生成","外部レビューサイクルの促進"],"ko":["다단계 계획 프로세스 오케스트레이션","순차적 프로젝트 계획 생성","외부 검토 주기 촉진"],"es":["Orquestar procesos de planificación multi-etapa","Generar planes de proyectos secuenciales","Facilitar ciclos de revisión externa"],"fr":["Orchestrer des processus de planification multi-étapes","Générer des plans de projets séquentiels","Faciliter des cycles de revue externe"],"de":["Orchestrieren von Multi-Schritt-Planungsprozessen","Generieren von sequenziellen Projektplänen","Erleichtern von externen Überprüfungszyklen"],"pt":["Orquestração de processos de planejamento multi-etapas","Geração de planos de projeto sequenciais","Facilitação de ciclos de Revisão Externa"],"ru":["Оркестровка многоэтапных процессов планирования","Генерация последовательных проектных планов","Облегчение циклов Внешнего Обзора"],"ar":["توجيه عمليات التخطيط متعددة الخطوات","توليد خطط مشروع متسلسلة","تسهيل دورات المراجعة الخارجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to predefined sequential protocol","Limited to six predefined project phases"],"zh":["需要严格遵守预定义的顺序协议","仅限于六个预定义的项目阶段"],"ja":["事前に定義された順次プロトコルへの厳格な遵守が必要","事前に定義された6つのプロジェクト段階に限定"],"ko":["미리 정의된 순차적 프로토콜을 엄격히 준수해야 함","미리 정의된 6개의 프로젝트 단계로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión a un protocolo secuencial predefinido","Limitado a seis fases de proyecto predefinidas"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte à un protocole séquentiel prédéfini","Limité à six phases de projet prédéfinies"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung eines vordefinierten sequenziellen Protokolls","Begrenzt auf sechs vordefinierte Projektphasen"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita a protocolo sequencial predefinido","Limitado a seis fases de projeto predefinidas"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения заранее определенного последовательного протокола","Ограничен шестью заранее определёнными фазами проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بالبروتوكول المتسلسل المحدد مسبقًا","محدود بست مراحل مشروع محددة مسبقًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
