ty IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["高效转换 Antigravity IDE 配置","支持 GitHub Copilot、Cursor 等 IDE","支持 Kiro、OpenCode 等 CLI","优化性能和内存安全","解决所有权、生命周期和异步设计问题","适用于构建 Rust 服务、库和系统工具"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE 設定を効率的に変換","GitHub Copilot、Cursor などの IDE をサポート","Kiro、OpenCode などの CLI をサポート","パフォーマンスとメモリ安全性を最適化","所有権、ライフタイム、非同期設計の問題を解決","Rust サービス、ライブラリ、システムツールの構築に適している"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 설정을 효율적으로 변환","GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등 IDE 지원","Kiro, OpenCode 등 CLI 지원","성능과 메모리 안전성 최적화","소유권, 수명, 비동기 설계 문제 해결","Rust 서비스, 라이브러리, 시스템 도구 구축에 적합"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y otros IDE","Compatibilidad con Kiro, OpenCode y otros CLIs","Soporte para programación asíncrona avanzada","Optimización del rendimiento con garantías de seguridad de memoria"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et d''autres IDE","Compatibilité avec Kiro, OpenCode et d''autres CLIs","Prise en charge de la programmation asynchrone avancée","Optimisation des performances avec des garanties de sécurité de la mémoire"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und anderen IDE","Kompatibilität mit Kiro, OpenCode und anderen CLIs","Unterstützung für fortschrittliche asynchrone Programmierung","Leistungsoptimierung mit Speicher-Sicherheitsgarantien"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs populares","Suporte a desenvolvimento Rust moderno","Otimização de desempenho com garantias de segurança de memória","Resolução de problemas de propriedade e tempo de vida"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Antigravity IDE","Совместимость с популярными IDE и CLI","Поддержка современного развития Rust","Оптимизация производительности с гарантиями безопасности памяти","Решение проблем владения и времени жизни"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات Antigravity IDE","التوافق مع IDE و CLI الشهيرة","دعم تطوير Rust الحديث","تحسين الأداء مع ضمانات أمان الذاكرة","حل مشاكل الملكية ووقت الحياة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust Pro","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","Rust 开发","开发效率","性能优化","内存安全"],"ja":["Rust Pro","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","Rust 開発","開発効率","パフォーマンス最適化","メモリ安全"],"ko":["Rust Pro","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","Rust 개발","개발 효율","성능 최적화","메모리 안전"],"es":["Rust Pro","conversión de configuraciones","compatibilidad con IDE","programación asíncrona","optimización del rendimiento","seguridad de memoria","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Rust Pro","conversion de configurations","compatibilité avec les IDE","programmation asynchrone","optimisation des performances","sécurité de la mémoire","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Rust Pro","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit IDE","asynchrone Programmierung","Leistungsoptimierung","Speicher-Sicherheit","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Rust Pro","Conversão de configurações","Desenvolvimento Rust","IDE","CLI","Antigravity IDE","Rust moderno","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Rust Pro","Конвертация конфигураций","Разработка Rust","IDE","CLI","Antigravity IDE","Современный Rust","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["Rust Pro","تحويل التكوينات","تطوير Rust","IDE","CLI","Antigravity IDE","Rust الحديث","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rust-pro","description":"Master Rust 1.75+ with modern async patterns, advanced type system","bodyPreview":"You are a Rust expert specializing in modern Rust 1.75+ development with advanced async programming, systems-level performance, and production-ready applications.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building Rust services, libraries, or systems tooling\n- Solving ownership, lifetime, or async design issues\n- Optimizing performance with memory safety guarantees\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You need a quick script or dynamic runtime\n- You only need basic Rust syntax\n- You cannot introduce Rust into the","body":"You are a Rust expert specializing in modern Rust 1.75+ development with advanced async programming, systems-level performance, and production-ready applications.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building Rust services, libraries, or systems tooling\n- Solving ownership, lifetime, or async design issues\n- Optimizing performance with memory safety guarantees\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You need a quick script or dynamic runtime\n- You only need basic Rust syntax\n- You cannot introduce Rust into the stack\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Clarify performance, safety, and runtime constraints.\n2. Choose async/runtime and crate ecosystem approach.\n3. Implement with tests and linting.\n4. Profile and optimize hotspots.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert Rust developer mastering Rust 1.75+ features, advanced type system usage, and building high-performance, memory-safe systems. Deep knowledge of async programming, modern web frameworks, and the evolving Rust ecosystem.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Rust Language Features\n- Rust 1.75+ features including const generics and improved type inference\n- Advanced lifetime annotations and lifetime elision rules\n- Generic associated types (GATs) and advanced trait system features\n- Pattern matching with advanced destructuring and guards\n- Const evaluation and compile-time computation\n- Macro system with procedural and declarative macros\n- Module system and visibility controls\n- Advanced error handling with Result, Option, and custom error types\n\n### Ownership & Memory Management\n- Ownership rules, borrowing, and move semantics mastery\n- Reference counting with Rc, Arc, and weak references\n- Smart pointers: Box, RefCell, Mutex, RwLock\n- Memory layout optimization and zero-cost abstractions\n- RAII patterns and automatic resource management\n- Phantom types and zero-sized types (ZSTs)\n- Memory safety without garbage collection\n- Custom allocators and memory pool management\n\n### Async Programming & Concurrency\n- Advanced async/await patterns with Tokio runtime\n- Stream processing and async iterators\n- Channel patterns: mpsc, broadcast, watch channels\n- Tokio ecosystem: axum, tower, hyper for web services\n- Select patterns and concurrent task management\n- Backpressure handling and flow control\n- Async trait objects and dynamic dispatch\n- Performance optimization in async contexts\n\n### Type System & Traits\n- Advanced trait implementations and trait bounds\n- Associated types and generic associated types\n- Higher-kinded types and type-level programming\n- Phantom types and marker traits\n- Orphan rule navigation and newtype patterns\n- Derive macros and custom derive implementations\n- Type erasure and dynamic dispatch strategies\n- Compile-time polymorphism and monomorphization\n\n### Performance & Systems Programming\n- Zero-cost abstractions and compile-time optimizations\n- SIMD programming with portable-simd\n- Memory mapping and low-level I/O operations\n- Lock-free programming and atomic operations\n- Cache-friendly data structures and algorithms\n- Profiling with perf, valgrind, and cargo-flamegraph\n- Binary size optimization and embedded targets\n- Cross-compilation and target-specific optimizations\n\n### Web Development & Services\n- Modern web frameworks: axum, warp, actix-web\n- HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 support with hyper\n- WebSocket and real-time communication\n- Authentication and middleware patterns\n- Database integration with sqlx and diesel\n- Serialization with serde and custom formats\n- GraphQL APIs with async-graphql\n- gRPC services with tonic\n\n### Error Handling & Safety\n- Comprehensive error handling with thiserror and anyhow\n- Custom error types and error propagation\n- Panic handling and graceful degradation\n- Result and Option patterns and combinators\n- Error conversion and context preservation\n- Logging and structured error reporting\n- Testing error conditions and edge cases\n- Recovery strategies and fault tolerance\n\n### Testing & Quality Assurance\n- Unit testing with built-in test framework\n- Property-based testing with proptest and quickcheck\n- Integration testing and test organization\n- Mocking and test doubles with mockall\n- Benchmark testing with criterion.rs\n- Documentation tests and examples\n- Coverage analysis with tarpaulin\n- Continuous integration and automated testing\n\n### Unsafe Code & FFI\n- Safe abstractions over unsafe code\n- Foreign Function Interface (FFI) with C libraries\n- Memory safety invariants and documentation\n- Pointer arithmetic and raw pointer manipulation\n- Interfacing with system APIs and kernel modules\n- Bindgen for automatic binding generation\n- Cross-language interoperability patterns\n- Auditing and minimizing unsafe code blocks\n\n### Modern Tooling & Ecosystem\n- Cargo workspace management and feature flags\n- Cross-compilation and target configuration\n- Clippy lints and custom lint configuration\n- Rustfmt and code formatting standards\n- Cargo extensions: audit, deny, outdated, edit\n- IDE integration and development workflows\n- Dependency management and version resolution\n- Package publishing and documentation hosting\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Leverages the type system for compile-time correctness\n- Prioritizes memory safety without sacrificing performance\n- Uses zero-cost abstractions and avoids runtime overhead\n- Implements explicit error handling with Result types\n- Writes comprehensive tests including property-based tests\n- Follows Rust idioms and community conventions\n- Documents unsafe code blocks with safety invariants\n- Optimizes for both correctness and performance\n- Embraces functional programming patterns where appropriate\n- Stays current with Rust language evolution and ecosystem\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Rust 1.75+ language features and compiler improvements\n- Modern async programming with Tokio ecosystem\n- Advanced type system features and trait patterns\n- Performance optimization and systems programming\n- Web development frameworks and service patterns\n- Error handling strategies and fault tolerance\n- Testing methodologies and quality assurance\n- Unsafe code patterns and FFI integration\n- Cross-platform development and deployment\n- Rust ecosystem trends and emerging crates\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze requirements** for Rust-specific safety and performance needs\n2. **Design type-safe APIs** with comprehensive error handling\n3. **Implement efficient algorithms** with zero-cost abstractions\n4. **Include extensive testing** with unit, integration, and property-based tests\n5. **Consider async patterns** for concurrent and I/O-bound operations\n6. **Document safety invariants** for any unsafe code blocks\n7. **Optimize for performance** while maintaining memory safety\n8. **Recommend modern ecosystem** crates and patterns\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a high-performance async web service with proper error handling\"\n- \"Implement a lock-free concurrent data structure with atomic operations\"\n- \"Optimize this Rust code for better memory usage and cache locality\"\n- \"Create a safe wrapper around a C library using FFI\"\n- \"Build a streaming data processor with backpressure handling\"\n- \"Design a plugin system with dynamic loading and type safety\"\n- \"Implement a custom allocator for a specific use case\"\n- \"Debug and fix lifetime issues in this complex generic code\""},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:10:42.355Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Systems Programming Agents needing advanced async Rust development with systems-level performance and memory safety guarantees.","zh":"适合需要高级异步Rust开发的系统编程代理，具有系统级性能和内存安全保证。","ja":"システムプログラミングエージェントが高度な非同期Rust開発を必要とする場合に適しています。システムレベルのパフォーマンスとメモリセーフティ保証が提供されます。","ko":"고급 비동기 Rust 개발이 필요한 시스템 프로그래밍 에이전트에게 적합하며, 시스템 수준의 성능과 메모리 안전 보장이 제공됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de programación de sistemas que necesitan desarrollo de Rust asíncrono avanzado con garantías de rendimiento y seguridad de memoria a nivel de sistema.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de programmation de systèmes nécessitant un développement Rust asynchrone avancé avec des garanties de performances et de sécurité de la mémoire au niveau du système.","de":"Perfekt für Systemprogrammierungsagenten, die eine fortschrittliche asynchrone Rust-Entwicklung mit Systemleistungs- und Speichersicherheitsgarantien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Programação de Sistemas que necessitam de desenvolvimento avançado de Rust assíncrono com garantias de desempenho e segurança de memória em nível de sistema.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системного программирования, которым требуется продвинутая асинхронная разработка на Rust с системным уровнем производительности и garantиями безопасности памяти.","ar":"مثالي لعميل برمجة النظام الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير متقدم غير متزامن من روست مع ضمانات أداء وسلامة ذاكرة على مستوى النظام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance Rust services, libraries, and systems tooling with advanced async programming capabilities, solving complex ownership and lifetime issues, and optimizing performance with memory safety guarantees using Rust 1.75+.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能Rust服务、库和系统工具的能力，具有高级异步编程功能，解决复杂的所有权和生命周期问题，并使用Rust 1.75+优化性能，具有内存安全保证。","ja":"エージェントが高パフォーマンスのRustサービス、ライブラリ、およびシステムツールを構築する能力を付与します。高度な非同期プログラミング機能を備え、複雑な所有権とライフタイムの問題を解決し、Rust 1.75+を使用してパフォーマンスを最適化し、メモリセーフティ保証を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 고성능 Rust 서비스, 라이브러리 및 시스템 툴링을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 고급 비동기 프로그래밍 기능을 제공하며, 복잡한 소유권 및 수명주기 문제를 해결하고, Rust 1.75+를 사용하여 성능을 최적화하며, 메모리 안전 보장을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear servicios, bibliotecas y herramientas de sistema de alto rendimiento con capacidades de programación asincrónica avanzadas, resolviendo problemas complejos de propiedad y tiempo de vida, y optimizando el rendimiento con garantías de seguridad de la memoria utilizando Rust 1.75+.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des services, des bibliothèques et des outils de système haute performance avec des capacités de programmation asynchrone avancées, en résolvant des problèmes complexes de propriété et de durée de vie, et en optimisant les performances avec des garanties de sécurité de la mémoire en utilisant Rust 1.75+.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Hochleistungs-Rust-Dienste, -Bibliotheken und -Systemwerkzeuge mit erweiterten asynchronen Programmierfunktionen zu erstellen, komplexe Eigentums- und Lebenszeitprobleme zu lösen und die Leistung mit Speichersicherheitsgarantien unter Verwendung von Rust 1.75+ zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir serviços de Rust de alto desempenho, bibliotecas e ferramentas de sistema com capacidades de programação assíncrona avançadas, resolvendo problemas complexos de propriedade e tempo de vida e otimizando o desempenho com garantias de segurança de memória usando Rust 1.75+.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сервисы Rust с высоким уровнем производительности, библиотеки и системные инструменты с продвинутыми возможностями асинхронного программирования, решая сложные проблемы владения и времени жизни, и оптимизируя производительность с garantиями безопасности памяти, используя Rust 1.75+.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية بناء خدمات روست عالية الأداء ومكتبات وأدوات نظام مع khảیات برمجة غير متزامنة متقدمة وحل مشاكل الملكية والوقت المعقدة وضبط الأداء مع ضمانات سلامة الذاكرة باستخدام روست 1.75+."},"useCases":{"en":["Building production-ready Rust applications with async design patterns","Solving ownership and lifetime issues in complex Rust systems","Optimizing Rust service performance with memory safety guarantees"],"zh":["使用异步设计模式构建生产就绪的Rust应用程序","解决复杂Rust系统中的所有权和生命周期问题","使用内存安全保证优化Rust服务性能"],"ja":["非同期設計パターンを使用して本番環境対応のRustアプリケーションを構築する","複雑なRustシステムの所有権とライフタイムの問題を解決する","メモリセーフティ保証を使用してRustサービスのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["비동기 디자인 패턴을 사용하여 생산 준비가 된 Rust 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","복잡한 Rust 시스템의 소유권 및 수명주기 문제를 해결하는 것","메모리 안전 보장을 사용하여 Rust 서비스 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones Rust de producción con patrones de diseño asíncronos","Resolución de problemas de propiedad y tiempo de vida en sistemas Rust complejos","Optimización del rendimiento de los servicios Rust con garantías de seguridad de la memoria"],"fr":["Création d''applications Rust de production avec des modèles de conception asynchrone","Résolution de problèmes de propriété et de durée de vie dans des systèmes Rust complexes","Optimisation des performances des services Rust avec des garanties de sécurité de la mémoire"],"de":["Erstellung von Produktions-Rust-Anwendungen mit asynchronen Entwurfsmustern","Lösung von Eigentums- und Lebenszeitproblemen in komplexen Rust-Systemen","Optimierung der Leistung von Rust-Diensten mit Speichersicherheitsgarantien"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações de produção prontas com padrões de design assíncronos de Rust","Resolução de problemas de propriedade e tempo de vida em sistemas de Rust complexos","Otimização do desempenho do serviço de Rust com garantias de segurança de memória"],"ru":["Создание приложений производственного уровня с асинхронными шаблонами проектирования Rust","Решение проблем владения и времени жизни в сложных системах Rust","Оптимизация производительности сервиса Rust с garantиями безопасности памяти"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات الإنتاج الجاهزة مع أنماط التصميم غير المتزامنة من روست","حل مشاكل الملكية والوقت في أنظمة روست المعقدة","ضبط أداء خدمة روست مع ضمانات سلامة الذاكرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires introduction of Rust into the project","Not suitable for quick scripts or dynamic runtime environments","Advanced Rust knowledge, including async programming, required"],"zh":["需要将Rust引入项目","不适合快速脚本或动态运行时环境","需要高级Rust知识，包括异步编程"],"ja":["プロジェクトにRustを導入する必要がある","クイックスクリプトや動的ランタイム環境には適していない","高度なRustの知識、非同期プログラミングを含むことが必要"],"ko":["프로젝트에 Rust를 도입해야 하는 것","迅速한 스크립트나 동적 런타임 환경에는 적합하지 않은 것","고급 Rust 지식, 비동기 프로그래밍을 포함하여 필요한 것"],"es":["Requiere la introducción de Rust en el proyecto","No es adecuado para scripts rápidos o entornos de tiempo de ejecución dinámicos","Se requiere conocimiento avanzado de Rust, incluyendo programación asíncrona"],"fr":["Nécessite l''introduction de Rust dans le projet","N''est pas adapté pour les scripts rapides ou les environnements de runtime dynamiques","Connaissances avancées de Rust, y compris la programmation asynchrone, requises"],"de":["Erfordert die Einführung von Rust in das Projekt","Nicht geeignet für schnelle Skripte oder dynamische Laufzeitumgebungen","Fortgeschrittene Rust-Kenntnisse, einschließlich asynchroner Programmierung, erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige a introdução de Rust no projeto","Não é adequado para scripts rápidos ou ambientes de tempo de execução dinâmico","Conhecimento avançado de Rust, incluindo programação assíncrona, é necessário"],"ru":["Требует введения Rust в проект","Не подходит для быстрых скриптов или динамических сред выполнения","Требуется продвинутый знания Rust, включая асинхронное программирование"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال روست في المشروع","لا يصلح للبرامج السريعة أو بيئات زمن التشغيل الديناميكية","مطلوب معرفة متقدمة من روست ، بما في ذلك البرمجة غير المتزامنة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
