Analyze PRD for user experience requirements\n3. Follow UX design methodology and patterns\n4. Document user flows, wireframes, and design decisions\n5. Save UX design document to project documentation","body":"# Create UX Design Workflow\n\nCreate comprehensive UX design documentation:\n\n1. Read `_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md`\n2. Analyze PRD for user experience requirements\n3. Follow UX design methodology and patterns\n4. Document user flows, wireframes, and design decisions\n5. Save UX design document to project documentation"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:11:48.742Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing structured design documentation and workflow automation","zh":"非常适合需要结构化设计文档和工作流自动化的 UI/UX 代理","ja":"UI/UX エージェントが構造化された設計文書とワークフローの自動化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"구조화된 설계 문서와 워크플로 자동화를 필요로 하는 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan documentación de diseño estructurada y automatización de flujo de trabajo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin de documentation de conception structurée et d''automatisation de workflow","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die strukturierte Designdokumentation und Workflow-Automatisierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de documentação de design estruturada e automação de fluxo de trabalho","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым требуется структурированная документация по дизайну и автоматизация рабочего процесса","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق تصميم منظم وتوضيح سير العمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive UX design documentation, analyzing PRD for user experience requirements and following UX design methodology, while generating user flows, wireframes, and design decisions in Markdown format, leveraging the BMAD Method for autonomous epic execution pipelines","zh":"赋予代理创建全面性的用户体验设计文档的能力，分析 PRD 以了解用户体验需求，并遵循用户体验设计方法论，同时以 Markdown 格式生成用户流、线框图和设计决策，利用 BMAD 方法实现自主的史诗执行管道","ja":"エージェントが包括的な UX 設計文書を作成できるようにし、PRD を分析してユーザー体験の要件を把握し、UX 設計方法論に従いながら、ユーザーフロー、ワイヤーフレーム、設計決定を Markdown 形式で生成し、BMAD 方法を使用して自立的なエピック実行パイプラインを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 사용자 경험 설계 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, PRD를 분석하여 사용자 경험 요구 사항을 파악하고, 사용자 경험 설계 방법론을 따르며, 사용자 흐름, 와이어프레임, 설계 결정 등을 Markdown 형식으로 생성하며, BMAD 방법을 활용하여 자율적인 에픽 실행 파이프라인을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear una documentación de diseño de UX integral, analizando el PRD para requisitos de experiencia del usuario y siguiendo la metodología de diseño de UX, mientras genera flujos de usuario, alambrados y decisiones de diseño en formato Markdown, aprovechando el método BMAD para tuberías de ejecución de épicos autónomos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation de conception UX complète, en analysant le PRD pour les exigences d''expérience utilisateur et en suivant la méthodologie de conception UX, tout en générant des flux d''utilisateurs, des filtres et des décisions de conception au format Markdown, en exploitant la méthode BMAD pour les pipelines d''exécution d''épics autonomes","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende UX-Designdokumentation zu erstellen, indem sie das PRD für Benutzererfahrungsanforderungen analysieren und die UX-Designdokumentationsmethodik befolgen, während sie Benutzerflüsse, Drahtmodelle und Designentscheidungen im Markdown-Format generieren, die BMAD-Methode für autonome Epik-Ausführungspipelines nutzend","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar uma documentação abrangente de design de experiência do usuário, analisando PRD para requisitos de experiência do usuário e seguindo a metodologia de design de experiência do usuário, enquanto gera fluxos de usuário, wireframes e decisões de design no formato Markdown, utilizando o Método BMAD para pipelines de execução épica autônoma","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всестороннюю документацию по дизайну пользовательского опыта, анализируя PRD для требований пользовательского опыта и следуя методологии дизайна пользовательского опыта, при этом генерируя потоки пользователей, эскизы и решения по дизайну в формате Markdown, используя Метод BMAD для автономных конвейеров эпических задач","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء توثيق شاملة لتصميم تجربة المستخدم، حيث يقوم بتحليل وثائق متطلبات المنتج لاستخدامها في متطلبات تجربة المستخدم واتباع منهجية تصميم تجربة المستخدم، وفي الوقت نفسه генераfluxos المستخدم والتصاميم الأولية وقرارات التصميم في تنسيق Markdown، باستخدام طريقة BMAD لأتمتة أنابيب التنفيذ الملحقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UX design workflow creation","Generating user flows and wireframes for project documentation","Analyzing Product Requirements Documents (PRD) for user experience insights"],"zh":["自动化用户体验设计工作流创建","为项目文档生成用户流和线框图","分析产品需求文档（PRD）以获取用户体验洞察"],"ja":["UX 設計ワークフローの自動化","プロジェクト文書用のユーザーフローとワイヤーフレームの生成","ユーザー体験の洞察を得るための製品要件文書（PRD）の分析"],"ko":["사용자 경험 설계 워크플로 생성 자동화","프로젝트 문서를 위한 사용자 흐름과 와이어프레임 생성","사용자 경험에 대한 통찰력을 얻기 위한 제품 요구 사항 문서(PRD) 분석"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de flujos de trabajo de diseño de UX","Generación de flujos de usuario y alambrados para la documentación de proyectos","Análisis de documentos de requisitos de productos (PRD) para obtener información sobre la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de flux de travail de conception UX","Génération de flux d''utilisateurs et de filtres pour la documentation de projet","Analyse des documents de spécifications de produit (PRD) pour obtenir des informations sur l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von UX-Design-Workflows","Generierung von Benutzerflüssen und Drahtmodellen für die Projektdokumentation","Analyse von Produktanforderungsdokumenten (PRD) für Benutzererfahrungseinblicke"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de fluxo de trabalho de design de experiência do usuário","Gerar fluxos de usuário e wireframes para documentação de projeto","Analisar Documentos de Requisitos de Produto (PRD) para obter informações sobre a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание рабочего процесса дизайна пользовательского опыта","Генерировать потоки пользователей и эскизы для документации проекта","Анализировать Документы требований продукта (PRD) для получения информации о пользовательском опыте"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء سير عمل تصميم تجربة المستخدم","توليد تدفقات المستخدم والتصاميم الأولية للتوجيهات الخاصة بمشروع","تحليل وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD) للحصول على معلومات حول تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","Limited to Markdown format for UX design documentation","Dependent on BMAD Method agents for Kiro CLI"],"zh":["需要访问 _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","仅限 Markdown 格式的用户体验设计文档","依赖 BMAD 方法代理的 Kiro CLI"],"ja":["_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md にアクセスする必要がある","UX 設計文書は Markdown 形式のみ","BMAD 方法エージェントの Kiro CLI 依存"],"ko":["_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md에 접근할 수 있어야 함","사용자 경험 설계 문서는 Markdown 형식만","BMAD 방법 에이전트의 Kiro CLI 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","Limitado al formato Markdown para la documentación de diseño de UX","Dependiente de agentes del método BMAD para Kiro CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","Limité au format Markdown pour la documentation de conception UX","Dépendant des agents de la méthode BMAD pour Kiro CLI"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Format für die UX-Designdokumentation","Abhängig von BMAD-Methodenagenten für Kiro-CLI"],"pt":["Requer acesso a _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","Limitado ao formato Markdown para documentação de design de experiência do usuário","Dependente de agentes do Método BMAD para Kiro CLI"],"ru":["Требует доступа к _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","Ограничен форматом Markdown для документации по дизайну пользовательского опыта","Зависит от агентов Метода BMAD для Kiro CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى _bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-ux-design/workflow.md","محدود التنسيق Markdown لتوثيق تصميم تجربة المستخدم","يعتمد على عملاء طريقة BMAD لـ Kiro CLI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/jquery-4', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'jquery-4', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:11:56.935Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/jquery-4","name":"jquery-4","description":{"zh":"jQuery 4.0 现已推出，带来新的功能和改进。了解如何升级您的应用程序以利用这些变化","ja":"jQuery 4.0 がリリースされ、新機能と改良が導入されました。アプリケーションのアップグレード方法を学びます","ko":"jQuery 4.0이 출시되었습니다. 새로운 기능과 향상을 사용하도록 애플리케이션을 업그레이드하는 방법을 배우십시오","es":"La migración a jQuery 4.0 es sencilla con nuestro tutorial. Aprende a actualizar tu versión de jQuery de manera segura.","fr":"La migration vers jQuery 4.0 est simple avec notre tutoriel. Apprenez à mettre à jour votre version de jQuery de manière sécurisée.","de":"Die Migration zu jQuery 4.0 ist einfach mit unserem Tutorial. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre jQuery-Version sicher aktualisieren können.","pt":"A migração para jQuery 4.0 é um processo importante para manter seu projeto atualizado. Aqui está um guia rápido para ajudá-lo a fazer a transição.","ru":"Миграция на jQuery 4.0 является важным процессом для поддержания вашего проекта в актуальном состоянии. Вот быстрое руководство, чтобы помочь вам сделать переход.","ar":"الانتقال إلى jQuery 4.0 هو عملية هامة لتحديث مشروعك. هنا دليل سريع لمساعدتك على التحول.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"jQuery 4.0 升级指南","ja":"jQuery 4.0 マイグレーションガイド","ko":"jQuery 4.0 마이그레이션 가이드","es":"Migración a jQuery 4.0","fr":"Migration vers jQuery 4.0","de":"Migration zu jQuery 4.0","pt":"Migração para jQuery 4.0","ru":"Миграция на jQuery 4.0","ar":"تحرك إلى jQuery 4.0","en":"jquery-4"},"description":{"zh":"jQuery 4.0 现已推出，带来新的功能和改进。了解如何升级您的应用程序以利用这些变化","ja":"jQuery 4.0 がリリースされ、新機能と改良が導入されました。アプリケーションのアップグレード方法を学びます","ko":"jQuery 4.0이 출시되었습니다. 새로운 기능과 향상을 사용하도록 애플리케이션을 업그레이드하는 방법을 배우십시오","es":"La migración a jQuery 4.0 es sencilla con nuestro tutorial. Aprende a actualizar tu versión de jQuery de manera segura.","fr":"La migration vers jQuery 4.0 est simple avec notre tutoriel. Apprenez à mettre à jour votre version de jQuery de manière sécurisée.","de":"Die Migration zu jQuery 4.0 ist einfach mit unserem Tutorial. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre jQuery-Version sicher aktualisieren können.","pt":"A migração para jQuery 4.0 é um processo importante para manter seu projeto atualizado. Aqui está um guia rápido para ajudá-lo a fazer a transição.","ru":"Миграция на jQuery 4.0 является важным процессом для поддержания вашего проекта в актуальном состоянии. Вот быстрое руководство, чтобы помочь вам сделать пер...","ar":"الانتقال إلى jQuery 4.0 هو عملية هامة لتحديث مشروعك. هنا دليل سريع لمساعدتك على التحول.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["生产就绪","无依赖","最新版本：jquery@4.0.0，jquery-migrate@4.0.2","兼容性测试","简单升级"],"ja":["プロダクションレディ","依存関係なし","最新バージョン：jquery@4.0.0，jquery-migrate@4.0.2","互換性テスト","簡単アップグレード"],"ko":["생산 준비","의존성 없음","최신 버전：jquery@4.0.0，jquery-migrate@4.0.2","호환성 테스트","간단한 업그레이드"],"es":["Compatibilidad con navegadores modernos","Mejoras de rendimiento","Nuevas características de seguridad","Soporte para ECMAScript 2022","Compatibilidad con jQuery Migrate Plugin"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec les navigateurs modernes","Améliorations des performances","Nouvelles fonctionnalités de sécurité","Prise en charge d''ECMAScript 2022","Compatibilité avec le plugin jQuery Migrate"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit modernen Browsern","Leistungsverbesserungen","Neue Sicherheitsfunktionen","Unterstützung für ECMAScript 2022","Kompatibilität mit dem jQuery Migrate Plugin"],"pt":["Melhorias de desempenho","Nova API para manipulação de DOM","Suporte a novos navegadores","Depreciação de funções antigas","Migração segura com o plugin Migrate"],"ru":["Улучшения производительности","Новый API для манипуляции DOM","Поддержка новых браузеров","Устаревание старых функций","Безопасный переход с помощью плагина Migrate"],"ar":["تحسينات الأداء","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جديدة لتحويل DOM","دعم المتصفحات الجديدة","إلغاء وظائف قديمة","الانتقال الآمن باستخدام إضافة Migrate"]},"keywords":{"zh":["jQuery 4.0","升级","兼容性","JavaScript","前端开发","Web 开发"],"ja":["jQuery 4.0","アップグレード","互換性","JavaScript","フロントエンド開発","Web 開発"],"ko":["jQuery 4.0","업그레이드","호환성","JavaScript","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발"],"es":["jQuery 4.0","migración a jQuery 4.0","tutorial de jQuery","actualización de jQuery","compatibilidad con jQuery","mejoras de rendimiento de jQuery"],"fr":["jQuery 4.0","migration vers jQuery 4.0","tutoriel jQuery","mise à jour de jQuery","compatibilité avec jQuery","améliorations des performances de jQuery"],"de":["jQuery 4.0","Migration zu jQuery 4.0","jQuery-Tutorial","Aktualisierung von jQuery","Kompatibilität mit jQuery","Leistungsverbesserungen von jQuery"],"pt":["jQuery 4.0","migração","atualização","desenvolvimento web","JavaScript","biblioteca jQuery","melhorias de desempenho","nova API"],"ru":["jQuery 4.0","миграция","обновление","веб-разработка","JavaScript","библиотека jQuery","улучшения производительности","новый API"],"ar":["jQuery 4.0","الانتقال","التحديث","تطوير الويب","JavaScript","مكتبة jQuery","تحسينات الأداء","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جديدة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jquery-4","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# jQuery 4.0 Migration\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-25\n**Dependencies**: None\n**Latest Versions**: jquery@4.0.0, jquery-migrate@4.0.2\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Add jQuery Migrate Plugin for Safe Testing\n\nBefore upgrading, add the migrate plugin to identify compatibility issues:\n\n```html\n<!-- Development: Shows console warnings for deprecated features -->\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-4.0.0.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/","body":"# jQuery 4.0 Migration\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-25\n**Dependencies**: None\n**Latest Versions**: jquery@4.0.0, jquery-migrate@4.0.2\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Add jQuery Migrate Plugin for Safe Testing\n\nBefore upgrading, add the migrate plugin to identify compatibility issues:\n\n```html\n<!-- Development: Shows console warnings for deprecated features -->\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-4.0.0.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-migrate-4.0.2.js\"></script>\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Logs specific warnings when deprecated/removed features execute\n- Identifies code that needs updating before it breaks\n- Provides backward compatibility shims during transition\n\n### 2. Install via npm (if using build tools)\n\n```bash\nnpm install jquery@4.0.0\n# Or with migrate plugin for testing\nnpm install jquery@4.0.0 jquery-migrate@4.0.2\n```\n\n### 3. Check for Breaking Changes\n\nRun your application and check console for migrate plugin warnings. Each warning indicates code that needs updating.\n\n---\n\n## Breaking Changes Reference\n\n### Removed jQuery Utility Functions\n\nThese functions were deprecated and are now removed. Use native JavaScript equivalents:\n\n| Removed | Native Replacement |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| `$.isArray(arr)` | `Array.isArray(arr)` |\n| `$.parseJSON(str)` | `JSON.parse(str)` |\n| `$.trim(str)` | `str.trim()` or `String.prototype.trim.call(str)` |\n| `$.now()` | `Date.now()` |\n| `$.type(obj)` | `typeof obj` + `Array.isArray()` + `instanceof` |\n| `$.isNumeric(val)` | `!isNaN(parseFloat(val)) && isFinite(val)` |\n| `$.isFunction(fn)` | `typeof fn === ''function''` |\n| `$.isWindow(obj)` | `obj != null && obj === obj.window` |\n| `$.camelCase(str)` | Custom function (see below) |\n| `$.nodeName(el, name)` | `el.nodeName.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase()` |\n\n**camelCase replacement:**\n\n```javascript\n// Native replacement for $.camelCase\nfunction camelCase(str) {\n  return str.replace(/-([a-z])/g, (match, letter) => letter.toUpperCase());\n}\n```\n\n### Removed Prototype Methods\n\nThree internal array methods removed from jQuery objects:\n\n```javascript\n// OLD - No longer works in jQuery 4.0\n$elems.push(elem);\n$elems.sort(compareFn);\n$elems.splice(index, count);\n\n// NEW - Use array methods with call/apply\n[].push.call($elems, elem);\n[].sort.call($elems, compareFn);\n[].splice.call($elems, index, count);\n\n// Or convert to array first\nconst arr = $.makeArray($elems);\narr.push(elem);\n```\n\n### Focus/Blur Event Order Changed\n\njQuery 4.0 follows the W3C specification for focus event order:\n\n```javascript\n// jQuery 3.x order (non-standard):\n// focusout → blur → focusin → focus\n\n// jQuery 4.0 order (W3C standard):\n// blur → focusout → focus → focusin\n```\n\n**Impact**: If your code depends on specific event ordering, test thoroughly.\n\n```javascript\n// Example: code that may need adjustment\n$input.on(''blur focusout focus focusin'', function(e) {\n  console.log(e.type); // Order changed in 4.0\n});\n```\n\n### Removed from Slim Build\n\nThe slim build (`jquery-4.0.0.slim.min.js`) no longer includes:\n- Deferreds and Callbacks (use native Promises instead)\n- AJAX functionality\n- Animation effects\n\n```javascript\n// If using slim build, replace Deferreds with Promises\n// OLD - Deferred\nconst deferred = $.Deferred();\ndeferred.resolve(value);\ndeferred.promise();\n\n// NEW - Native Promise\nconst promise = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  resolve(value);\n});\n```\n\n### toggleClass Changes\n\nThe `toggleClass(boolean)` and `toggleClass(undefined)` signatures are removed:\n\n```javascript\n// OLD - No longer works\n$elem.toggleClass(true);   // Added all classes\n$elem.toggleClass(false);  // Removed all classes\n\n// NEW - Be explicit\n$elem.addClass(''class1 class2'');    // Add classes\n$elem.removeClass(''class1 class2''); // Remove classes\n\n// Or use toggleClass with class names\n$elem.toggleClass(''active'', true);  // Force add\n$elem.toggleClass(''active'', false); // Force remove\n```\n\n### AJAX Script Execution\n\nScripts fetched via AJAX no longer auto-execute unless dataType is specified:\n\n```javascript\n// OLD - Scripts auto-executed\n$.get(''script.js'');\n\n// NEW - Must specify dataType for auto-execution\n$.get({\n  url: ''script.js'',\n  dataType: ''script''\n});\n\n// Or use $.getScript (still works)\n$.getScript(''script.js'');\n```\n\n### Removed CSS Properties\n\n| Removed | Notes |\n|---------|-------|\n| `$.cssNumber` | Removed - define locally if needed |\n| `$.cssProps` | No longer needed - vendor prefixes obsolete |\n| `$.fx.interval` | Removed - requestAnimationFrame handles this |\n\n---\n\n## WordPress-Specific Migration\n\n### 1. Check WordPress jQuery Version\n\n```bash\n# Check current jQuery version in WordPress\nwp eval \"echo wp_scripts()->registered[''jquery-core'']->ver;\"\n```\n\n### 2. WordPress jQuery Migration Path\n\nWordPress themes/plugins should:\n\n```php\n// Dequeue old jQuery and enqueue 4.0 (testing only)\nfunction upgrade_jquery_for_testing() {\n  if (!is_admin()) {\n    wp_deregister_script(''jquery-core'');\n    wp_deregister_script(''jquery'');\n\n    wp_register_script(''jquery-core'',\n      ''https://code.jquery.com/jquery-4.0.0.min.js'',\n      array(), ''4.0.0'', true);\n\n    wp_register_script(''jquery'', false, array(''jquery-core''), ''4.0.0'', true);\n\n    // Add migrate plugin for debugging\n    wp_enqueue_script(''jquery-migrate'',\n      ''https://code.jquery.com/jquery-migrate-4.0.2.min.js'',\n      array(''jquery''), ''4.0.2'', true);\n  }\n}\nadd_action(''wp_enqueue_scripts'', ''upgrade_jquery_for_testing'', 1);\n```\n\n### 3. Common WordPress Plugin Issues\n\nMany WordPress plugins use removed jQuery methods:\n\n```javascript\n// Common pattern in older plugins - BROKEN in 4.0\nif ($.isArray(data)) { ... }\nvar json = $.parseJSON(response);\nvar cleaned = $.trim(userInput);\n\n// Fix: Update to native methods\nif (Array.isArray(data)) { ... }\nvar json = JSON.parse(response);\nvar cleaned = userInput.trim();\n```\n\n---\n\n## Migration Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Type Checking Migration\n\n```javascript\n// OLD jQuery type checking\nif ($.type(value) === ''array'') { ... }\nif ($.type(value) === ''function'') { ... }\nif ($.type(value) === ''object'') { ... }\nif ($.type(value) === ''string'') { ... }\nif ($.type(value) === ''number'') { ... }\n\n// NEW Native type checking\nif (Array.isArray(value)) { ... }\nif (typeof value === ''function'') { ... }\nif (value !== null && typeof value === ''object'' && !Array.isArray(value)) { ... }\nif (typeof value === ''string'') { ... }\nif (typeof value === ''number'') { ... }\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Utility Function Polyfills\n\nIf you need quick compatibility without changing all code:\n\n```javascript\n// Polyfill removed methods (temporary migration aid)\nif (typeof $.isArray === ''undefined'') {\n  $.isArray = Array.isArray;\n}\nif (typeof $.parseJSON === ''undefined'') {\n  $.parseJSON = JSON.parse;\n}\nif (typeof $.trim === ''undefined'') {\n  $.trim = function(str) {\n    return str == null ? '''' : String.prototype.trim.call(str);\n  };\n}\nif (typeof $.now === ''undefined'') {\n  $.now = Date.now;\n}\nif (typeof $.isFunction === ''undefined'') {\n  $.isFunction = function(fn) {\n    return typeof fn === ''function'';\n  };\n}\nif (typeof $.isNumeric === ''undefined'') {\n  $.isNumeric = function(val) {\n    return !isNaN(parseFloat(val)) && isFinite(val);\n  };\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: This is a temporary measure. Update your code to use native methods.\n\n### Pattern 3: ES Modules Import\n\njQuery 4.0 supports ES modules:\n\n```javascript\n// ES Module import (new in 4.0)\nimport $ from ''jquery'';\n\n// Or with named export\nimport { $ } from ''jquery'';\n\n// In package.json, ensure module resolution\n{\n  \"type\": \"module\"\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Trusted Types Compliance\n\nFor CSP with Trusted Types:\n\n```javascript\n// jQuery 4.0 accepts TrustedHTML in DOM manipulation\nimport DOMPurify from ''dompurify'';\n\n// Create trusted HTML\nconst clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(untrustedHTML, {RETURN_TRUSTED_TYPE: true});\n\n// Safe to use with jQuery 4.0\n$(''#container'').html(clean);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n- Add jquery-migrate plugin BEFORE upgrading production\n- Test focus/blur event handlers thoroughly\n- Replace removed utility functions with native equivalents\n- Specify `dataType: ''script''` for AJAX script loading\n- Use ES module imports when possible for modern projects\n\n### Never Do\n\n- Upgrade production without testing with migrate plugin first\n- Assume WordPress plugins are jQuery 4.0 compatible\n- Use slim build if you need AJAX or Deferreds\n- Rely on `$.type()` - use native type checking\n- Use `toggleClass(boolean)` signature\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **8** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: $.isArray is not a function\n**Error**: `TypeError: $.isArray is not a function`\n**Source**: https://github.com/jquery/jquery/issues/5411\n**Why It Happens**: Method removed in jQuery 4.0\n**Prevention**: Use `Array.isArray()` instead\n\n### Issue #2: $.parseJSON is not a function\n**Error**: `TypeError: $.parseJSON is not a function`\n**Source**: https://jquery.com/upgrade-guide/4.0/\n**Why It Happens**: Deprecated since 3.0, removed in 4.0\n**Prevention**: Use `JSON.parse()` instead\n\n### Issue #3: $.trim is not a function\n**Error**: `TypeError: $.trim is not a function`\n**Source**: https://jquery.com/upgrade-guide/4.0/\n**Why It Happens**: Native String.prototype.trim available everywhere\n**Prevention**: Use `str.trim()` or `String.prototype.trim.call(str)`\n\n### Issue #4: Focus events fire in wrong order\n**Error**: Unexpected behavior in form validation\n**Source**: https://blog.jquery.com/2026/01/17/jquery-4-0-0/\n**Why It Happens**: jQuery 4.0 follows W3C spec, not legacy order\n**Prevention**: Test and update event handlers that depend on order\n\n### Issue #5: Deferreds undefined in slim build\n**Error**: `TypeError: $.Deferred is not a function`\n**Source**: https://blog.jquery.com/2026/01/17/jquery-4-0-0/\n**Why It Happens**: Removed from slim build in 4.0\n**Prevention**: Use full build or native Promises\n\n### Issue #6: Scripts not executing from AJAX\n**Error**: Script loaded but not executed\n**Source**: https://jquery.com/upgrade-guide/4.0/\n**Why It Happens**: Auto-execution disabled without explicit dataType\n**Prevention**: Add `dataType: ''script''` to AJAX options\n\n### Issue #7: toggleClass not working\n**Error**: `toggleClass(true)` has no effect\n**Source**: https://jquery.com/upgrade-guide/4.0/\n**Why It Happens**: Boolean signature removed\n**Prevention**: Use addClass/removeClass or toggleClass with class names\n\n### Issue #8: WordPress plugin conflicts\n**Error**: Various \"is not a function\" errors\n**Source**: Common in WordPress ecosystem\n**Why It Happens**: Plugins using removed jQuery methods\n**Prevention**: Audit plugins with jquery-migrate before upgrading\n\n---\n\n## Browser Support\n\n### Supported in jQuery 4.0\n\n- Chrome (last 3 versions)\n- Firefox (last 2 versions + ESR)\n- Safari (last 3 versions)\n- Edge (Chromium-based)\n- iOS Safari (last 3 versions)\n- Android Chrome (last 3 versions)\n\n### Dropped Support\n\n- IE 10 and older (IE 11 supported until jQuery 5.0)\n- Edge Legacy (EdgeHTML)\n- Very old mobile browsers\n\n---\n\n## Slim vs Full Build Comparison\n\n| Feature | Full Build | Slim Build |\n|---------|-----------|------------|\n| Size (gzipped) | ~27.5k | ~19.5k |\n| DOM Manipulation | Yes | Yes |\n| Events | Yes | Yes |\n| AJAX | Yes | No |\n| Effects/Animation | Yes | No |\n| Deferreds | Yes | No |\n| Callbacks | Yes | No |\n\n**Use slim build when**: Static sites, no AJAX needs, using native fetch/Promises\n\n**Use full build when**: WordPress, AJAX-heavy apps, need $.animate or Deferreds\n\n---\n\n## Migration Checklist\n\n- [ ] Add jquery-migrate@4.0.2 to development\n- [ ] Run full site test, check console for warnings\n- [ ] Replace $.isArray() with Array.isArray()\n- [ ] Replace $.parseJSON() with JSON.parse()\n- [ ] Replace $.trim() with str.trim()\n- [ ] Replace $.now() with Date.now()\n- [ ] Replace $.type() with native type checking\n- [ ] Replace $.isFunction() with typeof check\n- [ ] Replace $.isNumeric() with isNaN/isFinite check\n- [ ] Update toggleClass(boolean) usage\n- [ ] Add dataType to script AJAX calls\n- [ ] Test focus/blur event order\n- [ ] Audit WordPress plugins if applicable\n- [ ] Remove jquery-migrate after fixing all issues\n- [ ] Upgrade to jquery@4.0.0 in production\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **jQuery 4.0.0 Release**: https://blog.jquery.com/2026/01/17/jquery-4-0-0/\n- **Upgrade Guide**: https://jquery.com/upgrade-guide/4.0/\n- **jQuery Migrate Plugin**: https://github.com/jquery/jquery-migrate\n- **API Documentation**: https://api.jquery.com/\n- **npm Package**: https://www.npmjs.com/package/jquery\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-25)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"jquery\": \"^4.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"jquery-migrate\": \"^4.0.2\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: WordPress admin breaks after jQuery upgrade\n**Solution**: Only upgrade frontend jQuery. Admin uses its own version. Use conditional logic to avoid affecting wp-admin.\n\n### Problem: Third-party plugins stop working\n**Solution**: Keep jquery-migrate loaded until plugins are updated. Check plugin changelogs for jQuery 4.0 compatibility updates.\n\n### Problem: AJAX requests work but scripts don''t execute\n**Solution**: Add `dataType: ''script''` to $.ajax options or use $.getScript() for script loading.\n\n### Problem: Form validation fires at wrong times\n**Solution**: Review focus/blur/focusin/focusout handlers. jQuery 4.0 fires: blur → focusout → focus → focusin (W3C order).\n\n---\n\n**Questions? Issues?**\n\n1. Check console for jquery-migrate warnings\n2. Review upgrade guide: https://jquery.com/upgrade-guide/4.0/\n3. Check jQuery GitHub issues: https://github.com/jquery/jquery/issues\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:11:56.935Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing seamless jQuery 4.0 migration and compatibility testing.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝迁移至jQuery 4.0并进行兼容性测试的前端代理。","ja":"jQuery 4.0 への無縫な移行と互換性テストが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"jQuery 4.0으로의 무縫한 마이그레이션과 호환성 테스트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una migración y prueba de compatibilidad de jQuery 4.0 sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une migration et de tests de compatibilité de jQuery 4.0 sans heurts.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine reibungslose jQuery 4.0-Migration und Kompatibilitätstests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de uma migração sem problemas para o jQuery 4.0 e testes de compatibilidade.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима бесперебойная миграция на jQuery 4.0 и тестирование на совместимость.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى هجرة بدون مشاكل إلى jQuery 4.0 واختبار التوافق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify compatibility issues using the jQuery Migrate Plugin, ensuring smooth transitions to jquery@4.0.0 and leveraging the latest features of jquery-migrate@4.0.2 for production-ready deployments.","zh":"赋予代理识别兼容性问题的能力，使用jQuery迁移插件，确保到jquery@4.0.0的平稳过渡，并利用jquery-migrate@4.0.2的最新功能实现生产就绪的部署。","ja":"jQuery Migrate Plugin を使用して、エージェントが互換性の問題を識別できるようにし、jquery@4.0.0 へのスムーズな移行を確実にし、jquery-migrate@4.0.2 の最新の機能を利用して、生产就绪のデプロイを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 jQuery Migrate Plugin을 사용하여 호환성 문제를 식별할 수 있도록 하여 jquery@4.0.0으로의 무縫한 전환을 보장하고, jquery-migrate@4.0.2의 최신 기능을 활용하여 생산 준비가 된 배포를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de compatibilidad utilizando el plugin jQuery Migrate, garantizando transiciones suaves a jquery@4.0.0 y aprovechando las últimas características de jquery-migrate@4.0.2 para implementaciones listas para producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de compatibilité en utilisant le plugin jQuery Migrate, assurant ainsi des transitions en douceur vers jquery@4.0.0 et exploitant les dernières fonctionnalités de jquery-migrate@4.0.2 pour des déploiements prêts pour la production.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Kompatibilitätsprobleme mit Hilfe des jQuery Migrate-Plugins zu identifizieren, was einen reibungslosen Übergang zu jquery@4.0.0 gewährleistet und die neuesten Funktionen von jquery-migrate@4.0.2 für produktionsbereite Bereitstellungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de compatibilidade usando o Plug-in jQuery Migrate, garantindo transições suaves para jquery@4.0.0 e aproveitando os recursos mais recentes do jquery-migrate@4.0.2 para implantações prontas para produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы совместимости с помощью плагина jQuery Migrate, обеспечивая плавные переходы на jquery@4.0.0 и используя последние функции jquery-migrate@4.0.2 для развертываний, готовых к производству.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد مشكلات التوافق باستخدام مكون إضافي jQuery Migrate ، مما يضمن الانتقالات السلسة إلى jquery@4.0.0 و الاستفادة من أحدث الميزات من jquery-migrate@4.0.2 للنشر الجاهز للانتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating legacy jQuery code to version 4.0","Debugging deprecated features with the jQuery Migrate Plugin","Testing cross-browser compatibility with jQuery 4.0"],"zh":["将遗留的jQuery代码迁移到版本4.0","使用jQuery迁移插件调试弃用的功能","使用jQuery 4.0测试跨浏览器兼容性"],"ja":["レガシーのjQueryコードをバージョン4.0に移行する","jQuery Migrate Pluginを使用して廃止された機能をデバッグする","jQuery 4.0を使用してクロスブラウザの互換性をテストする"],"ko":["레거시 jQuery 코드를 버전 4.0으로 마이그레이션하는 것","jQuery Migrate Plugin을 사용하여 사용 중단된 기능을 디버깅하는 것","jQuery 4.0을 사용하여 크로스 브라우저 호환성을 테스트하는 것"],"es":["Migrar código legacy de jQuery a la versión 4.0","Depurar características obsoletas con el plugin jQuery Migrate","Probar la compatibilidad entre navegadores con jQuery 4.0"],"fr":["Migrer le code legacy de jQuery vers la version 4.0","Déboguer les fonctionnalités obsolètes avec le plugin jQuery Migrate","Tester la compatibilité multi-navigateurs avec jQuery 4.0"],"de":["Legacy-JQuery-Code auf Version 4.0 migrieren","Veraltete Funktionen mit dem jQuery Migrate-Plugin debuggen","Cross-Browser-Kompatibilität mit jQuery 4.0 testen"],"pt":["Migrar código legado jQuery para a versão 4.0","Depurar recursos obsoletos com o Plug-in jQuery Migrate","Testar a compatibilidade entre navegadores com jQuery 4.0"],"ru":["Мигрировать устаревший код jQuery в версию 4.0","Отлаживать устаревшие функции с помощью плагина jQuery Migrate","Тестировать кросс-браузерную совместимость с jQuery 4.0"],"ar":["هجرة رمز jQuery القديم إلى الإصدار 4.0","تصحيح الأخطاء في الميزات المعفاة من الإصدار باستخدام مكون إضافي jQuery Migrate","اختبار التوافق بين المتصفحات مع jQuery 4.0"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires jQuery Migrate Plugin for compatibility testing","Dependent on specific versions of jquery and jquery-migrate libraries"],"zh":["需要jQuery迁移插件进行兼容性测试","依赖于特定版本的jquery和jquery-migrate库"],"ja":["互換性テストにはjQuery Migrate Pluginが必要","特定のバージョンのjqueryとjquery-migrateライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["호환성 테스트를 위해 jQuery Migrate Plugin이 필요","특정 버전의 jquery와 jquery-migrate 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el plugin jQuery Migrate para pruebas de compatibilidad","Depende de versiones específicas de las bibliotecas jquery y jquery-migrate"],"fr":["Nécessite le plugin jQuery Migrate pour les tests de compatibilité","Dépend de versions spécifiques des bibliothèques jquery et jquery-migrate"],"de":["Benötigt das jQuery Migrate-Plugin für Kompatibilitätstests","Hängt von bestimmten Versionen der Bibliotheken jquery und jquery-migrate ab"],"pt":["Requer o Plug-in jQuery Migrate para testes de compatibilidade","Depende de versões específicas das bibliotecas jquery e jquery-migrate"],"ru":["Требует плагина jQuery Migrate для тестирования на совместимость","Зависит от конкретных версий библиотек jquery и jquery-migrate"],"ar":["يتطلب مكون إضافي jQuery Migrate لاختبار التوافق","يعتمد على إصدارات محددة من مكتبات jquery و jquery-migrate"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dseirz-rgb/worker/multi-service-debug', 'community', 'dseirz-rgb', 'worker', 'dseirz-rgb/worker', 'multi-service-debug', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:12:03.090Z', NULL, '{"id":"dseirz-rgb/worker/multi-service-debug","name":"multi-service-debug","description":{"zh":"多服务调试技能是用于分布式系统调试的技能，通过画调用链和分析多服务日志来定位问题根因","ja":"マルチサービスデバッグスキルは、分散型システムのデバッグに使用されるスキルで、呼び出し链を描き、複数サービスのログを分析して問題の根本原因を特定する","ko":"다중 서비스 디버깅 스킬은 분산 시스템 디버깅에 사용되는 스킬로 호출 체인을 그리며 다중 서비스 로그를 분석하여 문제의 근본 원인을 식별","es":"La depuración de multi-servicio es una técnica para identificar y solucionar problemas en sistemas distribuidos","fr":"Le débogage de multi-service est une technique pour identifier et résoudre les problèmes dans les systèmes distribués","de":"Das Mehrdienst-Debugging ist eine Technik zur Identifizierung und Lösung von Problemen in verteilten Systemen","pt":"A depuração de multi-serviço é uma técnica para solucionar problemas de chamadas entre serviços. Ela envolve a análise de logs de múltiplos serviços para identificar a causa raiz de um problema.","ru":"Мульти-сервисная отладка - это техника для решения проблем вызовов между сервисами. Она включает в себя анализ логов нескольких сервисов для определения коренной причины проблемы.","ar":"تصحيح أخطاء الخدمة المتعددة هو تقنية لحل مشاكل الاتصال بين الخدمات. يتضمن تحليل سجلات الخدمات المتعددة لتحديد السبب الجذري للمشكلة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"多服务调试技能","ja":"マルチサービスデバッグスキル","ko":"다중 서비스 디버깅 스킬","es":"Depuración de Multi-Servicio","fr":"Débogage de Multi-Service","de":"Mehrdienst-Debugging","pt":"Depuração de Multi-Serviço: Solucione Problemas de Chamadas","ru":"Мульти-Сервисная Отладка: Решение Проблем Вызовов","ar":"تصحيح أخطاء الخدمة المتعددة: حل مشاكل الاتصال","en":"multi-service-debug"},"description":{"zh":"多服务调试技能是用于分布式系统调试的技能，通过画调用链和分析多服务日志来定位问题根因","ja":"マルチサービスデバッグスキルは、分散型システムのデバッグに使用されるスキルで、呼び出し链を描き、複数サービスのログを分析して問題の根本原因を特定する","ko":"다중 서비스 디버깅 스킬은 분산 시스템 디버깅에 사용되는 스킬로 호출 체인을 그리며 다중 서비스 로그를 분석하여 문제의 근본 원인을 식별","es":"La depuración de multi-servicio es una técnica para identificar y solucionar problemas en sistemas distribuidos","fr":"Le débogage de multi-service est une technique pour identifier et résoudre les problèmes dans les systèmes distribués","de":"Das Mehrdienst-Debugging ist eine Technik zur Identifizierung und Lösung von Problemen in verteilten Systemen","pt":"A depuração de multi-serviço é uma técnica para solucionar problemas de chamadas entre serviços. Ela envolve a análise de logs de múltiplos serviços para ide...","ru":"Мульти-сервисная отладка - это техника для решения проблем вызовов между сервисами. Она включает в себя анализ логов нескольких сервисов для определения коре...","ar":"تصحيح أخطاء الخدمة المتعددة هو تقنية لحل مشاكل الاتصال بين الخدمات. يتضمن تحليل سجلات الخدمات المتعددة لتحديد السبب الجذري للمشكلة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分布式系统调试","多服务日志关联","调用链分析","性能瓶颈定位","网络问题排查"],"ja":["分散型システムのデバッグ","複数サービスのログ関連","呼び出し链分析","パフォーマンスボトルネックの特定","ネットワーク問題の解決"],"ko":["분산 시스템 디버깅","다중 서비스 로그 연관성","호출 체인 분석","성능 병목 현상 식별","네트워크 문제 해결"],"es":["Análisis de llamadas entre servicios","Depuración de problemas de comunicación entre servicios","Identificación de cuellos de botella en el rendimiento","Solución de problemas de timeout y conexión","Verificación del estado de salud de los servicios"],"fr":["Analyse des appels entre services","Débogage des problèmes de communication entre services","Identification des goulots d''étranglement dans les performances","Résolution des problèmes de timeout et de connexion","Vérification de l''état de santé des services"],"de":["Analyse von Aufrufen zwischen Diensten","Fehlerbehebung bei Kommunikationsproblemen zwischen Diensten","Identifizierung von Engpässen bei der Leistung","Behebung von Timeout- und Verbindungsproblemen","Überprüfung des Gesundheitszustands der Dienste"],"pt":["Análise de logs de múltiplos serviços","Identificação da causa raiz de problemas","Solução de problemas de chamadas entre serviços","Melhoria da performance e redução de erros","Análise de tráfego de rede e comunicação entre serviços"],"ru":["Анализ логов нескольких сервисов","Определение коренной причины проблем","Решение проблем вызовов между сервисами","Повышение производительности и снижение ошибок","Анализ сетевого трафика и коммуникации между сервисами"],"ar":["تحليل سجلات الخدمات المتعددة","تحديد السبب الجذري للمشاكل","حل مشاكل الاتصال بين الخدمات","تحسين الأداء وتقليل الأخطاء","تحليل حركة المرور الشبكية والاتصالات بين الخدمات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["分布式系统","多服务调试","日志关联","调用链分析","性能优化","网络问题"],"ja":["分散型システム","マルチサービスデバッグ","ログ関連","呼び出し链分析","パフォーマンス最適化","ネットワーク問題"],"ko":["분산 시스템","다중 서비스 디버깅","로그 연관성","호출 체인 분석","성능 최적화","네트워크 문제"],"es":["depuración de multi-servicio","sistemas distribuidos","análisis de llamadas","depuración de problemas","rendimiento","timeout","conexión","estado de salud"],"fr":["débogage de multi-service","systèmes distribués","analyse des appels","débogage des problèmes","performances","timeout","connexion","état de santé"],"de":["Mehrdienst-Debugging","verteilte Systeme","Aufrufanalyse","Fehlerbehebung","Leistung","Timeout","Verbindung","Gesundheitszustand"],"pt":["depuração de multi-serviço","solução de problemas de chamadas","análise de logs","identificação de causa raiz","melhoria da performance","redução de erros","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["мульти-сервисная отладка","решение проблем вызовов","анализ логов","определение коренной причины","повышение производительности","снижение ошибок","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الخدمة المتعددة","حل مشاكل الاتصال","تحليل سجلات","تحديد السبب الجذري","تحسين الأداء","تقليل الأخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"dseirz-rgb","repo":"worker","repoPath":"dseirz-rgb/worker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"multi-service-debug","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Multi-Service Debug (多服务调试)\n\n> 🔍 **核心理念**: 分布式系统调试需要全局视角。单点日志不够，必须关联多服务日志才能定位根因。\n\n## 🔴 第一原则：先画调用链，再看日志\n\n**调试分布式问题必须先理清服务调用关系！**\n\n```\n❌ 错误思路: \"报错了，看看这个服务的日志\"\n✅ 正确思路: \"报错了，先画出请求经过哪些服务，再逐个检查\"\n\n❌ 错误思路: \"这个服务没问题，肯定是那个服务的问题\"  \n✅ 正确思路: \"先确认请求是否正确到达，再判断是哪个环节出问题\"\n```\n\n**调试优先级**: 网络连通性 > 请求格式 > 服务逻辑 > 资源限制\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n使用此技能当你需要：\n- 排查跨服务调用失败的问题\n- 聚合分析多个服务的日志\n- 调试服务间通信（HTTP/WebSocket）\n- 定位生产环境的性能瓶颈\n- 排查超时、连接失败等网络问题\n- 验证服务健康状态\n\n## Not For / Boundaries\n\n此技能不适用于：\n- 单服务内部的业务逻辑调试\n- 前端 UI 渲染问题","body":"# Multi-Service Debug (多服务调试)\n\n> 🔍 **核心理念**: 分布式系统调试需要全局视角。单点日志不够，必须关联多服务日志才能定位根因。\n\n## 🔴 第一原则：先画调用链，再看日志\n\n**调试分布式问题必须先理清服务调用关系！**\n\n```\n❌ 错误思路: \"报错了，看看这个服务的日志\"\n✅ 正确思路: \"报错了，先画出请求经过哪些服务，再逐个检查\"\n\n❌ 错误思路: \"这个服务没问题，肯定是那个服务的问题\"  \n✅ 正确思路: \"先确认请求是否正确到达，再判断是哪个环节出问题\"\n```\n\n**调试优先级**: 网络连通性 > 请求格式 > 服务逻辑 > 资源限制\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n使用此技能当你需要：\n- 排查跨服务调用失败的问题\n- 聚合分析多个服务的日志\n- 调试服务间通信（HTTP/WebSocket）\n- 定位生产环境的性能瓶颈\n- 排查超时、连接失败等网络问题\n- 验证服务健康状态\n\n## Not For / Boundaries\n\n此技能不适用于：\n- 单服务内部的业务逻辑调试\n- 前端 UI 渲染问题\n- 数据库查询优化（参考 performance-optimization skill）\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 🏗️ 项目服务架构\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         用户浏览器                               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                │\n                                ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Vercel (前端 + API)                          │\n│  ┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n│  │   React SPA     │    │   Serverless Functions (/api/*)     │ │\n│  │   (client/)     │    │   - /api/health                     │ │\n│  │                 │    │   - /api/chat                       │ │\n│  │                 │    │   - /api/documents                  │ │\n│  │                 │    │   - /api/unified-intelligence/*     │ │\n│  └─────────────────┘    └─────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                │\n                ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐\n                ▼               ▼               ▼\n┌───────────────────┐ ┌───────────────────┐ ┌───────────────────┐\n│   LightRAG        │ │   Voice Service   │ │   Quant Service   │\n│   (Cloud Run)     │ │   (Cloud Run)     │ │   (Cloud Run)     │\n│                   │ │                   │ │                   │\n│   Port: 9621      │ │   Port: 8080      │ │   Port: 6900      │\n│   Python/FastAPI  │ │   Python/LiveKit  │ │   Python/FastAPI  │\n└───────────────────┘ └───────────────────┘ └───────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 📋 服务端点速查\n\n| 服务 | 本地端口 | 生产 URL | 健康检查 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| Vercel API | 3000 | `https://your-app.vercel.app` | `/api/health` |\n| LightRAG | 9621 | `lightrag-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app` | `/health` |\n| Voice | 8080 | `voice-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app` | `/health` |\n| Quant | 6900 | `quant-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app` | `/health` |\n\n### 🔍 快速诊断命令\n\n```bash\n# 1. 检查所有服务健康状态\ncurl -s https://your-app.vercel.app/api/health | jq\ncurl -s https://lightrag-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/health | jq\ncurl -s https://voice-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/health | jq\ncurl -s https://quant-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/health | jq\n\n# 2. 查看 GCP 服务日志\ngcloud logging read \"resource.type=cloud_run_revision\" --limit=50 --format=json | jq\n\n# 3. 查看特定服务日志\ngcloud logging read \"resource.labels.service_name=lightrag-service\" --limit=20\n```\n\n---\n\n## 多服务调试工作流\n\n### Phase 1: 问题定位\n\n```\n1. 确认问题现象（错误信息、HTTP 状态码）\n2. 画出请求调用链\n3. 确定问题发生在哪个服务之间\n4. 收集相关时间点的日志\n```\n\n### Phase 2: 日志聚合\n\n```bash\n# 设置时间范围（问题发生前后 5 分钟）\nSTART_TIME=\"2025-01-01T10:00:00Z\"\nEND_TIME=\"2025-01-01T10:10:00Z\"\n\n# 聚合所有 Cloud Run 服务日志\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.type=cloud_run_revision AND timestamp>=\\\"$START_TIME\\\" AND timestamp<=\\\"$END_TIME\\\"\" \\\n  --format=\"table(timestamp,resource.labels.service_name,textPayload)\" \\\n  --order=asc\n```\n\n### Phase 3: 关联分析\n\n```\n1. 按时间排序所有日志\n2. 找到请求入口日志\n3. 追踪请求 ID（如果有）\n4. 找到错误发生点\n5. 分析上下文日志\n```\n\n### Phase 4: 验证修复\n\n```\n1. 本地复现问题\n2. 应用修复\n3. 本地验证\n4. 部署到生产\n5. 生产验证\n```\n\n---\n\n## 日志聚合分析\n\n### 📊 GCP Cloud Run 日志查询\n\n```bash\n# 查看所有服务的错误日志\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.type=cloud_run_revision AND severity>=ERROR\" \\\n  --limit=50 \\\n  --format=\"table(timestamp,resource.labels.service_name,textPayload)\"\n\n# 查看特定服务的详细日志\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.labels.service_name=lightrag-service\" \\\n  --limit=100 \\\n  --format=json | jq ''.[] | {time: .timestamp, msg: .textPayload}''\n\n# 按关键词搜索日志\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.type=cloud_run_revision AND textPayload:\\\"error\\\"\" \\\n  --limit=50\n```\n\n### 📊 Vercel 日志查询\n\n```bash\n# 查看最近部署的日志\nvercel logs <deployment-url> --follow\n\n# 查看函数执行日志\nvercel logs <deployment-url> --output=raw | grep -i error\n```\n\n### 📊 日志关联技巧\n\n```typescript\n// 在请求中添加 trace ID\nconst traceId = crypto.randomUUID();\n\n// 传递给下游服务\nfetch(LIGHTRAG_URL, {\n  headers: {\n    ''X-Trace-ID'': traceId,\n    ''X-Request-Time'': new Date().toISOString(),\n  }\n});\n\n// 在日志中包含 trace ID\nconsole.log(`[${traceId}] Processing request...`);\n```\n\n---\n\n## 服务间通信调试\n\n### 🔗 HTTP 调用调试\n\n```bash\n# 测试 Vercel -> LightRAG 通信\ncurl -v -X POST https://lightrag-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/query \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"query\": \"test\"}''\n\n# 检查响应时间\ncurl -w \"@curl-format.txt\" -s -o /dev/null \\\n  https://lightrag-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/health\n\n# curl-format.txt 内容:\n#   time_namelookup:  %{time_namelookup}s\\n\n#   time_connect:     %{time_connect}s\\n\n#   time_appconnect:  %{time_appconnect}s\\n\n#   time_pretransfer: %{time_pretransfer}s\\n\n#   time_redirect:    %{time_redirect}s\\n\n#   time_starttransfer: %{time_starttransfer}s\\n\n#   time_total:       %{time_total}s\\n\n```\n\n### 🔗 WebSocket 调试 (Voice Service)\n\n```bash\n# 使用 websocat 测试 WebSocket 连接\nwebsocat wss://voice-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/ws\n\n# 或使用 wscat\nnpx wscat -c wss://voice-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/ws\n```\n\n### 🔗 常见通信问题\n\n| 问题 | 症状 | 排查方向 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| 连接超时 | `ETIMEDOUT` | 检查网络、防火墙、服务是否运行 |\n| 连接拒绝 | `ECONNREFUSED` | 检查端口、服务状态 |\n| SSL 错误 | `CERT_*` | 检查证书配置 |\n| 502 Bad Gateway | 上游服务错误 | 检查目标服务日志 |\n| 503 Service Unavailable | 服务过载 | 检查资源限制、扩容 |\n| CORS 错误 | 跨域被拒绝 | 检查 CORS 配置 |\n\n---\n\n## 常见问题排查\n\n### 🔴 问题 1: Vercel API 调用 Cloud Run 超时\n\n**症状**: API 返回 504 Gateway Timeout\n\n**排查步骤**:\n```bash\n# 1. 检查 Cloud Run 服务状态\ngcloud run services describe lightrag-service --region=us-central1\n\n# 2. 检查服务日志\ngcloud logging read \"resource.labels.service_name=lightrag-service\" --limit=20\n\n# 3. 检查冷启动时间\n# 如果服务长时间未访问，可能需要预热\n\n# 4. 检查 Vercel 函数超时配置\n# vercel.json 中的 maxDuration 设置\n```\n\n**解决方案**:\n- 增加 Vercel 函数超时时间\n- 设置 Cloud Run 最小实例数避免冷启动\n- 优化服务启动时间\n\n### 🔴 问题 2: 服务间认证失败\n\n**症状**: 返回 401 Unauthorized 或 403 Forbidden\n\n**排查步骤**:\n```bash\n# 1. 检查服务是否需要认证\ngcloud run services describe <service> --format=\"yaml(spec.template.metadata.annotations)\"\n\n# 2. 检查 IAM 权限\ngcloud run services get-iam-policy <service>\n\n# 3. 检查请求头中的认证信息\ncurl -v -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" https://service-url/endpoint\n```\n\n**解决方案**:\n- 配置服务允许未认证访问（公开服务）\n- 或配置正确的服务账号和 IAM 权限\n\n### 🔴 问题 3: 环境变量不一致\n\n**症状**: 本地正常，生产报错\n\n**排查步骤**:\n```bash\n# 1. 检查 Vercel 环境变量\nvercel env ls\n\n# 2. 检查 Cloud Run 环境变量\ngcloud run services describe <service> \\\n  --format=\"yaml(spec.template.spec.containers[0].env)\"\n\n# 3. 对比本地 .env 文件\ncat .env | grep -E \"^[A-Z]\"\n```\n\n**解决方案**:\n- 同步所有环境变量\n- 使用 Secret Manager 管理敏感配置\n\n### 🔴 问题 4: 内存/CPU 不足\n\n**症状**: 服务频繁重启、OOM 错误\n\n**排查步骤**:\n```bash\n# 1. 查看资源使用情况\ngcloud run services describe <service> \\\n  --format=\"yaml(spec.template.spec.containers[0].resources)\"\n\n# 2. 查看 OOM 日志\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.labels.service_name=<service> AND textPayload:\\\"OOM\\\"\"\n\n# 3. 查看 GCP Console Metrics\n# Cloud Run > 服务 > Metrics > Memory utilization\n```\n\n**解决方案**:\n- 增加内存配置\n- 优化代码减少内存使用\n- 添加内存监控告警\n\n---\n\n## 调试工具推荐\n\n### 🛠️ 命令行工具\n\n| 工具 | 用途 | 安装 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `gcloud` | GCP 服务管理 | `brew install google-cloud-sdk` |\n| `vercel` | Vercel 部署管理 | `npm i -g vercel` |\n| `jq` | JSON 处理 | `brew install jq` |\n| `websocat` | WebSocket 调试 | `brew install websocat` |\n| `httpie` | HTTP 调试 | `brew install httpie` |\n\n### 🛠️ 浏览器工具\n\n- **Network 面板**: 查看请求/响应详情\n- **Console 面板**: 查看前端日志\n- **Application 面板**: 查看存储、Cookie\n\n### 🛠️ 监控工具\n\n- **GCP Cloud Monitoring**: 服务指标、告警\n- **Vercel Analytics**: 前端性能、函数执行\n- **Sentry**: 错误追踪（如已集成）\n\n---\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: 排查 LightRAG 查询失败\n\n**场景**: 用户报告文档搜索功能返回错误\n\n**Steps**:\n```bash\n# 1. 确认问题 - 检查 Vercel API 日志\nvercel logs <deployment-url> | grep -i lightrag\n\n# 2. 检查 LightRAG 服务状态\ncurl -s https://lightrag-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/health | jq\n\n# 3. 查看 LightRAG 服务日志\ngcloud logging read \"resource.labels.service_name=lightrag-service\" --limit=20\n\n# 4. 本地复现\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:9621/query \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"query\": \"test query\"}''\n\n# 5. 修复并验证\n# ... 修复代码 ...\n# 重新部署后验证\n```\n\n### Example 2: 排查 Voice 服务 WebSocket 断连\n\n**场景**: 语音对话频繁断开\n\n**Steps**:\n```bash\n# 1. 检查 WebSocket 连接\nwebsocat wss://voice-service-xxx-uc.a.run.app/ws\n\n# 2. 查看服务日志\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.labels.service_name=voice-service AND textPayload:\\\"disconnect\\\"\" \\\n  --limit=50\n\n# 3. 检查资源限制\ngcloud run services describe voice-service \\\n  --format=\"yaml(spec.template.spec.containers[0].resources)\"\n\n# 4. 检查并发连接数\n# GCP Console > Cloud Run > voice-service > Metrics\n```\n\n### Example 3: 全链路性能分析\n\n**场景**: 用户反馈页面加载慢\n\n**Steps**:\n```bash\n# 1. 测量各服务响应时间\nfor service in \"vercel-app\" \"lightrag-service\" \"quant-service\"; do\n  echo \"Testing $service...\"\n  curl -w \"Total: %{time_total}s\\n\" -s -o /dev/null \\\n    \"https://$service-xxx.run.app/health\"\ndone\n\n# 2. 分析慢请求\ngcloud logging read \\\n  \"resource.type=cloud_run_revision AND httpRequest.latency>\\\"1s\\\"\" \\\n  --limit=20\n\n# 3. 检查数据库查询时间\n# 查看 Supabase Dashboard > Database > Query Performance\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- `references/service-map.md`: 服务依赖关系图、端口和端点清单\n- `references/log-queries.md`: 常用日志查询命令集合\n- `references/troubleshooting-checklist.md`: 故障排查检查清单\n\n---\n\n## Maintenance\n\n- **Sources**: GCP Cloud Run 文档, Vercel 文档, 项目实践经验\n- **Last Updated**: 2025-01-01\n- **Known Limits**: \n  - 日志查询依赖 `gcloud` CLI 认证\n  - 某些调试需要相应的 GCP/Vercel 访问权限\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:12:03.090Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Distributed System Agents needing advanced multi-service debugging capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级多服务调试功能的分布式系统代理。","ja":"高度なマルチサービスデバッグ機能を必要とする分散システムエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 멀티 서비스 디버깅 기능을 필요로 하는 분산 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Sistemas Distribuidos que necesitan capacidades de depuración avanzadas de varios servicios.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Systèmes Distribués ayant besoin de capacités de débogage avancées de plusieurs services.","de":"Perfekt für Distributed System Agents, die erweiterte Multi-Service-Debugging-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas Distribuídos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de depuração de vários serviços.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов распределенных систем, которым требуются продвинутые возможности отладки нескольких сервисов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل نظام موزع بحاجة إلى إمكانيات فحص متقدمة متعددة الخدمات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug complex distributed systems by analyzing logs from multiple services, identifying root causes, and optimizing system performance using protocols like HTTP and WebSocket.","zh":"通过分析多个服务的日志、识别根本原因并使用HTTP和WebSocket等协议优化系统性能，赋予代理调试复杂分布式系统的能力。","ja":"複数のサービスからログを分析し、根本原因を特定し、HTTPやWebSocketなどのプロトコルを使用してシステムパフォーマンスを最適化することで、エージェントが複雑な分散システムのデバッグを行う能力を提供します。","ko":"複数의 서비스에서 로그를 분석하고根本 원인을 식별하며 HTTP와 WebSocket 등을 사용하여 시스템 성능을 최적화함으로써 에이전트가 복잡한 분산 시스템을 디버깅할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar sistemas distribuidos complejos analizando registros de varios servicios, identificando las causas raíz y optimizando el rendimiento del sistema utilizando protocolos como HTTP y WebSocket.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer des systèmes distribués complexes en analysant les journaux de plusieurs services, en identifiant les causes profondes et en optimisant les performances du système à l''aide de protocoles tels que HTTP et WebSocket.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe verteilte Systeme zu debuggen, indem sie Protokolle aus mehreren Diensten analysieren, die Ursachen identifizieren und die Systemleistung mit Protokollen wie HTTP und WebSocket optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurarem sistemas distribuídos complexos analisando logs de vários serviços, identificando as causas raiz e otimizando o desempenho do sistema usando protocolos como HTTP e WebSocket.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отлаживать сложные распределенные системы, анализируя логи нескольких сервисов, определяя корневые причины и оптимизируя производительность системы с использованием протоколов, таких как HTTP и WebSocket.","ar":"تمكين العميل من فحص الأنظمة الموزعة المعقدة عن طريق تحليل سجلات الخدمات المتعددة، وتحديد الأسباب الجذرية، وضبط أداء النظام باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و WebSocket."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging cross-service call failures","Aggregating and analyzing logs from multiple services","Identifying performance bottlenecks in production environments","Troubleshooting network connectivity issues and timeouts"],"zh":["跨服务调用故障的调试","聚合和分析多个服务的日志","在生产环境中识别性能瓶颈","故障排除网络连接问题和超时"],"ja":["クロスサービス呼び出しの故障のデバッグ","複数のサービスのログを集約し分析する","生産環境でのパフォーマンスボトルネックの特定","ネットワーク接続の問題とタイムアウトのトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["크로스 서비스 호출 실패의 디버깅","複数의 서비스에서 로그를 집약하고 분석하는 것","제작 환경에서 성능 병목 현상을 식별하는 것","네트워크 연결 문제와 시간 초과를 위한 문제 해결"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de llamadas entre servicios","Agregación y análisis de registros de varios servicios","Identificación de cuellos de botella de rendimiento en entornos de producción","Solución de problemas de conectividad de red y tiempos de espera"],"fr":["Débogage des défaillances d''appels entre services","Regroupement et analyse des journaux de plusieurs services","Identification des goulots d''étranglement des performances dans les environnements de production","Dépannage des problèmes de connectivité réseau et des délais d''attente"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Fehlern von Anrufen zwischen Diensten","Zusammenfassung und Analyse von Protokollen aus mehreren Diensten","Identifizierung von Leistungsengpässen in Produktionsumgebungen","Behebung von Netzwerkverbindungsproblemen und Timeouts"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de chamadas entre serviços","Agregação e análise de logs de vários serviços","Identificação de gargalos de desempenho em ambientes de produção","Solução de problemas de conectividade de rede e timeouts"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев межсервисных вызовов","Агрегация и анализ логов нескольких сервисов","Определение узких мест производительности в производственных средах","Устранение неполадок с сетевой связью и таймаутами"],"ar":["فحص فشل الاتصالات بين الخدمات","تجميع وتحليل سجلات الخدمات المتعددة","تحديد معوقات الأداء في بيئات الإنتاج","حل مشاكل الاتصال الشبكي وتجاوزات الوقت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for single-service internal business logic debugging","Not applicable for frontend UI rendering issues"],"zh":["不适用于单服务内部业务逻辑调试","不适用于前端UI渲染问题"],"ja":["シングルサービスの内部ビジネスロジックのデバッグに不適切","フロントエンドUIレンダリングの問題には適用不可"],"ko":["단일 서비스의 내부 비즈니스 로직 디버깅에 적합하지 않음","프론트엔드 UI 렌더링 문제에는 적용할 수 없음"],"es":["No es adecuado para la depuración de la lógica de negocio interna de un solo servicio","No es aplicable para problemas de representación de la interfaz de usuario frontend"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté au débogage de la logique commerciale interne d''un seul service","N''est pas applicable pour les problèmes de rendu de l''interface utilisateur frontend"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für die Fehlersuche in der internen Geschäftslogik eines einzelnen Dienstes","Nicht anwendbar für Probleme mit der Darstellung der Benutzeroberfläche frontend"],"pt":["Não é adequado para depuração de lógica de negócios interna de serviço único","Não se aplica a problemas de renderização de interface do usuário frontend"],"ru":["Не подходит для отладки внутренней логики бизнеса одного сервиса","Не применимо к проблемам отрисовки интерфейса пользователя на стороне клиента"],"ar":["لا يناسب فحص منطق العمل الداخلي لخدمة واحدة","لا ينطبق على مشاكل عرض واجهة المستخدم الأمامي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
