motores de búsqueda de IA","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","entidades y datos en la optimización"],"fr":["GEO Fundamentals","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche IA","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","entités et données dans l''optimisation"],"de":["GEO Fundamentals","Optimierung für KI-Suchmaschinen","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","Entitäten und Daten in der Optimierung"],"pt":["otimização geo","mecanismos de busca de ia","desenvolvedores","antigravity ide","ide compatível","cli compatível","visibilidade de projetos","generative engine optimization"],"ru":["гео-оптимизация","поисковые системы ии","разработчики","antigravity ide","совместимые ide","совместимые cli","видимость проектов","generative engine optimization"],"ar":["تحسين الجيوا","محركات البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي","مطورون","بيئة التطوير antigravity","بيئات تطوير متوافقة","واجهات سطر الأوامر المتوافقة","وضوح المشاريع","generative engine optimization"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"geo-fundamentals","description":"Generative Engine Optimization for AI search engines (ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity).","bodyPreview":"# GEO Fundamentals\n\n> Optimization for AI-powered search engines.\n\n---\n\n## 1. What is GEO?\n\n**GEO** = Generative Engine Optimization\n\n| Goal | Platform |\n|------|----------|\n| Be cited in AI responses | ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini |\n\n### SEO vs GEO\n\n| Aspect | SEO | GEO |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| Goal | #1 ranking | AI citations |\n| Platform | Google | AI engines |\n| Metrics | Rankings, CTR | Citation rate |\n| Focus | Keywords | Entities, data |\n\n---\n\n## 2. AI Engine Landscape\n\n| Engine","body":"# GEO Fundamentals\n\n> Optimization for AI-powered search engines.\n\n---\n\n## 1. What is GEO?\n\n**GEO** = Generative Engine Optimization\n\n| Goal | Platform |\n|------|----------|\n| Be cited in AI responses | ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini |\n\n### SEO vs GEO\n\n| Aspect | SEO | GEO |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| Goal | #1 ranking | AI citations |\n| Platform | Google | AI engines |\n| Metrics | Rankings, CTR | Citation rate |\n| Focus | Keywords | Entities, data |\n\n---\n\n## 2. AI Engine Landscape\n\n| Engine | Citation Style | Opportunity |\n|--------|----------------|-------------|\n| **Perplexity** | Numbered [1][2] | Highest citation rate |\n| **ChatGPT** | Inline/footnotes | Custom GPTs |\n| **Claude** | Contextual | Long-form content |\n| **Gemini** | Sources section | SEO crossover |\n\n---\n\n## 3. RAG Retrieval Factors\n\nHow AI engines select content to cite:\n\n| Factor | Weight |\n|--------|--------|\n| Semantic relevance | ~40% |\n| Keyword match | ~20% |\n| Authority signals | ~15% |\n| Freshness | ~10% |\n| Source diversity | ~15% |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Content That Gets Cited\n\n| Element | Why It Works |\n|---------|--------------|\n| **Original statistics** | Unique, citable data |\n| **Expert quotes** | Authority transfer |\n| **Clear definitions** | Easy to extract |\n| **Step-by-step guides** | Actionable value |\n| **Comparison tables** | Structured info |\n| **FAQ sections** | Direct answers |\n\n---\n\n## 5. GEO Content Checklist\n\n### Content Elements\n\n- [ ] Question-based titles\n- [ ] Summary/TL;DR at top\n- [ ] Original data with sources\n- [ ] Expert quotes (name, title)\n- [ ] FAQ section (3-5 Q&A)\n- [ ] Clear definitions\n- [ ] \"Last updated\" timestamp\n- [ ] Author with credentials\n\n### Technical Elements\n\n- [ ] Article schema with dates\n- [ ] Person schema for author\n- [ ] FAQPage schema\n- [ ] Fast loading (< 2.5s)\n- [ ] Clean HTML structure\n\n---\n\n## 6. Entity Building\n\n| Action | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| Google Knowledge Panel | Entity recognition |\n| Wikipedia (if notable) | Authority source |\n| Consistent info across web | Entity consolidation |\n| Industry mentions | Authority signals |\n\n---\n\n## 7. AI Crawler Access\n\n### Key AI User-Agents\n\n| Crawler | Engine |\n|---------|--------|\n| GPTBot | ChatGPT/OpenAI |\n| Claude-Web | Claude |\n| PerplexityBot | Perplexity |\n| Googlebot | Gemini (shared) |\n\n### Access Decision\n\n| Strategy | When |\n|----------|------|\n| Allow all | Want AI citations |\n| Block GPTBot | Don''t want OpenAI training |\n| Selective | Allow some, block others |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Measurement\n\n| Metric | How to Track |\n|--------|--------------|\n| AI citations | Manual monitoring |\n| \"According to [Brand]\" mentions | Search in AI |\n| Competitor citations | Compare share |\n| AI-referred traffic | UTM parameters |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Publish without dates | Add timestamps |\n| Vague attributions | Name sources |\n| Skip author info | Show credentials |\n| Thin content | Comprehensive coverage |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** AI cites content that''s clear, authoritative, and easy to extract. Be the best answer.\n\n---\n\n## Script\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/geo_checker.py` | GEO audit (AI citation readiness) | `python scripts/geo_checker.py <project_path>` |\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:11:47.463Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focusing on search engine optimization, such as Cursor and Claude, needing to understand and leverage geo-fundamentals for enhanced citation rates.","zh":"适合专注于搜索引擎优化的AI代理，例如Cursor和Claude，需要了解和利用地理基础知识以提高引用率。","ja":"検索エンジン最適化に焦点を当てたAIエージェント、たとえばCursorやClaudeが、地理基礎知識を理解して活用し、引用率を高めるのに適しています。","ko":"검색 엔진 최적화를 중점으로 하는 AI 에이전트(Cursor 및 Claude 등)가 지理 기초 지식을 이해하고 활용하여 인용률을 향상시키는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se centran en la optimización de motores de búsqueda, como Cursor y Claude, que necesitan comprender y aprovechar los fundamentos geográficos para mejorar las tasas de citación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur l''optimisation des moteurs de recherche, tels que Cursor et Claude, qui doivent comprendre et exploiter les fondamentaux géographiques pour améliorer les taux de citation.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die auf die Suche-Engine-Optimierung ausgerichtet sind, wie z.B. Cursor und Claude, die Geo-Grundlagen verstehen und nutzen müssen, um die Zitierhäufigkeit zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que se concentram na otimização para mecanismos de busca, como Cursor e Claude, que precisam entender e aproveitar fundamentos geográficos para taxas de citação aprimoradas.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, ориентированных на оптимизацию для поисковых систем, таких как Cursor и Claude, которым необходимо понимать и использовать геофундамент для улучшения показателей цитирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على تحسين محرك البحث، مثل Cursor و Claude، ويحتاج إلى فهم وتحقيق المفاهيم الجغرافية الأساسية لتحسين معدلات الاقتباس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize content for AI-powered search engines, utilizing Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) principles, and focusing on entities and data to increase citation rates in platforms like ChatGPT and Gemini, through compatible formats with GitHub Copilot and other CLIs.","zh":"赋予代理人优化内容以适应AI驱动的搜索引擎的能力，利用生成引擎优化（GEO）原则，关注实体和数据以增加ChatGPT和Gemini等平台上的引用率，并通过与GitHub Copilot和其他CLI兼容的格式实现。","ja":"AI駆動の検索エンジン向けにコンテンツを最適化する能力をエージェントに与え、生成エンジン最適化（GEO）原則を利用し、エンティティやデータに焦点を当てて、ChatGPTやGeminiなどのプラットフォームでの引用率を向上させ、GitHub Copilotやその他のCLIと互換性のある形式で提供します。","ko":"AI 주도 검색 엔진을 위한 최적화된 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하고, 생성 엔진 최적화(GEO) 원리를 활용하여 엔티티 및 데이터에 중점을 두어 ChatGPT 및 Gemini와 같은 플랫폼에서의 인용률을 향상시키고, GitHub Copilot 및 기타 CLI와의 호환성을 보장하는 형식으로 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el contenido para motores de búsqueda impulsados por IA, utilizando principios de Optimización de Motor Generativo (GEO) y centrándose en entidades y datos para aumentar las tasas de citación en plataformas como ChatGPT y Gemini, a través de formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot y otros CLIs.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser le contenu pour les moteurs de recherche alimentés par l''IA, en utilisant les principes de l''Optimisation de Moteur Génératif (GEO) et en se concentrant sur les entités et les données pour augmenter les taux de citation sur des plateformes comme ChatGPT et Gemini, via des formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot et d''autres CLIs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Inhalte für KI-basierte Suchmaschinen zu optimieren, indem sie Prinzipien der Generativen Motor-Optimierung (GEO) nutzen und sich auf Entitäten und Daten konzentrieren, um die Zitierhäufigkeit in Plattformen wie ChatGPT und Gemini zu erhöhen, über Formate, die mit GitHub Copilot und anderen CLIs kompatibel sind.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem o conteúdo para mecanismos de busca alimentados por IA, utilizando princípios de Otimização do Motor Gerador (GEO) e se concentrando em entidades e dados para aumentar as taxas de citação em plataformas como ChatGPT e Gemini, por meio de formatos compatíveis com GitHub Copilot e outros CLIs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать контент для поисковых систем, работающих на ИИ, используя принципы Генеративной Оптимизации Двигателя (GEO) и фокусируясь на сущностях и данных для увеличения показателей цитирования на платформах, таких как ChatGPT и Gemini, через совместимые форматы с GitHub Copilot и другими интерфейсами командной строки.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تحسين المحتوى لمحركات البحث التي تعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي، باستخدام مبادئ محرك التوليد الأمثل (GEO) والتركيز على الكيانات والبيانات لزيادة معدلات الاقتباس على منصات مثل ChatGPT و Gemini، من خلال تنسيقات متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot وواجهات سطر الأوامر الأخرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting configurations for compatibility with multiple IDEs and CLIs","Optimizing content for AI citations","Analyzing SEO vs GEO strategies for AI engine landscapes"],"zh":["将配置转换为与多个IDE和CLI兼容","优化内容以提高AI引用率","分析AI引擎景观中的SEO与GEO策略"],"ja":["複数のIDEおよびCLIと互換性のある形式へのコンフィグの変換","AIによる引用率の向上を目的としたコンテンツの最適化","AIエンジン景観におけるSEOとGEO戦略の分析"],"ko":["다중 IDE 및 CLI와의 호환성을 위한 구성 전환","AI 인용률 향상을 위한 콘텐츠 최적화","AI 엔진 경관에서의 SEO 및 GEO 전략 분석"],"es":["Convertir configuraciones para la compatibilidad con varias IDE y CLIs","Optimizar contenido para citaciones de IA","Analizar estrategias de SEO vs GEO para paisajes de motores de IA"],"fr":["Convertir des configurations pour la compatibilité avec plusieurs IDE et CLIs","Optimiser le contenu pour les citations d''IA","Analyser les stratégies de SEO vs GEO pour les paysages de moteurs d''IA"],"de":["Konfigurationen für die Kompatibilität mit mehreren IDEs und CLIs konvertieren","Inhalte für KI-Zitierungen optimieren","SEO- vs. GEO-Strategien für KI-Motor-Landschaften analysieren"],"pt":["Converter configurações para compatibilidade com várias IDEs e CLIs","Otimizar conteúdo para citações de IA","Analisar estratégias de SEO vs GEO para paisagens de motores de IA"],"ru":["Преобразование конфигураций для совместимости с несколькими IDE и интерфейсами командной строки","Оптимизация контента для цитирования ИИ","Анализ стратегий SEO vs GEO для ландшафтов двигателей ИИ"],"ar":["تحويل الإعدادات للتوافق مع بيئات تطوير متعددة وواجهات سطر الأوامر","تحسين المحتوى للاقتباسات من الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث مقابل الجغرافيا للبيئات المحركية للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of AI engine landscapes and GEO principles","Compatibility focused on specific IDEs and CLIs like GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and Kiro"],"zh":["需要了解AI引擎景观和GEO原则","兼容性仅限于特定的IDE和CLI，如GitHub Copilot、Cursor和Kiro"],"ja":["AIエンジン景観とGEO原則の理解が必要","互換性は、GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiroなどの特定のIDEおよびCLIに限定される"],"ko":["AI 엔진 경관 및 GEO 원리에 대한 이해 필요","호환성은 GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro 등의 특정 IDE 및 CLI에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los paisajes de motores de IA y principios de GEO","Compatibilidad centrada en IDE y CLIs específicos como GitHub Copilot, Cursor y Kiro"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des paysages de moteurs d''IA et des principes de GEO","Compatibilité axée sur des IDE et des CLIs spécifiques comme GitHub Copilot, Cursor et Kiro"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis von KI-Motor-Landschaften und GEO-Prinzipien","Kompatibilität konzentriert sich auf spezifische IDEs und CLIs wie GitHub Copilot, Cursor und Kiro"],"pt":["Exige entendimento de paisagens de motores de IA e princípios de GEO","Compatibilidade focada em IDEs e CLIs específicos, como GitHub Copilot, Cursor e Kiro"],"ru":["Требует понимания ландшафтов двигателей ИИ и принципов GEO","Совместимость ориентирована на конкретные IDE и интерфейсы командной строки, такие как GitHub Copilot, Cursor и Kiro"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم بيئات محركات الذكاء الاصطناعي ومبادئ الجغرافيا","التوافق يركز على بيئات تطوير متعددة وواجهات سطر الأوامر محددة، مثل GitHub Copilot و Cursor و Kiro"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('consuelohq/openengineer/consuelo-test', 'community', 'consuelohq', 'openengineer', 'consuelohq/openengineer', 'consuelo-test', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:12:47.550Z', NULL, '{"id":"consuelohq/openengineer/consuelo-test","name":"consuelo-test","description":{"zh":"Consuelo 测试运行器是用于自动化测试和验证部署更改的 AI 代理模板。它在 Railway 部署成功后运行，以验证更改是否按要求工作","ja":"Consuelo テストランナーは、デプロイされた変更を自動的にテストおよび検証する AI エージェント テンプレートです。Railway デプロイ後に実行され、変更が要件に従って動作することを確認します","ko":"Consuelo 테스트 러너는 배포된 변경을 자동으로 테스트하고 검증하는 AI 에이전트 템플릿입니다. Railway 배포 후에 실행되어 변경 사항이 요구 사항에 따라 작동하는지 확인합니다","es":"Consuelo Test es una plantilla de agente AI que automatiza pruebas y verifica cambios en aplicaciones en vivo después de una implementación exitosa.","fr":"Consuelo Test est un modèle d''agent AI qui automatise les tests et vérifie les modifications sur les applications en direct après une mise en production réussie.","de":"Consuelo Test ist eine Vorlage für einen AI-Agenten, der Tests automatisiert und Änderungen in Live-Anwendungen nach einer erfolgreichen Bereitstellung überprüft.","pt":"O Consuelo Test é um agente de IA que automatiza testes de desenvolvimento e GTM, garantindo que as alterações sejam verificadas após uma implantação bem-sucedida","ru":"Consuelo Test - это агент ИИ, который автоматизирует тестирование разработки и GTM, гарантируя, что изменения проверяются после успешной установки","ar":"كونسويلو تيست هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي يأتمتة اختبار التطوير و GTM، ويدقق في التغييرات بعد تنفيذ ناجح","en":"Autonomous AI agent templates for development and GTM automation"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Consuelo 测试运行器 - 自动化 AI 代理模板","ja":"Consuelo テストランナー - 自動化 AI エージェント テンプレート","ko":"Consuelo 테스트 러너 - 자동화 AI 에이전트 템플릿","es":"Consuelo Test: Autonomía de Pruebas para Desarrolladores","fr":"Consuelo Test : Modèles d''Agents AI pour Développement et...","de":"Consuelo Test: Autonome AI-Agenten-Vorlagen für Entwicklu...","pt":"Consuelo Test: Automação de Testes de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Консuelo Тест: Автоматизация тестирования разработки","ar":"كونسويلو تيست: أوتوماتيكية اختبار التطوير","en":"consuelo-test"},"description":{"zh":"Consuelo 测试运行器是用于自动化测试和验证部署更改的 AI 代理模板。它在 Railway 部署成功后运行，以验证更改是否按要求工作","ja":"Consuelo テストランナーは、デプロイされた変更を自動的にテストおよび検証する AI エージェント テンプレートです。Railway デプロイ後に実行され、変更が要件に従って動作することを確認します","ko":"Consuelo 테스트 러너는 배포된 변경을 자동으로 테스트하고 검증하는 AI 에이전트 템플릿입니다. Railway 배포 후에 실행되어 변경 사항이 요구 사항에 따라 작동하는지 확인합니다","es":"Consuelo Test es una plantilla de agente AI que automatiza pruebas y verifica cambios en aplicaciones en vivo después de una implementación exitosa.","fr":"Consuelo Test est un modèle d''agent AI qui automatise les tests et vérifie les modifications sur les applications en direct après une mise en production réus...","de":"Consuelo Test ist eine Vorlage für einen AI-Agenten, der Tests automatisiert und Änderungen in Live-Anwendungen nach einer erfolgreichen Bereitstellung überp...","pt":"O Consuelo Test é um agente de IA que automatiza testes de desenvolvimento e GTM, garantindo que as alterações sejam verificadas após uma implantação bem-suc...","ru":"Consuelo Test - это агент ИИ, который автоматизирует тестирование разработки и GTM, гарантируя, что изменения проверяются после успешной установки","ar":"كونسويلو تيست هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي يأتمتة اختبار التطوير و GTM، ويدقق في التغييرات بعد تنفيذ ناجح","en":"Autonomous AI agent templates for development and GTM automation"},"definition":{"en":"Autonomous AI agent templates for development and GTM automation"},"features":{"zh":["自动化测试和验证","Railway 部署后运行","验证更改是否按要求工作","支持 PR 号码或 Linear 任务 ID","可用于特定功能的测试","可用于心跳检查"],"ja":["自動テストと検証","Railway デプロイ後に実行","変更が要件に従って動作することを確認","PR 番号または Linear タスク ID をサポート","特定の機能のテストに使用可能","心拍チェックに使用可能"],"ko":["자동 테스트 및 검증","Railway 배포 후에 실행","변경 사항이 요구 사항에 따라 작동하는지 확인","PR 번호 또는 Linear 작업 ID 지원","특정 기능의 테스트에 사용 가능","심장 박동 확인에 사용 가능"],"es":["Pruebas automáticas después de implementaciones exitosas","Verificación de cambios en aplicaciones en vivo","Compatibilidad con Railway y Linear","Soporte para PR y tareas de Linear","Integración con heartbeat para pruebas periódicas"],"fr":["Tests automatisés après des mises en production réussies","Vérification des modifications sur les applications en direct","Compatibilité avec Railway et Linear","Prise en charge des PR et des tâches Linear","Intégration avec heartbeat pour des tests périodiques"],"de":["Automatisierte Tests nach erfolgreichen Bereitstellungen","Überprüfung von Änderungen in Live-Anwendungen","Kompatibilität mit Railway und Linear","Unterstützung für PR und Linear-Aufgaben","Integration mit heartbeat für periodische Tests"],"pt":["Automação de testes de desenvolvimento","Verificação de alterações após implantação","Integração com Railway e pr-watcher","Suporte a testes de recursos específicos","Verificação de alterações durante heartbeat checks"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования разработки","Проверка изменений после установки","Интеграция с Railway и pr-watcher","Поддержка тестирования конкретных функций","Проверка изменений во время heartbeat checks"],"ar":["أوتوماتيكية اختبار التطوير","التحقق من التغييرات بعد التنفيذ","التكامل مع Railway و pr-watcher","دعم اختبار الميزات النوعية","التحقق من التغييرات أثناء heartbeat checks"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动化测试","AI 代理模板","Railway 部署","PR 号码","Linear 任务 ID","心跳检查","自动化验证","部署更改"],"ja":["自動テスト","AI エージェント テンプレート","Railway デプロイ","PR 番号","Linear タスク ID","心拍チェック","自動検証","デプロイされた変更"],"ko":["자동 테스트","AI 에이전트 템플릿","Railway 배포","PR 번호","Linear 작업 ID","심장 박동 확인","자동 검증","배포된 변경"],"es":["automatización de pruebas","verificación de cambios","aplicaciones en vivo","Railway","Linear","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","automatización de tests"],"fr":["automatisation de tests","vérification de modifications","applications en direct","Railway","Linear","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","automatisation de tests"],"de":["Automatisierung von Tests","Überprüfung von Änderungen","Live-Anwendungen","Railway","Linear","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests","Automatisierung von Tests"],"pt":["automação de testes","desenvolvimento de software","GTM","Railway","pr-watcher","heartbeat checks","testes de desenvolvimento","agente de IA"],"ru":["автоматизация тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","GTM","Railway","pr-watcher","heartbeat checks","тестирование разработки","агент ИИ"],"ar":["أوتوماتيكية اختبار","تطوير البرمجيات","GTM","Railway","pr-watcher","heartbeat checks","اختبار التطوير","وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"consuelohq","repo":"openengineer","repoPath":"consuelohq/openengineer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"consuelo-test","description":"Test deployed Consuelo changes against Linear task requirements and PR verification criteria. Runs after successful Railway deploys to verify features work in production.","bodyPreview":"# Consuelo Test Runner\n\nTest deployed changes against the original requirements. This skill runs after a successful Railway deploy to verify that the changes actually work.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- After a successful Railway deploy (triggered by pr-watcher or heartbeat)\n- When asked to test a specific feature on the live app\n- During heartbeat checks if there are recently-deployed PRs that haven''t been tested\n\n## What You Need\n\n- **PR number** or **Linear task ID** — to know what was change","body":"# Consuelo Test Runner\n\nTest deployed changes against the original requirements. This skill runs after a successful Railway deploy to verify that the changes actually work.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- After a successful Railway deploy (triggered by pr-watcher or heartbeat)\n- When asked to test a specific feature on the live app\n- During heartbeat checks if there are recently-deployed PRs that haven''t been tested\n\n## What You Need\n\n- **PR number** or **Linear task ID** — to know what was changed and what to test\n- **Railway URL** — the deployed Consuelo app (usually from Railway dashboard or env)\n\n## Testing Flow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Requirements\n\n**From Linear task (if available):**\n```bash\n# Fetch the Linear task spec\npython3 /Users/kokayi/Dev/claude-agent-workflow/.opencode/skills/github-dev/fetch_task.py CON-456\n# Read the spec\ncat /Users/kokayi/Dev/claude-agent-workflow/.opencode/skills/github-dev/tasks/CON-456.md\n```\n\n**From PR description:**\n```bash\ngh pr view <number> --json body,title,files --repo kokayicobb/consuelo_on_call_coaching\n```\n\n### Step 2: Extract Verification Criteria\n\nLook for these in the Linear task spec or PR body:\n- `## Verification Criteria` section with checkboxes\n- `## Acceptance Criteria` section\n- `## What to Test` section\n- Any description of expected behavior\n\nIf no explicit criteria exist, derive them from:\n- The PR title and description (what was the intent?)\n- The changed files (what areas were modified?)\n- The commit messages (what was implemented?)\n\n### Step 3: Run Tests\n\nFor each verification criterion, test it against the deployed app:\n\n**API Tests (curl/httpie):**\n```bash\n# Test an API endpoint\ncurl -s https://your-railway-url.up.railway.app/api/endpoint | python3 -m json.tool\n\n# Test with authentication\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" https://your-railway-url.up.railway.app/api/protected\n```\n\n**UI Tests (agent-browser if available):**\nIf the changes involve UI:\n1. Navigate to the relevant page\n2. Verify the UI elements are present\n3. Test user interactions (clicks, form submissions)\n4. Check error states\n\n**Health Check:**\n```bash\n# Always start with a basic health check\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" https://your-railway-url.up.railway.app/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report Results\n\nPost test results as a PR comment:\n\n```markdown\n## Test Results — PR #123\n\n**Deployed URL:** https://...\n**Tested at:** 2026-02-07 15:30 UTC\n\n### Criteria Results\n\n| Criterion | Result | Notes |\n|-----------|--------|-------|\n| User can log in | PASS | Tested with test credentials |\n| Error on invalid login | PASS | Shows appropriate error message |\n| Dashboard loads | FAIL | 500 error on /dashboard |\n\n### Summary\n2/3 criteria passed. Dashboard endpoint returning 500.\n\n### Recommendation\nFix the dashboard endpoint before marking as complete.\n```\n\n### Step 5: Update Linear Task\n\nIf all tests pass:\n```bash\n# Move task to Done (via linear_helper or direct API)\npython3 /Users/kokayi/Dev/claude-agent-workflow/.opencode/skills/kiro/linear_helper.py label CON-456 --add tested\n```\n\nIf tests fail:\n- Post the failure details to the PR\n- Send Slack notification\n- Leave the task in \"In Review\" state\n\n## Test Categories\n\n### Critical (Must Pass)\n- App starts without errors (health check returns 200)\n- Core user flow works (the main feature being tested)\n- No console errors in the response\n\n### Important (Should Pass)\n- Error handling works (invalid inputs, edge cases)\n- Response times are reasonable (<5s for API calls)\n- No regressions in existing functionality\n\n### Nice to Have\n- UI looks correct (screenshots if agent-browser available)\n- Responsive design works\n- Edge cases handled gracefully\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- **Don''t test destructive operations** on production data\n- **Use test/staging credentials** if authentication is needed\n- **Report partial results** — even if some tests fail, report what passed\n- **This skill complements the github-review skill''s --test flag** — the review skill tests during review, this skill tests after deploy\n- **Railway URL** should be discoverable from Railway CLI or environment config\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:12:47.550Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Deployment Agents needing automated testing and validation of Railway deployments.","zh":"适用于需要自动化测试和验证铁路部署的部署代理的理想选择。","ja":"鉄道のデプロイの自動テストと検証が必要なデプロイエージェントに最適です。","ko":"철도 배포의 자동화된 테스트 및 검증이 필요한 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de implementación que necesitan pruebas y validación automatizadas de implementaciones de Railway.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de déploiement nécessitant des tests et une validation automatisés des déploiements de Railway.","de":"Ideal für Deployment-Agents, die automatisierte Tests und Validierung von Railway-Deployments benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Deployment Agents needing automated testing and validation of Railway deployments.","ru":"Ideal for Deployment Agents needing automated testing and validation of Railway deployments.","ar":"Ideal for Deployment Agents needing automated testing and validation of Railway deployments."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run test suites against deployed changes, ensuring compliance with original requirements using triggers like pr-watcher or heartbeat, and supports testing of specific features on live apps via Linear task IDs or PR numbers.","zh":"赋予代理运行测试套件以验证已部署的更改，使用触发器（如pr-watcher或心跳）确保遵守原始要求，并支持使用线性任务ID或PR编号在实时应用程序上测试特定功能。","ja":"エージェントがデプロイされた変更のテストスイートを実行して、トリガー（pr-watcherやハートビートなど）を使用して元の要件への準拠を確保し、LinearタスクIDやPR番号を使用してライブアプリケーション上で特定の機能をテストすることをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 배포된 변경 사항에 대한 테스트 세트를 실행하여 트리거(예: pr-watcher 또는 心跳)를 사용하여 원래 요구 사항을 준수하고 Linear 작업 ID 또는 PR 번호를 사용하여 라이브 애플리케이션에서 특정 기능을 테스트하는 것을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar suites de pruebas contra cambios implementados, garantizando el cumplimiento de los requisitos originales mediante disparadores como pr-watcher o heartbeat, y admite la prueba de características específicas en aplicaciones en vivo a través de IDs de tarea lineales o números de PR.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des suites de tests contre les modifications déployées, en garantissant la conformité aux exigences d''origine à l''aide de déclencheurs tels que pr-watcher ou heartbeat, et prend en charge les tests de fonctionnalités spécifiques sur des applications en direct via des ID de tâche linéaire ou des numéros de PR.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Test-Suiten gegen bereitgestellte Änderungen auszuführen, um die Einhaltung der ursprünglichen Anforderungen mit Hilfe von Triggern wie pr-watcher oder heartbeat sicherzustellen und unterstützt die Tests spezifischer Funktionen in Live-Apps über lineare Aufgaben-IDs oder PR-Nummern.","pt":"Empowers agents to run test suites against deployed changes, ensuring compliance with original requirements using triggers like pr-watcher or heartbeat, and supports testing of specific features on live apps via Linear task IDs or PR numbers.","ru":"Empowers agents to run test suites against deployed changes, ensuring compliance with original requirements using triggers like pr-watcher or heartbeat, and supports testing of specific features on live apps via Linear task IDs or PR numbers.","ar":"Empowers agents to run test suites against deployed changes, ensuring compliance with original requirements using triggers like pr-watcher or heartbeat, and supports testing of specific features on live apps via Linear task IDs or PR numbers."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating post-deployment testing","Validating recent PR deployments","Testing specific features on live applications"],"zh":["自动化部署后测试","验证最近的PR部署","在实时应用程序上测试特定功能"],"ja":["デプロイ後の自動テスト","最近のPRデプロイの検証","ライブアプリケーション上での特定の機能のテスト"],"ko":["배포 후 자동 테스트","최근 PR 배포의 검증","라이브 애플리케이션에서 특정 기능 테스트"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas posteriores a la implementación","Validación de implementaciones de PR recientes","Pruebas de características específicas en aplicaciones en vivo"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests post-déploiement","Validation des déploiements de PR récents","Tests de fonctionnalités spécifiques sur des applications en direct"],"de":["Automatisierung von Tests nach der Bereitstellung","Validierung von kürzlichen PR-Bereitstellungen","Testen spezifischer Funktionen in Live-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automating post-deployment testing","Validating recent PR deployments","Testing specific features on live applications"],"ru":["Automating post-deployment testing","Validating recent PR deployments","Testing specific features on live applications"],"ar":["Automating post-deployment testing","Validating recent PR deployments","Testing specific features on live applications"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway deploy access","Needs PR number or Linear task ID for testing"],"zh":["需要铁路部署访问权限","需要PR编号或线性任务ID进行测试"],"ja":["鉄道のデプロイアクセスが必要","テストにはPR番号またはLinearタスクIDが必要"],"ko":["철도 배포 액세스가 필요","테스트를 위해 PR 번호 또는 Linear 작업 ID가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la implementación de Railway","Necesita número de PR o ID de tarea lineal para las pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au déploiement de Railway","Nécessite un numéro de PR ou un ID de tâche linéaire pour les tests"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Railway-Bereitstellung","Benötigt PR-Nummer oder lineare Aufgaben-ID für die Tests"],"pt":["Requires Railway deploy access","Needs PR number or Linear task ID for testing"],"ru":["Requires Railway deploy access","Needs PR number or Linear task ID for testing"],"ar":["Requires Railway deploy access","Needs PR number or Linear task ID for testing"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/launch-strategy', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'launch-strategy', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:12:56.069Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/launch-strategy","name":"launch-strategy","description":{"zh":"SaaS产品发布策略旨在提高用户参与度和转化率","ja":"SaaS製品ローンチ戦略はユーザー参加率と変換率を向上させることを目的としています","ko":"SaaS 제품 런치 전략은 사용자 참여도 및 전환률을 높이는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"La estrategia de lanzamiento es crucial para el éxito de un producto SaaS. Nuestro experto ayuda a planificar lanzamientos que atraen la atención y convierten el interés en usuarios","fr":"La stratégie de lancement est essentielle pour le succès d''un produit SaaS. Notre expert aide à planifier des lancements qui capturent l''attention et convertissent l''intérêt en utilisateurs","de":"Die Launch-Strategie ist entscheidend für den Erfolg eines SaaS-Produkts. Unser Experte hilft bei der Planung von Produktstarts, die Aufmerksamkeit erregen und Interesse in Benutzer umwandeln","pt":"A estratégia de lançamento de produtos SaaS é crucial para o sucesso. Nossa abordagem ajuda a construir momentum e converter interesse em usuários.","ru":"Стратегия запуска SaaS-продуктов имеет важное значение для успеха. Наш подход помогает построить импульс и превратить интерес в пользователей.","ar":"استراتيجية إطلاق المنتجات ساس مهمة للنجاح. منهجنا يساعد على بناء الزخم وتحويل الاهتمام إلى مستخدمين.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SaaS 产品发布策略","ja":"SaaS製品ローンチ戦略","ko":"SaaS 제품 런치 전략","es":"Estrategia de Lanzamiento de Producto SaaS","fr":"Stratégie de Lancement de Produit SaaS","de":"Produktstartstrategie für SaaS","pt":"Estratégia de Lançamento de Produtos SaaS","ru":"Стратегия запуска SaaS-продуктов","ar":"استراتيجية إطلاق المنتجات ساس","en":"launch-strategy"},"description":{"zh":"SaaS产品发布策略旨在提高用户参与度和转化率","ja":"SaaS製品ローンチ戦略はユーザー参加率と変換率を向上させることを目的としています","ko":"SaaS 제품 런치 전략은 사용자 참여도 및 전환률을 높이는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"La estrategia de lanzamiento es crucial para el éxito de un producto SaaS. Nuestro experto ayuda a planificar lanzamientos que atraen la atención y convierte...","fr":"La stratégie de lancement est essentielle pour le succès d''un produit SaaS. Notre expert aide à planifier des lancements qui capturent l''attention et convert...","de":"Die Launch-Strategie ist entscheidend für den Erfolg eines SaaS-Produkts. Unser Experte hilft bei der Planung von Produktstarts, die Aufmerksamkeit erregen u...","pt":"A estratégia de lançamento de produtos SaaS é crucial para o sucesso. Nossa abordagem ajuda a construir momentum e converter interesse em usuários.","ru":"Стратегия запуска SaaS-продуктов имеет важное значение для успеха. Наш подход помогает построить импульс и превратить интерес в пользователей.","ar":"استراتيجية إطلاق المنتجات ساس مهمة للنجاح. منهجنا يساعد على بناء الزخم وتحويل الاهتمام إلى مستخدمين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高用户参与度","提高转化率","个性化推荐","实时分析","多渠道推广"],"ja":["ユーザー参加率の向上","変換率の向上","パーソナライズされたレコメンド","リアルタイム分析","マルチチャネルプロモーション"],"ko":["사용자 참여도 향상","전환률 향상","개인화된 추천","실시간 분석","다채널 홍보"],"es":["Planificación de lanzamientos personalizados","Análisis de marketing de productos","Captura de atención y conversión de interés","Estrategias de crecimiento y escalabilidad","Optimización del proceso de lanzamiento"],"fr":["Planification de lancements personnalisés","Analyse de marketing de produits","Capture de l''attention et conversion de l''intérêt","Stratégies de croissance et d''évolutivité","Optimisation du processus de lancement"],"de":["Planung von maßgeschneiderten Produktstarts","Produktmarketing-Analyse","Aufmerksamkeitserregung und Interessenkonversion","Wachstums- und Skalierungsstrategien","Optimierung des Launch-Prozesses"],"pt":["Planejamento de lançamento personalizado","Construção de momentum e interesse","Desenvolvimento de planos de marketing","Análise de resultados e ajustes","Otimização para conversão de usuários"],"ru":["Индивидуальный план запуска","Построение импульса и интереса","Разработка маркетинговых планов","Анализ результатов и корректировка","Оптимизация для конверсии пользователей"],"ar":["خطة إطلاق مخصصة","بناء الزخم والاهتمام","تطوير خطط تسويقية","تحليل النتائج وتعديلات","تحسين لتحويل المستخدمين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS产品发布","产品发布策略","用户参与度","转化率","个性化推荐","实时分析"],"ja":["SaaS製品ローンチ","製品ローンチ戦略","ユーザー参加率","変換率","パーソナライズされたレコメンド","リアルタイム分析"],"ko":["SaaS 제품 런치","제품 런치 전략","사용자 참여도","전환률","개인화된 추천","실시간 분석"],"es":["estrategia de lanzamiento","producto SaaS","marketing de productos","lanzamiento de productos","crecimiento y escalabilidad","optimización del lanzamiento"],"fr":["stratégie de lancement","produit SaaS","marketing de produits","lancement de produits","croissance et évolutivité","optimisation du lancement"],"de":["Launch-Strategie","SaaS-Produkt","Produktmarketing","Produkteinführung","Wachstum und Skalierbarkeit","Optimierung des Launch-Prozesses"],"pt":["estratégia de lançamento de produtos SaaS","lançamento de produtos","marketing de produtos SaaS","construção de momentum","conversão de usuários","planejamento de lançamento"],"ru":["стратегия запуска SaaS-продуктов","запуск продуктов","маркетинг SaaS-продуктов","построение импульса","конверсия пользователей","планирование запуска"],"ar":["استراتيجية إطلاق المنتجات ساس","إطلاق المنتجات","تسويق المنتجات ساس","بناء الزخم","تحويل المستخدمين","تخطيط الإطلاق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"launch-strategy","description":"When the user wants to plan a product launch, feature announcement, or release strategy. Also use when the user mentions launch, Product Hunt, feature release, announcement, go-to-market, beta launch, early access, waitlist, or product update. This skill covers phased launches, channel strategy, and ongoing launch momentum.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Launch Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS product launches and feature announcements. Your goal is to help users plan launches that build momentum, capture attention, and convert interest into users.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\n---\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\nThe best companies don''t jus","body":"# Launch Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS product launches and feature announcements. Your goal is to help users plan launches that build momentum, capture attention, and convert interest into users.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\n---\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\nThe best companies don''t just launch once—they launch again and again. Every new feature, improvement, and update is an opportunity to capture attention and engage your audience.\n\nA strong launch isn''t about a single moment. It''s about:\n- Getting your product into users'' hands early\n- Learning from real feedback\n- Making a splash at every stage\n- Building momentum that compounds over time\n\n---\n\n## The ORB Framework\n\nStructure your launch marketing across three channel types. Everything should ultimately lead back to owned channels.\n\n### Owned Channels\nYou own the channel (though not the audience). Direct access without algorithms or platform rules.\n\n**Examples:**\n- Email list\n- Blog\n- Podcast\n- Branded community (Slack, Discord)\n- Website/product\n\n**Why they matter:**\n- Get more effective over time\n- No algorithm changes or pay-to-play\n- Direct relationship with audience\n- Compound value from content\n\n**Start with 1-2 based on audience:**\n- Industry lacks quality content → Start a blog\n- People want direct updates → Focus on email\n- Engagement matters → Build a community\n\n**Example - Superhuman:**\nBuilt demand through an invite-only waitlist and one-on-one onboarding sessions. Every new user got a 30-minute live demo. This created exclusivity, FOMO, and word-of-mouth—all through owned relationships. Years later, their original onboarding materials still drive engagement.\n\n### Rented Channels\nPlatforms that provide visibility but you don''t control. Algorithms shift, rules change, pay-to-play increases.\n\n**Examples:**\n- Social media (Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Instagram)\n- App stores and marketplaces\n- YouTube\n- Reddit\n\n**How to use correctly:**\n- Pick 1-2 platforms where your audience is active\n- Use them to drive traffic to owned channels\n- Don''t rely on them as your only strategy\n\n**Example - Notion:**\nHacked virality through Twitter, YouTube, and Reddit where productivity enthusiasts were active. Encouraged community to share templates and workflows. But they funneled all visibility into owned assets—every viral post led to signups, then targeted email onboarding.\n\n**Platform-specific tactics:**\n- Twitter/X: Threads that spark conversation → link to newsletter\n- LinkedIn: High-value posts → lead to gated content or email signup\n- Marketplaces (Shopify, Slack): Optimize listing → drive to site for more\n\nRented channels give speed, not stability. Capture momentum by bringing users into your owned ecosystem.\n\n### Borrowed Channels\nTap into someone else''s audience to shortcut the hardest part—getting noticed.\n\n**Examples:**\n- Guest content (blog posts, podcast interviews, newsletter features)\n- Collaborations (webinars, co-marketing, social takeovers)\n- Speaking engagements (conferences, panels, virtual summits)\n- Influencer partnerships\n\n**Be proactive, not passive:**\n1. List industry leaders your audience follows\n2. Pitch win-win collaborations\n3. Use tools like SparkToro or Listen Notes to find audience overlap\n4. Set up affiliate/referral incentives\n\n**Example - TRMNL:**\nSent a free e-ink display to YouTuber Snazzy Labs—not a paid sponsorship, just hoping he''d like it. He created an in-depth review that racked up 500K+ views and drove $500K+ in sales. They also set up an affiliate program for ongoing promotion.\n\nBorrowed channels give instant credibility, but only work if you convert borrowed attention into owned relationships.\n\n---\n\n## Five-Phase Launch Approach\n\nLaunching isn''t a one-day event. It''s a phased process that builds momentum.\n\n### Phase 1: Internal Launch\nGather initial feedback and iron out major issues before going public.\n\n**Actions:**\n- Recruit early users one-on-one to test for free\n- Collect feedback on usability gaps and missing features\n- Ensure prototype is functional enough to demo (doesn''t need to be production-ready)\n\n**Goal:** Validate core functionality with friendly users.\n\n### Phase 2: Alpha Launch\nPut the product in front of external users in a controlled way.\n\n**Actions:**\n- Create landing page with early access signup form\n- Announce the product exists\n- Invite users individually to start testing\n- MVP should be working in production (even if still evolving)\n\n**Goal:** First external validation and initial waitlist building.\n\n### Phase 3: Beta Launch\nScale up early access while generating external buzz.\n\n**Actions:**\n- Work through early access list (some free, some paid)\n- Start marketing with teasers about problems you solve\n- Recruit friends, investors, and influencers to test and share\n\n**Consider adding:**\n- Coming soon landing page or waitlist\n- \"Beta\" sticker in dashboard navigation\n- Email invites to early access list\n- Early access toggle in settings for experimental features\n\n**Goal:** Build buzz and refine product with broader feedback.\n\n### Phase 4: Early Access Launch\nShift from small-scale testing to controlled expansion.\n\n**Actions:**\n- Leak product details: screenshots, feature GIFs, demos\n- Gather quantitative usage data and qualitative feedback\n- Run user research with engaged users (incentivize with credits)\n- Optionally run product/market fit survey to refine messaging\n\n**Expansion options:**\n- Option A: Throttle invites in batches (5-10% at a time)\n- Option B: Invite all users at once under \"early access\" framing\n\n**Goal:** Validate at scale and prepare for full launch.\n\n### Phase 5: Full Launch\nOpen the floodgates.\n\n**Actions:**\n- Open self-serve signups\n- Start charging (if not already)\n- Announce general availability across all channels\n\n**Launch touchpoints:**\n- Customer emails\n- In-app popups and product tours\n- Website banner linking to launch assets\n- \"New\" sticker in dashboard navigation\n- Blog post announcement\n- Social posts across platforms\n- Product Hunt, BetaList, Hacker News, etc.\n\n**Goal:** Maximum visibility and conversion to paying users.\n\n---\n\n## Product Hunt Launch Strategy\n\nProduct Hunt can be powerful for reaching early adopters, but it''s not magic—it requires preparation.\n\n### Pros\n- Exposure to tech-savvy early adopter audience\n- Credibility bump (especially if Product of the Day)\n- Potential PR coverage and backlinks\n\n### Cons\n- Very competitive to rank well\n- Short-lived traffic spikes\n- Requires significant pre-launch planning\n\n### How to Launch Successfully\n\n**Before launch day:**\n1. Build relationships with influential supporters, content hubs, and communities\n2. Optimize your listing: compelling tagline, polished visuals, short demo video\n3. Study successful launches to identify what worked\n4. Engage in relevant communities—provide value before pitching\n5. Prepare your team for all-day engagement\n\n**On launch day:**\n1. Treat it as an all-day event\n2. Respond to every comment in real-time\n3. Answer questions and spark discussions\n4. Encourage your existing audience to engage\n5. Direct traffic back to your site to capture signups\n\n**After launch day:**\n1. Follow up with everyone who engaged\n2. Convert Product Hunt traffic into owned relationships (email signups)\n3. Continue momentum with post-launch content\n\n### Case Studies\n\n**SavvyCal** (Scheduling tool):\n- Optimized landing page and onboarding before launch\n- Built relationships with productivity/SaaS influencers in advance\n- Responded to every comment on launch day\n- Result: #2 Product of the Month\n\n**Reform** (Form builder):\n- Studied successful launches and applied insights\n- Crafted clear tagline, polished visuals, demo video\n- Engaged in communities before launch (provided value first)\n- Treated launch as all-day engagement event\n- Directed traffic to capture signups\n- Result: #1 Product of the Day\n\n---\n\n## Post-Launch Product Marketing\n\nYour launch isn''t over when the announcement goes live. Now comes adoption and retention work.\n\n### Immediate Post-Launch Actions\n\n**Educate new users:**\nSet up automated onboarding email sequence introducing key features and use cases.\n\n**Reinforce the launch:**\nInclude announcement in your weekly/biweekly/monthly roundup email to catch people who missed it.\n\n**Differentiate against competitors:**\nPublish comparison pages highlighting why you''re the obvious choice.\n\n**Update web pages:**\nAdd dedicated sections about the new feature/product across your site.\n\n**Offer hands-on preview:**\nCreate no-code interactive demo (using tools like Navattic) so visitors can explore before signing up.\n\n### Keep Momentum Going\nIt''s easier to build on existing momentum than start from scratch. Every touchpoint reinforces the launch.\n\n---\n\n## Ongoing Launch Strategy\n\nDon''t rely on a single launch event. Regular updates and feature rollouts sustain engagement.\n\n### How to Prioritize What to Announce\n\nUse this matrix to decide how much marketing each update deserves:\n\n**Major updates** (new features, product overhauls):\n- Full campaign across multiple channels\n- Blog post, email campaign, in-app messages, social media\n- Maximize exposure\n\n**Medium updates** (new integrations, UI enhancements):\n- Targeted announcement\n- Email to relevant segments, in-app banner\n- Don''t need full fanfare\n\n**Minor updates** (bug fixes, small tweaks):\n- Changelog and release notes\n- Signal that product is improving\n- Don''t dominate marketing\n\n### Announcement Tactics\n\n**Space out releases:**\nInstead of shipping everything at once, stagger announcements to maintain momentum.\n\n**Reuse high-performing tactics:**\nIf a previous announcement resonated, apply those insights to future updates.\n\n**Keep engaging:**\nContinue using email, social, and in-app messaging to highlight improvements.\n\n**Signal active development:**\nEven small changelog updates remind customers your product is evolving. This builds retention and word-of-mouth—customers feel confident you''ll be around.\n\n---\n\n## Launch Checklist\n\n### Pre-Launch\n- [ ] Landing page with clear value proposition\n- [ ] Email capture / waitlist signup\n- [ ] Early access list built\n- [ ] Owned channels established (email, blog, community)\n- [ ] Rented channel presence (social profiles optimized)\n- [ ] Borrowed channel opportunities identified (podcasts, influencers)\n- [ ] Product Hunt listing prepared (if using)\n- [ ] Launch assets created (screenshots, demo video, GIFs)\n- [ ] Onboarding flow ready\n- [ ] Analytics/tracking in place\n\n### Launch Day\n- [ ] Announcement email to list\n- [ ] Blog post published\n- [ ] Social posts scheduled and posted\n- [ ] Product Hunt listing live (if using)\n- [ ] In-app announcement for existing users\n- [ ] Website banner/notification active\n- [ ] Team ready to engage and respond\n- [ ] Monitor for issues and feedback\n\n### Post-Launch\n- [ ] Onboarding email sequence active\n- [ ] Follow-up with engaged prospects\n- [ ] Roundup email includes announcement\n- [ ] Comparison pages published\n- [ ] Interactive demo created\n- [ ] Gather and act on feedback\n- [ ] Plan next launch moment\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What are you launching? (New product, major feature, minor update)\n2. What''s your current audience size and engagement?\n3. What owned channels do you have? (Email list size, blog traffic, community)\n4. What''s your timeline for launch?\n5. Have you launched before? What worked/didn''t work?\n6. Are you considering Product Hunt? What''s your preparation status?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **marketing-ideas**: For additional launch tactics (#22 Product Hunt, #23 Early Access Referrals)\n- **email-sequence**: For launch and onboarding email sequences\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing launch landing pages\n- **marketing-psychology**: For psychology behind waitlists and exclusivity\n- **programmatic-seo**: For comparison pages mentioned in post-launch\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:12:56.069Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing strategic product launch planning and feature announcement capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要战略产品发布规划和功能宣布能力的SaaS焦点AI代理。","ja":"戦略的な製品ローンチ計画と機能アナウンス機能を必要とするSaaS中心のAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전략적인 제품 런치 계획 및 기능 발표 기능이 필요한 SaaS 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA centrados en SaaS que necesitan planificación estratégica de lanzamiento de productos y capacidades de anuncio de características.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS ayant besoin d''une planification stratégique de lancement de produits et de capacités d''annonce de fonctionnalités.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agenten, die eine strategische Produktlaunch-Planung und Funktionenankündigungskapazitäten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que precisam de planejamento estratégico de lançamento de produtos e capacidades de anúncio de recursos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SaaS, которым необходимы стратегические планы запуска продукта и возможности объявления функций.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على SaaS وهم بحاجة إلى التخطيط الاستراتيجي لإطلاق المنتجات وقدرات الإعلان عن الميزات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to plan launches that build momentum, capture attention, and convert interest into users, leveraging product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and utilizing core philosophies of successful companies.","zh":"赋予代理人规划发布的能力，建立势头，吸引注意力，并将兴趣转化为用户，利用来自`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`等文件的产品营销背景，并利用成功公司的核心哲学。","ja":"エージェントは、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルからの製品マーケティングコンテキストを活用し、成功した企業の核心哲学を利用して、勢いを築き、注目を集め、関心をユーザーに変えるローンチ計画を立てることができます。","ko":"에이전트는 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 등의 파일에서 얻는 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 그리고 성공한 기업들의 핵심 철학을 이용하여 모멘텀을 쌓고 주목을 끌고 관심을 유저로 전환하는 런치 계획을 세울 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes planificar lanzamientos que generen impulso, capturen la atención y conviertan el interés en usuarios, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y utilizando filosofías básicas de empresas exitosas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de planifier des lancements qui créent un élan, capturent l''attention et convertissent l''intérêt en utilisateurs, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits à partir de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en utilisant les philosophies de base des entreprises réussies.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Launchs zu planen, die Schwung aufbauen, Aufmerksamkeit erregen und Interesse in Benutzer umwandeln, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen und die Kernphilosophien erfolgreicher Unternehmen anwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a planejar lançamentos que constroem momentum, capturam atenção e convertem interesse em usuários, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e utilizando filosofias centrais de empresas de sucesso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью планировать запуски, которые создают импульс, привлекают внимание и преобразуют интерес в пользователей, используя контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов, таких как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, и используя основные философии успешных компаний.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تخطيط الإطلاقات التي تبني الزخم وتلفت الانتباه وتحول الاهتمام إلى مستخدمين، مستفيدة من سياق تسويق المنتجات من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وتستخدم الفلسفات الأساسية للشركات الناجحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Crafting launch strategies for new SaaS products","Optimizing feature announcements for maximum user engagement","Developing pre-launch and post-launch plans to capture and retain user interest"],"zh":["为新的SaaS产品制定发布策略","优化功能公告以获得最大用户参与度","开发发布前和发布后的计划以捕获和保留用户兴趣"],"ja":["新しいSaaS製品のローンチ戦略を立てる","機能アナウンスを最適化して最大のユーザー関与を得る","ユーザーの関心を捕捉して維持するためのローンチ前とローンチ後の計画を立てる"],"ko":["新的 SaaS 제품의 런치 전략을 수립하는こと","기능 발표를 최적화하여 최대 사용자 참여를 얻는こと","사용자의 관심을 捕获하고 유지하기 위한 런치 전과 런치 후의 계획을 수립하는こと"],"es":["Crear estrategias de lanzamiento para nuevos productos SaaS","Optimizar anuncios de características para un máximo de participación del usuario","Desarrollar planes de prelanzamiento y poslanzamiento para capturar y retener el interés del usuario"],"fr":["Créer des stratégies de lancement pour de nouveaux produits SaaS","Optimiser les annonces de fonctionnalités pour un engagement maximum des utilisateurs","Développer des plans de pré-lancement et de post-lancement pour capter et conserver l''intérêt des utilisateurs"],"de":["Erstellung von Launch-Strategien für neue SaaS-Produkte","Optimierung von Funktionenankündigungen für eine maximale Benutzerverbindung","Entwicklung von Vor- und Nach-Launch-Plänen, um Benutzerinteresse zu gewinnen und zu halten"],"pt":["Elaboração de estratégias de lançamento para novos produtos SaaS","Otimização de anúncios de recursos para engajamento máximo do usuário","Desenvolvimento de planos pré-lançamento e pós-lançamento para capturar e reter o interesse do usuário"],"ru":["Разработка стратегий запуска для новых продуктов SaaS","Оптимизация объявлений функций для максимального вовлечения пользователей","Разработка планов до и после запуска для захвата и удержания интереса пользователей"],"ar":["صياغة استراتيجيات لإطلاق منتجات SaaS جديدة","تحسين إعلانات الميزات لتحقيق أقصى استفادة من المشاركة المستخدم","تطوير خطط ما قبل الإطلاق و ما بعد الإطلاق للاستفادة من اهتمام المستخدمين والمحافظة عليه"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files","May need additional information not covered in the product marketing context"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件","可能需要产品营销背景中未涵盖的额外信息"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルへのアクセスが必要","製品マーケティングコンテキストに含まれない追加情報が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트에 포함되지 않은 추가 정보가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos","Puede necesitar información adicional no cubierta en el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits","Peut nécessiter des informations supplémentaires non couvertes par le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Produktmarketing-Kontextdateien","Kann zusätzliche Informationen erfordern, die nicht im Produktmarketing-Kontext abgedeckt sind"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos","Pode precisar de informações adicionais não cobertas no contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта","Может потребовать дополнительной информации, не охватываемой контекстом маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتجات","يمكن أن يتطلب معلومات إضافية غير مغطاة في سياق تسويق المنتجات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
