Sie die Benutzerfreundlich...","pt":"Design de Interação: Crie Interfaces Usáveis","ru":"Дизайн Взаимодействия: Создавайте Интуитивные Интерфейсы","ar":"تصميم التفاعل: قم بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام","en":"interaction-design"},"description":{"zh":"交互设计是创建引人入胜的用户体验的关键。通过微交互、平滑过渡和手势交互，设计更好的用户界面","ja":"インタラクションデザインは、ユーザーを魅了するインタラクションを作成するための重要な要素です。マイクロインタラクション、スムーズな遷移、ジェスチャーインタラクションなどを使用して、より良いユーザー体験を設計します","ko":"인터랙션 디자인은 사용자 참여를 높이는 인터랙션을 생성하는 데 중요한 역할을 합니다. 마이크로 인터랙션, 스무스한 전환, 제스처 인터랙션 등을 통해 더 나은 사용자 인터페이스를 설계합니다","es":"El diseño de interacción crea experiencias de usuario atractivas e intuitivas a través del movimiento y la retroalimentación. Mejora la usabilidad y deleita ...","fr":"La conception d''interaction crée des expériences utilisateur engageantes et intuitives grâce au mouvement et à la rétroaction. Améliorez la convivialité et r...","de":"Das Interaktionsdesign erstellt ansprechende und intuitive Benutzererfahrungen durch Bewegung und Feedback. Verbessert die Benutzerfreundlichkeit und begeist...","pt":"O design de interação é fundamental para criar interfaces de usuário agradáveis e fáceis de usar. Aprenda a criar interações intuitivas e agradáveis.","ru":"Дизайн взаимодействия является основным для создания приятных и удобных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как создавать интуитивные и приятные интеракции.","ar":"تصميم التفاعل هو أساسي لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم سهلة الاستخدام وجميلة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء تفاعلات سهلة الاستخدام وجميلة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["微交互","平滑过渡","手势交互","加载状态设计","通知系统设计"],"ja":["マイクロインタラクション","スムーズな遷移","ジェスチャーインタラクション","ローディング状態設計","通知システム設計"],"ko":["마이크로 인터랙션","스무스한 전환","제스처 인터랙션","로딩 상태 설계","알림 시스템 설계"],"es":["Microinteracciones para mejorar la retroalimentación del usuario","Transiciones de página y componente suaves","Diseño de estados de carga y pantallas esqueleto","Interacciones basadas en gestos","Sistemas de notificación y toast","Interfaz de arrastrar y soltar"],"fr":["Micro-interactions pour améliorer la rétroaction utilisateur","Transitions de page et de composant fluides","Conception d''états de chargement et d''écrans squelettiques","Interactions basées sur les gestes","Systèmes de notification et de toast","Interface de glisser-déposer"],"de":["Mikrointeraktionen zur Verbesserung der Benutzerfeedback","Fließende Seiten- und Komponentenübergänge","Entwurf von Ladezuständen und Skelettbildschirmen","Gestenbasierte Interaktionen","Benachrichtigungssysteme und Toast","Ziehen-und-Ablegen-Schnittstelle"],"pt":["Microinterações para feedback do usuário","Transições suaves de página e componente","Estados de carregamento e telas esqueleto","Interações baseadas em gestos","Sistemas de notificação e toast","Interfaces de arrastar e soltar"],"ru":["Микроинтеракции для обратной связи пользователя","Плавные переходы страниц и компонентов","Состояния загрузки и скелетные экраны","Интеракции на основе жестов","Системы уведомлений и тостов","Интерфейсы перетаскивания"],"ar":["التفاعلات الصغيرة لتغذية الرجعة للمستخدم","التحولات السلسة للصفحة والمكون","حالات التحميل و الشاشات الهيكلية","التفاعلات القائمة على الإشارات","نظم الإشعارات و التوست","واجهات السحب و الإفلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["交互设计","用户体验","微交互","平滑过渡","手势交互","加载状态设计","通知系统设计"],"ja":["インタラクションデザイン","ユーザー体験","マイクロインタラクション","スムーズな遷移","ジェスチャーインタラクション","ローディング状態設計","通知システム設計"],"ko":["인터랙션 디자인","사용자 경험","마이크로 인터랙션","스무스한 전환","제스처 인터랙션","로딩 상태 설계","알림 시스템 설계"],"es":["diseño de interacción","experiencia del usuario","usabilidad","microinteracciones","transiciones suaves","interacciones basadas en gestos","notificación y toast","arrastrar y soltar","desarrollo web"],"fr":["conception d''interaction","expérience utilisateur","convivialité","micro-interactions","transitions fluides","interactions basées sur les gestes","notification et toast","glisser-déposer","développement web"],"de":["Interaktionsdesign","Benutzererfahrung","Benutzerfreundlichkeit","Mikrointeraktionen","fließende Übergänge","gestenbasierte Interaktionen","Benachrichtigung und Toast","Ziehen-und-Ablegen","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["design de interação","interfaces de usuário","usabilidade","engajamento do usuário","microinterações","transições suaves","estados de carregamento","interações baseadas em gestos"],"ru":["дизайн взаимодействия","пользовательские интерфейсы","удобство использования","вовлеченность пользователей","микроинтеракции","плавные переходы","состояния загрузки","интеракции на основе жестов"],"ar":["تصميم التفاعل","واجهات المستخدم","سهولة الاستخدام","مشاركة المستخدم","التفاعلات الصغيرة","التحولات السلسة","حالات التحميل","التفاعلات القائمة على الإشارات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"interaction-design","description":"Design and implement microinteractions, motion design, transitions, and user feedback patterns. Use when adding polish to UI interactions, implementing loading states, or creating delightful user experiences.","bodyPreview":"# Interaction Design\n\nCreate engaging, intuitive interactions through motion, feedback, and thoughtful state transitions that enhance usability and delight users.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Adding microinteractions to enhance user feedback\n- Implementing smooth page and component transitions\n- Designing loading states and skeleton screens\n- Creating gesture-based interactions\n- Building notification and toast systems\n- Implementing drag-and-drop interfaces\n- Adding scroll-triggered animations","body":"# Interaction Design\n\nCreate engaging, intuitive interactions through motion, feedback, and thoughtful state transitions that enhance usability and delight users.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Adding microinteractions to enhance user feedback\n- Implementing smooth page and component transitions\n- Designing loading states and skeleton screens\n- Creating gesture-based interactions\n- Building notification and toast systems\n- Implementing drag-and-drop interfaces\n- Adding scroll-triggered animations\n- Designing hover and focus states\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Purposeful Motion\n\nMotion should communicate, not decorate:\n\n- **Feedback**: Confirm user actions occurred\n- **Orientation**: Show where elements come from/go to\n- **Focus**: Direct attention to important changes\n- **Continuity**: Maintain context during transitions\n\n### 2. Timing Guidelines\n\n| Duration  | Use Case                                  |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 100-150ms | Micro-feedback (hovers, clicks)           |\n| 200-300ms | Small transitions (toggles, dropdowns)    |\n| 300-500ms | Medium transitions (modals, page changes) |\n| 500ms+    | Complex choreographed animations          |\n\n### 3. Easing Functions\n\n```css\n/* Common easings */\n--ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); /* Decelerate - entering */\n--ease-in: cubic-bezier(0.55, 0, 1, 0.45); /* Accelerate - exiting */\n--ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1); /* Both - moving between */\n--spring: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); /* Overshoot - playful */\n```\n\n## Quick Start: Button Microinteraction\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion } from \"framer-motion\";\n\nexport function InteractiveButton({ children, onClick }) {\n  return (\n    <motion.button\n      onClick={onClick}\n      whileHover={{ scale: 1.02 }}\n      whileTap={{ scale: 0.98 }}\n      transition={{ type: \"spring\", stiffness: 400, damping: 17 }}\n      className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg\"\n    >\n      {children}\n    </motion.button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Interaction Patterns\n\n### 1. Loading States\n\n**Skeleton Screens**: Preserve layout while loading\n\n```tsx\nfunction CardSkeleton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"animate-pulse\">\n      <div className=\"h-48 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg\" />\n      <div className=\"mt-4 h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-3/4\" />\n      <div className=\"mt-2 h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/2\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Progress Indicators**: Show determinate progress\n\n```tsx\nfunction ProgressBar({ progress }: { progress: number }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n      <motion.div\n        className=\"h-full bg-blue-600\"\n        initial={{ width: 0 }}\n        animate={{ width: `${progress}%` }}\n        transition={{ ease: \"easeOut\" }}\n      />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. State Transitions\n\n**Toggle with smooth transition**:\n\n```tsx\nfunction Toggle({ checked, onChange }) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      role=\"switch\"\n      aria-checked={checked}\n      onClick={() => onChange(!checked)}\n      className={`\n        relative w-12 h-6 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200\n        ${checked ? \"bg-blue-600\" : \"bg-gray-300\"}\n      `}\n    >\n      <motion.span\n        className=\"absolute top-1 left-1 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full shadow\"\n        animate={{ x: checked ? 24 : 0 }}\n        transition={{ type: \"spring\", stiffness: 500, damping: 30 }}\n      />\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Page Transitions\n\n**Framer Motion layout animations**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { AnimatePresence, motion } from \"framer-motion\";\n\nfunction PageTransition({ children, key }) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence mode=\"wait\">\n      <motion.div\n        key={key}\n        initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n        animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n        exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\n        transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n      >\n        {children}\n      </motion.div>\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Feedback Patterns\n\n**Ripple effect on click**:\n\n```tsx\nfunction RippleButton({ children, onClick }) {\n  const [ripples, setRipples] = useState([]);\n\n  const handleClick = (e) => {\n    const rect = e.currentTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const ripple = {\n      x: e.clientX - rect.left,\n      y: e.clientY - rect.top,\n      id: Date.now(),\n    };\n    setRipples((prev) => [...prev, ripple]);\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      setRipples((prev) => prev.filter((r) => r.id !== ripple.id));\n    }, 600);\n    onClick?.(e);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={handleClick} className=\"relative overflow-hidden\">\n      {children}\n      {ripples.map((ripple) => (\n        <span\n          key={ripple.id}\n          className=\"absolute bg-white/30 rounded-full animate-ripple\"\n          style={{ left: ripple.x, top: ripple.y }}\n        />\n      ))}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Gesture Interactions\n\n**Swipe to dismiss**:\n\n```tsx\nfunction SwipeCard({ children, onDismiss }) {\n  return (\n    <motion.div\n      drag=\"x\"\n      dragConstraints={{ left: 0, right: 0 }}\n      onDragEnd={(_, info) => {\n        if (Math.abs(info.offset.x) > 100) {\n          onDismiss();\n        }\n      }}\n      className=\"cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\"\n    >\n      {children}\n    </motion.div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## CSS Animation Patterns\n\n### Keyframe Animations\n\n```css\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(10px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%,\n  100% {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n  50% {\n    opacity: 0.5;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n  to {\n    transform: rotate(360deg);\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-fadeIn {\n  animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n.animate-pulse {\n  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n.animate-spin {\n  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Transitions\n\n```css\n.card {\n  transition:\n    transform 0.2s ease-out,\n    box-shadow 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n```\n\n## Accessibility Considerations\n\n```css\n/* Respect user motion preferences */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nfunction AnimatedComponent() {\n  const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(\n    \"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\",\n  ).matches;\n\n  return (\n    <motion.div\n      animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n      transition={{ duration: prefersReducedMotion ? 0 : 0.3 }}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Performance First**: Use `transform` and `opacity` for smooth 60fps\n2. **Reduce Motion Support**: Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n3. **Consistent Timing**: Use a timing scale across the app\n4. **Natural Physics**: Prefer spring animations over linear\n5. **Interruptible**: Allow users to cancel long animations\n6. **Progressive Enhancement**: Work without JS animations\n7. **Test on Devices**: Performance varies significantly\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Janky Animations**: Avoid animating `width`, `height`, `top`, `left`\n- **Over-animation**: Too much motion causes fatigue\n- **Blocking Interactions**: Never prevent user input during animations\n- **Memory Leaks**: Clean up animation listeners on unmount\n- **Flash of Content**: Use `will-change` sparingly for optimization\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Framer Motion Documentation](https://www.framer.com/motion/)\n- [CSS Animation Guide](https://web.dev/animations-guide/)\n- [Material Design Motion](https://m3.material.io/styles/motion/overview)\n- [GSAP Animation Library](https://greensock.com/gsap/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:13:58.717Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in user experience, seeking to craft engaging interactions through motion and feedback.","zh":"适合专注于用户体验的前端代理，旨在通过运动和反馈设计出吸引人的交互。","ja":"ユーザー体験に特化したフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。モーションとフィードバックを通じて魅力的なインタラクションを生み出すことを目指します。","ko":"사용자 경험을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 모션과 피드백을 통해 매력적인 상호 작용을 설계하도록 지원합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se especializan en experiencia de usuario y buscan crear interacciones atractivas a través del movimiento y la retroalimentación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans l''expérience utilisateur, cherchant à créer des interactions engageantes à travers le mouvement et la rétroaction.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf Benutzererfahrung spezialisieren und ansprechende Interaktionen durch Bewegung und Feedback gestalten möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em experiência do usuário, buscando criar interações atraentes por meio de movimento e feedback.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на пользовательском опыте, стремящихся создавать увлекательные взаимодействия через движение и обратную связь.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يختصون في تجربة المستخدم، يسعون إلى创اء تفاعلات جذابة من خلال الحركة والتعليقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design intuitive microinteractions, implement smooth state transitions, and create gesture-based interfaces using motion libraries and feedback protocols, enhancing overall usability and user delight through thoughtful loading states and skeleton screens.","zh":"赋予代理设计直观的微交互，实现平滑的状态转换，并使用运动库和反馈协议创建基于手势的界面，从而通过深思熟虑的加载状态和骨架屏幕增强整体可用性和用户愉悦度。","ja":"エージェントに直感的なマイクロインタラクションを設計し、状態の遷移をスムーズに行い、モーションライブラリとフィードバックプロトコルを使用してジェスチャーベースのインターフェイスを作成する力を与え、考慮されたロード状態とスケルトンスクリーンを通じて全体的な使いやすさとユーザーの喜びを高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 직관적인 마이크로 상호 작용을 설계하고, 상태 전환을 원활하게 구현하며, 모션 라이브러리와 피드백 프로토콜을 사용하여 제스처 기반 인터페이스를 생성하여, 신중하게设计된 로딩 상태와 스켈레톤 화면을 통해 전반적인 사용 편의성과 사용자 만족도를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar microinteracciones intuitivas, implementar transiciones de estado suaves y crear interfaces basadas en gestos utilizando bibliotecas de movimiento y protocolos de retroalimentación, mejorando la usabilidad y la satisfacción del usuario a través de estados de carga y pantallas de esqueleto bien pensados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des micro-interactions intuitives, de mettre en œuvre des transitions d''état fluides et de créer des interfaces basées sur des gestes en utilisant des bibliothèques de mouvement et des protocoles de rétroaction, améliorant ainsi la convivialité et le plaisir de l''utilisateur grâce à des états de chargement et des écrans de squelette bien pensés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, intuitive Mikrointeraktionen zu entwerfen, nahtlose Statusübergänge zu implementieren und gestenbasierte Schnittstellen unter Verwendung von Bewegungsbibliotheken und Feedback-Protokollen zu erstellen, wodurch die Benutzerfreundlichkeit und das Benutzererlebnis durch sorgfältig gestaltete Ladezustände und Skelettbildschirme verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar microinterações intuitivas, implementar transições de estado suaves e criar interfaces baseadas em gestos usando bibliotecas de movimento e protocolos de feedback, melhorando a usabilidade geral e o prazer do usuário por meio de estados de carregamento e telas esqueleto pensados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать интуитивные микровзаимодействия, реализовывать плавные переходы состояний и создавать жестовые интерфейсы с использованием библиотек движений и протоколов обратной связи, повышая общую удобство использования и удовольствие пользователя за счет продуманных состояний загрузки и экранов-скелетов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم تفاعلات صغيرة直يّة، وتنفيذ تحوّلات حالة سلسة، وإنشاء واجهات تعتمد على الإشارة باستخدام مكتبات الحركة وبروتوكولات التعليقات، مما يعزز من سهولة الاستخدام العامة ومتعة المستخدم من خلال حالات تحميل وواجهات هيكلية محسوبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing microinteractions to enhance user feedback","Designing gesture-based interactions for mobile applications","Creating scroll-triggered animations for dynamic web content"],"zh":["实现微交互以增强用户反馈","为移动应用程序设计基于手势的交互","为动态网页内容创建滚动触发的动画"],"ja":["ユーザーのフィードバックを強化するためのマイクロインタラクションの実装","モバイルアプリケーション向けのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションの設計","動的Webコンテンツ用のスクロールトリガーのアニメーションの作成"],"ko":["사용자 피드백을 강화하기 위한 마이크로 상호 작용의 구현","모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 제스처 기반 상호 작용의 설계","동적 웹 콘텐츠를 위한 스크롤 트리거 애니메이션의 생성"],"es":["Implementar microinteracciones para mejorar la retroalimentación del usuario","Diseñar interacciones basadas en gestos para aplicaciones móviles","Crear animaciones desencadenadas por desplazamiento para contenido web dinámico"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des micro-interactions pour améliorer la rétroaction de l''utilisateur","Concevoir des interactions basées sur des gestes pour les applications mobiles","Créer des animations déclenchées par défilement pour un contenu Web dynamique"],"de":["Mikrointeraktionen implementieren, um die Benutzerfeedback zu verbessern","Für mobile Anwendungen gestenbasierte Interaktionen entwerfen","Für dynamischen Webinhalt Scroll-gesteuerte Animationen erstellen"],"pt":["Implementação de microinterações para melhorar o feedback do usuário","Projeto de interações baseadas em gestos para aplicativos móveis","Criação de animações acionadas por rolagem para conteúdo web dinâmico"],"ru":["Реализация микровзаимодействий для улучшения обратной связи пользователя","Проектирование жестовых взаимодействий для мобильных приложений","Создание анимаций, срабатывающих при прокрутке, для динамического веб-контента"],"ar":["تنفيذ تفاعلات صغيرة لتحسين تعليقات المستخدم","تصميم تفاعلات تعتمد على الإشارة لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","إنشاء حركات متحركة مصاحبة للتمرير ل내용 الويب الديناميكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of frontend development frameworks","Dependent on specific design and interaction libraries","Limited to applications with user interface components"],"zh":["需要前端开发框架的知识","依赖于特定的设计和交互库","仅限于具有用户界面组件的应用程序"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発フレームワークの知識が必要","特定のデザインおよびインタラクションライブラリに依存","ユーザーインターフェイスコンポーネントを備えたアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","특정 디자인 및 상호 작용 라이브러리에 의존","사용자 인터페이스 컴포넌트를 갖춘 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de frameworks de desarrollo de frontend","Depende de bibliotecas de diseño y interacción específicas","Limitado a aplicaciones con componentes de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en frameworks de développement de frontend","Dépend de bibliothèques de conception et d''interaction spécifiques","Limité aux applications avec des composants d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Frontend-Entwicklungsframeworks","Ist abhängig von bestimmten Design- und Interaktionsbibliotheken","Eingeschränkt auf Anwendungen mit Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de estruturas de desenvolvimento de frontend","Depende de bibliotecas de design e interação específicas","Limitado a aplicações com componentes de interface do usuário"],"ru":["Требует знаний фронтенд-разработки","Зависит от конкретных библиотек дизайна и взаимодействия","Ограничен для приложений с компонентами пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار العمل الأمامي","يعتمد على مكتبات التصميم والتفاعل النوعية","محدود للتطبيقات التي تحتوي على مكونات واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
