","es":"Guía completa para auditar contenido web contra las pautas WCAG 2.2 con estrategias de remediation para mejorar la accesibilidad","fr":"Guide complet pour auditer le contenu web contre les lignes directrices WCAG 2.2 avec des stratégies de remédiation pour améliorer l''accessibilité","de":"Umfangreiche Anleitung zur Überprüfung von Webinhalten gegen die WCAG 2.2-Richtlinien mit Remediation-Strategien zur Verbesserung der Barrierefreiheit","pt":"Guia abrangente para auditoria de conteúdo web contra diretrizes WCAG 2.2 com estratégias de remediação","ru":"Комплексное руководство по аудиту веб-контента против руководств WCAG 2.2 с стратегиями исправления","ar":"دليل شام्ल لتدقيق المحتوى الويب ضد إرشادات WCAG 2.2 مع استراتيجيات الإصلاح","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["WCAG 2.2指南","无障碍审计","修复违规","实施无障碍组件","满足ADA/Section 508要求","实现VPAT合规"],"ja":["WCAG 2.2ガイドライン","アクセシビリティオーディット","違反修復","アクセシブルコンポーネントの実装","ADA/セクション508要件の満足","VPATコンプライアンスの実現"],"ko":["WCAG 2.2 가이드라인","접근성 감사","위반 수정","접근성 컴포넌트 구현","ADA/섹션 508 요구 사항 충족","VPAT 컴플라이언스 달성"],"es":["Auditoría de contenido web contra WCAG 2.2","Estrategias de remediation para violaciones WCAG","Implementación de componentes accesibles","Preparación para demandas de accesibilidad","Cumplimiento de ADA/Sección 508","Logro de la conformidad VPAT"],"fr":["Audit de contenu web contre WCAG 2.2","Stratégies de remédiation pour les violations WCAG","Mise en œuvre de composants accessibles","Préparation aux poursuites pour accessibilité","Conformité ADA/Section 508","Réalisations de la conformité VPAT"],"de":["Überprüfung von Webinhalten gegen WCAG 2.2","Remediation-Strategien für WCAG-Verletzungen","Implementierung von barrierefreien Komponenten","Vorbereitung auf Barrierefreiheitsklagen","Einhaltung von ADA/Abschnitt 508","Erreichung der VPAT-Konformität"],"pt":["Auditoria de acessibilidade web contra diretrizes WCAG 2.2","Estratégias de remediação para violações WCAG","Implementação de componentes acessíveis","Preparação para processos judiciais de acessibilidade","Cumprimento dos requisitos ADA/Seção 508","Alcance da conformidade VPAT"],"ru":["Аудит доступности веб-сайтов против руководств WCAG 2.2","Стратегии исправления для нарушений WCAG","Реализация доступных компонентов","Подготовка к судебным разбирательствам по доступности","Соблюдение требований ADA/Секции 508","Достижение соответствия VPAT"],"ar":["تدقيق إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب ضد إرشادات WCAG 2.2","استراتيجيات الإصلاح لانتهاكات WCAG","تنفيذ مكونات قابلة للوصول","التحضير للقضايا القانونية المتعلقة بالوصول","الامتثال لمتطلبات ADA/الفقرة 508","الوصول إلى مطابقة VPAT"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WCAG Audit","无障碍审计","WCAG 2.2","ADA合规","Section 508","VPAT","网页无障碍","审计工具"],"ja":["WCAGオーディット","アクセシビリティオーディット","WCAG 2.2","ADAコンプライアンス","セクション508","VPAT","ウェブアクセシビリティ","オーディットツール"],"ko":["WCAG감사","접근성 감사","WCAG 2.2","ADA 컴플라이언스","섹션 508","VPAT","웹 접근성","감사 도구"],"es":["accesibilidad web","WCAG 2.2","auditoría de accesibilidad","remediation","ADA","Sección 508","VPAT","desarrollo web accesible"],"fr":["accessibilité web","WCAG 2.2","audit d''accessibilité","remédiation","ADA","Section 508","VPAT","développement web accessible"],"de":["Web-Zugänglichkeit","WCAG 2.2","Barrierefreiheits-Audit","Remediation","ADA","Abschnitt 508","VPAT","barrierefreie Webentwicklung"],"pt":["WCAG Audit Patterns","auditoria de acessibilidade web","diretrizes WCAG 2.2","estratégias de remediação","acessibilidade web","desenvolvimento web acessível","cumprimento de requisitos ADA","conformidade VPAT"],"ru":["Шаблоны аудита WCAG","аудит доступности веб-сайтов","руководства WCAG 2.2","стратегии исправления","доступность веб-сайтов","разработка доступных веб-сайтов","соблюдение требований ADA","соответствие VPAT"],"ar":["نماذج تدقيق WCAG","تدقيق إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","إرشادات WCAG 2.2","استراتيجيات الإصلاح","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","تطوير الويب القابل للوصول","الامتثال لمتطلبات ADA","مطابقة VPAT"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wcag-audit-patterns","description":"Conduct WCAG 2.2 accessibility audits with automated testing, manual verification, and remediation guidance. Use when auditing websites for accessibility, fixing WCAG violations, or implementing accessible design patterns.","bodyPreview":"# WCAG Audit Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to auditing web content against WCAG 2.2 guidelines with actionable remediation strategies.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Conducting accessibility audits\n- Fixing WCAG violations\n- Implementing accessible components\n- Preparing for accessibility lawsuits\n- Meeting ADA/Section 508 requirements\n- Achieving VPAT compliance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. WCAG Conformance Levels\n\n| Level   | Description            | Required For      |\n| ------- | ---------------","body":"# WCAG Audit Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to auditing web content against WCAG 2.2 guidelines with actionable remediation strategies.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Conducting accessibility audits\n- Fixing WCAG violations\n- Implementing accessible components\n- Preparing for accessibility lawsuits\n- Meeting ADA/Section 508 requirements\n- Achieving VPAT compliance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. WCAG Conformance Levels\n\n| Level   | Description            | Required For      |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **A**   | Minimum accessibility  | Legal baseline    |\n| **AA**  | Standard conformance   | Most regulations  |\n| **AAA** | Enhanced accessibility | Specialized needs |\n\n### 2. POUR Principles\n\n```\nPerceivable:  Can users perceive the content?\nOperable:     Can users operate the interface?\nUnderstandable: Can users understand the content?\nRobust:       Does it work with assistive tech?\n```\n\n### 3. Common Violations by Impact\n\n```\nCritical (Blockers):\n├── Missing alt text for functional images\n├── No keyboard access to interactive elements\n├── Missing form labels\n└── Auto-playing media without controls\n\nSerious:\n├── Insufficient color contrast\n├── Missing skip links\n├── Inaccessible custom widgets\n└── Missing page titles\n\nModerate:\n├── Missing language attribute\n├── Unclear link text\n├── Missing landmarks\n└── Improper heading hierarchy\n```\n\n## Audit Checklist\n\n### Perceivable (Principle 1)\n\n````markdown\n## 1.1 Text Alternatives\n\n### 1.1.1 Non-text Content (Level A)\n\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Decorative images have alt=\"\"\n- [ ] Complex images have long descriptions\n- [ ] Icons with meaning have accessible names\n- [ ] CAPTCHAs have alternatives\n\nCheck:\n\n```html\n<!-- Good -->\n<img src=\"chart.png\" alt=\"Sales increased 25% from Q1 to Q2\" />\n<img src=\"decorative-line.png\" alt=\"\" />\n\n<!-- Bad -->\n<img src=\"chart.png\" />\n<img src=\"decorative-line.png\" alt=\"decorative line\" />\n```\n````\n\n## 1.2 Time-based Media\n\n### 1.2.1 Audio-only and Video-only (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Audio has text transcript\n- [ ] Video has audio description or transcript\n\n### 1.2.2 Captions (Level A)\n\n- [ ] All video has synchronized captions\n- [ ] Captions are accurate and complete\n- [ ] Speaker identification included\n\n### 1.2.3 Audio Description (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Video has audio description for visual content\n\n## 1.3 Adaptable\n\n### 1.3.1 Info and Relationships (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Headings use proper tags (h1-h6)\n- [ ] Lists use ul/ol/dl\n- [ ] Tables have headers\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] ARIA landmarks present\n\nCheck:\n\n```html\n<!-- Heading hierarchy -->\n<h1>Page Title</h1>\n<h2>Section</h2>\n<h3>Subsection</h3>\n<h2>Another Section</h2>\n\n<!-- Table headers -->\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Price</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n</table>\n```\n\n### 1.3.2 Meaningful Sequence (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Reading order is logical\n- [ ] CSS positioning doesn''t break order\n- [ ] Focus order matches visual order\n\n### 1.3.3 Sensory Characteristics (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Instructions don''t rely on shape/color alone\n- [ ] \"Click the red button\" → \"Click Submit (red button)\"\n\n## 1.4 Distinguishable\n\n### 1.4.1 Use of Color (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Color is not only means of conveying info\n- [ ] Links distinguishable without color\n- [ ] Error states not color-only\n\n### 1.4.3 Contrast (Minimum) (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Text: 4.5:1 contrast ratio\n- [ ] Large text (18pt+): 3:1 ratio\n- [ ] UI components: 3:1 ratio\n\nTools: WebAIM Contrast Checker, axe DevTools\n\n### 1.4.4 Resize Text (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Text resizes to 200% without loss\n- [ ] No horizontal scrolling at 320px\n- [ ] Content reflows properly\n\n### 1.4.10 Reflow (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Content reflows at 400% zoom\n- [ ] No two-dimensional scrolling\n- [ ] All content accessible at 320px width\n\n### 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] UI components have 3:1 contrast\n- [ ] Focus indicators visible\n- [ ] Graphical objects distinguishable\n\n### 1.4.12 Text Spacing (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] No content loss with increased spacing\n- [ ] Line height 1.5x font size\n- [ ] Paragraph spacing 2x font size\n- [ ] Letter spacing 0.12x font size\n- [ ] Word spacing 0.16x font size\n\n````\n\n### Operable (Principle 2)\n\n```markdown\n## 2.1 Keyboard Accessible\n\n### 2.1.1 Keyboard (Level A)\n- [ ] All functionality keyboard accessible\n- [ ] No keyboard traps\n- [ ] Tab order is logical\n- [ ] Custom widgets are keyboard operable\n\nCheck:\n```javascript\n// Custom button must be keyboard accessible\n<div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"\n     onkeydown=\"if(event.key === ''Enter'' || event.key === '' '') activate()\">\n````\n\n### 2.1.2 No Keyboard Trap (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Focus can move away from all components\n- [ ] Modal dialogs trap focus correctly\n- [ ] Focus returns after modal closes\n\n## 2.2 Enough Time\n\n### 2.2.1 Timing Adjustable (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Session timeouts can be extended\n- [ ] User warned before timeout\n- [ ] Option to disable auto-refresh\n\n### 2.2.2 Pause, Stop, Hide (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Moving content can be paused\n- [ ] Auto-updating content can be paused\n- [ ] Animations respect prefers-reduced-motion\n\n```css\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  * {\n    animation: none !important;\n    transition: none !important;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 2.3 Seizures and Physical Reactions\n\n### 2.3.1 Three Flashes (Level A)\n\n- [ ] No content flashes more than 3 times/second\n- [ ] Flashing area is small (<25% viewport)\n\n## 2.4 Navigable\n\n### 2.4.1 Bypass Blocks (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Skip to main content link present\n- [ ] Landmark regions defined\n- [ ] Proper heading structure\n\n```html\n<a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to main content</a>\n<main id=\"main\">...</main>\n```\n\n### 2.4.2 Page Titled (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Unique, descriptive page titles\n- [ ] Title reflects page content\n\n### 2.4.3 Focus Order (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Focus order matches visual order\n- [ ] tabindex used correctly\n\n### 2.4.4 Link Purpose (In Context) (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Links make sense out of context\n- [ ] No \"click here\" or \"read more\" alone\n\n```html\n<!-- Bad -->\n<a href=\"report.pdf\">Click here</a>\n\n<!-- Good -->\n<a href=\"report.pdf\">Download Q4 Sales Report (PDF)</a>\n```\n\n### 2.4.6 Headings and Labels (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Headings describe content\n- [ ] Labels describe purpose\n\n### 2.4.7 Focus Visible (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Focus indicator visible on all elements\n- [ ] Custom focus styles meet contrast\n\n```css\n:focus {\n  outline: 3px solid #005fcc;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n```\n\n### 2.4.11 Focus Not Obscured (Level AA) - WCAG 2.2\n\n- [ ] Focused element not fully hidden\n- [ ] Sticky headers don''t obscure focus\n\n````\n\n### Understandable (Principle 3)\n\n```markdown\n## 3.1 Readable\n\n### 3.1.1 Language of Page (Level A)\n- [ ] HTML lang attribute set\n- [ ] Language correct for content\n\n```html\n<html lang=\"en\">\n````\n\n### 3.1.2 Language of Parts (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Language changes marked\n\n```html\n<p>The French word <span lang=\"fr\">bonjour</span> means hello.</p>\n```\n\n## 3.2 Predictable\n\n### 3.2.1 On Focus (Level A)\n\n- [ ] No context change on focus alone\n- [ ] No unexpected popups on focus\n\n### 3.2.2 On Input (Level A)\n\n- [ ] No automatic form submission\n- [ ] User warned before context change\n\n### 3.2.3 Consistent Navigation (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Navigation consistent across pages\n- [ ] Repeated components same order\n\n### 3.2.4 Consistent Identification (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Same functionality = same label\n- [ ] Icons used consistently\n\n## 3.3 Input Assistance\n\n### 3.3.1 Error Identification (Level A)\n\n- [ ] Errors clearly identified\n- [ ] Error message describes problem\n- [ ] Error linked to field\n\n```html\n<input aria-describedby=\"email-error\" aria-invalid=\"true\" />\n<span id=\"email-error\" role=\"alert\">Please enter valid email</span>\n```\n\n### 3.3.2 Labels or Instructions (Level A)\n\n- [ ] All inputs have visible labels\n- [ ] Required fields indicated\n- [ ] Format hints provided\n\n### 3.3.3 Error Suggestion (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Errors include correction suggestion\n- [ ] Suggestions are specific\n\n### 3.3.4 Error Prevention (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Legal/financial forms reversible\n- [ ] Data checked before submission\n- [ ] User can review before submit\n\n````\n\n### Robust (Principle 4)\n\n```markdown\n## 4.1 Compatible\n\n### 4.1.1 Parsing (Level A) - Obsolete in WCAG 2.2\n- [ ] Valid HTML (good practice)\n- [ ] No duplicate IDs\n- [ ] Complete start/end tags\n\n### 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value (Level A)\n- [ ] Custom widgets have accessible names\n- [ ] ARIA roles correct\n- [ ] State changes announced\n\n```html\n<!-- Accessible custom checkbox -->\n<div role=\"checkbox\"\n     aria-checked=\"false\"\n     tabindex=\"0\"\n     aria-labelledby=\"label\">\n</div>\n<span id=\"label\">Accept terms</span>\n````\n\n### 4.1.3 Status Messages (Level AA)\n\n- [ ] Status updates announced\n- [ ] Live regions used correctly\n\n```html\n<div role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">3 items added to cart</div>\n\n<div role=\"alert\" aria-live=\"assertive\">Error: Form submission failed</div>\n```\n\n````\n\n## Automated Testing\n\n```javascript\n// axe-core integration\nconst axe = require(''axe-core'');\n\nasync function runAccessibilityAudit(page) {\n  await page.addScriptTag({ path: require.resolve(''axe-core'') });\n\n  const results = await page.evaluate(async () => {\n    return await axe.run(document, {\n      runOnly: {\n        type: ''tag'',\n        values: [''wcag2a'', ''wcag2aa'', ''wcag21aa'', ''wcag22aa'']\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  return {\n    violations: results.violations,\n    passes: results.passes,\n    incomplete: results.incomplete\n  };\n}\n\n// Playwright test example\ntest(''should have no accessibility violations'', async ({ page }) => {\n  await page.goto(''/'');\n  const results = await runAccessibilityAudit(page);\n\n  expect(results.violations).toHaveLength(0);\n});\n````\n\n```bash\n# CLI tools\nnpx @axe-core/cli https://example.com\nnpx pa11y https://example.com\nlighthouse https://example.com --only-categories=accessibility\n```\n\n## Remediation Patterns\n\n### Fix: Missing Form Labels\n\n```html\n<!-- Before -->\n<input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n\n<!-- After: Option 1 - Visible label -->\n<label for=\"email\">Email address</label>\n<input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" />\n\n<!-- After: Option 2 - aria-label -->\n<input type=\"email\" aria-label=\"Email address\" />\n\n<!-- After: Option 3 - aria-labelledby -->\n<span id=\"email-label\">Email</span>\n<input type=\"email\" aria-labelledby=\"email-label\" />\n```\n\n### Fix: Insufficient Color Contrast\n\n```css\n/* Before: 2.5:1 contrast */\n.text {\n  color: #767676;\n}\n\n/* After: 4.5:1 contrast */\n.text {\n  color: #595959;\n}\n\n/* Or add background */\n.text {\n  color: #767676;\n  background: #000;\n}\n```\n\n### Fix: Keyboard Navigation\n\n```javascript\n// Make custom element keyboard accessible\nclass AccessibleDropdown extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    this.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", \"0\");\n    this.setAttribute(\"role\", \"combobox\");\n    this.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"false\");\n\n    this.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n      switch (e.key) {\n        case \"Enter\":\n        case \" \":\n          this.toggle();\n          e.preventDefault();\n          break;\n        case \"Escape\":\n          this.close();\n          break;\n        case \"ArrowDown\":\n          this.focusNext();\n          e.preventDefault();\n          break;\n        case \"ArrowUp\":\n          this.focusPrevious();\n          e.preventDefault();\n          break;\n      }\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start early** - Accessibility from design phase\n- **Test with real users** - Disabled users provide best feedback\n- **Automate what you can** - 30-50% issues detectable\n- **Use semantic HTML** - Reduces ARIA needs\n- **Document patterns** - Build accessible component library\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t rely only on automated testing** - Manual testing required\n- **Don''t use ARIA as first solution** - Native HTML first\n- **Don''t hide focus outlines** - Keyboard users need them\n- **Don''t disable zoom** - Users need to resize\n- **Don''t use color alone** - Multiple indicators needed\n\n## Resources\n\n- [WCAG 2.2 Guidelines](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/)\n- [WebAIM](https://webaim.org/)\n- [A11y Project Checklist](https://www.a11yproject.com/checklist/)\n- [axe DevTools](https://www.deque.com/axe/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:14:01.909Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Accessibility Agents needing comprehensive WCAG 2.2 guideline auditing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面WCAG 2.2指南审计能力的无障碍代理。","ja":"WCAG 2.2ガイドラインの包括的な監査機能を必要とするアクセシビリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전면적인 WCAG 2.2 가이드라인 감사를 필요로 하는 접근성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Accesibilidad que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de directrices WCAG 2.2 integrales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''accessibilité ayant besoin de capacités d''audit de directives WCAG 2.2 complètes.","de":"Perfekt für Accessibility-Agents, die umfassende WCAG 2.2-Richtlinien-Prüfmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Acessibilidade que necessitam de capacidades de auditoria abrangentes das diretrizes WCAG 2.2.","ru":"Идеально для агентов доступности, которым необходимы всеобъемлющие возможности аудита руководящих принципов WCAG 2.2.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإمكانية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تدقيق شاملة لمرشد الإمكانية WCAG 2.2."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough accessibility audits, identify WCAG violations, and implement remediation strategies using actionable patterns, ensuring ADA/Section 508 compliance and VPAT conformance through WCAG conformance levels.","zh":"赋予代理进行彻底的无障碍审计、识别WCAG违规并使用可执行模式实施补救策略，确保ADA/第508节合规性和VPAT一致性通过WCAG一致性级别。","ja":"エージェントが包括的なアクセシビリティ監査を実施し、WCAG違反を特定し、実行可能なパターンを使用して是正戦略を実施することを可能にし、WCAGの準拠レベルを通じてADA/セクション508の準拠とVPATの一致を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 접근성 감사를 수행하고 WCAG 위반을 식별하며 실행 가능한 패턴을 사용하여 시정 전략을 구현하여 WCAG 준수 수준을 통해 ADA/제508조 준수 및 VPAT 준수를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de accesibilidad exhaustivas, identificar violaciones de WCAG y implementar estrategias de remediación utilizando patrones accionables, garantizando el cumplimiento de ADA/Sección 508 y la conformidad VPAT a través de los niveles de conformidad de WCAG.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits d''accessibilité approfondis, d''identifier les violations de WCAG et de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de remédiation en utilisant des modèles actionnables, garantissant ainsi la conformité ADA/Section 508 et la conformité VPAT grâce aux niveaux de conformité WCAG.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Barrierefreiheits-Audits durchzuführen, WCAG-Verletzungen zu identifizieren und Abhilfestrategien unter Verwendung von handlungsfähigen Mustern umzusetzen, um so die Einhaltung von ADA/Abschnitt 508 und die VPAT-Konformität durch die WCAG-Konformitätsstufen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de acessibilidade abrangentes, identificar violações da WCAG e implementar estratégias de remediação usando padrões de ação, garantindo a conformidade com a ADA/Seção 508 e a conformidade do VPAT por meio dos níveis de conformidade da WCAG.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты доступности, выявлять нарушения WCAG и реализовывать стратегии исправления с помощью действенных шаблонов, обеспечивая соответствие требованиям ADA/Раздела 508 и соответствие VPAT через уровни соответствия WCAG.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء تدقيقات شاملة للإمكانية، وتحديد انتهاكات WCAG، وتنفيذ استراتيجيات الإصلاح باستخدام أنماط مفعمة بالفعل، مما يضمن امتثال ADA/المادة 508 وامتثال VPAT من خلال مستويات امتثال WCAG."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating accessibility audits for web content","Identifying and fixing WCAG violations","Implementing accessible components for ADA/Section 508 compliance"],"zh":["自动化网络内容的无障碍审计","识别和修复WCAG违规","为ADA/第508节合规性实施可访问的组件"],"ja":["Webコンテンツのアクセシビリティ監査を自動化する","WCAG違反を特定して修正する","ADA/セクション508の準拠性のためにアクセス可能なコンポーネントを実装する"],"ko":["웹 콘텐츠의 접근성 감사를 자동화하는 것","WCAG 위반을 식별하고 수정하는 것","ADA/제508조 준수를 위한 접근 가능한 구성 요소를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de accesibilidad para contenido web","Identificar y corregir violaciones de WCAG","Implementar componentes accesibles para el cumplimiento de ADA/Sección 508"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits d''accessibilité pour le contenu Web","Identifier et corriger les violations de WCAG","Mettre en œuvre des composants accessibles pour la conformité ADA/Section 508"],"de":["Automatisierung von Barrierefreiheits-Audits für Webinhalte","Identifizierung und Korrektur von WCAG-Verletzungen","Implementierung von zugänglichen Komponenten für die Einhaltung von ADA/Abschnitt 508"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de acessibilidade para conteúdo da web","Identificar e corrigir violações da WCAG","Implementar componentes acessíveis para conformidade com a ADA/Seção 508"],"ru":["Автоматизация аудитов доступности для веб-контента","Выявление и исправление нарушений WCAG","Реализация доступных компонентов для соответствия требованиям ADA/Раздела 508"],"ar":["آليّة فحص الإمكانية للمحتوى الإلكتروني","تحديد وإصلاح انتهاكات WCAG","تنفيذ مكونات قابلة للوصول لامتثال ADA/المادة 508"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of WCAG 2.2 guidelines","Limited to web content accessibility audits"],"zh":["需要了解WCAG 2.2指南","仅限于网络内容的无障碍审计"],"ja":["WCAG 2.2ガイドラインの知識が必要","Webコンテンツのアクセシビリティ監査のみに限定される"],"ko":["WCAG 2.2 가이드ライン에 대한 지식이 필요","웹 콘텐츠의 접근성 감사만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las directrices WCAG 2.2","Limitado a auditorías de accesibilidad de contenido web"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des directives WCAG 2.2","Limité aux audits d''accessibilité de contenu Web"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der WCAG 2.2-Richtlinien","Begrenzt auf Barrierefreiheits-Audits für Webinhalte"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento das diretrizes WCAG 2.2","Limitado a auditorias de acessibilidade de conteúdo da web"],"ru":["Требует знания руководящих принципов WCAG 2.2","Ограничен аудитами доступности веб-контента"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمرشد الإمكانية WCAG 2.2","محدود بفحص الإمكانية لمحتوى الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
