ين التسلسل الهرمي المرئي والقابلية للقراءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["视觉设计","字体设计","颜色设计","间距设计","图标设计","可访问设计","设计系统","视觉层次","可读性设计"],"ja":["ビジュアルデザイン","タイポグラフィ","カラーデザイン","スペーシングデザイン","アイコンデザイン","アクセシブルデザイン","デザインシステム","視覚的な階層","可読性デザイン"],"ko":["시각적 디자인","타이포그래피","색상 디자인","스페이싱 디자인","아이콘 디자인","접근 가능한 디자인","디자인 시스템","시각적 계층","가독성 디자인"],"es":["diseño visual","tipografía","color y accesibilidad","espaciado y tamaño","iconografía","jerarquía visual","legibilidad","diseño de interfaces","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["conception visuelle","typographie","couleur et accessibilité","espacement et taille","iconographie","hiérarchie visuelle","lisibilité","conception d''interfaces","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["visuelles Design","Typografie","Farbe und Zugänglichkeit","Abstand und Größe","Iconografie","visuelle Hierarchie","Lesbarkeit","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["design visual","tipografia","cor","espaçamento","iconografia","acessibilidade","sistemas visuais","design tokens","paletas de cores"],"ru":["визуальный дизайн","типография","цвет","интервал","иконография","доступность","визуальные системы","дизайн-токены","цветовые палитры"],"ar":["التصميم المرئي","الطباعة","اللون","الفراغ","الرمزية","الوصول","الأنظمة المرئية","رموز التصميم","لوحات الألوان"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"visual-design-foundations","description":"Apply typography, color theory, spacing systems, and iconography principles to create cohesive visual designs. Use when establishing design tokens, building style guides, or improving visual hierarchy and consistency.","bodyPreview":"# Visual Design Foundations\n\nBuild cohesive, accessible visual systems using typography, color, spacing, and iconography fundamentals.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Establishing design tokens for a new project\n- Creating or refining a spacing and sizing system\n- Selecting and pairing typefaces\n- Building accessible color palettes\n- Designing icon systems and visual assets\n- Improving visual hierarchy and readability\n- Auditing designs for visual consistency\n- Implementing dark mode or theming\n\n#","body":"# Visual Design Foundations\n\nBuild cohesive, accessible visual systems using typography, color, spacing, and iconography fundamentals.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Establishing design tokens for a new project\n- Creating or refining a spacing and sizing system\n- Selecting and pairing typefaces\n- Building accessible color palettes\n- Designing icon systems and visual assets\n- Improving visual hierarchy and readability\n- Auditing designs for visual consistency\n- Implementing dark mode or theming\n\n## Core Systems\n\n### 1. Typography Scale\n\n**Modular Scale** (ratio-based sizing):\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --font-size-xs: 0.75rem; /* 12px */\n  --font-size-sm: 0.875rem; /* 14px */\n  --font-size-base: 1rem; /* 16px */\n  --font-size-lg: 1.125rem; /* 18px */\n  --font-size-xl: 1.25rem; /* 20px */\n  --font-size-2xl: 1.5rem; /* 24px */\n  --font-size-3xl: 1.875rem; /* 30px */\n  --font-size-4xl: 2.25rem; /* 36px */\n  --font-size-5xl: 3rem; /* 48px */\n}\n```\n\n**Line Height Guidelines**:\n| Text Type | Line Height |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| Headings | 1.1 - 1.3 |\n| Body text | 1.5 - 1.7 |\n| UI labels | 1.2 - 1.4 |\n\n### 2. Spacing System\n\n**8-point grid** (industry standard):\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --space-1: 0.25rem; /* 4px */\n  --space-2: 0.5rem; /* 8px */\n  --space-3: 0.75rem; /* 12px */\n  --space-4: 1rem; /* 16px */\n  --space-5: 1.25rem; /* 20px */\n  --space-6: 1.5rem; /* 24px */\n  --space-8: 2rem; /* 32px */\n  --space-10: 2.5rem; /* 40px */\n  --space-12: 3rem; /* 48px */\n  --space-16: 4rem; /* 64px */\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Color System\n\n**Semantic color tokens**:\n\n```css\n:root {\n  /* Brand */\n  --color-primary: #2563eb;\n  --color-primary-hover: #1d4ed8;\n  --color-primary-active: #1e40af;\n\n  /* Semantic */\n  --color-success: #16a34a;\n  --color-warning: #ca8a04;\n  --color-error: #dc2626;\n  --color-info: #0891b2;\n\n  /* Neutral */\n  --color-gray-50: #f9fafb;\n  --color-gray-100: #f3f4f6;\n  --color-gray-200: #e5e7eb;\n  --color-gray-300: #d1d5db;\n  --color-gray-400: #9ca3af;\n  --color-gray-500: #6b7280;\n  --color-gray-600: #4b5563;\n  --color-gray-700: #374151;\n  --color-gray-800: #1f2937;\n  --color-gray-900: #111827;\n}\n```\n\n## Quick Start: Design Tokens in Tailwind\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      fontFamily: {\n        sans: [\"Inter\", \"system-ui\", \"sans-serif\"],\n        mono: [\"JetBrains Mono\", \"monospace\"],\n      },\n      fontSize: {\n        xs: [\"0.75rem\", { lineHeight: \"1rem\" }],\n        sm: [\"0.875rem\", { lineHeight: \"1.25rem\" }],\n        base: [\"1rem\", { lineHeight: \"1.5rem\" }],\n        lg: [\"1.125rem\", { lineHeight: \"1.75rem\" }],\n        xl: [\"1.25rem\", { lineHeight: \"1.75rem\" }],\n        \"2xl\": [\"1.5rem\", { lineHeight: \"2rem\" }],\n      },\n      colors: {\n        brand: {\n          50: \"#eff6ff\",\n          500: \"#3b82f6\",\n          600: \"#2563eb\",\n          700: \"#1d4ed8\",\n        },\n      },\n      spacing: {\n        // Extends default with custom values\n        18: \"4.5rem\",\n        88: \"22rem\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Typography Best Practices\n\n### Font Pairing\n\n**Safe combinations**:\n\n- Heading: **Inter** / Body: **Inter** (single family)\n- Heading: **Playfair Display** / Body: **Source Sans Pro** (contrast)\n- Heading: **Space Grotesk** / Body: **IBM Plex Sans** (geometric)\n\n### Responsive Typography\n\n```css\n/* Fluid typography using clamp() */\nh1 {\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw + 1rem, 3.5rem);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\np {\n  font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw + 0.5rem, 1.125rem);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  max-width: 65ch; /* Optimal reading width */\n}\n```\n\n### Font Loading\n\n```css\n/* Prevent layout shift */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: \"Inter\";\n  src: url(\"/fonts/Inter.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");\n  font-display: swap;\n  font-weight: 400 700;\n}\n```\n\n## Color Theory\n\n### Contrast Requirements (WCAG)\n\n| Element            | Minimum Ratio |\n| ------------------ | ------------- |\n| Body text          | 4.5:1 (AA)    |\n| Large text (18px+) | 3:1 (AA)      |\n| UI components      | 3:1 (AA)      |\n| Enhanced           | 7:1 (AAA)     |\n\n### Dark Mode Strategy\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --bg-primary: #ffffff;\n  --bg-secondary: #f9fafb;\n  --text-primary: #111827;\n  --text-secondary: #6b7280;\n  --border: #e5e7eb;\n}\n\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  --bg-primary: #111827;\n  --bg-secondary: #1f2937;\n  --text-primary: #f9fafb;\n  --text-secondary: #9ca3af;\n  --border: #374151;\n}\n```\n\n### Color Accessibility\n\n```tsx\n// Check contrast programmatically\nfunction getContrastRatio(foreground: string, background: string): number {\n  const getLuminance = (hex: string) => {\n    const rgb = hexToRgb(hex);\n    const [r, g, b] = rgb.map((c) => {\n      c = c / 255;\n      return c <= 0.03928 ? c / 12.92 : Math.pow((c + 0.055) / 1.055, 2.4);\n    });\n    return 0.2126 * r + 0.7152 * g + 0.0722 * b;\n  };\n\n  const l1 = getLuminance(foreground);\n  const l2 = getLuminance(background);\n  const lighter = Math.max(l1, l2);\n  const darker = Math.min(l1, l2);\n\n  return (lighter + 0.05) / (darker + 0.05);\n}\n```\n\n## Spacing Guidelines\n\n### Component Spacing\n\n```\nCard padding:      16-24px (--space-4 to --space-6)\nSection gap:       32-64px (--space-8 to --space-16)\nForm field gap:    16-24px (--space-4 to --space-6)\nButton padding:    8-16px vertical, 16-24px horizontal\nIcon-text gap:     8px (--space-2)\n```\n\n### Visual Rhythm\n\n```css\n/* Consistent vertical rhythm */\n.prose > * + * {\n  margin-top: var(--space-4);\n}\n\n.prose > h2 + * {\n  margin-top: var(--space-2);\n}\n\n.prose > * + h2 {\n  margin-top: var(--space-8);\n}\n```\n\n## Iconography\n\n### Icon Sizing System\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --icon-xs: 12px;\n  --icon-sm: 16px;\n  --icon-md: 20px;\n  --icon-lg: 24px;\n  --icon-xl: 32px;\n}\n```\n\n### Icon Component\n\n```tsx\ninterface IconProps {\n  name: string;\n  size?: \"xs\" | \"sm\" | \"md\" | \"lg\" | \"xl\";\n  className?: string;\n}\n\nconst sizeMap = {\n  xs: 12,\n  sm: 16,\n  md: 20,\n  lg: 24,\n  xl: 32,\n};\n\nexport function Icon({ name, size = \"md\", className }: IconProps) {\n  return (\n    <svg\n      width={sizeMap[size]}\n      height={sizeMap[size]}\n      className={cn(\"inline-block flex-shrink-0\", className)}\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n    >\n      <use href={`/icons.svg#${name}`} />\n    </svg>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Establish Constraints**: Limit choices to maintain consistency\n2. **Document Decisions**: Create a living style guide\n3. **Test Accessibility**: Verify contrast, sizing, touch targets\n4. **Use Semantic Tokens**: Name by purpose, not appearance\n5. **Design Mobile-First**: Start with constraints, add complexity\n6. **Maintain Vertical Rhythm**: Consistent spacing creates harmony\n7. **Limit Font Weights**: 2-3 weights per family is sufficient\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Inconsistent Spacing**: Not using a defined scale\n- **Poor Contrast**: Failing WCAG requirements\n- **Font Overload**: Too many families or weights\n- **Magic Numbers**: Arbitrary values instead of tokens\n- **Missing States**: Forgetting hover, focus, disabled\n- **No Dark Mode Plan**: Retrofitting is harder than planning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Tailwind CSS Documentation](https://tailwindcss.com/docs)\n- [Type Scale Calculator](https://typescale.com/)\n- [Contrast Checker](https://webaim.org/resources/contrastchecker/)\n- [Material Design Color System](https://m3.material.io/styles/color/overview)\n- [Radix Colors](https://www.radix-ui.com/colors)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:14:31.759Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing advanced visual design capabilities for typography, color, and spacing fundamentals.","zh":"非常适合需要高级视觉设计功能的 UI/UX 代理，尤其是在字体、颜色和间距基础方面。","ja":"UI/UX エージェントがタイポグラフィ、色、スペーシングの基礎的な視覚デザイン機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"타이포그래피, 색상, 간격의 기본적인 시각적 디자인 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de diseño visual avanzadas para fundamentos de tipografía, color y espaciado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin de capacités de conception visuelle avancées pour les principes fondamentaux de typographie, de couleur et d''espacement.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agents, die erweiterte visuelle Designfähigkeiten für Typografie-, Farb- und Abstandsfundamente benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design visual para fundamentos de tipografia, cor e espaçamento.","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуального дизайна для типографики, цвета и основ пространственного расположения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم مرئي متقدم لأساسيات الطباعة ، واللون ، ومسافات التباعد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create cohesive visual systems using design tokens, accessible color palettes, and typography fundamentals, while implementing dark mode or theming using SVG and iconography protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建连贯的视觉系统的能力，使用设计令牌、无障碍颜色调色板和字体基础，同时使用 SVG 和图标协议实现暗黑模式或主题。","ja":"デザイン トークン、構造化されたカラーパレット、およびタイポグラフィーの基礎を使用して一貫性のある視覚システムを作成するエージェントを可能にし、SVG およびアイコン プロトコルを使用してダーク モードまたはテーマを実装します。","ko":"디자인 토큰, 구조화된 색상 팔레트 및 타이포그래피 기본을 사용하여 일관성 있는 시각적 시스템을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, SVG 및 아이콘 프로토콜을 사용하여 다크 모드 또는 테마를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear sistemas visuales cohesivos utilizando tokens de diseño, paletas de colores accesibles y principios fundamentales de tipografía, al mismo tiempo que implementan el modo oscuro o la tematización utilizando protocolos SVG y de iconografía.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes visuels cohérents en utilisant des jetons de conception, des palettes de couleurs accessibles et des principes fondamentaux de typographie, tout en implémentant le mode sombre ou la personnalisation à l''aide de protocoles SVG et d''icônes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kohärente visuelle Systeme zu erstellen, indem sie Design-Tokens, zugängliche Farbpaletten und Typografie-Grundlagen verwenden, während sie Dunkelmodus oder Thematisierung mit SVG- und Icon-Protokollen implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem sistemas visuais coesos usando tokens de design, paletas de cores acessíveis e fundamentos de tipografia, ao mesmo tempo em que implementam o modo escuro ou a tematização usando protocolos SVG e iconografia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целостные визуальные системы с помощью дизайн-токенов, доступных цветовых палитр и основ типографики, а также реализацию темного режима или тематизации с использованием протоколов SVG и иконографии.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء أنظمة بصرية متوافقة باستخدام رموز التصميم ، وألوان لوحات متوافقة ، وأسس الطباعة ، وفي الوقت نفسه تنفيذ وضع المظلمة أو التهيئة باستخدام بروتوكولات SVG وبروتوكولات الأيقونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Establishing design tokens for new projects","Building accessible color palettes for web applications","Designing icon systems and visual assets for mobile apps"],"zh":["为新项目建立设计令牌","为 Web 应用程序构建无障碍颜色调色板","为移动应用程序设计图标系统和视觉资产"],"ja":["新規プロジェクトのデザイン トークンを確立する","Web アプリケーションのアクセシブル カラーパレットを構築する","モバイル アプリケーションのアイコン システムと視覚的なアセットを設計する"],"ko":["새 프로젝트에 대한 디자인 토큰을 설정하는 것","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 접근 가능한 색상 팔레트를 구축하는 것","모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 아이콘 시스템 및 시각적 자산을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Establecer tokens de diseño para nuevos proyectos","Crear paletas de colores accesibles para aplicaciones web","Diseñar sistemas de iconos y activos visuales para aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Établir des jetons de conception pour les nouveaux projets","Créer des palettes de couleurs accessibles pour les applications Web","Concevoir des systèmes d''icônes et des ressources visuelles pour les applications mobiles"],"de":["Design-Tokens für neue Projekte festlegen","Zugängliche Farbpaletten für Webanwendungen erstellen","Icon-Systeme und visuelle Vermögenswerte für Mobile Apps entwerfen"],"pt":["Estabelecer tokens de design para novos projetos","Construir paletas de cores acessíveis para aplicações web","Projetar sistemas de ícones e ativos visuais para aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Установка токенов дизайна для новых проектов","Создание доступных цветовых палитр для веб-приложений","Разработка систем иконок и визуальных активов для мобильных приложений"],"ar":["تعيين رموز التصميم للمشاريع الجديدة","بناء لوحات الألوان المتوافقة لتطبيقات الويب","تصميم أنظمة الأيقونات والأصول المرئية لتطبيقات الهواتف المحمولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design expertise for effective implementation","Limited to visual design aspects, not functional implementation"],"zh":["需要设计专业知识才能有效实施","仅限于视觉设计方面，而不是功能实现"],"ja":["有効な実装にはデザインの専門知識が必要","視覚的なデザインの側面のみに限定され、機能の実装ではありません"],"ko":["유효한 구현에는 디자인 전문 지식이 필요함","기능 구현이 아닌 시각적 디자인 측면만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en diseño para una implementación efectiva","Limitado a aspectos de diseño visual, no a implementación funcional"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en conception pour une mise en œuvre efficace","Limité aux aspects de conception visuelle, et non à la mise en œuvre fonctionnelle"],"de":["Benötigt Design-Expertise für eine effektive Implementierung","Begrenzt auf visuelle Designaspekte, nicht auf funktionale Implementierung"],"pt":["Exige expertise em design para implementação eficaz","Limitado a aspectos de design visual, não implementação funcional"],"ru":["Требует опыта в области дизайна для эффективной реализации","Ограничен аспектами визуального дизайна, не функциональной реализацией"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في مجال التصميم للتنفيذ الفعال","محدود لجوانب التصميم المرئي ، وليس التنفيذ الوظيفي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
