成および維持するために使用されます","ko":"제품 마케팅 컨텍스트는 기본 위치 및 메시지 정보를 캡처하는 제품 마케팅 문서를 생성 및 유지하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"El contexto de marketing de productos es un documento que captura información fundamental de posición y mensaje para mejorar la eficiencia del equipo","fr":"Le contexte de marketing de produits est un document qui capture des informations fondamentales de position et de message pour améliorer l''efficacité de l''éq...","de":"Der Produktmarketing-Kontext ist ein Dokument, das grundlegende Positionierungs- und Messaging-Informationen erfasst, um die Team-Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"O contexto de marketing de produto é um documento que captura informações de posicionamento e mensagens fundamentais","ru":"Контекст продуктового маркетинга - это документ, который захватывает основную информацию о позиционировании и сообщениях","ar":"سياق تسويق المنتج هو وثيقة تحقق بيانات التموضع والرسائل الأساسية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建和维护产品营销文档","捕获基本定位和信息","避免信息重复","文档存储在`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","支持多步骤工作流","提供文档摘要"],"ja":["製品マーケティングドキュメントの作成および維持","基本的なポジショニングとメッセージ情報のキャプチャ","情報の重複を避ける","ドキュメントは`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`に保存される","複数ステップのワークフローをサポート","ドキュメントのサマリーを提供"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 문서 생성 및 유지","기본 위치 및 메시지 정보 캡처","정보 반복 피하기","문서는 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`에 저장됨","다단계 워크플로 지원","문서 요약 제공"],"es":["Creación y mantenimiento de un documento de contexto de marketing de productos","Captura de información de posición y mensaje fundamental","Mejora de la eficiencia del equipo mediante la reducción de la repetición de información","Almacenamiento del documento en .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Resumen y lectura del documento existente"],"fr":["Création et maintenance d''un document de contexte de marketing de produits","Capture d''informations de position et de message fondamentales","Amélioration de l''efficacité de l''équipe grâce à la réduction de la répétition d''informations","Stockage du document dans .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Résumé et lecture du document existant"],"de":["Erstellung und Pflege eines Dokuments für den Produktmarketing-Kontext","Erfassung grundlegender Positionierungs- und Messaging-Informationen","Verbesserung der Team-Effizienz durch Reduzierung von Informationswiederholungen","Speicherung des Dokuments in .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Zusammenfassung und Lesen des vorhandenen Dokuments"],"pt":["Criação de documento de contexto de marketing de produto","Armazenamento de informações de posicionamento e mensagens","Referência para outros skills de marketing","Sumarização de informações existentes","Verificação de existência de contexto"],"ru":["Создание документа контекста продуктового маркетинга","Хранение информации о позиционировании и сообщениях","Ссылка для других навыков маркетинга","Суммаризация существующей информации","Проверка существования контекста"],"ar":["إنشاء وثيقة سياق تسويق المنتج","تخزين بيانات التموضع والرسائل","مرجع لمهارات التسويق الأخرى","تحقيق بيانات موجودة","تحقق من وجود السياق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["产品营销背景","产品营销文档","基本定位","信息捕获","文档维护","信息重复","多步骤工作流"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキスト","製品マーケティングドキュメント","基本的なポジショニング","メッセージ情報のキャプチャ","ドキュメントの維持","情報の重複","複数ステップのワークフロー"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트","제품 마케팅 문서","기본 위치","메시지 정보 캡처","문서 유지","정보 반복","다단계 워크플로"],"es":["contexto de marketing de productos","documento de contexto de marketing","posicionamiento de productos","mensaje de marketing","eficiencia del equipo","marketing de productos"],"fr":["contexte de marketing de produits","document de contexte de marketing","positionnement de produits","message de marketing","efficacité de l''équipe","marketing de produits"],"de":["Produktmarketing-Kontext","Dokument für den Produktmarketing-Kontext","Produktpositionierung","Marketingnachricht","Team-Effizienz","Produktmarketing"],"pt":["contexto de marketing de produto","posicionamento de produto","mensagens de marketing","documento de contexto","skills de marketing","referência de marketing"],"ru":["контекст продуктового маркетинга","позиционирование продукта","сообщения маркетинга","документ контекста","навыки маркетинга","ссылка маркетинга"],"ar":["سياق تسويق المنتج","تموضع المنتج","رسائل التسويق","وثيقة السياق","مهارات التسويق","مرجع التسويق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-marketing-context","description":"When the user wants to create or update their product marketing context document. Also use when the user mentions product context, marketing context, set up context, positioning, or wants to avoid repeating foundational information across marketing tasks. Creates `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` that other marketing skills reference.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Product Marketing Context\n\nYou help users create and maintain a product marketing context document. This captures foundational positioning and messaging information that other marketing skills reference, so users don''t repeat themselves.\n\nThe document is stored at `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Check for Existing Context\n\nFirst, check if `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` already exists.\n\n**If it exists:**\n- Read it and summarize what''s captured\n- Ask whi","body":"# Product Marketing Context\n\nYou help users create and maintain a product marketing context document. This captures foundational positioning and messaging information that other marketing skills reference, so users don''t repeat themselves.\n\nThe document is stored at `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Check for Existing Context\n\nFirst, check if `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` already exists.\n\n**If it exists:**\n- Read it and summarize what''s captured\n- Ask which sections they want to update\n- Only gather info for those sections\n\n**If it doesn''t exist, offer two options:**\n\n1. **Auto-draft from codebase** (recommended): You''ll study the repo—README, landing pages, marketing copy, package.json, etc.—and draft a V1 of the context document. The user then reviews, corrects, and fills gaps. This is faster than starting from scratch.\n\n2. **Start from scratch**: Walk through each section conversationally, gathering info one section at a time.\n\nMost users prefer option 1. After presenting the draft, ask: \"What needs correcting? What''s missing?\"\n\n### Step 2: Gather Information\n\n**If auto-drafting:**\n1. Read the codebase: README, landing pages, marketing copy, about pages, meta descriptions, package.json, any existing docs\n2. Draft all sections based on what you find\n3. Present the draft and ask what needs correcting or is missing\n4. Iterate until the user is satisfied\n\n**If starting from scratch:**\nWalk through each section below conversationally, one at a time. Don''t dump all questions at once.\n\nFor each section:\n1. Briefly explain what you''re capturing\n2. Ask relevant questions\n3. Confirm accuracy\n4. Move to the next\n\n**Important:** Push for verbatim customer language. Exact phrases are more valuable than polished descriptions.\n\n---\n\n## Sections to Capture\n\n### 1. Product Overview\n- One-line description\n- What it does (2-3 sentences)\n- Product category (what \"shelf\" you sit on—how customers search for you)\n- Product type (SaaS, marketplace, e-commerce, service, etc.)\n- Business model and pricing\n\n### 2. Target Audience\n- Target company type (industry, size, stage)\n- Target decision-makers (roles, departments)\n- Primary use case (the main problem you solve)\n- Jobs to be done (2-3 things customers \"hire\" you for)\n- Specific use cases or scenarios\n\n### 3. Personas (B2B only)\nIf multiple stakeholders are involved in buying, capture for each:\n- User, Champion, Decision Maker, Financial Buyer, Technical Influencer\n- What each cares about, their challenge, and the value you promise them\n\n### 4. Problems & Pain Points\n- Core challenge customers face before finding you\n- Why current solutions fall short\n- What it costs them (time, money, opportunities)\n- Emotional tension (stress, fear, doubt)\n\n### 5. Competitive Landscape\n- **Direct competitors**: Same solution, same problem (e.g., Calendly vs SavvyCal)\n- **Secondary competitors**: Different solution, same problem (e.g., Calendly vs Superhuman scheduling)\n- **Indirect competitors**: Conflicting approach (e.g., Calendly vs personal assistant)\n- How each falls short for customers\n\n### 6. Differentiation\n- Key differentiators (capabilities alternatives lack)\n- How you solve it differently\n- Why that''s better (benefits)\n- Why customers choose you over alternatives\n\n### 7. Objections & Anti-Personas\n- Top 3 objections heard in sales and how to address them\n- Who is NOT a good fit (anti-persona)\n\n### 8. Switching Dynamics\nThe JTBD Four Forces:\n- **Push**: What frustrations drive them away from current solution\n- **Pull**: What attracts them to you\n- **Habit**: What keeps them stuck with current approach\n- **Anxiety**: What worries them about switching\n\n### 9. Customer Language\n- How customers describe the problem (verbatim)\n- How they describe your solution (verbatim)\n- Words/phrases to use\n- Words/phrases to avoid\n- Glossary of product-specific terms\n\n### 10. Brand Voice\n- Tone (professional, casual, playful, etc.)\n- Communication style (direct, conversational, technical)\n- Brand personality (3-5 adjectives)\n\n### 11. Proof Points\n- Key metrics or results to cite\n- Notable customers/logos\n- Testimonial snippets\n- Main value themes and supporting evidence\n\n### 12. Goals\n- Primary business goal\n- Key conversion action (what you want people to do)\n- Current metrics (if known)\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Create the Document\n\nAfter gathering information, create `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Product Marketing Context\n\n*Last updated: [date]*\n\n## Product Overview\n**One-liner:**\n**What it does:**\n**Product category:**\n**Product type:**\n**Business model:**\n\n## Target Audience\n**Target companies:**\n**Decision-makers:**\n**Primary use case:**\n**Jobs to be done:**\n-\n**Use cases:**\n-\n\n## Personas\n| Persona | Cares about | Challenge | Value we promise |\n|---------|-------------|-----------|------------------|\n| | | | |\n\n## Problems & Pain Points\n**Core problem:**\n**Why alternatives fall short:**\n-\n**What it costs them:**\n**Emotional tension:**\n\n## Competitive Landscape\n**Direct:** [Competitor] — falls short because...\n**Secondary:** [Approach] — falls short because...\n**Indirect:** [Alternative] — falls short because...\n\n## Differentiation\n**Key differentiators:**\n-\n**How we do it differently:**\n**Why that''s better:**\n**Why customers choose us:**\n\n## Objections\n| Objection | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| | |\n\n**Anti-persona:**\n\n## Switching Dynamics\n**Push:**\n**Pull:**\n**Habit:**\n**Anxiety:**\n\n## Customer Language\n**How they describe the problem:**\n- \"[verbatim]\"\n**How they describe us:**\n- \"[verbatim]\"\n**Words to use:**\n**Words to avoid:**\n**Glossary:**\n| Term | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| | |\n\n## Brand Voice\n**Tone:**\n**Style:**\n**Personality:**\n\n## Proof Points\n**Metrics:**\n**Customers:**\n**Testimonials:**\n> \"[quote]\" — [who]\n**Value themes:**\n| Theme | Proof |\n|-------|-------|\n| | |\n\n## Goals\n**Business goal:**\n**Conversion action:**\n**Current metrics:**\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Confirm and Save\n\n- Show the completed document\n- Ask if anything needs adjustment\n- Save to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`\n- Tell them: \"Other marketing skills will now use this context automatically. Run `/product-marketing-context` anytime to update it.\"\n\n---\n\n## Tips\n\n- **Be specific**: Ask \"What''s the #1 frustration that brings them to you?\" not \"What problem do they solve?\"\n- **Capture exact words**: Customer language beats polished descriptions\n- **Ask for examples**: \"Can you give me an example?\" unlocks better answers\n- **Validate as you go**: Summarize each section and confirm before moving on\n- **Skip what doesn''t apply**: Not every product needs all sections (e.g., Personas for B2C)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:14:10.401Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing streamlined product messaging and positioning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化产品信息和定位功能的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが製品のメッセージやポジショニング機能をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"제품 메시지 및 포지셔닝 기능을 간소화하는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan mensajería de producto y capacidades de posicionamiento simplificadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin d''une messagerie de produit et de capacités de positionnement simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine vereinfachte Produktmitteilung und Positionierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de mensagens de produto e capacidades de posicionamento simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности сообщения о продукте и позиционирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الذين يحتاجون إلى رسائل منتج ومقدرات تحديد الموضع المبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to centralize foundational marketing information in a `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` document, reducing repetition and enhancing cross-skill referencing through markdown formatting.","zh":"使代理能够在 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文档中集中基础营销信息，减少重复并通过Markdown格式提高跨技能引用。","ja":"エージェントが `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ドキュメントに基本的なマーケティング情報を集中させ、繰り返しを減らし、マークダウン形式でスキル間の参照を強化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 문서에 기본 마케팅 정보를集中시켜 반복을 줄이고 마크다운 형식을 통해 스킬 간 참조를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes centralizar la información de marketing fundamental en un documento `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, reduciendo la repetición y mejorando la referencia cruzada entre habilidades a través de la formación de markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de centraliser les informations de marketing fondamentales dans un document `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, réduisant les répétitions et améliorant les références croisées entre les compétences via la mise en forme markdown.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, grundlegende Marketinginformationen in einer `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`-Datei zu zentralisieren, wodurch sich die Wiederholung verringert und das Querreferenzieren zwischen Fähigkeiten durch Markdown-Formatierung verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a centralizar informações de marketing fundamentais em um documento `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, reduzindo a repetição e melhorando a referência entre habilidades por meio do formato de markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью централизовать основную информацию о маркетинге в документе `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, сокращая повторение и улучшая межнавыковую ссылку посредством форматирования markdown.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تجميع المعلومات التسويقية الأساسية في وثيقة `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ، مما يقلل من التكرار وتحسين الإشارة بين المهارات من خلال تنسيق markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating product messaging updates","Generating consistent marketing collateral","Maintaining a unified product positioning document"],"zh":["自动化产品信息更新","生成一致的营销资料","维护统一的产品定位文档"],"ja":["製品メッセージの更新を自動化する","一貫したマーケティング資料を生成する","統一された製品ポジショニングドキュメントを維持する"],"ko":["제품 메시지 업데이트 자동화","일관된 마케팅 자료 생성","통일된 제품 포지셔닝 문서 유지"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de la mensajería de producto","Generar material de marketing coherente","Mantener un documento de posicionamiento de producto unificado"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de la messagerie de produit","Générer un matériel de marketing cohérent","Maintenir un document de positionnement de produit unifié"],"de":["Automatisierung der Produktmitteilungs-Updates","Erzeugen konsistenter Marketingmaterialien","Beibehaltung eines einheitlichen Produktpositionierungsdokuments"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de mensagens de produto","Gerar materiais de marketing consistentes","Manter um documento de posicionamento de produto unificado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления сообщений о продукте","Генерировать последовательные маркетинговые материалы","Поддерживать унифицированный документ позиционирования продукта"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات رسائل المنتج","جعل مواد تسويقية متسقة","صيانة وثيقة موحدة لتحديد موقع المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to `.claude/` directory","Markdown formatting knowledge recommended"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问 `.claude/` 目录","建议掌握Markdown格式知识"],"ja":[" `.claude/` ディレクトリへのファイルシステムアクセスが必要","マークダウン形式の知識を習得することをお勧めします"],"ko":[" `.claude/` 디렉토리에 대한 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","마크다운 형식 지식을習得할 것을 권장"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos del directorio `.claude/`","Conocimiento de la formación de markdown recomendado"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers du répertoire `.claude/`","Connaissances de la mise en forme markdown recommandées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem des Verzeichnisses `.claude/`","Kenntnisse der Markdown-Formatierung werden empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `.claude/`","Conhecimento de formatação markdown recomendado"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к каталогу `.claude/`","Рекомендуется знание форматирования markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `.claude/`","معرفة تنسيق markdown مطلوبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
