royectos de desarrollo con patrones de arquitectura de CI/CD","fr":"Conception de pipelines de déploiement pour les projets de développement avec des modèles d''architecture CI/CD","de":"Entwurf von Deployment-Pipelines für Entwicklungsprojekte mit CI/CD-Architekturmuster","pt":"Desenho de pipeline de implantação é uma abordagem para criar pipelines de CI/CD escaláveis e seguros","ru":"Проектирование конвейера развертывания - это подход к созданию масштабируемых и безопасных конвейеров CI/CD","ar":"تصميم أنابيب النشر هو نهج لإنشاء أنابيب CI/CD قابلة للتوسيع وآمنة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["多阶段CI/CD管道","审批门","部署策略","管道阶段组织","安全和合规"],"ja":["マルチステージCI/CDパイプライン","承認ゲート","デプロイストラテジー","パイプライン段階の組織","セキュリティとコンプライアンス"],"ko":["멀티 스테이지 CI/CD 파이프라인","승인 게이트","배포 전략","파이프라인 단계 구성","보안 및 컴플라이언스"],"es":["Diseño de arquitectura de CI/CD","Implementación de puertas de implementación","Configuración de pipelines multi-entorno","Establecimiento de mejores prácticas de implementación","Implementación de entrega progresiva"],"fr":["Conception d''architecture CI/CD","Mise en œuvre de portes de déploiement","Configuration de pipelines multi-environnement","Établissement de meilleures pratiques de déploiement","Mise en œuvre de livraison progressive"],"de":["Entwurf von CI/CD-Architektur","Implementierung von Deployment-Gates","Konfiguration von Multi-Umgebung-Pipelines","Festlegung von Best Practices für die Implementierung","Implementierung von progressiver Auslieferung"],"pt":["Arquiteturas de CI/CD escaláveis","Portas de implantação com aprovação","Estratégias de implantação progressiva","Pipeline de implantação com várias fases","Integração contínua e entrega contínua"],"ru":["Масштабируемые архитектуры CI/CD","Ворота развертывания с утверждением","Стратегии прогрессивного развертывания","Конвейер развертывания с несколькими стадиями","Непрерывная интеграция и непрерывная доставка"],"ar":["هياكل CI/CD قابلة للتوسيع","أبواب نشر مع موافقة","استراتيجيات نشر تقدمي","أنابيب نشر مع مراحل متعددة","التكامل المستمر والتسليم المستمر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CI/CD","部署管道","管道设计","审批门","部署策略","DevOps","持续集成","持续部署"],"ja":["CI/CD","デプロイパイプライン","パイプライン設計","承認ゲート","デプロイストラテジー","DevOps","継続的インテグレーション","継続的デプロイ"],"ko":["CI/CD","배포 파이프라인","파이프라인 설계","승인 게이트","배포 전략","DevOps","지속적 통합","지속적 배포"],"es":["diseño de pipeline de implementación","arquitectura de CI/CD","puertas de implementación","pipelines multi-entorno","mejores prácticas de implementación","entrega progresiva"],"fr":["conception de pipeline de déploiement","architecture CI/CD","portes de déploiement","pipelines multi-environnement","meilleures pratiques de déploiement","livraison progressive"],"de":["Entwurf von Deployment-Pipelines","CI/CD-Architektur","Deployment-Gates","Multi-Umgebung-Pipelines","Best Practices für die Implementierung","progressive Auslieferung"],"pt":["desenho de pipeline de implantação","arquitetura de CI/CD","implantação de software","pipeline de implantação","estratégias de implantação","integração contínua","entrega contínua"],"ru":["проектирование конвейера развертывания","архитектура CI/CD","развертывание программного обеспечения","конвейер развертывания","стратегии развертывания","непрерывная интеграция","непрерывная доставка"],"ar":["تصميم أنابيب النشر","هيكلة CI/CD","نشر البرمجيات","أنابيب النشر","استراتيجيات النشر","التكامل المستمر","التسليم المستمر"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deployment-pipeline-design","description":"Design multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates, security checks, and deployment orchestration. Use when architecting deployment workflows, setting up continuous delivery, or implementing GitOps practices.","bodyPreview":"# Deployment Pipeline Design\n\nArchitecture patterns for multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates and deployment strategies.\n\n## Purpose\n\nDesign robust, secure deployment pipelines that balance speed with safety through proper stage organization and approval workflows.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Design CI/CD architecture\n- Implement deployment gates\n- Configure multi-environment pipelines\n- Establish deployment best practices\n- Implement progressive delivery\n\n## Pipeline Stages\n\n### Standard Pipel","body":"# Deployment Pipeline Design\n\nArchitecture patterns for multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates and deployment strategies.\n\n## Purpose\n\nDesign robust, secure deployment pipelines that balance speed with safety through proper stage organization and approval workflows.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Design CI/CD architecture\n- Implement deployment gates\n- Configure multi-environment pipelines\n- Establish deployment best practices\n- Implement progressive delivery\n\n## Pipeline Stages\n\n### Standard Pipeline Flow\n\n```\n┌─────────┐   ┌──────┐   ┌─────────┐   ┌────────┐   ┌──────────┐\n│  Build  │ → │ Test │ → │ Staging │ → │ Approve│ → │Production│\n└─────────┘   └──────┘   └─────────┘   └────────┘   └──────────┘\n```\n\n### Detailed Stage Breakdown\n\n1. **Source** - Code checkout\n2. **Build** - Compile, package, containerize\n3. **Test** - Unit, integration, security scans\n4. **Staging Deploy** - Deploy to staging environment\n5. **Integration Tests** - E2E, smoke tests\n6. **Approval Gate** - Manual approval required\n7. **Production Deploy** - Canary, blue-green, rolling\n8. **Verification** - Health checks, monitoring\n9. **Rollback** - Automated rollback on failure\n\n## Approval Gate Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Manual Approval\n\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions\nproduction-deploy:\n  needs: staging-deploy\n  environment:\n    name: production\n    url: https://app.example.com\n  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n  steps:\n    - name: Deploy to production\n      run: |\n        # Deployment commands\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Time-Based Approval\n\n```yaml\n# GitLab CI\ndeploy:production:\n  stage: deploy\n  script:\n    - deploy.sh production\n  environment:\n    name: production\n  when: delayed\n  start_in: 30 minutes\n  only:\n    - main\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Approver\n\n```yaml\n# Azure Pipelines\nstages:\n  - stage: Production\n    dependsOn: Staging\n    jobs:\n      - deployment: Deploy\n        environment:\n          name: production\n          resourceType: Kubernetes\n        strategy:\n          runOnce:\n            preDeploy:\n              steps:\n                - task: ManualValidation@0\n                  inputs:\n                    notifyUsers: \"team-leads@example.com\"\n                    instructions: \"Review staging metrics before approving\"\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/approval-gate-template.yml`\n\n## Deployment Strategies\n\n### 1. Rolling Deployment\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\nspec:\n  replicas: 10\n  strategy:\n    type: RollingUpdate\n    rollingUpdate:\n      maxSurge: 2\n      maxUnavailable: 1\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Gradual rollout\n- Zero downtime\n- Easy rollback\n- Best for most applications\n\n### 2. Blue-Green Deployment\n\n```yaml\n# Blue (current)\nkubectl apply -f blue-deployment.yaml\nkubectl label service my-app version=blue\n\n# Green (new)\nkubectl apply -f green-deployment.yaml\n# Test green environment\nkubectl label service my-app version=green\n\n# Rollback if needed\nkubectl label service my-app version=blue\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Instant switchover\n- Easy rollback\n- Doubles infrastructure cost temporarily\n- Good for high-risk deployments\n\n### 3. Canary Deployment\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Rollout\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\nspec:\n  replicas: 10\n  strategy:\n    canary:\n      steps:\n        - setWeight: 10\n        - pause: { duration: 5m }\n        - setWeight: 25\n        - pause: { duration: 5m }\n        - setWeight: 50\n        - pause: { duration: 5m }\n        - setWeight: 100\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Gradual traffic shift\n- Risk mitigation\n- Real user testing\n- Requires service mesh or similar\n\n### 4. Feature Flags\n\n```python\nfrom flagsmith import Flagsmith\n\nflagsmith = Flagsmith(environment_key=\"API_KEY\")\n\nif flagsmith.has_feature(\"new_checkout_flow\"):\n    # New code path\n    process_checkout_v2()\nelse:\n    # Existing code path\n    process_checkout_v1()\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Deploy without releasing\n- A/B testing\n- Instant rollback\n- Granular control\n\n## Pipeline Orchestration\n\n### Multi-Stage Pipeline Example\n\n```yaml\nname: Production Pipeline\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: Build application\n        run: make build\n      - name: Build Docker image\n        run: docker build -t myapp:${{ github.sha }} .\n      - name: Push to registry\n        run: docker push myapp:${{ github.sha }}\n\n  test:\n    needs: build\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Unit tests\n        run: make test\n      - name: Security scan\n        run: trivy image myapp:${{ github.sha }}\n\n  deploy-staging:\n    needs: test\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    environment:\n      name: staging\n    steps:\n      - name: Deploy to staging\n        run: kubectl apply -f k8s/staging/\n\n  integration-test:\n    needs: deploy-staging\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Run E2E tests\n        run: npm run test:e2e\n\n  deploy-production:\n    needs: integration-test\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    environment:\n      name: production\n    steps:\n      - name: Canary deployment\n        run: |\n          kubectl apply -f k8s/production/\n          kubectl argo rollouts promote my-app\n\n  verify:\n    needs: deploy-production\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Health check\n        run: curl -f https://app.example.com/health\n      - name: Notify team\n        run: |\n          curl -X POST ${{ secrets.SLACK_WEBHOOK }} \\\n            -d ''{\"text\":\"Production deployment successful!\"}''\n```\n\n## Pipeline Best Practices\n\n1. **Fail fast** - Run quick tests first\n2. **Parallel execution** - Run independent jobs concurrently\n3. **Caching** - Cache dependencies between runs\n4. **Artifact management** - Store build artifacts\n5. **Environment parity** - Keep environments consistent\n6. **Secrets management** - Use secret stores (Vault, etc.)\n7. **Deployment windows** - Schedule deployments appropriately\n8. **Monitoring integration** - Track deployment metrics\n9. **Rollback automation** - Auto-rollback on failures\n10. **Documentation** - Document pipeline stages\n\n## Rollback Strategies\n\n### Automated Rollback\n\n```yaml\ndeploy-and-verify:\n  steps:\n    - name: Deploy new version\n      run: kubectl apply -f k8s/\n\n    - name: Wait for rollout\n      run: kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app\n\n    - name: Health check\n      id: health\n      run: |\n        for i in {1..10}; do\n          if curl -sf https://app.example.com/health; then\n            exit 0\n          fi\n          sleep 10\n        done\n        exit 1\n\n    - name: Rollback on failure\n      if: failure()\n      run: kubectl rollout undo deployment/my-app\n```\n\n### Manual Rollback\n\n```bash\n# List revision history\nkubectl rollout history deployment/my-app\n\n# Rollback to previous version\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/my-app\n\n# Rollback to specific revision\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/my-app --to-revision=3\n```\n\n## Monitoring and Metrics\n\n### Key Pipeline Metrics\n\n- **Deployment Frequency** - How often deployments occur\n- **Lead Time** - Time from commit to production\n- **Change Failure Rate** - Percentage of failed deployments\n- **Mean Time to Recovery (MTTR)** - Time to recover from failure\n- **Pipeline Success Rate** - Percentage of successful runs\n- **Average Pipeline Duration** - Time to complete pipeline\n\n### Integration with Monitoring\n\n```yaml\n- name: Post-deployment verification\n  run: |\n    # Wait for metrics stabilization\n    sleep 60\n\n    # Check error rate\n    ERROR_RATE=$(curl -s \"$PROMETHEUS_URL/api/v1/query?query=rate(http_errors_total[5m])\" | jq ''.data.result[0].value[1]'')\n\n    if (( $(echo \"$ERROR_RATE > 0.01\" | bc -l) )); then\n      echo \"Error rate too high: $ERROR_RATE\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/pipeline-orchestration.md` - Complex pipeline patterns\n- `assets/approval-gate-template.yml` - Approval workflow templates\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `github-actions-templates` - For GitHub Actions implementation\n- `gitlab-ci-patterns` - For GitLab CI implementation\n- `secrets-management` - For secrets handling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:14:51.764Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring advanced CI/CD pipeline management with approval gates and deployment strategies.","zh":"适用于需要高级CI/CD流水线管理、审批门和部署策略的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが高度なCI/CDパイプライン管理、承認ゲート、およびデプロイ戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 CI/CD 파이프라인 관리, 승인 게이트 및 배포 전략이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una gestión avanzada de tuberías de CI/CD con puertas de aprobación y estrategias de implementación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion avancée de pipeline CI/CD avec des portes d''approbation et des stratégies de déploiement.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine erweiterte Verwaltung von CI/CD-Pipelines mit Genehmigungsschwellen und Bereitstellungsstrategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem gerenciamento avançado de pipeline CI/CD com portões de aprovação e estratégias de implantação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих продвинутого управления конвейерами CI/CD с воротами одобрения и стратегиями развертывания.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديڤوبس الذي يتطلب إدارة متقدمة لآلة الأنابيب سي/سي دي مع بوابات الموافقة واستراتيجيات النشر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design robust, secure deployment pipelines with multi-stage architecture, implementing deployment gates, and configuring multi-environment pipelines using approval workflows and progressive delivery strategies.","zh":"赋予代理设计强大的、安全的部署流水线，具有多阶段架构，实现部署门，并使用审批工作流和渐进式交付策略配置多环境流水线。","ja":"エージェントに、多段階アーキテクチャを実装し、デプロイゲートを実装し、承認ワークフローとプログレッシブデリバリ戦略を使用してマルチ環境パイプラインを構成することで、強固で安全なデプロイパイプラインを設計する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 다단계 아키텍처를 구현하고 배포 게이트를 구현하며 승인 워크플로 및 점진적 배포 전략을 사용하여 多 环境 파이프라인을 구성하여 강력하고 보안이 강화된 배포 파이프라인을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar tuberías de implementación robustas y seguras con arquitectura de varias etapas, implementando puertas de implementación y configurando tuberías de varios entornos utilizando flujos de trabajo de aprobación y estrategias de entrega progresiva.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des pipelines de déploiement robustes et sécurisés avec une architecture multi-étapes, en mettant en œuvre des portes de déploiement et en configurant des pipelines multi-environnements en utilisant des flux de travail d''approbation et des stratégies de livraison progressive.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, robuste und sichere Bereitstellungspipelines mit mehrstufiger Architektur zu entwerfen, indem sie Bereitstellungsschwellen implementieren und mehrumgebungs-Pipelines mithilfe von Genehmigungsworkflows und schrittweisen Lieferstrategien konfigurieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar pipelines de implantação robustos e seguros com arquitetura de várias etapas, implementando portões de implantação e configurando pipelines de vários ambientes usando fluxos de trabalho de aprovação e estratégias de entrega progressiva.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать надежные, безопасные конвейеры развертывания с многоступенчатой архитектурой, реализуя ворота развертывания и настраивая многосредовые конвейеры с помощью рабочих процессов одобрения и стратегий постепенного развертывания.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم أنابيب توزيع قوية وأمنة مع هندسة متعددة المراحل، وتنفيذ بوابات التوزيع، وتهيئة أنابيب متعددة البيئات باستخدام سير عمل الموافقة واستراتيجيات التسليم التدريجي."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing CI/CD architecture for cloud-native applications","Implementing deployment gates for blue-green deployments","Configuring multi-environment pipelines for canary releases"],"zh":["为云原生应用程序设计CI/CD架构","为蓝绿部署实现部署门","为金丝雀发布配置多环境流水线"],"ja":["クラウドネイティブアプリケーションのCI/CDアーキテクチャを設計する","ブルーグリーンデプロイのためのデプロイゲートを実装する","カナリアリリースのためのマルチ環境パイプラインを構成する"],"ko":["클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 위한 CI/CD 아키텍처 설계","블루-그린 배포를 위한 배포 게이트 구현","카나리 릴리스를 위한 다중 환경 파이프라인 구성"],"es":["Diseñar arquitectura de CI/CD para aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Implementar puertas de implementación para implementaciones azul-verde","Configurar tuberías de varios entornos para lanzamientos de canario"],"fr":["Concevoir une architecture CI/CD pour des applications cloud-native","Mettre en œuvre des portes de déploiement pour des déploiements bleu-vert","Configurer des pipelines multi-environnements pour des versions canari"],"de":["Entwerfen von CI/CD-Architektur für Cloud-native-Anwendungen","Implementieren von Bereitstellungsschwellen für Blau-Grün-Bereitstellungen","Konfigurieren von Mehrumgebungs-Pipelines für Kanari-Veröffentlichungen"],"pt":["Projeto de arquitetura CI/CD para aplicações nativas em nuvem","Implementação de portões de implantação para implantações azul-verde","Configuração de pipelines de vários ambientes para lançamentos canários"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектуры CI/CD для облачных приложений","Реализация ворот развертывания для синих-зеленых развертываний","Настройка многосредовых конвейеров для канареечных релизов"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة سي/سي دي لأنظمة التطبيقات السحابية الأصلية","تنفيذ بوابات التوزيع للنشر الأزرق والأخضر","تهيئة أنابيب متعددة البيئات لإصدارات الكناري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of CI/CD tools and protocols","Dependent on specific pipeline stage organization and approval workflows"],"zh":["需要CI/CD工具和协议的知识","依赖于特定的流水线阶段组织和审批工作流"],"ja":["CI/CDツールとプロトコルの知識が必要","特定のパイプライン段階の組織と承認ワークフローに依存する"],"ko":["CI/CD 도구 및 프로토콜에 대한 지식이 필요","특정 파이프라인 단계 조직 및 승인 워크플로에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de herramientas y protocolos de CI/CD","Dependiente de la organización específica de la etapa del pipeline y los flujos de trabajo de aprobación"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en outils et protocoles CI/CD","Dépend de l''organisation spécifique de l''étape du pipeline et des flux de travail d''approbation"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse von CI/CD-Tools und -Protokollen","Hängt von der spezifischen Organisation der Pipeline-Phase und den Genehmigungsworkflows ab"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de ferramentas e protocolos CI/CD","Dependente da organização específica de estágios de pipeline e fluxos de trabalho de aprovação"],"ru":["Требует знания инструментов и протоколов CI/CD","Зависит от конкретной организации стадий конвейера и рабочих процессов одобрения"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بأدوات وبروتوكولات سي/سي دي","يعتمد على تنظيم مرحلة معينة من труб الأنابيب وسير عمل الموافقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
