r agent","ja":"Perplexity ツールは、開発者向けに検索、質問、研究のソリューションを提供します。Perplexity Search、Perplexity Ask、Researcher agent を含みます","ko":"퍼플렉시티 툴은 개발자를 위한 검색, 질문, 연구의 解決方案을 제공합니다. 퍼플렉시티 검색, 퍼플렉시티 질문, 리서처 에이전트를 포함합니다","es":"Perplexidad ofrece herramientas de búsqueda y investigación para desarrolladores. Conoce sus características y cómo usarlas","fr":"Perplexité propose des outils de recherche et d''investigation pour les développeurs. Découvrez ses caractéristiques et comment les utiliser","de":"Perplexität bietet Such- und Recherche-Tools für Entwickler. Erfahren Sie mehr über ihre Eigenschaften und wie Sie sie verwenden","pt":"Perplexity é um conjunto de ferramentas de pesquisa avançada que fornecem respostas precisas para consultas genéricas","ru":"Perplexity - это набор инструментов продвинутого поиска, которые предоставляют точные ответы на общие запросы","ar":"Perplexity هي مجموعة من أدوات البحث المتقدم التي توفر إجابات دقيقة للاستفسارات العامة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Perplexity Search：搜索结果和 URL","Perplexity Ask：对话式答案","Researcher agent：深入研究","支持泛型查询","不适用于库/框架文档或工作空间问题"],"ja":["Perplexity Search：検索結果と URL","Perplexity Ask：対話式の答え","Researcher agent：深入研究","汎用クエリをサポート","ライブラリ/フレームワークのドキュメントやワークスペースの質問には不適"],"ko":["퍼플렉시티 검색: 검색 결과와 URL","퍼플렉시티 질문: 대화형 답변","리서처 에이전트: 심층 연구","일반 쿼리 지원","라이브러리/프레임워크 문서 또는 작업 공간 질문에는 부적합"],"es":["Búsqueda de resultados y URLs","Respuestas conversacionales","Investigación profunda","Uso de comandos específicos","Integración con otros herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Recherche de résultats et d''URL","Réponses conversationnelles","Recherche approfondie","Utilisation de commandes spécifiques","Intégration avec d''autres outils de développement"],"de":["Suche nach Ergebnissen und URLs","Konversationelle Antworten","Tiefere Recherche","Verwendung von spezifischen Befehlen","Integration mit anderen Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Pesquisa avançada com Perplexity Search","Respostas conversacionais com Perplexity Ask","Pesquisa profunda com Researcher agent","Ferramentas personalizadas para consultas genéricas","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Продвинутый поиск с Perplexity Search","Беседные ответы с Perplexity Ask","Глубокий поиск с Researcher agent","Инструменты для общих запросов","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["بحث متقدم مع Perplexity Search","إجابات محادثية مع Perplexity Ask","بحث متعمق مع Researcher agent","أدوات مخصصة للاستفسارات العامة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Perplexity","搜索","提问","研究","开发者工具","效率提升","泛型查询","库/框架文档","工作空间问题"],"ja":["Perplexity","検索","質問","研究","開発者ツール","効率化","汎用クエリ","ライブラリ/フレームワークのドキュメント","ワークスペースの質問"],"ko":["퍼플렉시티","검색","질문","연구","개발자 툴","효율성 향상","일반 쿼리","라이브러리/프레임워크 문서","작업 공간 질문"],"es":["perplexidad","herramientas de búsqueda","investigación","desarrollo","programación","búsqueda de resultados","respuestas conversacionales"],"fr":["perplexité","outils de recherche","investigation","développement","programmation","recherche de résultats","réponses conversationnelles"],"de":["perplexität","suchtools","recherche","entwicklung","programmierung","suche nach ergebnissen","konversationelle antworten"],"pt":["perplexity","pesquisa avançada","respostas precisas","consultas genéricas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de pesquisa"],"ru":["perplexity","продвинутый поиск","точные ответы","общие запросы","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты поиска"],"ar":["perplexity","بحث متقدم","إجابات دقيقة","استفسارات عامة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات البحث"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"perplexity","description":"Web search and research using Perplexity AI. Use when user says search, find, look up, ask, research, or whats the latest for generic queries. NOT for library/framework docs (use Context7) or workspace questions.","bodyPreview":"# Perplexity Tools\n\nUse ONLY when user says \"search\", \"find\", \"look up\", \"ask\", \"research\", or \"what''s the latest\" for generic queries. NOT for library/framework docs (use Context7), gt CLI (use Graphite MCP), or workspace questions (use Nx MCP).\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Which Perplexity tool?**\n- Need search results/URLs? → **Perplexity Search**\n- Need conversational answer? → **Perplexity Ask**\n- Need deep research? → **Researcher agent** (`/research <topic>`)\n\n**NOT Perplexity - use these inste","body":"# Perplexity Tools\n\nUse ONLY when user says \"search\", \"find\", \"look up\", \"ask\", \"research\", or \"what''s the latest\" for generic queries. NOT for library/framework docs (use Context7), gt CLI (use Graphite MCP), or workspace questions (use Nx MCP).\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Which Perplexity tool?**\n- Need search results/URLs? → **Perplexity Search**\n- Need conversational answer? → **Perplexity Ask**\n- Need deep research? → **Researcher agent** (`/research <topic>`)\n\n**NOT Perplexity - use these instead:**\n- Library/framework docs → **Context7 MCP**\n- Graphite `gt` CLI → **Graphite MCP**\n- THIS workspace → **Nx MCP**\n- Specific URL → **URL Crawler**\n\n## Perplexity Search\n\n**When to use:**\n- Generic searches, finding resources\n- Current best practices, recent information\n- Tutorial/blog post discovery\n- User says \"search for...\", \"find...\", \"look up...\"\n\n**Default parameters (ALWAYS USE):**\n```typescript\nmcp__perplexity__perplexity_search({\n  query: \"your search query\",\n  max_results: 3,           // Default is 10 - too many!\n  max_tokens_per_page: 512  // Reduce per-result content\n})\n```\n\n**When to increase limits:**\nOnly if:\n- User explicitly needs comprehensive results\n- Initial search found nothing useful\n- Complex topic needs multiple sources\n\n```typescript\n// Increased limits (use sparingly)\nmcp__perplexity__perplexity_search({\n  query: \"complex topic\",\n  max_results: 5,\n  max_tokens_per_page: 1024\n})\n```\n\n## Perplexity Ask\n\n**When to use:**\n- Need conversational explanation, not search results\n- Synthesize information from web\n- Explain concepts with current context\n\n**Usage:**\n```typescript\nmcp__perplexity__perplexity_ask({\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \"user\",\n      content: \"Explain how postgres advisory locks work\"\n    }\n  ]\n})\n```\n\n**NOT for:**\n- Library documentation (use Context7)\n- Deep multi-source research (use researcher agent)\n\n## Prohibited Tool\n\n**NEVER use:** `mcp__perplexity__perplexity_research`\n\n**Use instead:** Researcher agent (`/research <topic>`)\n- Token cost: 30-50k tokens\n- Provides multi-source synthesis with citations\n- Use sparingly for complex questions only\n\n## Tool Selection Chain\n\n**Priority order:**\n1. **Context7 MCP** - Library/framework docs\n2. **Graphite MCP** - Any `gt` CLI mention\n3. **Nx MCP** - THIS workspace questions\n4. **Perplexity Search** - Generic searches\n5. **Perplexity Ask** - Conversational answers\n6. **Researcher agent** - Deep multi-source research\n7. **WebSearch** - Last resort (after Perplexity exhausted)\n\n## Examples\n\n**✅ CORRECT - Use Perplexity Search:**\n- \"Find postgres migration best practices\"\n- \"Search for React testing tutorials\"\n- \"Look up latest trends in microservices\"\n\n**✅ CORRECT - Use Perplexity Ask:**\n- \"Explain how postgres advisory locks work\"\n- \"What are the trade-offs of microservices?\"\n\n**❌ WRONG - Use Context7 instead:**\n- \"Search for React hooks documentation\" → Context7 MCP\n- \"Find Next.js routing docs\" → Context7 MCP\n- \"Look up Temporal workflow API\" → Context7 MCP\n\n**❌ WRONG - Use Graphite MCP instead:**\n- \"Search for gt stack commands\" → Graphite MCP\n- \"Find gt branch workflow\" → Graphite MCP\n\n**❌ WRONG - Use Nx MCP instead:**\n- \"Search for build config\" (in THIS workspace) → Nx MCP\n- \"Find project dependencies\" (in THIS workspace) → Nx MCP\n\n## Key Points\n\n- **Default to limited results** - avoid context bloat\n- **Library docs = Context7** - ALWAYS try Context7 first\n- **\"gt\" = Graphite MCP** - ANY \"gt\" mention uses Graphite\n- **Deep research = /research** - NOT perplexity_research tool\n- **Fallback chain** - Search → Ask → WebSearch (last resort)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:15:02.084Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Information Retrieval Agents needing advanced search and research capabilities via Perplexity tools","zh":"非常适合需要通过Perplexity工具进行高级搜索和研究的信息检索代理","ja":"Perplexityツールを使用した高度な検索および研究機能を必要とする情報検索エージェントに最適","ko":"Perplexity 도구를 통해 고급 검색 및 연구 기능이 필요한 정보 검색 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Recuperación de Información que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda y investigación avanzadas a través de herramientas de Perplexity","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Recherche d''Information ayant besoin de capacités de recherche et de recherche avancées via des outils Perplexity","de":"Perfekt für Informationsabruf-Agenten, die erweiterte Such- und Recherchefunktionen über Perplexity-Tools benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Recuperação de Informação que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa e investigação avançadas via ferramentas Perplexity","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов поиска информации, которым требуются продвинутые возможности поиска и исследования с помощью инструментов Perplexity","ar":"مثالي لعميل استرجاع المعلومات الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في البحث والابحاث من خلال أدوات Perplexity"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize Perplexity Search for retrieving relevant URLs, Perplexity Ask for conversational answers, and Researcher agent for in-depth research topics, leveraging natural language queries and topic-specific investigation protocols","zh":"赋予代理使用Perplexity Search检索相关URL、Perplexity Ask进行对话式回答以及研究人员代理进行深入研究，利用自然语言查询和主题特定调查协议","ja":"エージェントがPerplexity Searchを使用して関連URLを取得したり、Perplexity Askを使用して会話形式の回答を取得したり、Researcherエージェントを使用して深い研究を行ったりし、自然言語クエリとトピック固有の調査プロトコルを利用","ko":"에이전트가 Perplexity Search를 사용하여 관련 URL을 검색하거나 Perplexity Ask를 사용하여 대화식 답변을 얻거나 연구자 에이전트를 사용하여 심층 연구를 수행하여 자연어 쿼리와 주제 특정 조사를 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar Perplexity Search para recuperar URLs relevantes, Perplexity Ask para respuestas conversacionales y el agente Researcher para temas de investigación en profundidad, aprovechando consultas de lenguaje natural y protocolos de investigación específicos de temas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser Perplexity Search pour récupérer des URL pertinentes, Perplexity Ask pour des réponses conversationnelles et l''agent Researcher pour des sujets de recherche en profondeur, en exploitant des requêtes de langage naturel et des protocoles d''investigation spécifiques au sujet","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Perplexity Search zur Abrufung relevanter URLs, Perplexity Ask für konversationelle Antworten und den Researcher-Agenten für tiefere Recherchen zu Themen zu nutzen, wobei natürliche Sprachabfragen und themenspezifische Untersuchungsprotokolle genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem a Pesquisa Perplexity para recuperar URLs relevantes, Perplexity Ask para respostas conversacionais e o agente Researcher para tópicos de pesquisa aprofundada, aproveitando consultas de linguagem natural e protocolos de investigação específicos de tópico","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать Поиск Perplexity для получения релевантных URL, Perplexity Ask для разговорных ответов и агента Researcher для глубоких исследований по темам, используя естественные языковые запросы и тематические протоколы расследования","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من استخدام بحث Perplexity لاسترجاع عناوين URL ذات صلة، و Perplexity Ask لأجوبة محادثية، ووكيل البحث للبحث المتعمق في المواضيع، واستغلال استفسارات اللغة الطبيعية وبروتوكولات التحقيق الخاصة بالموضوع"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching for specific information using Perplexity Search","Generating conversational answers with Perplexity Ask","Conducting deep research on topics using the Researcher agent"],"zh":["使用Perplexity Search搜索特定信息","使用Perplexity Ask生成对话式答案","使用研究人员代理对主题进行深入研究"],"ja":["Perplexity Searchを使用して特定の情報を検索する","Perplexity Askを使用して会話形式の回答を生成する","Researcherエージェントを使用してトピックの深い研究を行う"],"ko":["Perplexity Search를 사용하여 특정 정보를 검색","Perplexity Ask를 사용하여 대화식 답변을 생성","연구자 에이전트를 사용하여 주제에 대한 심층 연구를 수행"],"es":["Buscar información específica utilizando Perplexity Search","Generar respuestas conversacionales con Perplexity Ask","Realizar investigaciones profundas sobre temas utilizando el agente Researcher"],"fr":["Rechercher des informations spécifiques à l''aide de Perplexity Search","Générer des réponses conversationnelles avec Perplexity Ask","Effectuer des recherches approfondies sur des sujets à l''aide de l''agent Researcher"],"de":["Spezifische Informationen mit Perplexity Search suchen","Konversationelle Antworten mit Perplexity Ask generieren","Tiefere Recherchen zu Themen mit dem Researcher-Agenten durchführen"],"pt":["Procurar informações específicas usando a Pesquisa Perplexity","Gerar respostas conversacionais com Perplexity Ask","Realizar pesquisas profundas em tópicos usando o agente Researcher"],"ru":["Поиск конкретной информации с помощью Поиска Perplexity","Генерация разговорных ответов с помощью Perplexity Ask","Проведение глубоких исследований по темам с помощью агента Researcher"],"ar":["البحث عن معلومات محددة باستخدام بحث Perplexity","إنتاج إجابات محادثية مع Perplexity Ask","إجراء بحث متعمق في المواضيع باستخدام وكيل البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific user prompts like ''search'', ''find'', or ''research''","Not suitable for library/framework documentation or workspace questions"],"zh":["需要特定的用户提示，如''search''、''find''或''research''","不适合库/框架文档或工作区问题"],"ja":["''search''、''find''、''research''などの特定のユーザープロンプトが必要","ライブラリ/フレームワークドキュメントまたはワークスペースの質問には不向き"],"ko":["''search''、''find'' 또는 ''research''와 같은 특정 사용자 프롬프트가 필요","라이브러리/프레임워크 문서 또는 작업공간 질문에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere instrucciones de usuario específicas como ''buscar'', ''encontrar'' o ''investigar''","No es adecuado para la documentación de bibliotecas/cuadros de trabajo o preguntas de espacio de trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite des invites d''utilisateur spécifiques comme ''rechercher'', ''trouver'' ou ''rechercher''","N''est pas adapté à la documentation de bibliothèques/cadres de travail ou aux questions d''espace de travail"],"de":["Benötigt spezifische Benutzereingaben wie ''suchen'', ''finden'' oder ''recherchieren''","Nicht geeignet für Bibliotheks-/Framework-Dokumentation oder Arbeitsbereichsfragen"],"pt":["Exige prompts de usuário específicos como ''pesquisar'', ''encontrar'' ou ''pesquisar''","Não é adequado para documentação de biblioteca/estrutura ou perguntas de workspace"],"ru":["Требует специфических пользовательских подсказок, таких как ''искать'', ''находить'' или ''исследовать''","Не подходит для документации библиотеки/фреймворка или вопросов workspace"],"ar":["يتطلب نصائح مستخدم محددة مثل ''ابحث'' أو ''اعثر'' أو ''ابحث''","لا يناسب توثيق المكتبة/الإطار أو أسئلة مساحة العمل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
