사용","es":"Patrones de composición para construir componentes de React flexibles y mantenibles","fr":"Modèles de composition pour créer des composants React flexibles et maintenables","de":"Zusammensetzungs-Muster für flexible und wartbare React-Komponenten","pt":"Os padrões de composição Vercel permitem a criação de componentes React flexíveis e mantenedores, evitando a proliferação de props booleanos.","ru":"Шаблоны композиции Vercel позволяют создавать гибкие и поддерживаемые компоненты React, избегая размножения булевых свойств.","ar":"أنماط التركيبة Vercel تمكن من إنشاء مكونات ري액ت مرنة وقابلة للصيانة، وتجنب انتشار الخصائص المنطقية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["复合组件","状态提升","内部组合","避免布尔属性爆炸","提高代码可维护性"],"ja":["複合コンポーネント","状態の昇格","内部のコンポジション","ブール属性の増加を防ぐ","コードのメンテナンス性の向上"],"ko":["복합 컴포넌트","상태 상승","내부 컴포지션","불리언 속성 증식을 방지","코드 유지보수성 향상"],"es":["Evita la proliferación de propiedades booleanas","Crea componentes reutilizables","Diseña APIs de componentes flexibles","Mejora la escalabilidad de los codebases","Facilita el trabajo con AI agents"],"fr":["Évite la prolifération des propriétés booléennes","Crée des composants réutilisables","Concevez des APIs de composants flexibles","Améliorez la scalabilité des codebases","Facilitez le travail avec les agents IA"],"de":["Vermeidet die Ausbreitung von booleschen Eigenschaften","Erstellt wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Entwirft flexible Komponenten-APIs","Verbessert die Skalierbarkeit von Codebasen","Erleichtert die Arbeit mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["Criação de componentes flexíveis e mantenedores","Evitação da proliferação de props booleanos","Melhoria da escalabilidade do código","Uso de componentes compostos","Elevação de estado","Composição de internos"],"ru":["Создание гибких и поддерживаемых компонентов","Избегание размножения булевых свойств","Улучшение масштабируемости кода","Использование составных компонентов","Подъем состояния","Композиция внутренних компонентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات مرنة وقابلة للصيانة","تجنب انتشار الخصائص المنطقية","تحسين قابلية توسيع الرمز","استخدام المكونات المركبة","رفع الحالة","تركيبة المكونات الداخلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel","React","组合模式","灵活","易维护","布尔属性","状态提升","内部组合"],"ja":["Vercel","React","コンポジション パターン","柔軟","メンテナンスの容易","ブール属性","状態の昇格","内部のコンポジション"],"ko":["Vercel","React","컴포지션 패턴","유연","유지보수하기 쉬운","불리언 속성","상태 상승","내부 컴포지션"],"es":["patrones de composición de Vercel","react composition patterns","componentes de React flexibles","mantenimiento de componentes","boolean prop proliferation","codebases escalables"],"fr":["modèles de composition Vercel","react composition patterns","composants React flexibles","maintenance de composants","prolifération de propriétés booléennes","codebases scalables"],"de":["Vercel-Zusammensetzungs-Muster","react composition patterns","flexible React-Komponenten","Wartung von Komponenten","Ausbreitung von booleschen Eigenschaften","skalierbare Codebasen"],"pt":["padrões de composição Vercel","componentes React flexíveis","evitar props booleanos","escalabilidade do código","componentes compostos","elevação de estado","composição de internos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["шаблоны композиции Vercel","гибкие компоненты React","избегать булевых свойств","масштабируемость кода","составные компоненты","подъем состояния","композиция внутренних компонентов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أنماط التركيبة Vercel","مكونات ري액ت مرنة","تجنب الخصائص المنطقية","قابلية توسيع الرمز","المكونات المركبة","رفع الحالة","تركيبة المكونات الداخلية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-composition-patterns","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Composition Patterns\n\nComposition patterns for building flexible, maintainable React components. Avoid\nboolean prop proliferation by using compound components, lifting state, and\ncomposing internals. These patterns make codebases easier for both humans and AI\nagents to work with as they scale.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Refactoring components with many boolean props\n- Building reusable component libraries\n- Designing flexible component APIs\n- Reviewing compone","body":"# React Composition Patterns\n\nComposition patterns for building flexible, maintainable React components. Avoid\nboolean prop proliferation by using compound components, lifting state, and\ncomposing internals. These patterns make codebases easier for both humans and AI\nagents to work with as they scale.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Refactoring components with many boolean props\n- Building reusable component libraries\n- Designing flexible component APIs\n- Reviewing component architecture\n- Working with compound components or context providers\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                | Impact | Prefix          |\n| -------- | ----------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| 1        | Component Architecture  | HIGH   | `architecture-` |\n| 2        | State Management        | MEDIUM | `state-`        |\n| 3        | Implementation Patterns | MEDIUM | `patterns-`     |\n| 4        | React 19 APIs           | MEDIUM | `react19-`      |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Component Architecture (HIGH)\n\n- `architecture-avoid-boolean-props` - Don''t add boolean props to customize\n  behavior; use composition\n- `architecture-compound-components` - Structure complex components with shared\n  context\n\n### 2. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-decouple-implementation` - Provider is the only place that knows how\n  state is managed\n- `state-context-interface` - Define generic interface with state, actions, meta\n  for dependency injection\n- `state-lift-state` - Move state into provider components for sibling access\n\n### 3. Implementation Patterns (MEDIUM)\n\n- `patterns-explicit-variants` - Create explicit variant components instead of\n  boolean modes\n- `patterns-children-over-render-props` - Use children for composition instead\n  of renderX props\n\n### 4. React 19 APIs (MEDIUM)\n\n> **⚠️ React 19+ only.** Skip this section if using React 18 or earlier.\n\n- `react19-no-forwardref` - Don''t use `forwardRef`; use `use()` instead of `useContext()`\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/architecture-avoid-boolean-props.md\nrules/state-context-interface.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:16:21.091Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Frontend Code Generation Agents building scalable React component libraries.","zh":"适用于构建可扩展React组件库的前端代码生成代理。","ja":"スケーラブルなReactコンポーネントライブラリを構築するフロントエンドコード生成エージェントに必須です。","ko":"확장 가능한 React 컴포넌트 라이브러리를 구축하는 프론트엔드 코드 생성 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de generación de código frontend que construyen bibliotecas de componentes React escalables.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de génération de code frontend construisant des bibliothèques de composants React évolutives.","de":"Essenziell für Frontend-Code-Generierungs-Agents, die skalierbare React-Component-Libraries aufbauen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Geração de Código Frontend que constroem bibliotecas de componentes React escaláveis.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов генерации фронтенд-кода, строящих масштабируемые библиотеки компонентов React.","ar":"ضروري لعميل генера代码 フロントエンド لبناء مكتبات مكونات رياكت قابلة للتوسع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to refactor boolean-prop-heavy components into maintainable compound patterns, implementing state lifting and internal composition for AI-friendly codebases.","zh":"使代理能够将布尔值属性过多的组件重构为可维护的复合模式，实现状态提升和内部组合，以适应AI友好代码库。","ja":"エージェントがブール値プロパティの多いコンポーネントをメンテナンス可能な複合パターンにリファクタリングできるようにし、AIフレンドリーコードベースの実現に状態の持ち上げと内部の構成を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 불리언 속성으로 가득 찬 컴포넌트를 유지 보수할 수 있는 복합 패턴으로 리팩토링할 수 있도록 하여, 상태 상승 및 내부 구성 구현과 같은 AI 친화적 코드베이스를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes refactorizar componentes con abundancia de propiedades booleanas en patrones compuestos mantenibles, implementando el levantamiento del estado y la composición interna para bases de código compatibles con IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser les composants à forte densité de propriétés booléennes en modèles composés maintenables, mettant en œuvre le remontée d''état et la composition interne pour des bases de code adaptées à l''IA.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Komponenten mit vielen Boolean-Props in wartbare Compound-Patterns umzustrukturieren, durch Implementierung von State-Lifting und interner Komposition für KI-freundliche Codebasen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes reestruturem componentes com propagação de propriedades booleanas em padrões compostos manuteníveis, implementando elevação de estado e composição interna para código de base de IA amigável.","ru":"Позволяет агентам перерабатывать компоненты с распространением булевых свойств в поддерживаемые составные шаблоны, реализуя подъем состояния и внутреннюю композицию для дружественных к ИИ кодовых баз.","ar":"يمكن العميل من إعادة هيكلة المكونات التي تنشر الخصائص المنطقية في أنماط مركبة قابلة للصيانة، وتنفيذ رفع الحالة والتركيب الداخلي لأسس الشفرة الصديقة للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring components with boolean prop proliferation","Building reusable component library APIs","Generating flexible component compositions"],"zh":["重构具有布尔值属性过多的组件","构建可重用组件库API","生成灵活的组件组合"],"ja":["ブール値プロパティの多いコンポーネントのリファクタリング","再利用可能なコンポーネントライブラリAPIの構築","柔軟なコンポーネントの構成の生成"],"ko":["불리언 속성으로 가득 찬 컴포넌트의 리팩토링","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트 라이브러리 API 구축","유연한 컴포넌트 구성 생성"],"es":["Refactorizar componentes con proliferación de propiedades booleanas","Construir APIs de bibliotecas de componentes reutilizables","Generar composiciones de componentes flexibles"],"fr":["Refactorisation de composants avec prolifération de propriétés booléennes","Construction d''API de bibliothèques de composants réutilisables","Génération de compositions de composants flexibles"],"de":["Refactoring von Komponenten mit Boolean-Prop-Vermehrung","Aufbau wiederverwendbarer Component-Library-APIs","Generierung flexibler Komponentenkompositionen"],"pt":["Reestruturação de componentes com proliferação de propriedades booleanas","Construção de APIs de bibliotecas de componentes reutilizáveis","Geração de composições de componentes flexíveis"],"ru":["Переработка компонентов с распространением булевых свойств","Строительство API для библиотек повторно используемых компонентов","Генерация гибких композиций компонентов"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة المكونات التي تنشر الخصائص المنطقية","بناء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات لمكتبات المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","توليد تركيبات مكونات مرنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["React-specific patterns only","Requires existing component codebase to refactor"],"zh":["仅适用于React特定的模式","需要现有的组件代码库来重构"],"ja":["React特有のパターンのみ","リファクタリングするための既存のコンポーネントコードベースが必要"],"ko":["React 특정 패턴만 해당","리팩토링하기 위한 기존 컴포넌트 코드베이스가 필요"],"es":["Patrones específicos solo para React","Requiere una base de código de componentes existente para refactorizar"],"fr":["Modèles spécifiques à React uniquement","Nécessite une base de code de composants existante à refactoriser"],"de":["Nur React-spezifische Patterns","Erfordert eine bestehende Komponenten-Codebasis zum Refaktorisieren"],"pt":["Padrões específicos do React apenas","Requer uma base de código de componentes existente para reestruturação"],"ru":["Только шаблоны, специфичные для React","Требует существующей базы кода компонентов для переработки"],"ar":["أنماط محددة لرياكت فقط","يتطلب وجود قاعدة شفرة مكونات موجودة لإعادة الهيكلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
