 depure problema...","fr":"Optimisez les temps de construction avec Bazel dans des monorepos à grande échelle. Configurez le cache et l''exécution à distance, écrivez des règles personn...","de":"Optimieren Sie die Build-Zeiten mit Bazel in großen Monorepos. Konfigurieren Sie Remote-Caching und -Ausführung, schreiben Sie benutzerdefinierte Regeln und ...","pt":"Otimização de compilação Bazel para monorepos de grande escala, incluindo configuração de cache remoto e execução","ru":"Оптимизация сборки Bazel для крупномасштабных монорепозиториев, включая настройку удаленного кэширования и выполнения","ar":"تحسين بناء Bazel لمونوريبوزиторي كبير الحجم، بما في ذلك تكوين الذاكرة المؤقتة عن بعد والتنفيذ","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel"],"ja":["Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel"],"ko":["Bazel ","Bazel ","Bazel ","Bazel ","Bazel "],"es":["Configuración de Bazel para monorepos","Optimización de tiempos de compilación","Configuración de caché y ejecución remota","Escritura de reglas personalizadas","Depuración de problemas de compilación"],"fr":["Configuration de Bazel pour des monorepos","Optimisation des temps de construction","Configuration du cache et de l''exécution à distance","Écriture de règles personnalisées","Débogage des problèmes de construction"],"de":["Konfiguration von Bazel für Monorepos","Optimierung der Build-Zeiten","Konfiguration von Remote-Caching und -Ausführung","Schreiben von benutzerdefinierten Regeln","Debuggen von Build-Problemen"],"pt":["Configuração de cache remoto","Otimização de tempos de compilação","Escrita de regras personalizadas Bazel","Depuração de problemas de compilação","Migração para Bazel"],"ru":["Настройка удаленного кэширования","Оптимизация времени сборки","Написание пользовательских правил Bazel","Отладка проблем сборки","Миграция на Bazel"],"ar":["تكوين الذاكرة المؤقتة عن بعد","تحسين وقت البناء","كتابة قواعد بازل مخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء البناء","هجرة إلى Bazel"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bazel","monorepos","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel"],"ja":["Bazel","monorepos","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel"],"ko":["Bazel","monorepos","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel","Bazel"],"es":["Bazel","optimización de compilación","monorepos","compilación de software","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["Bazel","optimisation de construction","monorepos","construction de logiciels","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Bazel","Build-Optimierung","Monorepos","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Engineering","Build-Prozesse"],"pt":["Bazel","Otimização de compilação","Monorepos","Cache remoto","Regras personalizadas Bazel","Depuração de compilação","Migração para Bazel"],"ru":["Bazel","Оптимизация сборки","Монорепозитории","Удаленное кэширование","Пользовательские правила Bazel","Отладка сборки","Миграция на Bazel"],"ar":["Bazel","تحسين بناء","مونوريبوزиторي","ذاكرة مؤقتة عن بعد","قواعد بازل مخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء البناء","هجرة إلى Bazel"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bazel-build-optimization","description":"Optimize Bazel builds for large-scale monorepos. Use when configuring Bazel, implementing remote execution, or optimizing build performance for enterprise codebases.","bodyPreview":"# Bazel Build Optimization\n\nProduction patterns for Bazel in large-scale monorepos.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up Bazel for monorepos\n- Configuring remote caching/execution\n- Optimizing build times\n- Writing custom Bazel rules\n- Debugging build issues\n- Migrating to Bazel\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Bazel Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── WORKSPACE.bazel       # External dependencies\n├── .bazelrc              # Build configurations\n├── .bazelversion         # Bazel version\n├── BUILD.baze","body":"# Bazel Build Optimization\n\nProduction patterns for Bazel in large-scale monorepos.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up Bazel for monorepos\n- Configuring remote caching/execution\n- Optimizing build times\n- Writing custom Bazel rules\n- Debugging build issues\n- Migrating to Bazel\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Bazel Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── WORKSPACE.bazel       # External dependencies\n├── .bazelrc              # Build configurations\n├── .bazelversion         # Bazel version\n├── BUILD.bazel           # Root build file\n├── apps/\n│   └── web/\n│       └── BUILD.bazel\n├── libs/\n│   └── utils/\n│       └── BUILD.bazel\n└── tools/\n    └── bazel/\n        └── rules/\n```\n\n### 2. Key Concepts\n\n| Concept     | Description                            |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Target**  | Buildable unit (library, binary, test) |\n| **Package** | Directory with BUILD file              |\n| **Label**   | Target identifier `//path/to:target`   |\n| **Rule**    | Defines how to build a target          |\n| **Aspect**  | Cross-cutting build behavior           |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: WORKSPACE Configuration\n\n```python\n# WORKSPACE.bazel\nworkspace(name = \"myproject\")\n\nload(\"@bazel_tools//tools/build_defs/repo:http.bzl\", \"http_archive\")\n\n# Rules for JavaScript/TypeScript\nhttp_archive(\n    name = \"aspect_rules_js\",\n    sha256 = \"...\",\n    strip_prefix = \"rules_js-1.34.0\",\n    url = \"https://github.com/aspect-build/rules_js/releases/download/v1.34.0/rules_js-v1.34.0.tar.gz\",\n)\n\nload(\"@aspect_rules_js//js:repositories.bzl\", \"rules_js_dependencies\")\nrules_js_dependencies()\n\nload(\"@rules_nodejs//nodejs:repositories.bzl\", \"nodejs_register_toolchains\")\nnodejs_register_toolchains(\n    name = \"nodejs\",\n    node_version = \"20.9.0\",\n)\n\nload(\"@aspect_rules_js//npm:repositories.bzl\", \"npm_translate_lock\")\nnpm_translate_lock(\n    name = \"npm\",\n    pnpm_lock = \"//:pnpm-lock.yaml\",\n    verify_node_modules_ignored = \"//:.bazelignore\",\n)\n\nload(\"@npm//:repositories.bzl\", \"npm_repositories\")\nnpm_repositories()\n\n# Rules for Python\nhttp_archive(\n    name = \"rules_python\",\n    sha256 = \"...\",\n    strip_prefix = \"rules_python-0.27.0\",\n    url = \"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_python/releases/download/0.27.0/rules_python-0.27.0.tar.gz\",\n)\n\nload(\"@rules_python//python:repositories.bzl\", \"py_repositories\")\npy_repositories()\n```\n\n### Template 2: .bazelrc Configuration\n\n```bash\n# .bazelrc\n\n# Build settings\nbuild --enable_platform_specific_config\nbuild --incompatible_enable_cc_toolchain_resolution\nbuild --experimental_strict_conflict_checks\n\n# Performance\nbuild --jobs=auto\nbuild --local_cpu_resources=HOST_CPUS*.75\nbuild --local_ram_resources=HOST_RAM*.75\n\n# Caching\nbuild --disk_cache=~/.cache/bazel-disk\nbuild --repository_cache=~/.cache/bazel-repo\n\n# Remote caching (optional)\nbuild:remote-cache --remote_cache=grpcs://cache.example.com\nbuild:remote-cache --remote_upload_local_results=true\nbuild:remote-cache --remote_timeout=3600\n\n# Remote execution (optional)\nbuild:remote-exec --remote_executor=grpcs://remote.example.com\nbuild:remote-exec --remote_instance_name=projects/myproject/instances/default\nbuild:remote-exec --jobs=500\n\n# Platform configurations\nbuild:linux --platforms=//platforms:linux_x86_64\nbuild:macos --platforms=//platforms:macos_arm64\n\n# CI configuration\nbuild:ci --config=remote-cache\nbuild:ci --build_metadata=ROLE=CI\nbuild:ci --bes_results_url=https://results.example.com/invocation/\nbuild:ci --bes_backend=grpcs://bes.example.com\n\n# Test settings\ntest --test_output=errors\ntest --test_summary=detailed\n\n# Coverage\ncoverage --combined_report=lcov\ncoverage --instrumentation_filter=\"//...\"\n\n# Convenience aliases\nbuild:opt --compilation_mode=opt\nbuild:dbg --compilation_mode=dbg\n\n# Import user settings\ntry-import %workspace%/user.bazelrc\n```\n\n### Template 3: TypeScript Library BUILD\n\n```python\n# libs/utils/BUILD.bazel\nload(\"@aspect_rules_ts//ts:defs.bzl\", \"ts_project\")\nload(\"@aspect_rules_js//js:defs.bzl\", \"js_library\")\nload(\"@npm//:defs.bzl\", \"npm_link_all_packages\")\n\nnpm_link_all_packages(name = \"node_modules\")\n\nts_project(\n    name = \"utils_ts\",\n    srcs = glob([\"src/**/*.ts\"]),\n    declaration = True,\n    source_map = True,\n    tsconfig = \"//:tsconfig.json\",\n    deps = [\n        \":node_modules/@types/node\",\n    ],\n)\n\njs_library(\n    name = \"utils\",\n    srcs = [\":utils_ts\"],\n    visibility = [\"//visibility:public\"],\n)\n\n# Tests\nload(\"@aspect_rules_jest//jest:defs.bzl\", \"jest_test\")\n\njest_test(\n    name = \"utils_test\",\n    config = \"//:jest.config.js\",\n    data = [\n        \":utils\",\n        \"//:node_modules/jest\",\n    ],\n    node_modules = \"//:node_modules\",\n)\n```\n\n### Template 4: Python Library BUILD\n\n```python\n# libs/ml/BUILD.bazel\nload(\"@rules_python//python:defs.bzl\", \"py_library\", \"py_test\", \"py_binary\")\nload(\"@pip//:requirements.bzl\", \"requirement\")\n\npy_library(\n    name = \"ml\",\n    srcs = glob([\"src/**/*.py\"]),\n    deps = [\n        requirement(\"numpy\"),\n        requirement(\"pandas\"),\n        requirement(\"scikit-learn\"),\n        \"//libs/utils:utils_py\",\n    ],\n    visibility = [\"//visibility:public\"],\n)\n\npy_test(\n    name = \"ml_test\",\n    srcs = glob([\"tests/**/*.py\"]),\n    deps = [\n        \":ml\",\n        requirement(\"pytest\"),\n    ],\n    size = \"medium\",\n    timeout = \"moderate\",\n)\n\npy_binary(\n    name = \"train\",\n    srcs = [\"train.py\"],\n    deps = [\":ml\"],\n    data = [\"//data:training_data\"],\n)\n```\n\n### Template 5: Custom Rule for Docker\n\n```python\n# tools/bazel/rules/docker.bzl\ndef _docker_image_impl(ctx):\n    dockerfile = ctx.file.dockerfile\n    base_image = ctx.attr.base_image\n    layers = ctx.files.layers\n\n    # Build the image\n    output = ctx.actions.declare_file(ctx.attr.name + \".tar\")\n\n    args = ctx.actions.args()\n    args.add(\"--dockerfile\", dockerfile)\n    args.add(\"--output\", output)\n    args.add(\"--base\", base_image)\n    args.add_all(\"--layer\", layers)\n\n    ctx.actions.run(\n        inputs = [dockerfile] + layers,\n        outputs = [output],\n        executable = ctx.executable._builder,\n        arguments = [args],\n        mnemonic = \"DockerBuild\",\n        progress_message = \"Building Docker image %s\" % ctx.label,\n    )\n\n    return [DefaultInfo(files = depset([output]))]\n\ndocker_image = rule(\n    implementation = _docker_image_impl,\n    attrs = {\n        \"dockerfile\": attr.label(\n            allow_single_file = [\".dockerfile\", \"Dockerfile\"],\n            mandatory = True,\n        ),\n        \"base_image\": attr.string(mandatory = True),\n        \"layers\": attr.label_list(allow_files = True),\n        \"_builder\": attr.label(\n            default = \"//tools/docker:builder\",\n            executable = True,\n            cfg = \"exec\",\n        ),\n    },\n)\n```\n\n### Template 6: Query and Dependency Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Find all dependencies of a target\nbazel query \"deps(//apps/web:web)\"\n\n# Find reverse dependencies (what depends on this)\nbazel query \"rdeps(//..., //libs/utils:utils)\"\n\n# Find all targets in a package\nbazel query \"//libs/...\"\n\n# Find changed targets since commit\nbazel query \"rdeps(//..., set($(git diff --name-only HEAD~1 | sed ''s/.*/\"&\"/'' | tr ''\\n'' '' '')))\"\n\n# Generate dependency graph\nbazel query \"deps(//apps/web:web)\" --output=graph | dot -Tpng > deps.png\n\n# Find all test targets\nbazel query \"kind(''.*_test'', //...)\"\n\n# Find targets with specific tag\nbazel query \"attr(tags, ''integration'', //...)\"\n\n# Compute build graph size\nbazel query \"deps(//...)\" --output=package | wc -l\n```\n\n### Template 7: Remote Execution Setup\n\n```python\n# platforms/BUILD.bazel\nplatform(\n    name = \"linux_x86_64\",\n    constraint_values = [\n        \"@platforms//os:linux\",\n        \"@platforms//cpu:x86_64\",\n    ],\n    exec_properties = {\n        \"container-image\": \"docker://gcr.io/myproject/bazel-worker:latest\",\n        \"OSFamily\": \"Linux\",\n    },\n)\n\nplatform(\n    name = \"remote_linux\",\n    parents = [\":linux_x86_64\"],\n    exec_properties = {\n        \"Pool\": \"default\",\n        \"dockerNetwork\": \"standard\",\n    },\n)\n\n# toolchains/BUILD.bazel\ntoolchain(\n    name = \"cc_toolchain_linux\",\n    exec_compatible_with = [\n        \"@platforms//os:linux\",\n        \"@platforms//cpu:x86_64\",\n    ],\n    target_compatible_with = [\n        \"@platforms//os:linux\",\n        \"@platforms//cpu:x86_64\",\n    ],\n    toolchain = \"@remotejdk11_linux//:jdk\",\n    toolchain_type = \"@bazel_tools//tools/jdk:runtime_toolchain_type\",\n)\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n```bash\n# Profile build\nbazel build //... --profile=profile.json\nbazel analyze-profile profile.json\n\n# Identify slow actions\nbazel build //... --execution_log_json_file=exec_log.json\n\n# Memory profiling\nbazel build //... --memory_profile=memory.json\n\n# Skip analysis cache\nbazel build //... --notrack_incremental_state\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Use fine-grained targets** - Better caching\n- **Pin dependencies** - Reproducible builds\n- **Enable remote caching** - Share build artifacts\n- **Use visibility wisely** - Enforce architecture\n- **Write BUILD files per directory** - Standard convention\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t use glob for deps** - Explicit is better\n- **Don''t commit bazel-\\* dirs** - Add to .gitignore\n- **Don''t skip WORKSPACE setup** - Foundation of build\n- **Don''t ignore build warnings** - Technical debt\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Bazel Documentation](https://bazel.build/docs)\n- [Bazel Remote Execution](https://bazel.build/docs/remote-execution)\n- [rules_js](https://github.com/aspect-build/rules_js)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:16:50.298Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Build Optimization Agents needing advanced Bazel configuration and customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Bazel配置和自定义能力的构建优化代理。","ja":"ビルド最適化エージェントが高度なBazel構成とカスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Bazel 구성 및 사용자 지정 기능이 필요한 빌드 최적화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de compilación que necesitan capacidades de configuración y personalización avanzadas de Bazel.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de construction nécessitant une configuration et une personnalisation avancées de Bazel.","de":"Perfekt für Build-Optimierungsagenten, die erweiterte Bazel-Konfigurations- und Anpassungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de otimização de compilação que precisam de configuração e personalização avançadas do Bazel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации сборки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности конфигурации и настройки Bazel.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحسين البناء التي تحتاج إلى تكوين وتخصيص متقدمين لبرنامج Bazel."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize build times, configure remote caching and execution, and write custom Bazel rules using WORKSPACE and BUILD files, while also debugging build issues and migrating to Bazel.","zh":"赋予代理优化构建时间、配置远程缓存和执行、使用WORKSPACE和BUILD文件编写自定义Bazel规则的能力，同时也可以调试构建问题和迁移到Bazel。","ja":"エージェントがビルド時間を最適化し、リモートキャッシュと実行を構成し、WORKSPACEとBUILDファイルを使用してカスタムBazelルールを記述できるようにし、同時にビルドの問題をデバッグし、Bazelに移行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 빌드 시간을 최적화하고 원격 캐시 및 실행을 구성하며 WORKSPACE 및 BUILD 파일을 사용하여 사용자 지정 Bazel 규칙을 작성할 수 있도록 하며 동시에 빌드 문제를 디버깅하고 Bazel로 마이그레이션할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los tiempos de compilación, configurar la caché y la ejecución remota y escribir reglas personalizadas de Bazel utilizando archivos WORKSPACE y BUILD, además de depurar problemas de compilación y migrar a Bazel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les temps de construction, de configurer la mise en cache et l''exécution à distance et d''écrire des règles Bazel personnalisées à l''aide de fichiers WORKSPACE et BUILD, tout en déboguant les problèmes de construction et en migrant vers Bazel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Build-Zeiten zu optimieren, Remote-Caching und -Ausführung zu konfigurieren und benutzerdefinierte Bazel-Regeln mit WORKSPACE- und BUILD-Dateien zu schreiben, während auch Build-Probleme debuggt und zu Bazel migriert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar tempos de compilação, configurar cache e execução remota e escrever regras personalizadas do Bazel usando arquivos WORKSPACE e BUILD, além de depurar problemas de compilação e migrar para o Bazel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать время сборки, настраивать удаленный кэш и выполнение, а также писать пользовательские правила Bazel с помощью файлов WORKSPACE и BUILD, а также отлаживать проблемы сборки и мигрировать в Bazel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين أوقات البناء، وتكوين الذاكرة المؤقتة والتنفيذ عن بعد، وكتابة قواعد بازل مخصصة باستخدام ملفات WORKSPACE وBUILD، بالإضافة إلى تصحيح مشاكل البناء والتحول إلى برنامج Bazel."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring remote caching for large-scale monorepos","Optimizing build times using custom Bazel rules","Debugging build issues in complex Bazel projects"],"zh":["为大规模单体仓库配置远程缓存","使用自定义Bazel规则优化构建时间","在复杂的Bazel项目中调试构建问题"],"ja":["大規模モノレポのリモートキャッシュを構成する","カスタムBazelルールを使用してビルド時間を最適化する","複雑なBazelプロジェクトのビルドの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["대규모 모노레포에 대한 원격 캐시 구성","사용자 지정 Bazel 규칙을 사용한 빌드 시간 최적화","복잡한 Bazel 프로젝트의 빌드 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Configuración de caché remota para monorepos a gran escala","Optimización de tiempos de compilación mediante reglas personalizadas de Bazel","Depuración de problemas de compilación en proyectos Bazel complejos"],"fr":["Configuration de la mise en cache à distance pour les monorepos à grande échelle","Optimisation des temps de construction à l''aide de règles Bazel personnalisées","Débogage des problèmes de construction dans les projets Bazel complexes"],"de":["Konfiguration von Remote-Caching für groß angelegte Monorepos","Optimierung von Build-Zeiten mithilfe benutzerdefinierter Bazel-Regeln","Debuggen von Build-Problemen in komplexen Bazel-Projekten"],"pt":["Configurando cache remoto para monorepos em larga escala","Otimizando tempos de compilação usando regras personalizadas do Bazel","Depurando problemas de compilação em projetos Bazel complexos"],"ru":["Настройка удаленного кэша для крупномасштабных монорепозиториев","Оптимизация времени сборки с помощью пользовательских правил Bazel","Отладка проблем сборки в сложных проектах Bazel"],"ar":["تكوين الذاكرة المؤقتة عن بعد لمشاريع مونوريبوزиторي كبيرة النطاق","تحسين أوقات البناء باستخدام قواعد بازل مخصصة","تصحيح مشاكل البناء في مشاريع بازل معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Bazel installation and configuration","Limited to monorepo setups","Dependent on .bazelrc and .bazelversion files"],"zh":["需要Bazel的安装和配置","仅限于单体仓库设置","依赖于.bazelrc和.bazelversion文件"],"ja":["Bazelのインストールと構成が必要","モノレポ設定のみに限定される",".bazelrcと.bazelversionファイルに依存する"],"ko":["Bazel 설치 및 구성 필요","모노레포 설정만으로 제한됨",".bazelrc 및 .bazelversion 파일에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Bazel","Limitado a configuraciones de monorepo","Dependiente de los archivos .bazelrc y .bazelversion"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Bazel","Limité aux configurations de monorepo","Dépendant des fichiers .bazelrc et .bazelversion"],"de":["Benötigt Bazel-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Monorepo-Setups","Abhängig von .bazelrc- und .bazelversion-Dateien"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Bazel","Limitado a configurações de monorepo","Dependente dos arquivos .bazelrc e .bazelversion"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Bazel","Ограничен настройками монорепозитория","Зависит от файлов .bazelrc и .bazelversion"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت برنامج Bazel وتكوينه","محدود بتكوين مونوريبوزиторي","يعتمد على ملفات .bazelrc و .bazelversion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/unity-ecs-patterns', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'unity-ecs-patterns', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:16:56.809Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/unity-ecs-patterns","name":"unity-ecs-patterns","description":{"zh":"Unity ECS Patterns","ja":"Unity ECS","ko":"Unity ECS ","es":"Los patrones de Unity ECS permiten la creación de juegos de alto rendimiento y escalables","fr":"Les modèles Unity ECS permettent de créer des jeux haute performance et évolutifs","de":"Die Unity-ECS-Muster ermöglichen die Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Spielen und skalierbaren Spielen","pt":"Padrões de ECS Unity para desenvolver jogos de alta performance com Entity Component System, Job System e Burst Compiler.","ru":"Шаблоны Unity ECS для разработки высокопроизводительных игр с Entity Component System, Job System и Burst Compiler.","ar":"نماذج ECS Unity لإنشاء ألعاب عالية الأداء باستخدام Entity Component System و Job System و Burst Compiler.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Unity ECS Patterns","ja":"Unity ECS","ko":"Unity ECS ","es":"Patrones de Unity ECS para juegos de alto rendimiento","fr":"Modèles Unity ECS pour jeux haute performance","de":"Unity-ECS-Muster für Hochleistungs-Spiele","pt":"Padrões de ECS Unity","ru":"Шаблоны Unity ECS","ar":"نماذج ECS Unity","en":"unity-ecs-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Unity ECS Patterns","ja":"Unity ECS","ko":"Unity ECS ","es":"Los patrones de Unity ECS permiten la creación de juegos de alto rendimiento y escalables","fr":"Les modèles Unity ECS permettent de créer des jeux haute performance et évolutifs","de":"Die Unity-ECS-Muster ermöglichen die Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Spielen und skalierbaren Spielen","pt":"Padrões de ECS Unity para desenvolver jogos de alta performance com Entity Component System, Job System e Burst Compiler.","ru":"Шаблоны Unity ECS для разработки высокопроизводительных игр с Entity Component System, Job System и Burst Compiler.","ar":"نماذج ECS Unity لإنشاء ألعاب عالية الأداء باستخدام Entity Component System و Job System و Burst Compiler.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Data-Oriented Technology Stack","High-Performance Game Development","Parallelization"],"ja":["Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Data-Oriented Technology Stack","High-Performance Game Development","Parallelization"],"ko":["Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Data-Oriented Technology Stack","High-Performance Game Development","Parallelization"],"es":["Entity Component System (ECS)","Job System para la paralelización","Burst Compiler para la optimización del CPU","Patrones de diseño para la creación de juegos de alto rendimiento","Escalabilidad para miles de entidades","Optimización de la lógica del juego"],"fr":["Entity Component System (ECS)","Job System pour la parallélisation","Burst Compiler pour l''optimisation du CPU","Modèles de conception pour la création de jeux haute performance","Évolutivité pour des milliers d''entités","Optimisation de la logique du jeu"],"de":["Entity Component System (ECS)","Job-System für die Paralellisierung","Burst-Compiler für die CPU-Optimierung","Entwurfsmuster für die Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Spielen","Skalierbarkeit für Tausende von Entitäten","Optimierung der Spiellogik"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de jogos de alta performance","Gestão eficiente de milhares de entidades","Implementação de sistemas de jogo orientados a dados","Otimização de lógica de jogo limitada por CPU","Conversão de código de jogo OOP para ECS"],"ru":["Разработка высокопроизводительных игр","Эффективное управление тысячами сущностей","Реализация данных игровых систем","Оптимизация CPU-ограниченной игровой логики","Преобразование игрового кода OOP в ECS"],"ar":["إنشاء ألعاب عالية الأداء","إدارة كفاءة آلاف الكيانات","تنفيذ أنظمة لعبة متجهة إلى البيانات","تحسين منطق اللعبة المقيد بالمسار","تحويل код اللعبة OOP إلى ECS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Unity ECS","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Data-Oriented Technology Stack","High-Performance Game Development","Parallelization","Game Development","Unity Game Engine"],"ja":["Unity ECS","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Data-Oriented Technology Stack","High-Performance Game Development","Parallelization","Game Development","Unity Game Engine"],"ko":["Unity ECS","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Data-Oriented Technology Stack","High-Performance Game Development","Parallelization","Game Development","Unity Game Engine"],"es":["Unity ECS","juegos de alto rendimiento","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","patrones de diseño","optimización del CPU","escalabilidad"],"fr":["Unity ECS","jeux haute performance","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","modèles de conception","optimisation du CPU","évolutivité"],"de":["Unity ECS","Hochleistungs-Spiele","Entity Component System","Job-System","Burst-Compiler","Entwurfsmuster","CPU-Optimierung","Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["ECS Unity","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Unity ECS","Разработка игр","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["ECS Unity","تطوير الألعاب","Entity Component System","Job System","Burst Compiler","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unity-ecs-patterns","description":"Master Unity ECS (Entity Component System) with DOTS, Jobs, and Burst for high-performance game development. Use when building data-oriented games, optimizing performance, or working with large entity counts.","bodyPreview":"# Unity ECS Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Unity''s Data-Oriented Technology Stack (DOTS) including Entity Component System, Job System, and Burst Compiler.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building high-performance Unity games\n- Managing thousands of entities efficiently\n- Implementing data-oriented game systems\n- Optimizing CPU-bound game logic\n- Converting OOP game code to ECS\n- Using Jobs and Burst for parallelization\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. ECS vs OOP\n\n| Aspect      | Traditional OOP   | E","body":"# Unity ECS Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Unity''s Data-Oriented Technology Stack (DOTS) including Entity Component System, Job System, and Burst Compiler.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building high-performance Unity games\n- Managing thousands of entities efficiently\n- Implementing data-oriented game systems\n- Optimizing CPU-bound game logic\n- Converting OOP game code to ECS\n- Using Jobs and Burst for parallelization\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. ECS vs OOP\n\n| Aspect      | Traditional OOP   | ECS/DOTS        |\n| ----------- | ----------------- | --------------- |\n| Data layout | Object-oriented   | Data-oriented   |\n| Memory      | Scattered         | Contiguous      |\n| Processing  | Per-object        | Batched         |\n| Scaling     | Poor with count   | Linear scaling  |\n| Best for    | Complex behaviors | Mass simulation |\n\n### 2. DOTS Components\n\n```\nEntity: Lightweight ID (no data)\nComponent: Pure data (no behavior)\nSystem: Logic that processes components\nWorld: Container for entities\nArchetype: Unique combination of components\nChunk: Memory block for same-archetype entities\n```\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Basic ECS Setup\n\n```csharp\nusing Unity.Entities;\nusing Unity.Mathematics;\nusing Unity.Transforms;\nusing Unity.Burst;\nusing Unity.Collections;\n\n// Component: Pure data, no methods\npublic struct Speed : IComponentData\n{\n    public float Value;\n}\n\npublic struct Health : IComponentData\n{\n    public float Current;\n    public float Max;\n}\n\npublic struct Target : IComponentData\n{\n    public Entity Value;\n}\n\n// Tag component (zero-size marker)\npublic struct EnemyTag : IComponentData { }\npublic struct PlayerTag : IComponentData { }\n\n// Buffer component (variable-size array)\n[InternalBufferCapacity(8)]\npublic struct InventoryItem : IBufferElementData\n{\n    public int ItemId;\n    public int Quantity;\n}\n\n// Shared component (grouped entities)\npublic struct TeamId : ISharedComponentData\n{\n    public int Value;\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Systems with ISystem (Recommended)\n\n```csharp\nusing Unity.Entities;\nusing Unity.Transforms;\nusing Unity.Mathematics;\nusing Unity.Burst;\n\n// ISystem: Unmanaged, Burst-compatible, highest performance\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct MovementSystem : ISystem\n{\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnCreate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        // Require components before system runs\n        state.RequireForUpdate<Speed>();\n    }\n\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        float deltaTime = SystemAPI.Time.DeltaTime;\n\n        // Simple foreach - auto-generates job\n        foreach (var (transform, speed) in\n            SystemAPI.Query<RefRW<LocalTransform>, RefRO<Speed>>())\n        {\n            transform.ValueRW.Position +=\n                new float3(0, 0, speed.ValueRO.Value * deltaTime);\n        }\n    }\n\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnDestroy(ref SystemState state) { }\n}\n\n// With explicit job for more control\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct MovementJobSystem : ISystem\n{\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        var job = new MoveJob\n        {\n            DeltaTime = SystemAPI.Time.DeltaTime\n        };\n\n        state.Dependency = job.ScheduleParallel(state.Dependency);\n    }\n}\n\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct MoveJob : IJobEntity\n{\n    public float DeltaTime;\n\n    void Execute(ref LocalTransform transform, in Speed speed)\n    {\n        transform.Position += new float3(0, 0, speed.Value * DeltaTime);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Entity Queries\n\n```csharp\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct QueryExamplesSystem : ISystem\n{\n    private EntityQuery _enemyQuery;\n\n    public void OnCreate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        // Build query manually for complex cases\n        _enemyQuery = new EntityQueryBuilder(Allocator.Temp)\n            .WithAll<EnemyTag, Health, LocalTransform>()\n            .WithNone<Dead>()\n            .WithOptions(EntityQueryOptions.FilterWriteGroup)\n            .Build(ref state);\n    }\n\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        // SystemAPI.Query - simplest approach\n        foreach (var (health, entity) in\n            SystemAPI.Query<RefRW<Health>>()\n                .WithAll<EnemyTag>()\n                .WithEntityAccess())\n        {\n            if (health.ValueRO.Current <= 0)\n            {\n                // Mark for destruction\n                SystemAPI.GetSingleton<EndSimulationEntityCommandBufferSystem.Singleton>()\n                    .CreateCommandBuffer(state.WorldUnmanaged)\n                    .DestroyEntity(entity);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Get count\n        int enemyCount = _enemyQuery.CalculateEntityCount();\n\n        // Get all entities\n        var enemies = _enemyQuery.ToEntityArray(Allocator.Temp);\n\n        // Get component arrays\n        var healths = _enemyQuery.ToComponentDataArray<Health>(Allocator.Temp);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Entity Command Buffers (Structural Changes)\n\n```csharp\n// Structural changes (create/destroy/add/remove) require command buffers\n[BurstCompile]\n[UpdateInGroup(typeof(SimulationSystemGroup))]\npublic partial struct SpawnSystem : ISystem\n{\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        var ecbSingleton = SystemAPI.GetSingleton<BeginSimulationEntityCommandBufferSystem.Singleton>();\n        var ecb = ecbSingleton.CreateCommandBuffer(state.WorldUnmanaged);\n\n        foreach (var (spawner, transform) in\n            SystemAPI.Query<RefRW<Spawner>, RefRO<LocalTransform>>())\n        {\n            spawner.ValueRW.Timer -= SystemAPI.Time.DeltaTime;\n\n            if (spawner.ValueRO.Timer <= 0)\n            {\n                spawner.ValueRW.Timer = spawner.ValueRO.Interval;\n\n                // Create entity (deferred until sync point)\n                Entity newEntity = ecb.Instantiate(spawner.ValueRO.Prefab);\n\n                // Set component values\n                ecb.SetComponent(newEntity, new LocalTransform\n                {\n                    Position = transform.ValueRO.Position,\n                    Rotation = quaternion.identity,\n                    Scale = 1f\n                });\n\n                // Add component\n                ecb.AddComponent(newEntity, new Speed { Value = 5f });\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Parallel ECB usage\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct ParallelSpawnJob : IJobEntity\n{\n    public EntityCommandBuffer.ParallelWriter ECB;\n\n    void Execute([EntityIndexInQuery] int index, in Spawner spawner)\n    {\n        Entity e = ECB.Instantiate(index, spawner.Prefab);\n        ECB.AddComponent(index, e, new Speed { Value = 5f });\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Aspect (Grouping Components)\n\n```csharp\nusing Unity.Entities;\nusing Unity.Transforms;\nusing Unity.Mathematics;\n\n// Aspect: Groups related components for cleaner code\npublic readonly partial struct CharacterAspect : IAspect\n{\n    public readonly Entity Entity;\n\n    private readonly RefRW<LocalTransform> _transform;\n    private readonly RefRO<Speed> _speed;\n    private readonly RefRW<Health> _health;\n\n    // Optional component\n    [Optional]\n    private readonly RefRO<Shield> _shield;\n\n    // Buffer\n    private readonly DynamicBuffer<InventoryItem> _inventory;\n\n    public float3 Position\n    {\n        get => _transform.ValueRO.Position;\n        set => _transform.ValueRW.Position = value;\n    }\n\n    public float CurrentHealth => _health.ValueRO.Current;\n    public float MaxHealth => _health.ValueRO.Max;\n    public float MoveSpeed => _speed.ValueRO.Value;\n\n    public bool HasShield => _shield.IsValid;\n    public float ShieldAmount => HasShield ? _shield.ValueRO.Amount : 0f;\n\n    public void TakeDamage(float amount)\n    {\n        float remaining = amount;\n\n        if (HasShield && _shield.ValueRO.Amount > 0)\n        {\n            // Shield absorbs damage first\n            remaining = math.max(0, amount - _shield.ValueRO.Amount);\n        }\n\n        _health.ValueRW.Current = math.max(0, _health.ValueRO.Current - remaining);\n    }\n\n    public void Move(float3 direction, float deltaTime)\n    {\n        _transform.ValueRW.Position += direction * _speed.ValueRO.Value * deltaTime;\n    }\n\n    public void AddItem(int itemId, int quantity)\n    {\n        _inventory.Add(new InventoryItem { ItemId = itemId, Quantity = quantity });\n    }\n}\n\n// Using aspect in system\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct CharacterSystem : ISystem\n{\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        float dt = SystemAPI.Time.DeltaTime;\n\n        foreach (var character in SystemAPI.Query<CharacterAspect>())\n        {\n            character.Move(new float3(1, 0, 0), dt);\n\n            if (character.CurrentHealth < character.MaxHealth * 0.5f)\n            {\n                // Low health logic\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Singleton Components\n\n```csharp\n// Singleton: Exactly one entity with this component\npublic struct GameConfig : IComponentData\n{\n    public float DifficultyMultiplier;\n    public int MaxEnemies;\n    public float SpawnRate;\n}\n\npublic struct GameState : IComponentData\n{\n    public int Score;\n    public int Wave;\n    public float TimeRemaining;\n}\n\n// Create singleton on world creation\npublic partial struct GameInitSystem : ISystem\n{\n    public void OnCreate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        var entity = state.EntityManager.CreateEntity();\n        state.EntityManager.AddComponentData(entity, new GameConfig\n        {\n            DifficultyMultiplier = 1.0f,\n            MaxEnemies = 100,\n            SpawnRate = 2.0f\n        });\n        state.EntityManager.AddComponentData(entity, new GameState\n        {\n            Score = 0,\n            Wave = 1,\n            TimeRemaining = 120f\n        });\n    }\n}\n\n// Access singleton in system\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct ScoreSystem : ISystem\n{\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        // Read singleton\n        var config = SystemAPI.GetSingleton<GameConfig>();\n\n        // Write singleton\n        ref var gameState = ref SystemAPI.GetSingletonRW<GameState>().ValueRW;\n        gameState.TimeRemaining -= SystemAPI.Time.DeltaTime;\n\n        // Check exists\n        if (SystemAPI.HasSingleton<GameConfig>())\n        {\n            // ...\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 7: Baking (Converting GameObjects)\n\n```csharp\nusing Unity.Entities;\nusing UnityEngine;\n\n// Authoring component (MonoBehaviour in Editor)\npublic class EnemyAuthoring : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    public float Speed = 5f;\n    public float Health = 100f;\n    public GameObject ProjectilePrefab;\n\n    class Baker : Baker<EnemyAuthoring>\n    {\n        public override void Bake(EnemyAuthoring authoring)\n        {\n            var entity = GetEntity(TransformUsageFlags.Dynamic);\n\n            AddComponent(entity, new Speed { Value = authoring.Speed });\n            AddComponent(entity, new Health\n            {\n                Current = authoring.Health,\n                Max = authoring.Health\n            });\n            AddComponent(entity, new EnemyTag());\n\n            if (authoring.ProjectilePrefab != null)\n            {\n                AddComponent(entity, new ProjectilePrefab\n                {\n                    Value = GetEntity(authoring.ProjectilePrefab, TransformUsageFlags.Dynamic)\n                });\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Complex baking with dependencies\npublic class SpawnerAuthoring : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    public GameObject[] Prefabs;\n    public float Interval = 1f;\n\n    class Baker : Baker<SpawnerAuthoring>\n    {\n        public override void Bake(SpawnerAuthoring authoring)\n        {\n            var entity = GetEntity(TransformUsageFlags.Dynamic);\n\n            AddComponent(entity, new Spawner\n            {\n                Interval = authoring.Interval,\n                Timer = 0f\n            });\n\n            // Bake buffer of prefabs\n            var buffer = AddBuffer<SpawnPrefabElement>(entity);\n            foreach (var prefab in authoring.Prefabs)\n            {\n                buffer.Add(new SpawnPrefabElement\n                {\n                    Prefab = GetEntity(prefab, TransformUsageFlags.Dynamic)\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Declare dependencies\n            DependsOn(authoring.Prefabs);\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 8: Jobs with Native Collections\n\n```csharp\nusing Unity.Jobs;\nusing Unity.Collections;\nusing Unity.Burst;\nusing Unity.Mathematics;\n\n[BurstCompile]\npublic struct SpatialHashJob : IJobParallelFor\n{\n    [ReadOnly]\n    public NativeArray<float3> Positions;\n\n    // Thread-safe write to hash map\n    public NativeParallelMultiHashMap<int, int>.ParallelWriter HashMap;\n\n    public float CellSize;\n\n    public void Execute(int index)\n    {\n        float3 pos = Positions[index];\n        int hash = GetHash(pos);\n        HashMap.Add(hash, index);\n    }\n\n    int GetHash(float3 pos)\n    {\n        int x = (int)math.floor(pos.x / CellSize);\n        int y = (int)math.floor(pos.y / CellSize);\n        int z = (int)math.floor(pos.z / CellSize);\n        return x * 73856093 ^ y * 19349663 ^ z * 83492791;\n    }\n}\n\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct SpatialHashSystem : ISystem\n{\n    private NativeParallelMultiHashMap<int, int> _hashMap;\n\n    public void OnCreate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        _hashMap = new NativeParallelMultiHashMap<int, int>(10000, Allocator.Persistent);\n    }\n\n    public void OnDestroy(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        _hashMap.Dispose();\n    }\n\n    [BurstCompile]\n    public void OnUpdate(ref SystemState state)\n    {\n        var query = SystemAPI.QueryBuilder()\n            .WithAll<LocalTransform>()\n            .Build();\n\n        int count = query.CalculateEntityCount();\n\n        // Resize if needed\n        if (_hashMap.Capacity < count)\n        {\n            _hashMap.Capacity = count * 2;\n        }\n\n        _hashMap.Clear();\n\n        // Get positions\n        var positions = query.ToComponentDataArray<LocalTransform>(Allocator.TempJob);\n        var posFloat3 = new NativeArray<float3>(count, Allocator.TempJob);\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < count; i++)\n        {\n            posFloat3[i] = positions[i].Position;\n        }\n\n        // Build hash map\n        var hashJob = new SpatialHashJob\n        {\n            Positions = posFloat3,\n            HashMap = _hashMap.AsParallelWriter(),\n            CellSize = 10f\n        };\n\n        state.Dependency = hashJob.Schedule(count, 64, state.Dependency);\n\n        // Cleanup\n        positions.Dispose(state.Dependency);\n        posFloat3.Dispose(state.Dependency);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n```csharp\n// 1. Use Burst everywhere\n[BurstCompile]\npublic partial struct MySystem : ISystem { }\n\n// 2. Prefer IJobEntity over manual iteration\n[BurstCompile]\npartial struct OptimizedJob : IJobEntity\n{\n    void Execute(ref LocalTransform transform) { }\n}\n\n// 3. Schedule parallel when possible\nstate.Dependency = job.ScheduleParallel(state.Dependency);\n\n// 4. Use ScheduleParallel with chunk iteration\n[BurstCompile]\npartial struct ChunkJob : IJobChunk\n{\n    public ComponentTypeHandle<Health> HealthHandle;\n\n    public void Execute(in ArchetypeChunk chunk, int unfilteredChunkIndex,\n        bool useEnabledMask, in v128 chunkEnabledMask)\n    {\n        var healths = chunk.GetNativeArray(ref HealthHandle);\n        for (int i = 0; i < chunk.Count; i++)\n        {\n            // Process\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// 5. Avoid structural changes in hot paths\n// Use enableable components instead of add/remove\npublic struct Disabled : IComponentData, IEnableableComponent { }\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Use ISystem over SystemBase** - Better performance\n- **Burst compile everything** - Massive speedup\n- **Batch structural changes** - Use ECB\n- **Profile with Profiler** - Identify bottlenecks\n- **Use Aspects** - Clean component grouping\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t use managed types** - Breaks Burst\n- **Don''t structural change in jobs** - Use ECB\n- **Don''t over-architect** - Start simple\n- **Don''t ignore chunk utilization** - Group similar entities\n- **Don''t forget disposal** - Native collections leak\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Unity DOTS Documentation](https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.entities@latest)\n- [Unity DOTS Samples](https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/EntityComponentSystemSamples)\n- [Burst User Guide](https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.burst@latest)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:16:56.809Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Game Development Agents requiring high-performance Unity game creation using Entity Component System (ECS) patterns.","zh":"适用于需要高性能Unity游戏创建的游戏开发代理，使用实体组件系统（ECS）模式。","ja":"高性能のUnityゲーム作成を必要とするゲーム開発エージェントに適しています。エンティティコンポーネントシステム（ECS）パターンを使用します。","ko":"고성능 유니티 게임 생성이 필요한 게임 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 엔티티 컴포넌트 시스템(ECS) 패턴을 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que requieren una creación de juegos de Unity de alto rendimiento utilizando patrones de Sistema de Entidad-Componente (ECS).","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de jeux nécessitant une création de jeux Unity haute performance en utilisant des modèles de Système d''Entité-Composant (ECS).","de":"Ideal für Game-Development-Agents, die eine Unity-Spiel-Erstellung mit hoher Leistung unter Verwendung von Entitäts-Komponenten-System (ECS)-Mustern erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Jogos que requerem criação de jogos Unity de alto desempenho usando padrões Entity Component System (ECS).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, требующих высокопроизводительного создания игр на Unity с использованием шаблонов Entity Component System (ECS).","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الألعاب الذين يتطلبون إنشاء ألعاب Unity عالية الأداء باستخدام أنماط نظام الكيان والمكون (ECS)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage thousands of entities, optimize CPU-bound game logic, and implement data-oriented game systems using Unity''s Data-Oriented Technology Stack (DOTS), including Job System and Burst Compiler for parallelization.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理数千个实体、优化CPU绑定游戏逻辑、使用Unity的数据导向技术栈（DOTS）实现数据导向游戏系统的能力，包括用于并行化的作业系统和Burst编译器。","ja":"エージェントが数千のエンティティを効率的に管理し、CPUバウンドのゲームロジックを最適化し、Unityのデータ指向技術スタック（DOTS）を使用してデータ指向のゲームシステムを実装する能力を提供します。並列化に使用するジョブシステムとバーストコンパイラを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 수천 개의 엔티티를 효율적으로 관리하고 CPU 바운드 게임 논리를 최적화하며 유니티의 데이터 지향 기술 스택(DOTS)을 사용하여 데이터 지향 게임 시스템을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 병렬화에 사용되는 작업 시스템과 버스트 컴파일러를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de manera eficiente miles de entidades, optimizar la lógica de juego limitada por la CPU y implementar sistemas de juego orientados a datos utilizando la pila de tecnología orientada a datos de Unity (DOTS), incluyendo Job System y Burst Compiler para la paralelización.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement des milliers d''entités, d''optimiser la logique de jeu limitée par la CPU et de mettre en œuvre des systèmes de jeu orientés vers les données en utilisant la pile de technologie orientée vers les données de Unity (DOTS), y compris Job System et Burst Compiler pour la parallélisation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tausende von Entitäten effizient zu verwalten, CPU-gebundene Spiellogik zu optimieren und datenorientierte Spiel-Systeme mithilfe von Unitys Data-Oriented Technology Stack (DOTS) zu implementieren, einschließlich Job System und Burst Compiler für die Parallelisierung.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerenciar milhares de entidades com eficiência, otimizar a lógica do jogo limitada pela CPU e implementar sistemas de jogo orientados a dados usando o Data-Oriented Technology Stack (DOTS) da Unity, incluindo o Job System e o Burst Compiler para paralelização.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно управлять тысячами сущностей, оптимизировать игровую логику, ограниченную процессором, и реализовывать системы, ориентированные на данные, с использованием технологического стека Data-Oriented Technology Stack (DOTS) от Unity, включая систему заданий (Job System) и Burst Compiler для распараллеливания.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إدارة آلاف الكيانات بكفاءة، وتحسين منطق اللعبة المقيد بوحدة المعالجة المركزية (CPU)، وتنفيذ أنظمة ألعاب موجهة بالبيانات باستخدام مجموعة تكنولوجيا التوجه نحو البيانات (DOTS) من Unity، بما في ذلك نظام المهام (Job System) ومحرك Burst للتوزيع المتوازي."},"useCases":{"en":["Building high-performance Unity games","Converting OOP game code to ECS","Optimizing game logic with Jobs and Burst"],"zh":["构建高性能的Unity游戏","将面向对象的游戏代码转换为ECS","使用作业和Burst优化游戏逻辑"],"ja":["高性能のUnityゲームを構築する","オブジェクト指向のゲームコードをECSに変換する","ジョブとバーストを使用してゲームロジックを最適化する"],"ko":["고성능 유니티 게임을 구축하는 것","객체 지향 게임 코드를 ECS로 변환하는 것","작업과 버스트를 사용하여 게임 논리를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Construcción de juegos Unity de alto rendimiento","Conversión de código de juego OOP a ECS","Optimización de la lógica del juego con Jobs y Burst"],"fr":["Création de jeux Unity haute performance","Conversion de code de jeu OOP en ECS","Optimisation de la logique de jeu avec Jobs et Burst"],"de":["Erstellung von Unity-Spielen mit hoher Leistung","Umstellung von OOP-Spielcode auf ECS","Optimierung der Spiellogik mit Jobs und Burst"],"pt":["Construção de jogos Unity de alto desempenho","Conversão de código de jogo OOP para ECS","Otimização da lógica do jogo com Jobs e Burst"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных игр на Unity","Преобразование объектно-ориентированного игрового кода в ECS","Оптимизация игровой логики с помощью Jobs и Burst"],"ar":["بناء ألعاب Unity عالية الأداء","تحويل كود اللعبة الكائني التوجه (OOP) إلى ECS","تحسين منطق اللعبة باستخدام Jobs وBurst"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Unity game development environment","DOTS and ECS knowledge necessary"],"zh":["需要Unity游戏开发环境","需要DOTS和ECS的知识"],"ja":["Unityゲーム開発環境が必要","DOTSとECSの知識が必要"],"ko":["유니티 게임 개발 환경이 필요","DOTS와 ECS에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de desarrollo de juegos Unity","Conocimiento de DOTS y ECS necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement de jeux Unity","Connaissance de DOTS et ECS nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Unity-Game-Development-Umgebung","Kenntnisse von DOTS und ECS erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de desenvolvimento de jogos Unity","Conhecimento de DOTS e ECS necessário"],"ru":["Требуется среда разработки игр Unity","Необходимы знания DOTS и ECS"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير ألعاب Unity","معرفة بـ DOTS و ECS ضرورية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
