de Projeção","Modelos de Leitura para CQRS","Materialização de Vistas a partir de Eventos","Otimização do Desempenho de Consultas","Implementação de Painéis em Tempo Real","Criação de Índices de Pesquisa a partir de Eventos"],"ru":["Архитектура проекций","Модели чтения для CQRS","Материализация представлений из событий","Оптимизация производительности запросов","Реализация панелей в реальном времени","Создание индексов поиска из событий"],"ar":["هندسة الإسقاط","نماذج القراءة لسي كي آر إس","تحويل العروض من الأحداث","تحسين أداء الاستعلامات","تنفيذ لوحات التحكم في الوقت الفعلي","إنشاء فهارس البحث من الأحداث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["事件源系统","投影模式","CQRS","读模型","物化视图","查询性能优化","实时数据处理"],"ja":["イベントソーシングシステム","投影パターン","CQRS","読み取りモデル","物化ビュー","クエリのパフォーマンス最適化","リアルタイムのデータ処理"],"ko":["이벤트 소싱 시스템","프로젝션 패턴","CQRS","읽기 모델","물리적 뷰","쿼리 성능 최적화","실시간 데이터 처리"],"es":["patrones de proyección","sistemas de fuente de eventos","CQRS","modelos de lectura","proyecciones","optimización de consultas","paneles de control en tiempo real","índices de búsqueda"],"fr":["modèles de projection","systèmes à source d''événements","CQRS","modèles de lecture","projections","optimisation des requêtes","tableaux de bord en temps réel","index de recherche"],"de":["Projektionsmuster","Ereignisquellensysteme","CQRS","Lese-Modelle","Projektionen","Abfrageoptimierung","Echtzeit-Dashboards","Suchindizes"],"pt":["padrões de projeção","sistemas de fonte de eventos","cqrs","modelos de leitura","materialização de vistas","otimização de consultas","painéis em tempo real","índices de pesquisa","arquitetura de software"],"ru":["шаблоны проекций","событийно-ориентированные системы","cqrs","модели чтения","материализация представлений","оптимизация производительности","панели в реальном времени","индексы поиска","архитектура программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أنماط الإسقاط","أنظمة مصدر الحدث","سي كي آر إس","نماذج القراءة","تحويل العروض","تحسين الأداء","لوحات التحكم في الوقت الفعلي","فهارس البحث","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"projection-patterns","description":"Build read models and projections from event streams. Use when implementing CQRS read sides, building materialized views, or optimizing query performance in event-sourced systems.","bodyPreview":"# Projection Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to building projections and read models for event-sourced systems.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building CQRS read models\n- Creating materialized views from events\n- Optimizing query performance\n- Implementing real-time dashboards\n- Building search indexes from events\n- Aggregating data across streams\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Projection Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐\n│ Event Store │────►│ Projector   │────►│","body":"# Projection Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to building projections and read models for event-sourced systems.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building CQRS read models\n- Creating materialized views from events\n- Optimizing query performance\n- Implementing real-time dashboards\n- Building search indexes from events\n- Aggregating data across streams\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Projection Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐\n│ Event Store │────►│ Projector   │────►│ Read Model  │\n│             │     │             │     │ (Database)  │\n│ ┌─────────┐ │     │ ┌─────────┐ │     │ ┌─────────┐ │\n│ │ Events  │ │     │ │ Handler │ │     │ │ Tables  │ │\n│ └─────────┘ │     │ │ Logic   │ │     │ │ Views   │ │\n│             │     │ └─────────┘ │     │ │ Cache   │ │\n└─────────────┘     └─────────────┘     └─────────────┘\n```\n\n### 2. Projection Types\n\n| Type           | Description                 | Use Case               |\n| -------------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Live**       | Real-time from subscription | Current state queries  |\n| **Catchup**    | Process historical events   | Rebuilding read models |\n| **Persistent** | Stores checkpoint           | Resume after restart   |\n| **Inline**     | Same transaction as write   | Strong consistency     |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: Basic Projector\n\n```python\nfrom abc import ABC, abstractmethod\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import Dict, Any, Callable, List\nimport asyncpg\n\n@dataclass\nclass Event:\n    stream_id: str\n    event_type: str\n    data: dict\n    version: int\n    global_position: int\n\n\nclass Projection(ABC):\n    \"\"\"Base class for projections.\"\"\"\n\n    @property\n    @abstractmethod\n    def name(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Unique projection name for checkpointing.\"\"\"\n        pass\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    def handles(self) -> List[str]:\n        \"\"\"List of event types this projection handles.\"\"\"\n        pass\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    async def apply(self, event: Event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Apply event to the read model.\"\"\"\n        pass\n\n\nclass Projector:\n    \"\"\"Runs projections from event store.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, event_store, checkpoint_store):\n        self.event_store = event_store\n        self.checkpoint_store = checkpoint_store\n        self.projections: List[Projection] = []\n\n    def register(self, projection: Projection):\n        self.projections.append(projection)\n\n    async def run(self, batch_size: int = 100):\n        \"\"\"Run all projections continuously.\"\"\"\n        while True:\n            for projection in self.projections:\n                await self._run_projection(projection, batch_size)\n            await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n\n    async def _run_projection(self, projection: Projection, batch_size: int):\n        checkpoint = await self.checkpoint_store.get(projection.name)\n        position = checkpoint or 0\n\n        events = await self.event_store.read_all(position, batch_size)\n\n        for event in events:\n            if event.event_type in projection.handles():\n                await projection.apply(event)\n\n            await self.checkpoint_store.save(\n                projection.name,\n                event.global_position\n            )\n\n    async def rebuild(self, projection: Projection):\n        \"\"\"Rebuild a projection from scratch.\"\"\"\n        await self.checkpoint_store.delete(projection.name)\n        # Optionally clear read model tables\n        await self._run_projection(projection, batch_size=1000)\n```\n\n### Template 2: Order Summary Projection\n\n```python\nclass OrderSummaryProjection(Projection):\n    \"\"\"Projects order events to a summary read model.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, db_pool: asyncpg.Pool):\n        self.pool = db_pool\n\n    @property\n    def name(self) -> str:\n        return \"order_summary\"\n\n    def handles(self) -> List[str]:\n        return [\n            \"OrderCreated\",\n            \"OrderItemAdded\",\n            \"OrderItemRemoved\",\n            \"OrderShipped\",\n            \"OrderCompleted\",\n            \"OrderCancelled\"\n        ]\n\n    async def apply(self, event: Event) -> None:\n        handlers = {\n            \"OrderCreated\": self._handle_created,\n            \"OrderItemAdded\": self._handle_item_added,\n            \"OrderItemRemoved\": self._handle_item_removed,\n            \"OrderShipped\": self._handle_shipped,\n            \"OrderCompleted\": self._handle_completed,\n            \"OrderCancelled\": self._handle_cancelled,\n        }\n\n        handler = handlers.get(event.event_type)\n        if handler:\n            await handler(event)\n\n    async def _handle_created(self, event: Event):\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                INSERT INTO order_summaries\n                (order_id, customer_id, status, total_amount, item_count, created_at)\n                VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6)\n                \"\"\",\n                event.data[''order_id''],\n                event.data[''customer_id''],\n                ''pending'',\n                0,\n                0,\n                event.data[''created_at'']\n            )\n\n    async def _handle_item_added(self, event: Event):\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                UPDATE order_summaries\n                SET total_amount = total_amount + $2,\n                    item_count = item_count + 1,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                WHERE order_id = $1\n                \"\"\",\n                event.data[''order_id''],\n                event.data[''price''] * event.data[''quantity'']\n            )\n\n    async def _handle_item_removed(self, event: Event):\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                UPDATE order_summaries\n                SET total_amount = total_amount - $2,\n                    item_count = item_count - 1,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                WHERE order_id = $1\n                \"\"\",\n                event.data[''order_id''],\n                event.data[''price''] * event.data[''quantity'']\n            )\n\n    async def _handle_shipped(self, event: Event):\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                UPDATE order_summaries\n                SET status = ''shipped'',\n                    shipped_at = $2,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                WHERE order_id = $1\n                \"\"\",\n                event.data[''order_id''],\n                event.data[''shipped_at'']\n            )\n\n    async def _handle_completed(self, event: Event):\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                UPDATE order_summaries\n                SET status = ''completed'',\n                    completed_at = $2,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                WHERE order_id = $1\n                \"\"\",\n                event.data[''order_id''],\n                event.data[''completed_at'']\n            )\n\n    async def _handle_cancelled(self, event: Event):\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                UPDATE order_summaries\n                SET status = ''cancelled'',\n                    cancelled_at = $2,\n                    cancellation_reason = $3,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                WHERE order_id = $1\n                \"\"\",\n                event.data[''order_id''],\n                event.data[''cancelled_at''],\n                event.data.get(''reason'')\n            )\n```\n\n### Template 3: Elasticsearch Search Projection\n\n```python\nfrom elasticsearch import AsyncElasticsearch\n\nclass ProductSearchProjection(Projection):\n    \"\"\"Projects product events to Elasticsearch for full-text search.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, es_client: AsyncElasticsearch):\n        self.es = es_client\n        self.index = \"products\"\n\n    @property\n    def name(self) -> str:\n        return \"product_search\"\n\n    def handles(self) -> List[str]:\n        return [\n            \"ProductCreated\",\n            \"ProductUpdated\",\n            \"ProductPriceChanged\",\n            \"ProductDeleted\"\n        ]\n\n    async def apply(self, event: Event) -> None:\n        if event.event_type == \"ProductCreated\":\n            await self.es.index(\n                index=self.index,\n                id=event.data[''product_id''],\n                document={\n                    ''name'': event.data[''name''],\n                    ''description'': event.data[''description''],\n                    ''category'': event.data[''category''],\n                    ''price'': event.data[''price''],\n                    ''tags'': event.data.get(''tags'', []),\n                    ''created_at'': event.data[''created_at'']\n                }\n            )\n\n        elif event.event_type == \"ProductUpdated\":\n            await self.es.update(\n                index=self.index,\n                id=event.data[''product_id''],\n                doc={\n                    ''name'': event.data[''name''],\n                    ''description'': event.data[''description''],\n                    ''category'': event.data[''category''],\n                    ''tags'': event.data.get(''tags'', []),\n                    ''updated_at'': event.data[''updated_at'']\n                }\n            )\n\n        elif event.event_type == \"ProductPriceChanged\":\n            await self.es.update(\n                index=self.index,\n                id=event.data[''product_id''],\n                doc={\n                    ''price'': event.data[''new_price''],\n                    ''price_updated_at'': event.data[''changed_at'']\n                }\n            )\n\n        elif event.event_type == \"ProductDeleted\":\n            await self.es.delete(\n                index=self.index,\n                id=event.data[''product_id'']\n            )\n```\n\n### Template 4: Aggregating Projection\n\n```python\nclass DailySalesProjection(Projection):\n    \"\"\"Aggregates sales data by day for reporting.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, db_pool: asyncpg.Pool):\n        self.pool = db_pool\n\n    @property\n    def name(self) -> str:\n        return \"daily_sales\"\n\n    def handles(self) -> List[str]:\n        return [\"OrderCompleted\", \"OrderRefunded\"]\n\n    async def apply(self, event: Event) -> None:\n        if event.event_type == \"OrderCompleted\":\n            await self._increment_sales(event)\n        elif event.event_type == \"OrderRefunded\":\n            await self._decrement_sales(event)\n\n    async def _increment_sales(self, event: Event):\n        date = event.data[''completed_at''][:10]  # YYYY-MM-DD\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                INSERT INTO daily_sales (date, total_orders, total_revenue, total_items)\n                VALUES ($1, 1, $2, $3)\n                ON CONFLICT (date) DO UPDATE SET\n                    total_orders = daily_sales.total_orders + 1,\n                    total_revenue = daily_sales.total_revenue + $2,\n                    total_items = daily_sales.total_items + $3,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                \"\"\",\n                date,\n                event.data[''total_amount''],\n                event.data[''item_count'']\n            )\n\n    async def _decrement_sales(self, event: Event):\n        date = event.data[''original_completed_at''][:10]\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            await conn.execute(\n                \"\"\"\n                UPDATE daily_sales SET\n                    total_orders = total_orders - 1,\n                    total_revenue = total_revenue - $2,\n                    total_refunds = total_refunds + $2,\n                    updated_at = NOW()\n                WHERE date = $1\n                \"\"\",\n                date,\n                event.data[''refund_amount'']\n            )\n```\n\n### Template 5: Multi-Table Projection\n\n```python\nclass CustomerActivityProjection(Projection):\n    \"\"\"Projects customer activity across multiple tables.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, db_pool: asyncpg.Pool):\n        self.pool = db_pool\n\n    @property\n    def name(self) -> str:\n        return \"customer_activity\"\n\n    def handles(self) -> List[str]:\n        return [\n            \"CustomerCreated\",\n            \"OrderCompleted\",\n            \"ReviewSubmitted\",\n            \"CustomerTierChanged\"\n        ]\n\n    async def apply(self, event: Event) -> None:\n        async with self.pool.acquire() as conn:\n            async with conn.transaction():\n                if event.event_type == \"CustomerCreated\":\n                    # Insert into customers table\n                    await conn.execute(\n                        \"\"\"\n                        INSERT INTO customers (customer_id, email, name, tier, created_at)\n                        VALUES ($1, $2, $3, ''bronze'', $4)\n                        \"\"\",\n                        event.data[''customer_id''],\n                        event.data[''email''],\n                        event.data[''name''],\n                        event.data[''created_at'']\n                    )\n                    # Initialize activity summary\n                    await conn.execute(\n                        \"\"\"\n                        INSERT INTO customer_activity_summary\n                        (customer_id, total_orders, total_spent, total_reviews)\n                        VALUES ($1, 0, 0, 0)\n                        \"\"\",\n                        event.data[''customer_id'']\n                    )\n\n                elif event.event_type == \"OrderCompleted\":\n                    # Update activity summary\n                    await conn.execute(\n                        \"\"\"\n                        UPDATE customer_activity_summary SET\n                            total_orders = total_orders + 1,\n                            total_spent = total_spent + $2,\n                            last_order_at = $3\n                        WHERE customer_id = $1\n                        \"\"\",\n                        event.data[''customer_id''],\n                        event.data[''total_amount''],\n                        event.data[''completed_at'']\n                    )\n                    # Insert into order history\n                    await conn.execute(\n                        \"\"\"\n                        INSERT INTO customer_order_history\n                        (customer_id, order_id, amount, completed_at)\n                        VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4)\n                        \"\"\",\n                        event.data[''customer_id''],\n                        event.data[''order_id''],\n                        event.data[''total_amount''],\n                        event.data[''completed_at'']\n                    )\n\n                elif event.event_type == \"ReviewSubmitted\":\n                    await conn.execute(\n                        \"\"\"\n                        UPDATE customer_activity_summary SET\n                            total_reviews = total_reviews + 1,\n                            last_review_at = $2\n                        WHERE customer_id = $1\n                        \"\"\",\n                        event.data[''customer_id''],\n                        event.data[''submitted_at'']\n                    )\n\n                elif event.event_type == \"CustomerTierChanged\":\n                    await conn.execute(\n                        \"\"\"\n                        UPDATE customers SET tier = $2, updated_at = NOW()\n                        WHERE customer_id = $1\n                        \"\"\",\n                        event.data[''customer_id''],\n                        event.data[''new_tier'']\n                    )\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Make projections idempotent** - Safe to replay\n- **Use transactions** - For multi-table updates\n- **Store checkpoints** - Resume after failures\n- **Monitor lag** - Alert on projection delays\n- **Plan for rebuilds** - Design for reconstruction\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t couple projections** - Each is independent\n- **Don''t skip error handling** - Log and alert on failures\n- **Don''t ignore ordering** - Events must be processed in order\n- **Don''t over-normalize** - Denormalize for query patterns\n\n## Resources\n\n- [CQRS Pattern](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/cqrs)\n- [Projection Building Blocks](https://zimarev.com/blog/event-sourcing/projections/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:17:50.641Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Event-Driven Agents needing advanced event-sourced system capabilities and optimized query performance.","zh":"适用于需要高级事件源系统功能和优化查询性能的事件驱动代理。","ja":"イベント駆動型エージェントが高度なイベントソーシングシステム機能と最適化されたクエリパフォーマンスを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 이벤트 소싱 시스템 기능과 최적화된 쿼리 성능이 필요한 이벤트 驅動 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Eventos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de sistemas con origen de eventos y rendimiento de consulta optimizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents à événements qui ont besoin de capacités de systèmes à source d''événements avancées et de performances de requête optimisées.","de":"Perfekt für Ereignisgesteuerte Agenten, die erweiterte Ereignisquellen-Systemfunktionen und optimierte Abfrageleistung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Orientados a Eventos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de sistemas baseados em eventos e desempenho de consulta otimizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на события, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности систем, основанных на событиях, и оптимизированное выполнение запросов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الحدث الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لنظام مصدر الحدث وأداء استعلام محسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build comprehensive projections and read models for event-sourced systems, utilizing CQRS read models, materialized views, and real-time dashboards, while optimizing query performance and aggregating data across streams.","zh":"赋予代理构建事件源系统的全面投影和读取模型的能力，利用CQRS读取模型、物化视图和实时仪表盘，同时优化查询性能和聚合数据流。","ja":"エージェントがイベントソーシングシステムの包括的な投影と読み取りモデルを構築できるようにし、CQRS読み取りモデル、物化ビュー、リアルタイムダッシュボードを利用しながら、クエリパフォーマンスを最適化し、ストリーム間でデータを集約します。","ko":"에이전트가 이벤트 소싱 시스템에 대한 포괄적인 투영과 읽기 모델을 구축 할 수있게 해주고, CQRS 읽기 모델, 물리적 보기 및 실시간 대시보드를 사용하여 쿼리 성능을 최적화하고 스트림 간에 데이터를 집계합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear proyecciones y modelos de lectura completos para sistemas con origen de eventos, utilizando modelos de lectura CQRS, vistas materializadas y paneles de control en tiempo real, al mismo tiempo que se optimiza el rendimiento de las consultas y se agregan datos a través de flujos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des projections et des modèles de lecture complets pour les systèmes à source d''événements, en utilisant des modèles de lecture CQRS, des vues matérialisées et des tableaux de bord en temps réel, tout en optimisant les performances des requêtes et en agrégeant des données à travers les flux.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Projektionen und Lese-modelle für Ereignisquellen-Systeme zu erstellen, indem CQRS-Lese-Modelle, materialisierte Ansichten und Echtzeit-Dashboards verwendet werden, während die Abfrageleistung optimiert und Daten über Streams hinweg aggregiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir projetos abrangentes e modelos de leitura para sistemas baseados em eventos, utilizando modelos de leitura CQRS, vistas materializadas e painéis em tempo real, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza o desempenho de consulta e agrega dados em toda a transmissão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полные проекции и модели чтения для систем, основанных на событиях, используя модели чтения CQRS, материализованные представления и панели в реальном времени, оптимизируя при этом производительность запросов и агрегируя данные по потокам.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء مشاريع شاملة ونماذج للقراءة لأنظمة مصدر الحدث، باستخدام نماذج القراءة CQRS والمناظير الماديّة واللوحات في الوقت الفعلي، مع تحسين أداء الاستعلام وتجميع البيانات عبر التيارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building CQRS read models for event-sourced systems","Creating materialized views from events for optimized query performance","Implementing real-time dashboards for event-driven data visualization","Aggregating data across streams for advanced analytics","Building search indexes from events for efficient data retrieval"],"zh":["为事件源系统构建CQRS读取模型","从事件中创建物化视图以优化查询性能","实现实时仪表盘以进行事件驱动的数据可视化","聚合数据流以进行高级分析","从事件中构建搜索索引以实现高效的数据检索"],"ja":["イベントソーシングシステムのCQRS読み取りモデルを構築する","クエリパフォーマンスを最適化するためにイベントから物化ビューを作成する","イベント駆動型データ可視化のためのリアルタイムダッシュボードを実装する","ストリーム間でデータを集約して高度な分析を実行する","イベントから検索インデックスを作成して効率的なデータ検索を実現する"],"ko":["이벤트 소싱 시스템에 대한 CQRS 읽기 모델을 구축","쿼리 성능을 최적화하기 위해 이벤트에서 물리적 보기를 생성","이벤트 주도형 데이터 시각화를 위한 실시간 대시보드를 구현","스트림 간에 데이터를 집계하여 고급 분석을 수행","이벤트에서 검색 인덱스를 생성하여 효율적인 데이터 검색을 실현"],"es":["Crear modelos de lectura CQRS para sistemas con origen de eventos","Crear vistas materializadas a partir de eventos para un rendimiento de consulta optimizado","Implementar paneles de control en tiempo real para la visualización de datos basada en eventos","Agregar datos a través de flujos para análisis avanzados","Crear índices de búsqueda a partir de eventos para una recuperación de datos eficiente"],"fr":["Créer des modèles de lecture CQRS pour les systèmes à source d''événements","Créer des vues matérialisées à partir d''événements pour des performances de requête optimisées","Mettre en œuvre des tableaux de bord en temps réel pour la visualisation de données basée sur les événements","Agréger des données à travers les flux pour une analyse avancée","Créer des index de recherche à partir d''événements pour une récupération de données efficace"],"de":["Erstellen von CQRS-Lese-Modellen für Ereignisquellen-Systeme","Erstellen von materialisierten Ansichten aus Ereignissen für optimierte Abfrageleistung","Implementieren von Echtzeit-Dashboards für die Ereignisgesteuerte Datenvisualisierung","Aggregieren von Daten über Streams hinweg für erweiterte Analysen","Erstellen von Suchindizes aus Ereignissen für effizientes Datenabruf"],"pt":["Construir modelos de leitura CQRS para sistemas baseados em eventos","Criar vistas materializadas a partir de eventos para desempenho de consulta otimizado","Implementar painéis em tempo real para visualização de dados orientada a eventos","Agregar dados em toda a transmissão para análise avançada","Construir índices de pesquisa a partir de eventos para recuperação eficiente de dados"],"ru":["Построение моделей чтения CQRS для систем, основанных на событиях","Создание материализованных представлений из событий для оптимизированного выполнения запросов","Реализация панелей в реальном времени для визуализации данных, ориентированной на события","Агрегация данных по потокам для продвинутого анализа","Построение индексов поиска из событий для эффективного извлечения данных"],"ar":["بناء نماذج القراءة CQRS لأنظمة مصدر الحدث","إنشاء مناظير ماديّة من الأحداث لأداء استعلام محسّن","تنفيذ لوحات في الوقت الفعلي لتصوير بيانات الحدث","تجميع البيانات عبر التيارات لتجزئة متقدمة","بناء فهرس البحث من الأحداث لاسترجاع بيانات فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of event-sourced systems and CQRS architecture","Limited to event-driven systems and may not be applicable to other system architectures"],"zh":["需要理解事件源系统和CQRS架构","仅适用于事件驱动系统，可能不适用于其他系统架构"],"ja":["イベントソーシングシステムとCQRSアーキテクチャを理解する必要がある","イベント駆動型システムに限られ、他のシステムアーキテクチャには適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["이벤트 소싱 시스템과 CQRS 아키텍처를 이해해야 함","이벤트 주도형 시스템에만 국한되며 다른 시스템 아키텍처에는 적용할 수 없을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los sistemas con origen de eventos y la arquitectura CQRS","Limitado a sistemas basados en eventos y puede no ser aplicable a otras arquitecturas de sistemas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des systèmes à source d''événements et de l''architecture CQRS","Limité aux systèmes à événements et peut ne pas être applicable à d''autres architectures de systèmes"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von Ereignisquellen-Systemen und der CQRS-Architektur","Begrenzt auf ereignisgesteuerte Systeme und kann möglicherweise nicht auf andere Systemarchitekturen anwendbar sein"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de sistemas baseados em eventos e arquitetura CQRS","Limitado a sistemas orientados a eventos e pode não ser aplicável a outras arquiteturas de sistema"],"ru":["Требует понимания систем, основанных на событиях, и архитектуры CQRS","Ограничен для систем, ориентированных на события, и может быть не применим к другим архитектурам системы"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لأنظمة مصدر الحدث وهندسة CQRS","محدود لأنظمة الحدث وقد لا يكون قابلاً للتطبيق على هياكل نظام أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/gdpr-data-handling', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'gdpr-data-handling', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:18:05.691Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/gdpr-data-handling","name":"gdpr-data-handling","description":{"zh":"GDPR数据处理实践指南，涵盖个人数据分类、同意管理和隐私控制等方面","ja":"GDPRデータ処理の実践ガイド、個人データのカテゴリ化、同意管理、プライバシーコントロールなど","ko":"GDPR 데이터 처리에 대한 실용적인 가이드, 개인 데이터 분류, 동의 관리 및 개인 정보 보호 등을 다룹니다","es":"Guía para el procesamiento de datos personales de la UE con cumplimiento del GDPR. Incluye gestión de consentimiento y controles de privacidad.","fr":"Guide pour le traitement des données personnelles de l''UE avec conformité au RGPD. Inclut la gestion du consentement et les contrôles de confidentialité.","de":"Anleitung für die Verarbeitung personenbezogener Daten der EU mit GDPR-Konformität. Enthält Consent-Management und Datenschutzkontrollen.","pt":"Guia prático de implementação para processamento de dados em conformidade com GDPR, gerenciamento de consentimento e controles de privacidade. Inclui categorias de dados pessoais e procedimentos para solicitações de titulares.","ru":"Практическое руководство по реализации обработки данных в соответствии с GDPR, управлению согласием и настройке приватности. Включает категории персональных данных и процедуры обработки запросов субъектов.","ar":"دليل عملي لتنفيذ معالجة البيانات المتوافقة مع GDPR، إدارة الموافقة وضوابط الخصوصية. يتضمن فئات البيانات الشخصية وإجراءات معالجة طلبات الأفراد.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GDPR数据处理指南","ja":"GDPRデータ処理の実践ガイド","ko":"GDPR 데이터 처리 가이드","es":"Procesamiento de datos GDPR","fr":"Traitement de données RGPD","de":"GDPR-Datenverarbeitung","pt":"Implementação Prática de GDPR: Guia para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Практическое руководство по GDPR для разработчиков","ar":"دليل عملي لتطبيق GDPR للمطورين","en":"gdpr-data-handling"},"description":{"zh":"GDPR数据处理实践指南，涵盖个人数据分类、同意管理和隐私控制等方面","ja":"GDPRデータ処理の実践ガイド、個人データのカテゴリ化、同意管理、プライバシーコントロールなど","ko":"GDPR 데이터 처리에 대한 실용적인 가이드, 개인 데이터 분류, 동의 관리 및 개인 정보 보호 등을 다룹니다","es":"Guía para el procesamiento de datos personales de la UE con cumplimiento del GDPR. Incluye gestión de consentimiento y controles de privacidad.","fr":"Guide pour le traitement des données personnelles de l''UE avec conformité au RGPD. Inclut la gestion du consentement et les contrôles de confidentialité.","de":"Anleitung für die Verarbeitung personenbezogener Daten der EU mit GDPR-Konformität. Enthält Consent-Management und Datenschutzkontrollen.","pt":"Guia prático de implementação para processamento de dados em conformidade com GDPR, gerenciamento de consentimento e controles de privacidade. Inclui categor...","ru":"Практическое руководство по реализации обработки данных в соответствии с GDPR, управлению согласием и настройке приватности. Включает категории персональных ...","ar":"دليل عملي لتنفيذ معالجة البيانات المتوافقة مع GDPR، إدارة الموافقة وضوابط الخصوصية. يتضمن فئات البيانات الشخصية وإجراءات معالجة طلبات الأفراد.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["个人数据分类","同意管理","隐私控制","数据主体请求处理","GDPR合规审查","隐私优先架构设计"],"ja":["個人データのカテゴリ化","同意管理","プライバシーコントロール","データ主体の要求処理","GDPR合規レビュー","プライバシーファーストアーキテクチャ設計"],"ko":["개인 데이터 분류","동의 관리","개인 정보 보호","데이터 주체 요청 처리","GDPR 규정 준수 검토","개인 정보 우선 아키텍처 설계"],"es":["Procesamiento de datos personales","Gestión de consentimiento","Controles de privacidad","Revisión de cumplimiento del GDPR","Diseño de arquitecturas de privacidad"],"fr":["Traitement de données personnelles","Gestion du consentement","Contrôles de confidentialité","Révision de conformité au RGPD","Conception d''architectures de confidentialité"],"de":["Verarbeitung personenbezogener Daten","Consent-Management","Datenschutzkontrollen","Überprüfung der GDPR-Konformität","Entwurf von Datenschutzarchitekturen"],"pt":["Categorização de dados pessoais conforme GDPR","Implementação de mecanismos de consentimento","Processamento de solicitações de titulares de dados (DSRs)","Revisões de conformidade GDPR","Arquiteturas privacy-by-design","Modelos para acordos de processamento de dados"],"ru":["Классификация персональных данных согласно GDPR","Реализация механизмов получения согласия","Обработка запросов субъектов данных (DSRs)","Проверки соответствия требованиям GDPR","Архитектура с privacy-by-design","Шаблоны соглашений о обработке данных"],"ar":["تصنيف البيانات الشخصية وفقًا لـ GDPR","تنفيذ آليات الحصول على الموافقة","معالجة طلبات الأفراد (DSRs)","مراجعات الامتثال لـ GDPR","هندسة الأنظمة بخصوصية مدمجة","نماذج لاتفاقيات معالجة البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GDPR","数据处理","个人数据保护","同意管理","隐私控制","数据主体请求","GDPR合规"],"ja":["GDPR","データ処理","個人データ保護","同意管理","プライバシーコントロール","データ主体の要求","GDPR合規"],"ko":["GDPR","데이터 처리","개인 정보 보호","동의 관리","개인 정보 보호","데이터 주체 요청","GDPR 규정 준수"],"es":["GDPR","procesamiento de datos personales","gestión de consentimiento","controles de privacidad","cumplimiento del GDPR","arquitecturas de privacidad"],"fr":["RGPD","traitement de données personnelles","gestion du consentement","contrôles de confidentialité","conformité au RGPD","architectures de confidentialité"],"de":["GDPR","Verarbeitung personenbezogener Daten","Consent-Management","Datenschutzkontrollen","GDPR-Konformität","Datenschutzarchitekturen"],"pt":["gdpr implementação técnica","consentimento dados UE","solicitações titulares dados","conformidade GDPR desenvolvedores","processamento dados pessoais","privacidade by design","acordo processamento dados","proteção dados Europa"],"ru":["техническая реализация GDPR","согласие на обработку данных ЕС","запросы субъектов данных","соответствие GDPR для разработчиков","обработка персональных данных","приватность по умолчанию","соглашение об обработке данных","защита данных Европа"],"ar":["تنفيذ تقني لـ GDPR","موافقة معالجة بيانات الاتحاد الأوروبي","طلبات الأفراد","امتثال GDPR للمطورين","معالجة البيانات الشخصية","خصوصية مدمجة في التصميم","اتفاقية معالجة البيانات","حماية البيانات أوروبا"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gdpr-data-handling","description":"Implement GDPR-compliant data handling with consent management, data subject rights, and privacy by design. Use when building systems that process EU personal data, implementing privacy controls, or conducting GDPR compliance reviews.","bodyPreview":"# GDPR Data Handling\n\nPractical implementation guide for GDPR-compliant data processing, consent management, and privacy controls.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building systems that process EU personal data\n- Implementing consent management\n- Handling data subject requests (DSRs)\n- Conducting GDPR compliance reviews\n- Designing privacy-first architectures\n- Creating data processing agreements\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Personal Data Categories\n\n| Category               | Examples","body":"# GDPR Data Handling\n\nPractical implementation guide for GDPR-compliant data processing, consent management, and privacy controls.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building systems that process EU personal data\n- Implementing consent management\n- Handling data subject requests (DSRs)\n- Conducting GDPR compliance reviews\n- Designing privacy-first architectures\n- Creating data processing agreements\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Personal Data Categories\n\n| Category               | Examples                    | Protection Level   |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **Basic**              | Name, email, phone          | Standard           |\n| **Sensitive (Art. 9)** | Health, religion, ethnicity | Explicit consent   |\n| **Criminal (Art. 10)** | Convictions, offenses       | Official authority |\n| **Children''s**         | Under 16 data               | Parental consent   |\n\n### 2. Legal Bases for Processing\n\n```\nArticle 6 - Lawful Bases:\n├── Consent: Freely given, specific, informed\n├── Contract: Necessary for contract performance\n├── Legal Obligation: Required by law\n├── Vital Interests: Protecting someone''s life\n├── Public Interest: Official functions\n└── Legitimate Interest: Balanced against rights\n```\n\n### 3. Data Subject Rights\n\n```\nRight to Access (Art. 15)      ─┐\nRight to Rectification (Art. 16) │\nRight to Erasure (Art. 17)       │ Must respond\nRight to Restrict (Art. 18)      │ within 1 month\nRight to Portability (Art. 20)   │\nRight to Object (Art. 21)       ─┘\n```\n\n## Implementation Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Consent Management\n\n```javascript\n// Consent data model\nconst consentSchema = {\n  userId: String,\n  consents: [\n    {\n      purpose: String, // ''marketing'', ''analytics'', etc.\n      granted: Boolean,\n      timestamp: Date,\n      source: String, // ''web_form'', ''api'', etc.\n      version: String, // Privacy policy version\n      ipAddress: String, // For proof\n      userAgent: String, // For proof\n    },\n  ],\n  auditLog: [\n    {\n      action: String, // ''granted'', ''withdrawn'', ''updated''\n      purpose: String,\n      timestamp: Date,\n      source: String,\n    },\n  ],\n};\n\n// Consent service\nclass ConsentManager {\n  async recordConsent(userId, purpose, granted, metadata) {\n    const consent = {\n      purpose,\n      granted,\n      timestamp: new Date(),\n      source: metadata.source,\n      version: await this.getCurrentPolicyVersion(),\n      ipAddress: metadata.ipAddress,\n      userAgent: metadata.userAgent,\n    };\n\n    // Store consent\n    await this.db.consents.updateOne(\n      { userId },\n      {\n        $push: {\n          consents: consent,\n          auditLog: {\n            action: granted ? \"granted\" : \"withdrawn\",\n            purpose,\n            timestamp: consent.timestamp,\n            source: metadata.source,\n          },\n        },\n      },\n      { upsert: true },\n    );\n\n    // Emit event for downstream systems\n    await this.eventBus.emit(\"consent.changed\", {\n      userId,\n      purpose,\n      granted,\n      timestamp: consent.timestamp,\n    });\n  }\n\n  async hasConsent(userId, purpose) {\n    const record = await this.db.consents.findOne({ userId });\n    if (!record) return false;\n\n    const latestConsent = record.consents\n      .filter((c) => c.purpose === purpose)\n      .sort((a, b) => b.timestamp - a.timestamp)[0];\n\n    return latestConsent?.granted === true;\n  }\n\n  async getConsentHistory(userId) {\n    const record = await this.db.consents.findOne({ userId });\n    return record?.auditLog || [];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```html\n<!-- GDPR-compliant consent UI -->\n<div class=\"consent-banner\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"consent-title\">\n  <h2 id=\"consent-title\">Cookie Preferences</h2>\n\n  <p>\n    We use cookies to improve your experience. Select your preferences below.\n  </p>\n\n  <form id=\"consent-form\">\n    <!-- Necessary - always on, no consent needed -->\n    <div class=\"consent-category\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"necessary\" checked disabled />\n      <label for=\"necessary\">\n        <strong>Necessary</strong>\n        <span>Required for the website to function. Cannot be disabled.</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Analytics - requires consent -->\n    <div class=\"consent-category\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"analytics\" name=\"analytics\" />\n      <label for=\"analytics\">\n        <strong>Analytics</strong>\n        <span>Help us understand how you use our site.</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Marketing - requires consent -->\n    <div class=\"consent-category\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"marketing\" name=\"marketing\" />\n      <label for=\"marketing\">\n        <strong>Marketing</strong>\n        <span>Personalized ads based on your interests.</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"consent-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"accept-all\">Accept All</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"reject-all\">Reject All</button>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Save Preferences</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"consent-links\">\n      <a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a> |\n      <a href=\"/cookie-policy\">Cookie Policy</a>\n    </p>\n  </form>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Data Subject Access Request (DSAR)\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom typing import Dict, List, Optional\nimport json\n\nclass DSARHandler:\n    \"\"\"Handle Data Subject Access Requests.\"\"\"\n\n    RESPONSE_DEADLINE_DAYS = 30\n    EXTENSION_ALLOWED_DAYS = 60  # For complex requests\n\n    def __init__(self, data_sources: List[''DataSource'']):\n        self.data_sources = data_sources\n\n    async def submit_request(\n        self,\n        request_type: str,  # ''access'', ''erasure'', ''rectification'', ''portability''\n        user_id: str,\n        verified: bool,\n        details: Optional[Dict] = None\n    ) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Submit a new DSAR.\"\"\"\n        request = {\n            ''id'': self.generate_request_id(),\n            ''type'': request_type,\n            ''user_id'': user_id,\n            ''status'': ''pending_verification'' if not verified else ''processing'',\n            ''submitted_at'': datetime.utcnow(),\n            ''deadline'': datetime.utcnow() + timedelta(days=self.RESPONSE_DEADLINE_DAYS),\n            ''details'': details or {},\n            ''audit_log'': [{\n                ''action'': ''submitted'',\n                ''timestamp'': datetime.utcnow(),\n                ''details'': ''Request received''\n            }]\n        }\n\n        await self.db.dsar_requests.insert_one(request)\n        await self.notify_dpo(request)\n\n        return request[''id'']\n\n    async def process_access_request(self, request_id: str) -> Dict:\n        \"\"\"Process a data access request.\"\"\"\n        request = await self.get_request(request_id)\n\n        if request[''type''] != ''access'':\n            raise ValueError(\"Not an access request\")\n\n        # Collect data from all sources\n        user_data = {}\n        for source in self.data_sources:\n            try:\n                data = await source.get_user_data(request[''user_id''])\n                user_data[source.name] = data\n            except Exception as e:\n                user_data[source.name] = {''error'': str(e)}\n\n        # Format response\n        response = {\n            ''request_id'': request_id,\n            ''generated_at'': datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),\n            ''data_categories'': list(user_data.keys()),\n            ''data'': user_data,\n            ''retention_info'': await self.get_retention_info(),\n            ''processing_purposes'': await self.get_processing_purposes(),\n            ''third_party_recipients'': await self.get_recipients()\n        }\n\n        # Update request status\n        await self.update_request(request_id, ''completed'', response)\n\n        return response\n\n    async def process_erasure_request(self, request_id: str) -> Dict:\n        \"\"\"Process a right to erasure request.\"\"\"\n        request = await self.get_request(request_id)\n\n        if request[''type''] != ''erasure'':\n            raise ValueError(\"Not an erasure request\")\n\n        results = {}\n        exceptions = []\n\n        for source in self.data_sources:\n            try:\n                # Check for legal exceptions\n                can_delete, reason = await source.can_delete(request[''user_id''])\n\n                if can_delete:\n                    await source.delete_user_data(request[''user_id''])\n                    results[source.name] = ''deleted''\n                else:\n                    exceptions.append({\n                        ''source'': source.name,\n                        ''reason'': reason  # e.g., ''legal retention requirement''\n                    })\n                    results[source.name] = f''retained: {reason}''\n            except Exception as e:\n                results[source.name] = f''error: {str(e)}''\n\n        response = {\n            ''request_id'': request_id,\n            ''completed_at'': datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),\n            ''results'': results,\n            ''exceptions'': exceptions\n        }\n\n        await self.update_request(request_id, ''completed'', response)\n\n        return response\n\n    async def process_portability_request(self, request_id: str) -> bytes:\n        \"\"\"Generate portable data export.\"\"\"\n        request = await self.get_request(request_id)\n        user_data = await self.process_access_request(request_id)\n\n        # Convert to machine-readable format (JSON)\n        portable_data = {\n            ''export_date'': datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),\n            ''format_version'': ''1.0'',\n            ''data'': user_data[''data'']\n        }\n\n        return json.dumps(portable_data, indent=2, default=str).encode()\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Data Retention\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass RetentionBasis(Enum):\n    CONSENT = \"consent\"\n    CONTRACT = \"contract\"\n    LEGAL_OBLIGATION = \"legal_obligation\"\n    LEGITIMATE_INTEREST = \"legitimate_interest\"\n\nclass DataRetentionPolicy:\n    \"\"\"Define and enforce data retention policies.\"\"\"\n\n    POLICIES = {\n        ''user_account'': {\n            ''retention_period_days'': 365 * 3,  # 3 years after last activity\n            ''basis'': RetentionBasis.CONTRACT,\n            ''trigger'': ''last_activity_date'',\n            ''archive_before_delete'': True\n        },\n        ''transaction_records'': {\n            ''retention_period_days'': 365 * 7,  # 7 years for tax\n            ''basis'': RetentionBasis.LEGAL_OBLIGATION,\n            ''trigger'': ''transaction_date'',\n            ''archive_before_delete'': True,\n            ''legal_reference'': ''Tax regulations require 7 year retention''\n        },\n        ''marketing_consent'': {\n            ''retention_period_days'': 365 * 2,  # 2 years\n            ''basis'': RetentionBasis.CONSENT,\n            ''trigger'': ''consent_date'',\n            ''archive_before_delete'': False\n        },\n        ''support_tickets'': {\n            ''retention_period_days'': 365 * 2,\n            ''basis'': RetentionBasis.LEGITIMATE_INTEREST,\n            ''trigger'': ''ticket_closed_date'',\n            ''archive_before_delete'': True\n        },\n        ''analytics_data'': {\n            ''retention_period_days'': 365,  # 1 year\n            ''basis'': RetentionBasis.CONSENT,\n            ''trigger'': ''collection_date'',\n            ''archive_before_delete'': False,\n            ''anonymize_instead'': True\n        }\n    }\n\n    async def apply_retention_policies(self):\n        \"\"\"Run retention policy enforcement.\"\"\"\n        for data_type, policy in self.POLICIES.items():\n            cutoff_date = datetime.utcnow() - timedelta(\n                days=policy[''retention_period_days'']\n            )\n\n            if policy.get(''anonymize_instead''):\n                await self.anonymize_old_data(data_type, cutoff_date)\n            else:\n                if policy.get(''archive_before_delete''):\n                    await self.archive_data(data_type, cutoff_date)\n                await self.delete_old_data(data_type, cutoff_date)\n\n            await self.log_retention_action(data_type, cutoff_date)\n\n    async def anonymize_old_data(self, data_type: str, before_date: datetime):\n        \"\"\"Anonymize data instead of deleting.\"\"\"\n        # Example: Replace identifying fields with hashes\n        if data_type == ''analytics_data'':\n            await self.db.analytics.update_many(\n                {''collection_date'': {''$lt'': before_date}},\n                {''$set'': {\n                    ''user_id'': None,\n                    ''ip_address'': None,\n                    ''device_id'': None,\n                    ''anonymized'': True,\n                    ''anonymized_date'': datetime.utcnow()\n                }}\n            )\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Privacy by Design\n\n```python\nclass PrivacyFirstDataModel:\n    \"\"\"Example of privacy-by-design data model.\"\"\"\n\n    # Separate PII from behavioral data\n    user_profile_schema = {\n        ''user_id'': str,  # UUID, not sequential\n        ''email_hash'': str,  # Hashed for lookups\n        ''created_at'': datetime,\n        # Minimal data collection\n        ''preferences'': {\n            ''language'': str,\n            ''timezone'': str\n        }\n    }\n\n    # Encrypted at rest\n    user_pii_schema = {\n        ''user_id'': str,\n        ''email'': str,  # Encrypted\n        ''name'': str,   # Encrypted\n        ''phone'': str,  # Encrypted (optional)\n        ''address'': dict,  # Encrypted (optional)\n        ''encryption_key_id'': str\n    }\n\n    # Pseudonymized behavioral data\n    analytics_schema = {\n        ''session_id'': str,  # Not linked to user_id\n        ''pseudonym_id'': str,  # Rotating pseudonym\n        ''events'': list,\n        ''device_category'': str,  # Generalized, not specific\n        ''country'': str,  # Not city-level\n    }\n\nclass DataMinimization:\n    \"\"\"Implement data minimization principles.\"\"\"\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def collect_only_needed(form_data: dict, purpose: str) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"Filter form data to only fields needed for purpose.\"\"\"\n        REQUIRED_FIELDS = {\n            ''account_creation'': [''email'', ''password''],\n            ''newsletter'': [''email''],\n            ''purchase'': [''email'', ''name'', ''address'', ''payment''],\n            ''support'': [''email'', ''message'']\n        }\n\n        allowed = REQUIRED_FIELDS.get(purpose, [])\n        return {k: v for k, v in form_data.items() if k in allowed}\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def generalize_location(ip_address: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Generalize IP to country level only.\"\"\"\n        import geoip2.database\n        reader = geoip2.database.Reader(''GeoLite2-Country.mmdb'')\n        try:\n            response = reader.country(ip_address)\n            return response.country.iso_code\n        except:\n            return ''UNKNOWN''\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Breach Notification\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass BreachSeverity(Enum):\n    LOW = \"low\"\n    MEDIUM = \"medium\"\n    HIGH = \"high\"\n    CRITICAL = \"critical\"\n\nclass BreachNotificationHandler:\n    \"\"\"Handle GDPR breach notification requirements.\"\"\"\n\n    AUTHORITY_NOTIFICATION_HOURS = 72\n    AFFECTED_NOTIFICATION_REQUIRED_SEVERITY = BreachSeverity.HIGH\n\n    async def report_breach(\n        self,\n        description: str,\n        data_types: List[str],\n        affected_count: int,\n        severity: BreachSeverity\n    ) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"Report and handle a data breach.\"\"\"\n        breach = {\n            ''id'': self.generate_breach_id(),\n            ''reported_at'': datetime.utcnow(),\n            ''description'': description,\n            ''data_types_affected'': data_types,\n            ''affected_individuals_count'': affected_count,\n            ''severity'': severity.value,\n            ''status'': ''investigating'',\n            ''timeline'': [{\n                ''event'': ''breach_reported'',\n                ''timestamp'': datetime.utcnow(),\n                ''details'': description\n            }]\n        }\n\n        await self.db.breaches.insert_one(breach)\n\n        # Immediate notifications\n        await self.notify_dpo(breach)\n        await self.notify_security_team(breach)\n\n        # Authority notification required within 72 hours\n        if self.requires_authority_notification(severity, data_types):\n            breach[''authority_notification_deadline''] = (\n                datetime.utcnow() + timedelta(hours=self.AUTHORITY_NOTIFICATION_HOURS)\n            )\n            await self.schedule_authority_notification(breach)\n\n        # Affected individuals notification\n        if severity.value in [BreachSeverity.HIGH.value, BreachSeverity.CRITICAL.value]:\n            await self.schedule_individual_notifications(breach)\n\n        return breach\n\n    def requires_authority_notification(\n        self,\n        severity: BreachSeverity,\n        data_types: List[str]\n    ) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determine if supervisory authority must be notified.\"\"\"\n        # Always notify for sensitive data\n        sensitive_types = [''health'', ''financial'', ''credentials'', ''biometric'']\n        if any(t in sensitive_types for t in data_types):\n            return True\n\n        # Notify for medium+ severity\n        return severity in [BreachSeverity.MEDIUM, BreachSeverity.HIGH, BreachSeverity.CRITICAL]\n\n    async def generate_authority_report(self, breach_id: str) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"Generate report for supervisory authority.\"\"\"\n        breach = await self.get_breach(breach_id)\n\n        return {\n            ''organization'': {\n                ''name'': self.config.org_name,\n                ''contact'': self.config.dpo_contact,\n                ''registration'': self.config.registration_number\n            },\n            ''breach'': {\n                ''nature'': breach[''description''],\n                ''categories_affected'': breach[''data_types_affected''],\n                ''approximate_number_affected'': breach[''affected_individuals_count''],\n                ''likely_consequences'': self.assess_consequences(breach),\n                ''measures_taken'': await self.get_remediation_measures(breach_id),\n                ''measures_proposed'': await self.get_proposed_measures(breach_id)\n            },\n            ''timeline'': breach[''timeline''],\n            ''submitted_at'': datetime.utcnow().isoformat()\n        }\n```\n\n## Compliance Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## GDPR Implementation Checklist\n\n### Legal Basis\n\n- [ ] Documented legal basis for each processing activity\n- [ ] Consent mechanisms meet GDPR requirements\n- [ ] Legitimate interest assessments completed\n\n### Transparency\n\n- [ ] Privacy policy is clear and accessible\n- [ ] Processing purposes clearly stated\n- [ ] Data retention periods documented\n\n### Data Subject Rights\n\n- [ ] Access request process implemented\n- [ ] Erasure request process implemented\n- [ ] Portability export available\n- [ ] Rectification process available\n- [ ] Response within 30-day deadline\n\n### Security\n\n- [ ] Encryption at rest implemented\n- [ ] Encryption in transit (TLS)\n- [ ] Access controls in place\n- [ ] Audit logging enabled\n\n### Breach Response\n\n- [ ] Breach detection mechanisms\n- [ ] 72-hour notification process\n- [ ] Breach documentation system\n\n### Documentation\n\n- [ ] Records of processing activities (Art. 30)\n- [ ] Data protection impact assessments\n- [ ] Data processing agreements with vendors\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Minimize data collection** - Only collect what''s needed\n- **Document everything** - Processing activities, legal bases\n- **Encrypt PII** - At rest and in transit\n- **Implement access controls** - Need-to-know basis\n- **Regular audits** - Verify compliance continuously\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t pre-check consent boxes** - Must be opt-in\n- **Don''t bundle consent** - Separate purposes separately\n- **Don''t retain indefinitely** - Define and enforce retention\n- **Don''t ignore DSARs** - 30-day response required\n- **Don''t transfer without safeguards** - SCCs or adequacy decisions\n\n## Resources\n\n- [GDPR Full Text](https://gdpr-info.eu/)\n- [ICO Guidance](https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/guide-to-data-protection/guide-to-the-general-data-protection-regulation-gdpr/)\n- [EDPB Guidelines](https://edpb.europa.eu/our-work-tools/general-guidance/gdpr-guidelines-recommendations-best-practices_en)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:18:05.691Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Compliance Agents needing advanced GDPR data handling and consent management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级GDPR数据处理和同意管理能力的合规代理。","ja":"GDPRデータ処理および同意管理の高度な機能を必要とするコンプライアンスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GDPR 데이터 처리 및 동의 관리 기능이 필요한 컴플라이언스 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de cumplimiento que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de manejo de datos y gestión de consentimiento del RGPD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conformité ayant besoin de capacités avancées de traitement de données et de gestion de consentement du RGPD.","de":"Perfekt für Compliance-Agenten, die erweiterte GDPR-Datenverarbeitungs- und Zustimmungsmanagementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conformidade que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de manipulação de dados e gestão de consentimento do GDPR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по соблюдению требований, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности обработки данных GDPR и управления согласием.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الامتثال التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمعالجة بيانات GDPR وإدارة الموافقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement GDPR-compliant data processing, manage consent, and handle data subject requests (DSRs) using privacy-first architectures and data processing agreements, ensuring compliance with EU personal data regulations.","zh":"赋予代理实施GDPR合规数据处理、管理同意、使用隐私优先架构和数据处理协议处理数据主体请求（DSRs），确保遵守EU个人数据法规。","ja":"GDPRに準拠したデータ処理の実施、同意の管理、プライバシーファーストのアーキテクチャとデータ処理契約を使用したデータ主体要求（DSRs）の処理をエージェントに可能にし、EUの個人データ規制への遵守を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 GDPR 규정에 맞는 데이터 처리를 구현하고 동의를 관리하며 개인 정보 우선 아키텍처 및 데이터 처리 계약을 사용하여 데이터 주체 요청(DSR)을 처리하여 EU 개인 데이터 규정의 준수를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar un procesamiento de datos conforme al RGPD, gestionar el consentimiento y manejar las solicitudes de los sujetos de datos (DSR) utilizando arquitecturas de privacidad y acuerdos de procesamiento de datos, garantizando el cumplimiento de las regulaciones de protección de datos personales de la UE.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre un traitement de données conforme au RGPD, de gérer le consentement et de gérer les demandes des sujets de données (DSR) en utilisant des architectures de confidentialité et des accords de traitement de données, garantissant ainsi le respect des réglementations sur la protection des données personnelles de l''UE.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die GDPR-konforme Datenverarbeitung umzusetzen, Zustimmungen zu verwalten und Anfragen von Datenschutzberechtigten (DSR) mithilfe von datenschutzorientierten Architekturen und Datenverarbeitungsvereinbarungen zu bearbeiten, um die Einhaltung der EU-Datenschutzvorschriften zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar processamento de dados compatível com o GDPR, gerenciar consentimento e lidar com solicitações de sujeitos de dados (DSRs) usando arquiteturas de privacidade em primeiro lugar e acordos de processamento de dados, garantindo conformidade com as regulamentações de dados pessoais da UE.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать обработку данных в соответствии с GDPR, управлять согласием и обрабатывать запросы субъектов данных (DSRs) с использованием архитектур, ориентированных на приватность, и соглашений об обработке данных, обеспечивая соблюдение правил ЕС по защите персональных данных.","ar":"تمكين العميل من تنفيذ معالجة البيانات المتوافقة مع لوائح GDPR وإدارة الموافقة ومعالجة طلبات موضوعات البيانات (DSRs) باستخدام architekt私隐优先 و اتفاقيات معالجة البيانات ، مما يضمن الامتثال للوائح الأوروبية حول البيانات الشخصية."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing consent management for EU personal data","Handling data subject requests (DSRs) and conducting GDPR compliance reviews","Designing privacy-first architectures for data processing systems","Creating data processing agreements for GDPR compliance"],"zh":["为EU个人数据实施同意管理","处理数据主体请求（DSRs）并进行GDPR合规审查","为数据处理系统设计隐私优先架构","为GDPR合规创建数据处理协议"],"ja":["EU個人データの同意管理の実施","データ主体要求（DSRs）の処理とGDPRコンプライアンスレビューの実施","データ処理システムのプライバシーファーストアーキテクチャの設計","GDPRコンプライアンスのためのデータ処理契約の作成"],"ko":["EU 개인 데이터에 대한 동의 관리 구현","데이터 주체 요청(DSR) 처리 및 GDPR 규정 준수 검토","데이터 처리 시스템을 위한 개인 정보 우선 아키텍처 설계","GDPR 규정 준수를 위한 데이터 처리 계약 생성"],"es":["Implementar la gestión de consentimiento para los datos personales de la UE","Manejar las solicitudes de los sujetos de datos (DSR) y realizar revisiones de cumplimiento del RGPD","Diseñar arquitecturas de privacidad para sistemas de procesamiento de datos","Crear acuerdos de procesamiento de datos para el cumplimiento del RGPD"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la gestion du consentement pour les données personnelles de l''UE","Gérer les demandes des sujets de données (DSR) et effectuer des examens de conformité au RGPD","Concevoir des architectures de confidentialité pour les systèmes de traitement de données","Créer des accords de traitement de données pour la conformité au RGPD"],"de":["Implementierung der Zustimmungsverwaltung für EU-Personaldaten","Bearbeitung von Anfragen von Datenschutzberechtigten (DSR) und Durchführung von GDPR-Konformitätsprüfungen","Entwurf von datenschutzorientierten Architekturen für Datenverarbeitungssysteme","Erstellung von Datenverarbeitungsvereinbarungen für die GDPR-Konformität"],"pt":["Implementar gestão de consentimento para dados pessoais da UE","Lidar com solicitações de sujeitos de dados (DSRs) e realizar revisões de conformidade com o GDPR","Projetar arquiteturas de privacidade em primeiro lugar para sistemas de processamento de dados","Criar acordos de processamento de dados para conformidade com o GDPR"],"ru":["Реализовать управление согласием для персональных данных ЕС","Обрабатывать запросы субъектов данных (DSRs) и проводить обзоры соответствия требованиям GDPR","Проектировать архитектуры, ориентированные на приватность, для систем обработки данных","Создавать соглашения об обработке данных для соответствия требованиям GDPR"],"ar":["تنفيذ إدارة الموافقة للبيانات الشخصية في الاتحاد الأوروبي","معالجة طلبات موضوعات البيانات (DSRs) وإجراء استعراضات الامتثال للوائح GDPR","تصميم architekt 私隐优先 لنظم معالجة البيانات","إنشاء اتفاقيات معالجة البيانات للامتثال للوائح GDPR"]},"limitations":{"en":["Applies only to systems processing EU personal data","Requires knowledge of GDPR regulations and compliance standards"],"zh":["仅适用于处理EU个人数据的系统","需要GDPR法规和合规标准的知识"],"ja":["EU個人データを処理するシステムのみに適用","GDPR規制とコンプライアンス基準の知識が必要"],"ko":["EU 개인 데이터를 처리하는 시스템에만 적용","GDPR 규정 및 컴플라이언스 표준에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Se aplica solo a sistemas que procesan datos personales de la UE","Requiere conocimiento de las regulaciones y normas de cumplimiento del RGPD"],"fr":["Ne s''applique qu''aux systèmes traitant des données personnelles de l''UE","Nécessite une connaissance des réglementations et des normes de conformité au RGPD"],"de":["Gilt nur für Systeme, die EU-Personaldaten verarbeiten","Erfordert Kenntnisse der GDPR-Vorschriften und Konformitätsstandards"],"pt":["Aplica-se apenas a sistemas que processam dados pessoais da UE","Exige conhecimento das regulamentações e normas de conformidade do GDPR"],"ru":["Применяется только к системам, обрабатывающим персональные данные ЕС","Требует знания правил и стандартов соответствия требованиям GDPR"],"ar":["تطبق فقط على الأنظمة التي تمت معالجتها البيانات الشخصية للاتحاد الأوروبي","يتطلب معرفة اللوائح ومعايير الامتثال للوائح GDPR"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/billing-automation', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'billing-automation', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z', '2026-02-18T14:18:11.593Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/billing-automation","name":"billing-automation","description":{"zh":"自动化计费解决方案，实现循环计费、发票生成、逾期付款管理等功能","ja":"自動化請求システムを実現する","ko":"자동화 청구 솔루션을 구현하여 청구 효율성을 높입니다","es":"La automatización de facturación permite a los desarrolladores crear sistemas de facturación eficientes y escalables.","fr":"L''automatisation de la facturation permet aux développeurs de créer des systèmes de facturation efficaces et évolutifs.","de":"Die Automatisierung der Rechnungsstellung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, effiziente und skalierbare Rechnungssysteme zu erstellen.","pt":"Automação de faturamento para implementar sistemas de faturamento recorrente e gestão de pagamentos","ru":"Автоматизация выставления счетов для реализации систем регулярного выставления счетов и управления платежами","ar":"أتمتة الفواتير لتنفيذ أنظمة الفواتير المتكررة وإدارة المدفوعات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"自动化计费解决方案","ja":"自動化請求システム","ko":"자동화 청구 솔루션","es":"Automatización de Facturación","fr":"Automatisation de la Facturation","de":"Automatisierung der Rechnungsstellung","pt":"Automação de Faturamento","ru":"Автоматизация выставления счетов","ar":"أتمتة الفواتير","en":"billing-automation"},"description":{"zh":"自动化计费解决方案，实现循环计费、发票生成、逾期付款管理等功能","ja":"自動化請求システムを実現する","ko":"자동화 청구 솔루션을 구현하여 청구 효율성을 높입니다","es":"La automatización de facturación permite a los desarrolladores crear sistemas de facturación eficientes y escalables.","fr":"L''automatisation de la facturation permet aux développeurs de créer des systèmes de facturation efficaces et évolutifs.","de":"Die Automatisierung der Rechnungsstellung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, effiziente und skalierbare Rechnungssysteme zu erstellen.","pt":"Automação de faturamento para implementar sistemas de faturamento recorrente e gestão de pagamentos","ru":"Автоматизация выставления счетов для реализации систем регулярного выставления счетов и управления платежами","ar":"أتمتة الفواتير لتنفيذ أنظمة الفواتير المتكررة وإدارة المدفوعات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["循环计费","发票生成","逾期付款管理","分期计费","税费计算"],"ja":["定期請求","請求書生成","未払い管理","分割請求","税金計算"],"ko":["정기 청구","청구서 생성","미납 관리","분할 청구","세금 계산"],"es":["Facturación recurrente","Generación de facturas","Gestión de impagos","Cálculo de impuestos","Facturación basada en el uso"],"fr":["Facturation récurrente","Génération de factures","Gestion des impayés","Calcul des impôts","Facturation basée sur l''utilisation"],"de":["Wiederkehrende Rechnungsstellung","Rechnungserstellung","Mahnmanagement","Steuereberechnung","Nutzungsabhängige Rechnungsstellung"],"pt":["Faturamento recorrente","Geração de faturas","Gestão de pagamentos","Cálculo de impostos","Gestão de ciclos de faturamento"],"ru":["Регулярное выставление счетов","Генерация счетов","Управление платежами","Расчет налогов","Управление циклами выставления счетов"],"ar":["الفواتير المتكررة","إنشاء الفواتير","إدارة المدفوعات","حساب الضرائب","إدارة دورات الفواتير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动化计费","循环计费","发票生成","逾期付款管理","分期计费","税费计算","SaaS订阅计费"],"ja":["自動化請求","定期請求","請求書生成","未払い管理","分割請求","税金計算","SaaSサブスクリプション請求"],"ko":["자동화 청구","정기 청구","청구서 생성","미납 관리","분할 청구","세금 계산","SaaS订阅 청구"],"es":["automatización de facturación","facturación recurrente","generación de facturas","gestión de impagos","cálculo de impuestos","desarrollo de software","sistemas de facturación"],"fr":["automatisation de la facturation","facturation récurrente","génération de factures","gestion des impayés","calcul des impôts","développement de logiciels","systèmes de facturation"],"de":["Automatisierung der Rechnungsstellung","wiederkehrende Rechnungsstellung","Rechnungserstellung","Mahnmanagement","Steuereberechnung","Softwareentwicklung","Rechnungssysteme"],"pt":["automação de faturamento","faturamento recorrente","gestão de pagamentos","cálculo de impostos","saas","faturamento baseado em uso"],"ru":["автоматизация выставления счетов","регулярное выставление счетов","управление платежами","расчет налогов","saas","выставление счетов на основе использования"],"ar":["أتمتة الفواتير","الفواتير المتكررة","إدارة المدفوعات","حساب الضرائب","saas","فواتير استنادا إلى الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.527Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"billing-automation","description":"Build automated billing systems for recurring payments, invoicing, subscription lifecycle, and dunning management. Use when implementing subscription billing, automating invoicing, or managing recurring payment systems.","bodyPreview":"# Billing Automation\n\nMaster automated billing systems including recurring billing, invoice generation, dunning management, proration, and tax calculation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing SaaS subscription billing\n- Automating invoice generation and delivery\n- Managing failed payment recovery (dunning)\n- Calculating prorated charges for plan changes\n- Handling sales tax, VAT, and GST\n- Processing usage-based billing\n- Managing billing cycles and renewals\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Bill","body":"# Billing Automation\n\nMaster automated billing systems including recurring billing, invoice generation, dunning management, proration, and tax calculation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing SaaS subscription billing\n- Automating invoice generation and delivery\n- Managing failed payment recovery (dunning)\n- Calculating prorated charges for plan changes\n- Handling sales tax, VAT, and GST\n- Processing usage-based billing\n- Managing billing cycles and renewals\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Billing Cycles\n\n**Common Intervals:**\n\n- Monthly (most common for SaaS)\n- Annual (discounted long-term)\n- Quarterly\n- Weekly\n- Custom (usage-based, per-seat)\n\n### 2. Subscription States\n\n```\ntrial → active → past_due → canceled\n              → paused → resumed\n```\n\n### 3. Dunning Management\n\nAutomated process to recover failed payments through:\n\n- Retry schedules\n- Customer notifications\n- Grace periods\n- Account restrictions\n\n### 4. Proration\n\nAdjusting charges when:\n\n- Upgrading/downgrading mid-cycle\n- Adding/removing seats\n- Changing billing frequency\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom billing import BillingEngine, Subscription\n\n# Initialize billing engine\nbilling = BillingEngine()\n\n# Create subscription\nsubscription = billing.create_subscription(\n    customer_id=\"cus_123\",\n    plan_id=\"plan_pro_monthly\",\n    billing_cycle_anchor=datetime.now(),\n    trial_days=14\n)\n\n# Process billing cycle\nbilling.process_billing_cycle(subscription.id)\n```\n\n## Subscription Lifecycle Management\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass SubscriptionStatus(Enum):\n    TRIAL = \"trial\"\n    ACTIVE = \"active\"\n    PAST_DUE = \"past_due\"\n    CANCELED = \"canceled\"\n    PAUSED = \"paused\"\n\nclass Subscription:\n    def __init__(self, customer_id, plan, billing_cycle_day=None):\n        self.id = generate_id()\n        self.customer_id = customer_id\n        self.plan = plan\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.TRIAL\n        self.current_period_start = datetime.now()\n        self.current_period_end = self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=plan.trial_days or 30)\n        self.billing_cycle_day = billing_cycle_day or self.current_period_start.day\n        self.trial_end = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=plan.trial_days) if plan.trial_days else None\n\n    def start_trial(self, trial_days):\n        \"\"\"Start trial period.\"\"\"\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.TRIAL\n        self.trial_end = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=trial_days)\n        self.current_period_end = self.trial_end\n\n    def activate(self):\n        \"\"\"Activate subscription after trial or immediately.\"\"\"\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.ACTIVE\n        self.current_period_start = datetime.now()\n        self.current_period_end = self.calculate_next_billing_date()\n\n    def mark_past_due(self):\n        \"\"\"Mark subscription as past due after failed payment.\"\"\"\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.PAST_DUE\n        # Trigger dunning workflow\n\n    def cancel(self, at_period_end=True):\n        \"\"\"Cancel subscription.\"\"\"\n        if at_period_end:\n            self.cancel_at_period_end = True\n            # Will cancel when current period ends\n        else:\n            self.status = SubscriptionStatus.CANCELED\n            self.canceled_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def calculate_next_billing_date(self):\n        \"\"\"Calculate next billing date based on interval.\"\"\"\n        if self.plan.interval == ''month'':\n            return self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=30)\n        elif self.plan.interval == ''year'':\n            return self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=365)\n        elif self.plan.interval == ''week'':\n            return self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=7)\n```\n\n## Billing Cycle Processing\n\n```python\nclass BillingEngine:\n    def process_billing_cycle(self, subscription_id):\n        \"\"\"Process billing for a subscription.\"\"\"\n        subscription = self.get_subscription(subscription_id)\n\n        # Check if billing is due\n        if datetime.now() < subscription.current_period_end:\n            return\n\n        # Generate invoice\n        invoice = self.generate_invoice(subscription)\n\n        # Attempt payment\n        payment_result = self.charge_customer(\n            subscription.customer_id,\n            invoice.total\n        )\n\n        if payment_result.success:\n            # Payment successful\n            invoice.mark_paid()\n            subscription.advance_billing_period()\n            self.send_invoice(invoice)\n        else:\n            # Payment failed\n            subscription.mark_past_due()\n            self.start_dunning_process(subscription, invoice)\n\n    def generate_invoice(self, subscription):\n        \"\"\"Generate invoice for billing period.\"\"\"\n        invoice = Invoice(\n            customer_id=subscription.customer_id,\n            subscription_id=subscription.id,\n            period_start=subscription.current_period_start,\n            period_end=subscription.current_period_end\n        )\n\n        # Add subscription line item\n        invoice.add_line_item(\n            description=subscription.plan.name,\n            amount=subscription.plan.amount,\n            quantity=subscription.quantity or 1\n        )\n\n        # Add usage-based charges if applicable\n        if subscription.has_usage_billing:\n            usage_charges = self.calculate_usage_charges(subscription)\n            invoice.add_line_item(\n                description=\"Usage charges\",\n                amount=usage_charges\n            )\n\n        # Calculate tax\n        tax = self.calculate_tax(invoice.subtotal, subscription.customer)\n        invoice.tax = tax\n\n        invoice.finalize()\n        return invoice\n\n    def charge_customer(self, customer_id, amount):\n        \"\"\"Charge customer using saved payment method.\"\"\"\n        customer = self.get_customer(customer_id)\n\n        try:\n            # Charge using payment processor\n            charge = stripe.Charge.create(\n                customer=customer.stripe_id,\n                amount=int(amount * 100),  # Convert to cents\n                currency=''usd''\n            )\n\n            return PaymentResult(success=True, transaction_id=charge.id)\n        except stripe.error.CardError as e:\n            return PaymentResult(success=False, error=str(e))\n```\n\n## Dunning Management\n\n```python\nclass DunningManager:\n    \"\"\"Manage failed payment recovery.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.retry_schedule = [\n            {''days'': 3, ''email_template'': ''payment_failed_first''},\n            {''days'': 7, ''email_template'': ''payment_failed_reminder''},\n            {''days'': 14, ''email_template'': ''payment_failed_final''}\n        ]\n\n    def start_dunning_process(self, subscription, invoice):\n        \"\"\"Start dunning process for failed payment.\"\"\"\n        dunning_attempt = DunningAttempt(\n            subscription_id=subscription.id,\n            invoice_id=invoice.id,\n            attempt_number=1,\n            next_retry=datetime.now() + timedelta(days=3)\n        )\n\n        # Send initial failure notification\n        self.send_dunning_email(subscription, ''payment_failed_first'')\n\n        # Schedule retries\n        self.schedule_retries(dunning_attempt)\n\n    def retry_payment(self, dunning_attempt):\n        \"\"\"Retry failed payment.\"\"\"\n        subscription = self.get_subscription(dunning_attempt.subscription_id)\n        invoice = self.get_invoice(dunning_attempt.invoice_id)\n\n        # Attempt payment again\n        result = self.charge_customer(subscription.customer_id, invoice.total)\n\n        if result.success:\n            # Payment succeeded\n            invoice.mark_paid()\n            subscription.status = SubscriptionStatus.ACTIVE\n            self.send_dunning_email(subscription, ''payment_recovered'')\n            dunning_attempt.mark_resolved()\n        else:\n            # Still failing\n            dunning_attempt.attempt_number += 1\n\n            if dunning_attempt.attempt_number < len(self.retry_schedule):\n                # Schedule next retry\n                next_retry_config = self.retry_schedule[dunning_attempt.attempt_number]\n                dunning_attempt.next_retry = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=next_retry_config[''days''])\n                self.send_dunning_email(subscription, next_retry_config[''email_template''])\n            else:\n                # Exhausted retries, cancel subscription\n                subscription.cancel(at_period_end=False)\n                self.send_dunning_email(subscription, ''subscription_canceled'')\n\n    def send_dunning_email(self, subscription, template):\n        \"\"\"Send dunning notification to customer.\"\"\"\n        customer = self.get_customer(subscription.customer_id)\n\n        email_content = self.render_template(template, {\n            ''customer_name'': customer.name,\n            ''amount_due'': subscription.plan.amount,\n            ''update_payment_url'': f\"https://app.example.com/billing\"\n        })\n\n        send_email(\n            to=customer.email,\n            subject=email_content[''subject''],\n            body=email_content[''body'']\n        )\n```\n\n## Proration\n\n```python\nclass ProrationCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Calculate prorated charges for plan changes.\"\"\"\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def calculate_proration(old_plan, new_plan, period_start, period_end, change_date):\n        \"\"\"Calculate proration for plan change.\"\"\"\n        # Days in current period\n        total_days = (period_end - period_start).days\n\n        # Days used on old plan\n        days_used = (change_date - period_start).days\n\n        # Days remaining on new plan\n        days_remaining = (period_end - change_date).days\n\n        # Calculate prorated amounts\n        unused_amount = (old_plan.amount / total_days) * days_remaining\n        new_plan_amount = (new_plan.amount / total_days) * days_remaining\n\n        # Net charge/credit\n        proration = new_plan_amount - unused_amount\n\n        return {\n            ''old_plan_credit'': -unused_amount,\n            ''new_plan_charge'': new_plan_amount,\n            ''net_proration'': proration,\n            ''days_used'': days_used,\n            ''days_remaining'': days_remaining\n        }\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def calculate_seat_proration(current_seats, new_seats, price_per_seat, period_start, period_end, change_date):\n        \"\"\"Calculate proration for seat changes.\"\"\"\n        total_days = (period_end - period_start).days\n        days_remaining = (period_end - change_date).days\n\n        # Additional seats charge\n        additional_seats = new_seats - current_seats\n        prorated_amount = (additional_seats * price_per_seat / total_days) * days_remaining\n\n        return {\n            ''additional_seats'': additional_seats,\n            ''prorated_charge'': max(0, prorated_amount),  # No refund for removing seats mid-cycle\n            ''effective_date'': change_date\n        }\n```\n\n## Tax Calculation\n\n```python\nclass TaxCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Calculate sales tax, VAT, GST.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        # Tax rates by region\n        self.tax_rates = {\n            ''US_CA'': 0.0725,  # California sales tax\n            ''US_NY'': 0.04,    # New York sales tax\n            ''GB'': 0.20,       # UK VAT\n            ''DE'': 0.19,       # Germany VAT\n            ''FR'': 0.20,       # France VAT\n            ''AU'': 0.10,       # Australia GST\n        }\n\n    def calculate_tax(self, amount, customer):\n        \"\"\"Calculate applicable tax.\"\"\"\n        # Determine tax jurisdiction\n        jurisdiction = self.get_tax_jurisdiction(customer)\n\n        if not jurisdiction:\n            return 0\n\n        # Get tax rate\n        tax_rate = self.tax_rates.get(jurisdiction, 0)\n\n        # Calculate tax\n        tax = amount * tax_rate\n\n        return {\n            ''tax_amount'': tax,\n            ''tax_rate'': tax_rate,\n            ''jurisdiction'': jurisdiction,\n            ''tax_type'': self.get_tax_type(jurisdiction)\n        }\n\n    def get_tax_jurisdiction(self, customer):\n        \"\"\"Determine tax jurisdiction based on customer location.\"\"\"\n        if customer.country == ''US'':\n            # US: Tax based on customer state\n            return f\"US_{customer.state}\"\n        elif customer.country in [''GB'', ''DE'', ''FR'']:\n            # EU: VAT\n            return customer.country\n        elif customer.country == ''AU'':\n            # Australia: GST\n            return ''AU''\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    def get_tax_type(self, jurisdiction):\n        \"\"\"Get type of tax for jurisdiction.\"\"\"\n        if jurisdiction.startswith(''US_''):\n            return ''Sales Tax''\n        elif jurisdiction in [''GB'', ''DE'', ''FR'']:\n            return ''VAT''\n        elif jurisdiction == ''AU'':\n            return ''GST''\n        return ''Tax''\n\n    def validate_vat_number(self, vat_number, country):\n        \"\"\"Validate EU VAT number.\"\"\"\n        # Use VIES API for validation\n        # Returns True if valid, False otherwise\n        pass\n```\n\n## Invoice Generation\n\n```python\nclass Invoice:\n    def __init__(self, customer_id, subscription_id=None):\n        self.id = generate_invoice_number()\n        self.customer_id = customer_id\n        self.subscription_id = subscription_id\n        self.status = ''draft''\n        self.line_items = []\n        self.subtotal = 0\n        self.tax = 0\n        self.total = 0\n        self.created_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def add_line_item(self, description, amount, quantity=1):\n        \"\"\"Add line item to invoice.\"\"\"\n        line_item = {\n            ''description'': description,\n            ''unit_amount'': amount,\n            ''quantity'': quantity,\n            ''total'': amount * quantity\n        }\n        self.line_items.append(line_item)\n        self.subtotal += line_item[''total'']\n\n    def finalize(self):\n        \"\"\"Finalize invoice and calculate total.\"\"\"\n        self.total = self.subtotal + self.tax\n        self.status = ''open''\n        self.finalized_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def mark_paid(self):\n        \"\"\"Mark invoice as paid.\"\"\"\n        self.status = ''paid''\n        self.paid_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def to_pdf(self):\n        \"\"\"Generate PDF invoice.\"\"\"\n        from reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\n        # Generate PDF\n        # Include: company info, customer info, line items, tax, total\n        pass\n\n    def to_html(self):\n        \"\"\"Generate HTML invoice.\"\"\"\n        template = \"\"\"\n        <!DOCTYPE html>\n        <html>\n        <head><title>Invoice #{invoice_number}</title></head>\n        <body>\n            <h1>Invoice #{invoice_number}</h1>\n            <p>Date: {date}</p>\n            <h2>Bill To:</h2>\n            <p>{customer_name}<br>{customer_address}</p>\n            <table>\n                <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n                {line_items}\n            </table>\n            <p>Subtotal: ${subtotal}</p>\n            <p>Tax: ${tax}</p>\n            <h3>Total: ${total}</h3>\n        </body>\n        </html>\n        \"\"\"\n\n        return template.format(\n            invoice_number=self.id,\n            date=self.created_at.strftime(''%Y-%m-%d''),\n            customer_name=self.customer.name,\n            customer_address=self.customer.address,\n            line_items=self.render_line_items(),\n            subtotal=self.subtotal,\n            tax=self.tax,\n            total=self.total\n        )\n```\n\n## Usage-Based Billing\n\n```python\nclass UsageBillingEngine:\n    \"\"\"Track and bill for usage.\"\"\"\n\n    def track_usage(self, customer_id, metric, quantity):\n        \"\"\"Track usage event.\"\"\"\n        UsageRecord.create(\n            customer_id=customer_id,\n            metric=metric,\n            quantity=quantity,\n            timestamp=datetime.now()\n        )\n\n    def calculate_usage_charges(self, subscription, period_start, period_end):\n        \"\"\"Calculate charges for usage in billing period.\"\"\"\n        usage_records = UsageRecord.get_for_period(\n            subscription.customer_id,\n            period_start,\n            period_end\n        )\n\n        total_usage = sum(record.quantity for record in usage_records)\n\n        # Tiered pricing\n        if subscription.plan.pricing_model == ''tiered'':\n            charge = self.calculate_tiered_pricing(total_usage, subscription.plan.tiers)\n        # Per-unit pricing\n        elif subscription.plan.pricing_model == ''per_unit'':\n            charge = total_usage * subscription.plan.unit_price\n        # Volume pricing\n        elif subscription.plan.pricing_model == ''volume'':\n            charge = self.calculate_volume_pricing(total_usage, subscription.plan.tiers)\n\n        return charge\n\n    def calculate_tiered_pricing(self, total_usage, tiers):\n        \"\"\"Calculate cost using tiered pricing.\"\"\"\n        charge = 0\n        remaining = total_usage\n\n        for tier in sorted(tiers, key=lambda x: x[''up_to'']):\n            tier_usage = min(remaining, tier[''up_to''] - tier[''from''])\n            charge += tier_usage * tier[''unit_price'']\n            remaining -= tier_usage\n\n            if remaining <= 0:\n                break\n\n        return charge\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/billing-cycles.md**: Billing cycle management\n- **references/dunning-management.md**: Failed payment recovery\n- **references/proration.md**: Prorated charge calculations\n- **references/tax-calculation.md**: Tax/VAT/GST handling\n- **references/invoice-lifecycle.md**: Invoice state management\n- **assets/billing-state-machine.yaml**: Billing workflow\n- **assets/invoice-template.html**: Invoice templates\n- **assets/dunning-policy.yaml**: Dunning configuration\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Automate Everything**: Minimize manual intervention\n2. **Clear Communication**: Notify customers of billing events\n3. **Flexible Retry Logic**: Balance recovery with customer experience\n4. **Accurate Proration**: Fair calculation for plan changes\n5. **Tax Compliance**: Calculate correct tax for jurisdiction\n6. **Audit Trail**: Log all billing events\n7. **Graceful Degradation**: Handle edge cases without breaking\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Incorrect Proration**: Not accounting for partial periods\n- **Missing Tax**: Forgetting to add tax to invoices\n- **Aggressive Dunning**: Canceling too quickly\n- **No Notifications**: Not informing customers of failures\n- **Hardcoded Cycles**: Not supporting custom billing dates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:18:11.593Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing automated billing and invoicing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化计费和开票功能的金融代理","ja":"自動化請求および請求書作成機能が必要な金融エージェントに最適","ko":"자동화된 청구 및 청구서 작성 기능이 필요한 금융 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes financieros que necesitan capacidades de facturación y emisión de facturas automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents financiers ayant besoin de capacités de facturation et de création de factures automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzagenten, die eine automatisierte Rechnungsstellung und Abrechnung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Financeiros que necessitam de capacidades de faturamento e fatura automática.","ru":"Идеально для финансовых агентов, которым необходимы автоматизированные возможности выставления счетов и счетов-фактур.","ar":"مثالي لعمelez المالية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات tự động لالفواتير وتصدير الفواتير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate recurring billing, generate invoices, and manage dunning processes using protocols like JSON and XML, while handling tax calculations for VAT, GST, and sales tax.","zh":"赋予代理人使用JSON和XML等协议自动化周期性计费、生成发票和管理催讨流程的能力，同时处理增值税、商品和服务税以及销售税的税费计算","ja":"JSONやXMLなどのプロトコルを使用して、繰り返しの請求の自動化、請求書の生成、仕入処理の管理を行い、同時にVAT、GST、販売税などの税金計算を処理する","ko":"JSON 및 XML과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 반복되는 청구 자동화, 청구서 생성 및 압류 관리를 수행하며 동시에 부가가치세, 물품 및 서비스세, 판매세 등의 세금 계산을 처리","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la facturación periódica, generar facturas y gestionar procesos de recordatorio utilizando protocolos como JSON y XML, mientras maneja cálculos de impuestos para IVA, GST y impuestos sobre las ventas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la facturation récurrente, de générer des factures et de gérer les processus de relance utilisant des protocoles tels que JSON et XML, tout en gérant les calculs de taxes pour la TVA, la TPS et la taxe de vente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, wiederkehrende Rechnungsstellungen zu automatisieren, Rechnungen zu erstellen und Mahnprozesse über Protokolle wie JSON und XML zu verwalten, während es Steuerberechnungen für MwSt., GST und Umsatzsteuer handhabt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem a cobrança recorrente, gerem faturas e gerenciem processos de dunning usando protocolos como JSON e XML, enquanto lidam com cálculos de impostos para VAT, GST e imposto sobre vendas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать регулярный账单, генерировать счета-фактуры и управлять процессами dunning с использованием протоколов seperti JSON и XML, а также обрабатывать расчеты налогов для VAT, GST и налога с продаж.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء توفير الت automátisation للفواتير المتكررة وتوليد الفواتير وإدارة عمليات dunning باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON و XML، مع معالجة حسابات الضريبة للضريبة على القيمة المضافة وضريبة السلع والخدمات وضريبة المبيعات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SaaS subscription billing cycles","Generating invoices with prorated charges","Managing failed payment recovery through dunning management"],"zh":["自动化SaaS订阅计费周期","生成带有比例收费的发票","通过催讨管理处理失败的付款恢复"],"ja":["SaaSサブスクリプションの請求周期の自動化","比例課金を含む請求書の生成","催討管理を通じた失敗した支払い回復の処理"],"ko":["SaaS订阅 청구 주기의 자동화","비율 청구가 포함된 청구서 생성","압류 관리를 통한 실패한 결제 복구 처리"],"es":["Automatización de ciclos de facturación de suscripciones de SaaS","Generación de facturas con cargos prorrateados","Gestión de la recuperación de pagos fallidos a través de la gestión de recordatorios"],"fr":["Automation des cycles de facturation d''abonnement SaaS","Génération de factures avec des frais proratis","Gestion de la reprise de paiements échoués via la gestion de relance"],"de":["Automatisierung von Abrechnungszyklen für SaaS-Abonnements","Erstellung von Rechnungen mit anteiligen Gebühren","Verwaltung der Wiedererlangung fehlgeschlagener Zahlungen durch Mahnmanagement"],"pt":["Automatizar ciclos de faturamento de assinatura do SaaS","Gerar faturas com taxas proporcionais","Gerenciar recuperação de pagamentos falhos por meio de gerenciamento de dunning"],"ru":["Автоматизировать циклы выставления счетов для подписок SaaS","Генерировать счета-фактуры с пропорциональными сборами","Управлять восстановлением неудачных платежей через управление dunning"],"ar":["تutomatizar دورات الفواتير للاشتراكات SaaS","توليد فواتير مع رسوم比例","إدارة استرداد المدفوعات الفاشلة من خلال إدارة dunning"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with payment gateways","Handles specific tax regulations like VAT, GST, and sales tax"],"zh":["需要与支付网关集成","仅处理增值税、商品和服务税以及销售税等特定税法规则"],"ja":["決済ゲートウェイとの統合が必要","VAT、GST、販売税などの特定の税法規則のみを処理"],"ko":["결제 게이트웨이와의 통합이 필요","부가가치세, 물품 및 서비스세, 판매세 등의 특정 세법 규칙만 처리"],"es":["Requiere integración con pasarelas de pago","Maneja regulaciones fiscales específicas como IVA, GST y impuestos sobre las ventas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec les passerelles de paiement","Gère des réglementations fiscales spécifiques comme la TVA, la TPS et la taxe de vente"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit ZahlungsGateways","Behandelt spezifische Steuervorschriften wie MwSt., GST und Umsatzsteuer"],"pt":["Requer integração com gateways de pagamento","Lida com regulamentações fiscais específicas como VAT, GST e imposto sobre vendas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с шлюзами оплаты","Обрабатывает конкретные налоговые регламенты, такие как VAT, GST и налог с продаж"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع بوابات الدفع","يتعامل مع اللوائح الضريبية المحددة مثل ضريبة القيمة المضافة وضريبة السلع والخدمات وضريبة المبيعات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
