,"Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität"],"pt":["plan writing","conversão de configurações","Antigravity IDE","IDEs compatíveis","CLIs compatíveis","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["планирование написания","конвертация конфигураций","Antigravity IDE","совместимые IDE","совместимые CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["كتابة الخطة","تحويل الإعدادات","Antigravity IDE","IDEs متوافقة","CLIs متوافقة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-writing","description":"Structured task planning with clear breakdowns, dependencies, and verification criteria. Use when implementing features, refactoring, or any multi-step work.","bodyPreview":"# Plan Writing\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a framework for breaking down work into clear, actionable tasks with verification criteria.\n\n## Task Breakdown Principles\n\n### 1. Small, Focused Tasks\n- Each task should take 2-5 minutes\n- One clear outcome per task\n- Independently verifiable\n\n### 2. Clear Verification\n- How do you know it''s done?\n- What can you check/test?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### 3. Logical Ordering\n- Dependencies identified\n- Parallel work w","body":"# Plan Writing\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a framework for breaking down work into clear, actionable tasks with verification criteria.\n\n## Task Breakdown Principles\n\n### 1. Small, Focused Tasks\n- Each task should take 2-5 minutes\n- One clear outcome per task\n- Independently verifiable\n\n### 2. Clear Verification\n- How do you know it''s done?\n- What can you check/test?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### 3. Logical Ordering\n- Dependencies identified\n- Parallel work where possible\n- Critical path highlighted\n- **Phase X: Verification is always LAST**\n\n### 4. Dynamic Naming in Project Root\n- Plan files are saved as `{task-slug}.md` in the PROJECT ROOT\n- Name derived from task (e.g., \"add auth\" → `auth-feature.md`)\n- **NEVER** inside `.claude/`, `docs/`, or temp folders\n\n## Planning Principles (NOT Templates!)\n\n> 🔴 **NO fixed templates. Each plan is UNIQUE to the task.**\n\n### Principle 1: Keep It SHORT\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| 50 tasks with sub-sub-tasks | 5-10 clear tasks max |\n| Every micro-step listed | Only actionable items |\n| Verbose descriptions | One-line per task |\n\n> **Rule:** If plan is longer than 1 page, it''s too long. Simplify.\n\n---\n\n### Principle 2: Be SPECIFIC, Not Generic\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| \"Set up project\" | \"Run `npx create-next-app`\" |\n| \"Add authentication\" | \"Install next-auth, create `/api/auth/[...nextauth].ts`\" |\n| \"Style the UI\" | \"Add Tailwind classes to `Header.tsx`\" |\n\n> **Rule:** Each task should have a clear, verifiable outcome.\n\n---\n\n### Principle 3: Dynamic Content Based on Project Type\n\n**For NEW PROJECT:**\n- What tech stack? (decide first)\n- What''s the MVP? (minimal features)\n- What''s the file structure?\n\n**For FEATURE ADDITION:**\n- Which files are affected?\n- What dependencies needed?\n- How to verify it works?\n\n**For BUG FIX:**\n- What''s the root cause?\n- What file/line to change?\n- How to test the fix?\n\n---\n\n### Principle 4: Scripts Are Project-Specific\n\n> 🔴 **DO NOT copy-paste script commands. Choose based on project type.**\n\n| Project Type | Relevant Scripts |\n|--------------|------------------|\n| Frontend/React | `ux_audit.py`, `accessibility_checker.py` |\n| Backend/API | `api_validator.py`, `security_scan.py` |\n| Mobile | `mobile_audit.py` |\n| Database | `schema_validator.py` |\n| Full-stack | Mix of above based on what you touched |\n\n**Wrong:** Adding all scripts to every plan\n**Right:** Only scripts relevant to THIS task\n\n---\n\n### Principle 5: Verification is Simple\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| \"Verify the component works correctly\" | \"Run `npm run dev`, click button, see toast\" |\n| \"Test the API\" | \"curl localhost:3000/api/users returns 200\" |\n| \"Check styles\" | \"Open browser, verify dark mode toggle works\" |\n\n---\n\n## Plan Structure (Flexible, Not Fixed!)\n\n```\n# [Task Name]\n\n## Goal\nOne sentence: What are we building/fixing?\n\n## Tasks\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n- [ ] Task 3: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n\n## Done When\n- [ ] [Main success criteria]\n```\n\n> **That''s it.** No phases, no sub-sections unless truly needed.\n> Keep it minimal. Add complexity only when required.\n\n## Notes\n[Any important considerations]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices (Quick Reference)\n\n1. **Start with goal** - What are we building/fixing?\n2. **Max 10 tasks** - If more, break into multiple plans\n3. **Each task verifiable** - Clear \"done\" criteria\n4. **Project-specific** - No copy-paste templates\n5. **Update as you go** - Mark `[x]` when complete\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New project from scratch\n- Adding a feature\n- Fixing a bug (if complex)\n- Refactoring multiple files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:20:07.111Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Agents specializing in workflow orchestration and IDE integration.","zh":"适用于专注于工作流编排和IDE集成的AI代理。","ja":"ワークフロー オーケストレーションと IDE 統合に特化した AI エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"워크플로우 오케스트레이션 및 IDE 통합에 전문적인 AI 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA que se especializan en la orquestación de flujos de trabajo y la integración de IDE.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents IA spécialisés dans l''orchestration de flux de travail et l''intégration de l''IDE.","de":"Wesentlich für KI-Agents, die auf Workflow-Orchestrierung und IDE-Integration spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA especializados em orquestração de fluxo de trabalho e integração de IDE.","ru":"Необходим для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на оркестровке рабочих процессов и интеграции с IDE.","ar":"ضروري لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يختصون في أوركسترا سير العمل وتكامل بيئة التطوير"},"recommendation":{"en":"Converts Antigravity IDE configurations into formats compatible with GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and CLIs like Kiro and OpenCode. Breaks down complex workflows into 2-5 minute, verifiable tasks with clear dependencies and parallel execution paths.","zh":"将反重力IDE配置转换为兼容GitHub Copilot、Cursor和CLI（如Kiro和OpenCode）的格式。将复杂的工作流分解为2-5分钟、可验证的任务，具有清晰的依赖关系和并行执行路径。","ja":"Antigravity IDE の構成を GitHub Copilot、Cursor、および Kiro や OpenCode などの CLI と互換性のある形式に変換します。複雑なワークフローを 2~5 分、検証可能なタスクに分解し、明確な依存関係と並列実行パスを持ちます。","ko":"반중력 IDE 구성 파일을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 및 Kiro 및 OpenCode와 같은 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환합니다. 복잡한 워크플ロー는 2~5분, 검증 가능한 작업으로 분해되며 명확한 종속성 및 병렬 실행 경로를 가집니다.","es":"Convierte configuraciones de Antigravity IDE en formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y CLI como Kiro y OpenCode. Desglosa flujos de trabajo complejos en tareas verificables de 2-5 minutos con dependencias claras y rutas de ejecución paralela.","fr":"Converte les configurations Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et les CLI comme Kiro et OpenCode. Décompose les flux de travail complexes en tâches vérifiables de 2-5 minutes avec des dépendances claires et des chemins d''exécution parallèle.","de":"Wandelt Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in Formate um, die mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und CLI wie Kiro und OpenCode kompatibel sind. Zerlegt komplexe Workflows in überprüfbare Aufgaben von 2-5 Minuten mit klaren Abhängigkeiten und parallelen Ausführungspfaden.","pt":"Converte configurações do Antigravity IDE em formatos compatíveis com GitHub Copilot, Cursor e CLIs como Kiro e OpenCode. Divide fluxos de trabalho complexos em tarefas verificáveis de 2-5 minutos, com dependências claras e caminhos de execução paralela.","ru":"Преобразует конфигурации Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с GitHub Copilot, Cursor и CLIs, такими как Kiro и OpenCode. Разбивает сложные рабочие процессы на верифицируемые задачи продолжительностью 2-5 минут с четкими зависимостями и параллельными путями выполнения.","ar":"يحول تكوينات Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot و Cursor و CLIs مثل Kiro و OpenCode. يقسم سير العمل المعقدة إلى مهام قابلة للتحقق مدتها 2-5 دقائق مع зависимости واضحة ومسارات تنفيذ متوازي."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Antigravity workflows to Cursor-compatible plans","Generating CLI-ready task breakdowns for OpenCode","Creating verifiable action plans with explicit success criteria"],"zh":["将反重力工作流转换为Cursor兼容的计划","为OpenCode生成CLI准备的任务分解","创建具有明确成功标准的可验证操作计划"],"ja":["Antigravity ワークフローを Cursor 互換のプランに変換する","OpenCode 用の CLI 準備タスク ブレークダウンを生成する","明確な成功基準を持つ検証可能なアクション プランを作成する"],"ko":["반중력 워크플로를 커서와 호환되는 계획으로 변환","오픈코드를 위한 CLI 준비 작업 분해 생성","명확한 성공 기준을 갖는 검증 가능한 동작 계획 생성"],"es":["Conversión de flujos de trabajo de Antigravity en planes compatibles con Cursor","Generación de desglose de tareas listas para CLI para OpenCode","Creación de planes de acción verificables con criterios de éxito explícitos"],"fr":["Conversion de flux de travail Antigravity en plans compatibles avec Cursor","Génération de décomposition de tâches prêtes pour CLI pour OpenCode","Création de plans d''action vérifiables avec des critères de succès explicites"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-Workflows in Cursor-kompatible Pläne","Generierung von CLI-fertigen Aufgabenzerlegungen für OpenCode","Erstellung von überprüfbaren Aktionsplänen mit expliziten Erfolgskriterien"],"pt":["Conversão de fluxos de trabalho do Antigravity para planos compatíveis com o Cursor","Geração de quebras de tarefas prontas para CLI para o OpenCode","Criação de planos de ação verificáveis com critérios de sucesso explícitos"],"ru":["Преобразование рабочих процессов Antigravity в планы, совместимые с Cursor","Генерация разбиения задач, готовых для CLI, для OpenCode","Создание верифицируемых планов действий с явными критериями успеха"],"ar":["تحويل سير العمل Antigravity إلى خطط متوافقة مع Cursor","توليد تقسيم المهام جاهز للواجهة السطرية للرمز المفتوح","إنشاء خطط عمل قابلة للتحقق مع معايير نجاح明确"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Antigravity IDE configuration input","Limited to supported IDE/CLI targets (GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode)"],"zh":["需要反重力IDE配置输入","仅限支持的IDE/CLI目标（GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiro、OpenCode）"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE 構成入力を必要とする","サポート対象の IDE/CLI ターゲット (GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiro、OpenCode) 限定"],"ko":["반중력 IDE 구성 입력이 필요","지원되는 IDE/CLI 대상(GitHub Copilot, 커서, 키로, 오픈코드)만 해당"],"es":["Requiere entrada de configuración de IDE de Antigravity","Limitado a objetivos IDE/CLI admitidos (GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode)"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de configuration de l''IDE Antigravity","Limité à des cibles IDE/CLI prises en charge (GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode)"],"de":["Benötigt Eingabe von Antigravity-IDE-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf unterstützte IDE/CLI-Ziele (GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode)"],"pt":["Requer entrada de configuração do Antigravity IDE","Limitado a alvos IDE/CLI suportados (GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode)"],"ru":["Требует ввода конфигурации Antigravity IDE","Ограничен поддерживаемыми целевыми IDE/CLI (GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode)"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال تكوين Antigravity IDE","محدود بالأهداف المدعومة من IDE/CLI (GitHub Copilot، Cursor، Kiro، OpenCode)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
