a qualidade","Atenção ao detalhe estético","Escolhas criativas e inovadoras","Implementação de componentes e páginas","Desenvolvimento de aplicações e interfaces"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Разработка высококачественного кода","Внимание к эстетическим деталям","Креативные и инновационные решения","Реализация компонентов и страниц","Разработка приложений и интерфейсов"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير код عالي الجودة","الاهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","الخيارات الإبداعية والمبتكرة","تنفيذ المكونات والصفحات","تطوير التطبيقات والواجهات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","AI风格","美学细节","创造性选择","设计思维"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルインターフェース","AIスタイル","美学の細部","創造的な選択","デザイン思考"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","AI 스타일","미학적 세부 사항","창의적인 선택","디자인 사고"],"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces personalizadas","código de producción","diseño de pensamiento","estéticas genéricas","desarrollo web"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces personnalisées","code de production","conception de pensée","esthétiques génériques","développement web"],"de":["frontend-design","maßgeschneiderte interfaces","produktionscode","design-denken","generische ästhetik","webentwicklung"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","código de alta qualidade","desenvolvimento web","design de interface do usuário"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","индивидуальные интерфейсы пользователя","высококачественный код","веб-разработка","дизайн интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","كود عالي الجودة","تطوير الويب","تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"dseirz-rgb","repo":"worker","repoPath":"dseirz-rgb/worker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\r\n\r\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\r\n\r\n## Design Thinking\r\n\r\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic directio","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\r\n\r\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\r\n\r\n## Design Thinking\r\n\r\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\r\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\r\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\r\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\r\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\r\n\r\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\r\n\r\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\r\n- Production-grade and functional\r\n- Visually striking and memorable\r\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\r\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\r\n\r\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\r\n\r\nFocus on:\r\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\r\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\r\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\r\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\r\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\r\n\r\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\r\n\r\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\r\n\r\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\r\n\r\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:20:33.441Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interface design capabilities with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端界面设计能力并注重美观细节的UI焦点代理。","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントが、プロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイス設計能力を必要とする場合に最適です。美観の細部に注意を払います。","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 디자인 기능과 미학적 세부 사항에 주의를 필요로 하는 UI 중심 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan capacidades de diseño de interfaz de usuario de frontend de grado de producción con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant des capacités de conception d''interface frontend de grade de production avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Perfekt für UI-fokussierte Agenten, die Produktionsgrade-Frontend-Schnittstellen-Designfunktionen mit Beachtung von ästhetischen Details benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que necessitam de capacidades de design de interface de frontend de produção com atenção aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимы возможности проектирования интерфейса frontend уровня производства с учетом эстетических деталей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم ويهتمون بتصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المستخدمة في الإنتاج مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create distinctive, real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, implementing interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with a focus on avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics and committing to a bold aesthetic direction.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有异常美观细节关注和创造性选择的独特、真实工作代码的能力，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript实现接口，重点避免通用的人工智能美学，并致力于大胆的美学方向。","ja":"エージェントが、例外的な美観の細部への注意と創造的な選択を持つ、独自の実際の動作コードを作成できるようにします。HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用してインターフェイスを実装し、汎用の「AIスロップ」美学を避け、大胆な美学方向にコミットします。","ko":"에이전트가 예외적인 미학적 세부 사항에 주의를 기울이고 창의적인 선택을 하는 고유한 실제 작동 코드를 생성 할 수 있도록 합니다. HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 인터페이스를 구현하여 일반적인 ''AI 슬롭'' 미학을 피하고 대담한 미학 방향에 헌신합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear código de trabajo real y distintivo con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y opciones creativas, implementando interfaces mediante HTML, CSS y JavaScript, centrándose en evitar la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA'' y comprometiéndose con una dirección estética audaz.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code de travail réel et distinctif avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en implémentant des interfaces à l''aide de HTML, CSS et JavaScript, en se concentrant sur l''évitement de l''esthétique générique de ''bazar d''IA'' et en s''engageant dans une direction esthétique audacieuse.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eigenständigen, echten Arbeitscode mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen zu erstellen, implementiert Schnittstellen unter Verwendung von HTML, CSS und JavaScript, konzentriert sich auf die Vermeidung einer generischen ''KI-Schund''-Ästhetik und setzt sich für eine mutige ästhetische Richtung ein.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar código de trabalho real distinto, com atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas, implementando interfaces usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, com foco em evitar estéticas genéricas de ''slop de IA'' e comprometendo-se com uma direção estética ousada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать характерный, реально работающий код с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям и творческим решениям, реализуя интерфейсы с использованием HTML, CSS и JavaScript, с фокусом на избежании.generic ''AI-слоу'' эстетики и приверженностью смелому эстетическому направлению.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء رمز حقيقي متميز مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية، وتنفيذ الواجهات باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، مع التركيز على تجنب جماليات ''AI slop'' العامة والالتزام بالاتجاه الجمالي الجريء."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications with custom layouts","Generating production-ready UI components with precise styling","Creating visually appealing interfaces for web pages and applications"],"zh":["设计具有自定义布局的响应式Web应用程序","生成具有精确样式的生产就绪UI组件","为Web页面和应用程序创建视觉上吸引人的接口"],"ja":["カスタムレイアウトを使用したレスポンシブWebアプリケーションの設計","正確なスタイリングを持つプロダクションレディUIコンポーネントの生成","Webページおよびアプリケーションのための視覚的に魅力的なインターフェイスの作成"],"ko":["사용자 지정 레이아웃을 사용하여 반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","정확한 스타일링을 갖춘 생산 준비 UI 구성 요소 생성","웹 페이지 및 애플리케이션을 위한 시각적으로 매력적인 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas con diseños personalizados","Generar componentes de interfaz de usuario listos para producción con estilos precisos","Crear interfaces visualmente atractivas para páginas web y aplicaciones"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web responsives avec des dispositions personnalisées","Générer des composants d''interface utilisateur prêts pour la production avec des styles précis","Créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes pour les pages web et les applications"],"de":["Entwerfen von responsiven Webanwendungen mit benutzerdefinierten Layouts","Erzeugen von produktionsreifen Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit präziser Stilisierung","Erstellen von visuell ansprechenden Schnittstellen für Webseiten und Anwendungen"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas com layouts personalizados","Gerar componentes de UI prontos para produção com estilização precisa","Criar interfaces visualmente atraentes para páginas e aplicações web"],"ru":["Проектировать веб-приложения с адаптивной версткой и индивидуальными макетами","Генерировать компоненты UI, готовые к производству, с точной стилизацией","Создавать визуально привлекательные интерфейсы для веб-страниц и приложений"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ويب متجاوبة مع تخطيط مخصص","генерация مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجاهزة للانتاج مع تنسيق دقيق","إنشاء واجهات مرئية جذابة للصفحات والتطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements and context","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求和上下文","可能需要额外的技术约束以实现最佳实现"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件とコンテキストが必要","最適な実装を実現するために追加の技術的制約が必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항 및 컨텍스트가 필요합니다.","최적의 구현을 달성하기 위해 추가 기술 제약이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere requisitos y contexto de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Puede necesitar restricciones técnicas adicionales para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences et un contexte de frontend fournis par l''utilisateur","Peut nécessiter des contraintes techniques supplémentaires pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Benötigt von Benutzern bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen und Kontext","Kann zusätzliche technische Einschränkungen für eine optimale Implementierung benötigen"],"pt":["Exige requisitos e contexto de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Pode precisar de restrições técnicas adicionais para implementação ótima"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем требований и контекста frontend","Может потребовать дополнительных технических ограничений для оптимальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات وسياق واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المقدمة من المستخدم","قد يحتاج إلى قيود فنية إضافية للتنفيذ الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/red-team-tactics', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'agent-bridge-kit', 'HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit', 'red-team-tactics', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z', '2026-02-18T14:21:02.351Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/red-team-tactics","name":"red-team-tactics","description":{"zh":"红队战术是一种工具，用于将Antigravity IDE配置转换为兼容的格式，支持多种IDE和CLI。它基于MITRE ATT&CK框架，提供对手模拟原则","ja":"レッドチーム戦術は、Antigravity IDE設定を互換性のある形式に変換するツールです。MITRE ATT&CKフレームワークに基づいて対抗シミュレーションの原則を提供します","ko":"레드 팀 전술은 Antigravity IDE 설정을 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 도구입니다. MITRE ATT&CK 프레임워크를 기반으로 적대자 시뮬레이션 원칙을 제공합니다","es":"Herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Agent, Skill y Workflows de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con IDEs como GitHub Copilot y CLIs como Kiro","fr":"Outil pour convertir les configurations d''Agent, Skill et Workflows d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec les IDE tels que GitHub Copilot et les CLIs tels que Kiro","de":"Werkzeug zum Konvertieren von Agent-, Skill- und Workflow-Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate für IDEs wie GitHub Copilot und CLIs wie Kiro","pt":"A ferramenta Red Team Tactics é uma solução para converter configurações de Agent, Skill e Workflows do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs.","ru":"Инструмент Тактика Красной Команды является решением для конвертации конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workflows из Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI.","ar":"أداة تكتيكات الفريق الأحمر هي حل لتحويل تكوينات Agent و Skill و Workflows من Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDEs و CLIs.","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"红队战术：MITRE ATT&CK框架下的对手模拟","ja":"レッドチーム戦術：MITRE A