kdown convierte páginas web a Markdown limpio mediante un navegador instalado localmente","fr":"La compétence web-to-markdown convertit des pages web en Markdown propre via un navigateur installé localement","de":"Die Fähigkeit web-to-markdown wandelt Webseiten in sauberes Markdown um, indem sie einen lokal installierten Browser nutzt","pt":"A habilidade web-to-markdown converte páginas web em Markdown limpo, utilizando um navegador local","ru":"Навык web-to-markdown преобразует веб-страницы в чистый Markdown, используя локально установленный браузер","ar":"المهارة web-to-markdown تحول صفحات الويب إلى ماركداون نظيف باستخدام متصفح مثبت محليا","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["将网页转换为干净的 Markdown 格式","驱动本地安装的浏览器","支持 JavaScript 渲染","提高开发效率","简化文档工作"],"ja":["Web ページをクリーンな Markdown に変換","ローカルにインストールされたブラウザを駆動","JavaScript 渲染をサポート","開発効率を向上","ドキュメント作業を簡素化"],"ko":["웹 페이지를 깨끗한 마크다운으로 변환","로컬에 설치된 브라우저를 구동","자바스크립트 렌더링을 지원","개발 효율성을 높임","문서 작업을 단순화"],"es":["Conversión de páginas web a Markdown","Uso de un navegador instalado localmente","Compatibilidad con JavaScript","Salida de Markdown limpia","Fácil de usar","Integración con habilidades de desarrollo"],"fr":["Conversion de pages web en Markdown","Utilisation d''un navigateur installé localement","Compatibilité avec JavaScript","Sortie de Markdown propre","Facile à utiliser","Intégration avec des compétences de développement"],"de":["Umwandlung von Webseiten in Markdown","Verwendung eines lokal installierten Browsers","Kompatibilität mit JavaScript","Ausgabe von sauberen Markdown","Einfach zu bedienen","Integration mit Entwicklungsfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Conversão de páginas web em Markdown","Uso de navegador local","Suporte a JS renderizado","Saída em Markdown limpo","Facilidade de uso"],"ru":["Преобразование веб-страниц в Markdown","Использование локально установленного браузера","Поддержка JS рендеринга","Выходные данные в чистом Markdown","Легкость использования"],"ar":["تحويل صفحات الويب إلى ماركداون","استخدام متصفح مثبت محليا","دعم لتحويل JS","إخراج في ماركداون نظيف","سهولة الإستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web-to-Markdown","Markdown 转换","网页转换","开发效率","文档工作","JavaScript 渲染"],"ja":["WebからMarkdownへの変換","Markdown 変換","Web ページ変換","開発効率","ドキュメント作業","JavaScript レンダリング"],"ko":["웹에서 마크다운으로","마크다운 변환","웹 페이지 변환","개발 효율성","문서 작업","자바스크립트 렌더링"],"es":["web-to-markdown","conversión de páginas web","Markdown","desarrollo web","navegador local","JavaScript","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","tecnologías web"],"fr":["web-to-markdown","conversion de pages web","Markdown","développement web","navigateur local","JavaScript","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","technologies web"],"de":["web-to-markdown","Umwandlung von Webseiten","Markdown","Webentwicklung","lokal installierter Browser","JavaScript","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Webtechnologien"],"pt":["conversão web para markdown","web-to-markdown","markdown limpo","navegador local","js renderizado","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["веб в markdown","web-to-markdown","чистый markdown","локально установленный браузер","js рендеринг","веб разработка"],"ar":["تحويل الويب إلى ماركداون","web-to-markdown","ماركداون نظيف","متصفح مثبت محليا","تحويل js","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-to-markdown","description":"Use ONLY when the user explicitly says: use the skill web-to-markdown ... (or use a skill web-to-markdown ...). Converts webpage URLs to clean Markdown by calling the local web2md CLI (Puppeteer + Readability), suitable for JS-rendered pages.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# web-to-markdown\n\nConvert web pages to clean Markdown by driving a locally installed browser (via `web2md`).\n\n## Hard trigger gate (must enforce)\n\nThis skill MUST NOT be used unless the user explicitly wrote **exactly** a phrase like:\n- `use the skill web-to-markdown ...`\n- `use a skill web-to-markdown ...`\n\nIf the user did not explicitly request this skill by name, stop and ask them to re-issue the request including: `use the skill web-to-markdown`.\n\n## What this skill does\n\n- Handles JS-rende","body":"# web-to-markdown\n\nConvert web pages to clean Markdown by driving a locally installed browser (via `web2md`).\n\n## Hard trigger gate (must enforce)\n\nThis skill MUST NOT be used unless the user explicitly wrote **exactly** a phrase like:\n- `use the skill web-to-markdown ...`\n- `use a skill web-to-markdown ...`\n\nIf the user did not explicitly request this skill by name, stop and ask them to re-issue the request including: `use the skill web-to-markdown`.\n\n## What this skill does\n\n- Handles JS-rendered pages (Puppeteer → user Chrome).\n- Works best with Chromium-family browsers (Chrome/Chromium/Brave/Edge) via `puppeteer-core`.\n- Extracts main content (Readability).\n- Converts to Markdown (Turndown) with cleaned links and optional YAML frontmatter.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not use Playwright or other browser automation stacks; the mechanism is `web2md`.\n\n## Inputs you should collect (ask only if missing)\n\n- `url` (or a list of URLs)\n- Output preference:\n  - Print to stdout (`--print`), OR\n  - Save to a file (`--out ./file.md`), OR\n  - Save to a directory (`--out ./some-dir/` to auto-name by page title)\n- Optional rendering controls for tricky pages:\n  - `--chrome-path <path>` (if Chrome auto-detection fails)\n  - `--interactive` (show Chrome and pause so the user can complete human checks/login, then press Enter)\n  - `--wait-until load|domcontentloaded|networkidle0|networkidle2`\n  - `--wait-for ''<css selector>''`\n  - `--wait-ms <milliseconds>`\n  - `--headful` (debug)\n  - `--no-sandbox` (sometimes required in containers/CI)\n  - `--user-data-dir <dir>` (login/session; use a dedicated profile directory)\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Confirm the user explicitly invoked the skill (`use the skill web-to-markdown`).\n2) Validate URL(s) start with `http://` or `https://`.\n3) Ensure `web2md` is installed:\n   - Run: `command -v web2md`\n   - If missing, instruct the user to install it (assume the project exists at `~/workspace/softaworks/projects/web2md`):\n     - `cd ~/workspace/softaworks/projects/web2md && npm install && npm run build && npm link`\n     - Or: `cd ~/workspace/softaworks/projects/web2md && npm install && npm run build && npm install -g .`\n4) Convert:\n   - Single URL → file:\n     - `web2md ''<url>'' --out ./page.md`\n   - Single URL → auto-named file in directory:\n     - `mkdir -p ./out && web2md ''<url>'' --out ./out/`\n   - Human verification / login walls (interactive):\n     - `mkdir -p ./out && web2md ''<url>'' --interactive --user-data-dir ./tmp/web2md-profile --out ./out/`\n     - Then: complete the check in the browser window and press Enter in the terminal to continue.\n   - Print to stdout:\n     - `web2md ''<url>'' --print`\n   - Multiple URLs (batch):\n     - Create output dir (e.g. `./out/`) then run one `web2md` command per URL using `--out ./out/`\n5) Validate output:\n   - If writing files, verify they exist and are non-empty (e.g. `ls -la <path>` and `wc -c <path>`).\n6) Return:\n   - The saved file path(s), or the Markdown (stdout mode).\n\n## Defaults (recommended)\n\n- For most pages: `--wait-until networkidle2`\n- For heavy apps: start with `--wait-until domcontentloaded --wait-ms 2000`, then add `--wait-for ''main''` (or another stable selector) if needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:21:08.205Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Scraping Agents needing to convert web pages to clean Markdown format.","zh":"非常适合需要将网页转换为干净的Markdown格式的Web Scraping代理。","ja":"Web ScrapingエージェントがWebページをクリーンなMarkdown形式に変換する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 스크레이핑 에이전트가 웹 페이지를 깨끗한 Markdown 형식으로 변환해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Web Scraping que necesitan convertir páginas web a formato Markdown limpio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Web Scraping ayant besoin de convertir des pages web au format Markdown propre.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Scraping-Agents, die Webseiten in ein sauberes Markdown-Format umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Web Scraping que precisam converter páginas da web para formato Markdown limpo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-скрапинга, которым необходимо конвертировать веб-страницы в чистый формат Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استخلاص الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تحويل صفحات الويب إلى تنسيق Markdown نظيف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to drive locally installed browsers via web2md, handling JavaScript-rendered content and converting it to Markdown, leveraging protocols for seamless web page interaction.","zh":"赋予代理驱动本地安装的浏览器通过web2md，处理JavaScript渲染的内容并将其转换为Markdown，利用协议实现无缝的网页交互。","ja":"エージェントがweb2md経由でローカルにインストールされたブラウザを駆動し、JavaScriptでレンダリングされたコンテンツを処理してMarkdownに変換し、プロトコルを利用してシームレスなWebページのやり取りを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 web2md를 통해 로컬에 설치된 브라우저를 구동하여 자바스크립트 렌더링된 내용을 처리하고 마크다운으로 변환하며, 프로토콜을 활용하여 무缝한 웹 페이지 상호 작용을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para controlar navegadores instalados localmente a través de web2md, manejar contenido renderizado por JavaScript y convertirlo a Markdown, aprovechando protocolos para una interacción de página web sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler les navigateurs installés localement via web2md, en gérant le contenu rendu par JavaScript et en le convertissant en Markdown, en exploitant des protocoles pour une interaction de page web transparente.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, lokal installierte Browser über web2md zu steuern, JavaScript-gerenderten Inhalt zu handhaben und in Markdown umzuwandeln, indem Protokolle für eine reibungslose Webseiteninteraktion genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes controlem navegadores instalados localmente via web2md, lidando com conteúdo renderizado em JavaScript e convertendo-o para Markdown, utilizando protocolos para interação de página da web sem problemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять локально установленными браузерами через web2md, обрабатывая контент, отображаемый с помощью JavaScript, и конвертируя его в Markdown, используя протоколы для бесперебойного взаимодействия с веб-страницами.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تشغيل المتصفحات المثبتة محليًا عبر web2md، وتحويل المحتوى المُحدّث بواسطة JavaScript إلى تنسيق Markdown، واستخدام البروتوكولات لتفاعل صفحة الويب بسلاسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting web pages to Markdown for easy editing","Automating web content scraping and conversion","Generating Markdown documents from web-based sources"],"zh":["将网页转换为Markdown以便于编辑","自动化网页内容的抓取和转换","从基于Web的来源生成Markdown文档"],"ja":["WebページをMarkdownに変換して簡単に編集する","Webコンテンツのスクレイピングと変換を自動化する","WebベースのソースからMarkdownドキュメントを生成する"],"ko":["웹 페이지를 마크다운으로 변환하여 쉽게 편집하기","웹 콘텐츠 스크레이핑 및 변환 자동화","웹 기반 소스에서 마크다운 문서 생성"],"es":["Convertir páginas web a Markdown para una fácil edición","Automatizar la extracción y conversión de contenido web","Generar documentos Markdown a partir de fuentes web"],"fr":["Convertir des pages web en Markdown pour une édition facile","Automatiser l''extraction et la conversion de contenu web","Générer des documents Markdown à partir de sources web"],"de":["Webseiten in Markdown für eine einfache Bearbeitung umwandeln","Automatisierung der Extraktion und Umwandlung von Webinhalten","Erzeugen von Markdown-Dokumenten aus Webquellen"],"pt":["Converter páginas da web para Markdown para edição fácil","Automatizar a extração e conversão de conteúdo da web","Gerar documentos Markdown a partir de fontes baseadas na web"],"ru":["Преобразование веб-страниц в Markdown для легкого редактирования","Автоматизация извлечения и конвертации веб-контента","Генерация документов Markdown из веб-источников"],"ar":["تحويل صفحات الويب إلى تنسيق Markdown للتعديل السهل","تحسين استخلاص المحتوى وتحويله تلقائيًا","توليد وثائق Markdown من مصادر قائمة على الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit user request with ''use the skill web-to-markdown'' phrase","Needs locally installed browser for web2md functionality"],"zh":["需要显式的用户请求，使用''use the skill web-to-markdown''短语","需要本地安装浏览器以实现web2md功能"],"ja":["''use the skill web-to-markdown''フレーズを使用して明示的なユーザー要求が必要","web2md機能を実現するためにローカルにブラウザをインストールする必要がある"],"ko":["''use the skill web-to-markdown'' 구문을 사용하여 명시적인 사용자 요청이 필요","web2md 기능을 구현하려면 로컬에 브라우저를 설치해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una solicitud explícita del usuario con la frase ''usar la habilidad web-to-markdown''","Necesita un navegador instalado localmente para la funcionalidad de web2md"],"fr":["Nécessite une demande explicite de l''utilisateur avec la phrase ''utiliser la compétence web-to-markdown''","Nécessite un navigateur installé localement pour la fonctionnalité de web2md"],"de":["Benötigt eine explizite Benutzeraufforderung mit dem Wortlaut ''die Fähigkeit web-to-markdown verwenden''","Benötigt einen lokal installierten Browser für die web2md-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Exige solicitação explícita do usuário com a frase ''use a habilidade web-to-markdown''","Necessita de um navegador instalado localmente para funcionalidade web2md"],"ru":["Требует явного запроса пользователя с фразой ''использовать навык web-to-markdown''","Требует локально установленного браузера для функциональности web2md"],"ar":["يتطلب طلبًا صريحًا من المستخدم مع العبارة ''استخدم مهارة الويب إلى ماركداون''","يحتاج إلى متصفح مثبت محليًا للوظيفة web2md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/naming-analyzer', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'naming-analyzer', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z', '2026-02-18T14:21:50.934Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/naming-analyzer","name":"naming-analyzer","description":{"es":"El analizador de nombres sugiere mejores nombres para variables, funciones y clases según el contexto y las convenciones.","fr":"L''analyseur de noms suggère de meilleurs noms pour les variables, fonctions et classes en fonction du contexte et des conventions.","de":"Der Namen-Analyser suggeriert bessere Namen für Variablen, Funktionen und Klassen basierend auf dem Kontext und den Konventionen.","pt":"O Analisador de Nomenclatura sugere nomes de variáveis, funções e classes mais adequados com base no contexto e convenções.","ru":"Анализатор имен предлагает более подходящие имена переменных, функций и классов на основе контекста и соглашений.","ar":"يقترح محلل التسمية أسماء متغيرات ودوال وفئات أكثر ملاءمة بناءً على السياق والاتفاقيات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Analizador de Nombres: Mejora la Claridad del Código","fr":"Analyseur de Noms: Améliorez la Clarté du Code","de":"Namen-Analyser: Verbessern Sie die Klarheit des Codes","pt":"Analisador de Nomenclatura: Melhore Nomes de Variáveis e ...","ru":"Анализатор имен: улучшите имена переменных и функций","ar":"محلل التسمية: تحسين أسماء المتغيرات والدوال","en":"naming-analyzer"},"description":{"es":"El analizador de nombres sugiere mejores nombres para variables, funciones y clases según el contexto y las convenciones.","fr":"L''analyseur de noms suggère de meilleurs noms pour les variables, fonctions et classes en fonction du contexte et des conventions.","de":"Der Namen-Analyser suggeriert bessere Namen für Variablen, Funktionen und Klassen basierend auf dem Kontext und den Konventionen.","pt":"O Analisador de Nomenclatura sugere nomes de variáveis, funções e classes mais adequados com base no contexto e convenções.","ru":"Анализатор имен предлагает более подходящие имена переменных, функций и классов на основе контекста и соглашений.","ar":"يقترح محلل التسمية أسماء متغيرات ودوال وفئات أكثر ملاءمة بناءً على السياق والاتفاقيات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Análisis de nombres existentes","Identificación de problemas de claridad","Detección de inconsistencias en la nomenclatura","Sugerencias de nombres mejorados","Soporte para variables, funciones y clases"],"fr":["Analyse des noms existants","Identification des problèmes de clarté","Détection des incohérences dans la nomination","Suggestions de noms améliorés","Prise en charge des variables, fonctions et classes"],"de":["Analyse von bestehenden Namen","Identifizierung von Klarheitsproblemen","Erkennung von Inkonsistenzen in der Benennung","Vorschläge für verbesserte Namen","Unterstützung für Variablen, Funktionen und Klassen"],"pt":["Análise de nomes existentes","Identificação de problemas de nomenclatura","Sugestão de nomes de variáveis e funções mais claros","Verificação de convenções de nomenclatura","Análise de nomes de classes e interfaces","Melhoria da legibilidade do código"],"ru":["Анализ существующих имен","Определение проблем с именами","Предложение более ясных имен переменных и функций","Проверка соглашений об именах","Анализ имен классов и интерфейсов","Улучшение читаемости кода"],"ar":["تحليل الأسماء الحالية","تحديد مشاكل التسمية","اقتراح أسماء متغيرات ودوال أكثر وضوحا","فحص اتفاقيات التسمية","تحليل أسماء الفئات والواجهات","تحسين قراءة الكود"]},"keywords":{"es":["analizador de nombres","claridad del código","convenciones de nomenclatura","mejora del código","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["analyseur de noms","clarté du code","conventions de nomination","amélioration du code","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Namen-Analyser","Klarheit des Codes","Benennungskonventionen","Code-Optimierung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["analisador de nomenclatura","nomenclatura de código","legibilidade de código","melhoria de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","programação","codificação","otimização de código"],"ru":["анализатор имен","номенклатура кода","читаемость кода","улучшение кода","инструменты разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","кодирование","оптимизация кода"],"ar":["محلل التسمية","تسمية الكود","قراءة الكود","تحسين الكود","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة","تدوين","تحسين الكود"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"naming-analyzer","description":"Suggest better variable, function, and class names based on context and conventions.","bodyPreview":"# Naming Analyzer Skill\n\nSuggest better variable, function, and class names based on context and conventions.\n\n## Instructions\n\nYou are a naming convention expert. When invoked:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Names**:\n   - Variables, constants, functions, methods\n   - Classes, interfaces, types\n   - Files and directories\n   - Database tables and columns\n   - API endpoints\n\n2. **Identify Issues**:\n   - Unclear or vague names\n   - Abbreviations that obscure meaning\n   - Inconsistent naming conventions","body":"# Naming Analyzer Skill\n\nSuggest better variable, function, and class names based on context and conventions.\n\n## Instructions\n\nYou are a naming convention expert. When invoked:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Names**:\n   - Variables, constants, functions, methods\n   - Classes, interfaces, types\n   - Files and directories\n   - Database tables and columns\n   - API endpoints\n\n2. **Identify Issues**:\n   - Unclear or vague names\n   - Abbreviations that obscure meaning\n   - Inconsistent naming conventions\n   - Misleading names (name doesn''t match behavior)\n   - Too short or too long names\n   - Hungarian notation misuse\n   - Single-letter variables outside loops\n\n3. **Check Conventions**:\n   - Language-specific conventions (camelCase, snake_case, PascalCase)\n   - Framework conventions (React components, Vue props)\n   - Project-specific patterns\n   - Industry standards\n\n4. **Provide Suggestions**:\n   - Better alternative names\n   - Reasoning for each suggestion\n   - Consistency improvements\n   - Contextual appropriateness\n\n## Naming Conventions by Language\n\n### JavaScript/TypeScript\n- Variables/functions: `camelCase`\n- Classes/interfaces: `PascalCase`\n- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`\n- Private fields: `_prefixUnderscore` or `#privateField`\n- Boolean: `is`, `has`, `can`, `should` prefixes\n\n### Python\n- Variables/functions: `snake_case`\n- Classes: `PascalCase`\n- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`\n- Private: `_prefix_underscore`\n- Boolean: `is_`, `has_`, `can_` prefixes\n\n### Java\n- Variables/methods: `camelCase`\n- Classes/interfaces: `PascalCase`\n- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`\n- Packages: `lowercase`\n\n### Go\n- Exported: `PascalCase`\n- Unexported: `camelCase`\n- Acronyms: All caps (`HTTPServer`, not `HttpServer`)\n\n## Common Naming Issues\n\n### Too Vague\n```javascript\n// ❌ Bad - Too generic\nfunction process(data) { }\nconst info = getData();\nlet temp = x;\n\n// ✓ Good - Specific and clear\nfunction processPayment(transaction) { }\nconst userProfile = getUserProfile();\nlet previousValue = x;\n```\n\n### Misleading Names\n```javascript\n// ❌ Bad - Name doesn''t match behavior\nfunction getUser(id) {\n  const user = fetchUser(id);\n  user.lastLogin = Date.now();\n  saveUser(user); // Side effect! Not just \"getting\"\n  return user;\n}\n\n// ✓ Good - Name reflects actual behavior\nfunction fetchAndUpdateUserLogin(id) {\n  const user = fetchUser(id);\n  user.lastLogin = Date.now();\n  saveUser(user);\n  return user;\n}\n```\n\n### Abbreviations\n```javascript\n// ❌ Bad - Unclear abbreviations\nconst usrCfg = loadConfig();\nfunction calcTtl(arr) { }\n\n// ✓ Good - Clear and readable\nconst userConfig = loadConfig();\nfunction calculateTotal(amounts) { }\n\n// ✓ Acceptable - Well-known abbreviations\nconst htmlElement = document.getElementById(''main'');\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL;\n```\n\n### Boolean Naming\n```javascript\n// ❌ Bad - Unclear state\nconst login = user.authenticated;\nconst status = checkUser();\n\n// ✓ Good - Clear boolean intent\nconst isLoggedIn = user.authenticated;\nconst isUserValid = checkUser();\nconst hasPermission = user.roles.includes(''admin'');\nconst canEditPost = isOwner || isAdmin;\nconst shouldShowNotification = isEnabled && hasUnread;\n```\n\n### Magic Numbers\n```javascript\n// ❌ Bad - Unnamed constants\nif (age > 18) { }\nsetTimeout(callback, 3600000);\n\n// ✓ Good - Named constants\nconst LEGAL_AGE = 18;\nconst ONE_HOUR_IN_MS = 60 * 60 * 1000;\n\nif (age > LEGAL_AGE) { }\nsetTimeout(callback, ONE_HOUR_IN_MS);\n```\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```\n@naming-analyzer\n@naming-analyzer src/\n@naming-analyzer UserService.js\n@naming-analyzer --conventions\n@naming-analyzer --fix-all\n```\n\n## Report Format\n\n```markdown\n# Naming Analysis Report\n\n## Summary\n- Items analyzed: 156\n- Issues found: 23\n- Critical: 5 (misleading names)\n- Major: 12 (unclear/vague)\n- Minor: 6 (convention violations)\n\n---\n\n## Critical Issues (5)\n\n### src/services/UserService.js:45\n**Current**: `getUser(id)`\n**Issue**: Function name implies read-only but has side effects (updates lastLogin)\n**Severity**: Critical - Misleading\n**Suggestion**: `fetchAndUpdateUserLogin(id)`\n**Reason**: Name should reflect the mutation\n\n### src/utils/helpers.js:23\n**Current**: `validate(x)`\n**Issue**: Generic parameter name, unclear what''s being validated\n**Severity**: Critical - Too vague\n**Suggestion**: `validateEmail(emailAddress)`\n**Reason**: Specific names improve clarity\n\n---\n\n## Major Issues (12)\n\n### src/components/DataList.jsx:12\n**Current**: `const d = new Date()`\n**Issue**: Single-letter variable in large scope\n**Severity**: Major\n**Suggestion**: `const currentDate = new Date()`\n**Reason**: Clarity and searchability\n\n### src/api/client.js:67\n**Current**: `function proc(data) {}`\n**Issue**: Abbreviated function name\n**Severity**: Major\n**Suggestion**: `function processApiResponse(data) {}`\n**Reason**: Full words are more readable\n\n### src/models/User.js:34\n**Current**: `user.active`\n**Issue**: Boolean property without prefix\n**Severity**: Major\n**Suggestion**: `user.isActive`\n**Reason**: Follow boolean naming convention\n\n### src/utils/format.js:89\n**Current**: `const MAX = 100`\n**Issue**: Generic constant name\n**Severity**: Major\n**Suggestion**: `const MAX_RETRY_ATTEMPTS = 100`\n**Reason**: Specific purpose is clearer\n\n---\n\n## Minor Issues (6)\n\n### src/config/settings.js:12\n**Current**: `const API_url = ''...''`\n**Issue**: Inconsistent casing (mixing UPPER and lower)\n**Severity**: Minor\n**Suggestion**: `const API_URL = ''...''` or `const apiUrl = ''...''`\n**Reason**: Consistency in convention\n\n### src/helpers/string.js:45\n**Current**: `function strToNum(s) {}`\n**Issue**: Abbreviated function and parameter\n**Severity**: Minor\n**Suggestion**: `function stringToNumber(value) {}`\n**Reason**: Clarity over brevity\n\n---\n\n## Convention Violations\n\n### Inconsistent Boolean Prefixes\n**Locations**: 8 files\n**Issue**: Mixed use of `is`, `has`, `can` vs no prefix\n**Recommendation**: Standardize on boolean prefixes\n- Use `is` for state: `isActive`, `isVisible`\n- Use `has` for possession: `hasPermission`, `hasError`\n- Use `can` for ability: `canEdit`, `canDelete`\n- Use `should` for decisions: `shouldRender`, `shouldValidate`\n\n### Mixed Naming Conventions\n**Location**: src/legacy/\n**Issue**: Mix of camelCase and snake_case in JavaScript\n**Recommendation**: Convert all to camelCase for consistency\n\n---\n\n## Suggested Renaming\n\n### High Priority (Misleading or Critical)\n1. `getUser` → `fetchAndUpdateUserLogin` (src/services/UserService.js:45)\n2. `validate` → `validateEmail` (src/utils/helpers.js:23)\n3. `process` → `processPaymentTransaction` (src/payment/processor.js:67)\n\n### Medium Priority (Clarity)\n1. `d` → `currentDate` (7 locations)\n2. `temp` → `previousValue` (4 locations)\n3. `data` → `apiResponse` or more specific (12 locations)\n4. `arr` → `items`, `values`, or more specific (8 locations)\n\n### Low Priority (Convention)\n1. `active` → `isActive` (12 locations)\n2. `error` → `hasError` (6 locations)\n3. `API_url` → `API_URL` (3 locations)\n\n---\n\n## Naming Patterns to Follow\n\n### Functions/Methods\n- Verbs: `get`, `set`, `create`, `update`, `delete`, `fetch`, `calculate`, `validate`\n- Clear action: `sendEmail()`, `parseJSON()`, `formatCurrency()`\n\n### Classes\n- Nouns: `UserService`, `PaymentProcessor`, `EmailValidator`\n- Avoid generic: Don''t use `Manager`, `Helper`, `Utility` unless necessary\n\n### Variables\n- Nouns or noun phrases: `user`, `emailAddress`, `totalAmount`\n- Descriptive: `userList` not `list`, `activeUsers` not `users2`\n\n### Constants\n- All caps with underscores: `MAX_RETRY_ATTEMPTS`, `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT`\n- Include units: `CACHE_DURATION_MS`, `MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB`\n\n### Booleans\n- Question form: `isValid`, `hasPermission`, `canEdit`\n- Affirmative: `isEnabled` not `isDisabled` (prefer positive)\n\n---\n\n## Refactoring Script\n\nWould you like me to create a refactoring script to apply these changes?\nThis will:\n1. Rename all suggested items\n2. Update all references\n3. Maintain git history\n4. Generate migration guide\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n✓ **DO**:\n- Use full words over abbreviations\n- Be specific and descriptive\n- Follow language conventions\n- Use consistent patterns\n- Make booleans obvious\n- Include units in constants\n\n✗ **DON''T**:\n- Use single letters (except in loops: i, j, k)\n- Use vague names (data, info, temp, x)\n- Mix naming conventions\n- Use misleading names\n- Over-abbreviate\n- Use Hungarian notation in modern code\n```\n\n## Naming Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs it a boolean?\n├─ Yes → Use is/has/can/should prefix\n└─ No → Is it a function?\n    ├─ Yes → Use verb phrase (action)\n    └─ No → Is it a class?\n        ├─ Yes → Use noun (PascalCase)\n        └─ No → Is it a constant?\n            ├─ Yes → Use UPPER_SNAKE_CASE\n            └─ No → Use descriptive noun (camelCase/snake_case)\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Prioritize clarity over brevity\n- Context matters (loop counters can be `i`, `j`)\n- Well-known abbreviations are okay (`html`, `api`, `url`, `id`)\n- Consistency within a project is more important than perfect naming\n- Refactor names as understanding improves\n- Use IDE rename refactoring to safely update all references\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:21:50.934Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents seeking to enhance code readability through advanced naming convention analysis.","zh":"适用于代码审查代理，旨在通过高级命名约定分析增强代码可读性。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントがコードの可読性を高めるために命名規則の分析を強化することを目指したものです。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 고급命名 규칙 분석을 통해 코드의 가독성을 향상시키는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que buscan mejorar la legibilidad del código a través de un análisis avanzado de convenciones de nomenclatura.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Révision de Code cherchant à améliorer la lisibilité du code via une analyse avancée de conventions de nommage.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die die Lesbarkeit des Codes durch eine erweiterte Namenskonventionenanalyse verbessern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que buscam melhorar a legibilidade do código por meio de análise avançada de convenções de nomenclatura.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов обзора кода, стремящихся улучшить читаемость кода посредством расширенного анализа соглашений об именах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء قيد المراجعة الذين يسعون إلى تعزيز قابلية قراءة الشفرة من خلال تحليل متقدم لاتفاقيات التسمية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and suggest improvements for variable, function, and class names based on context and conventions, utilizing techniques such as identifying unclear names, resolving abbreviations, and enforcing consistent naming conventions across files, directories, database tables, and API endpoints.","zh":"赋予代理分析和建议变量、函数和类名的改进，基于上下文和约定，利用技术如识别不清晰的名称、解析缩写和在文件、目录、数据库表和API端点中强制执行一致的命名约定。","ja":"エージェントが変数、関数、クラス名の改善を分析し、提案することを可能にします。コンテキストと規約に基づいて、不明確な名前の識別、略語の解決、ファイル、ディレクトリ、データベーステーブル、APIエンドポイント全体で一貫した命名規約の適用などの技術を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 변수, 함수 및 클래스 이름의 개선을 분석 및 제안할 수 있도록 합니다. 컨텍스트 및 규약을 기반으로하여, 불분명한 이름의 식별, 축약어의 해석 및 파일, 디렉토리, 데이터베이스 테이블 및 API 엔드포인트 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 명명 규칙을 적용하는 등 기술을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar y sugerir mejoras para los nombres de variables, funciones y clases en función del contexto y las convenciones, utilizando técnicas como la identificación de nombres poco claros, la resolución de abreviaturas y la aplicación de convenciones de nomenclatura coherentes en archivos, directorios, tablas de bases de datos y puntos de conexión de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et de suggérer des améliorations pour les noms de variables, de fonctions et de classes en fonction du contexte et des conventions, en utilisant des techniques telles que l''identification de noms peu clairs, la résolution d''abréviations et l''application de conventions de nommage cohérentes dans les fichiers, les répertoires, les tables de bases de données et les points de terminaison d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Variable-, Funktions- und Klassennamen basierend auf Kontext und Konventionen zu analysieren und Verbesserungsvorschläge zu unterbreiten, indem Techniken wie die Identifizierung unklarer Namen, die Auflösung von Abkürzungen und die Durchsetzung konsistenter Benennungskonventionen in Dateien, Verzeichnissen, Datenbanktabellen und API-Endpunkten eingesetzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e sugerir melhorias para nomes de variáveis, funções e classes com base no contexto e nas convenções, utilizando técnicas como identificar nomes não claros, resolver abreviações e aplicar convenções de nomenclatura consistentes em arquivos, diretórios, tabelas de banco de dados e pontos de extremidade de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и предлагать улучшения для имен переменных, функций и классов на основе контекста и соглашений, используя методы, такие как выявление неясных имен, решение аббревиатур и обеспечение единообразных соглашений об именах в файлах, директориях, таблицах баз данных и точках API.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل وتقديم مقترحات لتحسين أسماء المتغيرات والدالات والفئات بناءً على السياق والاتفاقيات، باستخدام تقنيات مثل تحديد الأسماء الغامضة وحل الاختصارات وتطبيق اتفاقيات التسمية المتسقة عبر الملفات والدواليق وtables قواعد البيانات ونقاط النهاية API."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing existing codebases for naming inconsistencies","Generating suggestions for clearer variable and function names","Enforcing uniform naming conventions across large projects"],"zh":["分析现有代码库中的命名不一致性","生成更清晰的变量和函数名称的建议","在大型项目中执行统一的命名约定"],"ja":["既存のコードベースの命名の一貫性を分析する","より明確な変数と関数の名前の提案を生成する","大規模なプロジェクト全体で統一された命名規約を適用する"],"ko":["기존 코드베이스의 명명 일관성을 분석하는 것","더욱 명확한 변수 및 함수 이름에 대한 제안을 생성하는 것","대규모 프로젝트 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 명명 규칙을 적용하는 것"],"es":["Analizar las bases de código existentes en busca de inconsistencias en la nomenclatura","Generar sugerencias para nombres de variables y funciones más claros","Aplicar convenciones de nomenclatura uniformes en proyectos grandes"],"fr":["Analyser les bases de code existantes à la recherche d''incohérences dans la nomenclature","Générer des suggestions pour des noms de variables et de fonctions plus clairs","Appliquer des conventions de nommage uniformes dans les grands projets"],"de":["Analyse von bestehenden Codebasen auf Namensinkonsistenzen","Erzeugen von Vorschlägen für klarere Variablen- und Funktionsnamen","Durchsetzung einheitlicher Benennungskonventionen in großen Projekten"],"pt":["Analisar bases de código existentes em busca de inconsistências de nomenclatura","Gerar sugestões para nomes de variáveis e funções mais claros","Aplicar convenções de nomenclatura uniformes em projetos grandes"],"ru":["Анализ существующих баз кода на предмет несоответствий в именах","Генерировать предложения для более четких имен переменных и функций","Применять единые соглашения об именах в крупных проектах"],"ar":["تحليل قواعد البيانات الحالية للبحث عن عدم التماثل في التسمية","توليد مقترحات لأسماء متغيرات ودالات أوضح","تطبيق اتفاقيات التسمية الموحدة في مشاريع كبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase files and directories","Limited to analyzing naming conventions and does not refactor code"],"zh":["需要访问代码库文件和目录","仅限于分析命名约定，不重构代码"],"ja":["コードベースのファイルとディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","命名規約の分析のみに限定され、コードのリファクタリングは行わない"],"ko":["코드베이스 파일 및 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요함","명명 규칙 분석만으로 제한되며, 코드 재구성은 수행하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos y directorios del código","Limitado a analizar convenciones de nomenclatura y no refactoriza el código"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers et répertoires du code","Limité à l''analyse des conventions de nommage et ne refactorise pas le code"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Code-Dateien und -Verzeichnisse","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Benennungskonventionen und refactorisiert nicht den Code"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos e diretórios da base de código","Limitado à análise de convenções de nomenclatura e não refatora o código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам и директориям базы кода","Ограничен анализом соглашений об именах и не рефакторит код"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات ودواليق قاعدة البيانات","محدود بتحليل اتفاقيات التسمية ولا يعيد هيكلة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
