트웨어 아키텍처 문서를 생성하는 과정입니다","es":"La arquitectura C4 es un enfoque para documentar la arquitectura de software de manera clara y concisa.","fr":"L''architecture C4 est une approche pour documenter l''architecture de logiciel de manière claire et concise.","de":"Die C4-Architektur ist ein Ansatz, um die Software-Architektur klar und präzise zu dokumentieren.","pt":"A arquitetura C4 é um modelo de documentação de software que ajuda a entender e comunicar a estrutura de um sistema. Ela é composta por quatro níveis de abst...","ru":"Архитектура C4 - это модель документации программного обеспечения, которая помогает понять и передать структуру системы. Она состоит из четырех уровней абстр...","ar":"هندسة C4 هي نموذج لتوثيق البرمجيات التي تساعد على فهم وهيكلة نظام. تتكون من أربعة مستويات من التجريد.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用C4模型生成软件架构文档","支持Mermaid语法","生成多级抽象的架构图","可写入markdown文件","提高代码可读性"],"ja":["C4モデルを使用してソフトウェアアーキテクチャドキュメントを生成","Mermaid構文をサポート","複数の抽象レベルでアーキテクチャ図を生成","markdownファイルに書き込むことができる","コードの可読性を向上させる"],"ko":["C4 모델을 사용하여 소프트웨어 아키텍처 문서를 생성","Mermaid 구문을 지원","다중 수준의 추상화된 아키텍처 다이어그램을 생성","markdown 파일에 작성할 수 있습니다","코드의 가독성을 향상합니다"],"es":["Generación de diagramas C4 en sintaxis Mermaid","Documentación de la arquitectura de software","Análisis del código para identificar componentes y relaciones","Creación de diagramas a diferentes niveles de abstracción","Escritura de diagramas en archivos markdown con contexto explicativo"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes C4 en syntaxe Mermaid","Documentation de l''architecture de logiciel","Analyse du code pour identifier les composants et les relations","Création de diagrammes à différents niveaux d''abstraction","Écriture de diagrammes dans des fichiers markdown avec contexte explicatif"],"de":["Erstellung von C4-Modell-Diagrammen in Mermaid-Syntax","Dokumentation der Software-Architektur","Analyse des Codebestands zur Identifizierung von Komponenten und Beziehungen","Erstellung von Diagrammen auf verschiedenen Abstraktionsebenen","Schreiben von Diagrammen in Markdown-Dateien mit erläuterndem Kontext"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas C4 em sintaxe Mermaid","Documentação de arquitetura de software em múltiplos níveis de abstração","Melhoria da colaboração e compreensão do sistema","Suporte a markdown para documentação","Análise de código para identificar componentes e relações"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм C4 в синтаксисе Mermaid","Документация программной архитектуры на нескольких уровнях абстракции","Улучшение сотрудничества и понимания системы","Поддержка markdown для документации","Анализ кода для определения компонентов и отношений"],"ar":["توليد رسومات C4 بناءً على بنية Mermaid","توثيق هندسة البرمجيات على مستويات متعددة من التجريد","تحسين التعاون وفهم النظام","دعم markdown لتوثيق","تحليل الكود لتحديد المكونات والعلاقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["C4架构","软件架构文档","Mermaid语法","代码可读性","架构图","markdown文件"],"ja":["C4アーキテクチャ","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャドキュメント","Mermaid構文","コードの可読性","アーキテクチャ図","markdownファイル"],"ko":["C4 아키텍처","소프트웨어 아키텍처 문서","Mermaid 구문","코드의 가독성","아키텍처 다이어그램","markdown 파일"],"es":["arquitectura c4","documentación de software","diagramas c4","mermaid syntax","análisis de código","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["architecture c4","documentation de logiciel","diagrammes c4","syntaxe mermaid","analyse de code","développement de logiciel"],"de":["c4-architektur","software-dokumentation","c4-modell-diagramme","mermaid-syntax","code-analyse","software-entwicklung"],"pt":["arquitetura de software","documentação de arquitetura","C4","Mermaid","desenvolvimento de software","colaboração","análise de código"],"ru":["программная архитектура","документация архитектуры","C4","Mermaid","разработка программного обеспечения","сотрудничество","анализ кода"],"ar":["هندسة البرمجيات","توثيق الهندسة","C4","Mermaid","تطوير البرمجيات","التعاون","تحليل الكود"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"c4-architecture","description":"Generate architecture documentation using C4 model Mermaid diagrams. Use when asked to create architecture diagrams, document system architecture, visualize software structure, create C4 diagrams, or generate context/container/component/deployment diagrams. Triggers include architecture diagram, C4 diagram, system context, container diagram, component diagram, deployment diagram, document architecture, visualize architecture.","bodyPreview":"# C4 Architecture Documentation\n\nGenerate software architecture documentation using C4 model diagrams in Mermaid syntax.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Understand scope** - Determine which C4 level(s) are needed based on audience\n2. **Analyze codebase** - Explore the system to identify components, containers, and relationships\n3. **Generate diagrams** - Create Mermaid C4 diagrams at appropriate abstraction levels\n4. **Document** - Write diagrams to markdown files with explanatory context\n\n## C4 Diagram Leve","body":"# C4 Architecture Documentation\n\nGenerate software architecture documentation using C4 model diagrams in Mermaid syntax.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Understand scope** - Determine which C4 level(s) are needed based on audience\n2. **Analyze codebase** - Explore the system to identify components, containers, and relationships\n3. **Generate diagrams** - Create Mermaid C4 diagrams at appropriate abstraction levels\n4. **Document** - Write diagrams to markdown files with explanatory context\n\n## C4 Diagram Levels\n\nSelect the appropriate level based on the documentation need:\n\n| Level | Diagram Type | Audience | Shows | When to Create |\n|-------|-------------|----------|-------|----------------|\n| 1 | **C4Context** | Everyone | System + external actors | Always (required) |\n| 2 | **C4Container** | Technical | Apps, databases, services | Always (required) |\n| 3 | **C4Component** | Developers | Internal components | Only if adds value |\n| 4 | **C4Deployment** | DevOps | Infrastructure nodes | For production systems |\n| - | **C4Dynamic** | Technical | Request flows (numbered) | For complex workflows |\n\n**Key Insight:** \"Context + Container diagrams are sufficient for most software development teams.\" Only create Component/Code diagrams when they genuinely add value.\n\n## Quick Start Examples\n\n### System Context (Level 1)\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n  title System Context - Workout Tracker\n\n  Person(user, \"User\", \"Tracks workouts and exercises\")\n  System(app, \"Workout Tracker\", \"Vue PWA for tracking strength and CrossFit workouts\")\n  System_Ext(browser, \"Web Browser\", \"Stores data in IndexedDB\")\n\n  Rel(user, app, \"Uses\")\n  Rel(app, browser, \"Persists data to\", \"IndexedDB\")\n```\n\n### Container Diagram (Level 2)\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n  title Container Diagram - Workout Tracker\n\n  Person(user, \"User\", \"Tracks workouts\")\n\n  Container_Boundary(app, \"Workout Tracker PWA\") {\n    Container(spa, \"SPA\", \"Vue 3, TypeScript\", \"Single-page application\")\n    Container(pinia, \"State Management\", \"Pinia\", \"Manages application state\")\n    ContainerDb(indexeddb, \"IndexedDB\", \"Dexie\", \"Local workout storage\")\n  }\n\n  Rel(user, spa, \"Uses\")\n  Rel(spa, pinia, \"Reads/writes state\")\n  Rel(pinia, indexeddb, \"Persists\", \"Dexie ORM\")\n```\n\n### Component Diagram (Level 3)\n```mermaid\nC4Component\n  title Component Diagram - Workout Feature\n\n  Container(views, \"Views\", \"Vue Router pages\")\n\n  Container_Boundary(workout, \"Workout Feature\") {\n    Component(useWorkout, \"useWorkout\", \"Composable\", \"Workout execution state\")\n    Component(useTimer, \"useTimer\", \"Composable\", \"Timer state machine\")\n    Component(workoutRepo, \"WorkoutRepository\", \"Dexie\", \"Workout persistence\")\n  }\n\n  Rel(views, useWorkout, \"Uses\")\n  Rel(useWorkout, useTimer, \"Controls\")\n  Rel(useWorkout, workoutRepo, \"Saves to\")\n```\n\n### Dynamic Diagram (Request Flow)\n```mermaid\nC4Dynamic\n  title Dynamic Diagram - User Sign In Flow\n\n  ContainerDb(db, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"User credentials\")\n  Container(spa, \"Single-Page App\", \"React\", \"Banking UI\")\n\n  Container_Boundary(api, \"API Application\") {\n    Component(signIn, \"Sign In Controller\", \"Express\", \"Auth endpoint\")\n    Component(security, \"Security Service\", \"JWT\", \"Validates credentials\")\n  }\n\n  Rel(spa, signIn, \"1. Submit credentials\", \"JSON/HTTPS\")\n  Rel(signIn, security, \"2. Validate\")\n  Rel(security, db, \"3. Query user\", \"SQL\")\n\n  UpdateRelStyle(spa, signIn, $textColor=\"blue\", $offsetY=\"-30\")\n```\n\n### Deployment Diagram\n```mermaid\nC4Deployment\n  title Deployment Diagram - Production\n\n  Deployment_Node(browser, \"Customer Browser\", \"Chrome/Firefox\") {\n    Container(spa, \"SPA\", \"React\", \"Web application\")\n  }\n\n  Deployment_Node(aws, \"AWS Cloud\", \"us-east-1\") {\n    Deployment_Node(ecs, \"ECS Cluster\", \"Fargate\") {\n      Container(api, \"API Service\", \"Node.js\", \"REST API\")\n    }\n    Deployment_Node(rds, \"RDS\", \"db.r5.large\") {\n      ContainerDb(db, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Application data\")\n    }\n  }\n\n  Rel(spa, api, \"API calls\", \"HTTPS\")\n  Rel(api, db, \"Reads/writes\", \"JDBC\")\n```\n\n## Element Syntax\n\n### People and Systems\n```\nPerson(alias, \"Label\", \"Description\")\nPerson_Ext(alias, \"Label\", \"Description\")       # External person\nSystem(alias, \"Label\", \"Description\")\nSystem_Ext(alias, \"Label\", \"Description\")       # External system\nSystemDb(alias, \"Label\", \"Description\")         # Database system\nSystemQueue(alias, \"Label\", \"Description\")      # Queue system\n```\n\n### Containers\n```\nContainer(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\nContainer_Ext(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\nContainerDb(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\nContainerQueue(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\n```\n\n### Components\n```\nComponent(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\nComponent_Ext(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\nComponentDb(alias, \"Label\", \"Technology\", \"Description\")\n```\n\n### Boundaries\n```\nEnterprise_Boundary(alias, \"Label\") { ... }\nSystem_Boundary(alias, \"Label\") { ... }\nContainer_Boundary(alias, \"Label\") { ... }\nBoundary(alias, \"Label\", \"type\") { ... }\n```\n\n### Relationships\n```\nRel(from, to, \"Label\")\nRel(from, to, \"Label\", \"Technology\")\nBiRel(from, to, \"Label\")                        # Bidirectional\nRel_U(from, to, \"Label\")                        # Upward\nRel_D(from, to, \"Label\")                        # Downward\nRel_L(from, to, \"Label\")                        # Leftward\nRel_R(from, to, \"Label\")                        # Rightward\n```\n\n### Deployment Nodes\n```\nDeployment_Node(alias, \"Label\", \"Type\", \"Description\") { ... }\nNode(alias, \"Label\", \"Type\", \"Description\") { ... }  # Shorthand\n```\n\n## Styling and Layout\n\n### Layout Configuration\n```\nUpdateLayoutConfig($c4ShapeInRow=\"3\", $c4BoundaryInRow=\"1\")\n```\n- `$c4ShapeInRow` - Number of shapes per row (default: 4)\n- `$c4BoundaryInRow` - Number of boundaries per row (default: 2)\n\n### Element Styling\n```\nUpdateElementStyle(alias, $fontColor=\"red\", $bgColor=\"grey\", $borderColor=\"red\")\n```\n\n### Relationship Styling\n```\nUpdateRelStyle(from, to, $textColor=\"blue\", $lineColor=\"blue\", $offsetX=\"5\", $offsetY=\"-10\")\n```\nUse `$offsetX` and `$offsetY` to fix overlapping relationship labels.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Essential Rules\n\n1. **Every element must have**: Name, Type, Technology (where applicable), and Description\n2. **Use unidirectional arrows only** - Bidirectional arrows create ambiguity\n3. **Label arrows with action verbs** - \"Sends email using\", \"Reads from\", not just \"uses\"\n4. **Include technology labels** - \"JSON/HTTPS\", \"JDBC\", \"gRPC\"\n5. **Stay under 20 elements per diagram** - Split complex systems into multiple diagrams\n\n### Clarity Guidelines\n\n1. **Start at Level 1** - Context diagrams help frame the system scope\n2. **One diagram per file** - Keep diagrams focused on a single abstraction level\n3. **Meaningful aliases** - Use descriptive aliases (e.g., `orderService` not `s1`)\n4. **Concise descriptions** - Keep descriptions under 50 characters when possible\n5. **Always include a title** - \"System Context diagram for [System Name]\"\n\n### What to Avoid\n\nSee [references/common-mistakes.md](references/common-mistakes.md) for detailed anti-patterns:\n- Confusing containers (deployable) vs components (non-deployable)\n- Modeling shared libraries as containers\n- Showing message brokers as single containers instead of individual topics\n- Adding undefined abstraction levels like \"subcomponents\"\n- Removing type labels to \"simplify\" diagrams\n\n## Microservices Guidelines\n\n### Single Team Ownership\nModel each microservice as a **container** (or container group):\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n  title Microservices - Single Team\n\n  System_Boundary(platform, \"E-commerce Platform\") {\n    Container(orderApi, \"Order Service\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Order processing\")\n    ContainerDb(orderDb, \"Order DB\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Order data\")\n    Container(inventoryApi, \"Inventory Service\", \"Node.js\", \"Stock management\")\n    ContainerDb(inventoryDb, \"Inventory DB\", \"MongoDB\", \"Stock data\")\n  }\n```\n\n### Multi-Team Ownership\nPromote microservices to **software systems** when owned by separate teams:\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n  title Microservices - Multi-Team\n\n  Person(customer, \"Customer\", \"Places orders\")\n  System(orderSystem, \"Order System\", \"Team Alpha\")\n  System(inventorySystem, \"Inventory System\", \"Team Beta\")\n  System(paymentSystem, \"Payment System\", \"Team Gamma\")\n\n  Rel(customer, orderSystem, \"Places orders\")\n  Rel(orderSystem, inventorySystem, \"Checks stock\")\n  Rel(orderSystem, paymentSystem, \"Processes payment\")\n```\n\n### Event-Driven Architecture\nShow individual topics/queues as containers, NOT a single \"Kafka\" box:\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n  title Event-Driven Architecture\n\n  Container(orderService, \"Order Service\", \"Java\", \"Creates orders\")\n  Container(stockService, \"Stock Service\", \"Java\", \"Manages inventory\")\n  ContainerQueue(orderTopic, \"order.created\", \"Kafka\", \"Order events\")\n  ContainerQueue(stockTopic, \"stock.reserved\", \"Kafka\", \"Stock events\")\n\n  Rel(orderService, orderTopic, \"Publishes to\")\n  Rel(stockService, orderTopic, \"Subscribes to\")\n  Rel(stockService, stockTopic, \"Publishes to\")\n  Rel(orderService, stockTopic, \"Subscribes to\")\n```\n\n## Output Location\n\nWrite architecture documentation to `docs/architecture/` with naming convention:\n- `c4-context.md` - System context diagram\n- `c4-containers.md` - Container diagram\n- `c4-components-{feature}.md` - Component diagrams per feature\n- `c4-deployment.md` - Deployment diagram\n- `c4-dynamic-{flow}.md` - Dynamic diagrams for specific flows\n\n## Audience-Appropriate Detail\n\n| Audience | Recommended Diagrams |\n|----------|---------------------|\n| Executives | System Context only |\n| Product Managers | Context + Container |\n| Architects | Context + Container + key Components |\n| Developers | All levels as needed |\n| DevOps | Container + Deployment |\n\n## References\n\n- [references/c4-syntax.md](references/c4-syntax.md) - Complete Mermaid C4 syntax\n- [references/common-mistakes.md](references/common-mistakes.md) - Anti-patterns to avoid\n- [references/advanced-patterns.md](references/advanced-patterns.md) - Microservices, event-driven, deployment\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:21:34.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents requiring advanced documentation capabilities using C4 model diagrams in Mermaid syntax.","zh":"适用于需要使用 C4 模型图和 Mermaid 语法的高级文档功能的技术写作代理","ja":"C4 モデル図と Mermaid 構文を使用した高度なドキュメント機能を必要とするテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"C4 모델 다이어그램 및 Mermaid 구문을 사용하는 고급 문서 기능을 필요로 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que requieren capacidades de documentación avanzadas utilizando diagramas del modelo C4 en sintaxis Mermaid.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de rédaction technique nécessitant des capacités de documentation avancées utilisant des diagrammes de modèle C4 en syntaxe Mermaid.","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten, die erweiterte Dokumentationsfunktionen unter Verwendung von C4-Modell-Diagrammen in Mermaid-Syntax erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que exigem capacidades de documentação avançadas usando diagramas de modelo C4 em sintaxe Mermaid.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технического написания, требующих передовых возможностей документирования с использованием диаграмм модели C4 в синтаксисе Mermaid.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذي يتطلب إمكانات توثيق متقدمة باستخدام مخططات نموذج C4 في بناء جملة Mermaid."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive software architecture documentation at multiple abstraction levels, utilizing Mermaid C4 diagrams and markdown files for explanatory context, thereby enhancing audience understanding based on scope and codebase analysis.","zh":"能够赋予代理生成全面的软件架构文档，支持多个抽象级别，利用 Mermaid C4 图和 markdown 文件提供解释性上下文，从而根据范围和代码库分析增强受众的理解","ja":"エージェントが Mermaid C4 図と Markdown ファイルを使用して、範囲とコードベースの分析に基づいてオーディエンスの理解を高める複数の抽象レベルで包括的なソフトウェアアーキテクチャドキュメントを生成できるようにする","ko":"Mermaid C4 다이어그램 및 markdown 파일을 사용하여 여러 추상화 수준에서 포괄적인 소프트웨어 아키텍처 문서를 생성하여 범위 및 코드베이스 분석을 기반으로 청중의 이해를 향상시킬 수 있도록 에이전트를 능력화 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación de arquitectura de software integral en varios niveles de abstracción, utilizando diagramas C4 de Mermaid y archivos de markdown para contexto explicativo, mejorando así la comprensión del público en función del alcance y el análisis del código base.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation d''architecture logicielle complète à plusieurs niveaux d''abstraction, en utilisant des diagrammes C4 Mermaid et des fichiers markdown pour un contexte explicatif, améliorant ainsi la compréhension du public en fonction de la portée et de l''analyse du code base.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Software-Architektur-Dokumentationen auf mehreren Abstraktionsebenen zu erstellen, indem Mermaid-C4-Diagramme und Markdown-Dateien für erläuternden Kontext verwendet werden, wodurch das Verständnis des Publikums basierend auf dem Umfang und der Analyse der Codebasis verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentação abrangente de arquitetura de software em vários níveis de abstração, utilizando diagramas C4 do Mermaid e arquivos markdown para contexto explicativo, melhorando assim a compreensão do público com base na análise de escopo e código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать всестороннюю документацию по архитектуре программного обеспечения на нескольких уровнях абстракции, используя диаграммы C4 Mermaid и файлы markdown для объяснительного контекста, тем самым улучшая понимание аудитории на основе анализа объема и базы кода.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توليد توثيق شامل للهندسة المعمارية للبرمجيات على مستويات абستракة متعددة، باستخدام مخططات C4 من Mermaid وملفات markdown للسياق التوضيحي، وبالتالي تعزيز فهم الجمهور بناءً على تحليل النطاق وقاعدة الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating system context diagrams","Creating container diagrams for complex systems","Developing component diagrams for detailed analysis"],"zh":["生成系统上下文图","为复杂系统创建容器图","开发组件图以进行详细分析"],"ja":["システムコンテキスト図を生成する","複雑なシステムのコンテナ図を作成する","詳細分析のためのコンポーネント図を開発する"],"ko":["시스템 컨텍스트 다이어그램 생성","복잡한 시스템의 컨테이너 다이어그램 생성","세부 분석을 위한 구성 요소 다이어그램 개발"],"es":["Generar diagramas de contexto del sistema","Crear diagramas de contenedores para sistemas complejos","Desarrollar diagramas de componentes para análisis detallados"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes de contexte du système","Créer des diagrammes de conteneurs pour des systèmes complexes","Développer des diagrammes de composants pour une analyse détaillée"],"de":["Systemkontextdiagramme generieren","Containerdiagramme für komplexe Systeme erstellen","Komponentendiagramme für detaillierte Analysen entwickeln"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas de contexto do sistema","Criação de diagramas de contêiner para sistemas complexos","Desenvolvimento de diagramas de componentes para análise detalhada"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм контекста системы","Создание диаграмм контейнеров для сложных систем","Разработка диаграмм компонентов для детального анализа"],"ar":["توليد مخططات سياق النظام","إنشاء مخططات حاويات لأنظمة معقدة","تطوير مخططات المكونات لأغراض التحليل المفصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of C4 model levels","Mermaid syntax knowledge necessary","Limited to software architecture documentation"],"zh":["需要理解 C4 模型级别","需要 Mermaid 语法知识","仅限于软件架构文档"],"ja":["C4 モデルレベルの理解が必要","Mermaid 構文の知識が必要","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャドキュメントのみ"],"ko":["C4 모델 수준 이해 필요","Mermaid 구문 지식 필요","소프트웨어 아키텍처 문서만 해당"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los niveles del modelo C4","Conocimiento de la sintaxis Mermaid es necesario","Limitado a la documentación de la arquitectura de software"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des niveaux du modèle C4","Connaissances de la syntaxe Mermaid sont nécessaires","Limité à la documentation de l''architecture logicielle"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der C4-Modell-Ebenen","Mermaid-Syntax-Kenntnisse sind erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Dokumentation der Software-Architektur"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos níveis do modelo C4","Conhecimento da sintaxe Mermaid necessário","Limitado à documentação de arquitetura de software"],"ru":["Требует понимания уровней модели C4","Необходимо знание синтаксиса Mermaid","Ограничен документацией архитектуры программного обеспечения"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مستويات نموذج C4","مطلوب معرفة بناء جملة Mermaid","محدود بتوثيق هندسة البرمجيات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/content-strategy', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'content-strategy', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z', '2026-02-18T14:22:02.561Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/content-strategy","name":"content-strategy","description":{"zh":"内容策略是指规划能够驱动流量、建立权威和生成潜在客户的内容。它涉及了解目标受众、创建高质量内容和优化内容以提高可搜索性和可分享性","ja":"コンテンツ戦略とは、トラフィックを増やし、権威を確立し、潜在的な顧客を獲得するためのコンテンツを計画することです。ターゲットオーディエンスを理解し、高品質のコンテンツを作成し、コンテンツを最適化して検索性と共有性を高めることが含まれます","ko":"콘텐츠 전략은 트래픽을 증가시키고 권위를 확립하고 잠재 고객을 유치하는 콘텐츠를 계획하는 것을 의미합니다. 대상 受众를 이해하고 고품질의 콘텐츠를 생성하고 콘텐츠를 최적화하여 검색 가능성과 공유 가능성을 높이는 것이 포함됩니다","es":"La estrategia de contenido es crucial para atraer tráfico y generar leads. Aprende a planificar contenido efectivo.","fr":"La stratégie de contenu est essentielle pour attirer du trafic et générer des leads. Découvrez comment planifier du contenu efficace.","de":"Die Inhaltsstrategie ist entscheidend für die Anziehung von Verkehr und die Generierung von Leads. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Inhalte planen.","pt":"Desenvolva uma estratégia de conteúdo que impulsiona o tráfego e gera leads. Aprenda a criar conteúdo de qualidade que é compartilhado e encontrado","ru":"Разработайте стратегию контента, которая привлекает трафик и генерирует лиды. Узнайте, как создавать качественный контент, который делится и находит","ar":"قم بتطوير استراتيجية محتوى تزيد من حركة المرور وتوليد Leads. تعلم كيفية إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة يشاركه ويتم العثور عليه","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"内容策略 Content Strategy","ja":"コンテンツ戦略 Content Strategy","ko":"콘텐츠 전략 Content Strategy","es":"Estrategia de Contenido para Desarrolladores","fr":"Stratégie de Contenu pour les Développeurs","de":"Inhaltsstrategie für Entwickler","pt":"Estratégia de Conteúdo para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Стратегия контента для разработчиков","ar":"استراتيجية المحتوى للמطورين","en":"content-strategy"},"description":{"zh":"内容策略是指规划能够驱动流量、建立权威和生成潜在客户的内容。它涉及了解目标受众、创建高质量内容和优化内容以提高可搜索性和可分享性","ja":"コンテンツ戦略とは、トラフィックを増やし、権威を確立し、潜在的な顧客を獲得するためのコンテンツを計画することです。ターゲットオーディエンスを理解し、高品質のコンテンツを作成し、コンテンツを最適化して検索性と共有性を高めることが含まれます","ko":"콘텐츠 전략은 트래픽을 증가시키고 권위를 확립하고 잠재 고객을 유치하는 콘텐츠를 계획하는 것을 의미합니다. 대상 受众를 이해하고 고품질의 콘텐츠를 생성하고 콘텐츠를 최적화하여 검색 가능성과 공유 가능성을 높이는 것이 포함됩니다","es":"La estrategia de contenido es crucial para atraer tráfico y generar leads. Aprende a planificar contenido efectivo.","fr":"La stratégie de contenu est essentielle pour attirer du trafic et générer des leads. Découvrez comment planifier du contenu efficace.","de":"Die Inhaltsstrategie ist entscheidend für die Anziehung von Verkehr und die Generierung von Leads. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Inhalte planen.","pt":"Desenvolva uma estratégia de conteúdo que impulsiona o tráfego e gera leads. Aprenda a criar conteúdo de qualidade que é compartilhado e encontrado","ru":"Разработайте стратегию контента, которая привлекает трафик и генерирует лиды. Узнайте, как создавать качественный контент, который делится и находит","ar":"قم بتطوير استراتيجية محتوى تزيد من حركة المرور وتوليد Leads. تعلم كيفية إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة يشاركه ويتم العثور عليه","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["目标受众分析","内容规划","搜索引擎优化","内容创作","内容分发"],"ja":["ターゲットオーディエンス分析","コンテンツ計画","検索エンジン最適化","コンテンツ作成","コンテンツ配信"],"ko":["대상 受众 분석","콘텐츠 계획","검색 엔진 최적화","콘텐츠 생성","콘텐츠 배포"],"es":["Planificación de contenido personalizado","Análisis de tendencias y competidores","Creación de contenido atractivo y compartible","Optimización para motores de búsqueda","Medición y análisis de resultados"],"fr":["Planification de contenu personnalisé","Analyse des tendances et des concurrents","Création de contenu attractif et partageable","Optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche","Mesure et analyse des résultats"],"de":["Individuelle Inhaltsplanung","Trend- und Wettbewerbsanalyse","Erstellung von ansprechendem und teilem Inhalt","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Messung und Analyse der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Análise de necessidades de negócios","Definição de público-alvo","Criação de calendário de conteúdo","Otimização para motores de busca","Análise de desempenho do conteúdo"],"ru":["Анализ бизнес-потребностей","Определение целевой аудитории","Создание календаря контента","Оптимизация для поисковых систем","Анализ производительности контента"],"ar":["تحليل احتياجات الأعمال","تحديد الجمهور المستهدف","إنشاء تقويم المحتوى","تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل أداء المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["内容策略","内容营销","搜索引擎优化","目标受众分析","内容创作","内容分发"],"ja":["コンテンツ戦略","コンテンツマーケティング","検索エンジン最適化","ターゲットオーディエンス分析","コンテンツ作成","コンテンツ配信"],"ko":["콘텐츠 전략","콘텐츠 마케팅","검색 엔진 최적화","대상 受众 분석","콘텐츠 생성","콘텐츠 배포"],"es":["estrategia de contenido","planificación de contenido","contenido personalizado","análisis de tendencias","optimización para motores de búsqueda","medición de resultados"],"fr":["stratégie de contenu","planification de contenu","contenu personnalisé","analyse des tendances","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche","mesure des résultats"],"de":["Inhaltsstrategie","Inhaltsplanung","individueller Inhalt","Trendanalyse","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Ergebnismessung"],"pt":["estratégia de conteúdo","desenvolvimento de conteúdo","marketing de conteúdo","otimização para seo","análise de desempenho","calendário de conteúdo"],"ru":["стратегия контента","разработка контента","маркетинг контента","оптимизация для поисковых систем","анализ производительности","календарь контента"],"ar":["استراتيجية المحتوى","تطوير المحتوى","تسويق المحتوى","تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل الأداء","تقويم المحتوى"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-strategy","description":"When the user wants to plan a content strategy, decide what content to create, or figure out what topics to cover. Also use when the user mentions content strategy, what should I write about, content ideas, blog strategy, topic clusters, or content planning. For writing individual pieces, see copywriting. For SEO-specific audits, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Content Strategy\n\nYou are a content strategist. Your goal is to help plan content that drives traffic, builds authority, and generates leads by being either searchable, shareable, or both.\n\n## Before Planning\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Business Conte","body":"# Content Strategy\n\nYou are a content strategist. Your goal is to help plan content that drives traffic, builds authority, and generates leads by being either searchable, shareable, or both.\n\n## Before Planning\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Business Context\n- What does the company do?\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What''s the primary goal for content? (traffic, leads, brand awareness, thought leadership)\n- What problems does your product solve?\n\n### 2. Customer Research\n- What questions do customers ask before buying?\n- What objections come up in sales calls?\n- What topics appear repeatedly in support tickets?\n- What language do customers use to describe their problems?\n\n### 3. Current State\n- Do you have existing content? What''s working?\n- What resources do you have? (writers, budget, time)\n- What content formats can you produce? (written, video, audio)\n\n### 4. Competitive Landscape\n- Who are your main competitors?\n- What content gaps exist in your market?\n\n---\n\n## Searchable vs Shareable\n\nEvery piece of content must be searchable, shareable, or both. Prioritize in that order—search traffic is the foundation.\n\n**Searchable content** captures existing demand. Optimized for people actively looking for answers.\n\n**Shareable content** creates demand. Spreads ideas and gets people talking.\n\n### When Writing Searchable Content\n\n- Target a specific keyword or question\n- Match search intent exactly—answer what the searcher wants\n- Use clear titles that match search queries\n- Structure with headings that mirror search patterns\n- Place keywords in title, headings, first paragraph, URL\n- Provide comprehensive coverage (don''t leave questions unanswered)\n- Include data, examples, and links to authoritative sources\n- Optimize for AI/LLM discovery: clear positioning, structured content, brand consistency across the web\n\n### When Writing Shareable Content\n\n- Lead with a novel insight, original data, or counterintuitive take\n- Challenge conventional wisdom with well-reasoned arguments\n- Tell stories that make people feel something\n- Create content people want to share to look smart or help others\n- Connect to current trends or emerging problems\n- Share vulnerable, honest experiences others can learn from\n\n---\n\n## Content Types\n\n### Searchable Content Types\n\n**Use-Case Content**\nFormula: [persona] + [use-case]. Targets long-tail keywords.\n- \"Project management for designers\"\n- \"Task tracking for developers\"\n- \"Client collaboration for freelancers\"\n\n**Hub and Spoke**\nHub = comprehensive overview. Spokes = related subtopics.\n```\n/topic (hub)\n├── /topic/subtopic-1 (spoke)\n├── /topic/subtopic-2 (spoke)\n└── /topic/subtopic-3 (spoke)\n```\nCreate hub first, then build spokes. Interlink strategically.\n\n**Note:** Most content works fine under `/blog`. Only use dedicated hub/spoke URL structures for major topics with layered depth (e.g., Atlassian''s `/agile` guide). For typical blog posts, `/blog/post-title` is sufficient.\n\n**Template Libraries**\nHigh-intent keywords + product adoption.\n- Target searches like \"marketing plan template\"\n- Provide immediate standalone value\n- Show how product enhances the template\n\n### Shareable Content Types\n\n**Thought Leadership**\n- Articulate concepts everyone feels but hasn''t named\n- Challenge conventional wisdom with evidence\n- Share vulnerable, honest experiences\n\n**Data-Driven Content**\n- Product data analysis (anonymized insights)\n- Public data analysis (uncover patterns)\n- Original research (run experiments, share results)\n\n**Expert Roundups**\n15-30 experts answering one specific question. Built-in distribution.\n\n**Case Studies**\nStructure: Challenge → Solution → Results → Key learnings\n\n**Meta Content**\nBehind-the-scenes transparency. \"How We Got Our First $5k MRR,\" \"Why We Chose Debt Over VC.\"\n\nFor programmatic content at scale, see **programmatic-seo** skill.\n\n---\n\n## Content Pillars and Topic Clusters\n\nContent pillars are the 3-5 core topics your brand will own. Each pillar spawns a cluster of related content.\n\nMost of the time, all content can live under `/blog` with good internal linking between related posts. Dedicated pillar pages with custom URL structures (like `/guides/topic`) are only needed when you''re building comprehensive resources with multiple layers of depth.\n\n### How to Identify Pillars\n\n1. **Product-led**: What problems does your product solve?\n2. **Audience-led**: What does your ICP need to learn?\n3. **Search-led**: What topics have volume in your space?\n4. **Competitor-led**: What are competitors ranking for?\n\n### Pillar Structure\n\n```\nPillar Topic (Hub)\n├── Subtopic Cluster 1\n│   ├── Article A\n│   ├── Article B\n│   └── Article C\n├── Subtopic Cluster 2\n│   ├── Article D\n│   ├── Article E\n│   └── Article F\n└── Subtopic Cluster 3\n    ├── Article G\n    ├── Article H\n    └── Article I\n```\n\n### Pillar Criteria\n\nGood pillars should:\n- Align with your product/service\n- Match what your audience cares about\n- Have search volume and/or social interest\n- Be broad enough for many subtopics\n\n---\n\n## Keyword Research by Buyer Stage\n\nMap topics to the buyer''s journey using proven keyword modifiers:\n\n### Awareness Stage\nModifiers: \"what is,\" \"how to,\" \"guide to,\" \"introduction to\"\n\nExample: If customers ask about project management basics:\n- \"What is Agile Project Management\"\n- \"Guide to Sprint Planning\"\n- \"How to Run a Standup Meeting\"\n\n### Consideration Stage\nModifiers: \"best,\" \"top,\" \"vs,\" \"alternatives,\" \"comparison\"\n\nExample: If customers evaluate multiple tools:\n- \"Best Project Management Tools for Remote Teams\"\n- \"Asana vs Trello vs Monday\"\n- \"Basecamp Alternatives\"\n\n### Decision Stage\nModifiers: \"pricing,\" \"reviews,\" \"demo,\" \"trial,\" \"buy\"\n\nExample: If pricing comes up in sales calls:\n- \"Project Management Tool Pricing Comparison\"\n- \"How to Choose the Right Plan\"\n- \"[Product] Reviews\"\n\n### Implementation Stage\nModifiers: \"templates,\" \"examples,\" \"tutorial,\" \"how to use,\" \"setup\"\n\nExample: If support tickets show implementation struggles:\n- \"Project Template Library\"\n- \"Step-by-Step Setup Tutorial\"\n- \"How to Use [Feature]\"\n\n---\n\n## Content Ideation Sources\n\n### 1. Keyword Data\n\nIf user provides keyword exports (Ahrefs, SEMrush, GSC), analyze for:\n- Topic clusters (group related keywords)\n- Buyer stage (awareness/consideration/decision/implementation)\n- Search intent (informational, commercial, transactional)\n- Quick wins (low competition + decent volume + high relevance)\n- Content gaps (keywords competitors rank for that you don''t)\n\nOutput as prioritized table:\n| Keyword | Volume | Difficulty | Buyer Stage | Content Type | Priority |\n\n### 2. Call Transcripts\n\nIf user provides sales or customer call transcripts, extract:\n- Questions asked → FAQ content or blog posts\n- Pain points → problems in their own words\n- Objections → content to address proactively\n- Language patterns → exact phrases to use (voice of customer)\n- Competitor mentions → what they compared you to\n\nOutput content ideas with supporting quotes.\n\n### 3. Survey Responses\n\nIf user provides survey data, mine for:\n- Open-ended responses (topics and language)\n- Common themes (30%+ mention = high priority)\n- Resource requests (what they wish existed)\n- Content preferences (formats they want)\n\n### 4. Forum Research\n\nUse web search to find content ideas:\n\n**Reddit:** `site:reddit.com [topic]`\n- Top posts in relevant subreddits\n- Questions and frustrations in comments\n- Upvoted answers (validates what resonates)\n\n**Quora:** `site:quora.com [topic]`\n- Most-followed questions\n- Highly upvoted answers\n\n**Other:** Indie Hackers, Hacker News, Product Hunt, industry Slack/Discord\n\nExtract: FAQs, misconceptions, debates, problems being solved, terminology used.\n\n### 5. Competitor Analysis\n\nUse web search to analyze competitor content:\n\n**Find their content:** `site:competitor.com/blog`\n\n**Analyze:**\n- Top-performing posts (comments, shares)\n- Topics covered repeatedly\n- Gaps they haven''t covered\n- Case studies (customer problems, use cases, results)\n- Content structure (pillars, categories, formats)\n\n**Identify opportunities:**\n- Topics you can cover better\n- Angles they''re missing\n- Outdated content to improve on\n\n### 6. Sales and Support Input\n\nExtract from customer-facing teams:\n- Common objections\n- Repeated questions\n- Support ticket patterns\n- Success stories\n- Feature requests and underlying problems\n\n---\n\n## Prioritizing Content Ideas\n\nScore each idea on four factors:\n\n### 1. Customer Impact (40%)\n- How frequently did this topic come up in research?\n- What percentage of customers face this challenge?\n- How emotionally charged was this pain point?\n- What''s the potential LTV of customers with this need?\n\n### 2. Content-Market Fit (30%)\n- Does this align with problems your product solves?\n- Can you offer unique insights from customer research?\n- Do you have customer stories to support this?\n- Will this naturally lead to product interest?\n\n### 3. Search Potential (20%)\n- What''s the monthly search volume?\n- How competitive is this topic?\n- Are there related long-tail opportunities?\n- Is search interest growing or declining?\n\n### 4. Resource Requirements (10%)\n- Do you have expertise to create authoritative content?\n- What additional research is needed?\n- What assets (graphics, data, examples) will you need?\n\n### Scoring Template\n\n| Idea | Customer Impact (40%) | Content-Market Fit (30%) | Search Potential (20%) | Resources (10%) | Total |\n|------|----------------------|-------------------------|----------------------|-----------------|-------|\n| Topic A | 8 | 9 | 7 | 6 | 8.0 |\n| Topic B | 6 | 7 | 9 | 8 | 7.1 |\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen creating a content strategy, provide:\n\n### 1. Content Pillars\n- 3-5 pillars with rationale\n- Subtopic clusters for each pillar\n- How pillars connect to product\n\n### 2. Priority Topics\nFor each recommended piece:\n- Topic/title\n- Searchable, shareable, or both\n- Content type (use-case, hub/spoke, thought leadership, etc.)\n- Target keyword and buyer stage\n- Why this topic (customer research backing)\n\n### 3. Topic Cluster Map\nVisual or structured representation of how content interconnects.\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What patterns emerge from your last 10 customer conversations?\n2. What questions keep coming up in sales calls?\n3. Where are competitors'' content efforts falling short?\n4. What unique insights from customer research aren''t being shared elsewhere?\n5. Which existing content drives the most conversions, and why?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For writing individual content pieces\n- **seo-audit**: For technical SEO and on-page optimization\n- **programmatic-seo**: For scaled content generation\n- **email-sequence**: For email-based content\n- **social-content**: For social media content\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:22:02.561Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing advanced content planning and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级内容规划和优化能力的语言代理。","ja":"高度なコンテンツ計画と最適化機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 콘텐츠 계획 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de lenguaje que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de planificación y optimización de contenidos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents linguistiques ayant besoin de capacités avancées de planification et d''optimisation de contenu.","de":"Perfekt für Sprach-Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Inhaltsplanung und -optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de planejamento e otimização de conteúdo.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности планирования и оптимизации контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتخطيط والتحسين للمحتوى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to drive traffic, build authority, and generate leads by creating searchable and shareable content using product marketing context and .md files.","zh":"赋予代理创建可搜索和可分享的内容的能力，利用产品营销背景和 .md 文件来驱动流量、建立权威和产生潜在客户。","ja":"製品マーケティングのコンテキストと .md ファイルを使用して、検索可能で共有可能なコンテンツを作成することで、エージェントはトラフィックを駆動し、権威を築き、リードを生成することができます。","ko":"제품 마케팅 맥락과 .md 파일을 사용하여 검색 가능하고 공유 가능한 콘텐츠를 생성하여 에이전트가 트래픽을 유도하고 권위를 구축하고 리드를 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes impulsar el tráfico, construir autoridad y generar leads mediante la creación de contenido buscable y compartible utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y archivos .md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du trafic, d''établir une autorité et de générer des prospects en créant du contenu consultable et partageable à l''aide du contexte marketing produit et de fichiers .md.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten, Verkehr zu treiben, Autorität aufzubauen und Leads zu generieren, indem suchbarer und teilbarer Inhalt unter Verwendung von Produktmarketing-Kontext und .md-Dateien erstellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impulsionar o tráfego, construir autoridade e gerar leads criando conteúdo pesquisável e compartilhável usando o contexto de marketing de produtos e arquivos .md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью привлекать трафик, строить авторитет и генерировать лиды, создавая поисковый и общедоступный контент с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта и файлов .md.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من دفع Movement، بناء السلطة وتوليد العلامات التجارية من خلال إنشاء محتوى قابل للبحث وقابل للمشاركة باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وملفات .md."},"useCases":{"en":["Planning content marketing campaigns","Generating shareable content previews","Optimizing content for search engine ranking"],"zh":["规划内容营销活动","生成可分享的内容预览","优化内容以提高搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["コンテンツマーケティングキャンペーンの計画","共有可能なコンテンツプレビューの生成","検索エンジンランキングの向上を目的としたコンテンツの最適化"],"ko":["콘텐츠 마케팅 캠페인 계획","공유 가능한 콘텐츠 미리 보기 생성","검색 엔진 순위 최적화를 위한 콘텐츠 최적화"],"es":["Planificación de campañas de marketing de contenidos","Generación de vistas previas de contenido compartible","Optimización de contenido para el posicionamiento en motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Planification de campagnes de marketing de contenu","Génération d''aperçus de contenu partageables","Optimisation du contenu pour le classement dans les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Planung von Content-Marketing-Kampagnen","Erstellung von teilbaren Inhaltsvorschauen","Optimierung von Inhalten für die Suchmaschinenplatzierung"],"pt":["Planejamento de campanhas de marketing de conteúdo","Geração de pré-visualizações de conteúdo compartilhável","Otimização de conteúdo para classificação de mecanismos de busca"],"ru":["Планирование кампаний по маркетингу контента","Генерация предварительных просмотров общедоступного контента","Оптимизация контента для поисковой системы"],"ar":["تخطيط حملات تسويق المحتوى","توليد معاينة للمحتوى القابل للمشاركة","تحسين المحتوى لترتيب محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limited to text-based content planning"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景文件 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","仅限于基于文本的内容规划"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイル (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) が必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ計画に限定される"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 맥락 파일 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) 필요","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 계획에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere archivo de contexto de marketing de producto (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limitado a la planificación de contenido basado en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte marketing produit (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limité à la planification de contenu textuel"],"de":["Erfordert Produktmarketing-Kontextdatei (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Beschränkt auf textbasierte Inhaltsplanung"],"pt":["Requer arquivo de contexto de marketing de produtos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limitado ao planejamento de conteúdo baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требуется файл контекста маркетинга продукта (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Ограничен планированием контента на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف سياق تسويق المنتج (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","محدود بالتخطيط للمحتوى القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
