contenu éducatif","Créez des plans concrets et shippables","Aide à décomposer les grandes idées en étapes petites","Permet la création de cycles d''action Ship-Learn-Next"],"de":["Wandelt passives Lerncontent in Aktionspläne um","Extrahiert Implementierungsschritte aus Bildungsinhalten","Erstellt konkrete und shippbare Pläne","Hilft bei der Zerlegung großer Ideen in kleine Schritte","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Aktionszyklen Ship-Learn-Next"],"pt":["Transformação de conteúdo de aprendizado passivo em ciclos de ação","Extração de etapas de implementação de conteúdo educacional","Criação de planos de ação concretos a partir de conselhos e lições","Divisão de ideias grandes em pequenas e gerenciáveis","Ajuda na implementação de projetos reais","Melhoria da eficiência no desenvolvimento de projetos"],"ru":["Преобразование пассивного обучающего контента в циклы действий","Извлечение этапов реализации из образовательного контента","Создание конкретных планов действий из советов и уроков","Разделение больших идей на pequeñas и управляемые","Помощь в реализации реальных проектов","Улучшение эффективности в разработке проектов"],"ar":["تحويل المحتوى التعليمي السلبي إلى دورات عمل ملموسة","استخراج خطوات التنفيذ من المحتوى التعليمي","إنشاء خطط عمل ملموسة من النصائح والدروس","تقسيم الأفكار الكبيرة إلى صغيرة وقابلة للإدارة","مساعدة في تنفيذ المشاريع الفعلية","تحسين الكفاءة في تطوير المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ship-Learn-Next 技术","开发效率","被动学习内容","可执行计划","开发者工具","教育技术"],"ja":["Ship-Learn-Next スキル","開発効率","アドバイス","実践可能な計画","開発ツール","教育技術"],"ko":["Ship-Learn-Next 개발 기술","개발자 효율성","교육 콘텐츠","구체적인 계획","개발자 도구","교육 기술"],"es":["Ship-Learn-Next","planificación de acciones","contenido de aprendizaje","ciclos de acción","implementación de planes","desarrollo de software","aprendizaje activo"],"fr":["Ship-Learn-Next","planification d''actions","contenu d''apprentissage","cycles d''action","mise en œuvre de plans","développement de logiciels","apprentissage actif"],"de":["Ship-Learn-Next","Aktionsplanung","Lerncontent","Aktionszyklen","Implementierung von Plänen","Softwareentwicklung","aktives Lernen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de projetos","aprendizado ativo","ciclos de ação","planejamento de ações","implementação de projetos","eficiência no desenvolvimento"," Ship-Learn-Next","transformação de conteúdo","extração de etapas"],"ru":["разработка проектов","активное обучение","циклы действий","планирование действий","реализация проектов","эфективность в разработке","Ship-Learn-Next","преобразование контента","извлечение этапов"],"ar":["تطوير المشاريع","التعلم النشط","دورات العمل","تخطيط الإجراءات","تنفيذ المشاريع","الكفاءة في التطوير","Ship-Learn-Next","تحويل المحتوى","استخراج خطوات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ship-learn-next","description":"Transform learning content (like YouTube transcripts, articles, tutorials) into actionable implementation plans using the Ship-Learn-Next framework. Use when user wants to turn advice, lessons, or educational content into concrete action steps, reps, or a learning quest.","bodyPreview":"# Ship-Learn-Next Action Planner\n\nThis skill helps transform passive learning content into actionable **Ship-Learn-Next cycles** - turning advice and lessons into concrete, shippable iterations.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when the user:\n- Has a transcript/article/tutorial and wants to \"implement the advice\"\n- Asks to \"turn this into a plan\" or \"make this actionable\"\n- Wants to extract implementation steps from educational content\n- Needs help breaking down big ideas into small, shippab","body":"# Ship-Learn-Next Action Planner\n\nThis skill helps transform passive learning content into actionable **Ship-Learn-Next cycles** - turning advice and lessons into concrete, shippable iterations.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when the user:\n- Has a transcript/article/tutorial and wants to \"implement the advice\"\n- Asks to \"turn this into a plan\" or \"make this actionable\"\n- Wants to extract implementation steps from educational content\n- Needs help breaking down big ideas into small, shippable reps\n- Says things like \"I watched/read X, now what should I do?\"\n\n## Core Framework: Ship-Learn-Next\n\nEvery learning quest follows three repeating phases:\n\n1. **SHIP** - Create something real (code, content, product, demonstration)\n2. **LEARN** - Honest reflection on what happened\n3. **NEXT** - Plan the next iteration based on learnings\n\n**Key principle**: 100 reps beats 100 hours of study. Learning = doing better, not knowing more.\n\n## How This Skill Works\n\n### Step 1: Read the Content\n\nRead the file the user provides (transcript, article, notes):\n\n```bash\n# User provides path to file\nFILE_PATH=\"/path/to/content.txt\"\n```\n\nUse the Read tool to analyze the content.\n\n### Step 2: Extract Core Lessons\n\nIdentify from the content:\n- **Main advice/lessons**: What are the key takeaways?\n- **Actionable principles**: What can actually be practiced?\n- **Skills being taught**: What would someone learn by doing this?\n- **Examples/case studies**: Real implementations mentioned\n\n**Do NOT**:\n- Summarize everything (focus on actionable parts)\n- List theory without application\n- Include \"nice to know\" vs \"need to practice\"\n\n### Step 3: Define the Quest\n\nHelp the user frame their learning goal:\n\nAsk:\n1. \"Based on this content, what do you want to achieve in 4-8 weeks?\"\n2. \"What would success look like? (Be specific)\"\n3. \"What''s something concrete you could build/create/ship?\"\n\n**Example good quest**: \"Ship 10 cold outreach messages and get 2 responses\"\n**Example bad quest**: \"Learn about sales\" (too vague)\n\n### Step 4: Design Rep 1 (The First Iteration)\n\nBreak down the quest into the **smallest shippable version**:\n\nAsk:\n- \"What''s the smallest version you could ship THIS WEEK?\"\n- \"What do you need to learn JUST to do that?\" (not everything)\n- \"What would ''done'' look like for rep 1?\"\n\n**Make it:**\n- Concrete and specific\n- Completable in 1-7 days\n- Produces real evidence/artifact\n- Small enough to not be intimidating\n- Big enough to learn something meaningful\n\n### Step 5: Create the Rep Plan\n\nStructure each rep with:\n\n```markdown\n## Rep 1: [Specific Goal]\n\n**Ship Goal**: [What you''ll create/do]\n**Success Criteria**: [How you''ll know it''s done]\n**What You''ll Learn**: [Specific skills/insights]\n**Resources Needed**: [Minimal - just what''s needed for THIS rep]\n**Timeline**: [Specific deadline]\n\n**Action Steps**:\n1. [Concrete step 1]\n2. [Concrete step 2]\n3. [Concrete step 3]\n...\n\n**After Shipping - Reflection Questions**:\n- What actually happened? (Be specific)\n- What worked? What didn''t?\n- What surprised you?\n- On a scale of 1-10, how did this rep go?\n- What would you do differently next time?\n```\n\n### Step 6: Map Future Reps (2-5)\n\nBased on the content, suggest a progression:\n\n```markdown\n## Rep 2: [Next level]\n**Builds on**: What you learned in Rep 1\n**New challenge**: One new thing to try/improve\n**Expected difficulty**: [Easier/Same/Harder - and why]\n\n## Rep 3: [Continue progression]\n...\n```\n\n**Progression principles**:\n- Each rep adds ONE new element\n- Increase difficulty based on success\n- Reference specific lessons from the content\n- Keep reps shippable (not theoretical)\n\n### Step 7: Connect to Content\n\nFor each rep, reference the source material:\n\n- \"This implements the [concept] from minute X\"\n- \"You''re practicing the [technique] mentioned in the video\"\n- \"This tests the advice about [topic]\"\n\n**But**: Always emphasize DOING over studying. Point to resources only when needed for the specific rep.\n\n## Conversation Style\n\n**Direct but supportive**:\n- No fluff, but encouraging\n- \"Ship it, then we''ll improve it\"\n- \"What''s the smallest version you could do this week?\"\n\n**Question-driven**:\n- Make them think, don''t just tell\n- \"What exactly do you want to achieve?\" not \"Here''s what you should do\"\n\n**Specific, not generic**:\n- \"By Friday, ship one landing page\" not \"Learn web development\"\n- Push for concrete commitments\n\n**Action-oriented**:\n- Always end with \"what''s next?\"\n- Focus on the next rep, not the whole journey\n\n## What NOT to Do\n\n- ❌ Don''t create a study plan (create a SHIP plan)\n- ❌ Don''t list all resources to read/watch (pick minimal resources for current rep)\n- ❌ Don''t make perfect the enemy of shipped\n- ❌ Don''t let them plan forever without starting\n- ❌ Don''t accept vague goals (\"learn X\" → \"ship Y by Z date\")\n- ❌ Don''t overwhelm with the full journey (focus on rep 1)\n\n## Key Phrases to Use\n\n- \"What''s the smallest version you could ship this week?\"\n- \"What do you need to learn JUST to do that?\"\n- \"This isn''t about perfection - it''s rep 1 of 100\"\n- \"Ship something real, then we''ll improve it\"\n- \"Based on [content], what would you actually DO differently?\"\n- \"Learning = doing better, not knowing more\"\n\n## Example Output Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Your Ship-Learn-Next Quest: [Title]\n\n## Quest Overview\n**Goal**: [What they want to achieve in 4-8 weeks]\n**Source**: [The content that inspired this]\n**Core Lessons**: [3-5 key actionable takeaways from content]\n\n---\n\n## Rep 1: [Specific, Shippable Goal]\n\n**Ship Goal**: [Concrete deliverable]\n**Timeline**: [This week / By [date]]\n**Success Criteria**:\n- [ ] [Specific thing 1]\n- [ ] [Specific thing 2]\n- [ ] [Specific thing 3]\n\n**What You''ll Practice** (from the content):\n- [Skill/concept 1 from source material]\n- [Skill/concept 2 from source material]\n\n**Action Steps**:\n1. [Concrete step]\n2. [Concrete step]\n3. [Concrete step]\n4. Ship it (publish/deploy/share/demonstrate)\n\n**Minimal Resources** (only for this rep):\n- [Link or reference - if truly needed]\n\n**After Shipping - Reflection**:\nAnswer these questions:\n- What actually happened?\n- What worked? What didn''t?\n- What surprised you?\n- Rate this rep: _/10\n- What''s one thing to try differently next time?\n\n---\n\n## Rep 2: [Next Iteration]\n\n**Builds on**: Rep 1 + [what you learned]\n**New element**: [One new challenge/skill]\n**Ship goal**: [Next concrete deliverable]\n\n[Similar structure...]\n\n---\n\n## Rep 3-5: Future Path\n\n**Rep 3**: [Brief description]\n**Rep 4**: [Brief description]\n**Rep 5**: [Brief description]\n\n*(Details will evolve based on what you learn in Reps 1-2)*\n\n---\n\n## Remember\n\n- This is about DOING, not studying\n- Aim for 100 reps over time (not perfection on rep 1)\n- Each rep = Plan → Do → Reflect → Next\n- You learn by shipping, not by consuming\n\n**Ready to ship Rep 1?**\n```\n\n## Processing Different Content Types\n\n### YouTube Transcripts\n- Focus on advice, not stories\n- Extract concrete techniques mentioned\n- Identify case studies/examples to replicate\n- Note timestamps for reference later (but don''t require watching again)\n\n### Articles/Tutorials\n- Identify the \"now do this\" parts vs theory\n- Extract the specific workflow/process\n- Find the minimal example to start with\n\n### Course Notes\n- What''s the smallest project from the course?\n- Which modules are needed for rep 1? (ignore the rest for now)\n- What can be practiced immediately?\n\n## Success Metrics\n\nA good Ship-Learn-Next plan has:\n- ✅ Specific, shippable rep 1 (completable in 1-7 days)\n- ✅ Clear success criteria (user knows when they''re done)\n- ✅ Concrete artifacts (something real to show)\n- ✅ Direct connection to source content\n- ✅ Progression path for reps 2-5\n- ✅ Emphasis on action over consumption\n- ✅ Honest reflection built in\n- ✅ Small enough to start today, big enough to learn\n\n## Saving the Plan\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Always save the plan to a file for the user.\n\n### Filename Convention\n\nAlways use the format:\n- `Ship-Learn-Next Plan - [Brief Quest Title].md`\n\nExamples:\n- `Ship-Learn-Next Plan - Build in Proven Markets.md`\n- `Ship-Learn-Next Plan - Learn React.md`\n- `Ship-Learn-Next Plan - Cold Email Outreach.md`\n\n**Quest title should be**:\n- Brief (3-6 words)\n- Descriptive of the main goal\n- Based on the content''s core lesson/theme\n\n### What to Save\n\n**Complete plan including**:\n- Quest overview with goal and source\n- All reps (1-5) with full details\n- Action steps and reflection questions\n- Timeline commitments\n- Reference to source material\n\n**Format**: Always save as Markdown (`.md`) for readability\n\n## After Creating the Plan\n\n**Display to user**:\n1. Show them you''ve saved the plan: \"✓ Saved to: [filename]\"\n2. Give a brief overview of the quest\n3. Highlight Rep 1 (what''s due this week)\n\n**Then ask**:\n1. \"When will you ship Rep 1?\"\n2. \"What''s the one thing that might stop you? How will you handle it?\"\n3. \"Come back after you ship and we''ll reflect + plan Rep 2\"\n\n**Remember**: You''re not creating a curriculum. You''re helping them ship something real, learn from it, and ship the next thing.\n\nLet''s help them ship.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:21:33.895Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Action-Oriented Agents requiring iterative learning cycles and actionable plan generation","zh":"适用于需要迭代学习周期和可行计划生成的面向行动的代理","ja":"イテレーティブな学習サイクルと実行可能なプランの生成を必要とするアクション指向のエージェントに最適","ko":"반복적인 학습 주기와 실행 가능한 계획 생성이 필요한 행동 지향 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Orientados a Acciones que requieren ciclos de aprendizaje iterativos y generación de planes de acción","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Orientés vers l''Action nécessitant des cycles d''apprentissage itératifs et une génération de plans d''action","de":"Ideal für handlungsorientierte Agenten, die iterative Lernzyklen und die Generierung von Aktionsplänen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Orientados para Ação que requerem ciclos de aprendizado iterativos e geração de planos de ação","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на действие, требующих итеративных циклов обучения и генерации планов действий","ar":"مثالية لعميل التوجيه الفعلي الذي يتطلب دورات تعلم متكررة وتنمية خطة عمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform passive learning content into concrete Ship-Learn-Next cycles, leveraging implementation steps and educational content extraction to drive iterative progress, utilizing protocols like content preview and transcript analysis","zh":"赋予代理将被动学习内容转化为具体的 Ship-Learn-Next 周期的能力，利用实施步骤和教育内容提取来驱动迭代进展，使用诸如内容预览和转录分析的协议","ja":"エージェントが受動的な学習コンテンツを Ship-Learn-Next サイクルに変換できるようにし、実装ステップと教育コンテンツの抽出を使用してイテレーティブな進歩を推進し、コンテンツのプレビューやトランスクリプトの分析などのプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 수동적인 학습 콘텐츠를 구체적인 Ship-Learn-Next 주기에 변환할 수 있도록 하며, 구현 단계와 교육 콘텐츠 추출을 사용하여 반복적인 진행을 주도하며, 콘텐츠 미리 보기와 전사 분석과 같은 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar contenido de aprendizaje pasivo en ciclos concretos de Envío-Aprendizaje-Siguiente, aprovechando los pasos de implementación y la extracción de contenido educativo para impulsar el progreso iterativo, utilizando protocolos como la vista previa de contenido y el análisis de transcripciones","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer du contenu d''apprentissage passif en des cycles concrets de Navigation-Apprentissage-Suivant, en exploitant les étapes de mise en œuvre et l''extraction de contenu éducatif pour impulser le progrès itératif, en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''aperçu de contenu et l''analyse de transcripts","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, passives Lerninhalt in konkrete Schiffe-Lernen-Weiter-Zyklen umzuwandeln, indem Implementierungsschritte und die Extraktion von Bildungsinhalten genutzt werden, um iterativen Fortschritt zu treiben, unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie Inhaltsvorschau und Transkriptanalyse","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar conteúdo de aprendizado passivo em ciclos concretos de Navegação-Aprenda-Próximo, utilizando etapas de implementação e extração de conteúdo educacional para impulsionar o progresso iterativo, utilizando protocolos como visualização de conteúdo e análise de transcrição","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить пассивный обучающий контент в конкретные циклы Отправить-Научиться-Следующий, используя шаги реализации и извлечение образовательного контента для стимулирования итеративного прогресса, используя протоколы, такие как предварительный просмотр контента и анализ транскрипта","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحويل المحتوى التعلمي السلبي إلى دورات ملموسة من الإبحار-تعلم-التالي، باستخدام خطوات التنفيذ واستخراج المحتوى التعليمي لتحفيز التقدم المتكرر، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل معاينة المحتوى وتحليل النص"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating advice implementation from transcripts and articles","Generating actionable plans from tutorials and educational content","Extracting implementation steps from big ideas to drive shippable iterations"],"zh":["从转录和文章中自动实现建议","从教程和教育内容中生成可行计划","从大想法中提取实施步骤以驱动可发布的迭代"],"ja":["トランスクリプトと記事からアドバイスの実装を自動化する","チュートリアルと教育コンテンツから実行可能なプランを生成する","大きなアイデアから実装ステップを抽出してリリース可能なイテレーションを推進する"],"ko":["전사와 기사에서 조언 구현 자동화","튜토리얼 및 교육 콘텐츠에서 실행 가능한 계획 생성","큰 아이디어에서 구현 단계 추출하여 출판 가능한 반복 주기를 구동"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación de consejos a partir de transcripciones y artículos","Generación de planes de acción a partir de tutoriales y contenido educativo","Extracción de pasos de implementación de grandes ideas para impulsar iteraciones enviables"],"fr":["Automatisation de la mise en œuvre des conseils à partir de transcriptions et d''articles","Génération de plans d''action à partir de didacticiels et de contenu éducatif","Extraction d''étapes de mise en œuvre à partir de grandes idées pour impulser des itérations réalisables"],"de":["Automatisierung der Implementierung von Ratschlägen aus Transkripten und Artikeln","Generierung von Aktionsplänen aus Tutorien und Bildungsinhalten","Extraktion von Implementierungsschritten aus großen Ideen, um schiffbare Iterationen zu treiben"],"pt":["Automatizar a implementação de conselhos a partir de transcrições e artigos","Gerar planos de ação a partir de tutoriais e conteúdo educacional","Extrair etapas de implementação de ideias grandes para impulsionar iterações enviáveis"],"ru":["Автоматизировать реализацию советов из транскрипций и статей","Генерировать планы действий из туториалов и образовательного контента","Извлекать шаги реализации из больших идей для стимулирования отправляемых итераций"],"ar":["توفير تطبيق المشورة تلقائيًا من النصوص والمقالات","توليد خطط عمل من البرامج التعليمية والمحتوى التعليمي","استخراج خطوات التنفيذ من الأفكار الكبيرة لتحفيز الإصدارات القابلة للشحن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires well-structured educational content or transcripts","Limited to iterative learning cycles and action plan generation"],"zh":["需要结构良好的教育内容或转录","仅限于迭代学习周期和行动计划生成"],"ja":["構造化された教育コンテンツまたはトランスクリプトが必要","イテレーティブな学習サイクルとアクションプランの生成のみに限定"],"ko":["구조화된 교육 콘텐츠 또는 전사가 필요","반복적인 학습 주기 및 행동 계획 생성에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere contenido educativo bien estructurado o transcripciones","Limitado a ciclos de aprendizaje iterativos y generación de planes de acción"],"fr":["Nécessite un contenu éducatif bien structuré ou des transcriptions","Limité aux cycles d''apprentissage itératifs et à la génération de plans d''action"],"de":["Benötigt gut strukturierten Bildungsinhalt oder Transkripte","Begrenzt auf iterative Lernzyklen und die Generierung von Aktionsplänen"],"pt":["Requer conteúdo educacional bem estruturado ou transcrições","Limitado a ciclos de aprendizado iterativos e geração de planos de ação"],"ru":["Требует хорошо структурированного образовательного контента или транскрипций","Ограничен итеративными циклами обучения и генерацией планов действий"],"ar":["يتطلب المحتوى التعليمي المنظم جيدًا أو النصوص","محدود بدورات التعلم المتكررة وتنمية خطة العمل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/firebase-storage', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'firebase-storage', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z', '2026-02-18T14:22:15.705Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/firebase-storage","name":"firebase-storage","description":{"zh":"Firebase存储是一个强大的云存储解决方案，支持文件上传和管理。快速开始使用我们的5分钟教程","ja":"Firebase Storageは強力なクラウドストレージソリューションで、ファイルのアップロードと管理をサポートします。5分で始めることができます","ko":"파이어베이스 저장소는 파일 업로드 및 관리를 지원하는 강력한 클라우드 저장소 솔루션입니다. 5분만에 시작할 수 있습니다","es":"Firebase Storage es un servicio de almacenamiento de objetos que permite a los desarrolladores almacenar y servir archivos en sus aplicaciones. Esta guía rápida muestra cómo inicializar y utilizar Firebase Storage","fr":"Le stockage Firebase est un service de stockage d''objets qui permet aux développeurs de stocker et de servir des fichiers dans leurs applications. Ce guide rapide montre comment initialiser et utiliser le stockage Firebase","de":"Firebase Storage ist ein Objektspeicherdienst, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Dateien in ihren Anwendungen zu speichern und bereitzustellen. Diese Schnellstartanleitung zeigt, wie Sie Firebase Storage initialisieren und verwenden","pt":"O Firebase Storage é um serviço de armazenamento de dados que permite armazenar e gerenciar arquivos em sua aplicação. Aprenda a inicializar e utilizar o serviço com o SDK do Firebase.","ru":"Firebase Storage — это сервис хранения данных, который позволяет хранить и управлять файлами в вашем приложении. Узнайте, как инициализировать и использовать сервис с помощью SDK Firebase.","ar":"Firebase Storage هو خدمة تخزين البيانات التي تمكنك من تخزين وإدارة الملفات في تطبيقك. تعلم كيفية تهيئة واستخدام الخدمة باستخدام SDK Firebase.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Firebase存储解决方案","ja":"Firebase Storageソリューション","ko":"파이어베이스 저장소 솔루션","es":"Almacenamiento de Firebase: Guía Rápida para Desarrolladores","fr":"Stockage Firebase: Guide Rapide pour les Développeurs","de":"Firebase-Speicher: Schnellstart für Entwickler","pt":"Armazenamento de Dados com Firebase Storage","ru":"Хранилище данных Firebase Storage","ar":"تخزين البيانات مع Firebase Storage","en":"firebase-storage"},"description":{"zh":"Firebase存储是一个强大的云存储解决方案，支持文件上传和管理。快速开始使用我们的5分钟教程","ja":"Firebase Storageは強力なクラウドストレージソリューションで、ファイルのアップロードと管理をサポートします。5分で始めることができます","ko":"파이어베이스 저장소는 파일 업로드 및 관리를 지원하는 강력한 클라우드 저장소 솔루션입니다. 5분만에 시작할 수 있습니다","es":"Firebase Storage es un servicio de almacenamiento de objetos que permite a los desarrolladores almacenar y servir archivos en sus aplicaciones. Esta guía ráp...","fr":"Le stockage Firebase est un service de stockage d''objets qui permet aux développeurs de stocker et de servir des fichiers dans leurs applications. Ce guide r...","de":"Firebase Storage ist ein Objektspeicherdienst, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Dateien in ihren Anwendungen zu speichern und bereitzustellen. Diese Schnellsta...","pt":"O Firebase Storage é um serviço de armazenamento de dados que permite armazenar e gerenciar arquivos em sua aplicação. Aprenda a inicializar e utilizar o ser...","ru":"Firebase Storage — это сервис хранения данных, который позволяет хранить и управлять файлами в вашем приложении. Узнайте, как инициализировать и использовать...","ar":"Firebase Storage هو خدمة تخزين البيانات التي تمكنك من تخزين وإدارة الملفات في تطبيقك. تعلم كيفية تهيئة واستخدام الخدمة باستخدام SDK Firebase.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速初始化Firebase Storage","支持文件上传和管理","集成Firebase Authentication和Authorization","支持多种文件类型","提供安全的数据存储和传输"],"ja":["Firebase Storageの迅速な初期化","ファイルのアップロードと管理のサポート","Firebase AuthenticationとAuthorizationの統合","複数のファイルタイプのサポート","安全なデータの保存と転送"],"ko":["파이어베이스 저장소의 빠른 초기화","파일 업로드 및 관리 지원","파이어베이스 인증 및 권한 부여 통합","다양한 파일 유형 지원","안전한 데이터 저장 및 전송 제공"],"es":["Almacenamiento de archivos en la nube","Servicio de objetos escalable","Integración con otras herramientas de Firebase","Seguridad y autenticación avanzadas","Compatibilidad con varias plataformas"],"fr":["Stockage de fichiers en ligne","Service d''objets évolutif","Intégration avec d''autres outils Firebase","Sécurité et authentification avancées","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Cloud-Speicher für Dateien","Skalierbarer Objektspeicherdienst","Integration mit anderen Firebase-Tools","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Armazenamento de arquivos","Gerenciamento de arquivos","Integração com o SDK do Firebase","Suporte a diferentes tipos de arquivos","Segurança e autenticação"],"ru":["Хранение файлов","Управление файлами","Интеграция с SDK Firebase","Поддержка разных типов файлов","Безопасность и аутентификация"],"ar":["تخزين الملفات","إدارة الملفات","التكامل مع SDK Firebase","دعم أنواع الملفات المختلفة","الأمان والمصادقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Firebase存储","云存储解决方案","文件上传和管理","Firebase Authentication","Firebase Authorization","安全数据存储","数据传输"],"ja":["Firebase Storage","クラウドストレージソリューション","ファイルのアップロードと管理","Firebase Authentication","Firebase Authorization","安全なデータの保存","データの転送"],"ko":["파이어베이스 저장소","클라우드 저장소 솔루션","파일 업로드 및 관리","파이어베이스 인증","파이어베이스 권한 부여","안전한 데이터 저장","데이터 전송"],"es":["Firebase Storage","almacenamiento de objetos","desarrollo de aplicaciones","servicio de almacenamiento en la nube","seguridad de datos","autenticación avanzada"],"fr":["Stockage Firebase","stockage d''objets","développement d''applications","service de stockage en ligne","sécurité des données","authentification avancée"],"de":["Firebase Storage","Objektspeicher","Anwendungsentwicklung","Cloud-Speicherdienst","Datensicherheit","erweiterte Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Firebase Storage","armazenamento de dados","gerenciamento de arquivos","SDK do Firebase","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","tutoriais de Firebase"],"ru":["Firebase Storage","хранение данных","управление файлами","SDK Firebase","разработка приложений","уроки по Firebase"],"ar":["Firebase Storage","تخزين البيانات","إدارة الملفات","SDK Firebase","تطوير التطبيقات","دروس Firebase"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"firebase-storage","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Firebase Cloud Storage\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-25\n**Dependencies**: None (standalone skill)\n**Latest Versions**: firebase@12.8.0, firebase-admin@13.6.0\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Initialize Firebase Storage (Client)\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/firebase.ts\nimport { initializeApp } from ''firebase/app'';\nimport { getStorage } from ''firebase/storage'';\n\nconst firebaseConfig = {\n  apiKey: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY,\n  authDomain: process.env.N","body":"# Firebase Cloud Storage\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-25\n**Dependencies**: None (standalone skill)\n**Latest Versions**: firebase@12.8.0, firebase-admin@13.6.0\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Initialize Firebase Storage (Client)\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/firebase.ts\nimport { initializeApp } from ''firebase/app'';\nimport { getStorage } from ''firebase/storage'';\n\nconst firebaseConfig = {\n  apiKey: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY,\n  authDomain: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN,\n  projectId: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID,\n  storageBucket: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET,\n  // ... other config\n};\n\nconst app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);\nexport const storage = getStorage(app);\n```\n\n### 2. Initialize Firebase Admin Storage (Server)\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/firebase-admin.ts\nimport { initializeApp, cert, getApps } from ''firebase-admin/app'';\nimport { getStorage } from ''firebase-admin/storage'';\n\nif (!getApps().length) {\n  initializeApp({\n    credential: cert({\n      projectId: process.env.FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID,\n      clientEmail: process.env.FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL,\n      privateKey: process.env.FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY?.replace(/\\\\n/g, ''\\n''),\n    }),\n    storageBucket: process.env.FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET,\n  });\n}\n\nexport const adminStorage = getStorage().bucket();\n```\n\n---\n\n## File Upload (Client SDK)\n\n### Basic Upload\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, uploadBytes, getDownloadURL } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function uploadFile(file: File, path: string): Promise<string> {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n\n  // Upload file\n  const snapshot = await uploadBytes(storageRef, file);\n\n  // Get download URL\n  const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(snapshot.ref);\n\n  return downloadURL;\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst url = await uploadFile(file, `uploads/${userId}/${file.name}`);\n```\n\n### Upload with Progress\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, uploadBytesResumable, getDownloadURL, UploadTask } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nfunction uploadFileWithProgress(\n  file: File,\n  path: string,\n  onProgress: (progress: number) => void\n): Promise<string> {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n    const uploadTask = uploadBytesResumable(storageRef, file);\n\n    uploadTask.on(\n      ''state_changed'',\n      (snapshot) => {\n        const progress = (snapshot.bytesTransferred / snapshot.totalBytes) * 100;\n        onProgress(progress);\n      },\n      (error) => {\n        reject(error);\n      },\n      async () => {\n        const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(uploadTask.snapshot.ref);\n        resolve(downloadURL);\n      }\n    );\n  });\n}\n\n// Usage with React state\nconst [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);\nconst url = await uploadFileWithProgress(file, path, setProgress);\n```\n\n### Upload with Metadata\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, uploadBytes, getDownloadURL, UploadMetadata } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function uploadWithMetadata(file: File, path: string) {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n\n  const metadata: UploadMetadata = {\n    contentType: file.type,\n    customMetadata: {\n      uploadedBy: userId,\n      originalName: file.name,\n      uploadTime: new Date().toISOString(),\n    },\n  };\n\n  const snapshot = await uploadBytes(storageRef, file, metadata);\n  const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(snapshot.ref);\n\n  return { downloadURL, metadata: snapshot.metadata };\n}\n```\n\n### Upload from Data URL / Base64\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, uploadString, getDownloadURL } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\n// Upload base64 string\nasync function uploadBase64(base64String: string, path: string) {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n\n  // For data URL (includes prefix like \"data:image/png;base64,\")\n  const snapshot = await uploadString(storageRef, base64String, ''data_url'');\n\n  // For raw base64 (no prefix)\n  // const snapshot = await uploadString(storageRef, base64String, ''base64'');\n\n  const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(snapshot.ref);\n  return downloadURL;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## File Download\n\n### Get Download URL\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, getDownloadURL } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function getFileURL(path: string): Promise<string> {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n  const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(storageRef);\n  return downloadURL;\n}\n```\n\n### Download File as Blob\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, getBlob } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function downloadFile(path: string): Promise<Blob> {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n  const blob = await getBlob(storageRef);\n  return blob;\n}\n\n// Trigger browser download\nasync function downloadAndSave(path: string, filename: string) {\n  const blob = await downloadFile(path);\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n\n  const a = document.createElement(''a'');\n  a.href = url;\n  a.download = filename;\n  a.click();\n\n  URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n}\n```\n\n### Get File Metadata\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, getMetadata } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function getFileMetadata(path: string) {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n  const metadata = await getMetadata(storageRef);\n\n  return {\n    name: metadata.name,\n    size: metadata.size,\n    contentType: metadata.contentType,\n    created: metadata.timeCreated,\n    updated: metadata.updated,\n    customMetadata: metadata.customMetadata,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## File Management\n\n### Delete File\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, deleteObject } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function deleteFile(path: string): Promise<void> {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n  await deleteObject(storageRef);\n}\n```\n\n### List Files in Directory\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, listAll, list, getDownloadURL } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\n// List all files in a directory\nasync function listAllFiles(directoryPath: string) {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, directoryPath);\n  const result = await listAll(storageRef);\n\n  const files = await Promise.all(\n    result.items.map(async (itemRef) => ({\n      name: itemRef.name,\n      fullPath: itemRef.fullPath,\n      downloadURL: await getDownloadURL(itemRef),\n    }))\n  );\n\n  const folders = result.prefixes.map((folderRef) => ({\n    name: folderRef.name,\n    fullPath: folderRef.fullPath,\n  }));\n\n  return { files, folders };\n}\n\n// Paginated list (for large directories)\nasync function listFilesPaginated(directoryPath: string, pageSize = 100) {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, directoryPath);\n  const result = await list(storageRef, { maxResults: pageSize });\n\n  // Get next page\n  if (result.nextPageToken) {\n    const nextPage = await list(storageRef, {\n      maxResults: pageSize,\n      pageToken: result.nextPageToken,\n    });\n  }\n\n  return result;\n}\n```\n\n### Update Metadata\n\n```typescript\nimport { ref, updateMetadata } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''./firebase'';\n\nasync function updateFileMetadata(path: string, newMetadata: object) {\n  const storageRef = ref(storage, path);\n  const updatedMetadata = await updateMetadata(storageRef, {\n    customMetadata: newMetadata,\n  });\n  return updatedMetadata;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Server-Side Operations (Admin SDK)\n\n### Upload from Server\n\n```typescript\nimport { adminStorage } from ''./firebase-admin'';\n\nasync function uploadFromServer(\n  buffer: Buffer,\n  destination: string,\n  contentType: string\n) {\n  const file = adminStorage.file(destination);\n\n  await file.save(buffer, {\n    contentType,\n    metadata: {\n      metadata: {\n        uploadedBy: ''server'',\n        uploadTime: new Date().toISOString(),\n      },\n    },\n  });\n\n  // Make file publicly accessible (if needed)\n  await file.makePublic();\n\n  // Get public URL\n  const publicUrl = `https://storage.googleapis.com/${adminStorage.name}/${destination}`;\n\n  return publicUrl;\n}\n```\n\n### Generate Signed URL\n\n```typescript\nimport { adminStorage } from ''./firebase-admin'';\n\nasync function generateSignedUrl(\n  path: string,\n  expiresInMinutes = 60\n): Promise<string> {\n  const file = adminStorage.file(path);\n\n  const [signedUrl] = await file.getSignedUrl({\n    action: ''read'',\n    expires: Date.now() + expiresInMinutes * 60 * 1000,\n  });\n\n  return signedUrl;\n}\n\n// For uploads (write access)\nasync function generateUploadUrl(path: string): Promise<string> {\n  const file = adminStorage.file(path);\n\n  const [signedUrl] = await file.getSignedUrl({\n    action: ''write'',\n    expires: Date.now() + 15 * 60 * 1000, // 15 minutes\n    contentType: ''application/octet-stream'',\n  });\n\n  return signedUrl;\n}\n```\n\n### Delete from Server\n\n```typescript\nimport { adminStorage } from ''./firebase-admin'';\n\nasync function deleteFromServer(path: string): Promise<void> {\n  const file = adminStorage.file(path);\n  await file.delete();\n}\n\n// Delete entire directory\nasync function deleteDirectory(directoryPath: string): Promise<void> {\n  await adminStorage.deleteFiles({\n    prefix: directoryPath,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Security Rules\n\n### Basic Rules Structure\n\n```javascript\n// storage.rules\nrules_version = ''2'';\n\nservice firebase.storage {\n  match /b/{bucket}/o {\n\n    // Helper functions\n    function isAuthenticated() {\n      return request.auth != null;\n    }\n\n    function isOwner(userId) {\n      return request.auth.uid == userId;\n    }\n\n    function isValidImage() {\n      return request.resource.contentType.matches(''image/.*'')\n        && request.resource.size < 5 * 1024 * 1024; // 5MB\n    }\n\n    function isValidDocument() {\n      return request.resource.contentType.matches(''application/pdf'')\n        && request.resource.size < 10 * 1024 * 1024; // 10MB\n    }\n\n    // User uploads (private to user)\n    match /users/{userId}/{allPaths=**} {\n      allow read: if isOwner(userId);\n      allow write: if isOwner(userId)\n        && (isValidImage() || isValidDocument());\n    }\n\n    // Public uploads (anyone can read)\n    match /public/{allPaths=**} {\n      allow read: if true;\n      allow write: if isAuthenticated() && isValidImage();\n    }\n\n    // Profile pictures\n    match /profiles/{userId}/avatar.{ext} {\n      allow read: if true;\n      allow write: if isOwner(userId)\n        && request.resource.contentType.matches(''image/.*'')\n        && request.resource.size < 2 * 1024 * 1024; // 2MB\n    }\n\n    // Deny all other access\n    match /{allPaths=**} {\n      allow read, write: if false;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Deploy Rules\n\n```bash\nfirebase deploy --only storage\n```\n\n---\n\n## CORS Configuration\n\n### Configure CORS (Required for Web)\n\nCreate `cors.json`:\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"origin\": [\"https://your-domain.com\", \"http://localhost:3000\"],\n    \"method\": [\"GET\", \"PUT\", \"POST\", \"DELETE\"],\n    \"maxAgeSeconds\": 3600\n  }\n]\n```\n\nApply CORS configuration:\n\n```bash\ngsutil cors set cors.json gs://your-bucket-name.appspot.com\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:** Without CORS configuration, uploads from browsers will fail with CORS errors.\n\n---\n\n## React Components\n\n### File Upload Component\n\n```typescript\n// components/FileUpload.tsx\n''use client'';\n\nimport { useState, useRef } from ''react'';\nimport { ref, uploadBytesResumable, getDownloadURL } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''@/lib/firebase'';\n\ninterface FileUploadProps {\n  path: string;\n  onUploadComplete: (url: string) => void;\n  accept?: string;\n  maxSize?: number; // in bytes\n}\n\nexport function FileUpload({\n  path,\n  onUploadComplete,\n  accept = ''image/*'',\n  maxSize = 5 * 1024 * 1024, // 5MB\n}: FileUploadProps) {\n  const [uploading, setUploading] = useState(false);\n  const [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const inputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);\n\n  const handleFileChange = async (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n    const file = e.target.files?.[0];\n    if (!file) return;\n\n    // Validate file size\n    if (file.size > maxSize) {\n      setError(`File size must be less than ${maxSize / 1024 / 1024}MB`);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    setError(null);\n    setUploading(true);\n    setProgress(0);\n\n    try {\n      const storageRef = ref(storage, `${path}/${Date.now()}-${file.name}`);\n      const uploadTask = uploadBytesResumable(storageRef, file);\n\n      uploadTask.on(\n        ''state_changed'',\n        (snapshot) => {\n          const progress = (snapshot.bytesTransferred / snapshot.totalBytes) * 100;\n          setProgress(progress);\n        },\n        (error) => {\n          setError(error.message);\n          setUploading(false);\n        },\n        async () => {\n          const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(uploadTask.snapshot.ref);\n          onUploadComplete(downloadURL);\n          setUploading(false);\n          setProgress(100);\n        }\n      );\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      setError(err.message);\n      setUploading(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <input\n        ref={inputRef}\n        type=\"file\"\n        accept={accept}\n        onChange={handleFileChange}\n        disabled={uploading}\n        className=\"hidden\"\n      />\n      <button\n        onClick={() => inputRef.current?.click()}\n        disabled={uploading}\n        className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded disabled:opacity-50\"\n      >\n        {uploading ? `Uploading... ${Math.round(progress)}%` : ''Upload File''}\n      </button>\n      {error && <p className=\"text-red-500 mt-2\">{error}</p>}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Image Preview with Upload\n\n```typescript\n// components/ImageUpload.tsx\n''use client'';\n\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport { ref, uploadBytesResumable, getDownloadURL } from ''firebase/storage'';\nimport { storage } from ''@/lib/firebase'';\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\ninterface ImageUploadProps {\n  currentImage?: string;\n  path: string;\n  onUploadComplete: (url: string) => void;\n}\n\nexport function ImageUpload({\n  currentImage,\n  path,\n  onUploadComplete,\n}: ImageUploadProps) {\n  const [preview, setPreview] = useState<string | null>(currentImage || null);\n  const [uploading, setUploading] = useState(false);\n  const [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);\n\n  const handleFileChange = async (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n    const file = e.target.files?.[0];\n    if (!file) return;\n\n    // Show preview immediately\n    const reader = new FileReader();\n    reader.onloadend = () => {\n      setPreview(reader.result as string);\n    };\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file);\n\n    // Upload\n    setUploading(true);\n    const storageRef = ref(storage, `${path}/${Date.now()}-${file.name}`);\n    const uploadTask = uploadBytesResumable(storageRef, file);\n\n    uploadTask.on(\n      ''state_changed'',\n      (snapshot) => {\n        setProgress((snapshot.bytesTransferred / snapshot.totalBytes) * 100);\n      },\n      (error) => {\n        console.error(''Upload error:'', error);\n        setUploading(false);\n      },\n      async () => {\n        const downloadURL = await getDownloadURL(uploadTask.snapshot.ref);\n        onUploadComplete(downloadURL);\n        setUploading(false);\n      }\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"relative w-32 h-32\">\n      {preview ? (\n        <Image\n          src={preview}\n          alt=\"Preview\"\n          fill\n          className=\"object-cover rounded-full\"\n        />\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"w-full h-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n          <span className=\"text-gray-500\">No image</span>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      <label className=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 bg-blue-500 text-white p-2 rounded-full cursor-pointer\">\n        <input\n          type=\"file\"\n          accept=\"image/*\"\n          onChange={handleFileChange}\n          disabled={uploading}\n          className=\"hidden\"\n        />\n        {uploading ? `${Math.round(progress)}%` : ''+''}\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Common Storage Errors\n\n| Error Code | Description | Solution |\n|------------|-------------|----------|\n| `storage/unauthorized` | User not allowed to access | Check security rules, ensure user authenticated |\n| `storage/canceled` | Upload/download canceled | Handle gracefully, allow retry |\n| `storage/unknown` | Unknown error | Check network, retry with backoff |\n| `storage/object-not-found` | File doesn''t exist | Verify path, handle missing files |\n| `storage/bucket-not-found` | Bucket doesn''t exist | Check storageBucket config |\n| `storage/quota-exceeded` | Storage quota exceeded | Upgrade plan or delete files |\n| `storage/unauthenticated` | User not authenticated | Sign in user first |\n| `storage/invalid-checksum` | File corrupted during upload | Retry upload |\n| `storage/retry-limit-exceeded` | Too many retries | Check network, try later |\n\n### Error Handler Utility\n\n```typescript\nexport function getStorageErrorMessage(error: any): string {\n  const messages: Record<string, string> = {\n    ''storage/unauthorized'': ''You do not have permission to access this file'',\n    ''storage/canceled'': ''Upload was canceled'',\n    ''storage/object-not-found'': ''File not found'',\n    ''storage/quota-exceeded'': ''Storage quota exceeded'',\n    ''storage/unauthenticated'': ''Please sign in to upload files'',\n    ''storage/invalid-checksum'': ''Upload failed. Please try again'',\n    ''storage/retry-limit-exceeded'': ''Upload failed after multiple retries'',\n  };\n\n  return messages[error.code] || ''An unexpected error occurred'';\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **9** documented Firebase Storage errors:\n\n| Issue # | Error/Issue | Description | How to Avoid | Source |\n|---------|-------------|-------------|--------------|--------|\n| **#1** | `storage/unauthorized` | Security rules blocking access | Test rules, ensure user authenticated | Common |\n| **#2** | CORS errors | Browser blocked cross-origin request | Configure CORS with `gsutil cors set` | [Docs](https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage/web/download-files#cors_configuration) |\n| **#3** | Large file timeout | Upload times out | Use `uploadBytesResumable` for large files | Common |\n| **#4** | Memory issues | Loading large file into memory | Stream large files, use signed URLs | Common |\n| **#5** | Missing content type | File served with wrong MIME type | Always set `contentType` in metadata | Common |\n| **#6** | URL expiration | Download URL stops working | Regenerate URLs, use signed URLs for temp access | Common |\n| **#7** | `storage/quota-exceeded` | Free tier limit reached | Monitor usage, upgrade plan | Common |\n| **#8** | Private key newline issue | Admin SDK fails to initialize | Use `.replace(/\\\\n/g, ''\\n'')` | Common |\n| **#9** | Duplicate uploads | Same file uploaded multiple times | Add timestamp/UUID to filename | Best practice |\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Always Do\n\n1. **Validate file type and size** before upload\n2. **Use `uploadBytesResumable`** for large files (supports pause/resume)\n3. **Set content type** in metadata\n4. **Use unique filenames** (add timestamp or UUID)\n5. **Handle upload errors** gracefully with retry\n6. **Unsubscribe from upload tasks** on component unmount\n7. **Configure CORS** for web applications\n8. **Use security rules** to protect files\n9. **Generate signed URLs** for temporary access\n\n### Never Do\n\n1. **Never upload without authentication** (unless truly public)\n2. **Never trust client-provided file extension** (check content type)\n3. **Never store sensitive data** without encryption\n4. **Never expose Admin SDK** in client code\n5. **Never allow unlimited file sizes** (DoS risk)\n\n---\n\n## Firebase CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# Initialize Storage\nfirebase init storage\n\n# Deploy security rules\nfirebase deploy --only storage\n\n# Start emulator\nfirebase emulators:start --only storage\n```\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-25)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"firebase\": \"^12.8.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"firebase-admin\": \"^13.6.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Storage Overview**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage\n- **Web Get Started**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage/web/start\n- **Upload Files**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage/web/upload-files\n- **Download Files**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage/web/download-files\n- **Security Rules**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage/security\n- **Admin SDK**: https://firebase.google.com/docs/storage/admin/start\n\n---\n\n**Last verified**: 2026-01-25 | **Skill version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:22:15.705Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-based Agents requiring seamless integration with Firebase Cloud Storage for scalable file management.","zh":"适用于需要与Firebase Cloud Storage实现无缝集成的云端智能代理，用于可扩展的文件管理。","ja":"Firebase Cloud Storageとのシームレスな統合が必要なクラウドベースのエージェントに適しています。拡張可能なファイル管理のために。","ko":"Firebase Cloud Storage와의无缝한 통합이 필요한 클라우드 기반 에이전트에 적합합니다. 확장 가능한 파일 관리를 위해.","es":"Ideal para agentes basados en la nube que requieren una integración sin problemas con Firebase Cloud Storage para una gestión de archivos escalable.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents basés sur le cloud nécessitant une intégration transparente avec Firebase Cloud Storage pour une gestion de fichiers scalable.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-basierte Agenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Firebase Cloud Storage für eine skalierbare Dateiverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes baseados em Nuvem que requerem integração perfeita com o Firebase Cloud Storage para gerenciamento de arquivos escalável.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции с Firebase Cloud Storage для масштабируемого управления файлами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستندة إلى السحابة الذين يتطلبون التكامل السلس مع Firebase Cloud Storage لإدارة الملفات القابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Firebase Storage using the Firebase SDK, enabling secure file uploads and downloads via the firebase-admin library, and leveraging firebase@12.8.0 and firebase-admin@13.6.0 for production-ready reliability.","zh":"赋予代理使用Firebase SDK与Firebase Storage交互的能力，通过firebase-admin库实现安全的文件上传和下载，并利用firebase@12.8.0和firebase-admin@13.6.0实现生产就绪的可靠性。","ja":"Firebase SDKを使用してFirebase Storageとエージェントがやり取りできるようにし、firebase-adminライブラリを使用して安全なファイルのアップロードとダウンロードを可能にし、firebase@12.8.0とfirebase-admin@13.6.0を使用して本番環境での信頼性を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Firebase SDK를 사용하여 Firebase Storage와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여 firebase-admin 라이브러리를 통해 안전한 파일 업로드 및 다운로드를 가능하게 하며, firebase@12.8.0 및 firebase-admin@13.6.0을 사용하여 프로덕션 준비가 된 신뢰성을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con Firebase Storage utilizando el SDK de Firebase, lo que permite cargas y descargas de archivos seguras a través de la biblioteca firebase-admin, y aprovecha firebase@12.8.0 y firebase-admin@13.6.0 para una confiabilidad lista para producción.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour interagir avec Firebase Storage en utilisant le SDK Firebase, permettant des téléchargements et des téléversements de fichiers sécurisés via la bibliothèque firebase-admin, et exploitant firebase@12.8.0 et firebase-admin@13.6.0 pour une fiabilité prête pour la production.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mit Firebase Storage über das Firebase-SDK zu interagieren, wodurch sichere Datei-Uploads und -Downloads über die Bibliothek firebase-admin ermöglichen lassen, und nutzt firebase@12.8.0 und firebase-admin@13.6.0 für eine produktionsreife Zuverlässigkeit.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com o Firebase Storage usando o SDK do Firebase, permitindo uploads e downloads de arquivos seguros via a biblioteca firebase-admin, e aproveitando firebase@12.8.0 e firebase-admin@13.6.0 para confiabilidade pronta para produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с Firebase Storage с помощью SDK Firebase, обеспечивая безопасную загрузку и скачивание файлов через библиотеку firebase-admin, и использует firebase@12.8.0 и firebase-admin@13.6.0 для надежности, готовой к производству.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التفاعل مع Firebase Storage باستخدام SDK Firebase ، وتمكين تحميل وتنزيل الملفات الآمن عبر مكتبة firebase-admin ، واستخدام firebase@12.8.0 و firebase-admin@13.6.0 لضمان الموثوقية الجاهزة للإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing Firebase Storage clients for secure file access","Uploading and managing files in Firebase Cloud Storage buckets","Integrating Firebase Storage with other Firebase services for holistic application development"],"zh":["为安全文件访问初始化Firebase Storage客户端","在Firebase Cloud Storage存储桶中上传和管理文件","将Firebase Storage与其他Firebase服务集成以进行整体应用程序开发"],"ja":["セキュアなファイルアクセス用のFirebase Storageクライアントを初期化する","Firebase Cloud Storageバケット内でファイルをアップロードして管理する","Firebase Storageを他のFirebaseサービスと統合して包括的なアプリケーション開発を行う"],"ko":["보안 파일 액세스를 위한 Firebase Storage 클라이언트 초기화","Firebase Cloud Storage 버킷에서 파일을 업로드하고 관리","Firebase Storage를 다른 Firebase 서비스와 통합하여 종합적인 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Inicializar clientes de Firebase Storage para un acceso a archivos seguro","Cargar y gestionar archivos en buckets de Firebase Cloud Storage","Integrar Firebase Storage con otros servicios de Firebase para un desarrollo de aplicaciones holístico"],"fr":["Initialiser les clients de stockage Firebase pour un accès aux fichiers sécurisé","Téléverser et gérer des fichiers dans les buckets de stockage Firebase Cloud","Intégrer Firebase Storage avec d''autres services Firebase pour un développement d''applications holistique"],"de":["Initialisieren von Firebase Storage-Clients für einen sicheren Dateizugriff","Hochladen und Verwalten von Dateien in Firebase Cloud Storage-Buckets","Integrieren von Firebase Storage mit anderen Firebase-Diensten für eine umfassende Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Inicializar clientes de armazenamento do Firebase para acesso seguro de arquivos","Fazer upload e gerenciar arquivos em buckets de armazenamento do Firebase Cloud","Integrar o armazenamento do Firebase com outros serviços do Firebase para desenvolvimento de aplicativos holísticos"],"ru":["Инициализировать клиенты Firebase Storage для безопасного доступа к файлам","Загружать и управлять файлами в бакетах Firebase Cloud Storage","Интегрировать Firebase Storage с другими сервисами Firebase для комплексного развития приложений"],"ar":["تهيئة عملاء Firebase Storage للوصول الآمن إلى الملفات","تحميل وادارة الملفات في سلتك Firebase Cloud Storage","دمج تخزين Firebase مع خدمات Firebase الأخرى لتطوير التطبيقات الشاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firebase project configuration and API key setup","Dependent on firebase-admin and firebase library versions"],"zh":["需要Firebase项目配置和API密钥设置","依赖于firebase-admin和firebase库版本"],"ja":["Firebaseプロジェクトの構成とAPIキー設定が必要","firebase-adminとfirebaseライブラリのバージョンに依存"],"ko":["Firebase 프로젝트 구성 및 API 키 설정 필요","firebase-admin 및 firebase 라이브러리 버전에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de Firebase y configuración de clave de API","Dependiente de las versiones de las bibliotecas firebase-admin y firebase"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Firebase et une configuration de clé API","Dépendant des versions des bibliothèques firebase-admin et firebase"],"de":["Benötigt Firebase-Projekt-Konfiguration und API-Schlüssel-Setup","Abhängig von den Versionen der Bibliotheken firebase-admin und firebase"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto do Firebase e configuração da chave de API","Dependente das versões da biblioteca firebase-admin e firebase"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Firebase и настройки ключа API","Зависит от версий библиотек firebase-admin и firebase"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة مشروع Firebase وإعداد مفتاح API","يعتمد على إصدارات المكتبات firebase-admin و firebase"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
