:"React Native, React Navigation, Reanimated 3","ja":"React Native, React Navigation, Reanimated 3","ko":"React Native, React Navigation, Reanimated 3","es":"Aprende a diseñar aplicaciones móviles con React Native para crear experiencias de usuario nativas de alta calidad","fr":"Apprenez à concevoir des applications mobiles avec React Native pour créer des expériences utilisateur natives de haute qualité","de":"Lernen Sie, wie Sie Mobile Apps mit React Native entwerfen, um native Benutzererfahrungen mit hoher Qualität zu erstellen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicativos móveis performáticos e com experiência do usuário nativa usando React Native. Aprenda a usar React Navigation e Reanimated 3 para cria...","ru":"Разработайте производительные мобильные приложения с родным пользовательским опытом, используя React Native. Узнайте, как использовать React Navigation и Rea...","ar":"قم بإنشاء تطبيقات الجوال عالية الأداء وذات تجربة مستخدم أصيلة باستخدام React Native. تعلم كيفية استخدام React Navigation و Reanimated 3 لإنشاء تصاميم مستجيبَ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["React Native","React Navigation 6+","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Responsive"],"ja":["React Native","React Navigation 6+","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Responsive"],"ko":["React Native","React Navigation 6+","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Responsive"],"es":["Patrones de estilo de React Native","Navegación con React Navigation 6+","Animaciones con Reanimated 3","Diseño de componentes con StyleSheet y styled-components","Diseño de layouts responsivos"],"fr":["Modèles de style React Native","Navigation avec React Navigation 6+","Animations avec Reanimated 3","Conception de composants avec StyleSheet et styled-components","Conception de dispositions responsives"],"de":["React Native-Stil-Muster","Navigation mit React Navigation 6+","Animationen mit Reanimated 3","Komponenten-Design mit StyleSheet und styled-components","Responsive-Layout-Design"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos móveis cross-platform","Implementação de navegação com React Navigation 6+","Criação de animações performáticas com Reanimated 3","Estilização de componentes com StyleSheet e styled-components","Criação de layouts responsivos para diferentes tamanhos de tela"],"ru":["Создание кроссплатформенных мобильных приложений","Реализация навигации с React Navigation 6+","Создание производительных анимаций с Reanimated 3","Стилизация компонентов с помощью StyleSheet и styled-components","Создание адаптивных макетов для разных размеров экрана"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات الجوال متعددة المنصات","تنفيذ التصفح باستخدام React Navigation 6+","إنشاء تأثيرات متحركة عالية الأداء مع Reanimated 3","تصميم المكونات باستخدام StyleSheet و styled-components","إنشاء تصاميم مستجيبَة لاحجام شاشات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","React Native","Cross-platform","Mobile App","Responsive Design","StyleSheet","styled-components"],"ja":["React Native","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","React Native","Cross-platform","Mobile App","Responsive Design","StyleSheet","styled-components"],"ko":["React Native","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","React Native","Cross-platform","Mobile App","Responsive Design","StyleSheet","styled-components"],"es":["React Native","Diseño de aplicaciones móviles","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Desarrollo de aplicaciones cross-platform"],"fr":["React Native","Conception d''applications mobiles","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Développement d''applications cross-platform"],"de":["React Native","Mobile App-Design","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Cross-Platform-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["React Native","Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Layouts Responsivos"],"ru":["React Native","Разработка Мобильных Приложений","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","Адаптивные Макеты"],"ar":["React Native","تصميم تطبيقات الجوال","React Navigation","Reanimated 3","StyleSheet","styled-components","تصاميم مستجيبَة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-design","description":"Master React Native styling, navigation, and Reanimated animations for cross-platform mobile development. Use when building React Native apps, implementing navigation patterns, or creating performant animations.","bodyPreview":"# React Native Design\n\nMaster React Native styling patterns, React Navigation, and Reanimated 3 to build performant, cross-platform mobile applications with native-quality user experiences.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform mobile apps with React Native\n- Implementing navigation with React Navigation 6+\n- Creating performant animations with Reanimated 3\n- Styling components with StyleSheet and styled-components\n- Building responsive layouts for different screen sizes\n- Implem","body":"# React Native Design\n\nMaster React Native styling patterns, React Navigation, and Reanimated 3 to build performant, cross-platform mobile applications with native-quality user experiences.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform mobile apps with React Native\n- Implementing navigation with React Navigation 6+\n- Creating performant animations with Reanimated 3\n- Styling components with StyleSheet and styled-components\n- Building responsive layouts for different screen sizes\n- Implementing platform-specific designs (iOS/Android)\n- Creating gesture-driven interactions with Gesture Handler\n- Optimizing React Native performance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. StyleSheet and Styling\n\n**Basic StyleSheet:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { StyleSheet, View, Text } from ''react-native'';\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  container: {\n    flex: 1,\n    padding: 16,\n    backgroundColor: ''#ffffff'',\n  },\n  title: {\n    fontSize: 24,\n    fontWeight: ''600'',\n    color: ''#1a1a1a'',\n    marginBottom: 8,\n  },\n  subtitle: {\n    fontSize: 16,\n    color: ''#666666'',\n    lineHeight: 24,\n  },\n});\n\nfunction Card() {\n  return (\n    <View style={styles.container}>\n      <Text style={styles.title}>Title</Text>\n      <Text style={styles.subtitle}>Subtitle text</Text>\n    </View>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Dynamic Styles:**\n\n```typescript\ninterface CardProps {\n  variant: ''primary'' | ''secondary'';\n  disabled?: boolean;\n}\n\nfunction Card({ variant, disabled }: CardProps) {\n  return (\n    <View style={[\n      styles.card,\n      variant === ''primary'' ? styles.primary : styles.secondary,\n      disabled && styles.disabled,\n    ]}>\n      <Text style={styles.text}>Content</Text>\n    </View>\n  );\n}\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  card: {\n    padding: 16,\n    borderRadius: 12,\n  },\n  primary: {\n    backgroundColor: ''#6366f1'',\n  },\n  secondary: {\n    backgroundColor: ''#f3f4f6'',\n    borderWidth: 1,\n    borderColor: ''#e5e7eb'',\n  },\n  disabled: {\n    opacity: 0.5,\n  },\n  text: {\n    fontSize: 16,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Flexbox Layout\n\n**Row and Column Layouts:**\n\n```typescript\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  // Vertical stack (column)\n  column: {\n    flexDirection: \"column\",\n    gap: 12,\n  },\n  // Horizontal stack (row)\n  row: {\n    flexDirection: \"row\",\n    alignItems: \"center\",\n    gap: 8,\n  },\n  // Space between items\n  spaceBetween: {\n    flexDirection: \"row\",\n    justifyContent: \"space-between\",\n    alignItems: \"center\",\n  },\n  // Centered content\n  centered: {\n    flex: 1,\n    justifyContent: \"center\",\n    alignItems: \"center\",\n  },\n  // Fill remaining space\n  fill: {\n    flex: 1,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### 3. React Navigation Setup\n\n**Stack Navigator:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { NavigationContainer } from ''@react-navigation/native'';\nimport { createNativeStackNavigator } from ''@react-navigation/native-stack'';\n\ntype RootStackParamList = {\n  Home: undefined;\n  Detail: { itemId: string };\n  Settings: undefined;\n};\n\nconst Stack = createNativeStackNavigator<RootStackParamList>();\n\nfunction AppNavigator() {\n  return (\n    <NavigationContainer>\n      <Stack.Navigator\n        initialRouteName=\"Home\"\n        screenOptions={{\n          headerStyle: { backgroundColor: ''#6366f1'' },\n          headerTintColor: ''#ffffff'',\n          headerTitleStyle: { fontWeight: ''600'' },\n        }}\n      >\n        <Stack.Screen\n          name=\"Home\"\n          component={HomeScreen}\n          options={{ title: ''Home'' }}\n        />\n        <Stack.Screen\n          name=\"Detail\"\n          component={DetailScreen}\n          options={({ route }) => ({\n            title: `Item ${route.params.itemId}`,\n          })}\n        />\n        <Stack.Screen name=\"Settings\" component={SettingsScreen} />\n      </Stack.Navigator>\n    </NavigationContainer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Tab Navigator:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createBottomTabNavigator } from ''@react-navigation/bottom-tabs'';\nimport { Ionicons } from ''@expo/vector-icons'';\n\ntype TabParamList = {\n  Home: undefined;\n  Search: undefined;\n  Profile: undefined;\n};\n\nconst Tab = createBottomTabNavigator<TabParamList>();\n\nfunction TabNavigator() {\n  return (\n    <Tab.Navigator\n      screenOptions={({ route }) => ({\n        tabBarIcon: ({ focused, color, size }) => {\n          const icons: Record<string, keyof typeof Ionicons.glyphMap> = {\n            Home: focused ? ''home'' : ''home-outline'',\n            Search: focused ? ''search'' : ''search-outline'',\n            Profile: focused ? ''person'' : ''person-outline'',\n          };\n          return <Ionicons name={icons[route.name]} size={size} color={color} />;\n        },\n        tabBarActiveTintColor: ''#6366f1'',\n        tabBarInactiveTintColor: ''#9ca3af'',\n      })}\n    >\n      <Tab.Screen name=\"Home\" component={HomeScreen} />\n      <Tab.Screen name=\"Search\" component={SearchScreen} />\n      <Tab.Screen name=\"Profile\" component={ProfileScreen} />\n    </Tab.Navigator>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Reanimated 3 Basics\n\n**Animated Values:**\n\n```typescript\nimport Animated, {\n  useSharedValue,\n  useAnimatedStyle,\n  withSpring,\n  withTiming,\n} from ''react-native-reanimated'';\n\nfunction AnimatedBox() {\n  const scale = useSharedValue(1);\n  const opacity = useSharedValue(1);\n\n  const animatedStyle = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({\n    transform: [{ scale: scale.value }],\n    opacity: opacity.value,\n  }));\n\n  const handlePress = () => {\n    scale.value = withSpring(1.2, {}, () => {\n      scale.value = withSpring(1);\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <Pressable onPress={handlePress}>\n      <Animated.View style={[styles.box, animatedStyle]} />\n    </Pressable>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Gesture Handler Integration:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Gesture, GestureDetector } from ''react-native-gesture-handler'';\nimport Animated, {\n  useSharedValue,\n  useAnimatedStyle,\n  withSpring,\n} from ''react-native-reanimated'';\n\nfunction DraggableCard() {\n  const translateX = useSharedValue(0);\n  const translateY = useSharedValue(0);\n\n  const gesture = Gesture.Pan()\n    .onUpdate((event) => {\n      translateX.value = event.translationX;\n      translateY.value = event.translationY;\n    })\n    .onEnd(() => {\n      translateX.value = withSpring(0);\n      translateY.value = withSpring(0);\n    });\n\n  const animatedStyle = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({\n    transform: [\n      { translateX: translateX.value },\n      { translateY: translateY.value },\n    ],\n  }));\n\n  return (\n    <GestureDetector gesture={gesture}>\n      <Animated.View style={[styles.card, animatedStyle]}>\n        <Text>Drag me!</Text>\n      </Animated.View>\n    </GestureDetector>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Platform-Specific Styling\n\n```typescript\nimport { Platform, StyleSheet } from \"react-native\";\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  container: {\n    padding: 16,\n    ...Platform.select({\n      ios: {\n        shadowColor: \"#000\",\n        shadowOffset: { width: 0, height: 2 },\n        shadowOpacity: 0.1,\n        shadowRadius: 4,\n      },\n      android: {\n        elevation: 4,\n      },\n    }),\n  },\n  text: {\n    fontFamily: Platform.OS === \"ios\" ? \"SF Pro Text\" : \"Roboto\",\n    fontSize: 16,\n  },\n});\n\n// Platform-specific components\nimport { Platform } from \"react-native\";\nconst StatusBarHeight = Platform.OS === \"ios\" ? 44 : 0;\n```\n\n## Quick Start Component\n\n```typescript\nimport React from ''react'';\nimport {\n  View,\n  Text,\n  StyleSheet,\n  Pressable,\n  Image,\n} from ''react-native'';\nimport Animated, {\n  useSharedValue,\n  useAnimatedStyle,\n  withSpring,\n} from ''react-native-reanimated'';\n\ninterface ItemCardProps {\n  title: string;\n  subtitle: string;\n  imageUrl: string;\n  onPress: () => void;\n}\n\nconst AnimatedPressable = Animated.createAnimatedComponent(Pressable);\n\nexport function ItemCard({ title, subtitle, imageUrl, onPress }: ItemCardProps) {\n  const scale = useSharedValue(1);\n\n  const animatedStyle = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({\n    transform: [{ scale: scale.value }],\n  }));\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatedPressable\n      style={[styles.card, animatedStyle]}\n      onPress={onPress}\n      onPressIn={() => { scale.value = withSpring(0.97); }}\n      onPressOut={() => { scale.value = withSpring(1); }}\n    >\n      <Image source={{ uri: imageUrl }} style={styles.image} />\n      <View style={styles.content}>\n        <Text style={styles.title} numberOfLines={1}>\n          {title}\n        </Text>\n        <Text style={styles.subtitle} numberOfLines={2}>\n          {subtitle}\n        </Text>\n      </View>\n    </AnimatedPressable>\n  );\n}\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  card: {\n    backgroundColor: ''#ffffff'',\n    borderRadius: 16,\n    overflow: ''hidden'',\n    shadowColor: ''#000'',\n    shadowOffset: { width: 0, height: 2 },\n    shadowOpacity: 0.1,\n    shadowRadius: 8,\n    elevation: 4,\n  },\n  image: {\n    width: ''100%'',\n    height: 160,\n    backgroundColor: ''#f3f4f6'',\n  },\n  content: {\n    padding: 16,\n    gap: 4,\n  },\n  title: {\n    fontSize: 18,\n    fontWeight: ''600'',\n    color: ''#1f2937'',\n  },\n  subtitle: {\n    fontSize: 14,\n    color: ''#6b7280'',\n    lineHeight: 20,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use TypeScript**: Define navigation and prop types for type safety\n2. **Memoize Components**: Use `React.memo` and `useCallback` to prevent unnecessary rerenders\n3. **Run Animations on UI Thread**: Use Reanimated worklets for 60fps animations\n4. **Avoid Inline Styles**: Use StyleSheet.create for performance\n5. **Handle Safe Areas**: Use `SafeAreaView` or `useSafeAreaInsets`\n6. **Test on Real Devices**: Simulator/emulator performance differs from real devices\n7. **Use FlatList for Lists**: Never use ScrollView with map for long lists\n8. **Platform-Specific Code**: Use Platform.select for iOS/Android differences\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Gesture Conflicts**: Wrap gestures with `GestureDetector` and use `simultaneousHandlers`\n- **Navigation Type Errors**: Define `ParamList` types for all navigators\n- **Animation Jank**: Move animations to UI thread with `runOnUI` worklets\n- **Memory Leaks**: Cancel animations and cleanup in useEffect\n- **Font Loading**: Use `expo-font` or `react-native-asset` for custom fonts\n- **Safe Area Issues**: Test on notched devices (iPhone, Android with cutouts)\n\n## Resources\n\n- [React Native Documentation](https://reactnative.dev/)\n- [React Navigation](https://reactnavigation.org/)\n- [Reanimated Documentation](https://docs.swmansion.com/react-native-reanimated/)\n- [Gesture Handler](https://docs.swmansion.com/react-native-gesture-handler/)\n- [Expo Documentation](https://docs.expo.dev/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:22:26.700Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Development Agents building cross-platform applications with native-quality UX.","zh":"适用于构建跨平台应用程序的移动开发代理，具有本地质量的UX。","ja":"モバイル開発エージェントがクロスプラットフォームアプリケーションをビルドし、ネイティブ品質のUXを実現するのに最適です。","ko":"모바일 개발 에이전트가 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 구축하고 네이티브 품질의 UX를 제공하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo móvil que crean aplicaciones de plataforma cruzada con experiencia de usuario de calidad nativa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement mobile créant des applications multiplateformes avec une expérience utilisateur de qualité native.","de":"Ideal für Mobile-Entwicklungsagenten, die Cross-Platform-Anwendungen mit einer benutzerfreundlichen Oberfläche von nativer Qualität erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que constroem aplicações cross-platform com UX de qualidade nativa.","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильной разработки, строящих кроссплатформенные приложения с UX высокого качества.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الهاتف المحمول التي تبني تطبيقات متعددة المنصات مع واجهة مستخدم ذات جودة أصلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement React Navigation 6+ routing structures and create performant animations using Reanimated 3. Provides expertise in StyleSheet optimization and responsive layout design for various screen sizes.","zh":"使代理能够实现 React Navigation 6+ 路由结构，并使用 Reanimated 3 创建高性能动画。提供 StyleSheet 优化和响应式布局设计的专业知识，以适应不同的屏幕尺寸。","ja":"エージェントが React Navigation 6+ ルーティング構造を実装し、Reanimated 3 を使用してパフォーマンスの高いアニメーションを作成できるようにします。StyleSheet の最適化と、さまざまな画面サイズに対応したレスポンシブ レイアウト デザインの専門知識を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 React Navigation 6+ 라우팅 구조를 구현하고 Reanimated 3를 사용하여 고성능 애니메이션을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. StyleSheet 최적화 및 다양한 화면 크기에 적응하는 반응형 레이아웃 디자인에 대한 전문 지식을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar estructuras de enrutamiento de React Navigation 6+ y crear animaciones de alto rendimiento utilizando Reanimated 3. Proporciona experiencia en la optimización de StyleSheet y el diseño de diseños receptivos para varios tamaños de pantalla.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des structures de routage React Navigation 6+ et de créer des animations performantes à l''aide de Reanimated 3. Fournit une expertise dans l''optimisation de StyleSheet et la conception de mises en page réactives pour différentes tailles d''écran.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, React Navigation 6+-Routing-Strukturen zu implementieren und performante Animationen mit Reanimated 3 zu erstellen. Bietet Expertenwissen in der Optimierung von StyleSheet und dem Design responsiver Layouts für verschiedene Bildschirmgrößen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem estruturas de roteamento do React Navigation 6+ e criem animações performáticas usando Reanimated 3. Fornece especialização em otimização de StyleSheet e design de layout responsivo para várias tamanhos de tela.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать структуры маршрутизации React Navigation 6+ и создавать производительные анимации с помощью Reanimated 3. Предоставляет экспертизу в оптимизации StyleSheet и проектировании адаптивного макета для различных размеров экрана.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ هياكل التوجيه React Navigation 6+ وإنشاء حركات متحركة ذات أداء عالٍ باستخدام Reanimated 3. يوفر خبرة في تحسين StyleSheet وتصميم التخطيط الاستجابي لأحجام شاشات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing complex navigation flows with React Navigation 6+","Creating performant gesture-driven animations with Reanimated 3","Building responsive layouts that adapt to different screen sizes","Optimizing component styling patterns using StyleSheet and styled-components"],"zh":["使用 React Navigation 6+ 实现复杂的导航流程","使用 Reanimated 3 创建高性能的基于手势的动画","构建能够适应不同屏幕尺寸的响应式布局","使用 StyleSheet 和 styled-components 优化组件样式模式"],"ja":["React Navigation 6+ を使用して複雑なナビゲーションフローを実装する","Reanimated 3 を使用してパフォーマンスの高いジェスチャ駆動のアニメーションを作成する","さまざまな画面サイズに適応するレスポンシブ レイアウトを構築する","StyleSheet と styled-components を使用してコンポーネントのスタイル パターンを最適化する"],"ko":["React Navigation 6+를 사용하여 복잡한 내비게이션 흐름을 구현하는 것","Reanimated 3를 사용하여 고성능의 제스처 기반 애니메이션을 생성하는 것","다양한 화면 크기에 적응하는 반응형 레이아웃을 구축하는 것","StyleSheet와 styled-components를 사용하여 컴포넌트 스타일 패턴을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar flujos de navegación complejos con React Navigation 6+","Crear animaciones de gestos de alto rendimiento con Reanimated 3","Crear diseños receptivos que se adapten a diferentes tamaños de pantalla","Optimizar patrones de estilo de componentes utilizando StyleSheet y styled-components"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des flux de navigation complexes avec React Navigation 6+","Créer des animations de gestes performantes avec Reanimated 3","Concevoir des mises en page réactives qui s''adaptent à différentes tailles d''écran","Optimiser les modèles de style de composants en utilisant StyleSheet et styled-components"],"de":["Komplexe Navigationsflüsse mit React Navigation 6+ implementieren","Performante Gesten-Animationen mit Reanimated 3 erstellen","Responsives Layout erstellen, das sich an verschiedene Bildschirmgrößen anpasst","Komponenten-Styling-Muster mit StyleSheet und styled-components optimieren"],"pt":["Implementação de fluxos de navegação complexos com React Navigation 6+","Criação de animações baseadas em gestos performáticas com Reanimated 3","Construção de layouts responsivos que se adaptam a diferentes tamanhos de tela","Otimização de padrões de estilização de componentes usando StyleSheet e styled-components"],"ru":["Реализация сложных потоков навигации с помощью React Navigation 6+","Создание производительных анимаций, управляемых жестами, с помощью Reanimated 3","Построение адаптивных макетов, которые адаптируются к различным размерам экрана","Оптимизация шаблонов стилизации компонентов с помощью StyleSheet и styled-components"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات ملاحة معقدة مع React Navigation 6+","إنشاء حركات متحركة قادرة على الإشارة بأداء عالٍ مع Reanimated 3","بناء تخطيطات استجابة تتناسب مع أحجام شاشات مختلفة","تحسين أنماط أسلوب مكونات باستخدام StyleSheet وstyled-components"]},"limitations":{"en":["React Native ecosystem specific","Requires JavaScript/TypeScript environment","Cross-platform mobile focus only"],"zh":["仅限 React Native 生态系统","需要 JavaScript/TypeScript 环境","仅限跨平台移动设备"],"ja":["React Native エコシステムのみ","JavaScript/TypeScript 環境が必要","クロスプラットフォーム モバイル デバイスのみ"],"ko":["React Native 생태계만 해당","JavaScript/TypeScript 환경이 필요","크로스 플랫폼 모바일 디바이스만 해당"],"es":["Específico del ecosistema React Native","Requiere un entorno JavaScript/TypeScript","Enfoque solo en desarrollo móvil multiplataforma"],"fr":["Spécifique à l''écosystème React Native","Nécessite un environnement JavaScript/TypeScript","Se concentre uniquement sur le développement mobile multiplateforme"],"de":["Spezifisch für das React Native-Ökosystem","Benötigt eine JavaScript/TypeScript-Umgebung","Konzentriert sich nur auf die Entwicklung von Cross-Platform-Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Ecosistema React Native específico","Requer ambiente JavaScript/TypeScript","Foco apenas em aplicativos móveis cross-platform"],"ru":["Конкретно экосистема React Native","Требует среды JavaScript/TypeScript","Фокус только на кроссплатформенных мобильных приложениях"],"ar":["بيئة React Native محددة","يتطلب بيئة JavaScript/TypeScript","التركيز فقط على التطبيقات المتنقلة متعددة المنصات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
