 usuario reutilizables y mantenibles con frameworks modernos y patrones de composición limpios","fr":"Concevez des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables et maintenables avec des frameworks modernes et des modèles de composition propres","de":"Erstellen Sie wiederverwendbare und wartbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit modernen Frameworks und sauberen ZusammensetzungsMustern","pt":"Desenvolva componentes UI reutilizáveis e mantidos com frameworks modernos e padrões de composição limpos.","ru":"Разрабатывайте многократно используемые и поддерживаемые компоненты UI с помощью современных фреймворков и чистых шаблонов композиции.","ar":"ابني مكونات واجهة المستخدم المعاد استخدامها والمتوافقة مع الإطارات الحديثة وأنماط التكوين النظيفة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["构建可复用 UI 组件","使用现代框架和组合模式","实现复杂组件组合","选择和应用 CSS-in-JS 解决方案","构建无障碍和响应式 UI 组件"],"ja":["再利用可能な UI コンポーネントの構築","最新のフレームワークと組み合わせパターンの使用","複雑なコンポーネントの構成","CSS-in-JS 解決策の選択と適用","アクセシブルでレスポンシブな UI コンポーネントの構築"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구축","최신 프레임워크와 조합 패턴 사용","복잡한 컴포넌트 조합","CSS-in-JS 솔루션 선택 및 적용","접근성과 반응성 있는 UI 컴포넌트 구축"],"es":["Diseño de bibliotecas de componentes reutilizables","Implementación de patrones de composición complejos","Elección y aplicación de soluciones CSS-in-JS","Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y responsivos","Establecimiento de APIs de componentes consistentes en todo el código"],"fr":["Conception de bibliothèques de composants réutilisables","Mise en œuvre de modèles de composition complexes","Choix et application de solutions CSS-in-JS","Création de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et responsifs","Établissement d''API de composants cohérents dans tout le code"],"de":["Erstellung von Bibliotheken wiederverwendbarer Komponenten","Implementierung von komplexen ZusammensetzungsMustern","Auswahl und Anwendung von CSS-in-JS-Lösungen","Erstellung von zugänglichen und responsiven Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Festlegung von konsistenten Komponenten-APIs im gesamten Code"],"pt":["Criação de bibliotecas de componentes reutilizáveis","Implementação de padrões de composição complexos","Escolha e aplicação de soluções CSS-in-JS","Criação de componentes UI acessíveis e responsivos","Refatoração de componentes legados para padrões modernos"],"ru":["Создание библиотек многократно используемых компонентов","Реализация сложных шаблонов композиции","Выбор и применение решений CSS-in-JS","Создание доступных и адаптивных компонентов UI","Рефакторинг устаревших компонентов в современные шаблоны"],"ar":["إنشاء مكتبات مكونات واجهة المستخدم المعاد استخدامها","تنفيذ أنماط التكوين المعقدة","اختيار وتطبيق حلول CSS-in-JS","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة والمتجاوبة","إعادة هيكلة المكونات القديمة إلى الأنماط الحديثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web 组件设计","可复用 UI 组件","现代框架","组合模式","CSS-in-JS","无障碍 UI","响应式 UI"],"ja":["Web コンポーネント設計","再利用可能な UI コンポーネント","最新のフレームワーク","組み合わせパターン","CSS-in-JS","アクセシブル UI","レスポンシブ UI"],"ko":["웹 컴포넌트 디자인","재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트","최신 프레임워크","조합 패턴","CSS-in-JS","접근성 UI","반응성 UI"],"es":["diseño de componentes web","componentes reutilizables","patrones de composición","CSS-in-JS","componentes accesibles","componentes responsivos","bibliotecas de componentes"],"fr":["conception de composants web","composants réutilisables","modèles de composition","CSS-in-JS","composants accessibles","composants responsifs","bibliothèques de composants"],"de":["Web-Komponenten-Design","wiederverwendbare Komponenten","ZusammensetzungsMuster","CSS-in-JS","zugängliche Komponenten","responsive Komponenten","Bibliotheken von Komponenten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de componentes web","componentes UI reutilizáveis","frameworks modernos","padrões de composição limpos","CSS-in-JS","componentes UI acessíveis","refatoração de componentes legados"],"ru":["проектирование веб-компонентов","многократно используемые компоненты UI","современные фреймворки","чистые шаблоны композиции","CSS-in-JS","доступные компоненты UI","рефакторинг устаревших компонентов"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات الويب","مكونات واجهة المستخدم المعاد استخدامها","الإطارات الحديثة","أنماط التكوين النظيفة","CSS-in-JS","مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة","إعادة هيكلة المكونات القديمة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-component-design","description":"Master React, Vue, and Svelte component patterns including CSS-in-JS, composition strategies, and reusable component architecture. Use when building UI component libraries, designing component APIs, or implementing frontend design systems.","bodyPreview":"# Web Component Design\n\nBuild reusable, maintainable UI components using modern frameworks with clean composition patterns and styling approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing reusable component libraries or design systems\n- Implementing complex component composition patterns\n- Choosing and applying CSS-in-JS solutions\n- Building accessible, responsive UI components\n- Creating consistent component APIs across a codebase\n- Refactoring legacy components into modern patterns\n- Implementi","body":"# Web Component Design\n\nBuild reusable, maintainable UI components using modern frameworks with clean composition patterns and styling approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing reusable component libraries or design systems\n- Implementing complex component composition patterns\n- Choosing and applying CSS-in-JS solutions\n- Building accessible, responsive UI components\n- Creating consistent component APIs across a codebase\n- Refactoring legacy components into modern patterns\n- Implementing compound components or render props\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Component Composition Patterns\n\n**Compound Components**: Related components that work together\n\n```tsx\n// Usage\n<Select value={value} onChange={setValue}>\n  <Select.Trigger>Choose option</Select.Trigger>\n  <Select.Options>\n    <Select.Option value=\"a\">Option A</Select.Option>\n    <Select.Option value=\"b\">Option B</Select.Option>\n  </Select.Options>\n</Select>\n```\n\n**Render Props**: Delegate rendering to parent\n\n```tsx\n<DataFetcher url=\"/api/users\">\n  {({ data, loading, error }) =>\n    loading ? <Spinner /> : <UserList users={data} />\n  }\n</DataFetcher>\n```\n\n**Slots (Vue/Svelte)**: Named content injection points\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <Card>\n    <template #header>Title</template>\n    <template #content>Body text</template>\n    <template #footer><Button>Action</Button></template>\n  </Card>\n</template>\n```\n\n### 2. CSS-in-JS Approaches\n\n| Solution              | Approach               | Best For                          |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Tailwind CSS**      | Utility classes        | Rapid prototyping, design systems |\n| **CSS Modules**       | Scoped CSS files       | Existing CSS, gradual adoption    |\n| **styled-components** | Template literals      | React, dynamic styling            |\n| **Emotion**           | Object/template styles | Flexible, SSR-friendly            |\n| **Vanilla Extract**   | Zero-runtime           | Performance-critical apps         |\n\n### 3. Component API Design\n\n```tsx\ninterface ButtonProps {\n  variant?: \"primary\" | \"secondary\" | \"ghost\";\n  size?: \"sm\" | \"md\" | \"lg\";\n  isLoading?: boolean;\n  isDisabled?: boolean;\n  leftIcon?: React.ReactNode;\n  rightIcon?: React.ReactNode;\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n  onClick?: () => void;\n}\n```\n\n**Principles**:\n\n- Use semantic prop names (`isLoading` vs `loading`)\n- Provide sensible defaults\n- Support composition via `children`\n- Allow style overrides via `className` or `style`\n\n## Quick Start: React Component with Tailwind\n\n```tsx\nimport { forwardRef, type ComponentPropsWithoutRef } from \"react\";\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\";\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\";\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        primary: \"bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700\",\n        secondary: \"bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-200\",\n        ghost: \"hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        sm: \"h-8 px-3 text-sm\",\n        md: \"h-10 px-4 text-sm\",\n        lg: \"h-12 px-6 text-base\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"primary\",\n      size: \"md\",\n    },\n  },\n);\n\ninterface ButtonProps\n  extends\n    ComponentPropsWithoutRef<\"button\">,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  isLoading?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport const Button = forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, isLoading, children, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <button\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size }), className)}\n      disabled={isLoading || props.disabled}\n      {...props}\n    >\n      {isLoading && <Spinner className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\" />}\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  ),\n);\nButton.displayName = \"Button\";\n```\n\n## Framework Patterns\n\n### React: Compound Components\n\n```tsx\nimport { createContext, useContext, useState, type ReactNode } from \"react\";\n\ninterface AccordionContextValue {\n  openItems: Set<string>;\n  toggle: (id: string) => void;\n}\n\nconst AccordionContext = createContext<AccordionContextValue | null>(null);\n\nfunction useAccordion() {\n  const context = useContext(AccordionContext);\n  if (!context) throw new Error(\"Must be used within Accordion\");\n  return context;\n}\n\nexport function Accordion({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {\n  const [openItems, setOpenItems] = useState<Set<string>>(new Set());\n\n  const toggle = (id: string) => {\n    setOpenItems((prev) => {\n      const next = new Set(prev);\n      next.has(id) ? next.delete(id) : next.add(id);\n      return next;\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <AccordionContext.Provider value={{ openItems, toggle }}>\n      <div className=\"divide-y\">{children}</div>\n    </AccordionContext.Provider>\n  );\n}\n\nAccordion.Item = function AccordionItem({\n  id,\n  title,\n  children,\n}: {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  children: ReactNode;\n}) {\n  const { openItems, toggle } = useAccordion();\n  const isOpen = openItems.has(id);\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button onClick={() => toggle(id)} className=\"w-full text-left py-3\">\n        {title}\n      </button>\n      {isOpen && <div className=\"pb-3\">{children}</div>}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n### Vue 3: Composables\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, computed, provide, inject, type InjectionKey } from \"vue\";\n\ninterface TabsContext {\n  activeTab: Ref<string>;\n  setActive: (id: string) => void;\n}\n\nconst TabsKey: InjectionKey<TabsContext> = Symbol(\"tabs\");\n\n// Parent component\nconst activeTab = ref(\"tab-1\");\nprovide(TabsKey, {\n  activeTab,\n  setActive: (id: string) => {\n    activeTab.value = id;\n  },\n});\n\n// Child component usage\nconst tabs = inject(TabsKey);\nconst isActive = computed(() => tabs?.activeTab.value === props.id);\n</script>\n```\n\n### Svelte 5: Runes\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  interface Props {\n    variant?: ''primary'' | ''secondary'';\n    size?: ''sm'' | ''md'' | ''lg'';\n    onclick?: () => void;\n    children: import(''svelte'').Snippet;\n  }\n\n  let { variant = ''primary'', size = ''md'', onclick, children }: Props = $props();\n\n  const classes = $derived(\n    `btn btn-${variant} btn-${size}`\n  );\n</script>\n\n<button class={classes} {onclick}>\n  {@render children()}\n</button>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Single Responsibility**: Each component does one thing well\n2. **Prop Drilling Prevention**: Use context for deeply nested data\n3. **Accessible by Default**: Include ARIA attributes, keyboard support\n4. **Controlled vs Uncontrolled**: Support both patterns when appropriate\n5. **Forward Refs**: Allow parent access to DOM nodes\n6. **Memoization**: Use `React.memo`, `useMemo` for expensive renders\n7. **Error Boundaries**: Wrap components that may fail\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Prop Explosion**: Too many props - consider composition instead\n- **Style Conflicts**: Use scoped styles or CSS Modules\n- **Re-render Cascades**: Profile with React DevTools, memo appropriately\n- **Accessibility Gaps**: Test with screen readers and keyboard navigation\n- **Bundle Size**: Tree-shake unused component variants\n\n## Resources\n\n- [React Component Patterns](https://reactpatterns.com/)\n- [Vue Composition API Guide](https://vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html)\n- [Svelte Component Documentation](https://svelte.dev/docs/svelte-components)\n- [Radix UI Primitives](https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives)\n- [shadcn/ui Components](https://ui.shadcn.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:22:52.730Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI component development capabilities with modern frameworks and CSS-in-JS solutions.","zh":"非常适合需要使用现代框架和CSS-in-JS解决方案开发高级UI组件的前端代理。","ja":"モダンなフレームワークとCSS-in-JSソリューションを使用して高度なUIコンポーネントを開発する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"모던 프레임워크와 CSS-in-JS 솔루션을 사용하여 고급 UI 컴포넌트를 개발해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de componentes de interfaz de usuario avanzados con frameworks modernos y soluciones CSS-in-JS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de développement de composants d''interface utilisateur avancés avec des frameworks modernes et des solutions CSS-in-JS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte UI-Komponenten-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit modernen Frameworks und CSS-in-JS-Lösungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de componentes de interface do usuário com frameworks modernos e soluções CSS-in-JS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с использованием современных фреймворков и решений CSS-in-JS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتطوير مكونات واجهة المستخدم مع الإطارات الحديثة وحلول CSS-in-JS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build reusable, maintainable UI components using clean composition patterns, styling approaches, and accessible design principles, while implementing complex component composition patterns and choosing optimal CSS-in-JS solutions like styled-components or emotion.","zh":"赋予代理构建可重用、可维护的UI组件的能力，使用干净的组合模式、样式方法和无障碍设计原则，同时实现复杂的组件组合模式，并选择最优的CSS-in-JS解决方案，如styled-components或emotion。","ja":"クリーンなコンポジションパターン、スタイリングアプローチ、無障碍設計原則を使用して再利用可能で、メンテナンス可能なUIコンポーネントを構築するエージェントの能力を付与し、複雑なコンポーネントコンポジションパターンを実装し、最適なCSS-in-JSソリューション（例：styled-componentsまたはemotion）を選択します。","ko":"클린한 컴포지션 패턴, 스타일링 방법, 접근성 디자인 원칙을 사용하여 재사용 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 복잡한 컴포넌트 컴포지션 패턴을 구현하고, 최적의 CSS-in-JS 솔루션(styled-components 또는 emotion 등)을 선택합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables y mantenibles utilizando patrones de composición limpios, enfoques de estilo y principios de diseño accesibles, mientras implementan patrones de composición de componentes complejos y eligen soluciones CSS-in-JS óptimas como styled-components o emotion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables et maintenables en utilisant des modèles de composition propres, des approches de style et des principes de conception accessibles, tout en implémentant des modèles de composition de composants complexes et en choisissant des solutions CSS-in-JS optimales comme styled-components ou emotion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, wiederverwendbare und wartbare Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten zu erstellen, indem sie saubere Zusammensetzungsmodelle, Styling-Ansätze und zugängliche Designprinzipien verwenden, während sie komplexe Komponenten-Zusammensetzungsmodelle implementieren und optimale CSS-in-JS-Lösungen wie styled-components oder emotion wählen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir componentes de UI reutilizáveis, mantidos e acessíveis, utilizando padrões de composição limpos, abordagens de styling e princípios de design acessível, enquanto implementam padrões de composição de componentes complexos e escolhem soluções CSS-in-JS ótimas como styled-components ou emotion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать многократно используемые, поддерживаемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, используя чистые шаблоны композиции, подходы к стилизации и принципы доступного дизайна, а также реализуя сложные шаблоны композиции компонентов и выбирая оптимальные решения CSS-in-JS, такие как styled-components или emotion.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والصيانة والمتوافقة مع معايير الوصول، باستخدام أنماط تركيب نظيفة ونهج تنسيق ومبادئ تصميم متوافقة مع معايير الوصول، أثناء تنفيذ أنماط تركيب مكونات معقدة واختيار حلول CSS-in-JS المثلى مثل styled-components أو emotion."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing reusable component libraries for design systems","Implementing complex component composition patterns with modern frameworks","Building accessible, responsive UI components with consistent APIs","Refactoring legacy components into modern, maintainable patterns"],"zh":["为设计系统设计可重用组件库","使用现代框架实现复杂组件组合模式","构建可访问、响应式UI组件，具有一致的API","将遗留组件重构为现代、可维护模式"],"ja":["デザインシステムのための再利用可能コンポーネントライブラリの設計","モダンなフレームワークを使用した複雑なコンポーネントコンポジションパターンの実装","アクセシブルでレスポンシブなUIコンポーネントの構築、一貫したAPIを備える","レガシーコンポーネントのリファクタリング、モダンでメンテナンス可能なパターンへの"],"ko":["디자인 시스템을 위한 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트 라이브러리의 설계","모던 프레임워크를 사용한 복잡한 컴포넌트 컴포지션 패턴의 구현","접근성과 반응성이 뛰어난 UI 컴포넌트의 구축, 일관된 API를 가짐","레거시 컴포넌트를 모던하고 유지 보수 가능한 패턴으로 리팩토링"],"es":["Diseñar bibliotecas de componentes reutilizables para sistemas de diseño","Implementar patrones de composición de componentes complejos con frameworks modernos","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y responsivos con API coherentes","Reorganizar componentes heredados en patrones modernos y mantenibles"],"fr":["Concevoir des bibliothèques de composants réutilisables pour les systèmes de conception","Implémenter des modèles de composition de composants complexes avec des frameworks modernes","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et responsifs avec des API cohérentes","Réorganiser les composants hérités en modèles modernes et maintenables"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Komponentenbibliotheken für Designsysteme entwerfen","Komplexe Komponenten-Zusammensetzungsmodelle mit modernen Frameworks implementieren","Zugängliche und responsive Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit konsistenten APIs erstellen","Veraltete Komponenten in moderne, wartbare Muster umstrukturieren"],"pt":["Projeto de bibliotecas de componentes reutilizáveis para sistemas de design","Implementação de padrões de composição de componentes complexos com frameworks modernos","Construção de componentes de UI acessíveis e responsivos com APIs consistentes","Reestruturação de componentes legados em padrões modernos e mantidos"],"ru":["Проектирование библиотек многократно используемых компонентов для систем дизайна","Реализация сложных шаблонов композиции компонентов с использованием современных фреймворков","Создание доступных и адаптивных компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с последовательными API","Перестройка устаревших компонентов в современные, поддерживаемые шаблоны"],"ar":["تصميم مكتبات مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لأنظمة التصميم","تنفيذ أنماط تركيب مكونات معقدة باستخدام الإطارات الحديثة","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة مع معايير الوصول والمتوافقة مع أجهزة مختلفة والأحجام المختلفة، مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متسقة","إعادة هيكلة المكونات التقليدية إلى أنماط حديثة ومتوافقة مع معايير الصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of modern frontend frameworks","Familiarity with CSS-in-JS solutions and styling approaches necessary","May require additional setup for accessibility and responsiveness features"],"zh":["需要现代前端框架的知识","需要对CSS-in-JS解决方案和样式方法有所了解","可能需要额外的设置以支持无障碍和响应性功能"],"ja":["モダンなフロントエンドフレームワークの知識が必要","CSS-in-JSソリューションとスタイリングアプローチの知識が必要","アクセシビリティとレスポンシブ性の機能をサポートするために追加の設定が必要になる場合"],"ko":["모던 프론트엔드 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","CSS-in-JS 솔루션 및 스타일링 방법에 대한 지식이 필요","접근성 및 반응성 기능을 지원하기 위해 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de frameworks frontend modernos","Familiaridad con soluciones CSS-in-JS y enfoques de estilo necesarios","Puede requerir configuración adicional para características de accesibilidad y responsividad"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des frameworks frontend modernes","Familiarité avec les solutions CSS-in-JS et les approches de style nécessaires","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les fonctionnalités d''accessibilité et de responsivité"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse moderner Frontend-Frameworks","Vertrautheit mit CSS-in-JS-Lösungen und Styling-Ansätzen erforderlich","Kann zusätzliche Einrichtung für Zugänglichkeits- und Responsivitätsfunktionen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de frameworks frontend modernos","Familiaridade com soluções CSS-in-JS e abordagens de styling necessária","Pode exigir configuração adicional para recursos de acessibilidade e responsividade"],"ru":["Требует знания современных фреймворков Frontend","Необходимо знакомство с решениями CSS-in-JS и подходами к стилизации","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для функций доступности и адаптивности"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالإطارات الأمامية الحديثة","الاحترافية بحلول CSS-in-JS والنهج التنسيقية ضرورية","يمكن أن يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا لميزات الوصول والاستجابة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
