|\n| Fix dependency issues | \"fix my dependency problems\" |\n| Security audit | \"audit dependencies","body":"# Dependency Updater\n\nSmart dependency management for any language with automatic detection and safe updates.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```\nupdate my dependencies\n```\n\nThe skill auto-detects your project type and handles the rest.\n\n---\n\n## Triggers\n\n| Trigger | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Update dependencies | \"update dependencies\", \"update deps\" |\n| Check outdated | \"check for outdated packages\" |\n| Fix dependency issues | \"fix my dependency problems\" |\n| Security audit | \"audit dependencies for vulnerabilities\" |\n| Diagnose deps | \"diagnose dependency issues\" |\n\n---\n\n## Supported Languages\n\n| Language | Package File | Update Tool | Audit Tool |\n|----------|--------------|-------------|------------|\n| **Node.js** | package.json | `taze` | `npm audit` |\n| **Python** | requirements.txt, pyproject.toml | `pip-review` | `safety`, `pip-audit` |\n| **Go** | go.mod | `go get -u` | `govulncheck` |\n| **Rust** | Cargo.toml | `cargo update` | `cargo audit` |\n| **Ruby** | Gemfile | `bundle update` | `bundle audit` |\n| **Java** | pom.xml, build.gradle | `mvn versions:*` | `mvn dependency:*` |\n| **.NET** | *.csproj | `dotnet outdated` | `dotnet list package --vulnerable` |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Update Type | Version Change | Action |\n|-------------|----------------|--------|\n| **Fixed** | No `^` or `~` | Skip (intentionally pinned) |\n| **PATCH** | `x.y.z` → `x.y.Z` | Auto-apply |\n| **MINOR** | `x.y.z` → `x.Y.0` | Auto-apply |\n| **MAJOR** | `x.y.z` → `X.0.0` | Prompt user individually |\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nUser Request\n    │\n    ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Step 1: DETECT PROJECT TYPE                         │\n│ • Scan for package files (package.json, go.mod...) │\n│ • Identify package manager                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Step 2: CHECK PREREQUISITES                         │\n│ • Verify required tools are installed               │\n│ • Suggest installation if missing                   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Step 3: SCAN FOR UPDATES                            │\n│ • Run language-specific outdated check              │\n│ • Categorize: MAJOR / MINOR / PATCH / Fixed         │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Step 4: AUTO-APPLY SAFE UPDATES                     │\n│ • Apply MINOR and PATCH automatically               │\n│ • Report what was updated                           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Step 5: PROMPT FOR MAJOR UPDATES                    │\n│ • AskUserQuestion for each MAJOR update             │\n│ • Show current → new version                        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Step 6: APPLY APPROVED MAJORS                       │\n│ • Update only approved packages                     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Step 7: FINALIZE                                    │\n│ • Run install command                               │\n│ • Run security audit                                │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Commands by Language\n\n### Node.js (npm/yarn/pnpm)\n\n```bash\n# Check prerequisites\nscripts/check-tool.sh taze \"npm install -g taze\"\n\n# Scan for updates\ntaze\n\n# Apply minor/patch\ntaze minor --write\n\n# Apply specific majors\ntaze major --write --include pkg1,pkg2\n\n# Monorepo support\ntaze -r  # recursive\n\n# Security\nnpm audit\nnpm audit fix\n```\n\n### Python\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated\npip list --outdated\n\n# Update all (careful!)\npip-review --auto\n\n# Update specific\npip install --upgrade package-name\n\n# Security\npip-audit\nsafety check\n```\n\n### Go\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated\ngo list -m -u all\n\n# Update all\ngo get -u ./...\n\n# Tidy up\ngo mod tidy\n\n# Security\ngovulncheck ./...\n```\n\n### Rust\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated\ncargo outdated\n\n# Update within semver\ncargo update\n\n# Security\ncargo audit\n```\n\n### Ruby\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated\nbundle outdated\n\n# Update all\nbundle update\n\n# Update specific\nbundle update --conservative gem-name\n\n# Security\nbundle audit\n```\n\n### Java (Maven)\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated\nmvn versions:display-dependency-updates\n\n# Update to latest\nmvn versions:use-latest-releases\n\n# Security\nmvn dependency:tree\nmvn dependency-check:check\n```\n\n### .NET\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated\ndotnet list package --outdated\n\n# Update specific\ndotnet add package PackageName\n\n# Security\ndotnet list package --vulnerable\n```\n\n---\n\n## Diagnosis Mode\n\nWhen dependencies are broken, run diagnosis:\n\n### Common Issues & Fixes\n\n| Issue | Symptoms | Fix |\n|-------|----------|-----|\n| **Version Conflict** | \"Cannot resolve dependency tree\" | Clean install, use overrides/resolutions |\n| **Peer Dependency** | \"Peer dependency not satisfied\" | Install required peer version |\n| **Security Vuln** | `npm audit` shows issues | `npm audit fix` or manual update |\n| **Unused Deps** | Bloated bundle | Run `depcheck` (Node) or equivalent |\n| **Duplicate Deps** | Multiple versions installed | Run `npm dedupe` or equivalent |\n\n### Emergency Fixes\n\n```bash\n# Node.js - Nuclear reset\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\nnpm cache clean --force\nnpm install\n\n# Python - Clean virtualenv\nrm -rf venv\npython -m venv venv\nsource venv/bin/activate\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Go - Reset modules\nrm go.sum\ngo mod tidy\n```\n\n---\n\n## Security Audit\n\nRun security checks for any project:\n\n```bash\n# Node.js\nnpm audit\nnpm audit --json | jq ''.metadata.vulnerabilities''\n\n# Python\npip-audit\nsafety check\n\n# Go\ngovulncheck ./...\n\n# Rust\ncargo audit\n\n# Ruby\nbundle audit\n\n# .NET\ndotnet list package --vulnerable\n```\n\n### Severity Response\n\n| Severity | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| **Critical** | Fix immediately |\n| **High** | Fix within 24h |\n| **Moderate** | Fix within 1 week |\n| **Low** | Fix in next release |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Why | Instead |\n|-------|-----|---------|\n| Update fixed versions | Intentionally pinned | Skip them |\n| Auto-apply MAJOR | Breaking changes | Prompt user |\n| Batch MAJOR prompts | Loses context | Prompt individually |\n| Skip lock file | Irreproducible builds | Always commit lock files |\n| Ignore security alerts | Vulnerabilities | Address by severity |\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter updates:\n\n- [ ] Updates scanned without errors\n- [ ] MINOR/PATCH auto-applied\n- [ ] MAJOR updates prompted individually\n- [ ] Fixed versions untouched\n- [ ] Lock file updated\n- [ ] Install command ran\n- [ ] Security audit passed (or issues noted)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Project Detection</strong></summary>\n\nThe skill auto-detects project type by scanning for package files:\n\n| File Found | Language | Package Manager |\n|------------|----------|-----------------|\n| `package.json` | Node.js | npm/yarn/pnpm |\n| `requirements.txt` | Python | pip |\n| `pyproject.toml` | Python | pip/poetry |\n| `Pipfile` | Python | pipenv |\n| `go.mod` | Go | go modules |\n| `Cargo.toml` | Rust | cargo |\n| `Gemfile` | Ruby | bundler |\n| `pom.xml` | Java | Maven |\n| `build.gradle` | Java/Kotlin | Gradle |\n| `*.csproj` | .NET | dotnet |\n\n**Detection order matters for monorepos:**\n1. Check current directory first\n2. Then check for workspace/monorepo patterns\n3. Offer to run recursively if applicable\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Node.js with taze</strong></summary>\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install taze globally (recommended)\nnpm install -g taze\n\n# Or use npx\nnpx taze\n```\n\n### Smart Update Flow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Scan all updates\ntaze\n\n# 2. Apply safe updates (minor + patch)\ntaze minor --write\n\n# 3. For each major, prompt user:\n#    \"Update @types/node from ^20.0.0 to ^22.0.0?\"\n#    If yes, add to approved list\n\n# 4. Apply approved majors\ntaze major --write --include approved-pkg1,approved-pkg2\n\n# 5. Install\nnpm install  # or pnpm install / yarn\n```\n\n### Auto-Approve List\n\nSome packages have frequent major bumps but are backward-compatible:\n\n| Package | Reason |\n|---------|--------|\n| `lucide-react` | Icon library, majors are additive |\n| `@types/*` | Type definitions, usually safe |\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Version Strategies</strong></summary>\n\n### Semantic Versioning\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH (e.g., 2.3.1)\n\nMAJOR: Breaking changes - requires code changes\nMINOR: New features - backward compatible\nPATCH: Bug fixes - backward compatible\n```\n\n### Range Specifiers\n\n| Specifier | Meaning | Example |\n|-----------|---------|---------|\n| `^1.2.3` | Minor + Patch OK | `>=1.2.3 <2.0.0` |\n| `~1.2.3` | Patch only | `>=1.2.3 <1.3.0` |\n| `1.2.3` | Exact (fixed) | Only `1.2.3` |\n| `>=1.2.3` | At least | Any `>=1.2.3` |\n| `*` | Any | Latest (dangerous) |\n\n### Recommended Strategy\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"critical-lib\": \"1.2.3\",      // Exact for critical\n    \"stable-lib\": \"~1.2.3\",       // Patch only for stable\n    \"modern-lib\": \"^1.2.3\"        // Minor OK for active\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Conflict Resolution</strong></summary>\n\n### Node.js Conflicts\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\nnpm ls package-name      # See dependency tree\nnpm explain package-name # Why installed\nyarn why package-name    # Yarn equivalent\n```\n\n**Resolution with overrides:**\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"overrides\": {\n    \"lodash\": \"^4.18.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Resolution with resolutions (Yarn):**\n```json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"lodash\": \"^4.18.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Python Conflicts\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\npip check\npipdeptree -p package-name\n```\n\n**Resolution:**\n```bash\n# Use virtual environment\npython -m venv venv\nsource venv/bin/activate\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Or use constraints\npip install -c constraints.txt -r requirements.txt\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n## Script Reference\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/check-tool.sh` | Verify tool is installed |\n| `scripts/run-taze.sh` | Run taze with proper flags |\n\n---\n\n## Related Tools\n\n| Tool | Language | Purpose |\n|------|----------|---------|\n| [taze](https://github.com/antfu-collective/taze) | Node.js | Smart dependency updates |\n| [npm-check-updates](https://github.com/raineorshine/npm-check-updates) | Node.js | Alternative to taze |\n| [pip-review](https://github.com/jgonggrijp/pip-review) | Python | Interactive pip updates |\n| [cargo-edit](https://github.com/killercup/cargo-edit) | Rust | Cargo dependency management |\n| [bundler-audit](https://github.com/rubysec/bundler-audit) | Ruby | Security auditing |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:23:19.180Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated dependency management and security auditing capabilities.","zh":"适合需要自动依赖管理和安全审计功能的开发代理。","ja":"自動依存関係管理およびセキュリティ監査機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동 의존성 관리 및 보안 감사 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan administración automática de dependencias y capacidades de auditoría de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion automatique des dépendances et des capacités d''audit de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Abhängigkeitsverwaltung und Sicherheitsauditfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de dependências automatizado e capacidades de auditoria de segurança.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы автоматизированное управление зависимостями и возможности аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة التبعيات الآلية وقدرات التدقيق الأمني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically detect and safely update dependencies for any language, ensuring project security and integrity through triggers like ''update dependencies'' and ''security audit'', handling package updates and fixing dependency issues.","zh":"赋予代理自动检测和安全更新依赖项的能力，无论语言如何，通过诸如''更新依赖项''和''安全审计''等触发器，确保项目安全和完整性，处理包更新和修复依赖问题。","ja":"エージェントに自動で依存関係を検出して安全に更新する能力を与え、言語に関係なく、''依存関係を更新する''や''セキュリティ監査''などのトリガーを使用して、プロジェクトのセキュリティと完全性を確保し、パッケージの更新や依存関係の問題の修復を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 자동으로 종속성을 감지하고 안전하게 업데이트할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 언어에 관계없이 ''의존성 업데이트'' 또는 ''보안 감사''와 같은 트리거를 통해 프로젝트 보안 및 무결성을 보장하고, 패키지 업데이트와 종속성 문제를 해결하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar automáticamente y actualizar de forma segura las dependencias para cualquier lenguaje, garantizando la seguridad y la integridad del proyecto a través de desencadenadores como ''actualizar dependencias'' y ''auditoría de seguridad'', manejo de actualizaciones de paquetes y solución de problemas de dependencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter automatiquement et de mettre à jour en toute sécurité les dépendances pour n''importe quel langage, en garantissant la sécurité et l''intégrité du projet via des déclencheurs tels que ''mettre à jour les dépendances'' et ''audit de sécurité'', en gérant les mises à jour de packages et en résolvant les problèmes de dépendance.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Abhängigkeiten automatisch zu erkennen und sicher zu aktualisieren, für jede Sprache, die Projektsicherheit und -integrität durch Auslöser wie ''Abhängigkeiten aktualisieren'' und ''Sicherheitsaudit'' sicherzustellen, Paketaktualisierungen zu verwalten und Abhängigkeitsprobleme zu beheben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar automaticamente e atualizar com segurança as dependências para qualquer linguagem, garantindo a segurança e a integridade do projeto por meio de gatilhos como ''atualizar dependências'' e ''auditoria de segurança'', tratando atualizações de pacotes e corrigindo problemas de dependência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически обнаруживать и безопасно обновлять зависимости для любого языка, обеспечивая безопасность и целостность проекта посредством триггеров, таких как ''обновление зависимостей'' и ''аудит безопасности'', обработки обновлений пакетов и исправления проблем с зависимостями.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الكشف التلقائي عن التحديثات الآمنة للتبعيات لأي لغة، ضامنًا أمن المشروع وسلامته من خلال محفزات مثل ''تحديث التبعيات'' و ''فحص الأمن''، معالجة تحديثات الحزم وتصحيح مشاكل التبعية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dependency updates for project maintenance","Debugging dependency issues with ''fix my dependency problems''","Performing security audits to identify outdated packages"],"zh":["自动更新项目维护的依赖项","使用''修复我的依赖问题''调试依赖问题","执行安全审计以识别过时的包"],"ja":["プロジェクトメンテナンスの依存関係を自動更新する","''私の依存関係の問題を修正''で依存関係の問題をデバッグする","古くなったパッケージを特定するためにセキュリティ監査を実行する"],"ko":["프로젝트 유지 보수를 위한 종속성을 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","''내 종속성 문제를 수정''으로 종속성 문제를 디버깅하는 것","過期된 패키지를 식별하기 위한 보안 감사를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de dependencias para el mantenimiento de proyectos","Depurar problemas de dependencias con ''arreglar mis problemas de dependencia''","Realizar auditorías de seguridad para identificar paquetes obsoletos"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour des dépendances pour la maintenance de projets","Déboguer les problèmes de dépendance avec ''réparer mes problèmes de dépendance''","Effectuer des audits de sécurité pour identifier les packages obsolètes"],"de":["Automatisieren von Abhängigkeitsupdates für die Wartung von Projekten","Beheben von Abhängigkeitsproblemen mit ''beheben Sie meine Abhängigkeitsprobleme''","Durchführen von Sicherheitsaudits, um veraltete Pakete zu identifizieren"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de dependências para manutenção de projetos","Depurar problemas de dependência com ''corrigir meus problemas de dependência''","Realizar auditorias de segurança para identificar pacotes desatualizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления зависимостей для поддержки проектов","Отлаживать проблемы с зависимостями с помощью ''исправить мои проблемы с зависимостями''","Провести аудит безопасности для выявления устаревших пакетов"],"ar":["تحديث التبعيات تلقائيًا لصيانة المشاريع","تصحيح مشاكل التبعية باستخدام ''اصحح مشاكلي مع التبعيات''","إجراء فحوصات أمنية لتحديد الحزم القديمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project type auto-detection capabilities","May need additional configuration for complex project setups"],"zh":["需要项目类型自动检测能力","可能需要为复杂项目设置进行额外配置"],"ja":["プロジェクトタイプの自動検出機能が必要","複雑なプロジェクト設定の場合、追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["프로젝트 유형 자동 감지 기능이 필요함","복잡한 프로젝트 설정의 경우 추가적인 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de autodetección de tipo de proyecto","Puede necesitar configuración adicional para configuraciones de proyecto complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de détection automatique du type de projet","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les configurations de projet complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Fähigkeiten zur automatischen Erkennung von Projekttypen","Kann für komplexe Projektsets eine zusätzliche Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de detecção automática de tipo de projeto","Pode precisar de configuração adicional para configurações de projeto complexas"],"ru":["Требует возможностей автоматического обнаружения типа проекта","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для сложных конфигураций проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب إمكانيات الكشف التلقائي عن نوع المشروع","قد يحتاج إلى تكوين إضافي لتعيينات مشروع معقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
