igns, um Schnittstellen zu erstellen, die auf allen Geräten adaptierbar sind","pt":"Desenvolva habilidades em design responsivo para criar interfaces adaptáveis e atraentes","ru":"Развивайте навыки в области респонсивного дизайна для создания адаптируемых и привлекательных интерфейсов","ar":"طور مهاراتك في تصميم المستجيب لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم المستجيبة والمثيرة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["移动优先的响应式布局","基于容器查询的组件响应性","流体字体和间距比例","使用CSS Grid和Flexbox的复杂布局","断点策略的设计系统","响应式图片和媒体"],"ja":["モバイルファーストのレスポンシブレイアウト","コンテナクエリを使用したコンポーネントのレスポンシブ性","流体フォントとスペーシングスケール","CSS GridとFlexboxを使用した複雑なレイアウト","ブレークポイント戦略のデザインシステム","レスポンシブ画像とメディア"],"ko":["모바일 우선의 반응형 레이아웃","컨테이너 쿼리를 사용한 컴포넌트 반응형","흐르기 폰트와 간격 비율","CSS Grid와 Flexbox를 사용한 복잡한 레이아웃","브레이크포인트 전략의 디자인 시스템","반응형 이미지와 미디어"],"es":["Implementación de diseños responsivos para móviles","Uso de consultas de contenedores para componentes responsivos","Creación de escalas de tipografía y espaciado fluidas","Creación de diseños complejos con CSS Grid y Flexbox","Diseño de estrategias de puntos de interrupción para sistemas de diseño","Implementación de imágenes y medios responsivos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de conceptions réactives pour les appareils mobiles","Utilisation de requêtes de conteneurs pour des composants réactifs","Création d''échelles de typographie et d''espacement fluides","Création de mises en page complexes avec CSS Grid et Flexbox","Conception de stratégies de points de rupture pour les systèmes de conception","Mise en œuvre d''images et de médias réactifs"],"de":["Implementierung responsiver Designs für mobile Geräte","Verwendung von Container-Abfragen für komponentenbasierte Responsivität","Erstellung von Fluid-Typografie- und Abstandsskalen","Erstellung komplexer Layouts mit CSS Grid und Flexbox","Entwurf von Breakpoint-Strategien für Design-Systeme","Implementierung responsiver Bilder und Medien"],"pt":["Implementação de layouts responsivos para dispositivos móveis","Uso de consultas de contêiner para componentes responsivos","Criação de escalas de tipografia e espaçamento fluidas","Construção de layouts complexos com CSS Grid e Flexbox","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de quebra para sistemas de design"],"ru":["Реализация респонсивных макетов для мобильных устройств","Использование запросов контейнера для компонентов с респонсивным дизайном","Создание жидких масштабов типографики и интервала","Строительство сложных макетов с помощью CSS Grid и Flexbox","Разработка стратегий разрыва для систем дизайна"],"ar":["تنفيذ تخطيطات مستجيبة لأجهزة المحمول","استخدام استعلامات الحاوية لمكونات التصميم المستجيب","إنشاء مقاييس طباعة وفراغ سائل","بناء تخطيطات معقدة باستخدام شبكة CSS و Flexbox","تطوير استراتيجيات كسر للنظم التصميمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["响应式设计","移动优先","容器查询","流体字体","CSS Grid","Flexbox","断点策略","设计系统","响应式图片"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザイン","モバイルファースト","コンテナクエリ","流体フォント","CSS Grid","Flexbox","ブレークポイント戦略","デザインシステム","レスポンシブ画像"],"ko":["반응형 디자인","모바일 우선","컨테이너 쿼리","흐르기 폰트","CSS Grid","Flexbox","브레이크포인트 전략","디자인 시스템","반응형 이미지"],"es":["diseño responsivo","desarrollo web","diseño móvil","CSS Grid","Flexbox","tipografía fluida","imagenes responsivas","media query"],"fr":["conception réactive","développement web","conception mobile","CSS Grid","Flexbox","typographie fluide","images réactives","requête média"],"de":["responsives Design","Webentwicklung","Mobile-Design","CSS Grid","Flexbox","Fließende Typografie","responsive Bilder","Medienabfrage"],"pt":["design responsivo","desenvolvimento web","layout responsivo","tipografia fluida","CSS Grid","Flexbox","quebra de layout","sistemas de design"],"ru":["респонсивный дизайн","веб-разработка","респонсивный макет","жидкая типография","CSS Grid","Flexbox","разрыв макета","системы дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم مستجيب","تطوير ويب","تخطيط مستجيب","طباعة سائلة","CSS Grid","Flexbox","كسر التصميم","نظم التصميم"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"responsive-design","description":"Implement modern responsive layouts using container queries, fluid typography, CSS Grid, and mobile-first breakpoint strategies. Use when building adaptive interfaces, implementing fluid layouts, or creating component-level responsive behavior.","bodyPreview":"# Responsive Design\n\nMaster modern responsive design techniques to create interfaces that adapt seamlessly across all screen sizes and device contexts.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing mobile-first responsive layouts\n- Using container queries for component-based responsiveness\n- Creating fluid typography and spacing scales\n- Building complex layouts with CSS Grid and Flexbox\n- Designing breakpoint strategies for design systems\n- Implementing responsive images and media\n- Creating adapt","body":"# Responsive Design\n\nMaster modern responsive design techniques to create interfaces that adapt seamlessly across all screen sizes and device contexts.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing mobile-first responsive layouts\n- Using container queries for component-based responsiveness\n- Creating fluid typography and spacing scales\n- Building complex layouts with CSS Grid and Flexbox\n- Designing breakpoint strategies for design systems\n- Implementing responsive images and media\n- Creating adaptive navigation patterns\n- Building responsive tables and data displays\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Container Queries\n\n- Component-level responsiveness independent of viewport\n- Container query units (cqi, cqw, cqh)\n- Style queries for conditional styling\n- Fallbacks for browser support\n\n### 2. Fluid Typography & Spacing\n\n- CSS clamp() for fluid scaling\n- Viewport-relative units (vw, vh, dvh)\n- Fluid type scales with min/max bounds\n- Responsive spacing systems\n\n### 3. Layout Patterns\n\n- CSS Grid for 2D layouts\n- Flexbox for 1D distribution\n- Intrinsic layouts (content-based sizing)\n- Subgrid for nested grid alignment\n\n### 4. Breakpoint Strategy\n\n- Mobile-first media queries\n- Content-based breakpoints\n- Design token integration\n- Feature queries (@supports)\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Modern Breakpoint Scale\n\n```css\n/* Mobile-first breakpoints */\n/* Base: Mobile (< 640px) */\n@media (min-width: 640px) {\n  /* sm: Landscape phones, small tablets */\n}\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  /* md: Tablets */\n}\n@media (min-width: 1024px) {\n  /* lg: Laptops, small desktops */\n}\n@media (min-width: 1280px) {\n  /* xl: Desktops */\n}\n@media (min-width: 1536px) {\n  /* 2xl: Large desktops */\n}\n\n/* Tailwind CSS equivalent */\n/* sm:  @media (min-width: 640px) */\n/* md:  @media (min-width: 768px) */\n/* lg:  @media (min-width: 1024px) */\n/* xl:  @media (min-width: 1280px) */\n/* 2xl: @media (min-width: 1536px) */\n```\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Container Queries\n\n```css\n/* Define a containment context */\n.card-container {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  container-name: card;\n}\n\n/* Query the container, not the viewport */\n@container card (min-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;\n    gap: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  .card-image {\n    aspect-ratio: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n@container card (min-width: 600px) {\n  .card {\n    grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .card-title {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Container query units */\n.card-title {\n  /* 5% of container width, clamped between 1rem and 2rem */\n  font-size: clamp(1rem, 5cqi, 2rem);\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// React component with container queries\nfunction ResponsiveCard({ title, image, description }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"@container\">\n      <article className=\"flex flex-col @md:flex-row @md:gap-4\">\n        <img\n          src={image}\n          alt=\"\"\n          className=\"w-full @md:w-48 @lg:w-64 aspect-video @md:aspect-square object-cover\"\n        />\n        <div className=\"p-4 @md:p-0\">\n          <h2 className=\"text-lg @md:text-xl @lg:text-2xl font-semibold\">\n            {title}\n          </h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-2 text-muted-foreground @md:line-clamp-3\">\n            {description}\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Fluid Typography\n\n```css\n/* Fluid type scale using clamp() */\n:root {\n  /* Min size, preferred (fluid), max size */\n  --text-xs: clamp(0.75rem, 0.7rem + 0.25vw, 0.875rem);\n  --text-sm: clamp(0.875rem, 0.8rem + 0.375vw, 1rem);\n  --text-base: clamp(1rem, 0.9rem + 0.5vw, 1.125rem);\n  --text-lg: clamp(1.125rem, 1rem + 0.625vw, 1.25rem);\n  --text-xl: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1.25vw, 1.5rem);\n  --text-2xl: clamp(1.5rem, 1.25rem + 1.25vw, 2rem);\n  --text-3xl: clamp(1.875rem, 1.5rem + 1.875vw, 2.5rem);\n  --text-4xl: clamp(2.25rem, 1.75rem + 2.5vw, 3.5rem);\n}\n\n/* Usage */\nh1 {\n  font-size: var(--text-4xl);\n}\nh2 {\n  font-size: var(--text-3xl);\n}\nh3 {\n  font-size: var(--text-2xl);\n}\np {\n  font-size: var(--text-base);\n}\n\n/* Fluid spacing scale */\n:root {\n  --space-xs: clamp(0.25rem, 0.2rem + 0.25vw, 0.5rem);\n  --space-sm: clamp(0.5rem, 0.4rem + 0.5vw, 0.75rem);\n  --space-md: clamp(1rem, 0.8rem + 1vw, 1.5rem);\n  --space-lg: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.5vw, 2.5rem);\n  --space-xl: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2.5vw, 4rem);\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// Utility function for fluid values\nfunction fluidValue(\n  minSize: number,\n  maxSize: number,\n  minWidth = 320,\n  maxWidth = 1280,\n) {\n  const slope = (maxSize - minSize) / (maxWidth - minWidth);\n  const yAxisIntersection = -minWidth * slope + minSize;\n\n  return `clamp(${minSize}rem, ${yAxisIntersection.toFixed(4)}rem + ${(slope * 100).toFixed(4)}vw, ${maxSize}rem)`;\n}\n\n// Generate fluid type scale\nconst fluidTypeScale = {\n  sm: fluidValue(0.875, 1),\n  base: fluidValue(1, 1.125),\n  lg: fluidValue(1.25, 1.5),\n  xl: fluidValue(1.5, 2),\n  \"2xl\": fluidValue(2, 3),\n};\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: CSS Grid Responsive Layout\n\n```css\n/* Auto-fit grid - items wrap automatically */\n.grid-auto {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr));\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n/* Auto-fill grid - maintains empty columns */\n.grid-auto-fill {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* Responsive grid with named areas */\n.page-layout {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-areas:\n    \"header\"\n    \"main\"\n    \"sidebar\"\n    \"footer\";\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  .page-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;\n    grid-template-areas:\n      \"header header\"\n      \"main sidebar\"\n      \"footer footer\";\n  }\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 1024px) {\n  .page-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr 300px;\n    grid-template-areas:\n      \"header header header\"\n      \"nav main sidebar\"\n      \"footer footer footer\";\n  }\n}\n\n.header {\n  grid-area: header;\n}\n.main {\n  grid-area: main;\n}\n.sidebar {\n  grid-area: sidebar;\n}\n.footer {\n  grid-area: footer;\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// Responsive grid component\nfunction ResponsiveGrid({ children, minItemWidth = \"250px\", gap = \"1.5rem\" }) {\n  return (\n    <div\n      className=\"grid\"\n      style={{\n        gridTemplateColumns: `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(${minItemWidth}, 100%), 1fr))`,\n        gap,\n      }}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Usage with Tailwind\nfunction ProductGrid({ products }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n      {products.map((product) => (\n        <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Responsive Navigation\n\n```tsx\nfunction ResponsiveNav({ items }) {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"relative\">\n      {/* Mobile menu button */}\n      <button\n        className=\"lg:hidden p-2\"\n        onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}\n        aria-expanded={isOpen}\n        aria-controls=\"nav-menu\"\n      >\n        <span className=\"sr-only\">Toggle navigation</span>\n        {isOpen ? <X /> : <Menu />}\n      </button>\n\n      {/* Navigation links */}\n      <ul\n        id=\"nav-menu\"\n        className={cn(\n          // Base: hidden on mobile\n          \"absolute top-full left-0 right-0 bg-background border-b\",\n          \"flex flex-col\",\n          // Mobile: slide down\n          isOpen ? \"flex\" : \"hidden\",\n          // Desktop: always visible, horizontal\n          \"lg:static lg:flex lg:flex-row lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent\",\n        )}\n      >\n        {items.map((item) => (\n          <li key={item.href}>\n            <a\n              href={item.href}\n              className={cn(\n                \"block px-4 py-3\",\n                \"lg:px-3 lg:py-2\",\n                \"hover:bg-muted lg:hover:bg-transparent lg:hover:text-primary\",\n              )}\n            >\n              {item.label}\n            </a>\n          </li>\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Responsive Images\n\n```tsx\n// Responsive image with art direction\nfunction ResponsiveHero() {\n  return (\n    <picture>\n      {/* Art direction: different crops for different screens */}\n      <source\n        media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\"\n        srcSet=\"/hero-wide.webp\"\n        type=\"image/webp\"\n      />\n      <source\n        media=\"(min-width: 768px)\"\n        srcSet=\"/hero-medium.webp\"\n        type=\"image/webp\"\n      />\n      <source srcSet=\"/hero-mobile.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n\n      {/* Fallback */}\n      <img\n        src=\"/hero-mobile.jpg\"\n        alt=\"Hero image description\"\n        className=\"w-full h-auto\"\n        loading=\"eager\"\n        fetchpriority=\"high\"\n      />\n    </picture>\n  );\n}\n\n// Responsive image with srcset for resolution switching\nfunction ProductImage({ product }) {\n  return (\n    <img\n      src={product.image}\n      srcSet={`\n        ${product.image}?w=400 400w,\n        ${product.image}?w=800 800w,\n        ${product.image}?w=1200 1200w\n      `}\n      sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\"\n      alt={product.name}\n      className=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Responsive Tables\n\n```tsx\n// Responsive table with horizontal scroll\nfunction ResponsiveTable({ data, columns }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"w-full overflow-x-auto\">\n      <table className=\"w-full min-w-[600px]\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            {columns.map((col) => (\n              <th key={col.key} className=\"text-left p-3\">\n                {col.label}\n              </th>\n            ))}\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          {data.map((row, i) => (\n            <tr key={i} className=\"border-t\">\n              {columns.map((col) => (\n                <td key={col.key} className=\"p-3\">\n                  {row[col.key]}\n                </td>\n              ))}\n            </tr>\n          ))}\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Card-based table for mobile\nfunction ResponsiveDataTable({ data, columns }) {\n  return (\n    <>\n      {/* Desktop table */}\n      <table className=\"hidden md:table w-full\">\n        {/* ... standard table */}\n      </table>\n\n      {/* Mobile cards */}\n      <div className=\"md:hidden space-y-4\">\n        {data.map((row, i) => (\n          <div key={i} className=\"border rounded-lg p-4 space-y-2\">\n            {columns.map((col) => (\n              <div key={col.key} className=\"flex justify-between\">\n                <span className=\"font-medium text-muted-foreground\">\n                  {col.label}\n                </span>\n                <span>{row[col.key]}</span>\n              </div>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Viewport Units\n\n```css\n/* Standard viewport units */\n.full-height {\n  height: 100vh; /* May cause issues on mobile */\n}\n\n/* Dynamic viewport units (recommended for mobile) */\n.full-height-dynamic {\n  height: 100dvh; /* Accounts for mobile browser UI */\n}\n\n/* Small viewport (minimum) */\n.min-full-height {\n  min-height: 100svh;\n}\n\n/* Large viewport (maximum) */\n.max-full-height {\n  max-height: 100lvh;\n}\n\n/* Viewport-relative font sizing */\n.hero-title {\n  /* 5vw with min/max bounds */\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Mobile-First**: Start with mobile styles, enhance for larger screens\n2. **Content Breakpoints**: Set breakpoints based on content, not devices\n3. **Fluid Over Fixed**: Use fluid values for typography and spacing\n4. **Container Queries**: Use for component-level responsiveness\n5. **Test Real Devices**: Simulators don''t catch all issues\n6. **Performance**: Optimize images, lazy load off-screen content\n7. **Touch Targets**: Maintain 44x44px minimum on mobile\n8. **Logical Properties**: Use inline/block for internationalization\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Horizontal Overflow**: Content breaking out of viewport\n- **Fixed Widths**: Using px instead of relative units\n- **Viewport Height**: 100vh issues on mobile browsers\n- **Font Size**: Text too small on mobile\n- **Touch Targets**: Buttons too small to tap accurately\n- **Aspect Ratio**: Images squishing or stretching\n- **Z-Index Stacking**: Overlays breaking on different screens\n\n## Resources\n\n- [CSS Container Queries](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_container_queries)\n- [Utopia Fluid Type Calculator](https://utopia.fyi/type/calculator/)\n- [Every Layout](https://every-layout.dev/)\n- [Responsive Images Guide](https://web.dev/responsive-images/)\n- [CSS Grid Garden](https://cssgridgarden.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:23:50.673Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to create adaptable and responsive user interfaces across various screen sizes and device contexts.","zh":"非常适合需要创建可适应和响应不同屏幕尺寸和设备上下文的用户界面的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがさまざまな画面サイズとデバイスコンテキストに適応できるレスポンシブなユーザーインターフェイスを作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"다양한 화면 크기와 장치 컨텍스트에서 적응 가능하고 반응형인 사용자 인터페이스를 생성해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan crear interfaces de usuario adaptables y responsivas en varios tamaños de pantalla y contextos de dispositivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin de créer des interfaces utilisateur adaptables et réactives sur différentes tailles d''écran et contextes de périphérique.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die anpassungsfähige und responsive Benutzeroberflächen über verschiedene Bildschirmgrößen und Gerätekontexte hinweg erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar interfaces de usuário adaptáveis e responsivas em várias dimensões de tela e contextos de dispositivo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимо создавать адаптивные и отзывчивые пользовательские интерфейсы на различных размерах экрана и контекстах устройств.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتكيف واستجابة عبر أحجام شاشات ومحتوى أجهزة مختلفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design mobile-first responsive layouts, utilize container queries for component-based responsiveness, and create fluid typography and spacing scales using CSS Grid and Flexbox, ensuring seamless user experiences across devices.","zh":"赋予代理设计移动优先的响应式布局，利用容器查询进行基于组件的响应性，使用CSS Grid和Flexbox创建流体排版和间距比例，从而确保跨设备的无缝用户体验。","ja":"モバイルファーストのレスポンシブレイアウトを設計し、コンポーネントベースのレスポンシブ性のためにコンテナクエリを利用し、CSS GridとFlexboxを使用して流体的な組版と間隔の尺度を作成することで、エージェントに力を与え、デバイス全体でシームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供します。","ko":"모바일 우선의 반응형 레이아웃을 설계하고, 구성 요소 기반의 반응성으로 컨테이너 쿼리를 활용하며, CSS Grid와 Flexbox를 사용하여 유동적인 타이포그래피와 간격을 만들 수 있도록 에이전트에게 힘을 부여하여, 모든 장치에서 무결점의 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar diseños responsivos de primera generación para móviles, utilizar consultas de contenedores para la responsividad basada en componentes y crear escalas de tipografía y espaciado fluidas utilizando CSS Grid y Flexbox, garantizando experiencias de usuario sin problemas en todos los dispositivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des dispositions réactives mobiles première, d''utiliser des requêtes de conteneur pour la réactivité basée sur les composants et de créer des échelles de typographie et d''espacement fluides en utilisant CSS Grid et Flexbox, garantissant des expériences utilisateur sans problème sur tous les appareils.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mobile-first-responsive Layouts zu entwerfen, Containerabfragen für komponentenbasierte Responsivität zu nutzen und flüssige Typografien- und Abstandsskalen mit CSS Grid und Flexbox zu erstellen, um nahtlose Benutzererfahrungen auf allen Geräten zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar layouts responsivos de primeiro nível para dispositivos móveis, a utilizar consultas de contêiner para responsividade baseada em componentes e a criar escalas de tipografia e espaçamento fluidas usando CSS Grid e Flexbox, garantindo experiências de usuário sem interrupção em dispositivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать мобильные макеты с первого раза, использовать запросы контейнера для компонентной отзывчивости и создавать жидкие шрифты и масштабы间ранения с помощью CSS Grid и Flexbox, обеспечивая бесперебойный пользовательский опыт на устройствах.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم تخطيطات استجابة أولية للموبايل، واستخدام استفسارات الحاوية للاستجابة القائمة على المكونات، وإنشاء مقاييس خط وتباعد سائلة باستخدام شبكة CSS و Flexbox، مما يضمن تجارب مستخدم دون انقطاع عبر الأجهزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing responsive images and media for enhanced user engagement","Building complex layouts with CSS Grid and Flexbox for dynamic content","Designing breakpoint strategies for comprehensive design systems"],"zh":["为增强用户参与度而实现响应式图像和媒体","使用CSS Grid和Flexbox构建复杂布局以实现动态内容","为综合设计系统设计断点策略"],"ja":["ユーザー関与の向上のためにレスポンシブ画像とメディアを実装する","CSS GridとFlexboxを使用して複雑なレイアウトを構築し、ダイナミックコンテンツを実現する","包括的なデザインシステムのためのブレークポイント戦略を設計する"],"ko":["고급 사용자 참여를 위한 반응형 이미지 및 미디어 구현","CSS Grid 및 Flexbox를 사용하여 동적 콘텐츠를 위한 복잡한 레이아웃 구축","포괄적인 디자인 시스템을 위한 중단점 전략 설계"],"es":["Implementar imágenes y medios responsivos para una mayor participación del usuario","Crear diseños complejos con CSS Grid y Flexbox para contenido dinámico","Diseñar estrategias de puntos de interrupción para sistemas de diseño integrales"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des images et des médias réactifs pour une participation utilisateur améliorée","Construire des dispositions complexes avec CSS Grid et Flexbox pour un contenu dynamique","Concevoir des stratégies de points de rupture pour des systèmes de conception complets"],"de":["Implementierung responsiver Bilder und Medien für eine verbesserte Benutzerbeteiligung","Erstellung komplexer Layouts mit CSS Grid und Flexbox für dynamischen Inhalt","Entwurf von Umbruchstrategien für umfassende Designs"],"pt":["Implementar imagens e mídias responsivas para envolvimento do usuário aprimorado","Construir layouts complexos com CSS Grid e Flexbox para conteúdo dinâmico","Projetar estratégias de ponto de interrupção para sistemas de design abrangentes"],"ru":["Реализовывать отзывчивые изображения и медиа для улучшения вовлеченности пользователя","Строить сложные макеты с помощью CSS Grid и Flexbox для динамического контента","Проектировать стратегии контрольных точек для всесторонних систем дизайна"],"ar":["تطبيق صور ووسائط استجابة لتعزيز المشاركة المستخدم","بناء تخطيطات معقدة باستخدام شبكة CSS و Flexbox للمحتوى الديناميكي","تصميم استراتيجيات نقطة الكسر لمنظومات التصميم الشاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proficiency in CSS and HTML","Limited to web-based applications","Dependent on device and browser support for CSS Grid and Flexbox"],"zh":["需要精通CSS和HTML","仅限于基于Web的应用程序","依赖于设备和浏览器对CSS Grid和Flexbox的支持"],"ja":["CSSとHTMLの熟練が必要","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定される","CSS GridとFlexboxのデバイスとブラウザーのサポートに依存する"],"ko":["CSS 및 HTML에精通해야 함","웹 기반 응용 프로그램에만 제한됨","CSS Grid 및 Flexbox에 대한 디바이스 및 브라우저 지원에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos en CSS y HTML","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en web","Dependiente del soporte del dispositivo y del navegador para CSS Grid y Flexbox"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en CSS et HTML","Limité aux applications basées sur le Web","Dépend du support du périphérique et du navigateur pour CSS Grid et Flexbox"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse in CSS und HTML","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen","Abhängig von der Geräte- und Browser-Unterstützung für CSS Grid und Flexbox"],"pt":["Exige proficiência em CSS e HTML","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web","Dependente do suporte do dispositivo e do navegador para CSS Grid e Flexbox"],"ru":["Требует навыков в CSS и HTML","Ограничен веб-приложениями","Зависит от поддержки устройства и браузера для CSS Grid и Flexbox"],"ar":["يتطلب إتقانًا في CSS و HTML","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى الويب","يعتمد على دعم الجهاز والمتصفح لشبكة CSS و Flexbox"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
