":"このガイドでは、Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールを使用してPDFを処理する基本操作について説明します。読み取り、テキストの抽出、フォームの入力など","ko":"이 가이드는 Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 PDF를 처리하는 기본적인 연산에 대해 설명합니다. 읽기, 텍스트 추출, 양식 작성 등","es":"Esta guía cubre operaciones esenciales de procesamiento de PDF usando bibliotecas y herramientas de línea de comandos de Python.","fr":"Ce guide couvre les opérations essentielles de traitement de PDF à l''aide de bibliothèques et d''outils de ligne de commande Python.","de":"Diese Anleitung behandelt grundlegende PDF-Verarbeitungsoperationen mit Python-Bibliotheken und Befehlszeilen-Tools.","pt":"Este guia cobre operações essenciais de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Это руководство охватывает основные операции по обработке PDF с использованием библиотек Python и командных инструментов.","ar":"يهذا الدليل عمليات أساسية لمعالجة المستندات PDF باستخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر.","en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"definition":{"en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"features":{"zh":["使用Python库读取PDF文件","提取PDF文本","填写PDF表单","使用命令行工具进行PDF处理","支持多种PDF操作"],"ja":["Pythonライブラリを使用してPDFファイルを読み取り","PDFテキストを抽出","PDFフォームを入力","コマンドラインツールを使用してPDFを処理","複数のPDF操作をサポート"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 PDF 파일을 읽기","PDF 텍스트를 추출","PDF 양식을 작성","명령줄 도구를 사용하여 PDF를 처리","다양한 PDF 연산을 지원"],"es":["Lectura y escritura de archivos PDF","Extracción de texto de archivos PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python como pypdf","Procesamiento de formularios PDF","Uso de herramientas de línea de comandos para PDF"],"fr":["Lecture et écriture de fichiers PDF","Extraction de texte de fichiers PDF","Utilisation de bibliothèques Python comme pypdf","Traitement de formulaires PDF","Utilisation d''outils de ligne de commande pour PDF"],"de":["Lesen und Schreiben von PDF-Dateien","Textextraktion aus PDF-Dateien","Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf","Verarbeitung von PDF-Formularen","Verwendung von Befehlszeilen-Tools für PDF"],"pt":["Leitura de arquivos PDF","Extração de texto de PDF","Criação de arquivos PDF","Edição de formulários PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python como pypdf"],"ru":["Чтение файлов PDF","Извлечение текста из PDF","Создание файлов PDF","Редактирование форм PDF","Использование библиотек Python, таких как pypdf"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF","استخراج النص من PDF","إنشاء ملفات PDF","تحرير أشكال PDF","استخدام مكتبات Python مثل pypdf"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF处理","Python库","命令行工具","PDF读取","PDF提取文本","PDF填写表单","PDF操作"],"ja":["PDF処理","Pythonライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","PDF読み取り","PDFテキスト抽出","PDFフォーム入力","PDF操作"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","PDF 읽기","PDF 텍스트 추출","PDF 양식 작성","PDF 연산"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas pdf","herramientas pdf","pdf python","manipulación de pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","bibliothèques pdf","outils pdf","pdf python","manipulation de pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pdf-bibliotheken","pdf-tools","pdf python","pdf-manipulation"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando pdf","manipulação de arquivos pdf","extração de texto pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","библиотеки pdf","инструменты командной строки pdf","манипулирование файлами pdf","извлечение текста pdf"],"ar":["معالجة pdf","python pdf","مكتبات pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر pdf","التعامل مع ملفات pdf","استخراج النص من pdf"]}},"owner":"rongma1sheng","repo":"kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant","repoPath":"rongma1sheng/kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:23:37.205Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités de traitement de PDF avancées en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen unter Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل المستندات التي تحتاج إلى معالجة PDF متقدمة باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text from PDFs, read PDF documents, and perform essential PDF processing operations using command-line tools and Python libraries like pypdf, enabling efficient document analysis and automation. It provides advanced features for filling out PDF forms and detailed examples for reference.","zh":"赋予代理从PDF中提取文本、读取PDF文档和使用命令行工具以及Python库（如pypdf）执行基本PDF处理操作的能力，从而实现高效的文档分析和自动化。它提供了高级功能，用于填写PDF表单，并提供了详细的示例供参考。","ja":"エージェントがPDFからテキストを抽出してPDFドキュメントを読み取り、コマンドラインツールおよびPythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用して基本的なPDF処理操作を実行する能力を付与し、効率的なドキュメント分析および自動化を可能にします。PDFフォームの入力を容易にする高度な機能と参考例を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 PDF에서 텍스트를 추출하고 PDF 문서를 읽고 명령줄 도구 및 Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 기본 PDF 처리 작업을 수행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 효율적인 문서 분석 및 자동화를 가능하게 합니다. PDF 양식填写를 위한 고급 기능과 참조용詳細한 예제를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto de PDF, leer documentos PDF y realizar operaciones de procesamiento de PDF esenciales utilizando herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas de Python como pypdf, lo que permite un análisis y automatización de documentos eficientes. Proporciona funciones avanzadas para rellenar formularios PDF y ejemplos detallados para referencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte à partir de PDF, de lire des documents PDF et d''effectuer des opérations de traitement de PDF essentielles en utilisant des outils de ligne de commande et des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf, ce qui permet une analyse et une automatisation de documents efficaces. Il fournit des fonctionnalités avancées pour remplir des formulaires PDF et des exemples détaillés pour référence.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Text aus PDFs zu extrahieren, PDF-Dokumente zu lesen und wesentliche PDF-Verarbeitungsoperationen mithilfe von Befehlszeilentools und Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf durchzuführen, wodurch eine effiziente Dokumentenanalyse und -automatisierung ermöglicht wird. Bietet erweiterte Funktionen zum Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen und detaillierte Beispiele für die Referenz.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto de PDFs, ler documentos PDF e realizar operações de processamento de PDF essenciais usando ferramentas de linha de comando e bibliotecas Python como pypdf, permitindo uma análise e automação de documentos eficientes. Ele fornece recursos avançados para preenchimento de formulários PDF e exemplos detalhados para referência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст из PDF, читать документы PDF и выполнять основные операции обработки PDF с использованием инструментов командной строки и библиотек Python, таких как pypdf, что обеспечивает эффективный анализ и автоматизацию документов. Он предоставляет продвинутые функции для заполнения форм PDF и подробные примеры для справки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية استخراج النص من ملفات PDF، وقراءة مستندات PDF، وأداء عمليات معالجة PDF الأساسية باستخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر ومكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf، مما يتيح تحليلًا و автоматизациًا فعالين للمستندات. كما يقدم ميزات متقدمة لملء استمارات PDF وأمثلة مفصلة لل参照."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF documents","Automating PDF form filling","Analyzing PDF document structure"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取文本","自动填写PDF表单","分析PDF文档结构"],"ja":["PDFドキュメントからテキストを抽出する","PDFフォームの自動入力","PDFドキュメント構造の分析"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 텍스트 추출","PDF 양식 자동 填写","PDF 문서 구조 분석"],"es":["Extracción de texto de documentos PDF","Automatización del relleno de formularios PDF","Análisis de la estructura del documento PDF"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de documents PDF","Automatisation du remplissage de formulaires PDF","Analyse de la structure de document PDF"],"de":["Extraktion von Text aus PDF-Dokumenten","Automatisierung des Ausfüllens von PDF-Formularen","Analyse der PDF-Dokumentenstruktur"],"pt":["Extração de texto de documentos PDF","Automação de preenchimento de formulários PDF","Análise da estrutura de documentos PDF"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из документов PDF","Автоматизация заполнения форм PDF","Анализ структуры документов PDF"],"ar":["استخراج النص من مستندات PDF","تأليف自动 لملء استمارات PDF","تحليل هيكل مستندات PDF"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to PDF format","Needs pypdf library installation"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限PDF格式","需要安装pypdf库"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","PDF形式のみ","pypdfライブラリのインストールが必要"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","PDF 형식만 해당","pypdf 라이브러리 설치 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado al formato PDF","Requiere instalación de la biblioteca pypdf"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au format PDF","Nécessite l''installation de la bibliothèque pypdf"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf PDF-Format","Benötigt die Installation der pypdf-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao formato PDF","Necessita instalação da biblioteca pypdf"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен форматом PDF","Требуется установка библиотеки pypdf"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدود بالتنسيق PDF","يحتاج إلى تثبيت مكتبة pypdf"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
