n persistants","Modèles personnalisables","Intégration avec des projets","Suivi de progrès","Organisation de tâches"],"de":["Persistente Markdown-Dateien","Anpassbare Vorlagen","Integration mit Projekten","Fortschrittsverfolgung","Aufgabenorganisation"],"pt":["Uso de arquivos markdown persistentes","Gerenciamento de tarefas complexas","Integração com templates e scripts","Organização de arquivos em pastas","Facilidade de uso e configuração"],"ru":["Использование постоянных файлов markdown","Управление сложными задачами","Интеграция с шаблонами и скриптами","Организация файлов в папках","Легкость использования и настройки"],"ar":["استخدام الملفات ماركداون المستدامة","إدارة المهام المعقدة","التكامل مع القوالب والسكريبتات","تنظيم الملفات في المجلدات","سهولة الاستخدام والتكوين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文件规划技能","持久性markdown文件","Manus风格","工作效率","开发者工具","项目管理"],"ja":["ファイル計画スキル","永続的なMarkdownファイル","Manusスタイル","作業効率","開発者ツール","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["파일 계획 기술","영속적인 마크다운 파일","Manus 스타일","작업 효율성","개발자 도구","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["planificación con archivos","markdown persistente","patrón de flujo de trabajo","productividad","gestión de proyectos","organización de tareas"],"fr":["planification avec des fichiers","markdown persistant","modèle de flux de travail","productivité","gestion de projets","organisation de tâches"],"de":["Planung mit Dateien","persistente Markdown-Dateien","Arbeitsablaufmuster","Produktivität","Projektmanagement","Aufgabenorganisation"],"pt":["planejamento com arquivos","arquivos markdown persistentes","gerenciamento de tarefas","templates","scripts","organização de arquivos","facilidade de uso","configuração"],"ru":["планирование с файлами","постоянные файлы markdown","управление задачами","шаблоны","скрипты","организация файлов","легкость использования","настройка"],"ar":["التخطيط مع الملفات","الملفات ماركداون المستدامة","إدارة المهام","القوالب","السكريبتات","تنظيم الملفات","سهولة الاستخدام","التكوين"]}},"owner":"OthmanAdi","repo":"planning-with-files","repoPath":"OthmanAdi/planning-with-files","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"planning-with-files","description":"Implements Manus-style file-based planning for complex tasks. Creates task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md. Use when starting complex multi-step tasks, research projects, or any task requiring >5 tool calls.","bodyPreview":"# Planning with Files\n\nWork like Manus: Use persistent markdown files as your \"working memory on disk.\"\n\n## Important: Where Files Go\n\n- **Templates** are in this skill''s `templates/` folder\n- **Your planning files** go in **your project directory**\n\n| Location | What Goes There |\n|----------|-----------------|\n| Skill directory | Templates, scripts, reference docs |\n| Your project directory | `task_plan.md`, `findings.md`, `progress.md` |\n\n## Quick Start\n\nBefore ANY complex task:\n\n1. **Create `","body":"# Planning with Files\n\nWork like Manus: Use persistent markdown files as your \"working memory on disk.\"\n\n## Important: Where Files Go\n\n- **Templates** are in this skill''s `templates/` folder\n- **Your planning files** go in **your project directory**\n\n| Location | What Goes There |\n|----------|-----------------|\n| Skill directory | Templates, scripts, reference docs |\n| Your project directory | `task_plan.md`, `findings.md`, `progress.md` |\n\n## Quick Start\n\nBefore ANY complex task:\n\n1. **Create `task_plan.md`** — Use [templates/task_plan.md](templates/task_plan.md) as reference\n2. **Create `findings.md`** — Use [templates/findings.md](templates/findings.md) as reference\n3. **Create `progress.md`** — Use [templates/progress.md](templates/progress.md) as reference\n4. **Re-read plan before decisions** — Refreshes goals in attention window\n5. **Update after each phase** — Mark complete, log errors\n\n> **Note:** Planning files go in your project root, not the skill installation folder.\n\n## The Core Pattern\n\n```\nContext Window = RAM (volatile, limited)\nFilesystem = Disk (persistent, unlimited)\n\n→ Anything important gets written to disk.\n```\n\n## File Purposes\n\n| File | Purpose | When to Update |\n|------|---------|----------------|\n| `task_plan.md` | Phases, progress, decisions | After each phase |\n| `findings.md` | Research, discoveries | After ANY discovery |\n| `progress.md` | Session log, test results | Throughout session |\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. Create Plan First\nNever start a complex task without `task_plan.md`. Non-negotiable.\n\n### 2. The 2-Action Rule\n> \"After every 2 view/browser/search operations, IMMEDIATELY save key findings to text files.\"\n\nThis prevents visual/multimodal information from being lost.\n\n### 3. Read Before Decide\nBefore major decisions, read the plan file. This keeps goals in your attention window.\n\n### 4. Update After Act\nAfter completing any phase:\n- Mark phase status: `in_progress` → `complete`\n- Log any errors encountered\n- Note files created/modified\n\n### 5. Log ALL Errors\nEvery error goes in the plan file. This builds knowledge and prevents repetition.\n\n```markdown\n## Errors Encountered\n| Error | Attempt | Resolution |\n|-------|---------|------------|\n| FileNotFoundError | 1 | Created default config |\n| API timeout | 2 | Added retry logic |\n```\n\n### 6. Never Repeat Failures\n```\nif action_failed:\n    next_action != same_action\n```\nTrack what you tried. Mutate the approach.\n\n## The 3-Strike Error Protocol\n\n```\nATTEMPT 1: Diagnose & Fix\n  → Read error carefully\n  → Identify root cause\n  → Apply targeted fix\n\nATTEMPT 2: Alternative Approach\n  → Same error? Try different method\n  → Different tool? Different library?\n  → NEVER repeat exact same failing action\n\nATTEMPT 3: Broader Rethink\n  → Question assumptions\n  → Search for solutions\n  → Consider updating the plan\n\nAFTER 3 FAILURES: Escalate to User\n  → Explain what you tried\n  → Share the specific error\n  → Ask for guidance\n```\n\n## Read vs Write Decision Matrix\n\n| Situation | Action | Reason |\n|-----------|--------|--------|\n| Just wrote a file | DON''T read | Content still in context |\n| Viewed image/PDF | Write findings NOW | Multimodal → text before lost |\n| Browser returned data | Write to file | Screenshots don''t persist |\n| Starting new phase | Read plan/findings | Re-orient if context stale |\n| Error occurred | Read relevant file | Need current state to fix |\n| Resuming after gap | Read all planning files | Recover state |\n\n## The 5-Question Reboot Test\n\nIf you can answer these, your context management is solid:\n\n| Question | Answer Source |\n|----------|---------------|\n| Where am I? | Current phase in task_plan.md |\n| Where am I going? | Remaining phases |\n| What''s the goal? | Goal statement in plan |\n| What have I learned? | findings.md |\n| What have I done? | progress.md |\n\n## When to Use This Pattern\n\n**Use for:**\n- Multi-step tasks (3+ steps)\n- Research tasks\n- Building/creating projects\n- Tasks spanning many tool calls\n- Anything requiring organization\n\n**Skip for:**\n- Simple questions\n- Single-file edits\n- Quick lookups\n\n## Templates\n\nCopy these templates to start:\n\n- [templates/task_plan.md](templates/task_plan.md) — Phase tracking\n- [templates/findings.md](templates/findings.md) — Research storage\n- [templates/progress.md](templates/progress.md) — Session logging\n\n## Scripts\n\nHelper scripts for automation:\n\n- `scripts/init-session.sh` — Initialize all planning files\n- `scripts/check-complete.sh` — Verify all phases complete\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n- **Manus Principles:** See [references/reference.md](references/reference.md)\n- **Real Examples:** See [references/examples.md](references/examples.md)\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Do Instead |\n|-------|------------|\n| State goals once and forget | Re-read plan before decisions |\n| Hide errors and retry silently | Log errors to plan file |\n| Stuff everything in context | Store large content in files |\n| Start executing immediately | Create plan file FIRST |\n| Repeat failed actions | Track attempts, mutate approach |\n| Create files in skill directory | Create files in your project |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:24:44.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents leveraging markdown files for persistent planning and organization.","zh":"适用于利用 Markdown 文件进行持久规划和组织的任务管理代理。","ja":"Markdown ファイルを使用した永続的な計画と組織を行うタスク管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"마크다운 파일을 사용한 지속적인 계획 및 조직을 위한 태스크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que utilizan archivos markdown para la planificación y organización persistentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches qui utilisent des fichiers markdown pour la planification et l''organisation persistantes.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die Markdown-Dateien für die persistente Planung und Organisation nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que utilizam arquivos markdown para planejamento e organização persistentes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления задачами, использующих файлы markdown для постоянного планирования и организации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المهام الذين يستفيدون من الملفات markdown للتنظيم والتخطيط المستدامين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a ''working memory on disk'', enabling efficient task planning and progress tracking using templates and reference documents in markdown format.","zh":"使代理能够将持久的 Markdown 文件用作 ''磁盘上的工作内存''，从而使用模板和 Markdown 格式的参考文档实现高效的任务规划和进度跟踪。","ja":"エージェントが、永続的な Markdown ファイルを ''ディスク上のワーキングメモリ'' として利用できるようにし、テンプレートや Markdown 形式の参考ドキュメントを使用したタスク計画と進度追跡を効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 지속적인 마크다운 파일을 ''디스크上的 작업 메모리''로 사용할 수 있도록 해줌으로써, 템플릿 및 마크다운 형식의 참조 문서를 사용한 태스크 계획 및 진행 상황 추적을 효율적으로 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes utilizar archivos markdown persistentes como una ''memoria de trabajo en disco'', lo que permite una planificación de tareas eficiente y un seguimiento del progreso utilizando plantillas y documentos de referencia en formato markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des fichiers markdown persistants comme une ''mémoire de travail sur disque'', ce qui permet une planification de tâches efficace et un suivi des progrès à l''aide de modèles et de documents de référence au format markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, persistente Markdown-Dateien als ''Arbeitsspeicher auf Disk'' zu nutzen, was eine effiziente Aufgabenplanung und Verlaufsverfolgung mithilfe von Vorlagen und Referenzdokumenten im Markdown-Format ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem arquivos markdown persistentes como uma ''memória de trabalho em disco'', permitindo o planejamento eficiente de tarefas e o acompanhamento de progresso usando modelos e documentos de referência no formato markdown.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать постоянные файлы markdown как ''рабочую память на диске'', обеспечивая эффективное планирование задач и отслеживание прогресса с помощью шаблонов и справочных документов в формате markdown.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استخدام الملفات markdown المستدامة كـ ''ذاكرة عمل على القرص''، مما يتيح التخطيط الفعال للمهام وتتبع التقدم باستخدام القوالب والوثائق المرجعية بتنسيق markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task planning with markdown templates","Generating progress reports in markdown files","Organizing project findings in a centralized markdown repository"],"zh":["使用 Markdown 模板自动化任务规划","在 Markdown 文件中生成进度报告","在集中式 Markdown 存储库中组织项目发现"],"ja":["Markdown テンプレートを使用したタスク計画の自動化","Markdown ファイル内で進度レポートを生成する","集中型 Markdown リポジトリ内でプロジェクトの発見を整理する"],"ko":["마크다운 템플릿을 사용한 태스크 계획 자동화","마크다운 파일 내에서 진행 상황 보고서 생성","집중형 마크다운 저장소 내에서 프로젝트 발견을 조직화"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de tareas con plantillas markdown","Generación de informes de progreso en archivos markdown","Organización de los resultados del proyecto en un repositorio centralizado de markdown"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification de tâches avec des modèles markdown","Génération de rapports de progrès dans des fichiers markdown","Organisation des résultats du projet dans un référentiel centralisé markdown"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenplanung mit Markdown-Vorlagen","Erstellung von Fortschrittsberichten in Markdown-Dateien","Organisation der Projektergebnisse in einem zentralen Markdown-Repository"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de tarefas com modelos markdown","Gerar relatórios de progresso em arquivos markdown","Organizar descobertas de projeto em um repositório markdown centralizado"],"ru":["Автоматизация планирования задач с помощью шаблонов markdown","Генерация отчетов о прогрессе в файлах markdown","Организация результатов проекта в централизованном хранилище markdown"],"ar":["تأتمتة تخطيط المهام باستخدام قوالب markdown","توليد تقارير التقدم في ملفات markdown","تنظيم نتائج المشروع في مستودع markdown مركزي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project directory for planning files","Limited to markdown file format","Dependent on skill directory for templates and scripts"],"zh":["需要项目目录来存储规划文件","仅限于 Markdown 文件格式","依赖技能目录来获取模板和脚本"],"ja":["計画ファイルを保存するためにプロジェクトディレクトリが必要","Markdown ファイル形式のみに限定される","テンプレートやスクリプトを取得するためにスキルディレクトリに依存する"],"ko":["계획 파일을 저장하려면 프로젝트 디렉토리가 필요","마크다운 파일 형식만 사용할 수 있음","템플릿 및 스크립트를 가져오기 위해 스킬 디렉토리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un directorio de proyecto para los archivos de planificación","Limitado al formato de archivo markdown","Dependiente del directorio de habilidades para las plantillas y los scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire de projet pour les fichiers de planification","Limité au format de fichier markdown","Dépendant du répertoire de compétences pour les modèles et les scripts"],"de":["Benötigt ein Projektverzeichnis für die Planungsdateien","Begrenzt auf das Markdown-Dateiformat","Abhängig vom Skill-Verzeichnis für Vorlagen und Skripte"],"pt":["Exige um diretório de projeto para arquivos de planejamento","Limitado ao formato de arquivo markdown","Dependente do diretório de habilidades para modelos e scripts"],"ru":["Требует директории проекта для файлов планирования","Ограничен форматом файла markdown","Зависит от директории навыков для шаблонов и скриптов"],"ar":["يتطلب مجلد مشروع لملفات التخطيط","محدود تنسيق ملف markdown","يعتمد على مجلد المهارات للقوالب والسكريبتات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
