ator是一个开源的AI代理，帮助开发者创建高质量的Pull Request，简化代码审查流程","ja":"PR Creatorは、開発者が高品質のプルリクエストを作成し、コードレビューのプロセスを簡素化するためのオープンソースAIエージェントです","ko":"PR Creator는 개발자가 높은 品質의 Pull Request를 생성하고 코드 리뷰 프로세스를 간소화하는 것을 도와주는 오픈소스 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Pr-creator es un agente de IA de código abierto que ayuda a crear solicitudes de extracción de alta calidad","fr":"Pr-creator est un agent IA open source qui aide à créer des demandes d''extraction de haute qualité","de":"Pr-creator ist ein Open-Source-KI-Agent, der dabei hilft, hochwertige Pull-Requests zu erstellen","pt":"O pr-creator é um agente de IA de código aberto que ajuda a criar solicitações de pull request de alta qualidade, seguindo os padrões do repositório.","ru":"Pr-creator - это открытый ИИ-агент, который помогает создать качественные запросы на Pull Request, следующие стандартам репозитория.","ar":"pr-creator هو وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مفتوح المصدر الذي يساعد على إنشاء طلبات سحب جودة عالية، يتبع معايير المستودع.","en":"An open-source AI agent that brings the power of Gemini directly into your terminal."},"definition":{"en":"An open-source AI agent that brings the power of Gemini directly into your terminal."},"features":{"zh":["自动创建Pull Request","代码审查流程简化","Git分支管理","commit消息模板","代码质量检查"],"ja":["プルリクエストの自動作成","コードレビューのプロセス簡素化","Gitブランチ管理","コミットメッセージテンプレート","コード品質チェック"],"ko":["Pull Request 자동 생성","코드 리뷰 프로세스 간소화","Git 브랜치 관리","commit 메시지 템플릿","코드 품질 체크"],"es":["Creación de solicitudes de extracción de alta calidad","Seguimiento de los estándares del repositorio","Gestión de ramas","Commit y revisiones","Integración con Gemini","Interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Création de demandes d''extraction de haute qualité","Suivi des normes du référentiel","Gestion des branches","Commit et révisions","Intégration avec Gemini","Interface en ligne de commande"],"de":["Erstellung von hochwertigen Pull-Requests","Einhalten der Repository-Standards","Verwaltung von Branches","Commit und Überprüfungen","Integration mit Gemini","Kommandozeileninterface"],"pt":["Criação de solicitações de pull request de alta qualidade","Seguimento dos padrões do repositório","Gerenciamento de branch","Commit e criação de solicitações de pull request","Integração com o terminal"],"ru":["Создание качественных запросов на Pull Request","Следование стандартам репозитория","Управление веткой","Коммит и создание запросов на Pull Request","Интеграция с терминалом"],"ar":["إنشاء طلبات سحب جودة عالية","متابعة معايير المستودع","إدارة الفرع","التعهد وإنشاء طلبات سحب","التكامل مع الطرفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PR Creator","Pull Request","代码审查","Git","自动化工具","代码质量","开发效率"],"ja":["PR Creator","プルリクエスト","コードレビュー","Git","自動化ツール","コード品質","開発効率"],"ko":["PR Creator","Pull Request","코드 리뷰","Git","자동화 도구","코드 품질","개발 효율"],"es":["solicitudes de extracción","pr-creator","agente de IA","código abierto","Gemini","gestión de ramas","commit","revisión","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["demandes d''extraction","pr-creator","agent IA","code open source","Gemini","gestion des branches","commit","révision","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Pull-Requests","pr-creator","KI-Agent","Open-Source-Code","Gemini","Verwaltung von Branches","Commit","Überprüfung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["pr-creator","solicitações de pull request","padrões do repositório","gerenciamento de branch","commit","terminal","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["pr-creator","запросы на Pull Request","стандарты репозитория","управление веткой","коммит","терминал","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["pr-creator","طلبات سحب","معايير المستودع","إدارة الفرع","التعهد","الطرفية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"google-gemini","repo":"gemini-cli","repoPath":"google-gemini/gemini-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-creator","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Pull Request Creator\n\nThis skill guides the creation of high-quality Pull Requests that adhere to the\nrepository''s standards.\n\n## Workflow\n\nFollow these steps to create a Pull Request:\n\n1.  **Branch Management**: **CRITICAL:** Ensure you are NOT working on the\n    `main` branch.\n    - Run `git branch --show-current`.\n    - If the current branch is `main`, you MUST create and switch to a new\n      descriptive branch:\n      ```bash\n      git checkout -b <new-branch-name>\n      ```\n\n2.  **Commit","body":"# Pull Request Creator\n\nThis skill guides the creation of high-quality Pull Requests that adhere to the\nrepository''s standards.\n\n## Workflow\n\nFollow these steps to create a Pull Request:\n\n1.  **Branch Management**: **CRITICAL:** Ensure you are NOT working on the\n    `main` branch.\n    - Run `git branch --show-current`.\n    - If the current branch is `main`, you MUST create and switch to a new\n      descriptive branch:\n      ```bash\n      git checkout -b <new-branch-name>\n      ```\n\n2.  **Commit Changes**: Verify that all intended changes are committed.\n    - Run `git status` to check for unstaged or uncommitted changes.\n    - If there are uncommitted changes, stage and commit them with a descriptive\n      message before proceeding. NEVER commit directly to `main`.\n      ```bash\n      git add .\n      git commit -m \"type(scope): description\"\n      ```\n\n3.  **Locate Template**: Search for a pull request template in the repository.\n    - Check `.github/pull_request_template.md`\n    - Check `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`\n    - If multiple templates exist (e.g., in `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/`),\n      ask the user which one to use or select the most appropriate one based on\n      the context (e.g., `bug_fix.md` vs `feature.md`).\n\n4.  **Read Template**: Read the content of the identified template file.\n\n5.  **Draft Description**: Create a PR description that strictly follows the\n    template''s structure.\n    - **Headings**: Keep all headings from the template.\n    - **Checklists**: Review each item. Mark with `[x]` if completed. If an item\n      is not applicable, leave it unchecked or mark as `[ ]` (depending on the\n      template''s instructions) or remove it if the template allows flexibility\n      (but prefer keeping it unchecked for transparency).\n    - **Content**: Fill in the sections with clear, concise summaries of your\n      changes.\n    - **Related Issues**: Link any issues fixed or related to this PR (e.g.,\n      \"Fixes #123\").\n\n6.  **Preflight Check**: Before creating the PR, run the workspace preflight\n    script to ensure all build, lint, and test checks pass.\n    ```bash\n    npm run preflight\n    ```\n    If any checks fail, address the issues before proceeding to create the PR.\n\n7.  **Push Branch**: Push the current branch to the remote repository.\n    **CRITICAL SAFETY RAIL:** Double-check your branch name before pushing.\n    NEVER push if the current branch is `main`.\n    ```bash\n    # Verify current branch is NOT main\n    git branch --show-current\n    # Push non-interactively\n    git push -u origin HEAD\n    ```\n\n8.  **Create PR**: Use the `gh` CLI to create the PR. To avoid shell escaping\n    issues with multi-line Markdown, write the description to a temporary file\n    first.\n    ```bash\n    # 1. Write the drafted description to a temporary file\n    # 2. Create the PR using the --body-file flag\n    gh pr create --title \"type(scope): succinct description\" --body-file <temp_file_path>\n    # 3. Remove the temporary file\n    rm <temp_file_path>\n    ```\n    - **Title**: Ensure the title follows the\n      [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format if the\n      repository uses it (e.g., `feat(ui): add new button`,\n      `fix(core): resolve crash`).\n\n## Principles\n\n- **Safety First**: NEVER push to `main`. This is your highest priority.\n- **Compliance**: Never ignore the PR template. It exists for a reason.\n- **Completeness**: Fill out all relevant sections.\n- **Accuracy**: Don''t check boxes for tasks you haven''t done.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:24:32.007Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing streamlined Pull Request creation and Git branch management.","zh":"适用于需要简化拉取请求创建和Git分支管理的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントがストリームライン化されたプルリクエストの作成とGitブランチ管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 관리 에이전트가 간소화된 풀 요청 생성 및 Git 브랜치 관리가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing streamlined Pull Request creation and Git branch management.","fr":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing streamlined Pull Request creation and Git branch management.","de":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing streamlined Pull Request creation and Git branch management.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de uma criação simplificada de Pull Requests e gerenciamento de branches Git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, которым требуется упрощенное создание Pull Request и управление ветками Git.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة التعليمات البرمجية الذين يحتاجون إلى تبسيط إنشاء طلبات السحب وإدارة فروع Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Pull Requests adhering to repository standards, utilizing Git protocols and commands like ''git branch'' and ''git checkout'', ensuring consistency and efficiency in code review processes.","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量的拉取请求的能力，遵循仓库标准，利用Git协议和命令，如''git branch''和''git checkout''，确保代码审查过程的一致性和效率。","ja":"エージェントがリポジトリの規格に従った高品質のプルリクエストを作成できるようにし、Gitのプロトコルや''git branch''や''git checkout''のようなコマンドを利用して、コードレビューのプロセスでの一貫性と効率を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 저장소 표준을 준수하는 높은 품질의 풀 요청을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Git 프로토콜 및 ''git branch'' 및 ''git checkout''와 같은 명령을 사용하여 코드 검토 프로세스에서 일관성 및 효율성을 보장합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Pull Requests adhering to repository standards, utilizing Git protocols and commands like ''git branch'' and ''git checkout'', ensuring consistency and efficiency in code review processes.","fr":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Pull Requests adhering to repository standards, utilizing Git protocols and commands like ''git branch'' and ''git checkout'', ensuring consistency and efficiency in code review processes.","de":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Pull Requests adhering to repository standards, utilizing Git protocols and commands like ''git branch'' and ''git checkout'', ensuring consistency and efficiency in code review processes.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar Pull Requests de alta qualidade, aderindo aos padrões do repositório, utilizando protocolos e comandos Git como ''git branch'' e ''git checkout'', garantindo consistência e eficiência nos processos de revisão de código.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать высококачественные Pull Request, соответствующие стандартам репозитория, используя протоколы и команды Git, такие как ''git branch'' и ''git checkout'', обеспечивая согласованность и эффективность процессов проверки кода.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء طلبات سحب عالية الجودة تلتزم بمعايير المستودع، باستخدام بروتوكولات وأوامر Git مثل ''git branch'' و ''git checkout''، مما يضمن الاتساق والكفاءة في عمليات مراجعة التعليمات البرمجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Pull Request creation for new feature branches","Ensuring compliance with repository standards for commit messages and branch naming","Streamlining code review workflows by generating well-structured Pull Requests"],"zh":["自动化新功能分支的拉取请求创建","确保提交消息和分支命名遵循仓库标准","通过生成结构良好的拉取请求来简化代码审查工作流"],"ja":["新機能ブランチのプルリクエストの作成を自動化する","コミットメッセージやブランチ名がリポジトリの規格に従っていることを保証する","構造化されたプルリクエストを生成してコードレビューのワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 브랜치에 대한 풀 요청 생성 자동화","커밋 메시지 및 브랜치 이름이 저장소 표준을 준수하는지 확인","구조화된 풀 요청을 생성하여 코드 리뷰 워크플로우를 간소화"],"es":["Automating Pull Request creation for new feature branches","Ensuring compliance with repository standards for commit messages and branch naming","Streamlining code review workflows by generating well-structured Pull Requests"],"fr":["Automating Pull Request creation for new feature branches","Ensuring compliance with repository standards for commit messages and branch naming","Streamlining code review workflows by generating well-structured Pull Requests"],"de":["Automating Pull Request creation for new feature branches","Ensuring compliance with repository standards for commit messages and branch naming","Streamlining code review workflows by generating well-structured Pull Requests"],"pt":["Automatização da criação de Pull Requests para novos branches de funcionalidades","Garantia de conformidade com os padrões do repositório para mensagens de commit e nomenclatura de branches","Simplificação dos fluxos de trabalho de revisão de código através da geração de Pull Requests bem estruturados"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания Pull Request для новых веток функций","Обеспечение соответствия стандартам репозитория для сообщений о фиксациях и именования веток","Упрощение рабочих процессов проверки кода за счет создания хорошо структурированных Pull Request"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء طلبات السحب لفروع الميزات الجديدة","ضمان الامتثال لمعايير المستودع لرسائل الالتزام وتسمية الفروع","تبسيط سير عمل مراجعة التعليمات البرمجية من خلال إنشاء طلبات سحب ذات هيكلة جيدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Must be used outside of the ''main'' branch"],"zh":["需要Git安装和配置","必须在''main''分支以外使用"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","''main''ブランチ以外で使用する必要がある"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","''main'' 브랜치 외에서 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Must be used outside of the ''main'' branch"],"fr":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Must be used outside of the ''main'' branch"],"de":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Must be used outside of the ''main'' branch"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Deve ser usado fora do branch ''main''"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Git","Должен использоваться вне ветки ''main''"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","يجب استخدامه خارج الفرع ''main''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
