atoren","Überprüfung von Typen von Vorlagen","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript","Erweiterung des TypeScript-Compilers","Generierung von Ivy-Anweisungen"],"pt":["Compilação de decorators Angular","Verificação de tipo de modelo","Extensão do compilador TypeScript","Suporte à arquitetura Ivy","Melhoria do desempenho da aplicação"],"ru":["Компиляция декораторов Angular","Проверка типа модели","Расширение компилятора TypeScript","Поддержка архитектуры Ivy","Улучшение производительности приложения"],"ar":["تجميع معالجات Angular","فحص نوع النموذج","توسيع مجمع TypeScript","دعم архитектура Ivy","تحسين أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AngularCompiler","ngtsc","TypeScript","Web应用交付","Angular开发","CompilerCLI"],"ja":["AngularCompiler","ngtsc","TypeScript","Webアプリケーションの構築","Angular開発","CompilerCLI"],"ko":["AngularCompiler","negtsc","TypeScript","웹애플리케이션배포","Angular개발","CompilerCLI"],"es":["Angular Compiler CLI","reference-compiler-cli","compilador de Angular","decoradores de Angular","TypeScript","Ivy","plantillas de Angular"],"fr":["Compilateur CLI Angular","reference-compiler-cli","compilateur Angular","décorateurs Angular","TypeScript","Ivy","modèles Angular"],"de":["Angular-Compiler-CLI","reference-compiler-cli","Angular-Compiler","Angular-Dekoratoren","TypeScript","Ivy","Angular-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Angular Compiler CLI","Compilador Angular","Desempenho de aplicativos web","Otimização de aplicativos"," TypeScript","Ivy","Decorators Angular"],"ru":["Angular Compiler CLI","Компилятор Angular","Производительность веб-приложений","Оптимизация приложений","TypeScript","Ivy","Декораторы Angular"],"ar":["مجمع Angular CLI","مجمع Angular","أداء التطبيقات الويب","تحسين التطبيقات","TypeScript","Ivy","معالجات Angular"]}},"owner":"angular","repo":"angular","repoPath":"angular/angular","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reference-compiler-cli","description":"Explains the mental model and architecture of the code under `packages/compiler-cli`. You MUST use this skill any time you plan to work with code in `packages/compiler-cli`","bodyPreview":"# Angular Compiler CLI (`ngtsc`) Architecture\n\n## Overview\n\nThe `packages/compiler-cli` package contains the Angular Compiler (Ivy), often referred to as `ngtsc`. It is a wrapper around the TypeScript compiler (`tsc`) that extends it with Angular-specific capabilities.\n\nThe core goal of `ngtsc` is to compile Angular decorators (like `@Component`, `@Directive`, `@Pipe`) into static properties on the class (Ivy instructions, e.g., `static ɵcmp = ...`). It also performs template type checking and a","body":"# Angular Compiler CLI (`ngtsc`) Architecture\n\n## Overview\n\nThe `packages/compiler-cli` package contains the Angular Compiler (Ivy), often referred to as `ngtsc`. It is a wrapper around the TypeScript compiler (`tsc`) that extends it with Angular-specific capabilities.\n\nThe core goal of `ngtsc` is to compile Angular decorators (like `@Component`, `@Directive`, `@Pipe`) into static properties on the class (Ivy instructions, e.g., `static ɵcmp = ...`). It also performs template type checking and ahead-of-time (AOT) compilation.\n\n## Mental Model\n\nThe compiler is designed as a **lazy, incremental, and partial** compilation pipeline.\n\n1.  **Wrapper Pattern**: `NgtscProgram` wraps the standard `ts.Program`. It intercepts calls to act as a drop-in replacement for standard tooling.\n2.  **Traits System**: Every class with an Angular decorator is considered a \"Trait\". The compiler manages the state of these traits through a state machine:\n    - **Pending**: Detected but not processed.\n    - **Analyzed**: Metadata extracted, template parsed (but dependencies not yet linked).\n    - **Resolved**: Dependencies (directives/pipes in template) resolved, import cycles handled.\n    - **Skipped**: Not an Angular class.\n3.  **Lazy Analysis**: Analysis only happens when necessary (e.g., when diagnostics are requested or emit is prepared).\n4.  **Output AST**: The compiler generates an intermediate \"Output AST\" (`o.Expression`) for the generated code, which is then translated into TypeScript AST nodes during the emit phase.\n\n## Key Subsystems\n\n### 1. Core Orchestration (`ngtsc/core`)\n\n- **`NgtscProgram`**: The public API implementing `api.Program`. It manages the `ts.Program` and the `NgCompiler`.\n- **`NgCompiler`**: The brain of the compiler. It orchestrates the compilation phases (Analysis, Resolution, Type Checking, Emit). It holds the `TraitCompiler`.\n\n### 2. Trait Compilation (`ngtsc/transform`)\n\n- **`TraitCompiler`**: Manages the lifecycle of \"Traits\". It iterates over source files, identifies decorated classes, and delegates to the appropriate `DecoratorHandler`.\n- **`Trait`**: A state container for a class, holding its handler, analysis results, and resolution results.\n\n### 3. Decorator Handlers (`ngtsc/annotations`)\n\n- **`DecoratorHandler`**: An interface for handling specific decorators.\n- **`ComponentDecoratorHandler`**: The most complex handler. It:\n  - Extracts metadata (selector, inputs, outputs).\n  - Parses the template.\n  - Resolves used directives and pipes (`R3TargetBinder`).\n  - Generates the `ɵcmp` instruction.\n- **`DirectiveDecoratorHandler`**, **`PipeDecoratorHandler`**, **`NgModuleDecoratorHandler`**: Handle their respective decorators.\n\n### 4. Template Type Checking (`ngtsc/typecheck`)\n\n- **`TemplateTypeChecker`**: Generates \"Type Check Blocks\" (TCBs). A TCB is a block of TypeScript code that represents the template''s logic in a way `tsc` can understand and check for errors.\n- **`TypeCheckBlock`**: The actual generated code that validates bindings, events, and structural directives.\n\n### 5. Metadata & Scope (`ngtsc/metadata`, `ngtsc/scope`)\n\n- **`MetadataReader`**: Reads Angular metadata from source files (using `LocalMetadataRegistry`) and `.d.ts` files (using `DtsMetadataReader`).\n- **`ScopeRegistry`**: Determines the \"compilation scope\" of a component (which directives/pipes are available to it), handling `NgModule` transitive exports and Standalone Component imports.\n\n### 6. Emit & Transformation (`ngtsc/transform`)\n\n- **`ivyTransformFactory`**: A TypeScript transformer factory.\n- **`IvyCompilationVisitor`**: Visits classes, triggers compilation via `TraitCompiler`, and collects the Output AST.\n- **`IvyTransformationVisitor`**: Translates the Output AST into TypeScript AST, injects the `static ɵ...` fields, and removes the original decorators.\n\n## Compilation Phases\n\n1.  **Construction**: `NgtscProgram` creates `NgCompiler`, which sets up all registries and the `TraitCompiler`.\n2.  **Analysis** (`analyzeSync`):\n    - The `TraitCompiler` scans files.\n    - `DecoratorHandler`s extract metadata and parse templates.\n    - No cross-file resolution happens here (allowing for parallelism and caching).\n3.  **Resolution** (`resolve`):\n    - `TraitCompiler` resolves traits.\n    - Components link their templates to specific Directives and Pipes (found via `ScopeRegistry`).\n    - Import cycles are detected and handled (e.g., via \"remote scoping\").\n4.  **Type Checking**:\n    - `TemplateTypeChecker` creates TCBs for all components.\n    - TypeScript diagnostics are retrieved for these TCBs.\n5.  **Emit** (`prepareEmit`):\n    - `ivyTransformFactory` is created.\n    - TS `emit` is called.\n    - The transformers run, injecting the compiled Ivy instructions into the JS/DTS output.\n\n## Important File Locations\n\n- `packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/program.ts`: Entry point (`NgtscProgram`).\n- `packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/core/src/compiler.ts`: Core logic (`NgCompiler`).\n- `packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/transform/src/trait.ts`: Trait state machine.\n- `packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/annotations/component/src/handler.ts`: Component compilation logic.\n- `packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/typecheck/src/template_type_checker.ts`: Type checking logic.\n- `packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/transform/src/transform.ts`: AST transformation logic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:26:17.600Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing Angular-specific compilation and type checking capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要 Angular 特定编译和类型检查功能的前端代理。","ja":"Angular 固有のコンパイルおよび型チェック機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular 특정 컴파일 및 타입 체크 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de compilación y comprobación de tipos específicas de Angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de compilation et de vérification de types spécifiques à Angular.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Angular-spezifische Kompilierungs- und Typprüfungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de compilação e verificação de tipo específicas do Angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются возможности компиляции и проверки типов, специфичные для Angular.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلىقدرات تحويل برمجي وتحقق نوع محدد لشركة Angular."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compile Angular decorators into static properties on the class using Ivy instructions, perform template type checking, and leverage the TypeScript compiler (tsc) with Angular-specific capabilities via ngtsc.","zh":"赋予代理编译 Angular 装饰器为类上的静态属性的能力，使用 Ivy 指令执行模板类型检查，并通过 ngtsc 利用带有 Angular 特定功能的 TypeScript 编译器 (tsc)。","ja":"エージェントに、Ivy 命令を使用して Angular デコレーターをクラスの静的プロパティにコンパイルし、テンプレートの型チェックを実行し、ngtsc 経由で Angular 固有の機能を備えた TypeScript コンパイラー (tsc) を利用する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 Ivy 명령을 사용하여 Angular 데코레이터를 클래스의 정적 속성으로 컴파일하고 템플릿 타입 체크를 수행하며 ngtsc를 통해 Angular 특정 기능을 갖춘 TypeScript 컴파일러(tsc)를 활용할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a compilar decoradores de Angular en propiedades estáticas de la clase utilizando instrucciones Ivy, realizar comprobaciones de tipos de plantillas y aprovechar el compilador de TypeScript (tsc) con capacidades específicas de Angular a través de ngtsc.","fr":"Permet aux agents de compiler les décorateurs Angular en propriétés statiques de la classe à l''aide d''instructions Ivy, d''effectuer des vérifications de types de modèles et d''utiliser le compilateur TypeScript (tsc) avec des fonctionnalités spécifiques à Angular via ngtsc.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Angular-Decorator in statische Klassen-Eigenschaften mit Ivy-Anweisungen zu kompilieren, Vorlagen-Typprüfungen durchzuführen und den TypeScript-Compiler (tsc) mit Angular-spezifischen Funktionen über ngtsc zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compilar decoradores do Angular em propriedades estáticas da classe usando instruções Ivy, realizar verificação de tipo de modelo e aproveitar o compilador do TypeScript (tsc) com capacidades específicas do Angular via ngtsc.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью компилировать декораторы Angular в статические свойства класса с помощью инструкций Ivy, выполнять проверку типов шаблона и использовать компилятор TypeScript (tsc) с возможностями, специфичными для Angular, через ngtsc.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل برمجي.decorators من شركة Angular إلى خصائص ثابتة للفئة باستخدام تعليمات Ivy، وأداء التحقق من نوع النموذج، والاستفادة من مترجم TypeScript (tsc) معقدرات محددة لشركة Angular عبر ngtsc."},"useCases":{"en":["Compiling Angular components into efficient static code","Performing template type checking for Angular applications","Generating Ivy instructions for optimized Angular rendering"],"zh":["将 Angular 组件编译为高效的静态代码","执行 Angular 应用的模板类型检查","为优化的 Angular 渲染生成 Ivy 指令"],"ja":["Angular コンポーネントを効率的な静的コードにコンパイルする","Angular アプリケーションのテンプレートの型チェックを実行する","最適化された Angular レンダリング用の Ivy 命令を生成する"],"ko":["Angular 컴포넌트를 효율적인 정적 코드로 컴파일하는 것","Angular 애플리케이션의 템플릿 타입 체크를 수행하는 것","최적화된 Angular 렌더링을 위한 Ivy 명령을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Compilar componentes de Angular en código estático eficiente","Realizar comprobaciones de tipos de plantillas para aplicaciones de Angular","Generar instrucciones Ivy para una renderización de Angular optimizada"],"fr":["Compiler les composants Angular en code statique efficace","Effectuer des vérifications de types de modèles pour les applications Angular","Générer des instructions Ivy pour un rendu Angular optimisé"],"de":["Angular-Komponenten in effizienten statischen Code kompilieren","Vorlagen-Typprüfungen für Angular-Anwendungen durchführen","Ivy-Anweisungen für eine optimierte Angular-Renderung generieren"],"pt":["Compilar componentes do Angular em código estático eficiente","Realizar verificação de tipo de modelo para aplicações do Angular","Gerar instruções Ivy para renderização otimizada do Angular"],"ru":["Компилировать компоненты Angular в эффективный статический код","Выполнять проверку типов шаблона для приложений Angular","Генерировать инструкции Ivy для оптимизированной отрисовки Angular"],"ar":["تحويل برمجي لمكونات شركة Angular إلى رمز ثابت فعال","أداء التحقق من نوع النموذج للتطبيقات من شركة Angular","إنتاج تعليمات Ivy للتصيير الأمثل لشركة Angular"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular project setup","Dependent on TypeScript compiler (tsc) version compatibility"],"zh":["需要 Angular 项目设置","依赖于 TypeScript 编译器 (tsc) 版本兼容性"],"ja":["Angular プロジェクトの設定が必要","TypeScript コンパイラー (tsc) のバージョン互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Angular 프로젝트 설정이 필요하다","TypeScript 컴파일러(tsc) 버전 호환성에 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de Angular","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de la versión del compilador de TypeScript (tsc)"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Angular","Dépend de la compatibilité de la version du compilateur TypeScript (tsc)"],"de":["Benötigt eine Angular-Projekt-Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der TypeScript-Compiler-(tsc)-Version"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto do Angular","Dependente da versão do compilador do TypeScript (tsc) para compatibilidade"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Angular","Зависит от версии компилятора TypeScript (tsc) для совместимости"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع شركة Angular","يعتمد على إصدار مترجم TypeScript (tsc) لتحقيق التوافق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
