efe Einblicke in das Verhalten von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Monitoramento de processos e threads","Extração de configurações","Recuperação de payloads","Integração com sandbox CAPEv2","Motor de hooking extensivo","Visibilidade profunda no comportamento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Мониторинг процессов и потоков","Экстракция конфигураций","Восстановление полезных нагрузок","Интеграция с песочницей CAPEv2","Расширенный движок хукинга","Глубокая видимость поведения приложений"],"ar":["مراقبة العمليات والخيط","استخراج التكوين","استعادة الحمولة","التكامل مع حاوية الرمل CAPEv2","محرك hooking موسع","رؤية متعمقة في سلوك التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["capemon","CAPE","恶意代码分析","配置提取","有效负载恢复","API Hooking","监控引擎"],"ja":["capemon","CAPE","マルウェア分析","設定抽出","ペイロード復元","API Hooking","モニタリングエンジン"],"ko":["capemon","CAPE","악성 코드 분석","설정 추출","페이로드 복원","API Hooking","모니터링 엔진"],"es":["análisis de malware","monitoreo de aplicaciones","extracción de configuraciones","recuperación de payloads","motor de hooking","sandbox CAPEv2","seguridad informática","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["analyse de malware","surveillance d''applications","extraction de configurations","récupération de payloads","moteur de hooking","sandbox CAPEv2","sécurité informatique","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Malware-Analyse","Anwendungs-Überwachung","Konfigurations-Extraktion","Payload-Wiederherstellung","Hooking-Motor","CAPEv2-Sandbox","IT-Sicherheit","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["análise de malware","monitoramento de aplicativos","recuperação de payloads","sandbox CAPEv2","motor de hooking","visibilidade de aplicativos","segurança cibernética","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["анализ вредоносного ПО","мониторинг приложений","восстановление полезных нагрузок","песочница CAPEv2","движок хукинга","видимость приложений","кибербезопасность","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة","مراقبة التطبيقات","استعادة الحمولة","حاوية الرمل CAPEv2","محرك hooking","رؤية التطبيقات","أمن السيبراني","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"kevoreilly","repo":"capemon","repoPath":"kevoreilly/capemon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.528Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"capemon-developer","description":"Expert capability for navigating, modifying, and extending the capemon malware monitoring codebase. Includes deep knowledge of Windows API hooking, PE structures, and the CAPEv2 sandbox architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creatio","body":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creation, termination, and manipulation of processes and threads.\n- **File System Operations:** Tracking file creation, deletion, reading, and writing.\n- **Registry Activity:** Capturing configuration changes and persistence mechanisms.\n- **Network Communication:** Intercepting socket operations, DNS queries, and high-level protocol activity (HTTP, etc.).\n- **Cryptography:** Extracting keys and monitoring encryption/decryption routines.\n- **Synchronization & Services:** Monitoring mutexes, events, and Windows Service interactions.\n- **Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI):** Intercepting WMI queries used for anti-analysis or reconnaissance.\n- **Scripting Engines:** Specific hooks for VBScript and other language runtimes.\n\n### 2. Debugging & Tracing\n`capemon` implements a powerful in-process debugger independent of Windows debugging interfaces, but harnessing the capabilities of the processor:\n- **Hardware breakpoints:** Four breakpoints bp0-bp3 that can be set on execute, read or write\n- **Software breakpoints:** Unlimited INT3 or ''CC'' breakpoints overwriting instruction byte\n- **Single-step:** Tracing allows instruction-level capture enhanced with configurable step-over, trace-length, register changes, function names, strings & more\n- **Actions:** Configurable actions allow control flow manipulation with skipped or taken jumps, arbitrary register changes or jumps, string capture, dumps, scans & more\n- **Programmable:** Debugger configurable either on submission with simple text options or via dynamic YARA signature scans during unpacking or detonation\n- **Integration:** Hooking engine integrated with optional behavior log output & breakpoints set on return from hooked APIs (break-on-return)\n- **Stealth:** Debugger does not rely upon Windows interface and thus evades detection by a slew of interface-related indicators, with additional stealth from hook-based protections\n\n### 3. Automated Unpacking\n''capemon'' implements a powerful unpacking engine using a combination of techniques\n- **Memory region tracking:** Regions of memory revealed through indicators of execution, allocation or protection are tracked\n- **Early capture:** Multiple possible triggers allow payload capture at earliest moment often resulting in working unpacked samples\n- **Injection capture:**: Strong coverage of injection techniques for inter-process payload capture\n- **PE unmapping:** Integrated Scylla engine allows capture of memory or file-mapped PE images in memory\n- **Shellcode dumping:** Shellcode * non-PE regions equally captured as payloads\n- **Import Reconstruction:** Repairing Import Address Tables (IAT) to create functional dumped executables.\n- **AMSI Dumping:** Intercepting and dumping buffers passed to the Antimalware Scan Interface (AMSI).\n\n### 4. Config Extraction\nAutomated Static & Dynamic malware configuration extraction relies on ''capemon'' capabilities\n- **Static extraction:** Typically reliant upon capemon''s unpacking or process dump capture before static parsing\n- **Dynamic extraction:** When parser implementation is onerous, dynamic capture of decrypted configs can be performed by debugger via YARA signature\n\n### 5. YARA integration\nIntegration of YARA for in-memory scanning\n- **Dynamic configuration:** Sandbox configuration such as hooking exclusions or options implemented during detonation\n- **Debugger programming:** Precise dydnamic breakpoint address resolution using YARA signatures & cape-specific metadata\n- **Unpacking engine integration:** Dynamic scanning of all memory regions prior to unpacking capture\n- **Function resolution:** Allows dynamic address resolution for APIs or functions for hooking or other purposes\n\n## Technical Foundations\n- **Platform:** Windows (x86 and x64).\n- **Hooking Method:** Inline hooking of Win32 and Native APIs (NTAPI).\n- **Debugger:** Native in-process ''self'' debugging utilising minimal OS interfaces & hardware capabilities (breakpoint, single-step)\n- **Dependencies:** \n    - `distorm` for instruction decoding.\n    - `libyara` for pattern matching.\n    - `Scylla` for PE reconstruction.\n    - `bson` for data serialization.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:26:16.471Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Malware Analysis Agents requiring advanced API hooking and monitoring capabilities","zh":"适用于需要高级API钩子和监控能力的恶意软件分析代理","ja":"高度なAPIフックと監視機能を必要とするマルウェア分析エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 API 후킹 및 모니터링 기능을 필요로 하는 악성 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de malware que requieren capacidades de hooking y monitoreo de API avanzadas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de malware nécessitant des capacités de hooking et de surveillance d''API avancées","de":"Ideal für Malware-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte API-Hooking- und Überwachungsfunktionen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Malware que exigem recursos avançados de hooking e monitoramento de API","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Малварей, требующих продвинутых возможностей перехвата и мониторинга API","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة التي تتطلب تقنيات متقدمة لربط ومراقبة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor application behavior across multiple subsystems, including process and thread management, using an extensive hooking engine derived from cuckoomon-modified, and provides deep visibility into configuration extraction and payload recovery through the CAPEv2 sandbox","zh":"赋予代理监控应用程序行为的能力，跨多个子系统，包括进程和线程管理，使用来自cuckoomon-modified的广泛的钩子引擎，并通过CAPEv2沙箱提供对配置提取和有效负载恢复的深入可见性","ja":"エージェントに、cuckoomon-modifiedからの広範なフックエンジンを使用して、プロセスおよびスレッド管理を含む複数のサブシステムを跨いでアプリケーションの動作を監視する機能を提供し、またCAPEv2サンドボックスを介して、設定の抽出およびペイロードの回復に関する深い可視性を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 여러 하위 시스템을跨어 애플리케이션 동작을 모니터링 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 이는 프로세스 및 쓰레드 관리를 포함하며, cuckoomon-modified에서 유래한 포괄적인 후킹 엔진을 사용하며, CAPEv2 샌드박스를 통해 구성 추출 및 페이로드 복구에 대한 심층 가시성을 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para monitorear el comportamiento de las aplicaciones en varios subsistemas, incluyendo la gestión de procesos y subprocesos, utilizando un motor de hooking extenso derivado de cuckoomon-modificado, y proporciona una visibilidad profunda en la extracción de configuraciones y la recuperación de payloads a través del sandbox CAPEv2","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller le comportement des applications à travers plusieurs sous-systèmes, notamment la gestion des processus et des threads, en utilisant un moteur de hooking étendu dérivé de cuckoomon-modifié, et fournit une visibilité approfondie dans l''extraction de configurations et la récupération de charges utiles via le sandbox CAPEv2","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, das Verhalten von Anwendungen über mehrere Subsysteme hinweg zu überwachen, einschließlich Prozess- und Thread-Management, unter Verwendung eines umfangreichen Hooking-Engines, der von cuckoomon-modified abgeleitet ist, und bietet eine tiefe Einblick in die Konfigurationsextraktion und die Payload-Wiederherstellung durch den CAPEv2-Sandbox","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar o comportamento de aplicativos em vários subsistemas, incluindo gerenciamento de processos e threads, usando um mecanismo de hooking extensivo derivado do cuckoomon-modificado, e fornece visibilidade profunda na extração de configurações e recuperação de payload por meio do sandbox CAPEv2","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать поведение приложений в нескольких подсистемах, включая управление процессами и потоками, используя обширный механизм перехвата, полученный из модифицированного cuckoomon, и обеспечивает глубокую видимость извлечения конфигураций и восстановления полезной нагрузки через песочницу CAPEv2","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من مراقبة سلوك التطبيقات عبر عدة أنظمة فرعية، بما في ذلك إدارة العمليات والخيط، باستخدام محرك ربط موسع مشتق من cuckoomon-modified، ويوفر رؤية عميقة في استخراج التكوين واستعادة الحمولة من خلال صندوق الرمل CAPEv2"},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring malware behavior through API hooking","Extracting configurations from malicious applications","Recovering payloads from malware samples","Analyzing process and thread management in malware"],"zh":["通过API钩子监控恶意软件行为","从恶意应用程序中提取配置","从恶意软件样本中恢复有效负载","分析恶意软件中的进程和线程管理"],"ja":["APIフックを介したマルウェアの動作の監視","悪意のあるアプリケーションからの設定の抽出","マルウェアサンプルからのペイロードの回復","マルウェア内のプロセスおよびスレッド管理の分析"],"ko":["API 후킹을 통한 악성 코드 동작 모니터링","악성 애플리케이션에서 구성 추출","악성 코드 샘플에서 페이로드 복구","악성 코드의 프로세스 및 쓰레드 관리 분석"],"es":["Monitorear el comportamiento de malware a través del hooking de API","Extraer configuraciones de aplicaciones maliciosas","Recuperar payloads de muestras de malware","Analizar la gestión de procesos y subprocesos en malware"],"fr":["Surveiller le comportement de malware via le hooking d''API","Extraire des configurations d''applications malveillantes","Récupérer des charges utiles d''échantillons de malware","Analyser la gestion des processus et des threads dans les malwares"],"de":["Überwachung des Malware-Verhaltens durch API-Hooking","Extraktion von Konfigurationen aus bösartigen Anwendungen","Wiederherstellung von Payloads aus Malware-Proben","Analyse der Prozess- und Thread-Verwaltung in Malware"],"pt":["Monitorar o comportamento de malware por meio de hooking de API","Extraír configurações de aplicações maliciosas","Recuperar payloads de amostras de malware","Analizar gerenciamento de processos e threads em malware"],"ru":["Отслеживать поведение малварей с помощью перехвата API","Извлекать конфигурации из злонамеренных приложений","Восстанавливать полезные нагрузки из образцов малварей","Анализировать управление процессами и потоками в малваре"],"ar":["مراقبة سلوك البرمجيات الخبيثة من خلال ربط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","استخراج التكوينات من التطبيقات الخبيثة","استعادة الحمولات من عينات البرمجيات الخبيثة","تحليل إدارة العمليات والخيط في البرمجيات الخبيثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with CAPEv2 sandbox","Limited to malware analysis and monitoring"],"zh":["需要与CAPEv2沙箱集成","仅限于恶意软件分析和监控"],"ja":["CAPEv2サンドボックスとの統合が必要","マルウェア分析および監視のみに限定"],"ko":["CAPEv2 샌드박스와의 통합이 필요","악성 코드 분석 및 모니터링에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con el sandbox CAPEv2","Limitado al análisis y monitoreo de malware"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le sandbox CAPEv2","Limité à l''analyse et à la surveillance de malware"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit dem CAPEv2-Sandbox","Begrenzt auf Malware-Analyse und -Überwachung"],"pt":["Exige integração com o sandbox CAPEv2","Limitado à análise e monitoramento de malware"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с песочницей CAPEv2","Ограничен анализом и мониторингом малварей"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع صندوق الرمل CAPEv2","محدود بالتحليل ومراقبة البرمجيات الخبيثة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
