ocking y organización de pruebas"],"fr":["Création de tests d''unités et de fonctionnalités avec Pest","Débogage de tests avec SSG et Vercel","Organisation de tests dans le répertoire tests/Feature","Utilisation de php artisan make:test pour créer des tests","Compatibilité avec les datasets, mocking et organisation de tests"],"de":["Erstellung von Einheits- und Funktionsprüfungen mit Pest","Fehlersuche von Prüfungen mit SSG und Vercel","Organisation von Prüfungen im Verzeichnis tests/Feature","Verwendung von php artisan make:test zum Erstellen von Prüfungen","Kompatibilität mit Datenbeständen, Mocking und Prüfungsorganisation"],"pt":["Criação de testes unitários e de recursos","Uso de SSG para melhor desempenho","Hospedagem no Vercel para escalabilidade","Integração com o Statamic","Suporte a datasets e mocking"],"ru":["Создание модульных и функциональных тестов","Использование SSG для улучшения производительности","Размещение на Vercel для масштабируемости","Интеграция со Statamic","Поддержка наборов данных и макинга"],"ar":["إنشاء الاختبارات الوحدوية و الميزات","استخدام SSG لتحسين الأداء","استضافة على Vercel للتمكين من التوسع","التكامل مع استاتيك","دعم مجموعات البيانات و التمثيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pest 测试","PHP 测试框架","代码质量","开发效率","单元测试","功能测试","测试驱动开发"],"ja":["Pest テスト","PHP テストフレームワーク","コード品質","開発効率","ユニットテスト","機能テスト","テスト駆動開発"],"ko":["Pest 테스트","PHP 테스트 프레임워크","코드 품질","개발 효율성","유닛 테스트","기능 테스트","테스트 주도 개발"],"es":["pruebas de pest","statamic starter kit","ssg","vercel","pruebas de unidad","pruebas de características","depuración de pruebas","php artisan make:test"],"fr":["tests pest","kit de démarrage statamic","ssg","vercel","tests d''unités","tests de fonctionnalités","débogage de tests","php artisan make:test"],"de":["pest-prüfungen","statamic-starter-kit","ssg","vercel","einheitsprüfungen","funktionsprüfungen","fehlersuche von prüfungen","php artisan make:test"],"pt":["Pest Testing","Statamic","SSG","Vercel","Testes unitários","Testes de recursos","Desenvolvimento web","Ferramentas de teste"],"ru":["Pest-тестирование","Statamic","SSG","Vercel","Модульные тесты","Функциональные тесты","Веб-разработка","Инструменты тестирования"],"ar":["إختبار Pest","استاتيك","SSG","Vercel","الاختبارات الوحدوية","الاختبارات الميزات","تطوير الويب","أدوات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"jasonbaciulis","repo":"bedrock-demo","repoPath":"jasonbaciulis/bedrock-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pest-testing","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Pest Testing 3\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new tests (unit or feature)\n- Modifying existing tests\n- Debugging test failures\n- Working with datasets, mocking, or test organization\n- Writing architecture tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Pest 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Tests\n\nAll tests must be written using Pest. Use `php artisan make:test --pest {name}`.\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Tests live in the `tests/Feature`","body":"# Pest Testing 3\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new tests (unit or feature)\n- Modifying existing tests\n- Debugging test failures\n- Working with datasets, mocking, or test organization\n- Writing architecture tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Pest 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Tests\n\nAll tests must be written using Pest. Use `php artisan make:test --pest {name}`.\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Tests live in the `tests/Feature` and `tests/Unit` directories.\n- Do NOT remove tests without approval - these are core application code.\n- Test happy paths, failure paths, and edge cases.\n\n### Basic Test Structure\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Basic Pest Test Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''is true'', function () {\n    expect(true)->toBeTrue();\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Running Tests\n\n- Run minimal tests with filter before finalizing: `php artisan test --compact --filter=testName`.\n- Run all tests: `php artisan test --compact`.\n- Run file: `php artisan test --compact tests/Feature/ExampleTest.php`.\n\n## Assertions\n\nUse specific assertions (`assertSuccessful()`, `assertNotFound()`) instead of `assertStatus()`:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Pest Response Assertion\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''returns all'', function () {\n    $this->postJson(''/api/docs'', [])->assertSuccessful();\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n| Use | Instead of |\n|-----|------------|\n| `assertSuccessful()` | `assertStatus(200)` |\n| `assertNotFound()` | `assertStatus(404)` |\n| `assertForbidden()` | `assertStatus(403)` |\n\n## Mocking\n\nImport mock function before use: `use function Pest\\Laravel\\mock;`\n\n## Datasets\n\nUse datasets for repetitive tests (validation rules, etc.):\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Pest Dataset Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''has emails'', function (string $email) {\n    expect($email)->not->toBeEmpty();\n})->with([\n    ''james'' => ''james@laravel.com'',\n    ''taylor'' => ''taylor@laravel.com'',\n]);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Pest 3 Features\n\n### Architecture Testing\n\nPest 3 includes architecture testing to enforce code conventions:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Architecture Test Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\narch(''controllers'')\n    ->expect(''App\\Http\\Controllers'')\n    ->toExtendNothing()\n    ->toHaveSuffix(''Controller'');\n\narch(''models'')\n    ->expect(''App\\Models'')\n    ->toExtend(''Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Model'');\n\narch(''no debugging'')\n    ->expect([''dd'', ''dump'', ''ray''])\n    ->not->toBeUsed();\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Type Coverage\n\nPest 3 provides improved type coverage analysis. Run with `--type-coverage` flag.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Not importing `use function Pest\\Laravel\\mock;` before using mock\n- Using `assertStatus(200)` instead of `assertSuccessful()`\n- Forgetting datasets for repetitive validation tests\n- Deleting tests without approval"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:26:28.990Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for PHP-based AI Agents needing advanced testing capabilities with Pest 3","zh":"非常适合需要使用Pest 3进行高级测试的PHP基础AI代理","ja":"Pest 3を使用した高度なテスト機能を必要とするPHPベースのAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Pest 3를 사용하여 고급 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 PHP 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en PHP que necesitan capacidades de prueba avanzadas con Pest 3","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur PHP nécessitant des capacités de test avancées avec Pest 3","de":"Perfekt für PHP-basierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Testfunktionen mit Pest 3 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em PHP que necessitam de capacidades de teste avançadas com Pest 3","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе PHP, которым необходимы расширенные возможности тестирования с помощью Pest 3","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على PHP الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات اختبار متقدمة مع Pest 3"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write and manage tests using Pest, leveraging PHP artisan commands for seamless test creation and organization, while utilizing Vercel for hosting and Statamic for static site generation","zh":"赋予代理使用Pest编写和管理测试的能力，利用PHP工匠命令实现无缝的测试创建和组织，同时利用Vercel进行托管和Statamic进行静态站点生成","ja":"Pestを使用してテストを記述して管理するエージェントの能力を付与し、PHPアーティザンコマンドを使用してテストの作成と整理をスムーズに行い、Vercelを使用してホスティングとStatamicを使用して静的サイトを生成する","ko":"Pest를 사용하여 테스트를 작성하고 관리하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, PHP 아티즌 명령어를 사용하여 테스트 생성과 조직을 무결하게 수행하며, Vercel을 사용하여 호스팅과 Statamic을 사용하여 정적 사이트를 생성한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir y gestionar pruebas utilizando Pest, aprovechando los comandos de artesano de PHP para la creación y organización de pruebas sin problemas, mientras utiliza Vercel para la hospedaje y Statamic para la generación de sitios estáticos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire et de gérer des tests à l''aide de Pest, en exploitant les commandes d''artisan PHP pour une création et une organisation de tests sans effort, tout en utilisant Vercel pour l''hébergement et Statamic pour la génération de sites statiques","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Tests mit Pest zu schreiben und zu verwalten, indem es PHP-Artisan-Befehle für eine nahtlose Testerstellung und -organisation nutzt, während Vercel für das Hosting und Statamic für die statische Seiten generierung verwendet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever e gerenciar testes usando Pest, aproveitando os comandos artesanais do PHP para a criação e organização de testes sem problemas, enquanto utiliza o Vercel para hospedagem e o Statamic para geração de sites estáticos","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять тестами с помощью Pest, используя команды PHP-ремесла для бесшовного создания и организации тестов, а также использует Vercel для хостинга и Statamic для генерации статических сайтов","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء كتابة وإدارة الاختبارات باستخدام Pest، واستخدام أوامر الفنون الحرفية PHP لإنشاء الاختبارات وتنظيمها دون مشاكل، بينما يستخدم Vercel للاستضافة وStatamic لإنشاء مواقع ثابتة"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating unit and feature tests with Pest","Debugging test failures and organizing test datasets","Writing architecture tests and mocking dependencies"],"zh":["使用Pest创建单元测试和功能测试","调试测试失败并组织测试数据集","编写架构测试和模拟依赖"],"ja":["Pestを使用してユニットテストと機能テストを作成する","テストの失敗をデバッグしてテストデータセットを整理する","アーキテクチャテストを記述して依存関係をモックする"],"ko":["Pest를 사용하여 유닛 테스트와 기능 테스트를 생성한다","테스트 실패를 디버깅하고 테스트 데이터 세트를 조직한다","아키텍처 테스트를 작성하고 의존성을 모의한다"],"es":["Crear pruebas unitarias y de características con Pest","Depurar fallos de pruebas y organizar conjuntos de datos de pruebas","Escribir pruebas de arquitectura y simular dependencias"],"fr":["Créer des tests unitaires et de fonctionnalités avec Pest","Déboguer les échecs de tests et organiser les jeux de données de tests","Écrire des tests d''architecture et simuler les dépendances"],"de":["Erstellen von Einheits- und Funktionsprüfungen mit Pest","Fehler bei der Testausführung debuggen und Testdatensätze organisieren","Schreiben von Architekturtests und Abhängigkeiten simulieren"],"pt":["Criar testes unitários e de recursos com Pest","Depurar falhas de teste e organizar conjuntos de dados de teste","Escrever testes de arquitetura e simular dependências"],"ru":["Создание модульных и функциональных тестов с помощью Pest","Отладка неудач тестов и организация наборов данных тестов","Написание тестов архитектуры и имитация зависимостей"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات الوحدات و الميزات باستخدام Pest","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار وتنظيم مجموعات بيانات الاختبار","كتابة اختبارات الهندسة المعمارية ومحاكاة الاعتماديات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP environment","Pest 3 compatibility needed","Vercel hosting and Statamic setup required"],"zh":["需要PHP环境","需要Pest 3兼容性","需要Vercel托管和Statamic设置"],"ja":["PHP環境が必要","Pest 3の互換性が必要","VercelのホスティングとStatamicの設定が必要"],"ko":["PHP 환경이 필요하다","Pest 3의 호환성이 필요하다","Vercel 호스팅과 Statamic 설정이 필요하다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de PHP","Se necesita compatibilidad con Pest 3","Se requiere hospedaje de Vercel y configuración de Statamic"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement PHP","La compatibilité avec Pest 3 est nécessaire","L''hébergement Vercel et la configuration de Statamic sont requises"],"de":["Benötigt PHP-Umgebung","Pest 3-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Vercel-Hosting und Statamic-Einrichtung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente PHP","Compatibilidade com Pest 3 necessária","Hospedagem Vercel e configuração Statamic necessárias"],"ru":["Требуется среда PHP","Необходимо совместимость с Pest 3","Требуется хостинг Vercel и настройка Statamic"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة PHP","مطلوبة التوافق مع Pest 3","مطلوبة استضافة Vercel و إعداد Statamic"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
