je de consulta poderoso, pero puede ser peligroso si no se utiliza correctamente. Aprende a evitar problemas comunes.","fr":"GraphQL est un langage de requête puissant, mais il peut être dangereux si vous ne l''utilisez pas correctement. Apprenez à éviter les problèmes courants.","de":"GraphQL ist eine leistungsfähige Abfragesprache, aber sie kann gefährlich sein, wenn sie nicht richtig verwendet wird. Lernen Sie, wie Sie häufige Probleme v...","pt":"Otimize suas APIs GraphQL com dicas de um especialista e evite problemas de desempenho","ru":"Оптимизируйте свои API GraphQL с помощью советов специалиста и избегайте проблем с производительностью","ar":"حسّن واجهات برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL الخاصة بك مع نصائح من خبير و تجنب مشاكل الأداء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用DataLoader优化查询性能","限制查询深度防止DDoS攻击","正确使用nullable类型","优化API的错误处理"],"ja":["DataLoaderを使用してクエリパフォーマンスを最適化","クエリ深度を制限してDDoS攻撃を防ぐ","nullableタイプを正しく使用する","APIのエラーハンドリングを最適化"],"ko":["DataLoader를 사용하여 쿼리 성능 최적화","쿼리 깊이 제한으로 DDoS 공격 방지","널러블 타입 사용 방법","API 오류 처리 최적화"],"es":["Evita el problema de la consulta N+1","Limita la profundidad de las consultas","Utiliza DataLoader para optimizar las consultas","Gestiona errores y datos nulos de manera efectiva","Mejora la experiencia del usuario con respuestas rápidas"],"fr":["Évitez le problème de requête N+1","Limitez la profondeur des requêtes","Utilisez DataLoader pour optimiser les requêtes","Gérez les erreurs et les données nulles de manière efficace","Améliorez l''expérience utilisateur avec des réponses rapides"],"de":["Vermeiden Sie das Problem der Abfrage N+1","Begrenzen Sie die Tiefe der Abfragen","Verwenden Sie DataLoader, um Abfragen zu optimieren","Verwalten Sie Fehler und Nullwerte effektiv","Verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung mit schnellen Antworten"],"pt":["Evite o problema N+1 de consultas","Otimização de consultas aninhadas","Limitação de profundidade de consultas","Uso de DataLoader para melhorar o desempenho","Tratamento de erros e nulos","Melhoria da segurança contra ataques DDoS"],"ru":["Избегайте проблемы N+1 запросов","Оптимизация вложенных запросов","Ограничение глубины запросов","Использование DataLoader для улучшения производительности","Обработка ошибок и нулевых значений","Улучшение безопасности против атак DDoS"],"ar":["تجنب مشكلة N+1 من الاستعلامات","تحسين الاستعلامات المتداخلة","تحديد عمق الاستعلامات","استخدام DataLoader لتحسين الأداء","معالجة الأخطاء والقيم المفقودة","تحسين الأمان ضد هجمات DDoS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GraphQL","DataLoader","N+1查询问题","DDoS攻击","API优化","查询语言"],"ja":["GraphQL","DataLoader","N+1クエリ問題","DDoS攻撃","API最適化","クエリ言語"],"ko":["GraphQL","DataLoader","N+1 쿼리 문제","DDoS 공격","API 최적화","쿼리 언어"],"es":["GraphQL","optimización de GraphQL","problema de consulta N+1","DataLoader","APIs escalables","desarrollo de software","consultas eficientes"],"fr":["GraphQL","optimisation de GraphQL","problème de requête N+1","DataLoader","APIs évolutives","développement de logiciels","requêtes efficaces"],"de":["GraphQL","GraphQL-Optimierung","Abfrageproblem N+1","DataLoader","skalierbare APIs","Softwareentwicklung","effiziente Abfragen"],"pt":["GraphQL","otimização de desempenho","problema N+1","DataLoader","segurança contra DDoS","desenvolvimento de APIs","consultas aninhadas","limitação de profundidade de consultas"],"ru":["GraphQL","оптимизация производительности","проблема N+1","DataLoader","безопасность против DDoS","разработка API","вложенные запросы","ограничение глубины запросов"],"ar":["GraphQL","تحسين الأداء","مشكلة N+1","DataLoader","أمان ضد DDoS","تنمية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","استعلامات متداخلة","تحديد عمق الاستعلامات"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"graphql","description":"GraphQL gives clients exactly the data they need - no more, no less. One endpoint, typed schema, introspection. But the flexibility that makes it powerful also makes it dangerous. Without proper controls, clients can craft queries that bring down your server.  This skill covers schema design, resolvers, DataLoader for N+1 prevention, federation for microservices, and client integration with Apollo/urql. Key insight: GraphQL is a contract. The schema is the API documentation. Design it carefully.","bodyPreview":"# GraphQL\n\nYou''re a developer who has built GraphQL APIs at scale. You''ve seen the\nN+1 query problem bring down production servers. You''ve watched clients\ncraft deeply nested queries that took minutes to resolve. You know that\nGraphQL''s power is also its danger.\n\nYour hard-won lessons: The team that didn''t use DataLoader had unusable\nAPIs. The team that allowed unlimited query depth got DDoS''d by their\nown clients. The team that made everything nullable couldn''t distinguish\nerrors from empty dat","body":"# GraphQL\n\nYou''re a developer who has built GraphQL APIs at scale. You''ve seen the\nN+1 query problem bring down production servers. You''ve watched clients\ncraft deeply nested queries that took minutes to resolve. You know that\nGraphQL''s power is also its danger.\n\nYour hard-won lessons: The team that didn''t use DataLoader had unusable\nAPIs. The team that allowed unlimited query depth got DDoS''d by their\nown clients. The team that made everything nullable couldn''t distinguish\nerrors from empty data. You''ve l\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- graphql-schema-design\n- graphql-resolvers\n- graphql-federation\n- graphql-subscriptions\n- graphql-dataloader\n- graphql-codegen\n- apollo-server\n- apollo-client\n- urql\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Schema Design\n\nType-safe schema with proper nullability\n\n### DataLoader for N+1 Prevention\n\nBatch and cache database queries\n\n### Apollo Client Caching\n\nNormalized cache with type policies\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ No DataLoader\n\n### ❌ No Query Depth Limiting\n\n### ❌ Authorization in Schema\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Each resolver makes separate database queries | critical | # USE DATALOADER |\n| Deeply nested queries can DoS your server | critical | # LIMIT QUERY DEPTH AND COMPLEXITY |\n| Introspection enabled in production exposes your schema | high | # DISABLE INTROSPECTION IN PRODUCTION |\n| Authorization only in schema directives, not resolvers | high | # AUTHORIZE IN RESOLVERS |\n| Authorization on queries but not on fields | high | # FIELD-LEVEL AUTHORIZATION |\n| Non-null field failure nullifies entire parent | medium | # DESIGN NULLABILITY INTENTIONALLY |\n| Expensive queries treated same as cheap ones | medium | # QUERY COST ANALYSIS |\n| Subscriptions not properly cleaned up | medium | # PROPER SUBSCRIPTION CLEANUP |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `backend`, `postgres-wizard`, `nextjs-app-router`, `react-patterns`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:26:47.250Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API-focused Agents requiring scalable and efficient query management with GraphQL","zh":"适用于需要可扩展和高效查询管理的 GraphQL API 集中型代理","ja":"GraphQL を使用したクエリ管理が可能で、拡張性と効率性が求められる API フォーカス型エージェントに最適","ko":"GraphQL을 사용하여 쿼리 관리를 효율적으로 수행할 수 있는 API 중심 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes enfocados en API que requieren una gestión de consultas escalable y eficiente con GraphQL","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''API nécessitant une gestion de requêtes scalable et efficace avec GraphQL","de":"Ideal für API-fokussierte Agenten, die eine skalierbare und effiziente Abfrageverwaltung mit GraphQL erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes focados em API que exigem gerenciamento de consulta escalável e eficiente com GraphQL","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на API, требующих масштабируемого и эффективного управления запросами с помощью GraphQL","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتخصصين في واجهات برمجة التطبيقات التي تتطلب إدارة استفسار قابلة للتوسيع وفعالة مع جراف كيول"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle complex queries using DataLoader, mitigate the N+1 query problem, and enforce query depth limits to prevent DDoS attacks, while also managing nullable fields for error distinction","zh":"赋予代理处理复杂查询的能力，使用 DataLoader 来缓解 N+1 查询问题，并通过强制查询深度限制来防止 DDoS 攻击，同时也能管理可空字段以区分错误","ja":"エージェントに複雑なクエリを処理する能力を与え、DataLoader を使用して N+1 クエリ問題を軽減し、DDoS 攻撃を防ぐためにクエリの深さ制限を実施し、エラーを区別するために Nullable フィールドを管理する","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 쿼리를 처리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고, DataLoader를 사용하여 N+1 쿼리 문제를 완화하며, DDoS 공격을 방지하기 위해 쿼리 깊이 제한을 적용하며, 에러 구분을 위해 nullable 필드를 관리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar consultas complejas utilizando DataLoader, mitigar el problema de la consulta N+1 y hacer cumplir los límites de profundidad de la consulta para prevenir ataques DDoS, mientras también gestiona campos nulos para la distinción de errores","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des requêtes complexes en utilisant DataLoader, d''atténuer le problème de requête N+1 et de faire respecter les limites de profondeur de requête pour prévenir les attaques DDoS, tout en gérant les champs null pour la distinction des erreurs","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Abfragen mit DataLoader zu verarbeiten, das N+1-Abfrageproblem zu mildern und Abfrage-Tiefe-Grenzwerte durchzusetzen, um DDoS-Angriffe zu verhindern, während auch nullable Felder für die Fehlerunterscheidung verwaltet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com consultas complexas usando DataLoader, mitigar o problema de consulta N+1 e impor limites de profundidade de consulta para prevenir ataques DDoS, além de gerenciar campos nulos para distinção de erros","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать сложные запросы с помощью DataLoader, смягчать проблему запроса N+1 и устанавливать ограничения глубины запроса для предотвращения атак DDoS, а также управлять nullable-полями для различия ошибок","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التعامل مع الاستفسارات المعقدة باستخدام DataLoader، وتخفيف مشكلة استفسار N+1، وفرض حدود عمق الاستفسار لمنع هجمات DDoS، بالإضافة إلى إدارة الحقول القابلة للتعيين للاستعلام لتمييز الأخطاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing GraphQL APIs for production environments","Implementing DataLoader for efficient data fetching","Enforcing query depth limits for DDoS protection"],"zh":["为生产环境优化 GraphQL API","实现 DataLoader 以实现高效数据获取","强制执行查询深度限制以防止 DDoS 攻击"],"ja":["本番環境向けのGraphQL APIの最適化","DataLoaderを使用した効率的なデータ取得の実装","DDoS保護のためのクエリの深さ制限の実施"],"ko":["생산 환경을 위한 GraphQL API 최적화","데이터 로더를 사용한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 구현","DDoS 보호를 위한 쿼리 깊이 제한 적용"],"es":["Optimizar APIs de GraphQL para entornos de producción","Implementar DataLoader para una recolección de datos eficiente","Hacer cumplir los límites de profundidad de la consulta para la protección DDoS"],"fr":["Optimiser les API GraphQL pour les environnements de production","Mettre en œuvre DataLoader pour une récupération de données efficace","Faire respecter les limites de profondeur de requête pour la protection DDoS"],"de":["GraphQL-APIs für Produktionsumgebungen optimieren","DataLoader für effizientes Daten Abrufen implementieren","Abfrage-Tiefe-Grenzwerte für DDoS-Schutz durchsetzen"],"pt":["Otimizando APIs GraphQL para ambientes de produção","Implementando DataLoader para busca de dados eficiente","Impulsionando limites de profundidade de consulta para proteção contra DDoS"],"ru":["Оптимизация GraphQL API для производственных сред","Реализация DataLoader для эффективной выборки данных","Установление ограничений глубины запроса для защиты от DDoS"],"ar":["تحسين واجهات برمجة التطبيقات جراف كيول لبيئات الإنتاج","تنفيذ DataLoader لاسترجاع البيانات بكفاءة","فرض حدود عمق الاستفسار لحماية ضد هجمات DDoS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires careful handling of nullable fields to distinguish errors from empty data","Needs proper configuration to avoid the N+1 query problem"],"zh":["需要小心处理可空字段以区分错误和空数据","需要适当的配置以避免 N+1 查询问题"],"ja":["エラーと空のデータを区別するために、Nullable フィールドを慎重に処理する必要がある","N+1 クエリ問題を避けるために、適切な構成が必要"],"ko":["에러와 빈 데이터를 구분하기 위해 nullable 필드를 주의해서 처리해야 함","N+1 쿼리 문제를 피하기 위해 올바른 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un manejo cuidadoso de los campos nulos para distinguir los errores de los datos vacíos","Necesita una configuración adecuada para evitar el problema de la consulta N+1"],"fr":["Nécessite une manipulation soigneuse des champs null pour distinguer les erreurs des données vides","Nécessite une configuration appropriée pour éviter le problème de requête N+1"],"de":["Erfordert eine sorgfältige Handhabung von nullable Feldern, um Fehler von leeren Daten zu unterscheiden","Benötigt eine ordnungsgemäße Konfiguration, um das N+1-Abfrageproblem zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Exige manipulação cuidadosa de campos nulos para distinguir erros de dados vazios","Necessita de configuração adequada para evitar o problema de consulta N+1"],"ru":["Требует тщательного обращения с nullable-полями для различия ошибок и пустых данных","Требует правильной настройки для избежания проблемы запроса N+1"],"ar":["يتطلب التعامل بحذر مع الحقول القابلة للتعيين لتمييز الأخطاء من البيانات الفارغة","يتطلب التهيئة المناسبة لتجنب مشكلة استفسار N+1"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/crewai', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'crewai', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z', '2026-02-18T14:26:42.703Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/crewai","name":"crewai","description":{"zh":"CrewAI 是一种多智能体架构，允许您设计和协调智能体团队以实现最佳协作","ja":"CrewAI は、マルチエージェントアーキテクチャを設計し、最適な協調を実現するためのエージェントチームを調整することができる","ko":"CrewAI는 멀티 에이전트 아키텍처를 설계하고 최적의 협조를 달성하기 위한 에이전트 팀을 조정할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다","es":"CrewAI es una herramienta para diseñar equipos de agentes AI colaborativos. Permite definir roles, responsabilidades y tareas para una colaboración óptima","fr":"CrewAI est un outil pour concevoir des équipes d''agents AI collaboratifs. Il permet de définir des rôles, des responsabilités et des tâches pour une collaboration optimale","de":"CrewAI ist ein Werkzeug zum Entwerfen kooperierender AI-Agententeams. Es ermöglicht die Definition von Rollen, Verantwortlichkeiten und Aufgaben für eine optimale Zusammenarbeit","pt":"CrewAI é uma ferramenta para design de equipes de agentes de IA colaborativos. Permite criar agentes com papéis e responsabilidades claros.","ru":"CrewAI — инструмент для проектирования команд коллаборативных агентов ИИ. Позволяет создавать агентов с четкими ролями и обязанностями.","ar":"CrewAI هي أداة لتصميم فرق وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي التعاونية. تمكن من إنشاء وكلاء مع أدوار ومسؤوليات واضحة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"CrewAI 多智能体架构师","ja":"CrewAI マルチエージェントアーキテクト","ko":"CrewAI 멀티 에이전트 아키텍트","es":"CrewAI: Arquitectura de Agentes Colaborativos","fr":"CrewAI : Architecture d''Agents Collaboratifs","de":"CrewAI: Kooperierende Agentenarchitektur","pt":"CrewAI: Arquitetura de Agentes de IA Colaborativos","ru":"CrewAI: Архитектура Коллаборатив