 tarefas e dependências","Orquestração de equipes para colaboração ótima","Uso de processos sequenciais e hierárquicos","Criação de perfis de agente com expertise específica"],"ru":["Определение агентов с ролями и обязанностями","Проектирование задач и зависимостей","Оркестрация команд для оптимального сотрудничества","Использование последовательных и иерархических процессов","Создание профилей агентов с конкретными навыками"],"ar":["تحديد وكلاء مع أدوار ومسؤوليات","تصميم المهام والاعتمادات","أوركسترا الفرق للتعاون الأمثل","استخدام العمليات المتسلسلة والهرمية","إنشاء ملفات تعريف الوكيل مع الخبرة المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CrewAI","多智能体","协作团队","智能体架构","任务设计","依赖关系管理"],"ja":["CrewAI","マルチエージェント","協調チーム","エージェントアーキテクチャ","タスク設計","依存関係管理"],"ko":["CrewAI","멀티 에이전트","협조 팀","에이전트 아키텍처","작업 설계","의존성 관리"],"es":["CrewAI","agentes colaborativos","arquitectura de agentes","diseño de tareas","colaboración AI","inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["CrewAI","agents collaboratifs","architecture d''agents","conception de tâches","collaboration IA","intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels"],"de":["CrewAI","kooperierende Agenten","Agentenarchitektur","Aufgabenkonzeption","Kooperation KI","künstliche Intelligenz","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["CrewAI","agentes de IA","colaboração","design de equipes","papéis e responsabilidades","tarefas e dependências","orquestração de equipes"],"ru":["CrewAI","агенты ИИ","сотрудничество","проектирование команд","роли и обязанности","задачи и зависимости","оркестрация команд"],"ar":["CrewAI","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التعاون","تصميم الفرق","الأدوار والمسؤوليات","المهام والاعتمادات","أوركسترا الفرق"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"crewai","description":"Expert in CrewAI - the leading role-based multi-agent framework used by 60% of Fortune 500 companies. Covers agent design with roles and goals, task definition, crew orchestration, process types (sequential, hierarchical, parallel), memory systems, and flows for complex workflows. Essential for building collaborative AI agent teams. Use when: crewai, multi-agent team, agent roles, crew of agents, role-based agents.","bodyPreview":"# CrewAI\n\n**Role**: CrewAI Multi-Agent Architect\n\nYou are an expert in designing collaborative AI agent teams with CrewAI. You think\nin terms of roles, responsibilities, and delegation. You design clear agent personas\nwith specific expertise, create well-defined tasks with expected outputs, and\norchestrate crews for optimal collaboration. You know when to use sequential vs\nhierarchical processes.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Agent definitions (role, goal, backstory)\n- Task design and dependencies\n- Crew","body":"# CrewAI\n\n**Role**: CrewAI Multi-Agent Architect\n\nYou are an expert in designing collaborative AI agent teams with CrewAI. You think\nin terms of roles, responsibilities, and delegation. You design clear agent personas\nwith specific expertise, create well-defined tasks with expected outputs, and\norchestrate crews for optimal collaboration. You know when to use sequential vs\nhierarchical processes.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Agent definitions (role, goal, backstory)\n- Task design and dependencies\n- Crew orchestration\n- Process types (sequential, hierarchical)\n- Memory configuration\n- Tool integration\n- Flows for complex workflows\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3.10+\n- crewai package\n- LLM API access\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Crew with YAML Config\n\nDefine agents and tasks in YAML (recommended)\n\n**When to use**: Any CrewAI project\n\n```python\n# config/agents.yaml\nresearcher:\n  role: \"Senior Research Analyst\"\n  goal: \"Find comprehensive, accurate information on {topic}\"\n  backstory: |\n    You are an expert researcher with years of experience\n    in gathering and analyzing information. You''re known\n    for your thorough and accurate research.\n  tools:\n    - SerperDevTool\n    - WebsiteSearchTool\n  verbose: true\n\nwriter:\n  role: \"Content Writer\"\n  goal: \"Create engaging, well-structured content\"\n  backstory: |\n    You are a skilled writer who transforms research\n    into compelling narratives. You focus on clarity\n    and engagement.\n  verbose: true\n\n# config/tasks.yaml\nresearch_task:\n  description: |\n    Research the topic: {topic}\n\n    Focus on:\n    1. Key facts and statistics\n    2. Recent developments\n    3. Expert opinions\n    4. Contrarian viewpoints\n\n    Be thorough and cite sources.\n  agent: researcher\n  expected_output: |\n    A comprehensive research report with:\n    - Executive summary\n    - Key findings (bulleted)\n    - Sources cited\n\nwriting_task:\n  description: |\n    Using the research provided, write an article about {topic}.\n\n    Requirements:\n    - 800-1000 words\n    - Engaging introduction\n    - Clear structure with headers\n    - Actionable conclusion\n  agent: writer\n  expected_output: \"A polished article ready for publication\"\n  context:\n    - research_task  # Uses output from research\n\n# crew.py\nfrom crewai import Agent, Task, Crew, Process\nfrom crewai.project import CrewBase, agent, task, crew\n\n@CrewBase\nclass ContentCrew:\n    agents_config = ''config/agents.yaml''\n    tasks_config = ''config/tasks.yaml''\n\n    @agent\n    def researcher(self) -> Agent:\n        return Agent(config=self.agents_config[''researcher''])\n\n    @agent\n    def writer(self) -> Agent:\n        return Agent(config=self.agents_config[''writer''])\n\n    @task\n    def research_task(self) -> Task:\n        return Task(config=self.tasks_config[''research_task''])\n\n    @task\n    def writing_task(self) -> Task:\n        return Task(config\n```\n\n### Hierarchical Process\n\nManager agent delegates to workers\n\n**When to use**: Complex tasks needing coordination\n\n```python\nfrom crewai import Crew, Process\n\n# Define specialized agents\nresearcher = Agent(\n    role=\"Research Specialist\",\n    goal=\"Find accurate information\",\n    backstory=\"Expert researcher...\"\n)\n\nanalyst = Agent(\n    role=\"Data Analyst\",\n    goal=\"Analyze and interpret data\",\n    backstory=\"Expert analyst...\"\n)\n\nwriter = Agent(\n    role=\"Content Writer\",\n    goal=\"Create engaging content\",\n    backstory=\"Expert writer...\"\n)\n\n# Hierarchical crew - manager coordinates\ncrew = Crew(\n    agents=[researcher, analyst, writer],\n    tasks=[research_task, analysis_task, writing_task],\n    process=Process.hierarchical,\n    manager_llm=ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o\"),  # Manager model\n    verbose=True\n)\n\n# Manager decides:\n# - Which agent handles which task\n# - When to delegate\n# - How to combine results\n\nresult = crew.kickoff()\n```\n\n### Planning Feature\n\nGenerate execution plan before running\n\n**When to use**: Complex workflows needing structure\n\n```python\nfrom crewai import Crew, Process\n\n# Enable planning\ncrew = Crew(\n    agents=[researcher, writer, reviewer],\n    tasks=[research, write, review],\n    process=Process.sequential,\n    planning=True,  # Enable planning\n    planning_llm=ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o\")  # Planner model\n)\n\n# With planning enabled:\n# 1. CrewAI generates step-by-step plan\n# 2. Plan is injected into each task\n# 3. Agents see overall structure\n# 4. More consistent results\n\nresult = crew.kickoff()\n\n# Access the plan\nprint(crew.plan)\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Vague Agent Roles\n\n**Why bad**: Agent doesn''t know its specialty.\nOverlapping responsibilities.\nPoor task delegation.\n\n**Instead**: Be specific:\n- \"Senior React Developer\" not \"Developer\"\n- \"Financial Analyst specializing in crypto\" not \"Analyst\"\nInclude specific skills in backstory.\n\n### ❌ Missing Expected Outputs\n\n**Why bad**: Agent doesn''t know done criteria.\nInconsistent outputs.\nHard to chain tasks.\n\n**Instead**: Always specify expected_output:\nexpected_output: |\n  A JSON object with:\n  - summary: string (100 words max)\n  - key_points: list of strings\n  - confidence: float 0-1\n\n### ❌ Too Many Agents\n\n**Why bad**: Coordination overhead.\nInconsistent communication.\nSlower execution.\n\n**Instead**: 3-5 agents with clear roles.\nOne agent can handle multiple related tasks.\nUse tools instead of agents for simple actions.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Python-only\n- Best for structured workflows\n- Can be verbose for simple cases\n- Flows are newer feature\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `langgraph`, `autonomous-agents`, `langfuse`, `structured-output`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:26:42.703Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Agent System Architects needing advanced collaborative AI team design capabilities with CrewAI.","zh":"适合需要高级协作AI团队设计能力的多智能体系统架构师，使用CrewAI。","ja":"CrewAIを使用するマルチエージェントシステムアーキテクトが高度な共同AIチーム設計機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"CrewAI를 사용하는 멀티 에이전트 시스템 아키텍트가 고급 협업 AI 팀 디자인 기능을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para arquitectos de sistemas de agentes múltiples que necesitan capacidades de diseño de equipo de inteligencia artificial colaborativa avanzadas con CrewAI.","fr":"Idéal pour les architectes de systèmes multi-agents ayant besoin de capacités de conception d''équipe d''intelligence artificielle collaborative avancées avec CrewAI.","de":"Ideal für Multi-Agenten-System-Architekten, die erweiterte Funktionen für die Zusammenarbeit von künstlicher Intelligenz in Teams mit CrewAI benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Arquitetos de Sistemas de Múltiplos Agentes que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design de equipes de IA colaborativas com CrewAI.","ru":"Идеально для архитекторов систем 多AGENT, которым необходимы расширенные возможности проектирования команд ИИ с функцией CrewAI.","ar":"مثالي لمهندسي أنظمة وكلاء متعددين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصميم فرق ذكاء اصطناعي تعاونية مع CrewAI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define clear agent personas with specific expertise, create well-defined tasks with expected outputs, and orchestrate crews for optimal collaboration using sequential vs hierarchical processes, and task dependencies.","zh":"赋予代理定义明确的代理人格，具备特定专业知识，创建明确定义的任务，具有预期输出，并使用顺序与层次过程和任务依赖关系来协调船员以实现最佳协作。","ja":"エージェントが明確なエージェントの個性を定義し、特定の専門知識を持たせ、明確に定義されたタスクを作成し、予想される出力を持ち、シーケンシャルと階層的なプロセス、およびタスクの依存関係を使用して、クルーを最適な協力のためにオーケストレーションすることを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 명확한 에이전트 개성을 정의하고 특정 전문 지식을 갖게 하며 명확하게 정의된 작업을 생성하고 예상 출력을 가지며 순차적이고 계층적인 프로세스 및 작업 의존성을 사용하여 최적의 협력을 위한 승무원을 오케스트레이션 할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes definir perfiles de agente claros con habilidades específicas, crear tareas bien definidas con resultados esperados y orquestar equipos para una colaboración óptima utilizando procesos secuenciales versus jerárquicos y dependencias de tareas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des profils d''agent clairs avec des expertises spécifiques, de créer des tâches bien définies avec des résultats attendus et d''orchestrer des équipes pour une collaboration optimale en utilisant des processus séquentiels versus hiérarchiques et des dépendances de tâches.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, klare Agentenprofile mit spezifischen Fähigkeiten zu definieren, gut definierte Aufgaben mit erwarteten Ausgaben zu erstellen und Teams für eine optimale Zusammenarbeit zu orchestrieren, indem sie sequenzielle versus hierarchische Prozesse und Aufgabenabhängigkeiten verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir personas de agente claras com especialidades específicas, criar tarefas bem definidas com saídas esperadas e orquestrar equipes para colaboração ótima usando processos sequenciais versus hierárquicos e dependências de tarefas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять четкие персоны агентов с конкретными навыками, создавать хорошо определенные задачи с ожидаемыми результатами и оркестрировать команды для оптимального сотрудничества с использованием последовательных против иерархических процессов и зависимостей задач.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعريف شخصيات وكلاء واضحة مع خبرات محددة، وإنشاء مهام محددة جيدًا مع مخرجات متوقعة، وتوجيه أفرقة للتعاون الأمثل باستخدام العمليات التسلسلية مقابل الهياكل الهرمية، واعتماديات المهام."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing collaborative AI agent teams","Defining agent roles and responsibilities","Orchestrating crews for optimal task execution"],"zh":["设计协作AI代理团队","定义代理角色和职责","为最佳任务执行而编排船员"],"ja":["共同AIエージェントチームの設計","エージェントの役割と責任の定義","タスクの実行の最適化のためのクルー編成"],"ko":["협업 AI 에이전트 팀 설계","에이전트 역할 및 책임 정의","최적의 작업 실행을 위한 승무원 조직"],"es":["Diseño de equipos de agentes de inteligencia artificial colaborativa","Definición de roles y responsabilidades de los agentes","Orquestación de equipos para la ejecución óptima de tareas"],"fr":["Conception d''équipes d''agents d''intelligence artificielle collaborative","Définition des rôles et des responsabilités des agents","Orchestration d''équipes pour l''exécution optimale des tâches"],"de":["Entwicklung von kollaborativen künstlicher Intelligenz-Agenten-Teams","Definition von Agenten-Rollen und -Verantwortungen","Orchestrierung von Teams für die optimale Aufgabenausführung"],"pt":["Projetar equipes de agentes de IA colaborativas","Definir papéis e responsabilidades de agentes","Orquestrar equipes para execução ótima de tarefas"],"ru":["Проектирование команд ИИ с функцией сотрудничества","Определение ролей и обязанностей агентов","Оркестрирование команд для оптимального выполнения задач"],"ar":["تصميم فرق وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي تعاونية","تحديد أدوار ومسؤوليات الوكلاء","توجيه الفرق لتنفيذ المهام الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear definition of agent roles and goals","Dependent on well-defined tasks with expected outputs"],"zh":["需要明确的代理角色和目标定义","依赖于明确定义的任务和预期输出"],"ja":["エージェントの役割と目標の明確な定義が必要","明確に定義されたタスクと予想される出力に依存する"],"ko":["에이전트 역할 및 목표에 대한 명확한 정의가 필요","명확하게 정의된 작업 및 예상 출력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una definición clara de los roles y objetivos de los agentes","Depende de tareas bien definidas con resultados esperados"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition claire des rôles et des objectifs des agents","Dépend de tâches bien définies avec des résultats attendus"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Definition der Agenten-Rollen und -Ziele","Hängt von gut definierten Aufgaben mit erwarteten Ausgaben ab"],"pt":["Exige definição clara de papéis e objetivos de agentes","Depende de tarefas bem definidas com saídas esperadas"],"ru":["Требует четкого определения ролей и целей агентов","Зависит от хорошо определенных задач с ожидаемыми результатами"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفًا واضحًا لأدوار وأهداف الوكلاء","يعتمد على مهام محددة جيدًا مع مخرجات متوقعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
