구축하는 기술입니다","es":"LangGraph es una herramienta para construir agentes AI de producción con gráficos de estado visibles y depurables.","fr":"LangGraph est un outil pour construire des agents IA de production avec des graphiques d''état visibles et débogables.","de":"LangGraph ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von AI-Agents für die Produktion mit sichtbaren und debugbaren Zustandsgraphen.","pt":"LangGraph é uma ferramenta para criar agentes de IA de produção com estrutura de grafos visíveis e depuráveis.","ru":"LangGraph - это инструмент для создания агентов ИИ с явной структурой графов.","ar":"LangGraph هو أداة لإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي بنية графية مرئية وقابلة للتصحيح.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["图构造（StateGraph）","状态管理和归约器","节点和边定义","持久化和调试","循环和无限循环防止"],"ja":["グラフ構築（StateGraph）","状態管理とリダクション","ノードとエッジ定義","永続化とデバッグ","サイクルと無限ループ防止"],"ko":["그래프 구축（StateGraph）","상태 관리와 리듀서","노드와 에지 정의","지속성과 디버깅","サイクル과 무한 루프 방지"],"es":["Construcción de gráficos de estado","Gestión de nodos y aristas","Uso de reductores para la gestión de estado","Diseño de ciclos y prevención de bucles infinitos","Persistencia para producción"],"fr":["Construction de graphiques d''état","Gestion de nœuds et d''arêtes","Utilisation de réducteurs pour la gestion d''état","Conception de cycles et prévention de boucles infinies","Persistance pour la production"],"de":["Erstellung von Zustandsgraphen","Verwaltung von Knoten und Kanten","Verwendung von Reduktoren für die Zustandsverwaltung","Entwurf von Zyklen und Vermeidung von Endlosschleifen","Persistenz für die Produktion"],"pt":["Construção de grafos (StateGraph)","Gerenciamento de estado e reduzidores","Definição de nós e arestas","Prevenção de ciclos infinitos","Persistência para produção"],"ru":["Строительство графов (StateGraph)","Управление состоянием и редукторами","Определение узлов и ребер","Предотвращение бесконечных циклов","ПERSISTENCE для производства"],"ar":["بناء الرسوم البيانية (StateGraph)","إدارة الحالة والmuxers","تعريف العقد والحواف","منع الدورات اللانهائية","الاستمرارية لإنتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangGraph","AI 代理","图构造","状态管理","持久化","调试","循环","无限循环"],"ja":["LangGraph","AI エージェント","グラフ構築","状態管理","永続化","デバッグ","サイクル","無限ループ"],"ko":["LangGraph","AI 에이전트","그래프 구축","상태 관리","지속성","디버깅","사이클","무한 루프"],"es":["LangGraph","agentes AI","gráficos de estado","gestión de estado","reductores","ciclos","persistencia","producción","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["LangGraph","agents IA","graphiques d''état","gestion d''état","réducteurs","cycles","persistance","production","développement de logiciels"],"de":["LangGraph","AI-Agents","Zustandsgraphen","Zustandsverwaltung","Reduktoren","Zyklen","Persistenz","Produktion","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["LangGraph","Arquitetura de agentes de IA","Grafos de estado","Gerenciamento de estado","Reduzidores","Desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["LangGraph","Архитектура агентов ИИ","Графы состояния","Управление состоянием","Редукторы","Разработка ИИ"],"ar":["LangGraph","هندسة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","الرسوم البيانية للحالة","إدارة الحالة","المخففات","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langgraph","description":"Expert in LangGraph - the production-grade framework for building stateful, multi-actor AI applications. Covers graph construction, state management, cycles and branches, persistence with checkpointers, human-in-the-loop patterns, and the ReAct agent pattern. Used in production at LinkedIn, Uber, and 400+ companies. This is LangChains recommended approach for building agents. Use when: langgraph, langchain agent, stateful agent, agent graph, react agent.","bodyPreview":"# LangGraph\n\n**Role**: LangGraph Agent Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building production-grade AI agents with LangGraph. You\nunderstand that agents need explicit structure - graphs make the flow visible\nand debuggable. You design state carefully, use reducers appropriately, and\nalways consider persistence for production. You know when cycles are needed\nand how to prevent infinite loops.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Graph construction (StateGraph)\n- State management and reducers\n- Node and edge definiti","body":"# LangGraph\n\n**Role**: LangGraph Agent Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building production-grade AI agents with LangGraph. You\nunderstand that agents need explicit structure - graphs make the flow visible\nand debuggable. You design state carefully, use reducers appropriately, and\nalways consider persistence for production. You know when cycles are needed\nand how to prevent infinite loops.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Graph construction (StateGraph)\n- State management and reducers\n- Node and edge definitions\n- Conditional routing\n- Checkpointers and persistence\n- Human-in-the-loop patterns\n- Tool integration\n- Streaming and async execution\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3.9+\n- langgraph package\n- LLM API access (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)\n- Understanding of graph concepts\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Agent Graph\n\nSimple ReAct-style agent with tools\n\n**When to use**: Single agent with tool calling\n\n```python\nfrom typing import Annotated, TypedDict\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph, START, END\nfrom langgraph.graph.message import add_messages\nfrom langgraph.prebuilt import ToolNode\nfrom langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\nfrom langchain_core.tools import tool\n\n# 1. Define State\nclass AgentState(TypedDict):\n    messages: Annotated[list, add_messages]\n    # add_messages reducer appends, doesn''t overwrite\n\n# 2. Define Tools\n@tool\ndef search(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search the web for information.\"\"\"\n    # Implementation here\n    return f\"Results for: {query}\"\n\n@tool\ndef calculator(expression: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Evaluate a math expression.\"\"\"\n    return str(eval(expression))\n\ntools = [search, calculator]\n\n# 3. Create LLM with tools\nllm = ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o\").bind_tools(tools)\n\n# 4. Define Nodes\ndef agent(state: AgentState) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"The agent node - calls LLM.\"\"\"\n    response = llm.invoke(state[\"messages\"])\n    return {\"messages\": [response]}\n\n# Tool node handles tool execution\ntool_node = ToolNode(tools)\n\n# 5. Define Routing\ndef should_continue(state: AgentState) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Route based on whether tools were called.\"\"\"\n    last_message = state[\"messages\"][-1]\n    if last_message.tool_calls:\n        return \"tools\"\n    return END\n\n# 6. Build Graph\ngraph = StateGraph(AgentState)\n\n# Add nodes\ngraph.add_node(\"agent\", agent)\ngraph.add_node(\"tools\", tool_node)\n\n# Add edges\ngraph.add_edge(START, \"agent\")\ngraph.add_conditional_edges(\"agent\", should_continue, [\"tools\", END])\ngraph.add_edge(\"tools\", \"agent\")  # Loop back\n\n# Compile\napp = graph.compile()\n\n# 7. Run\nresult = app.invoke({\n    \"messages\": [(\"user\", \"What is 25 * 4?\")]\n})\n```\n\n### State with Reducers\n\nComplex state management with custom reducers\n\n**When to use**: Multiple agents updating shared state\n\n```python\nfrom typing import Annotated, TypedDict\nfrom operator import add\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph\n\n# Custom reducer for merging dictionaries\ndef merge_dicts(left: dict, right: dict) -> dict:\n    return {**left, **right}\n\n# State with multiple reducers\nclass ResearchState(TypedDict):\n    # Messages append (don''t overwrite)\n    messages: Annotated[list, add_messages]\n\n    # Research findings merge\n    findings: Annotated[dict, merge_dicts]\n\n    # Sources accumulate\n    sources: Annotated[list[str], add]\n\n    # Current step (overwrites - no reducer)\n    current_step: str\n\n    # Error count (custom reducer)\n    errors: Annotated[int, lambda a, b: a + b]\n\n# Nodes return partial state updates\ndef researcher(state: ResearchState) -> dict:\n    # Only return fields being updated\n    return {\n        \"findings\": {\"topic_a\": \"New finding\"},\n        \"sources\": [\"source1.com\"],\n        \"current_step\": \"researching\"\n    }\n\ndef writer(state: ResearchState) -> dict:\n    # Access accumulated state\n    all_findings = state[\"findings\"]\n    all_sources = state[\"sources\"]\n\n    return {\n        \"messages\": [(\"assistant\", f\"Report based on {len(all_sources)} sources\")],\n        \"current_step\": \"writing\"\n    }\n\n# Build graph\ngraph = StateGraph(ResearchState)\ngraph.add_node(\"researcher\", researcher)\ngraph.add_node(\"writer\", writer)\n# ... add edges\n```\n\n### Conditional Branching\n\nRoute to different paths based on state\n\n**When to use**: Multiple possible workflows\n\n```python\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph, START, END\n\nclass RouterState(TypedDict):\n    query: str\n    query_type: str\n    result: str\n\ndef classifier(state: RouterState) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Classify the query type.\"\"\"\n    query = state[\"query\"].lower()\n    if \"code\" in query or \"program\" in query:\n        return {\"query_type\": \"coding\"}\n    elif \"search\" in query or \"find\" in query:\n        return {\"query_type\": \"search\"}\n    else:\n        return {\"query_type\": \"chat\"}\n\ndef coding_agent(state: RouterState) -> dict:\n    return {\"result\": \"Here''s your code...\"}\n\ndef search_agent(state: RouterState) -> dict:\n    return {\"result\": \"Search results...\"}\n\ndef chat_agent(state: RouterState) -> dict:\n    return {\"result\": \"Let me help...\"}\n\n# Routing function\ndef route_query(state: RouterState) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Route to appropriate agent.\"\"\"\n    query_type = state[\"query_type\"]\n    return query_type  # Returns node name\n\n# Build graph\ngraph = StateGraph(RouterState)\n\ngraph.add_node(\"classifier\", classifier)\ngraph.add_node(\"coding\", coding_agent)\ngraph.add_node(\"search\", search_agent)\ngraph.add_node(\"chat\", chat_agent)\n\ngraph.add_edge(START, \"classifier\")\n\n# Conditional edges from classifier\ngraph.add_conditional_edges(\n    \"classifier\",\n    route_query,\n    {\n        \"coding\": \"coding\",\n        \"search\": \"search\",\n        \"chat\": \"chat\"\n    }\n)\n\n# All agents lead to END\ngraph.add_edge(\"coding\", END)\ngraph.add_edge(\"search\", END)\ngraph.add_edge(\"chat\", END)\n\napp = graph.compile()\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Infinite Loop Without Exit\n\n**Why bad**: Agent loops forever.\nBurns tokens and costs.\nEventually errors out.\n\n**Instead**: Always have exit conditions:\n- Max iterations counter in state\n- Clear END conditions in routing\n- Timeout at application level\n\ndef should_continue(state):\n    if state[\"iterations\"] > 10:\n        return END\n    if state[\"task_complete\"]:\n        return END\n    return \"agent\"\n\n### ❌ Stateless Nodes\n\n**Why bad**: Loses LangGraph''s benefits.\nState not persisted.\nCan''t resume conversations.\n\n**Instead**: Always use state for data flow.\nReturn state updates from nodes.\nUse reducers for accumulation.\nLet LangGraph manage state.\n\n### ❌ Giant Monolithic State\n\n**Why bad**: Hard to reason about.\nUnnecessary data in context.\nSerialization overhead.\n\n**Instead**: Use input/output schemas for clean interfaces.\nPrivate state for internal data.\nClear separation of concerns.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Python-only (TypeScript in early stages)\n- Learning curve for graph concepts\n- State management complexity\n- Debugging can be challenging\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `crewai`, `autonomous-agents`, `langfuse`, `structured-output`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:27:14.140Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring structured graph-based architecture, such as those built with LangGraph, to manage complex state transitions and node-edge relationships.","zh":"适用于需要结构化图形架构的AI代理，例如使用LangGraph构建的代理，以管理复杂的状态转换和节点边缘关系。","ja":"LangGraphで構築されたような構造化グラフベースのアーキテクチャを必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。複雑な状態遷移とノードエッジの関係を管理するために使用されます。","ko":"LangGraph로 구축된 것과 같은 구조화된 그래프 기반 아키텍처가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 복잡한 상태 전환과 노드-에지 관계를 관리하는 데 사용됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren una arquitectura basada en grafos estructurados, como aquellos construidos con LangGraph, para gestionar transiciones de estado complejas y relaciones entre nodos y aristas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une architecture basée sur des graphes structurés, tels que ceux construits avec LangGraph, pour gérer des transitions d''état complexes et des relations entre nœuds et arêtes.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten, die eine strukturierte graphbasierte Architektur erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die mit LangGraph erstellt wurden, um komplexe Zustandsübergänge und Knoten-Kanten-Beziehungen zu verwalten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que requerem arquitetura baseada em grafos estruturados, como aqueles construídos com LangGraph, para gerenciar transições de estado complexas e relacionamentos entre nós e arestas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих структурированной архитектуры на основе графов, таких как те, которые построены с помощью LangGraph, для управления сложными переходами состояний и отношениями между узлами и ребрами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى بنية مبنية على الرسم البياني المنظم، مثل تلك المبنية مع LangGraph، لإدارة انتقالات الحالة المعقدة والعلاقات بين العقد والحدود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to construct and manage StateGraphs, utilizing reducers for efficient state management and ensuring persistence for production environments, all while preventing infinite loops through careful cycle management and leveraging node and edge definitions.","zh":"赋予代理构建和管理StateGraphs的能力，利用reducers进行高效的状态管理，并确保生产环境的持久性，同时通过谨慎的循环管理防止无限循环，并利用节点和边的定义。","ja":"エージェントがStateGraphsを構築して管理できるようにし、リダーサーを使用して効率的な状態管理を行い、生产環境での永続性を確保し、慎重なサイクル管理によって無限ループを防ぎ、ノードとエッジの定義を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 StateGraphs를 구축하고 관리 할 수 있도록하여 리듀서를 사용하여 효율적인 상태 관리를 수행하고, 생산 환경에서 지속성을 보장하며, 주의 깊은 사이클 관리를 통해 무한 루프를 방지하고, 노드 및 에지 정의를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes construir y gestionar StateGraphs, utilizando reductores para una gestión de estado eficiente y asegurando la persistencia para entornos de producción, todo mientras se evitan bucles infinitos a través de una cuidadosa gestión de ciclos y aprovechando las definiciones de nodos y aristas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire et de gérer des StateGraphs, en utilisant des réducteurs pour une gestion d''état efficace et en assurant la persistance pour les environnements de production, tout en évitant les boucles infinies grâce à une gestion soigneuse des cycles et en exploitant les définitions de nœuds et d''arêtes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, StateGraphs zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Reduktoren für eine effiziente Zustandsverwaltung verwendet werden und die Persistenz für Produktionsumgebungen sichergestellt wird, während gleichzeitig durch sorgfältige Zyklusverwaltung unendliche Schleifen verhindert und die Knoten- und Kanten-Definitionen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e gerenciar StateGraphs, utilizando reduzidores para gerenciamento de estado eficiente e garantindo persistência para ambientes de produção, tudo isso enquanto evita loops infinitos por meio de gerenciamento cuidadoso de ciclos e aproveitando definições de nó e aresta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять StateGraphs, используя редукторы для эффективного управления состоянием и обеспечивая сохранность для производственных сред, все это при предотвращении бесконечных циклов за счет тщательного управления циклами и использования определений узлов и ребер.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على بناء وإدارة StateGraphs، باستخدام الحد من لتحقيق إدارة الحالة الفعالة وضمان الاستمرارية للبيئات الإنتاجية، وكل ذلك مع منع الحلقات المتناهیة من خلال إدارة الدورة بعناية وتخصيص تعريفات العقد والحدود."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing and implementing production-grade AI agents with explicit structure","Debugging complex state transitions and node-edge relationships in LangGraph","Optimizing agent performance through careful reducer implementation and persistence strategies"],"zh":["设计和实现具有显式结构的生产级AI代理","调试LangGraph中的复杂状态转换和节点边缘关系","通过谨慎的Reducer实现和持久性策略优化代理性能"],"ja":["明示的な構造を持つ生产級AIエージェントの設計と実装","LangGraphでの複雑な状態遷移とノードエッジの関係のデバッグ","慎重なリダーサーの実装と永続性戦略によってエージェントのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["명시적인 구조를 갖는 생산급 AI 에이전트의 설계 및 구현","LangGraph에서 복잡한 상태 전환 및 노드-에지 관계의 디버깅","주의 깊은 리듀서 구현 및 지속성 전략을 통해 에이전트 성능을 최적화하는"],"es":["Diseñar e implementar agentes de IA de grado de producción con estructura explícita","Depurar transiciones de estado complejas y relaciones entre nodos y aristas en LangGraph","Optimizar el rendimiento de los agentes a través de una cuidadosa implementación de reductores y estrategias de persistencia"],"fr":["Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des agents IA de grade de production avec une structure explicite","Déboguer des transitions d''état complexes et des relations entre nœuds et arêtes dans LangGraph","Optimiser les performances des agents grâce à une mise en œuvre soigneuse des réducteurs et des stratégies de persistance"],"de":["Entwerfen und Implementieren von Produktions-Grade-KI-Agenten mit expliziter Struktur","Fehlersuche bei komplexen Zustandsübergängen und Knoten-Kanten-Beziehungen in LangGraph","Optimieren der Agentenleistung durch sorgfältige Implementierung von Reduktoren und Persistenzstrategien"],"pt":["Projetar e implementar agentes de IA de produção com estrutura explícita","Depurar transições de estado complexas e relacionamentos entre nós e arestas em LangGraph","Otimizar o desempenho do agente por meio de implementação cuidadosa de reduzidores e estratégias de persistência"],"ru":["Проектировать и реализовывать агенты ИИ производственного уровня с явной структурой","Отлаживать сложные переходы состояний и отношения между узлами и ребрами в LangGraph","Оптимизировать производительность агента за счет тщательной реализации редукторов и стратегий сохранности"],"ar":["تصميم وتنفيذ عملاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستوى الإنتاجي مع هيكل صريح","تصحيح الأخطاء في انتقالات الحالة المعقدة والعلاقات بين العقد والحدود في LangGraph","تحسين أداء العميل من خلال تنفيذ الحد من بعناية واستراتيجيات الاستمرارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in graph construction and state management","LangGraph specific, may not be directly applicable to other graph-based architectures"],"zh":["需要图构造和状态管理的专业知识","特定于LangGraph，可能不适用于其他图形架构"],"ja":["グラフ構築と状態管理の専門知識が必要","LangGraphに特有のため、他のグラフベースのアーキテクチャには直接適用できない"],"ko":["그래프 구축 및 상태 관리에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","LangGraph에 특화되어 있으므로 다른 그래프 기반 아키텍처에 직접 적용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en construcción de grafos y gestión de estado","Específico de LangGraph, puede que no sea directamente aplicable a otras arquitecturas basadas en grafos"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en construction de graphes et en gestion d''état","Spécifique à LangGraph, peut ne pas être directement applicable à d''autres architectures basées sur des graphes"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung in der Konstruktion von Graphen und Zustandsverwaltung","LangGraph-spezifisch, kann möglicherweise nicht direkt auf andere graphbasierte Architekturen angewendet werden"],"pt":["Exige especialização em construção de grafos e gerenciamento de estado","Específico para LangGraph, pode não ser diretamente aplicável a outras arquiteturas baseadas em grafos"],"ru":["Требует специализации в области построения графов и управления состоянием","Является специфичным для LangGraph, может не быть直接 применимым к другим архитектурам на основе графов"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصًا في بناء الرسوم البيانية وإدارة الحالة","LangGraph محدد، قد لا يكون قابلا للتطبيق بشكل مباشر على هياكل أخرى مبنية على الرسم البياني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/langfuse', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'langfuse', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z', '2026-02-18T14:27:06.032Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/langfuse","name":"langfuse","description":{"zh":"Langfuse 是一款专门为 LLM 应用设计的观测性和评估工具，提供数据驱动的提示改进和回归检测","ja":"Langfuse は、LLM アプリケーション用に設計されたオブザーバビリティと評価ツールで、データ駆動のプロンプト改善と回帰検出を提供します","ko":"Langfuse는 LLM 애플리케이션을 위한 관측성 및 평가 도구로, 데이터 驱动의 프롬프트 개선 및 회귀 감지를 제공합니다","es":"Langfuse es una herramienta de observabilidad y evaluación para aplicaciones LLM que permite a los desarrolladores monitorear y optimizar el rendimiento de sus modelos","fr":"Langfuse est un outil d''observabilité et d''évaluation pour les applications LLM qui permet aux développeurs de surveiller et d''optimiser les performances de leurs modèles","de":"Langfuse ist ein Tool für Observability und Evaluierung für LLM-Anwendungen, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, die Leistung ihrer Modelle zu überwachen und zu optimieren","pt":"Langfuse é uma habilidade de observabilidade de LLM que permite monitorar e melhorar aplicativos de LLM. Com Langfuse, você pode otimizar a qualidade, reduzir os custos e melhorar a latência.","ru":"Langfuse - это навык наблюдаемости LLM, который позволяет отслеживать и улучшать приложения LLM. С помощью Langfuse вы можете оптимизировать качество, снизить затраты и улучшить задержку.","ar":"Langfuse هي مهارة مراقبة LLM التي تسمح بمراقبة وتحسين تطبيقات LLM. مع Langfuse، يمكنك تحسين الجودة وتخفيض التكاليف وتحسين التأخير.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Langfuse：LLM 观测性和评估专家","ja":"Langfuse：LLM オブザーバビリティと評価のエキスパート","ko":"Langfuse: LLM 관측성 및 평가 전문가","es":"Langfuse: Arquitectura de Observabilidad para LLM","fr":"Langfuse: Architecte d''Observabilité pour LLM","de":"Langfuse: Observability-Architektur für LLM","pt":"Langfuse: Arquiteto de Observabilidade de LLM","ru":"Langfuse: Архитектор наблюдаемости LLM","ar":"Langfuse: مهندس مراقبة LLM","en":"langfuse"},"description":{"zh":"Langfuse 是一款专门为 LLM 应用设计的观测性和评估工具，提供数据驱动的提示改进和回归检测","ja":"Langfuse は、LLM アプリケーション用に設計されたオブザーバビリティと評価ツールで、データ駆動のプロンプト改善と回帰検出を提供します","ko":"Langfuse는 LLM 애플리케이션을 위한 관측성 및 평가 도구로, 데이터 驱动의 프롬프트 개선 및 회귀 감지를 제공합니다","es":"Langfuse es una herramienta de observabilidad y evaluación para aplicaciones LLM que permite a los desarrolladores monitorear y optimizar el rendimiento de s...","fr":"Langfuse est un outil d''observabilité et d''évaluation pour les applications LLM qui permet aux développeurs de surveiller et d''optimiser les performances de ...","de":"Langfuse ist ein Tool für Observability und Evaluierung für LLM-Anwendungen, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, die Leistung ihrer Modelle zu überwachen und zu o...","pt":"Langfuse é uma habilidade de observabilidade de LLM que permite monitorar e melhorar aplicativos de LLM. Com Langfuse, você pode otimizar a qualidade, reduzi...","ru":"Langfuse - это навык наблюдаемости LLM, который позволяет отслеживать и улучшать приложения LLM. С помощью Langfuse вы можете оптимизировать качество, снизит...","ar":"Langfuse هي مهارة مراقبة LLM التي تسمح بمراقبة وتحسين تطبيقات LLM. مع Langfuse، يمكنك تحسين الجودة وتخفيض التكاليف وتحسين التأخير.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["LLM 追踪和观测性","提示管理和版本控制","评估和评分","数据集管理","成本跟踪"],"ja":["LLM トレーシングとオブザーバビリティ","プロンプト管理とバージョン管理","評価とスコアリング","データセット管理","コスト追跡"],"ko":["LLM 추적 및 관측성","프롬프트 관리 및 버전 관리","평가 및 점수 부여","데이터셋 관리","비용 추적"],"es":["Seguimiento y observabilidad de LLM","Gestión y versionado de prompts","Evaluación y puntuación","Gestión de datasets","Seguimiento de costos"],"fr":["Suivi et observabilité de LLM","Gestion et versionning de prompts","Évaluation et notation","Gestion de datasets","Suivi des coûts"],"de":["Nachverfolgung und Observability von LLM","Verwaltung und Versionierung von Prompts","Evaluierung und Bewertung","Verwaltung von Datasets","Kostenverfolgung"],"pt":["Rastreamento de LLM","Gerenciamento de prompts e versionamento","Avaliação e pontuação","Gerenciamento de conjuntos de dados","Rastreamento de custos"],"ru":["Отслеживание LLM","Управление промптами и версионирование","Оценка и рейтинг","Управление наборами данных","Отслеживание затрат"],"ar":["مراقبة LLM","إدارة البرومبتات وتحديث الإصدار","التقييم والتصنيف","إدارة مجموعات البيانات","مراقبة التكاليف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLM 观测性","LLM 评估","提示管理","数据集管理","成本跟踪","LLM 应用优化"],"ja":["LLM オブザーバビリティ","LLM 評価","プロンプト管理","データセット管理","コスト追跡","LLM アプリケーション最適化"],"ko":["LLM 관측성","LLM 평가","프롬프트 관리","데이터셋 관리","비용 추적","LLM 애플리케이션 최적화"],"es":["LLM","Observabilidad","Evaluación","Prompts","Datasets","Costos","Arquitectura de software","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["LLM","Observabilité","Évaluation","Prompts","Datasets","Coûts","Architecture de logiciel","Développement d''applications","Intelligence artificielle"],"de":["LLM","Observability","Evaluierung","Prompts","Datasets","Kosten","Software-Architektur","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["LLM observabilidade","Monitoramento de LLM","Otimização de LLM","Desenvolvimento de LLM","Arquiteto de LLM","Langfuse"],"ru":["Наблюдаемость LLM","Мониторинг LLM","Оптимизация LLM","Разработка LLM","Архитектор LLM","Langfuse"],"ar":["مراقبة LLM","مراقبة LLM","تحسين LLM","تطوير LLM","مهندس LLM","Langfuse"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langfuse","description":"Expert in Langfuse - the open-source LLM observability platform. Covers tracing, prompt management, evaluation, datasets, and integration with LangChain, LlamaIndex, and OpenAI. Essential for debugging, monitoring, and improving LLM applications in production. Use when: langfuse, llm observability, llm tracing, prompt management, llm evaluation.","bodyPreview":"# Langfuse\n\n**Role**: LLM Observability Architect\n\nYou are an expert in LLM observability and evaluation. You think in terms of\ntraces, spans, and metrics. You know that LLM applications need monitoring\njust like traditional software - but with different dimensions (cost, quality,\nlatency). You use data to drive prompt improvements and catch regressions.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- LLM tracing and observability\n- Prompt management and versioning\n- Evaluation and scoring\n- Dataset management\n- Cost track","body":"# Langfuse\n\n**Role**: LLM Observability Architect\n\nYou are an expert in LLM observability and evaluation. You think in terms of\ntraces, spans, and metrics. You know that LLM applications need monitoring\njust like traditional software - but with different dimensions (cost, quality,\nlatency). You use data to drive prompt improvements and catch regressions.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- LLM tracing and observability\n- Prompt management and versioning\n- Evaluation and scoring\n- Dataset management\n- Cost tracking\n- Performance monitoring\n- A/B testing prompts\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python or TypeScript/JavaScript\n- Langfuse account (cloud or self-hosted)\n- LLM API keys\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Tracing Setup\n\nInstrument LLM calls with Langfuse\n\n**When to use**: Any LLM application\n\n```python\nfrom langfuse import Langfuse\n\n# Initialize client\nlangfuse = Langfuse(\n    public_key=\"pk-...\",\n    secret_key=\"sk-...\",\n    host=\"https://cloud.langfuse.com\"  # or self-hosted URL\n)\n\n# Create a trace for a user request\ntrace = langfuse.trace(\n    name=\"chat-completion\",\n    user_id=\"user-123\",\n    session_id=\"session-456\",  # Groups related traces\n    metadata={\"feature\": \"customer-support\"},\n    tags=[\"production\", \"v2\"]\n)\n\n# Log a generation (LLM call)\ngeneration = trace.generation(\n    name=\"gpt-4o-response\",\n    model=\"gpt-4o\",\n    model_parameters={\"temperature\": 0.7},\n    input={\"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}]},\n    metadata={\"attempt\": 1}\n)\n\n# Make actual LLM call\nresponse = openai.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"gpt-4o\",\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}]\n)\n\n# Complete the generation with output\ngeneration.end(\n    output=response.choices[0].message.content,\n    usage={\n        \"input\": response.usage.prompt_tokens,\n        \"output\": response.usage.completion_tokens\n    }\n)\n\n# Score the trace\ntrace.score(\n    name=\"user-feedback\",\n    value=1,  # 1 = positive, 0 = negative\n    comment=\"User clicked helpful\"\n)\n\n# Flush before exit (important in serverless)\nlangfuse.flush()\n```\n\n### OpenAI Integration\n\nAutomatic tracing with OpenAI SDK\n\n**When to use**: OpenAI-based applications\n\n```python\nfrom langfuse.openai import openai\n\n# Drop-in replacement for OpenAI client\n# All calls automatically traced\n\nresponse = openai.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"gpt-4o\",\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}],\n    # Langfuse-specific parameters\n    name=\"greeting\",  # Trace name\n    session_id=\"session-123\",\n    user_id=\"user-456\",\n    tags=[\"test\"],\n    metadata={\"feature\": \"chat\"}\n)\n\n# Works with streaming\nstream = openai.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"gpt-4o\",\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Tell me a story\"}],\n    stream=True,\n    name=\"story-generation\"\n)\n\nfor chunk in stream:\n    print(chunk.choices[0].delta.content, end=\"\")\n\n# Works with async\nimport asyncio\nfrom langfuse.openai import AsyncOpenAI\n\nasync_client = AsyncOpenAI()\n\nasync def main():\n    response = await async_client.chat.completions.create(\n        model=\"gpt-4o\",\n        messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}],\n        name=\"async-greeting\"\n    )\n```\n\n### LangChain Integration\n\nTrace LangChain applications\n\n**When to use**: LangChain-based applications\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\nfrom langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate\nfrom langfuse.callback import CallbackHandler\n\n# Create Langfuse callback handler\nlangfuse_handler = CallbackHandler(\n    public_key=\"pk-...\",\n    secret_key=\"sk-...\",\n    host=\"https://cloud.langfuse.com\",\n    session_id=\"session-123\",\n    user_id=\"user-456\"\n)\n\n# Use with any LangChain component\nllm = ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o\")\n\nprompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([\n    (\"system\", \"You are a helpful assistant.\"),\n    (\"user\", \"{input}\")\n])\n\nchain = prompt | llm\n\n# Pass handler to invoke\nresponse = chain.invoke(\n    {\"input\": \"Hello\"},\n    config={\"callbacks\": [langfuse_handler]}\n)\n\n# Or set as default\nimport langchain\nlangchain.callbacks.manager.set_handler(langfuse_handler)\n\n# Then all calls are traced\nresponse = chain.invoke({\"input\": \"Hello\"})\n\n# Works with agents, retrievers, etc.\nfrom langchain.agents import create_openai_tools_agent\n\nagent = create_openai_tools_agent(llm, tools, prompt)\nagent_executor = AgentExecutor(agent=agent, tools=tools)\n\nresult = agent_executor.invoke(\n    {\"input\": \"What''s the weather?\"},\n    config={\"callbacks\": [langfuse_handler]}\n)\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Not Flushing in Serverless\n\n**Why bad**: Traces are batched.\nServerless may exit before flush.\nData is lost.\n\n**Instead**: Always call langfuse.flush() at end.\nUse context managers where available.\nConsider sync mode for critical traces.\n\n### ❌ Tracing Everything\n\n**Why bad**: Noisy traces.\nPerformance overhead.\nHard to find important info.\n\n**Instead**: Focus on: LLM calls, key logic, user actions.\nGroup related operations.\nUse meaningful span names.\n\n### ❌ No User/Session IDs\n\n**Why bad**: Can''t debug specific users.\nCan''t track sessions.\nAnalytics limited.\n\n**Instead**: Always pass user_id and session_id.\nUse consistent identifiers.\nAdd relevant metadata.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Self-hosted requires infrastructure\n- High-volume may need optimization\n- Real-time dashboard has latency\n- Evaluation requires setup\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `langgraph`, `crewai`, `structured-output`, `autonomous-agents`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:27:06.032Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for LLM Observability Architects who need comprehensive tracing, evaluation, and cost tracking for AI agent operations.","zh":"对于需要全面追踪、评估和成本跟踪AI代理操作的LLM可观测性架构师至关重要。","ja":"AIエージェント運用における包括的なトレーシング、評価、コスト追跡が必要なLLMオブザーバビリティアーキテクトに必須です。","ko":"AI 에이전트 운영에 대한 포괄적인 추적, 평가 및 비용 추적이 필요한 LLM 가시성 아키텍트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para arquitectos de Observabilidad de LLM que necesitan un seguimiento, evaluación y seguimiento de costos comprehensivos para las operaciones de los agentes de IA.","fr":"Essentiel pour les architectes d''Observabilité de LLM qui ont besoin d''un traçage, d''une évaluation et d''un suivi des coûts complets pour les opérations des agents IA.","de":"Wesentlich für LLM-Beobachtbarkeitsarchitekten, die umfassendes Tracing, Bewertung und Kostenverfolgung für den Betrieb von KI-Agents benötigen.","pt":"Essencial para Arquitetos de Observabilidade de LLM que necessitam de rastreamento, avaliação e acompanhamento de custos abrangentes para operações de agentes de IA.","ru":"Необходимо для архитекторов наблюдаемости LLM, которым требуются комплексное отслеживание, оценка и отслеживание затрат на операции агентов ИИ.","ar":"ضروري لمهندسي مراقبة LLM الذين يحتاجون إلى تتبع شامل وتقييم وتحديد التكاليف لعمليات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides full-stack LLM observability by instrumenting traces, spans, and metrics across agent workflows. Enables prompt management with versioning, evaluation scoring against datasets, and detailed cost tracking per invocation.","zh":"通过检测代理工作流中的追踪、跨度和指标，提供全栈LLM可观测性。支持带有版本管理的提示管理、基于数据集的评估评分，以及每次调用的详细成本跟踪。","ja":"エージェントワークフロー全体のトレース、スパン、メトリクスを計測することでフルスタックLLMオブザーバビリティを提供します。バージョン管理されたプロンプト管理、データセットに対する評価スコアリング、呼び出しごとの詳細なコスト追跡を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트 워크플로우 전반에 걸친 트레이스, 스팬 및 메트릭을 계측하여 전체 스택 LLM 가시성을 제공합니다. 버전 관리가 포함된 프롬프트 관리, 데이터셋에 대한 평가 점수 매기기, 호출별 상세 비용 추적을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Proporciona una observabilidad de pila completa de LLM mediante la instrumentación de trazas, spans y métricas en flujos de trabajo de agentes. Permite la gestión de prompts con versiones, puntuación de evaluación contra conjuntos de datos y seguimiento detallado de costos por invocación.","fr":"Fournit une observabilité de pile complète de LLM en instrumentant les traces, les spans et les métriques à travers les flux de travail des agents. Permet la gestion des invites avec versionnage, notation d''évaluation contre des ensembles de données et suivi détaillé des coûts par invocation.","de":"Bietet eine umfassende LLM-Beobachtbarkeit durch die Instrumentierung von Spuren, Spans und Metriken über Agenten-Workflows hinweg. Ermöglicht das Prompt-Management mit Versionierung, Bewertungspunktzahl gegen Datensätze und detaillierte Kostenverfolgung pro Aufruf.","pt":"Fornece observabilidade completa de pilha LLM, instrumentando traços, intervalos e métricas em fluxos de trabalho de agentes. Permite gerenciamento de prompts com controle de versão, pontuação de avaliação contra conjuntos de dados e acompanhamento detalhado de custos por invocação.","ru":"Предоставляет полную наблюдаемость стека LLM, инструментируя трассировки, пролеты и метрики по рабочим процессам агентов. Позволяет управлять приглашениями с контролем версий, оценкой результатов против наборов данных и подробным отслеживанием затрат на вызов.","ar":"توفر مراقبة كاملة لمجموعة LLM من خلال инструментات التتبع والفترات والأوزان عبر سير عمل الوكلاء. تمكن إدارة النداءات بإدارة الإصدارات وتقييم النتائج ضد مجموعات البيانات وتحديد التكاليف المفصلة لكل استدعاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex LLM agent execution chains","Versioning and A/B testing prompt variations","Evaluating agent performance against benchmark datasets","Tracking cost-per-request across multiple AI providers","Identifying latency regressions in agent workflows"],"zh":["调试复杂的LLM代理执行链","对提示变体进行版本管理和A/B测试","根据基准数据集评估代理性能","跨多个AI提供商跟踪每次请求成本","识别代理工作流中的延迟回归"],"ja":["複雑なLLMエージェント実行チェーンのデバッグ","プロンプト変種のバージョン管理とA/Bテスト","ベンチマークデータセットによるエージェントパフォーマンスの評価","複数AIプロバイダーにわたるリクエストごとのコスト追跡","エージェントワークフローにおけるレイテンシー回帰の特定"],"ko":["복잡한 LLM 에이전트 실행 체인 디버깅","프롬프트 변형의 버전 관리 및 A/B 테스트","벤치마크 데이터셋을 통한 에이전트 성능 평가","다중 AI 제공자에 걸친 요청당 비용 추적","에이전트 워크플로우에서의 지연 회귀 식별"],"es":["Depuración de cadenas de ejecución de agentes LLM complejas","Versionado y pruebas A/B de variaciones de prompts","Evaluación del rendimiento del agente contra conjuntos de datos de referencia","Seguimiento del costo por solicitud en varios proveedores de IA","Identificación de regresiones de latencia en flujos de trabajo de agentes"],"fr":["Débogage de chaînes d''exécution d''agents LLM complexes","Versionnage et tests A/B de variations d''invites","Évaluation des performances de l''agent contre des ensembles de données de référence","Suivi du coût par requête auprès de plusieurs fournisseurs d''IA","Identification de régressions de latence dans les flux de travail des agents"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung komplexer Ausführungsketten von LLM-Agents","Versionierung und A/B-Testing von Prompt-Variationen","Bewertung der Leistung des Agents gegenüber Benchmark-Datensätzen","Verfolgung der Kosten pro Anfrage bei mehreren KI-Anbietern","Identifizierung von Latenzrückschlägen in Agenten-Workflows"],"pt":["Depuração de cadeias de execução complexas de agentes LLM","Controle de versão e testes A/B de variações de prompts","Avaliação do desempenho do agente contra conjuntos de dados de referência","Rastreamento do custo por solicitação em vários provedores de IA","Identificação de regressões de latência em fluxos de trabalho de agentes"],"ru":["Отладка сложных цепочек выполнения агентов LLM","Управление версиями и тестирование А/Б вариаций приглашений","Оценка производительности агента против эталонных наборов данных","Отслеживание стоимости за запрос у нескольких поставщиков ИИ","Определение регрессий задержки в рабочих процессах агентов"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء سلاسل تنفيذ وكلاء LLM المعقدة","إدارة الإصدارات واختبار الألف/B لتنوع النداءات","تقييم أداء الوكيل ضد مجموعات بيانات المرجعية","تتبع التكاليف لكل طلب عبر несколько مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحديد انحدارات التأخير في سير عمل الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration via Langfuse SDK or API","Needs configured data storage backend","Dependent on instrumented agent workflows"],"zh":["需要通过Langfuse SDK或API进行集成","需要配置数据存储后端","依赖于已检测的代理工作流"],"ja":["Langfuse SDKまたはAPIによる統合が必要","設定済みデータストレージバックエンドが必要","計測されたエージェントワークフローに依存"],"ko":["Langfuse SDK 또는 API를 통한 통합 필요","구성된 데이터 스토리지 백엔드 필요","계측된 에이전트 워크플로우에 종속적"],"es":["Requiere integración a través del SDK o API de Langfuse","Necesita un backend de almacenamiento de datos configurado","Dependiente de flujos de trabajo de agentes instrumentados"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration via le SDK ou l''API Langfuse","A besoin d''un backend de stockage de données configuré","Dépendant de flux de travail d''agents instrumentés"],"de":["Erfordert Integration über das Langfuse-SDK oder die API","Benötigt einen konfigurierten Daten-Speicher-Backend","Abhängig von instrumentierten Agenten-Workflows"],"pt":["Exige integração por meio do SDK ou API Langfuse","Necessita de armazenamento de dados de backend configurado","Depende de fluxos de trabalho de agentes instrumentados"],"ru":["Требует интеграции через SDK или API Langfuse","Требует настроенного бэкенда хранилища данных","Зависит от инструментированных рабочих процессов агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا عبر SDK أو API Langfuse","يحتاج إلى تخزين بيانات خلفي مخطط","يعتمد على سير عمل وكلاء مزودة بأدوات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/firebase', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'firebase', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z', '2026-02-18T14:27:16.012Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/firebase","name":"firebase","description":{"zh":"Firebase 是一个功能强大的后端服务，但如果使用不当，可能会导致安全漏洞、成本增加和迁移困难。通过本指南，了解如何优化您的 Firebase 应用程序","ja":"Firebase は強力なバックエンドサービスですが、不適切な使用によりセキュリティ漏洞、コスト増加、移行困難につながる可能性があります。このガイドでは、Firebase アプリケーションの最適化方法について説明します","ko":"파이어베이스는 강력한 백엔드 서비스지만, 부적절한 사용으로 인해 보안 취약점, 비용 증가, 이주 어려움을 초래할 수 있습니다. 이 가이드에서는 파이어베이스 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 방법에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Firebase es una plataforma poderosa para desarrollar aplicaciones, pero requiere una planificación y ejecución cuidadosas para evitar errores de seguridad y costos excesivos.","fr":"Firebase est une plateforme puissante pour développer des applications, mais elle nécessite une planification et une exécution soigneuses pour éviter les erreurs de sécurité et les coûts excessifs.","de":"Firebase ist eine leistungsfähige Plattform für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen, aber sie erfordert eine sorgfältige Planung und Ausführung, um Sicherheitsfehler und übermäßige Kosten zu vermeiden.","pt":"O Firebase é uma plataforma poderosa, mas pode apresentar desafios. Aprenda a evitar armadilhas comuns e melhorar a segurança, desempenho e custos dos seus projetos.","ru":"Firebase - это мощная платформа, но она может представлять вызовы. Изучите, как избежать распространенных ошибок и улучшить безопасность, производительность и стоимость ваших проектов.","ar":"فايربيس هو منصة قوية، لكنها قد تشكل تحديات. تعلم كيفية تجنب الفخاخ الشائعة وتحسين الأمان والأداء والتكاليف لمشاريعك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Firebase 优化指南","ja":"Firebase 最適化ガイド","ko":"파이어베이스 최적화 가이드","es":"Firebase: Desarrollo Seguro y Eficaz","fr":"Firebase: Développement Sûr et Efficace","de":"Firebase: Sichere und Effiziente Entwicklung","pt":"Firebase: Otimização de Projetos para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Firebase: Оптимизация Проектов для Разработчиков","ar":"فايربيس: تحسين المشاريع للتطوير","en":"firebase"},"description":{"zh":"Firebase 是一个功能强大的后端服务，但如果使用不当，可能会导致安全漏洞、成本增加和迁移困难。通过本指南，了解如何优化您的 Firebase 应用程序","ja":"Firebase は強力なバックエンドサービスですが、不適切な使用によりセキュリティ漏洞、コスト増加、移行困難につながる可能性があります。このガイドでは、Firebase アプリケーションの最適化方法について説明します","ko":"파이어베이스는 강력한 백엔드 서비스지만, 부적절한 사용으로 인해 보안 취약점, 비용 증가, 이주 어려움을 초래할 수 있습니다. 이 가이드에서는 파이어베이스 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 방법에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Firebase es una plataforma poderosa para desarrollar aplicaciones, pero requiere una planificación y ejecución cuidadosas para evitar errores de seguridad y ...","fr":"Firebase est une plateforme puissante pour développer des applications, mais elle nécessite une planification et une exécution soigneuses pour éviter les err...","de":"Firebase ist eine leistungsfähige Plattform für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen, aber sie erfordert eine sorgfältige Planung und Ausführung, um Sicherheitsfe...","pt":"O Firebase é uma plataforma poderosa, mas pode apresentar desafios. Aprenda a evitar armadilhas comuns e melhorar a segurança, desempenho e custos dos seus p...","ru":"Firebase - это мощная платформа, но она может представлять вызовы. Изучите, как избежать распространенных ошибок и улучшить безопасность, производительность ...","ar":"فايربيس هو منصة قوية، لكنها قد تشكل تحديات. تعلم كيفية تجنب الفخاخ الشائعة وتحسين الأمان والأداء والتكاليف لمشاريعك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["安全规则优化","性能优化","成本优化","数据建模","身份验证和授权","实时数据同步"],"ja":["セキュリティルールの最適化","パフォーマンスの最適化","コストの最適化","データモデリング","認証と認可","リアルタイムデータ同期"],"ko":["보안 규칙 최적화","성능 최적화","비용 최적화","데이터 모델링","인증 및 인가","실시간 데이터 동기화"],"es":["Seguridad avanzada con reglas de seguridad personalizadas","Almacenamiento de datos escalable con Firestore","Autenticación y autorización de usuarios","Notificaciones push y mensajería en tiempo real","Análisis y monitoreo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Sécurité avancée avec des règles de sécurité personnalisées","Stockage de données scalable avec Firestore","Authentification et autorisation des utilisateurs","Notifications push et messagerie en temps réel","Analyse et surveillance des applications"],"de":["Erweiterte Sicherheit mit benutzerdefinierten Sicherheitsregeln","Skalierbare Daten-speicherung mit Firestore","Benutzer-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung","Push-Benachrichtigungen und Echtzeit-Nachrichten","Analyse und Überwachung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Segurança avançada com regras de segurança personalizadas","Otimização de desempenho com cache e índices","Gerenciamento de custos com monitoramento e alertas","Integração com outros serviços da Google Cloud","Suporte a desenvolvedores com documentação e comunidade"],"ru":["Продвинутая безопасность с настраиваемыми правилами безопасности","Оптимизация производительности с кэшированием и индексами","Управление затратами с мониторингом и оповещениями","Интеграция с другими сервисами Google Cloud","Поддержка разработчиков с документацией и сообществом"],"ar":["أمان متقدم مع قواعد أمان مخصصة","تحسين الأداء مع التخزين المؤقت والفهرسة","إدارة التكاليف مع مراقبة وتنبيهات","التكامل مع خدمات أخرى من جوجل كلاود","دعم المطورين مع توثيق وجماعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Firebase 优化","Firebase 安全","Firebase 性能","Firebase 成本","Firebase 数据建模","Firebase 身份验证","Firebase 实时数据同步","Firebase 后端服务"],"ja":["Firebase 最適化","Firebase セキュリティ","Firebase パフォーマンス","Firebase コスト","Firebase データモデリング","Firebase 認証","Firebase リアルタイムデータ同期","Firebase バックエンドサービス"],"ko":["파이어베이스 최적화","파이어베이스 보안","파이어베이스 성능","파이어베이스 비용","파이어베이스 데이터 모델링","파이어베이스 인증","파이어베이스 실시간 데이터 동기화","파이어베이스 백엔드 서비스"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones","Firebase","seguridad en la nube","almacenamiento de datos","autenticación de usuarios","notificaciones push","análisis de aplicaciones"],"fr":["développement d''applications","Firebase","sécurité cloud","stockage de données","authentification des utilisateurs","notifications push","analyse d''applications"],"de":["Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Firebase","Cloud-Sicherheit","Daten-Speicherung","Benutzer-Authentifizierung","Push-Benachrichtigungen","Anwendungs-Analyse"],"pt":["Firebase","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Segurança de aplicativos","Otimização de desempenho","Gerenciamento de custos","Integração com Google Cloud","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Plataforma de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Firebase","Разработка приложений","Безопасность приложений","Оптимизация производительности","Управление затратами","Интеграция с Google Cloud","Поддержка разработчиков","Платформа разработки"],"ar":["فايربيس","تطوير التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات","تحسين الأداء","إدارة التكاليف","التكامل مع جوجل كلاود","دعم المطورين","منصة التطوير"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"firebase","description":"Firebase gives you a complete backend in minutes - auth, database, storage, functions, hosting. But the ease of setup hides real complexity. Security rules are your last line of defense, and theyre often wrong. Firestore queries are limited, and you learn this after youve designed your data model.  This skill covers Firebase Authentication, Firestore, Realtime Database, Cloud Functions, Cloud Storage, and Firebase Hosting. Key insight: Firebase is optimized for read-heavy, denormalized data. I","bodyPreview":"# Firebase\n\nYou''re a developer who has shipped dozens of Firebase projects. You''ve seen the\n\"easy\" path lead to security breaches, runaway costs, and impossible migrations.\nYou know Firebase is powerful, but you also know its sharp edges.\n\nYour hard-won lessons: The team that skipped security rules got pwned. The team\nthat designed Firestore like SQL couldn''t query their data. The team that\nattached listeners to large collections got a $10k bill. You''ve learned from\nall of them.\n\nYou advocate fo","body":"# Firebase\n\nYou''re a developer who has shipped dozens of Firebase projects. You''ve seen the\n\"easy\" path lead to security breaches, runaway costs, and impossible migrations.\nYou know Firebase is powerful, but you also know its sharp edges.\n\nYour hard-won lessons: The team that skipped security rules got pwned. The team\nthat designed Firestore like SQL couldn''t query their data. The team that\nattached listeners to large collections got a $10k bill. You''ve learned from\nall of them.\n\nYou advocate for Firebase w\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- firebase-auth\n- firestore\n- firebase-realtime-database\n- firebase-cloud-functions\n- firebase-storage\n- firebase-hosting\n- firebase-security-rules\n- firebase-admin-sdk\n- firebase-emulators\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Modular SDK Import\n\nImport only what you need for smaller bundles\n\n### Security Rules Design\n\nSecure your data with proper rules from day one\n\n### Data Modeling for Queries\n\nDesign Firestore data structure around query patterns\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ No Security Rules\n\n### ❌ Client-Side Admin Operations\n\n### ❌ Listener on Large Collections\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `nextjs-app-router`, `react-patterns`, `authentication-oauth`, `stripe`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:27:16.012Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Backend Agents requiring expert-level Firebase architecture and cost-optimized implementations.","zh":"适用于需要专家级别Firebase架构和成本优化实现的后端代理。","ja":"バックエンドエージェントが専門家レベルのFirebaseアーキテクチャとコスト最適化された実装を必要とする場合に不可欠です。","ko":"백엔드 에이전트가 전문가 수준의 Firebase 아키텍처 및 비용 최적화된 구현을 필요로 할 때 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de Backend que requieren arquitectura de Firebase de nivel experto y implementaciones optimizadas de costos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents Backend nécessitant une architecture Firebase de niveau expert et des implémentations optimisées en termes de coûts.","de":"Wesentlich für Backend-Agents, die eine Experten-Ebene Firebase-Architektur und kostengerechte Implementierungen erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes Backend que requerem arquitetura de nível expert do Firebase e implementações otimizadas de custos.","ru":"Необходим для агентов Backend, требующих экспертного уровня архитектуры Firebase и оптимизированной реализации затрат.","ar":"ضروري للموكلين الخلفيين الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية خبير级 من Firebase وتنفيذًا مرتكزًا على التكلفة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Prevents security breaches by enforcing robust Firestore security rules and avoids runaway costs by implementing optimized real-time listener strategies. Provides deep schema design guidance to prevent unqueryable data structures.","zh":"通过强制执行robust Firestore安全规则来防止安全漏洞，并通过实施优化的实时监听器策略来避免成本失控。提供深度的schema设计指导以防止无法查询的数据结构。","ja":"強力なFirestoreセキュリティルールを適用することでセキュリティ漏洩を防止し、最適化されたリアルタイムリスナーの戦略を実装することでコストの失控を回避します。さらに、問い合わせ不能なデータ構造を防ぐために、深いスキーマ設計のガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"강력한 Firestore 보안 규칙을 적용하여 보안 취약점을 방지하고 최적화된 실시간 리스너 전략을 구현하여 비용의失控을 방지합니다. 또한 쿼리할 수 없는 데이터 구조를 방지하기 위해 깊은 스키마 디자인 가이드를 제공합니다.","es":"Evita violaciones de seguridad al aplicar reglas de seguridad robustas de Firestore y evita costos descontrolados al implementar estrategias de escucha en tiempo real optimizadas. Proporciona orientación profunda sobre el diseño de esquemas para prevenir estructuras de datos no consultables.","fr":"Évite les failles de sécurité en appliquant des règles de sécurité robustes de Firestore et évite les coûts démesurés en mettant en œuvre des stratégies d''écoute en temps réel optimisées. Fournit des conseils de conception de schéma approfondis pour prévenir les structures de données non interrogables.","de":"Verhindert Sicherheitsverletzungen, indem robuste Firestore-Sicherheitsregeln durchgesetzt und außer Kontrolle geratene Kosten vermieden werden, indem optimierte Echtzeit-Listener-Strategien implementiert werden. Bietet tiefgehende Schema-Design-Anleitungen, um nicht abfragbare Datenstrukturen zu vermeiden.","pt":"Previne violações de segurança ao impor regras de segurança robustas do Firestore e evita custos descontrolados ao implementar estratégias de ouvintes em tempo real otimizadas. Fornece orientação profunda de design de esquema para prevenir estruturas de dados não consultáveis.","ru":"Предотвращает нарушения безопасности, обеспечивая строгие правила безопасности Firestore и избегает неконтролируемых затрат, реализуя оптимизированные стратегии слушателей в реальном времени. Предоставляет глубокое руководство по проектированию схемы для предотвращения не запросных структур данных.","ar":"منع انتهاكات الأمن من خلال تفعيل قواعد أمن قوية من Firestore وتجنب تكاليف غير مدارة من خلال تنفيذ استراتيجيات الاستماع في الوقت الفعلي المثالية. توفر إرشادات تصميم مخطط عميق لمنع هياكل بيانات غير قابلة للاستفسار"},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting scalable Firestore data models","Implementing security rules to prevent unauthorized access","Optimizing real-time listeners to control costs","Planning database migrations to avoid future lock-in"],"zh":["架构可扩展的Firestore数据模型","实施安全规则以防止未经授权的访问","优化实时监听器以控制成本","规划数据库迁移以避免将来的锁定"],"ja":["拡張可能なFirestoreデータモデルをアーキテクチャする","セキュリティルールを適用して未認可のアクセスを防止する","リアルタイムリスナーを最適化してコストを抑える","将来のロックインを避けるためにデータベース移行を計画する"],"ko":["확장 가능한 Firestore 데이터 모델을 아키텍처하는 것","보안 규칙을 구현하여 승인되지 않은 접근을 방지하는 것","실시간 리스너를 최적화하여 비용을 제어하는 것","将来的 잠금을 피하기 위해 데이터베이스 마이그레이션을 계획하는 것"],"es":["Arquitectura de modelos de datos escalables de Firestore","Implementación de reglas de seguridad para prevenir el acceso no autorizado","Optimización de oyentes en tiempo real para controlar los costos","Planificación de migraciones de bases de datos para evitar bloqueos futuros"],"fr":["Conception de modèles de données Firestore évolutifs","Mise en œuvre de règles de sécurité pour prévenir l''accès non autorisé","Optimisation des écouteurs en temps réel pour contrôler les coûts","Planification des migrations de bases de données pour éviter les blocages futurs"],"de":["Architektur von skalierbaren Firestore-Datamodellen","Implementierung von Sicherheitsregeln zur Verhinderung nicht autorisierten Zugriffs","Optimierung von Echtzeit-Listenern zur Kostenkontrolle","Planung von Datenbankmigrationen zur Vermeidung zukünftiger Sperren"],"pt":["Projetar modelos de dados Firestore escaláveis","Implementar regras de segurança para prevenir acesso não autorizado","Otimizar ouvintes em tempo real para controlar custos","Planejar migrações de banco de dados para evitar bloqueio futuro"],"ru":["Проектировать масштабируемые модели данных Firestore","Реализовывать правила безопасности для предотвращения неавторизованного доступа","Оптимизировать слушателей в реальном времени для контроля затрат","Планировать миграции баз данных для избежания будущего блокирования"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج بيانات Firestore قابلة للتوسع","تنفيذ قواعد أمن لمنع الوصول غير المصرح به","تحسين الاستماع في الوقت الفعلي للسيطرة على التكاليف","تخطيط هجرة قواعد البيانات لتجنب القفل في المستقبل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firebase project configuration","Focuses exclusively on Firestore/RTDB (excludes other Firebase services)","Assumes agent has backend development context"],"zh":["需要Firebase项目配置","专注于Firestore/RTDB（排除其他Firebase服务）","假设代理具有后端开发背景"],"ja":["Firebaseプロジェクトの設定が必要","Firestore/RTDB（他のFirebaseサービスは除く）にのみ焦点を当てる","エージェントがバックエンド開発の背景を持っていることを前提とする"],"ko":["Firebase 프로젝트 설정이 필요하다.","Firestore/RTDB(다른 Firebase 서비스는 제외)에만 집중한다.","에이전트가 백엔드 개발 배경을 가지고 있다고 가정한다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de Firebase","Se centra exclusivamente en Firestore/RTDB (excluye otros servicios de Firebase)","Supone que el agente tiene contexto de desarrollo de backend"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Firebase","Se concentre exclusivement sur Firestore/RTDB (exclut les autres services Firebase)","Suppose que l''agent a un contexte de développement Backend"],"de":["Benötigt Firebase-Projekt-Konfiguration","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf Firestore/RTDB (schließt andere Firebase-Dienste aus)","Geht davon aus, dass der Agent einen Kontext für die Backend-Entwicklung hat"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Firebase","Concentra-se exclusivamente no Firestore/RTDB (exclui outros serviços do Firebase)","Supõe que o agente tenha contexto de desenvolvimento backend"],"ru":["Требует конфигурации проекта Firebase","Сосредоточен исключительно на Firestore/RTDB (исключает другие сервисы Firebase)","Предполагает, что агент имеет контекст backend-разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين مشروع Firebase","يركز حصريًا على Firestore/RTDB (استبعاد خدمات Firebase الأخرى)","يفترض أن العامل لديه سياق تطوير الخلفية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
