및 인박스 배치 최적화, 트랜잭션 이메일 큐 최적화","es":"Los sistemas de email son cruciales para la comunicación empresarial. Aprende a optimizar la entrega y evitar la carpeta de spam","fr":"Les systèmes d''email sont essentiels pour la communication d''entreprise. Découvrez comment optimiser la livraison et éviter le dossier spam","de":"E-Mail-Systeme sind wichtig für die Unternehmenskommunikation. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Zustellung optimieren und den Spam-Ordner vermeiden","pt":"Otimização de entrega de e-mails para desenvolvedores, incluindo SPF, DKIM, DMARC e muito mais","ru":"Оптимизация доставки электронной почты для разработчиков, включая SPF, DKIM, DMARC и многое другое","ar":"تحسين التسليم البريد الإلكتروني للمطورين، بما في ذلك SPF و DKIM و DMARC وغيرها","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["高达99.9%的可达性","交易性邮件队列优化","防止黑名单","SPF/DKIM/DMARC 调试","监控和重试逻辑"],"ja":["99.9%の配信率","トランザクションメールキューの最適化","ブラックリスト対策","SPF/DKIM/DMARC デバッグ","監視とリトライロジック"],"ko":["99.9%의 도달 가능성","트랜잭션 이메일 큐 최적화","블랙리스트 방지","SPF/DKIM/DMARC 디버깅","모니터링 및 재시도 로직"],"es":["Cola de correo electrónico transaccional con lógica de reintentos","Monitoreo y optimización de la entrega","Evitación de la carpeta de spam","Implementación de SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad"],"fr":["File d''attente de courriels transactionnels avec logique de réessais","Surveillance et optimisation de la livraison","Évitement du dossier spam","Mise en œuvre de SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Évolutivité et flexibilité"],"de":["Transaktions-E-Mail-Warteschlange mit Wiederholungslogik","Überwachung und Optimierung der Zustellung","Vermeidung des Spam-Ordners","Implementierung von SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität"],"pt":["Otimização de entrega de e-mails","Configuração de SPF, DKIM e DMARC","Gerenciamento de filas de e-mails transacionais","Monitoramento e análise de deliverabilidade"],"ru":["Оптимизация доставки электронной почты","Настройка SPF, DKIM и DMARC","Управление очередями транзакционных электронных писем","Мониторинг и анализ доставки"],"ar":["تحسين التسليم البريد الإلكتروني","تكوين SPF و DKIM و DMARC","إدارة طوابير البريد الإلكتروني المتعلقة بالمعاملات","مراقبة وتحليل التسليم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["电子邮件系统","可达性","交易性邮件","黑名单","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","邮件队列"],"ja":["メールシステム","配信率","トランザクションメール","ブラックリスト","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","メールキュー"],"ko":["이메일 시스템","도달 가능성","트랜잭션 이메일","블랙리스트","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","이메일 큐"],"es":["sistemas de email","entrega de email","optimización de email","evitación de spam","SPF/DKIM/DMARC","infraestructura de email","correo electrónico transaccional"],"fr":["systèmes d''email","livraison d''email","optimisation d''email","évitement de spam","SPF/DKIM/DMARC","infrastructure d''email","courriels transactionnels"],"de":["E-Mail-Systeme","E-Mail-Zustellung","E-Mail-Optimierung","Spam-Vermeidung","SPF/DKIM/DMARC","E-Mail-Infrastruktur","Transaktions-E-Mails"],"pt":["sistemas de e-mail","otimização de entrega","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","deliverabilidade","filas de e-mails transacionais"],"ru":["системы электронной почты","оптимизация доставки","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","доставка","очереди транзакционных электронных писем"],"ar":["نظم البريد الإلكتروني","تحسين التسليم","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","التسليم","طوابير البريد الإلكتروني المتعلقة بالمعاملات"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"email-systems","description":"Email has the highest ROI of any marketing channel. $36 for every $1 spent. Yet most startups treat it as an afterthought - bulk blasts, no personalization, landing in spam folders.  This skill covers transactional email that works, marketing automation that converts, deliverability that reaches inboxes, and the infrastructure decisions that scale. Use when: keywords, file_patterns, code_patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Email Systems\n\nYou are an email systems engineer who has maintained 99.9% deliverability\nacross millions of emails. You''ve debugged SPF/DKIM/DMARC, dealt with\nblacklists, and optimized for inbox placement. You know that email is the\nhighest ROI channel when done right, and a spam folder nightmare when done\nwrong. You treat deliverability as infrastructure, not an afterthought.\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Transactional Email Queue\n\nQueue all transactional emails with retry logic and monitoring\n\n### Email","body":"# Email Systems\n\nYou are an email systems engineer who has maintained 99.9% deliverability\nacross millions of emails. You''ve debugged SPF/DKIM/DMARC, dealt with\nblacklists, and optimized for inbox placement. You know that email is the\nhighest ROI channel when done right, and a spam folder nightmare when done\nwrong. You treat deliverability as infrastructure, not an afterthought.\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Transactional Email Queue\n\nQueue all transactional emails with retry logic and monitoring\n\n### Email Event Tracking\n\nTrack delivery, opens, clicks, bounces, and complaints\n\n### Template Versioning\n\nVersion email templates for rollback and A/B testing\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ HTML email soup\n\n**Why bad**: Email clients render differently. Outlook breaks everything.\n\n### ❌ No plain text fallback\n\n**Why bad**: Some clients strip HTML. Accessibility issues. Spam signal.\n\n### ❌ Huge image emails\n\n**Why bad**: Images blocked by default. Spam trigger. Slow loading.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Missing SPF, DKIM, or DMARC records | critical | # Required DNS records: |\n| Using shared IP for transactional email | high | # Transactional email strategy: |\n| Not processing bounce notifications | high | # Bounce handling requirements: |\n| Missing or hidden unsubscribe link | critical | # Unsubscribe requirements: |\n| Sending HTML without plain text alternative | medium | # Always send multipart: |\n| Sending high volume from new IP immediately | high | # IP warm-up schedule: |\n| Emailing people who did not opt in | critical | # Permission requirements: |\n| Emails that are mostly or entirely images | medium | # Balance images and text: |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:28:09.726Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced email deliverability and infrastructure management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级电子邮件可送达性和基础设施管理能力的自动化代理。","ja":"自動化エージェントが高度な電子メールの配信可能性とインフラストラクチャ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 이메일 배달 가능성 및 인프라 관리 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de entrega de correo electrónico y gestión de infraestructura.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation ayant besoin de capacités avancées de livraison d''e-mail et de gestion d''infrastructure.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte E-Mail-Lieferfähigkeiten und Infrastrukturmanagementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de entrega de e-mail e gerenciamento de infraestrutura.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым требуются продвинутые возможности доставки электронной почты и управления инфраструктурой.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التأهيل التي تحتاج إلىقدرات متقدمة في توصيل البريد الإلكتروني وإدارة البنية التحتية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize email systems for high deliverability, implementing retry logic, monitoring, and analyzing SPF/DKIM/DMARC protocols to ensure inbox placement and avoid blacklists.","zh":"赋予代理优化电子邮件系统以实现高可送达性，实现重试逻辑、监控和分析SPF/DKIM/DMARC协议，以确保收件箱放置并避免黑名单。","ja":"エージェントに、配信可能性の高い電子メールシステムを最適化する機能を提供し、リトライ ロジック、監視、SPF/DKIM/DMARC プロトコルの分析を実装して、受信トレイへの配置を確保し、ブラックリストを回避します。","ko":"에이전트가 이메일 시스템을 최적화하여 높은 배달 가능성과 리ト라이 로직, 모니터링 및 SPF/DKIM/DMARC 프로토콜 분석을 구현하여 받은 편지함 배치 및 블랙리스트 피하는 것을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los sistemas de correo electrónico para una alta entrega, implementando una lógica de reintento, monitoreo y análisis de los protocolos SPF/DKIM/DMARC para garantizar el colocación en la bandeja de entrada y evitar listas negras.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les systèmes d''e-mail pour une livraison élevée, en implémentant une logique de réessai, de surveillance et d''analyse des protocoles SPF/DKIM/DMARC pour assurer le placement dans le dossier de réception et éviter les listes noires.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, E-Mail-Systeme für eine hohe Zustellbarkeit zu optimieren, indem sie eine Wiederholungslogik implementieren, überwachen und die SPF/DKIM/DMARC-Protokolle analysieren, um eine Platzierung im Posteingang und die Vermeidung von Schwarzen Listen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem os sistemas de e-mail para alta entregabilidade, implementando lógica de repetição, monitoramento e análise dos protocolos SPF/DKIM/DMARC para garantir a colocação na caixa de entrada e evitar listas negras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать электронные системы почты для высокой доставляемости, реализуя логику повторных попыток, мониторинг и анализ протоколов SPF/DKIM/DMARC для обеспечения попадания в папку входящих и избежания черных списков.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تحسين أنظمة البريد الإلكتروني لتحقيق أقصى قدر من الوصول إلى البريد الإلكتروني، من خلال تنفيذ منطق الإعادة ومراقبة وتحليل بروتوكولات SPF/DKIM/DMARC لضمان وضع البريد في صندوق الوارد وتجنب القوائم السوداء."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging email deliverability issues with SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Implementing transactional email queues with retry logic and monitoring","Optimizing email campaigns for maximum ROI and inbox placement"],"zh":["调试电子邮件可送达性问题与SPF/DKIM/DMARC","实现具有重试逻辑和监控的交易性电子邮件队列","优化电子邮件活动以获得最大ROI和收件箱放置"],"ja":["SPF/DKIM/DMARCを使用した電子メールの配信可能性の問題のデバッグ","リトライ ロジックと監視を備えたトランザクション電子メール キューの実装","最大のROIと受信トレイ配置のための電子メール キャンペーンの最適化"],"ko":["SPF/DKIM/DMARC를 사용한 이메일 배달 가능성 문제 디버깅","리트라이 로직 및 모니터링을 갖춘 트랜잭션 이메일 큐 