tainer","Regras de design: uma responsabilidade por componente, props down, events up","Composição sobre herança","Preferência por componentes leves"],"ru":["Принципы проектирования компонентов","Типы компонентов: Server, Client, Presentational и Container","Правила проектирования: одна обязанность на компонент, props down, events up","Композиция над наследованием","Предпочтение легких компонентов"],"ar":["مبادئ تصميم المكونات","أنواع المكونات: خادم، عميل، عرضي وحاوي","قواعد التصميم: مسؤولية واحدة لكل مكون، props down، events up","التأليف على الوراثة","الافضلية للمكونات الخفيفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 模式","React 应用","组件设计","设计规则","状态管理","Props","事件","React 开发"],"ja":["React パターン","React アプリケーション","コンポーネント設計","設計ルール","ステート管理","Props","イベント","React 開発"],"ko":["React 패턴","React 애플리케이션","컴포넌트 설계","디자인 규칙","상태 관리","Props","이벤트","React 개발"],"es":["patrones de react","diseño de componentes","aplicaciones de producción","react para principiantes","desarrollo de aplicaciones","react js","programación react","componentes de react"],"fr":["modèles de react","conception de composants","applications de production","react pour débutants","développement d''applications","react js","programmation react","composants de react"],"de":["react-muster","komponenten-design","produktionsanwendungen","react für anfänger","anwendungsentwicklung","react js","programmierung react","komponenten von react"],"pt":["Padrões React","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos React","Princípios de design de componentes","Componentes React","Aplicativos de produção","Qualidade de código"],"ru":["Шаблоны React","Разработка приложений React","Принципы проектирования компонентов","Компоненты React","Приложения для производства","Качество кода"],"ar":["نماذج رياكت","تطوير تطبيقات رياكت","مبادئ تصميم المكونات","مكونات رياكت","تطبيقات إنتاج","جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-patterns","description":"Modern React patterns and principles. Hooks, composition, performance, TypeScript best practices.","bodyPreview":"# React Patterns\n\n> Principles for building production-ready React applications.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Component Design Principles\n\n### Component Types\n\n| Type | Use | State |\n|------|-----|-------|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, static | None |\n| **Client** | Interactivity | useState, effects |\n| **Presentational** | UI display | Props only |\n| **Container** | Logic/state | Heavy state |\n\n### Design Rules\n\n- One responsibility per component\n- Props down, events up\n- Composition over inheritance\n- Prefer s","body":"# React Patterns\n\n> Principles for building production-ready React applications.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Component Design Principles\n\n### Component Types\n\n| Type | Use | State |\n|------|-----|-------|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, static | None |\n| **Client** | Interactivity | useState, effects |\n| **Presentational** | UI display | Props only |\n| **Container** | Logic/state | Heavy state |\n\n### Design Rules\n\n- One responsibility per component\n- Props down, events up\n- Composition over inheritance\n- Prefer small, focused components\n\n---\n\n## 2. Hook Patterns\n\n### When to Extract Hooks\n\n| Pattern | Extract When |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **useLocalStorage** | Same storage logic needed |\n| **useDebounce** | Multiple debounced values |\n| **useFetch** | Repeated fetch patterns |\n| **useForm** | Complex form state |\n\n### Hook Rules\n\n- Hooks at top level only\n- Same order every render\n- Custom hooks start with \"use\"\n- Clean up effects on unmount\n\n---\n\n## 3. State Management Selection\n\n| Complexity | Solution |\n|------------|----------|\n| Simple | useState, useReducer |\n| Shared local | Context |\n| Server state | React Query, SWR |\n| Complex global | Zustand, Redux Toolkit |\n\n### State Placement\n\n| Scope | Where |\n|-------|-------|\n| Single component | useState |\n| Parent-child | Lift state up |\n| Subtree | Context |\n| App-wide | Global store |\n\n---\n\n## 4. React 19 Patterns\n\n### New Hooks\n\n| Hook | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **useActionState** | Form submission state |\n| **useOptimistic** | Optimistic UI updates |\n| **use** | Read resources in render |\n\n### Compiler Benefits\n\n- Automatic memoization\n- Less manual useMemo/useCallback\n- Focus on pure components\n\n---\n\n## 5. Composition Patterns\n\n### Compound Components\n\n- Parent provides context\n- Children consume context\n- Flexible slot-based composition\n- Example: Tabs, Accordion, Dropdown\n\n### Render Props vs Hooks\n\n| Use Case | Prefer |\n|----------|--------|\n| Reusable logic | Custom hook |\n| Render flexibility | Render props |\n| Cross-cutting | Higher-order component |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Performance Principles\n\n### When to Optimize\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| Slow renders | Profile first |\n| Large lists | Virtualize |\n| Expensive calc | useMemo |\n| Stable callbacks | useCallback |\n\n### Optimization Order\n\n1. Check if actually slow\n2. Profile with DevTools\n3. Identify bottleneck\n4. Apply targeted fix\n\n---\n\n## 7. Error Handling\n\n### Error Boundary Usage\n\n| Scope | Placement |\n|-------|-----------|\n| App-wide | Root level |\n| Feature | Route/feature level |\n| Component | Around risky component |\n\n### Error Recovery\n\n- Show fallback UI\n- Log error\n- Offer retry option\n- Preserve user data\n\n---\n\n## 8. TypeScript Patterns\n\n### Props Typing\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Interface | Component props |\n| Type | Unions, complex |\n| Generic | Reusable components |\n\n### Common Types\n\n| Need | Type |\n|------|------|\n| Children | ReactNode |\n| Event handler | MouseEventHandler |\n| Ref | RefObject<Element> |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Testing Principles\n\n| Level | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| Unit | Pure functions, hooks |\n| Integration | Component behavior |\n| E2E | User flows |\n\n### Test Priorities\n\n- User-visible behavior\n- Edge cases\n- Error states\n- Accessibility\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Prop drilling deep | Use context |\n| Giant components | Split smaller |\n| useEffect for everything | Server components |\n| Premature optimization | Profile first |\n| Index as key | Stable unique ID |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** React is about composition. Build small, combine thoughtfully.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:28:13.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured React application development capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要结构化React应用程序开发功能的前端代理。","ja":"構造化されたReactアプリケーションの開発機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"구조화된 React 애플리케이션 개발 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de aplicaciones React estructuradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de développement d''applications React structurées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die strukturierte React-Anwendungs-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured React application development capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured React application development capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured React application development capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design reusable UI components using composition over inheritance, and manage state with useState and effects, while following principles like one responsibility per component and props down, events up.","zh":"赋予代理设计可重用UI组件的能力，使用组合而非继承，使用useState和效果管理状态，同时遵循单一职责和属性向下、事件向上的原则。","ja":"エージェントに、コンポジションを使用して再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを設計し、useStateとエフェクトを使用して状態を管理し、単一の責任とプロパティダウン、イベントアップの原則に従う機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 구성_over_상속을 사용하고 useState 및 효과를 사용하여 상태를 관리하며, 단일 책임 및 속성 아래로, 이벤트 위로의 원칙을 따름으로써 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar componentes de IU reutilizables utilizando la composición sobre la herencia, y gestionar el estado con useState y efectos, siguiendo principios como una responsabilidad por componente y props hacia abajo, eventos hacia arriba.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables en utilisant la composition plutôt que l''héritage, et de gérer l''état avec useState et des effets, tout en suivant des principes tels qu''une responsabilité par composant et des props vers le bas, des événements vers le haut.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mithilfe von Zusammensetzung anstelle von Vererbung zu entwerfen und den Zustand mit useState und Effekten zu verwalten, während sie Prinzipien wie eine Verantwortung pro Komponente und Props nach unten, Ereignisse nach oben befolgen.","pt":"Empowers agents to design reusable UI components using composition over inheritance, and manage state with useState and effects, while following principles like one responsibility per component and props down, events up.","ru":"Empowers agents to design reusable UI components using composition over inheritance, and manage state with useState and effects, while following principles like one responsibility per component and props down, events up.","ar":"Empowers agents to design reusable UI components using composition over inheritance, and manage state with useState and effects, while following principles like one responsibility per component and props down, events up."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing presentational components for UI display","Building container components for logic and state management","Implementing server components for data fetching and static rendering"],"zh":["为UI显示设计表示组件","为逻辑和状态管理构建容器组件","为数据获取和静态渲染实现服务器组件"],"ja":["UI表示のためにプレゼンテーションコンポーネントを設計する","ロジックと状態管理のためにコンテナコンポーネントを構築する","データ取得と静的レンダリングのためにサーバーコンポーネントを実装する"],"ko":["UI 표시를 위해 프레젠테이션 컴포넌트를 설계하는 것","로직 및 상태 관리를 위한 컨테이너 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","데이터 가져오기 및 정적 렌더링을 위한 서버 컴포넌트 구현"],"es":["Diseñar componentes presentacionales para la visualización de la IU","Crear componentes contenedores para la lógica y la gestión de estado","Implementar componentes del servidor para la recuperación de datos y la representación estática"],"fr":["Concevoir des composants présentationnels pour l''affichage de l''interface utilisateur","Créer des composants conteneurs pour la logique et la gestion d''état","Mettre en œuvre des composants serveur pour la récupération de données et le rendu statique"],"de":["Entwerfen von Präsentationskomponenten für die Anzeige der Benutzeroberfläche","Erstellen von Containern-Komponenten für Logik und Zustandsverwaltung","Implementieren von Server-Komponenten für Datenabruf und statische Darstellung"],"pt":["Designing presentational components for UI display","Building container components for logic and state management","Implementing server components for data fetching and static rendering"],"ru":["Designing presentational components for UI display","Building container components for logic and state management","Implementing server components for data fetching and static rendering"],"ar":["Designing presentational components for UI display","Building container components for logic and state management","Implementing server components for data fetching and static rendering"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React fundamentals","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要React基础知识","仅限React 기반应用程序"],"ja":["Reactの基礎知識が必要","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 기본 지식이 필요함","React 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los fundamentos de React","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en bases de React","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React-Grundlagen","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of React fundamentals","Limited to React-based applications"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of React fundamentals","Limited to React-based applications"],"ar":["Requires knowledge of React fundamentals","Limited to React-based applications"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
