comércio eletrônico","plataforma de vendas"],"ru":["приложения shopify","разработка приложений","react router","app bridge","вебхуки","rest api","опрос","электронная коммерция","платформа продаж"],"ar":["تطبيقات شوبيفاي","تطوير التطبيقات","رياكت روتر","اب بريدج","الويب هوك","ريست.api","استطلاع","التجارة الإلكترونية","منصة البيع"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shopify-apps","description":"Expert patterns for Shopify app development including Remix/React Router apps, embedded apps with App Bridge, webhook handling, GraphQL Admin API, Polaris components, billing, and app extensions. Use when: shopify app, shopify, embedded app, polaris, app bridge.","bodyPreview":"# Shopify Apps\n\n## Patterns\n\n### React Router App Setup\n\nModern Shopify app template with React Router\n\n### Embedded App with App Bridge\n\nRender app embedded in Shopify Admin\n\n### Webhook Handling\n\nSecure webhook processing with HMAC verification\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ REST API for New Apps\n\n### ❌ Webhook Processing Before Response\n\n### ❌ Polling Instead of Webhooks\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | high | ## Respond immediately, proc","body":"# Shopify Apps\n\n## Patterns\n\n### React Router App Setup\n\nModern Shopify app template with React Router\n\n### Embedded App with App Bridge\n\nRender app embedded in Shopify Admin\n\n### Webhook Handling\n\nSecure webhook processing with HMAC verification\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ REST API for New Apps\n\n### ❌ Webhook Processing Before Response\n\n### ❌ Polling Instead of Webhooks\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | high | ## Respond immediately, process asynchronously |\n| Issue | high | ## Check rate limit headers |\n| Issue | high | ## Request protected customer data access |\n| Issue | medium | ## Use TOML only (recommended) |\n| Issue | medium | ## Handle both URL formats |\n| Issue | high | ## Use GraphQL for all new code |\n| Issue | high | ## Use latest App Bridge via script tag |\n| Issue | high | ## Implement all GDPR handlers |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:27:41.804Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Commerce Integration Agents building and maintaining Shopify apps with modern React Router and App Bridge patterns.","zh":"适用于Commerce Integration Agents构建和维护Shopify应用，使用现代React Router和App Bridge模式。","ja":"Commerce Integration AgentsがShopifyアプリを構築して維持するために、React RouterとApp Bridgeのモダンパターンを使用する場合に不可欠です。","ko":"Commerce Integration Agents가 Shopify 애플리케이션을 구축하고 유지 관리하는 데 필요한 React Router 및 App Bridge의 현대적인 패턴을 사용하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de integración de comercio que crean y mantienen aplicaciones de Shopify con patrones de React Router y App Bridge modernos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''intégration de commerce qui créent et maintiennent des applications Shopify avec des modèles React Router et App Bridge modernes.","de":"Wesentlich für Commerce-Integration-Agents, die Shopify-Apps mit modernen React-Router- und App-Bridge-Mustern erstellen und warten.","pt":"Essencial para Agents de Integração de Comércio que constroem e mantêm aplicativos Shopify com padrões modernos de React Router e App Bridge.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов интеграции электронной коммерции, создающих и поддерживающих приложения Shopify с современными шаблонами React Router и App Bridge.","ar":"ضروري لعميل دمج التجارة الذي يبني ويحافظ على تطبيقات Shopify باستخدام أنماط React Router و App Bridge الحديثة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables embedded app development within Shopify Admin using React Router and App Bridge, while providing secure webhook processing with HMAC verification for real-time data synchronization. Directly implements Shopify''s recommended patterns while avoiding anti-patterns like REST API for new apps and premature webhook processing.","zh":"支持在Shopify Admin中使用React Router和App Bridge进行内嵌应用开发，同时提供安全的Webhook处理和HMAC验证以实现实时数据同步。直接实现Shopify推荐的模式，同时避免了新应用中使用REST API和过早的Webhook处理等反模式。","ja":"Shopify Admin内でReact RouterとApp Bridgeを使用した埋め込みアプリの開発を可能にし、HMAC検証によるセキュアなWebhook処理を提供してリアルタイムのデータ同期を実現します。Shopify推奨のパターンを直接実装し、REST APIを新規アプリに使用したり、Webhook処理を早期に実行したりするなどの反パターンを回避します。","ko":"Shopify Admin에서 React Router 및 App Bridge를 사용하여 내장 애플리케이션 개발을 가능하게 하며 HMAC 검증을 통한 보안 웹후크 처리를 제공하여 실시간 데이터 동기화를 구현합니다. Shopify가 권장하는 패턴을 직접 구현하며 새 애플리케이션에서 REST API를 사용하거나 웹후크 처리를过早에 수행하는 등 반 패턴을 피합니다.","es":"Permite el desarrollo de aplicaciones integradas dentro de Shopify Admin utilizando React Router y App Bridge, al tiempo que proporciona un procesamiento de webhooks seguro con verificación HMAC para la sincronización de datos en tiempo real. Implementa directamente los patrones recomendados por Shopify, evitando anti-patrones como la API REST para nuevas aplicaciones y el procesamiento prematuro de webhooks.","fr":"Permet le développement d''applications intégrées au sein de Shopify Admin en utilisant React Router et App Bridge, tout en fournissant un traitement de webhooks sécurisé avec vérification HMAC pour la synchronisation des données en temps réel. Met directement en œuvre les modèles recommandés par Shopify, en évitant les anti-modèles tels que l''API REST pour les nouvelles applications et le traitement prématuré des webhooks.","de":"Ermöglicht die Entwicklung von eingebetteten Apps innerhalb von Shopify Admin mit React Router und App Bridge, während sicheres Webhook-Verarbeiten mit HMAC-Verifizierung für Echtzeit-Datensynchronisierung bereitgestellt wird. Implementiert direkt die von Shopify empfohlenen Muster, während Anti-Muster wie REST-API für neue Apps und verfrühte Webhook-Verarbeitung vermieden werden.","pt":"Permite o desenvolvimento de aplicativos incorporados dentro do Shopify Admin usando React Router e App Bridge, além de fornecer processamento de webhooks seguro com verificação HMAC para sincronização de dados em tempo real. Implementa diretamente os padrões recomendados pela Shopify, evitando anti-padrões como REST API para novos aplicativos e processamento prematuro de webhooks.","ru":"Позволяет создавать встроенные приложения внутри административного интерфейса Shopify, используя React Router и App Bridge, а также обеспечивает безопасную обработку вебхуков с верификацией HMAC для синхронизации данных в реальном времени. Прямо реализует рекомендуемые шаблоны Shopify, избегая анти-шаблонов, таких как REST API для новых приложений и преждевременная обработка вебхуков.","ar":"يمكن تطوير تطبيقات مضمنة داخل واجهة إدارة Shopify باستخدام React Router و App Bridge، بالإضافة إلى تقديم معالجة الويب هوك الآمنة مع التحقق HMAC لمزامنة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي. يطبق مباشرة الأنماط الموصى بها من Shopify، وتجنب أنماط مضادة مثل REST API لتطبيقات جديدة ومعالجة الويب هوك المسبقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building embedded React Router apps for Shopify Admin","Implementing secure webhook handling with HMAC verification","Migrating legacy apps from REST to modern GraphQL patterns","Setting up real-time data synchronization through webhooks"],"zh":["为Shopify Admin构建内嵌React Router应用","实现安全的Webhook处理和HMAC验证","将遗留应用从REST迁移到现代GraphQL模式","通过Webhook设置实时数据同步"],"ja":["Shopify Admin用の埋め込みReact Routerアプリの構築","HMAC検証によるセキュアなWebhook処理の実装","レガシーアプリをRESTからモダンなGraphQLパターンに移行","Webhookを使用したリアルタイムデータ同期の設定"],"ko":["Shopify Admin을 위한 내장 React Router 애플리케이션 구축","HMAC 검증을 통한 보안 웹후크 처리 구현","레거시 애플리케이션을 REST에서 현대적인 GraphQL 패턴으로 마이그레이션","웹후크를 통한 실시간 데이터 동기화 설정"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones React Router integradas para Shopify Admin","Implementación de manipulación de webhooks segura con verificación HMAC","Migración de aplicaciones heredadas de REST a patrones GraphQL modernos","Configuración de la sincronización de datos en tiempo real a través de webhooks"],"fr":["Création d''applications React Router intégrées pour Shopify Admin","Mise en œuvre d''un traitement de webhooks sécurisé avec vérification HMAC","Migration d''applications héritées de REST vers des modèles GraphQL modernes","Configuration de la synchronisation des données en temps réel via des webhooks"],"de":["Erstellung von eingebetteten React-Router-Apps für Shopify Admin","Implementierung von sicherer Webhook-Verarbeitung mit HMAC-Verifizierung","Migration von Legacy-Apps von REST zu modernen GraphQL-Mustern","Einrichtung der Echtzeit-Datensynchronisierung über Webhooks"],"pt":["Construir aplicativos React Router incorporados para o Shopify Admin","Implementar manipulação de webhooks segura com verificação HMAC","Migrar aplicativos legados do REST para padrões GraphQL modernos","Configurar sincronização de dados em tempo real por meio de webhooks"],"ru":["Создание встроенных приложений React Router для административного интерфейса Shopify","Реализация безопасной обработки вебхуков с верификацией HMAC","Миграция устаревших приложений с REST на современные шаблоны GraphQL","Настройка синхронизации данных в реальном времени через вебхуки"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات React Router المضمنة لواجهة إدارة Shopify","تنفيذ معالجة الويب هوك الآمنة مع التحقق HMAC","هجرة التطبيقات القديمة من REST إلى أنماط GraphQL الحديثة","تكوين مزامنة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي من خلال الويب هوك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires immediate webhook response before processing","Cannot use REST API for new app development","Must avoid polling in favor of webhook-based approaches"],"zh":["需要在处理之前立即响应Webhook","不能为新应用开发使用REST API","必须避免轮询而使用Webhook-based方法"],"ja":["処理前にWebhookに即座に応答する必要がある","新規アプリの開発にはREST APIを使用できない","ポーリングを避けてWebhookベースのアプローチを使用しなければならない"],"ko":["처리 전에 웹후크에 즉시 응답해야 함","새 애플리케이션 개발에는 REST API를 사용할 수 없음","폴링을 피하고 웹후크 기반 접근 방식을 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una respuesta inmediata de webhook antes de procesar","No se puede utilizar la API REST para el desarrollo de nuevas aplicaciones","Se debe evitar la encuesta en favor de enfoques basados en webhooks"],"fr":["Nécessite une réponse immédiate de webhook avant de traiter","L''API REST ne peut pas être utilisée pour le développement d''applications nouvelles","Il faut éviter les sondages en faveur d''approches basées sur les webhooks"],"de":["Benötigt eine sofortige Webhook-Antwort vor der Verarbeitung","Die REST-API kann nicht für die Entwicklung neuer Apps verwendet werden","Das Polling muss vermieden werden, um Ansätze basierend auf Webhooks zu bevorzugen"],"pt":["Exige resposta imediata do webhook antes do processamento","Não pode usar REST API para desenvolvimento de novos aplicativos","Deve evitar o polling em favor de abordagens baseadas em webhooks"],"ru":["Требует немедленного ответа вебхука перед обработкой","Не может использовать REST API для разработки новых приложений","Должен избегать опроса в пользу подходов, основанных на вебхуках"],"ar":["يتطلب استجابة فورية للويب هوك قبل المعالجة","لا يمكن استخدام REST API لتطوير تطبيقات جديدة","يجب تجنب الاستطلاع لصالح المناهج المعتمدة على الويب هوك"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/onboarding-cro', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'onboarding-cro', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z', '2026-02-18T14:28:41.666Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/onboarding-cro","name":"onboarding-cro","description":{"zh":"用户引导CRO是指帮助用户快速达到‘aha moment’，建立使用习惯并提高长期留存率的过程","ja":"オンボーディングCROは、ユーザーが‘aha moment’に到達し、使用習慣を確立し、長期的なリテンションを高めるプロセスです","ko":"온보딩 CRO는 사용자가 ‘aha moment’에 도달하고 사용 패턴을 형성하여 장기적으로 리텐션을 높이는 과정입니다","es":"Onboarding CRO se centra en ayudar a los usuarios a alcanzar su ''aha moment'' lo antes posible y establecer hábitos que conduzcan a la retención a largo plazo","fr":"Onboarding CRO se concentre sur l''aide aux utilisateurs à atteindre leur ''aha moment'' le plus rapidement possible et à établir des habitudes qui conduisent à la rétention à long terme","de":"Onboarding CRO konzentriert sich darauf, den Nutzern zu helfen, ihr ''aha moment'' so schnell wie möglich zu erreichen und Gewohnheiten zu etablieren, die zu langfristiger Bindung führen","pt":"Onboarding CRO é uma técnica para ajudar os usuários a alcançar seu momento ''aha'' mais rapidamente e estabelecer hábitos para retenção a longo prazo","ru":"Onboarding CRO - это техника, помогающая пользователям быстрее достичь своего ''aha'' момента и установить привычки для долгосрочного удержания","ar":"تجربة التسجيل CRO هي تقنية لمساعدة المستخدمين في الوصول إلى لحظة ''aha'' بأسرع ما يمكن وتنمية عادات للاحتفاظ على المدى الطويل","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"用户引导CRO优化","ja":"オンボーディングCRO最適化","ko":"온보딩 CRO 최적화","es":"Optimiza el proceso de incorporación de usuarios con Onbo...","fr":"Améliorez l''expérience d''intégration avec Onboarding CRO","de":"Optimieren Sie den Onboarding-Prozess mit Onboarding CRO","pt":"Onboarding CRO: Otimização de Ativação de Usuários","ru":"Onboarding CRO: Оптимизация активации пользователей","ar":"تجربة التسجيل CRO: تحسين تنشيط المستخدمين","en":"onboarding-cro"},"description":{"zh":"用户引导CRO是指帮助用户快速达到‘aha moment’，建立使用习惯并提高长期留存率的过程","ja":"オンボーディングCROは、ユーザーが‘aha moment’に到達し、使用習慣を確立し、長期的なリテンションを高めるプロセスです","ko":"온보딩 CRO는 사용자가 ‘aha moment’에 도달하고 사용 패턴을 형성하여 장기적으로 리텐션을 높이는 과정입니다","es":"Onboarding CRO se centra en ayudar a los usuarios a alcanzar su ''aha moment'' lo antes posible y establecer hábitos que conduzcan a la retención a largo plazo","fr":"Onboarding CRO se concentre sur l''aide aux utilisateurs à atteindre leur ''aha moment'' le plus rapidement possible et à établir des habitudes qui conduisent à...","de":"Onboarding CRO konzentriert sich darauf, den Nutzern zu helfen, ihr ''aha moment'' so schnell wie möglich zu erreichen und Gewohnheiten zu etablieren, die zu l...","pt":"Onboarding CRO é uma técnica para ajudar os usuários a alcançar seu momento ''aha'' mais rapidamente e estabelecer hábitos para retenção a longo prazo","ru":"Onboarding CRO - это техника, помогающая пользователям быстрее достичь своего ''aha'' момента и установить привычки для долгосрочного удержания","ar":"تجربة التسجيل CRO هي تقنية لمساعدة المستخدمين في الوصول إلى لحظة ''aha'' بأسرع ما يمكن وتنمية عادات للاحتفاظ على المدى الطويل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速达到‘aha moment’","建立使用习惯","提高长期留存率","优化用户体验","个性化引导流程"],"ja":["‘aha moment’に到達する","使用習慣を確立する","長期的なリテンションを高める","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化する","オンボーディングプロセスをカスタマイズする"],"ko":["‘aha moment’에 도달하는 것","사용 패턴을 형성하는 것","장기적인 리텐션을 높이는 것","사용자 경험을 최적화하는 것","온보딩 프로세스를 개인화하는 것"],"es":["Análisis del contexto del producto","Definición del ''aha moment''","Estrategias de activación del usuario","Técnicas de retención a largo plazo","Optimización del proceso de incorporación","Medición del éxito del Onboarding"],"fr":["Analyse du contexte du produit","Définition du ''aha moment''","Stratégies d''activation de l''utilisateur","Techniques de rétention à long terme","Optimisation du processus d''intégration","Mesure du succès de l''Onboarding"],"de":["Analyse des Produktkontexts","Definition des ''aha moment''","Strategien zur Aktivierung des Nutzers","Techniken zur langfristigen Bindung","Optimierung des Onboarding-Prozesses","Messung des Erfolgs des Onboarding"],"pt":["Análise de contexto do produto","Definição do momento ''aha''","Otimização da experiência de onboarding","Estratégias para retenção a longo prazo","Análise de comportamento do usuário","Melhoria da taxa de conversão"],"ru":["Анализ контекста продукта","Определение ''aha'' момента","Оптимизация опыта оnboarding","Стратегии для долгосрочного удержания","Анализ поведения пользователя","Улучшение коэффициента конверсии"],"ar":["تحليل سياق المنتج","تحديد لحظة ''aha''","تحسين تجربة التسجيل","استراتيجيات للاحتفاظ على المدى الطويل","تحليل سلوك المستخدم","تحسين معدل التحويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["用户引导CRO","用户体验优化","留存率提高","个性化引导","SaaS工具优化","用户激活"],"ja":["オンボーディングCRO","ユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化","リテンション率向上","カスタマイズオンボーディング","SaaSツール最適化","ユーザー活性化"],"ko":["온보딩 CRO","사용자 경험 최적화","리텐션율 향상","개인화 온보딩","SaaS 도구 최적화","사용자 활성화"],"es":["onboarding cro","optimización del onboarding","retención de usuarios","aha moment","estrategias de activación","análisis de contexto del producto","técnicas de retención a largo plazo","medición del éxito del onboarding"],"fr":["onboarding cro","optimisation de l''onboarding","rétention des utilisateurs","aha moment","stratégies d''activation","analyse du contexte du produit","techniques de rétention à long terme","mesure du succès de l''onboarding"],"de":["onboarding cro","optimierung des onboarding","nutzerbindung","aha moment","strategien zur aktivierung","analyse des produktkontexts","techniken zur langfristigen bindung","messung des erfolgs des onboarding"],"pt":["onboarding cro","otimização de ativação de usuários","experiência de onboarding","retenção de usuários","análise de comportamento do usuário","melhoria da taxa de conversão","estratégias de cro","desenvolvimento de produto"],"ru":["onboarding cro","оптимизация активации пользователей","опыт оnboarding","удержание пользователей","анализ поведения пользователя","улучшение коэффициента конверсии","стратегии cro","разработка продукта"],"ar":["تجربة التسجيل cro","تحسين تنشيط المستخدمين","تجربة التسجيل","احتفاظ المستخدمين","تحليل سلوك المستخدم","تحسين معدل التحويل","استراتيجيات cro","تنمية المنتج"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"onboarding-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize post-signup onboarding, user activation, first-run experience, or time-to-value. Also use when the user mentions onboarding flow, activation rate, user activation, first-run experience, empty states, onboarding checklist, aha moment, or new user experience. For signup/registration optimization, see signup-flow-cro. For ongoing email sequences, see email-sequence.","bodyPreview":"# Onboarding CRO\n\nYou are an expert in user onboarding and activation. Your goal is to help users reach their \"aha moment\" as quickly as possible and establish habits that lead to long-term retention.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Product Context**\n   - What type of product? (SaaS tool, marketplace, app, etc.)\n   - B2B or B2C?\n   - What''s the core value proposition?\n\n2. **Activation Definition**\n   - What''s the \"aha moment\" for your product?\n   - Wha","body":"# Onboarding CRO\n\nYou are an expert in user onboarding and activation. Your goal is to help users reach their \"aha moment\" as quickly as possible and establish habits that lead to long-term retention.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Product Context**\n   - What type of product? (SaaS tool, marketplace, app, etc.)\n   - B2B or B2C?\n   - What''s the core value proposition?\n\n2. **Activation Definition**\n   - What''s the \"aha moment\" for your product?\n   - What action indicates a user \"gets it\"?\n   - What''s your current activation rate?\n\n3. **Current State**\n   - What happens immediately after signup?\n   - Is there an existing onboarding flow?\n   - Where do users currently drop off?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Time-to-Value Is Everything\n- How quickly can someone experience the core value?\n- Remove every step between signup and that moment\n- Consider: Can they experience value BEFORE signup?\n\n### 2. One Goal Per Session\n- Don''t try to teach everything at once\n- Focus first session on one successful outcome\n- Save advanced features for later\n\n### 3. Do, Don''t Show\n- Interactive > Tutorial\n- Doing the thing > Learning about the thing\n- Show UI in context of real tasks\n\n### 4. Progress Creates Motivation\n- Show advancement\n- Celebrate completions\n- Make the path visible\n\n---\n\n## Defining Activation\n\n### Find Your Aha Moment\nThe action that correlates most strongly with retention:\n- What do retained users do that churned users don''t?\n- What''s the earliest indicator of future engagement?\n- What action demonstrates they \"got it\"?\n\n**Examples by product type:**\n- Project management: Create first project + add team member\n- Analytics: Install tracking + see first report\n- Design tool: Create first design + export/share\n- Collaboration: Invite first teammate\n- Marketplace: Complete first transaction\n\n### Activation Metrics\n- % of signups who reach activation\n- Time to activation\n- Steps to activation\n- Activation by cohort/source\n\n---\n\n## Onboarding Flow Design\n\n### Immediate Post-Signup (First 30 Seconds)\n\n**Options:**\n1. **Product-first**: Drop directly into product\n   - Best for: Simple products, B2C, mobile apps\n   - Risk: Blank slate overwhelm\n\n2. **Guided setup**: Short wizard to configure\n   - Best for: Products needing personalization\n   - Risk: Adds friction before value\n\n3. **Value-first**: Show outcome immediately\n   - Best for: Products with demo data or samples\n   - Risk: May not feel \"real\"\n\n**Whatever you choose:**\n- Clear single next action\n- No dead ends\n- Progress indication if multi-step\n\n### Onboarding Checklist Pattern\n\n**When to use:**\n- Multiple setup steps required\n- Product has several features to discover\n- Self-serve B2B products\n\n**Best practices:**\n- 3-7 items (not overwhelming)\n- Order by value (most impactful first)\n- Start with quick wins\n- Progress bar/completion %\n- Celebration on completion\n- Dismiss option (don''t trap users)\n\n**Checklist item structure:**\n- Clear action verb\n- Benefit hint\n- Estimated time\n- Quick-start capability\n\nExample:\n```\n☐ Connect your first data source (2 min)\n  Get real-time insights from your existing tools\n  [Connect Now]\n```\n\n### Empty States\n\nEmpty states are onboarding opportunities, not dead ends.\n\n**Good empty state:**\n- Explains what this area is for\n- Shows what it looks like with data\n- Clear primary action to add first item\n- Optional: Pre-populate with example data\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Illustration or preview\n2. Brief explanation of value\n3. Primary CTA to add first item\n4. Optional: Secondary action (import, template)\n\n### Tooltips and Guided Tours\n\n**When to use:**\n- Complex UI that benefits from orientation\n- Features that aren''t self-evident\n- Power features users might miss\n\n**When to avoid:**\n- Simple, intuitive interfaces\n- Mobile apps (limited screen space)\n- When they interrupt important flows\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Max 3-5 steps per tour\n- Point to actual UI elements\n- Dismissable at any time\n- Don''t repeat for returning users\n- Consider user-initiated tours\n\n### Progress Indicators\n\n**Types:**\n- Checklist (discrete tasks)\n- Progress bar (% complete)\n- Level/stage indicator\n- Profile completeness\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show early progress (start at 20%, not 0%)\n- Quick early wins (first items easy to complete)\n- Clear benefit of completing\n- Don''t block features behind completion\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Channel Onboarding\n\n### Email + In-App Coordination\n\n**Trigger-based emails:**\n- Welcome email (immediate)\n- Incomplete onboarding (24h, 72h)\n- Activation achieved (celebration + next step)\n- Feature discovery (days 3, 7, 14)\n- Stalled user re-engagement\n\n**Email should:**\n- Reinforce in-app actions\n- Not duplicate in-app messaging\n- Drive back to product with specific CTA\n- Be personalized based on actions taken\n\n### Push Notifications (Mobile)\n\n- Permission timing is critical (not immediately)\n- Clear value proposition for enabling\n- Reserve for genuine value moments\n- Re-engagement for stalled users\n\n---\n\n## Engagement Loops\n\n### Building Habits\n- What regular action should users take?\n- What trigger can prompt return?\n- What reward reinforces the behavior?\n\n**Loop structure:**\nTrigger → Action → Variable Reward → Investment\n\n**Examples:**\n- Trigger: Email digest of activity\n- Action: Log in to respond\n- Reward: Social engagement, progress, achievement\n- Investment: Add more data, connections, content\n\n### Milestone Celebrations\n- Acknowledge meaningful achievements\n- Show progress relative to journey\n- Suggest next milestone\n- Shareable moments (social proof generation)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Stalled Users\n\n### Detection\n- Define \"stalled\" criteria (X days inactive, incomplete setup)\n- Monitor at cohort level\n- Track recovery rate\n\n### Re-engagement Tactics\n1. **Email sequence for incomplete onboarding**\n   - Reminder of value proposition\n   - Address common blockers\n   - Offer help/demo/call\n   - Deadline/urgency if appropriate\n\n2. **In-app recovery**\n   - Welcome back message\n   - Pick up where they left off\n   - Simplified path to activation\n\n3. **Human touch**\n   - For high-value accounts: personal outreach\n   - Offer live walkthrough\n   - Ask what''s blocking them\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Activation rate**: % reaching activation event\n- **Time to activation**: How long to first value\n- **Onboarding completion**: % completing setup\n- **Day 1/7/30 retention**: Return rate by timeframe\n- **Feature adoption**: Which features get used\n\n### Funnel Analysis\nTrack drop-off at each step:\n```\nSignup → Step 1 → Step 2 → Activation → Retention\n100%      80%       60%       40%         25%\n```\n\nIdentify biggest drops and focus there.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Onboarding Audit\nFor each issue:\n- **Finding**: What''s happening\n- **Impact**: Why it matters\n- **Recommendation**: Specific fix\n- **Priority**: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Onboarding Flow Design\n- **Activation goal**: What they should achieve\n- **Step-by-step flow**: Each screen/state\n- **Checklist items**: If applicable\n- **Empty states**: Copy and CTA\n- **Email sequence**: Triggers and content\n- **Metrics plan**: What to measure\n\n### Copy Deliverables\n- Welcome screen copy\n- Checklist items with microcopy\n- Empty state copy\n- Tooltip content\n- Email sequence copy\n- Milestone celebration copy\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns by Product Type\n\n### B2B SaaS Tool\n1. Short setup wizard (use case selection)\n2. First value-generating action\n3. Team invitation prompt\n4. Checklist for deeper setup\n\n### Marketplace/Platform\n1. Complete profile\n2. First search/browse\n3. First transaction\n4. Repeat engagement loop\n\n### Mobile App\n1. Permission requests (strategic timing)\n2. Quick win in first session\n3. Push notification setup\n4. Habit loop establishment\n\n### Content/Social Platform\n1. Follow/customize feed\n2. First content consumption\n3. First content creation\n4. Social connection/engagement\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Flow Simplification Experiments\n\n**Reduce Friction**\n- Add or remove email verification during onboarding\n- Test empty states vs. pre-populated dummy data\n- Provide pre-filled templates to accelerate setup\n- Add OAuth options for faster account linking\n- Reduce number of required onboarding steps\n\n**Step Sequencing**\n- Test different ordering of onboarding steps\n- Lead with highest-value features first\n- Move friction-heavy steps later in flow\n- Test required vs. optional step balance\n\n**Progress & Motivation**\n- Add progress bars or completion percentages\n- Test onboarding checklists (3-5 items vs. 5-7 items)\n- Gamify milestones with badges or rewards\n- Show \"X% complete\" messaging\n\n---\n\n### Guided Experience Experiments\n\n**Product Tours**\n- Add interactive product tours (Navattic, Storylane)\n- Test tooltip-based guidance vs. modal walkthroughs\n- Video tutorials for complex workflows\n- Self-paced vs. guided tour options\n\n**CTA Optimization**\n- Test CTA text variations during onboarding\n- Test CTA placement within onboarding screens\n- Add in-app tooltips for advanced features\n- Sticky CTAs that persist during onboarding\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**User Segmentation**\n- Segment users by role to show relevant features\n- Segment by goal to customize onboarding path\n- Create role-specific dashboards\n- Ask use-case question to personalize flow\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalized welcome messages\n- Industry-specific examples and templates\n- Dynamic feature recommendations based on answers\n\n---\n\n### Quick Wins & Engagement Experiments\n\n**Time-to-Value**\n- Highlight quick wins early (\"Complete your first X\")\n- Show success messages after key actions\n- Display progress celebrations at milestones\n- Suggest next steps after each completion\n\n**Support & Help**\n- Offer free onboarding calls for complex products\n- Add contextual help throughout onboarding\n- Test chat support availability during onboarding\n- Proactive outreach for stuck users\n\n---\n\n### Email & Multi-Channel Experiments\n\n**Onboarding Emails**\n- Personalized welcome email from founder\n- Behavior-based emails (triggered by actions/inactions)\n- Test email timing and frequency\n- Include quick tips and video content\n\n**Feedback Loops**\n- Add NPS survey during onboarding\n- Ask \"What''s blocking you?\" for incomplete users\n- Follow-up based on NPS score\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What action most correlates with retention?\n2. What happens immediately after signup?\n3. Where do users currently drop off?\n4. What''s your activation rate target?\n5. Do you have cohort analysis on successful vs. churned users?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: For optimizing the signup before onboarding\n- **email-sequence**: For onboarding email series\n- **paywall-upgrade-cro**: For converting to paid during/after onboarding\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing onboarding changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:28:41.666Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Customer Success Agents focused on SaaS tools and marketplace platforms needing expert user onboarding and activation strategies.","zh":"适合专注于SaaS工具和市场平台的客户成功代理，需要专家级的用户入门和激活策略。","ja":"SaaSツールやマーケットプレイスプラットフォームに焦点を当てたカスタマーサクセスエージェントが、専門家によるユーザー起動およびアクティベーション戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"SaaS 도구 및 시장 플랫폼에 중점을 둔 고객 성공 에이전트에게 적합하며, 전문가급의 사용자 온보딩 및 활성화 전략이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de éxito del cliente centrados en herramientas SaaS y plataformas de mercado que necesitan estrategias de incorporación y activación de usuarios expertas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de réussite client axés sur les outils SaaS et les plateformes de marché ayant besoin de stratégies d''intégration et d''activation d''utilisateurs expertes.","de":"Ideal für Customer-Success-Agents, die sich auf SaaS-Tools und Marktplattformen konzentrieren und expertenmäßige Strategien für die Onboarding- und Aktivierungsphase von Benutzern benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sucesso do Cliente focados em ferramentas SaaS e plataformas de marketplace que necessitam de estratégias de ativação e onboardamento de usuários especializados.","ru":"Идеально для менеджеров по успеху клиентов, ориентированных на инструменты SaaS и платформы рынка, требующих экспертных стратегий онбординга и активации пользователей.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء نجاح العملاء الذين يركزون على أدوات SaaS ومنصات السوق التي تحتاج إلى استراتيجيات تنشيط وتسجيل دخول مستخدمين خبيرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to understand product context, define activation milestones, and implement tailored onboarding flows using core value propositions, ultimately driving long-term user retention and ''aha moments'' through optimized user journeys and habit formation.","zh":"赋予代理理解产品背景、定义激活里程碑并使用核心价值主张实施定制的入门流程，通过优化的用户旅程和习惯形成，最终实现长期用户留存和‘啊哈’时刻。","ja":"エージェントが製品の背景を理解し、アクティベーションの里程碑を定義し、コアバリュープロポジションを使用してカスタマイズされたオンボーディングフローを実施できるようにし、最適化されたユーザージャーニーと習慣形成を通じて、長期的なユーザーリテンションと『アハ！』の瞬間を実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 배경을 이해하고 활성화 里程碑를 정의하며 핵심 가치 제안을 사용하여 맞춤형 온보딩 흐름을 구현할 수 있도록 하여, 최적화된 사용자 여정 및 습관 형성을 통해 장기적인 사용자 유지 및 ''아하!'' 순간을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes comprender el contexto del producto, definir hitos de activación y implementar flujos de incorporación personalizados utilizando las propuestas de valor básicas, lo que en última instancia impulsa la retención de usuarios a largo plazo y los ''momentos aha'' a través de trayectorias de usuario optimizadas y la formación de hábitos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de comprendre le contexte du produit, de définir les jalons d''activation et de mettre en œuvre des flux d''intégration personnalisés en utilisant les propositions de valeur de base, ce qui impulse en fin de compte la rétention des utilisateurs à long terme et les ''moments aha'' à travers les parcours utilisateurs optimisés et la formation de l''habitude.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Produktkontext zu verstehen, Aktivierungsmeilensteine zu definieren und maßgeschneiderte Onboarding-Flows unter Verwendung der Kernwertvorschläge umzusetzen, was letztendlich die langfristige Benutzerrückhaltung und die ''Aha-Momente'' durch optimierte Benutzerreisen und die Ausbildung von Gewohnheiten antreibt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a entender o contexto do produto, definir marcos de ativação e implementar fluxos de onboardamento personalizados usando proposições de valor essenciais, impulsionando, em última análise, a retenção de usuários a longo prazo e ''momentos de aha'' por meio de jornadas de usuário otimizadas e formação de hábitos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью понимать контекст продукта, определять вехи активации и реализовывать адаптированные потоки онбординга с использованием основных ценностных предложений, в конечном итоге стимулируя долгосрочное удержание пользователей и ''моменты аха'' посредством оптимизированных пользовательских путей и формирования привычек.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فهم سياق المنتج وتحديد معالم التنشيط وتنفيذ تدفقات تسجيل دخول مخصصة باستخدام مقترحات قيمة أساسية، مما يدفع في النهاية إلى الاحتفاظ بالمستخدمين على المدى الطويل و ''لحظات أها'' من خلال رحلات المستخدم المُحسّنة وتكوين العادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining the ''aha moment'' for B2B and B2C products","Developing personalized onboarding sequences for SaaS tools and marketplaces","Analyzing product context to inform activation strategies"],"zh":["为B2B和B2C产品定义''啊哈''时刻","为SaaS工具和市场开发出个性化的入门序列","分析产品背景以指导激活策略"],"ja":["B2BおよびB2C製品の『アハ！』の瞬間を定義する","SaaSツールおよびマーケットプレイスプラットフォームのカスタマイズされたオンボーディングシーケンスを開発する","製品の背景を分析してアクティベーション戦略に情報を提供する"],"ko":["B2B 및 B2C 제품의 ''아하!'' 순간을 정의하는 것","SaaS 도구 및 시장 플랫폼을 위한 맞춤형 온보딩 시퀀스를 개발하는 것","제품 배경을 분석하여 활성화 전략에 정보를 제공하는 것"],"es":["Definir el ''momento aha'' para productos B2B y B2C","Desarrollar secuencias de incorporación personalizadas para herramientas SaaS y mercados","Analizar el contexto del producto para informar las estrategias de activación"],"fr":["Définir le ''moment aha'' pour les produits B2B et B2C","Développer des séquences d''intégration personnalisées pour les outils SaaS et les marchés","Analyser le contexte du produit pour éclairer les stratégies d''activation"],"de":["Definieren des ''Aha-Moments'' für B2B- und B2C-Produkte","Entwicklung personalisierter Onboarding-Sequenzen für SaaS-Tools und Märkte","Analyse des Produktkontexts, um Aktivierungsstrategien zu informieren"],"pt":["Definir o ''momento de aha'' para produtos B2B e B2C","Desenvolver sequências de onboardamento personalizadas para ferramentas SaaS e marketplaces","Analizar o contexto do produto para informar estratégias de ativação"],"ru":["Определить ''момент аха'' для продуктов B2B и B2C","Разработать индивидуальные последовательности онбординга для инструментов SaaS и рынков","Анализировать контекст продукта для информирования стратегий активации"],"ar":["تحديد ''لحظة أها'' لمنتجات بى بى و بى سى","تطوير تسلسلات تسجيل دخول مخصصة لأدوات SaaS ومنصات السوق","تحليل سياق المنتج لإبلاغ استراتيجيات التنشيط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of product-specific value propositions","Limited to digital products such as SaaS tools, apps, and marketplaces","Dependent on clear definition of activation milestones and ''aha moments''"],"zh":["需要了解产品特定的价值主张","仅限于数字产品，如SaaS工具、应用程序和市场","依赖于清晰的激活里程碑和''啊哈''时刻的定义"],"ja":["製品特有の価値提案を理解する必要がある","デジタル製品（SaaSツール、ｱﾌﾘｹｰｼョﾝ、ﾏｰｹｯﾄﾌﾟﾚｲｽなど）に限定される","明確に定義されたアクティベーションの里程碑と『アハ！』の瞬間に依存する"],"ko":["제품 특有的 가치 제안을 이해해야 함","디지털 제품(SaaS 도구, 애플리케이션, 시장 등)으로 제한됨","명확하게 정의된 활성화 里程碑 및 ''아하!'' 순간에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las propuestas de valor específicas del producto","Limitado a productos digitales como herramientas SaaS, aplicaciones y mercados","Dependiente de una definición clara de hitos de activación y ''momentos aha''"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des propositions de valeur spécifiques au produit","Limité aux produits numériques tels que les outils SaaS, les applications et les marchés","Dépendante d''une définition claire des jalons d''activation et des ''moments aha''"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis produktspezifischer Wertvorschläge","Begrenzt auf digitale Produkte wie SaaS-Tools, Apps und Märkte","Abhängig von einer klaren Definition von Aktivierungsmeilensteinen und ''Aha-Momenten''"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das proposições de valor específicas do produto","Limitado a produtos digitais, como ferramentas SaaS, aplicativos e marketplaces","Dependente da definição clara de marcos de ativação e ''momentos de aha''"],"ru":["Требует понимания специфических ценностных предложений продукта","Ограничен цифровыми продуктами, такими как инструменты SaaS, приложения и рынки","Зависит от четкого определения вех активации и ''моментов аха''"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مقترحات قيمة خاصة بالمنتج","محدود بالمنتجات الرقمية، مثل أدوات SaaS والتطبيقات ومنصات السوق","يعتمد على تعريف واضح لمعالم التنشيط و ''لحظات أها''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/upstash-qstash', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'upstash-qstash', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z', '2026-02-18T14:28:21.519Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/upstash-qstash","name":"upstash-qstash","description":{"zh":"Upstash QStash 是一个服务器无服务器消息队列，提供 HTTP 接口，实现可靠的消息传递","ja":"Upstash QStash はサーバーレス メッセージ キューで、HTTP インターフェイスを提供して信頼性の高いメッセージ傳達を実現","ko":"Upstash QStash는 서버리스 메시지 큐로서 HTTP 인터페이스를 제공하여 안정적인 메시지 전달을 실현","es":"Upstash QStash es una herramienta para construir sistemas de mensajería servidorless confiables. Proporciona una forma sencilla de programar llamadas HTTP para su ejecución posterior.","fr":"Upstash QStash est un outil pour construire des systèmes de messagerie serveurless fiables. Il offre un moyen simple de planifier des appels HTTP pour une exécution ultérieure.","de":"Upstash QStash ist ein Tool zum Aufbau zuverlässiger serverloser Messaging-Systeme. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, HTTP-Aufrufe für eine spätere Ausführung zu planen.","pt":"O Upstash QStash é uma solução de mensagens serverless que permite enviar mensagens HTTP de forma confiável e simples.","ru":"Upstash QStash - это решение для серверных сообщений, которое позволяет отправлять сообщения HTTP надежно и просто.","ar":"أبستاش كيستاش هو حل لرسائل الخادم الأقل التي يسمح بإرسال رسائل HTTP بطريقة موثوقة وسهلة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Upstash QStash 服务器无服务器消息队列","ja":"Upstash QStash サーバーレス メッセージ キュー","ko":"Upstash QStash 서버리스 메시지 큐","es":"Upstash QStash: Mensajería servidorless confiable","fr":"Upstash QStash : Messagerie serveurless fiable","de":"Upstash QStash: Zuverlässige serverlose Messaging","pt":"Upstash QStash: Mensagens Serverless Confiáveis","ru":"Upstash QStash: Надежные серверные сообщения","ar":"أبستاش كيستاش: رسائل خادوم أقل بدون إدارة البنية التحتية","en":"upstash-qstash"},"description":{"zh":"Upstash QStash 是一个服务器无服务器消息队列，提供 HTTP 接口，实现可靠的消息传递","ja":"Upstash QStash はサーバーレス メッセージ キューで、HTTP インターフェイスを提供して信頼性の高いメッセージ傳達を実現","ko":"Upstash QStash는 서버리스 메시지 큐로서 HTTP 인터페이스를 제공하여 안정적인 메시지 전달을 실현","es":"Upstash QStash es una herramienta para construir sistemas de mensajería servidorless confiables. Proporciona una forma sencilla de programar llamadas HTTP pa...","fr":"Upstash QStash est un outil pour construire des systèmes de messagerie serveurless fiables. Il offre un moyen simple de planifier des appels HTTP pour une ex...","de":"Upstash QStash ist ein Tool zum Aufbau zuverlässiger serverloser Messaging-Systeme. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, HTTP-Aufrufe für eine spätere Ausfüh...","pt":"O Upstash QStash é uma solução de mensagens serverless que permite enviar mensagens HTTP de forma confiável e simples.","ru":"Upstash QStash - это решение для серверных сообщений, которое позволяет отправлять сообщения HTTP надежно и просто.","ar":"أبستاش كيستاش هو حل لرسائل الخادم الأقل التي يسمح بإرسال رسائل HTTP بطريقة موثوقة وسهلة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["服务器无服务器架构","HTTP 接口","可靠的消息传递","支持 cron 作业","支持 webhook 投递"],"ja":["サーバーレス アーキテクチャ","HTTP インターフェイス","信頼性の高いメッセージ傳達","cron 作業のサポート","webhook 配信のサポート"],"ko":["서버리스 아키텍처","HTTP 인터페이스","안정적인 메시지 전달","cron 작업 지원","webhook 전달 지원"],"es":["Mensajería servidorless confiable","Programación de llamadas HTTP","Sin gestión de infraestructura","Entrega de webhooks confiable","Compatibilidad con cron jobs"],"fr":["Messagerie serveurless fiable","Planification d''appels HTTP","Pas de gestion d''infrastructure","Livraison de webhooks fiable","Compatibilité avec les tâches planifiées"],"de":["Zuverlässige serverlose Messaging","Planung von HTTP-Aufrufen","Keine Infrastrukturverwaltung","Zuverlässige Webhook-Lieferung","Kompatibilität mit geplanten Aufgaben"],"pt":["Entrega confiável de mensagens HTTP","Simplesidade na implementação","Suporte a agendamento de mensagens","Integração com webhooks","Sem gerenciamento de infraestrutura"],"ru":["Надежная доставка сообщений HTTP","Простота реализации","Поддержка планирования сообщений","Интеграция с вебхуками","Без управления инфраструктурой"],"ar":["تسليم موثوق لرسائل HTTP","بساطة في التنفيذ","دعم جدولة الرسائل","_integration مع الويب هوك","بدون إدارة البنية التحتية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["服务器无服务器消息队列","Upstash QStash","HTTP 接口","可靠的消息传递","cron 作业","webhook 投递"],"ja":["サーバーレス メッセージ キュー","Upstash QStash","HTTP インターフェイス","信頼性の高いメッセージ傳達","cron 作業","webhook 配信"],"ko":["서버리스 메시지 큐","Upstash QStash","HTTP 인터페이스","안정적인 메시지 전달","cron 작업","webhook 전달"],"es":["Upstash QStash","mensajería servidorless","programación de llamadas HTTP","entrega de webhooks","cron jobs","servidorless","messaging confiable"],"fr":["Upstash QStash","messagerie serveurless","planification d''appels HTTP","livraison de webhooks","tâches planifiées","serveurless","messagerie fiable"],"de":["Upstash QStash","serverlose Messaging","Planung von HTTP-Aufrufen","Webhook-Lieferung","geplante Aufgaben","serverlos","zuverlässige Messaging"],"pt":["mensagens serverless","Upstash QStash","entrega confiável","HTTP","desenvolvimento de software","soluções de mensagens"],"ru":["серверные сообщения","Upstash QStash","надежная доставка","HTTP","разработка программного обеспечения","решения для сообщений"],"ar":["رسائل الخادم الأقل","أبستاش كيستاش","تسليم موثوق","HTTP","تطوير البرمجيات","حلل لرسائل"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-qstash","description":"Upstash QStash expert for serverless message queues, scheduled jobs, and reliable HTTP-based task delivery without managing infrastructure. Use when: qstash, upstash queue, serverless cron, scheduled http, message queue serverless.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash QStash\n\nYou are an Upstash QStash expert who builds reliable serverless messaging\nwithout infrastructure management. You understand that QStash''s simplicity\nis its power - HTTP in, HTTP out, with reliability in between.\n\nYou''ve scheduled millions of messages, set up cron jobs that run for years,\nand built webhook delivery systems that never drop a message. You know that\nQStash shines when you need \"just make this HTTP call later, reliably.\"\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. HTTP is the univers","body":"# Upstash QStash\n\nYou are an Upstash QStash expert who builds reliable serverless messaging\nwithout infrastructure management. You understand that QStash''s simplicity\nis its power - HTTP in, HTTP out, with reliability in between.\n\nYou''ve scheduled millions of messages, set up cron jobs that run for years,\nand built webhook delivery systems that never drop a message. You know that\nQStash shines when you need \"just make this HTTP call later, reliably.\"\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. HTTP is the universal language - no c\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- qstash-messaging\n- scheduled-http-calls\n- serverless-cron\n- webhook-delivery\n- message-deduplication\n- callback-handling\n- delay-scheduling\n- url-groups\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Message Publishing\n\nSending messages to be delivered to endpoints\n\n### Scheduled Cron Jobs\n\nSetting up recurring scheduled tasks\n\n### Signature Verification\n\nVerifying QStash message signatures in your endpoint\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Skipping Signature Verification\n\n### ❌ Using Private Endpoints\n\n### ❌ No Error Handling in Endpoints\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Not verifying QStash webhook signatures | critical | # Always verify signatures with both keys: |\n| Callback endpoint taking too long to respond | high | # Design for fast acknowledgment: |\n| Hitting QStash rate limits unexpectedly | high | # Check your plan limits: |\n| Not using deduplication for critical operations | high | # Use deduplication for critical messages: |\n| Expecting QStash to reach private/localhost endpoints | critical | # Production requirements: |\n| Using default retry behavior for all message types | medium | # Configure retries per message: |\n| Sending large payloads instead of references | medium | # Send references, not data: |\n| Not using callback/failureCallback for critical flows | medium | # Use callbacks for critical operations: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `vercel-deployment`, `nextjs-app-router`, `redis-specialist`, `email-systems`, `supabase-backend`, `cloudflare-workers`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:28:21.519Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing reliable HTTP-based messaging without infrastructure management.","zh":"非常适合需要可靠的HTTP基于消息传递的无服务器代理，不需要基础设施管理。","ja":"インフラストラクチャの管理が不要な信頼性の高いHTTPベースのメッセージングを必要とするサーバーレスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"인프라 관리가 필요 없는 신뢰할 수 있는 HTTP 기반 메시징이 필요한 서버리스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes sin servidor que necesitan mensajería basada en HTTP confiable sin administración de infraestructura.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents sans serveur ayant besoin d''une messagerie fiable basée sur HTTP sans gestion d''infrastructure.","de":"Perfekt für Serverless-Agents, die zuverlässige HTTP-basierte Messaging ohne Infrastrukturverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Serverless que precisam de mensagens baseadas em HTTP confiáveis sem gerenciamento de infraestrutura.","ru":"Идеально для серверных агентов, которым требуются надежные сообщения на основе HTTP без управления инфраструктурой.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الخادم ألاسيرفرلس الذي يحتاج إلى رسائل موثوقة تعتمد على بروتوكول HTTP دون إدارة البنية التحتية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to schedule millions of messages with reliability, utilizing HTTP in and out protocols, and setting up cron jobs for long-term execution, making it ideal for building webhook delivery systems that guarantee message delivery using Upstash QStash.","zh":"赋予代理人以可靠性调度数百万条消息的能力，利用HTTP入出协议，并设置cron作业以进行长期执行，使其成为使用Upstash QStash保证消息传递的webhook传递系统的理想选择。","ja":"エージェントは数百万のメッセージを信頼性を持ってスケジュールし、HTTPの入出プロトコルを利用し、cronジョブを設定して長期的な実行を行うことができ、Upstash QStashを使用したWebhook配信システムの構築に最適です。","ko":"에이전트가 수백만 개의 메시지를 신뢰성 있게 예약할 수 있으며, HTTP 입출력 프로토콜을 사용하고 cron 작업을 설정하여 장기 실행을 수행할 수 있으므로 Upstash QStash를 사용하여 메시지 전달을 보장하는 웹 훅 전송 시스템을 구축하는 데理想적입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a programar millones de mensajes de forma confiable, utilizando protocolos HTTP de entrada y salida, y configurando trabajos cron para la ejecución a largo plazo, lo que la hace ideal para construir sistemas de entrega de webhooks que garanticen la entrega de mensajes mediante Upstash QStash.","fr":"Permet aux agents de planifier des millions de messages de manière fiable, en utilisant les protocoles HTTP entrants et sortants, et en configurant des tâches cron pour l''exécution à long terme, ce qui en fait un outil idéal pour la construction de systèmes de livraison de webhooks qui garantissent la livraison des messages à l''aide d''Upstash QStash.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Millionen von Nachrichten zuverlässig zu planen, indem HTTP-Protokolle für Ein- und Ausgaben verwendet werden und Cron-Jobs für die langfristige Ausführung eingerichtet werden, was es ideal für den Aufbau von Webhook-LieferSystemen macht, die die Zustellung von Nachrichten mit Upstash QStash garantieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a agendar milhões de mensagens com confiabilidade, utilizando protocolos HTTP de entrada e saída, e configurando trabalhos cron para execução de longo prazo, tornando-o ideal para construir sistemas de entrega de webhooks que garantam a entrega de mensagens usando Upstash QStash.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью планировать миллионы сообщений с надежностью, используя входящие и исходящие протоколы HTTP, и настраивать задания cron для долгосрочного выполнения, что делает его идеальным для построения систем доставки веб-хуков, которые гарантируют доставку сообщений с помощью Upstash QStash.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على جدولة ملايين الرسائل مع الموثوقية، باستخدام بروتوكولات HTTP للوصول والخروج، وضبط مهام الكرون للتنفيذ على المدى الطويل، مما يجعله مثاليًا لبناء أنظمة تسليم الويب هوك التي تضمن تسليم الرسائل باستخدام Upstash QStash."},"useCases":{"en":["Scheduling millions of messages for delayed delivery","Setting up cron jobs for long-term automated tasks","Building webhook delivery systems with guaranteed message reliability"],"zh":["延迟传递数百万条消息的调度","设置cron作业以进行长期自动化任务","使用Upstash QStash构建具有保证的消息可靠性的webhook传递系统"],"ja":["数百万のメッセージを遅延配信するためのスケジューリング","長期的な自動化タスクのためのcronジョブの設定","Upstash QStashを使用したメッセージ配信保証のあるWebhook配信システムの構築"],"ko":["지연 전달을 위한 수백만 개의 메시지 예약","장기 자동화 작업을 위한 cron 작업 설정","Upstash QStash를 사용하여 메시지 전달을 보장하는 웹 훅 전송 시스템 구축"],"es":["Programar millones de mensajes para entrega retrasada","Configurar trabajos cron para tareas automatizadas a largo plazo","Construir sistemas de entrega de webhooks con confiabilidad garantizada de los mensajes"],"fr":["Planifier des millions de messages pour une livraison différée","Configurer des tâches cron pour des tâches automatisées à long terme","Construire des systèmes de livraison de webhooks avec une fiabilité garantie des messages"],"de":["Millionen von Nachrichten für eine verzögerte Zustellung planen","Cron-Jobs für langfristige automatisierte Aufgaben einrichten","Webhook-LieferSysteme mit garantierter Nachrichten-Zuverlässigkeit aufbauen"],"pt":["Agendamento de milhões de mensagens para entrega atrasada","Configuração de trabalhos cron para tarefas automatizadas de longo prazo","Construção de sistemas de entrega de webhooks com confiabilidade garantida de mensagens"],"ru":["Планирование миллионов сообщений для отложенной доставки","Настройка заданий cron для автоматических задач долгосрочного выполнения","Построение систем доставки веб-хуков с гарантированной надежностью доставки сообщений"],"ar":["جدولة ملايين الرسائل لل تسليم المؤجل","ضبط مهام الكرون للمهام التلقائية على المدى الطويل","بناء أنظمة تسليم الويب هوك مع ضمان موثوقية تسليم الرسائل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Upstash QStash account","Dependent on HTTP protocol for messaging"],"zh":["需要Upstash QStash账户","依赖于HTTP协议进行消息传递"],"ja":["Upstash QStashアカウントが必要","メッセージングにHTTPプロトコルに依存"],"ko":["Upstash QStash 계정이 필요합니다.","메시지 전송에 HTTP 프로토콜에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Upstash QStash","Dependiente del protocolo HTTP para la mensajería"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Upstash QStash","Dépendant du protocole HTTP pour la messagerie"],"de":["Benötigt ein Upstash QStash-Konto","Von dem HTTP-Protokoll für die Messaging abhängig"],"pt":["Exige conta Upstash QStash","Dependente do protocolo HTTP para mensagens"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Upstash QStash","Зависит от протокола HTTP для обмена сообщениями"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Upstash QStash","يعتمد على بروتوكول HTTP للرسائل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
