tion pour réduire la friction et augmenter les taux d''achèvement","de":"Optimieren Sie Ihre Registrierflüsse, um die Reibung zu reduzieren und die Abschlussraten zu erhöhen","pt":"Otimização de fluxo de cadastro para reduzir fricção e aumentar taxas de conclusão","ru":"Оптимизация потока регистрации для снижения трения и увеличения показателей завершения","ar":"تحسين تدفق التسجيل لتقليل الاحتكاك وزيادة معدلات الإكمال","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["减少注册流程中的步骤","优化注册表单字段","提高注册完成率","设置成功激活"],"ja":["サインアップフローのステップを減らす","サインアップフォームのフィールドを最適化する","サインアップ完了率を向上させる","成功的なアクティブ化を設定する"],"ko":["등록 흐름의 단계를 줄이기","등록 양식 필드를 최적화하기","등록 완료율을 높이기","성공적인 활성화를 설정하기"],"es":["Análisis de flujo de registro","Optimización de formulario","Reducción de la fricción","Aumento de las tasas de finalización","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Analyse du flux d''inscription","Optimisation du formulaire","Réduction de la friction","Augmentation des taux d''achèvement","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Analyse des Registrierflusses","Optimierung des Formulars","Reduzierung der Reibung","Erhöhung der Abschlussraten","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Análise de fluxo de cadastro","Otimização de campos obrigatórios","Redução de etapas","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Aumento das taxas de conclusão"],"ru":["Анализ потока регистрации","Оптимизация обязательных полей","Сокращение количества шагов","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Увеличение показателей завершения"],"ar":["تحليل تدفق التسجيل","تحسين الحقول الإلزامية","تقليل عدد الخطوات","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","زيادة معدلات الإكمال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["注册流优化","减少用户流失","提高完成率","成功激活","开发者工具","用户体验"],"ja":["サインアップフロー最適化","ユーザーの流失を減らす","完了率を向上させる","成功的なアクティブ化","開発者ツール","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["등록 흐름 최적화","사용자 이탈 줄이기","완료율 높이기","성공적인 활성화","개발자 도구","사용자 경험"],"es":["flujo de registro","optimización de registro","CRO","experiencia del usuario","formulario de registro","reducción de la fricción"],"fr":["flux d''inscription","optimisation d''inscription","CRO","expérience utilisateur","formulaire d''inscription","réduction de la friction"],"de":["Registrierfluss","Optimierung des Registrierens","CRO","Benutzererfahrung","Registrierformular","Reduzierung der Reibung"],"pt":["otimização de fluxo de cadastro","redução de fricção","aumento de taxas de conclusão","experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento web","fluxo de cadastro"],"ru":["оптимизация потока регистрации","снижение трения","увеличение показателей завершения","пользовательский опыт","веб-разработка","поток регистрации"],"ar":["تحسين تدفق التسجيل","تقليل الاحتكاك","زيادة معدلات الإكمال","تجربة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","تدفق التسجيل"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"signup-flow-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize signup, registration, account creation, or trial activation flows. Also use when the user mentions signup conversions, registration friction, signup form optimization, free trial signup, reduce signup dropoff, or account creation flow. For post-signup onboarding, see onboarding-cro. For lead capture forms (not account creation), see form-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Signup Flow CRO\n\nYou are an expert in optimizing signup and registration flows. Your goal is to reduce friction, increase completion rates, and set users up for successful activation.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Flow Type**\n   - Free trial signup\n   - Freemium account creation\n   - Paid account creation\n   - Waitlist/early access signup\n   - B2B vs B2C\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - How many steps/screens?\n   - What fields are required?\n   - What''s t","body":"# Signup Flow CRO\n\nYou are an expert in optimizing signup and registration flows. Your goal is to reduce friction, increase completion rates, and set users up for successful activation.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Flow Type**\n   - Free trial signup\n   - Freemium account creation\n   - Paid account creation\n   - Waitlist/early access signup\n   - B2B vs B2C\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - How many steps/screens?\n   - What fields are required?\n   - What''s the current completion rate?\n   - Where do users drop off?\n\n3. **Business Constraints**\n   - What data is genuinely needed at signup?\n   - Are there compliance requirements?\n   - What happens immediately after signup?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Minimize Required Fields\nEvery field reduces conversion. For each field, ask:\n- Do we absolutely need this before they can use the product?\n- Can we collect this later through progressive profiling?\n- Can we infer this from other data?\n\n**Typical field priority:**\n- Essential: Email (or phone), Password\n- Often needed: Name\n- Usually deferrable: Company, Role, Team size, Phone, Address\n\n### 2. Show Value Before Asking for Commitment\n- What can you show/give before requiring signup?\n- Can they experience the product before creating an account?\n- Reverse the order: value first, signup second\n\n### 3. Reduce Perceived Effort\n- Show progress if multi-step\n- Group related fields\n- Use smart defaults\n- Pre-fill when possible\n\n### 4. Remove Uncertainty\n- Clear expectations (\"Takes 30 seconds\")\n- Show what happens after signup\n- No surprises (hidden requirements, unexpected steps)\n\n---\n\n## Field-by-Field Optimization\n\n### Email Field\n- Single field (no email confirmation field)\n- Inline validation for format\n- Check for common typos (gmial.com → gmail.com)\n- Clear error messages\n\n### Password Field\n- Show password toggle (eye icon)\n- Show requirements upfront, not after failure\n- Consider passphrase hints for strength\n- Update requirement indicators in real-time\n\n**Better password UX:**\n- Allow paste (don''t disable)\n- Show strength meter instead of rigid rules\n- Consider passwordless options\n\n### Name Field\n- Single \"Full name\" field vs. First/Last split (test this)\n- Only require if immediately used (personalization)\n- Consider making optional\n\n### Social Auth Options\n- Place prominently (often higher conversion than email)\n- Show most relevant options for your audience\n  - B2C: Google, Apple, Facebook\n  - B2B: Google, Microsoft, SSO\n- Clear visual separation from email signup\n- Consider \"Sign up with Google\" as primary\n\n### Phone Number\n- Defer unless essential (SMS verification, calling leads)\n- If required, explain why\n- Use proper input type with country code handling\n- Format as they type\n\n### Company/Organization\n- Defer if possible\n- Auto-suggest as they type\n- Infer from email domain when possible\n\n### Use Case / Role Questions\n- Defer to onboarding if possible\n- If needed at signup, keep to one question\n- Use progressive disclosure (don''t show all options at once)\n\n---\n\n## Single-Step vs. Multi-Step\n\n### Single-Step Works When:\n- 3 or fewer fields\n- Simple B2C products\n- High-intent visitors (from ads, waitlist)\n\n### Multi-Step Works When:\n- More than 3-4 fields needed\n- Complex B2B products needing segmentation\n- You need to collect different types of info\n\n### Multi-Step Best Practices\n- Show progress indicator\n- Lead with easy questions (name, email)\n- Put harder questions later (after psychological commitment)\n- Each step should feel completable in seconds\n- Allow back navigation\n- Save progress (don''t lose data on refresh)\n\n**Progressive commitment pattern:**\n1. Email only (lowest barrier)\n2. Password + name\n3. Customization questions (optional)\n\n---\n\n## Trust and Friction Reduction\n\n### At the Form Level\n- \"No credit card required\" (if true)\n- \"Free forever\" or \"14-day free trial\"\n- Privacy note: \"We''ll never share your email\"\n- Security badges if relevant\n- Testimonial near signup form\n\n### Error Handling\n- Inline validation (not just on submit)\n- Specific error messages (\"Email already registered\" + recovery path)\n- Don''t clear the form on error\n- Focus on the problem field\n\n### Microcopy\n- Placeholder text: Use for examples, not labels\n- Labels: Always visible (not just placeholders)\n- Help text: Only when needed, placed close to field\n\n---\n\n## Mobile Signup Optimization\n\n- Larger touch targets (44px+ height)\n- Appropriate keyboard types (email, tel, etc.)\n- Autofill support\n- Reduce typing (social auth, pre-fill)\n- Single column layout\n- Sticky CTA button\n- Test with actual devices\n\n---\n\n## Post-Submit Experience\n\n### Success State\n- Clear confirmation\n- Immediate next step\n- If email verification required:\n  - Explain what to do\n  - Easy resend option\n  - Check spam reminder\n  - Option to change email if wrong\n\n### Verification Flows\n- Consider delaying verification until necessary\n- Magic link as alternative to password\n- Let users explore while awaiting verification\n- Clear re-engagement if verification stalls\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- Form start rate (landed → started filling)\n- Form completion rate (started → submitted)\n- Field-level drop-off (which fields lose people)\n- Time to complete\n- Error rate by field\n- Mobile vs. desktop completion\n\n### What to Track\n- Each field interaction (focus, blur, error)\n- Step progression in multi-step\n- Social auth vs. email signup ratio\n- Time between steps\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Findings\nFor each issue found:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: Why it matters (with estimated impact if possible)\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Recommended Changes\nOrganized by:\n1. Quick wins (same-day fixes)\n2. High-impact changes (week-level effort)\n3. Test hypotheses (things to A/B test)\n\n### Form Redesign (if requested)\n- Recommended field set with rationale\n- Field order\n- Copy for labels, placeholders, buttons, errors\n- Visual layout suggestions\n\n---\n\n## Common Signup Flow Patterns\n\n### B2B SaaS Trial\n1. Email + Password (or Google auth)\n2. Name + Company (optional: role)\n3. → Onboarding flow\n\n### B2C App\n1. Google/Apple auth OR Email\n2. → Product experience\n3. Profile completion later\n\n### Waitlist/Early Access\n1. Email only\n2. Optional: Role/use case question\n3. → Waitlist confirmation\n\n### E-commerce Account\n1. Guest checkout as default\n2. Account creation optional post-purchase\n3. OR Social auth with single click\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Form Design Experiments\n\n**Layout & Structure**\n- Single-step vs. multi-step signup flow\n- Multi-step with progress bar vs. without\n- 1-column vs. 2-column field layout\n- Form embedded on page vs. separate signup page\n- Horizontal vs. vertical field alignment\n\n**Field Optimization**\n- Reduce to minimum fields (email + password only)\n- Add or remove phone number field\n- Single \"Name\" field vs. \"First/Last\" split\n- Add or remove company/organization field\n- Test required vs. optional field balance\n\n**Authentication Options**\n- Add SSO options (Google, Microsoft, GitHub, LinkedIn)\n- SSO prominent vs. email form prominent\n- Test which SSO options resonate (varies by audience)\n- SSO-only vs. SSO + email option\n\n**Visual Design**\n- Test button colors and sizes for CTA prominence\n- Plain background vs. product-related visuals\n- Test form container styling (card vs. minimal)\n- Mobile-optimized layout testing\n\n---\n\n### Copy & Messaging Experiments\n\n**Headlines & CTAs**\n- Test headline variations above signup form\n- CTA button text: \"Create Account\" vs. \"Start Free Trial\" vs. \"Get Started\"\n- Add clarity around trial length in CTA\n- Test value proposition emphasis in form header\n\n**Microcopy**\n- Field labels: minimal vs. descriptive\n- Placeholder text optimization\n- Error message clarity and tone\n- Password requirement display (upfront vs. on error)\n\n**Trust Elements**\n- Add social proof next to signup form\n- Test trust badges near form (security, compliance)\n- Add \"No credit card required\" messaging\n- Include privacy assurance copy\n\n---\n\n### Trial & Commitment Experiments\n\n**Free Trial Variations**\n- Credit card required vs. not required for trial\n- Test trial length impact (7 vs. 14 vs. 30 days)\n- Freemium vs. free trial model\n- Trial with limited features vs. full access\n\n**Friction Points**\n- Email verification required vs. delayed vs. removed\n- Test CAPTCHA impact on completion\n- Terms acceptance checkbox vs. implicit acceptance\n- Phone verification for high-value accounts\n\n---\n\n### Post-Submit Experiments\n\n- Clear next steps messaging after signup\n- Instant product access vs. email confirmation first\n- Personalized welcome message based on signup data\n- Auto-login after signup vs. require login\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What''s your current signup completion rate?\n2. Do you have field-level analytics on drop-off?\n3. What data is absolutely required before they can use the product?\n4. Are there compliance or verification requirements?\n5. What happens immediately after signup?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **onboarding-cro**: For optimizing what happens after signup\n- **form-cro**: For non-signup forms (lead capture, contact)\n- **page-cro**: For the landing page leading to signup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing signup flow changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:28:33.019Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversion Rate Optimization Agents needing advanced signup flow analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级注册流分析和优化能力的转化率优化代理","ja":"登録フロー分析と最適化機能の高度なニーズを持つコンバージョンレート最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 등록 흐름 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 전환률 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de tasas de conversión que necesitan un análisis y capacidades de optimización de flujo de registro avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation du taux de conversion ayant besoin d''une analyse et de capacités d''optimisation de flux d''inscription avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Conversion Rate Optimization-Agents, die eine erweiterte Analyse und Optimierungsfunktionen für Registrierungsflüsse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão que necessitam de análise e otimização avançadas do fluxo de inscrição.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации потока регистрации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتاجين إلى تحليل وتحسين متقدمين لتدفق التسجيل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to reduce friction and increase completion rates in signup flows by analyzing flow types, such as free trial signup, freemium account creation, and paid account creation, and optimizing fields and steps for B2B and B2C applications using protocols like HTTPS and HTML forms.","zh":"通过分析注册流类型（如免费试用注册、免费版账户创建和付费账户创建），并使用HTTPS和HTML表单等协议优化B2B和B2C应用中的字段和步骤，赋予代理减少注册流程中的阻力并提高完成率的能力","ja":"フリートライアル登録、フリーミアムアカウント作成、有料アカウント作成などのフロー種別を分析し、HTTPSやHTMLフォームなどのプロトコルを使用してB2BおよびB2Cアプリケーションのフィールドやステップを最適化することで、代理は登録フローの摩擦を減らし、完了率を向上させることができる","ko":"프리 트라이얼 가입, 프리미엄 계정 생성, 유료 계정 생성 등의 흐름 유형을 분석하고 HTTPS 및 HTML 폼 등을 사용하여 B2B 및 B2C 애플리케이션의 필드와 단계를 최적화하여 에이전트가 가입 흐름의 마찰을 줄이고 완료率를提高할 수 있는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a reducir la fricción y aumentar las tasas de finalización en los flujos de registro analizando los tipos de flujos, como el registro de prueba gratuita, la creación de cuentas freemium y la creación de cuentas de pago, y optimizando campos y pasos para aplicaciones B2B y B2C que utilizan protocolos como HTTPS y formularios HTML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réduire les frictions et d''augmenter les taux d''achèvement dans les flux d''inscription en analysant les types de flux, tels que l''inscription à l''essai gratuit, la création de comptes freemium et la création de comptes payants, et en optimisant les champs et les étapes pour les applications B2B et B2C utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTPS et les formulaires HTML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Reibung in den Registrierungsflüssen zu reduzieren und die Abschlussraten zu erhöhen, indem sie Flusstypen wie kostenlose Testregistrierung, Erstellung von Freemium-Konten und Erstellung von kostenpflichtigen Konten analysieren und Felder und Schritte für B2B- und B2C-Anwendungen mit Protokollen wie HTTPS und HTML-Formularen optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reduzir a fricção e aumentar as taxas de conclusão nos fluxos de inscrição, analisando os tipos de fluxo, como inscrição para teste gratuito, criação de conta freemium e criação de conta paga, e otimizando campos e etapas para aplicações B2B e B2C usando protocolos como HTTPS e formulários HTML.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сократить трение и повысить уровень завершения потоков регистрации, анализируя типы потоков, такие как регистрация на бесплатную пробную версию, создание аккаунта фриميума и создание платного аккаунта, и оптимизируя поля и шаги для приложений B2B и B2C с использованием протоколов như HTTPS и HTML-форм.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقليل الاحتكاك وزيادة معدلات الإكمال في تدفقات التسجيل من خلال تحليل أنواع التدفقات، مثل التسجيل المجاني، وإنشاء حساب الفريميوم، وإنشاء الحساب المدفوع، وتحسين الحقول والخطوات لتنطبق على تطبيقات العمل للعمل و العمل لل客户 باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS وأشكال HTML."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing and optimizing free trial signup flows for increased conversion","Streamlining freemium account creation processes for better user activation","Debugging paid account creation flows to reduce friction and increase completion rates"],"zh":["分析和优化免费试用注册流程以提高转化率","简化免费版账户创建流程以提高用户激活度","调试付费账户创建流程以减少阻力和提高完成率"],"ja":["フリートライアル登録フローの分析と最適化によるコンバージョン率の向上","フリーミアムアカウント作成プロセスの簡素化によるユーザー活性化の向上","有料アカウント作成フローのデバッグによる摩擦の軽減と完了率の向上"],"ko":["무료 트라이얼 가입 흐름을 분석하고 최적화하여 전환률을提高","프리미엄 계정 생성 프로세스를 간소화하여 사용자 활성화를提高","유료 계정 생성 흐름을 디버깅하여 마찰을 줄이고 완료율을提高"],"es":["Analizar y optimizar los flujos de registro de prueba gratuita para aumentar la conversión","Optimizar los procesos de creación de cuentas freemium para una mejor activación del usuario","Depurar los flujos de creación de cuentas de pago para reducir la fricción y aumentar las tasas de finalización"],"fr":["Analyser et optimiser les flux d''inscription à l''essai gratuit pour augmenter la conversion","Optimiser les processus de création de comptes freemium pour une meilleure activation des utilisateurs","Déboguer les flux de création de comptes payants pour réduire les frictions et augmenter les taux d''achèvement"],"de":["Analysieren und optimieren von kostenlosen Testregistrierungsflüssen zur Erhöhung der Konversion","Optimieren der Erstellungsprozesse für Freemium-Konten zur besseren Aktivierung der Benutzer","Debuggen der Erstellungsflüsse für kostenpflichtige Konten, um die Reibung zu reduzieren und die Abschlussraten zu erhöhen"],"pt":["Analisar e otimizar fluxos de inscrição para teste gratuito para aumentar a conversão","Otimizar processos de criação de contas freemium para melhor ativação do usuário","Depurar fluxos de criação de contas pagas para reduzir a fricção e aumentar as taxas de conclusão"],"ru":["Анализ и оптимизация потоков регистрации на бесплатную пробную версию для увеличения конверсии","Оптимизация процессов создания аккаунтов фримиума для лучшей активации пользователей","Отладка потоков создания платных аккаунтов для сокращения трения и повышения уровня завершения"],"ar":["تحليل وتحسين تدفقات التسجيل المجانية لزيادة التحويل","تحسين عمليات إنشاء حسابات الفريميوم لتنشيط المستخدمين بشكل أفضل","تصحيح أخطاء تدفقات إنشاء الحسابات المدفوعة لتقليل الاحتكاك وزيادة معدلات الإكمال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of flow types and current state of signup flows","Limited to optimizing signup flows, not applicable to general user experience optimization"],"zh":["需要了解注册流类型和当前注册流的状态","仅限于优化注册流程，不适用于一般的用户体验优化"],"ja":["フロー種別と現在の登録フローの状態を理解する必要がある","登録フローの最適化のみに適用され、一般的なユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化には適用できない"],"ko":["흐름 유형과 현재 가입 흐름의 상태를 이해해야 함","가입 흐름 최적화에만 적용되며 일반적인 사용자 경험 최적화에는 적용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los tipos de flujos y del estado actual de los flujos de registro","Limitado a la optimización de flujos de registro, no aplicable a la optimización general de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des types de flux et de l''état actuel des flux d''inscription","Limité à l''optimisation des flux d''inscription, non applicable à l''optimisation générale de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis für die Flusstypen und den aktuellen Zustand der Registrierungsflüsse","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von Registrierungsflüssen, nicht anwendbar auf die allgemeine Optimierung der Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos tipos de fluxo e do estado atual dos fluxos de inscrição","Limitado à otimização de fluxos de inscrição, não se aplica à otimização geral da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Требует понимания типов потоков и текущего состояния потоков регистрации","Ограничен оптимизацией потоков регистрации, не применимо к общей оптимизации пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لأنواع التدفقات وحالة التدفقات الحالية للتسجيل","محدود بتحسين تدفقات التسجيل، لا ينطبق على تحسين تجربة المستخدم بشكل عام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
