lack","ru":"Конструктор Slack-ботов","ar":"بناء بوت سلاك","en":"slack-bot-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Slack Bot Builder是一个用于构建Slack机器人的框架，提供了事件处理、安全检查和请求验证等功能","ja":"Slack Bot BuilderはSlackボットを構築するためのフレームワークで、イベントハンドリング、セキュリティチェック、リクエスト検証などを提供","ko":"Slack Bot Builder는 Slack 봇을 구축하기 위한 프레임워크로 이벤트 처리, 보안 확인 및 요청 검증 등을 제공","es":"Bolt App es el framework recomendado por Slack para desarrollar aplicaciones, permitiendo la creación de bots de manera sencilla y segura","fr":"Bolt App est le framework recommandé par Slack pour développer des applications, permettant la création de bots de manière simple et sécurisée","de":"Bolt App ist das von Slack empfohlene Framework für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen, ermöglicht die Erstellung von Bots auf einfache und sichere Weise","pt":"O Slack Bot Builder é uma ferramenta para criar bots personalizados para o Slack. Ele utiliza o framework Bolt para lidar com autenticação e processamento de...","ru":"Slack Bot Builder — это инструмент для создания индивидуальных ботов для Slack. Он использует фреймворк Bolt для обработки аутентификации и событий.","ar":"أداة بناء بوت سلاك هي أداة لإنشاء بوتات مخصصة لمنصة سلاك. تستخدم إطار العمل بولت لمعالجة المصادقة ومعالجة الأحداث.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["事件处理","安全检查","请求验证","组织化的代码结构","支持Python、JavaScript和Java"],"ja":["イベントハンドリング","セキュリティチェック","リクエスト検証","組織化されたコード構造","Python、JavaScript、Javaをサポート"],"ko":["이벤트 처리","보안 확인","요청 검증","조직화된 코드 구조","Python, JavaScript, Java 지원"],"es":["Manejo de eventos en pocas líneas de código","Verificación de seguridad y validación de payload integradas","Patrones organizados y consistentes","Compatible con experimentos y producción","Disponible en Python, JavaScript (Node.js) y Java"],"fr":["Gestion d''événements en quelques lignes de code","Vérification de sécurité et validation de payload intégrées","Modèles organisés et cohérents","Compatible avec les expériences et la production","Disponible en Python, JavaScript (Node.js) et Java"],"de":["Ereignishandling in wenigen Codezeilen","Sicherheitsprüfungen und Payload-Validierung integriert","Organisierte und konsistente Muster","Kompatibel mit Experimenten und Produktion","Verfügbar in Python, JavaScript (Node.js) und Java"],"pt":["Tratamento de eventos em poucas linhas de código","Verificação de segurança e validação de carga útil integradas","Padrões organizados e consistentes","Funciona para experimentos e produção","Disponível em Python, JavaScript (Node.js) e Java"],"ru":["Обработка событий в несколько строк кода","Встроенные проверки безопасности и валидация полезной нагрузки","Организованные и последовательные шаблоны","Работает для экспериментов и производства","Доступно на Python, JavaScript (Node.js) и Java"],"ar":["معالجة الأحداث في بضع سطور من الكود","التحقق من الأمان والتحقق من صحة الحمولة المدمجة","أنماط منظمّة ومتسقّة","يعمل للاختبارات والإنتاج","متوفر على Python وJavaScript (Node.js) وJava"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slack Bot Builder","Slack机器人","事件处理","安全检查","请求验证","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"ja":["Slack Bot Builder","Slackボット","イベントハンドリング","セキュリティチェック","リクエスト検証","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"ko":["Slack Bot Builder","Slack 봇","이벤트 처리","보안 확인","요청 검증","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"es":["constructor de bots de Slack","Bolt App","desarrollo de aplicaciones de Slack","framework de Slack","creación de bots de Slack","seguridad de aplicaciones de Slack","desarrollo de aplicaciones en Python","desarrollo de aplicaciones en JavaScript","desarrollo de aplicaciones en Java"],"fr":["constructeur de bots Slack","Bolt App","développement d''applications Slack","framework Slack","création de bots Slack","sécurité des applications Slack","développement d''applications en Python","développement d''applications en JavaScript","développement d''applications en Java"],"de":["Slack-Bot-Builder","Bolt App","Entwicklung von Slack-Anwendungen","Slack-Framework","Erstellung von Slack-Bots","Sicherheit von Slack-Anwendungen","Entwicklung von Anwendungen in Python","Entwicklung von Anwendungen in JavaScript","Entwicklung von Anwendungen in Java"],"pt":["Slack Bot Builder","framework Bolt","desenvolvimento de bots","autenticação no Slack","processamento de eventos no Slack","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"ru":["Slack Bot Builder","фреймворк Bolt","разработка ботов","аутентификация в Slack","обработка событий в Slack","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"ar":["بناء بوت سلاك","إطار العمل بولت","تطوير البوتات","المصادقة على منصة سلاك","معالجة الأحداث على منصة سلاك","Python","JavaScript","Java"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-bot-builder","description":"Build Slack apps using the Bolt framework across Python, JavaScript, and Java. Covers Block Kit for rich UIs, interactive components, slash commands, event handling, OAuth installation flows, and Workflow Builder integration. Focus on best practices for production-ready Slack apps. Use when: slack bot, slack app, bolt framework, block kit, slash command.","bodyPreview":"# Slack Bot Builder\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Bolt App Foundation Pattern\n\nThe Bolt framework is Slack''s recommended approach for building apps.\nIt handles authentication, event routing, request verification, and\nHTTP request processing so you can focus on app logic.\n\nKey benefits:\n- Event handling in a few lines of code\n- Security checks and payload validation built-in\n- Organized, consistent patterns\n- Works for experiments and production\n\nAvailable in: Python, JavaScript (Node.js), Java\n\n\n**When to u","body":"# Slack Bot Builder\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Bolt App Foundation Pattern\n\nThe Bolt framework is Slack''s recommended approach for building apps.\nIt handles authentication, event routing, request verification, and\nHTTP request processing so you can focus on app logic.\n\nKey benefits:\n- Event handling in a few lines of code\n- Security checks and payload validation built-in\n- Organized, consistent patterns\n- Works for experiments and production\n\nAvailable in: Python, JavaScript (Node.js), Java\n\n\n**When to use**: [''Starting any new Slack app'', ''Migrating from legacy Slack APIs'', ''Building production Slack integrations'']\n\n```python\n# Python Bolt App\nfrom slack_bolt import App\nfrom slack_bolt.adapter.socket_mode import SocketModeHandler\nimport os\n\n# Initialize with tokens from environment\napp = App(\n    token=os.environ[\"SLACK_BOT_TOKEN\"],\n    signing_secret=os.environ[\"SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET\"]\n)\n\n# Handle messages containing \"hello\"\n@app.message(\"hello\")\ndef handle_hello(message, say):\n    \"\"\"Respond to messages containing ''hello''.\"\"\"\n    user = message[\"user\"]\n    say(f\"Hey there <@{user}>!\")\n\n# Handle slash command\n@app.command(\"/ticket\")\ndef handle_ticket_command(ack, body, client):\n    \"\"\"Handle /ticket slash command.\"\"\"\n    # Acknowledge immediately (within 3 seconds)\n    ack()\n\n    # Open a modal for ticket creation\n    client.views_open(\n        trigger_id=body[\"trigger_id\"],\n        view={\n            \"type\": \"modal\",\n            \"callback_id\": \"ticket_modal\",\n            \"title\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Create Ticket\"},\n            \"submit\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Submit\"},\n            \"blocks\": [\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"input\",\n                    \"block_id\": \"title_block\",\n                    \"element\": {\n                        \"type\": \"plain_text_input\",\n                        \"action_id\": \"title_input\"\n                    },\n                    \"label\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Title\"}\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"input\",\n                    \"block_id\": \"desc_block\",\n                    \"element\": {\n                        \"type\": \"plain_text_input\",\n                        \"multiline\": True,\n                        \"action_id\": \"desc_input\"\n                    },\n                    \"label\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Description\"}\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"input\",\n                    \"block_id\": \"priority_block\",\n                    \"element\": {\n                        \"type\": \"static_select\",\n                        \"action_id\": \"priority_select\",\n   \n```\n\n### Block Kit UI Pattern\n\nBlock Kit is Slack''s UI framework for building rich, interactive messages.\nCompose messages using blocks (sections, actions, inputs) and elements\n(buttons, menus, text inputs).\n\nLimits:\n- Up to 50 blocks per message\n- Up to 100 blocks in modals/Home tabs\n- Block text limited to 3000 characters\n\nUse Block Kit Builder to prototype: https://app.slack.com/block-kit-builder\n\n\n**When to use**: [''Building rich message layouts'', ''Adding interactive components to messages'', ''Creating forms in modals'', ''Building Home tab experiences'']\n\n```python\nfrom slack_bolt import App\nimport os\n\napp = App(token=os.environ[\"SLACK_BOT_TOKEN\"])\n\ndef build_notification_blocks(incident: dict) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Build Block Kit blocks for incident notification.\"\"\"\n    severity_emoji = {\n        \"critical\": \":red_circle:\",\n        \"high\": \":large_orange_circle:\",\n        \"medium\": \":large_yellow_circle:\",\n        \"low\": \":white_circle:\"\n    }\n\n    return [\n        # Header\n        {\n            \"type\": \"header\",\n            \"text\": {\n                \"type\": \"plain_text\",\n                \"text\": f\"{severity_emoji.get(incident[''severity''], '''')} Incident Alert\"\n            }\n        },\n        # Details section\n        {\n            \"type\": \"section\",\n            \"fields\": [\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Incident:*\\n{incident[''title'']}\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Severity:*\\n{incident[''severity''].upper()}\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Service:*\\n{incident[''service'']}\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Reported:*\\n<!date^{incident[''timestamp'']}^{date_short} {time}|{incident[''timestamp'']}>\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        # Description\n        {\n            \"type\": \"section\",\n            \"text\": {\n                \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                \"text\": f\"*Description:*\\n{incident[''description''][:2000]}\"\n            }\n        },\n        # Divider\n        {\"type\": \"divider\"},\n        # Action buttons\n        {\n            \"type\": \"actions\",\n            \"block_id\": f\"incident_actions_{incident[''id'']}\",\n            \"elements\": [\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"button\",\n                    \"text\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Acknowledge\"},\n                    \"style\": \"primary\",\n                    \"action_id\": \"acknowle\n```\n\n### OAuth Installation Pattern\n\nEnable users to install your app in their workspaces via OAuth 2.0.\nBolt handles most of the OAuth flow, but you need to configure it\nand store tokens securely.\n\nKey OAuth concepts:\n- Scopes define permissions (request minimum needed)\n- Tokens are workspace-specific\n- Installation data must be stored persistently\n- Users can add scopes later (additive)\n\n70% of users abandon installation when confronted with excessive\npermission requests - request only what you need!\n\n\n**When to use**: [''Distributing app to multiple workspaces'', ''Building public Slack apps'', ''Enterprise-grade integrations'']\n\n```python\nfrom slack_bolt import App\nfrom slack_bolt.oauth.oauth_settings import OAuthSettings\nfrom slack_sdk.oauth.installation_store import FileInstallationStore\nfrom slack_sdk.oauth.state_store import FileOAuthStateStore\nimport os\n\n# For production, use database-backed stores\n# For example: PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis\n\nclass DatabaseInstallationStore:\n    \"\"\"Store installation data in your database.\"\"\"\n\n    async def save(self, installation):\n        \"\"\"Save installation when user completes OAuth.\"\"\"\n        await db.installations.upsert({\n            \"team_id\": installation.team_id,\n            \"enterprise_id\": installation.enterprise_id,\n            \"bot_token\": encrypt(installation.bot_token),\n            \"bot_user_id\": installation.bot_user_id,\n            \"bot_scopes\": installation.bot_scopes,\n            \"user_id\": installation.user_id,\n            \"installed_at\": installation.installed_at\n        })\n\n    async def find_installation(self, *, enterprise_id, team_id, user_id=None, is_enterprise_install=False):\n        \"\"\"Find installation for a workspace.\"\"\"\n        record = await db.installations.find_one({\n            \"team_id\": team_id,\n            \"enterprise_id\": enterprise_id\n        })\n\n        if record:\n            return Installation(\n                bot_token=decrypt(record[\"bot_token\"]),\n                # ... other fields\n            )\n        return None\n\n# Initialize OAuth-enabled app\napp = App(\n    signing_secret=os.environ[\"SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET\"],\n    oauth_settings=OAuthSettings(\n        client_id=os.environ[\"SLACK_CLIENT_ID\"],\n        client_secret=os.environ[\"SLACK_CLIENT_SECRET\"],\n        scopes=[\n            \"channels:history\",\n            \"channels:read\",\n            \"chat:write\",\n            \"commands\",\n            \"users:read\"\n        ],\n        user_scopes=[],  # User token scopes if needed\n        installation_store=DatabaseInstallationStore(),\n        state_store=FileOAuthStateStore(expiration_seconds=600)\n    )\n)\n\n# OAuth routes are handled a\n```\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | ## Acknowledge immediately, process later |\n| Issue | critical | ## Proper state validation |\n| Issue | critical | ## Never hardcode or log tokens |\n| Issue | high | ## Request minimum required scopes |\n| Issue | medium | ## Know and respect the limits |\n| Issue | high | ## Socket Mode: Only for development |\n| Issue | critical | ## Bolt handles this automatically |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:29:00.114Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Communication Agents needing seamless Slack integration and event handling capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要无缝Slack集成和事件处理能力的通信代理。","ja":"Slackの統合とイベントハンドリング機能が必要なコミュニケーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"슬랙 통합 및 이벤트 처리 기능이 필요한 커뮤니케이션 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Comunicación que necesitan una integración con Slack sin problemas y capacidades de manejo de eventos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Communication ayant besoin d''une intégration Slack transparente et de capacités de gestion d''événements.","de":"Perfekt für Kommunikationsagenten, die eine nahtlose Slack-Integration und Ereignishandhabungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comunicação que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Slack e capacidades de manipulação de eventos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов связи, требующих бесшовной интеграции со Slack и возможностей обработки событий.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التواصل التي تحتاج إلى تكامل متكامل مع Slack وقدرات معالجة الحدث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable Slack apps using the Bolt framework, handling authentication, event routing, and request verification with Python, JavaScript, or Java, ensuring organized and secure patterns for production and experiments.","zh":"通过Bolt框架，使用Python、JavaScript或Java语言，实现身份验证、事件路由和请求验证，帮助代理构建可扩展的Slack应用，确保生产和实验中的组织和安全模式。","ja":"Boltフレームワークを使用して、Python、JavaScript、またはJavaで認証、イベントルーティング、リクエストの検証を行い、エージェントがスケーラブルなSlackアプリを構築できるようにし、生産と実験の両方で組織化されたセキュアなパターンを確保します。","ko":"Bolt 프레임워크를 사용하여 Python, JavaScript 또는 Java로 인증, 이벤트 라우팅 및 요청 검증을 수행하여 에이전트가 확장 가능한 슬랙 앱을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 생산과 실험 모두에서 조직화된 보안 패턴을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones Slack escalables utilizando el marco Bolt, manejando la autenticación, la routificación de eventos y la verificación de solicitudes con Python, JavaScript o Java, asegurando patrones organizados y seguros para la producción y los experimentos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Slack évolutives en utilisant le framework Bolt, en gérant l''authentification, le routage d''événements et la vérification des requêtes avec Python, JavaScript ou Java, en garantissant des modèles organisés et sécurisés pour la production et les expériences.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare Slack-Apps mit dem Bolt-Framework zu erstellen, Authentifizierung, Ereignisrouting und Anforderungsüberprüfung mit Python, JavaScript oder Java zu verwalten und organisierte und sichere Muster für die Produktion und Experimente sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos Slack escaláveis usando o framework Bolt, manipulando autenticação, roteamento de eventos e verificação de solicitação com Python, JavaScript ou Java, garantindo padrões organizados e seguros para produção e experimentos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые приложения Slack, используя фреймворк Bolt, обрабатывая аутентификацию, маршрутизацию событий и проверку запросов на Python, JavaScript или Java, обеспечивая организованные и безопасные шаблоны для производства и экспериментов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات Slack قابلة للتوسع باستخدام إطار Bolt، وتحكم أمان وتوجيه الأحداث وتحقق الطلبات باستخدام Python وJavaScript أو Java، مما يضمن أنماطا منظمة وأمنة للإنتاج والتجارب."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom Slack bots with advanced event handling","Automating workflows using Slack''s API and the Bolt framework","Debugging Slack app issues with built-in security checks and payload validation"],"zh":["构建具有高级事件处理功能的自定义Slack机器人","使用Slack API和Bolt框架自动化工作流程","使用内置安全检查和有效负载验证调试Slack应用问题"],"ja":["高度なイベントハンドリング機能を備えたカスタムSlackボットの構築","Slack APIとBoltフレームワークを使用したワークフローの自動化","内蔵のセキュリティチェックとペイロード検証を使用したSlackアプリの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["고급 이벤트 처리 기능을 갖춘 사용자 지정 슬랙 봇을 구축하는 것","슬랙 API 및 볼트 프레임워크를 사용하여 워크플로우를 자동화하는 것","내장 보안 점검 및 페이로드 검증을 사용하여 슬랙 앱 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Creación de bots personalizados de Slack con un manejo de eventos avanzado","Automatización de flujos de trabajo utilizando la API de Slack y el marco Bolt","Depuración de problemas de aplicaciones de Slack con comprobaciones de seguridad integradas y validación de carga"],"fr":["Création de bots Slack personnalisés avec une gestion d''événements avancée","Automatisation de flux de travail en utilisant l''API Slack et le framework Bolt","Débogage des problèmes d''applications Slack avec des vérifications de sécurité intégrées et une validation de charge"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Slack-Bots mit erweitertem Ereignishandling","Automatisierung von Workflows mit der Slack-API und dem Bolt-Framework","Fehlerbehebung bei Slack-App-Problemen mit integrierten Sicherheitsprüfungen und Nutzlastvalidierung"],"pt":["Construir bots personalizados do Slack com manipulação de eventos avançada","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho usando a API do Slack e o framework Bolt","Depurar problemas de aplicativos do Slack com verificações de segurança integradas e validação de payload"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских ботов Slack с расширенной обработкой событий","Автоматизация рабочих процессов с помощью API Slack и фреймворка Bolt","Отладка проблем приложений Slack с помощью встроенных проверок безопасности и валидации полезной нагрузки"],"ar":["بناء بوتات مخصصة لبرنامج Slack م