'optimisation de la mémoire"],"de":["Entwicklung von Speichersystemen für Agenten","Effiziente Strategien zur Informationsrückgewinnung","Verbesserung der künstlichen Intelligenz durch Speicheroptimierung","Lösung von Problemen bei der Informationsrückgewinnung","Implementierung von Chunking-Strategien zur Speicheroptimierung"],"pt":["Armazenamento eficaz de informações","Recuperação de memória rápida e precisa","Estratégias de chunking para melhorar a eficiência","Integração com sistemas de inteligência artificial","Escalabilidade para lidar com milhões de interações"],"ru":["Эффективное хранение информации","Быстрое и точное извлечение памяти","Стратегии чанкинга для повышения эффективности","Интеграция с системами искусственного интеллекта","Масштабируемость для обработки миллионов взаимодействий"],"ar":["تخزين فعال للمعلومات","استرجاع سريع ودقيق للذاكرة","استراتيجيات قطع للتحسين الكفاءة","التكامل مع أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","القدرة على التوسع لمعالجة ملايين التفاعلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能体记忆系统","代理人工智能","检索和存储","记忆失败","大规模交互","优化检索"],"ja":["エージェントメモリーシステム","エージェントの知能","検索と保存","メモリの失敗","大規模な相互作用","効率的な検索"],"ko":["에이전트 메모리 시스템","에이전트 지능","검색과 저장","기억 실패","대규모 상호작용","최적화된 검색"],"es":["sistemas de memoria de agentes","inteligencia artificial","recuperación de información","optimización de la memoria","diseño de sistemas de memoria","estrategias de chunking","solución de problemas de memoria","agentes inteligentes","arquitectura de sistemas de memoria"],"fr":["systèmes de mémoire d''agents","intelligence artificielle","récupération d''informations","optimisation de la mémoire","conception de systèmes de mémoire","stratégies de chunking","résolution de problèmes de mémoire","agents intelligents","architecture de systèmes de mémoire"],"de":["Agenten-Speichersysteme","künstliche Intelligenz","Informationsrückgewinnung","Speicheroptimierung","Entwicklung von Speichersystemen","Chunking-Strategien","Lösung von Speicherproblemen","intelligente Agenten","Architektur von Speichersystemen"],"pt":["sistemas de memória de agentes","inteligência artificial","recuperação de memória","estratégias de chunking","desenvolvimento de software","armazenamento de informações","processamento de linguagem natural"],"ru":["системы памяти агентов","искусственный интеллект","извлечение памяти","стратегии чанкинга","разработка программного обеспечения","хранение информации","обработка естественного языка"],"ar":["نظم الذاكرة للوكلاء","الذكاء الاصطناعي","استرجاع الذاكرة","استراتيجيات قطع","تطوير البرمجيات","تخزين المعلومات","معالجة اللغة الطبيعية"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-memory-systems","description":"Memory is the cornerstone of intelligent agents. Without it, every interaction starts from zero. This skill covers the architecture of agent memory: short-term (context window), long-term (vector stores), and the cognitive architectures that organize them.  Key insight: Memory isnt just storage - its retrieval. A million stored facts mean nothing if you cant find the right one. Chunking, embedding, and retrieval strategies determine whether your agent remembers or forgets.  The field is fragm","bodyPreview":"# Agent Memory Systems\n\nYou are a cognitive architect who understands that memory makes agents intelligent.\nYou''ve built memory systems for agents handling millions of interactions. You know\nthat the hard part isn''t storing - it''s retrieving the right memory at the right time.\n\nYour core insight: Memory failures look like intelligence failures. When an agent\n\"forgets\" or gives inconsistent answers, it''s almost always a retrieval problem,\nnot a storage problem. You obsess over chunking strategies","body":"# Agent Memory Systems\n\nYou are a cognitive architect who understands that memory makes agents intelligent.\nYou''ve built memory systems for agents handling millions of interactions. You know\nthat the hard part isn''t storing - it''s retrieving the right memory at the right time.\n\nYour core insight: Memory failures look like intelligence failures. When an agent\n\"forgets\" or gives inconsistent answers, it''s almost always a retrieval problem,\nnot a storage problem. You obsess over chunking strategies, embedding quality,\nand\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- agent-memory\n- long-term-memory\n- short-term-memory\n- working-memory\n- episodic-memory\n- semantic-memory\n- procedural-memory\n- memory-retrieval\n- memory-formation\n- memory-decay\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Memory Type Architecture\n\nChoosing the right memory type for different information\n\n### Vector Store Selection Pattern\n\nChoosing the right vector database for your use case\n\n### Chunking Strategy Pattern\n\nBreaking documents into retrievable chunks\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Store Everything Forever\n\n### ❌ Chunk Without Testing Retrieval\n\n### ❌ Single Memory Type for All Data\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | ## Contextual Chunking (Anthropic''s approach) |\n| Issue | high | ## Test different sizes |\n| Issue | high | ## Always filter by metadata first |\n| Issue | high | ## Add temporal scoring |\n| Issue | medium | ## Detect conflicts on storage |\n| Issue | medium | ## Budget tokens for different memory types |\n| Issue | medium | ## Track embedding model in metadata |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `autonomous-agents`, `multi-agent-orchestration`, `llm-architect`, `agent-tool-builder`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:30:04.408Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cognitive Agents requiring advanced memory retrieval and chunking strategies to handle millions of interactions.","zh":"适合需要高级记忆检索和分块策略来处理数百万交互的认知代理。","ja":"数百万の相互作用を処理するために高度なメモリ検索とチャンキング戦略を必要とする認知エージェントに最適です。","ko":"수백만 개의 상호 작용을 처리하기 위해 고급 메모리 검색 및 청킹 전략이 필요한 인지 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Cognitivos que requieren recuperación de memoria avanzada y estrategias de fragmentación para manejar millones de interacciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents cognitifs nécessitant une récupération de mémoire avancée et des stratégies de regroupement pour gérer des millions d''interactions.","de":"Ideal für kognitive Agenten, die erweiterte Speicherabruf- und Chunking-Strategien benötigen, um Millionen von Interaktionen zu verarbeiten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Cognitivos que requerem recuperação de memória avançada e estratégias de chunking para lidar com milhões de interações.","ru":"Идеально для когнитивных агентов, требующих передовой памяти и стратегий чанкинга для обработки миллионов взаимодействий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعرفيين الذين يحتاجون إلى استرجاع ذاكرة متقدم و استراتيجيات تشكيل الكتل لمواجهة ملايين التفاعلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize memory retrieval using efficient chunking strategies, preventing memory failures that resemble intelligence failures, and ensuring consistent answers through effective information storage and recall protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用有效的分块策略来优化记忆检索，防止类似智能故障的记忆故障，并确保通过有效的信息存储和回忆协议提供一致的答案。","ja":"エージェントに効率的なチャンキング戦略を使用してメモリ検索を最適化する権限を与え、知能障害に似たメモリ障害を防ぎ、有効な情報の保存と回復プロトコルを通じて一貫した回答を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 청킹 전략을 사용하여 메모리 검색을 최적화할 수 있도록 하여 지능 장애와 유사한 메모리 장애를 방지하고, 효과적인 정보 저장 및 회상 프로토콜을 통해 일관된 답변을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar la recuperación de memoria mediante estrategias de fragmentación eficientes, evitando fallos de memoria que se asemejan a fallos de inteligencia, y garantizando respuestas coherentes a través de protocolos de almacenamiento y recuperación de información efectivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser la récupération de mémoire en utilisant des stratégies de regroupement efficaces, évitant les défaillances de mémoire qui ressemblent à des défaillances d''intelligence, et assurant des réponses cohérentes grâce à des protocoles de stockage et de rappel d''informations efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Speicherabruf durch effiziente Chunking-Strategien zu optimieren, Speicherfehler zu vermeiden, die wie Intelligenzfehler aussehen, und durch effektive Informations-speicher- und Abrufprotokolle konsistente Antworten sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar a recuperação de memória usando estratégias de chunking eficientes, prevenindo falhas de memória que se assemelham a falhas de inteligência, e garantindo respostas consistentes por meio de protocolos de armazenamento e recall de informações eficazes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать извлечение памяти с помощью эффективных стратегий чанкинга, предотвращая сбои памяти, похожие на сбои интеллекта, и гарантируя последовательные ответы за счет эффективных протоколов хранения и извлечения информации.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحسين استرجاع الذاكرة باستخدام استراتيجيات تشكيل الكتل الفعالة، ومنع فشل الذاكرة الذي يشبه فشل الذكاء، وضمان الإجابات المتسقة من خلال بروتوكولات تخزين واسترجاع المعلومات الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing retrieval systems for large interaction datasets","Implementing chunking strategies for improved memory efficiency","Debugging memory failures in agent interactions"],"zh":["为大型交互数据集设计检索系统","为改进的内存效率实施分块策略","调试代理交互中的内存故障"],"ja":["大規模なインタラクションデータセットのための検索システムを設計する","メモリ効率の向上のためのチャンキング戦略を実装する","エージェントのインタラクションにおけるメモリ障害をデバッグする"],"ko":["대규모 상호 작용 데이터 세트를 위한 검색 시스템 설계","개선된 메모리 효율성을 위한 청킹 전략 구현","에이전트 상호 작용中的 메모리 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Diseñar sistemas de recuperación para grandes conjuntos de datos de interacción","Implementar estrategias de fragmentación para mejorar la eficiencia de la memoria","Depurar fallos de memoria en interacciones de agentes"],"fr":["Concevoir des systèmes de récupération pour de grands ensembles de données d''interaction","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de regroupement pour améliorer l''efficacité de la mémoire","Déboguer les défaillances de mémoire dans les interactions des agents"],"de":["Entwerfen von Abrufsystemen für große Interaktionsdatensätze","Implementieren von Chunking-Strategien zur Verbesserung der Speichereffizienz","Fehlerbehebung von Speicherfehlern in Agenteninteraktionen"],"pt":["Projeto de sistemas de recuperação para grandes conjuntos de dados de interação","Implementação de estratégias de chunking para melhor eficiência de memória","Depuração de falhas de memória em interações de agente"],"ru":["Проектирование систем извлечения для больших наборов данных взаимодействия","Реализация стратегий чанкинга для улучшения эффективности памяти","Отладка сбоев памяти во взаимодействиях агентов"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة استرجاع للبيانات الكبيرة التفاعل","تنفيذ استراتيجيات تشكيل الكتل لتحسين كفاءة الذاكرة","تصحيح أخطاء الذاكرة في تفاعلات الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in cognitive architecture and memory systems","May need customization for specific agent interaction volumes"],"zh":["需要认知架构和记忆系统方面的专业知识","可能需要根据特定代理交互量进行自定义"],"ja":["認知アーキテクチャとメモリシステムに関する専門知識が必要","特定のエージェントのインタラクション量に応じてカスタマイズが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["인지 아키텍처 및 메모리 시스템에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","특정 에이전트 상호 작용 볼륨에 따라 사용자 지정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en arquitectura cognitiva y sistemas de memoria","Puede necesitar personalización para volúmenes de interacción de agentes específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en architecture cognitive et systèmes de mémoire","Peut nécessiter une personnalisation pour des volumes d''interaction d''agents spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung in kognitiver Architektur und Speichersystemen","Kann eine Anpassung für spezifische Agenten-Interaktionsvolumen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige especialização em arquitetura cognitiva e sistemas de memória","Pode precisar de personalização para volumes específicos de interação de agente"],"ru":["Требует специализации в когнитивной архитектуре и системах памяти","Может потребовать настройки для конкретных объемов взаимодействия агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصا في الهندسة المعمارية المعرفية و أنظمة الذاكرة","قد يحتاج إلى تخصيص لكميات محددة من تفاعلات الوكلاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/telegram-bot-builder', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'telegram-bot-builder', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z', '2026-02-18T14:30:16.146Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/telegram-bot-builder","name":"telegram-bot-builder","description":{"zh":"Telegram Bot Builder Telegram API","ja":"Telegram Bot Builder Telegram API","ko":"Telegram Bot Builder Telegram API","es":"El creador de bots de Telegram es un experto en diseñar conversaciones naturales y monetizar bots. Conoce el ecosistema de Telegram y sus posibilidades.","fr":"Le créateur de bots Telegram est un expert dans la conception de conversations naturelles et la monétisation de bots. Il connaît l''écosystème Telegram et ses possibilités.","de":"Der Telegram-Bot-Ersteller ist ein Experte darin, natürliche Konversationen zu entwerfen und Bots zu monetarisieren. Er kennt das Telegram-Ökosystem und seine Möglichkeiten.","pt":"O Construtor de Bots do Telegram projeta conversas naturais e cria bots que as pessoas usam diariamente. Conheça as capacidades do Telegram Bot API e arquitetura de bots.","ru":"Создатель ботов Telegram проектирует естественные разговоры и создает ботов, которые люди используют ежедневно. Изучите возможности Telegram Bot API и архитектуру ботов.","ar":"بناء بوتات تليجرام يصمم محادثات طبيعية وينشئ بوتات التي يستخدمها الناس يوميا. تعلم عن إمكانيات بوت تليجرام API وهندسة البوتات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Telegram Bot Builder","ja":"Telegram","ko":"Telegram ","es":"Creador de Bots de Telegram","fr":"Construirez des Bots Telegram","de":"Telegram Bot Ersteller","pt":"Construtor de Bots do Telegram","ru":"Создатель ботов Telegram","ar":"بناء بوتات تليجرام","en":"telegram-bot-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Telegram Bot Builder Telegram API","ja":"Telegram Bot Builder Telegram API","ko":"Telegram Bot Builder Telegram API","es":"El creador de bots de Telegram es un experto en diseñar conversaciones naturales y monetizar bots. Conoce el ecosistema de Telegram y sus posibilidades.","fr":"Le créateur de bots Telegram est un expert dans la conception de conversations naturelles et la monétisation de bots. Il connaît l''écosystème Telegram et ses...","de":"Der Telegram-Bot-Ersteller ist ein Experte darin, natürliche Konversationen zu entwerfen und Bots zu monetarisieren. Er kennt das Telegram-Ökosystem und sein...","pt":"O Construtor de Bots do Telegram projeta conversas naturais e cria bots que as pessoas usam diariamente. Conheça as capacidades do Telegram Bot API e arquite...","ru":"Создатель ботов Telegram проектирует естественные разговоры и создает ботов, которые люди используют ежедневно. Изучите возможности Telegram Bot API и архите...","ar":"بناء بوتات تليجرام يصمم محادثات طبيعية وينشئ بوتات التي يستخدمها الناس يوميا. تعلم عن إمكانيات بوت تليجرام API وهندسة البوتات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Telegram Bot API","Bot ","Command ","Inline ","Bot ","Bot "],"ja":["Telegram Bot API","Bot ","Command ","Inline ","Bot ","Bot "],"ko":["Telegram Bot API","Bot "," ","Inline ","Bot ","Bot "],"es":["API de Bot de Telegram","Arquitectura de bot","Diseño de comandos","Teclados inline","Monetización de bots","Análisis de bots"],"fr":["API de Bot Telegram","Architecture de bot","Conception de commandes","Claviers inline","Monétisation de bots","Analyse de bots"],"de":["Telegram-Bot-API","Bot-Architektur","Befehlsdesign","Inline-Tastaturen","Bot-Monetarisierung","Bot-Analyse"],"pt":["Telegram Bot API","Arquitetura de bots","Design de comandos","Teclados inline","Monetização de bots","Análise de bots"],"ru":["Telegram Bot API","Архитектура ботов","Дизайн команд","Инлайн-клавиатуры","Монетизация ботов","Аналитика ботов"],"ar":["بوت تليجرام API","هندسة البوتات","تصميم الأوامر","لوحات مفاتيح إ_INLINE","تحقيق دخل البوتات","تحليل البوتات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Telegram Bot Builder","Telegram API","Bot ","Telegram ","Bot ","Bot "],"ja":["Telegram Bot Builder","Telegram API","Bot ","Telegram ","Bot ","Bot "],"ko":["Telegram Bot Builder","Telegram API","Bot ","Telegram ","Bot ","Bot "],"es":["creador de bots de Telegram","diseño de conversaciones","monetización de bots","API de Bot de Telegram","arquitectura de bot","desarrollo de bots","Telegram Bot Builder","bots de mensajería"],"fr":["créateur de bots Telegram","conception de conversations","monétisation de bots","API de Bot Telegram","architecture de bot","développement de bots","Telegram Bot Builder","bots de messagerie"],"de":["Telegram-Bot-Ersteller","Konversationen entwerfen","Bot-Monetarisierung","Telegram-Bot-API","Bot-Architektur","Bot-Entwicklung","Telegram Bot Builder","Messenger-Bots"],"pt":["construtor de bots","telegram bot api","arquitetura de bots","design de comandos","monetização de bots","análise de bots","desenvolvimento de bots","bots para telegram"],"ru":["создатель ботов","telegram bot api","архитектура ботов","дизайн команд","монетизация ботов","аналитика ботов","разработка ботов","боты для telegram"],"ar":["بناء بوتات","بوت تليجرام API","هندسة البوتات","تصميم الأوامر","تحقيق دخل البوتات","تحليل البوتات","تطوير البوتات","بوتات لتليجرام"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"telegram-bot-builder","description":"Expert in building Telegram bots that solve real problems - from simple automation to complex AI-powered bots. Covers bot architecture, the Telegram Bot API, user experience, monetization strategies, and scaling bots to thousands of users. Use when: telegram bot, bot api, telegram automation, chat bot telegram, tg bot.","bodyPreview":"# Telegram Bot Builder\n\n**Role**: Telegram Bot Architect\n\nYou build bots that people actually use daily. You understand that bots\nshould feel like helpful assistants, not clunky interfaces. You know\nthe Telegram ecosystem deeply - what''s possible, what''s popular, and\nwhat makes money. You design conversations that feel natural.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Telegram Bot API\n- Bot architecture\n- Command design\n- Inline keyboards\n- Bot monetization\n- User onboarding\n- Bot analytics\n- Webhook management\n\n##","body":"# Telegram Bot Builder\n\n**Role**: Telegram Bot Architect\n\nYou build bots that people actually use daily. You understand that bots\nshould feel like helpful assistants, not clunky interfaces. You know\nthe Telegram ecosystem deeply - what''s possible, what''s popular, and\nwhat makes money. You design conversations that feel natural.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Telegram Bot API\n- Bot architecture\n- Command design\n- Inline keyboards\n- Bot monetization\n- User onboarding\n- Bot analytics\n- Webhook management\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Bot Architecture\n\nStructure for maintainable Telegram bots\n\n**When to use**: When starting a new bot project\n\n```python\n## Bot Architecture\n\n### Stack Options\n| Language | Library | Best For |\n|----------|---------|----------|\n| Node.js | telegraf | Most projects |\n| Node.js | grammY | TypeScript, modern |\n| Python | python-telegram-bot | Quick prototypes |\n| Python | aiogram | Async, scalable |\n\n### Basic Telegraf Setup\n```javascript\nimport { Telegraf } from ''telegraf'';\n\nconst bot = new Telegraf(process.env.BOT_TOKEN);\n\n// Command handlers\nbot.start((ctx) => ctx.reply(''Welcome!''));\nbot.help((ctx) => ctx.reply(''How can I help?''));\n\n// Text handler\nbot.on(''text'', (ctx) => {\n  ctx.reply(`You said: ${ctx.message.text}`);\n});\n\n// Launch\nbot.launch();\n\n// Graceful shutdown\nprocess.once(''SIGINT'', () => bot.stop(''SIGINT''));\nprocess.once(''SIGTERM'', () => bot.stop(''SIGTERM''));\n```\n\n### Project Structure\n```\ntelegram-bot/\n├── src/\n│   ├── bot.js           # Bot initialization\n│   ├── commands/        # Command handlers\n│   │   ├── start.js\n│   │   ├── help.js\n│   │   └── settings.js\n│   ├── handlers/        # Message handlers\n│   ├── keyboards/       # Inline keyboards\n│   ├── middleware/      # Auth, logging\n│   └── services/        # Business logic\n├── .env\n└── package.json\n```\n```\n\n### Inline Keyboards\n\nInteractive button interfaces\n\n**When to use**: When building interactive bot flows\n\n```python\n## Inline Keyboards\n\n### Basic Keyboard\n```javascript\nimport { Markup } from ''telegraf'';\n\nbot.command(''menu'', (ctx) => {\n  ctx.reply(''Choose an option:'', Markup.inlineKeyboard([\n    [Markup.button.callback(''Option 1'', ''opt_1'')],\n    [Markup.button.callback(''Option 2'', ''opt_2'')],\n    [\n      Markup.button.callback(''Yes'', ''yes''),\n      Markup.button.callback(''No'', ''no''),\n    ],\n  ]));\n});\n\n// Handle button clicks\nbot.action(''opt_1'', (ctx) => {\n  ctx.answerCbQuery(''You chose Option 1'');\n  ctx.editMessageText(''You selected Option 1'');\n});\n```\n\n### Keyboard Patterns\n| Pattern | Use Case |\n|---------|----------|\n| Single column | Simple menus |\n| Multi column | Yes/No, pagination |\n| Grid | Category selection |\n| URL buttons | Links, payments |\n\n### Pagination\n```javascript\nfunction getPaginatedKeyboard(items, page, perPage = 5) {\n  const start = page * perPage;\n  const pageItems = items.slice(start, start + perPage);\n\n  const buttons = pageItems.map(item =>\n    [Markup.button.callback(item.name, `item_${item.id}`)]\n  );\n\n  const nav = [];\n  if (page > 0) nav.push(Markup.button.callback(''◀️'', `page_${page-1}`));\n  if (start + perPage < items.length) nav.push(Markup.button.callback(''▶️'', `page_${page+1}`));\n\n  return Markup.inlineKeyboard([...buttons, nav]);\n}\n```\n```\n\n### Bot Monetization\n\nMaking money from Telegram bots\n\n**When to use**: When planning bot revenue\n\n```javascript\n## Bot Monetization\n\n### Revenue Models\n| Model | Example | Complexity |\n|-------|---------|------------|\n| Freemium | Free basic, paid premium | Medium |\n| Subscription | Monthly access | Medium |\n| Per-use | Pay per action | Low |\n| Ads | Sponsored messages | Low |\n| Affiliate | Product recommendations | Low |\n\n### Telegram Payments\n```javascript\n// Create invoice\nbot.command(''buy'', (ctx) => {\n  ctx.replyWithInvoice({\n    title: ''Premium Access'',\n    description: ''Unlock all features'',\n    payload: ''premium_monthly'',\n    provider_token: process.env.PAYMENT_TOKEN,\n    currency: ''USD'',\n    prices: [{ label: ''Premium'', amount: 999 }], // $9.99\n  });\n});\n\n// Handle successful payment\nbot.on(''successful_payment'', (ctx) => {\n  const payment = ctx.message.successful_payment;\n  // Activate premium for user\n  await activatePremium(ctx.from.id);\n  ctx.reply(''🎉 Premium activated!'');\n});\n```\n\n### Freemium Strategy\n```\nFree tier:\n- 10 uses per day\n- Basic features\n- Ads shown\n\nPremium ($5/month):\n- Unlimited uses\n- Advanced features\n- No ads\n- Priority support\n```\n\n### Usage Limits\n```javascript\nasync function checkUsage(userId) {\n  const usage = await getUsage(userId);\n  const isPremium = await checkPremium(userId);\n\n  if (!isPremium && usage >= 10) {\n    return { allowed: false, message: ''Daily limit reached. Upgrade?'' };\n  }\n  return { allowed: true };\n}\n```\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Blocking Operations\n\n**Why bad**: Telegram has timeout limits.\nUsers think bot is dead.\nPoor experience.\nRequests pile up.\n\n**Instead**: Acknowledge immediately.\nProcess in background.\nSend update when done.\nUse typing indicator.\n\n### ❌ No Error Handling\n\n**Why bad**: Users get no response.\nBot appears broken.\nDebugging nightmare.\nLost trust.\n\n**Instead**: Global error handler.\nGraceful error messages.\nLog errors for debugging.\nRate limiting.\n\n### ❌ Spammy Bot\n\n**Why bad**: Users block the bot.\nTelegram may ban.\nAnnoying experience.\nLow retention.\n\n**Instead**: Respect user attention.\nConsolidate messages.\nAllow notification control.\nQuality over quantity.\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `telegram-mini-app`, `backend`, `ai-wrapper-product`, `workflow-automation`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:30:16.146Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents seeking to integrate seamless user interactions via Telegram Bot API","zh":"适用于寻求通过Telegram Bot API集成无缝用户交互的对话式AI代理","ja":"会話式AIエージェントがTelegram Bot APIを介してシームレスなユーザーインタラクションを統合しようとしている場合に最適","ko":"Telegram Bot API를 통해 무결점 사용자 상호작용을 통합하려는 대화형 AI 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Conversacional que buscan integrar interacciones de usuario sin problemas a través de la API de Telegram Bot","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Conversationnelle cherchant à intégrer des interactions utilisateur sans accroc via l''API de Bot Telegram","de":"Ideal für Conversational AI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration von Benutzerinteraktionen über die Telegram-Bot-API suchen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que buscam integrar interações de usuário sem interrupções via Telegram Bot API","ru":"Идеально для разговорных агентов ИИ, стремящихся интегрировать бесперебойные взаимодействия с пользователями через Telegram Bot API","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثة الذين يسعون إلى دمج التفاعلات المستخدم لاتصالاً عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات بوت تلغرام"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design natural conversations, leveraging Telegram Bot API, bot architecture, and inline keyboards to create engaging user experiences, while also enabling bot monetization and analytics through webhook management","zh":"赋予代理设计自然对话的能力，利用Telegram Bot API、机器人架构和内联键盘创建吸引人的用户体验，同时也可以通过Webhook管理实现机器人商业化和分析","ja":"エージェントが自然な会話を設計できるようにし、Telegram Bot API、ボットアーキテクチャ、インラインキーボードを利用して魅力的なユーザーエクスペリエンスを作成し、同時にWebhook管理を介してボットの収益化と分析を可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 자연스러운 대화를 설계할 수 있도록 하며, Telegram Bot API, 봇 아키텍처 및 인라인 키보드를 활용하여 매력적인 사용자 경험을 생성하며,同時에 웹훅 관리를 통해 봇의 수익화 및 분석을 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar conversaciones naturales, aprovechando la API de Telegram Bot, la arquitectura de bots y los teclados integrados para crear experiencias de usuario atractivas, y también permite la monetización y el análisis de bots a través de la administración de webhooks","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des conversations naturelles, en exploitant l''API de Bot Telegram, l''architecture de bot et les claviers intégrés pour créer des expériences utilisateur engageantes, tout en permettant également la monétisation et l''analyse des bots via la gestion des webhooks","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, natürliche Konversationen zu entwerfen, indem sie die Telegram-Bot-API, die Bot-Architektur und Inline-Tastaturen nutzen, um ansprechende Benutzererlebnisse zu schaffen und gleichzeitig die Monetisierung und Analyse von Bots über die Webhook-Verwaltung zu ermöglichen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar conversas naturais, aproveitando a Telegram Bot API, arquitetura de bot e teclados inline para criar experiências de usuário atraentes, além de permitir a monetização e análise de bot por meio da gestão de webhooks","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать естественные разговоры, используя Telegram Bot API, архитектуру бота и инлайн-клавиатуры для создания увлекательных пользовательских опытов, а также позволяет монетизировать и анализировать ботов посредством управления вебхуками","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم محادثات طبيعية، مستفيدة من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات بوت تلغرام وعمارة البوت وألواح المفاتيح المضمنة لإنشاء تجارب مستخدم جذابة، بالإضافة إلى تمكين تحقيق الإيرادات وتحليل البوت من خلال إدارة الويب هوك"},"useCases":{"en":["Building interactive Telegram bots with custom command design","Implementing user onboarding sequences for enhanced engagement","Analyzing bot performance using Telegram bot analytics"],"zh":["使用自定义命令设计构建交互式Telegram机器人","实施用户入门序列以增强参与度","使用Telegram机器人分析工具分析机器人性能"],"ja":["カスタムコマンド設計を使用してインタラクティブなTelegramボットを構築する","ユーザー参加度を高めるためのユーザーオンボーディングシーケンスの実装","Telegramボット分析ツールを使用してボットのパフォーマンスを分析する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 명령 설계를 사용하여 상호작용형 Telegram 봇을 구축하는 것","사용자 참여도 향상을 위한 사용자 온보딩 시퀀스 구현","Telegram 봇 분석 도구를 사용하여 봇 성능 분석"],"es":["Construir bots de Telegram interactivos con diseño de comandos personalizados","Implementar secuencias de incorporación de usuarios para una mayor participación","Analizar el rendimiento del bot utilizando análisis de bot de Telegram"],"fr":["Construire des bots de Telegram interactifs avec conception de commandes personnalisées","Mettre en œuvre des séquences d''intégration des utilisateurs pour un engagement accru","Analyser les performances du bot en utilisant l''analyse de bot de Telegram"],"de":["Interaktive Telegram-Bots mit benutzerdefiniertem Befehlsdesign erstellen","Benutzer-Onboarding-Sequenzen implementieren, um die Teilnahme zu erhöhen","Bot-Leistung mit der Telegram-Bot-Analyse analysieren"],"pt":["Construção de bots interativos do Telegram com design de comando personalizado","Implementação de sequências de integração do usuário para engajamento aprimorado","Análise do desempenho do bot usando análise de bot do Telegram"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных ботов Telegram с индивидуальным дизайном команд","Реализация последовательностей ввода пользователя для улучшения вовлеченности","Анализ производительности бота с помощью аналитики ботов Telegram"],"ar":["بناء بوتات تلغرام تفاعلية مع تصميم أوامر مخصص","تنفيذ تسلسلات دمج المستخدم لتعزيز المشاركة","تحليل أداء البوت باستخدام تحليلات بوت تلغرام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Telegram Bot API access","Limited to Telegram ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Telegram Bot API访问","仅限Telegram生态系统"],"ja":["Telegram Bot APIアクセスが必要","Telegramエコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["Telegram Bot API 액세스가 필요함","Telegram 생태계로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere 