здание бота"],"ar":["بوت ديسكورد","ديسكورد.js","جافا سكريبت","تايب سكريبت","أوامر شرطة","بوت ديسكورد","تطوير البوت","إنشاء البوت"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"discord-bot-architect","description":"Specialized skill for building production-ready Discord bots. Covers Discord.js (JavaScript) and Pycord (Python), gateway intents, slash commands, interactive components, rate limiting, and sharding.","bodyPreview":"# Discord Bot Architect\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Discord.js v14 Foundation\n\nModern Discord bot setup with Discord.js v14 and slash commands\n\n**When to use**: [''Building Discord bots with JavaScript/TypeScript'', ''Need full gateway connection with events'', ''Building bots with complex interactions'']\n\n```javascript\n```javascript\n// src/index.js\nconst { Client, Collection, GatewayIntentBits, Events } = require(''discord.js'');\nconst fs = require(''node:fs'');\nconst path = require(''node:path'');\nrequire(''dotenv'')","body":"# Discord Bot Architect\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Discord.js v14 Foundation\n\nModern Discord bot setup with Discord.js v14 and slash commands\n\n**When to use**: [''Building Discord bots with JavaScript/TypeScript'', ''Need full gateway connection with events'', ''Building bots with complex interactions'']\n\n```javascript\n```javascript\n// src/index.js\nconst { Client, Collection, GatewayIntentBits, Events } = require(''discord.js'');\nconst fs = require(''node:fs'');\nconst path = require(''node:path'');\nrequire(''dotenv'').config();\n\n// Create client with minimal required intents\nconst client = new Client({\n  intents: [\n    GatewayIntentBits.Guilds,\n    // Add only what you need:\n    // GatewayIntentBits.GuildMessages,\n    // GatewayIntentBits.MessageContent,  // PRIVILEGED - avoid if possible\n  ]\n});\n\n// Load commands\nclient.commands = new Collection();\nconst commandsPath = path.join(__dirname, ''commands'');\nconst commandFiles = fs.readdirSync(commandsPath).filter(f => f.endsWith(''.js''));\n\nfor (const file of commandFiles) {\n  const filePath = path.join(commandsPath, file);\n  const command = require(filePath);\n  if (''data'' in command && ''execute'' in command) {\n    client.commands.set(command.data.name, command);\n  }\n}\n\n// Load events\nconst eventsPath = path.join(__dirname, ''events'');\nconst eventFiles = fs.readdirSync(eventsPath).filter(f => f.endsWith(''.js''));\n\nfor (const file of eventFiles) {\n  const filePath = path.join(eventsPath, file);\n  const event = require(filePath);\n  if (event.once) {\n    client.once(event.name, (...args) => event.execute(...args));\n  } else {\n    client.on(event.name, (...args) => event.execute(...args));\n  }\n}\n\nclient.login(process.env.DISCORD_TOKEN);\n```\n\n```javascript\n// src/commands/ping.js\nconst { SlashCommandBuilder } = require(''discord.js'');\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  data: new SlashCommandBuilder()\n    .setName(''ping'')\n    .setDescription(''Replies with Pong!''),\n\n  async execute(interaction) {\n    const sent = await interaction.reply({\n      content: ''Pinging...'',\n      fetchReply: true\n    });\n\n    const latency = sent.createdTimestamp - interaction.createdTimestamp;\n    await interaction.editReply(`Pong! Latency: ${latency}ms`);\n  }\n};\n```\n\n```javascript\n// src/events/interactionCreate.js\nconst { Events } = require(''discord.js'');\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  name: Event\n```\n\n### Pycord Bot Foundation\n\nDiscord bot with Pycord (Python) and application commands\n\n**When to use**: [''Building Discord bots with Python'', ''Prefer async/await patterns'', ''Need good slash command support'']\n\n```python\n```python\n# main.py\nimport os\nimport discord\nfrom discord.ext import commands\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\n\nload_dotenv()\n\n# Configure intents - only enable what you need\nintents = discord.Intents.default()\n# intents.message_content = True  # PRIVILEGED - avoid if possible\n# intents.members = True          # PRIVILEGED\n\nbot = commands.Bot(\n    command_prefix=\"!\",  # Legacy, prefer slash commands\n    intents=intents\n)\n\n@bot.event\nasync def on_ready():\n    print(f\"Logged in as {bot.user}\")\n    # Sync commands (do this carefully - see sharp edges)\n    # await bot.sync_commands()\n\n# Slash command\n@bot.slash_command(name=\"ping\", description=\"Check bot latency\")\nasync def ping(ctx: discord.ApplicationContext):\n    latency = round(bot.latency * 1000)\n    await ctx.respond(f\"Pong! Latency: {latency}ms\")\n\n# Slash command with options\n@bot.slash_command(name=\"greet\", description=\"Greet a user\")\nasync def greet(\n    ctx: discord.ApplicationContext,\n    user: discord.Option(discord.Member, \"User to greet\"),\n    message: discord.Option(str, \"Custom message\", required=False)\n):\n    msg = message or \"Hello!\"\n    await ctx.respond(f\"{user.mention}, {msg}\")\n\n# Load cogs\nfor filename in os.listdir(\"./cogs\"):\n    if filename.endswith(\".py\"):\n        bot.load_extension(f\"cogs.{filename[:-3]}\")\n\nbot.run(os.environ[\"DISCORD_TOKEN\"])\n```\n\n```python\n# cogs/general.py\nimport discord\nfrom discord.ext import commands\n\nclass General(commands.Cog):\n    def __init__(self, bot):\n        self.bot = bot\n\n    @commands.slash_command(name=\"info\", description=\"Bot information\")\n    async def info(self, ctx: discord.ApplicationContext):\n        embed = discord.Embed(\n            title=\"Bot Info\",\n            description=\"A helpful Discord bot\",\n            color=discord.Color.blue()\n        )\n        embed.add_field(name=\"Servers\", value=len(self.bot.guilds))\n        embed.add_field(name=\"Latency\", value=f\"{round(self.bot.latency * 1000)}ms\")\n        await ctx.respond(embed=embed)\n\n    @commands.Cog.\n```\n\n### Interactive Components Pattern\n\nUsing buttons, select menus, and modals for rich UX\n\n**When to use**: [''Need interactive user interfaces'', ''Collecting user input beyond slash command options'', ''Building menus, confirmations, or forms'']\n\n```python\n```javascript\n// Discord.js - Buttons and Select Menus\nconst {\n  SlashCommandBuilder,\n  ActionRowBuilder,\n  ButtonBuilder,\n  ButtonStyle,\n  StringSelectMenuBuilder,\n  ModalBuilder,\n  TextInputBuilder,\n  TextInputStyle\n} = require(''discord.js'');\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  data: new SlashCommandBuilder()\n    .setName(''menu'')\n    .setDescription(''Shows an interactive menu''),\n\n  async execute(interaction) {\n    // Button row\n    const buttonRow = new ActionRowBuilder()\n      .addComponents(\n        new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(''confirm'')\n          .setLabel(''Confirm'')\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary),\n        new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(''cancel'')\n          .setLabel(''Cancel'')\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger),\n        new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setLabel(''Documentation'')\n          .setURL(''https://discord.js.org'')\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Link)  // Link buttons don''t emit events\n      );\n\n    // Select menu row (one per row, takes all 5 slots)\n    const selectRow = new ActionRowBuilder()\n      .addComponents(\n        new StringSelectMenuBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(''select-role'')\n          .setPlaceholder(''Select a role'')\n          .setMinValues(1)\n          .setMaxValues(3)\n          .addOptions([\n            { label: ''Developer'', value: ''dev'', emoji: ''💻'' },\n            { label: ''Designer'', value: ''design'', emoji: ''🎨'' },\n            { label: ''Community'', value: ''community'', emoji: ''🎉'' }\n          ])\n      );\n\n    await interaction.reply({\n      content: ''Choose an option:'',\n      components: [buttonRow, selectRow]\n    });\n\n    // Collect responses\n    const collector = interaction.channel.createMessageComponentCollector({\n      filter: i => i.user.id === interaction.user.id,\n      time: 60_000  // 60 seconds timeout\n    });\n\n    collector.on(''collect'', async i => {\n      if (i.customId === ''confirm'') {\n        await i.update({ content: ''Confirmed!'', components: [] });\n        collector.stop();\n      } else if (i.custo\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Message Content for Commands\n\n**Why bad**: Message Content Intent is privileged and deprecated for bot commands.\nSlash commands are the intended approach.\n\n### ❌ Syncing Commands on Every Start\n\n**Why bad**: Command registration is rate limited. Global commands take up to 1 hour\nto propagate. Syncing on every start wastes API calls and can hit limits.\n\n### ❌ Blocking the Event Loop\n\n**Why bad**: Discord gateway requires regular heartbeats. Blocking operations\ncause missed heartbeats and disconnections.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | ## Acknowledge immediately, process later |\n| Issue | critical | ## Step 1: Enable in Developer Portal |\n| Issue | high | ## Use a separate deploy script (not on startup) |\n| Issue | critical | ## Never hardcode tokens |\n| Issue | high | ## Generate correct invite URL |\n| Issue | medium | ## Development: Use guild commands |\n| Issue | medium | ## Never block the event loop |\n| Issue | medium | ## Show modal immediately |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:30:41.054Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript/TypeScript-focused AI Agents needing advanced Discord bot development capabilities with Discord.js v14 and slash commands","zh":"适合需要高级Discord机器人开发能力的JavaScript/TypeScript专注的AI代理，支持Discord.js v14和斜杠命令","ja":"JavaScript/TypeScriptに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに適しています。Discord.js v14およびスラッシュコマンドを使用した高度なDiscordボット開発機能が必要です","ko":"JavaScript/TypeScript에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Discord.js v14 및 슬래시 명령을 사용한 고급 Discord 봇 개발 기능이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA con enfoque en JavaScript/TypeScript que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de bots de Discord avanzadas con Discord.js v14 y comandos de barra","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur JavaScript/TypeScript nécessitant des capacités de développement de bots Discord avancées avec Discord.js v14 et commandes de barre","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript/TypeScript-fokussierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Discord-Bot-Entwicklungsfunktionen mit Discord.js v14 und Schrägstrichbefehlen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em JavaScript/TypeScript que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de bots do Discord com o Discord.js v14 e comandos de barra","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на JavaScript/TypeScript, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки ботов Discord с помощью Discord.js v14 и команд с запятой","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على JavaScript/TypeScript وهم بحاجة إلى قدرات متقدمة لتطوير بوتات Discord باستخدام Discord.js v14 وأوامر الشرطة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build complex Discord bots with full gateway connections and event handling using Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits, and Events, while also supporting modern features like slash commands","zh":"赋予代理构建复杂的Discord机器人能力，具有完整的网关连接和事件处理，使用Discord.js v14、GatewayIntentBits和事件，同时也支持现代功能，如斜杠命令","ja":"エージェントがDiscord.js v14、GatewayIntentBits、イベントを使用して、フルゲートウェイ接続とイベントハンドリングを備えた複雑なDiscordボットを構築する能力を提供します。スラッシュコマンドなどの最新機能もサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits 및 이벤트를 사용하여 완전한 게이트웨이 연결 및 이벤트 처리를 갖춘 복잡한 Discord 봇을 구축할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 슬래시 명령과 같은 최신 기능도 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir bots de Discord complejos con conexiones de gateway completas y control de eventos utilizando Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits y Events, y también soporta características modernas como comandos de barra","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des bots Discord complexes avec des connexions de passerelle complètes et une gestion d''événements en utilisant Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits et Events, tout en prenant en charge des fonctionnalités modernes comme les commandes de barre","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Discord-Bots mit vollständigen Gateway-Verbindungen und Ereignisverwaltung unter Verwendung von Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits und Events zu erstellen, und unterstützt auch moderne Funktionen wie Schrägstrichbefehle","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir bots Discord complexos com conexões de gateway completas e tratamento de eventos usando Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits e Events, além de suportar recursos modernos como comandos de barra","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложных ботов Discord с полными соединениями шлюза и обработкой событий с помощью Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits и Events, а также поддерживает современные функции, такие как команды с запятой","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء بوتات Discord معقدة مع اتصالات بوابة كاملة ومعالجة الأحداث باستخدام Discord.js v14 و GatewayIntentBits و Events، بالإضافة إلى دعم الميزات الحديثة مثل أوامر الشرطة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building Discord bots with JavaScript/TypeScript","Handling complex interactions with Discord bot events","Implementing slash commands for user engagement"],"zh":["使用JavaScript/TypeScript构建Discord机器人","处理Discord机器人事件的复杂交互","实现斜杠命令以提高用户参与度"],"ja":["JavaScript/TypeScriptを使用したDiscordボットの構築","Discordボットイベントの複雑な相互作用の処理","スラッシュコマンドの実装によるユーザー参与の向上"],"ko":["JavaScript/TypeScript를 사용한 Discord 봇 구축","Discord 봇 이벤트의 복잡한 상호 작용 처리","슬래시 명령의 구현을 통한 사용자 참여 향상"],"es":["Construcción de bots de Discord con JavaScript/TypeScript","Control de interacciones complejas con eventos de bots de Discord","Implementación de comandos de barra para la participación del usuario"],"fr":["Construction de bots Discord avec JavaScript/TypeScript","Gestion d''interactions complexes avec les événements de bot Discord","Mise en œuvre de commandes de barre pour l''engagement de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von Discord-Bots mit JavaScript/TypeScript","Handhabung komplexer Interaktionen mit Discord-Bot-Ereignissen","Implementierung von Schrägstrichbefehlen für die Benutzerverbindung"],"pt":["Construir bots Discord com JavaScript/TypeScript","Manipular interações complexas com eventos de bot do Discord","Implementar comandos de barra para envolvimento do usuário"],"ru":["Создание ботов Discord с помощью JavaScript/TypeScript","Обработка сложных взаимодействий с событиями бота Discord","Реализация команд с запятой для вовлечения пользователя"],"ar":["بناء بوتات Discord باستخدام JavaScript/TypeScript","تعامل مع التفاعلات المعقدة مع أحداث بوت Discord","تنفيذ أوامر الشرطة للمشاركة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Discord.js v14","Needs Node.js environment","JavaScript/TypeScript only"],"zh":["需要Discord.js v14","需要Node.js环境","仅支持JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ja":["Discord.js v14が必要","Node.js環境が必要","JavaScript/TypeScriptのみをサポート"],"ko":["Discord.js v14가 필요","Node.js 환경이 필요","JavaScript/TypeScript만 지원"],"es":["Requiere Discord.js v14","Necesita entorno de Node.js","Solo JavaScript/TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite Discord.js v14","Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Uniquement JavaScript/TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt Discord.js v14","Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Nur JavaScript/TypeScript"],"pt":["Exige Discord.js v14","Necessita de ambiente Node.js","Apenas JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует Discord.js v14","Требует среды Node.js","Только JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب Discord.js v14","يحتاج إلى بيئة Node.js","JavaScript/TypeScript فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
