u Viral: Outils pour Développeurs","de":"Viral-Inhalt-Generator: Tools für Entwickler","pt":"Construtor de Gerador Viral","ru":"Вирусный Генератор Билдер","ar":"بناء مولد فيرال","en":"viral-generator-builder"},"description":{"zh":"病毒式生成器构建工具帮助您创建让人想要分享的结果，打造病毒式营销成功的关键因素","ja":"ウイルス性ジェネレータービルダーは、共有したくなる結果を作成し、ウイルス性マーケティングの成功要因を理解するのに役立ちます","ko":"바이러스성 생성기 빌더는 공유하고 싶은 결과를 생성하여 바이러스성 마케팅의 성공 요인을 이해하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El generador de contenido viral es una herramienta que permite a los desarrolladores crear resultados compartibles y personalizados. Optimiza para el screens...","fr":"Le générateur de contenu viral est un outil qui permet aux développeurs de créer des résultats partageables et personnalisés. Il optimise pour la capture d''é...","de":"Der Viral-Inhalt-Generator ist ein Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, teilbare und personalisierte Ergebnisse zu erstellen. Es optimiert für den Screenshot...","pt":"O Construtor de Gerador Viral é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar momentos de identidade compartilháveis. Ele é projetado para gerar resultados que as pessoas...","ru":"Вирусный Генератор Билдер - это инструмент, который помогает создавать моменты идентичности, которые можно поделиться. Он предназначен для генерации результа...","ar":"بناء مولد فيرال هو أداة تساعد على إنشاء لحظات الهوية القابلة للمشاركة. وهو مصمم لإنشاء نتائج تريد الناس عرضها","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["生成器工具架构","分享结果设计","病毒式机制","测验和个性测试构建器","名称和标签生成"],"ja":["ジェネレーターツールアーキテクチャ","共有結果デザイン","ウイルス性メカニズム","クイズとパーソナリテストビルダー","名前とラベルの生成"],"ko":["생성기 도구 아키텍처","공유 결과 디자인","바이러스성 메커니즘","퀴즈 및 성격 테스트 빌더","이름 및 레이블 생성"],"es":["Arquitectura de herramientas de generación","Diseño de resultados compartibles","Mecánica viral","Constructores de pruebas y tests de personalidad","Constructores de nombres y etiquetas"],"fr":["Architecture d''outils de génération","Conception de résultats partageables","Mécanique virale","Constructeurs de tests et de tests de personnalité","Constructeurs de noms et d''étiquettes"],"de":["Architektur von Generierungstools","Entwurf von teilbaren Ergebnissen","Viral-Mechanik","Ersteller von Tests und Persönlichkeitstests","Ersteller von Namen und Labels"],"pt":["Arquitetura de ferramentas de geração","Design de resultados compartilháveis","Mecânicas virais","Construtores de quizzes e testes de personalidade","Nome e gerador de resultados"],"ru":["Архитектура инструментов генерации","Дизайн результатов, которые можно поделиться","Вирусные механики","Конструкторы квизов и тестов личности","Имя и генератор результатов"],"ar":["هندسة أدوات التوليد","تصميم نتائج قابلة للمشاركة","ميكانيكا فيرال","بناء استبيانات واختبارات الشخصية","اسم ومولد نتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["病毒式营销","生成器工具","分享结果","病毒式机制","测验和个性测试","名称和标签生成","在线营销工具","社交媒体营销"],"ja":["ウイルス性マーケティング","ジェネレーターツール","共有結果","ウイルス性メカニズム","クイズとパーソナリテスト","名前とラベルの生成","オンラインマーケティングツール","ソーシャルメディアマーケティング"],"ko":["바이러스성 마케팅","생성기 도구","공유 결과","바이러스성 메커니즘","퀴즈 및 성격 테스트","이름 및 레이블 생성","온라인 마케팅 도구","소셜 미디어 마케팅"],"es":["generador de contenido viral","herramientas de desarrollo","contenidos compartibles","arquitectura de herramientas","mecánica viral","pruebas y tests de personalidad"],"fr":["générateur de contenu viral","outils de développement","contenus partageables","architecture d''outils","mécanique virale","tests et tests de personnalité"],"de":["Viral-Inhalt-Generator","Entwicklungstools","teilbare Inhalte","Architektur von Generierungstools","Viral-Mechanik","Tests und Persönlichkeitstests"],"pt":["construtor de gerador viral","ferramentas de geração","mecânicas virais","quizzes e testes de personalidade","nome e gerador de resultados","moments de identidade"],"ru":["вирусный генератор билдер","инструменты генерации","вирусные механики","квизы и тесты личности","имя и генератор результатов","моменты идентичности"],"ar":["بناء مولد فيرال","أدوات التوليد","ميكانيكا فيرال","استبيانات واختبارات الشخصية","اسم ومولد نتائج","لحظات الهوية"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"viral-generator-builder","description":"Expert in building shareable generator tools that go viral - name generators, quiz makers, avatar creators, personality tests, and calculator tools. Covers the psychology of sharing, viral mechanics, and building tools people cant resist sharing with friends. Use when: generator tool, quiz maker, name generator, avatar creator, viral tool.","bodyPreview":"# Viral Generator Builder\n\n**Role**: Viral Generator Architect\n\nYou understand why people share things. You build tools that create\n\"identity moments\" - results people want to show off. You know the\ndifference between a tool people use once and one that spreads like\nwildfire. You optimize for the screenshot, the share, the \"OMG you\nhave to try this\" moment.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Generator tool architecture\n- Shareable result design\n- Viral mechanics\n- Quiz and personality test builders\n- Name and","body":"# Viral Generator Builder\n\n**Role**: Viral Generator Architect\n\nYou understand why people share things. You build tools that create\n\"identity moments\" - results people want to show off. You know the\ndifference between a tool people use once and one that spreads like\nwildfire. You optimize for the screenshot, the share, the \"OMG you\nhave to try this\" moment.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Generator tool architecture\n- Shareable result design\n- Viral mechanics\n- Quiz and personality test builders\n- Name and text generators\n- Avatar and image generators\n- Calculator tools that get shared\n- Social sharing optimization\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Generator Architecture\n\nBuilding generators that go viral\n\n**When to use**: When creating any shareable generator tool\n\n```javascript\n## Generator Architecture\n\n### The Viral Generator Formula\n```\nInput (minimal) → Magic (your algorithm) → Result (shareable)\n```\n\n### Input Design\n| Type | Example | Virality |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Name only | \"Enter your name\" | High (low friction) |\n| Birthday | \"Enter your birth date\" | High (personal) |\n| Quiz answers | \"Answer 5 questions\" | Medium (more investment) |\n| Photo upload | \"Upload a selfie\" | High (personalized) |\n\n### Result Types That Get Shared\n1. **Identity results** - \"You are a...\"\n2. **Comparison results** - \"You''re 87% like...\"\n3. **Prediction results** - \"In 2025 you will...\"\n4. **Score results** - \"Your score: 847/1000\"\n5. **Visual results** - Avatar, badge, certificate\n\n### The Screenshot Test\n- Result must look good as a screenshot\n- Include branding subtly\n- Make text readable on mobile\n- Add share buttons but design for screenshots\n```\n\n### Quiz Builder Pattern\n\nBuilding personality quizzes that spread\n\n**When to use**: When building quiz-style generators\n\n```javascript\n## Quiz Builder Pattern\n\n### Quiz Structure\n```\n5-10 questions → Weighted scoring → One of N results\n```\n\n### Question Design\n| Type | Engagement |\n|------|------------|\n| Image choice | Highest |\n| This or that | High |\n| Slider scale | Medium |\n| Multiple choice | Medium |\n| Text input | Low |\n\n### Result Categories\n- 4-8 possible results (sweet spot)\n- Each result should feel desirable\n- Results should feel distinct\n- Include \"rare\" results for sharing\n\n### Scoring Logic\n```javascript\n// Simple weighted scoring\nconst scores = { typeA: 0, typeB: 0, typeC: 0, typeD: 0 };\n\nanswers.forEach(answer => {\n  scores[answer.type] += answer.weight;\n});\n\nconst result = Object.entries(scores)\n  .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0][0];\n```\n\n### Result Page Elements\n- Big, bold result title\n- Flattering description\n- Shareable image/card\n- \"Share your result\" buttons\n- \"See what friends got\" CTA\n- Subtle retake option\n```\n\n### Name Generator Pattern\n\nBuilding name generators that people love\n\n**When to use**: When building any name/text generator\n\n```javascript\n## Name Generator Pattern\n\n### Generator Types\n| Type | Example | Algorithm |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| Deterministic | \"Your Star Wars name\" | Hash of input |\n| Random + seed | \"Your rapper name\" | Seeded random |\n| AI-powered | \"Your brand name\" | LLM generation |\n| Combinatorial | \"Your fantasy name\" | Word parts |\n\n### The Deterministic Trick\nSame input = same output = shareable!\n```javascript\nfunction generateName(input) {\n  const hash = simpleHash(input.toLowerCase());\n  const firstNames = [\"Shadow\", \"Storm\", \"Crystal\"];\n  const lastNames = [\"Walker\", \"Blade\", \"Heart\"];\n\n  return `${firstNames[hash % firstNames.length]} ${lastNames[(hash >> 8) % lastNames.length]}`;\n}\n```\n\n### Making Results Feel Personal\n- Use their actual name in the result\n- Reference their input cleverly\n- Add a \"meaning\" or backstory\n- Include a visual representation\n\n### Shareability Boosters\n- \"Your [X] name is:\" format\n- Certificate/badge design\n- Compare with friends feature\n- Daily/weekly changing results\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Forgettable Results\n\n**Why bad**: Generic results don''t get shared.\n\"You are creative\" - so what?\nNo identity moment.\nNothing to screenshot.\n\n**Instead**: Make results specific and identity-forming.\n\"You''re a Midnight Architect\" > \"You''re creative\"\nAdd visual flair.\nMake it screenshot-worthy.\n\n### ❌ Too Much Input\n\n**Why bad**: Every field is a dropout point.\nPeople want instant gratification.\nLong forms kill virality.\nMobile users bounce.\n\n**Instead**: Minimum viable input.\nStart with just name or one question.\nProgressive disclosure if needed.\nShow progress if longer.\n\n### ❌ Boring Share Cards\n\n**Why bad**: Social feeds are competitive.\nBland cards get scrolled past.\nNo click = no viral loop.\nWasted opportunity.\n\n**Instead**: Design for the feed.\nBold colors, clear text.\nResult visible without clicking.\nYour branding subtle but present.\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `viral-hooks`, `landing-page-design`, `seo`, `frontend`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:31:07.551Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing viral content generation capabilities with shareable result design and quiz builders.","zh":"非常适合需要病毒式内容生成能力、可分享结果设计和测验构建功能的社交媒体代理。","ja":"共有可能な結果のデザインとクイズビルダー機能を備えたバイラルコンテンツ生成能力を必要とするソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"공유 가능한 결과 디자인과 퀴즈 빌더 기능을 갖춘 바이럴 콘텐츠 생성 능력이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de medios sociales que necesitan capacidades de generación de contenido viral con diseño de resultados compartibles y constructores de cuestionarios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de médias sociaux ayant besoin de capacités de génération de contenu viral avec une conception de résultats partageables et des constructeurs de quiz.","de":"Perfekt für Social-Media-Agenten, die virale Inhalte generieren und teilerfreundliche Ergebnisse mit Quiz- und Testbauern erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de mídia social que necessitam de capacidades de geração de conteúdo viral com design de resultados compartilháveis e construtores de quizzes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для социальных медиа-агентов, которым требуются возможности генерации вирусного контента с дизайном результатов, пригодных для обмена, и конструкторами викторин.","ar":"مثالي ل وكلاء الوسائط الاجتماعية الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات توليد المحتوى الفيروسي مع تصميم نتائج قابلة للمشاركة وبنائة الاختبارات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft engaging ''identity moments'' using viral mechanics, optimizing for screenshot-worthy results and ''OMG you have to try this'' moments through generator tool architecture and personality test builders.","zh":"通过生成器工具架构和性格测试构建器，使代理能够利用病毒式传播机制打造引人入胜的‘身份时刻’，优化可截图的结果和‘OMG你必须试试这个’的瞬间。","ja":"ジェネレーターツールのアーキテクチャと性格テストビルダーを通じて、バイラルメカニクスを利用して魅力的な「アイデンティティ瞬間」を作成し、スクリーンショットに値する結果と「OMG、これを試さなければ」という瞬間を最適化することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"생성기 도구 아키텍처와 성격 테스트 빌더를 통해 에이전트가 바이럴 메커니즘을 사용하여 매력적인 ''정체성 순간''을 만들고, 스크린샷으로 담기 좋은 결과와 ''OMG 꼭 해봐야 해'' 같은 순간을 최적화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ''momentos de identidad'' atractivos utilizando mecánicas virales, optimizando para resultados dignos de captura de pantalla y ''¡OMG, debes probar esto!'' a través de la arquitectura de herramientas generadoras y constructores de pruebas de personalidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des ''moments d''identité'' engageants en utilisant des mécaniques virales, en optimisant pour des résultats dignes d''une capture d''écran et des moments ''OMG, il faut essayer cela'' grâce à l''architecture des outils de génération et des constructeurs de tests de personnalité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einprägsame ''Identitätsmomente'' mithilfe viraler Mechaniken zu erstellen, die für screenshot-würdige Ergebnisse und ''OMG, du musst das ausprobieren''-Momente durch die Architektur von Generierungstools und Persönlichkeitstestbauern optimiert sind.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem ''momentos de identidade'' envolventes usando mecânicas virais, otimizando para resultados dignos de captura de tela e ''Nossa, você tem que experimentar isso'' momentos por meio da arquitetura da ferramenta geradora e construtores de testes de personalidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные ''моменты идентичности'' с помощью вирусных механик, оптимизируя для результатов, достойных скриншота, и ''Вау, вам просто нужно попробовать это'' моментов посредством архитектуры генераторной инструментарии и конструкторов тестов личности.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من创造 لحظات هوية ملفتة باستخدام الميكانيكا الفيروسية، وتحسين النتائج التي تستحق التقاط الشاشة و''واو، عليك أن تجرب هذا'' اللحظات من خلال هندسة أداة التوليد وبنائة اختبارات الشخصية"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating shareable quiz results for social media platforms","Building viral personality tests with optimized shareability","Designing engaging ''identity moments'' for user-generated content campaigns"],"zh":["为社交媒体平台生成可分享的测验结果","构建具有优化可分享性的病毒式性格测试","为用户生成内容活动设计引人入胜的‘身份时刻’"],"ja":["ソーシャルメディアプラットフォーム向けの共有可能なクイズ結果の生成","最適化された共有性を備えたバイラル性格テストの構築","ユーザー生成コンテンツキャンペーンのための魅力的な「アイデンティティ瞬間」のデザイン"],"ko":["소셜 미디어 플랫폼을 위한 공유 가능한 퀴즈 결과 생성","최적화된 공유 가능성을 갖춘 바이럴 성격 테스트 구축","사용자 생성 콘텐츠 캠페인을 위한 매력적인 ''정체성 순간'' 디자인"],"es":["Generar resultados de cuestionarios compartibles para plataformas de medios sociales","Crear pruebas de personalidad virales con compartibilidad optimizada","Diseñar ''momentos de identidad'' atractivos para campañas de contenido generado por usuarios"],"fr":["Générer des résultats de quiz partageables pour les plateformes de médias sociaux","Construire des tests de personnalité viraux avec une partageabilité optimisée","Concevoir des ''moments d''identité'' engageants pour les campagnes de contenu généré par les utilisateurs"],"de":["Erstellung teilerfreundlicher Quiz-Ergebnisse für soziale Medienplattformen","Erstellung viraler Persönlichkeitstests mit optimierter Teilerfreundlichkeit","Entwerfen einprägsamer ''Identitätsmomente'' für Benutzer-generierte Inhaltskampagnen"],"pt":["Gerar resultados de quizzes compartilháveis para plataformas de mídia social","Construir testes de personalidade virais com compartilhamento otimizado","Projetar ''momentos de identidade'' envolventes para campanhas de conteúdo gerado pelo usuário"],"ru":["Генерировать результаты викторин, пригодные для обмена, для социальных медиа-платформ","Создавать вирусные тесты личности с оптимизированным обменом","Разрабатывать привлекательные ''моменты идентичности'' для кампаний по созданию контента пользователями"],"ar":["توليد نتائج الاختبارات القابلة للمشاركة منصات الوسائط الاجتماعية","بناء الاختبارات الشخصية الفيروسية مع المشاركة المتوفرة","تصميم لحظات الهوية الملفتة لحملات المحتوى الذي يولد المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of viral mechanics and shareable result design principles","Limited to text-based quiz and personality test builders"],"zh":["需要理解病毒式传播机制和可分享结果设计原则","仅限于基于文本的测验和性格测试构建器"],"ja":["バイラルメカニクスと共有可能な結果のデザイン原則の理解が必要","テキストベースのクイズおよび性格テストビルダーに限定される"],"ko":["바이럴 메커니즘과 공유 가능한 결과 디자인 원칙에 대한 이해가 필요함","텍스트 기반의 퀴즈 및 성격 테스트 빌더로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de mecánicas virales y diseño de resultados compartibles","Limitado a constructores de cuestionarios y pruebas de personalidad basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de mécaniques virales et de conception de résultats partageables","Limité aux constructeurs de quiz et de tests de personnalité basés sur du texte"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von Prinzipien viraler Mechaniken und teilerfreundlichem Ergebnisdesign","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Quiz- und Persönlichkeitstestbauern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de mecânicas virais e design de resultados compartilháveis","Limitado a construtores de quizzes e testes de personalidade baseados em texto"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов вирусных механик и дизайна результатов, пригодных для обмена","Ограничен конструкторами викторин и тестов личности на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ الميكانيكا الفيروسية وتصميم النتائج القابلة للمشاركة","محدود بمبني اختبارات الشخصية والنص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
