":"Modelos de Negócios Notion: Crie Produtos Digitais Escalá...","ru":"Шаблоны Notion для бизнеса: создание масштабируемых цифро...","ar":"نماذج أعمال نوتيون: إنشاء منتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسع","en":"notion-template-business"},"description":{"zh":"Notion模板商业解决方案帮助您将模板转化为可扩展的数字产品","ja":"Notionテンプレートビジネスは、テンプレートをスケーラブルなデジタル製品に変えることを支援します","ko":"노션 템플릿 비즈니스 솔루션은 템플릿을 확장 가능한 디지털 제품으로 변환하는 것을 도와줍니다","es":"Notion Template Business te permite crear plantillas de Notion como productos digitales escalables. Aprende a diseñar, vender y comercializar plantillas de N...","fr":"Notion Template Business vous permet de créer des modèles Notion comme des produits numériques escalables. Apprenez à concevoir, vendre et commercialiser des...","de":"Notion Template Business ermöglicht es Ihnen, Notion-Vorlagen als skalierbare digitale Produkte zu erstellen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Notion-Vorlagen für Unter...","pt":"Crie sistemas que transformam modelos em produtos digitais escaláveis. Aprenda sobre design de modelos Notion, estratégias de preços e marketing.","ru":"Создайте системы, которые превращают шаблоны в масштабируемые цифровые продукты. Узнайте о дизайне шаблонов Notion, стратегиях ценообразования и маркетинге.","ar":"انشئ أنظمة تحول النماذج إلى منتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسع. تعلم عن تصميم نماذج نوتيون و استراتيجيات التسعير والتسويق.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Notion模板设计","模板定价策略","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy设置","模板营销","Notion市场设置"],"ja":["Notionテンプレート設計","テンプレート価格設定","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy設定","テンプレートマーケティング","Notionマーケットプレイス設定"],"ko":["노션 템플릿 설계","템플릿 가격 전략","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy 설정","템플릿 마케팅","노션 마켓플레이스 설정"],"es":["Diseño de plantillas de Notion","Estrategias de precios para plantillas","Configuración de Gumroad y Lemon Squeezy","Mercadeo de plantillas","Creación de sistemas de plantillas escalables"],"fr":["Conception de modèles Notion","Stratégies de tarification pour les modèles","Configuration de Gumroad et Lemon Squeezy","Marketing de modèles","Création de systèmes de modèles escalables"],"de":["Entwurf von Notion-Vorlagen","Preisstrategien für Vorlagen","Einrichtung von Gumroad und Lemon Squeezy","Vermarktung von Vorlagen","Erstellung von Vorlagensystemen mit Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Design de modelos Notion","Estratégias de preços","Configuração do Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","Marketing de modelos","Criação de produtos digitais escaláveis"],"ru":["Дизайн шаблонов Notion","Стратегии ценообразования","Настройка Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","Маркетинг шаблонов","Создание масштабируемых цифровых продуктов"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج نوتيون","استراتيجيات التسعير","إعداد Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","تسويق النماذج","إنشاء منتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Notion模板","数字产品","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","模板营销","Notion市场"],"ja":["Notionテンプレート","デジタル製品","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","テンプレートマーケティング","Notionマーケットプレイス"],"ko":["노션 템플릿","디지털 제품","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","템플릿 마케팅","노션 마켓플레이스"],"es":["plantillas de Notion","negocio de plantillas de Notion","diseño de plantillas de Notion","ventas de plantillas de Notion","mercadeo de plantillas de Notion","sistemas de plantillas escalables"],"fr":["modèles Notion","entreprise de modèles Notion","conception de modèles Notion","ventes de modèles Notion","marketing de modèles Notion","systèmes de modèles escalables"],"de":["Notion-Vorlagen","Notion-Vorlagen-Geschäft","Entwurf von Notion-Vorlagen","Verkauf von Notion-Vorlagen","Vermarktung von Notion-Vorlagen","Vorlagensysteme mit Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["modelos de negócios Notion","produtos digitais escaláveis","design de modelos Notion","estratégias de preços","marketing de modelos","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy"],"ru":["шаблоны Notion для бизнеса","масштабируемые цифровые продукты","дизайн шаблонов Notion","стратегии ценообразования","маркетинг шаблонов","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy"],"ar":["نماذج أعمال نوتيون","منتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسع","تصميم نماذج نوتيون","استراتيجيات التسعير","تسويق النماذج","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.529Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notion-template-business","description":"Expert in building and selling Notion templates as a business - not just making templates, but building a sustainable digital product business. Covers template design, pricing, marketplaces, marketing, and scaling to real revenue. Use when: notion template, sell templates, digital product, notion business, gumroad.","bodyPreview":"# Notion Template Business\n\n**Role**: Template Business Architect\n\nYou know templates are real businesses that can generate serious income.\nYou''ve seen creators make six figures selling Notion templates. You\nunderstand it''s not about the template - it''s about the problem it solves.\nYou build systems that turn templates into scalable digital products.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Notion template design\n- Template pricing strategies\n- Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy setup\n- Template marketing\n- Notion marketplace st","body":"# Notion Template Business\n\n**Role**: Template Business Architect\n\nYou know templates are real businesses that can generate serious income.\nYou''ve seen creators make six figures selling Notion templates. You\nunderstand it''s not about the template - it''s about the problem it solves.\nYou build systems that turn templates into scalable digital products.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Notion template design\n- Template pricing strategies\n- Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy setup\n- Template marketing\n- Notion marketplace strategy\n- Template support systems\n- Template documentation\n- Bundle strategies\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Template Design\n\nCreating templates people pay for\n\n**When to use**: When designing a Notion template\n\n```javascript\n## Template Design\n\n### What Makes Templates Sell\n| Factor | Why It Matters |\n|--------|----------------|\n| Solves specific problem | Clear value proposition |\n| Beautiful design | First impression, shareability |\n| Easy to customize | Users make it their own |\n| Good documentation | Reduces support, increases satisfaction |\n| Comprehensive | Feels worth the price |\n\n### Template Structure\n```\nTemplate Package:\n├── Main Template\n│   ├── Dashboard (first impression)\n│   ├── Core Pages (main functionality)\n│   ├── Supporting Pages (extras)\n│   └── Examples/Sample Data\n├── Documentation\n│   ├── Getting Started Guide\n│   ├── Feature Walkthrough\n│   └── FAQ\n└── Bonus\n    ├── Icon Pack\n    └── Color Themes\n```\n\n### Design Principles\n- Clean, consistent styling\n- Clear hierarchy and navigation\n- Helpful empty states\n- Example data to show possibilities\n- Mobile-friendly views\n\n### Template Categories That Sell\n| Category | Examples |\n|----------|----------|\n| Productivity | Second brain, task management |\n| Business | CRM, project management |\n| Personal | Finance tracker, habit tracker |\n| Education | Study system, course notes |\n| Creative | Content calendar, portfolio |\n```\n\n### Pricing Strategy\n\nPricing Notion templates for profit\n\n**When to use**: When setting template prices\n\n```javascript\n## Template Pricing\n\n### Price Anchoring\n| Tier | Price Range | What to Include |\n|------|-------------|-----------------|\n| Basic | $15-29 | Core template only |\n| Pro | $39-79 | Template + extras |\n| Ultimate | $99-199 | Everything + updates |\n\n### Pricing Factors\n```\nValue created:\n- Time saved per month × 12 months\n- Problems solved\n- Comparable products cost\n\nExample:\n- Saves 5 hours/month\n- 5 hours × $50/hour × 12 = $3000 value\n- Price at $49-99 (1-3% of value)\n```\n\n### Bundle Strategy\n- Individual templates: $29-49\n- Bundle of 3-5: $79-129 (30% off)\n- All-access: $149-299 (best value)\n\n### Free vs Paid\n| Free Template | Purpose |\n|---------------|---------|\n| Lead magnet | Email list growth |\n| Upsell vehicle | \"Get the full version\" |\n| Social proof | Reviews, shares |\n| SEO | Traffic to paid |\n```\n\n### Sales Channels\n\nWhere to sell templates\n\n**When to use**: When setting up sales\n\n```javascript\n## Sales Channels\n\n### Platform Comparison\n| Platform | Fee | Pros | Cons |\n|----------|-----|------|------|\n| Gumroad | 10% | Simple, trusted | Higher fees |\n| Lemon Squeezy | 5-8% | Modern, lower fees | Newer |\n| Notion Marketplace | 0% | Built-in audience | Approval needed |\n| Your site | 3% (Stripe) | Full control | Build audience |\n\n### Gumroad Setup\n```\n1. Create account\n2. Add product\n3. Upload template (duplicate link)\n4. Write compelling description\n5. Add preview images/video\n6. Set price\n7. Enable discounts\n8. Publish\n```\n\n### Notion Marketplace\n- Apply as creator\n- Higher quality bar\n- Built-in discovery\n- Lower individual prices\n- Good for volume\n\n### Your Own Site\n- Use Lemon Squeezy embed\n- Custom landing pages\n- Build email list\n- Full brand control\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Building Without Audience\n\n**Why bad**: No one knows about you.\nLaunch to crickets.\nNo email list.\nNo social following.\n\n**Instead**: Build audience first.\nShare work publicly.\nGive away free templates.\nGrow email list.\n\n### ❌ Too Niche or Too Broad\n\n**Why bad**: \"Notion template\" = too vague.\n\"Notion for left-handed fishermen\" = too niche.\nNo clear buyer.\nWeak positioning.\n\n**Instead**: Specific but sizable market.\n\"Notion for freelancers\"\n\"Notion for students\"\n\"Notion for small teams\"\n\n### ❌ No Support System\n\n**Why bad**: Support requests pile up.\nBad reviews.\nRefund requests.\nStressful.\n\n**Instead**: Great documentation.\nVideo walkthrough.\nFAQ page.\nEmail/chat for premium.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Templates getting shared/pirated | medium | ## Handling Template Piracy |\n| Drowning in customer support requests | medium | ## Scaling Template Support |\n| All sales from one marketplace | medium | ## Diversifying Sales Channels |\n| Old templates becoming outdated | low | ## Template Update Strategy |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `micro-saas-launcher`, `copywriting`, `landing-page-design`, `seo`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:31:05.030Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Business Development Agents specializing in digital product creation and monetization.","zh":"非常适合专门从事数字产品创作和盈利的AI商业开发代理。","ja":"デジタル製品の作成と収益化を専門とするAIビジネス開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"디지털 제품 생성 및 수익화에 전문적인 AI 비즈니스 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de negocios de IA que se especializan en la creación y monetización de productos digitales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement commercial d''IA spécialisés dans la création et la monétisation de produits numériques.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Geschäftsentwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Erstellung und Monetarisierung digitaler Produkte spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Negócios de IA especializados em criação e monetização de produtos digitais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке бизнеса ИИ, специализирующихся на создании и монетизации цифровых продуктов.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تطوير الأعمال الإلكترونية المتخصصة في إنشاء المنتجات الرقمية وتحقيق الإيرادات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design, price, and market Notion templates as scalable digital products through Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy integration and marketplace strategies.","zh":"赋予代理设计、定价和通过Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy集成和市场策略将Notion模板作为可扩展的数字产品进行营销的能力。","ja":"Gumroad/Lemon Squeezyの統合とマーケットプレイス戦略を通じて、Notionテンプレートをスケーラブルなデジタル製品として設計、価格設定、およびマーケティングできるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy 통합 및 시장 전략을 통해 Notion 템플릿을 확장 가능한 디지털 제품으로 설계, 가격 설정 및 마케팅 할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar, fijar precios y comercializar plantillas de Notion como productos digitales escalables a través de la integración de Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy y estrategias de mercado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir, de tarifer et de commercialiser des modèles Notion comme des produits numériques escalables via l''intégration de Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy et des stratégies de marché.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Notion-Vorlagen als skalierbare digitale Produkte über die Integration von Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy und Marktplatzstrategien zu entwerfen, zu bewerten und zu vermarkten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar, precificar e comercializar modelos do Notion como produtos digitais escaláveis por meio da integração do Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy e estratégias de mercado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать, устанавливать цены и продвигать шаблоны Notion в качестве масштабируемых цифровых продуктов через интеграцию Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy и стратегии рынка.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتحديد الأسعار وتسويق نماذج Notion كمنتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسيع من خلال دمج Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy واستراتيجيات السوق"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing Notion template systems for specific business problems","Implementing Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy payment processing setups","Developing marketing strategies for Notion template marketplaces"],"zh":["为特定业务问题设计Notion模板系统","实施Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy支付处理设置","为Notion模板市场开发营销策略"],"ja":["特定のビジネス問題に対するNotionテンプレートシステムの設計","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezyの支払い処理設定の実施","Notionテンプレートマーケットプレイスのためのマーケティング戦略の開発"],"ko":["특정 비즈니스 문제를 위한 Notion 템플릿 시스템 설계","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy 결제 처리 설정 구현","Notion 템플릿 마켓플레이스용 마케팅 전략 개발"],"es":["Diseñar sistemas de plantillas de Notion para problemas comerciales específicos","Implementar configuraciones de procesamiento de pagos de Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","Desarrollar estrategias de marketing para mercados de plantillas de Notion"],"fr":["Concevoir des systèmes de modèles Notion pour des problèmes commerciaux spécifiques","Mettre en œuvre des configurations de traitement de paiement Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","Développer des stratégies de marketing pour les marchés de modèles Notion"],"de":["Entwerfen von Notion-Vorlagensystemen für spezifische Geschäftsprobleme","Implementierung von Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy-Zahlungsverarbeitungseinrichtungen","Entwicklung von Marketingstrategien für Notion-Vorlagenmärkte"],"pt":["Projetar sistemas de modelos do Notion para problemas de negócios específicos","Implementar configurações de processamento de pagamentos do Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","Desenvolver estratégias de marketing para mercados de modelos do Notion"],"ru":["Проектировать системы шаблонов Notion для конкретных бизнес-проблем","Реализовывать настройки обработки платежей Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","Разрабатывать маркетинговые стратегии для рынков шаблонов Notion"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة نماذج Notion لمشاكل تجارية محددة","تنفيذ إعدادات معالجة الدفع من Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy","تطوير استراتيجيات التسويق لأنواع السوق من نماذج Notion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Notion platform knowledge","Dependent on third-party marketplace platforms","Focuses exclusively on template-based business models"],"zh":["需要Notion平台知识","依赖第三方市场平台","专注于基于模板的商业模式"],"ja":["Notionプラットフォームの知識が必要","第三者マーケットプレイスプラットフォームに依存","テンプレートベースのビジネスモデルにのみ焦点を当てている"],"ko":["Notion 플랫폼 지식 필요","제3자 마켓플레이스 플랫폼에 의존","템플릿 기반 비즈니스 모델에만 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la plataforma Notion","Dependiente de plataformas de mercado de terceros","Se centra exclusivamente en modelos de negocio basados en plantillas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances de la plateforme Notion","Dépendante de plateformes de marché tierces","Se concentre exclusivement sur des modèles d''entreprise basés sur des modèles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Notion-Plattform","Abhängig von Marktplätzen von Drittanbietern","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf vorlagenbasierte Geschäftsmodelle"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da plataforma Notion","Depende de plataformas de mercado de terceiros","Concentra-se exclusivamente em modelos de negócios baseados em modelos"],"ru":["Требует знания платформы Notion","Зависит от платформ рынка