y, spacing, and shadows","Implementing multi-brand theming systems with consistent APIs","Establishing design-to-code workflows with Figma tokens for semantic HTML","Architecting component libraries with reusable UI components","Building responsive web applications with adaptive design systems"],"ar":["Creating design tokens for colors, typography, spacing, and shadows","Implementing multi-brand theming systems with consistent APIs","Establishing design-to-code workflows with Figma tokens for semantic HTML","Architecting component libraries with reusable UI components","Building responsive web applications with adaptive design systems"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of CSS, HTML, and design principles","Limited to web and mobile application design","Dependent on Figma or similar design tools for token implementation"],"zh":["需要CSS、HTML和设计原则的知识","仅限于网页和移动应用设计","依赖Figma或类似的设计工具进行令牌实现"],"ja":["CSS、HTML、デザイン原則の知識が必要","Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションデザインに限定される","Figmaまたは同等のデザインツールに依存してトークンを実装する"],"ko":["CSS, HTML 및 디자인 원리의 지식이 필요","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 제한됨","Figma 또는 유사한 디자인 도구에 의존하여 토큰을 구현"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de CSS, HTML y principios de diseño","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles","Dependiente de Figma o herramientas de diseño similares para la implementación de tokens"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en CSS, HTML et principes de conception","Limité à la conception d''applications Web et mobiles","Dépendant de Figma ou d''outils de conception similaires pour la mise en œuvre des jetons"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von CSS, HTML und Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Abhängig von Figma oder ähnlichen Design-Tools für die Token-Implementierung"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of CSS, HTML, and design principles","Limited to web and mobile application design","Dependent on Figma or similar design tools for token implementation"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of CSS, HTML, and design principles","Limited to web a