 Seguras","ru":"Продвинутый Git: Безопасные Операции","ar":"جيت المتقدم: عمليات آمنة","en":"git-advanced"},"description":{"zh":"Git 高级技能提供了安全的版本控制方法，包括 rebase-first 工作流和线性历史，帮助开发者避免代码库错误","ja":"Git アドバンスドスキルは、安全なバージョン管理方法を提供し、rebase-first ワークフローと線形履歴を使用します","ko":"Git 고급 스킬은 안전한 버전 관리 방법을 제공하며 rebase-first 워크플로와 선형 기록을 사용합니다","es":"Guía para operaciones Git avanzadas con consideraciones de seguridad, incluyendo flujo de trabajo de rebase y resolución de conflictos","fr":"Guide pour les opérations Git avancées avec des considérations de sécurité, y compris le flux de travail de rebase et la résolution de conflits","de":"Anleitung für erweiterte Git-Operationen mit Sicherheitsaspekten, einschließlich Rebase-Workflow und Konfliktlösung","pt":"O Git Avançado fornece orientação para operações Git avançadas com considerações de segurança, utilizando um fluxo de trabalho de rebase com histórico linear","ru":"Продвинутый Git предоставляет руководство для продвинутых операций Git с учетом безопасности, используя рабочий процесс ребейза с линейной историей","ar":"جيت المتقدم يقدم إرشادات لعمليات جيت المتقدمة مع مراعاة أمان، باستخدام تدفق عمل إعادة التركيب مع تاريخ خطي","en":"Production-validated SAFe multi-agent development methodology with Claude Code. Treat AI agents as specialized team members (11 roles: BSA, Architect, QAS, e..."},"definition":{"en":"Production-validated SAFe multi-agent development methodology with Claude Code. Treat AI agents as specialized team members (11 roles: BSA, Architect, QAS, etc). Complete whitepaper + working template. "},"features":{"zh":["rebase-first 工作流","线性历史","安全的版本控制","避免代码库错误","高级 Git 操作"],"ja":["rebase-first ワークフロー","線形履歴","安全なバージョン管理","コードベースエラーの回避","高度な Git 操作"],"ko":["rebase-first 워크플로","선형 기록","안전한 버전 관리","코드베이스 오류 방지","고급 Git 작업"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo de rebase","Resolución de conflictos complejos","Uso de git bisect para encontrar errores","Recovery de errores de Git","Operaciones de cherry-picking"],"fr":["Flux de travail de rebase","Résolution de conflits complexes","Utilisation de git bisect pour trouver les erreurs","Récupération des erreurs de Git","Opérations de cherry-picking"],"de":["Rebase-Workflow","Auflösung komplexer Konflikte","Verwendung von git bisect zum Finden von Fehlern","Wiederherstellung von Git-Fehlern","Cherry-Picking-Operationen"],"pt":["Rebase de branches de recursos","Uso de git bisect para encontrar bugs","Cherry-picking de commits entre branches","Resolução de conflitos de merge complexos","Recuperação de erros Git"],"ru":["Ребейз функциональных веток","Использование git bisect для поиска ошибок","Черри-пикинг коммитов между ветками","Решение сложных конфликтов слияния","Восстановление после ошибок Git"],"ar":["إعادة التركيب من فروع الميزات","استخدام جيت بيسكت للعثور على الأخطاء","التحديد العنقودي للتعهدات بين الفروع","حل النزاعات المعقدة للدمج","استعادة من أخطاء جيت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 高级技能","安全的版本控制","rebase-first 工作流","线性历史","Git 操作","代码库安全"],"ja":["Git アドバンスドスキル","安全なバージョン管理","rebase-first ワークフロー","線形履歴","Git 操作","コードベースの安全性"],"ko":["Git 고급 스킬","안전한 버전 관리","rebase-first 워크플로","선형 기록","Git 작업","코드베이스 안전"],"es":["git avanzado","operaciones seguras","rebase workflow","resolución de conflictos","git bisect","cherry-picking","recuperación de errores"],"fr":["git avancé","opérations sécurisées","flux de travail de rebase","résolution de conflits","git bisect","cherry-picking","récupération des erreurs"],"de":["erweitertes git","sichere operationen","rebase-workflow","auflösung von konflikten","git bisect","cherry-picking","wiederherstellung von fehlern"],"pt":["Git Avançado","Operações Git Seguras","Rebase","Resolução de Conflitos","Desenvolvimento de Software","Metodologia de Desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Продвинутый Git","Безопасные Операции Git","Ребейз","Решение Конфликтов","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Методология Разработки"],"ar":["جيت المتقدم","عمليات جيت آمنة","إعادة التركيب","حل النزاعات","تطوير البرمجيات","منهجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-advanced","description":"Advanced git operations including rebase, bisect, cherry-pick, and conflict resolution. Use when rebasing branches, debugging with bisect, cherry-picking commits, or resolving complex merge conflicts.","bodyPreview":"# Git Advanced Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide guidance for advanced git operations with safety considerations. This project uses a **rebase-first workflow** with linear history—understand these patterns to avoid breaking the codebase.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Rebasing feature branches onto main\n- Using git bisect to find bugs\n- Cherry-picking commits between branches\n- Resolving complex merge conflicts\n- Recovering from git mistakes\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Operations\n\n```ba","body":"# Git Advanced Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide guidance for advanced git operations with safety considerations. This project uses a **rebase-first workflow** with linear history—understand these patterns to avoid breaking the codebase.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Rebasing feature branches onto main\n- Using git bisect to find bugs\n- Cherry-picking commits between branches\n- Resolving complex merge conflicts\n- Recovering from git mistakes\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Operations\n\n```bash\n# FORBIDDEN: Force push to protected branches\ngit push --force origin main    # NEVER\ngit push --force origin master  # NEVER\n\n# FORBIDDEN: Merge commits on main branch\ngit merge feature-branch       # Use rebase-and-merge PR strategy\n\n# FORBIDDEN: Skip pre-commit hooks\ngit commit --no-verify         # Hooks exist for a reason\n\n# FORBIDDEN: Rewriting shared history\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5 && git push --force  # If already pushed\n```\n\n### SAFE Operations\n\n```bash\n# SAFE: Force-with-lease on your feature branch\ngit push --force-with-lease origin {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-feature  # Safe\n\n# SAFE: Interactive rebase before first push\ngit rebase -i origin/main   # Squash/clean local commits\n\n# SAFE: Force push after conflict resolution\ngit rebase origin/main && git push --force-with-lease origin {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-feature\n```\n\n## Rebase Workflow (Standard)\n\n### Before Creating PR\n\n```bash\n# 1. Fetch latest changes\ngit fetch origin main\n\n# 2. Rebase onto latest main\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# 3. If conflicts, resolve them\ngit status                   # See conflicted files\n# ... edit files to resolve ...\ngit add <resolved-files>\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# 4. Push with force-with-lease\ngit push --force-with-lease origin {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-feature\n```\n\n### During PR Review (After Feedback)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Make requested changes\ngit add . && git commit -m \"fix: address PR feedback [{TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX]\"\n\n# 2. Fetch and rebase again\ngit fetch origin main\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# 3. Push update\ngit push --force-with-lease origin {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-feature\n```\n\n## Git Bisect (Finding Bugs)\n\n### When to Use\n\nUse bisect when you know a bug was introduced at some point but don''t know which commit.\n\n### Bisect Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Start bisect\ngit bisect start\n\n# 2. Mark current state (has bug)\ngit bisect bad\n\n# 3. Mark a known good commit\ngit bisect good <commit-sha>\n# e.g., git bisect good abc1234\n\n# 4. Git checks out middle commit - test it\nyarn test:unit  # or manual test\n\n# 5. Tell git if this commit is good or bad\ngit bisect good  # or\ngit bisect bad\n\n# 6. Repeat until found\n# Git will tell you the first bad commit\n\n# 7. End bisect\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\n### Automated Bisect\n\n```bash\n# Run a test script automatically\ngit bisect start HEAD abc1234\ngit bisect run yarn test:specific-test\n```\n\n## Cherry-Pick (Selective Commits)\n\n### When to Use\n\n- Backporting a fix to an older branch\n- Pulling a specific commit from one branch to another\n- Selective feature extraction\n\n### Cherry-Pick Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Find the commit SHA\ngit log --oneline branch-name | head -20\n\n# 2. Cherry-pick to current branch\ngit cherry-pick <commit-sha>\n\n# 3. If conflicts, resolve them\ngit status\n# ... resolve conflicts ...\ngit add <resolved-files>\ngit cherry-pick --continue\n\n# 4. Push the result\ngit push origin current-branch\n```\n\n### Cherry-Pick Multiple Commits\n\n```bash\n# Range of commits (oldest..newest, exclusive of oldest)\ngit cherry-pick abc123^..def456\n\n# Specific commits\ngit cherry-pick abc123 def456 ghi789\n```\n\n## Conflict Resolution\n\n### Common Conflict Scenarios\n\n| Scenario                 | Resolution Strategy             |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| Same line edited         | Choose one version or combine   |\n| File deleted vs modified | Decide: keep modified or delete |\n| Rename conflicts         | Decide which name to use        |\n| Binary file conflicts    | Choose one version explicitly   |\n\n### Conflict Resolution Steps\n\n```bash\n# 1. See what''s conflicted\ngit status\n\n# 2. Open conflicted file, look for markers\n<<<<<<< HEAD\nyour changes\n=======\ntheir changes\n>>>>>>> branch-name\n\n# 3. Edit file to resolve (remove markers, keep correct code)\n\n# 4. Mark as resolved\ngit add <resolved-file>\n\n# 5. Continue rebase/merge\ngit rebase --continue\n# or\ngit merge --continue\n```\n\n### Conflict Prevention\n\n```bash\n# Rebase frequently to avoid large conflicts\ngit fetch origin main\ngit rebase origin/main  # Do this daily during long features\n\n# Check for potential conflicts before rebase\ngit diff origin/main...HEAD --stat\n```\n\n## Recovery Commands\n\n### Abort Operations\n\n```bash\n# Abort rebase\ngit rebase --abort\n\n# Abort merge\ngit merge --abort\n\n# Abort cherry-pick\ngit cherry-pick --abort\n```\n\n### Undo Last Commit\n\n```bash\n# Keep changes staged\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\n# Keep changes unstaged\ngit reset HEAD~1\n\n# Discard changes (DANGEROUS)\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1\n```\n\n### Recover Lost Commits\n\n```bash\n# Find lost commits in reflog\ngit reflog\n\n# Restore to a specific state\ngit reset --hard HEAD@{n}\n\n# Cherry-pick a lost commit\ngit cherry-pick <sha-from-reflog>\n```\n\n## Safety Guidelines\n\n### When to Ask Before Force Push\n\n**ALWAYS ask first if:**\n\n- You''ve pushed commits that others might have pulled\n- You''re working on a shared branch\n- You''re not 100% sure what will happen\n- The branch has been open for > 1 week\n\n### Safe Force Push Pattern\n\n```bash\n# 1. Verify you''re on correct branch\ngit branch\n\n# 2. Verify what will be pushed\ngit log origin/{TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-feature..HEAD --oneline\n\n# 3. Use force-with-lease (protects against overwriting others'' work)\ngit push --force-with-lease origin {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX-feature\n```\n\n### Pre-Push Checklist\n\n- [ ] Running `yarn ci:validate` passes\n- [ ] On correct branch (not main or master)\n- [ ] Commits have proper message format\n- [ ] No sensitive data in commits\n\n## Reference\n\n- **CONTRIBUTING.md**: Branch naming and commit format\n- **safe-workflow skill**: Complete workflow patterns\n- **release-patterns skill**: PR and merge patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:32:49.972Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Development Team Agents managing complex codebases with SAFe multi-agent workflows.","zh":"对于管理具有SAFe多智能体工作流程的复杂代码库的开发团队智能体至关重要。","ja":"SAFeのマルチエージェントワークフローを用いた複雑なコードベースを管理する開発チームエージェントに必須です。","ko":"SAFe 다중 에이전트 워크플로우로 복잡한 코드베이스를 관리하는 개발 팀 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes del equipo de desarrollo que administran códigos complejos con flujos de trabajo de varios agentes de SAFe.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de l''équipe de développement gérant des bases de code complexes avec des flux de travail multi-agents SAFe.","de":"Wesentlich für Entwicklungs-Team-Agenten, die komplexe Codebasen mit SAFe-Multi-Agent-Workflows verwalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Equipe de Desenvolvimento que gerenciam codebases complexos com fluxos de trabalho multi-agentes SAFe.","ru":"Необходим для команд разработки, управляющих сложными кодовыми базами с помощью многопользовательских рабочих процессов SAFe.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء فريق التطوير الذين يديرون قواعد كود معقدة مع تدفقات عمل متعددة الوكلاء SAFe."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables rebase-first workflow implementation with linear history maintenance and complex conflict resolution. Provides specialized guidance for git bisect debugging, cherry-picking between branches, and recovery from dangerous operations.","zh":"支持采用变基优先的工作流程实施，包括线性历史记录维护和复杂的冲突解决。为git二分法调试、分支间拣选提交以及从危险操作中恢复提供专门指导。","ja":"リベース優先のワークフロー実装を可能にし、リニアな履歴の維持と複雑なコンフリクト解決を提供します。git bisectデバッグ、ブランチ間でのチェリーピック、危険な操作からの回復に関する専門的なガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"리베이스 우선 워크플로우 구현을 가능하게 하여 선형 역사 유지 및 복잡한 충돌 해결을 제공합니다. git bisect 디버깅, 브랜치 간 체리 픽, 위험한 작업에서의 복구에 대한 전문 지침을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la implementación de un flujo de trabajo de rebase con mantenimiento de historial lineal y resolución de conflictos complejos. Proporciona orientación especializada para depuración con git bisect, cherry-picking entre ramas y recuperación de operaciones peligrosas.","fr":"Permet la mise en œuvre d''un flux de travail de rebase avec une maintenance d''historique linéaire et une résolution de conflits complexes. Fournit des conseils spécialisés pour le débogage avec git bisect, le cherry-picking entre les branches et la récupération des opérations dangereuses.","de":"Ermöglicht die Implementierung eines Rebase-Workflows mit linearer Historienpflege und komplexer Konfliktlösung. Bietet spezielle Anleitung für git bisect-Debugging, Cherry-Picking zwischen Branches und Wiederherstellung von gefährlichen Operationen.","pt":"Permite a implementação do fluxo de trabalho rebase-first com manutenção de histórico linear e resolução de conflitos complexos. Fornece orientação especializada para depuração git bisect, cherry-picking entre branches e recuperação de operações perigosas.","ru":"Позволяет реализовать рабочий процесс rebase-first с поддержкой линейной истории и разрешением сложных конфликтов. Предоставляет специализированное руководство для отладки git bisect, cherry-picking между ветками и восстановления после опасных операций.","ar":"يمكن تنفيذ سير عمل rebase-first مع صيانة تاريخ خطي و حل النزاعات المعقدة. يوفر إرشادات متخصصة للتصحيح git bisect و cherry-picking بين الفروع و الاستعادة من العمليات الخطرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Rebasing feature branches onto main","Using git bisect to identify bug introductions","Cherry-picking commits across release branches","Resolving multi-file merge conflicts","Recovering from accidental destructive operations"],"zh":["将功能分支变基到主分支","使用git bisect识别错误引入","跨发布分支拣选提交","解决多文件合并冲突","从意外的破坏性操作中恢复"],"ja":["機能ブランチをメインブランチにリベース","git bisectを使用したバグ導入の特定","リリースブランチ間でのコミットのチェリーピック","マルチファイルマージコンフリクトの解決","誤った破壊的操作からの回復"],"ko":["기능 브랜치를 메인 브랜치에 리베이스","git bisect를 사용한 버그 도입 지점 식별","릴리스 브랜치 간 커밋 체리 픽","다중 파일 병합 충돌 해결","실수로 수행한 파괴적 작업에서 복구"],"es":["Rebasar ramas de características en la rama principal","Usar git bisect para identificar introducciones de errores","Cherry-picking de confirmaciones entre ramas de lanzamiento","Resolución de conflictos de fusiones multiarchivo","Recuperación de operaciones destructivas accidentales"],"fr":["Réorganiser les branches de fonctionnalités sur la branche principale","Utiliser git bisect pour identifier les introductions de bogues","Cherry-picking de validations entre les branches de version","Résolution de conflits de fusion multi-fichiers","Récupération des opérations destructrices accidentelles"],"de":["Neuordnen von Feature-Branches auf dem Hauptbranch","Verwenden von git bisect zur Identifizierung von Fehler-Einführungen","Cherry-Picking von Commits zwischen Release-Branches","Auflösung von Multi-Datei-Merge-Konflikten","Wiederherstellung von unbeabsichtigten destruktiven Operationen"],"pt":["Rebasing de branches de recurso no branch principal","Usando git bisect para identificar a introdução de bugs","Cherry-picking de commits entre branches de lançamento","Resolução de conflitos de mesclagem de vários arquivos","Recuperação de operações destrutivas acidentais"],"ru":["Перебазирование веток функций на основную ветку","Использование git bisect для выявления введения ошибок","Cherry-picking коммитов между релизными ветками","Разрешение конфликтов слияния нескольких файлов","Восстановление после случайных разрушительных операций"],"ar":["إعادة قاعدة الفروع الميزة على الفرع الرئيسي","استخدام git bisect لتحديد مقدمة العيوب","تشيري-بيكينج من التزامات بين الفروع الإصدار","حل النزاعات من الدمج الملفات المتعددة","استعادة من العمليات التدميرية العرضية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of rebase workflows","Contains FORBIDDEN operations list for safety","SAFe methodology-specific implementation"],"zh":["需要理解变基工作流程","包含出于安全考虑的禁止操作列表","特定于SAFe方法的实施"],"ja":["リベースワークフローの理解が必要","安全性のため禁止操作リストを含む","SAFe方法論に特化した実装"],"ko":["리베이스 워크플로우에 대한 이해 필요","안전을 위한 금지 작업 목록 포함","SAFe 방법론에 특화된 구현"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de flujos de trabajo de rebase","Contiene una lista de operaciones PROHIBIDAS para la seguridad","Implementación específica de la metodología SAFe"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des flux de travail de rebase","Contient une liste d''opérations INTERDITES pour la sécurité","Mise en œuvre spécifique de la méthodologie SAFe"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Rebase-Workflows","Enthält eine Liste von VERBOTENEN Operationen für die Sicherheit","SAFe-spezifische Implementierung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de fluxos de trabalho rebase","Contém lista de operações PROIBIDAS para segurança","Implementação específica da metodologia SAFe"],"ru":["Требует понимания рабочих процессов rebase","Содержит список ЗАПРЕЩЕННЫХ операций для безопасности","Реализация, специфичная для методологии SAFe"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم سير عمل إعادة القاعدة","يحتوي على قائمة OPERAÇÕES PROIBIDAS من أجل السلامة","تنفيذ محدد لمنهجية SAFe"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
