on d''erreurs"],"de":["Methode für die sichere und valide Entwicklung von APIs","Implementierung von API-Routen mit RLS-Kontext-Hilfen","Checklisten für eine sichere und valide Implementierung","Unterstützung für CRUD und Webhooks","Muster für die Fehlerbehandlung"],"pt":["Metodologia SAFe para desenvolvimento de APIs","Checklists para implementação segura de APIs","Templates prontos para uso","Suporte a RLS context helpers","Implementação de endpoints CRUD","Tratamento de erros e webhooks"],"ru":["Методология SAFe для разработки API","Чек-листы для безопасной реализации API","Шаблоны, готовые к использованию","Поддержка RLS context helpers","Реализация endpoint''ов CRUD","Обработка ошибок и вебхуков"],"ar":["منهجية SAFe لتنمية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","قوائم مراجعة لتنفيذ واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الآمنة","قوالب جاهزة للاستخدام","دعم لمساعدي السياق RLS","تنفيذ نقاط النهاية CRUD","معالجة الأخطاء والويب هوك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API","SAFe","CRUD","RLS","API","API"],"ja":["API","SAFe","CRUD","RLS","API","API"],"ko":["API","SAFe","CRUD","RLS","API","API"],"es":["patrones de API","desarrollo de API","SAFe","Claude Code","RLS context helpers","CRUD","webhooks","manejo de errores"],"fr":["modèles d''API","développement d''API","SAFe","Claude Code","RLS context helpers","CRUD","webhooks","gestion d''erreurs"],"de":["API-Muster","API-Entwicklung","SAFe","Claude Code","RLS-Kontext-Hilfen","CRUD","Webhooks","Fehlerbehandlung"],"pt":["padrões de API","desenvolvimento de APIs","SAFe","Claude Code","segurança de API","RLS context helpers","endpoints CRUD","tratamento de erros","webhooks"],"ru":["шаблоны API","разработка API","SAFe","Claude Code","безопасность API","RLS context helpers","endpoint''ы CRUD","обработка ошибок","вебхуки"],"ar":["أنماط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تنمية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","SAFe","Claude Code","أمان واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","مساعدي السياق RLS","نقاط النهاية CRUD","معالجة الأخطاء","الويب هوك"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-patterns","description":"API route implementation patterns with RLS, Zod validation, and error handling. Use when creating API routes, implementing endpoints, or adding server-side validation.","bodyPreview":"# API Patterns Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nRoute to existing API patterns and provide checklists for safe, validated API route implementation. All API routes MUST use RLS context helpers—see `rls-patterns` skill.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating new API routes\n- Implementing CRUD endpoints\n- Adding request/response validation\n- Handling webhooks\n- Implementing error handling patterns\n\n## Authoritative References (MUST READ)\n\n| Pattern           | Location                                      | Pur","body":"# API Patterns Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nRoute to existing API patterns and provide checklists for safe, validated API route implementation. All API routes MUST use RLS context helpers—see `rls-patterns` skill.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating new API routes\n- Implementing CRUD endpoints\n- Adding request/response validation\n- Handling webhooks\n- Implementing error handling patterns\n\n## Authoritative References (MUST READ)\n\n| Pattern           | Location                                      | Purpose                     |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| User Context API  | `docs/patterns/api/user-context-api.md`       | User-scoped operations      |\n| Admin Context API | `docs/patterns/api/admin-context-api.md`      | Admin-scoped operations     |\n| Zod Validation    | `docs/patterns/api/zod-validation-api.md`     | Request/response validation |\n| Webhook Handler   | `docs/patterns/api/webhook-handler.md`        | Webhook processing          |\n| Bonus Content     | `docs/patterns/api/bonus-content-delivery.md` | Protected content delivery  |\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// FORBIDDEN: Direct Prisma calls (bypass RLS)\nconst users = await prisma.user.findMany();\n// Must use: withUserContext, withAdminContext, or withSystemContext\n\n// FORBIDDEN: Missing authentication check\nexport async function GET(req: Request) {\n  return getUserData(); // No auth check!\n}\n\n// FORBIDDEN: Unvalidated user input\nconst { userId } = await req.json();\n// Must validate with Zod schema\n\n// FORBIDDEN: Generic error responses\nreturn new Response(\"Error\", { status: 500 });\n// Must use structured error response\n```\n\n### CORRECT Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT: RLS context + auth check\nexport async function GET(req: Request) {\n  const { userId } = await auth();\n  if (!userId) {\n    return NextResponse.json({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }, { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  const data = await withUserContext(prisma, userId, async (client) => {\n    return client.user.findUnique({ where: { user_id: userId } });\n  });\n\n  return NextResponse.json(data);\n}\n\n// CORRECT: Zod validation\nconst schema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  name: z.string().min(1),\n});\n\nconst result = schema.safeParse(body);\nif (!result.success) {\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    { error: \"Validation failed\", details: result.error.flatten() },\n    { status: 400 },\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## API Route Checklist\n\nBefore ANY API route:\n\n- [ ] Authentication check with `await auth()` from auth provider\n- [ ] Proper 401 response for unauthenticated\n- [ ] Request validation with Zod schema\n- [ ] RLS context wrapper (`withUserContext`/`withAdminContext`/`withSystemContext`)\n- [ ] Structured error responses with appropriate status codes\n- [ ] TypeScript types for request/response\n\n## Standard Response Patterns\n\n### Success Response\n\n```typescript\nreturn NextResponse.json({ data, success: true }, { status: 200 });\n```\n\n### Error Response\n\n```typescript\nreturn NextResponse.json(\n  {\n    error: \"Human-readable error message\",\n    code: \"ERROR_CODE\",\n    details: optional_details,\n  },\n  { status: 400 | 401 | 403 | 404 | 500 },\n);\n```\n\n### Status Codes\n\n| Code | When to Use                                  |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 200  | Success                                      |\n| 201  | Created (POST)                               |\n| 400  | Bad request / validation error               |\n| 401  | Not authenticated                            |\n| 403  | Forbidden (authenticated but not authorized) |\n| 404  | Resource not found                           |\n| 500  | Server error                                 |\n\n## API Route Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { auth } from \"@clerk/nextjs/server\";\nimport { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { withUserContext } from \"@/lib/rls-helpers\";\nimport { prisma } from \"@/lib/prisma\";\n\n// Request validation schema\nconst RequestSchema = z.object({\n  // Define expected fields\n});\n\nexport async function POST(req: Request) {\n  try {\n    // 1. Authenticate\n    const { userId } = await auth();\n    if (!userId) {\n      return NextResponse.json({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }, { status: 401 });\n    }\n\n    // 2. Parse and validate request\n    const body = await req.json();\n    const result = RequestSchema.safeParse(body);\n    if (!result.success) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { error: \"Validation failed\", details: result.error.flatten() },\n        { status: 400 },\n      );\n    }\n\n    // 3. Execute with RLS context\n    const data = await withUserContext(prisma, userId, async (client) => {\n      return client.resource.create({ data: result.data });\n    });\n\n    // 4. Return success response\n    return NextResponse.json({ data, success: true }, { status: 201 });\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"API error:\", error);\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 },\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## API Documentation Template\n\nFor documenting new endpoints:\n\n```markdown\n## Endpoint: POST /api/resource\n\n### Description\n\nCreates a new resource for the authenticated user.\n\n### Authentication\n\nRequired: Session authentication\n\n### Request Body\n\n| Field | Type   | Required | Description   |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------- |\n| name  | string | Yes      | Resource name |\n| type  | string | No       | Resource type |\n\n### Response\n\n**Success (201)**:\n\\`\\`\\`json\n{ \"data\": { \"id\": 1, \"name\": \"...\" }, \"success\": true }\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Error (400)**:\n\\`\\`\\`json\n{ \"error\": \"Validation failed\", \"details\": {...} }\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### RLS Context\n\nUses `withUserContext` - user can only access own resources.\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **rls-patterns**: RLS context helper usage (REQUIRED for all DB operations)\n- **security-audit**: API security validation\n- **testing-patterns**: API endpoint testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:33:27.254Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Development Teams needing standardized API implementation with RLS context helpers and CRUD endpoint management.","zh":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Development Teams needing standardized API implementation with RLS context helpers and CRUD endpoint management.","ja":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Development Teams needing standardized API implementation with RLS context helpers and CRUD endpoint management.","ko":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Development Teams needing standardized API implementation with RLS context helpers and CRUD endpoint management.","es":"Perfecto para equipos de desarrollo de multiagentes que necesitan una implementación de API estandarizada con helpers de contexto RLS y administración de puntos de conexión CRUD.","fr":"Parfait pour les équipes de développement multi-agents ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre d''API standardisée avec des aides de contexte RLS et une gestion de points de terminaison CRUD.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agent-Entwicklungsteams, die eine standardisierte API-Implementierung mit RLS-Kontext-Hilfen und CRUD-Endpunktverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para equipes de desenvolvimento de multi-agentes que necessitam de implementação de API padronizada com helpers de contexto RLS e gerenciamento de endpoints CRUD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для команд разработки многоагентных систем, которым требуется стандартизированная реализация API с помощью контекстных хелперов RLS и управления конечными точками CRUD.","ar":"مثالي للفرق التطويرية متعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ واجهة برمجة تطبيقات موحدة مع مساعدي سياق RLS وإدارة نقاط النهاية CRUD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement safe and validated API routes using SAFe methodology, providing checklists for API route implementation and supporting request/response validation, error handling, and webhook management with RLS context helpers.","zh":"Empowers agents to implement safe and validated API routes using SAFe methodology, providing checklists for API route implementation and supporting request/response validation, error handling, and webhook management with RLS context helpers.","ja":"Empowers agents to implement safe and validated API routes using SAFe methodology, providing checklists for API route implementation and supporting request/response validation, error handling, and webhook management with RLS context helpers.","ko":"Empowers agents to implement safe and validated API routes using SAFe methodology, providing checklists for API route implementation and supporting request/response validation, error handling, and webhook management with RLS context helpers.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar rutas de API seguras y validadas utilizando la metodología SAFe, proporcionando listas de verificación para la implementación de rutas de API y admitiendo la validación de solicitudes/respuestas, el manejo de errores y la administración de webhooks con helpers de contexto RLS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des routes API sécurisées et validées en utilisant la méthodologie SAFe, en fournissant des listes de vérification pour la mise en œuvre des routes API et en prenant en charge la validation des requêtes/réponses, la gestion des erreurs et la gestion des webhooks avec des aides de contexte RLS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und validierte API-Routen unter Verwendung der SAFe-Methode zu implementieren, indem Checklisten für die Implementierung von API-Routen bereitgestellt und die Überprüfung von Anfragen/Antworten, die Fehlerbehandlung und die Verwaltung von Webhooks mit RLS-Kontext-Hilfen unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar rotas de API seguras e validadas usando a metodologia SAFe, fornecendo listas de verificação para a implementação de rotas de API e suportando a validação de solicitação/resposta, tratamento de erros e gerenciamento de webhooks com helpers de contexto RLS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать безопасные и проверенные маршруты API, используя методологию SAFe, предоставляя чек-листы для реализации маршрутов API и поддерживая проверку запроса/ответа, обработку ошибок и управление вебхуками с помощью контекстных хелперов RLS.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مسارات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات آمنة وموثوقة باستخدام منهجية SAFe، وتقديم قوائم التحقق لتنفيذ مسارات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات ودعم التحقق من الطلب/الاستجابة ومعالجة الأخطاء وإدارة الويب هوك مع مساعدي سياق RLS."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure CRUD endpoints","Adding request/response validation for API routes","Handling webhooks with standardized error handling patterns","Creating new API routes with RLS context helpers"],"zh":["Implementing secure CRUD endpoints","Adding request/response validation for API routes","Handling webhooks with standardized error handling patterns","Creating new API routes with RLS context helpers"],"ja":["Implementing secure CRUD endpoints","Adding request/response validation for API routes","Handling webhooks with standardized error handling patterns","Creating new API routes with RLS context helpers"],"ko":["Implementing secure CRUD endpoints","Adding request/response validation for API routes","Handling webhooks with standardized error handling patterns","Creating new API routes with RLS context helpers"],"es":["Implementar puntos de conexión CRUD seguros","Agregar validación de solicitudes/respuestas para rutas de API","Controlar webhooks con patrones de manejo de errores estandarizados","Crear nuevas rutas de API con helpers de contexto RLS"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des points de terminaison CRUD sécurisés","Ajouter une validation des requêtes/réponses pour les routes API","Gérer les webhooks avec des modèles de gestion des erreurs standardisés","Créer de nouvelles routes API avec des aides de contexte RLS"],"de":["Sichere CRUD-Endpunkte implementieren","Anfragen/Antworten-Validierung für API-Routen hinzufügen","Webhooks mit standardisierten Fehlerbehandlungsmustern verwalten","Neue API-Routen mit RLS-Kontext-Hilfen erstellen"],"pt":["Implementar pontos de extremidade CRUD seguros","Adicionar validação de solicitação/resposta para rotas de API","Tratar webhooks com padrões de tratamento de erros padronizados","Criar novas rotas de API com helpers de contexto RLS"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных конечных точек CRUD","Добавление проверки запроса/ответа для маршрутов API","Обработка вебхуков с помощью стандартизированных шаблонов обработки ошибок","Создание новых маршрутов API с помощью контекстных хелперов RLS"],"ar":["تنفيذ نقاط نهاية CRUD آمنة","إضافة التحقق من الطلب/الاستجابة لمسارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","معالجة الويب هوك باستخدام أنماط معالجة الأخطاء الموحدة","إنشاء مسارات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جديدة مع مساعدي سياق RLS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Must use RLS context helpers for API route implementation"],"zh":["Requires understanding of SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Must use RLS context helpers for API route implementation"],"ja":["Requires understanding of SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Must use RLS context helpers for API route implementation"],"ko":["Requires understanding of SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Must use RLS context helpers for API route implementation"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la metodología de desarrollo multiagente SAFe","Debe utilizar helpers de contexto RLS para la implementación de rutas de API"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la méthodologie de développement multi-agent SAFe","Doit utiliser des aides de contexte RLS pour la mise en œuvre des routes API"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der SAFe-Methode für die Multi-Agent-Entwicklung","Muss RLS-Kontext-Hilfen für die Implementierung von API-Routen verwenden"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da metodologia de desenvolvimento multi-agente SAFe","Deve usar helpers de contexto RLS para implementação de rotas de API"],"ru":["Требует понимания методологии разработки многоагентных систем SAFe","Должен использовать контекстные хелперы RLS для реализации маршрутов API"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم منهجية تطوير متعددة الوكلاء SAFe","يجب استخدام مساعدي سياق RLS لتنفيذ مسارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
