pago","gestión de suscripciones","webhooks de Stripe","pruebas de pago","reembolsos y disputas"],"fr":["intégration de Stripe","modèles de rayures","développement d''agents multiples","méthodologie de développement","sécurité de paiement","gestion d''abonnements","webhooks de Stripe","tests de paiement","remboursements et litiges"],"de":["Stripe-Integration","Streifenmuster","Entwicklung mehrerer Agenten","Entwicklungs-methodik","Zahlungssicherheit","Abonnementsverwaltung","Stripe-Webhooks","Zahlungstests","Rückerstattungen und Streitigkeiten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de agentes","integração da Stripe","metodologia SAFe","AI como membros da equipe","segurança e consistência","testes de pagamento"],"ru":["разработка агентов","интеграция Stripe","методология SAFe","ИИ как члены команды","безопасность и последовательность","тестирование оплаты"],"ar":["تطوير الوكلاء","دمج سترايب","منهجية ساف","الذكاء الاصطناعي كأعضاء الفريق","الأمان والاتساق","اختبار الدفع"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stripe-patterns","description":"Stripe payment integration patterns. Use when implementing payment flows, handling webhooks, or working with subscriptions. Routes to existing patterns and provides evidence templates for payment testing.","bodyPreview":"# Stripe Patterns Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide safe and consistent Stripe integration. Routes to existing payment patterns and provides evidence templates for testing.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating or modifying checkout flows\n- Implementing Stripe webhooks\n- Working with subscriptions or invoices\n- Testing payment functionality\n- Handling refunds or disputes\n\n## Canonical Code References\n\n### Configuration\n\n- **Stripe Client Factory**: `lib/stripe-config.ts`\n  - Use `createStripeClient()`","body":"# Stripe Patterns Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide safe and consistent Stripe integration. Routes to existing payment patterns and provides evidence templates for testing.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating or modifying checkout flows\n- Implementing Stripe webhooks\n- Working with subscriptions or invoices\n- Testing payment functionality\n- Handling refunds or disputes\n\n## Canonical Code References\n\n### Configuration\n\n- **Stripe Client Factory**: `lib/stripe-config.ts`\n  - Use `createStripeClient()` for consistent API version\n  - Never hardcode API keys\n\n### API Routes\n\n- **Checkout Session**: `app/api/payments/create-checkout-session/route.ts`\n- **Webhook Handler**: `app/api/payments/webhook/route.ts`\n\n### Helpers\n\n- **Payment Helpers**: `utils/data/payments/` (use RLS context)\n- **Subscription Helpers**: `utils/data/subscriptions/`\n- **Invoice Helpers**: `utils/data/invoices/`\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Test Mode Safety Checklist\n\nBefore ANY payment work:\n\n- [ ] Verify `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` starts with `sk_test_`\n- [ ] Confirm test webhook secret (`whsec_...` from Stripe CLI)\n- [ ] Use test card numbers only (4242...)\n- [ ] Never use production keys in development\n\n### Idempotency Checklist\n\nFor webhook handlers:\n\n- [ ] Store event ID before processing\n- [ ] Check for duplicate events\n- [ ] Use database transactions\n- [ ] Return 200 OK even on idempotency skip\n\n```typescript\n// Idempotent webhook pattern\nawait withSystemContext(prisma, \"webhook\", async (client) => {\n  // Check if already processed\n  const existing = await client.webhook_events.findUnique({\n    where: { stripe_event_id: event.id },\n  });\n  if (existing) {\n    console.log(`Skipping duplicate event: ${event.id}`);\n    return;\n  }\n\n  // Process and record\n  await client.webhook_events.create({\n    data: {\n      stripe_event_id: event.id,\n      event_type: event.type,\n      processed_at: new Date(),\n    },\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Webhook Signature Verification\n\n**ALWAYS** verify webhook signatures:\n\n```typescript\nimport { stripe } from \"@/lib/stripe-config\";\n\nconst signature = request.headers.get(\"stripe-signature\");\nconst event = stripe.webhooks.constructEvent(\n  body,\n  signature,\n  process.env.STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET,\n);\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create Checkout Session\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStripeClient } from \"@/lib/stripe-config\";\nimport { withUserContext } from \"@/lib/rls-context\";\n\nexport async function createCheckout(userId: string, priceId: string) {\n  const stripe = createStripeClient();\n\n  // Store user context for success handling\n  const session = await stripe.checkout.sessions.create({\n    mode: \"subscription\",\n    line_items: [{ price: priceId, quantity: 1 }],\n    success_url: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/success?session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}`,\n    cancel_url: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/pricing`,\n    metadata: { userId },\n  });\n\n  return session;\n}\n```\n\n### Handle Subscription Events\n\n```typescript\n// Webhook event types to handle\nconst SUBSCRIPTION_EVENTS = [\n  \"customer.subscription.created\",\n  \"customer.subscription.updated\",\n  \"customer.subscription.deleted\",\n  \"invoice.payment_succeeded\",\n  \"invoice.payment_failed\",\n];\n```\n\n## Evidence Template for Linear\n\nWhen completing payment work, attach this evidence block:\n\n```markdown\n**Payment Testing Evidence**\n\n- [ ] Test mode verified (`sk_test_` key)\n- [ ] Webhook signature verification tested\n- [ ] Idempotency tested (duplicate event handling)\n- [ ] Success flow tested (card 4242...)\n- [ ] Failure flow tested (card 4000000000000002)\n- [ ] Subscription lifecycle tested (create/update/cancel)\n\n**Test Results:**\n\n- Checkout session: [session_id]\n- Webhook events processed: [count]\n- Subscription status: [active/cancelled]\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- **Stripe Config**: `lib/stripe-config.ts`\n- **Webhook Route**: `app/api/payments/webhook/route.ts`\n- **Payment Tests**: `__tests__/payments/`\n- **Stripe Docs**: https://stripe.com/docs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:33:55.999Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for E-commerce Agents requiring seamless Stripe integration and payment processing capabilities.","zh":"适合需要无缝Stripe集成和支付处理功能的电子商务代理。","ja":"Stripeのシームレスな統合と支払い処理機能を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適。","ko":"무정지 스트라이프 통합과 결제 처리 기능을 필요로 하는 전자 상거래 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de comercio electrónico que requieren una integración con Stripe sin problemas y capacidades de procesamiento de pagos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de commerce électronique nécessitant une intégration Stripe transparente et des capacités de traitement de paiement.","de":"Ideal für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine nahtlose Stripe-Integration und Zahlungsverarbeitungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que exigem integração perfeita com o Stripe e capacidades de processamento de pagamentos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, требующих бесшовной интеграции со Stripe и возможностей обработки платежей.","ar":"مثالي لويجوه التجارة الإلكترونية التي تتطلب التكامل السلس مع Stripe وقدرات معالجة الدفع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide safe and consistent Stripe integration, utilizing Stripe webhooks, handling subscriptions and invoices, and providing evidence templates for testing, all while leveraging the Stripe Client Factory and createStripeClient() function from lib/stripe-config.ts.","zh":"赋予代理商实现安全一致的Stripe集成的能力，利用Stripe Webhook，处理订阅和发票，并提供测试的证据模板，同时利用lib/stripe-config.ts中的Stripe Client Factory和createStripeClient()函数。","ja":"エージェントが安全で一貫性のあるStripe統合を実現できるようにすることで、Stripe Webhookを利用し、サブスクリプションや請求書を処理し、テスト用の証拠テンプレートを提供し、lib/stripe-config.tsのStripe Client FactoryとcreateStripeClient()関数を活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 안전하고 일관된 스트라이프 통합을 제공할 수 있도록 스트라이프 웹후크를 사용하여 구독 및 청구서를 처리하고 테스트를 위한 증거 템플릿을 제공하며 lib/stripe-config.ts의 스트라이프 클라이언트 팩토리와 createStripeClient() 함수를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a guiar una integración segura y consistente con Stripe, utilizando webhooks de Stripe, manejo de suscripciones y facturas, y proporcionando plantillas de evidencia para pruebas, todo mientras aprovecha la fábrica de clientes de Stripe y la función createStripeClient() desde lib/stripe-config.ts.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider une intégration sécurisée et cohérente de Stripe, en utilisant les webhooks de Stripe, en gérant les abonnements et les factures, et en fournissant des modèles de preuve pour les tests, tout en exploitant la fabrique de clients Stripe et la fonction createStripeClient() à partir de lib/stripe-config.ts.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine sichere und konsistente Stripe-Integration zu leiten, indem Stripe-Webhooks verwendet werden, Abonnements und Rechnungen gehandhabt werden und Beweisvorlagen für Tests bereitgestellt werden, während die Stripe-Client-Fabrik und die createStripeClient()-Funktion aus lib/stripe-config.ts genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar a integração segura e consistente do Stripe, utilizando webhooks do Stripe, manipulando assinaturas e faturas, e fornecendo modelos de evidências para testes, tudo isso aproveitando a Fábrica de Cliente do Stripe e a função createStripeClient() do lib/stripe-config.ts.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить безопасную и последовательную интеграцию со Stripe, используя веб-хуки Stripe, обрабатывая подписки и счета, и предоставляя шаблоны доказательств для тестирования, все это при использовании Фабрики клиента Stripe и функции createStripeClient() из lib/stripe-config.ts.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من توجيه التكامل الآمن والمثالي لشركة Stripe ، باستخدام ويب هوك Stripe ، ومعالجة الاشتراكات والفواتير ، وتقديم قوالب أدلة للاختبار ، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من مصنع عميل Stripe ووظيفة createStripeClient() من lib/stripe-config.ts."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure checkout flows with Stripe payment gateways","Automating subscription and invoice management using Stripe webhooks","Testing and validating payment functionality with evidence templates","Handling refunds and disputes through Stripe''s API","Integrating Stripe with existing payment patterns for streamlined e-commerce operations"],"zh":["使用Stripe支付网关实现安全的结账流程","使用Stripe Webhook自动化订阅和发票管理","使用证据模板测试和验证支付功能","通过Stripe的API处理退款和争议","将Stripe与现有的支付模式集成以简化电子商务操作"],"ja":["Stripeの支払いゲートウェイを使用して安全な決済フローを実現する","Stripe Webhookを使用してサブスクリプションと請求書の管理を自動化する","証拠テンプレートを使用して支払い機能をテストして検証する","StripeのAPIを使用して返金と紛争を処理する","Stripeを既存の支払いパターンと統合して電子商取引のオペレーションを簡素化する"],"ko":["스트라이프 결제 게이트웨이를 사용하여 안전한 결제 흐름을 구현합니다.","스트라이프 웹후크를 사용하여 구독 및 청구서 관리를 자동화합니다.","증거 템플릿을 사용하여 결제 기능을 테스트하고 검증합니다.","스트라이프의 API를 사용하여 환불 및 분쟁을 처리합니다.","스트라이프를 기존의 결제 패턴과 통합하여 전자 상거래 운영을 간소화합니다."],"es":["Implementar flujos de pago seguro con pasarelas de pago de Stripe","Automatizar la gestión de suscripciones y facturas utilizando webhooks de Stripe","Probar y validar la funcionalidad de pago con plantillas de evidencia","Gestionar reembolsos y disputas a través de la API de Stripe","Integrar Stripe con patrones de pago existentes para operaciones de comercio electrónico optimizadas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des flux de paiement sécurisés avec les passerelles de paiement Stripe","Automatiser la gestion des abonnements et des factures en utilisant les webhooks de Stripe","Tester et valider la fonctionnalité de paiement avec des modèles de preuve","Gérer les remboursements et les litiges via l''API de Stripe","Intégrer Stripe avec des modèles de paiement existants pour des opérations de commerce électronique optimisées"],"de":["Implementierung sicherer Zahlungsflüsse mit Stripe-Zahlungsgateways","Automatisierung der Abonnements- und Rechnungsverwaltung mithilfe von Stripe-Webhooks","Testen und Validieren der Zahlungsfunktion mit Beweisvorlagen","Handhabung von Rückerstattungen und Streitigkeiten über die Stripe-API","Integration von Stripe mit bestehenden Zahlungsmustern für optimierte E-Commerce-Operationen"],"pt":["Implementação de fluxos de checkout seguros com gateways de pagamento do Stripe","Automatização da gestão de assinaturas e faturas usando webhooks do Stripe","Testes e validação da funcionalidade de pagamento com modelos de evidências","Tratamento de reembolsos e disputas por meio da API do Stripe","Integração do Stripe com padrões de pagamento existentes para operações de comércio eletrônico otimizadas"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных потоков оплаты с использованием платежных шлюзов Stripe","Автоматизация управления подписками и счетами с помощью веб-хуков Stripe","Тестирование и проверка функциональности оплаты с помощью шаблонов доказательств","Обработка возвратов и споров через API Stripe","Интеграция Stripe с существующими шаблонами оплаты для оптимизации операций электронной коммерции"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات الدفع الآمنة مع بوابات دفع Stripe","الآلية التلقائية لإدارة الاشتراكات والفواتير باستخدام ويب هوك Stripe","اختبار وتحقق من وظائف الدفع باستخدام قوالب الأدلة","معالجة الاسترجاعات والمخالفات من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe","دمج Stripe مع أنماط الدفع الحالية لعمليات التجارة الإلكترونية المُثلى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Stripe API credentials","Limited to Stripe payment gateway integration","Needs SAFe multi-agent development methodology for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要Stripe API凭证","仅限Stripe支付网关集成","需要SAFe多代理开发方法论以实现最佳实践"],"ja":["Stripe APIの資格情報が必要","Stripeの支払いゲートウェイの統合のみ","最適な実装のためにSAFeマルチエージェント開発方法論が必要"],"ko":["스트라이프 API 자격 증명이 필요합니다.","스트라이프 결제 게이트웨이 통합만 해당됩니다.","최적의 구현을 위해 SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발 방법론이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere credenciales de la API de Stripe","Limitado a la integración con la pasarela de pago de Stripe","Necesita la metodología de desarrollo de agentes multi-SAFe para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification de l''API Stripe","Limité à l''intégration avec la passerelle de paiement Stripe","Nécessite la méthodologie de développement d''agents multi-SAFe pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Benötigt Stripe-API-Zugangsdaten","Begrenzt auf die Integration mit dem Stripe-Zahlungsgateway","Benötigt die SAFe-Mehrfachagenten-Entwicklungsmethodik für eine optimale Implementierung"],"pt":["Exige credenciais de API do Stripe","Limitado à integração do gateway de pagamento do Stripe","Necessita da metodologia de desenvolvimento de vários agentes SAFe para implementação ótima"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных API Stripe","Ограничен интеграцией платежного шлюза Stripe","Требует методологии разработки нескольких агентов SAFe для оптимальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات اعتماد واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe","محدود بتكامل بوابة دفع Stripe","يحتاج إلى منهجية تطوير متعدد الوكلاء SAFe للحصول على التنفيذ الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
