ethodik","Entwicklung von AI-Agents","Claude Code","sicheres Deployment","Validierung des Deployments"],"pt":["método de implantação de AI","desenvolvimento de multi-agente","SAFe","Claude Code","implantação segura","validação de implantação","desenvolvedores de AI"],"ru":["метод развертывания ИИ","разработка многоагентных систем","SAFe","Claude Code","безопасное развертывание","валидация развертывания","разработчики ИИ"],"ar":["طريقة نشر آي آي","تطوير متعدد الوكلاء","SAFe","Claude Code","نشر آمن","تصديق النشر","مطورو آي آي"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deployment-sop","description":"Deployment workflows, pre-deploy validation, and smoke testing patterns. Use when deploying to staging or production, running smoke tests, or validating deployments.","bodyPreview":"# Deployment SOP Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nRoute to existing deployment SOPs and provide checklists for safe, validated deployments. This skill does NOT duplicate SOP content—it links to authoritative sources.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Deploying to staging or production\n- Running pre-deploy validation\n- Executing post-deploy smoke tests\n- Accessing development machines for deployment\n- Coordinating release activities\n\n## Authoritative References (MUST READ)\n\n| Document                 | Location","body":"# Deployment SOP Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nRoute to existing deployment SOPs and provide checklists for safe, validated deployments. This skill does NOT duplicate SOP content—it links to authoritative sources.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Deploying to staging or production\n- Running pre-deploy validation\n- Executing post-deploy smoke tests\n- Accessing development machines for deployment\n- Coordinating release activities\n\n## Authoritative References (MUST READ)\n\n| Document                 | Location                                          | Purpose                     |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| Semantic Release SOP     | `docs/ci-cd/Semantic-Release-Deployment-SOP.md`   | Release automation workflow |\n| Staging/UAT Release SOP  | `docs/sop/STAGING-UAT-RELEASE-SOP.md`             | UAT validation process      |\n| Linux Dev Machine Access | `docs/deployment/LINUX-DEV-MACHINE-ACCESS-SOP.md` | Dev server access           |\n| Production Server Access | `docs/deployment/PRODUCTION-SERVER-ACCESS-SOP.md` | Production deployment       |\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\nBefore ANY deployment:\n\n- [ ] All CI checks pass (GitHub Actions green)\n- [ ] PR merged to target branch\n- [ ] No unresolved blockers in Linear\n- [ ] Database migrations tested locally\n- [ ] Environment variables verified\n\n```bash\n# Validate before deploy\nyarn ci:validate\nyarn build\n```\n\n## Post-Deployment Smoke Test\n\nAfter deployment completes:\n\n- [ ] Health endpoint responds: `curl https://{domain}/api/health`\n- [ ] Database connection verified (check health response)\n- [ ] Authentication flow works (sign-in/sign-up)\n- [ ] Critical user flows functional\n- [ ] No new errors in logs\n\n```bash\n# Smoke test commands\ncurl -s https://{domain}/api/health | jq .\n# Expected: {\"status\":\"healthy\",\"timestamp\":\"...\"}\n```\n\n## Deployment Evidence Template\n\nFor Linear ticket attachment:\n\n```markdown\n## Deployment Evidence - {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX\n\n### Environment\n\n- **Target**: Staging / Production\n- **Branch**: `{branch_name}`\n- **Commit**: `{commit_sha}`\n\n### Pre-Deployment\n\n- [x] CI checks passed\n- [x] PR merged\n- [x] Migrations verified\n\n### Post-Deployment\n\n- [x] Health check: PASSED\n- [x] Auth flow: PASSED\n- [x] Smoke tests: PASSED\n\n### Verification\n\ncurl -s https://{domain}/api/health\n{\"status\":\"healthy\",\"timestamp\":\"2025-XX-XXTXX:XX:XX.XXXZ\"}\n```\n\n## Rollback Procedure\n\nIf deployment fails:\n\n1. **Identify failure** - Check logs, monitoring dashboards\n2. **Revert commit** - `git revert {commit_sha}`\n3. **Push revert** - Triggers automatic rollback deployment\n4. **Verify rollback** - Run smoke tests again\n5. **Document incident** - Update Linear ticket with evidence\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN\n\n- Deploying with failing CI checks\n- Skipping smoke tests on production\n- Deploying database migrations without local testing\n- Force-deploying over active incidents\n\n### REQUIRED\n\n- Health check MUST pass within 5 minutes\n- Production deployments MUST have staging validation first\n- Rollback plan MUST be documented before production deploy\n\n## Branch → Environment Mapping\n\n| Branch   | Environment | Auto-Deploy |\n| -------- | ----------- | ----------- |\n| `dev`    | Staging     | Manual pull |\n| `main`   | Production  | Automatic   |\n\n**Note**: Merging to `dev` builds Docker image but requires manual pull on staging server.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:33:47.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Agent Development Teams needing standardized SAFe deployment methodologies with Claude Code integration.","zh":"适合需要标准化SAFe部署方法的多代理开发团队，且具有Claude Code集成。","ja":"Claude Codeの統合を備えた標準的なSAFeデプロイメント方法ロジーが必要なマルチエージェント開発チームに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 SAFe 배포 방법론 및 Claude Code 통합이 필요한 다중 에이전트 개발 팀에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para equipos de desarrollo de multiagentes que necesitan metodologías de implementación de SAFe estandarizadas con integración de Claude Code.","fr":"Idéal pour les équipes de développement multi-agents ayant besoin de méthodologies de déploiement SAFe standardisées avec une intégration de Claude Code.","de":"Ideal für Multi-Agent-Entwicklungsteams, die standardisierte SAFe-Implementierungsmethoden mit Claude-Code-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para equipes de desenvolvimento de multi-agente que precisam de metodologias de implantação SAFe padronizadas com integração do Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для команд разработки многоагентных систем, которым необходимы стандартизированные методологии развертывания SAFe с интеграцией Claude Code.","ar":"مثالية للفرق التى تتطور متعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى منهجيات نشر_SAFe معايير مع إدماج Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute safe and validated deployments by providing checklists and linking to authoritative sources, utilizing protocols such as pre-deploy validation and post-deploy smoke tests, and coordinating release activities across 11 specialized team member roles.","zh":"赋予代理执行安全且经过验证的部署，通过提供清单并链接到权威来源，利用预部署验证和发布后烟雾测试等协议，并在11个专门的团队成员角色之间协调发布活动。","ja":"チェックリストの提供や権威ある情報源へのリンクを行い、事前デプロイの検証や事後デプロイのスモークテストなどのプロトコルを利用し、11の専門チームメンバーの役割を横断してリリース活動を調整することで、エージェントが安全で検証済みのデプロイを実行できるようにします。","ko":"체크리스트를 제공하고 권위 있는 정보源에 연결하고 예치 배포 검증 및 배포 후 연기 테스트 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 다중 에이전트 팀 간의发布 활동을 조정함으로써 에이전트가 안전하고 검증된 배포를 실행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar implementaciones seguras y validadas al proporcionar listas de verificación y enlaces a fuentes autorizadas, utilizando protocolos como la validación previa a la implementación y las pruebas de humo posteriores a la implementación, y coordinando las actividades de lanzamiento en 11 roles de miembros del equipo especializados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des déploiements sécurisés et validés en fournissant des listes de vérification et en faisant des liens vers des sources autorisées, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la validation préalable au déploiement et les tests de fumée postérieurs au déploiement, et en coordonnant les activités de lancement à travers 11 rôles de membres d''équipe spécialisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und überprüfte Bereitstellungen durchzuführen, indem es Prüflisten und Verknüpfungen mit autoritativen Quellen zur Verfügung stellt und Protokolle wie die Überprüfung vor der Bereitstellung und die Rauchtests nach der Bereitstellung verwendet und die Freigabeaktivitäten über 11 spezialisierte Teammitglieder-Rollen koordiniert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar implantações seguras e validadas, fornecendo listas de verificação e linkando para fontes autorizadas, utilizando protocolos como validação pré-implantação e testes de fumaça pós-implantação, e coordenando atividades de lançamento em 11 funções de membros da equipe especializados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять безопасные и проверенные развертывания, предоставляя контрольные списки и ссылки на авторитетные источники, используя протоколы, такие как предварительная проверка развертывания и пост-развертывание тесты на дым, и координируя выпуски по 11 специализированным ролям членов команды.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ عمليات النشر الآمنة والمؤكدة من خلال تقديم قوائم التحقق والربط بالمصادر الموثوقة، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التحقق قبل النشر واختبارات الدخان بعد النشر، وتنسيق أنشطة الإصدار عبر 11 دورة متخصصة لأعضاء الفريق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating staging and production deployments","Generating deployment checklists for SAFe compliance","Coordinating release activities across multi-agent teams"],"zh":["自动化预生产和生产环境的部署","生成SAFe合规性的部署清单","在多代理团队中协调发布活动"],"ja":["ステージングとプロダクションのデプロイの自動化","SAFeコンプライアンスのデプロイチェックリストの生成","マルチエージェントチーム間のリリース活動の調整"],"ko":["스태이징 및 프로덕션 배포 자동화","SAFe 규정 준수 배포 체크리스트 생성","다중 에이전트 팀 간의 릴리즈 활동 조정"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de ensayo y producción","Generación de listas de verificación de implementación para la conformidad con SAFe","Coordinación de actividades de lanzamiento en equipos multiagentes"],"fr":["Automatisation des déploiements de test et de production","Génération de listes de vérification de déploiement pour la conformité SAFe","Coordination des activités de lancement dans les équipes multi-agents"],"de":["Automatisierung von Staging- und Produktionsbereitstellungen","Erstellung von Bereitstellungs-Prüflisten für die SAFe-Konformität","Koordinierung von Freigabeaktivitäten in Multi-Agent-Teams"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações em staging e produção","Gerar listas de verificação de implantação para conformidade SAFe","Coordenar atividades de lançamento em equipes multi-agente"],"ru":["Автоматизация развертывания в staging и производстве","Генерация контрольных списков развертывания для соответствия SAFe","Координация выпусков по командам многоагентных систем"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات النشر في مرحلة ما قبل الإنتاج والانتاج","توليد قوائم التحقق من عمليات النشر للامتثال ل_SAFe","تنسيق أنشطة الإصدار عبر فرق متعددة الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to development machines for deployment","Limited to SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Dependent on Claude Code integration"],"zh":["需要访问开发机器以进行部署","仅限SAFe多代理开发方法","依赖于Claude Code集成"],"ja":["デプロイを行うために開発マシンへのアクセスが必要","SAFeマルチエージェント開発方法ロジーに限定される","Claude Codeの統合に依存する"],"ko":["배포를 위해 개발 머신에 접근해야 함","SAFe 다중 에이전트 개발 방법론에만 한정됨","Claude Code 통합에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a máquinas de desarrollo para la implementación","Limitado a la metodología de desarrollo multiagente SAFe","Dependiente de la integración de Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux machines de développement pour le déploiement","Limité à la méthodologie de développement multi-agent SAFe","Dépendant de l''intégration de Claude Code"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Entwicklungsmaschinen für die Bereitstellung","Begrenzt auf die SAFe-Multi-Agent-Entwicklungsmethodik","Abhängig von der Claude-Code-Integration"],"pt":["Requer acesso às máquinas de desenvolvimento para implantação","Limitado à metodologia de desenvolvimento multi-agente SAFe","Dependente da integração do Claude Code"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к машинам разработки для развертывания","Ограничен методологией разработки многоагентных систем SAFe","Зависит от интеграции с Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أجهزة التطوير لنشر","محدود بمنهجية تطوير متعددة الوكلاء _SAFe","يعتمد على إدماج Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
