e rutas de API para autenticación","Detección de vulnerabilidades","Revisión de seguridad previa a la implementación","Comprobación de credenciales expuestas","Revisión de patrones de acceso a bases de datos"],"fr":["Validation des politiques de RLS","Analyse des routes d''API pour l''authentification","Détection de vulnérabilités","Révision de sécurité avant le déploiement","Vérification de credenciales exposées","Révision de modèles d''accès aux bases de données"],"de":["Validierung von RLS-Richtlinien","Analyse von API-Routen für Authentifizierung","Erkennung von Schwachstellen","Sicherheitsüberprüfung vor der Bereitstellung","Überprüfung von offengelegten Anmeldeinformationen","Überprüfung von Datenbankzugriffsmustern"],"pt":["Validação de políticas de RLS","Análise de rotas de API para autenticação","Detecção de vulnerabilidades","Revisão de segurança pré-implementação","Verificação de credenciais expostas","Análise de padrões de acesso ao banco de dados"],"ru":["Валидация политик RLS","Анализ маршрутов API для аутентификации","Обнаружение уязвимостей","Предварительный обзор безопасности","Проверка открытых учетных данных","Анализ шаблонов доступа к базе данных"],"ar":["التحقق من سياسات RLS","تحليل مسارات API للتحقق","كشف الثغرات","استعراض أمان ما قبل التنفيذ","التحقق من بيانات الاعتماد المفتوحة","تحليل أنماط الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["安全审计","RLS策略","OWASP合规性","漏洞检测","预部署安全审查","API安全","数据库安全","安全验证"],"ja":["セキュリティ監査","RLSポリシー","OWASPコンプライアンス","脆弱性の検出","デプロイ前のセキュリティレビュー","APIのセキュリティ","データベースのセキュリティ","セキュリティ検証"],"ko":["보안 감사","RLS 정책","OWASP 준수","취약성 검색","배포 전 보안 검토","API 보안","데이터베이스 보안","보안 검증"],"es":["análisis de seguridad","seguridad de aplicaciones","validación de seguridad","OWASP","RLS","desarrollo de software","seguridad primero","vulnerabilidades","autenticación"],"fr":["audit de sécurité","sécurité des applications","validation de sécurité","OWASP","RLS","développement de logiciels","sécurité première","vulnérabilités","authentification"],"de":["Sicherheitsprüfung","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","Sicherheitsvalidierung","OWASP","RLS","Softwareentwicklung","Sicherheitserst","Schwachstellen","Authentifizierung"],"pt":["auditoria de segurança","segurança de desenvolvimento","validação de RLS","OWASP","detecção de vulnerabilidades","segurança de API","autenticação","autorização"],"ru":["аудит безопасности","безопасность разработки","валидация RLS","OWASP","обнаружение уязвимостей","безопасность API","аутентификация","авторизация"],"ar":["تدقيق أمان","أمان التطوير","التحقق من RLS","OWASP","كشف الثغرات","أمان API","التحقق","السماح"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-audit","description":"RLS validation, security audits, OWASP compliance, and vulnerability scanning. Use when validating RLS policies, auditing API routes, scanning for security issues, or reviewing code for vulnerabilities.","bodyPreview":"# Security Audit Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide security validation with RLS enforcement, OWASP compliance, and vulnerability detection following security-first architecture.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Validating RLS policies\n- Auditing API routes for auth\n- Vulnerability scanning\n- Pre-deployment security review\n- Checking for exposed credentials\n- Reviewing database access patterns\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// FORBIDDEN: Direct Prisma calls (bypass RLS)","body":"# Security Audit Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide security validation with RLS enforcement, OWASP compliance, and vulnerability detection following security-first architecture.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Validating RLS policies\n- Auditing API routes for auth\n- Vulnerability scanning\n- Pre-deployment security review\n- Checking for exposed credentials\n- Reviewing database access patterns\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// FORBIDDEN: Direct Prisma calls (bypass RLS)\nconst users = await prisma.user.findMany();\n// Must use: withUserContext, withAdminContext, or withSystemContext\n\n// FORBIDDEN: Missing authentication on protected routes\nexport async function GET(req: Request) {\n  // No auth check before accessing user data\n  return getUserData();\n}\n\n// FORBIDDEN: Exposed credentials\nconst API_KEY = \"sk_live_abc123\"; // Hardcoded secret\n\n// FORBIDDEN: SQL injection vulnerability\nconst query = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${userId}`; // Interpolated\n```\n\n### CORRECT Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT: RLS context wrapper\nconst users = await withUserContext(prisma, userId, async (client) => {\n  return client.user.findMany();\n});\n\n// CORRECT: Auth check before data access\nexport async function GET(req: Request) {\n  const { userId } = await auth();\n  if (!userId) {\n    return new Response(\"Unauthorized\", { status: 401 });\n  }\n  return getUserData(userId);\n}\n\n// CORRECT: Environment variables for secrets\nconst API_KEY = process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY;\n\n// CORRECT: Parameterized queries\nconst user = await prisma.$queryRaw`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${userId}`;\n```\n\n## Security Audit Checklist\n\n### 1. RLS Validation\n\n- [ ] All database operations use context wrappers\n- [ ] No direct Prisma calls in route handlers\n- [ ] User isolation verified (user A cannot see user B''s data)\n- [ ] Admin operations properly scoped\n\n```bash\n# Find potential RLS bypasses\ngrep -r \"prisma\\.\" --include=\"*.ts\" app/ lib/ | grep -v \"withUserContext\\|withAdminContext\\|withSystemContext\"\n```\n\n### 2. Authentication Checks\n\n- [ ] All protected routes verify authentication\n- [ ] Auth provider auth() called before data access\n- [ ] Proper 401/403 responses for unauthorized\n\n```bash\n# Find routes missing auth checks\ngrep -r \"export async function\" --include=\"route.ts\" app/ | head -20\n# Manually verify each has auth check\n```\n\n### 3. Credential Scanning\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded secrets in code\n- [ ] No API keys in client-side code\n- [ ] Environment variables used correctly\n\n```bash\n# Scan for potential secrets\ngrep -rE \"(sk_live|pk_live|password|secret|key)\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.tsx\" | grep -v \"process.env\\|.env\"\n```\n\n### 4. Dependency Vulnerabilities\n\n```bash\n# Run security audit\nnpm audit\nyarn audit\n\n# Check for high/critical vulnerabilities\nnpm audit --audit-level=high\n```\n\n### 5. Input Validation\n\n- [ ] User input validated with Zod schemas\n- [ ] No raw query interpolation\n- [ ] File upload restrictions in place\n\n## OWASP Top 10 Checklist\n\n| Risk                 | Check                            | Status |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------ |\n| A01 Broken Access    | RLS enforced, auth on all routes | ☐      |\n| A02 Crypto Failures  | Secrets in env vars only         | ☐      |\n| A03 Injection        | Parameterized queries, Zod       | ☐      |\n| A04 Insecure Design  | Auth-first pattern followed      | ☐      |\n| A05 Misconfiguration | Prod env properly secured        | ☐      |\n| A06 Vulnerable Deps  | npm audit clean                  | ☐      |\n| A07 Auth Failures    | Auth integration correct         | ☐      |\n| A08 Data Integrity   | RLS prevents tampering           | ☐      |\n| A09 Logging Failures | Security events logged           | ☐      |\n| A10 SSRF             | External URLs validated          | ☐      |\n\n## Security Validation Commands\n\n```bash\n# Complete security check\nnpm audit && yarn lint && echo \"Security checks passed\"\n\n# RLS bypass detection\ngrep -r \"prisma\\.\" --include=\"*.ts\" app/ lib/ | wc -l\n# Compare with context wrapper count\n\n# Secret detection\ngit secrets --scan  # If git-secrets installed\ngrep -rE \"sk_|pk_|password=\" . --include=\"*.ts\"\n```\n\n## Pre-Deployment Security Review\n\nBefore ANY production deployment:\n\n- [ ] npm audit shows no high/critical issues\n- [ ] RLS policies validated\n- [ ] No new direct Prisma calls\n- [ ] Environment variables documented\n- [ ] Backup taken before migration\n- [ ] Rollback plan documented\n\n## Security Audit Report Template\n\n```markdown\n## Security Audit Report - {TICKET_PREFIX}-XXX\n\n### Summary\n\n- **Date**: [date]\n- **Auditor**: Security Engineer\n- **Scope**: [what was audited]\n\n### Findings\n\n| Severity | Issue | Location | Status |\n| -------- | ----- | -------- | ------ |\n| HIGH     | ...   | ...      | FIXED  |\n| MEDIUM   | ...   | ...      | OPEN   |\n\n### RLS Validation\n\n- [x] All tables have RLS enabled\n- [x] User isolation verified\n- [x] Admin policies scoped correctly\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. [recommendation]\n2. [recommendation]\n\n### Approval\n\n- [ ] Security Engineer approves\n- [ ] Ready for deployment\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- **Security Architecture**: `docs/guides/SECURITY_FIRST_ARCHITECTURE.md`\n- **RLS Implementation**: `docs/database/RLS_IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md`\n- **RLS Policies**: `docs/database/RLS_POLICY_CATALOG.md`\n- **OWASP Top 10**: https://owasp.org/Top10/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:33:54.172Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-Focused AI Agents implementing SAFe methodology with specialized team roles for production security audits.","zh":"非常适合专注于安全的AI代理实施SAFe方法论，并配备专门的生产安全审计团队角色。","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたAIエージェントがSAFe方法論を実装し、生産環境のセキュリティ監査のための専門的なチームロールを備える場合に理想的です。","ko":"보안 중심 AI 에이전트가 SAFe 방법론을 구현하고 생산 보안 감사를 위한 전문 팀 역할을 갖춘 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA centrados en la seguridad que implementan la metodología SAFe con roles de equipo especializados para auditorías de seguridad en producción.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents IA axés sur la sécurité implémentant la méthodologie SAFe avec des rôles d''équipe spécialisés pour les audits de sécurité en production.","de":"Ideal für sicherheitsfokussierte KI-Agenten, die die SAFe-Methodik mit spezialisierten Teamrollen für Sicherheitsaudits in der Produktion implementieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em Segurança que implementam a metodologia SAFe com papéis de equipe especializados para auditorias de segurança de produção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ориентированных на безопасность агентов ИИ, реализующих методологию SAFe с особыми ролями команд для проверки безопасности производства.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على الأمان الذي ينفذ منهجية SAFe مع أدوار فريق متخصصة للتدقيق الأمني للإنتاج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces RLS policies, validates OWASP compliance, and performs vulnerability scanning through security-first architecture. Provides production-validated multi-agent workflow with 11 specialized roles including BSA, Architect, and QAS for comprehensive security validation.","zh":"强制执行RLS策略，验证OWASP合规性，并通过安全优先的架构执行漏洞扫描。提供经过生产验证的多代理工作流，包含BSA、架构师和QAS在内的11种专业角色，以实现全面的安全验证。","ja":"RLSポリシーの適用を強制し、OWASP準拠を検証し、セキュリティファーストのアーキテクチャを通じて脆弱性スキャンを実行します。BSA、アーキテクト、QASを含む11の専門的な役割を備えた、生産環境で検証されたマルチエージェントワークフローを提供し、包括的なセキュリティ検証を実現します。","ko":"RLS 정책을 적용하고 OWASP 준수를 검증하며, 보안 우선 아키텍처를 통해 취약점 스캐닝을 수행합니다. BSA, 아키텍트, QAS를 포함한 11개의 전문 역할로 구성된 생산 검증 다중 에이전트 워크플로를 제공하여 포괄적인 보안 검증을 수행합니다.","es":"Impone políticas RLS, valida el cumplimiento de OWASP y realiza escaneos de vulnerabilidades mediante una arquitectura centrada en la seguridad. Proporciona un flujo de trabajo multiagente validado en producción con 11 roles especializados, incluidos BSA, Arquitecto y QAS, para una validación de seguridad integral.","fr":"Applique des politiques RLS, valide la conformité OWASP et effectue des analyses de vulnérabilités via une architecture security-first. Fournit un workflow multi-agents validé en production avec 11 rôles spécialisés incluant BSA, Architecte et QAS pour une validation de sécurité complète.","de":"Erzwingt RLS-Richtlinien, validiert die OWASP-Compliance und führt Schwachstellenscans durch eine sicherheitsorientierte Architektur durch. Bietet einen produktionsvalidierten Multi-Agenten-Workflow mit 11 spezialisierten Rollen, einschließlich BSA, Architekt und QAS, für umfassende Sicherheitsvalidierung.","pt":"Impõe políticas de RLS, valida a conformidade com a OWASP e realiza varredura de vulnerabilidades por meio de uma arquitetura de segurança em primeiro lugar. Fornece um fluxo de trabalho de multiagente validado para produção com 11 papéis especializados, incluindo BSA, Arquiteto e QAS para validação de segurança abrangente.","ru":"Принудительно применяет политики RLS, проверяет соответствие требованиям OWASP и выполняет сканирование уязвимостей посредством архитектуры, ориентированной на безопасность. Предоставляет производственно-проверенный рабочий процесс нескольких агентов с 11 специализированными ролями, включая BSA, Архитектор и QAS для комплексной проверки безопасности.","ar":"ينفذ سياسات RLS ، ويدقق في امتثال OWASP ، وينفذ مسح للثغرات الأمنية من خلال هندسة الأمان أولاً. يوفر تدفق عمل متعدد الوكالات تم التحقق منه من الإنتاج مع 11 دورًا متخصصًا ، بما في ذلك BSA و المهندس المعماري و QAS للتحقق الأمني الشامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating RLS policy enforcement","Auditing API routes for authentication vulnerabilities","Performing pre-deployment security reviews","Detecting exposed credentials","Scanning for OWASP compliance gaps"],"zh":["验证RLS策略执行","审计API路由的身份验证漏洞","执行部署前安全审查","检测暴露的凭据","扫描OWASP合规性差距"],"ja":["RLSポリシーの適用検証","認証の脆弱性に対するAPIルートの監査","デプロイ前のセキュリティレビューの実施","露出した認証情報の検出","OWASP準拠ギャップのスキャン"],"ko":["RLS 정책 적용 검증","인증 취약점에 대한 API 경로 감사","배포 전 보안 검토 수행","노출된 자격 증명 탐지","OWASP 준수 격차 스캐닝"],"es":["Validación de la aplicación de políticas RLS","Auditoría de rutas de API para vulnerabilidades de autenticación","Realización de revisiones de seguridad previas al despliegue","Detección de credenciales expuestas","Escaneo de brechas de cumplimiento de OWASP"],"fr":["Validation de l''application des politiques RLS","Audit des routes API pour les vulnérabilités d''authentification","Réalisation de revues de sécurité pré-déploiement","Détection des identifiants exposés","Scan des écarts de conformité OWASP"],"de":["Validierung der RLS-Richtlinienumsetzung","Überprüfung von API-Routen auf Authentifizierungsschwachstellen","Durchführung von Sicherheitsüberprüfungen vor dem Deployment","Erkennung von offengelegten Zugangsdaten","Scan auf OWASP-Compliance-Lücken"],"pt":["Validação da aplicação da política de RLS","Auditoria de rotas de API para vulnerabilidades de autenticação","Revisões de segurança pré-implementação","Detecção de credenciais expostas","Varredura de lacunas de conformidade com a OWASP"],"ru":["Проверка применения политики RLS","Аудит маршрутов API на наличие уязвимостей аутентификации","Предварительные обзоры безопасности","Обнаружение открытых учетных данных","Сканирование пробелов в соответствии требованиям OWASP"],"ar":["التحقق من تنفيذ سياسة RLS","تدقيق مسارات API للثغرات الأمنية للتحقق","استعراضات أمان ما قبل النشر","اكتشاف بيانات اعتماد مُفصّلة","فحص الفجوات في امتثال OWASP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prisma ORM environment","Limited to SAFe development methodology","Needs multi-agent coordination for full effectiveness","Specifically targets database access pattern vulnerabilities"],"zh":["需要Prisma ORM环境","仅限于SAFe开发方法论","需要多代理协调以实现全部效能","专门针对数据库访问模式漏洞"],"ja":["Prisma ORM環境が必要","SAFe開発方法論に限定される","完全な効果にはマルチエージェントの調整が必要","特にデータベースアクセスパターンの脆弱性を対象とする"],"ko":["Prisma ORM 환경이 필요함","SAFe 개발 방법론으로 제한됨","완전한 효과를 위해 다중 에이전트 조정이 필요함","특히 데이터베이스 접근 패턴 취약점을 대상으로 함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Prisma ORM","Limitado a la metodología de desarrollo SAFe","Requiere coordinación multiagente para su máxima eficacia","Se enfoca específicamente en vulnerabilidades de patrones de acceso a bases de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Prisma ORM","Limité à la méthodologie de développement SAFe","Nécessite une coordination multi-agents pour une efficacité complète","Cible spécifiquement les vulnérabilités des modèles d''accès aux bases de données"],"de":["Erfordert eine Prisma ORM-Umgebung","Beschränkt auf die SAFe-Entwicklungsmethodik","Benötigt Multi-Agenten-Koordination für volle Wirksamkeit","Zielt spezifisch auf Schwachstellen in Datenbankzugriffsmustern ab"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Prisma ORM","Limitado à metodologia de desenvolvimento SAFe","Necessita de coordenação de multiagente para eficácia total","Destina-se especificamente a vulnerabilidades de padrão de acesso ao banco de dados"],"ru":["Требует среды Prisma ORM","Ограничен методологией разработки SAFe","Требует координации нескольких агентов для полной эффективности","Конкретно нацелен на уязвимости образца доступа к базе данных"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Prisma ORM","محدود بمетодولوجيا تطوير SAFe","يحتاج إلى تنسيق متعدد الوكالات من أجل الفعالية الكاملة","يستهدف بشكل خاص ثغرات نمط الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
