的剧本和电影项目的模板，帮助开发者提高推销成功率","ja":"Logline スキルは、魅力的な脚本と映画プロジェクトを作成するためのテンプレートです","ko":"Logline 기술은 매력적인 시나리오와 영화 프로젝트를 생성하는 데 사용되는 템플릿입니다","es":"La plantilla de proyecto creativo logline es una herramienta para crear guiones y producir cine de manera efectiva","fr":"Le modèle de projet créatif logline est un outil pour créer des scénarios et produire des films de manière efficace","de":"Das kreative Projekt-Template logline ist ein Werkzeug für die effektive Erstellung von Drehbüchern und Filmproduktion","pt":"O logline é um modelo de projeto criativo para roteiros de filmes e novelas, que ajuda a criar um resumo atraente e claro","ru":"Логлайн - это шаблон креативного проекта для сценариев фильмов и романов, который помогает создать привлекательное и ясное резюме","ar":"اللوجلاين هو نموذج مشروع إبداعي للسيناريوهات والأفلام، يساعد على إنشاء ملخص جذاب وواضح","en":"Creative project template for screenplays, novels, and film production. Multi-AI harness with upstream sync."},"definition":{"en":"Creative project template for screenplays, novels, and film production. Multi-AI harness with upstream sync."},"features":{"zh":["多 AI 引擎支持","上游同步功能","剧本和电影项目模板","提高推销成功率"],"ja":["複数 AI エンジン対応","アップストリーム同期機能","脚本と映画プロジェクトテンプレート","売上成功率向上"],"ko":["다중 AI 엔진 지원","업스트림 동기화 기능","시나리오 및 영화 프로젝트 템플릿","판매 성공률 향상"],"es":["Plantilla de proyecto creativo para guiones y producción de cine","Herramienta para crear loglines atractivos","Sincronización upstream para colaboración en tiempo real","Apoyo para la creación de materiales de presentación","Análisis de conceptos para garantizar la claridad y el atractivo","Apoyo para el marketing de guiones"],"fr":["Modèle de projet créatif pour scénarios et production de film","Outil pour créer des loglines attractifs","Synchronisation en amont pour la collaboration en temps réel","Support pour la création de matériel de présentation","Analyse de concepts pour garantir la clarté et l''attrait","Support pour le marketing de scénarios"],"de":["Kreatives Projekt-Template für Drehbücher und Filmproduktion","Werkzeug für die Erstellung attraktiver Loglines","Upstream-Synchronisation für Echtzeit-Kollaboration","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von Präsentationsmaterial","Konzeptanalyse zur Gewährleistung von Klarheit und Attraktivität","Unterstützung für das Marketing von Drehbüchern"],"pt":["Criação de resumos atraentes para roteiros","Desenvolvimento de materiais de pitch","Teste de conceitos claros e atraentes","Marketing de roteiros de filmes"],"ru":["Создание привлекательных резюме для сценариев","Разработка материалов для пича","Тестирование ясных и привлекательных концепций","Маркетинг сценариев фильмов"],"ar":["إنشاء ملخصات جذابة للسيناريوهات","تطوير مواد للعرض","اختبار مفاهيم واضحة وجذابة","تسويق سيناريوهات الأفلام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Logline 技术","剧本模板","电影制作","推销成功率","创意项目","AI 引擎"],"ja":["Logline スキル","脚本テンプレート","映画制作","売上成功率","創造的プロジェクト","AI エンジン"],"ko":["Logline 기술","시나리오 템플릿","영화 제작","판매 성공률","창의적 프로젝트","AI 엔진"],"es":["logline","guiones","producción de cine","plantilla de proyecto creativo","herramienta de escritura","marketing de guiones","desarrollo de proyectos","colaboración en tiempo real","análisis de conceptos"],"fr":["logline","scénarios","production de film","modèle de projet créatif","outils d''écriture","marketing de scénarios","développement de projets","collaboration en temps réel","analyse de concepts"],"de":["Logline","Drehbücher","Filmproduktion","kreatives Projekt-Template","Schreibwerkzeug","Drehbuch-Marketing","Projektentwicklung","Echtzeit-Kollaboration","Konzeptanalyse"],"pt":["logline","roteiro de filme","novela","resumo atraente","pitch","marketing de roteiros","desenvolvimento de projetos criativos"],"ru":["логлайн","сценарий фильма","роман","привлекательное резюме","пич","маркетинг сценариев","разработка креативных проектов"],"ar":["اللوجلاين","سيناريو فيلم","رواية","ملخص جذاب","عرض","تسويق سيناريوهات","تطوير مشاريع إبداعية"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"story-systems-template","repoPath":"bybren-llc/story-systems-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logline","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Logline Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Distilling a story to its essential hook\n- Preparing pitch materials\n- Testing if a concept is clear and compelling\n- Marketing a screenplay\n\n## What is a Logline?\n\nA logline (also called a \"hook\") is a one to two sentence description of your movie that captures the essence of the story in a way that makes people want to see it.\n\n## The Four Components of a Hook\n\nPer WTFB methodology, every effective hook contains these four elemen","body":"# Logline Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Distilling a story to its essential hook\n- Preparing pitch materials\n- Testing if a concept is clear and compelling\n- Marketing a screenplay\n\n## What is a Logline?\n\nA logline (also called a \"hook\") is a one to two sentence description of your movie that captures the essence of the story in a way that makes people want to see it.\n\n## The Four Components of a Hook\n\nPer WTFB methodology, every effective hook contains these four elements:\n\n### 1. Characters\n- Who are they?\n- What do they want?\n- What are their goals?\n\n### 2. Conflict\n- What is the main obstacle to achieving their goal?\n- Who or what opposes them?\n\n### 3. Setting\n- Time period\n- Genre\n- Style/tone\n\n### 4. Action\n- What exciting things happen?\n- **Never be boring!**\n\n## Logline Formula\n\n```\n[ADJECTIVE] [PROTAGONIST TYPE] must [GOAL/ACTION]\nwhen [INCITING INCIDENT/CONFLICT],\nor else [STAKES].\n```\n\n### Alternative Formula\n```\nWhen [SETUP], a [PROTAGONIST] must [OBJECTIVE]\nbefore [ANTAGONIST] [THREAT].\n```\n\n### Genre-Specific Formula\n```\nA [GENRE] about [PROTAGONIST] who [SITUATION]\nuntil [CATALYST] forces them to [ACTION]\nagainst [ANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE].\n```\n\n## Classic Logline Examples\n\n### Raiders of the Lost Ark\n\"An archeologist is hired by the U.S. government to find the Ark of the Covenant before the Nazis.\"\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Character: Archeologist (implies adventure, intelligence)\n- Conflict: Race against Nazis\n- Setting: Implied WWII era, adventure genre\n- Action: \"Find\" + competing with Nazis = excitement\n\n### Gladiator\n\"A Roman general is betrayed and his family killed by an insane emperor. Now a gladiator, he comes to Rome for revenge.\"\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Character: Roman general (status, skill)\n- Conflict: Betrayal, loss, revenge against emperor\n- Setting: Roman era, epic drama\n- Action: Gladiator combat, revenge journey\n\n## Logline Development Worksheet\n\n### Step 1: Core Elements\n```\nPROTAGONIST: ___________________________________\n(Be specific: not \"a man\" but \"a disgraced surgeon\")\n\nGOAL: ___________________________________\n(What do they actively pursue?)\n\nANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE: ___________________________________\n(Person, force, or circumstance opposing them)\n\nSTAKES: ___________________________________\n(What happens if they fail?)\n\nUNIQUE ELEMENT: ___________________________________\n(What makes THIS story different?)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Draft Loglines\n\n**Draft 1** (Basic):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Draft 2** (Add specificity):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Draft 3** (Add stakes):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Final Logline**:\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n## Logline Quality Checklist\n\n### Must Have\n- [ ] Protagonist clearly identified\n- [ ] Goal/objective stated\n- [ ] Conflict/obstacle present\n- [ ] Implies genre\n- [ ] One to two sentences maximum\n- [ ] Creates desire to know more\n\n### Should Have\n- [ ] Unique hook or twist\n- [ ] Stakes implied or stated\n- [ ] Active voice (character DOES something)\n- [ ] Specific rather than vague\n\n### Must Avoid\n- [ ] No questions (\"What if...?\")\n- [ ] No character names (unless famous)\n- [ ] No theme statements\n- [ ] No backstory\n- [ ] No \"and then\" chains\n\n## Common Logline Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Example | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Too vague | \"A man faces challenges\" | \"A retired hitman hunts the men who killed his dog\" |\n| Too long | Multiple sentences | Cut to one powerful sentence |\n| No conflict | \"A woman discovers her past\" | \"A woman must confront the cult that raised her\" |\n| Passive | \"A story about love\" | \"A dying man races to reconnect with his estranged daughter\" |\n| Lists events | \"First X, then Y, then Z\" | Focus on central conflict |\n| Theme not story | \"An exploration of grief\" | \"A widow must solve her husband''s murder\" |\n\n## Genre-Specific Tips\n\n### Action/Thriller\n- Emphasize physical stakes and ticking clock\n- \"Must stop X before Y happens\"\n\n### Comedy\n- Hint at the comedic situation or irony\n- Include the fish-out-of-water element\n\n### Drama\n- Focus on internal conflict made external\n- Emphasize emotional stakes\n\n### Horror\n- Establish the threat\n- Imply isolation or helplessness\n\n### Romance\n- Show the obstacle to love\n- Include what makes this couple unique\n\n## Logline Testing\n\nShare your logline and ask:\n1. Do they understand the genre?\n2. Do they know who the protagonist is?\n3. Can they identify the conflict?\n4. Do they want to know what happens?\n5. Can they picture the movie?\n\nIf \"no\" to any, revise.\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Logline is 25 words or fewer\n- [ ] Protagonist is specific and interesting\n- [ ] Goal is clear and active\n- [ ] Conflict/obstacle is compelling\n- [ ] Stakes are implied or stated\n- [ ] Genre is clear\n- [ ] Creates curiosity to see the film\n- [ ] No character names used\n- [ ] Active voice throughout\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:34:47.869Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Writing Agents needing to distill stories into compelling hooks","zh":"非常适合需要将故事提炼成引人入胜的hook的创意写作代理","ja":"創造的な文章を作成するエージェントが物語を魅力的なくき出しに凝縮するのに最適","ko":"창의적인 글쓰기 에이전트가 이야기를 매력적인 훅으로 요약하는 데 적합함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura creativa que necesitan condensar historias en ganchos atractivos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''écriture créative ayant besoin de condenser des histoires en accroches percutantes","de":"Perfekt für kreative Schreibagenten, die Geschichten in überzeugende Hooks verdichten müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Criativa que precisam condensar histórias em ganchos atraentes","ru":"Идеально для агентов творческого письма, которым необходимо свести истории к привлекательным крючкам","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الإبداعية الذين يحتاجون إلى تقطير القصص إلى مشابك جذابة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft effective loglines using the WTFB methodology, incorporating essential hook components and upstream sync for multi-AI harnessing, to create clear and compelling story pitches in a one to two sentence description","zh":"使代理能够使用WTFB方法ology，结合基本的hook组件和上游同步，用于多AI利用，以在一到两句话的描述中创建清晰而有力的故事推介","ja":"エージェントがWTFBメソドロジーを使用して、基本的なhookコンポーネントやマルチAIハーネシングのためのアップストリーム同期を組み込み、1～2文の説明で明確かつ魅力的なくき出しを作成できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 WTFB 방법론을 사용하여 기본 훅 구성 요소와 멀티 AI 하네스를 위한 업스트림 동기화를 결합하여 한두 문장의 설명으로 명확하고 매력적인 스토리 피치를 생성할 수 있도록 함","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear líneas de log efectivas utilizando la metodología WTFB, incorporando componentes esenciales de hook y sincronización upstream para arneses multi-AI, para crear pitches de historia claras y atractivas en una descripción de una o dos oraciones","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des loglines efficaces en utilisant la méthodologie WTFB, en incorporant des composants essentiels de hook et une synchronisation en amont pour des harnais multi-AI, pour créer des pitches d''histoire clairs et percutants dans une description d''une ou deux phrases","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, effektive Loglines mit der WTFB-Methode zu erstellen, indem sie wesentliche Hook-Komponenten und eine Upstream-Synchronisation für Multi-AI-Harnesse einbeziehen, um klare und überzeugende Story-Pitches in einer Beschreibung von ein bis zwei Sätzen zu erstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar loglines eficazes usando a metodologia WTFB, incorporando componentes essenciais de gancho e sincronização upstream para aproveitar vários AIs, para criar pitches de história claros e atraentes em uma descrição de uma ou duas frases","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные логлайны с использованием методологии WTFB, включая необходимые компоненты крючка и синхронизацию upstream для использования нескольких ИИ, для создания четких и привлекательных предложений истории в описании из одного-двух предложений","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء=loglines فعالة باستخدام منهجية WTFB، ودمج مكونات أساسية من المشابك وتزامن Upstream لاستخدام عدة أجهزة استقبال ذكية، لإنشاء مقترحات قصة واضحة وجذابة في وصف من جملة إلى جملتين"},"useCases":{"en":["Distilling complex stories into essential hooks","Generating pitch materials for screenplays and novels","Testing concept clarity and marketing screenplays"],"zh":["将复杂的故事提炼成基本的hook","为剧本和小说生成推销材料","测试概念的清晰度和营销剧本"],"ja":["複雑な物語を基本的なhookに凝縮する","脚本や小説のためのピッチ資料を生成する","概念の明確性とマーケティング脚本をテストする"],"ko":["복잡한 이야기를 기본적인 훅으로 요약하는 것","시나리오 및 소설을 위한 피치 자료 생성","개념의 명확성 및 마케팅 시나리오 테스트"],"es":["Destilar historias complejas en ganchos esenciales","Generar materiales de presentación para guiones y novelas","Probar la claridad de conceptos y marketing de guiones"],"fr":["Distiller des histoires complexes en accroches essentielles","Générer des matériaux de présentation pour les scénarios et les romans","Tester la clarté des concepts et le marketing des scénarios"],"de":["Komplexe Geschichten in wesentliche Hooks verdichten","Präsentationsmaterialien für Drehbücher und Romane generieren","Konzeptklarheit und Marketing von Drehbüchern testen"],"pt":["Condensar histórias complexas em ganchos essenciais","Gerar materiais de pitch para roteiros e romances","Testar clareza de conceito e marketing de roteiros"],"ru":["Сводить сложные истории к необходимым крючкам","Генерировать материалы для пITCH для сценариев и романов","Тестировать ясность концепции и маркетинг сценариев"],"ar":["تقطير القصص المعقدة إلى مشابك أساسية","إنشاء مواد للعرض التقديمي لسيناريوهات والروايات","اختبار وضوح المفهوم وتسويق السيناريوهات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of story structure and essence","Limited to creative writing and film production contexts"],"zh":["需要理解故事结构和本质","仅限于创意写作和电影制作的背景"],"ja":["物語の構造と本質を理解する必要がある","創造的な文章作成と映画制作の背景のみに限定される"],"ko":["스토리 구조 및 본질을 이해해야 함","창의적인 글쓰기 및 영화 제작의 배경에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la estructura y esencia de la historia","Limitado a contextos de escritura creativa y producción de cine"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la structure et de l''essence de l''histoire","Limité aux contextes d''écriture créative et de production de films"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Story-Struktur und -Essenz","Begrenzt auf Kontexte der kreativen Schreib- und Filmproduktion"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da estrutura e essência da história","Limitado a contextos de escrita criativa e produção cinematográfica"],"ru":["Требует понимания структуры и сути истории","Ограничен контекстами творческого письма и кинопроизводства"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لهيكل و جوهر القصة","محدود بسياقات الكتابة الإبداعية وإنتاج الأفلام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
