],"de":["Kreatives Projekt-Template für Drehbücher und Romane","Upstream-Synchronisation für eine effiziente Zusammenarbeit","Erstellt verständliche und ansprechende Geschichten-Zusammenfassungen","Ideal für Präsentationsmaterialien und Pitching","Entspricht der WTFB-Methode für effektive Synopsen"],"pt":["Modelo criativo para roteiros e produção de filmes","Sincronização upstream para atualizações em tempo real","Multi-AI para análise e sugestões","Facilmente pitchável por produtores e executivos","Instantaneamente compreensível na primeira leitura"],"ru":["Креативная модель для сценариев и кинопроизводства","Синхронизация upstream для обновлений в режиме реального времени","Много-АИ для анализа и предложений","Легко представляемый продюсерами и руководителями","Немедленно понятный при первом чтении"],"ar":["قالب إبداعي لسيناريوهات وإنتاج الأفلام","مزامنة upstream لتحديثات في الوقت الحقيقي","multi-AI لتحليل والاقتراحات","سهلة التسويق من قبل المنتجين والمديرين","فهمها على الفور عند القراءة الأولى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Synopsis 技术","创意项目模板","多 AI 持有","上游同步","屏幕剧本","小说","电影制作","项目提案","可读性"],"ja":["シノプシス スキル","クリエイティブ プロジェクト テンプレート","マルチ AI 持有","上游同期","映画","小説","映画制作","プロジェクト提案","可読性"],"ko":["시놉시스 기술","창의적인 프로젝트 템플릿","멀티 AI 홀더","업스트림 동기화","스크린 플레이","소설","영화 제작","프로젝트 제안","가독성"],"es":["sinopsis","guión","novela","producción de cine","plantilla de proyecto creativo","sincronización upstream","resumen de historia","materiales de presentación","pitching"],"fr":["synopsis","scénario","roman","production de film","modèle de projet créatif","synchronisation en amont","résumé d''histoire","materiaux de présentation","pitching"],"de":["Synopsis","Drehbuch","Roman","Filmproduktion","kreatives Projekt-Template","Upstream-Synchronisation","Geschichten-Zusammenfassung","Präsentationsmaterialien","Pitching"],"pt":["sinopse criativa","roteiros de filmes","produção de filmes","multi-AI","sincronização upstream","pitch de projetos","resumo de histórias"],"ru":["креативный синопсис","сценарии фильмов","кинопроизводство","много-АИ","синхронизация upstream","представление проектов","обзор историй"],"ar":["ملخص إبداعي","سيناريوهات الأفلام","إنتاج الأفلام","multi-AI","مزامنة upstream","تسويق المشاريع","ملخص القصص"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"story-systems-template","repoPath":"bybren-llc/story-systems-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"synopsis","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Synopsis Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Preparing submission materials\n- Creating one-page story summaries\n- Pitching to producers or executives\n- Condensing screenplay for coverage\n\n## What Makes a Good Synopsis\n\nPer WTFB methodology, a good synopsis must:\n\n1. **Be easily pitchable by a producer to others** - They need to be able to sell it up the chain\n2. **Be instantly understandable on first read** - No re-reading required\n3. **Give an accurate picture of the story*","body":"# Synopsis Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Preparing submission materials\n- Creating one-page story summaries\n- Pitching to producers or executives\n- Condensing screenplay for coverage\n\n## What Makes a Good Synopsis\n\nPer WTFB methodology, a good synopsis must:\n\n1. **Be easily pitchable by a producer to others** - They need to be able to sell it up the chain\n2. **Be instantly understandable on first read** - No re-reading required\n3. **Give an accurate picture of the story** - No misleading or incomplete information\n4. **Be one page or less** - Industry standard maximum length\n5. **Not over-complicate with every character/detail** - Focus on essentials\n\n## Synopsis vs. Treatment\n\n| Synopsis | Treatment |\n|----------|-----------|\n| One page maximum | 3-15 pages typical |\n| Essential plot only | Detailed scene breakdown |\n| Main characters only | All significant characters |\n| Present tense | Present tense |\n| No dialogue | May include key dialogue |\n| Quick read | Longer investment |\n\n## Synopsis Structure\n\n### Header\n```\nTITLE: ___________________________________\nSUBMITTED BY: ___________________________________\nAUTHOR: ___________________________________\nFORM/PAGES: Script – ___ pages\nGENRE: ___________________________________\nLOCALE: ___________________________________\nCIRCA: ___________________________________\n```\n\n### Logline (2-3 lines)\nThe hook that captures the essence of your story.\n\n### Body (Remaining space)\nTell the complete story in present tense, focusing on:\n- Main character introduction\n- The central conflict\n- Key turning points\n- The resolution\n\n## Synopsis Template\n\n```markdown\n# [TITLE]\n\n**Genre:** [Genre] | **Setting:** [Location], [Time Period]\n**Pages:** [Number] | **Format:** Original Screenplay\n\n## LOGLINE\n[One to two sentence hook]\n\n## SYNOPSIS\n\n[PROTAGONIST NAME] is [brief character description establishing their status quo].\n\nWhen [INCITING INCIDENT], [they] must [GOAL]. But [ANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE] stands in the way, [describe conflict].\n\nAs [PROTAGONIST] [midpoint action/discovery], [stakes raise]. [Describe escalation and complications].\n\n[Describe the dark moment/all is lost beat].\n\nIn the end, [PROTAGONIST] [describe resolution and character transformation]. [Final image or state].\n```\n\n## Example Synopsis: Eastern Market\n\n```\nTITLE: EASTERN MARKET\nGENRE: Human Condition\nLOCALE: Detroit\nCIRCA: Present Day\n\nLOGLINE:\nTwo brothers struggle not to waste their lives without wasting each\nother at a place called the Eastern Market.\n\nSYNOPSIS:\nEastern Market is the story of two brothers Dino & Angelo Napolitano\nwho live and work in the once bustling metropolis called Detroit,\nthat''s now become an empty dying city. Similar to the city''s\ncondition, Dino was also once a rising star, who had garnered the\nadoration of thousands of boxing fans. When sports broadcasters\nbring Dino''s name up before a match, it''s only in the negative\nregarding his squandered talent. He is known as the boxing world''s\nposter child of self-inflicted failure. Unlike other stories about\nfailed fighters, there is no chance that Dino could ever return to\nthe ring. Dino is a keep to himself hard working guy; however, his\nhard drinking has only nurtured the bitterness that''s consuming his\nlife and everything around him. Failed at love and life, Dino\ndoesn''t see the woman (Robin) who loves him, only the woman (Kim)\nthat he lost.\n\nDino''s younger brother Angelo is married with a child and is the\nbinding force in Dino''s life. Every time Dino fails or falls, Angelo\nis there to fix things and make it right. But Angelo and his wife\nare getting sick and tired of helping his brother and alcoholic\nmother Irene at every turn. Angelo just wants to get on with his own\nlife, but can''t let go of his brother.\n\nBoth men work for a scumbag named Paul at Backos meats who''s been\nusing the brothers for years. Though it doesn''t seem like it, both\nmen really want the same thing; to make their mark on this life\nwithout leaving a stain, at the place called the Eastern Market.\n```\n\n## Synopsis Writing Tips\n\n### DO\n- Write in present tense\n- Focus on the protagonist''s journey\n- Include the ending (unlike a query letter)\n- Use active, vivid language\n- Convey the tone/genre of the script\n- Make it emotionally engaging\n\n### DON''T\n- Include every subplot\n- Name every character (3-4 max)\n- Use dialogue unless essential\n- Describe scenes in detail\n- Leave the ending ambiguous\n- Exceed one page\n\n## Simplicity Test\n\nAsk yourself: \"Could even an idiot read it and understand it?\"\n\nIf you need to re-read sections, simplify. The producer needs to pitch this story to others in a meeting. Make it memorable and clear.\n\n## Synopsis Length Guidelines\n\n```\nStandard: 250-350 words (one page, single-spaced)\nShort: 150-200 words (half page)\nExtended: 500-750 words (two pages - only if requested)\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [ ] One page or less\n- [ ] Instantly understandable on first read\n- [ ] Protagonist clearly identified\n- [ ] Central conflict explained\n- [ ] Resolution included\n- [ ] Tone matches the screenplay\n- [ ] No more than 3-4 character names used\n- [ ] Present tense throughout\n- [ ] Could be pitched verbally in 2 minutes\n- [ ] Franchise/sequel potential mentioned (if applicable)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:35:08.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Writing Agents needing advanced screenplay and novel summarization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级剧本和小说摘要能力的创意写作代理","ja":"クリエイティブライティングエージェントが高度な脚本と小説の要約機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 대본 및 소설 요약 기능이 필요한 창의적 글쓰기 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura creativa que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de resumen de guiones y novelas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''écriture créative ayant besoin de capacités avancées de résumé de scénarios et de romans.","de":"Perfekt für Creative-Writing-Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Zusammenfassung von Drehbüchern und Romanen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Criativa que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de resumo de roteiros e romances.","ru":"Идеально для Креативных Литературных Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности суммаризации сценариев и романов.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام الإبداعية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتلخيص السيناريوهات والروايات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate concise, pitchable synopses using WTFB methodology, enabling instant understanding and accurate story representation through multi-AI harness with upstream sync, supporting formats like screenplays and novels.","zh":"赋予代理生成简洁、可推介的摘要，使用WTFB方法，通过多AI组合和上游同步，实现即时理解和准确的故事表现，支持剧本和小说等格式","ja":"WTFBメソドロジーを使用して、代理が簡潔で売り出しやすいシノプシスを生成できるようにし、多AIハーネスと上流同期を介して即時の理解と正確なストーリー表現を可能にし、脚本や小説などの形式をサポート","ko":"WTFB 방법을 사용하여 에이전트가 간결하고 판매 가능한 요약을 생성할 수 있도록 함으로써 즉시 이해와 정확한 이야기 표현을 가능하게 하는 멀티 AI 하네스와 업스트림 동기화를 지원하며, 대본 및 소설과 같은 형식을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar sinopsis concisas y presentables utilizando la metodología WTFB, lo que permite una comprensión instantánea y una representación precisa de la historia a través de un arnés multi-AI con sincronización upstream, que admite formatos como guiones y novelas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des synopses concises et présentables en utilisant la méthodologie WTFB, ce qui permet une compréhension instantanée et une représentation précise de l''histoire grâce à un harnais multi-AI avec synchronisation en amont, prenant en charge des formats tels que les scénarios et les romans.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, prägnante und präsentierbare Zusammenfassungen mit der WTFB-Methodik zu erstellen, was ein sofortiges Verständnis und eine genaue Geschichtsdarstellung durch einen Multi-AI-Harness mit Upstream-Synchronisation ermöglicht und Formate wie Drehbücher und Romane unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar sinopses concisas e vendáveis usando a metodologia WTFB, permitindo uma compreensão instantânea e uma representação precisa da história por meio de uma ferramenta multi-AI com sincronização upstream, suportando formatos como roteiros e romances.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать краткие и привлекательные синопсисы, используя методологию WTFB, обеспечивающую мгновенное понимание и точное представление истории посредством много-АИ-инструмента с синхронизацией upstream, поддерживающего форматы, такие как сценарии и романы.","ar":"يمكن للوسائل الإعلام تمكين الوكلاء من توليد ملخصات مقنعة ومختصرة باستخدام منهجية WTFB، مما يتيح الفهم الفوري والتمثيل الدقيق للقصة من خلال أداة متعددة الذكاء ذات التزامن العلوي، تدعم صيغ مثل السيناريوهات والروايات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating one-page story summaries","Generating submission materials for producers","Condensing screenplays for coverage","Creating pitchable project templates"],"zh":["自动化一ページの故事摘要","为制片人生成提交材料","为报道而压缩脚本","创建可销售的项目模板"],"ja":["1ページのストーリーサマリーの自動化","プロデューサー向けの提出資料の生成","報道用の脚本の圧縮","売り出し可能なプロジェクトテンプレートの作成"],"ko":["한 페이지의 이야기 요약 자동화","제작자에게 제출 자료 생성","보도용 대본 압축","판매 가능한 프로젝트 템플릿 생성"],"es":["Automatización de resúmenes de historias de una página","Generación de materiales de presentación para productores","Condensación de guiones para cobertura","Creación de plantillas de proyectos presentables"],"fr":["Automatisation des résumés d''histoires d''une page","Génération de matériel de soumission pour les producteurs","Condensation des scénarios pour la couverture","Création de modèles de projets présentables"],"de":["Automatisierung von Einseitengeschichten-Zusammenfassungen","Erstellung von Einreichungsmaterial für Produzenten","Kondensierung von Drehbüchern für Abdeckung","Erstellung von präsentierbaren Projektvorlagen"],"pt":["Automatizar resumos de histórias de uma página","Gerar materiais de submissão para produtores","Condensar roteiros para cobertura","Criar modelos de projetos vendáveis"],"ru":["Автоматизировать одностраницные резюме историй","Генерировать материалы для подачи продюсерам","Сжимать сценарии для освещения","Создавать привлекательные шаблоны проектов"],"ar":["آليّة تلخيص قصص صفحة واحدة","توليد مواد تقديمية للمنتجين","تجميع السيناريوهات لتغطية","إنشاء قوالب مشاريع مقنعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of storytelling principles","Limited to creative writing projects","Needs upstream sync for multi-AI harness"],"zh":["需要了解故事原理","仅限创意写作项目","需要上游同步用于多AI组合"],"ja":["ストーリーテリングの原則の理解が必要","クリエイティブライティングプロジェクトのみ","多AIハーネスには上流同期が必要"],"ko":["이야기 원리의 이해가 필요","창의적 글쓰기 프로젝트만 해당","멀티 AI 하네스에는 업스트림 동기화가 필요"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de narración de historias","Limitado a proyectos de escritura creativa","Necesita sincronización upstream para arnés multi-AI"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de narration","Limité aux projets d''écriture créative","Nécessite une synchronisation en amont pour un harnais multi-AI"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Erzählprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Creative-Writing-Projekte","Benötigt Upstream-Synchronisation für Multi-AI-Harness"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de princípios de narrativa","Limitado a projetos de escrita criativa","Necessita de sincronização upstream para ferramenta multi-AI"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов повествования","Ограничен креативными литературными проектами","Требует синхронизации upstream для много-АИ-инструмента"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ السرد","محدود لمشاريع الكتابة الإبداعية","يحتاج إلى التزامن العلوي لأداة متعددة الذكاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow/pattern-discovery', 'community', 'bybren-llc', 'safe-agentic-workflow', 'bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow', 'pattern-discovery', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z', '2026-02-18T14:34:51.274Z', NULL, '{"id":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow/pattern-discovery","name":"pattern-discovery","description":{"zh":"模式发现技能是一种开发方法，通过检查模式库来优化开发流程。它可以帮助开发人员减少代码重复，提高开发效率。","ja":"パターンディスカバリースキルは、開発プロセスを最適化する開発方法です。パターンライブラリを確認することで、開発者はコードの重複を減らし、開発効率を向上させることができます。","ko":"패턴 발견 기술은 개발 프로세스를 최적화하는 개발 방법입니다. 패턴 라이브러리를 확인함으로써 개발자는 코드 중복을 줄이고 개발 효율성을 높일 수 있습니다.","es":"El descubrimiento de patrones es una metodología de desarrollo validada que mejora la eficiencia y reduce errores","fr":"La découverte de modèles est une méthodologie de développement validée qui améliore l''efficacité et réduit les erreurs","de":"Die Mustererkennung ist eine validierte Entwicklungs-methodik, die die Effizienz verbessert und Fehler reduziert","pt":"A descoberta de padrões é uma metodologia de desenvolvimento que ajuda a evitar a recriação de código, melhorando a eficiência e reduzindo erros.","ru":"Обнаружение шаблонов - это методология разработки, которая помогает избежать переизобретения колеса, повышая эффективность и снижая количество ошибок.","ar":"اكتشاف الأنماط هو منهجية تطوير تساعد على تجنب إعادة إنشاء الكود، مما يحسن الكفاءة ويقلل من الأخطاء.","en":"Production-validated SAFe multi-agent development methodology with Claude Code. Treat AI agents as specialized team members (11 roles: BSA, Architect, QAS, etc). Complete whitepaper + working template. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"模式发现技能 - 优化开发流程","ja":"パターンディスカバリースキル - 開発プロセスの最適化","ko":"패턴 발견 기술 - 개발 프로세스 최적화","es":"Descubrimiento de Patrones para Desarrolladores","fr":"Découverte de Modèles pour les Développeurs","de":"Mustererkennung für Entwickler","pt":"Descoberta de Padrões para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Обнаружение Шаблонов для Разработчиков","ar":"اكتشاف الأنماط لل مبرمجين","en":"pattern-discovery"},"description":{"zh":"模式发现技能是一种开发方法，通过检查模式库来优化开发流程。它可以帮助开发人员减少代码重复，提高开发效率。","ja":"パターンディスカバリースキルは、開発プロセスを最適化する開発方法です。パターンライブラリを確認することで、開発者はコードの重複を減らし、開発効率を向上させることができます。","ko":"패턴 발견 기술은 개발 프로세스를 최적화하는 개발 방법입니다. 패턴 라이브러리를 확인함으로써 개발자는 코드 중복을 줄이고 개발 효율성을 높일 수 있습니다.","es":"El descubrimiento de patrones es una metodología de desarrollo validada que mejora la eficiencia y reduce errores","fr":"La découverte de modèles est une méthodologie de développement validée qui améliore l''efficacité et réduit les erreurs","de":"Die Mustererkennung ist eine validierte Entwicklungs-methodik, die die Effizienz verbessert und Fehler reduziert","pt":"A descoberta de padrões é uma metodologia de desenvolvimento que ajuda a evitar a recriação de código, melhorando a eficiência e reduzindo erros.","ru":"Обнаружение шаблонов - это методология разработки, которая помогает избежать переизобретения колеса, повышая эффективность и снижая количество ошибок.","ar":"اكتشاف الأنماط هو منهجية تطوير تساعد على تجنب إعادة إنشاء الكود، مما يحسن الكفاءة ويقلل من الأخطاء.","en":"Production-validated SAFe multi-agent development methodology with Claude Code. Treat AI agents as specialized team members (11 roles: BSA, Architect, QAS, e..."},"definition":{"en":"Production-validated SAFe multi-agent development methodology with Claude Code. Treat AI agents as specialized team members (11 roles: BSA, Architect, QAS, etc). Complete whitepaper + working template. "},"features":{"zh":["优化开发流程","减少代码重复","提高开发效率","检查模式库","支持SAFe多代理开发方法"],"ja":["開発プロセスの最適化","コードの重複の減少","開発効率の向上","パターンライブラリの確認","SAFe多代理開発方法のサポート"],"ko":["개발 프로세스 최적화","코드 중복의 감소","개발 효율性的 향상","패턴 라이브러리의 확인","SAFe 다중 에이전트 개발 방법의 지원"],"es":["Metodología de desarrollo validada","Mejora de la eficiencia","Reducción de errores","Integración con Claude Code","Compatibilidad con SAFe"],"fr":["Méthodologie de développement validée","Amélioration de l''efficacité","Réduction des erreurs","Intégration avec Claude Code","Compatibilité avec SAFe"],"de":["Validierte Entwicklungs-methodik","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Fehlerreduzierung","Integration mit Claude Code","Kompatibilität mit SAFe"],"pt":["Verificação de bibliotecas de padrões antes de implementar novas funcionalidades","Melhoria da eficiência e redução de erros","Implementação de padrões de desenvolvimento SAFe","Integração com Claude Code","11 papéis de agentes de IA especializados"],"ru":["Проверка библиотек шаблонов перед реализацией новых функций","Повышение эффективности и снижение количества ошибок","Реализация шаблонов разработки SAFe","Интеграция с Claude Code","11 ролей специализированных агентов ИИ"],"ar":["التحقق من مكتبات الأنماط قبل تنفيذ ميزات جديدة","تحسين الكفاءة وتقليل الأخطاء","تنفيذ أنماط التطوير آمنة","التكامل مع كلود كود","11 دورة لوسائل الإعلام المتخصصين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["模式发现技能","开发方法","优化开发流程","SAFe多代理开发方法","代码重复","开发效率"],"ja":["パターンディスカバリースキル","開発方法","開発プロセスの最適化","SAFe多代理開発方法","コードの重複","開発効率"],"ko":["패턴 발견 기술","개발 방법","개발 프로세스 최적화","SAFe 다중 에이전트 개발 방법","코드 중복","개발 효율성"],"es":["descubrimiento de patrones","desarrollo de software","metodología de desarrollo","eficiencia","reducción de errores","SAFe","Claude Code"],"fr":["découverte de modèles","développement de logiciels","méthodologie de développement","efficacité","réduction des erreurs","SAFe","Claude Code"],"de":["Mustererkennung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungs-methodik","Effizienz","Fehlerreduzierung","SAFe","Claude Code"],"pt":["descoberta de padrões","desenvolvimento de software","SAFe","Claude Code","agentes de IA","padrões de desenvolvimento","eficiência","redução de erros"],"ru":["обнаружение шаблонов","разработка программного обеспечения","SAFe","Claude Code","агенты ИИ","шаблоны разработки","эффективность","снижение количества ошибок"],"ar":["اكتشاف الأنماط","تطوير البرمجيات","آمنة","كلود كود","وسائل الإعلام","أنماط التطوير","الكفاءة","تقليل الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pattern-discovery","description":"Pattern library discovery for pattern-first development. Use BEFORE implementing any new feature, creating components, writing API routes, or adding database operations. Ensures existing patterns are checked first.","bodyPreview":"# Pattern Discovery Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nEnforce pattern-first development by checking the pattern library before implementing new functionality.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- About to create a new API route\n- About to create a new UI component\n- About to add database operations\n- User asks \"how do I implement...\" or \"how should I build...\"\n\n## Pattern Discovery Protocol\n\n**ALWAYS check patterns before writing new code:**\n\n### Step 1: Check Pattern Library\n\n```bash\nls docs/patterns/api/      # API route patt","body":"# Pattern Discovery Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nEnforce pattern-first development by checking the pattern library before implementing new functionality.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- About to create a new API route\n- About to create a new UI component\n- About to add database operations\n- User asks \"how do I implement...\" or \"how should I build...\"\n\n## Pattern Discovery Protocol\n\n**ALWAYS check patterns before writing new code:**\n\n### Step 1: Check Pattern Library\n\n```bash\nls docs/patterns/api/      # API route patterns\nls docs/patterns/ui/       # UI component patterns\nls docs/patterns/database/ # Database patterns\nls docs/patterns/testing/  # Testing patterns\n```\n\n### Step 2: Review Pattern Index\n\nSee `docs/patterns/README.md` for the complete index.\n\n### Step 3: Apply or Escalate\n\n**If pattern exists:** Copy, customize, validate.\n\n**If missing:** Search codebase, implement following conventions, report gap.\n\n## Pattern Matching Guide\n\n| If you need to...                  | Use this pattern                  |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| Create authenticated API endpoint  | `api/user-context-api.md`         |\n| Create admin-only API endpoint     | `api/admin-context-api.md`        |\n| Handle external webhooks           | `api/webhook-handler.md`          |\n| Validate API input with Zod        | `api/zod-validation-api.md`       |\n| Create protected page              | `ui/authenticated-page.md`        |\n| Build form with validation         | `ui/form-with-validation.md`      |\n| Add new table with RLS             | `database/rls-migration.md`       |\n| Test API endpoints                 | `testing/api-integration-test.md` |\n\n## Reference\n\n- **Pattern Index**: `docs/patterns/README.md`\n- **RLS Patterns**: See `rls-patterns` skill\n- **Frontend Patterns**: See `frontend-patterns` skill\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:34:51.274Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SAFe-compliant Development Agents needing systematic pattern discovery and code reuse.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化模式发现和代码重用的SAFe兼容开发代理。","ja":"SAFe準拠の開発エージェントが体系的なパターン発見とコード再利用を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시스템적인 패턴 발견과 코드 재사용이 필요한 SAFe 규격 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo compatibles con SAFe que necesitan un descubrimiento de patrones sistemático y reutilización de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement conformes à SAFe nécessitant une découverte de modèles systématique et une réutilisation de code.","de":"Perfekt für SAFe-konforme Entwicklungsmittel, die ein systematisches Mustererkennung und Code-Wiederverwendung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento compatíveis com SAFe que necessitam de descoberta sistemática de padrões e reutilização de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, соответствующих SAFe, которым необходима систематическая обнаружение закономерностей и повторное использование кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير المتوافق مع SAFe الذي يحتاج إلى اكتشاف نمط منهجي وإعادة استخدام الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce pattern-first development by checking the pattern library before implementing new functionality, utilizing protocols like the Pattern Discovery Protocol and integrating with tools like Claude Code.","zh":"使代理能够通过检查模式库在实施新功能之前强制执行模式优先开发，利用诸如模式发现协议之类的协议，并与Claude Code等工具集成。","ja":"パターン発見プロトコルなどのプロトコルを使用して、エージェントが新しい機能を実装する前にパターンライブラリを確認することで、パターン優先の開発を強制することができます。また、Claude Codeなどのツールと統合することもできます。","ko":"패턴 라이브러리를 확인하여 새로운 기능을 구현하기 전에 패턴 우선 개발을 강제할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하며, 패턴 발견 프로토콜과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하고 Claude Code와 같은 도구와 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir el desarrollo de patrones primero, verificando la biblioteca de patrones antes de implementar nueva funcionalidad, utilizando protocolos como el Protocolo de Descubrimiento de Patrones y integrándose con herramientas como Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''imposer le développement de modèles en premier, en vérifiant la bibliothèque de modèles avant de mettre en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités, en utilisant des protocoles tels que le Protocole de Découverte de Modèles et en s''intégrant avec des outils tels que Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Muster-erst-Entwicklung durchzusetzen, indem sie die Musterbibliothek überprüfen, bevor sie neue Funktionalitäten implementieren, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie dem Muster-Erkennungsprotokoll und der Integration mit Tools wie Claude Code.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor o desenvolvimento baseado em padrões, verificando a biblioteca de padrões antes de implementar nova funcionalidade, utilizando protocolos como o Protocolo de Descoberta de Padrões e integrando com ferramentas como Claude Code.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить разработку, основанную на закономерностях, проверяя библиотеку закономерностей перед реализацией новой функциональности, используя протоколы, такие как Протокол обнаружения закономерностей, и интегрируя с инструментами, такими как Claude Code.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على فرض التطوير الأول لنمط التحقق من مكتبة النمط قبل تنفيذ وظيفة جديدة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل بروتوكول اكتشاف النمط وتكاملها مع أدوات مثل Claude Code."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pattern library checks for new API routes","Generating pattern-compliant UI components","Validating database operations against established patterns"],"zh":["自动化新API路由的模式库检查","生成模式兼容的UI组件","验证数据库操作是否符合已建立的模式"],"ja":["新しいAPIルートのパターンライブラリチェックの自動化","パターンに準拠したUIコンポーネントの生成","確立されたパターンに従ったデータベース操作の検証"],"ko":["새로운 API 라우트에 대한 패턴 라이브러리 검사의 자동화","패턴 규칙에 따른 UI 컴포넌트 생성","설정된 패턴에 대한 데이터베이스 작업의 검증"],"es":["Automatización de controles de biblioteca de patrones para nuevas rutas de API","Generación de componentes de interfaz de usuario compatibles con patrones","Validación de operaciones de base de datos frente a patrones establecidos"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de bibliothèque de modèles pour les nouvelles routes API","Génération de composants d''interface utilisateur conformes aux modèles","Validation des opérations de base de données par rapport aux modèles établis"],"de":["Automatisierung von Muster-Bibliotheks-Checks für neue API-Routen","Generierung von muster-konformen Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","Validierung von Datenbankoperationen gegenüber etablierten Mustern"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de biblioteca de padrões para novas rotas de API","Gerar componentes de UI compatíveis com padrões","Validar operações de banco de dados contra padrões estabelecidos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки библиотеки закономерностей для новых маршрутов API","Генерировать компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, соответствующие закономерностям","Проверять операции базы данных на соответствие установленным закономерностям"],"ar":["توفير التأكد من مكتبة النمط للطرق الجديدة API","توليد مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة مع نمط","التحقق من عمليات قاعدة البيانات مقابل الأنماط المعينة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to a pattern library","Intended for SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Claude Code integration necessary for full functionality"],"zh":["需要访问模式库","适用于SAFe多代理开发方法论","需要Claude Code集成以实现全部功能"],"ja":["パターンライブラリへのアクセスが必要","SAFeのマルチエージェント開発方法論に適している","Claude Codeの統合が必要である"],"ko":["패턴 라이브러리에 접근이 필요하다","SAFe 다중 에이전트 개발 방법론에 적합하다","Claude Code와의 통합이 필요하다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una biblioteca de patrones","Diseñado para la metodología de desarrollo de múltiples agentes SAFe","La integración con Claude Code es necesaria para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à une bibliothèque de modèles","Conçu pour la méthodologie de développement multi-agents SAFe","L''intégration avec Claude Code est nécessaire pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf eine Muster-Bibliothek","Für die SAFe-Mehrfachmitteler-Entwicklungsmethodik vorgesehen","Die Integration mit Claude Code ist für die volle Funktionalität erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso a uma biblioteca de padrões","Destinado à metodologia de desenvolvimento de multi-agente SAFe","Integração com Claude Code necessária para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к библиотеке закономерностей","Предназначен для методологии разработки нескольких агентов SAFe","Интеграция с Claude Code необходима для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مكتبة نمط","موجه إلى منهجية تطوير متعدد الوكلاء SAFe","التكامل مع Claude Code ضروري للوظيفة الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
