de RLS integradas","Arquitectura de seguridad","Análisis de impacto de esquema","Planificación de migración de datos"],"fr":["Création de migrations de bases de données sécurisées","Politiques de RLS intégrées","Architecture de sécurité","Analyse d''impact de schéma","Planification de migration de données"],"de":["Erstellung sicherer Datenbankmigrationen","Integrierte RLS-Richtlinien","Sicherheitsarchitektur","Schema-Auswirkungsanalyse","Datenmigrationplanung"],"pt":["Metodologia de desenvolvimento de agente AI validada para produção","SAFe e Claude Code para desenvolvimento de agente AI","Arquitetura de segurança e fluxo de aprovação","Criação de migrações de banco de dados com políticas de RLS","Análise de impacto de esquema e planejamento de migração de dados"],"ru":["Проверенная методика разработки агентов ИИ для производства","SAFe и Claude Code для разработки агентов ИИ","Архитектура безопасности и поток утверждения","Создание миграций базы данных с политиками RLS","Анализ воздействия схемы и планирование миграции данных"],"ar":["منهجية تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المعتمدة للإنتاج","SAFe و Claude Code لتنمية وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","هندسة أمنية وflux موافقة","إنشاء هجرات قاعدة البيانات مع سياسات RLS","تحليل تأثير مخطط و تخطيط هجرة البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据库迁移","SAFe多代理开发方法","Claude Code","安全性","合规性","RLS政策","许可管理"],"ja":["データベース移行","SAFeマルチエージェント開発方法","Claude Code","セキュリティ","コンプライアンス","RLSポリシー","許可管理"],"ko":["데이터베이스 마이그레이션","SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발 방법","Claude Code","보안","규정 준수","RLS 정책","허가 관리"],"es":["patrones de migración","migración de bases de datos","políticas de RLS","arquitectura de seguridad","desarrollo de agentes múltiples","seguridad de datos"],"fr":["modèles de migration","migration de bases de données","politiques de RLS","architecture de sécurité","développement d''agents multiples","sécurité des données"],"de":["Migrationsmuster","Datenbankmigration","RLS-Richtlinien","Sicherheitsarchitektur","Entwicklung mehrerer Agenten","Datensicherheit"],"pt":["padrões de migração","desenvolvimento de agente AI","SAFe","Claude Code","arquitetura de segurança","fluxo de aprovação","migrações de banco de dados","políticas de RLS","análise de impacto de esquema","planejamento de migração de dados"],"ru":["паттерны миграции","разработка агентов ИИ","SAFe","Claude Code","архитектура безопасности","поток утверждения","миграции базы данных","политики RLS","анализ воздействия схемы","планирование миграции данных"],"ar":["أنماط هجرة","تنمية وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","SAFe","Claude Code","هندسة أمنية","flux موافقة","هجرات قاعدة البيانات","سياسات RLS","تحليل تأثير مخطط","تخطيط هجرة البيانات"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"migration-patterns","description":"Database migration creation with mandatory RLS policies and ARCHitect approval workflow. Use when creating migrations, adding tables with RLS, or updating Prisma schema.","bodyPreview":"# Migration Patterns Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide database migration creation with mandatory RLS policies, following security-first architecture and approval workflow.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating database migrations\n- Adding new tables (all tables need RLS)\n- Updating Prisma schema\n- Adding GRANT statements\n- Schema impact analysis\n- Data migration planning\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- FORBIDDEN: RLS policies in separate file\n-- RLS MUST be in the same","body":"# Migration Patterns Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide database migration creation with mandatory RLS policies, following security-first architecture and approval workflow.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating database migrations\n- Adding new tables (all tables need RLS)\n- Updating Prisma schema\n- Adding GRANT statements\n- Schema impact analysis\n- Data migration planning\n\n## Stop-the-Line Conditions\n\n### FORBIDDEN Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- FORBIDDEN: RLS policies in separate file\n-- RLS MUST be in the same migration.sql file as the table creation\n\n-- FORBIDDEN: Table without RLS\nCREATE TABLE user_data (...);\n-- Missing: ALTER TABLE user_data ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n\n-- FORBIDDEN: Resolve applied migrations\nnpx prisma migrate resolve --applied \"migration_name\"\n-- This bypasses migration verification\n\n-- FORBIDDEN: Missing user_id index\nCREATE TABLE payments (...);\n-- Missing: CREATE INDEX idx_payments_user_id ON payments(user_id);\n\n-- FORBIDDEN: Schema changes without ARCHitect approval\n-- All migrations require approval before PR\n```\n\n### CORRECT Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- CORRECT: Complete migration with RLS in same file\nCREATE TABLE user_data (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  user_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n  data JSONB,\n  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()\n);\n\n-- Enable RLS (SAME FILE - MANDATORY)\nALTER TABLE user_data ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n\n-- User policy\nCREATE POLICY user_data_user_select ON user_data\n  FOR SELECT TO {PROJECT}_app_user\n  USING (user_id = current_setting(''app.current_user_id'', true));\n\n-- Index for RLS performance (MANDATORY)\nCREATE INDEX idx_user_data_user_id ON user_data(user_id);\n\n-- Grant permissions\nGRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE ON user_data TO {PROJECT}_app_user;\n```\n\n## Migration Workflow (MANDATORY)\n\n### Step 1: Get ARCHitect Approval\n\nBefore ANY schema change:\n\n```text\n1. Document proposed changes\n2. Get ARCHitect approval (create issue or discussion)\n3. Only proceed after explicit approval\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create Migration\n\n```bash\n# Generate migration\nnpx prisma migrate dev --name descriptive_name\n\n# Verify migration file created\nls prisma/migrations/\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add RLS to Migration\n\nEdit the generated migration to include:\n\n- [ ] `ALTER TABLE ... ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY`\n- [ ] User SELECT policy\n- [ ] User INSERT policy (if applicable)\n- [ ] User UPDATE policy (if applicable)\n- [ ] Admin policies (if needed)\n- [ ] System policies (for background jobs)\n- [ ] Index on user_id column\n- [ ] GRANT statements\n\n### Step 4: Verify Locally\n\n```bash\n# Test migration\nDATABASE_URL=\"...\" npx prisma migrate dev\n\n# Verify RLS is enabled\npsql -c \"SELECT tablename, rowsecurity FROM pg_tables WHERE schemaname = ''public'';\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Update Documentation\n\nAfter successful migration:\n\n- [ ] Update `docs/database/DATA_DICTIONARY.md` (MANDATORY)\n- [ ] Update RLS policy catalog if new policies added\n- [ ] Document in Linear ticket\n\n## RLS Policy Templates\n\n### User Read Policy\n\n```sql\nCREATE POLICY {table}_user_select ON {table}\n  FOR SELECT TO {PROJECT}_app_user\n  USING (user_id = current_setting(''app.current_user_id'', true));\n```\n\n### User Write Policy\n\n```sql\nCREATE POLICY {table}_user_insert ON {table}\n  FOR INSERT TO {PROJECT}_app_user\n  WITH CHECK (user_id = current_setting(''app.current_user_id'', true));\n```\n\n### Admin Policy\n\n```sql\nCREATE POLICY {table}_admin_all ON {table}\n  FOR ALL TO {PROJECT}_app_user\n  USING (current_setting(''app.user_role'', true) = ''admin'');\n```\n\n### System Policy (Background Jobs)\n\n```sql\nCREATE POLICY {table}_system_all ON {table}\n  FOR ALL TO {PROJECT}_app_user\n  USING (current_setting(''app.context_type'', true) = ''system'');\n```\n\n## Migration Checklist\n\nBefore PR:\n\n- [ ] ARCHitect approval obtained\n- [ ] RLS policies in same migration file\n- [ ] User policies created\n- [ ] user_id index created\n- [ ] GRANT statements added\n- [ ] Local migration test passed\n- [ ] DATA_DICTIONARY.md updated\n- [ ] Evidence attached to Linear\n\n## PROD Migration Requirements\n\nFor production migrations:\n\n- [ ] Human operator must be present (MANDATORY)\n- [ ] Backup taken before migration\n- [ ] Rollback plan documented\n- [ ] Post-migration validation steps defined\n- [ ] Data integrity checks planned\n\n## Reference\n\n- **Migration SOP**: `docs/database/RLS_DATABASE_MIGRATION_SOP.md` (MANDATORY)\n- **Data Dictionary**: `docs/database/DATA_DICTIONARY.md` (update after changes)\n- **RLS Implementation**: `docs/database/RLS_IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md`\n- **RLS Policies**: `docs/database/RLS_POLICY_CATALOG.md`\n- **Security First**: `docs/guides/SECURITY_FIRST_ARCHITECTURE.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:35:06.244Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents requiring structured database migration patterns with security-first architecture and RLS policies","zh":"非常适合需要结构化数据库迁移模式、安全第一架构和行级安全（RLS）策略的开发代理","ja":"構造化されたデータベース移行パターン、セキュリティ第一のアーキテクチャ、RLSポリシーを必要とする開発エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 패턴, 보안 우선 아키텍처 및 RLS 정책을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren patrones de migración de bases de datos estructurados con arquitectura de seguridad en primer lugar y políticas de RLS","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant des modèles de migration de bases de données structurés avec une architecture de sécurité en premier lieu et des politiques de RLS","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die strukturierte Datenbank-Migrationsmuster mit Sicherheits-Architektur und RLS-Richtlinien erfordern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem padrões de migração de banco de dados estruturados com arquitetura de segurança em primeiro lugar e políticas de RLS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих структурированных шаблонов миграции баз данных с архитектурой, ориентированной на безопасность, и политиками RLS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء التي تتطلب أنماط هجرة قواعد البيانات المنظمة مع هندسة الأمان أولاً وسياسات RLS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce mandatory Row-Level Security (RLS) policies, manage Prisma schema updates, and automate GRANT statement additions, ensuring secure and compliant database migrations with SAFe multi-agent development methodology and Claude Code","zh":"赋予代理人执行强制的行级安全（RLS）策略、管理Prisma模式更新和自动GRANT语句添加的能力，确保安全且合规的数据库迁移，同时支持SAFe多代理开发方法论和Claude Code","ja":"強制的な行レベルのセキュリティ（RLS）ポリシーを適用し、Prismaスキーマの更新を管理し、GRANT文の追加を自動化することで、セキュアでコンプライアンスのあるデータベース移行を可能にし、SAFeマルチエージェント開発方法論とClaude Codeをサポートする","ko":"强制적인 행 수준 보안(RLS) 정책을 적용하고, Prisma 스키마 업데이트를 관리하며, GRANT 문 추가를 자동화하여 안전하고 규정 준수하는 데이터베이스 마이그레이션을 보장하고, SAFe 다중 에이전트 개발 방법론 및 Claude Code를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar políticas de Seguridad a Nivel de Fila (RLS) obligatorias, gestionar actualizaciones de esquemas de Prisma y automatizar adiciones de declaraciones GRANT, garantizando migraciones de bases de datos seguras y compatibles con la metodología de desarrollo multiagente SAFe y Claude Code","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des politiques de Sécurité au Niveau des Lignes (RLS) obligatoires, de gérer les mises à jour des schémas Prisma et d''automatiser les ajouts de déclarations GRANT, garantissant ainsi des migrations de bases de données sécurisées et conformes à la méthodologie de développement multi-agent SAFe et Claude Code","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, obligatorische Richtlinien für Reiheniveau-Sicherheit (RLS) durchzusetzen, Prisma-Schema-Aktualisierungen zu verwalten und GRANT-Anweisungen hinzuzufügen, um sichere und konforme Datenbankmigrationen mit der SAFe-Mehragenten-Entwicklungsmethodik und Claude Code zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor políticas de Segurança em Nível de Linha (RLS) obrigatórias, gerenciar atualizações de esquema do Prisma e automatizar adições de instruções GRANT, garantindo migrações de banco de dados seguras e conformes com a metodologia de desenvolvimento multiagente SAFe e Claude Code","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать обязательные политики безопасности на уровне строк (RLS), управлять обновлениями схемы Prisma и автоматизировать добавления операторов GRANT, обеспечивая безопасную и соответствующую миграцию баз данных с помощью многоагентной методологии разработки SAFe и Claude Code","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض سياسات أمان المستوى الصف (RLS) الإلزامية، وإدارة تحديثات مخطط Prisma، وتأتمة إضافات عبارات GRANT، مما يضمن هجرات قواعد البيانات الآمنة والمطابقة لمعايير منهجية التطوير المتعددة الوكلاء SAFe و Claude Code"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating database migrations with RLS policies","Updating Prisma schema with security-first approach","Automating schema impact analysis and data migration planning"],"zh":["使用RLS策略创建数据库迁移","使用安全第一方法更新Prisma模式","自动化模式影响分析和数据迁移规划"],"ja":["RLSポリシーを使用したデータベース移行の作成","セキュリティ第一のアプローチを使用したPrismaスキーマの更新","スキーマの影響分析とデータ移行計画の自動化"],"ko":["RLS 정책을 사용하여 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 생성","보안 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 Prisma 스키마 업데이트","스키마 영향 분석 및 데이터 마이그레이션 계획 자동화"],"es":["Crear migraciones de bases de datos con políticas de RLS","Actualizar esquema de Prisma con enfoque de seguridad en primer lugar","Automatizar el análisis de impacto de esquema y la planificación de migración de datos"],"fr":["Créer des migrations de bases de données avec des politiques de RLS","Mettre à jour le schéma Prisma avec une approche de sécurité en premier lieu","Automatiser l''analyse d''impact de schéma et la planification de migration de données"],"de":["Erstellen von Datenbankmigrationen mit RLS-Richtlinien","Aktualisieren des Prisma-Schemas mit Sicherheitsansatz","Automatisieren der Analyse des Schemaauswirkungen und der Datenmigrationplanung"],"pt":["Criar migrações de banco de dados com políticas de RLS","Atualizar esquema do Prisma com abordagem de segurança em primeiro lugar","Automatizar análise de impacto de esquema e planejamento de migração de dados"],"ru":["Создание миграций баз данных с политиками RLS","Обновление схемы Prisma с подходом, ориентированным на безопасность","Автоматизация анализа воздействия схемы и планирования миграции данных"],"ar":["إنشاء هجرات قواعد البيانات مع سياسات RLS","تحديث مخطط Prisma بالنهج الأمني أولاً","تأتمة تحليل التأثير المخططي وتخطيط هجرة البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","SAFe multi-agent development methodology compliance","RLS policies must be defined in the same file as migration scripts"],"zh":["需要Claude Code集成","需要遵守SAFe多代理开发方法论","RLS策略必须在与迁移脚本相同的文件中定义"],"ja":["Claude Codeの統合が必要","SAFeマルチエージェント開発方法論の遵守が必要","RLSポリシーは移行スクリプトと同じファイルに定義する必要がある"],"ko":["Claude Code 통합이 필요","SAFe 다중 에이전트 개발 방법론을 준수해야 함","RLS 정책은 마이그레이션 스크립트와 동일한 파일에 정의되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Cumplimiento con la metodología de desarrollo multiagente SAFe","Las políticas de RLS deben definirse en el mismo archivo que los scripts de migración"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Conformité à la méthodologie de développement multi-agent SAFe","Les politiques de RLS doivent être définies dans le même fichier que les scripts de migration"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Claude Code","Einhaltung der SAFe-Mehragenten-Entwicklungsmethodik","RLS-Richtlinien müssen in der gleichen Datei wie die Migrations-Skripte definiert werden"],"pt":["Exige integração com Claude Code","Conformidade com a metodologia de desenvolvimento multiagente SAFe","Políticas de RLS devem ser definidas no mesmo arquivo que os scripts de migração"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Соблюдение многоагентной методологии разработки SAFe","Политики RLS должны быть определены в том же файле, что и скрипты миграции"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع Claude Code","الامتثال لمنهجية التطوير المتعددة الوكلاء SAFe"," يجب تعريف سياسات RLS في نفس الملف الذي يتم فيه تشغيل نصوص الهجرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
