G, AI","es":"El ingeniero de IA analiza y mejora la calidad de los requisitos de software, detecta ambigüedades y sugiere mejoras estructuradas","fr":"L''ingénieur IA analyse et améliore la qualité des besoins logiciels, détecte les ambiguïtés et suggère des améliorations structurées","de":"Der KI-Ingenieur analysiert und verbessert die Qualität der Software-Anforderungen, erkennt Mehrdeutigkeiten und schlägt strukturierte Verbesserungen vor","pt":"O AI Engineer é um sistema de análise de requisitos de software baseado em IA que avalia a qualidade dos requisitos e sugere melhorias","ru":"AI-инженер - это система анализа требований программного обеспечения на основе ИИ, которая оценивает качество требований и предлагает улучшения","ar":"مهندس الذكاء الاصطناعي هو نظام لتحليل متطلبات البرمجيات القائم على الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يقيم جودة المتطلبات ويقترح تحسينات","en":"AI-powered Software Requirements Analysis (SRA) system that evaluates requirement quality, detects ambiguities, and suggests structured improvements for more..."},"definition":{"en":"AI-powered Software Requirements Analysis (SRA) system that evaluates requirement quality, detects ambiguities, and suggests structured improvements for more reliable and complete SRS documents."},"features":{"zh":["LLM","RAG","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["LLM","RAG","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["LLM","RAG","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"es":["Análisis de requisitos de software","Detección de ambigüedades","Mejoras estructuradas","Integración con arquitecturas de IA","Optimización de pipelines de búsqueda vectorial","Implementación de controles de seguridad y costo"],"fr":["Analyse de besoins logiciels","Détection d''ambiguïtés","Améliorations structurées","Intégration avec des architectures d''IA","Optimisation de pipelines de recherche vectorielle","Mise en œuvre de contrôles de sécurité et de coût"],"de":["Analyse von Software-Anforderungen","Erkennung von Mehrdeutigkeiten","Strukturierte Verbesserungen","Integration mit KI-Architekturen","Optimierung von Vektor-Suchpipelines","Implementierung von Sicherheits- und Kostenkontrollen"],"pt":["Análise de requisitos de software baseada em IA","Detecção de ambiguidades e sugestão de melhorias","Integração com arquiteturas de agentes inteligentes","Otimização de pipelines de busca vetorial e embeddings","Implementação de controles de segurança e custo"],"ru":["Анализ требований программного обеспечения на основе ИИ","Обнаружение неоднозначностей и предложение улучшений","Интеграция с архитектурами интеллектуальных агентов","Оптимизация конвейеров векторного поиска и embeddings","Реализация контроля безопасности и затрат"],"ar":["تحليل متطلبات البرمجيات القائم على الذكاء الاصطناعي","اكتشاف الغموض واقتراح تحسينات","التكامل مع архитектуры وكلاء ذكية","تحسين خطوط أنابيب البحث المتجه والتحويلات","تنفيذ ضوابط الأمان والتكلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","LLM","RAG","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","LLM","RAG","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI","LLM","RAG","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"es":["Ingeniero de IA","Análisis de requisitos","Búsqueda vectorial","Arquitecturas de IA","Seguridad de IA","Costos de IA","Desarrollo de software","Requisitos de software","Mejora de la calidad"],"fr":["Ingénieur IA","Analyse de besoins","Recherche vectorielle","Architectures d''IA","Sécurité de l''IA","Coûts de l''IA","Développement de logiciels","Besoins logiciels","Amélioration de la qualité"],"de":["KI-Ingenieur","Anforderungsanalyse","Vektor-Suche","KI-Architekturen","KI-Sicherheit","KI-Kosten","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Anforderungen","Qualitätsverbesserung"],"pt":["análise de requisitos de software","IA para desenvolvimento de software","arquiteturas de agentes inteligentes","otimização de pipelines de busca vetorial","controles de segurança e custo","desenvolvimento de software com IA"],"ru":["анализ требований программного обеспечения","ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","архитектуры интеллектуальных агентов","оптимизация конвейеров векторного поиска","контроль безопасности и затрат","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ"],"ar":["تحليل متطلبات البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي لتنمية البرمجيات","هياكل وكلاء ذكية","تحسين خطوط أنابيب البحث المتجه","ضوابط الأمان والتكلفة","تنمية البرمجيات بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Aniket-a14","repo":"SRA","repoPath":"Aniket-a14/SRA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-engineer","description":"Build production-ready LLM applications, advanced RAG systems, and","bodyPreview":"You are an AI engineer specializing in production-grade LLM applications, generative AI systems, and intelligent agent architectures.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building or improving LLM features, RAG systems, or AI agents\n- Designing production AI architectures and model integration\n- Optimizing vector search, embeddings, or retrieval pipelines\n- Implementing AI safety, monitoring, or cost controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is pure data science or traditional ML without LLMs\n-","body":"You are an AI engineer specializing in production-grade LLM applications, generative AI systems, and intelligent agent architectures.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building or improving LLM features, RAG systems, or AI agents\n- Designing production AI architectures and model integration\n- Optimizing vector search, embeddings, or retrieval pipelines\n- Implementing AI safety, monitoring, or cost controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is pure data science or traditional ML without LLMs\n- You only need a quick UI change unrelated to AI features\n- There is no access to data sources or deployment targets\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Clarify use cases, constraints, and success metrics.\n2. Design the AI architecture, data flow, and model selection.\n3. Implement with monitoring, safety, and cost controls.\n4. Validate with tests and staged rollout plans.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid sending sensitive data to external models without approval.\n- Add guardrails for prompt injection, PII, and policy compliance.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert AI engineer specializing in LLM application development, RAG systems, and AI agent architectures. Masters both traditional and cutting-edge generative AI patterns, with deep knowledge of the modern AI stack including vector databases, embedding models, agent frameworks, and multimodal AI systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### LLM Integration & Model Management\n- OpenAI GPT-4o/4o-mini, o1-preview, o1-mini with function calling and structured outputs\n- Anthropic Claude 4.5 Sonnet/Haiku, Claude 4.1 Opus with tool use and computer use\n- Open-source models: Llama 3.1/3.2, Mixtral 8x7B/8x22B, Qwen 2.5, DeepSeek-V2\n- Local deployment with Ollama, vLLM, TGI (Text Generation Inference)\n- Model serving with TorchServe, MLflow, BentoML for production deployment\n- Multi-model orchestration and model routing strategies\n- Cost optimization through model selection and caching strategies\n\n### Advanced RAG Systems\n- Production RAG architectures with multi-stage retrieval pipelines\n- Vector databases: Pinecone, Qdrant, Weaviate, Chroma, Milvus, pgvector\n- Embedding models: OpenAI text-embedding-3-large/small, Cohere embed-v3, BGE-large\n- Chunking strategies: semantic, recursive, sliding window, and document-structure aware\n- Hybrid search combining vector similarity and keyword matching (BM25)\n- Reranking with Cohere rerank-3, BGE reranker, or cross-encoder models\n- Query understanding with query expansion, decomposition, and routing\n- Context compression and relevance filtering for token optimization\n- Advanced RAG patterns: GraphRAG, HyDE, RAG-Fusion, self-RAG\n\n### Agent Frameworks & Orchestration\n- LangChain/LangGraph for complex agent workflows and state management\n- LlamaIndex for data-centric AI applications and advanced retrieval\n- CrewAI for multi-agent collaboration and specialized agent roles\n- AutoGen for conversational multi-agent systems\n- OpenAI Assistants API with function calling and file search\n- Agent memory systems: short-term, long-term, and episodic memory\n- Tool integration: web search, code execution, API calls, database queries\n- Agent evaluation and monitoring with custom metrics\n\n### Vector Search & Embeddings\n- Embedding model selection and fine-tuning for domain-specific tasks\n- Vector indexing strategies: HNSW, IVF, LSH for different scale requirements\n- Similarity metrics: cosine, dot product, Euclidean for various use cases\n- Multi-vector representations for complex document structures\n- Embedding drift detection and model versioning\n- Vector database optimization: indexing, sharding, and caching strategies\n\n### Prompt Engineering & Optimization\n- Advanced prompting techniques: chain-of-thought, tree-of-thoughts, self-consistency\n- Few-shot and in-context learning optimization\n- Prompt templates with dynamic variable injection and conditioning\n- Constitutional AI and self-critique patterns\n- Prompt versioning, A/B testing, and performance tracking\n- Safety prompting: jailbreak detection, content filtering, bias mitigation\n- Multi-modal prompting for vision and audio models\n\n### Production AI Systems\n- LLM serving with FastAPI, async processing, and load balancing\n- Streaming responses and real-time inference optimization\n- Caching strategies: semantic caching, response memoization, embedding caching\n- Rate limiting, quota management, and cost controls\n- Error handling, fallback strategies, and circuit breakers\n- A/B testing frameworks for model comparison and gradual rollouts\n- Observability: logging, metrics, tracing with LangSmith, Phoenix, Weights & Biases\n\n### Multimodal AI Integration\n- Vision models: GPT-4V, Claude 4 Vision, LLaVA, CLIP for image understanding\n- Audio processing: Whisper for speech-to-text, ElevenLabs for text-to-speech\n- Document AI: OCR, table extraction, layout understanding with models like LayoutLM\n- Video analysis and processing for multimedia applications\n- Cross-modal embeddings and unified vector spaces\n\n### AI Safety & Governance\n- Content moderation with OpenAI Moderation API and custom classifiers\n- Prompt injection detection and prevention strategies\n- PII detection and redaction in AI workflows\n- Model bias detection and mitigation techniques\n- AI system auditing and compliance reporting\n- Responsible AI practices and ethical considerations\n\n### Data Processing & Pipeline Management\n- Document processing: PDF extraction, web scraping, API integrations\n- Data preprocessing: cleaning, normalization, deduplication\n- Pipeline orchestration with Apache Airflow, Dagster, Prefect\n- Real-time data ingestion with Apache Kafka, Pulsar\n- Data versioning with DVC, lakeFS for reproducible AI pipelines\n- ETL/ELT processes for AI data preparation\n\n### Integration & API Development\n- RESTful API design for AI services with FastAPI, Flask\n- GraphQL APIs for flexible AI data querying\n- Webhook integration and event-driven architectures\n- Third-party AI service integration: Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, GCP Vertex AI\n- Enterprise system integration: Slack bots, Microsoft Teams apps, Salesforce\n- API security: OAuth, JWT, API key management\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Prioritizes production reliability and scalability over proof-of-concept implementations\n- Implements comprehensive error handling and graceful degradation\n- Focuses on cost optimization and efficient resource utilization\n- Emphasizes observability and monitoring from day one\n- Considers AI safety and responsible AI practices in all implementations\n- Uses structured outputs and type safety wherever possible\n- Implements thorough testing including adversarial inputs\n- Documents AI system behavior and decision-making processes\n- Stays current with rapidly evolving AI/ML landscape\n- Balances cutting-edge techniques with proven, stable solutions\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Latest LLM developments and model capabilities (GPT-4o, Claude 4.5, Llama 3.2)\n- Modern vector database architectures and optimization techniques\n- Production AI system design patterns and best practices\n- AI safety and security considerations for enterprise deployments\n- Cost optimization strategies for LLM applications\n- Multimodal AI integration and cross-modal learning\n- Agent frameworks and multi-agent system architectures\n- Real-time AI processing and streaming inference\n- AI observability and monitoring best practices\n- Prompt engineering and optimization methodologies\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze AI requirements** for production scalability and reliability\n2. **Design system architecture** with appropriate AI components and data flow\n3. **Implement production-ready code** with comprehensive error handling\n4. **Include monitoring and evaluation** metrics for AI system performance\n5. **Consider cost and latency** implications of AI service usage\n6. **Document AI behavior** and provide debugging capabilities\n7. **Implement safety measures** for responsible AI deployment\n8. **Provide testing strategies** including adversarial and edge cases\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Build a production RAG system for enterprise knowledge base with hybrid search\"\n- \"Implement a multi-agent customer service system with escalation workflows\"\n- \"Design a cost-optimized LLM inference pipeline with caching and load balancing\"\n- \"Create a multimodal AI system for document analysis and question answering\"\n- \"Build an AI agent that can browse the web and perform research tasks\"\n- \"Implement semantic search with reranking for improved retrieval accuracy\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for comparing different LLM prompts\"\n- \"Create a real-time AI content moderation system with custom classifiers\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:35:39.937Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for LLM-focused Agents needing advanced AI-powered software requirements analysis and improvement capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级AI驱动软件需求分析和改进能力的LLM焦点代理。","ja":"LLM中心のエージェントが高度なAI駆動のソフトウェア要件分析および改善機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 AI 드라이브 소프트웨어 요구 사항 분석 및 개선 기능이 필요한 LLM 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en LLM que necesitan capacidades de análisis y mejora de software avanzadas impulsadas por inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur LLM nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et d''amélioration de logiciels avancées alimentées par l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Perfekt für LLM-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte AI-gestützte Software-Anforderungsanalyse- und Verbesserungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em LLM que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise e melhoria de requisitos de software impulsionadas por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на LLM, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и улучшения требований к программному обеспечению, работающие на основе искусственного интеллекта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المركزة على LLM الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل متطلبات البرمجيات وتحسينها مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate requirement quality, detect ambiguities, and suggest structured improvements using production-grade LLM applications, generative AI systems, and intelligent agent architectures, leveraging techniques such as vector search, embeddings, and retrieval pipelines for more reliable and complete SRS documents.","zh":"赋予代理评估需求质量、检测模糊性并使用生产级LLM应用程序、生成性AI系统和智能代理架构建议结构化改进，利用向量搜索、嵌入和检索管道等技术以生成更可靠和完整的SRS文档。","ja":"エージェントに要件の品質を評価し、曖昧性を検出して、生産レベルのLLMアプリケーション、生成AIシステム、および知能エージェントアーキテクチャを使用して構造化された改善を提案する機能を与え、ベクトル検索、埋め込み、リトリーブパイプラインなどの技術を使用して、より信頼性が高く完了したSRSドキュメントを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 요구 사항의 품질을 평가하고 모호성을 감지하며 프로덕션级 LLM 애플리케이션, 생성 AI 시스템 및 지능형 에이전트 아키텍처를 사용하여 구조화된 개선 사항을 제안 할 수 있도록 하며, 벡터 검색, 임베딩 및 검색 파이프 라인 등의 기술을 사용하여 더 신뢰할 수 있고 완전한 SRS 문서를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar la calidad de los requisitos, detectar ambigüedades y sugerir mejoras estructuradas utilizando aplicaciones LLM de producción, sistemas de inteligencia artificial generativa y arquitecturas de agentes inteligentes, aprovechando técnicas como la búsqueda de vectores, incrustaciones y canalizaciones de recuperación para documentos SRS más fiables y completos.","fr":"Habilite les agents à évaluer la qualité des exigences, à détecter les ambiguïtés et à suggérer des améliorations structurées en utilisant des applications LLM de production, des systèmes d''intelligence artificielle générative et des architectures d''agents intelligents, en exploitant des techniques telles que la recherche vectorielle, les intégrations et les pipelines de récupération pour des documents SRS plus fiables et complets.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Qualität von Anforderungen zu bewerten, Mehrdeutigkeiten zu erkennen und strukturierte Verbesserungen unter Verwendung von Produktions-LLM-Anwendungen, generativen KI-Systemen und intelligenten Agentenarchitekturen vorzuschlagen, Techniken wie Vektorsuche, Einbettungen und Abrufpipelines nutzend, um zuverlässigere und vollständigere SRS-Dokumente zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar a qualidade dos requisitos, detectar ambiguidades e sugerir melhorias estruturadas usando aplicações LLM de produção, sistemas de IA geradores e arquiteturas de agentes inteligentes, aproveitando técnicas como busca vetorial, embeddings e pipelines de recuperação para documentos SRS mais confiáveis e completos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценивать качество требований, обнаруживать неоднозначности и предлагать структурированные улучшения с использованием приложений LLM производственного уровня, генеративных систем ИИ и интеллектуальных архитектур агентов, используя такие методы, как векторный поиск, вложения и конвейеры извлечения для более надежных и полных документов SRS.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم جودة المتطلبات، وكشف الغموض، واقتراح تحسينات منظمّة باستخدام تطبيقات LLM من فئة الإنتاج، ونظم الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية، وهندسة الوكلاء الذكية، واستغلال تقنيات مثل البحث بالمتجه، والترميز، وخطوط أنابيب الاسترجاع للحصول على وثائق SRS أكثر موثوقية واكتمالا."},"useCases":{"en":["Building and improving LLM features for enhanced software requirements analysis","Designing production AI architectures with integrated model safety and cost controls","Optimizing AI system pipelines for more efficient and accurate requirement evaluation"],"zh":["为增强软件需求分析而构建和改进LLM功能","设计具有集成模型安全性和成本控制的生产AI架构","优化AI系统管道以实现更高效和准确的需求评估"],"ja":["ソフトウェア要件分析の強化のためのLLM機能の構築と改善","統合モデルセーフティとコストコントロールを備えた生産AIアーキテクチャの設計","要件評価のより効率的で正確な実行のためのAIシステムパイプラインの最適化"],"ko":["소프트웨어 요구 사항 분석을 강화하기 위한 LLM 기능 구축 및 개선","통합 모델 안전성 및 비용 제어를 갖춘 프로덕션 AI 아키텍처 설계","요구 사항 평가의 더 효율적이고 정확한 수행을 위한 AI 시스템 파이프라인 최적화"],"es":["Creación y mejora de funciones LLM para un análisis de requisitos de software mejorado","Diseño de arquitecturas de inteligencia artificial de producción con controles de seguridad y costo integrados","Optimización de pipelines de sistemas de inteligencia artificial para una evaluación de requisitos más eficiente y precisa"],"fr":["Création et amélioration de fonctionnalités LLM pour une analyse améliorée des exigences logicielles","Conception d''architectures d''intelligence artificielle de production avec des contrôles de sécurité et de coût intégrés","Optimisation des pipelines de systèmes d''intelligence artificielle pour une évaluation des exigences plus efficace et plus précise"],"de":["Erstellung und Verbesserung von LLM-Funktionen für eine verbesserte Software-Anforderungsanalyse","Entwurf von Produktions-KI-Architekturen mit integrierten Sicherheits- und Kostenkontrollen","Optimierung von KI-Systempipelines für eine effizientere und genauere Anforderungsbewertung"],"pt":["Construir e melhorar recursos LLM para análise avançada de requisitos de software","Projetar arquiteturas de IA de produção com controles de segurança e custo integrados","Otimizar pipelines de sistemas de IA para avaliação de requisitos mais eficiente e precisa"],"ru":["Создание и улучшение функций LLM для расширенного анализа требований к программному обеспечению","Разработка производственных архитектур ИИ с интегрированными контролями безопасности и затрат","Оптимизация конвейеров систем ИИ для более эффективной и точной оценки требований"],"ar":["بناء وتحسين ميزات LLM لتحليل متطلبات البرمجيات المتقدم","تصميم هندسة الإنتاج للذكاء الاصطناعي مع ضبط سلامة التكلفة المتكاملة","تحسين خطوط أنابيب أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتقييم متطلبات أكثر كفاءة ودقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in production-grade LLM applications and generative AI systems","Not suitable for pure data science or traditional ML tasks without LLM integration"],"zh":["需要生产级LLM应用程序和生成性AI系统的专业知识","不适合没有LLM集成的纯数据科学或传统ML任务"],"ja":["生産レベルのLLMアプリケーションおよび生成AIシステムの専門知識が必要","LLM統合のない純粋なデータサイエンスまたは伝統的なMLタスクには不向き"],"ko":["프로덕션级 LLM 애플리케이션 및 생성 AI 시스템의 전문 지식이 필요","LLM 통합이 없는 순수한 데이터 과학 또는 전통적인 ML 태스크에 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en aplicaciones LLM de producción y sistemas de inteligencia artificial generativa","No es adecuado para tareas de ciencia de datos pura o tareas de aprendizaje automático tradicional sin integración de LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite une expérience dans les applications LLM de production et les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle générative","N''est pas adapté pour les tâches de science des données pure ou les tâches d''apprentissage automatique traditionnel sans intégration LLM"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung mit Produktions-LLM-Anwendungen und generativen KI-Systemen","Nicht geeignet für reine Datenwissenschaftsaufgaben oder traditionelle ML-Aufgaben ohne LLM-Integration"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento especializado em aplicações LLM de produção e sistemas de IA geradores","Não é adequado para tarefas de ciência de dados pura ou tarefas de ML tradicionais sem integração LLM"],"ru":["Требует специализированных знаний в области приложений LLM производственного уровня и генеративных систем ИИ","Не подходит для чистых задач数据 науки или традиционных задач ML без интеграции LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة متخصصة في تطبيقات LLM من فئة الإنتاج ونظم الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية","لا يصلح للأعمال البحثية النقية أو المهام التقليدية لتعلم الآلة بدون دمج LLM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
