Synchronisation","Kompatibel mit Fountain Title Page Syntax","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Titelseiten-Metadaten","Ideal für die Vorbereitung von Drehbüchern für die Einreichung"],"pt":["Criação de títulos de página personalizados","Sincronização upstream para atualizações em tempo real","Suporte para roteiros, romances e produção de filmes","Formato de título de página padrão","Chaves padrão para metadados"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных страниц названия","Синхронизация upstream для обновлений в реальном времени","Поддержка сценариев, романов и кинопроизводства","Стандартный формат названия страницы","Стандартные ключи для метаданных"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات العنوان المخصصة","التزامن المتدفق لتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","دعم سيناريوهات والروايات وإنتاج الأفلام","تنسيق صفحة العنوان القياسي","مفاتيح قياسية للبيانات الوصفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["标题页技能","屏剧创作","小说创作","电影制作","元数据管理","Fountain标题页语法","标准键值对","上游同步"],"ja":["タイトルページスキル","スクリーンプレイ制作","小説制作","映画制作","メタデータ管理","Fountainタイトルページ構文","標準キーペア","上流同期"],"ko":["타이틀 페이지 스킬","스크린플레이 제작","소설 제작","영화 제작","메타데이터 관리","Fountain 타이틀 페이지 구문","표준 키-값 페어","업스트림 동기화"],"es":["plantilla de título de página","guiones","novelas","producción cinematográfica","modelo multi-AI","Fountain Title Page Syntax","metadatos de título de página"],"fr":["modèle de page de titre","scénarios","romans","production cinématographique","modèle multi-AI","syntaxe Fountain Title Page","métadonnées de page de titre"],"de":["Titelseiten-Vorlage","Drehbücher","Romane","Filmproduktion","Multi-AI-Modell","Fountain Title Page Syntax","Titelseiten-Metadaten"],"pt":["modelo de título de página","roteiros","produção de filmes","sincronização upstream","metadados","formato de título de página","chaves padrão","criação de títulos de página","personalização de títulos de página"],"ru":["шаблон названия страницы","сценарии","кинопроизводство","синхронизация upstream","метаданные","формат названия страницы","стандартные ключи","создание страниц названия","настройка страниц названия"],"ar":["قالب صفحة العنوان","سيناريوهات","إنتاج الأفلام","التزامن المتدفق","البيانات الوصفية","تنسيق صفحة العنوان","مفاتيح قياسية","إنشاء صفحات العنوان","تخصيص صفحات العنوان"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"story-systems-template","repoPath":"bybren-llc/story-systems-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"title-page","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Title Page Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Creating new screenplays\n- Setting up title page metadata\n- Updating screenplay information\n- Preparing scripts for submission\n\n## Title Page Format\n\n### Fountain Title Page Syntax\nKey-value pairs at the very beginning of the document:\n\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **Seoul Identity**\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nDraft date: December 27, 2025\nContact:\n    scott@wordstofilmby.com\n    (555) 123-4567\n```\n\n### Standard Keys\n\n| K","body":"# Title Page Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Creating new screenplays\n- Setting up title page metadata\n- Updating screenplay information\n- Preparing scripts for submission\n\n## Title Page Format\n\n### Fountain Title Page Syntax\nKey-value pairs at the very beginning of the document:\n\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **Seoul Identity**\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nDraft date: December 27, 2025\nContact:\n    scott@wordstofilmby.com\n    (555) 123-4567\n```\n\n### Standard Keys\n\n| Key | Purpose | Required |\n|-----|---------|----------|\n| `Title` | Screenplay title | Yes |\n| `Credit` | Credit type | Yes |\n| `Author` | Writer name(s) | Yes |\n| `Source` | Source material | If adapted |\n| `Draft date` | Current draft date | Recommended |\n| `Contact` | Contact information | Yes |\n| `Copyright` | Copyright notice | Optional |\n| `Notes` | Additional notes | Optional |\n\n### Multi-Line Values\nIndent continuation lines:\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **The Long and Winding\n    Road to Nowhere**\nContact:\n    Jane Smith\n    jane@email.com\n    (555) 123-4567\n    123 Main Street\n    Los Angeles, CA 90001\n```\n\n### Formatting in Titles\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **Bold Title**\n    _Underlined Subtitle_\n    *Italic tagline*\n```\n\n## Credit Types\n\n### Single Writer\n```fountain\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\n```\n\n### Writing Team (Collaborators)\n```fountain\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham & Jane Smith\n```\nNote: `&` indicates a writing team who wrote together.\n\n### Multiple Writers (Sequential)\n```fountain\nCredit: Screenplay by\nAuthor: Scott Graham and Jane Smith\n```\nNote: `and` indicates writers who worked separately.\n\n### Adapted Work\n```fountain\nCredit: Screenplay by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nSource: Based on the novel by Jane Smith\n```\n\n### Multiple Credits\n```fountain\nCredit: Screenplay by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nCredit: Story by\nAuthor: Jane Smith & John Doe\n```\n\n## Industry Standards\n\n### Spec Script Title Page\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **SEOUL IDENTITY**\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nContact:\n    scott@wordstofilmby.com\n```\n\n**Do NOT include on spec scripts:**\n- Draft numbers\n- WGA registration numbers (prominently)\n- Date revisions\n\n### Production Script Title Page\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **SEOUL IDENTITY**\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nDraft date: REVISED - December 27, 2025\nContact:\n    Production Company Name\n    Address\n```\n\n## Contact Information\n\n### What to Include\n```fountain\nContact:\n    Your Name\n    your.email@domain.com\n    (555) 123-4567\n```\n\nOr your representation:\n```fountain\nContact:\n    Represented by\n    Agent Name\n    Agency Name\n    agent@agency.com\n    (555) 123-4567\n```\n\n### Positioning\nIn final PDF output:\n- Title: Centered, 1/3 down page\n- Credit/Author: Centered, below title\n- Contact: Lower right (or lower left)\n\n## Copyright Notice\n\n### Optional Copyright\n```fountain\nCopyright: (c) 2025 Scott Graham\n```\n\n### WGA Registration\nIf including (not recommended on specs):\n```fountain\nNotes: WGAw Registered\n```\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Feature Film Spec\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **SEOUL IDENTITY**\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nDraft date: December 2025\nContact:\n    scott@wordstofilmby.com\n```\n\n### Television Spec\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **\"The One Where Everything Changes\"**\nCredit: Spec episode of\nAuthor: BREAKING BAD\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nContact:\n    scott@wordstofilmby.com\n```\n\n### Adaptation\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **THE GREAT GATSBY**\nCredit: Screenplay by\nAuthor: Scott Graham\nSource: Based on the novel by F. Scott Fitzgerald\nDraft date: December 2025\nContact:\n    scott@wordstofilmby.com\n```\n\n### Writing Team\n```fountain\nTitle:\n    **BUDDY COP MOVIE**\nCredit: Written by\nAuthor: Scott Graham & Jane Smith\nDraft date: December 2025\nContact:\n    Represented by\n    Super Agent\n    Big Agency\n    agent@bigagency.com\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n- [ ] Title is present\n- [ ] Credit type is correct\n- [ ] Author name(s) formatted correctly\n- [ ] Contact information included\n- [ ] Draft date current (if included)\n- [ ] Source credited (if adaptation)\n- [ ] No WGA number on spec scripts\n- [ ] No draft numbers on spec scripts\n- [ ] Multi-line values properly indented\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:36:15.720Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Writing Agents needing standardized title page generation for screenplays and novels.","zh":"非常适合需要为电影剧本和小说生成标准化标题页的创意写作代理","ja":"スクリーンプレイや小説の標準化されたタイトルページ生成が必要なクリエイティブライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"스크린플레이와 소설의 표준화된 제목 페이지 생성이 필요한 크리에이티브 라이터 에이전트에게 완벽한","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura creativa que necesitan una generación de página de título estandarizada para guiones y novelas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''écriture créative ayant besoin d''une génération de page de titre standardisée pour les scénarios et les romans.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Schreibagenten, die eine standardisierte Titelseitengenerierung für Drehbücher und Romane benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Criativa que necessitam de geração padronizada de páginas de título para roteiros e romances.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов творческого письма, которым требуется стандартизированное создание титульных страниц для сценариев и романов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الكتابة الإبداعية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء صفحات عنواين موحدة للنصوص السينمائية والروايات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create industry-compliant title pages using Fountain syntax, enabling seamless metadata management and upstream sync for film production and script submissions.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Fountain 语法创建符合行业标准的标题页，从而实现元数据管理和上游同步的无缝对接，适用于电影制作和剧本提交","ja":"Fountain 構文を使用して業界標準に準拠したタイトルページを作成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、メタデータ管理と上流同期をシームレスに実現し、映画制作と脚本提出に適しています","ko":"에이전트가 Fountain 구문을 사용하여 산업 규격에 맞는 제목 페이지를 생성할 수 있도록 해주어, 메타데이터 관리 및 상류 동기화를 원활하게 수행하여 영화 제작 및 스크립트 제출에 적합","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear páginas de título compatibles con la industria utilizando la sintaxis Fountain, lo que permite una gestión de metadatos sin problemas y una sincronización ascendente para la producción de películas y la presentación de guiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages de titre conformes à l''industrie en utilisant la syntaxe Fountain, ce qui permet une gestion des métadonnées sans heurts et une synchronisation ascendante pour la production de films et la soumission de scénarios.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, branchenkonforme Titelseiten mit der Fountain-Syntax zu erstellen, wodurch eine nahtlose Metadatenverwaltung und eine Upstream-Synchronisation für Filmproduktionen und Drehbucheinreichungen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar páginas de título em conformidade com os padrões da indústria usando a sintaxe Fountain, permitindo o gerenciamento contínuo de metadados e a sincronização ascendente para produção de filmes e envio de roteiros.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать соответствующие отраслевым стандартам титульные страницы с использованием синтаксиса Fountain, обеспечивая беспрерывное управление метаданными и восходящую синхронизацию для кинопроизводства и подачи сценариев.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء صفحات عنواين متوافقة مع معايير الصناعة باستخدام صيغة Fountain، مما يتيح إدارة سلسة للبيانات الوصفية ومزامنة تصاعدية لإنتاج الأفلام وتقديم النصوص."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating title pages for screenplay submissions","Updating metadata for novel manuscripts","Creating standardized credits for film productions"],"zh":["为剧本提交生成标题页","更新小说手稿的元数据","为电影制作创建标准化的署名"],"ja":["脚本提出用のタイトルページの生成","小説原稿のメタデータの更新","映画制作用の標準化されたクレジットの作成"],"ko":["스크립트 제출용 제목 페이지 생성","소설 원고의 메타데이터 更新","영화 제작용 표준화된 크레딧 생성"],"es":["Generación de páginas de título para la presentación de guiones","Actualización de metadatos para manuscritos de novelas","Creación de créditos estandarizados para producciones de películas"],"fr":["Génération de pages de titre pour la soumission de scénarios","Mise à jour des métadonnées pour les manuscrits de romans","Création de crédits standardisés pour les productions de films"],"de":["Generierung von Titelseiten für Drehbucheinreichungen","Aktualisierung von Metadaten für Romanmanuskripte","Erstellung standardisierter Credits für Filmproduktionen"],"pt":["Geração de páginas de título para envio de roteiros","Atualização de metadados para manuscritos de romances","Criação de créditos padronizados para produções cinematográficas"],"ru":["Создание титульных страниц для подачи сценариев","Обновление метаданных для рукописей романов","Создание стандартизированных титров для кинопроизводства"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات عنواين لتقديم النصوص السينمائية","تحديث البيانات الوصفية لمخطوطات الروايات","إنشاء بيانات الاعتماد الموحدة لإنتاج الأفلام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Fountain title page syntax","Limited to screenplays, novels, and film production use cases"],"zh":["需要了解 Fountain 标题页语法","仅限用于剧本、小说和电影制作的用例"],"ja":["Fountain タイトルページ構文の知識が必要","脚本、小説、映画制作の用途に限定"],"ko":["Fountain 제목 페이지 구문에 대한 지식이 필요","스크립트, 소설 및 영화 제작의 사용 사례에 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis de página de título Fountain","Limitado a guiones, novelas y casos de uso de producción de películas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la syntaxe de page de titre Fountain","Limité aux scénarios, romans et cas d''utilisation de production de films"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Fountain-Titelseitensyntax","Begrenzt auf Drehbücher, Romane und Filmproduktionsanwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da sintaxe de página de título do Fountain","Limitado a casos de uso para roteiros, romances e produção cinematográfica"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса титульной страницы Fountain","Ограничено вариантами использования для сценариев, романов и кинопроизводства"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بصيغة صفحة العنوان Fountain","يقتصر على حالات الاستخدام للنصوص السينمائية والروايات وإنتاج الأفلام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
