ガイドは、開発者が高品質のプルリクエストを作成することを支援します","ko":"풀 리퀘스트 생성기 기술 문서는 개발자가 고 质의 풀 리퀘스트를 생성하도록 도와줍니다","es":"El skill de creación de PR te guía a través del proceso de creación de solicitudes de extracción de alta calidad que se ajustan a los estándares del repositorio","fr":"Le skill de création de PR vous guide à travers le processus de création de demandes d''extraction de haute qualité qui répondent aux normes du référentiel","de":"Der PR-Erstellungsskill führt Sie durch den Prozess der Erstellung von hochwertigen Pull-Requests, die den Standards des Repository entsprechen","pt":"O pr-creator é uma habilidade que ajuda a criar Pull Requests de alta qualidade, seguindo os padrões do repositório","ru":"Pr-creator - это навык, который помогает создавать Pull Requests высокого качества, соответствующие стандартам репозитория","ar":"مُنشئ طلبات السحب هو مهارة تساعد على إنشاء طلبات السحب عالية الجودة، متوافقة مع معايير المستودع","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分支管理","提交管理","Pull Request 模板","代码审查","仓库标准化"],"ja":["ブランチ管理","コミット管理","プルリクエストテンプレート","コードレビュー","リポジトリ標準化"],"ko":["브랜치 관리","커밋 관리","풀 리퀘스트 템플릿","코드審查","仓库 표준화"],"es":["Creación de ramas descriptivas","Gestión de commits","Adherencia a los estándares del repositorio","Colaboración en equipo","Mejora del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Création de branches descriptives","Gestion des commits","Conformité aux normes du référentiel","Collaboration d''équipe","Amélioration du flux de travail"],"de":["Erstellung von beschreibenden Zweigen","Commit-Verwaltung","Einhaltung der Repository-Standards","Teamzusammenarbeit","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs"],"pt":["Criação de branches descritivos","Gerenciamento de commits","Padronização de Pull Requests","Integração com repositórios","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes"],"ru":["Создание описательных веток","Управление коммитами","Стандартизация Pull Requests","Интеграция с репозиториями","Поддержка нескольких сред"],"ar":["إنشاء فروع وصفية","إدارة التعديلات","توحيد طلبات السحب","التكامل مع المستودعات","دعم بيئات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pull Request","代码审查","仓库标准","分支管理","提交管理","Pull Request 模板"],"ja":["プルリクエスト","コードレビュー","リポジトリ標準","ブランチ管理","コミット管理","プルリクエストテンプレート"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트","코드審查","仓库 표준","브랜치 관리","커밋 관리","풀 리퀘스트 템플릿"],"es":["creador de solicitudes de extracción","pr creator","gestión de ramas","commits","colaboración en equipo","flujo de trabajo","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["créateur de demandes d''extraction","pr creator","gestion des branches","commits","collaboration d''équipe","flux de travail","développement de logiciels"],"de":["pull-request-ersteller","pr creator","zweigverwaltung","commits","teamzusammenarbeit","arbeitsablauf","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["pr-creator","Pull Requests","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de repositórios","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","criação de branches","commits","padronização de código"],"ru":["pr-creator","Pull Requests","разработка программного обеспечения","управление репозиториями","инструменты разработки","создание веток","коммиты","стандартизация кода"],"ar":["مُنشئ طلبات السحب","طلبات السحب","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المستودعات","أدوات التطوير","إنشاء الفروع","التعديلات","توحيد الشفرة"]}},"owner":"Ven0m0","repo":"claude-config","repoPath":"Ven0m0/claude-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-creator","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Pull Request Creator\n\nThis skill guides the creation of high-quality Pull Requests that adhere to the\nrepository''s standards.\n\n## Workflow\n\nFollow these steps to create a Pull Request:\n\n1.  **Branch Management**: **CRITICAL:** Ensure you are NOT working on the\n    `main` branch.\n    - Run `git branch --show-current`.\n    - If the current branch is `main`, you MUST create and switch to a new\n      descriptive branch:\n      ```bash\n      git checkout -b <new-branch-name>\n      ```\n\n2.  **Commit","body":"# Pull Request Creator\n\nThis skill guides the creation of high-quality Pull Requests that adhere to the\nrepository''s standards.\n\n## Workflow\n\nFollow these steps to create a Pull Request:\n\n1.  **Branch Management**: **CRITICAL:** Ensure you are NOT working on the\n    `main` branch.\n    - Run `git branch --show-current`.\n    - If the current branch is `main`, you MUST create and switch to a new\n      descriptive branch:\n      ```bash\n      git checkout -b <new-branch-name>\n      ```\n\n2.  **Commit Changes**: Verify that all intended changes are committed.\n    - Run `git status` to check for unstaged or uncommitted changes.\n    - If there are uncommitted changes, stage and commit them with a descriptive\n      message before proceeding. NEVER commit directly to `main`.\n      ```bash\n      git add .\n      git commit -m \"type(scope): description\"\n      ```\n\n3.  **Locate Template**: Search for a pull request template in the repository.\n    - Check `.github/pull_request_template.md`\n    - Check `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`\n    - If multiple templates exist (e.g., in `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/`),\n      ask the user which one to use or select the most appropriate one based on\n      the context (e.g., `bug_fix.md` vs `feature.md`).\n\n4.  **Read Template**: Read the content of the identified template file.\n\n5.  **Draft Description**: Create a PR description that strictly follows the\n    template''s structure.\n    - **Headings**: Keep all headings from the template.\n    - **Checklists**: Review each item. Mark with `[x]` if completed. If an item\n      is not applicable, leave it unchecked or mark as `[ ]` (depending on the\n      template''s instructions) or remove it if the template allows flexibility\n      (but prefer keeping it unchecked for transparency).\n    - **Content**: Fill in the sections with clear, concise summaries of your\n      changes.\n    - **Related Issues**: Link any issues fixed or related to this PR (e.g.,\n      \"Fixes #123\").\n\n6.  **Preflight Check**: Before creating the PR, run the workspace preflight\n    script to ensure all build, lint, and test checks pass.\n    ```bash\n    npm run preflight\n    ```\n    If any checks fail, address the issues before proceeding to create the PR.\n\n7.  **Push Branch**: Push the current branch to the remote repository.\n    **CRITICAL SAFETY RAIL:** Double-check your branch name before pushing.\n    NEVER push if the current branch is `main`.\n    ```bash\n    # Verify current branch is NOT main\n    git branch --show-current\n    # Push non-interactively\n    git push -u origin HEAD\n    ```\n\n8.  **Create PR**: Use the `gh` CLI to create the PR. To avoid shell escaping\n    issues with multi-line Markdown, write the description to a temporary file\n    first.\n    ```bash\n    # 1. Write the drafted description to a temporary file\n    # 2. Create the PR using the --body-file flag\n    gh pr create --title \"type(scope): succinct description\" --body-file <temp_file_path>\n    # 3. Remove the temporary file\n    rm <temp_file_path>\n    ```\n    - **Title**: Ensure the title follows the\n      [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format if the\n      repository uses it (e.g., `feat(ui): add new button`,\n      `fix(core): resolve crash`).\n\n## Principles\n\n- **Safety First**: NEVER push to `main`. This is your highest priority.\n- **Compliance**: Never ignore the PR template. It exists for a reason.\n- **Completeness**: Fill out all relevant sections.\n- **Accuracy**: Don''t check boxes for tasks you haven''t done.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:36:56.609Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized Pull Request creation and Git branch management capabilities.","zh":"适合需要标准化Pull Request创建和Git分支管理功能的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたプルリクエストの作成とGitブランチ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 풀 리퀘스트 생성 및 Git 브랜치 관리 기능이 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de código que necesitan una creación de solicitudes de extracción estandarizada y capacidades de administración de ramas Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant une création standardisée de demandes d''extraction et des capacités de gestion de branches Git.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agenten, die standardisierte Pull-Request-Erstellung und Git-Branch-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de criação de Solicitações de Pull padronizadas e capacidades de gerenciamento de branches Git.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления кодом, требующих стандартизированного создания запросов на включение и управления ветками Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء طلبات سحب стандرد وميزات إدارة فروع جيت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Pull Requests adhering to repository standards, utilizing Git commands like `git branch` and `git checkout`, ensuring seamless branch management and code review processes.","zh":"赋予代理创建符合仓库标准的高质量Pull Request的能力，利用Git命令如`git branch`和`git checkout`，确保无缝的分支管理和代码审查流程。","ja":"エージェントがリポジトリの標準に従った高品質のプルリクエストを作成できるようにし、`git branch`や`git checkout`などのGitコマンドを使用してブランチ管理とコードレビューのプロセスを無縫に実行できる。","ko":"에이전트가 리포지토리 표준을 준수하는 고품질 풀 리퀘스트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, `git branch` 및 `git checkout`などの Git 명령을 사용하여 분기 관리 및 코드 리뷰 프로세스를 원활하게 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear solicitudes de extracción de alta calidad que se ajustan a los estándares del repositorio, utilizando comandos Git como `git branch` y `git checkout`, garantizando procesos de administración de ramas y revisión de código sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des demandes d''extraction de haute qualité conformes aux normes du référentiel, en utilisant des commandes Git comme `git branch` et `git checkout`, garantissant ainsi des processus de gestion de branches et d''examen de code sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Pull-Requests von hoher Qualität zu erstellen, die den Repository-Standards entsprechen, indem Git-Befehle wie `git branch` und `git checkout` verwendet werden, um somit nahtlose Branch-Management- und Code-Review-Prozesse sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar Solicitações de Pull de alta qualidade que aderem aos padrões do repositório, utilizando comandos Git como `git branch` e `git checkout`, garantindo processos de gerenciamento de branches e revisão de código sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать запросы на включение высокого качества, соответствующие стандартам репозитория, используя команды Git, такие как `git branch` и `git checkout`, обеспечивая бесперебойные процессы управления ветками и кода.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء طلبات سحب عالية الجودة تتوافق مع معايير المستودع، باستخدام أوامر جيت مثل `git branch` و `git checkout`، مما يضمن سلاسة عمليات إدارة الفروع ومراجعة الشفرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Pull Request creation for code updates","Managing Git branches for collaborative development","Ensuring compliance with repository coding standards"],"zh":["自动化代码更新的Pull Request创建","管理Git分支以进行协作开发","确保遵守仓库编码标准"],"ja":["コード更新のプルリクエストの自動化","コラボレーション開発のためのGitブランチの管理","リポジトリのコーディング規約の遵守"],"ko":["코드 업데이트 풀 리퀘스트 생성 자동화","协作 개발을 위한 Git 브랜치 관리","리포지토리 코딩 표준 준수 보장"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de solicitudes de extracción para actualizaciones de código","Administración de ramas Git para desarrollo colaborativo","Garantía del cumplimiento de los estándares de codificación del repositorio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de demandes d''extraction pour les mises à jour de code","Gestion des branches Git pour le développement collaboratif","Assurance du respect des normes de codage du référentiel"],"de":["Automatisierung der Pull-Request-Erstellung für Code-Updates","Verwaltung von Git-Branches für kollaborative Entwicklung","Sicherstellung der Einhaltung der Repository-Coding-Standards"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de Solicitações de Pull para atualizações de código","Gerenciar branches Git para desenvolvimento colaborativo","Garantir conformidade com os padrões de codificação do repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на включение для обновлений кода","Управлять ветками Git для совместного развития","Обеспечить соответствие стандартам кодирования репозитория"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء طلبات سحب لتحديثات الشفرة","إدارة فروع جيت للتنمية التعاونية","ضمان مطابقة معايير البرمجة للمستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Must not be working on the ''main'' branch"],"zh":["需要Git的安装和配置","不能在''main''分支上工作"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","''main''ブランチ上では動作しない"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","''main'' 브랜치에서 작동하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","No debe estar trabajando en la rama ''main''"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Ne doit pas fonctionner sur la branche ''main''"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Darf nicht auf dem ''main''-Branch arbeiten"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Não deve estar funcionando no branch ''main''"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Не должно работать в ветке ''main''"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين جيت","لا يجب أن يعمل على الفرع ''الرئيسي''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
