t":"Angular Core: Arquitetura e Modelo Mental","ru":"Ядро Angular: Архитектура и Ментальная Модель","ar":"نواة أنجولار: هندسة ومفهوم عقلي","en":"reference-core"},"description":{"zh":"Angular Core 是 Angular 框架的核心，负责渲染、依赖注入、变更检测等功能","ja":"Angular Core は Angular フレームワークの中心であり、レンダリング、依存性注入、変更検知などの機能を担当します","ko":"Angular Core 는 Angular 프레임워크의 핵심으로 렌더링, 의존성 주입, 변경 감지 등의 기능을 담당합니다","es":"Angular Core es el componente central del framework Angular, responsable de la renderización, la inyección de dependencias y la detección de cambios","fr":"Angular Core est le composant central du framework Angular, responsable du rendu, de l''injection de dépendances et de la détection de modifications","de":"Angular Core ist das zentrale Komponente des Angular-Frameworks, verantwortlich für die Renderung, die Dependency-Injection und die Änderungserkennung","pt":"O Angular Core é o coração do framework Angular, responsável pela lógica de execução e gerenciamento de renderização, injeção de dependência e detecção de al...","ru":"Ядро Angular является сердцем фреймворка Angular, ответственным за логику выполнения и управление рендерингом, внедрением зависимостей и обнаружением изменений","ar":"نواة أنجولار هي قلب إطار أنجولار، مسؤولة عن 논理 التنفيذ وإدارة العرض والإدخال التلقائي للتبعية والكشف عن التغييرات","en":"This is frozen/no-commits mirror of the https://github.com/angular/angular.git"},"definition":{"en":"This is frozen/no-commits mirror of the https://github.com/angular/angular.git"},"features":{"zh":["渲染（Ivy/Render3）","依赖注入（DI）","变更检测","运行时逻辑"],"ja":["レンダリング（Ivy/Render3）","依存性注入（DI）","変更検知","ランタイムロジック"],"ko":["렌더링（Ivy/Render3）","의존성 주입（DI）","변경 감지","런타임 로직"],"es":["Renderización (Ivy/Render3)","Inyección de dependencias (DI)","Detección de cambios","Arquitectura de alto nivel","Lógica de ejecución","Gestión de objetos"],"fr":["Rendu (Ivy/Render3)","Injection de dépendances (DI)","Détection de modifications","Architecture de haut niveau","Logique d''exécution","Gestion d''objets"],"de":["Renderung (Ivy/Render3)","Dependency-Injection (DI)","Änderungserkennung","Hochstufige Architektur","Ausführungslogik","Objektverwaltung"],"pt":["Renderização (Ivy/Render3)","Injeção de Dependência (DI)","Detecção de Alterações","Gerenciamento de Ciclo de Vida de Objetos","Suporte a Templates"],"ru":["Рендеринг (Ivy/Render3)","Внедрение зависимостей (DI)","Обнаружение изменений","Управление циклом жизни объектов","Поддержка шаблонов"],"ar":["العرض (Ivy/Render3)","إدخال التبعية (DI)","الكشف عن التغييرات","إدارة دورة حياة الكائنات","دعم القوالب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular Core","渲染","依赖注入","变更检测","Angular 框架","前端开发"],"ja":["Angular Core","レンダリング","依存性注入","変更検知","Angular フレームワーク","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Angular Core","렌더링","의존성 주입","변경 감지","Angular 프레임워크","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["Angular Core","arquitectura Angular","modelo mental Angular","renderización Ivy","inyección de dependencias","detección de cambios","desarrollo web","framework JavaScript"],"fr":["Angular Core","architecture Angular","modèle mental Angular","rendu Ivy","injection de dépendances","détection de modifications","développement web","framework JavaScript"],"de":["Angular Core","Angular-Architektur","mentales Modell Angular","Renderung Ivy","Dependency-Injection","Änderungserkennung","Webentwicklung","JavaScript-Framework"],"pt":["Angular Core","Arquitetura Angular","Renderização Ivy","Injeção de Dependência","Detecção de Alterações","Desenvolvimento Web","Framework JavaScript"],"ru":["Ядро Angular","Архитектура Angular","Рендеринг Ivy","Внедрение зависимостей","Обнаружение изменений","Веб-разработка","Фреймворк JavaScript"],"ar":["نواة أنجولار","هندسة أنجولار","عرض Ivy","إدخال التبعية","الكشف عن التغييرات","تطوير الويب","إطار العمل جافا سكريبت"]}},"owner":"codacy-open-source-projects-scans","repo":"angular","repoPath":"codacy-open-source-projects-scans/angular","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reference-core","description":"Explains the mental model and architecture of the code under `packages/core`. You MUST use this skill any time you plan to work with code in `packages/core`","bodyPreview":"# Angular Core (`packages/core`) Mental Model\n\nThis document outlines the architecture and mental model for `packages/core`, the heart of the Angular framework.\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n`packages/core` contains the runtime logic for Angular. Its primary responsibilities are:\n\n1.  **Rendering (Ivy/Render3)**: Transforming templates into DOM updates.\n2.  **Dependency Injection (DI)**: Managing object creation and lifetime.\n3.  **Change Detection**: Synchronizing the model with the view.\n4.","body":"# Angular Core (`packages/core`) Mental Model\n\nThis document outlines the architecture and mental model for `packages/core`, the heart of the Angular framework.\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n`packages/core` contains the runtime logic for Angular. Its primary responsibilities are:\n\n1.  **Rendering (Ivy/Render3)**: Transforming templates into DOM updates.\n2.  **Dependency Injection (DI)**: Managing object creation and lifetime.\n3.  **Change Detection**: Synchronizing the model with the view.\n4.  **Reactivity**: Signals and Zone.js integration.\n\n## 2. Rendering Engine (Ivy / Render3)\n\nThe rendering engine (located in `packages/core/src/render3`) uses an **instruction-based** approach.\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Instructions**: The Angular compiler transforms templates into a sequence of instruction calls (e.g., `ɵɵelementStart`, `ɵɵtext`, `ɵɵproperty`). These instructions are executed at runtime to create and update the view.\n  - _Location_: `packages/core/src/render3/instructions`\n\n- **LView (Logical View)**: An array containing the _state_ of a specific view instance. It holds:\n  - DOM nodes (`RElement`, `RText`).\n  - Binding values (for change detection).\n  - Directive/Component instances.\n  - _Context_: `packages/core/src/render3/interfaces/view.ts`\n\n- **TView (Template View)**: An array containing the _static structure_ of a view. It is shared across all instances (`LView`s) of the same component/template. It holds:\n  - Property names for bindings.\n  - Node relationship information.\n  - Compiled directive definitions.\n  - _Context_: `packages/core/src/render3/interfaces/view.ts`\n\n- **Memory Layout**: `LView` and `TView` are parallel arrays. Index `i` in `LView` corresponds to metadata at index `i` in `TView`.\n  - `HEADER`: Fixed size, contains context (Parent, Host, etc.).\n  - `DECLS`: Static nodes (elements, text, pipes).\n  - `VARS`: Binding values.\n  - `EXPANDO`: Dynamic data (host bindings, injectors).\n\n### The Render Cycle\n\n1.  **Creation Mode**: Instructions create DOM nodes and store them in `LView`.\n2.  **Update Mode**: Instructions check current values against previous values stored in `LView`. If changed, they update the DOM.\n\n## 3. Dependency Injection (DI)\n\nDI in Angular is hierarchical and split into two systems that interact:\n\n### Module Injector (`R3Injector`)\n\n- Configured via `@NgModule.providers` or `providedIn: ''root''`.\n- Stored in a hierarchy of `R3Injector` instances.\n- _Location_: `packages/core/src/di/r3_injector.ts`\n\n### Node Injector\n\n- Configured via `@Component.providers` or `@Directive.providers`.\n- **Not a class**, but a data structure embedded in the `LView` (\"Expando\" section).\n- Uses **Bloom Filters** (`TView.data`) to quickly check if a token is present at a specific node index before traversing up the tree.\n- Resolves tokens starting from the current node, walking up the view tree (Element Injector hierarchy), and falling back to the Module Injector if not found.\n\n## 4. Change Detection\n\n- **Dirty Checking**: Angular checks if values bound in templates have changed.\n- **Strategies**:\n  - `Default`: Checks everything.\n  - `OnPush`: Checks only if inputs change, events fire, or signals update.\n- **Signals**: The new reactivity primitive. Signals notify the scheduler when they change, potentially allowing for fine-grained updates (Zoneless).\n\n## 5. Key Directories to Know\n\n- `src/render3`: The Ivy rendering engine.\n  - `instructions`: The runtime instructions called by compiled code.\n  - `interfaces`: `LView`, `TView`, `TNode` definitions.\n- `src/di`: Dependency injection system.\n- `src/change_detection`: Change detection logic.\n- `src/zone`: Zone.js integration.\n- `src/signal`: Signals implementation (if present in this version, otherwise likely in `primitives`).\n\n## 6. Conventions & Gotchas\n\n- **Prefixes**: Private/Internal exports often start with `ɵ`.\n- **Global State**: Ivy relies heavily on global state (e.g., `getLView()`) during instruction execution to avoid passing context arguments everywhere. This is for performance and code size.\n- **Performance**: The code is highly optimized for performance and memory. You will see arrays used instead of objects, bitmasks, and manual memory management patterns. **Respect these patterns.**\n\n## 7. How to Modify Core\n\n1.  **Understand the Instruction**: If modifying runtime behavior, find the corresponding instruction in `src/render3/instructions`.\n2.  **Check `LView`/`TView` Impact**: If adding state, understand where it fits in the `LView` array.\n3.  **Tests**: Core has extensive tests. Run them using Bazel.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:36:59.491Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing in-depth understanding of Angular framework internals, particularly Ivy/Render3 rendering and Dependency Injection (DI) management.","zh":"非常适合需要深入理解Angular框架内部的前端代理，特别是Ivy/Render3渲染和依赖注入（DI）管理。","ja":"Angularフレームワークの内部、特にIvy/Render3レンダリングと依存性注入（DI）管理について詳細に理解する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular 프레임워크 내부, 특히 Ivy/Render3 렌더링 및 의존성 주입(DI) 관리에 대한 심도 있는 이해가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una comprensión en profundidad de los internos del marco Angular, particularmente la renderización Ivy/Render3 y la administración de inyección de dependencias (DI).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une compréhension approfondie des internes du framework Angular, en particulier le rendu Ivy/Render3 et la gestion de l''injection de dépendances (DI).","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein tiefes Verständnis der internen Angular-Framework-Architektur benötigen, insbesondere der Ivy/Render3-Renderung und des Dependency Injection (DI)-Managements.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de uma compreensão aprofundada dos internos do framework Angular, particularmente do renderizado Ivy/Render3 e do gerenciamento de Injeção de Dependência (DI).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется глубокое понимание внутренней структуры фреймворка Angular, особенно рендеринга Ivy/Render3 и управления внедрением зависимостей (DI).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى فهم عميق لدواخل إطار Angular، ولا سيما تقديم Ivy/Render3 وإدارة الحقن التابعة (DI)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dissect and analyze the Angular Core architecture, leveraging knowledge of rendering, dependency injection, and change detection to optimize and debug Angular applications, utilizing protocols like template transformation into DOM updates.","zh":"使代理能够解析和分析Angular Core架构，利用渲染、依赖注入和变更检测的知识来优化和调试Angular应用，利用诸如模板转换为DOM更新等协议。","ja":"エージェントがAngular Coreアーキテクチャを分析して解釈できるようにし、レンダリング、依存性注入、変更検知の知識を利用してAngularアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化し、デバッグを行い、テンプレート変換をDOM更新に変換するなどのプロトコルを利用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular Core 아키텍처를 분석하고 해석할 수 있도록 하여 렌더링, 의존성 주입 및 변경 감지에 대한 지식을 활용하여 Angular 애플리케이션을 최적화하고 디버깅하며 템플릿 변환을 DOM 업데이트로 변환하는 등의 프로토콜을 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desmontar y analizar la arquitectura central de Angular, aprovechando el conocimiento de la renderización, la inyección de dependencias y la detección de cambios para optimizar y depurar aplicaciones Angular, utilizando protocolos como la transformación de plantillas en actualizaciones de DOM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de disséquer et d''analyser l''architecture centrale d''Angular, en exploitant les connaissances de la gestion de la renderisation, de l''injection de dépendances et de la détection de changements pour optimiser et déboguer les applications Angular, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la transformation de modèles en mises à jour de DOM.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Kernarchitektur von Angular zu zerlegen und zu analysieren, indem sie das Wissen über die Renderung, die Abhängigkeitsinjektion und die Änderungserkennung nutzen, um Angular-Anwendungen zu optimieren und zu debuggen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie der Transformation von Vorlagen in DOM-Aktualisierungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dissecar e analisar a arquitetura central do Angular, utilizando o conhecimento do renderizado, injeção de dependência e detecção de alterações para otimizar e depurar aplicações Angular, utilizando protocolos como a transformação de modelos em atualizações de DOM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разобрать и проанализировать ядро Angular, используя знания о рендеринге, внедрении зависимостей и обнаружении изменений для оптимизации и отладки приложений Angular, используя протоколы, такие как преобразование шаблонов в обновления DOM.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تفكيك و تحليل بنية Angular الأساسية، مستخدمين معرفتهم بالتранزيت و الحقن التابعة و اكتشاف التغييرات لتحسين و تصحيح تطبيقات Angular، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تحويل النماذج إلى تحديثات DOM."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex Angular rendering issues","Optimizing Dependency Injection for performance","Analyzing Change Detection strategies for Angular applications"],"zh":["调试复杂的Angular渲染问题","优化依赖注入以提高性能","分析Angular应用的变更检测策略"],"ja":["複雑なAngularレンダリングの問題をデバッグする","パフォーマンス向上のために依存性注入を最適化する","Angularアプリケーションの変更検知戦略を分析する"],"ko":["복잡한 Angular 렌더링 문제 디버깅","성능 향상을 위한 의존성 주입 최적화","Angular 애플리케이션의 변경 감지 전략 분석"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de renderizado complejos de Angular","Optimización de la inyección de dependencias para el rendimiento","Análisis de estrategias de detección de cambios para aplicaciones de Angular"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes de rendu complexes d''Angular","Optimisation de l''injection de dépendances pour les performances","Analyse des stratégies de détection de changements pour les applications Angular"],"de":["Debuggen komplexer Angular-Renderprobleme","Optimierung der Abhängigkeitsinjektion für die Leistung","Analyse von Strategien zur Änderungserkennung für Angular-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de renderização complexos do Angular","Otimização da Injeção de Dependência para desempenho","Análise de estratégias de detecção de alterações para aplicações Angular"],"ru":["Отладка сложных проблем рендеринга Angular","Оптимизация внедрения зависимостей для производительности","Анализ стратегий обнаружения изменений для приложений Angular"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء في تقديم Angular المعقدة","تحسين الحقن التابعة للأداء","تحليل استراتيجيات اكتشاف التغييرات لتطبيقات Angular"]},"limitations":{"en":["Frozen repository with no new commits","Specific to Angular framework","Requires prior knowledge of Angular and its ecosystem"],"zh":["仓库已冻结，没有新的提交","仅限于Angular框架","需要之前的Angular和其生态系统的知识"],"ja":["リポジトリが凍結されており、新しいコミットはない","Angularフレームワークに限定されている","Angularとそのエコシステムに関する事前の知識が必要"],"ko":["仓库가 동결되어 새로운 커밋이 없음","Angular 프레임워크에만 국한됨","이전에 Angular 및 그 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Repositorio congelado sin nuevos commits","Específico del marco Angular","Requiere conocimiento previo de Angular y su ecosistema"],"fr":["Dépôt gelé sans nouveaux commits","Spécifique au framework Angular","Nécessite des connaissances préalables sur Angular et son écosystème"],"de":["Eingefrorener Repository ohne neue Commits","Spezifisch für das Angular-Framework","Benötigt vorheriges Wissen über Angular und sein Ökosystem"],"pt":["Repositório congelado sem novos commits","Específico do framework Angular","Requer conhecimento prévio do Angular e seu ecossistema"],"ru":["Замороженный репозиторий без новых коммитов","Специфичен для фреймворка Angular","Требует предварительных знаний Angular и его экосистемы"],"ar":["مخزن متجمد بدون تعهدات جديدة","محدد لإطار Angular","يتطلب معرفة سابقة بإطار Angular وبيئته"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nrwl/nx-console/nx-plugins', 'community', 'nrwl', 'nx-console', 'nrwl/nx-console', 'nx-plugins', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z', '2026-02-18T14:37:08.918Z', NULL, '{"id":"nrwl/nx-console/nx-plugins","name":"nx-plugins","description":{"zh":"Nx Console是Nx和Lerna的用户界面，用于找到和安装新插件。","ja":"Nx Consoleは、NxとLernaのユーザーインターフェイスであり、新しいプラグインを見つけてインストールするために使用されます。","ko":"Nx Console은 Nx와 Lerna의 사용자 인터페이스로서 새로운 플러그인을 찾고 설치하는 데 사용됩니다.","es":"Los plugins de Nx permiten extender la funcionalidad de Nx Console, mejorando la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software.","fr":"Les plugins Nx permettent d''étendre les fonctionnalités de Nx Console, améliorant l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels.","de":"Die Nx-Plugins ermöglichen die Erweiterung der Funktionalität von Nx Console, wodurch die Effizienz bei der Softwareentwicklung verbessert wird.","pt":"O Nx Console é a interface do usuário para Nx e Lerna, permitindo a extensão com plugins.","ru":"Nx Console — это пользовательский интерфейс для Nx и Lerna, позволяющий расширять функционал с помощью плагинов.","ar":"الواجهة Nx هي واجهة المستخدم ل Nx و Lerna، وتسمح بالامتداد مع الملحقات.","en":"Nx Console is the user interface for Nx & Lerna."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nx插件开发指南","ja":"Nxプラグイン開発ガイド","ko":"Nx 플러그인 개발 가이드","es":"Nx Plugins: Extiende Nx Console","fr":"Nx Plugins : Étendez Nx Console","de":"Nx-Plugins: Erweitern Sie Nx Console","pt":"Nx Plugins: Extensões para Nx Console","ru":"Плагины Nx: расширения для Nx Console","ar":"ملحقات Nx: امتدادات للواجهة Nx","en":"nx-plugins"},"description":{"zh":"Nx Console是Nx和Lerna的用户界面，用于找到和安装新插件。","ja":"Nx Consoleは、NxとLernaのユーザーインターフェイスであり、新しいプラグインを見つけてインストールするために使用されます。","ko":"Nx Console은 Nx와 Lerna의 사용자 인터페이스로서 새로운 플러그인을 찾고 설치하는 데 사용됩니다.","es":"Los plugins de Nx permiten extender la funcionalidad de Nx Console, mejorando la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software.","fr":"Les plugins Nx permettent d''étendre les fonctionnalités de Nx Console, améliorant l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels.","de":"Die Nx-Plugins ermöglichen die Erweiterung der Funktionalität von Nx Console, wodurch die Effizienz bei der Softwareentwicklung verbessert wird.","pt":"O Nx Console é a interface do usuário para Nx e Lerna, permitindo a extensão com plugins.","ru":"Nx Console — это пользовательский интерфейс для Nx и Lerna, позволяющий расширять функционал с помощью плагинов.","ar":"الواجهة Nx هي واجهة المستخدم ل Nx و Lerna، وتسمح بالامتداد مع الملحقات.","en":"Nx Console is the user interface for Nx & Lerna."},"definition":{"en":"Nx Console is the user interface for Nx & Lerna."},"features":{"zh":["找到和安装新插件","使用pnpm nx list列出插件","使用pnpm nx add安装插件"],"ja":["新しいプラグインを見つける","pnpm nx listを使用してプラグインをリストする","pnpm nx addを使用してプラグインをインストールする"],"ko":["新的 플러그인을 찾고 설치","pnpm nx list로 플러그인 목록을 출력","pnpm nx add로 플러그인을 설치"],"es":["Instalación de plugins con pnpm nx add","Lista de plugins disponibles con pnpm nx list","Personalización de Nx Console","Ampliación de funcionalidad","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Installation de plugins avec pnpm nx add","Liste des plugins disponibles avec pnpm nx list","Personnalisation de Nx Console","Élargissement des fonctionnalités","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Installation von Plugins mit pnpm nx add","Liste der verfügbaren Plugins mit pnpm nx list","Anpassung von Nx Console","Erweiterung der Funktionalität","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Listar plugins disponíveis com `pnpm nx list`","Instalar plugins com `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Exemplo de instalação: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`","Extensão do Nx Console","Adiciona funcionalidades ao sistema","Facilita a gestão de projetos"],"ru":["Список доступных плагинов с помощью `pnpm nx list`","Установка плагинов с помощью `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Пример установки: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`","Расширение Nx Console","Добавляет новые функции к системе","Упрощает управление проектами"],"ar":["قائمة الملحقات المتاحة باستخدام `pnpm nx list`","تثبيت الملحقات باستخدام `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","مثال للتثبيت: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`","امتداد لواجهة Nx","تضيف ميزات جديدة إلى النظام","تسهل إدارة المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nx插件","Nx Console","pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add","开发工具"],"ja":["Nxプラグイン","Nx Console","pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add","開発ツール"],"ko":["Nx 플러그인","Nx Console","pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add","개발 도구"],"es":["nx plugins","desarrollo de software","productividad","pnpm nx","nx console","plugins de nx"],"fr":["plugins nx","développement de logiciels","productivité","pnpm nx","nx console","plugins nx"],"de":["nx-plugins","softwareentwicklung","produktivität","pnpm nx","nx-console","nx-plugins"],"pt":["Nx Plugins","Nx Console","Lerna","pnpm","instalar plugins","listar plugins","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Плагины Nx","Nx Console","Lerna","pnpm","установка плагинов","список плагинов","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ملحقات Nx","الواجهة Nx","Lerna","pnpm","تثبيت الملحقات","قائمة الملحقات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"nrwl","repo":"nx-console","repoPath":"nrwl/nx-console","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nx-plugins","description":"Find and add Nx plugins. USE WHEN user wants to discover available plugins, install a new plugin, or add support for a specific framework or technology to the workspace.","bodyPreview":"## Finding and Installing new plugins\n\n- List plugins: `pnpm nx list`\n- Install plugins `pnpm nx add <plugin>`. Example: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`.","body":"## Finding and Installing new plugins\n\n- List plugins: `pnpm nx list`\n- Install plugins `pnpm nx add <plugin>`. Example: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:37:08.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents managing complex monorepos with Nx and Lerna, seeking streamlined plugin installation and management.","zh":"适用于使用 Nx 和 Lerna 管理复杂 monorepos 的开发代理，寻求简化插件安装和管理的解决方案。","ja":"Nx と Lerna を使用して複雑な monorepos を管理する開発エージェントに適し、プラグインのインストールと管理を簡素化する。","ko":"Nx와 Lerna를 사용하여 복잡한 monorepos를 관리하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며, 플러그인 설치 및 관리를 간소화하는 것을 목표로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que gestionan monorepos complejos con Nx y Lerna, y buscan una instalación y gestión de plugins simplificadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement gérant des monorepos complexes avec Nx et Lerna, recherchant une installation et une gestion de plugins rationalisées.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die komplexe Monorepos mit Nx und Lerna verwalten und eine vereinfachte Plugin-Installation und -Verwaltung suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que gerenciam monorepos complexos com Nx e Lerna, buscando instalação e gerenciamento de plugins simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которые управляют сложными монорепозиториями с помощью Nx и Lerna, ищущими упрощенную установку и управление плагинами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يديرون مستودعات مونو معقدة مع Nx و Lerna، يبحثون عن تثبيت وإدارة إضافات مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover and install new plugins using `pnpm nx list` and `pnpm nx add <plugin>`, enhancing their build and development capabilities with libraries like @nx/react, and simplifying plugin management through the Nx Console interface.","zh":"赋予代理发现和安装新插件的能力，使用 `pnpm nx list` 和 `pnpm nx add <plugin>`，并通过 @nx/react 等库增强其构建和开发能力，同时通过 Nx Console 接口简化插件管理。","ja":"エージェントが新しいプラグインを検出してインストールできるようにし、`pnpm nx list` と `pnpm nx add <plugin>` を使用して、@nx/react などのライブラリでビルドと開発能力を強化し、Nx Console インターフェイスでプラグイン管理を簡素化する。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 플러그인을 검색하고 설치할 수 있도록 하며, `pnpm nx list`와 `pnpm nx add <plugin>`을 사용하여 @nx/react 등의 라이브러리로 빌드 및 개발 능력을 강화하며, Nx Console 인터페이스를 통해 플러그인 관리를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir e instalar nuevos plugins utilizando `pnpm nx list` y `pnpm nx add <plugin>`, mejorando sus capacidades de compilación y desarrollo con bibliotecas como @nx/react, y simplificando la gestión de plugins a través de la interfaz de Nx Console.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et d''installer de nouveaux plugins en utilisant `pnpm nx list` et `pnpm nx add <plugin>`, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de construction et de développement avec des bibliothèques comme @nx/react, et simplifiant la gestion des plugins via l''interface Nx Console.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, neue Plugins mit `pnpm nx list` und `pnpm nx add <plugin>` zu entdecken und zu installieren, und verbessert so ihre Build- und Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit Bibliotheken wie @nx/react, und vereinfacht die Plugin-Verwaltung über die Nx Console-Schnittstelle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrir e instalar novos plugins usando `pnpm nx list` e `pnpm nx add <plugin>`, melhorando suas capacidades de compilação e desenvolvimento com bibliotecas como @nx/react, e simplificando o gerenciamento de plugins por meio da interface do Console Nx.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и устанавливать новые плагины с помощью `pnpm nx list` и `pnpm nx add <plugin>`, улучшая их возможности сборки и разработки с библиотеками типа @nx/react, и упрощая управление плагинами через интерфейс консоли Nx.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية اكتشاف وتثبيت إضافات جديدة باستخدام `pnpm nx list` و `pnpm nx add <plugin>`، وتحسين قابليات بناء وتطويرهم مع مكتبات مثل @nx/react، وبتبسيط إدارة الإضافات من خلال واجهة Console Nx."},"useCases":{"en":["Listing available plugins for project enhancement","Installing specific plugins like @nx/react for React projects","Managing plugin dependencies using pnpm"],"zh":["列出可用于项目增强的可用插件","安装特定的插件，如 @nx/react，用于 React 项目","使用 pnpm 管理插件依赖"],"ja":["プロジェクトの強化に使用できる利用可能なプラグインをリストする","特定のプラグイン（例：@nx/react）をインストールして React プロジェクトを使用する","pnpm を使用してプラグインの依存関係を管理する"],"ko":["프로젝트 향상을 위한 사용 가능한 플러그인을 나열하는 것","특정 플러그인(@nx/react 등)을 설치하여 리액트 프로젝트를 사용하는 것","pnpm을 사용하여 플러그인 종속성을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Listar plugins disponibles para la mejora del proyecto","Instalar plugins específicos como @nx/react para proyectos React","Gestionar dependencias de plugins con pnpm"],"fr":["Lister les plugins disponibles pour l''amélioration du projet","Installer des plugins spécifiques comme @nx/react pour les projets React","Gérer les dépendances de plugins avec pnpm"],"de":["Auflisten verfügbarer Plugins zur Projektverbesserung","Installieren spezifischer Plugins wie @nx/react für React-Projekte","Verwalten von Plugin-Abhängigkeiten mit pnpm"],"pt":["Listar plugins disponíveis para melhoria do projeto","Instalar plugins específicos como @nx/react para projetos React","Gerenciar dependências de plugins usando pnpm"],"ru":["Перечисление доступных плагинов для улучшения проекта","Установка конкретных плагинов, таких как @nx/react, для проектов React","Управление зависимостями плагинов с помощью pnpm"],"ar":["قائمة الإضافات المتاحة لتحسين المشروع","تثبيت إضافات محددة مثل @nx/react لمشاريع React","إدارة зависимости الإضافات باستخدام pnpm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm installation","Specific to Nx and Lerna ecosystems"],"zh":["需要 pnpm 安装","仅限于 Nx 和 Lerna 生态系统"],"ja":["pnpm のインストールが必要","Nx と Lerna のエコシステムに特化"],"ko":["pnpm 설치가 필요함","Nx와 Lerna 생태계에만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pnpm","Específico para los ecosistemas Nx y Lerna"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pnpm","Spécifique aux écosystèmes Nx et Lerna"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von pnpm","Spezifisch für die Nx- und Lerna-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pnpm","Específico para os ecossistemas Nx e Lerna"],"ru":["Требует установки pnpm","Конкретно для экосистем Nx и Lerna"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pnpm","محدد لأنظمة Nx و Lerna"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
