 en charge la création de bibliothèques et d''applications"],"de":["Erstellt Projekte und scaffold von Funktionen","Automatisiert repetitive Aufgaben in einem Monorepo","Stellt die Konsistenz in allen Code sicher","Ermöglicht die Ausführung von benutzerdefinierten Generatoren","Unterstützt die Erstellung von Bibliotheken und Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de projetos","Scaffold de features","Geração de código automática","Manutenção de consistência em monorepos","Automatização de tarefas repetitivas"],"ru":["Создание проектов","Scaffold функций","Автоматическая генерация кода","Поддержание согласованности в монорепозиториях","Автоматизация повторяющихся задач"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع","تأسيس الميزات","توليد الكود التلقائي","الحفاظ على الاتساق في مونوريبوزиторيز","تحسين المهام المتكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["nx-generate","Nx控制台","monorepo","代码迁移","自动化","脚手架","代码生成"],"ja":["nx-generate","Nxコンソール","monorepo","コード移行","自動化","スケルトン化","コード生成"],"ko":["nx-generate","Nx 콘솔","monorepo","코드 마이그레이션","자동화","스캐폴딩","코드 생성"],"es":["nx generate","monorepo","automatización de tareas","scaffold de características","generadores personalizados","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["nx generate","monorepo","automatisation de tâches","scaffold de fonctionnalités","générateurs personnalisés","développement de logiciels"],"de":["nx generate","monorepo","automatisierung von aufgaben","scaffold von funktionen","benutzerdefinierte generatoren","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Nx Generate","Geração de código","Monorepo","Scaffold","Automatização","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Nx Generate","Генерация кода","Монорепозиторий","Scaffold","Автоматизация","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Nx Generate","توليد الكود","مونوريبوزиторي","تأسيس","تحسين","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"nrwl","repo":"nx-console","repoPath":"nrwl/nx-console","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nx-generate","description":"Generate code using nx generators. INVOKE IMMEDIATELY when user mentions scaffolding, setup, structure, creating apps/libs, or setting up project structure. Trigger words - scaffold, setup, create a ... app, create a ... lib, project structure, generate, add a new project. ALWAYS use this BEFORE calling nx_docs or exploring - this skill handles discovery internally.","bodyPreview":"# Run Nx Generator\n\nNx generators are powerful tools that scaffold projects, make automated code migrations or automate repetitive tasks in a monorepo. They ensure consistency across the codebase and reduce boilerplate work.\n\nThis skill applies when the user wants to:\n\n- Create new projects like libraries or applications\n- Scaffold features or boilerplate code\n- Run workspace-specific or custom generators\n- Do anything else that an nx generator exists for\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Always use `--n","body":"# Run Nx Generator\n\nNx generators are powerful tools that scaffold projects, make automated code migrations or automate repetitive tasks in a monorepo. They ensure consistency across the codebase and reduce boilerplate work.\n\nThis skill applies when the user wants to:\n\n- Create new projects like libraries or applications\n- Scaffold features or boilerplate code\n- Run workspace-specific or custom generators\n- Do anything else that an nx generator exists for\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Always use `--no-interactive`** - Prevents prompts that would hang execution\n2. **Read the generator source code** - The schema alone is not enough; understand what the generator actually does\n3. **Match existing repo patterns** - Study similar artifacts in the repo and follow their conventions\n4. **Verify with lint/test/build/typecheck etc.** - Generated code must pass verification. The listed targets are just an example, use what''s appropriate for this workspace.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Discover Available Generators\n\nUse the Nx CLI to discover available generators:\n\n- List all generators for a plugin: `npx nx list @nx/react`\n- View available plugins: `npx nx list`\n\nThis includes plugin generators (e.g., `@nx/react:library`) and local workspace generators.\n\n### 2. Match Generator to User Request\n\nIdentify which generator(s) could fulfill the user''s needs. Consider what artifact type they want, which framework is relevant, and any specific generator names mentioned.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: When both a local workspace generator and an external plugin generator could satisfy the request, **always prefer the local workspace generator**. Local generators are customized for the specific repo''s patterns.\n\nIf no suitable generator exists, you can stop using this skill. However, the burden of proof is high—carefully consider all available generators before deciding none apply.\n\n### 3. Get Generator Options\n\nUse the `--help` flag to understand available options:\n\n```bash\nnpx nx g @nx/react:library --help\n```\n\nPay attention to required options, defaults that might need overriding, and options relevant to the user''s request.\n\n### Library Buildability\n\n**Default to non-buildable libraries** unless there''s a specific reason for buildable.\n\n| Type                        | When to use                                                       | Generator flags                     |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Non-buildable** (default) | Internal monorepo libs consumed by apps                           | No `--bundler` flag                 |\n| **Buildable**               | Publishing to npm, cross-repo sharing, stable libs for cache hits | `--bundler=vite` or `--bundler=swc` |\n\nNon-buildable libs:\n\n- Export `.ts`/`.tsx` source directly\n- Consumer''s bundler compiles them\n- Faster dev experience, less config\n\nBuildable libs:\n\n- Have their own build target\n- Useful for stable libs that rarely change (cache hits)\n- Required for npm publishing\n\n**If unclear, ask the user:** \"Should this library be buildable (own build step, better caching) or non-buildable (source consumed directly, simpler setup)?\"\n\n### 4. Read Generator Source Code\n\n**This step is critical.** The schema alone does not tell you everything. Reading the source code helps you:\n\n- Know exactly what files will be created/modified and where\n- Understand side effects (updating configs, installing deps, etc.)\n- Identify behaviors and options not obvious from the schema\n- Understand how options interact with each other\n\nTo find generator source code:\n\n- For plugin generators: Use `node -e \"console.log(require.resolve(''@nx/<plugin>/generators.json''));\"` to find the generators.json, then locate the source from there\n- If that fails, read directly from `node_modules/<plugin>/generators.json`\n- For local generators: Typically in `tools/generators/` or a local plugin directory. Search the repo for the generator name.\n\nAfter reading the source, reconsider: Is this the right generator? If not, go back to step 2.\n\n> **⚠️ `--directory` flag behavior can be misleading.**\n> It should specify the full path of the generated library or component, not the parent path that it will be generated in.\n>\n> ```bash\n> # ✅ Correct - directory is the full path for the library\n> nx g @nx/react:library --directory=libs/my-lib\n> # generates libs/my-lib/package.json and more\n>\n> # ❌ Wrong - this will create files at libs and libs/src/...\n> nx g @nx/react:library --name=my-lib --directory=libs\n> # generates libs/package.json and more\n> ```\n\n### 5. Examine Existing Patterns\n\nBefore generating, examine the target area of the codebase:\n\n- Look at similar existing artifacts (other libraries, applications, etc.)\n- Identify naming conventions, file structures, and configuration patterns\n- Note which test runners, build tools, and linters are used\n- Configure the generator to match these patterns\n\n### 6. Dry-Run to Verify File Placement\n\n**Always run with `--dry-run` first** to verify files will be created in the correct location:\n\n```bash\nnpx nx g @nx/react:library --name=my-lib --dry-run --no-interactive\n```\n\nReview the output carefully. If files would be created in the wrong location, adjust your options based on what you learned from the generator source code.\n\nNote: Some generators don''t support dry-run (e.g., if they install npm packages). If dry-run fails for this reason, proceed to running the generator for real.\n\n### 7. Run the Generator\n\nExecute the generator:\n\n```bash\nnx generate <generator-name> <options> --no-interactive\n```\n\n> **Tip:** New packages often need workspace dependencies wired up (e.g., importing shared types, being consumed by apps). The `link-workspace-packages` skill can help add these correctly.\n\n### 8. Modify Generated Code (If Needed)\n\nGenerators provide a starting point. Modify the output as needed to:\n\n- Add or modify functionality as requested\n- Adjust imports, exports, or configurations\n- Integrate with existing code patterns\n\n**Important:** If you replace or delete generated test files (e.g., `*.spec.ts`), either write meaningful replacement tests or remove the `test` target from the project configuration. Empty test suites will cause `nx test` to fail.\n\n### 9. Format and Verify\n\nFormat all generated/modified files:\n\n```bash\nnx format --fix\n```\n\nThis example is for built-in nx formatting with prettier. There might be other formatting tools for this workspace, use these when appropriate.\n\nThen verify the generated code works. Keep in mind that the changes you make with a generator or subsequent modifications might impact various projects so it''s usually not enough to only run targets for the artifact you just created.\n\n```bash\n# these targets are just an example!\nnx run-many -t build,lint,test,typecheck\n```\n\nThese targets are common examples used across many workspaces. You should do research into other targets available for this workspace and its projects. CI configuration is usually a good guide for what the critical targets are that have to pass.\n\nIf verification fails with manageable issues (a few lint errors, minor type issues), fix them. If issues are extensive, attempt obvious fixes first, then escalate to the user with details about what was generated, what''s failing, and what you''ve attempted.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:37:52.768Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for monorepo management agents automating code scaffolding and project generation.","zh":"适用于单体仓库管理代理自动化代码脚手架和项目生成。","ja":"モノレポ管理エージェントによるコードスキャフォールディングとプロジェクト生成の自動化に不可欠。","ko":"모노레포 관리 에이전트를 위한 코드 스캐폴딩 및 프로젝트 생성 자동화에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de gestión de monorepo que automatizan la creación de estructuras de código y generación de proyectos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de gestion de monorepo qui automatisent la création de structures de code et la génération de projets.","de":"Wesentlich für Monorepo-Management-Agents, die die Automatisierung von Code-Skelettierung und Projektgenerierung durchführen.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de gerenciamento de monorepo que automatizam a estruturação de código e geração de projetos.","ru":"Необходим для агентов управления монорепозиторием, автоматизирующих создание каркаса кода и генерацию проектов.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات إدارة مونوريبوزиторي التي تلقمية هيكلة الشفرة وتوليد المشاريع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated project scaffolding for libraries and applications, performs code migrations, and ensures consistency across Nx monorepos using workspace-specific generators. Reduces boilerplate work through standardized code generation templates.","zh":"实现库和应用程序的自动化项目脚手架，执行代码迁移，并确保Nx单体仓库中的一致性，使用特定于工作区的生成器。通过标准化代码生成模板减少样板工作。","ja":"ライブラリとアプリケーションの自動化されたプロジェクトスキャフォールディングを可能にし、コード移行を実行し、ワークスペース固有のジェネレーターを使用してNxモノレポ全体の整合性を確保する。標準化されたコード生成テンプレートを通じてボイラープレート作業を削減する。","ko":"라이브러리와 애플리케이션의 자동화된 프로젝트 스캐폴딩을 가능하게 하며, 코드 마이그레이션을 수행하고, 워크스페이스 단위의 생성기를 사용하여 Nx 모노레포 전반의 일관성을 보장합니다. 표준화된 코드 생성 템플릿을 통해 보일러플레이트 작업을 줄입니다.","es":"Permite la creación automática de estructuras de proyecto para bibliotecas y aplicaciones, realiza migraciones de código y garantiza la coherencia en monorepos de Nx utilizando generadores específicos del espacio de trabajo. Reduce el trabajo de código repetitivo a través de plantillas de generación de código estandarizadas.","fr":"Permet la création automatique de structures de projet pour les bibliothèques et les applications, effectue des migrations de code et assure la cohérence dans les monorepos Nx en utilisant des générateurs spécifiques à l''espace de travail. Réduit le travail de code répétitif grâce à des modèles de génération de code standardisés.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Projekt-Skelettierung für Bibliotheken und Anwendungen, führt Code-Migrationen durch und stellt die Konsistenz in Nx-Monorepos mit workspace-spezifischen Generatoren sicher. Reduziert Boilerplate-Arbeit durch standardisierte Code-Generierungsvorlagen.","pt":"Permite a estruturação automática de projetos para bibliotecas e aplicações, executa migrações de código e garante a consistência em monorepos Nx usando geradores específicos do espaço de trabalho. Reduz o trabalho de codificação padrão por meio de modelos de geração de código padronizados.","ru":"Позволяет автоматизировать создание каркаса проекта для библиотек и приложений, выполняет миграции кода и обеспечивает согласованность во всех монорепозиториях Nx с помощью генераторов, специфичных для рабочего пространства. Снижает объем рутинной работы за счет использования стандартизированных шаблонов генерации кода.","ar":"تمكن من هيكلة المشاريع آليًا لمكتبات التطبيقات، وينفذ هجرات الشفرة وضمان الاتساق عبر مونوريبوزиторي Nx باستخدام مولدات خاصة بمساحة العمل. ويقلل من العمل التكراري من خلال قوالب توليد الشفرة الموحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new libraries and applications","Running automated code migrations","Generating boilerplate code for features","Executing custom workspace generators"],"zh":["创建新库和应用程序的脚手架","运行自动化代码迁移","为功能生成样板代码","执行自定义工作区生成器"],"ja":["新しいライブラリとアプリケーションのスキャフォールディング","自動化されたコード移行の実行","機能のボイラープレートコードの生成","カスタムワークスペースジェネレータの実行"],"ko":["새 라이브러리와 애플리케이션의 스캐폴딩","자동화된 코드 마이그레이션 실행","기능의 보일러플레이트 코드 생성","커스텀 워크스페이스 생성기 실행"],"es":["Creación de estructuras para nuevas bibliotecas y aplicaciones","Ejecución de migraciones de código automatizadas","Generación de código repetitivo para características","Ejecución de generadores personalizados de espacio de trabajo"],"fr":["Création de structures pour les nouvelles bibliothèques et les applications","Exécution de migrations de code automatisées","Génération de code répétitif pour les fonctionnalités","Exécution de générateurs personnalisés d''espace de travail"],"de":["Erstellung von Strukturen für neue Bibliotheken und Anwendungen","Ausführung automatisierter Code-Migrationen","Generierung von Boilerplate-Code für Funktionen","Ausführung benutzerdefinierter Workspace-Generatoren"],"pt":["Criação de novas bibliotecas e aplicações","Execução de migrações de código automatizadas","Geração de código de características repetitivas","Execução de geradores personalizados de espaço de trabalho"],"ru":["Создание новых библиотек и приложений","Запуск автоматизированных миграций кода","Генерация повторяющегося кода функций","Выполнение пользовательских генераторов рабочего пространства"],"ar":["إنشاء مكتبات وتطبيقات جديدة","تشغيل هجرات الشفرة الآلية","توليد شفرة ميزات متكررة","تشغيل مولدات مساحة العمل المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nx workspace context","Depends on existing generator definitions","Needs monorepo filesystem access"],"zh":["需要Nx工作区上下文","依赖于现有的生成器定义","需要单体仓库文件系统访问"],"ja":["Nxワークスペースコンテキストが必要","既存のジェネレーター定義に依存","モノレポファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Nx 워크스페이스 컨텍스트가 필요합니다","기존 생성기 정의에 의존","모노레포 파일 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere contexto de espacio de trabajo de Nx","Depende de las definiciones de generadores existentes","Necesita acceso al sistema de archivos del monorepo"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte d''espace de travail Nx","Dépend des définitions de générateurs existantes","Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers du monorepo"],"de":["Benötigt Nx-Workspace-Kontext","Hängt von bestehenden Generator-Definitionen ab","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dateisystem des Monorepos"],"pt":["Exige contexto de espaço de trabalho Nx","Depende de definições de gerador existentes","Necessita de acesso ao sistema de arquivos de monorepo"],"ru":["Требует контекста рабочего пространства Nx","Зависит от существующих определений генератора","Требует доступа к файловой системе монорепозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق مساحة عمل Nx","يعتمد على تعريفات المولدات الحالية","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى نظام ملفات مونوريبوزиторي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ZsZs/processpuzzle/nx-plugins', 'community', 'ZsZs', 'processpuzzle', 'ZsZs/processpuzzle', 'nx-plugins', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z', '2026-02-18T14:37:44.573Z', NULL, '{"id":"ZsZs/processpuzzle/nx-plugins","name":"nx-plugins","description":{"zh":"nx - pnpm nx list pnpm nx add ","ja":"nx - pnpm nx list pnpm nx add ","ko":"nx - pnpm nx list pnpm nx add ","es":"Los plugins de Nx te permiten extender la funcionalidad de tu proyecto. Puedes encontrar e instalar nuevos plugins con facilidad","fr":"Les plugins Nx vous permettent d''étendre la fonctionnalité de votre projet. Vous pouvez facilement trouver et installer de nouveaux plugins","de":"Die Nx-Plugins ermöglichen es Ihnen, die Funktionalität Ihres Projekts zu erweitern. Sie können neue Plugins leicht finden und installieren","pt":"Os plugins Nx permitem que você estenda as funcionalidades do seu projeto. Aprenda a instalar e usar plugins com facilidade.","ru":"Плагины Nx позволяют расширить функциональность вашего проекта. Узнайте, как установить и использовать плагины легко.","ar":"الملحقات Nx تسمح لك بتوسيع功能 مشروعك. تعلم كيفية تثبيت الملحقات واستخدامها بسهولة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"nx-plugins - ","ja":"nx","ko":"nx - ","es":"Plugins de Nx: Instalación y Uso","fr":"Nx Plugins : Installation et Utilisation","de":"Nx-Plugins: Installation und Einsatz","pt":"Plugins Nx: Instalação e Uso","ru":"Плагины Nx: установка и использование","ar":"ملحقات Nx: التثبيت والاستخدام","en":"nx-plugins"},"description":{"zh":"nx - pnpm nx list pnpm nx add ","ja":"nx - pnpm nx list pnpm nx add ","ko":"nx - pnpm nx list pnpm nx add ","es":"Los plugins de Nx te permiten extender la funcionalidad de tu proyecto. Puedes encontrar e instalar nuevos plugins con facilidad","fr":"Les plugins Nx vous permettent d''étendre la fonctionnalité de votre projet. Vous pouvez facilement trouver et installer de nouveaux plugins","de":"Die Nx-Plugins ermöglichen es Ihnen, die Funktionalität Ihres Projekts zu erweitern. Sie können neue Plugins leicht finden und installieren","pt":"Os plugins Nx permitem que você estenda as funcionalidades do seu projeto. Aprenda a instalar e usar plugins com facilidade.","ru":"Плагины Nx позволяют расширить функциональность вашего проекта. Узнайте, как установить и использовать плагины легко.","ar":"الملحقات Nx تسمح لك بتوسيع功能 مشروعك. تعلم كيفية تثبيت الملحقات واستخدامها بسهولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add ","nx","pnpm","plugin","nx"],"ja":["pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add ","nx","pnpm","plugin","nx"],"ko":["pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add ","nx","pnpm","plugin","nx"],"es":["Lista de plugins disponibles con `pnpm nx list`","Instalación de plugins con `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Compatibilidad con proyectos React","Extensión de la funcionalidad del proyecto","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Liste des plugins disponibles avec `pnpm nx list`","Installation de plugins avec `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Compatibilité avec les projets React","Extension de la fonctionnalité du projet","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Liste der verfügbaren Plugins mit `pnpm nx list`","Installation von Plugins mit `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Kompatibilität mit React-Projekten","Erweiterung der Funktionalität des Projekts","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Listar plugins disponíveis com `pnpm nx list`","Instalar plugins com `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Personalizar funcionalidades do projeto","Estender as funcionalidades do Nx","Melhorar a produtividade com plugins personalizados","Facilidade de uso e instalação"],"ru":["Список доступных плагинов с `pnpm nx list`","Установка плагинов с `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","Настройка функций проекта","Расширение функций Nx","Повышение производительности с помощью индивидуальных плагинов","Легкость использования и установки"],"ar":["قائمة الملحقات المتاحة مع `pnpm nx list`","تثبيت الملحقات مع `pnpm nx add <plugin>`","تخصيص وظائف المشروع","توسيع وظائف Nx","تحسين الإنتاجية باستخدام الملحقات المخصصة","سهولة الاستخدام والتثبيت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["nx","nx-plugin","pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add","nx","plugin","nx","pnpm"],"ja":["nx","nx-plugin","pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add","nx","plugin","nx","pnpm"],"ko":["nx","nx-plugin","pnpm nx list","pnpm nx add","nx","plugin","nx","pnpm"],"es":["plugins de nx","instalación de plugins","desarrollo de software","productividad del desarrollador","proyectos react","extensión de funcionalidad"],"fr":["plugins nx","installation de plugins","développement de logiciels","productivité du développeur","projets react","extension de fonctionnalité"],"de":["nx-plugins","installation von plugins","softwareentwicklung","entwicklerproduktivität","react-projekte","funktionalitätserweiterung"],"pt":["plugins nx","instalar plugins nx","usar plugins nx","extensões nx","funcionalidades personalizadas","produtividade","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["плагины nx","установка плагинов nx","использование плагинов nx","расширения nx","индивидуальные функции","производительность","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ملحقات nx","تثبيت ملحقات nx","استخدام ملحقات nx","امتدادات nx","وظائف مخصصة","الإنتاجية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ZsZs","repo":"processpuzzle","repoPath":"ZsZs/processpuzzle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nx-plugins","description":"Find and add Nx plugins. USE WHEN user wants to discover available plugins, install a new plugin, or add support for a specific framework or technology to the workspace.","bodyPreview":"## Finding and Installing new plugins\n\n- List plugins: `pnpm nx list`\n- Install plugins `pnpm nx add <plugin>`. Example: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`.","body":"## Finding and Installing new plugins\n\n- List plugins: `pnpm nx list`\n- Install plugins `pnpm nx add <plugin>`. Example: `pnpm nx add @nx/react`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:37:44.573Z","qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pockfojoh/alumnos/pest-testing', 'community', 'pockfojoh', 'alumnos', 'pockfojoh/alumnos', 'pest-testing', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z', '2026-02-18T14:38:09.326Z', NULL, '{"id":"pockfojoh/alumnos/pest-testing","name":"pest-testing","description":{"zh":"Pest 测试是一种 PHP 测试框架，用于提高测试效率和简化测试流程。通过 Pest，可以创建和管理测试用例，调试测试失败，组织测试代码","ja":"Pest テスティングは、PHP テストフレームワークであり、テスト効率を向上させ、テストプロセスを簡素化するために使用される。Pest を使用すると、テストケースを作成して管理し、テストの失敗をデバッグし、テストコードを整理することができる","ko":"Pest 테스팅은 PHP 테스트 프레임워크로 테스트 효율을 향상시키고 테스트 프로세스를 간소화하는 데 사용된다. Pest를 사용하면 테스트 케이스를 생성하고 관리하며 테스트 실패를 디버깅하고 테스트 코드를 정리할 수 있다","es":"Pest es una herramienta de testing de PHP que permite crear y depurar pruebas de manera efectiva. Aprende a utilizar Pest para mejorar la calidad de tu código.","fr":"Pest est un outil de testing PHP qui permet de créer et de déboguer des tests de manière efficace. Découvrez comment utiliser Pest pour améliorer la qualité de votre code.","de":"Pest ist ein PHP-Testing-Tool, das das Erstellen und Debuggen von Tests ermöglicht. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Pest verwenden können, um die Qualität Ihres Codes zu verbessern.","pt":"Pest é uma ferramenta de teste que ajuda a criar e otimizar testes de unidade e recursos em projetos de desenvolvimento","ru":"Pest - это инструмент тестирования, который помогает создавать и оптимизировать юнит-тесты и функции в проектах разработки","ar":"Pest هو أداة اختبار تساعد على إنشاء وتحسين اختبارات الوحدة والميزات في مشاريع التطوير","en":"tarea de base de datos 2"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Pest 测试：提高 PHP 应用测试效率","ja":"Pest テスティング：PHP アプリケーションのテスト効率を向上させる","ko":"Pest 테스팅: PHP 애플리케이션 테스트 효율 향상","es":"Pruebas de pest: Testing de PHP con Pest","fr":"Test Pest : Testing PHP avec Pest","de":"Pest-Tests: PHP-Testing mit Pest","pt":"Testes de Pest: Otimização de Testes de Unidade","ru":"Тестирование Pest: Оптимизация Юнит-тестов","ar":"اختبار Pest: تحسين اختبارات الوحدة","en":"pest-testing"},"description":{"zh":"Pest 测试是一种 PHP 测试框架，用于提高测试效率和简化测试流程。通过 Pest，可以创建和管理测试用例，调试测试失败，组织测试代码","ja":"Pest テスティングは、PHP テストフレームワークであり、テスト効率を向上させ、テストプロセスを簡素化するために使用される。Pest を使用すると、テストケースを作成して管理し、テストの失敗をデバッグし、テストコードを整理することができる","ko":"Pest 테스팅은 PHP 테스트 프레임워크로 테스트 효율을 향상시키고 테스트 프로세스를 간소화하는 데 사용된다. Pest를 사용하면 테스트 케이스를 생성하고 관리하며 테스트 실패를 디버깅하고 테스트 코드를 정리할 수 있다","es":"Pest es una herramienta de testing de PHP que permite crear y depurar pruebas de manera efectiva. Aprende a utilizar Pest para mejorar la calidad de tu código.","fr":"Pest est un outil de testing PHP qui permet de créer et de déboguer des tests de manière efficace. Découvrez comment utiliser Pest pour améliorer la qualité ...","de":"Pest ist ein PHP-Testing-Tool, das das Erstellen und Debuggen von Tests ermöglicht. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Pest verwenden können, um die Qualität Ihres Codes ...","pt":"Pest é uma ferramenta de teste que ajuda a criar e otimizar testes de unidade e recursos em projetos de desenvolvimento","ru":"Pest - это инструмент тестирования, который помогает создавать и оптимизировать юнит-тесты и функции в проектах разработки","ar":"Pest هو أداة اختبار تساعد على إنشاء وتحسين اختبارات الوحدة والميزات في مشاريع التطوير","en":"tarea de base de datos 2"},"definition":{"en":"tarea de base de datos 2"},"features":{"zh":["创建和管理测试用例","调试测试失败","组织测试代码","支持 PHP 艺术家命令","简化测试流程"],"ja":["テストケースを作成して管理する","テストの失敗をデバッグする","テストコードを整理する","PHP アーティザンコマンドをサポートする","テストプロセスを簡素化する"],"ko":["테스트 케이스를 생성하고 관리한다","테스트 실패를 디버깅한다","테스트 코드를 정리한다","PHP 아티산 명령어를 지원한다","테스트 프로세스를 간소화한다"],"es":["Creación de pruebas unitarias y de características","Depuración de fallos de pruebas","Organización de pruebas en datasets y mocking","Escritura de pruebas de arquitectura","Integración con PHP Artisan"],"fr":["Création de tests unitaires et de fonctionnalités","Débogage des échecs de tests","Organisation des tests dans des datasets et mocking","Écriture de tests d''architecture","Intégration avec PHP Artisan"],"de":["Erstellung von Unit-Tests und Feature-Tests","Debuggen von Testfehlern","Organisation von Tests in Datasets und Mocking","Schreiben von Architekturtests","Integration mit PHP Artisan"],"pt":["Criação de testes de unidade","Otimização de testes existentes","Depuração de falhas de teste","Organização de testes","Suporte a datasets e mocking","Suporte a testes de arquitetura"],"ru":["Создание юнит-тестов","Оптимизация существующих тестов","Отладка неудач тестов","Организация тестов","Поддержка наборов данных и mocking","Поддержка тестов архитектуры"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات الوحدة","تحسين الاختبارات الحالية","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار","تنظيم الاختبارات","دعم مجموعات البيانات ومحاكاة","دعم اختبارات الهياكل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pest 测试","PHP 测试框架","测试用例管理","调试测试失败","测试代码组织","PHP 艺术家命令"],"ja":["Pest テスティング","PHP テストフレームワーク","テストケース管理","テストの失敗をデバッグ","テストコード整理","PHP アーティザンコマンド"],"ko":["Pest 테스팅","PHP 테스트 프레임워크","테스트 케이스 관리","테스트 실패 디버깅","테스트 코드 정리","PHP 아티산 명령어"],"es":["pest testing","testing de php","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de características","depuración de pruebas","organización de pruebas","php artisan"],"fr":["test pest","testing php","tests unitaires","tests de fonctionnalités","débogage de tests","organisation de tests","php artisan"],"de":["pest testing","php testing","unit tests","feature tests","test debuggen","test organisation","php artisan"],"pt":["testes de unidade","pest","desenvolvimento de software","testes de recurso","depuração de testes","organização de testes","datasets","mocking","testes de arquitetura"],"ru":["юнит-тесты","pest","разработка программного обеспечения","тесты функций","отладка тестов","организация тестов","наборы данных","mocking","тесты архитектуры"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدة","pest","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات الميزات","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار","تنظيم الاختبارات","مجموعات البيانات","محاكاة","اختبارات الهياكل"]}},"owner":"pockfojoh","repo":"alumnos","repoPath":"pockfojoh/alumnos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pest-testing","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Pest Testing 3\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new tests (unit or feature)\n- Modifying existing tests\n- Debugging test failures\n- Working with datasets, mocking, or test organization\n- Writing architecture tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Pest 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Tests\n\nAll tests must be written using Pest. Use `php artisan make:test --pest {name}`.\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Tests live in the `tests/Feature`","body":"# Pest Testing 3\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new tests (unit or feature)\n- Modifying existing tests\n- Debugging test failures\n- Working with datasets, mocking, or test organization\n- Writing architecture tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Pest 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Tests\n\nAll tests must be written using Pest. Use `php artisan make:test --pest {name}`.\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Tests live in the `tests/Feature` and `tests/Unit` directories.\n- Do NOT remove tests without approval - these are core application code.\n- Test happy paths, failure paths, and edge cases.\n\n### Basic Test Structure\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Basic Pest Test Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''is true'', function () {\n    expect(true)->toBeTrue();\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Running Tests\n\n- Run minimal tests with filter before finalizing: `php artisan test --compact --filter=testName`.\n- Run all tests: `php artisan test --compact`.\n- Run file: `php artisan test --compact tests/Feature/ExampleTest.php`.\n\n## Assertions\n\nUse specific assertions (`assertSuccessful()`, `assertNotFound()`) instead of `assertStatus()`:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Pest Response Assertion\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''returns all'', function () {\n    $this->postJson(''/api/docs'', [])->assertSuccessful();\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n| Use | Instead of |\n|-----|------------|\n| `assertSuccessful()` | `assertStatus(200)` |\n| `assertNotFound()` | `assertStatus(404)` |\n| `assertForbidden()` | `assertStatus(403)` |\n\n## Mocking\n\nImport mock function before use: `use function Pest\\Laravel\\mock;`\n\n## Datasets\n\nUse datasets for repetitive tests (validation rules, etc.):\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Pest Dataset Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''has emails'', function (string $email) {\n    expect($email)->not->toBeEmpty();\n})->with([\n    ''james'' => ''james@laravel.com'',\n    ''taylor'' => ''taylor@laravel.com'',\n]);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Pest 3 Features\n\n### Architecture Testing\n\nPest 3 includes architecture testing to enforce code conventions:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Architecture Test Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\narch(''controllers'')\n    ->expect(''App\\Http\\Controllers'')\n    ->toExtendNothing()\n    ->toHaveSuffix(''Controller'');\n\narch(''models'')\n    ->expect(''App\\Models'')\n    ->toExtend(''Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Model'');\n\narch(''no debugging'')\n    ->expect([''dd'', ''dump'', ''ray''])\n    ->not->toBeUsed();\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Type Coverage\n\nPest 3 provides improved type coverage analysis. Run with `--type-coverage` flag.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Not importing `use function Pest\\Laravel\\mock;` before using mock\n- Using `assertStatus(200)` instead of `assertSuccessful()`\n- Forgetting datasets for repetitive validation tests\n- Deleting tests without approval"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:38:09.326Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for PHP Analysis Agents needing advanced test automation and debugging capabilities with Pest 3","zh":"非常适合需要使用Pest 3进行高级测试自动化和调试的PHP分析代理","ja":"Pest 3を使用した高度なテスト自動化とデバッグ機能を必要とするPHP分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Pest 3를 사용한 고급 테스트 자동화 및 디버깅 기능을 필요로 하는 PHP 분석 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de PHP que necesitan capacidades de automatización y depuración de pruebas avanzadas con Pest 3","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse PHP nécessitant une automatisation et un débogage de tests avancés avec Pest 3","de":"Perfekt für PHP-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Testautomatisierungs- und Debugging-Funktionen mit Pest 3 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise PHP que precisam de capacidades avançadas de automação de testes e depuração com Pest 3","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа PHP, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности автоматизации тестирования и отладки с помощью Pest 3","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل PHP الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في أتمتة الاختبار وإصلاح الأخطاء باستخدام Pest 3"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write and organize unit and feature tests using Pest, facilitating efficient debugging of test failures and dataset management with PHP artisan commands","zh":"赋予代理编写和组织单元测试和功能测试的能力，使用Pest进行高效的测试失败调试和数据集管理，并使用PHP artisan命令","ja":"Pestを使用して単体テストと機能テストを書き込み、組織化する能力をエージェントに与え、テストの失敗を効率的にデバッグし、データセットを管理し、PHPのartisanコマンドを使用する","ko":"에이전트가 Pest를 사용하여 단위 테스트와 기능 테스트를 작성하고 구성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 테스트 실패를 효율적으로 디버깅하고 데이터셋을 관리하며, PHP 아티산 명령어를 사용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir y organizar pruebas unitarias y de características utilizando Pest, facilitando la depuración eficiente de fallos de pruebas y la gestión de conjuntos de datos con comandos de arte de PHP","fr":"Habilite les agents à écrire et à organiser des tests unitaires et de fonctionnalités à l''aide de Pest, facilitant le débogage efficace des échecs de test et la gestion des jeux de données avec des commandes d''artisanat PHP","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Einheit- und Funktionsprüfungen mit Pest zu schreiben und zu organisieren, wodurch eine effiziente Fehlersuche und Datenverwaltung mit PHP-Artefakt-Kommandos erleichtert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever e organizar testes unitários e de recursos usando Pest, facilitando a depuração eficiente de falhas de teste e gerenciamento de conjuntos de dados com comandos PHP artisan","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать и организовывать модульные и функциональные тесты с помощью Pest, облегчая эффективную отладку сбоев тестирования и управление наборами данных с помощью команд PHP artisan","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من كتابة وتنظيم الاختبارات الوحدوية واختبارات الميزات باستخدام Pest، مما يسهل إصلاح الأخطاء بشكل فعال وإدارة مجموعات البيانات باستخدام أوامر PHP artisan"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new unit and feature tests with Pest","Debugging test failures and organizing test suites","Writing architecture tests and managing test datasets"],"zh":["使用Pest创建新的单元测试和功能测试","调试测试失败并组织测试套件","编写架构测试并管理测试数据集"],"ja":["Pestを使用して新しい単体テストと機能テストを作成する","テストの失敗をデバッグし、テストスイートを組織化する","アーキテクチャテストを書き込み、テストデータセットを管理する"],"ko":["Pest를 사용하여 새로운 단위 테스트와 기능 테스트를 생성함","테스트 실패를 디버깅하고 테스트 스위트를 구성함","아키텍처 테스트를 작성하고 테스트 데이터셋을 관리함"],"es":["Crear nuevas pruebas unitarias y de características con Pest","Depurar fallos de pruebas y organizar suites de pruebas","Escribir pruebas de arquitectura y gestionar conjuntos de datos de pruebas"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles tests unitaires et de fonctionnalités avec Pest","Déboguer les échecs de test et organiser les suites de tests","Écrire des tests d''architecture et gérer les jeux de données de test"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Einheits- und Funktionsprüfungen mit Pest","Fehlersuche und Organisation von Test-Suiten","Schreiben von Architekturprüfungen und Verwaltung von Test-Datensätzen"],"pt":["Criar novos testes unitários e de recursos com Pest","Depurar falhas de teste e organizar conjuntos de testes","Escrever testes de arquitetura e gerenciar conjuntos de testes"],"ru":["Создание новых модульных и функциональных тестов с помощью Pest","Отладка сбоев тестирования и организация наборов тестов","Написание тестов архитектуры и управление наборами тестов"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات وحدوية واختبارات ميزات جديدة مع Pest","إصلاح اخفاقات الاختبار وتنظيم مجموعات الاختبار","كتابة اختبارات الهيكل وإدارة مجموعات الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP environment","Pest 3 compatibility necessary","Tests must be written in Pest format"],"zh":["需要PHP环境","需要Pest 3的兼容性","测试必须以Pest格式编写"],"ja":["PHP環境が必要","Pest 3の互換性が必要","テストはPest形式で書き込まれる必要がある"],"ko":["PHP 환경이 필요함","Pest 3의 호환성이 필요함","테스트는 Pest 형식으로 작성되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de PHP","Compatibilidad con Pest 3 necesaria","Las pruebas deben estar escritas en formato Pest"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement PHP","Compatibilité avec Pest 3 nécessaire","Les tests doivent être écrits au format Pest"],"de":["Benötigt PHP-Umgebung","Kompatibilität mit Pest 3 erforderlich","Tests müssen im Pest-Format geschrieben werden"],"pt":["Requer ambiente PHP","Compatibilidade com Pest 3 necessária","Testes devem ser escritos no formato Pest"],"ru":["Требуется среда PHP","Необходимо совместимость с Pest 3","Тесты должны быть написаны в формате Pest"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة PHP","التوافق مع Pest 3 ضروري","يجب كتابة الاختبارات بصيغة Pest"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
