ций","Интеграция с фреймворком Laravel","Поддержка отладки тестовых сбоев"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات وحدة فعالة","تحسين جودة الرمز","دعم إنشاء اختبارات ميزة","التكامل مع إطار العمل Laravel","دعم التصحيح من أخطاء الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pest 测试框架","测试工具","PHPUnit","Pest 3","测试组织","架构测试","调试测试失败"],"ja":["Pest テスト フレームワーク","テスト ツール","PHPUnit","Pest 3","テストの組織","アーキテクチャ テスト","テストの失敗のデバッグ"],"ko":["Pest 테스트 프레임워크","테스트 도구","PHPUnit","Pest 3","테스트의 조직","아키텍처 테스트","테스트의 실패 디버깅"],"es":["pruebas de pest","testing avanzado","php artisan","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de características","datasets","mocking","pruebas de arquitectura"],"fr":["tests pest","test avancé","php artisan","tests unitaires","tests de fonctionnalités","datasets","mocking","tests d''architecture"],"de":["pest-testing","erweitertes testen","php artisan","einheitstests","funktionalitätstests","datenbestände","mocking","architekturtests"],"pt":["testes de unidade","pest","otimização de testes","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de software","laravel","testes automatizados"],"ru":["юнит-тесты","pest","оптимизация тестов","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","laravel","автоматизированные тесты"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدة","الحشرات","تحسين الاختبارات","جودة الرمز","تطوير البرمجيات","laravel","اختبارات آلية"]}},"owner":"muneebslog","repo":"Medsync","repoPath":"muneebslog/Medsync","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pest-testing","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Pest Testing 3\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new tests (unit or feature)\n- Modifying existing tests\n- Debugging test failures\n- Working with datasets, mocking, or test organization\n- Writing architecture tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Pest 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Tests\n\nAll tests must be written using Pest. Use `php artisan make:test --pest {name}`.\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Tests live in the `tests/Feature`","body":"# Pest Testing 3\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new tests (unit or feature)\n- Modifying existing tests\n- Debugging test failures\n- Working with datasets, mocking, or test organization\n- Writing architecture tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Pest 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Tests\n\nAll tests must be written using Pest. Use `php artisan make:test --pest {name}`.\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Tests live in the `tests/Feature` and `tests/Unit` directories.\n- Do NOT remove tests without approval - these are core application code.\n- Test happy paths, failure paths, and edge cases.\n\n### Basic Test Structure\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Basic Pest Test Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''is true'', function () {\n    expect(true)->toBeTrue();\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Running Tests\n\n- Run minimal tests with filter before finalizing: `php artisan test --compact --filter=testName`.\n- Run all tests: `php artisan test --compact`.\n- Run file: `php artisan test --compact tests/Feature/ExampleTest.php`.\n\n## Assertions\n\nUse specific assertions (`assertSuccessful()`, `assertNotFound()`) instead of `assertStatus()`:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Pest Response Assertion\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''returns all'', function () {\n    $this->postJson(''/api/docs'', [])->assertSuccessful();\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n| Use | Instead of |\n|-----|------------|\n| `assertSuccessful()` | `assertStatus(200)` |\n| `assertNotFound()` | `assertStatus(404)` |\n| `assertForbidden()` | `assertStatus(403)` |\n\n## Mocking\n\nImport mock function before use: `use function Pest\\Laravel\\mock;`\n\n## Datasets\n\nUse datasets for repetitive tests (validation rules, etc.):\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Pest Dataset Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\nit(''has emails'', function (string $email) {\n    expect($email)->not->toBeEmpty();\n})->with([\n    ''james'' => ''james@laravel.com'',\n    ''taylor'' => ''taylor@laravel.com'',\n]);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Pest 3 Features\n\n### Architecture Testing\n\nPest 3 includes architecture testing to enforce code conventions:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Architecture Test Example\" lang=\"php\">\n\narch(''controllers'')\n    ->expect(''App\\Http\\Controllers'')\n    ->toExtendNothing()\n    ->toHaveSuffix(''Controller'');\n\narch(''models'')\n    ->expect(''App\\Models'')\n    ->toExtend(''Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Model'');\n\narch(''no debugging'')\n    ->expect([''dd'', ''dump'', ''ray''])\n    ->not->toBeUsed();\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Type Coverage\n\nPest 3 provides improved type coverage analysis. Run with `--type-coverage` flag.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Not importing `use function Pest\\Laravel\\mock;` before using mock\n- Using `assertStatus(200)` instead of `assertSuccessful()`\n- Forgetting datasets for repetitive validation tests\n- Deleting tests without approval"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:38:01.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Laravel Development Agents needing streamlined PHP testing workflows with Pest 3.","zh":"非常适合需要简化PHP测试工作流的Laravel开发代理，特别是使用Pest 3。","ja":"Laravel開発エージェントがPest 3を使用してPHPのテストワークフローを効率化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Pest 3를 사용하여 PHP 테스트 워크플ロー가 간소화된 Laravel 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Laravel que necesitan flujos de trabajo de prueba de PHP optimizados con Pest 3.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Laravel qui ont besoin de flux de travail de test PHP rationalisés avec Pest 3.","de":"Perfekt für Laravel-Entwicklungsagenten, die optimierte PHP-Testworkflows mit Pest 3 benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Laravel que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de teste PHP otimizados com Pest 3.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Laravel, которым необходимы оптимизированные рабочие процессы тестирования PHP с помощью Pest 3.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء لتحديث لارافيل الذين يحتاجون إلى تدفقات عمل اختبار PHP مضغوطة مع Pest 3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to create, modify, and debug tests using Pest 3''s expressive syntax, including working with datasets, mocking, and organizing tests in the `tests/Feature` directory. It leverages `php artisan make:test --pest` for rapid test generation and supports architecture testing capabilities.","zh":"使代理能够使用Pest 3的表达式语法创建、修改和调试测试，包括处理数据集、模拟和在`tests/Feature`目录中组织测试。它利用`php artisan make:test --pest`实现快速测试生成，并支持架构测试能力。","ja":"Pest 3の表現的な構文を使用してエージェントがテストを作成、変更、デバッグできるようにし、データセットの操作、モッキング、`tests/Feature`ディレクトリ内のテストの組織化などを含む。また、`php artisan make:test --pest`を使用して迅速なテスト生成を実現し、アーキテクチャテスト機能をサポートします。","ko":"Pest 3의 표현식 구문을 사용하여 에이전트가 테스트를 생성, 수정 및 디버깅할 수 있도록 하며, 데이터셋 작업, 모의 및 `tests/Feature` 디렉토리 내에서 테스트를 조직화하는 등을 포함합니다. 또한 `php artisan make:test --pest`를 사용하여 빠른 테스트 생성을 가능하게 하고, 아키텍처 테스트 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear, modificar y depurar pruebas utilizando la sintaxis expresiva de Pest 3, incluyendo el trabajo con conjuntos de datos, la simulación y la organización de pruebas en el directorio `tests/Feature`. Utiliza `php artisan make:test --pest` para la generación rápida de pruebas y admite capacidades de prueba de arquitectura.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de modifier et de déboguer des tests en utilisant la syntaxe expressive de Pest 3, y compris le travail avec des jeux de données, la simulation et l''organisation des tests dans le répertoire `tests/Feature`. Il utilise `php artisan make:test --pest` pour la génération rapide de tests et prend en charge les capacités de test d''architecture.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tests mit der ausdrucksstarken Syntax von Pest 3 zu erstellen, zu ändern und zu debuggen, einschließlich der Arbeit mit Datensätzen, Mocking und der Organisation von Tests im `tests/Feature`-Verzeichnis. Es nutzt `php artisan make:test --pest` für die schnelle Testgenerierung und unterstützt Architektur-Testfunktionen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem, modifiquem e depurem testes usando a sintaxe expressiva do Pest 3, incluindo trabalhar com conjuntos de dados, simulação e organização de testes no diretório `tests/Feature`. Ele aproveita `php artisan make:test --pest` para geração rápida de testes e suporta capacidades de teste de arquitetura.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, изменять и отлаживать тесты с помощью выразительного синтаксиса Pest 3, включая работу с наборами данных, макетирование и организацию тестов в директории `tests/Feature`. Он использует `php artisan make:test --pest` для быстрого создания тестов и поддерживает возможности тестирования архитектуры.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء وتنقيح وتصحيح الاختبارات باستخدام بناء الجمل التعبيرية لبرنامج Pest 3، بما في ذلك العمل مع مجموعات البيانات والتقليد وتنظيم الاختبارات في الدليل `tests/Feature`. انها تستفيد من `php artisan make:test --pest` من أجل توليد الاختبارات السريع ودعم قدرات اختبار الهندسة المعمارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new unit or feature tests","Debugging test failures","Organizing tests in structured directories","Working with datasets and mocking","Writing architecture tests"],"zh":["创建新的单元测试或特性测试","调试测试失败","在结构化目录中组织测试","处理数据集和模拟","编写架构测试"],"ja":["新しいユニットテストまたは機能テストの作成","テストの失敗のデバッグ","構造化ディレクトリ内のテストの組織化","データセットとモッキングの操作","アーキテクチャテストの記述"],"ko":["새로운 유닛 테스트 또는 기능 테스트 생성","테스트 실패 디버깅","구조화된 디렉토리 내에서 테스트 조직화","데이터셋 및 모의 작업","아키텍처 테스트 작성"],"es":["Crear nuevas pruebas unitarias o de funcionalidad","Depurar fallos de prueba","Organizar pruebas en directorios estructurados","Trabajar con conjuntos de datos y simulación","Escribir pruebas de arquitectura"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles tests unitaires ou de fonctionnalité","Déboguer les échecs de test","Organiser les tests dans des répertoires structurés","Travailler avec des jeux de données et la simulation","Écrire des tests d''architecture"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Einheit- oder Funktionalitätstests","Debuggen von Testfehlern","Organisieren von Tests in strukturierten Verzeichnissen","Arbeiten mit Datensätzen und Mocking","Schreiben von Architekturtests"],"pt":["Criar novos testes unitários ou de recursos","Depurar falhas de teste","Organizar testes em diretórios estruturados","Trabalhar com conjuntos de dados e simulação","Escrever testes de arquitetura"],"ru":["Создание новых юнит-тестов или тестов функций","Отладка сбоев тестов","Организация тестов в структурированных директориях","Работа с наборами данных и макетированием","Написание тестов архитектуры"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات وحدة جديدة أو ميزات","تصحيح اختبارات الفشل","تنظيم الاختبارات في دلائل منظم","العمل مع مجموعات البيانات والتقليد","كتابة اختبارات الهندسة المعمارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Pest 3 framework","Limited to PHP/Laravel environments","Depends on Artisan command for test generation"],"zh":["需要Pest 3框架","仅限PHP/Laravel环境","依赖于Artisan命令进行测试生成"],"ja":["Pest 3フレームワークが必要","PHP/Laravel環境に限定される","テスト生成にはArtisanコマンドに依存する"],"ko":["Pest 3 프레임워크 필요","PHP/Laravel 환경에만 제한됨","테스트 생성시 Artisan 명령에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el framework Pest 3","Limitado a entornos PHP/Laravel","Depende del comando Artisan para la generación de pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Pest 3","Limité aux environnements PHP/Laravel","Dépend de la commande Artisan pour la génération de tests"],"de":["Benötigt das Pest 3-Framework","Begrenzt auf PHP/Laravel-Umgebungen","Hängt von dem Artisan-Befehl für die Testgenerierung ab"],"pt":["Exige framework Pest 3","Limitado a ambientes PHP/Laravel","Depende do comando Artisan para geração de testes"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Pest 3","Ограничен средами PHP/Laravel","Зависит от команды Artisan для генерации тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار العمل Pest 3","محدود بالبيئات PHP/لارافيل","يعتمد على أمر الفنان لإنشاء الاختبارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
