d que permite a los desarrolladores revisar y mejorar la calidad de su código","fr":"La révision de code frontend est une compétence qui permet aux développeurs de réviser et d''améliorer la qualité de leur code","de":"Die Überprüfung von Frontend-Code ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihren Code zu überprüfen und zu verbessern","pt":"A revisão de código frontend é uma ferramenta que analisa arquivos .tsx, .ts e .js para garantir a qualidade do código","ru":"Проверка фронтенд-кода - это инструмент, который анализирует файлы .tsx, .ts и .js для обеспечения качества кода","ar":"استعراض رمز الواجهة الأمامية هو أداة تحليل الملفات .tsx و .ts و .js لضمان جودة الرمز","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["支持两种审查模式：Pending-change review和File-targeted review","自动化代码检查","提高代码质量","支持.tsx、.ts、.js文件","检查代码违规并报告"],"ja":["2つのレビューモードをサポート：Pending-change reviewとFile-targeted review","自動化コードチェック","コード品質の向上",".tsx、.ts、.jsファイルをサポート","コード違反をチェックして報告"],"ko":["두 가지 리뷰 모드 지원：Pending-change review와 File-targeted review","자동화 코드 체크","코드 품질 향상",".tsx、.ts、.js 파일 지원","코드 위반을 체크하고 보고"],"es":["Revisión de código pendiente de cambios","Revisión de archivos específicos","Compatibilidad con archivos .tsx, .ts y .js","Informes de violaciones de la lista de comprobación","Modos de revisión flexibles"],"fr":["Révision de code en attente de modifications","Révision de fichiers spécifiques","Compatibilité avec les fichiers .tsx, .ts et .js","Rapports de violations de la liste de contrôle","Modes de révision flexibles"],"de":["Überprüfung von Code mit bevorstehenden Änderungen","Überprüfung bestimmter Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Dateien .tsx, .ts und .js","Berichte über Verletzungen der Prüfliste","Flexible Überprüfungsmodi"],"pt":["Análise de arquivos .tsx, .ts e .js","Dois modos de revisão: pending-change e file-targeted","Relatório de violações de checklist","Integração com AesopIDE e Antigravity-inspired UI","Suporte a staged/working-tree files"],"ru":["Анализ файлов .tsx, .ts и .js","Два режима проверки: pending-change и file-targeted","Отчет о нарушениях чек-листа","Интеграция с AesopIDE и Antigravity-inspired UI","Поддержка staged/working-tree файлов"],"ar":["تحليل الملفات .tsx و .ts و .js","وضعان لاستعراض: pending-change و file-targeted","تقرير عن انتهاكات قائمة التحقق","التكامل مع AesopIDE و Antigravity-inspired UI","دعم الملفات staged/working-tree"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端代码审查","自动化代码检查","代码质量","Pending-change review","File-targeted review","tsx","ts","js"],"ja":["フロントエンドコードレビュー","自動化コードチェック","コード品質","Pending-change review","File-targeted review","tsx","ts","js"],"ko":["프론트엔드 코드 리뷰","자동화 코드 체크","코드 품질","Pending-change review","File-targeted review","tsx","ts","js"],"es":["revisión de código frontend","desarrollo de frontend","mejora de código","herramientas de desarrollo","código .tsx","código .ts","código .js"],"fr":["révision de code frontend","développement de frontend","amélioration de code","outils de développement","code .tsx","code .ts","code .js"],"de":["Überprüfung von Frontend-Code","Frontend-Entwicklung","Code-Verbesserung","Entwicklertools","Code .tsx","Code .ts","Code .js"],"pt":["revisão de código frontend","análise de código","qualidade de código","ferramenta de revisão","AesopIDE","Antigravity-inspired UI","tsx","ts","js"],"ru":["проверка фронтенд-кода","анализ кода","качество кода","инструментальная проверка","AesopIDE","Antigravity-inspired UI","tsx","ts","js"],"ar":["استعراض رمز الواجهة الأمامية","تحليل الرمز","جودة الرمز","أداة المراجعة","AesopIDE","Antigravity-inspired UI","tsx","ts","js"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-code-review","description":"Trigger when the user requests a review of frontend files (e.g., `.tsx`, `.ts`, `.js`). Support both pending-change reviews and focused file reviews while applying the checklist rules.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Code Review\n\n## Intent\nUse this skill whenever the user asks to review frontend code (especially `.tsx`, `.ts`, or `.js` files). Support two review modes:\n\n1. **Pending-change review** – inspect staged/working-tree files slated for commit and flag checklist violations before submission.\n2. **File-targeted review** – review the specific file(s) the user names and report the relevant checklist findings.\n\nStick to the checklist below for every applicable file and mode.\n\n## Checklist\nSee","body":"# Frontend Code Review\n\n## Intent\nUse this skill whenever the user asks to review frontend code (especially `.tsx`, `.ts`, or `.js` files). Support two review modes:\n\n1. **Pending-change review** – inspect staged/working-tree files slated for commit and flag checklist violations before submission.\n2. **File-targeted review** – review the specific file(s) the user names and report the relevant checklist findings.\n\nStick to the checklist below for every applicable file and mode.\n\n## Checklist\nSee [references/code-quality.md](references/code-quality.md), [references/performance.md](references/performance.md), [references/business-logic.md](references/business-logic.md) for the living checklist split by category—treat it as the canonical set of rules to follow.\n\nFlag each rule violation with urgency metadata so future reviewers can prioritize fixes.\n\n## Review Process\n1. Open the relevant component/module. Gather lines that relate to class names, React Flow hooks, prop memoization, and styling.\n2. For each rule in the review point, note where the code deviates and capture a representative snippet.\n3. Compose the review section per the template below. Group violations first by **Urgent** flag, then by category order (Code Quality, Performance, Business Logic).\n\n## Required output\nWhen invoked, the response must exactly follow one of the two templates:\n\n### Template A (any findings)\n```\n# Code review\nFound <N> urgent issues need to be fixed:\n\n## 1 <brief description of bug>\nFilePath: <path> line <line>\n<relevant code snippet or pointer>\n\n\n### Suggested fix\n<brief description of suggested fix>\n\n---\n... (repeat for each urgent issue) ...\n\nFound <M> suggestions for improvement:\n\n## 1 <brief description of suggestion>\nFilePath: <path> line <line>\n<relevant code snippet or pointer>\n\n\n### Suggested fix\n<brief description of suggested fix>\n\n---\n\n... (repeat for each suggestion) ...\n```\n\nIf there are no urgent issues, omit that section. If there are no suggestions, omit that section.\n\nIf the issue number is more than 10, summarize as \"10+ urgent issues\" or \"10+ suggestions\" and just output the first 10 issues.\n\nDon''t compress the blank lines between sections; keep them as-is for readability.\n\nIf you use Template A (i.e., there are issues to fix) and at least one issue requires code changes, append a brief follow-up question after the structured output asking whether the user wants you to apply the suggested fix(es). For example: \"Would you like me to use the Suggested fix section to address these issues?\"\n\n### Template B (no issues)\n```\n## Code review\nNo issues found.\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:39:00.429Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents specializing in frontend development with expertise in TypeScript and JavaScript files","zh":"适合专门从事前端开发并精通TypeScript和JavaScript文件的代码审查代理","ja":"フロントエンド開発を専門とし、TypeScriptとJavaScriptファイルに精通しているコードレビュー代理向け","ko":"프론트엔드 개발을 전문으로 하며 TypeScript와 JavaScript 파일에 精通한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que se especializan en desarrollo frontend con experiencia en archivos TypeScript y JavaScript","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code spécialisés dans le développement frontend avec expertise dans les fichiers TypeScript et JavaScript","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die sich auf Frontend-Entwicklung mit Erfahrung in TypeScript- und JavaScript-Dateien spezialisieren","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código especializados em desenvolvimento frontend com experiência em arquivos TypeScript e JavaScript","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по проверке кода, специализирующихся на разработке frontend с опытом работы с файлами TypeScript и JavaScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الشفرة المتخصص في تطوير الواجهة الأمامية مع الخبرة في ملفات TypeScript وJavaScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inspect staged or targeted frontend code files, such as .tsx, .ts, or .js, and flag checklist violations, ensuring adherence to coding standards and best practices through pending-change review and file-targeted review modes","zh":"赋予代理检查暂存或目标前端代码文件（如.tsx、.ts或.js）并标记清单违规项的能力，确保通过待更改审查和文件目标审查模式遵守编码标准和最佳实践","ja":"エージェントがステージングされたまたはターゲットのフロントエンドコードファイル（たとえば、.tsx、.ts、または.js）を検査し、チェックリスト違反をフラグ化する機能を提供し、変更待ちのレビューとファイル対象のレビューモードを通じて、コーディング規範とベストプラクティスに準拠することを保証する","ko":"에이전트가 스테이징된 또는 대상 프론트엔드 코드 파일(.tsx, .ts 또는 .js 등)을 검사하고 체크리스트 위반을 플래그하는 기능을 제공하여,_pending 변경 사항 검토 및 파일 대상 검토 모드를 통해 코딩 표준 및 최선의 관행을 준수하도록 보장","es":"Permite a los agentes inspeccionar archivos de código frontend puestos en escena o dirigidos, como .tsx, .ts o .js, y marcar violaciones de la lista de verificación, garantizando el cumplimiento de los estándares de codificación y las mejores prácticas a través de los modos de revisión de cambios pendientes y revisión dirigida a archivos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''inspecter les fichiers de code frontend mis en scène ou ciblés, tels que .tsx, .ts ou .js, et de signaler les violations de la liste de contrôle, en garantissant le respect des normes de codage et des meilleures pratiques via les modes de révision des modifications en attente et de révision ciblée sur les fichiers","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gestufte oder gezielte Frontend-Code-Dateien wie .tsx, .ts oder .js zu überprüfen und Checklist-Verletzungen zu markieren, um die Einhaltung von Kodierungsstandards und Best Practices durch die Überprüfung von Warteschleifen- und dateizielgerichteten Überprüfungsmodi sicherzustellen","pt":"Permite que os agentes inspecionem arquivos de código frontend em estágio ou direcionados, como .tsx, .ts ou .js, e sinalizem violações de lista de verificação, garantindo a adesão aos padrões e práticas de codificação por meio dos modos de revisão de alterações pendentes e revisão direcionada a arquivos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять файлы frontend-кода, находящиеся на стадии или направленные, такие как .tsx, .ts или .js, и флагировать нарушения чек-листа, обеспечивая соблюдение стандартов и лучших практик кодирования через режимы просмотра изменений и целевой просмотр файлов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فحص ملفات الشفرة الأمامية الموجهة أو المرحلية، مثل .tsx، .ts أو .js، وتحديد انتهاكات قائمة التحقق، مما يضمن الامتثال لمعايير الترميز وأفضل الممارسات من خلال وضع مراجعة التغييرات المعلقة ومراجعة الملفات الموجهة"},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting staged frontend code for checklist violations before submission","Reviewing specific frontend files and reporting relevant checklist findings","Flagging potential issues in .tsx, .ts, or .js files to improve code quality"],"zh":["提交前检查暂存的前端代码是否存在清单违规项","审查特定的前端文件并报告相关的清单发现","标记.tsx、.ts或.js文件中的潜在问题以提高代码质量"],"ja":["提出前にステージングされたフロントエンドコードをチェックリスト違反で検査する","特定のフロントエンドファイルをレビューし、関連するチェックリストの発見を報告する",".tsx、.ts、または.jsファイルの潜在的な問題をフラグ化してコード品質を向上させる"],"ko":["제출 전 스테이징된 프론트엔드 코드를 체크리스트 위반으로 검사","특정 프론트엔드 파일을 검토하고 관련 체크리스트 발견을 보고",".tsx, .ts 또는 .js 파일의 잠재적 문제를 플래그하여 코드 품질을 개선"],"es":["Inspeccionar el código frontend en escena para violaciones de la lista de verificación antes de la presentación","Revisar archivos frontend específicos e informar los hallazgos relevantes de la lista de verificación","Marcar posibles problemas en archivos .tsx, .ts o .js para mejorar la calidad del código"],"fr":["Inspecter le code frontend mis en scène pour les violations de la liste de cont