aciones Next.js","fr":"L''authentification Clerk est une solution pour protéger vos routes et gérer les sessions dans les applications Next.js","de":"Die Clerk-Authentifizierung ist eine Lösung zum Schutz Ihrer Routen und zur Verwaltung von Sitzungen in Next.js-Anwendungen","pt":"O Clerk Auth é uma solução de autenticação para aplicações Next.js, fornecendo uma forma fácil de gerenciar sessões de usuário.","ru":"Clerk Auth — это решение для аутентификации приложений Next.js, предоставляющее простой способ управления сессиями пользователей.","ar":"Clerk Auth هو حل التحقق لمواقع الويب Next.js، يوفر طريقة سهلة لإدارة جلسات المستخدمين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["ClerkProvider: 应用程序身份验证上下文","预建身份验证表单: 登录和注册","用户菜单: 会话管理","中间件路由保护: 使用 clerkMiddleware 和 createRouteMatcher","环境变量集成"],"ja":["ClerkProvider: アプリケーションの認証コンテキスト","事前ビルド認証フォーム: ログインと登録","ユーザーメニュー: セッション管理","ミドルウェアルート保護: clerkMiddleware と createRouteMatcher を使用","環境変数の統合"],"ko":["ClerkProvider: 애플리케이션 인증 컨텍스트","사전構築 인증 양식: 로그인 및 등록","사용자 메뉴: 세션 관리","미들웨어 라우트 보호: clerkMiddleware 및 createRouteMatcher 사용","환경 변수 통합"],"es":["Configuración de ClerkProvider para contexto de autenticación","Protección de rutas con middleware","Componentes preconstruidos para inicio de sesión y registro","Gestión de sesiones con UserButton","Compatibilidad con Next.js 14/15 App Router"],"fr":["Configuration de ClerkProvider pour le contexte d''authentification","Protection des routes avec middleware","Composants préconstruits pour la connexion et l''inscription","Gestion des sessions avec UserButton","Compatibilité avec Next.js 14/15 App Router"],"de":["Konfiguration von ClerkProvider für Authentifizierungskontext","Schutz von Routen mit Middleware","Vordefinierte Komponenten für Anmeldung und Registrierung","Sitzungsverwaltung mit UserButton","Kompatibilität mit Next.js 14/15 App Router"],"pt":["ClerkProvider para contexto de autenticação","Componentes de login e cadastro pré-construídos","Botão de usuário com gerenciamento de sessão","Proteção de rotas com clerkMiddleware","Criação de rotas personalizadas com createRouteMatcher"],"ru":["ClerkProvider для контекста аутентификации","Предварительно построенные компоненты входа и регистрации","Кнопка пользователя с управлением сессией","Защита маршрутов с помощью clerkMiddleware","Создание пользовательских маршрутов с помощью createRouteMatcher"],"ar":["ClerkProvider لسياق التحقق","مكونات الدخول والتسجيل المسبوقة","زر المستخدم بإدارة الجلسة","حماية المسارات باستخدام clerkMiddleware","إنشاء مسارات مخصصة باستخدام createRouteMatcher"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Clerk 身份验证","Next.js 身份验证","身份验证解决方案","路由保护","中间件","环境变量","登录","注册"],"ja":["Clerk 認証","Next.js 認証","認証ソリューション","ルート保護","ミドルウェア","環境変数","ログイン","登録"],"ko":["클러크 인증","Next.js 인증","인증 솔루션","라우트 보호","미들웨어","환경 변수","로그인","등록"],"es":["autenticación Clerk","Next.js","protección de rutas","gestión de sesiones","desarrollo de aplicaciones","seguridad de aplicaciones","ClerkProvider","middleware"],"fr":["authentification Clerk","Next.js","protection des routes","gestion des sessions","développement d''applications","sécurité des applications","ClerkProvider","middleware"],"de":["Clerk-Authentifizierung","Next.js","Schutz von Routen","Sitzungsverwaltung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Anwendungssicherheit","ClerkProvider","Middleware"],"pt":["autenticação next.js","clerk auth","gerenciamento de sessão","proteção de rotas","desenvolvimento de aplicações","segurança de aplicações","login e cadastro"],"ru":["аутентификация next.js","clerk auth","управление сессией","защита маршрутов","разработка приложений","безопасность приложений","вход и регистрация"],"ar":["التحقق من Next.js","Clerk Auth","إدارة الجلسة","حماية المسارات","تطوير التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات","الدخول والتسجيل"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.530Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clerk-auth","description":"Expert patterns for Clerk auth implementation, middleware, organizations, webhooks, and user sync Use when: adding authentication, clerk auth, user authentication, sign in, sign up.","bodyPreview":"# Clerk Authentication\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Next.js App Router Setup\n\nComplete Clerk setup for Next.js 14/15 App Router.\n\nIncludes ClerkProvider, environment variables, and basic\nsign-in/sign-up components.\n\nKey components:\n- ClerkProvider: Wraps app for auth context\n- <SignIn />, <SignUp />: Pre-built auth forms\n- <UserButton />: User menu with session management\n\n\n### Middleware Route Protection\n\nProtect routes using clerkMiddleware and createRouteMatcher.\n\nBest practices:\n- Single middleware.ts","body":"# Clerk Authentication\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Next.js App Router Setup\n\nComplete Clerk setup for Next.js 14/15 App Router.\n\nIncludes ClerkProvider, environment variables, and basic\nsign-in/sign-up components.\n\nKey components:\n- ClerkProvider: Wraps app for auth context\n- <SignIn />, <SignUp />: Pre-built auth forms\n- <UserButton />: User menu with session management\n\n\n### Middleware Route Protection\n\nProtect routes using clerkMiddleware and createRouteMatcher.\n\nBest practices:\n- Single middleware.ts file at project root\n- Use createRouteMatcher for route groups\n- auth.protect() for explicit protection\n- Centralize all auth logic in middleware\n\n\n### Server Component Authentication\n\nAccess auth state in Server Components using auth() and currentUser().\n\nKey functions:\n- auth(): Returns userId, sessionId, orgId, claims\n- currentUser(): Returns full User object\n- Both require clerkMiddleware to be configured\n\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:39:01.761Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Next.js Agents requiring seamless authentication integration with Clerk","zh":"适用于需要与 Clerk 无缝身份验证集成的 Next.js 代理","ja":"Clerk とのシームレスな認証統合を必要とする Next.js エージェントに最適","ko":"Clerk와의 무결점 인증 통합을 필요로하는 Next.js 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal for Next.js Agents requiring seamless authentication integration with Clerk","fr":"Ideal for Next.js Agents requiring seamless authentication integration with Clerk","de":"Ideal for Next.js Agents requiring seamless authentication integration with Clerk","pt":"Ideal para Agentes do Next.js que exigem integração de autenticação sem interrupções com o Clerk","ru":"Идеально для агентов Next.js, требующих бесшовной аутентификации с Clerk","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Next.js الذين يتطلبون دمج مصادقة بدون انقطاع مع Clerk"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to protect routes using clerkMiddleware and createRouteMatcher, while providing a pre-built auth context with ClerkProvider, and basic sign-in/sign-up components via <SignIn />, <SignUp />, and <UserButton /> for user session management","zh":"赋予代理保护路由的能力，使用 clerkMiddleware 和 createRouteMatcher，同时提供预建的身份验证上下文和 ClerkProvider，以及基本的登录/注册组件，通过 <SignIn />、<SignUp /> 和 <UserButton /> 进行用户会话管理","ja":"clerkMiddleware と createRouteMatcher を使用してルートを保護し、ClerkProvider を使用して事前に構築された認証コンテキストを提供し、<SignIn />、<SignUp />、<UserButton /> を使用して基本的なサインイン/サインアップコンポーネントを提供し、ユーザーセッション管理を行う","ko":"에이전트가 clerkMiddleware와 createRouteMatcher를 사용하여 라우트를 보호할 수 있도록 하며, ClerkProvider를 사용하여 사전 구축된 인증 컨텍스트와 기본적인 로그인/가입 컴포넌트를 <SignIn />、<SignUp /> 및 <UserButton />를 통해 제공하여 사용자 세션 관리를 수행","es":"Empowers agents to protect routes using clerkMiddleware and createRouteMatcher, while providing a pre-built auth context with ClerkProvider, and basic sign-in/sign-up components via <SignIn />, <SignUp />, and <UserButton /> for user session management","fr":"Empowers agents to protect routes using clerkMiddleware and createRouteMatcher, while providing a pre-built auth context with ClerkProvider, and basic sign-in/sign-up components via <SignIn />, <SignUp />, and <UserButton /> for user session management","de":"Empowers agents to protect routes using clerkMiddleware and createRouteMatcher, while providing a pre-built auth context with ClerkProvider, and basic sign-in/sign-up components via <SignIn />, <SignUp />, and <UserButton /> for user session management","pt":"Habilita os agentes a proteger rotas usando clerkMiddleware e createRouteMatcher, ao mesmo tempo em que fornece um contexto de autenticação pré-construído com ClerkProvider, e componentes básicos de entrada/saída via <SignIn />, <SignUp /> e <UserButton /> para gerenciamento de sessão do usuário","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью защищать маршруты с помощью clerkMiddleware и createRouteMatcher, а также предоставляет предварительно созданный контекст аутентификации с ClerkProvider и базовые компоненты входа/регистрации через <SignIn />, <SignUp /> и <UserButton /> для управления пользовательской сессией","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على حماية المسارات باستخدام clerkMiddleware و createRouteMatcher، وفي الوقت نفسه يقدم سياق مصادقة مسبق التعريف مع ClerkProvider ومكونات أساسية للدخول/التسجيل عبر <SignIn /> و <SignUp /> و <UserButton /> لإدارة جلسة المستخدم"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up Clerk authentication for Next.js 14/15 App Router","Protecting middleware routes with clerkMiddleware","Implementing single sign-on (SSO) with ClerkProvider"],"zh":["为 Next.js 14/15 App Router 应用设置 Clerk 身份验证","使用 clerkMiddleware 保护中间件路由","使用 ClerkProvider 实现单点登录 (SSO)"],"ja":["Next.js 14/15 App Router アプリケーションの Clerk 認証を設定する","clerkMiddleware を使用してミドルウェア ルートを保護する","ClerkProvider を使用してシングル サインオン (SSO) を実装する"],"ko":["Next.js 14/15 App Router 애플리케이션에 Clerk 인증 설정","clerkMiddleware를 사용하여 미들웨어 라우트 보호","ClerkProvider를 사용하여 단일 인증(SSO) 구현"],"es":["Setting up Clerk authentication for Next.js 14/15 App Router","Protecting middleware routes with clerkMiddleware","Implementing single sign-on (SSO) with ClerkProvider"],"fr":["Setting up Clerk authentication for Next.js 14/15 App Router","Protecting middleware routes with clerkMiddleware","Implementing single sign-on (SSO) with ClerkProvider"],"de":["Setting up Clerk authentication for Next.js 14/15 App Router","Protecting middleware routes with clerkMiddleware","Implementing single sign-on (SSO) with ClerkProvider"],"pt":["Configuração da autenticação do Clerk para Next.js 14/15 App Router","Proteção de rotas de middleware com clerkMiddleware","Implementação de login único (SSO) com ClerkProvider"],"ru":["Настройка аутентификации Clerk для Next.js 14/15 App Router","Защита маршрутов middleware с помощью clerkMiddleware","Реализация единого входа (SSO) с ClerkProvider"],"ar":["تكوين مصادقة Clerk ل Next.js 14/15 App Router","حماية مسارات البرامج الوسيطة مع clerkMiddleware","تنفيذ تسجيل الدخول الموحد (SSO) مع ClerkProvider"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js 14/15 App Router setup","Dependent on Clerk authentication service"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 14/15 App Router 设置","依赖于 Clerk 身份验证服务"],"ja":["Next.js 14/15 App Router の設定が必要","Clerk 認証サービスに依存する"],"ko":["Next.js 14/15 App Router 설정이 필요","Clerk 인증 서비스에 의존"],"es":["Requires Next.js 14/15 App Router setup","Dependent on Clerk authentication service"],"fr":["Requires Next.js 14/15 App Router setup","Dependent on Clerk authentication service"],"de":["Requires Next.js 14/15 App Router setup","Dependent on Clerk authentication service"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Next.js 14/15 App Router","Dependente do serviço de autenticação do Clerk"],"ru":["Требует настройки Next.js 14/15 App Router","Зависит от сервиса аутентификации Clerk"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Next.js 14/15 App Router","يعتمد على خدمة مصادقة Clerk"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
