t","desenvolvimento de aplicações","componentes react","design de componentes","aplicações de produção","react para produção","componentes server","componentes client","componentes presentational","componentes container"],"ru":["шаблоны react","разработка приложений","компоненты react","проектирование компонентов","производственные приложения","react для производства","компоненты server","компоненты client","компоненты presentational","компоненты container"],"ar":["نماذج رياكت","تنمية التطبيقات","مكونات رياكت","تصميم المكونات","تطبيقات الإنتاج","رياكت للإنتاج","مكونات سيرفر","مكونات كلينت","مكونات تقديمية","مكونات حاوية"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-patterns","description":"Modern React patterns and principles. Hooks, composition, performance, TypeScript best practices.","bodyPreview":"# React Patterns\n\n> Principles for building production-ready React applications.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Component Design Principles\n\n### Component Types\n\n| Type | Use | State |\n|------|-----|-------|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, static | None |\n| **Client** | Interactivity | useState, effects |\n| **Presentational** | UI display | Props only |\n| **Container** | Logic/state | Heavy state |\n\n### Design Rules\n\n- One responsibility per component\n- Props down, events up\n- Composition over inheritance\n- Prefer s","body":"# React Patterns\n\n> Principles for building production-ready React applications.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Component Design Principles\n\n### Component Types\n\n| Type | Use | State |\n|------|-----|-------|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, static | None |\n| **Client** | Interactivity | useState, effects |\n| **Presentational** | UI display | Props only |\n| **Container** | Logic/state | Heavy state |\n\n### Design Rules\n\n- One responsibility per component\n- Props down, events up\n- Composition over inheritance\n- Prefer small, focused components\n\n---\n\n## 2. Hook Patterns\n\n### When to Extract Hooks\n\n| Pattern | Extract When |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **useLocalStorage** | Same storage logic needed |\n| **useDebounce** | Multiple debounced values |\n| **useFetch** | Repeated fetch patterns |\n| **useForm** | Complex form state |\n\n### Hook Rules\n\n- Hooks at top level only\n- Same order every render\n- Custom hooks start with \"use\"\n- Clean up effects on unmount\n\n---\n\n## 3. State Management Selection\n\n| Complexity | Solution |\n|------------|----------|\n| Simple | useState, useReducer |\n| Shared local | Context |\n| Server state | React Query, SWR |\n| Complex global | Zustand, Redux Toolkit |\n\n### State Placement\n\n| Scope | Where |\n|-------|-------|\n| Single component | useState |\n| Parent-child | Lift state up |\n| Subtree | Context |\n| App-wide | Global store |\n\n---\n\n## 4. React 19 Patterns\n\n### New Hooks\n\n| Hook | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **useActionState** | Form submission state |\n| **useOptimistic** | Optimistic UI updates |\n| **use** | Read resources in render |\n\n### Compiler Benefits\n\n- Automatic memoization\n- Less manual useMemo/useCallback\n- Focus on pure components\n\n---\n\n## 5. Composition Patterns\n\n### Compound Components\n\n- Parent provides context\n- Children consume context\n- Flexible slot-based composition\n- Example: Tabs, Accordion, Dropdown\n\n### Render Props vs Hooks\n\n| Use Case | Prefer |\n|----------|--------|\n| Reusable logic | Custom hook |\n| Render flexibility | Render props |\n| Cross-cutting | Higher-order component |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Performance Principles\n\n### When to Optimize\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| Slow renders | Profile first |\n| Large lists | Virtualize |\n| Expensive calc | useMemo |\n| Stable callbacks | useCallback |\n\n### Optimization Order\n\n1. Check if actually slow\n2. Profile with DevTools\n3. Identify bottleneck\n4. Apply targeted fix\n\n---\n\n## 7. Error Handling\n\n### Error Boundary Usage\n\n| Scope | Placement |\n|-------|-----------|\n| App-wide | Root level |\n| Feature | Route/feature level |\n| Component | Around risky component |\n\n### Error Recovery\n\n- Show fallback UI\n- Log error\n- Offer retry option\n- Preserve user data\n\n---\n\n## 8. TypeScript Patterns\n\n### Props Typing\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Interface | Component props |\n| Type | Unions, complex |\n| Generic | Reusable components |\n\n### Common Types\n\n| Need | Type |\n|------|------|\n| Children | ReactNode |\n| Event handler | MouseEventHandler |\n| Ref | RefObject<Element> |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Testing Principles\n\n| Level | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| Unit | Pure functions, hooks |\n| Integration | Component behavior |\n| E2E | User flows |\n\n### Test Priorities\n\n- User-visible behavior\n- Edge cases\n- Error states\n- Accessibility\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Prop drilling deep | Use context |\n| Giant components | Split smaller |\n| useEffect for everything | Server components |\n| Premature optimization | Profile first |\n| Index as key | Stable unique ID |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** React is about composition. Build small, combine thoughtfully.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:39:43.308Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured React application development with component design principles","zh":"适合需要结构化React应用开发的前端代理，具有组件设计原则","ja":"Reactアプリケーション開発に構造化されたコンポーネント設計原則を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 리액트 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 컴포넌트 설계 원칙을 가지고 있습니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones React estructuradas con principios de diseño de componentes","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de développement d''applications React structurées avec des principes de conception de composants","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die strukturierte React-Anwendungsentwicklung mit Komponenten-Designprinzipien benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos React estruturados com princípios de design de componentes","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы структурированные приложения React с принципами проектирования компонентов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطبيقات React المنظمة مع مبادئ تصميم المكونات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready React applications using component types like Server, Client, Presentational, and Container, following design rules such as one responsibility per component, props down, events up, and composition over inheritance, utilizing state management with useState and effects","zh":"赋予代理构建生产就绪的React应用程序的能力，使用诸如Server、Client、Presentational和Container等组件类型，遵循诸如每个组件一个职责、属性向下传递、事件向上传递以及组合优于继承的设计规则，利用useState和效果进行状态管理","ja":"Server、Client、Presentational、Containerなどのコンポーネントタイプを使用して、1つのコンポーネント1つの責任、propsを下に、イベントを上に、組み合わせよりも継承を優先するなどの設計ルールに従い、useStateとエフェクトを使用したステート管理で、生产就绪のReactアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を与える","ko":"에이전트가 서버, 클라이언트, 프리젠테이셔널, 컨테이너 등의 컴포넌트 유형을 사용하여 프로덕션 준비가 된 리액트 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 각 컴포넌트당 하나의 책임, 속성은 아래로, 이벤트는 위로, 조합이 상속보다 우선하는 등의 디자인 규칙을 따르며, useState 및 효과를 사용한 상태 관리를 활용한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones React listas para producción utilizando tipos de componentes como Servidor, Cliente, Presentacional y Contenedor, siguiendo reglas de diseño como una responsabilidad por componente, props hacia abajo, eventos hacia arriba y composición sobre herencia, utilizando gestión de estado con useState y efectos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications React prêtes pour la production en utilisant des types de composants tels que Serveur, Client, Présentationnel et Conteneur, en suivant des règles de conception telles qu''une responsabilité par composant, props vers le bas, événements vers le haut et composition sur héritage, en utilisant la gestion d''état avec useState et des effets","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionsbereite React-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie Komponententypen wie Server, Client, Präsentations- und Containerkomponenten verwenden, folgend auf Designregeln wie eine Verantwortung pro Komponente, Props nach unten, Ereignisse nach oben und Zusammensetzung anstelle von Vererbung, unter Verwendung von Zustandsverwaltung mit useState und Effekten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos React prontos para produção usando tipos de componentes como Servidor, Cliente, Apresentação e Contêiner, seguindo regras de design como uma responsabilidade por componente, props para baixo, eventos para cima e composição sobre herança, utilizando gerenciamento de estado com useState e efeitos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать готовые к производству приложения React, используя типы компонентов, такие как Сервер, Клиент, Представление и Контейнер, следуя правилам проектирования, таким как одна ответственность на компонент, props вниз, события вверх и композиция над наследованием, используя управление состоянием с useState и эффектами","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات React جاهزة للإنتاج باستخدام أنواع المكونات مثل الخادم والعميل والتقديمي والحاوي ، متبعةً قواعد التصميم مثل مسؤولية واحدة لكل مكون ، والخصائص إلى الأسفل والأحداث إلى الأعلى والتركيب على الوراثة ، باستخدام إدارة الحالة مع useState والأffects"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing reusable Presentational components with props only","Implementing Container components for logic and state management","Optimizing Client components for interactivity with useState and effects"],"zh":["设计仅使用属性的可重用Presentational组件","实现用于逻辑和状态管理的Container组件","使用useState和效果优化Client组件以实现交互"],"ja":["プロパティのみを使用した再利用可能なPresentationalコンポーネントを設計する","ロジックとステート管理のためにContainerコンポーネントを実装する","useStateとエフェクトを使用してClientコンポーネントをインタラクティブに最適化する"],"ko":["속성만을 사용하는 재사용 가능한 프리젠테이셔널 컴포넌트를 설계한다","로직 및 상태 관리를 위해 컨테이너 컴포넌트를 구현한다","useState 및 효과를 사용하여 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 상호작용에 최적화한다"],"es":["Diseñar componentes Presentacionales reutilizables con props solo","Implementar componentes Contenedor para lógica y gestión de estado","Optimizar componentes Client para interactividad con useState y efectos"],"fr":["Concevoir des composants Présentationnels réutilisables avec des props uniquement","Mettre en œuvre des composants Conteneur pour la logique et la gestion d''état","Optimiser les composants Client pour l''interactivité avec useState et des effets"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Präsentationskomponenten mit Props nur entwerfen","Containerkomponenten für Logik und Zustandsverwaltung implementieren","Clientkomponenten für Interaktivität mit useState und Effekten optimieren"],"pt":["Projetar componentes Presentacionais reutilizáveis com props apenas","Implementar componentes Container para lógica e gerenciamento de estado","Otimizar componentes Client para interatividade com useState e efeitos"],"ru":["Проектировать многократно используемые компоненты Представления с props только","Реализовывать компоненты Контейнер для логики и управления состоянием","Оптимизировать компоненты Клиент для интерактивности с useState и эффектами"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات تقديمية قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع الخصائص فقط","تنفيذ مكونات حاوية لل منطق وإدارة الحالة","تحسين مكونات العميل للتفاعل مع useState والأffects"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React framework knowledge","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要React框架知识","仅限于基于React的应用程序"],"ja":["Reactフレームワークの知識が必要","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["리액트 프레임워크 지식이 필요하다","리액트 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del framework React","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur le framework React","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des React-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do framework React","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требует знаний фреймв