,"DMARC","ブラックリスト","インボックス最適化"],"ko":["이메일 시스템","전자우편","送達率","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","블랙리스트","인박스 최적화"],"es":["sistemas de correo electrónico","deliverabilidad","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","cola de correo electrónico","optimización de inbox","evitación de spam"],"fr":["systèmes d''email","deliverabilité","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","file d''attente d''email","optimisation de boîte de réception","évitement de spam"],"de":["E-Mail-Systeme","Deliverability","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","E-Mail-Warteschlange","Optimierung des Posteingangs","Spam-Vermeidung"],"pt":["sistemas de email","otimização de entrega","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","filas de email","monitoramento de entrega","otimização de inbox"],"ru":["системы электронной почты","оптимизация доставки","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","очереди электронной почты","мониторинг доставки","оптимизация входящих"],"ar":["نظم البريد الإلكتروني","تحسين التسليم","SPF","DKIM","DMARC","طوابير البريد الإلكتروني","مراقبة التسليم","تحسين صندوق الوارد"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"email-systems","description":"Email has the highest ROI of any marketing channel. $36 for every $1 spent. Yet most startups treat it as an afterthought - bulk blasts, no personalization, landing in spam folders.  This skill covers transactional email that works, marketing automation that converts, deliverability that reaches inboxes, and the infrastructure decisions that scale. Use when: keywords, file_patterns, code_patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Email Systems\n\nYou are an email systems engineer who has maintained 99.9% deliverability\nacross millions of emails. You''ve debugged SPF/DKIM/DMARC, dealt with\nblacklists, and optimized for inbox placement. You know that email is the\nhighest ROI channel when done right, and a spam folder nightmare when done\nwrong. You treat deliverability as infrastructure, not an afterthought.\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Transactional Email Queue\n\nQueue all transactional emails with retry logic and monitoring\n\n### Email","body":"# Email Systems\n\nYou are an email systems engineer who has maintained 99.9% deliverability\nacross millions of emails. You''ve debugged SPF/DKIM/DMARC, dealt with\nblacklists, and optimized for inbox placement. You know that email is the\nhighest ROI channel when done right, and a spam folder nightmare when done\nwrong. You treat deliverability as infrastructure, not an afterthought.\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Transactional Email Queue\n\nQueue all transactional emails with retry logic and monitoring\n\n### Email Event Tracking\n\nTrack delivery, opens, clicks, bounces, and complaints\n\n### Template Versioning\n\nVersion email templates for rollback and A/B testing\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ HTML email soup\n\n**Why bad**: Email clients render differently. Outlook breaks everything.\n\n### ❌ No plain text fallback\n\n**Why bad**: Some clients strip HTML. Accessibility issues. Spam signal.\n\n### ❌ Huge image emails\n\n**Why bad**: Images blocked by default. Spam trigger. Slow loading.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Missing SPF, DKIM, or DMARC records | critical | # Required DNS records: |\n| Using shared IP for transactional email | high | # Transactional email strategy: |\n| Not processing bounce notifications | high | # Bounce handling requirements: |\n| Missing or hidden unsubscribe link | critical | # Unsubscribe requirements: |\n| Sending HTML without plain text alternative | medium | # Always send multipart: |\n| Sending high volume from new IP immediately | high | # IP warm-up schedule: |\n| Emailing people who did not opt in | critical | # Permission requirements: |\n| Emails that are mostly or entirely images | medium | # Balance images and text: |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:39:33.494Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing expert email deliverability and infrastructure management","zh":"适合需要专家级电子邮件可达性和基础设施管理的AI代理","ja":"AIエージェントが専門のメール配信とインフラストラクチャ管理を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"전문적인 이메일 전달 가능성 및 인프라 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una entrega de correo electrónico experta y gestión de infraestructura","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin d''une livraison de courriels experte et d''une gestion d''infrastructure","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine experte E-Mail-Zustellung und Infrastrukturverwaltung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de entrega de e-mail de expert e gerenciamento de infraestrutura","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы экспертная доставка электронной почты и управление инфраструктурой","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تسليم البريد الإلكتروني الخبير وإدارة البنية التحتية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize email systems with retry logic, monitoring, and SPF/DKIM/DMARC debugging, ensuring high deliverability rates and inbox placement using protocols like DMARC","zh":"赋予代理人优化电子邮件系统的能力，使用重试逻辑、监控和SPF/DKIM/DMARC调试，确保高可达性率和收件箱放置，使用类似DMARC的协议","ja":"エージェントにメールシステムを最適化する能力を付与し、リトライロジック、監視、SPF/DKIM/DMARCデバッグを使用して、高い配信率と受信トレイへの配置を確保します。DMARCなどのプロトコルを使用します","ko":"에이전트에게 이메일 시스템을 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 재시도 로직, 모니터링 및 SPF/DKIM/DMARC 디버깅을 사용하여 높은 전달 가능성 및 받은 편지함 배치를 보장합니다. DMARC와 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los sistemas de correo electrónico con lógica de reintentos, monitoreo y depuración de SPF/DKIM/DMARC, garantizando altas tasas de entrega y colocación en la bandeja de entrada utilizando protocolos como DMARC","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les systèmes de courriels avec une logique de réessais, de surveillance et de débogage SPF/DKIM/DMARC, garantissant des taux de livraison élevés et un placement dans la boîte de réception en utilisant des protocoles comme DMARC","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, E-Mail-Systeme mit Wiederholungslogik, Überwachung und SPF/DKIM/DMARC-Debugging zu optimieren, um hohe Zustellraten und Platzierung im Posteingang unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie DMARC zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os sistemas de e-mail com lógica de retry, monitoramento e depuração de SPF/DKIM/DMARC, garantindo altas taxas de entrega e posicionamento na caixa de entrada usando protocolos como DMARC","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать системы электронной почты с логикой повторной отправки, мониторингом и отладкой SPF/DKIM/DMARC, обеспечивая высокие показатели доставки и размещения в входящих сообщениях с использованием протоколов seperti DMARC","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين أنظمة البريد الإلكتروني باستخدام منطق إعادة المحاولة ومراقبة وإزالة أخطاء SPF/DKIM/DMARC، مما يضمن معدلات تسليم عالية ووضعها في صندوق الوارد باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل DMARC"},"useCases":{"en":["Queueing transactional emails with retry logic","Debugging SPF/DKIM/DMARC issues","Optimizing email campaigns for inbox placement"],"zh":["使用重试逻辑排队事务性电子邮件","调试SPF/DKIM/DMARC问题","优化电子邮件活动以实现收件箱放置"],"ja":["リトライロジックを使用してトランザクションメールをキューイングする","SPF/DKIM/DMARCの問題をデバッグする","受信トレイへの配置のためにメールキャンペーンを最適化する"],"ko":["재시도 로직을 사용하여 트랜잭션 이메일을 큐에 넣는 것","SPF/DKIM/DMARC 문제를 디버깅하는 것","받은 편지함 배치를 위해 이메일 캠페인을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Cola de correos electrónicos transaccionales con lógica de reintentos","Depuración de problemas de SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Optimización de campañas de correo electrónico para la colocación en la bandeja de entrada"],"fr":["Mise en file d''attente des courriels transactionnels avec logique de réessais","Débogage des problèmes de SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Optimisation des campagnes de courriels pour le placement dans la boîte de réception"],"de":["Queueing von Transaktions-E-Mails mit Wiederholungslogik","Debugging von SPF/DKIM/DMARC-Problemen","Optimierung von E-Mail-Kampagnen für die Platzierung im Posteingang"],"pt":["Fila de transação de e-mails com lógica de retry","Depuração de problemas de SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Otimização de campanhas de e-mail para posicionamento na caixa de entrada"],"ru":["Очередь транзакционных электронных писем с логикой повторной отправки","Отладка проблем SPF/DKIM/DMARC","Оптимизация электронных кампаний для размещения в входящих сообщениях"],"ar":["الترتيب الانتقالي للبريد الإلكتروني مع منطق إعادة المحاولة","إزالة أخطاء SPF/DKIM/DMARC","تحسين حملات البريد الإلكتروني لوضعها في صندوق الوارد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in email protocols like SPF, DKIM, and DMARC","Deliverability depends on infrastructure quality"],"zh":["需要SPF、DKIM和DMARC等电子邮件协议的专业知识","可达性取决于基础设施质量"],"ja":["SPF、DKIM、DMARCなどのメールプロトコルの専門知識が必要","配信性はインフラストラクチャの品質に依存する"],"ko":["SPF, DKIM 및 DMARC와 같은 이메일 프로토콜에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다","전달 가능성은 인프라의 품질에 따라 다릅니다"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en protocolos de correo electrónico como SPF, DKIM y DMARC","La entrega depende de la calidad de la infraestructura"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les protocoles de courriels tels que SPF, DKIM et DMARC","La livraison dépend de la qualité de l''infrastructure"],"de":["Benötigt Erfahrung mit E-Mail-Protokollen wie SPF, DKIM und DMARC","Die Zustellung hängt von der Infrastrukturqualität ab"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento especializado em protocolos de e-mail como SPF, DKIM e DMARC","A entrega depende da qualidade da infraestrutura"],"ru":["Требует специальных знаний в протоколах электронной почты, таких как SPF, DKIM и DMARC","Доставка зависит от качества инфраструктуры"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في بروتوكولات البريد الإلكتروني مثل SPF و DKIM و DMARC","تعتمد التسليم على جودة البنية التحتية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/upstash-qstash', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'upstash-qstash', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z', '2026-02-18T14:40:19.749Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/upstash-qstash","name":"upstash-qstash","description":{"zh":"Upstash QStash 是一个服务器端无服务器消息队列，通过 HTTP 实现可靠的消息传递。它的简单性是其强大的来源","ja":"Upstash QStash は、HTTP で信頼性の高いメッセージングを実現するサーバーレス メッセージ キューです。シンプルさがその強さの源です","ko":"Upstash QStash는 HTTP를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 메시징을 제공하는 서버리스 메시지 큐입니다. 간단함이 그 강점의 근원입니다","es":"Upstash QStash es una solución de mensajería servidorless que permite enviar mensajes HTTP de manera confiable y sin gestión de infraestructura","fr":"Upstash QStash est une solution de messagerie serveurless qui permet d''envoyer des messages HTTP de manière fiable et sans gestion d''infrastructure","de":"Upstash QStash ist eine Lösung für serverless Messaging, die eine zuverlässige und infrastrukturlose Übermittlung von HTTP-Nachrichten ermöglicht","pt":"Upstash QStash é uma solução de mensagens serverless confiável que permite enviar requisições HTTP de forma simples e segura.","ru":"Upstash QStash - это надежное серверное решение для сообщений, которое позволяет отправлять запросы HTTP простым и безопасным способом.","ar":"أبستاش كيستاش هو حل رسائل خادم أقل تعطيلا موثوق يسمح بإرسال طلبات HTTP بسهولة وأمان.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Upstash QStash 服务器端无服务器消息队列","ja":"Upstash QStash サーバーレス メッセージ キュー","ko":"Upstash QStash 서버리스 메시징","es":"Upstash QStash: Mensajería servidorless confiable","fr":"Upstash QStash : Messagerie serveurless fiable","de":"Upstash QStash: Zuverlässige serverless Messaging","pt":"Upstash QStash: Mensagens Serverless Confiáveis","ru":"Upstash QStash: Надежные Серверные Сообщения","ar":"أبستاش كيستاش: رسائل خادم أقل تعطيلا موثوقة","en":"upstash-qstash"},"description":{"zh":"Upstash QStash 是一个服务器端无服务器消息队列，通过 HTTP 实现可靠的消息传递。它的简单性是其强大的来源","ja":"Upstash QStash は、HTTP で信頼性の高いメッセージングを実現するサーバーレス メッセージ キューです。シンプルさがその強さの源です","ko":"Upstash QStash는 HTTP를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 메시징을 제공하는 서버리스 메시지 큐입니다. 간단함이 그 강점의 근원입니다","es":"Upstash QStash es una solución de mensajería servidorless que permite enviar mensajes HTTP de manera confiable y sin gestión de infraestructura","fr":"Upstash QStash est une solution de messagerie serveurless qui permet d''envoyer des messages HTTP de manière fiable et sans gestion d''infrastructure","de":"Upstash QStash ist eine Lösung für serverless Messaging, die eine zuverlässige und infrastrukturlose Übermittlung von HTTP-Nachrichten ermöglicht","pt":"Upstash QStash é uma solução de mensagens serverless confiável que permite enviar requisições HTTP de forma simples e segura.","ru":"Upstash QStash - это надежное серверное решение для сообщений, которое позволяет отправлять запросы HTTP простым и безопасным способом.","ar":"أبستاش كيستاش هو حل رسائل خادم أقل تعطيلا موثوق يسمح بإرسال طلبات HTTP بسهولة وأمان.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["服务器端无服务器消息队列","通过 HTTP 实现可靠的消息传递","简单易用","支持 cron 作业","支持 webhook 投递"],"ja":["サーバーレス メッセージ キュー","HTTP で信頼性の高いメッセージング","シンプルで使いやすい","cron ジョブのサポート","webhook デリバリーのサポート"],"ko":["서버리스 메시지 큐","HTTP를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 메시징","간단하고 사용하기 쉬움","cron 작업 지원","webhook 배달 지원"],"es":["Envío de mensajes HTTP confiable","Programación de mensajes sin gestión de infraestructura","Compatibilidad con cron jobs y webhooks","Escalabilidad automática","Seguimiento y monitoreo de mensajes"],"fr":["Envoi de messages HTTP fiable","Planification de messages sans gestion d''infrastructure","Compatibilité avec les cron jobs et les webhooks","Mise à l''échelle automatique","Suivi et surveillance des messages"],"de":["Zuverlässige Übermittlung von HTTP-Nachrichten","Planung von Nachrichten ohne Infrastrukturverwaltung","Kompatibilität mit Cron-Jobs und Webhooks","Automatische Skalierung","Nachverfolgung und Überwachung von Nachrichten"],"pt":["Envio de requisições HTTP de forma simples e segura","Agendamento de requisições para execução posterior","Cron jobs que funcionam por anos","Sistema de entrega de webhooks que não perde mensagens","Integração fácil com aplicações serverless"],"ru":["Отправка запросов HTTP простым и безопасным способом","Планирование запросов для выполнения позже","Крон-задачи, которые работают в течение лет","Система доставки вебхуков, которая не теряет сообщения","Легкая интеграция с серверными приложениями"],"ar":["إرسال طلبات HTTP بسهولة وأمان","التخطيط لطلبات للتنفيذ في وقت لاحق","وظائف كرون التي تعمل لسنوات","نظام تسليم الويب هوك الذي لا يفقد الرسائل","التكامل السهل مع التطبيقات الخادمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Upstash QStash","服务器端无服务器","消息队列","HTTP 消息传递","可靠性","cron 作业","webhook","服务器端消息队列"],"ja":["Upstash QStash","サーバーレス","メッセージ キュー","HTTP メッセージング","信頼性","cron ジョブ","webhook","サーバーレス メッセージ キュー"],"ko":["Upstash QStash","서버리스","메시지 큐","HTTP 메시징","신뢰성","cron 작업","webhook","서버리스 메시지 큐"],"es":["Upstash QStash","mensajería servidorless","envío de mensajes HTTP","programación de mensajes","cron jobs","webhooks","escalabilidad automática","seguimiento de mensajes"],"fr":["Upstash QStash","messagerie serveurless","envoi de messages HTTP","planification de messages","cron jobs","webhooks","mise à l''échelle automatique","suivi de messages"],"de":["Upstash QStash","serverless Messaging","Übermittlung von HTTP-Nachrichten","Planung von Nachrichten","Cron-Jobs","Webhooks","automatische Skalierung","Nachverfolgung von Nachrichten"],"pt":["Upstash QStash","mensagens serverless","requisições HTTP","agendamento de requisições","cron jobs","webhooks","aplicações serverless","infraestrutura como código"],"ru":["Upstash QStash","серверные сообщения","запросы HTTP","планирование запросов","крон-задачи","вебхуки","серверные приложения","инфраструктура как код"],"ar":["أبستاش كيستاش","رسائل خادم أقل تعطيلا","طلبات HTTP","التخطيط لطلبات","وظائف كرون","الويب هوك","تطبيقات خادم أقل تعطيلا","البنية التحتية كкод"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-qstash","description":"Upstash QStash expert for serverless message queues, scheduled jobs, and reliable HTTP-based task delivery without managing infrastructure. Use when: qstash, upstash queue, serverless cron, scheduled http, message queue serverless.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash QStash\n\nYou are an Upstash QStash expert who builds reliable serverless messaging\nwithout infrastructure management. You understand that QStash''s simplicity\nis its power - HTTP in, HTTP out, with reliability in between.\n\nYou''ve scheduled millions of messages, set up cron jobs that run for years,\nand built webhook delivery systems that never drop a message. You know that\nQStash shines when you need \"just make this HTTP call later, reliably.\"\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. HTTP is the univers","body":"# Upstash QStash\n\nYou are an Upstash QStash expert who builds reliable serverless messaging\nwithout infrastructure management. You understand that QStash''s simplicity\nis its power - HTTP in, HTTP out, with reliability in between.\n\nYou''ve scheduled millions of messages, set up cron jobs that run for years,\nand built webhook delivery systems that never drop a message. You know that\nQStash shines when you need \"just make this HTTP call later, reliably.\"\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. HTTP is the universal language - no c\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- qstash-messaging\n- scheduled-http-calls\n- serverless-cron\n- webhook-delivery\n- message-deduplication\n- callback-handling\n- delay-scheduling\n- url-groups\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Message Publishing\n\nSending messages to be delivered to endpoints\n\n### Scheduled Cron Jobs\n\nSetting up recurring scheduled tasks\n\n### Signature Verification\n\nVerifying QStash message signatures in your endpoint\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Skipping Signature Verification\n\n### ❌ Using Private Endpoints\n\n### ❌ No Error Handling in Endpoints\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Not verifying QStash webhook signatures | critical | # Always verify signatures with both keys: |\n| Callback endpoint taking too long to respond | high | # Design for fast acknowledgment: |\n| Hitting QStash rate limits unexpectedly | high | # Check your plan limits: |\n| Not using deduplication for critical operations | high | # Use deduplication for critical messages: |\n| Expecting QStash to reach private/localhost endpoints | critical | # Production requirements: |\n| Using default retry behavior for all message types | medium | # Configure retries per message: |\n| Sending large payloads instead of references | medium | # Send references, not data: |\n| Not using callback/failureCallback for critical flows | medium | # Use callbacks for critical operations: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `vercel-deployment`, `nextjs-app-router`, `redis-specialist`, `email-systems`, `supabase-backend`, `cloudflare-workers`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:40:19.749Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing reliable serverless messaging with HTTP protocol","zh":"非常适合需要可靠的无服务器消息传递和HTTP协议的云代理","ja":"信頼性の高いサーバーレスメッセージングとHTTPプロトコルが必要なクラウドエージェントに最適","ko":"신뢰할 수 있는 서버리스 메시징과 HTTP 프로토콜이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de la nube que necesitan mensajería sin servidor confiable con protocolo HTTP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant un messagisme sans serveur fiable avec le protocole HTTP","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die zuverlässige serverlose Messaging mit HTTP-Protokoll benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de mensagens sem servidor confiáveis com protocolo HTTP","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым требуются надежные серверные сообщения с протоколом HTTP","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى رسائل خفيفة موثوقة ببروتوكول HTTP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to schedule millions of messages with reliability, utilizing HTTP in and out for seamless communication, and setting up cron jobs for long-term execution, all while ensuring reliability through QStash''s simplicity","zh":"赋予代理人以可靠的方式调度数百万条消息的能力，利用HTTP进行无缝通信，并设置cron作业以实现长期执行，同时通过QStash的简单性确保可靠性","ja":"エージェントが信頼性を持って数百万のメッセージをスケジュールできるようにし、HTTPを使用してシームレスな通信を行い、長期的な実行のためにcronジョブを設定し、QStashのシンプルさによって信頼性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 수백만 개의 메시지를 신뢰할 수 있는 방식으로 예약할 수 있도록 하며, HTTP를 사용하여 무결점 통신을 수행하고, 장기 실행을 위한 크론 작업을 설정하며, QStash의 단순성으로 신뢰성을 보장","es":"Empodera a los agentes para programar millones de mensajes con confiabilidad, utilizando HTTP para la comunicación entrante y saliente para una comunicación sin problemas, y configurar trabajos cron para la ejecución a largo plazo, todo mientras se garantiza la confiabilidad a través de la simplicidad de QStash","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour planifier des millions de messages avec fiabilité, en utilisant HTTP pour la communication entrante et sortante pour une communication sans accroc, et en configurant des tâches planifiées pour l''exécution à long terme, le tout en garantissant la fiabilité grâce à la simplicité de QStash","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Millionen von Nachrichten mit Zuverlässigkeit zu planen, indem HTTP für die eingehende und ausgehende Kommunikation verwendet wird, um eine nahtlose Kommunikation zu ermöglichen, und Cron-Jobs für die langfristige Ausführung einzurichten, all dies, während die Zuverlässigkeit durch die Einfachheit von QStash sichergestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a agendar milhões de mensagens com confiabilidade, utilizando HTTP para dentro e para fora para uma comunicação sem interrupções, e configurando trabalhos cron para execução de longo prazo, garantindo a confiabilidade por meio da simplicidade do QStash","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью планировать миллионы сообщений с надежностью, используя HTTP для входящих и исходящих сообщений для бесперебойной связи, и настраивать задания cron для долгосрочного выполнения, обеспечивая при этом надежность благодаря простоте QStash","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على جدولة ملايين الرسائل مع الموثوقية، وذلك باستخدام بروتوكول HTTP للداخل والخارج للاتصال السلس، وضبط مهام كرون للتنفيذ على المدى الطويل، مع ضمان الموثوقية من خلال بساطة QStash"},"useCases":{"en":["Scheduling millions of messages for delayed delivery","Setting up cron jobs for long-term automated tasks","Building webhook delivery systems with guaranteed message delivery"],"zh":["为延迟投递调度数百万条消息","为长期自动化任务设置cron作业","使用保证的消息传递构建Webhook投递系统"],"ja":["遅延配信のために数百万のメッセージをスケジュールする","長期的な自動化タスクのためにcronジョブを設定する","保証されたメッセージ配信を使用してWebhook配信システムを構築する"],"ko":["지연 배달을 위해 수백만 개의 메시지를 예약","장기 자동화 작업을 위한 크론 작업을 설정","보장된 메시지 전달을 사용하여 웹후크 전달 시스템을 구축"],"es":["Programar millones de mensajes para entrega retrasada","Configurar trabajos cron para tareas automatizadas a largo plazo","Construir sistemas de entrega de webhooks con entrega de mensajes garantizada"],"fr":["Planifier des millions de messages pour une livraison différée","Configurer des tâches planifiées pour des tâches automatisées à long terme","Construire des systèmes de livraison de webhooks avec une livraison de messages garantie"],"de":["Millionen von Nachrichten für verzögerte Zustellung planen","Cron-Jobs für langfristige automatisierte Aufgaben einrichten","Webhook-Liefer-systeme mit garantierter Nachrichtenlieferung aufbauen"],"pt":["Agendar milhões de mensagens para entrega atrasada","Configurar trabalhos cron para tarefas automatizadas de longo prazo","Construir sistemas de entrega de webhooks com entrega de mensagens garantida"],"ru":["Планировать миллионы сообщений для задержанной доставки","Настроить задания cron для автоматических задач долгосрочного выполнения","Построить системы доставки вебхуков с гарантированной доставкой сообщений"],"ar":["جدولة ملايين الرسائل لتسليم متأخر","ضبط مهام كرون لمهام أوتوماتيكية طويلة الأمد","بناء أنظمة تسليم الويب هوك مع تسليم رسائل مضمون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires infrastructure for serverless messaging","Relies on HTTP protocol for communication"],"zh":["需要基础设施用于无服务器消息传递","依赖HTTP协议进行通信"],"ja":["サーバーレスメッセージングのためにインフラストラクチャが必要","HTTPプロトコルに依存して通信を行う"],"ko":["서버리스 메시징을 위해 인프라가 필요","HTTP 프로토콜에 의존하여 통신"],"es":["Requiere infraestructura para mensajería sin servidor","Depende del protocolo HTTP para la comunicación"],"fr":["Nécessite une infrastructure pour le messagisme sans serveur","Dépend du protocole HTTP pour la communication"],"de":["Benötigt Infrastruktur für serverlose Messaging","Basiert auf dem HTTP-Protokoll für die Kommunikation"],"pt":["Exige infraestrutura para mensagens sem servidor","Depende do protocolo HTTP para comunicação"],"ru":["Требует инфраструктуры для серверных сообщений","Полагается на протокол HTTP для связи"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية تحتية لرسائل خفيفة","يعتمد على بروتوكول HTTP للاتصال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/onboarding-cro', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'onboarding-cro', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z', '2026-02-18T14:40:10.036Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/onboarding-cro","name":"onboarding-cro","description":{"zh":"Onboarding CRO 是指帮助用户达到「aha moment」的过程，通过优化用户体验和建立习惯，实现长期留存","ja":"Onboarding CRO は、「aha moment」に達するためのプロセスであり、ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化と習慣の形成によって長期的なリテンションを実現する","ko":"온보딩 CRO는 사용자가 ''aha moment''에 도달하는 것을 돕는 프로세스로, 사용자 경험을 최적화하고 습관을 형성하여 장기적인 유지 관리를 실현합니다","es":"El onboarding es crucial para la retención de usuarios. Aprende a optimizar la experiencia de onboarding para alcanzar el momento ''aha'' lo antes posible","fr":"L''onboarding est essentiel pour la rétention des utilisateurs. Découvrez comment optimiser l''expérience d''onboarding pour atteindre le moment ''aha'' le plus rapidement possible","de":"Das Onboarding ist entscheidend für die Bindung von Benutzern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Onboarding-Erfahrung optimieren können, um den ''aha''-Moment so schnell wie möglich zu erreichen","pt":"Onboarding CRO é uma abordagem para melhorar a experiência de ativação de usuários e aumentar a retenção","ru":"Onboarding CRO - это подход к улучшению опыта активации пользователей и увеличению удержания","ar":"تجربة الإعداد الاولي لتحويل العملاء هي نهج لتحسين تجربة تفعيل المستخدمين وزيادة الاحتفاظ","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Onboarding CRO 优化","ja":"Onboarding CRO 最適化","ko":"온보딩 CRO 최적화","es":"Optimización de Onboarding para CRO","fr":"Amélioration de l''Onboarding pour CRO","de":"Onboarding-Optimierung für CRO","pt":"Onboarding CRO: Otimização de Ativação de Usuários","ru":"Onboarding CRO: Оптимизация активации пользователей","ar":"تجربة الإعداد الاولي لتحويل العملاء: تحسين تفعيل المستخدمين","en":"onboarding-cro"},"description":{"zh":"Onboarding CRO 是指帮助用户达到「aha moment」的过程，通过优化用户体验和建立习惯，实现长期留存","ja":"Onboarding CRO は、「aha moment」に達するためのプロセスであり、ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化と習慣の形成によって長期的なリテンションを実現する","ko":"온보딩 CRO는 사용자가 ''aha moment''에 도달하는 것을 돕는 프로세스로, 사용자 경험을 최적화하고 습관을 형성하여 장기적인 유지 관리를 실현합니다","es":"El onboarding es crucial para la retención de usuarios. Aprende a optimizar la experiencia de onboarding para alcanzar el momento ''aha'' lo antes posible","fr":"L''onboarding est essentiel pour la rétention des utilisateurs. Découvrez comment optimiser l''expérience d''onboarding pour atteindre le moment ''aha'' le plus r...","de":"Das Onboarding ist entscheidend für die Bindung von Benutzern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Onboarding-Erfahrung optimieren können, um den ''aha''-Moment so schne...","pt":"Onboarding CRO é uma abordagem para melhorar a experiência de ativação de usuários e aumentar a retenção","ru":"Onboarding CRO - это подход к улучшению опыта активации пользователей и увеличению удержания","ar":"تجربة الإعداد الاولي لتحويل العملاء هي نهج لتحسين تجربة تفعيل المستخدمين وزيادة الاحتفاظ","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["用户激活定义","产品上下文理解","核心价值主张识别","用户体验优化","习惯形成策略"],"ja":["ユーザーアクティベーションの定義","製品コンテキストの理解","コアバリュープロポジションの特定","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化","習慣形成戦略"],"ko":["사용자 활성화 정의","제품 컨텍스트 이해","핵심 가치 제안 식별","사용자 경험 최적화","습관 형성 전략"],"es":["Análisis de contexto de producto","Definición del momento ''aha''","Optimización de la experiencia de onboarding","Establecimiento de hábitos para la retención a largo plazo","Recomendaciones personalizadas para CRO"],"fr":["Analyse du contexte de produit","Définition du moment ''aha''","Optimisation de l''expérience d''onboarding","Établissement de habitudes pour la rétention à long terme","Recommandations personnalisées pour CRO"],"de":["Analyse des Produktkontexts","Definition des ''aha''-Moments","Optimierung der Onboarding-Erfahrung","Einrichtung von Gewohnheiten für die langfristige Bindung","Personalisierte Empfehlungen für CRO"],"pt":["Análise de contexto do produto","Definição do momento de ativação","Otimização da experiência de onboarding","Aumento da retenção de usuários","Melhoria da taxa de conversão"],"ru":["Анализ контекста продукта","Определение момента активации","Оптимизация опыта ознакомления","Увеличение удержания пользователей","Улучшение коэффициента конверсии"],"ar":["تحليل سياق المنتج","تحديد момент التفعيل","تحسين تجربة الإعداد الاولي","زيادة الاحتفاظ بالمستخدمين","تحسين معدل التحويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Onboarding CRO","用户激活","留存率优化","用户体验设计","习惯形成","产品开发","用户增长"],"ja":["Onboarding CRO","ユーザーアクティベーション","リテンション率最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計","習慣形成","製品開発","ユーザー増加"],"ko":["온보딩 CRO","사용자 활성화","유지 관리 최적화","사용자 경험 디자인","습관 형성","제품 개발","사용자 증가"],"es":["onboarding","CRO","optimización de onboarding","retención de usuarios","momento aha","análisis de contexto de producto","recomendaciones de CRO"],"fr":["onboarding","CRO","amélioration de l''onboarding","rétention des utilisateurs","moment aha","analyse du contexte de produit","recommandations de CRO"],"de":["onboarding","CRO","onboarding-optimierung","benutzerbindung","aha-moment","analyse des produktkontexts","cro-empfehlungen"],"pt":["onboarding cro","otimização de ativação","experiência de onboarding","retenção de usuários","taxa de conversão","análise de contexto do produto"],"ru":["onboarding cro","оптимизация активации","опыт ознакомления","удержание пользователей","коэффициент конверсии","анализ контекста продукта"],"ar":["تجربة الإعداد الاولي لتحويل العملاء","تحسين تفعيل المستخدمين","تجربة الإعداد الاولي","الاحتفاظ بالمستخدمين","معدل التحويل","تحليل سياق المنتج"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"onboarding-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize post-signup onboarding, user activation, first-run experience, or time-to-value. Also use when the user mentions onboarding flow, activation rate, user activation, first-run experience, empty states, onboarding checklist, aha moment, or new user experience. For signup/registration optimization, see signup-flow-cro. For ongoing email sequences, see email-sequence.","bodyPreview":"# Onboarding CRO\n\nYou are an expert in user onboarding and activation. Your goal is to help users reach their \"aha moment\" as quickly as possible and establish habits that lead to long-term retention.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Product Context**\n   - What type of product? (SaaS tool, marketplace, app, etc.)\n   - B2B or B2C?\n   - What''s the core value proposition?\n\n2. **Activation Definition**\n   - What''s the \"aha moment\" for your product?\n   - Wha","body":"# Onboarding CRO\n\nYou are an expert in user onboarding and activation. Your goal is to help users reach their \"aha moment\" as quickly as possible and establish habits that lead to long-term retention.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Product Context**\n   - What type of product? (SaaS tool, marketplace, app, etc.)\n   - B2B or B2C?\n   - What''s the core value proposition?\n\n2. **Activation Definition**\n   - What''s the \"aha moment\" for your product?\n   - What action indicates a user \"gets it\"?\n   - What''s your current activation rate?\n\n3. **Current State**\n   - What happens immediately after signup?\n   - Is there an existing onboarding flow?\n   - Where do users currently drop off?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Time-to-Value Is Everything\n- How quickly can someone experience the core value?\n- Remove every step between signup and that moment\n- Consider: Can they experience value BEFORE signup?\n\n### 2. One Goal Per Session\n- Don''t try to teach everything at once\n- Focus first session on one successful outcome\n- Save advanced features for later\n\n### 3. Do, Don''t Show\n- Interactive > Tutorial\n- Doing the thing > Learning about the thing\n- Show UI in context of real tasks\n\n### 4. Progress Creates Motivation\n- Show advancement\n- Celebrate completions\n- Make the path visible\n\n---\n\n## Defining Activation\n\n### Find Your Aha Moment\nThe action that correlates most strongly with retention:\n- What do retained users do that churned users don''t?\n- What''s the earliest indicator of future engagement?\n- What action demonstrates they \"got it\"?\n\n**Examples by product type:**\n- Project management: Create first project + add team member\n- Analytics: Install tracking + see first report\n- Design tool: Create first design + export/share\n- Collaboration: Invite first teammate\n- Marketplace: Complete first transaction\n\n### Activation Metrics\n- % of signups who reach activation\n- Time to activation\n- Steps to activation\n- Activation by cohort/source\n\n---\n\n## Onboarding Flow Design\n\n### Immediate Post-Signup (First 30 Seconds)\n\n**Options:**\n1. **Product-first**: Drop directly into product\n   - Best for: Simple products, B2C, mobile apps\n   - Risk: Blank slate overwhelm\n\n2. **Guided setup**: Short wizard to configure\n   - Best for: Products needing personalization\n   - Risk: Adds friction before value\n\n3. **Value-first**: Show outcome immediately\n   - Best for: Products with demo data or samples\n   - Risk: May not feel \"real\"\n\n**Whatever you choose:**\n- Clear single next action\n- No dead ends\n- Progress indication if multi-step\n\n### Onboarding Checklist Pattern\n\n**When to use:**\n- Multiple setup steps required\n- Product has several features to discover\n- Self-serve B2B products\n\n**Best practices:**\n- 3-7 items (not overwhelming)\n- Order by value (most impactful first)\n- Start with quick wins\n- Progress bar/completion %\n- Celebration on completion\n- Dismiss option (don''t trap users)\n\n**Checklist item structure:**\n- Clear action verb\n- Benefit hint\n- Estimated time\n- Quick-start capability\n\nExample:\n```\n☐ Connect your first data source (2 min)\n  Get real-time insights from your existing tools\n  [Connect Now]\n```\n\n### Empty States\n\nEmpty states are onboarding opportunities, not dead ends.\n\n**Good empty state:**\n- Explains what this area is for\n- Shows what it looks like with data\n- Clear primary action to add first item\n- Optional: Pre-populate with example data\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Illustration or preview\n2. Brief explanation of value\n3. Primary CTA to add first item\n4. Optional: Secondary action (import, template)\n\n### Tooltips and Guided Tours\n\n**When to use:**\n- Complex UI that benefits from orientation\n- Features that aren''t self-evident\n- Power features users might miss\n\n**When to avoid:**\n- Simple, intuitive interfaces\n- Mobile apps (limited screen space)\n- When they interrupt important flows\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Max 3-5 steps per tour\n- Point to actual UI elements\n- Dismissable at any time\n- Don''t repeat for returning users\n- Consider user-initiated tours\n\n### Progress Indicators\n\n**Types:**\n- Checklist (discrete tasks)\n- Progress bar (% complete)\n- Level/stage indicator\n- Profile completeness\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show early progress (start at 20%, not 0%)\n- Quick early wins (first items easy to complete)\n- Clear benefit of completing\n- Don''t block features behind completion\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Channel Onboarding\n\n### Email + In-App Coordination\n\n**Trigger-based emails:**\n- Welcome email (immediate)\n- Incomplete onboarding (24h, 72h)\n- Activation achieved (celebration + next step)\n- Feature discovery (days 3, 7, 14)\n- Stalled user re-engagement\n\n**Email should:**\n- Reinforce in-app actions\n- Not duplicate in-app messaging\n- Drive back to product with specific CTA\n- Be personalized based on actions taken\n\n### Push Notifications (Mobile)\n\n- Permission timing is critical (not immediately)\n- Clear value proposition for enabling\n- Reserve for genuine value moments\n- Re-engagement for stalled users\n\n---\n\n## Engagement Loops\n\n### Building Habits\n- What regular action should users take?\n- What trigger can prompt return?\n- What reward reinforces the behavior?\n\n**Loop structure:**\nTrigger → Action → Variable Reward → Investment\n\n**Examples:**\n- Trigger: Email digest of activity\n- Action: Log in to respond\n- Reward: Social engagement, progress, achievement\n- Investment: Add more data, connections, content\n\n### Milestone Celebrations\n- Acknowledge meaningful achievements\n- Show progress relative to journey\n- Suggest next milestone\n- Shareable moments (social proof generation)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Stalled Users\n\n### Detection\n- Define \"stalled\" criteria (X days inactive, incomplete setup)\n- Monitor at cohort level\n- Track recovery rate\n\n### Re-engagement Tactics\n1. **Email sequence for incomplete onboarding**\n   - Reminder of value proposition\n   - Address common blockers\n   - Offer help/demo/call\n   - Deadline/urgency if appropriate\n\n2. **In-app recovery**\n   - Welcome back message\n   - Pick up where they left off\n   - Simplified path to activation\n\n3. **Human touch**\n   - For high-value accounts: personal outreach\n   - Offer live walkthrough\n   - Ask what''s blocking them\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Activation rate**: % reaching activation event\n- **Time to activation**: How long to first value\n- **Onboarding completion**: % completing setup\n- **Day 1/7/30 retention**: Return rate by timeframe\n- **Feature adoption**: Which features get used\n\n### Funnel Analysis\nTrack drop-off at each step:\n```\nSignup → Step 1 → Step 2 → Activation → Retention\n100%      80%       60%       40%         25%\n```\n\nIdentify biggest drops and focus there.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Onboarding Audit\nFor each issue:\n- **Finding**: What''s happening\n- **Impact**: Why it matters\n- **Recommendation**: Specific fix\n- **Priority**: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Onboarding Flow Design\n- **Activation goal**: What they should achieve\n- **Step-by-step flow**: Each screen/state\n- **Checklist items**: If applicable\n- **Empty states**: Copy and CTA\n- **Email sequence**: Triggers and content\n- **Metrics plan**: What to measure\n\n### Copy Deliverables\n- Welcome screen copy\n- Checklist items with microcopy\n- Empty state copy\n- Tooltip content\n- Email sequence copy\n- Milestone celebration copy\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns by Product Type\n\n### B2B SaaS Tool\n1. Short setup wizard (use case selection)\n2. First value-generating action\n3. Team invitation prompt\n4. Checklist for deeper setup\n\n### Marketplace/Platform\n1. Complete profile\n2. First search/browse\n3. First transaction\n4. Repeat engagement loop\n\n### Mobile App\n1. Permission requests (strategic timing)\n2. Quick win in first session\n3. Push notification setup\n4. Habit loop establishment\n\n### Content/Social Platform\n1. Follow/customize feed\n2. First content consumption\n3. First content creation\n4. Social connection/engagement\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Flow Simplification Experiments\n\n**Reduce Friction**\n- Add or remove email verification during onboarding\n- Test empty states vs. pre-populated dummy data\n- Provide pre-filled templates to accelerate setup\n- Add OAuth options for faster account linking\n- Reduce number of required onboarding steps\n\n**Step Sequencing**\n- Test different ordering of onboarding steps\n- Lead with highest-value features first\n- Move friction-heavy steps later in flow\n- Test required vs. optional step balance\n\n**Progress & Motivation**\n- Add progress bars or completion percentages\n- Test onboarding checklists (3-5 items vs. 5-7 items)\n- Gamify milestones with badges or rewards\n- Show \"X% complete\" messaging\n\n---\n\n### Guided Experience Experiments\n\n**Product Tours**\n- Add interactive product tours (Navattic, Storylane)\n- Test tooltip-based guidance vs. modal walkthroughs\n- Video tutorials for complex workflows\n- Self-paced vs. guided tour options\n\n**CTA Optimization**\n- Test CTA text variations during onboarding\n- Test CTA placement within onboarding screens\n- Add in-app tooltips for advanced features\n- Sticky CTAs that persist during onboarding\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**User Segmentation**\n- Segment users by role to show relevant features\n- Segment by goal to customize onboarding path\n- Create role-specific dashboards\n- Ask use-case question to personalize flow\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalized welcome messages\n- Industry-specific examples and templates\n- Dynamic feature recommendations based on answers\n\n---\n\n### Quick Wins & Engagement Experiments\n\n**Time-to-Value**\n- Highlight quick wins early (\"Complete your first X\")\n- Show success messages after key actions\n- Display progress celebrations at milestones\n- Suggest next steps after each completion\n\n**Support & Help**\n- Offer free onboarding calls for complex products\n- Add contextual help throughout onboarding\n- Test chat support availability during onboarding\n- Proactive outreach for stuck users\n\n---\n\n### Email & Multi-Channel Experiments\n\n**Onboarding Emails**\n- Personalized welcome email from founder\n- Behavior-based emails (triggered by actions/inactions)\n- Test email timing and frequency\n- Include quick tips and video content\n\n**Feedback Loops**\n- Add NPS survey during onboarding\n- Ask \"What''s blocking you?\" for incomplete users\n- Follow-up based on NPS score\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What action most correlates with retention?\n2. What happens immediately after signup?\n3. Where do users currently drop off?\n4. What''s your activation rate target?\n5. Do you have cohort analysis on successful vs. churned users?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: For optimizing the signup before onboarding\n- **email-sequence**: For onboarding email series\n- **paywall-upgrade-cro**: For converting to paid during/after onboarding\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing onboarding changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:40:10.036Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Growth Engineering Agents specializing in user activation and retention optimization.","zh":"非常适合专注于用户激活和留存优化的增长工程智能体。","ja":"ユーザー活性化とリテンション最適化を専門とする成長エンジニアリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 활성화 및 유지율 최적화에 특화된 성장 엔지니어링 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ingeniería de crecimiento que se especializan en la activación y optimización de la retención de usuarios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie de croissance spécialisés dans l''activation et l''optimisation de la rétention des utilisateurs.","de":"Perfekt für Wachstums-Ingenieure, die sich auf die Aktivierung und Optimierung der Benutzerbindung spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia de Crescimento especializados em ativação de usuários e otimização de retenção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инженерии роста, специализирующихся на активации пользователей и оптимизации удержания.","ar":"مثالي لعميل هندسة النمو المتخصص في تفعيل المستخدمين وتحسين الاحتفاظ."},"recommendation":{"en":"","zh":"","ja":"","ko":"","es":"","fr":"","de":"","pt":"","ru":"","ar":""},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing user activation funnels","Designing habit-forming onboarding sequences","Optimizing aha moment discovery paths","Prototyping retention-focused UI flows"],"zh":["分析用户激活漏斗","设计形成习惯的引导序列","优化顿悟时刻发现路径","构建以留存为重点的UI流程原型"],"ja":["ユーザー活性化ファネルの分析","習慣形成を促すオンボーディングシーケンスの設計","Aha体験（気づきの瞬間）の発見パスの最適化","リテンション重視のUIフローのプロトタイピング"],"ko":["사용자 활성화 퍼널 분석","습관 형성 온보딩 시퀀스 설계","아하 모먼트 발견 경로 최적화","유지율 중심 UI 흐름 프로토타이핑"],"es":["Análisis de embudos de activación de usuarios","Diseño de secuencias de incorporación que generan hábitos","Optimización de rutas de descubrimiento del momento áha","Creación de prototipos de flujos de interfaz de usuario enfocados en la retención"],"fr":["Analyse des embouts d''activation des utilisateurs","Conception de séquences d''intégration qui créent des habitudes","Optimisation des chemins de découverte du moment aha","Création de prototypes de flux d''interface utilisateur axés sur la rétention"],"de":["Analyse von Aktivierungs-Trichtern für Benutzer","Entwurf von Onboarding-Sequenzen, die Gewohnheiten erzeugen","Optimierung von Entdeckungspfaden für den Aha-Moment","Erstellung von Prototypen für benutzerorientierte Schnittstellen-Flüsse"],"pt":["Analisar funis de ativação de usuários","Projetar sequências de integração que formam hábitos","Otimizar caminhos de descoberta do momento aha","Prototipar fluxos de UI focados na retenção"],"ru":["Анализ воронок активации пользователей","Проектирование последовательностей интеграции, формирующих привычки","Оптимизация путей открытия момента аха","Прототипирование потоков UI, ориентированных на удержание"],"ar":["تحليل مرشحات تفعيل المستخدمين","تصميم تسلسلات دمج تكوين العادات","تحسين مسارات اكتشاف لحظة آهآ","إنشاء نماذج أولية لتدفقات واجهة المستخدم الموجهة نحو الاحتفاظ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product-specific context for activation definition","B2B/B2C specialization needed for tailored recommendations","Dependent on clear core value proposition input"],"zh":["需要产品特定的上下文来定义激活","需要B2B/B2C专业化以提供量身定制的建议","依赖于明确的核心价值主张输入"],"ja":["活性化の定義には製品固有のコンテキストが必要","カスタマイズされた推奨事項にはB2B/B2Cの専門知識が必要","明確な核心的価値提案の入力に依存"],"ko":["활성화 정의를 위해 제품별 컨텍스트 필요","맞춤형 권장 사항을 위한 B2B/B2C 전문성 필요","명확한 핵심 가치 제안 입력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un contexto específico del producto para la definición de la activación","Se necesita especialización B2B/B2C para recomendaciones personalizadas","Depende de una clara propuesta de valor básica"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte spécifique au produit pour la définition de l''activation","Spécialisation B2B/B2C nécessaire pour des recommandations personnalisées","Dépend d''une proposition de valeur claire"],"de":["Benötigt einen produktspezifischen Kontext für die Definition der Aktivierung","B2B/B2C-Spezialisierung erforderlich für maßgeschneiderte Empfehlungen","Hängt von einer klaren Kernwertproposition ab"],"pt":["Exige contexto específico do produto para definição de ativação","Especialização B2B/B2C necessária para recomendações personalizadas","Dependente de entrada de proposta de valor central clara"],"ru":["Требует контекста, специфичного для продукта, для определения активации","Необходима специализация B2B/B2C для индивидуальных рекомендаций","Зависит от rõческой входной информации о центральной ценностной пропозиции"],"ar":["يتطلب سياقًا محددًا للمنتج لتعريف التفعيل","تخصص B2B/B2C مطلوب لتقديم توصيات مخصصة","يعتمد على إدخال واضح للمقترح القيمة الأساسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
