nt\"に到達させるのを支援します","ko":"사용자 온보딩 CRO 전문가가 사용자를 \"aha moment\"에 도달하게 합니다","es":"El onboarding CRO es fundamental para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y aumentar la retención. Aprende a optimizar el proceso de activación de tus usuarios","fr":"L''onboarding CRO est essentiel pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et augmenter la rétention. Découvrez comment optimiser le processus d''activation de vo...","de":"Das Onboarding CRO ist entscheidend für die Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung und die Erhöhung der Bindung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den Aktivierungsprozess Ih...","pt":"O onboarding CRO é um processo que visa ajudar os usuários a alcançar seu ''aha moment'' o mais rápido possível","ru":"Онбординг CRO - это процесс, направленный на помощь пользователям в достижении своего ''aha момента'' как можно быстрее","ar":"تجربة التسجيل CRO هي عملية تهدف إلى مساعدة المستخدمين في الوصول إلى لحظة ''aha'' في أقرب وقت ممكن","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["产品背景分析","激活定义","用户习惯建立","长期留存率提高","个性化推荐","实时反馈"],"ja":["製品背景分析","アクティベーション定義","ユーザーハビットの確立","長期留存率の向上","個人化されたレコメンド","リアルタイムフィードバック"],"ko":["제품 배경 분석","활성화 정의","사용자 습관 설정","장기 보유률 향상","개인화된 추천","실시간 피드백"],"es":["Análisis del contexto del producto","Definición del momento \"aha\"","Optimización del proceso de activación","Mejora de la retención de usuarios","Análisis de la propuesta de valor principal"],"fr":["Analyse du contexte du produit","Définition du moment \"aha\"","Optimisation du processus d''activation","Amélioration de la rétention des utilisateurs","Analyse de la proposition de valeur principale"],"de":["Analyse des Produktkontexts","Definition des \"aha\"-Moments","Optimierung des Aktivierungsprozesses","Verbesserung der Benutzerbindung","Analyse der Hauptwertpropagierung"],"pt":["Análise do contexto do produto","Definição do ''aha moment''","Otimização do fluxo de onboarding","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Aumento da retenção de usuários","Análise de resultados e ajustes"],"ru":["Анализ контекста продукта","Определение ''aha момента''","Оптимизация потока онбординга","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Увеличение удержания пользователей","Анализ результатов и корректировка"],"ar":["تحليل سياق المنتج","تحديد لحظة ''aha''","تحسين تدفق التسجيل","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","زيادة الاحتفاظ بالمستخدمين","تحليل النتائج وتعديلها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["用户入门CRO","激活定义","长期留存率","个性化推荐","实时反馈","产品背景分析","用户习惯建立"],"ja":["ユーザーオンボーディングCRO","アクティベーション定義","長期留存率","個人化されたレコメンド","リアルタイムフィードバック","製品背景分析","ユーザーハビットの確立"],"ko":["사용자 온보딩 CRO","활성화 정의","장기 보유률","개인화된 추천","실시간 피드백","제품 배경 분석","사용자 습관 설정"],"es":["onboarding CRO","optimización de onboarding","retención de usuarios","momento aha","propuesta de valor principal","análisis de contexto del producto"],"fr":["onboarding CRO","amélioration de l''onboarding","rétention des utilisateurs","moment aha","proposition de valeur principale","analyse du contexte du produit"],"de":["onboarding CRO","Onboarding-Optimierung","Benutzerbindung","aha-Moment","Hauptwertpropagierung","Produktkontextanalyse"],"pt":["onboarding CRO","otimização de onboarding","experiência do usuário","retenção de usuários","análise de resultados","fluxo de onboarding","aha moment","integração do usuário"],"ru":["онбординг CRO","оптимизация онбординга","пользовательский опыт","удержание пользователей","анализ результатов","поток онбординга","aha момент","интеграция пользователя"],"ar":["تجربة التسجيل CRO","تحسين تجربة التسجيل","تجربة المستخدم","الاحتفاظ بالمستخدمين","تحليل النتائج","تدفق التسجيل","لحظة ''aha''","دمج المستخدم"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"onboarding-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize post-signup onboarding, user activation, first-run experience, or time-to-value. Also use when the user mentions onboarding flow, activation rate, user activation, first-run experience, empty states, onboarding checklist, aha moment, or new user experience. For signup/registration optimization, see signup-flow-cro. For ongoing email sequences, see email-sequence.","bodyPreview":"# Onboarding CRO\n\nYou are an expert in user onboarding and activation. Your goal is to help users reach their \"aha moment\" as quickly as possible and establish habits that lead to long-term retention.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Product Context**\n   - What type of product? (SaaS tool, marketplace, app, etc.)\n   - B2B or B2C?\n   - What''s the core value proposition?\n\n2. **Activation Definition**\n   - What''s the \"aha moment\" for your product?\n   - Wha","body":"# Onboarding CRO\n\nYou are an expert in user onboarding and activation. Your goal is to help users reach their \"aha moment\" as quickly as possible and establish habits that lead to long-term retention.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Product Context**\n   - What type of product? (SaaS tool, marketplace, app, etc.)\n   - B2B or B2C?\n   - What''s the core value proposition?\n\n2. **Activation Definition**\n   - What''s the \"aha moment\" for your product?\n   - What action indicates a user \"gets it\"?\n   - What''s your current activation rate?\n\n3. **Current State**\n   - What happens immediately after signup?\n   - Is there an existing onboarding flow?\n   - Where do users currently drop off?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Time-to-Value Is Everything\n- How quickly can someone experience the core value?\n- Remove every step between signup and that moment\n- Consider: Can they experience value BEFORE signup?\n\n### 2. One Goal Per Session\n- Don''t try to teach everything at once\n- Focus first session on one successful outcome\n- Save advanced features for later\n\n### 3. Do, Don''t Show\n- Interactive > Tutorial\n- Doing the thing > Learning about the thing\n- Show UI in context of real tasks\n\n### 4. Progress Creates Motivation\n- Show advancement\n- Celebrate completions\n- Make the path visible\n\n---\n\n## Defining Activation\n\n### Find Your Aha Moment\nThe action that correlates most strongly with retention:\n- What do retained users do that churned users don''t?\n- What''s the earliest indicator of future engagement?\n- What action demonstrates they \"got it\"?\n\n**Examples by product type:**\n- Project management: Create first project + add team member\n- Analytics: Install tracking + see first report\n- Design tool: Create first design + export/share\n- Collaboration: Invite first teammate\n- Marketplace: Complete first transaction\n\n### Activation Metrics\n- % of signups who reach activation\n- Time to activation\n- Steps to activation\n- Activation by cohort/source\n\n---\n\n## Onboarding Flow Design\n\n### Immediate Post-Signup (First 30 Seconds)\n\n**Options:**\n1. **Product-first**: Drop directly into product\n   - Best for: Simple products, B2C, mobile apps\n   - Risk: Blank slate overwhelm\n\n2. **Guided setup**: Short wizard to configure\n   - Best for: Products needing personalization\n   - Risk: Adds friction before value\n\n3. **Value-first**: Show outcome immediately\n   - Best for: Products with demo data or samples\n   - Risk: May not feel \"real\"\n\n**Whatever you choose:**\n- Clear single next action\n- No dead ends\n- Progress indication if multi-step\n\n### Onboarding Checklist Pattern\n\n**When to use:**\n- Multiple setup steps required\n- Product has several features to discover\n- Self-serve B2B products\n\n**Best practices:**\n- 3-7 items (not overwhelming)\n- Order by value (most impactful first)\n- Start with quick wins\n- Progress bar/completion %\n- Celebration on completion\n- Dismiss option (don''t trap users)\n\n**Checklist item structure:**\n- Clear action verb\n- Benefit hint\n- Estimated time\n- Quick-start capability\n\nExample:\n```\n☐ Connect your first data source (2 min)\n  Get real-time insights from your existing tools\n  [Connect Now]\n```\n\n### Empty States\n\nEmpty states are onboarding opportunities, not dead ends.\n\n**Good empty state:**\n- Explains what this area is for\n- Shows what it looks like with data\n- Clear primary action to add first item\n- Optional: Pre-populate with example data\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Illustration or preview\n2. Brief explanation of value\n3. Primary CTA to add first item\n4. Optional: Secondary action (import, template)\n\n### Tooltips and Guided Tours\n\n**When to use:**\n- Complex UI that benefits from orientation\n- Features that aren''t self-evident\n- Power features users might miss\n\n**When to avoid:**\n- Simple, intuitive interfaces\n- Mobile apps (limited screen space)\n- When they interrupt important flows\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Max 3-5 steps per tour\n- Point to actual UI elements\n- Dismissable at any time\n- Don''t repeat for returning users\n- Consider user-initiated tours\n\n### Progress Indicators\n\n**Types:**\n- Checklist (discrete tasks)\n- Progress bar (% complete)\n- Level/stage indicator\n- Profile completeness\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show early progress (start at 20%, not 0%)\n- Quick early wins (first items easy to complete)\n- Clear benefit of completing\n- Don''t block features behind completion\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Channel Onboarding\n\n### Email + In-App Coordination\n\n**Trigger-based emails:**\n- Welcome email (immediate)\n- Incomplete onboarding (24h, 72h)\n- Activation achieved (celebration + next step)\n- Feature discovery (days 3, 7, 14)\n- Stalled user re-engagement\n\n**Email should:**\n- Reinforce in-app actions\n- Not duplicate in-app messaging\n- Drive back to product with specific CTA\n- Be personalized based on actions taken\n\n### Push Notifications (Mobile)\n\n- Permission timing is critical (not immediately)\n- Clear value proposition for enabling\n- Reserve for genuine value moments\n- Re-engagement for stalled users\n\n---\n\n## Engagement Loops\n\n### Building Habits\n- What regular action should users take?\n- What trigger can prompt return?\n- What reward reinforces the behavior?\n\n**Loop structure:**\nTrigger → Action → Variable Reward → Investment\n\n**Examples:**\n- Trigger: Email digest of activity\n- Action: Log in to respond\n- Reward: Social engagement, progress, achievement\n- Investment: Add more data, connections, content\n\n### Milestone Celebrations\n- Acknowledge meaningful achievements\n- Show progress relative to journey\n- Suggest next milestone\n- Shareable moments (social proof generation)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Stalled Users\n\n### Detection\n- Define \"stalled\" criteria (X days inactive, incomplete setup)\n- Monitor at cohort level\n- Track recovery rate\n\n### Re-engagement Tactics\n1. **Email sequence for incomplete onboarding**\n   - Reminder of value proposition\n   - Address common blockers\n   - Offer help/demo/call\n   - Deadline/urgency if appropriate\n\n2. **In-app recovery**\n   - Welcome back message\n   - Pick up where they left off\n   - Simplified path to activation\n\n3. **Human touch**\n   - For high-value accounts: personal outreach\n   - Offer live walkthrough\n   - Ask what''s blocking them\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Activation rate**: % reaching activation event\n- **Time to activation**: How long to first value\n- **Onboarding completion**: % completing setup\n- **Day 1/7/30 retention**: Return rate by timeframe\n- **Feature adoption**: Which features get used\n\n### Funnel Analysis\nTrack drop-off at each step:\n```\nSignup → Step 1 → Step 2 → Activation → Retention\n100%      80%       60%       40%         25%\n```\n\nIdentify biggest drops and focus there.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Onboarding Audit\nFor each issue:\n- **Finding**: What''s happening\n- **Impact**: Why it matters\n- **Recommendation**: Specific fix\n- **Priority**: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Onboarding Flow Design\n- **Activation goal**: What they should achieve\n- **Step-by-step flow**: Each screen/state\n- **Checklist items**: If applicable\n- **Empty states**: Copy and CTA\n- **Email sequence**: Triggers and content\n- **Metrics plan**: What to measure\n\n### Copy Deliverables\n- Welcome screen copy\n- Checklist items with microcopy\n- Empty state copy\n- Tooltip content\n- Email sequence copy\n- Milestone celebration copy\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns by Product Type\n\n### B2B SaaS Tool\n1. Short setup wizard (use case selection)\n2. First value-generating action\n3. Team invitation prompt\n4. Checklist for deeper setup\n\n### Marketplace/Platform\n1. Complete profile\n2. First search/browse\n3. First transaction\n4. Repeat engagement loop\n\n### Mobile App\n1. Permission requests (strategic timing)\n2. Quick win in first session\n3. Push notification setup\n4. Habit loop establishment\n\n### Content/Social Platform\n1. Follow/customize feed\n2. First content consumption\n3. First content creation\n4. Social connection/engagement\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Flow Simplification Experiments\n\n**Reduce Friction**\n- Add or remove email verification during onboarding\n- Test empty states vs. pre-populated dummy data\n- Provide pre-filled templates to accelerate setup\n- Add OAuth options for faster account linking\n- Reduce number of required onboarding steps\n\n**Step Sequencing**\n- Test different ordering of onboarding steps\n- Lead with highest-value features first\n- Move friction-heavy steps later in flow\n- Test required vs. optional step balance\n\n**Progress & Motivation**\n- Add progress bars or completion percentages\n- Test onboarding checklists (3-5 items vs. 5-7 items)\n- Gamify milestones with badges or rewards\n- Show \"X% complete\" messaging\n\n---\n\n### Guided Experience Experiments\n\n**Product Tours**\n- Add interactive product tours (Navattic, Storylane)\n- Test tooltip-based guidance vs. modal walkthroughs\n- Video tutorials for complex workflows\n- Self-paced vs. guided tour options\n\n**CTA Optimization**\n- Test CTA text variations during onboarding\n- Test CTA placement within onboarding screens\n- Add in-app tooltips for advanced features\n- Sticky CTAs that persist during onboarding\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**User Segmentation**\n- Segment users by role to show relevant features\n- Segment by goal to customize onboarding path\n- Create role-specific dashboards\n- Ask use-case question to personalize flow\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalized welcome messages\n- Industry-specific examples and templates\n- Dynamic feature recommendations based on answers\n\n---\n\n### Quick Wins & Engagement Experiments\n\n**Time-to-Value**\n- Highlight quick wins early (\"Complete your first X\")\n- Show success messages after key actions\n- Display progress celebrations at milestones\n- Suggest next steps after each completion\n\n**Support & Help**\n- Offer free onboarding calls for complex products\n- Add contextual help throughout onboarding\n- Test chat support availability during onboarding\n- Proactive outreach for stuck users\n\n---\n\n### Email & Multi-Channel Experiments\n\n**Onboarding Emails**\n- Personalized welcome email from founder\n- Behavior-based emails (triggered by actions/inactions)\n- Test email timing and frequency\n- Include quick tips and video content\n\n**Feedback Loops**\n- Add NPS survey during onboarding\n- Ask \"What''s blocking you?\" for incomplete users\n- Follow-up based on NPS score\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What action most correlates with retention?\n2. What happens immediately after signup?\n3. Where do users currently drop off?\n4. What''s your activation rate target?\n5. Do you have cohort analysis on successful vs. churned users?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: For optimizing the signup before onboarding\n- **email-sequence**: For onboarding email series\n- **paywall-upgrade-cro**: For converting to paid during/after onboarding\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing onboarding changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:39:44.405Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Customer Success Agents focused on SaaS tool onboarding, needing expertise in activation definition and product context analysis.","zh":"非常适合专注于SaaS工具上线的客户成功专员，需要具备激活定义和产品背景分析的专业知识。","ja":"SaaSツールのオンボーディングに焦点を当てたカスタマーサクセスエージェントに最適で、アクティベーションの定義と製品コンテキスト分析の専門知識が必要です。","ko":"SaaS 도구 온보딩에 중점을 둔 고객 성공 에이전트에게 이상적이며, 활성화 정의 및 제품 컨텍스트 분석에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de éxito del cliente centrados en la incorporación de herramientas SaaS, que necesitan experiencia en definición de activación y análisis de contexto de producto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de réussite client axés sur l''intégration d''outils SaaS, ayant besoin d''expertise en définition d''activation et en analyse de contexte de produit.","de":"Ideal für Kunden-Erfolgs-Agents, die auf die Onboarding von SaaS-Tools spezialisiert sind und Erfahrung in der Definition von Aktivierungen und der Analyse des Produktkontexts benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sucesso do Cliente focados em integração de ferramentas SaaS, necessitando de especialização em definição de ativação e análise de contexto de produto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по успеху клиентов, ориентированных на интеграцию инструментов SaaS, требующих экспертизы в определении активации и анализе контекста продукта.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء نجاح العملاء الذين يركزون على إعداد أدوات SaaS، ويتطلبون خبرة في تعريف التنشيط وتحليل سياق المنتج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline user onboarding processes, leveraging core value proposition analysis and ''aha moment'' identification to enhance long-term retention, utilizing product context understanding and activation metrics like B2B or B2C market differentiation.","zh":"使专员能够利用核心价值主张分析和''顿悟时刻''识别来简化用户上线流程，利用产品背景理解和B2B或B2C市场差异化等激活指标来增强长期留存率。","ja":"コアバリュープロポジション分析と「Ahaモーメント」の特定を活用してユーザーオンボーディングプロセスを効率化し、製品コンテキストの理解とB2BまたはB2C市場差別化などのアクティベーション指標を利用して長期的な定着率を向上させることでエージェントを支援します。","ko":"에이전트가 핵심 가치 제안 분석과 ''Aha 순간'' 식별을 활용하여 사용자 온보딩 프로세스를 간소화하고, 제품 컨텍스트 이해와 B2B 또는 B2C 시장 차별화와 같은 활성화 지표를 활용하여 장기적 retention을 향상시키도록 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes simplificar los procesos de incorporación de usuarios, aprovechando el análisis de la propuesta de valor principal y la identificación del ''momento áha'' para mejorar la retención a largo plazo, utilizando la comprensión del contexto del producto y las métricas de activación como la diferenciación del mercado B2B o B2C.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser les processus d''intégration des utilisateurs, en exploitant l''analyse de la proposition de valeur principale et l''identification du ''moment áha'' pour améliorer la rétention à long terme, en utilisant la compréhension du contexte du produit et les métriques d''activation comme la différenciation du marché B2B ou B2C.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Onboarding-Prozesse von Benutzern zu rationalisieren, indem sie die Analyse des Kernwertangebots und die Identifizierung des ''Aha-Moments'' nutzen, um die langfristige Bindung zu verbessern, unter Nutzung des Produktkontextverständnisses und der Aktivierungsmetriken wie der B2B- oder B2C-Marktdifferenzierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os processos de integração do usuário, aproveitando a análise da proposição de valor central e a identificação do ''momento aha'' para melhorar a retenção a longo prazo, utilizando a compreensão do contexto do produto e métricas de ativação como a diferençação de mercado B2B ou B2C.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать процессы интеграции пользователей, используя анализ основной ценности и определение ''момента аха'' для улучшения долгосрочного удержания, используя понимание контекста продукта и метрики активации, такие как дифференциация рынка B2B или B2C.","ar":"يُمكن الوكلاء من简ification عمليات إعداد المستخدم، مستفيدين من تحليل القيمة الأساسية و تحديد ''لحظة أها'' لتعزيز الاستهلاك على المدى الطويل، باستخدام فهم سياق المنتج وأدوات التنشيط مثل التمييز بين الأسواق B2B أو B2C."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing product context for tailored onboarding","Defining activation metrics for SaaS tools","Optimizing user journeys for ''aha moment'' achievement"],"zh":["分析产品背景以进行量身定制的上线","为SaaS工具定义激活指标","优化用户旅程以实现''顿悟时刻''"],"ja":["カスタマイズされたオンボーディングのための製品コンテキストの分析","SaaSツールのアクティベーション指標の定義","「Ahaモーメント」達成のためのユーザージャーニーの最適化"],"ko":["맞춤형 온보딩을 위한 제품 컨텍스트 분석","SaaS 도구를 위한 활성화 지표 정의","''Aha 순간'' 달성을 위한 사용자 여정 최적화"],"es":["Analizar el contexto del producto para una incorporación personalizada","Definir métricas de activación para herramientas SaaS","Optimizar los recorridos de usuario para lograr el ''momento áha''"],"fr":["Analyser le contexte du produit pour une intégration personnalisée","Définir des métriques d''activation pour les outils SaaS","Optimiser les parcours utilisateur pour atteindre le ''moment áha''"],"de":["Den Produktkontext für eine personalisierte Onboarding analysieren","Aktivierungsmetriken für SaaS-Tools definieren","Benutzerreisen optimieren, um den ''Aha-Moment'' zu erreichen"],"pt":["Analisar o contexto do produto para integração personalizada","Definir métricas de ativação para ferramentas SaaS","Otimizar jornadas de usuário para alcançar o ''momento aha''"],"ru":["Анализ контекста продукта для индивидуальной интеграции","Определение метрик активации для инструментов SaaS","Оптимизация путей пользователя для достижения ''момента аха''"],"ar":["تحليل سياق المنتج من أجل إعداد مخصص","تحديد مقاييس التنشيط لأدوات SaaS","تحسين مسارات المستخدم لتحقيق ''لحظة أها''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of product value proposition","Limited to digital products (SaaS, apps, marketplaces)"],"zh":["需要理解产品的价值主张","仅限于数字产品（SaaS、应用程序、市场）"],"ja":["製品のバリュープロポジションの理解が必要","デジタル製品（SaaS、アプリ、マーケットプレイス）に限定"],"ko":["제품 가치 제안에 대한 이해가 필요함","디지털 제품(SaaS, 앱, 마켓플레이스)으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la propuesta de valor del producto","Limitado a productos digitales (SaaS, aplicaciones, mercados)"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la proposition de valeur du produit","Limité aux produits numériques (SaaS, applications, marchés)"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis des Wertangebots des Produkts","Begrenzt auf digitale Produkte (SaaS, Apps, Märkte)"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da proposição de valor do produto","Limitado a produtos digitais (SaaS, aplicativos, marketplaces)"],"ru":["Требует понимания ценности продукта","Ограничен цифровыми продуктами (SaaS, приложениями, рынками)"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم القيمة الأساسية للمنتج","محدود بالمنتجات الرقمية (SaaS و التطبيقات و الأسواق)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/azure-functions', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'azure-functions', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z', '2026-02-18T14:40:25.127Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/azure-functions","name":"azure-functions","description":{"zh":"Azure Functions 是一个事件驱动的计算服务，支持多种编程语言。了解其模式、反模式和注意事项","ja":"Azure Functions はイベント駆動のコンピューティングサービスで、複数のプログラミング言語をサポートしています。パターン、アンチパターン、注意事項について学びます","ko":"Azure Functions는 이벤트 驱动의 컴퓨팅 서비스로 여러 프로그래밍 언어를 지원합니다. 패턴, 안티패턴, 주의事項에 대해 학습합니다","es":"Azure Functions es un servicio de computación en la nube que permite desarrollar aplicaciones serverless. Ofrece patrones y características para mejorar la eficiencia y la escalabilidad.","fr":"Azure Functions est un service de calcul en nuage qui permet de développer des applications sans serveur. Il propose des modèles et des fonctionnalités pour améliorer l''efficacité et la scalabilité.","de":"Azure-Funktionen ist ein Cloud-Computing-Dienst, der die Entwicklung von serverlosen Anwendungen ermöglicht. Er bietet Muster und Funktionen, um die Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit zu verbessern.","pt":"Azure Functions é um serviço de computação serverless que permite criar aplicações escaláveis. Aprenda sobre os padrões e anti-padrões de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Azure Functions — это сервис серверной вычислительной техники, который позволяет создавать масштабируемые приложения. Узнайте о шаблонах и анти-шаблонах разработки.","ar":"وظائف Azure هي خدمة حوسبة خالية من الخادم تتيح إنشاء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسع. تعرف على الأنماط والمعرفة المضادة للنمط","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Azure Functions 技术指南","ja":"Azure Functions 技術ガイド","ko":"Azure Functions 기술 가이드","es":"Funciones de Azure: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Serverless","fr":"Fonctions Azure : Développement d''applications sans serveur","de":"Azure-Funktionen: Entwicklung von serverlosen Anwendungen","pt":"Azure Functions: Desenvolvimento de Serviços Serverless","ru":"Azure Functions: Разработка Серверных Приложений","ar":"وظائف Azure: تطوير الخدمات الخالية من الخادم","en":"azure-functions"},"description":{"zh":"Azure Functions 是一个事件驱动的计算服务，支持多种编程语言。了解其模式、反模式和注意事项","ja":"Azure Functions はイベント駆動のコンピューティングサービスで、複数のプログラミング言語をサポートしています。パターン、アンチパターン、注意事項について学びます","ko":"Azure Functions는 이벤트 驱动의 컴퓨팅 서비스로 여러 프로그래밍 언어를 지원합니다. 패턴, 안티패턴, 주의事項에 대해 학습합니다","es":"Azure Functions es un servicio de computación en la nube que permite desarrollar aplicaciones serverless. Ofrece patrones y características para mejorar la e...","fr":"Azure Functions est un service de calcul en nuage qui permet de développer des applications sans serveur. Il propose des modèles et des fonctionnalités pour ...","de":"Azure-Funktionen ist ein Cloud-Computing-Dienst, der die Entwicklung von serverlosen Anwendungen ermöglicht. Er bietet Muster und Funktionen, um die Effizien...","pt":"Azure Functions é um serviço de computação serverless que permite criar aplicações escaláveis. Aprenda sobre os padrões e anti-padrões de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Azure Functions — это сервис серверной вычислительной техники, который позволяет создавать масштабируемые приложения. Узнайте о шаблонах и анти-шаблонах разр...","ar":"وظائف Azure هي خدمة حوسبة خالية من الخادم تتيح إنشاء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسع. تعرف على الأنماط والمعرفة المضادة للنمط","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多种编程语言，如 .NET、Node.js 和 Python","事件驱动的计算服务","提供隔离工作者模型和代码中心的方法","支持 TypeScript 和 JavaScript","提供反模式和注意事项"],"ja":["複数のプログラミング言語をサポートしています（.NET、Node.js、Pythonなど）","イベント駆動のコンピューティングサービス","隔離されたワーカーモデルとコード中心のアプローチを提供","TypeScript と JavaScript をサポート","アンチパターンと注意事項を提供"],"ko":["여러 프로그래밍 언어를 지원합니다(.NET, Node.js, Python 등)","이벤트駆动의 컴퓨팅 서비스","격리된 워커 모델과 코드 중심의 방법을 제공","TypeScript와 JavaScript를 지원","안티패턴과 주의事項을 제공"],"es":["Modelo de trabajador aislado (.NET)","Modelo de programación Node.js v4","Modelo de programación Python v2","Evitación de llamadas asíncronas bloqueantes","Uso de HttpClient eficiente"],"fr":["Modèle de travailleur isolé (.NET)","Modèle de programmation Node.js v4","Modèle de programmation Python v2","Évitement des appels asynchrones bloquants","Utilisation efficace de HttpClient"],"de":["Isoliertes Worker-Modell (.NET)","Node.js-v4-Programmiermodell","Python-v2-Programmiermodell","Vermeidung von blockierenden asynchronen Aufrufen","Effiziente Verwendung von HttpClient"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações serverless","Padrões de desenvolvimento modernos","Suporte a linguagens como .NET, Node.js e Python","Integração com outros serviços Azure","Escalabilidade automática"],"ru":["Разработка серверных приложений","Современные шаблоны разработки","Поддержка языков seperti .NET, Node.js и Python","Интеграция с другими сервисами Azure","Автомасштабирование"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات الخالية من الخادم","أنماط تطوير حديثة","دعم لغات مثل .NET و Node.js و Python","التكامل مع خدمات Azure الأخرى","توسيع تلقائي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Functions","云函数","FaaS","事件驱动","隔离工作者模型","代码中心","TypeScript","JavaScript","Python",".NET"],"ja":["Azure Functions","クラウド関数","FaaS","イベント駆動","隔離されたワーカーモデル","コード中心","TypeScript","JavaScript","Python",".NET"],"ko":["Azure Functions","클라우드 함수","FaaS","이벤트駆动","격리된 워커 모델","코드 중심","TypeScript","JavaScript","Python",".NET"],"es":["Azure Functions","desarrollo de aplicaciones serverless","patrones de diseño","anti-patrones","Node.js","Python","computación en la nube"],"fr":["Fonctions Azure","développement d''applications sans serveur","modèles de conception","anti-modèles","Node.js","Python","calcul en nuage"],"de":["Azure-Funktionen","Entwicklung von serverlosen Anwendungen","Entwurfsmuster","Antimuster","Node.js","Python","Cloud-Computing"],"pt":["Azure Functions","desenvolvimento serverless","aplicações escaláveis","padrões de desenvolvimento","anti-padrões","Node.js",".NET","Python"],"ru":["Azure Functions","сервис серверной вычислительной техники","масштабируемые приложения","шаблоны разработки","анти-шаблоны","Node.js",".NET","Python"],"ar":["وظائف Azure","تطوير الخدمات الخالية من الخادم","تطبيقات قابلة للتوسع","أنماط التطوير","معرفة مضادة للنمط","Node.js",".NET","Python"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-functions","description":"Expert patterns for Azure Functions development including isolated worker model, Durable Functions orchestration, cold start optimization, and production patterns. Covers .NET, Python, and Node.js programming models. Use when: azure function, azure functions, durable functions, azure serverless, function app.","bodyPreview":"# Azure Functions\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Isolated Worker Model (.NET)\n\nModern .NET execution model with process isolation\n\n### Node.js v4 Programming Model\n\nModern code-centric approach for TypeScript/JavaScript\n\n### Python v2 Programming Model\n\nDecorator-based approach for Python functions\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Blocking Async Calls\n\n### ❌ New HttpClient Per Request\n\n### ❌ In-Process Model for New Projects\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue","body":"# Azure Functions\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Isolated Worker Model (.NET)\n\nModern .NET execution model with process isolation\n\n### Node.js v4 Programming Model\n\nModern code-centric approach for TypeScript/JavaScript\n\n### Python v2 Programming Model\n\nDecorator-based approach for Python functions\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Blocking Async Calls\n\n### ❌ New HttpClient Per Request\n\n### ❌ In-Process Model for New Projects\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | high | ## Use async pattern with Durable Functions |\n| Issue | high | ## Use IHttpClientFactory (Recommended) |\n| Issue | high | ## Always use async/await |\n| Issue | medium | ## Configure maximum timeout (Consumption) |\n| Issue | high | ## Use isolated worker for new projects |\n| Issue | medium | ## Configure Application Insights properly |\n| Issue | medium | ## Check extension bundle (most common) |\n| Issue | medium | ## Add warmup trigger to initialize your code |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:40:25.127Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Based Agents needing scalable serverless architecture with Azure Functions","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的无服务器架构且使用Azure Functions的基于云的代理","ja":"Azure Functionsを使用してスケーラブルなサーバーレスアーキテクチャが必要なクラウドベースのエージェントに最適","ko":"Azure Functions를 사용하여 확장 가능한 서버리스 아키텍처가 필요한 클라우드 기반 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en la nube que necesitan una arquitectura sin servidor escalable con Azure Functions","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur le cloud nécessitant une architecture sans serveur scalable avec Azure Functions","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-basierte Agenten, die eine skalierbare serverlose Architektur mit Azure Functions benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Baseados em Nuvem que necessitam de arquitetura sem servidor escalável com Azure Functions","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым требуется масштабируемая серверная архитектура с Azure Functions","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستندة إلى السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية خالية من الخادم قابلة للتطوير مع Azure Functions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy event-driven serverless applications using modern .NET, Node.js v4, and Python v2 programming models, while avoiding anti-patterns like blocking async calls and ensuring process isolation with the Isolated Worker Model","zh":"赋予代理使用现代的.NET、Node.js v4和Python v2编程模型部署事件驱动的无服务器应用程序的能力，同时避免阻塞异步调用等反模式，并通过隔离工作者模型确保进程隔离","ja":"エージェントがmodern .NET、Node.js v4、Python v2プログラミングモデルを使用してイベント駆動のサーバーレスアプリケーションをデプロイし、ブロッキング非同期呼び出しなどの反パターンを避け、隔離ワーカーモデルによりプロセス分離を確保する能力を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 현대적인 .NET, Node.js v4 및 Python v2 프로그래밍 모델을 사용하여 이벤트 驱动의 서버리스 애플리케이션을 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 블로킹 비동기 호출 등의 반 패턴을 피하고, 격리된 워커 모델을 통해 프로세스 격리를 보장하는 기능을 제공한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar aplicaciones sin servidor orientadas a eventos utilizando modelos de programación modernos de .NET, Node.js v4 y Python v2, evitando anti-patrones como llamadas asíncronas bloqueantes y garantizando el aislamiento de procesos con el modelo de trabajador aislado","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications sans serveur à événements utilisant des modèles de programmation modernes .NET, Node.js v4 et Python v2, tout en évitant les anti-modèles tels que les appels asynchrones bloquants et en assurant l''isolement des processus avec le modèle de travailleur isolé","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ereignisgesteuerte serverlose Anwendungen mit modernen .NET-, Node.js-v4- und Python-v2-Programmiermodellen zu bereitstellen, während Anti-Muster wie blockierende asynchrone Aufrufe vermieden und die Prozessisolierung mit dem isolierten Worker-Modell sichergestellt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar aplicações sem servidor orientadas a eventos usando modelos de programação modernos .NET, Node.js v4 e Python v2, evitando anti-padrões como chamadas assíncronas de bloqueio e garantindo isolamento de processo com o Modelo de Trabalhador Isolado","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать событийно-ориентированные серверные приложения, используя современные модели программирования .NET, Node.js v4 и Python v2, избегая анти-шаблонов, таких как блокирующие асинхронные вызовы, и обеспечивая изоляцию процесса с помощью Изолированной Модели Работника","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من نشر تطبيقات خالية من الخادم متجهة إلى الأحداث باستخدام نماذج برمجة حديثة .NET و Node.js v4 و Python v2، وتجنب أنماط معاكسة مثل مكالمات غير متزامنة لحظر وتأمين عزل العملية باستخدام نموذج العامل المعزول"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying serverless APIs with Azure Functions","Automating workflows using Azure Functions triggers","Debugging Azure Functions with sharp edge issue resolution"],"zh":["使用Azure Functions部署无服务器API","使用Azure Functions触发器自动化工作流","使用sharp edge问题解決调试Azure Functions"],"ja":["Azure Functionsを使用してサーバーレスAPIをデプロイする","Azure Functionsトリガーを使用してワークフローを自動化する","sharp edge問題解決を使用してAzure Functionsをデバッグする"],"ko":["Azure Functions를 사용하여 서버리스 API를 배포한다","Azure Functions 트리거를 사용하여 워크플ロー 자동화","sharp edge 문제 해결을 사용하여 Azure Functions 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar APIs sin servidor con Azure Functions","Automatizar flujos de trabajo utilizando desencadenadores de Azure Functions","Depurar Azure Functions con resolución de problemas de borde afilado"],"fr":["Déployer des API sans serveur avec Azure Functions","Automatiser les flux de travail à l''aide de déclencheurs Azure Functions","Déboguer Azure Functions avec une résolution de problèmes de pointe"],"de":["Bereitstellen von serverlosen APIs mit Azure Functions","Automatisieren von Workflows mit Azure Functions-Trigger","Debuggen von Azure Functions mit scharfer Problemlösung"],"pt":["Implantação de APIs sem servidor com Azure Functions","Automatização de fluxos de trabalho usando gatilhos Azure Functions","Depuração de Azure Functions com resolução de problemas de borda afiada"],"ru":["Развертывание серверных API с Azure Functions","Автоматизация рабочих процессов с помощью триггеров Azure Functions","Отладка Azure Functions с резким краем разрешения проблем"],"ar":["نشر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات خالية من الخادم مع Azure Functions","آليّة سير العمل باستخدام محفزات Azure Functions","تصحيح Azure Functions مع حل حاد الحواف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure subscription","Limited to specific programming models (.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)","Avoids In-Process Model for new projects"],"zh":["需要Azure订阅","仅限于特定的编程模型(.NET、Node.js v4、Python v2)","新项目中避免使用In-Process模型"],"ja":["Azureサブスクリプションが必要","特定のプログラミングモデル(.NET、Node.js v4、Python v2)のみ","新規プロジェクトではIn-Processモデルを避ける"],"ko":["Azure 구독이 필요","특정 프로그래밍 모델(.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)만 해당","새 프로젝트에서는 In-Process 모델 사용 안 함"],"es":["Requiere suscripción de Azure","Limitado a modelos de programación específicos (.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)","Evita el modelo de proceso en el mismo proceso para nuevos proyectos"],"fr":["Nécessite un abonnement Azure","Limité à des modèles de programmation spécifiques (.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)","Évite le modèle de processus en cours de nouveaux projets"],"de":["Benötigt Azure-Abonnement","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Programmiermodelle (.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)","Vermeidet das In-Process-Modell für neue Projekte"],"pt":["Exige assinatura do Azure","Limitado a modelos de programação específicos (.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)","Evita o Modelo de Processo para novos projetos"],"ru":["Требует подписки Azure","Ограничен конкретными моделями программирования (.NET, Node.js v4, Python v2)","Избегает Модели Процесса для новых проектов"],"ar":["يتطلب اشتراك Azure","محدود بنماذج برمجة محددة (.NET و Node.js v4 و Python v2)","يتجنب نموذج العملية لمشاريع جديدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
