del usuario"],"fr":["flux d''inscription","amélioration du flux d''inscription","réduction de la friction","taux d''achèvement","activation des utilisateurs","développement de logiciels","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Registrierungsfluss","Optimierung des Registrierungsflusses","Reduzierung der Reibung","Abschlussraten","Aktivierung von Benutzern","Software-Entwicklung","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["otimização de fluxo de cadastro","redução de fricção","aumento de taxas de conclusão","experiência do usuário","design de interface","otimização para dispositivos móveis","fluxo de cadastro","cadastro de usuário"],"ru":["оптимизация потока регистрации","снижение трения","повышение показателей завершения","пользовательский опыт","дизайн интерфейса","оптимизация для мобильных устройств","поток регистрации","регистрация пользователя"],"ar":["تحسين تدفق التسجيل","تقليل الاحتكاك","زيادة معدلات الإكمال","تجربة المستخدم","تصميم الواجهة","تحسين للجهاز المحمول","تدفق التسجيل","تسجيل المستخدم"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"signup-flow-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize signup, registration, account creation, or trial activation flows. Also use when the user mentions signup conversions, registration friction, signup form optimization, free trial signup, reduce signup dropoff, or account creation flow. For post-signup onboarding, see onboarding-cro. For lead capture forms (not account creation), see form-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Signup Flow CRO\n\nYou are an expert in optimizing signup and registration flows. Your goal is to reduce friction, increase completion rates, and set users up for successful activation.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Flow Type**\n   - Free trial signup\n   - Freemium account creation\n   - Paid account creation\n   - Waitlist/early access signup\n   - B2B vs B2C\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - How many steps/screens?\n   - What fields are required?\n   - What''s t","body":"# Signup Flow CRO\n\nYou are an expert in optimizing signup and registration flows. Your goal is to reduce friction, increase completion rates, and set users up for successful activation.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Flow Type**\n   - Free trial signup\n   - Freemium account creation\n   - Paid account creation\n   - Waitlist/early access signup\n   - B2B vs B2C\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - How many steps/screens?\n   - What fields are required?\n   - What''s the current completion rate?\n   - Where do users drop off?\n\n3. **Business Constraints**\n   - What data is genuinely needed at signup?\n   - Are there compliance requirements?\n   - What happens immediately after signup?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Minimize Required Fields\nEvery field reduces conversion. For each field, ask:\n- Do we absolutely need this before they can use the product?\n- Can we collect this later through progressive profiling?\n- Can we infer this from other data?\n\n**Typical field priority:**\n- Essential: Email (or phone), Password\n- Often needed: Name\n- Usually deferrable: Company, Role, Team size, Phone, Address\n\n### 2. Show Value Before Asking for Commitment\n- What can you show/give before requiring signup?\n- Can they experience the product before creating an account?\n- Reverse the order: value first, signup second\n\n### 3. Reduce Perceived Effort\n- Show progress if multi-step\n- Group related fields\n- Use smart defaults\n- Pre-fill when possible\n\n### 4. Remove Uncertainty\n- Clear expectations (\"Takes 30 seconds\")\n- Show what happens after signup\n- No surprises (hidden requirements, unexpected steps)\n\n---\n\n## Field-by-Field Optimization\n\n### Email Field\n- Single field (no email confirmation field)\n- Inline validation for format\n- Check for common typos (gmial.com → gmail.com)\n- Clear error messages\n\n### Password Field\n- Show password toggle (eye icon)\n- Show requirements upfront, not after failure\n- Consider passphrase hints for strength\n- Update requirement indicators in real-time\n\n**Better password UX:**\n- Allow paste (don''t disable)\n- Show strength meter instead of rigid rules\n- Consider passwordless options\n\n### Name Field\n- Single \"Full name\" field vs. First/Last split (test this)\n- Only require if immediately used (personalization)\n- Consider making optional\n\n### Social Auth Options\n- Place prominently (often higher conversion than email)\n- Show most relevant options for your audience\n  - B2C: Google, Apple, Facebook\n  - B2B: Google, Microsoft, SSO\n- Clear visual separation from email signup\n- Consider \"Sign up with Google\" as primary\n\n### Phone Number\n- Defer unless essential (SMS verification, calling leads)\n- If required, explain why\n- Use proper input type with country code handling\n- Format as they type\n\n### Company/Organization\n- Defer if possible\n- Auto-suggest as they type\n- Infer from email domain when possible\n\n### Use Case / Role Questions\n- Defer to onboarding if possible\n- If needed at signup, keep to one question\n- Use progressive disclosure (don''t show all options at once)\n\n---\n\n## Single-Step vs. Multi-Step\n\n### Single-Step Works When:\n- 3 or fewer fields\n- Simple B2C products\n- High-intent visitors (from ads, waitlist)\n\n### Multi-Step Works When:\n- More than 3-4 fields needed\n- Complex B2B products needing segmentation\n- You need to collect different types of info\n\n### Multi-Step Best Practices\n- Show progress indicator\n- Lead with easy questions (name, email)\n- Put harder questions later (after psychological commitment)\n- Each step should feel completable in seconds\n- Allow back navigation\n- Save progress (don''t lose data on refresh)\n\n**Progressive commitment pattern:**\n1. Email only (lowest barrier)\n2. Password + name\n3. Customization questions (optional)\n\n---\n\n## Trust and Friction Reduction\n\n### At the Form Level\n- \"No credit card required\" (if true)\n- \"Free forever\" or \"14-day free trial\"\n- Privacy note: \"We''ll never share your email\"\n- Security badges if relevant\n- Testimonial near signup form\n\n### Error Handling\n- Inline validation (not just on submit)\n- Specific error messages (\"Email already registered\" + recovery path)\n- Don''t clear the form on error\n- Focus on the problem field\n\n### Microcopy\n- Placeholder text: Use for examples, not labels\n- Labels: Always visible (not just placeholders)\n- Help text: Only when needed, placed close to field\n\n---\n\n## Mobile Signup Optimization\n\n- Larger touch targets (44px+ height)\n- Appropriate keyboard types (email, tel, etc.)\n- Autofill support\n- Reduce typing (social auth, pre-fill)\n- Single column layout\n- Sticky CTA button\n- Test with actual devices\n\n---\n\n## Post-Submit Experience\n\n### Success State\n- Clear confirmation\n- Immediate next step\n- If email verification required:\n  - Explain what to do\n  - Easy resend option\n  - Check spam reminder\n  - Option to change email if wrong\n\n### Verification Flows\n- Consider delaying verification until necessary\n- Magic link as alternative to password\n- Let users explore while awaiting verification\n- Clear re-engagement if verification stalls\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- Form start rate (landed → started filling)\n- Form completion rate (started → submitted)\n- Field-level drop-off (which fields lose people)\n- Time to complete\n- Error rate by field\n- Mobile vs. desktop completion\n\n### What to Track\n- Each field interaction (focus, blur, error)\n- Step progression in multi-step\n- Social auth vs. email signup ratio\n- Time between steps\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Findings\nFor each issue found:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: Why it matters (with estimated impact if possible)\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Recommended Changes\nOrganized by:\n1. Quick wins (same-day fixes)\n2. High-impact changes (week-level effort)\n3. Test hypotheses (things to A/B test)\n\n### Form Redesign (if requested)\n- Recommended field set with rationale\n- Field order\n- Copy for labels, placeholders, buttons, errors\n- Visual layout suggestions\n\n---\n\n## Common Signup Flow Patterns\n\n### B2B SaaS Trial\n1. Email + Password (or Google auth)\n2. Name + Company (optional: role)\n3. → Onboarding flow\n\n### B2C App\n1. Google/Apple auth OR Email\n2. → Product experience\n3. Profile completion later\n\n### Waitlist/Early Access\n1. Email only\n2. Optional: Role/use case question\n3. → Waitlist confirmation\n\n### E-commerce Account\n1. Guest checkout as default\n2. Account creation optional post-purchase\n3. OR Social auth with single click\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Form Design Experiments\n\n**Layout & Structure**\n- Single-step vs. multi-step signup flow\n- Multi-step with progress bar vs. without\n- 1-column vs. 2-column field layout\n- Form embedded on page vs. separate signup page\n- Horizontal vs. vertical field alignment\n\n**Field Optimization**\n- Reduce to minimum fields (email + password only)\n- Add or remove phone number field\n- Single \"Name\" field vs. \"First/Last\" split\n- Add or remove company/organization field\n- Test required vs. optional field balance\n\n**Authentication Options**\n- Add SSO options (Google, Microsoft, GitHub, LinkedIn)\n- SSO prominent vs. email form prominent\n- Test which SSO options resonate (varies by audience)\n- SSO-only vs. SSO + email option\n\n**Visual Design**\n- Test button colors and sizes for CTA prominence\n- Plain background vs. product-related visuals\n- Test form container styling (card vs. minimal)\n- Mobile-optimized layout testing\n\n---\n\n### Copy & Messaging Experiments\n\n**Headlines & CTAs**\n- Test headline variations above signup form\n- CTA button text: \"Create Account\" vs. \"Start Free Trial\" vs. \"Get Started\"\n- Add clarity around trial length in CTA\n- Test value proposition emphasis in form header\n\n**Microcopy**\n- Field labels: minimal vs. descriptive\n- Placeholder text optimization\n- Error message clarity and tone\n- Password requirement display (upfront vs. on error)\n\n**Trust Elements**\n- Add social proof next to signup form\n- Test trust badges near form (security, compliance)\n- Add \"No credit card required\" messaging\n- Include privacy assurance copy\n\n---\n\n### Trial & Commitment Experiments\n\n**Free Trial Variations**\n- Credit card required vs. not required for trial\n- Test trial length impact (7 vs. 14 vs. 30 days)\n- Freemium vs. free trial model\n- Trial with limited features vs. full access\n\n**Friction Points**\n- Email verification required vs. delayed vs. removed\n- Test CAPTCHA impact on completion\n- Terms acceptance checkbox vs. implicit acceptance\n- Phone verification for high-value accounts\n\n---\n\n### Post-Submit Experiments\n\n- Clear next steps messaging after signup\n- Instant product access vs. email confirmation first\n- Personalized welcome message based on signup data\n- Auto-login after signup vs. require login\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What''s your current signup completion rate?\n2. Do you have field-level analytics on drop-off?\n3. What data is absolutely required before they can use the product?\n4. Are there compliance or verification requirements?\n5. What happens immediately after signup?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **onboarding-cro**: For optimizing what happens after signup\n- **form-cro**: For non-signup forms (lead capture, contact)\n- **page-cro**: For the landing page leading to signup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing signup flow changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:40:24.529Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversion Rate Optimization Agents needing advanced signup flow analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级注册流分析和优化能力的转化率优化代理。","ja":"登録フロー分析と最適化の高度な機能が必要なコンバージョン率最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급_signup_흐름 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 전환률 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de la tasa de conversión que necesitan un análisis y capacidades de optimización de flujo de registro avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation du taux de conversion qui ont besoin d''une analyse et de capacités d''optimisation de flux d''inscription avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Conversion-Rate-Optimierungs-Agents, die eine erweiterte Analyse und Optimierungsfähigkeiten für Registrierungsflüsse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de fluxo de inscrição avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии, которым необходимы продвинутые анализ и возможности оптимизации потока регистрации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين معدل التحويل الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل وتحسين تدفق التسجيل المتقدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to reduce friction and increase completion rates in signup flows by analyzing flow types, such as free trial signup, freemium account creation, and paid account creation, and optimizing fields and steps for better user activation using protocols like B2B and B2C.","zh":"通过分析流类型（如免费试用注册、免费增值账户创建和付费账户创建）并优化字段和步骤以提高用户激活率（使用B2B和B2C协议），赋予代理人减少注册流中摩擦并提高完成率的能力。","ja":"フリートライアル登録、フリーミアムアカウント作成、有料アカウント作成などのフロー型を分析し、B2BやB2Cなどのプロトコルを使用してフィールドやステップを最適化することで、ユーザーのアクティベーション率を向上させ、エージェントが登録フローでのフリクションを減らし、完了率を向上させる能力を提供します。","ko":"프리 트라이얼 등록, 프리미엄 계정 생성, 유료 계정 생성 등의 흐름 유형을 분석하고 B2B 및 B2C와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 필드 및 단계를 최적화하여 사용자 활성화 비율을提高하고 에이전트가 등록 흐름에서 마찰을 줄이고 완료 비율을提高하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a reducir la fricción y aumentar las tasas de finalización en los flujos de registro analizando los tipos de flujo, como la inscripción en una versión de prueba gratuita, la creación de una cuenta freemium y la creación de una cuenta de pago, y optimizando campos y pasos para una mejor activación del usuario utilizando protocolos como B2B y B2C.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réduire les frictions et d''augmenter les taux d''achèvement dans les flux d''inscription en analysant les types de flux, tels que l''inscription à une version d''essai gratuite, la création d''un compte freemium et la création d''un compte payant, et en optimisant les champs et les étapes pour une meilleure activation de l''utilisateur en utilisant des protocoles tels que B2B et B2C.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Reibungsverluste zu reduzieren und Abschlussraten in Registrierungsflüssen zu erhöhen, indem sie Flussarten analysieren, wie z.B. die Registrierung für eine kostenlose Testversion, die Erstellung eines Freemium-Kontos und die Erstellung eines kostenpflichtigen Kontos, und Felder und Schritte für eine bessere Nutzeraktivierung mithilfe von Protokollen wie B2B und B2C optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reduzir a fricção e aumentar as taxas de conclusão nos fluxos de inscrição, analisando tipos de fluxo, como inscrição para teste gratuito, criação de conta freemium e criação de conta paga, e otimizando campos e etapas para melhor ativação do usuário usando protocolos como B2B e B2C.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью снижать трение и увеличивать уровень завершения в потоках регистрации, анализируя типы потоков, такие как регистрация на бесплатную пробную версию, создание учетной записи freemium и создание платной учетной записи, и оптимизируя поля и шаги для лучшей активации пользователей с использованием протоколов như B2B и B2C.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقليل الاحتكاك وزيادة معدلات الاستكمال في تدفقات التسجيل من خلال تحليل أنواع التدفقات، مثل التسجيل للاختبار المجاني، وإنشاء حساب Freemium وإنشاء حساب مدفوع، وتحسين الحقول والخطوات لتنشيط المستخدم بشكل أفضل باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل B2B و B2C."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing waitlist/early access signup flows","Optimizing freemium account creation processes","Reducing friction in paid account creation"],"zh":["分析等待名单/提前访问注册流程","优化免费增值账户创建流程","减少付费账户创建中的摩擦"],"ja":["ウェイティングリスト/早期アクセス登録フローの分析","フリーミアムアカウント作成プロセスの最適化","有料アカウント作成でのフリクションの軽減"],"ko":["대기자/초기 접근注册_흐름 분석","프리미엄 계정 생성 프로세스 최적화","유료 계정 생성에서 마찰 감소"],"es":["Análisis de flujos de registro de lista de espera / acceso temprano","Optimización de procesos de creación de cuentas freemium","Reducción de la fricción en la creación de cuentas de pago"],"fr":["Analyse des flux d''inscription de liste d''attente / accès anticipé","Optimisation des processus de création de comptes freemium","Réduction des frictions dans la création de comptes payants"],"de":["Analyse von Warteliste-/Frühzugang-Registrierungsflüssen","Optimierung von Freemium-Kontoerstellungsprozessen","Reduzierung von Reibungsverlusten bei der Erstellung von kostenpflichtigen Konten"],"pt":["Analisar fluxos de inscrição para lista de espera / acesso antecipado","Otimizar processos de criação de conta freemium","Reduzir fricção na criação de conta paga"],"ru":["Анализ потоков регистрации на список ожидания / ранний доступ","Оптимизация процессов создания учетной записи freemium","Снижение трения при создании платной учетной записи"],"ar":["تحليل تدفقات التسجيل لقائمة الانتظار / الوصول المبكر","تحسين عمليات إنشاء حساب Freemium","تقليل الاحتكاك في إنشاء حساب مدفوع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of flow types and current state","Limited to signup and registration flows"],"zh":["需要了解流类型和当前状态","仅限注册和注册流程"],"ja":["フロー型と現在の状態を理解する必要がある","登録と登録フローに限定される"],"ko":["흐름 유형 및 현재 상태를 이해해야 함","등록 및 등록 흐름에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los tipos de flujo y del estado actual","Limitado a flujos de registro y registro"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des types de flux et de l''état actuel","Limité aux flux d''inscription et d''enregistrement"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von Flussarten und aktuellem Zustand","Begrenzt auf Registrierungs- und Anmeldeflüsse"],"pt":["Exige entendimento dos tipos de fluxo e do estado atual","Limitado a fluxos de inscrição e registro"],"ru":["Требует понимания типов потоков и текущего состояния","Ограничен потоками регистрации и регистрации"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لأنواع التدفقات والحالة الحالية","محدود بتدفقات التسجيل والتسجيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
