"Создайте ботов Slack с легкостью","ar":"ابني بوتات سلاك بسهولة","en":"slack-bot-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Slack Bot Builder 是一种构建自定义 Slack 应用的框架，提供身份验证、事件路由和 HTTP 请求处理等功能","ja":"Slack Bot Builder はカスタム Slack アプリを構築するためのフレームワークで、認証、イベント ルーティング、HTTP リクエスト処理などの機能を提供","ko":"Slack Bot Builder는 맞춤형 Slack 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 프레임워크로 인증, 이벤트 라우팅, HTTP 요청 처리 등의 기능을 제공","es":"El constructor de bots de Slack es una herramienta para crear aplicaciones personalizadas. Bolt es el framework recomendado por Slack para desarrollar aplica...","fr":"Le constructeur de bots Slack est un outil pour créer des applications personnalisées. Bolt est le framework recommandé par Slack pour développer des applica...","de":"Der Slack-Bot-Builder ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Anwendungen. Bolt ist das von Slack empfohlene Framework für die Entwicklung von Anw...","pt":"O Slack Bot Builder é uma ferramenta para criar bots do Slack de forma rápida e segura. Ele fornece um framework para desenvolver aplicações de forma eficiente.","ru":"Slack Bot Builder - это инструмент для создания ботов Slack быстро и безопасно. Он предоставляет фреймворк для разработки приложений эффективно.","ar":"Slack Bot Builder هو أداة لإنشاء بوتات سلاك بسرعة وأمان. يوفر إطارًا لإنشاء التطبيقات بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["简化身份验证和事件路由","提供 HTTP 请求处理和安全检查","支持 Python、JavaScript 和 Java","适用于实验和生产环境","提供组织化和一致的模式"],"ja":["認証とイベント ルーティングを簡素化","HTTP リクエスト処理とセキュリティ チェックを提供","Python、JavaScript、Java をサポート","実験と生产環境に適している","組織化と一貫性のあるパターンを提供"],"ko":["인증과 이벤트 라우팅을 간소화","HTTP 요청 처리와 보안 검사를 제공","Python, JavaScript, Java를 지원","실험과 생산 환경에 적합","조직화와 일관된 패턴을 제공"],"es":["Manejo de eventos en pocas líneas de código","Comprobaciones de seguridad y validación de carga incorporadas","Patrones organizados y coherentes","Funciona para experimentos y producción","Disponible en Python, JavaScript (Node.js) y Java"],"fr":["Gestion d''événements en quelques lignes de code","Vérifications de sécurité et validation de charge intégrées","Modèles organisés et cohérents","Fonctionne pour les expériences et la production","Disponible en Python, JavaScript (Node.js) et Java"],"de":["Ereignishandling in wenigen Codezeilen","Sicherheitsüberprüfungen und Payload-Validierung integriert","Organisierte und konsistente Muster","Funktioniert für Experimente und Produktion","Verfügbar in Python, JavaScript (Node.js) und Java"],"pt":["Tratamento de eventos em poucas linhas de código","Verificação de segurança e validação de payload integradas","Padrões organizados e consistentes","Funciona para experimentos e produção","Disponível em Python, JavaScript (Node.js) e Java"],"ru":["Обработка событий в нескольких строках кода","Встроенная проверка безопасности и валидация payload","Организованные и последовательные шаблоны","Работает для экспериментов и производства","Доступно на Python, JavaScript (Node.js) и Java"],"ar":["معالجة الأحداث في بضعة أسطر من الشفرة","تحقق أمان مدمج وتحقق.payload","أنماط منظمة ومستمرة","يعمل لل exper و الإنتاج","متوفر على Python و JavaScript (Node.js) و Java"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slack Bot Builder","自定义 Slack 应用","身份验证","事件路由","HTTP 请求处理","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"ja":["Slack Bot Builder","カスタム Slack アプリ","認証","イベント ルーティング","HTTP リクエスト処理","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"ko":["Slack Bot Builder","맞춤형 Slack 애플리케이션","인증","이벤트 라우팅","HTTP 요청 처리","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"es":["bot de Slack","constructor de bots de Slack","Bolt","framework de Slack","desarrollo de aplicaciones","aplicaciones personalizadas","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"fr":["bot Slack","constructeur de bots Slack","Bolt","framework Slack","développement d''applications","applications personnalisées","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"de":["Slack-Bot","Slack-Bot-Builder","Bolt","Slack-Framework","Anwendungsentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Anwendungen","Python","JavaScript","Java"],"pt":["Slack Bot Builder","desenvolvimento de bots","aplicações do Slack","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","segurança de aplicações","framework de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Slack Bot Builder","разработка ботов","приложения Slack","инструменты разработки","безопасность приложений","фреймворк разработки"],"ar":["Slack Bot Builder","تطوير البوتات","تطبيقات سلاك","أدوات التطوير","أمان التطبيقات","إطار التطوير"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-bot-builder","description":"Build Slack apps using the Bolt framework across Python, JavaScript, and Java. Covers Block Kit for rich UIs, interactive components, slash commands, event handling, OAuth installation flows, and Workflow Builder integration. Focus on best practices for production-ready Slack apps. Use when: slack bot, slack app, bolt framework, block kit, slash command.","bodyPreview":"# Slack Bot Builder\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Bolt App Foundation Pattern\n\nThe Bolt framework is Slack''s recommended approach for building apps.\nIt handles authentication, event routing, request verification, and\nHTTP request processing so you can focus on app logic.\n\nKey benefits:\n- Event handling in a few lines of code\n- Security checks and payload validation built-in\n- Organized, consistent patterns\n- Works for experiments and production\n\nAvailable in: Python, JavaScript (Node.js), Java\n\n\n**When to u","body":"# Slack Bot Builder\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Bolt App Foundation Pattern\n\nThe Bolt framework is Slack''s recommended approach for building apps.\nIt handles authentication, event routing, request verification, and\nHTTP request processing so you can focus on app logic.\n\nKey benefits:\n- Event handling in a few lines of code\n- Security checks and payload validation built-in\n- Organized, consistent patterns\n- Works for experiments and production\n\nAvailable in: Python, JavaScript (Node.js), Java\n\n\n**When to use**: [''Starting any new Slack app'', ''Migrating from legacy Slack APIs'', ''Building production Slack integrations'']\n\n```python\n# Python Bolt App\nfrom slack_bolt import App\nfrom slack_bolt.adapter.socket_mode import SocketModeHandler\nimport os\n\n# Initialize with tokens from environment\napp = App(\n    token=os.environ[\"SLACK_BOT_TOKEN\"],\n    signing_secret=os.environ[\"SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET\"]\n)\n\n# Handle messages containing \"hello\"\n@app.message(\"hello\")\ndef handle_hello(message, say):\n    \"\"\"Respond to messages containing ''hello''.\"\"\"\n    user = message[\"user\"]\n    say(f\"Hey there <@{user}>!\")\n\n# Handle slash command\n@app.command(\"/ticket\")\ndef handle_ticket_command(ack, body, client):\n    \"\"\"Handle /ticket slash command.\"\"\"\n    # Acknowledge immediately (within 3 seconds)\n    ack()\n\n    # Open a modal for ticket creation\n    client.views_open(\n        trigger_id=body[\"trigger_id\"],\n        view={\n            \"type\": \"modal\",\n            \"callback_id\": \"ticket_modal\",\n            \"title\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Create Ticket\"},\n            \"submit\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Submit\"},\n            \"blocks\": [\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"input\",\n                    \"block_id\": \"title_block\",\n                    \"element\": {\n                        \"type\": \"plain_text_input\",\n                        \"action_id\": \"title_input\"\n                    },\n                    \"label\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Title\"}\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"input\",\n                    \"block_id\": \"desc_block\",\n                    \"element\": {\n                        \"type\": \"plain_text_input\",\n                        \"multiline\": True,\n                        \"action_id\": \"desc_input\"\n                    },\n                    \"label\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Description\"}\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"input\",\n                    \"block_id\": \"priority_block\",\n                    \"element\": {\n                        \"type\": \"static_select\",\n                        \"action_id\": \"priority_select\",\n   \n```\n\n### Block Kit UI Pattern\n\nBlock Kit is Slack''s UI framework for building rich, interactive messages.\nCompose messages using blocks (sections, actions, inputs) and elements\n(buttons, menus, text inputs).\n\nLimits:\n- Up to 50 blocks per message\n- Up to 100 blocks in modals/Home tabs\n- Block text limited to 3000 characters\n\nUse Block Kit Builder to prototype: https://app.slack.com/block-kit-builder\n\n\n**When to use**: [''Building rich message layouts'', ''Adding interactive components to messages'', ''Creating forms in modals'', ''Building Home tab experiences'']\n\n```python\nfrom slack_bolt import App\nimport os\n\napp = App(token=os.environ[\"SLACK_BOT_TOKEN\"])\n\ndef build_notification_blocks(incident: dict) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Build Block Kit blocks for incident notification.\"\"\"\n    severity_emoji = {\n        \"critical\": \":red_circle:\",\n        \"high\": \":large_orange_circle:\",\n        \"medium\": \":large_yellow_circle:\",\n        \"low\": \":white_circle:\"\n    }\n\n    return [\n        # Header\n        {\n            \"type\": \"header\",\n            \"text\": {\n                \"type\": \"plain_text\",\n                \"text\": f\"{severity_emoji.get(incident[''severity''], '''')} Incident Alert\"\n            }\n        },\n        # Details section\n        {\n            \"type\": \"section\",\n            \"fields\": [\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Incident:*\\n{incident[''title'']}\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Severity:*\\n{incident[''severity''].upper()}\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Service:*\\n{incident[''service'']}\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                    \"text\": f\"*Reported:*\\n<!date^{incident[''timestamp'']}^{date_short} {time}|{incident[''timestamp'']}>\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        # Description\n        {\n            \"type\": \"section\",\n            \"text\": {\n                \"type\": \"mrkdwn\",\n                \"text\": f\"*Description:*\\n{incident[''description''][:2000]}\"\n            }\n        },\n        # Divider\n        {\"type\": \"divider\"},\n        # Action buttons\n        {\n            \"type\": \"actions\",\n            \"block_id\": f\"incident_actions_{incident[''id'']}\",\n            \"elements\": [\n                {\n                    \"type\": \"button\",\n                    \"text\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"Acknowledge\"},\n                    \"style\": \"primary\",\n                    \"action_id\": \"acknowle\n```\n\n### OAuth Installation Pattern\n\nEnable users to install your app in their workspaces via OAuth 2.0.\nBolt handles most of the OAuth flow, but you need to configure it\nand store tokens securely.\n\nKey OAuth concepts:\n- Scopes define permissions (request minimum needed)\n- Tokens are workspace-specific\n- Installation data must be stored persistently\n- Users can add scopes later (additive)\n\n70% of users abandon installation when confronted with excessive\npermission requests - request only what you need!\n\n\n**When to use**: [''Distributing app to multiple workspaces'', ''Building public Slack apps'', ''Enterprise-grade integrations'']\n\n```python\nfrom slack_bolt import App\nfrom slack_bolt.oauth.oauth_settings import OAuthSettings\nfrom slack_sdk.oauth.installation_store import FileInstallationStore\nfrom slack_sdk.oauth.state_store import FileOAuthStateStore\nimport os\n\n# For production, use database-backed stores\n# For example: PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis\n\nclass DatabaseInstallationStore:\n    \"\"\"Store installation data in your database.\"\"\"\n\n    async def save(self, installation):\n        \"\"\"Save installation when user completes OAuth.\"\"\"\n        await db.installations.upsert({\n            \"team_id\": installation.team_id,\n            \"enterprise_id\": installation.enterprise_id,\n            \"bot_token\": encrypt(installation.bot_token),\n            \"bot_user_id\": installation.bot_user_id,\n            \"bot_scopes\": installation.bot_scopes,\n            \"user_id\": installation.user_id,\n            \"installed_at\": installation.installed_at\n        })\n\n    async def find_installation(self, *, enterprise_id, team_id, user_id=None, is_enterprise_install=False):\n        \"\"\"Find installation for a workspace.\"\"\"\n        record = await db.installations.find_one({\n            \"team_id\": team_id,\n            \"enterprise_id\": enterprise_id\n        })\n\n        if record:\n            return Installation(\n                bot_token=decrypt(record[\"bot_token\"]),\n                # ... other fields\n            )\n        return None\n\n# Initialize OAuth-enabled app\napp = App(\n    signing_secret=os.environ[\"SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET\"],\n    oauth_settings=OAuthSettings(\n        client_id=os.environ[\"SLACK_CLIENT_ID\"],\n        client_secret=os.environ[\"SLACK_CLIENT_SECRET\"],\n        scopes=[\n            \"channels:history\",\n            \"channels:read\",\n            \"chat:write\",\n            \"commands\",\n            \"users:read\"\n        ],\n        user_scopes=[],  # User token scopes if needed\n        installation_store=DatabaseInstallationStore(),\n        state_store=FileOAuthStateStore(expiration_seconds=600)\n    )\n)\n\n# OAuth routes are handled a\n```\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | ## Acknowledge immediately, process later |\n| Issue | critical | ## Proper state validation |\n| Issue | critical | ## Never hardcode or log tokens |\n| Issue | high | ## Request minimum required scopes |\n| Issue | medium | ## Know and respect the limits |\n| Issue | high | ## Socket Mode: Only for development |\n| Issue | critical | ## Bolt handles this automatically |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:41:01.899Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Agents needing to deploy and manage Slack integrations using Bolt framework patterns.","zh":"适用于需要使用Bolt框架模式部署和管理Slack集成的AI代理。","ja":"Boltフレームワークパターンを使用してSlack統合をデプロイおよび管理する必要があるAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Bolt 프레임워크 패턴을 사용하여 Slack 통합을 배포 및 관리해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA que necesitan implementar y gestionar integraciones de Slack utilizando patrones de framework Bolt.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de déployer et de gérer des intégrations Slack en utilisant des modèles de framework Bolt.","de":"Wesentlich für AI-Agents, die Slack-Integrationen mithilfe von Bolt-Framework-Mustern bereitstellen und verwalten müssen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA que precisam implantar e gerenciar integrações do Slack usando padrões do framework Bolt.","ru":"Необходимо для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется развертывать и управлять интеграциями Slack с использованием шаблонов фреймворка Bolt.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر وإدارة تكاملات Slack باستخدام أنماط إطار عمل Bolt."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables rapid Slack bot deployment with built-in authentication, event routing, and request verification. Provides structured Bolt framework patterns for both Python and JavaScript environments, handling security checks and HTTP processing automatically.","zh":"实现快速的Slack机器人部署，具有内置的身份验证、事件路由和请求验证。为Python和JavaScript环境提供结构化的Bolt框架模式，自动处理安全检查和HTTP处理。","ja":"ビルトインの認証、イベントルーティング、およびリクエストの検証を備えたSlackボットの迅速なデプロイを可能にします。PythonおよびJavaScript環境の両方で構造化されたBoltフレームワークパターンを提供し、セキュリティチェックとHTTP処理を自動的に処理します。","ko":"내장 인증, 이벤트 라우팅 및 요청 검증을備えた 슬랙 봇의 빠른 배포를 가능하게 합니다. 파이썬 및 자바스크립트 환경 모두에서 구조화된 볼트 프레임워크 패턴을 제공하며 보안 검사 및 HTTP 처리를 자동으로 처리합니다.","es":"Permite el despliegue rápido de bots de Slack con autenticación integrada, enrutamiento de eventos y verificación de solicitudes. Proporciona patrones de framework Bolt estructurados tanto para entornos Python como JavaScript, manejando automáticamente las comprobaciones de seguridad y el procesamiento HTTP.","fr":"Permet un déploiement rapide de bots Slack avec une authentification intégrée, un routage d''événements et une vérification de requêtes. Fournit des modèles de framework Bolt structurés pour les environnements Python et JavaScript, gérant automatiquement les vérifications de sécurité et le traitement HTTP.","de":"Ermöglicht ein schnelles Bereitstellen von Slack-Bots mit integrierter Authentifizierung, Ereignisweiterleitung und Anfrageüberprüfung. Bietet strukturierte Bolt-Framework-Muster für Python- und JavaScript-Umgebungen, die Sicherheitsprüfungen und HTTP-Verarbeitung automatisch durchführen.","pt":"Permite a implantação rápida de bots no Slack com autenticação integrada, roteamento de eventos e verificação de solicitações. Fornece padrões estruturados do framework Bolt para ambientes Python e JavaScript, tratando automaticamente verificações de segurança e processamento HTTP.","ru":"Обеспечивает быстрое развертывание ботов в Slack со встроенной аутентификацией, маршрутизацией событий и проверкой запросов. Предоставляет структурированные шаблоны фреймворка Bolt для сред Python и JavaScript, автоматически обрабатывая проверки безопасности и HTTP-обработку.","ar":"يتيح النشر السريع لروبوتات Slack مع المصادقة المضمنة، وتوجيه الأحداث، والتحقق من الطلبات. يوفر أنماطًا منظمة لإطار عمل Bolt لكل من بيئات Python وJavaScript، مع التعامل تلقائيًا مع الفحوصات الأمنية ومعالجة HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying event-driven Slack bots","Implementing secure authentication workflows","Routing Slack API events to agent logic","Building production-ready Slack integrations"],"zh":["部署事件驱动的Slack机器人","实现安全的身份验证工作流","将Slack API事件路由到代理逻辑","构建生产就绪的Slack集成"],"ja":["イベントドリブンのSlackボットをデプロイする","セキュアな認証ワークフローを実装する","Slack APIイベントをエージェントロジックにルーティングする","本番レディーのSlack統合を構築する"],"ko":["이벤트 驱动의 슬랙 봇을 배포한다","보안 인증 워크플로우를 구현한다","슬랙 API 이벤트를 에이전트 논리에게 라우팅한다","프로덕션 준비 슬랙 통합을 구축한다"],"es":["Implementación de bots de Slack orientados a eventos","Implementación de flujos de trabajo de autenticación seguros","Enrutamiento de eventos de la API de Slack a la lógica del agente","Creación de integraciones de Slack listas para producción"],"fr":["Déploiement de bots Slack à événements","Mise en œuvre de flux de travail d''authentification sécurisés","Acheminement d''événements d''API Slack vers la logique de l''agent","Conception d''intégrations Slack prêtes pour la production"],"de":["Bereitstellung von ereignisgesteuerten Slack-Bots","Implementierung sicherer Authentifizierungsworkflows","Weiterleitung von Slack-API-Ereignissen an die Agentenlogik","Erstellung von produktionsbereiten Slack-Integrationen"],"pt":["Implantação de bots Slack acionados por eventos","Implementação de fluxos de trabalho de autenticação seguros","Roteamento de eventos da API Slack para a lógica do agente","Criação de integrações Slack prontas para produção"],"ru":["Развертывание управляемых событиями ботов Slack","Реализация безопасных рабочих процессов аутентификации","Маршрутизация событий API Slack к логике агента","Создание готовых к эксплуатации интеграций Slack"],"ar":["نشر روبوتات Slack مدفوعة بالأحداث","تنفيذ سير عمل المصادقة الآمنة","توجيه أحداث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Slack إلى منطق الوكيل","بناء تكاملات Slack جاهزة للإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python or Node.js runtime","Slack-specific implementation only","Bolt framework dependency"],"zh":["需要Python或Node.js运行时","仅限Slack特定实现","依赖于Bolt框架"],"ja":["PythonまたはNode.jsのランタイムが必要","Slack特有の実装のみ","Boltフレームワークへの依存"],"ko":["파이썬 또는 노드 js 런타임이 필요","슬랙 특정 구현만","볼트 프레임워크 의존"],"es":["Requiere un tiempo de ejecución de Python o Node.js","Implementación específica de Slack solo","Dependencia del framework Bolt"],"fr":["Nécessite un runtime Python ou Node.js","Implémentation spécifique à Slack uniquement","Dépendance du framework Bolt"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python- oder Node.js-Laufzeitumgebung","Nur Slack-spezifische Implementierung","Abhängigkeit vom Bolt-Framework"],"pt":["Requer tempo de execução Python ou Node.js","Implementação específica apenas para Slack","Dependência do framework Bolt"],"ru":["Требует среду выполнения Python или Node.js","Только для реализации под Slack","Зависимость от фреймворка Bolt"],"ar":["يتطلب وقت تشغيل Python أو Node.js","تنفيذ مخصص لـ Slack فقط","الاعتماد على إطار عمل Bolt"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/ai-wrapper-product', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'ai-wrapper-product', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z', '2026-02-18T14:41:45.745Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/ai-wrapper-product","name":"ai-wrapper-product","description":{"zh":"AI","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"Este recurso para arquitectos de producto enseña a desarrollar wrappers de IA robustos que resuelven problemas reales. Cubre ingeniería de prompts, gestión de costes de API, medición de uso y selección de modelos para crear productos sostenibles y utilizados diariamente.","fr":"Cette ressource pour architectes produit enseigne à développer des wrappers IA robustes qui résolvent des problèmes réels. Elle couvre l''ingénierie de prompts, la gestion des coûts d''API, la mesure d''usage et la sélection de modèles pour créer des produits durables et utilisés quotidiennement.","de":"Diese Ressource für Produktarchitekten vermittelt die Entwicklung robuster KI-Wrapper, die echte Probleme lösen. Sie behandelt Prompt Engineering, API-Kostenmanagement, Nutzungsmessung und Modellauswahl für nachhaltige, täglich genutzte Produkte.","pt":"A arquitetura de produto AI envolve criar soluções inovadoras que resolvem problemas reais. Isso inclui engenharia de prompt, gestão de custos e experiência do usuário.","ru":"Архитектура ИИ-продукта предполагает создание инновационных решений, которые решают реальные проблемы. Это включает в себя инженерию запросов, управление затратами и опыт пользователя.","ar":"هندسة المنتج الذكي تتضمن إنشاء حلول مبتكرة تحل مشكلات حقيقية. هذا يشمل تحسين الطلبات وإدارة التكاليف وخبرة المستخدم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI Wrapper Product ","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"Arquitectura de Productos AI Wrapper para Desarrolladores","fr":"Architecture de Produits AI Wrapper pour Développeurs","de":"AI Wrapper Produktarchitektur für Entwickler","pt":"Arquitetura de Produto AI: Soluções Inovadoras","ru":"Архитектура ИИ-продукта: Инновационные решения","ar":"هندسة المنتج الذكي: حلول مبتكرة","en":"ai-wrapper-product"},"description":{"zh":"AI","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"Este recurso para arquitectos de producto enseña a desarrollar wrappers de IA robustos que resuelven problemas reales. Cubre ingeniería de prompts, gestión d...","fr":"Cette ressource pour architectes produit enseigne à développer des wrappers IA robustes qui résolvent des problèmes réels. Elle couvre l''ingénierie de prompt...","de":"Diese Ressource für Produktarchitekten vermittelt die Entwicklung robuster KI-Wrapper, die echte Probleme lösen. Sie behandelt Prompt Engineering, API-Kosten...","pt":"A arquitetura de produto AI envolve criar soluções inovadoras que resolvem problemas reais. Isso inclui engenharia de prompt, gestão de custos e experiência ...","ru":"Архитектура ИИ-продукта предполагает создание инновационных решений, которые решают реальные проблемы. Это включает в себя инженерию запросов, управление зат...","ar":"هندسة المنتج الذكي تتضمن إنشاء حلول مبتكرة تحل مشكلات حقيقية. هذا يشمل تحسين الطلبات وإدارة التكاليف وخبرة المستخدم.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["AI","API","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","API","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","API ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["Arquitectura de producto centrada en IA como motor de valor","Ingeniería de prompts aplicada al desarrollo de producto","Gestión y optimización de costes de API de modelos de IA","Sistemas de medición y métricas de uso de IA","Estrategias de selección de modelos para casos de uso específicos","Patrones de experiencia de usuario (UX) para productos de IA"],"fr":["Architecture produit centrée sur l''IA comme moteur de valeur","Ingénierie de prompts appliquée au développement produit","Gestion et optimisation des coûts des APIs de modèles d''IA","Systèmes de mesure et métriques d''usage de l''IA","Stratégies de sélection de modèles pour des cas d''usage spécifiques","Modèles d''expérience utilisateur (UX) pour produits IA"],"de":["Produktarchitektur mit KI als wertschöpfender Kern","Prompt Engineering für die Produktentwicklung","Verwaltung und Optimierung von KI-API-Kosten","Nutzungsmessung und Metriken für KI-Anwendungen","Strategien zur Modellauswahl für spezifische Use Cases","Nutzererfahrungsmuster (UX) für KI-Produkte"],"pt":["Arquitetura de produto AI","Engenharia de prompt","Gestão de custos","Medição de uso de IA","Seleção de modelos"],"ru":["Архитектура ИИ-продукта","Инженерия запросов","Управление затратами","Измерение использования ИИ","Выбор моделей"],"ar":["هندسة المنتج الذكي","تحسين الطلبات","إدارة التكاليف","قياس استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختيار النماذج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","AI","API","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","AI","API","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","AI ","API ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["arquitectura producto IA","ingenieria de prompts producto","gestion costes API IA","metering uso IA","seleccion modelos ML","patrones UX IA","desarrollo productos sostenibles IA","wrapper IA rentable"],"fr":["architecture produit IA","ingénierie de prompts produit","gestion coûts API IA","mesurage usage IA","sélection modèles ML","modèles UX IA","développement produits IA durables","wrapper IA rentable"],"de":["KI Produktarchitektur","Prompt Engineering Produkt","KI API Kostenmanagement","KI Nutzungsmessung","ML Modellauswahl","KI UX Muster","nachhaltige KI Produktentwicklung","wirtschaftlicher KI Wrapper"],"pt":["arquitetura de produto AI","engenharia de prompt","gestão de custos","desenvolvimento de produtos AI","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["архитектура ИИ-продукта","инженерия запросов","управление затратами","разработка ИИ-продуктов","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["هندسة المنتج الذكي","تحسين الطلبات","إدارة التكاليف","تطوير منتجات الذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-wrapper-product","description":"Expert in building products that wrap AI APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) into focused tools people will pay for. Not just ChatGPT but different - products that solve specific problems with AI. Covers prompt engineering for products, cost management, rate limiting, and building defensible AI businesses. Use when: AI wrapper, GPT product, AI tool, wrap AI, AI SaaS.","bodyPreview":"# AI Wrapper Product\n\n**Role**: AI Product Architect\n\nYou know AI wrappers get a bad rap, but the good ones solve real problems.\nYou build products where AI is the engine, not the gimmick. You understand\nprompt engineering is product development. You balance costs with user\nexperience. You create AI products people actually pay for and use daily.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- AI product architecture\n- Prompt engineering for products\n- API cost management\n- AI usage metering\n- Model selection\n- AI UX patte","body":"# AI Wrapper Product\n\n**Role**: AI Product Architect\n\nYou know AI wrappers get a bad rap, but the good ones solve real problems.\nYou build products where AI is the engine, not the gimmick. You understand\nprompt engineering is product development. You balance costs with user\nexperience. You create AI products people actually pay for and use daily.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- AI product architecture\n- Prompt engineering for products\n- API cost management\n- AI usage metering\n- Model selection\n- AI UX patterns\n- Output quality control\n- AI product differentiation\n\n## Patterns\n\n### AI Product Architecture\n\nBuilding products around AI APIs\n\n**When to use**: When designing an AI-powered product\n\n```python\n## AI Product Architecture\n\n### The Wrapper Stack\n```\nUser Input\n    ↓\nInput Validation + Sanitization\n    ↓\nPrompt Template + Context\n    ↓\nAI API (OpenAI/Anthropic/etc.)\n    ↓\nOutput Parsing + Validation\n    ↓\nUser-Friendly Response\n```\n\n### Basic Implementation\n```javascript\nimport Anthropic from ''@anthropic-ai/sdk'';\n\nconst anthropic = new Anthropic();\n\nasync function generateContent(userInput, context) {\n  // 1. Validate input\n  if (!userInput || userInput.length > 5000) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid input'');\n  }\n\n  // 2. Build prompt\n  const systemPrompt = `You are a ${context.role}.\n    Always respond in ${context.format}.\n    Tone: ${context.tone}`;\n\n  // 3. Call API\n  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({\n    model: ''claude-3-haiku-20240307'',\n    max_tokens: 1000,\n    system: systemPrompt,\n    messages: [{\n      role: ''user'',\n      content: userInput\n    }]\n  });\n\n  // 4. Parse and validate output\n  const output = response.content[0].text;\n  return parseOutput(output);\n}\n```\n\n### Model Selection\n| Model | Cost | Speed | Quality | Use Case |\n|-------|------|-------|---------|----------|\n| GPT-4o | $$$ | Fast | Best | Complex tasks |\n| GPT-4o-mini | $ | Fastest | Good | Most tasks |\n| Claude 3.5 Sonnet | $$ | Fast | Excellent | Balanced |\n| Claude 3 Haiku | $ | Fastest | Good | High volume |\n```\n\n### Prompt Engineering for Products\n\nProduction-grade prompt design\n\n**When to use**: When building AI product prompts\n\n```javascript\n## Prompt Engineering for Products\n\n### Prompt Template Pattern\n```javascript\nconst promptTemplates = {\n  emailWriter: {\n    system: `You are an expert email writer.\n      Write professional, concise emails.\n      Match the requested tone.\n      Never include placeholder text.`,\n    user: (input) => `Write an email:\n      Purpose: ${input.purpose}\n      Recipient: ${input.recipient}\n      Tone: ${input.tone}\n      Key points: ${input.points.join('', '')}\n      Length: ${input.length} sentences`,\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Output Control\n```javascript\n// Force structured output\nconst systemPrompt = `\n  Always respond with valid JSON in this format:\n  {\n    \"title\": \"string\",\n    \"content\": \"string\",\n    \"suggestions\": [\"string\"]\n  }\n  Never include any text outside the JSON.\n`;\n\n// Parse with fallback\nfunction parseAIOutput(text) {\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(text);\n  } catch {\n    // Fallback: extract JSON from response\n    const match = text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n    if (match) return JSON.parse(match[0]);\n    throw new Error(''Invalid AI output'');\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Quality Control\n| Technique | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Examples in prompt | Guide output style |\n| Output format spec | Consistent structure |\n| Validation | Catch malformed responses |\n| Retry logic | Handle failures |\n| Fallback models | Reliability |\n```\n\n### Cost Management\n\nControlling AI API costs\n\n**When to use**: When building profitable AI products\n\n```javascript\n## AI Cost Management\n\n### Token Economics\n```javascript\n// Track usage\nasync function callWithCostTracking(userId, prompt) {\n  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({...});\n\n  // Log usage\n  await db.usage.create({\n    userId,\n    inputTokens: response.usage.input_tokens,\n    outputTokens: response.usage.output_tokens,\n    cost: calculateCost(response.usage),\n    model: ''claude-3-haiku'',\n  });\n\n  return response;\n}\n\nfunction calculateCost(usage) {\n  const rates = {\n    ''claude-3-haiku'': { input: 0.25, output: 1.25 }, // per 1M tokens\n  };\n  const rate = rates[''claude-3-haiku''];\n  return (usage.input_tokens * rate.input +\n          usage.output_tokens * rate.output) / 1_000_000;\n}\n```\n\n### Cost Reduction Strategies\n| Strategy | Savings |\n|----------|---------|\n| Use cheaper models | 10-50x |\n| Limit output tokens | Variable |\n| Cache common queries | High |\n| Batch similar requests | Medium |\n| Truncate input | Variable |\n\n### Usage Limits\n```javascript\nasync function checkUsageLimits(userId) {\n  const usage = await db.usage.sum({\n    where: {\n      userId,\n      createdAt: { gte: startOfMonth() }\n    }\n  });\n\n  const limits = await getUserLimits(userId);\n  if (usage.cost >= limits.monthlyCost) {\n    throw new Error(''Monthly limit reached'');\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n```\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Thin Wrapper Syndrome\n\n**Why bad**: No differentiation.\nUsers just use ChatGPT.\nNo pricing power.\nEasy to replicate.\n\n**Instead**: Add domain expertise.\nPerfect the UX for specific task.\nIntegrate into workflows.\nPost-process outputs.\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Costs Until Scale\n\n**Why bad**: Surprise bills.\nNegative unit economics.\nCan''t price properly.\nBusiness isn''t viable.\n\n**Instead**: Track every API call.\nKnow your cost per user.\nSet usage limits.\nPrice with margin.\n\n### ❌ No Output Validation\n\n**Why bad**: AI hallucinates.\nInconsistent formatting.\nBad user experience.\nTrust issues.\n\n**Instead**: Validate all outputs.\nParse structured responses.\nHave fallback handling.\nPost-process for consistency.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| AI API costs spiral out of control | high | ## Controlling AI Costs |\n| App breaks when hitting API rate limits | high | ## Handling Rate Limits |\n| AI gives wrong or made-up information | high | ## Handling Hallucinations |\n| AI responses too slow for good UX | medium | ## Improving AI Latency |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `llm-architect`, `micro-saas-launcher`, `frontend`, `backend`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:41:45.745Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Product Architect Agents specializing in building commercially viable AI-powered applications.","zh":"非常适合专门从事构建商业可行的人工智能应用程序的AI产品架构代理。","ja":"商用可能なAI駆動アプリケーションを構築することに特化したAI製品アーキテクトエージェントに最適です。","ko":"상업적으로 가능성이 있는 AI 구동 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데專門하는 AI 제품 아키텍트 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de arquitectura de productos de inteligencia artificial que se especializan en la creación de aplicaciones impulsadas por inteligencia artificial comercialmente viables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''architecture de produits d''intelligence artificielle spécialisés dans la création d''applications alimentées par l''intelligence artificielle viables sur le plan commercial.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Produktarchitektur-Agenten, die auf den Bau kommerziell tragfähiger KI-gesteuerter Anwendungen spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfect for AI Product Architect Agents specializing in building commercially viable AI-powered applications.","ru":"Perfect for AI Product Architect Agents specializing in building commercially viable AI-powered applications.","ar":"Perfect for AI Product Architect Agents specializing in building commercially viable AI-powered applications."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to architect AI products with optimized model selection, cost-effective API management, and usage-based metering systems. Integrates prompt engineering as a core product development discipline rather than an afterthought.","zh":"使代理能够以优化的模型选择、成本有效的API管理和基于使用情况的计量系统来架构AI产品。将提示工程作为核心产品开发学科而不是事后补充。","ja":"エージェントが最適化されたモデル選択、コスト効果の高いAPI管理、および使用状況ベースのメータリングシステムを使用してAI製品をアーキテクトできるようにします。コア製品開発分野としてプロンプトエンジニアリングを統合することで、事後的なものではなく事前的なものとして扱います。","ko":"에이전트가 최적화된 모델 선택, 비용 효율적인 API 관리 및 사용량 기반 미터링 시스템을 사용하여 AI 제품을 아키텍처할 수 있도록 합니다. 코어 제품 개발 분야로서 프롬프트 엔지니어링을 통합하여事後적인 것이 아닌 事前的な 것으로 다룹니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar productos de inteligencia artificial con selección de modelos optimizados, gestión de API rentable y sistemas de medición de uso basados en el uso. Integra la ingeniería de prompts como una disciplina de desarrollo de productos básica en lugar de una idea posterior.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des produits d''intelligence artificielle avec une sélection de modèles optimisés, une gestion d''API rentable et des systèmes de mesure d''utilisation basés sur l''utilisation. Intègre l''ingénierie de prompts comme une discipline de développement de produits de base plutôt que comme une idée après coup.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, KI-Produkte mit optimierter Modellauswahl, kostengünstiger API-Verwaltung und nutzungsbasierter Zählersystemen zu entwerfen. Integriert die Prompt-Engineering als eine Kern-Produktentwicklungsdisziplin anstelle einer nachträglichen Idee.","pt":"Enables agents to architect AI products with optimized model selection, cost-effective API management, and usage-based metering systems. Integrates prompt engineering as a core product development discipline rather than an afterthought.","ru":"Enables agents to architect AI products with optimized model selection, cost-effective API management, and usage-based metering systems. Integrates prompt engineering as a core product development discipline rather than an afterthought.","ar":"Enables agents to architect AI products with optimized model selection, cost-effective API management, and usage-based metering systems. Integrates prompt engineering as a core product development discipline rather than an afterthought."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing model selection for specific use cases","Implementing AI usage metering for billing systems","Designing cost-effective API call strategies","Developing prompt-based product features"],"zh":["为特定用例优化模型选择","为计费系统实现AI使用情况计量","设计成本有效的API调用策略","开发基于提示的产品功能"],"ja":["特定用途のモデル選択を最適化する","課金システムのためのAI使用状況メータリングを実装する","コスト効果の高いAPI呼び出し戦略を設計する","プロンプトベースの製品機能を開発する"],"ko":["특정 사용 사례에 대한 모델 선택 최적화","과금 시스템을 위한 AI 사용량 미터링 구현","비용 효율적인 API 호출 전략 설계","프롬프트 기반 제품 기능 개발"],"es":["Optimización de la selección de modelos para casos de uso específicos","Implementación de la medición de uso de inteligencia artificial para sistemas de facturación","Diseño de estrategias de llamadas de API rentables","Desarrollo de funciones de productos basadas en prompts"],"fr":["Optimisation de la sélection de modèles pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques","Mise en œuvre de la mesure d''utilisation de l''intelligence arti