onexión de puerta de enlace completa","Eventos personalizados","Soporte para JavaScript y TypeScript"],"fr":["Configuration de Discord.js v14","Commandes de barre","Connexion de passerelle complète","Événements personnalisés","Prise en charge de JavaScript et TypeScript"],"de":["Konfiguration von Discord.js v14","Slash-Befehle","Vollständige Gateway-Verbindung","Benutzerdefinierte Ereignisse","Unterstützung für JavaScript und TypeScript"],"pt":["Configuração moderna com comandos de barra","Conexão de gateway completa com eventos","Criação de bots com interações complexas","Suporte a JavaScript/TypeScript","Uso de Discord.js v14","Integração com o ecossistema do Discord"],"ru":["Современная настройка с командами слэша","Полное подключение к шлюзу с событиями","Создание ботов с сложными взаимодействиями","Поддержка JavaScript/TypeScript","Использование Discord.js v14","Интеграция с экосистемой Discord"],"ar":["تكوين حديث مع أوامر شرطة","اتصال بوابة كامل مع أحداث","إنشاء بوتات مع تفاعلات معقدة","دعم JavaScript/TypeScript","استخدام Discord.js v14","التكامل مع نظام ديسكورد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Discord Bot","Discord.js v14","现代化 Discord 机器人","全网关连接","复杂交互","斜杠命令","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"ja":["Discord ボット","Discord.js v14","モダンな Discord ボット","フルゲートウェイ接続","複雑なインタラクション","スラッシュコマンド","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"ko":["디스코드 봇","디스코드.js v14","현대적인 디스코드 봇","완전한 게이트웨이 연결","복잡한 상호 작용","슬래시 명령","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"es":["Discord.js v14","bots de Discord","comandos de barra","conexión de puerta de enlace","eventos personalizados","JavaScript","TypeScript","desarrollo de bots"],"fr":["Discord.js v14","bots Discord","commandes de barre","connexion de passerelle","événements personnalisés","JavaScript","TypeScript","développement de bots"],"de":["Discord.js v14","Discord-Bots","Slash-Befehle","Gateway-Verbindung","benutzerdefinierte Ereignisse","JavaScript","TypeScript","Bot-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Discord Bot Architect","Discord.js v14","Bots do Discord","JavaScript","TypeScript","Comandos de barra","Conexão de gateway","Interações complexas","Desenvolvimento de bots"],"ru":["Архитектор бота Discord","Discord.js v14","Боты Discord","JavaScript","TypeScript","Команды слэша","Подключение к шлюзу","Сложные взаимодействия","Разработка ботов"],"ar":["مهندس بوت ديسكورد","Discord.js v14","بوتات ديسكورد","JavaScript","TypeScript","أوامر شرطة","اتصال بوابة","تفاعلات معقدة","تطوير البوتات"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"discord-bot-architect","description":"Specialized skill for building production-ready Discord bots. Covers Discord.js (JavaScript) and Pycord (Python), gateway intents, slash commands, interactive components, rate limiting, and sharding.","bodyPreview":"# Discord Bot Architect\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Discord.js v14 Foundation\n\nModern Discord bot setup with Discord.js v14 and slash commands\n\n**When to use**: [''Building Discord bots with JavaScript/TypeScript'', ''Need full gateway connection with events'', ''Building bots with complex interactions'']\n\n```javascript\n```javascript\n// src/index.js\nconst { Client, Collection, GatewayIntentBits, Events } = require(''discord.js'');\nconst fs = require(''node:fs'');\nconst path = require(''node:path'');\nrequire(''dotenv'')","body":"# Discord Bot Architect\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Discord.js v14 Foundation\n\nModern Discord bot setup with Discord.js v14 and slash commands\n\n**When to use**: [''Building Discord bots with JavaScript/TypeScript'', ''Need full gateway connection with events'', ''Building bots with complex interactions'']\n\n```javascript\n```javascript\n// src/index.js\nconst { Client, Collection, GatewayIntentBits, Events } = require(''discord.js'');\nconst fs = require(''node:fs'');\nconst path = require(''node:path'');\nrequire(''dotenv'').config();\n\n// Create client with minimal required intents\nconst client = new Client({\n  intents: [\n    GatewayIntentBits.Guilds,\n    // Add only what you need:\n    // GatewayIntentBits.GuildMessages,\n    // GatewayIntentBits.MessageContent,  // PRIVILEGED - avoid if possible\n  ]\n});\n\n// Load commands\nclient.commands = new Collection();\nconst commandsPath = path.join(__dirname, ''commands'');\nconst commandFiles = fs.readdirSync(commandsPath).filter(f => f.endsWith(''.js''));\n\nfor (const file of commandFiles) {\n  const filePath = path.join(commandsPath, file);\n  const command = require(filePath);\n  if (''data'' in command && ''execute'' in command) {\n    client.commands.set(command.data.name, command);\n  }\n}\n\n// Load events\nconst eventsPath = path.join(__dirname, ''events'');\nconst eventFiles = fs.readdirSync(eventsPath).filter(f => f.endsWith(''.js''));\n\nfor (const file of eventFiles) {\n  const filePath = path.join(eventsPath, file);\n  const event = require(filePath);\n  if (event.once) {\n    client.once(event.name, (...args) => event.execute(...args));\n  } else {\n    client.on(event.name, (...args) => event.execute(...args));\n  }\n}\n\nclient.login(process.env.DISCORD_TOKEN);\n```\n\n```javascript\n// src/commands/ping.js\nconst { SlashCommandBuilder } = require(''discord.js'');\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  data: new SlashCommandBuilder()\n    .setName(''ping'')\n    .setDescription(''Replies with Pong!''),\n\n  async execute(interaction) {\n    const sent = await interaction.reply({\n      content: ''Pinging...'',\n      fetchReply: true\n    });\n\n    const latency = sent.createdTimestamp - interaction.createdTimestamp;\n    await interaction.editReply(`Pong! Latency: ${latency}ms`);\n  }\n};\n```\n\n```javascript\n// src/events/interactionCreate.js\nconst { Events } = require(''discord.js'');\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  name: Event\n```\n\n### Pycord Bot Foundation\n\nDiscord bot with Pycord (Python) and application commands\n\n**When to use**: [''Building Discord bots with Python'', ''Prefer async/await patterns'', ''Need good slash command support'']\n\n```python\n```python\n# main.py\nimport os\nimport discord\nfrom discord.ext import commands\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\n\nload_dotenv()\n\n# Configure intents - only enable what you need\nintents = discord.Intents.default()\n# intents.message_content = True  # PRIVILEGED - avoid if possible\n# intents.members = True          # PRIVILEGED\n\nbot = commands.Bot(\n    command_prefix=\"!\",  # Legacy, prefer slash commands\n    intents=intents\n)\n\n@bot.event\nasync def on_ready():\n    print(f\"Logged in as {bot.user}\")\n    # Sync commands (do this carefully - see sharp edges)\n    # await bot.sync_commands()\n\n# Slash command\n@bot.slash_command(name=\"ping\", description=\"Check bot latency\")\nasync def ping(ctx: discord.ApplicationContext):\n    latency = round(bot.latency * 1000)\n    await ctx.respond(f\"Pong! Latency: {latency}ms\")\n\n# Slash command with options\n@bot.slash_command(name=\"greet\", description=\"Greet a user\")\nasync def greet(\n    ctx: discord.ApplicationContext,\n    user: discord.Option(discord.Member, \"User to greet\"),\n    message: discord.Option(str, \"Custom message\", required=False)\n):\n    msg = message or \"Hello!\"\n    await ctx.respond(f\"{user.mention}, {msg}\")\n\n# Load cogs\nfor filename in os.listdir(\"./cogs\"):\n    if filename.endswith(\".py\"):\n        bot.load_extension(f\"cogs.{filename[:-3]}\")\n\nbot.run(os.environ[\"DISCORD_TOKEN\"])\n```\n\n```python\n# cogs/general.py\nimport discord\nfrom discord.ext import commands\n\nclass General(commands.Cog):\n    def __init__(self, bot):\n        self.bot = bot\n\n    @commands.slash_command(name=\"info\", description=\"Bot information\")\n    async def info(self, ctx: discord.ApplicationContext):\n        embed = discord.Embed(\n            title=\"Bot Info\",\n            description=\"A helpful Discord bot\",\n            color=discord.Color.blue()\n        )\n        embed.add_field(name=\"Servers\", value=len(self.bot.guilds))\n        embed.add_field(name=\"Latency\", value=f\"{round(self.bot.latency * 1000)}ms\")\n        await ctx.respond(embed=embed)\n\n    @commands.Cog.\n```\n\n### Interactive Components Pattern\n\nUsing buttons, select menus, and modals for rich UX\n\n**When to use**: [''Need interactive user interfaces'', ''Collecting user input beyond slash command options'', ''Building menus, confirmations, or forms'']\n\n```python\n```javascript\n// Discord.js - Buttons and Select Menus\nconst {\n  SlashCommandBuilder,\n  ActionRowBuilder,\n  ButtonBuilder,\n  ButtonStyle,\n  StringSelectMenuBuilder,\n  ModalBuilder,\n  TextInputBuilder,\n  TextInputStyle\n} = require(''discord.js'');\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  data: new SlashCommandBuilder()\n    .setName(''menu'')\n    .setDescription(''Shows an interactive menu''),\n\n  async execute(interaction) {\n    // Button row\n    const buttonRow = new ActionRowBuilder()\n      .addComponents(\n        new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(''confirm'')\n          .setLabel(''Confirm'')\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary),\n        new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(''cancel'')\n          .setLabel(''Cancel'')\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger),\n        new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setLabel(''Documentation'')\n          .setURL(''https://discord.js.org'')\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Link)  // Link buttons don''t emit events\n      );\n\n    // Select menu row (one per row, takes all 5 slots)\n    const selectRow = new ActionRowBuilder()\n      .addComponents(\n        new StringSelectMenuBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(''select-role'')\n          .setPlaceholder(''Select a role'')\n          .setMinValues(1)\n          .setMaxValues(3)\n          .addOptions([\n            { label: ''Developer'', value: ''dev'', emoji: ''💻'' },\n            { label: ''Designer'', value: ''design'', emoji: ''🎨'' },\n            { label: ''Community'', value: ''community'', emoji: ''🎉'' }\n          ])\n      );\n\n    await interaction.reply({\n      content: ''Choose an option:'',\n      components: [buttonRow, selectRow]\n    });\n\n    // Collect responses\n    const collector = interaction.channel.createMessageComponentCollector({\n      filter: i => i.user.id === interaction.user.id,\n      time: 60_000  // 60 seconds timeout\n    });\n\n    collector.on(''collect'', async i => {\n      if (i.customId === ''confirm'') {\n        await i.update({ content: ''Confirmed!'', components: [] });\n        collector.stop();\n      } else if (i.custo\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Message Content for Commands\n\n**Why bad**: Message Content Intent is privileged and deprecated for bot commands.\nSlash commands are the intended approach.\n\n### ❌ Syncing Commands on Every Start\n\n**Why bad**: Command registration is rate limited. Global commands take up to 1 hour\nto propagate. Syncing on every start wastes API calls and can hit limits.\n\n### ❌ Blocking the Event Loop\n\n**Why bad**: Discord gateway requires regular heartbeats. Blocking operations\ncause missed heartbeats and disconnections.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | ## Acknowledge immediately, process later |\n| Issue | critical | ## Step 1: Enable in Developer Portal |\n| Issue | high | ## Use a separate deploy script (not on startup) |\n| Issue | critical | ## Never hardcode tokens |\n| Issue | high | ## Generate correct invite URL |\n| Issue | medium | ## Development: Use guild commands |\n| Issue | medium | ## Never block the event loop |\n| Issue | medium | ## Show modal immediately |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:42:49.159Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript/TypeScript-based AI Agents needing advanced Discord bot integration with Discord.js v14 and slash commands","zh":"适合于需要高级Discord机器人集成的基于JavaScript/TypeScript的AI代理，特别是使用Discord.js v14和斜杠命令","ja":"JavaScript/TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントがDiscord.js v14およびスラッシュコマンドを使用した高度なDiscordボット統合を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자바스크립트/타입스크립트 기반 AI 에이전트가 디스코드.js v14 및 슬래시 명령을 사용하여 고급 디스코드 봇 통합을 필요로 할 때 완벽","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA basados en JavaScript/TypeScript que necesitan una integración avanzada de bot de Discord con Discord.js v14 y comandos de barra","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA basés sur JavaScript/TypeScript nécessitant une intégration avancée de bot Discord avec Discord.js v14 et commandes de barre oblique","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript/TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Discord-Bot-Integration mit Discord.js v14 und Schrägstrichbefehlen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em JavaScript/TypeScript que necessitam de integração avançada de bot do Discord com Discord.js v14 e comandos de barra","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе JavaScript/TypeScript, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция с Discord с помощью Discord.js v14 и команд с слэшем","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى جافا سكريبت / тайب سكريبت التي تحتاج إلى دمج متقدم.bot الديسكورد مع ديسكورد.جس 14 وأوامر السلاش"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build complex Discord bots with full gateway connection and event handling using Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits, and Events, facilitating interactions with Discord servers and users","zh":"赋予代理构建复杂Discord机器人的能力，使用Discord.js v14、GatewayIntentBits和事件，实现与Discord服务器和用户的交互","ja":"Discord.js v14、GatewayIntentBits、イベントを使用して、エージェントが複雑なDiscordボットを構築し、Discordサーバーおよびユーザーとのやり取りを可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 디스코드.js v14, 게이트웨이 인텐트 비트 및 이벤트를 사용하여 복잡한 디스코드 봇을 구축하고 디스코드 서버 및 사용자와의 상호 작용을 용이하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir bots de Discord complejos con conexión de gateway completa y control de eventos utilizando Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits y Events, facilitando las interacciones con servidores y usuarios de Discord","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des bots Discord complexes avec une connexion de passerelle complète et une gestion d''événements à l''aide de Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits et Events, facilitant les interactions avec les serveurs et les utilisateurs de Discord","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Discord-Bots mit voller Gateway-Verbindung und Ereignisverwaltung mit Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits und Events zu erstellen, um Interaktionen mit Discord-Servern und -Benutzern zu erleichtern","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir bots do Discord complexos com conexão de gateway completa e manipulação de eventos usando Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits e Events, facilitando interações com servidores e usuários do Discord","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложных ботов Discord с полным подключением к шлюзу и обработкой событий, используя Discord.js v14, GatewayIntentBits и Events, что облегчает взаимодействие с серверами и пользователями Discord","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء bots الديسكورد المعقدة مع اتصال البوابة الكامل ومعالجة الأحداث باستخدام ديسكورد.جس 14 و GatewayIntentBits والأحداث، مما يسهل التفاعل مع خوادم ومستخدمي الديسكورد"},"useCases":{"en":["Building Discord bots with JavaScript/TypeScript","Handling complex interactions and events with GatewayIntentBits","Implementing slash commands for user engagement"],"zh":["使用JavaScript/TypeScript构建Discord机器人","使用GatewayIntentBits处理复杂的交互和事件","实现斜杠命令以提高用户参与度"],"ja":["JavaScript/TypeScriptを使用してDiscordボットを構築","GatewayIntentBitsを使用して複雑なやり取りとイベントを処理","ユーザー参加を促進するためにスラッシュコマンドを実装"],"ko":["자바스크립트/타입스크립트를 사용하여 디스코드 봇을 구축","게이트웨이 인텐트 비트를 사용하여 복잡한 상호 작용 및 이벤트 처리","사용자 참여를 높이기 위해 슬래시 명령을 구현"],"es":["Construir bots de Discord con JavaScript/TypeScript","Controlar interacciones y eventos complejos con GatewayIntentBits","Implementar comandos de barra para la participación del usuario"],"fr":["Construire des bots Discord avec JavaScript/TypeScript","Gérer des interactions et des événements complexes avec GatewayIntentBits","Mettre en œuvre des commandes de barre oblique pour l''engagement des utilisateurs"],"de":["Discord-Bots mit JavaScript/TypeScript erstellen","Komplexe Interaktionen und Ereignisse mit GatewayIntentBits verwalten","Schrägstrichbefehle für die Benutzerverbundung implementieren"],"pt":["Construção de bots do Discord com JavaScript/TypeScript","Manipulação de interações complexas e eventos com GatewayIntentBits","Implementação de comandos de barra para engajamento do usuário"],"ru":["Создание ботов Discord с помощью JavaScript/TypeScript","Обработка сложных взаимодействий и событий с помощью GatewayIntentBits","Реализация команд с слэшем для вовлечения пользователей"],"ar":["بناء bots الديسكورد مع جافا سكريبت / тайп سكريبت","معالجة التفاعلات المعقدة والأحداث مع GatewayIntentBits","تنفيذ أوامر السلاش للمشاركة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Discord.js v14","Needs full gateway connection with events","JavaScript/TypeScript only"],"zh":["需要Discord.js v14","需要完整的网关连接和事件","仅支持JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ja":["Discord.js v14が必要","イベントを含む完全なゲートウェイ接続が必要","JavaScript/TypeScriptのみ"],"ko":["디스코드.js v14 필요","이벤트를 포함한 완전한 게이트웨이 연결 필요","자바스크립트/타입스크립트만 지원"],"es":["Requiere Discord.js v14","Necesita una conexión de gateway completa con eventos","Solo JavaScript/TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite Discord.js v14","A besoin d''une connexion de passerelle complète avec des événements","Uniquement JavaScript/TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt Discord.js v14","Benötigt eine vollständige Gateway-Verbindung mit Ereignissen","Nur JavaScript/TypeScript"],"pt":["Requer Discord.js v14","Necessita conexão de gateway completa com eventos","Apenas JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуется Discord.js v14","Требуется полное подключение к шлюзу с событиями","Только JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب ديسكورد.جس 14","يحتاج اتصال البوابة الكامل بالأحداث","جافا سكريبت / тайب سكريبت فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
