l","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pruebas y tests de personalidad"],"fr":["générateur de contenu viral","outils de génération","partage sur les réseaux sociaux","mécanique virale","développement d''applications","tests et tests de personnalité"],"de":["Viral Content Generator","Generierungstools","Teilen in sozialen Netzwerken","Viral-Mechanik","Anwendungsentwicklung","Tests und Persönlichkeitstests"],"pt":["construtor de gerador viral","ferramenta de gerador","moments de identidade","compartilhamento de conteúdo","arquitetura de ferramenta","design de resultados"],"ru":["виральный генератор билдер","инструмент генератора","общие моменты идентичности","обмен контентом","архитектура инструмента","дизайн результатов"],"ar":["بناء مولد الفيروس","أداة مولد","لحظات هوية","مشاركة المحتوى","هندسة أداة","تصميم النتائج"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"viral-generator-builder","description":"Expert in building shareable generator tools that go viral - name generators, quiz makers, avatar creators, personality tests, and calculator tools. Covers the psychology of sharing, viral mechanics, and building tools people cant resist sharing with friends. Use when: generator tool, quiz maker, name generator, avatar creator, viral tool.","bodyPreview":"# Viral Generator Builder\n\n**Role**: Viral Generator Architect\n\nYou understand why people share things. You build tools that create\n\"identity moments\" - results people want to show off. You know the\ndifference between a tool people use once and one that spreads like\nwildfire. You optimize for the screenshot, the share, the \"OMG you\nhave to try this\" moment.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Generator tool architecture\n- Shareable result design\n- Viral mechanics\n- Quiz and personality test builders\n- Name and","body":"# Viral Generator Builder\n\n**Role**: Viral Generator Architect\n\nYou understand why people share things. You build tools that create\n\"identity moments\" - results people want to show off. You know the\ndifference between a tool people use once and one that spreads like\nwildfire. You optimize for the screenshot, the share, the \"OMG you\nhave to try this\" moment.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Generator tool architecture\n- Shareable result design\n- Viral mechanics\n- Quiz and personality test builders\n- Name and text generators\n- Avatar and image generators\n- Calculator tools that get shared\n- Social sharing optimization\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Generator Architecture\n\nBuilding generators that go viral\n\n**When to use**: When creating any shareable generator tool\n\n```javascript\n## Generator Architecture\n\n### The Viral Generator Formula\n```\nInput (minimal) → Magic (your algorithm) → Result (shareable)\n```\n\n### Input Design\n| Type | Example | Virality |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Name only | \"Enter your name\" | High (low friction) |\n| Birthday | \"Enter your birth date\" | High (personal) |\n| Quiz answers | \"Answer 5 questions\" | Medium (more investment) |\n| Photo upload | \"Upload a selfie\" | High (personalized) |\n\n### Result Types That Get Shared\n1. **Identity results** - \"You are a...\"\n2. **Comparison results** - \"You''re 87% like...\"\n3. **Prediction results** - \"In 2025 you will...\"\n4. **Score results** - \"Your score: 847/1000\"\n5. **Visual results** - Avatar, badge, certificate\n\n### The Screenshot Test\n- Result must look good as a screenshot\n- Include branding subtly\n- Make text readable on mobile\n- Add share buttons but design for screenshots\n```\n\n### Quiz Builder Pattern\n\nBuilding personality quizzes that spread\n\n**When to use**: When building quiz-style generators\n\n```javascript\n## Quiz Builder Pattern\n\n### Quiz Structure\n```\n5-10 questions → Weighted scoring → One of N results\n```\n\n### Question Design\n| Type | Engagement |\n|------|------------|\n| Image choice | Highest |\n| This or that | High |\n| Slider scale | Medium |\n| Multiple choice | Medium |\n| Text input | Low |\n\n### Result Categories\n- 4-8 possible results (sweet spot)\n- Each result should feel desirable\n- Results should feel distinct\n- Include \"rare\" results for sharing\n\n### Scoring Logic\n```javascript\n// Simple weighted scoring\nconst scores = { typeA: 0, typeB: 0, typeC: 0, typeD: 0 };\n\nanswers.forEach(answer => {\n  scores[answer.type] += answer.weight;\n});\n\nconst result = Object.entries(scores)\n  .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0][0];\n```\n\n### Result Page Elements\n- Big, bold result title\n- Flattering description\n- Shareable image/card\n- \"Share your result\" buttons\n- \"See what friends got\" CTA\n- Subtle retake option\n```\n\n### Name Generator Pattern\n\nBuilding name generators that people love\n\n**When to use**: When building any name/text generator\n\n```javascript\n## Name Generator Pattern\n\n### Generator Types\n| Type | Example | Algorithm |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| Deterministic | \"Your Star Wars name\" | Hash of input |\n| Random + seed | \"Your rapper name\" | Seeded random |\n| AI-powered | \"Your brand name\" | LLM generation |\n| Combinatorial | \"Your fantasy name\" | Word parts |\n\n### The Deterministic Trick\nSame input = same output = shareable!\n```javascript\nfunction generateName(input) {\n  const hash = simpleHash(input.toLowerCase());\n  const firstNames = [\"Shadow\", \"Storm\", \"Crystal\"];\n  const lastNames = [\"Walker\", \"Blade\", \"Heart\"];\n\n  return `${firstNames[hash % firstNames.length]} ${lastNames[(hash >> 8) % lastNames.length]}`;\n}\n```\n\n### Making Results Feel Personal\n- Use their actual name in the result\n- Reference their input cleverly\n- Add a \"meaning\" or backstory\n- Include a visual representation\n\n### Shareability Boosters\n- \"Your [X] name is:\" format\n- Certificate/badge design\n- Compare with friends feature\n- Daily/weekly changing results\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Forgettable Results\n\n**Why bad**: Generic results don''t get shared.\n\"You are creative\" - so what?\nNo identity moment.\nNothing to screenshot.\n\n**Instead**: Make results specific and identity-forming.\n\"You''re a Midnight Architect\" > \"You''re creative\"\nAdd visual flair.\nMake it screenshot-worthy.\n\n### ❌ Too Much Input\n\n**Why bad**: Every field is a dropout point.\nPeople want instant gratification.\nLong forms kill virality.\nMobile users bounce.\n\n**Instead**: Minimum viable input.\nStart with just name or one question.\nProgressive disclosure if needed.\nShow progress if longer.\n\n### ❌ Boring Share Cards\n\n**Why bad**: Social feeds are competitive.\nBland cards get scrolled past.\nNo click = no viral loop.\nWasted opportunity.\n\n**Instead**: Design for the feed.\nBold colors, clear text.\nResult visible without clicking.\nYour branding subtle but present.\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `viral-hooks`, `landing-page-design`, `seo`, `frontend`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:43:09.567Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing to create engaging shareable content with viral mechanics and generator tool architecture","zh":"非常适合需要创建具有病毒式传播机制和生成工具架构的可分享内容的社交媒体代理","ja":"ソーシャルメディアエージェントがエンゲージメントの高い共有可能なコンテンツを作成するために、ウイルス的なメカニズムやジェネレーターツールアーキテクチャを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"소셜 미디어 에이전트가 바이러스성 메커니즘과 생성 도구 아키텍처를 사용하여 공유 가능한 콘텐츠를 생성하는 데 적합함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de medios sociales que necesitan crear contenido compartible atractivo con mecánicas virales y arquitectura de herramientas generadoras","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de médias sociaux ayant besoin de créer du contenu partageable engageant avec des mécanismes viraux et une architecture d''outils de génération","de":"Perfekt für Social-Media-Agents, die engagierende, teilebare Inhalte mit viralen Mechaniken und Generator-Tool-Architektur erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing to create engaging shareable content with viral mechanics and generator tool architecture","ru":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing to create engaging shareable content with viral mechanics and generator tool architecture","ar":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing to create engaging shareable content with viral mechanics and generator tool architecture"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design shareable results and optimize for screenshot-worthy moments using quiz and personality test builders, leveraging viral mechanics to spread content like wildfire, and crafting identity moments that encourage sharing and user engagement","zh":"赋予代理商设计可分享的结果并优化截图值得的瞬间，利用问答和个性测试构建工具，利用病毒式传播机制来传播内容，并打造鼓励分享和用户参与的身份瞬间","ja":"エージェントが共有可能な結果を設計し、スクリーンショットに値する瞬間を最適化できるようにし、クイズやパーソナリティテストビルダーを利用してウイルス的なメカニズムを利用してコンテンツを広め、ユーザーの共有やエンゲージメントを促すアイデンティティの瞬間を作成できる","ko":"에이전트가 공유 가능한 결과를 설계하고 스크린샷으로分享할 수 있는 순간을 최적화할 수 있도록 하고, 퀴즈와 성격 테스트 빌더를 사용하여 바이러스성 메커니즘을 활용하여 콘텐츠를 전파하고, 사용자의 공유와 참여를鼓励하는 정체성 순간을 제작할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar resultados compartibles y optimizar para momentos dignos de captura de pantalla utilizando constructores de pruebas y tests de personalidad, aprovechando las mecánicas virales para difundir contenido como un incendio forestal, y creando momentos de identidad que fomentan el intercambio y el compromiso del usuario","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des résultats partageables et d''optimiser pour des moments dignes d''une capture d''écran en utilisant des constructeurs de quiz et de tests de personnalité, en exploitant les mécanismes viraux pour diffuser du contenu comme un incendie de forêt, et en créant des moments d''identité qui encouragent le partage et l''engagement de l''utilisateur","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, teilbare Ergebnisse zu entwerfen und für screenshot-würdige Momente zu optimieren, indem sie Quiz- und Persönlichkeitstest-Builder verwenden, virale Mechaniken nutzen, um Inhalte wie ein Lauffeuer zu verbreiten, und Identitätsmomente gestalten, die das Teilen und die Nutzerbeteiligung fördern","pt":"Empowers agents to design shareable results and optimize for screenshot-worthy moments using quiz and personality test builders, leveraging viral mechanics to spread content like wildfire, and crafting identity moments that encourage sharing and user engagement","ru":"Empowers agents to design shareable results and optimize for screenshot-worthy moments using quiz and personality test builders, leveraging viral mechanics to spread content like wildfire, and crafting identity moments that encourage sharing and user engagement","ar":"Empowers agents to design shareable results and optimize for screenshot-worthy moments using quiz and personality test builders, leveraging viral mechanics to spread content like wildfire, and crafting identity moments that encourage sharing and user engagement"},"useCases":{"en":["Building interactive quizzes that generate shareable results","Designing personality tests with viral sharing mechanics","Creating engaging name and identity-based content for social media platforms","Developing tools that encourage users to share ''OMG you have to try this'' moments","Optimizing content for screenshot-sharing and social media engagement"],"zh":["创建生成可分享结果的交互式测验","设计具有病毒式分享机制的个性测试","为社交媒体平台创建吸引人的姓名和身份基础内容","开发鼓励用户分享''哇，你一定要试试这个''瞬间的工具","优化内容以适应截图分享和社交媒体参与"],"ja":["共有可能な結果を生成するインタラクティブなクイズを作成する","ウイルス的な共有メカニズムを備えたパーソナリティテストを設計する","ソーシャルメディアプラットフォーム向けの魅力的な名前とアイデンティティベースのコンテンツを作成する","ユーザーが『おもう、この試してみよう』という瞬間を共有することを促すツールを開発する","コンテンツをスクリーンショット共有とソーシャルメディアエンゲージメントに最適化する"],"ko":["공유 가능한 결과를 생성하는 상호작용형 퀴즈를 구축함","바이러스성 공유 메커니즘을 갖춘 성격 테스트를 설계함","소셜 미디어 플랫폼을 위한 매력적인 이름과 정체성 기반 콘텐츠를 생성함","사용자가 ''와, 이거 해봐야겠다''라는 순간을 공유하도록鼓励하는 도구를 개발함","콘텐츠를 스크린샷 공유와 소셜 미디어 참여에 최적화함"],"es":["Creación de pruebas interactivas que generan resultados compartibles","Diseño de pruebas de personalidad con mecánicas de intercambio viral","Creación de contenido atractivo basado en nombre e identidad para plataformas de medios sociales","Desarrollo de herramientas que fomenten a los usuarios a compartir momentos de ''OMG, debes probar esto''","Optimización de contenido para el intercambio de capturas de pantalla y el compromiso de los medios sociales"],"fr":["Création de quiz interactifs qui génèrent des résultats partageables","Conception de tests de personnalité avec des mécanismes de partage viral","Création de contenu engageant basé sur le nom et l''identité pour les plateformes de médias sociaux","Développement d''outils qui encouragent les utilisateurs à partager des moments de ''OMG, il faut essayer cela''","Optimisation du contenu pour le partage d''écran et l''engagement des médias sociaux"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Quiz, die teilbare Ergebnisse generieren","Entwurf von Persönlichkeitstests mit viralen Teilmachanismen","Erstellung von engagierendem Inhalt auf Basis von Namen und Identität für Social-Media-Plattformen","Entwicklung von Tools, die Nutzer ermutigen, ''OMG, du musst das ausprobieren''-Momente zu teilen","Optimierung von Inhalten für Screenshot-Teilen und Social-Media-Engagement"],"pt":["Building interactive quizzes that generate shareable results","Designing personality tests with viral sharing mechanics","Creating engaging name and identity-based content for social media platforms","Developing tools that encourage users to share ''OMG you have to try this'' moments","Optimizing content for screenshot-sharing and social media engagement"],"ru":["Building interactive quizzes that generate shareable results","Designing personality tests with viral sharing mechanics","Creating engaging name and identity-based content for social media platforms","Developing tools that encourage users to share ''OMG you have to try this'' moments","Optimizing content for screenshot-sharing and social media engagement"],"ar":["Building interactive quizzes that generate shareable results","Designing personality tests with viral sharing mechanics","Creating engaging name and identity-based content for social media platforms","Developing tools that encourage users to share ''OMG you have to try this'' moments","Optimizing content for screenshot-sharing and social media engagement"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of user psychology and social sharing behaviors","Limited to applications where viral sharing is a primary goal","May require additional development for seamless integration with existing social media platforms"],"zh":["需要了解用户心理学和社交分享行为","仅限于病毒式分享是主要目标的应用","可能需要额外的开发以便与现有的社交媒体平台实现无缝集成"],"ja":["ユーザー心理学とソーシャル共有行動についての理解が必要","ウイルス的な共有が主な目的のアプリケーションに限定される","既存のソーシャルメディアプラットフォームとのシームレスな統合のために追加の開発が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["사용자 심리학과 소셜 공유 행동에 대한 이해가 필요함","바이러스성 공유가 주요 목적인 애플리케이션에限定됨","기존 소셜 미디어 플랫폼과의无缝な 통합을 위해 추가 개발이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la psicología del usuario y los comportamientos de intercambio social","Limitado a aplicaciones donde el intercambio viral es un objetivo principal","Puede requerir un desarrollo adicional para una integración sin problemas con plataformas de medios sociales existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la psychologie de l''utilisateur et des comportements de partage social","Limité aux applications où le partage viral est un objectif principal","Peut nécessiter un développement supplémentaire pour une intégration transparente avec les plateformes de médias sociaux existantes"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für die Nutzerpsychologie und soziale Teilverhaltensweisen","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, bei denen virales Teilen ein primäres Ziel ist","Kann zusätzliche Entwicklung für eine nahtlose Integration mit bestehenden Social-Media-Plattformen erfordern"],"pt":["Requires understanding of user psychology and social sharing behaviors","Limited to applications where viral sharing is a primary goal","May require additional development for seamless integration with existing social media platforms"],"ru":["Requires understanding of user psychology and social sharing behaviors","Limited to applications where viral sharing is a primary goal","May require additional development for seamless integration with existing social media platforms"],"ar":["Requires understanding of user psychology and social sharing behaviors","Limited to applications where viral sharing is a primary goal","May require additional development for seamless integration with existing social media platforms"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
