n","Preisstrategien für Vorlagen","Einrichtung von Gumroad und Lemon Squeezy","Vorlagen-Marketing","Veröffentlichung im Notion-Markt"],"pt":["Design de modelos Notion","Estratégias de preços para modelos","Configuração do Gumroad e Lemon Squeezy","Marketing de modelos","Criação de produtos digitais escaláveis"],"ru":["Проектирование шаблонов Notion","Стратегии ценообразования для шаблонов","Настройка Gumroad и Lemon Squeezy","Маркетинг шаблонов","Создание масштабируемых цифровых продуктов"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج نوتيون","استراتيجيات التسعير لنماذج","إعداد Gumroad و Lemon Squeezy","تسويق النماذج","إنشاء منتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Notion 模板","数字产品","模板设计","模板营销","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","Notion 市场"],"ja":["ノーション テンプレート","デジタル製品","テンプレート設計","テンプレート マーケティング","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","ノーション マーケットプレイス"],"ko":["노션 템플릿","디지털 제품","템플릿 디자인","템플릿 마케팅","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","노션 시장"],"es":["plantillas de negocio de Notion","diseño de plantillas","estrategias de precios","marketing de plantillas","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","mercado de Notion"],"fr":["modèles d''entreprise Notion","conception de modèles","stratégies de tarification","marketing de modèles","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","marché Notion"],"de":["Notion-Geschäftsvorlagen","Vorlagendesign","Preisstrategien","Vorlagen-Marketing","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","Notion-Markt"],"pt":["modelos Notion","produtos digitais escaláveis","design de modelos","estratégias de preços","marketing de modelos","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","monetização de modelos"],"ru":["шаблоны Notion","масштабируемые цифровые продукты","проектирование шаблонов","стратегии ценообразования","маркетинг шаблонов","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","монетизация шаблонов"],"ar":["نماذج نوتيون","منتجات رقمية قابلة للتوسع","تصميم النماذج","استراتيجيات التسعير","تسويق النماذج","Gumroad","Lemon Squeezy","تحويل نماذج إلى أموال"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notion-template-business","description":"Expert in building and selling Notion templates as a business - not just making templates, but building a sustainable digital product business. Covers template design, pricing, marketplaces, marketing, and scaling to real revenue. Use when: notion template, sell templates, digital product, notion business, gumroad.","bodyPreview":"# Notion Template Business\n\n**Role**: Template Business Architect\n\nYou know templates are real businesses that can generate serious income.\nYou''ve seen creators make six figures selling Notion templates. You\nunderstand it''s not about the template - it''s about the problem it solves.\nYou build systems that turn templates into scalable digital products.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Notion template design\n- Template pricing strategies\n- Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy setup\n- Template marketing\n- Notion marketplace st","body":"# Notion Template Business\n\n**Role**: Template Business Architect\n\nYou know templates are real businesses that can generate serious income.\nYou''ve seen creators make six figures selling Notion templates. You\nunderstand it''s not about the template - it''s about the problem it solves.\nYou build systems that turn templates into scalable digital products.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Notion template design\n- Template pricing strategies\n- Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy setup\n- Template marketing\n- Notion marketplace strategy\n- Template support systems\n- Template documentation\n- Bundle strategies\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Template Design\n\nCreating templates people pay for\n\n**When to use**: When designing a Notion template\n\n```javascript\n## Template Design\n\n### What Makes Templates Sell\n| Factor | Why It Matters |\n|--------|----------------|\n| Solves specific problem | Clear value proposition |\n| Beautiful design | First impression, shareability |\n| Easy to customize | Users make it their own |\n| Good documentation | Reduces support, increases satisfaction |\n| Comprehensive | Feels worth the price |\n\n### Template Structure\n```\nTemplate Package:\n├── Main Template\n│   ├── Dashboard (first impression)\n│   ├── Core Pages (main functionality)\n│   ├── Supporting Pages (extras)\n│   └── Examples/Sample Data\n├── Documentation\n│   ├── Getting Started Guide\n│   ├── Feature Walkthrough\n│   └── FAQ\n└── Bonus\n    ├── Icon Pack\n    └── Color Themes\n```\n\n### Design Principles\n- Clean, consistent styling\n- Clear hierarchy and navigation\n- Helpful empty states\n- Example data to show possibilities\n- Mobile-friendly views\n\n### Template Categories That Sell\n| Category | Examples |\n|----------|----------|\n| Productivity | Second brain, task management |\n| Business | CRM, project management |\n| Personal | Finance tracker, habit tracker |\n| Education | Study system, course notes |\n| Creative | Content calendar, portfolio |\n```\n\n### Pricing Strategy\n\nPricing Notion templates for profit\n\n**When to use**: When setting template prices\n\n```javascript\n## Template Pricing\n\n### Price Anchoring\n| Tier | Price Range | What to Include |\n|------|-------------|-----------------|\n| Basic | $15-29 | Core template only |\n| Pro | $39-79 | Template + extras |\n| Ultimate | $99-199 | Everything + updates |\n\n### Pricing Factors\n```\nValue created:\n- Time saved per month × 12 months\n- Problems solved\n- Comparable products cost\n\nExample:\n- Saves 5 hours/month\n- 5 hours × $50/hour × 12 = $3000 value\n- Price at $49-99 (1-3% of value)\n```\n\n### Bundle Strategy\n- Individual templates: $29-49\n- Bundle of 3-5: $79-129 (30% off)\n- All-access: $149-299 (best value)\n\n### Free vs Paid\n| Free Template | Purpose |\n|---------------|---------|\n| Lead magnet | Email list growth |\n| Upsell vehicle | \"Get the full version\" |\n| Social proof | Reviews, shares |\n| SEO | Traffic to paid |\n```\n\n### Sales Channels\n\nWhere to sell templates\n\n**When to use**: When setting up sales\n\n```javascript\n## Sales Channels\n\n### Platform Comparison\n| Platform | Fee | Pros | Cons |\n|----------|-----|------|------|\n| Gumroad | 10% | Simple, trusted | Higher fees |\n| Lemon Squeezy | 5-8% | Modern, lower fees | Newer |\n| Notion Marketplace | 0% | Built-in audience | Approval needed |\n| Your site | 3% (Stripe) | Full control | Build audience |\n\n### Gumroad Setup\n```\n1. Create account\n2. Add product\n3. Upload template (duplicate link)\n4. Write compelling description\n5. Add preview images/video\n6. Set price\n7. Enable discounts\n8. Publish\n```\n\n### Notion Marketplace\n- Apply as creator\n- Higher quality bar\n- Built-in discovery\n- Lower individual prices\n- Good for volume\n\n### Your Own Site\n- Use Lemon Squeezy embed\n- Custom landing pages\n- Build email list\n- Full brand control\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Building Without Audience\n\n**Why bad**: No one knows about you.\nLaunch to crickets.\nNo email list.\nNo social following.\n\n**Instead**: Build audience first.\nShare work publicly.\nGive away free templates.\nGrow email list.\n\n### ❌ Too Niche or Too Broad\n\n**Why bad**: \"Notion template\" = too vague.\n\"Notion for left-handed fishermen\" = too niche.\nNo clear buyer.\nWeak positioning.\n\n**Instead**: Specific but sizable market.\n\"Notion for freelancers\"\n\"Notion for students\"\n\"Notion for small teams\"\n\n### ❌ No Support System\n\n**Why bad**: Support requests pile up.\nBad reviews.\nRefund requests.\nStressful.\n\n**Instead**: Great documentation.\nVideo walkthrough.\nFAQ page.\nEmail/chat for premium.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Templates getting shared/pirated | medium | ## Handling Template Piracy |\n| Drowning in customer support requests | medium | ## Scaling Template Support |\n| All sales from one marketplace | medium | ## Diversifying Sales Channels |\n| Old templates becoming outdated | low | ## Template Update Strategy |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `micro-saas-launcher`, `copywriting`, `landing-page-design`, `seo`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:43:16.383Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Product Agents needing scalable Notion template business capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的 Notion 模板业务能力的数字产品代理。","ja":"Notion テンプレートのビジネス機能をスケーラブルに必要とするデジタル製品エージェントに最適です。","ko":"확장 가능한 Notion 템플릿 비즈니스 기능이 필요한 디지털 제품 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Producto Digital que necesitan capacidades de negocio de plantillas de Notion escalables.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Produit Numérique ayant besoin de capacités d''entreprise de modèles Notion évolutives.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Produktagenten, die skalierbare Notion-Vorlagen-Geschäftsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produto Digital que necessitam de capacidades de negócios de modelo de Notion escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для цифровых продуктов агентов, которым необходимы масштабируемые возможности шаблонов Notion.","ar":"مثالي لموكلات المنتجات الرقمية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات أعمال قابلة للتوسيع لنموذج Notion."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and market Notion templates, leveraging Gumroad and Lemon Squeezy for seamless digital product distribution, while utilizing Notion marketplace strategies for maximum reach.","zh":"赋予代理设计和营销 Notion 模板的能力，利用 Gumroad 和 Lemon Squeezy 实现无缝的数字产品分销，同时利用 Notion 市场策略实现最大范围的覆盖。","ja":"Notion テンプレートを設計およびマーケティングできるエージェントをEmpowerし、Gumroad と Lemon Squeezy を使用してデジタル製品の配布をスムーズに行い、Notion マーケットプレイス戦略を使用して最大のリーチを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Notion 템플릿을 설계하고 마케팅할 수 있도록 Empower하고, Gumroad와 Lemon Squeezy를 사용하여 디지털 제품의 분배를 원활하게 수행하며, Notion 시장 전략을 사용하여 최대 범위의 커버지를 달성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y comercializar plantillas de Notion, aprovechando Gumroad y Lemon Squeezy para una distribución de productos digitales sin problemas, al mismo tiempo que utiliza estrategias del mercado de Notion para alcanzar el máximo alcance.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de commercialiser des modèles Notion, en exploitant Gumroad et Lemon Squeezy pour une distribution de produits numériques sans accroc, tout en utilisant les stratégies du marché Notion pour atteindre une portée maximale.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Notion-Vorlagen zu entwerfen und zu vermarkten, indem sie Gumroad und Lemon Squeezy für eine nahtlose digitale Produktdistribution nutzen und dabei Notion-Marktplatzstrategien für maximale Reichweite einsetzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e comercializar modelos de Notion, utilizando Gumroad e Lemon Squeezy para distribuição de produtos digitais sem interrupções, enquanto utiliza estratégias de mercado de Notion para alcance máximo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и продвигать шаблоны Notion, используя Gumroad и Lemon Squeezy для бесшовной цифровой продукции, а также используя стратегии рынка Notion для максимального охвата.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتسويق نماذج Notion، مستخدمين Gumroad و Lemon Squeezy لتوزيع منتجات رقمية دون انقطاع، مع استخدام استراتيجيات سوق Notion لتحقيق أقصى حد من الوصول."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing profitable Notion templates","Developing template pricing strategies","Automating template sales with Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy setup"],"zh":["设计可盈利的 Notion 模板","开发模板定价策略","使用 Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy 设置自动模板销售"],"ja":["収益性の高い Notion テンプレートを設計する","テンプレートの価格戦略を開発する","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy の設定を使用してテンプレートの販売を自動化する"],"ko":["수익성 있는 Notion 템플릿을 설계하는 것","템플릿 가격 전략을 개발하는 것","Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy 설정을 사용하여 템플릿 판매를 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar plantillas de Notion rentables","Desarrollar estrategias de precios de plantillas","Automatizar las ventas de plantillas con configuración de Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles Notion rentables","Développer des stratégies de tarification de modèles","Automatiser les ventes de modèles avec une configuration Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy"],"de":["Rentable Notion-Vorlagen entwerfen","Vorlagen-Preisstrategien entwickeln","Vorlagen-Verkäufe mit Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy-Einrichtung automatisieren"],"pt":["Projeto de modelos de Notion rentáveis","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de preços de modelos","Automatização de vendas de modelos com configuração Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy"],"ru":["Проектирование прибыльных шаблонов Notion","Разработка стратегий ценообразования шаблонов","Автоматизация продаж шаблонов с настройкой Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج Notion مربحة","تطوير استراتيجيات تسعير النماذج","تأتمة مبيعات النماذج مع إعداد Gumroad/Lemon Squeezy"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Notion account","Gumroad or Lemon Squeezy setup necessary","Limited to digital product sales"],"zh":["需要 Notion 账户","需要 Gumroad 或 Lemon Squeezy 设置","仅限数字产品销售"],"ja":["Notion アカウントが必要","Gumroad または Lemon Squeezy の設定が必要","デジタル製品の販売のみ"],"ko":["Notion 계정이 필요합니다","Gumroad 또는 Lemon Squeezy 설정이 필요합니다","디지털 제품 판매에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Notion","Configuración de Gumroad o Lemon Squeezy necesaria","Limitado a las ventas de productos digitales"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Notion","Configuration de Gumroad ou Lemon Squeezy nécessaire","Limité aux ventes de produits numériques"],"de":["Benötigt ein Notion-Konto","Gumroad- oder Lemon-Squeezy-Einrichtung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf den Verkauf digitaler Produkte"],"pt":["Requer conta Notion","Configuração Gumroad ou Lemon Squeezy necessária","Limitado a vendas de produtos digitais"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись Notion","Необходима настройка Gumroad или Lemon Squeezy","Ограничен продажами цифровых продуктов"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Notion","إعداد Gumroad أو Lemon Squeezy ضروري","محدود بتوزيع المنتجات الرقمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
