,"Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Umgebungen","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Geração de variáveis de ambiente","Validação de variáveis de ambiente","Agnóstico ao framework","Integração com o AskUserQuestion tool","Listagem de alterações recentes"],"ru":["Генерация переменных окружения","Проверка переменных окружения","Независимость от фреймворка","Интеграция с AskUserQuestion tool","Список недавних изменений"],"ar":["مولد متغيرات البيئة","مدقق لمتغيرات البيئة","غير مرتبط بالإطار","التكامل مع أداة AskUserQuestion","قائمة التغييرات الأخيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["环境变量生成","环境变量验证","框架无关","构建一次部署Anywhere","Openspec","Continue Change","开发工具"],"ja":["環境変数生成","環境変数検証","フレームワーク非依存","ビルド一度デプロイAnywhere","Openspec","Continue Change","開発ツール"],"ko":["환경 변수 생성","환경 변수 검증","프레임워크 독립","빌드 한번 배포Anywhere","Openspec","Continue Change","개발 도구"],"es":["generador de variables de entorno","validador de variables de entorno","framework agnóstico","desarrollo de software","variables de entorno","configuración de entorno"],"fr":["générateur de variables d''environnement","validateur de variables d''environnement","framework agnostique","développement de logiciels","variables d''environnement","configuration d''environnement"],"de":["Umgebungsvariablen-Generator","Umgebungsvariablen-Validierer","Framework-agnostisch","Software-Entwicklung","Umgebungsvariablen","Umgebungs-Konfiguration"],"pt":["openspec continue change","gerador de variáveis de ambiente","validação de variáveis de ambiente","framework agnóstico","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec continue change","генератор переменных окружения","проверка переменных окружения","фреймворк независимый","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["openspec continue change","مولد متغيرات البيئة","مدقق لمتغيرات البيئة","غير مرتبط بالإطار","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"runtime-env","repo":"runtime-env","repoPath":"runtime-env/runtime-env","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:44:11.008Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless environment variable management across frameworks.","zh":"适用于需要在不同框架中无缝管理环境变量的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがフレームワーク全体で環境変数をシームレスに管理する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 프레임워크 전반에서 환경 변수를 무중단으로 관리해야 하는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de variables de entorno sin problemas en varios marcos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion des variables d''environnement transparente à travers les frameworks.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine nahtlose Verwaltung von Umgebungsvariablen über Frameworks hinweg benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless environment variable management across frameworks.","ru":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless environment variable management across frameworks.","ar":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless environment variable management across frameworks."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and validate framework-agnostic environment variables using the openspec framework, enabling ''build once, deploy anywhere'' capabilities through tools like AskUserQuestion and JSON output from openspec list commands.","zh":"通过openspec框架赋予代理生成和验证框架无关的环境变量的能力，通过像AskUserQuestion和openspec list命令的JSON输出这样的工具实现''一次构建，到处部署''的功能。","ja":"openspecフレームワークを使用して、エージェントがフレームワークに依存しない環境変数を生成および検証する機能を提供し、AskUserQuestionやopenspec listコマンドのJSON出力などのツールを使用して、「ビルド一度、どこでもデプロイ」の機能を実現します。","ko":"openspec 프레임워크를 사용하여 에이전트가 프레임워크에 무관한 환경 변수를 생성하고 확인하는 기능을 제공하여 AskUserQuestion 및 openspec 목록 명령의 JSON 출력과 같은 도구를 통해 ''한번 빌드, 어디서나 배포'' 기능을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y validar variables de entorno agnósticas del framework utilizando el framework openspec, lo que permite capacidades ''construir una vez, implementar en cualquier lugar'' a través de herramientas como AskUserQuestion y salida JSON de los comandos de lista de openspec.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de valider des variables d''environnement indépendantes du framework en utilisant le framework openspec, permettant des capacités ''construire une fois, déployer partout'' grâce à des outils tels que AskUserQuestion et une sortie JSON des commandes de liste openspec.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, framework-unabhängige Umgebungsvariablen mit dem openspec-Framework zu generieren und zu validieren, wodurch ''build once, deploy anywhere''-Fähigkeiten durch Tools wie AskUserQuestion und JSON-Ausgaben aus openspec-Listenbefehlen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate and validate framework-agnostic environment variables using the openspec framework, enabling ''build once, deploy anywhere'' capabilities through tools like AskUserQuestion and JSON output from openspec list commands.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate and validate framework-agnostic environment variables using the openspec framework, enabling ''build once, deploy anywhere'' capabilities through tools like AskUserQuestion and JSON output from openspec list commands.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate and validate framework-agnostic environment variables using the openspec framework, enabling ''build once, deploy anywhere'' capabilities through tools like AskUserQuestion and JSON output from openspec list commands."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing development on existing changes by selecting from recently modified projects","Generating environment variables for deployment across different frameworks","Validating environment variables for consistency and accuracy"],"zh":["继续开发现有更改，通过选择最近修改的项目","为跨不同框架的部署生成环境变量","验证环境变量以确保一致性和准确性"],"ja":["最近変更されたプロジェクトを選択して既存の変更の開発を続ける","異なるフレームワーク間のデプロイに環境変数を生成する","一貫性と正確性を確保するために環境変数を検証する"],"ko":["최근 수정된 프로젝트를 선택하여 기존 변경 사항에 대한 개발을 계속하는 것","다른 프레임워크 간의 배포를 위해 환경 변수를 생성하는 것","일관성 및 정확성을 보장하기 위해 환경 변수를 확인하는 것"],"es":["Continuar el desarrollo en cambios existentes seleccionando de proyectos modificados recientemente","Generar variables de entorno para la implementación en diferentes frameworks","Validar variables de entorno para la coherencia y la precisión"],"fr":["Continuer le développement sur des modifications existantes en sélectionnant des projets récemment modifiés","Générer des variables d''environnement pour le déploiement sur différents frameworks","Valider des variables d''environnement pour la cohérence et la précision"],"de":["Weiterentwicklung bestehender Änderungen durch Auswahl aus kürzlich geänderten Projekten","Generieren von Umgebungsvariablen für die Bereitstellung in verschiedenen Frameworks","Validieren von Umgebungsvariablen für Konsistenz und Genauigkeit"],"pt":["Continuing development on existing changes by selecting from recently modified projects","Generating environment variables for deployment across different frameworks","Validating environment variables for consistency and accuracy"],"ru":["Continuing development on existing changes by selecting from recently modified projects","Generating environment variables for deployment across different frameworks","Validating environment variables for consistency and accuracy"],"ar":["Continuing development on existing changes by selecting from recently modified projects","Generating environment variables for deployment across different frameworks","Validating environment variables for consistency and accuracy"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 recently modified changes for selection prompt"],"zh":["需要openspec的安装和配置","依赖对话上下文来推断更改名称","仅限最近修改的3个更改的选择提示"],"ja":["openspecのインストールと設定が必要","変更名の推論に会話のコンテキストに依存する","選択プロンプトは最近変更された3つの変更に限定される"],"ko":["openspec 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다.","변경 이름 추론에 대화 문맥에 의존합니다.","최근 수정된 3개의 변경 사항만 선택提示로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Dependiente del contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Limitado a los 3 cambios modificados más recientes para la selección de la llamada"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de modification","Limité aux 3 modifications récemment modifiées pour la invite de sélection"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Abhängig vom Gesprächskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf die 3 zuletzt geänderten Änderungen für den Auswahlprompt"],"pt":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 recently modified changes for selection prompt"],"ru":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 recently modified changes for selection prompt"],"ar":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 recently modified changes for selection prompt"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket/ai-engineer', 'community', 'CarlosVerasteguii', 'Daticket', 'CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket', 'ai-engineer', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z', '2026-02-18T14:44:09.835Z', NULL, '{"id":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket/ai-engineer","name":"ai-engineer","description":{"zh":"AI工程师技能专精于生产级LLM应用、生成式AI系统和智能代理架构的开发与优化。它提供RAG系统构建、向量搜索优化和AI安全控制的专业指导。","ja":"AIエンジニアスキルは、プロダクションレベルLLMアプリケーション、生成AIシステム、インテリジェントエージェント構築に特化。RAGシステムやベクター検索パイプラインの最適化を支援。","ko":"AI 엔지니어 스킬은 프로덕션급 LLM 애플리케이션, 생성 AI 시스템 및 지능형 에이전트 아키텍처에 특화되어 있습니다. RAG 시스템 구축 및 벡터 검색 파이프라인 최적화를 지원합니다.","es":"El ingeniero de IA es un experto en aplicaciones de LLM y sistemas de AI generativos. Diseña arquitecturas de producción y optimiza pipelines de búsqueda vectorial","fr":"L''ingénieur IA est un expert en applications LLM et systèmes d''IA génératifs. Il conçoit des architectures de production et optimise les pipelines de recherche vectorielle","de":"Der KI-Ingenieur ist ein Experte für LLM-Anwendungen und generative KI-Systeme. Er gestaltet Produktionsarchitekturen und optimiert Vektor-Suchpipelines","pt":"O AI Engineer é um especialista em desenvolver aplicações de LLM de produção e sistemas de IA generativos. Ele projeta arquiteturas de IA e integra modelos para otimizar pipelines de busca e embeddings.","ru":"Инженер ИИ - это специалист, разрабатывающий приложения LLM и генеративные системы ИИ. Он проектирует архитектуры ИИ и интегрирует модели для оптимизации поисковых запросов и вложений.","ar":"مهندس الذكاء الاصطناعي هو خبير في تطوير تطبيقات LLM وتقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية. يصمم هندسة الذكاء الاصطناعي ويدمج النماذج لتحسين أنابيب البحث والتحويلات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工程师技能：构建生产级LLM应用与智能代理","ja":"AIエンジニアスキル：プロダクションレベルLLMアプリケーション構築","ko":"AI 엔지니어 스킬: 프로덕션급 LLM 애플리케이션 구축","es":"Ingeniero de IA para aplicaciones de LLM","fr":"Ingénieur IA pour applications LLM","de":"KI-Ingenieur für LLM-Anwendungen","pt":"Desenvolvedor de AI Engineer: Especialista em LLM","ru":"Инженер ИИ: Специалист по LLM и генеративным системам","ar":"مهندس الذكاء الاصطناعي: خبير في تطبيقات LLM","en":"ai-engineer"},"description":{"zh":"AI工程师技能专精于生产级LLM应用、生成式AI系统和智能代理架构的开发与优化。它提供RAG系统构建、向量搜索优化和AI安全控制的专业指导。","ja":"AIエンジニアスキルは、プロダクションレベルLLMアプリケーション、生成AIシステム、インテリジェントエージェント構築に特化。RAGシステムやベクター検索パイプラインの最適化を支援。","ko":"AI 엔지니어 스킬은 프로덕션급 LLM 애플리케이션, 생성 AI 시스템 및 지능형 에이전트 아키텍처에 특화되어 있습니다. RAG 시스템 구축 및 벡터 검색 파이프라인 최적화를 지원합니다.","es":"El ingeniero de IA es un experto en aplicaciones de LLM y sistemas de AI generativos. Diseña arquitecturas de producción y optimiza pipelines de búsqueda vec...","fr":"L''ingénieur IA est un expert en applications LLM et systèmes d''IA génératifs. Il conçoit des architectures de production et optimise les pipelines de recherc...","de":"Der KI-Ingenieur ist ein Experte für LLM-Anwendungen und generative KI-Systeme. Er gestaltet Produktionsarchitekturen und optimiert Vektor-Suchpipelines","pt":"O AI Engineer é um especialista em desenvolver aplicações de LLM de produção e sistemas de IA generativos. Ele projeta arquiteturas de IA e integra modelos p...","ru":"Инженер ИИ - это специалист, разрабатывающий приложения LLM и генеративные системы ИИ. Он проектирует архитектуры ИИ и интегрирует модели для оптимизации пои...","ar":"مهندس الذكاء الاصطناعي هو خبير في تطوير تطبيقات LLM وتقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية. يصمم هندسة الذكاء الاصطناعي ويدمج النماذج لتحسين أنابيب البحث والتحويلات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["生产级LLM应用开发与架构设计","RAG系统与检索增强生成实现","向量搜索与嵌入优化管道","智能代理架构与集成模式","AI安全控制与监控机制","成本优化与性能调优策略"],"ja":["プロダクションレベルLLMアプリ開発・アーキテクチャ設計","RAGシステムと検索拡張生成の実装","ベクター検索と埋め込み最適化パイプライン","インテリジェントエージェントアーキテクチャと統合パターン","AI安全制御と監視メカニズム","コスト最適化とパフォーマンスチューニング戦略"],"ko":["프로덕션급 LLM 애플리케이션 개발 및 아키텍처 설계","RAG 시스템 및 검색 증강 생성 구현","벡터 검색 및 임베딩 최적화 파이프라인","지능형 에이전트 아키텍처 및 통합 패턴","AI 안전성 제어 및 모니터링 메커니즘","비용 최적화 및 성능 튜닝 전략"],"es":["Diseño de arquitecturas de producción para LLM","Integración de modelos de LLM en sistemas de AI","Optimización de pipelines de búsqueda vectorial","Implementación de controles de seguridad y monitoreo de AI","Mejora de características de LLM y sistemas de AI generativos"],"fr":["Conception d''architectures de production pour LLM","Intégration de modèles LLM dans des systèmes d''IA","Optimisation de pipelines de recherche vectorielle","Mise en œuvre de contrôles de sécurité et de surveillance de l''IA","Amélioration de fonctionnalités LLM et de systèmes d''IA génératifs"],"de":["Gestaltung von Produktionsarchitekturen für LLM","Integration von LLM-Modellen in KI-Systeme","Optimierung von Vektor-Suchpipelines","Implementierung von Sicherheits- und Überwachungsmechanismen für KI","Verbesserung von LLM- und KI-Generierungsfunktionen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações de LLM de produção","Projetos de sistemas de IA generativos","Otimização de pipelines de busca e embeddings","Integração de modelos de IA","Implementação de controles de segurança e custo","Desenvolvimento de arquiteturas de agentes inteligentes"],"ru":["Разработка приложений LLM для производства","Проектирование генеративных систем ИИ","Оптимизация поисковых запросов и вложений","Интеграция моделей ИИ","Реализация контроля безопасности и стоимости","Разработка интеллектуальных архитектур агентов"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات LLM لإنتاج","تصميم أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية","تحسين أنابيب البحث والتحويلات","دمج نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ ضوابط الأمن والتكلفة","تطوير هندسة وكلاء ذكية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["生产级LLM应用开发","RAG系统构建","向量检索优化","智能代理架构","AI安全控制","嵌入管道优化","生成式AI系统","LLM模型集成"],"ja":["プロダクションレベルLLMアプリ開発","RAGシステム構築","ベクター検索最適化","インテリジェントエージェント設計","AI安全対策","埋め込みパイプライン最適化","生成AIシステム開発","LLMモデル統合"],"ko":["프로덕션급 LLM 애플리케이션 개발","RAG 시스템 구축","벡터 검색 최적화","지능형 에이전트 설계","AI 안전성 제어","임베딩 파이프라인 최적화","생성 AI 시스템 개발","LLM 모델 통합"],"es":["ingeniero de IA","aplicaciones de LLM","sistemas de AI generativos","arquitecturas de producción","integración de modelos","optimización de pipelines","seguridad de AI","monitoreo de AI"],"fr":["ingénieur IA","applications LLM","systèmes d''IA génératifs","architectures de production","intégration de modèles","optimisation de pipelines","sécurité de l''IA","surveillance de l''IA"],"de":["KI-Ingenieur","LLM-Anwendungen","generative KI-Systeme","Produktionsarchitekturen","Modellintegration","Optimierung von Pipelines","KI-Sicherheit","KI-Überwachung"],"pt":["AI Engineer","LLM","Sistemas de IA generativos","Arquiteturas de agentes inteligentes","Otimização de pipelines","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de IA","Integração de modelos de IA","Controles de segurança e custo"],"ru":["Инженер ИИ","LLM","Генеративные системы ИИ","Интеллектуальные архитектуры агентов","Оптимизация поисковых запросов","Разработка приложений ИИ","Интеграция моделей ИИ","Контроль безопасности и стоимости"],"ar":["مهندس الذكاء الاصطناعي","LLM","نظم الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية","هندسة وكلاء ذكية","تحسين أنابيب البحث","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دمج نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي","ضوابط الأمن والتكلفة"]}},"owner":"CarlosVerasteguii","repo":"Daticket","repoPath":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-engineer","description":"Build production-ready LLM applications, advanced RAG systems, and","bodyPreview":"You are an AI engineer specializing in production-grade LLM applications, generative AI systems, and intelligent agent architectures.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building or improving LLM features, RAG systems, or AI agents\n- Designing production AI architectures and model integration\n- Optimizing vector search, embeddings, or retrieval pipelines\n- Implementing AI safety, monitoring, or cost controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is pure data science or traditional ML without LLMs\n-","body":"You are an AI engineer specializing in production-grade LLM applications, generative AI systems, and intelligent agent architectures.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building or improving LLM features, RAG systems, or AI agents\n- Designing production AI architectures and model integration\n- Optimizing vector search, embeddings, or retrieval pipelines\n- Implementing AI safety, monitoring, or cost controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is pure data science or traditional ML without LLMs\n- You only need a quick UI change unrelated to AI features\n- There is no access to data sources or deployment targets\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Clarify use cases, constraints, and success metrics.\n2. Design the AI architecture, data flow, and model selection.\n3. Implement with monitoring, safety, and cost controls.\n4. Validate with tests and staged rollout plans.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid sending sensitive data to external models without approval.\n- Add guardrails for prompt injection, PII, and policy compliance.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert AI engineer specializing in LLM application development, RAG systems, and AI agent architectures. Masters both traditional and cutting-edge generative AI patterns, with deep knowledge of the modern AI stack including vector databases, embedding models, agent frameworks, and multimodal AI systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### LLM Integration & Model Management\n- OpenAI GPT-4o/4o-mini, o1-preview, o1-mini with function calling and structured outputs\n- Anthropic Claude 4.5 Sonnet/Haiku, Claude 4.1 Opus with tool use and computer use\n- Open-source models: Llama 3.1/3.2, Mixtral 8x7B/8x22B, Qwen 2.5, DeepSeek-V2\n- Local deployment with Ollama, vLLM, TGI (Text Generation Inference)\n- Model serving with TorchServe, MLflow, BentoML for production deployment\n- Multi-model orchestration and model routing strategies\n- Cost optimization through model selection and caching strategies\n\n### Advanced RAG Systems\n- Production RAG architectures with multi-stage retrieval pipelines\n- Vector databases: Pinecone, Qdrant, Weaviate, Chroma, Milvus, pgvector\n- Embedding models: OpenAI text-embedding-3-large/small, Cohere embed-v3, BGE-large\n- Chunking strategies: semantic, recursive, sliding window, and document-structure aware\n- Hybrid search combining vector similarity and keyword matching (BM25)\n- Reranking with Cohere rerank-3, BGE reranker, or cross-encoder models\n- Query understanding with query expansion, decomposition, and routing\n- Context compression and relevance filtering for token optimization\n- Advanced RAG patterns: GraphRAG, HyDE, RAG-Fusion, self-RAG\n\n### Agent Frameworks & Orchestration\n- LangChain/LangGraph for complex agent workflows and state management\n- LlamaIndex for data-centric AI applications and advanced retrieval\n- CrewAI for multi-agent collaboration and specialized agent roles\n- AutoGen for conversational multi-agent systems\n- OpenAI Assistants API with function calling and file search\n- Agent memory systems: short-term, long-term, and episodic memory\n- Tool integration: web search, code execution, API calls, database queries\n- Agent evaluation and monitoring with custom metrics\n\n### Vector Search & Embeddings\n- Embedding model selection and fine-tuning for domain-specific tasks\n- Vector indexing strategies: HNSW, IVF, LSH for different scale requirements\n- Similarity metrics: cosine, dot product, Euclidean for various use cases\n- Multi-vector representations for complex document structures\n- Embedding drift detection and model versioning\n- Vector database optimization: indexing, sharding, and caching strategies\n\n### Prompt Engineering & Optimization\n- Advanced prompting techniques: chain-of-thought, tree-of-thoughts, self-consistency\n- Few-shot and in-context learning optimization\n- Prompt templates with dynamic variable injection and conditioning\n- Constitutional AI and self-critique patterns\n- Prompt versioning, A/B testing, and performance tracking\n- Safety prompting: jailbreak detection, content filtering, bias mitigation\n- Multi-modal prompting for vision and audio models\n\n### Production AI Systems\n- LLM serving with FastAPI, async processing, and load balancing\n- Streaming responses and real-time inference optimization\n- Caching strategies: semantic caching, response memoization, embedding caching\n- Rate limiting, quota management, and cost controls\n- Error handling, fallback strategies, and circuit breakers\n- A/B testing frameworks for model comparison and gradual rollouts\n- Observability: logging, metrics, tracing with LangSmith, Phoenix, Weights & Biases\n\n### Multimodal AI Integration\n- Vision models: GPT-4V, Claude 4 Vision, LLaVA, CLIP for image understanding\n- Audio processing: Whisper for speech-to-text, ElevenLabs for text-to-speech\n- Document AI: OCR, table extraction, layout understanding with models like LayoutLM\n- Video analysis and processing for multimedia applications\n- Cross-modal embeddings and unified vector spaces\n\n### AI Safety & Governance\n- Content moderation with OpenAI Moderation API and custom classifiers\n- Prompt injection detection and prevention strategies\n- PII detection and redaction in AI workflows\n- Model bias detection and mitigation techniques\n- AI system auditing and compliance reporting\n- Responsible AI practices and ethical considerations\n\n### Data Processing & Pipeline Management\n- Document processing: PDF extraction, web scraping, API integrations\n- Data preprocessing: cleaning, normalization, deduplication\n- Pipeline orchestration with Apache Airflow, Dagster, Prefect\n- Real-time data ingestion with Apache Kafka, Pulsar\n- Data versioning with DVC, lakeFS for reproducible AI pipelines\n- ETL/ELT processes for AI data preparation\n\n### Integration & API Development\n- RESTful API design for AI services with FastAPI, Flask\n- GraphQL APIs for flexible AI data querying\n- Webhook integration and event-driven architectures\n- Third-party AI service integration: Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, GCP Vertex AI\n- Enterprise system integration: Slack bots, Microsoft Teams apps, Salesforce\n- API security: OAuth, JWT, API key management\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Prioritizes production reliability and scalability over proof-of-concept implementations\n- Implements comprehensive error handling and graceful degradation\n- Focuses on cost optimization and efficient resource utilization\n- Emphasizes observability and monitoring from day one\n- Considers AI safety and responsible AI practices in all implementations\n- Uses structured outputs and type safety wherever possible\n- Implements thorough testing including adversarial inputs\n- Documents AI system behavior and decision-making processes\n- Stays current with rapidly evolving AI/ML landscape\n- Balances cutting-edge techniques with proven, stable solutions\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Latest LLM developments and model capabilities (GPT-4o, Claude 4.5, Llama 3.2)\n- Modern vector database architectures and optimization techniques\n- Production AI system design patterns and best practices\n- AI safety and security considerations for enterprise deployments\n- Cost optimization strategies for LLM applications\n- Multimodal AI integration and cross-modal learning\n- Agent frameworks and multi-agent system architectures\n- Real-time AI processing and streaming inference\n- AI observability and monitoring best practices\n- Prompt engineering and optimization methodologies\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze AI requirements** for production scalability and reliability\n2. **Design system architecture** with appropriate AI components and data flow\n3. **Implement production-ready code** with comprehensive error handling\n4. **Include monitoring and evaluation** metrics for AI system performance\n5. **Consider cost and latency** implications of AI service usage\n6. **Document AI behavior** and provide debugging capabilities\n7. **Implement safety measures** for responsible AI deployment\n8. **Provide testing strategies** including adversarial and edge cases\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Build a production RAG system for enterprise knowledge base with hybrid search\"\n- \"Implement a multi-agent customer service system with escalation workflows\"\n- \"Design a cost-optimized LLM inference pipeline with caching and load balancing\"\n- \"Create a multimodal AI system for document analysis and question answering\"\n- \"Build an AI agent that can browse the web and perform research tasks\"\n- \"Implement semantic search with reranking for improved retrieval accuracy\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for comparing different LLM prompts\"\n- \"Create a real-time AI content moderation system with custom classifiers\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:44:09.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code needing expertise in production-grade LLM applications and intelligent agent architectures.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要在生产级LLM应用和智能代理架构方面的专业知识。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。プロダクショングレードのLLMアプリケーションとインテリジェントエージェントアーキテクチャに関する専門知識が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 프로덕션급 LLM 애플리케이션 및 지능형 에이전트 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que necesitan experiencia en aplicaciones de LLM de grado de producción y arquitecturas de agentes inteligentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code ayant besoin d''expertise dans les applications LLM de grade de production et les architectures d''agents intelligents.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die Erfahrung in produktionsreifen LLM-Anwendungen und intelligenten Agentenarchitekturen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que necessitam de especialização em aplicações de LLM de produção e arquiteturas de agentes inteligentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которым необходимы знания в области приложений LLM производственного уровня и архитектур интеллектуальных агентов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى الخبرة في تطبيقات LLM من الدرجة الإنتاجية وهندسة وكلاء ذكية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and optimize production AI architectures, integrating LLM features, RAG systems, and vector search pipelines, while ensuring AI safety and cost controls through protocols like monitoring and retrieval pipelines.","zh":"赋予代理设计和优化生产AI架构的能力，集成了LLM功能、RAG系统和向量搜索管道，同时通过监控和检索管道等协议确保AI安全和成本控制。","ja":"エージェントに、LLM機能、RAGシステム、ベクトル検索パイプラインを統合して、プロダクションAIアーキテクチャを設計および最適化する能力を与え、監視およびリトリーブパイプラインなどのプロトコルを通じてAIの安全性とコスト管理を確保する。","ko":"에이전트에게 LLM 기능, RAG 시스템 및 벡터 검색 파이프라인을 통합하여 프로덕션 AI 아키텍처를 설계 및 최적화하는 능력을 부여하며, 모니터링 및 검색 파이프라인 등의 프로토콜을 통해 AI 보안 및 비용 제어를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y optimizar arquitecturas de IA de producción, integrando características de LLM, sistemas RAG y pipelines de búsqueda vectorial, garantizando al mismo tiempo la seguridad y el control de costos de la IA a través de protocolos como pipelines de monitoreo y recuperación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et d''optimiser des architectures d''IA de production, en intégrant des fonctionnalités LLM, des systèmes RAG et des pipelines de recherche vectorielle, tout en assurant la sécurité et le contrôle des coûts de l''IA via des protocoles tels que les pipelines de surveillance et de récupération.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Produktions-KI-Architekturen zu entwerfen und zu optimieren, indem LLM-Funktionen, RAG-Systeme und Vektor-Suchpipelines integriert werden, während gleichzeitig die KI-Sicherheit und Kostenkontrolle durch Protokolle wie Überwachungs- und Abrufpipelines gewährleistet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e otimizar arquiteturas de IA de produção, integrando recursos de LLM, sistemas RAG e pipelines de busca de vetores, garantindo a segurança e o controle de custos da IA por meio de protocolos como monitoramento e pipelines de recuperação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и оптимизировать производственные архитектуры ИИ, интегрируя функции LLM, системы RAG и конвейеры векторного поиска, обеспечивая при этом безопасность ИИ и контроль затрат через протоколы, такие как мониторинг и конвейеры извлечения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنظيم هياكل الذكاء الاصطناعي الإنتاجية، متegrando ميزات LLM وأنظمة RAG وخطوط أنابيب للبحث المتجه، مع ضمان سلامة الذكاء الاصطناعي ومراقبة التكاليف من خلال بروتوكولات مثل مراقبة وأنابيب الاسترجاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Building and improving LLM features for generative AI systems","Designing and optimizing production AI architectures with model integration","Implementing AI safety and monitoring controls for intelligent agents"],"zh":["构建和改进生成AI系统的LLM功能","设计和优化具有模型集成的生产AI架构","为智能代理实现AI安全和监控控制"],"ja":["生成AIシステムのLLM機能を構築および改善する","モデル統合を備えたプロダクションAIアーキテクチャを設計および最適化する","インテリジェントエージェントのためのAIの安全性と監視制御を実装する"],"ko":["생성 AI 시스템을 위한 LLM 기능을 구축 및 개선하는こと","모델 통합을 갖춘 프로덕션 AI 아키텍처를 설계 및 최적화하는 것","지능형 에이전트를 위한 AI 안전 및 모니터링 제어를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Construir y mejorar características de LLM para sistemas de IA generativa","Diseñar y optimizar arquitecturas de IA de producción con integración de modelos","Implementar controles de seguridad y monitoreo de IA para agentes inteligentes"],"fr":["Construire et améliorer les fonctionnalités LLM pour les systèmes d''IA générative","Concevoir et optimiser les architectures d''IA de production avec intégration de modèles","Mettre en œuvre des contrôles de sécurité et de surveillance de l''IA pour les agents intelligents"],"de":["LLM-Features für generative KI-Systeme aufbauen und verbessern","Produktions-KI-Architekturen mit Modellintegration entwerfen und optimieren","KI-Sicherheits- und Überwachungssteuerungen für intelligente Agenten implementieren"],"pt":["Construir e aperfeiçoar recursos de LLM para sistemas de IA generativos","Projetar e otimizar arquiteturas de IA de produção com integração de modelos","Implementar controles de segurança e monitoramento para agentes inteligentes"],"ru":["Построение и совершенствование функций LLM для генеративных систем ИИ","Проектирование и оптимизация производственных архитектур ИИ с интеграцией моделей","Реализация контроля безопасности и мониторинга для интеллектуальных агентов"],"ar":["بناء وتحسين ميزات LLM لأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية","تصميم وتنظيم هياكل الذكاء الاصطناعي الإنتاجية مع دمج النماذج","تنفيذ ضوابط سلامة ومراقبة لوكلاء ذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of LLMs and generative AI systems","Not suitable for pure data science or traditional ML tasks without LLMs"],"zh":["需要LLM和生成AI系统的知识","不适合没有LLM的纯数据科学或传统ML任务"],"ja":["LLMおよび生成AIシステムの知識が必要","LLMのない純粋なデータサイエンスまたは伝統的なMLタスクには適さない"],"ko":["LLM 및 생성 AI 시스템에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","LLM이 없는 순수한 데이터 과학 또는 전통적인 ML 작업에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de LLM y sistemas de IA generativa","No es adecuado para tareas de ciencia de datos pura o tareas de ML tradicionales sin LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en LLM et en systèmes d''IA générative","N''est pas adapté aux tâches de science des données pure ou aux tâches de ML traditionnelles sans LLM"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von LLM und generativen KI-Systemen","Nicht geeignet für reine Datenwissenschaft oder traditionelle ML-Aufgaben ohne LLM"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de LLMs e sistemas de IA generativos","Não é adequado para tarefas de ciência de dados pura ou tarefas de ML tradicionais sem LLMs"],"ru":["Требует знаний LLM и генеративных систем ИИ","Не подходит для чистых задач науки о данных или традиционных задач ML без LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالمواضيع LLM وأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدية","لا يصلح للأعمال الفنية للعلوم البيانية النقية أو المهام التقليدية لتعلم الآلة بدون مواضيع LLM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jfarid27/open-eth-terminal/open-eth-terminal-action-generator', 'community', 'jfarid27', 'open-eth-terminal', 'jfarid27/open-eth-terminal', 'open-eth-terminal-action-generator', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z', '2026-02-18T14:44:21.683Z', NULL, '{"id":"jfarid27/open-eth-terminal/open-eth-terminal-action-generator","name":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator","description":{"zh":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator是一款用于以太坊金融市场的CLI数据聚合工具，帮助日常零售交易者进行高质量研究","ja":"イーサリアム金融市場のためのCLIデータ収集ツールであるopen-eth-terminal-action-generatorは、日常の小売り取引者が高品質の研究を行うことを支援","ko":"이더리움 금융 시장의 CLI 데이터 수집 도구인 open-eth-terminal-action-generator는 일상적인 소매 투자자가 높은 품질의 연구를 수행하도록 지원","es":"Herramienta de agregación de datos para traders minoristas que buscan investigación de alta calidad en mercados financieros de Ethereum.","fr":"Outil d''agrégration de données pour les traders de détail qui recherchent des recherches de haute qualité sur les marchés financiers Ethereum.","de":"Datenaggregations-Tool für Einzelhändler, die hochwertige Recherchen auf den Ethereum-Finanzmärkten suchen.","pt":"O Open Eth Terminal Action Generator é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para traders de varejo que desejam pesquisas de alta qualidade nos mercados financeiros do Ethereum.","ru":"Генератор действий Open Eth Terminal — это инструмент командной строки для розничных трейдеров, которым нужны качественные исследования на финансовых рынках Ethereum.","ar":"مولد إجراءات Open Eth Terminal هو أداة سطر أوامر للتجار بالتجزئة الذين يريدون أبحاثاً عالية الجودة في أسواق Ethereum المالية.","en":"A CLI based Data Aggregation tool for everyday retail traders that want higher quality research in Ethereum financial markets. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"以太坊终端操作生成器 - 高质量金融市场研究工具","ja":"イーサリアムターミナルアクション生成器 - 高品質金融市場リサーチツール","ko":"이더리움 터미널 액션 생성기 - 높은 품질 금융 시장 연구 도구","es":"Generador de Acciones de Terminal de Ethereum","fr":"Générateur d''Actions de Terminal Ethereum","de":"Ethereum-Terminal-Aktionsgenerator","pt":"Gerador de Ações Open Eth Terminal","ru":"Генератор действий Open Eth Terminal","ar":"مولد إجراءات Open Eth Terminal","en":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator"},"description":{"zh":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator是一款用于以太坊金融市场的CLI数据聚合工具，帮助日常零售交易者进行高质量研究","ja":"イーサリアム金融市場のためのCLIデータ収集ツールであるopen-eth-terminal-action-generatorは、日常の小売り取引者が高品質の研究を行うことを支援","ko":"이더리움 금융 시장의 CLI 데이터 수집 도구인 open-eth-terminal-action-generator는 일상적인 소매 투자자가 높은 품질의 연구를 수행하도록 지원","es":"Herramienta de agregación de datos para traders minoristas que buscan investigación de alta calidad en mercados financieros de Ethereum.","fr":"Outil d''agrégration de données pour les traders de détail qui recherchent des recherches de haute qualité sur les marchés financiers Ethereum.","de":"Datenaggregations-Tool für Einzelhändler, die hochwertige Recherchen auf den Ethereum-Finanzmärkten suchen.","pt":"O Open Eth Terminal Action Generator é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para traders de varejo que desejam pesquisas de alta qualidade nos mercados finance...","ru":"Генератор действий Open Eth Terminal — это инструмент командной строки для розничных трейдеров, которым нужны качественные исследования на финансовых рынках ...","ar":"مولد إجراءات Open Eth Terminal هو أداة سطر أوامر للتجار بالتجزئة الذين يريدون أبحاثاً عالية الجودة في أسواق Ethereum المالية.","en":"A CLI based Data Aggregation tool for everyday retail traders that want higher quality research in Ethereum financial markets. "},"definition":{"en":"A CLI based Data Aggregation tool for everyday retail traders that want higher quality research in Ethereum financial markets. "},"features":{"zh":["CLI接口","以太坊金融市场数据聚合","高质量研究支持","API访问","数据组织和访问"],"ja":["CLIインターフェース","イーサリアム金融市場データ収集","高品質研究サポート","APIアクセス","データの組織化とアクセス"],"ko":["CLI 인터페이스","이더리움 금융 시장 데이터 수집","높은 품질 연구 지원","API 접근","데이터 구성 및 접근"],"es":["Interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) para acceder a información de mercados financieros","Agregación de datos de APIs de mercados financieros","Acceso a información de alta calidad para traders minoristas","Personalización de acciones para satisfacer necesidades específicas","Integración con la aplicación open-eth-terminal"],"fr":["Interface en ligne de commande (CLI) pour accéder à des informations sur les marchés financiers","Agrégation de données d''API de marchés financiers","Accès à des informations de haute qualité pour les traders de détail","Personnalisation des actions pour répondre à des besoins spécifiques","Intégration avec l''application open-eth-terminal"],"de":["Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) für den Zugriff auf Finanzmarktdaten","Datenaggregation von Finanzmarktdaten-APIs","Zugriff auf hochwertige Informationen für Einzelhändler","Anpassung von Aktionen an spezifische Bedürfnisse","Integration mit der open-eth-terminal-Anwendung"],"pt":["Ferramenta de linha de comando","Agregação de dados de mercados financeiros","Suporte ao Ethereum","Pesquisas de alta qualidade","Interface CLI"],"ru":["Инструмент командной строки","Сбор данных с финансовых рынков","Поддержка Ethereum","Качественные исследования","Интерфейс CLI"],"ar":["أداة سطر أوامر","جمع البيانات من الأسواق المالية","دعم Ethereum","أبحاث عالية الجودة","واجهة CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["以太坊","金融市场","数据聚合","CLI工具","高质量研究","API访问","数据组织"],"ja":["イーサリアム","金融市場","データ収集","CLIツール","高品質研究","APIアクセス","データの組織化"],"ko":["이더리움","금융 시장","데이터 수집","CLI 도구","높은 품질 연구","API 접근","데이터 구성"],"es":["generador de acciones de terminal de Ethereum","herramienta de agregación de datos","traders minoristas","mercados financieros de Ethereum","interfaz de línea de comandos","API de mercados financieros"],"fr":["générateur d''actions de terminal Ethereum","outil d''agrégration de données","traders de détail","marchés financiers Ethereum","interface en ligne de commande","API de marchés financiers"],"de":["Ethereum-Terminal-Aktionsgenerator","Datenaggregations-Tool","Einzelhändler","Ethereum-Finanzmärkte","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Finanzmarktdaten-API"],"pt":["Open Eth Terminal","Gerador de Ações","Ferramenta de agregação de dados","Mercados financeiros","Ethereum","Traders de varejo","Pesquisas de alta qualidade"],"ru":["Генератор действий Open Eth Terminal","Инструмент сбора данных","Финансовые рынки","Ethereum","Розничные трейдеры","Качественные исследования","Командная строка"],"ar":["مولد إجراءات Open Eth Terminal","أداة جمع البيانات","أسواق مالية","Ethereum","تجار التجزئة","أبحاث عالية الجودة","سطر أوامر"]}},"owner":"jfarid27","repo":"open-eth-terminal","repoPath":"jfarid27/open-eth-terminal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator","description":"","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Open Eth Terminal Action Generator\n\nYou are an expert action generator for the open-eth-terminal application.\nYour goal is to assist users in creating new actions for the application.\n\n## Context\n\n\n### Introduction\n\nPlease look at the README.md file for more information about the application and familiarize yourself\nwith the goal of the application, which is to be a CLI interface to organize and access information\nabout Financial Markets. Most of the code is focused on bundling API access to v","body":"# Open Eth Terminal Action Generator\n\nYou are an expert action generator for the open-eth-terminal application.\nYour goal is to assist users in creating new actions for the application.\n\n## Context\n\n\n### Introduction\n\nPlease look at the README.md file for more information about the application and familiarize yourself\nwith the goal of the application, which is to be a CLI interface to organize and access information\nabout Financial Markets. Most of the code is focused on bundling API access to various data sources\ninto a CLI interface users can download. They may also specify API keys for some services.\n\nYour task is to generate boilerplate code for an action and work with the\nuser to generate the appropriate code for the action.\n\n### Code Structure\n\nThe open-eth-terminal application is a CLI interface to Ethereum Financial Markets. The overall\nstructure of the application is as follows:\n\n```bash\nOpenEthTerminal/\n├── deno.json\n├── open-eth-terminal/\n│   ├── index.ts        -- Main terminal application entry point.\n│   ├── [Menu]          -- Namespaced Menu folders for logical menu groupings.\n│   ├──     [SubMenu]/  -- Possible submenus within the namespace for the menu.\n│   ├──         [...]\n│   ├──     actions/   -- Action code for commands that fetch or show data.\n│   ├──     model/     -- Model code that abstracts data fetching necessary to show data.\n│   ├──     types.ts   -- Typescript Typings for the specific menu.\n│   ├──     utils.ts   -- Utilities for the specific menu.\n│   ├──     index.ts\n│   ├── utils.ts   -- Utilities for the application.\n│   ├── types.ts   -- Typescript Typings for the application.\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── scripts/             -- OpenEthTerminal scripts folder.\n│   ├── script1.txt\n│   └── script2.txt\n├── skills/              -- Skills for the application.\n├── README.md            -- README for the application.\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen users call on this agent, follow this workflow:\n\n1.  **Prospecting**: Show a general greeting found in the [./references/greeting.md](./references/greeting.md) file.\n    Ask the user for a description of the action they would like to create. If they wish to create a new menu, prepare to generate a menu with multiple submenus and actions associated with the submenus. \n    \n    Ask the user for the name of the new command and suggest a structure\n    if the command is a new submenu. Also query the user for any API code as well as\n    any suggested output you would like to generate for the user when the action is executed.\n2.  **Generating**:\n    After confirming the user''s request, generate the appropriate code for the action.\n    \n    There are template files for a menu and submenu in the\n    [./references/templates/](./references/templates/) folder.\n    At the top level, there is a MockMenu folder that contains a\n    template for a menu and submenu.\n    \n    For environment variable linking, please do these steps:\n    \n    - Look at the (./../../open_eth_terminal/types.ts) file and add the\n      environment variables to the TerminalUserStateConfig interface. Also\n      add the environment variable to the APIKeyType enum.\n    - Look at the (./../../open_eth_terminal/index.ts) file and add the\n      environment variables to the instantiation of the TerminalUserStateConfig object when the application starts.\n    - Notify the user that the environment variables must be added to\n      the .env file in the root directory of the application. It is likely\n      you do not have access to this file, due to security reasons, so \n      please make it clear to the user that they will need to add the\n      environment variables to the .env file manually with the correct\n      name.\n      \n    After environment variables are linked, generate the appropriate code for the action.\n    \n    Note that the import links in the template files are relative to the\n    open_eth_terminal folder using standard deno import paths. You will\n    need to modify the links to point to the correct location of the\n    files.\n    \n3.  **Confirmation**:\n    After generating the appropriate files, generate a short summary of\n    your actions and show the user areas where they will need to generate\n    custom code. The boilerplate will be expected to not be perfect and\n    generate mock code that the user will need to modify.\n\n4.  **Feedback**: Once the code is generated, you may ask the user if the\n    output was what they expected or if they would like to modify it.\n    If the user is satisfied with the output, ask them if they would like to exit or continue the conversation.\n\n    If the user would like to modify the output, ask them appropriate questions to clarify their goal, and return\n    to step 1.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:44:21.683Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing advanced Ethereum financial market data aggregation and analysis capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级以太坊金融市场数据聚合和分析能力的基于CLI的AI代理。","ja":"CLIベースのAIエージェントが高度なEthereum金融市場データの集約および分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 이더리움 금융 시장 데이터 집계 및 분석 기능이 필요한 CLI 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en CLI que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de agregación y análisis de datos de mercados financieros de Ethereum.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur CLI qui nécessitent des capacités avancées d''agrégation et d''analyse de données de marchés financiers Ethereum.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-basierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Aggregation und Analyse von Ethereum-Finanzmarktdaten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em CLI que precisam de capacidades avançadas de agregação e análise de dados de mercados financeiros Ethereum.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе CLI, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности сбора и анализа данных финансовых рынков Ethereum.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لدمج وتحليل بيانات السوق المالي الإثريوم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality research actions for the open-eth-terminal application, utilizing API access to Ethereum financial markets and providing a CLI interface for organized information access, leveraging README.md documentation for expert guidance.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的研究操作的能力，用于open-eth-terminal应用程序，利用API访问以太坊金融市场，并提供CLI接口用于有序的信息访问，利用README.md文档提供专家指导。","ja":"open-eth-terminalアプリケーションで高品質のリサーチ操作を生成するエージェントを可能にし、Ethereum金融市場へのAPIアクセスを利用し、情報へのアクセスを整理するためのCLIインターフェイスを提供し、README.mdドキュメントを利用して専門家のガイダンスを提供する。","ko":"open-eth-terminal 애플리케이션에서 고품질의 연구 동작을 생성하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 이더리움 금융 시장에 대한 API 액세스를 활용하며, 정보 액세스를 구성하기 위한 CLI 인터페이스를 제공하며, README.md 문서를 활용하여 전문가의 가이드를 제공한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar acciones de investigación de alta calidad para la aplicación open-eth-terminal, utilizando el acceso a la API de los mercados financieros de Ethereum y proporcionando una interfaz de CLI para el acceso a la información organizada, aprovechando la documentación de README.md para una guía experta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des actions de recherche de haute qualité pour l''application open-eth-terminal, en utilisant l''accès à l''API des marchés financiers Ethereum et en fournissant une interface CLI pour un accès à l''information organisé, en exploitant la documentation de README.md pour un guide d''expert.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Forschungshandlungen hoher Qualität für die open-eth-terminal-Anwendung zu generieren, indem sie den API-Zugriff auf die Ethereum-Finanzmärkte nutzen und eine CLI-Schnittstelle für den organisierten Informationszugriff bereitstellen, wobei die README.md-Dokumentation für eine Expertenführung genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar ações de pesquisa de alta qualidade para o aplicativo open-eth-terminal, utilizando o acesso à API dos mercados financeiros Ethereum e fornecendo uma interface de linha de comando para acesso organizado às informações, aproveitando a documentação do README.md para orientação especializada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные исследовательские действия для приложения open-eth-terminal, используя доступ к API финансовых рынков Ethereum и предоставляя интерфейс командной строки для организованного доступа к информации, используя документацию README.md для экспертных рекомендаций.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من توليد إجراءات بحث عالية الجودة لتطبيق محطة إثريوم المفتوحة، باستخدام وصول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات إلى أسواق إثريوم المالية وتوفير واجهة سطر الأوامر للوصول المنظم إلى المعلومات، واستخدام توثيق README.md لإرشادات الخبراء."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating new actions for the open-eth-terminal application","Assisting users in creating customized data aggregation workflows","Enhancing research quality in Ethereum financial markets"],"zh":["为open-eth-terminal应用程序生成新的操作","帮助用户创建自定义的数据聚合工作流","提高以太坊金融市场的研究质量"],"ja":["open-eth-terminalアプリケーション用の新しい操作を生成する","ユーザーがカスタマイズされたデータ集約ワークフローを作成するのを支援する","Ethereum金融市場の研究品質を高める"],"ko":["open-eth-terminal 애플리케이션을 위한 새로운 동작을 생성하는 것","사용자가 사용자 정의 데이터 집계 워크플로를 생성하는 것을 지원하는 것","이더리움 금융 시장의 연구 품질을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Generar nuevas acciones para la aplicación open-eth-terminal","Ayudar a los usuarios a crear flujos de trabajo personalizados de agregación de datos","Mejorar la calidad de la investigación en los mercados financieros de Ethereum"],"fr":["Générer de nouvelles actions pour l''application open-eth-terminal","Aider les utilisateurs à créer des flux de travail personnalisés d''agrégation de données","Améliorer la qualité de la recherche sur les marchés financiers Ethereum"],"de":["Neue Aktionen für die open-eth-terminal-Anwendung generieren","Benutzern helfen, benutzerdefinierte Daten-Aggregations-Workflows zu erstellen","Forschungsqualität in den Ethereum-Finanzmärkten verbessern"],"pt":["Geração de novas ações para o aplicativo open-eth-terminal","Auxílio aos usuários na criação de fluxos de trabalho personalizados de agregação de dados","Melhoria da qualidade da pesquisa nos mercados financeiros Ethereum"],"ru":["Генерация новых действий для приложения open-eth-terminal","Помощь пользователям в создании индивидуальных рабочих процессов сбора данных","Улучшение качества исследований на финансовых рынках Ethereum"],"ar":["توليد إجراءات جديدة لتطبيق محطة إثريوم المفتوحة","مساعدة المستخدمين في إنشاء سير عمل مخصصة لدمج البيانات","تحسين جودة البحث في أسواق إثريوم المالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with the open-eth-terminal application and its README.md documentation","Focused on Ethereum financial markets only","CLI-based interface may require additional setup for agent integration"],"zh":["需要熟悉open-eth-terminal应用程序及其README.md文档","仅专注于以太坊金融市场","基于CLI的接口可能需要额外的设置用于代理集成"],"ja":["open-eth-terminalアプリケーションおよびそのREADME.mdドキュメントに精通している必要がある","Ethereum金融市場のみに焦点を当てている","CLIベースのインターフェイスは、エージェント統合のために追加の設定が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["open-eth-terminal 애플리케이션 및その README.md 문서에熟练해야 한다","이더리움 금융 시장만에 초점을 맞추고 있다","CLI 기반 인터페이스는 에이전트 통합을 위해 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con la aplicación open-eth-terminal y su documentación de README.md","Se centra solo en los mercados financieros de Ethereum","La interfaz basada en CLI puede requerir una configuración adicional para la integración del agente"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de l''application open-eth-terminal et de sa documentation de README.md","Se concentre uniquement sur les marchés financiers Ethereum","L''interface basée sur CLI peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour l''intégration de l''agent"],"de":["Benötigt Vertrautheit mit der open-eth-terminal-Anwendung und ihrer README.md-Dokumentation","Konzentriert sich nur auf die Ethereum-Finanzmärkte","Die CLI-basierte Schnittstelle kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung für die Integration des Agents erfordern"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com o aplicativo open-eth-terminal e sua documentação do README.md","Focado apenas nos mercados financeiros Ethereum","A interface baseada em CLI pode exigir configuração adicional para integração do agente"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с приложением open-eth-terminal и его документацией README.md","Ориентирован только на финансовые рынки Ethereum","Интерфейс командной строки может требовать дополнительной настройки для интеграции агента"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتطبيق محطة إثريوم المفتوحة ووثيقه README.md","مُركّز فقط على أسواق إثريوم المالية","واجهة سطر الأوامر قد تتطلب إعدادا إضافيا للدمج مع العميل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
