ve-Change: Ferramenta de Arquivamento de Al...","ru":"Openspec-Archive-Change: Инструмент Архивации Изменений","ar":"openspec-archive-change: أداة أرشفة التعديلات","en":"openspec-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow using openspec-archive-change. This feature allows developers to manage changes in their workflow.","ja":"openspec-archive-change","ko":"openspec-archive-change","es":"openspec-archive-change es una habilidad que archiva cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental. Permite especificar un nombre de cambio opciona...","fr":"openspec-archive-change est une compétence qui archive des modifications complétées dans le flux de travail expérimental. Elle permet de spécifier un nom de ...","de":"openspec-archive-change ist eine Fähigkeit, die abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow archiviert. Sie ermöglicht die optionale Angabe eines Ä...","pt":"A ferramenta openspec-archive-change é usada para arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental do JUDO Core runtime","ru":"Инструмент openspec-archive-change используется для архивации завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе JUDO Core runtime","ar":"تُستخدم أداة openspec-archive-change لأرشفة التعديلات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي لتشغيل JUDO Core","en":"JUDO Core runtime"},"definition":{"en":"JUDO Core runtime"},"features":{"zh":["Archive completed changes","Optional change name specification","Infer change name from conversation context","Prompt for available changes","Use AskUserQuestion tool for user selection","Show only active changes"],"ja":["","","","","",""],"ko":["","","","","",""],"es":["Archiva cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental","Permite especificar un nombre de cambio opcionalmente","Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion para seleccionar cambios","Muestra solo cambios activos","Incluye el esquema utilizado para cada cambio"],"fr":["Archive des modifications complétées dans le flux de travail expérimental","Permet de spécifier un nom de modification de manière optionnelle","Utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion pour sélectionner des modifications","Affiche uniquement les modifications actives","Inclut le schéma utilisé pour chaque modification"],"de":["Archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow","Ermöglicht die optionale Angabe eines Änderungsnamens","Verwendet das Tool AskUserQuestion zur Auswahl von Änderungen","Zeigt nur aktive Änderungen an","Inklusive des für jede Änderung verwendeten Schemas"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações concluídas","Integração com o JUDO Core runtime","Suporte à seleção de alterações ativas","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de alterações","Exibição de esquemas usados para cada alteração","Compatibilidade com o fluxo de trabalho experimental"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных изменений","Интеграция с JUDO Core runtime","Поддержка выбора активных изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion для выбора изменений","Отображение схем, используемых для каждой изменения","Совместимость с экспериментальным рабочим процессом"],"ar":["أرشفة التعديلات المكتملة","التكامل مع تشغيل JUDO Core","دعم اختيار التعديلات النشطة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار التعديلات","عرض مخططات المستخدمة لكل تعديل","التوافق مع تدفق العمل التجريبي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","JUDO Core runtime","experimental workflow","change management","API","development","AskUserQuestion tool","conversation context","active changes"],"ja":["","","","","","","","",""],"ko":["","","","","","","","",""],"es":["JUDO Core","openspec-archive-change","flujo de trabajo experimental","archivar cambios","AskUserQuestion","esquema de cambio"],"fr":["JUDO Core","openspec-archive-change","flux de travail expérimental","archiver des modifications","AskUserQuestion","schéma de modification"],"de":["JUDO Core","openspec-archive-change","experimenteller Workflow","Änderungen archivieren","AskUserQuestion","Änderungsschema"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","JUDO Core runtime","arquivamento de alterações","fluxo de trabalho experimental","AskUserQuestion","seleção de alterações","esquemas de alterações","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","JUDO Core runtime","архивация изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","AskUserQuestion","выбор изменений","схемы изменений","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","تشغيل JUDO Core","أرشفة التعديلات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","AskUserQuestion","اختيار التعديلات","مخططات التعديلات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"BlackBeltTechnology","repo":"judo-runtime-core","repoPath":"BlackBeltTechnology/judo-runtime-core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:44:27.555Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing workflow management and experimental change archival capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要工作流管理和实验性变更存档功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがワークフロー管理と実験的な変更のアーカイブ機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"워크플로우 관리 및 실험적 변경 사항 아카이브 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gestión de flujos de trabajo y capacidades de archivo de cambios experimentales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de gestion de workflow et de capacités d''archivage de changements expérimentaux.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine Workflow-Verwaltung und experimentelle Änderungsarchivierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho e capacidades de arquivo de alterações experimentais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности управления рабочим процессом и архивации экспериментальных изменений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النشطين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل وقدرات أرشفة التغييرات التجريبية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in the experimental workflow using the JUDO Core runtime, leveraging `openspec list --json` for available change selection and the AskUserQuestion tool for user interaction, all while ensuring only active changes are considered.","zh":"通过JUDO Core运行时，使用`openspec list --json`选择可用更改，并使用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户交互，仅考虑活动更改，从而使代理能够存档实验工作流中的完成更改。","ja":"JUDO Coreランタイムを使用して、`openspec list --json`で利用可能な変更を選択し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーとのやり取りを行い、有効な変更のみを考慮して、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブできるようにエージェントを有効にします。","ko":"JUDO Core 런타임을 사용하여 `openspec list --json`로 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 선택하고 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자와 상호 작용하면서 활성 변경 사항만 고려하여 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 아카이브할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental utilizando el tiempo de ejecución JUDO Core, aprovechando `openspec list --json` para la selección de cambios disponibles y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la interacción con el usuario, todo mientras se garantiza que solo se consideren cambios activos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les changements complets dans le flux de travail expérimental en utilisant le runtime JUDO Core, en exploitant `openspec list --json` pour la sélection des changements disponibles et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour l''interaction avec l''utilisateur, le tout en garantissant que seuls les changements actifs soient pris en compte.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow unter Verwendung der JUDO Core-Laufzeit zu archivieren, indem `openspec list --json` für die Auswahl verfügbarer Änderungen und das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerinteraktion genutzt wird, während sichergestellt wird, dass nur aktive Änderungen berücksichtigt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental usando o tempo de execução JUDO Core, aproveitando `openspec list --json` para seleção de alterações disponíveis e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para interação do usuário, garantindo que apenas alterações ativas sejam consideradas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальном рабочем процессе, используя среду выполнения JUDO Core, используя `openspec list --json` для выбора доступных изменений и инструмент AskUserQuestion для взаимодействия с пользователем, гарантируя, что учитываются только активные изменения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي باستخدام وقت تشغيل JUDO Core، واستخدام `openspec list --json` لتحديد التغييرات المتاحة وأداة AskUserQuestion للتفاعل مع المستخدم، مع ضمان考虑 التغييرات النشطة فقط."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed experimental changes","Managing active changes in the workflow","Prompting users for change selection"],"zh":["存档完成的实验性更改","在工作流中管理活动更改","提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["実験的な変更のアーカイブ","ワークフロー内のアクティブな変更の管理","ユーザーに変更の選択を促す"],"ko":["완료된 실험적 변경 사항을 아카이브하는 것","워크플로우에서 활성 변경 사항을 관리하는 것","사용자에게 변경 사항 선택을 제안하는 것"],"es":["Archivado de cambios experimentales completados","Gestión de cambios activos en el flujo de trabajo","Solicitud a los usuarios para la selección de cambios"],"fr":["Archivage de changements expérimentaux complets","Gestion de changements actifs dans le flux de travail","Sollicitation des utilisateurs pour la sélection de changements"],"de":["Archivierung abgeschlossener experimenteller Änderungen","Verwaltung von aktiven Änderungen im Workflow","Aufforderung an Benutzer zur Auswahl von Änderungen"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações experimentais concluídas","Gerenciamento de alterações ativas no fluxo de trabalho","Solicitação de seleção de alterações aos usuários"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных экспериментальных изменений","Управление активными изменениями в рабочем процессе","Запрос на выбор изменений от пользователей"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات التجريبية المكتملة","إدارة التغييرات النشطة في تدفق العمل","استعلام المستخدمين لتحديد التغييرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JUDO Core runtime","Needs access to conversation context for change name inference","Limited to active, non-archived changes"],"zh":["需要JUDO Core运行时","需要对话上下文以进行更改名称推断","仅限活动、未存档的更改"],"ja":["JUDO Coreランタイムが必要","会話コンテキストへのアクセスが変更名の推論に必要","アクティブでアーカイブされていない変更のみ"],"ko":["JUDO Core 런타임이 필요함","대화 컨텍스트에 대한 액세스가 변경 이름 추론에 필요함","활성 및 아카이브되지 않은 변경 사항만 제한"],"es":["Requiere el tiempo de ejecución JUDO Core","Necesita acceso al contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Limitado a cambios activos y no archivados"],"fr":["Nécessite le runtime JUDO Core","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de changement","Limité aux changements actifs et non archivés"],"de":["Benötigt die JUDO Core-Laufzeit","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf aktive, nicht archivierte Änderungen"],"pt":["Exige o tempo de execução JUDO Core","Necessita acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado a alterações ativas e não arquivadas"],"ru":["Требует среды выполнения JUDO Core","Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен активными, неархивированными изменениями"],"ar":["يتطلب وقت تشغيل JUDO Core","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستدلال اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة غير المأرشفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
