lexibilidad para adaptarse a diferentes flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Analyse de contexte pour détecter les changements récents","Création de documentation personnalisée basée sur les types de documents","Prise en charge de plusieurs types de documents (ailog, aidec, adr, etc.)","Intégration avec Git pour obtenir des informations de changement","Flexibilité pour s''adapter à différents flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Kontextanalyse zur Erkennung aktueller Änderungen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierter Dokumentation basierend auf Dokumententypen","Unterstützung für verschiedene Dokumententypen (ailog, aidec, adr usw.)","Integration mit Git zur Abrufung von Änderungsinformationen","Flexibilität zur Anpassung an unterschiedliche Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Criação de documentação automatizada","Análise de contexto para determinar o tipo de documentação necessária","Suporte a vários tipos de documentação","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Melhoria da eficiência do time de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизированная создание документации","Анализ контекста для определения типа необходимой документации","Поддержка нескольких типов документации","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Улучшение эффективности команды разработчиков"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق آلي","تحليل السياق لتحديد نوع الوثائق المطلوبة","دعم أنواع متعددة من الوثائق","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين كفاءة فريق التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DevTrail新技能","AI辅助开发","文档管理","自动化","开发效率","Git版本控制","文档创建","AI开发工具"],"ja":["DevTrail新スキル","AI支援開発","ドキュメント管理","自動化","開発効率","Gitバージョン管理","ドキュメント作成","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["DevTrail 새로운 기술","AI 지원 개발","문서 관리","자동화","개발 효율성","Git 버전 관리","문서 생성","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["desarrollo asistido por AI","gobernanza de documentación","creación de documentación","análisis de contexto","integración con Git","tipos de documentos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement assisté par l''IA","gouvernance de documentation","création de documentation","analyse de contexte","intégration avec Git","types de documents","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["KI-unterstützte Entwicklung","Dokumentations-Governance","Erstellung von Dokumentationen","Kontextanalyse","Integration mit Git","Dokumententypen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["DevTrail New","governança de documentação","desenvolvimento assistido por IA","documentação automatizada","análise de contexto","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","eficiência do time"],"ru":["DevTrail New","управление документацией","разработка с помощью ИИ","автоматизированная документация","анализ контекста","инструменты разработки","эффективность команды"],"ar":["ديفتريل نيو","حوكمة الوثائق","تطوير مدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","وثائق آلي","تحليل السياق","أدوات التطوير","كفاءة الفريق"]}},"owner":"Enigmora","repo":"devtrail","repoPath":"Enigmora/devtrail","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.531Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devtrail-new","description":"Create DevTrail documentation. Analyzes context to suggest document type or accepts explicit type parameter. Always confirms before creating.","bodyPreview":"# DevTrail New Skill\n\nCreate DevTrail documentation based on recent changes.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### 1. Check for Parameters\n\nIf the user specified a document type (e.g., `/devtrail-new ailog`), skip to step 4 using that type.\n\nValid types: `ailog`, `aidec`, `adr`, `eth`, `req`, `tes`, `inc`, `tde`\n\n### 2. Analyze Context\n\nGather information about recent changes:\n\n```bash\n# Get current date\ndate +%Y-%m-%d\n\n# Get modified files (staged and unstaged)\ngit status --p","body":"# DevTrail New Skill\n\nCreate DevTrail documentation based on recent changes.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### 1. Check for Parameters\n\nIf the user specified a document type (e.g., `/devtrail-new ailog`), skip to step 4 using that type.\n\nValid types: `ailog`, `aidec`, `adr`, `eth`, `req`, `tes`, `inc`, `tde`\n\n### 2. Analyze Context\n\nGather information about recent changes:\n\n```bash\n# Get current date\ndate +%Y-%m-%d\n\n# Get modified files (staged and unstaged)\ngit status --porcelain\n\n# Get recent changes summary\ngit diff --stat HEAD~1 2>/dev/null || git diff --stat\n\n# Count lines changed\ngit diff --numstat HEAD~1 2>/dev/null || git diff --numstat\n```\n\n### 3. Classify and Suggest Type\n\nBased on the analysis, suggest a document type:\n\n| Pattern | Suggested Type |\n|---------|---------------|\n| New code in `src/`, `lib/`, `app/` (>10 lines) | AILOG |\n| Multiple implementation alternatives discussed | AIDEC |\n| Structural/architectural changes, new modules | ADR |\n| Files with `auth`, `user`, `privacy`, `gdpr` | ETH (draft) |\n| Test files (`*.test.*`, `*.spec.*`) | TES |\n| Bug fixes, hotfixes | INC |\n| `TODO`, `FIXME`, `HACK` comments added | TDE |\n| Requirements or spec files | REQ |\n\n### 4. Confirm with User\n\n**Always display this confirmation before creating:**\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  DevTrail New                                                    ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                                                                   ║\n║  📊 Analysis:                                                     ║\n║     • Files modified: [N]                                         ║\n║     • Lines changed: [+X / -Y]                                    ║\n║     • Area: [detected area or \"general\"]                          ║\n║                                                                   ║\n║  🎯 Suggested type: [TYPE] ([Full Name])                          ║\n║     Reason: [Brief explanation]                                   ║\n║                                                                   ║\n║  📝 Proposed filename:                                            ║\n║     [TYPE]-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN-[description].md                        ║\n║                                                                   ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nConfirm creation? [Y/n/other type]:\n```\n\nWait for user confirmation before proceeding.\n\n### 5. Check Language Configuration\n\nRead `.devtrail/config.yml` to determine language:\n\n```yaml\nlanguage: en  # or es\n```\n\nUse template path based on language:\n- `en` (default): `.devtrail/templates/TEMPLATE-[TYPE].md`\n- `es`: `.devtrail/templates/i18n/es/TEMPLATE-[TYPE].md`\n\n### 6. Generate Document ID\n\nDetermine the next sequence number:\n\n```bash\n# Find existing documents of this type for today\nls .devtrail/*/[TYPE]-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)-*.md 2>/dev/null | wc -l\n```\n\nID format: `[TYPE]-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN`\n\n### 7. Load Template and Create Document\n\n1. Read the appropriate template\n2. Replace placeholders:\n   - `YYYY-MM-DD` → Current date\n   - `NNN` → Sequence number (001, 002, etc.)\n   - `[agent-name-v1.0]` → `gemini-cli-v1.0`\n3. Fill in context from git analysis\n4. Save to correct location:\n\n| Type | Location |\n|------|----------|\n| AILOG | `.devtrail/07-ai-audit/agent-logs/` |\n| AIDEC | `.devtrail/07-ai-audit/decisions/` |\n| ETH | `.devtrail/07-ai-audit/ethical-reviews/` |\n| ADR | `.devtrail/02-design/decisions/` |\n| REQ | `.devtrail/01-requirements/` |\n| TES | `.devtrail/04-testing/` |\n| INC | `.devtrail/05-operations/incidents/` |\n| TDE | `.devtrail/06-evolution/technical-debt/` |\n\n### 8. Report Result\n\nAfter creation, display:\n\n```\n✅ DevTrail document created:\n   .devtrail/[path]/[TYPE]-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN-description.md\n\n   Review required: [yes/no]\n   Risk level: [low/medium/high/critical]\n```\n\n## Document Type Reference\n\n| Type | Full Name | Purpose |\n|------|-----------|---------|\n| `ailog` | AI Action Log | Record what the AI agent did |\n| `aidec` | AI Decision | Document a technical decision with alternatives |\n| `adr` | Architecture Decision Record | Major architectural decisions |\n| `eth` | Ethical Review | Privacy, bias, responsible AI concerns |\n| `req` | Requirement | System requirements |\n| `tes` | Test Plan | Test strategies and plans |\n| `inc` | Incident Post-mortem | Incident analysis |\n| `tde` | Technical Debt | Identified technical debt |\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n1. **No git repository**: Inform user that git is required for context analysis\n2. **No changes detected**: Ask user to describe what to document\n3. **User declines**: Acknowledge and exit gracefully\n4. **Invalid type parameter**: Show valid types and ask again\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:44:36.442Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated documentation governance for AI-assisted development","zh":"非常适合需要自动化文档治理的AI辅助开发的开发代理","ja":"自動化ドキュメント管理が必要なAIアシスト開発の開発エージェントに最適","ko":"자동화 문서 관리가 필요한 AI 지원 개발을 위한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gobernanza de documentación automatizada para desarrollo asistido por AI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gouvernance de la documentation automatisée pour le développement assisté par l''IA","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Dokumentationsregierung für die AI-gestützte Entwicklung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de governança de documentação automatizada para desenvolvimento assistido por IA","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное управление документацией для разработки с помощью ИИ","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى حوكمة وثائقية آلية لتطوير مدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create DevTrail documentation based on recent changes, utilizing Git status analysis and supporting various document types such as ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, and tde","zh":"赋予代理创建基于最近更改的DevTrail文档的能力，利用Git状态分析，并支持诸如ailog、aidec、adr、eth、req、tes、inc和tde等各种文档类型","ja":"エージェントが最近の変更に基づいてDevTrailドキュメントを作成する能力を提供し、Git状態分析を利用し、ailog、aidec、adr、eth、req、tes、inc、tdeなどの様々なドキュメントタイプをサポート","ko":"最近의 변경 사항을 기반으로 DevTrail 문서를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, Git 상태 분석을 활용하고, ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc 및 tde와 같은 다양한 문서 유형을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentación de DevTrail basada en los cambios recientes, utilizando el análisis de estado de Git y admitiendo varios tipos de documentos como ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc y tde","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation DevTrail basée sur les modifications récentes, en utilisant l''analyse de l''état Git et en prenant en charge divers types de documents tels que ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc et tde","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, DevTrail-Dokumentationen basierend auf aktuellen Änderungen zu erstellen, unter Verwendung der Git-Statusanalyse und Unterstützung verschiedener Dokumenttypen wie ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc und tde","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentação DevTrail com base em alterações recentes, utilizando análise de status do Git e suportando vários tipos de documentos, como ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc e tde","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать документацию DevTrail на основе недавних изменений, используя анализ состояния Git и поддерживая различные типы документов, такие как ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc и tde","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وثائق DevTrail بناءً على التغييرات الحديثة، باستخدام تحليل حالة Git ودعم أنواع مختلفة من الوثائق مثل ailog و aidec و adr و eth و req و tes و inc و tde"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates","Generating DevTrail reports based on Git modifications","Creating documentation for AI-assisted development projects"],"zh":["自动化文档更新","基于Git修改生成DevTrail报告","为AI辅助开发项目创建文档"],"ja":["ドキュメント更新の自動化","Gitの変更に基づいてDevTrailレポートを生成","AIアシスト開発プロジェクトのドキュメントを作成"],"ko":["문서 업데이트 자동화","Git 수정에 기반한 DevTrail 보고서 생성","AI 지원 개발 프로젝트를 위한 문서 생성"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de documentación","Generación de informes de DevTrail basados en modificaciones de Git","Creación de documentación para proyectos de desarrollo asistidos por AI"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de la documentation","Génération de rapports DevTrail basés sur les modifications Git","Création de documentation pour les projets de développement assistés par l''IA"],"de":["Automatisierung von Dokumentenaktualisierungen","Erstellung von DevTrail-Berichten basierend auf Git-Änderungen","Erstellung von Dokumentationen für AI-gestützte Entwicklungsvorhaben"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação","Gerar relatórios DevTrail com base em modificações do Git","Criar documentação para projetos de desenvolvimento assistido por IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации","Генерировать отчеты DevTrail на основе изменений в Git","Создавать документацию для проектов разработки с помощью ИИ"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديثات الوثائق","إنشاء تقارير DevTrail بناءً على التعديلات في Git","إنشاء وثائق لمشاريع التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Limited to specified document types"],"zh":["需要Git仓库访问","仅限指定文档类型"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","指定されたドキュメントタイプのみ"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스가 필요","지정된 문서 유형만"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Limitado a los tipos de documentos especificados"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Limité aux types de documents spécifiés"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf die angegebenen Dokumenttypen"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Git","Limitado a tipos de documentos especificados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git","Ограничен определёнными типами документов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","محدود بنوع معين من الوثائق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
