e otimização","Recomendações acionáveis para desenvolvedores","Integração com contexto de marketing","Auditoria de desempenho orgânico","Otimização para mecanismos de busca"],"ru":["Комплексный технический SEO анализ","Выявление проблем оптимизации","Практические рекомендации для разработчиков","Интеграция с маркетинговым контекстом","Аудит органической производительности","Оптимизация для поисковых систем"],"ar":["تحليل SEO تقني شامل","تحديد مشكلات التحسين","توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ للمطورين","التكامل مع سياق التسويق","تدقيق الأداء العضوي","تحسين محركات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站分析","性能优化","用户体验","搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["SEO 監査","検索エンジン最適化","Web サイト分析","パフォーマンス最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","検索エンジンランキング"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 분석","성능 최적화","사용자 경험","검색 엔진 순위"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de búsqueda","mejora de rendimiento","visibilidad en línea","marketing de producto","desarrollo web","SEO para desarrolladores","herramientas de SEO","mejora de la búsqueda orgánica"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de recherche","amélioration des performances","visibilité en ligne","marketing de produit","développement web","SEO pour les développeurs","outils de SEO","amélioration de la recherche organique"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Leistungsverbesserung","Online-Sichtbarkeit","Produktmarketing","Webentwicklung","SEO für Entwickler","SEO-Tools","Verbesserung der organischen Suche"],"pt":["auditoria SEO técnica","ferramenta SEO desenvolvedores","otimização mecanismos busca","análise desempenho orgânico","correção problemas SEO","auditoria site técnico","SEO para programadores","ferramenta análise SEO"],"ru":["технический SEO аудит","инструмент SEO для разработчиков","оптимизация поисковых систем","анализ органической производительности","исправление SEO проблем","технический аудит сайта","SEO для программистов","инструмент анализа SEO"],"ar":["تدقيق SEO التقني","أداة SEO للمطورين","تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل الأداء العضوي","إصلاح مشكلات SEO","تدقيق الموقع التقني","SEO للمبرمجين","أداة تحليل SEO"]}},"owner":"jefedcreator","repo":"strive","repoPath":"jefedcreator/strive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.532Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:46:25.414Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的数字营销代理","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis y optimización de SEO.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse et d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для цифровых маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الرقمي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم وقدرات تحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using product marketing context, site context, and technical SEO audits, leveraging file formats like `.md` and protocols for data aggregation.","zh":"使代理能够使用产品营销背景、网站背景和技术SEO审计来识别SEO问题并提供可行的建议，利用文件格式如`.md`和数据聚合协议","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を特定し、製品マーケティングのコンテキスト、サイトのコンテキスト、および技術SEO監査を使用して実行可能な推奨事項を提供できるようにし、`.md`などのファイル形式やデータ集約プロトコルを活用","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트, 사이트 컨텍스트 및 기술 SEO 감사를 사용하여 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 하며, `.md`와 같은 파일 형식 및 데이터 집계 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes para identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones accionables utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, el contexto del sitio y auditorías de SEO técnicas, aprovechando formatos de archivo como `.md` y protocolos para la agregación de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, le contexte du site et des audits de SEO techniques, en exploitant des formats de fichiers tels que `.md` et des protocoles pour l''agrégation de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen bereitzustellen, die den Produktmarketing-Kontext, den Seitenkontext und technische SEO-Audits unter Nutzung von Dateiformaten wie `.md` und Protokollen für die Datenaggregation verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações açãoaveis usando o contexto de marketing de produto, contexto do site e auditorias técnicas de SEO, aproveitando formatos de arquivo como `.md` e protocolos para agregação de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с использованием контекста продуктивного маркетинга, контекста сайта и технических аудитов SEO, используя форматы файлов như `.md` и протоколы для сбора данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل SEO وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وسياق الموقع واختبارات SEO الفنية ، واستخدام تنسيقات الملفات مثل `.md` وبروتوكولات للتحليل البياني."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating technical SEO recommendations","Analyzing product marketing context for optimization"],"zh":["审计网站SEO性能","生成技术SEO推荐","分析产品营销背景以优化"],"ja":["サイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査","技術SEOの推奨事項を生成","最適化のために製品マーケティングのコンテキストを分析"],"ko":["사이트 SEO 성능 감사","기술 SEO 추천 생성","최적화를 위한 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 분석"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de SEO del sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones técnicas de SEO","Análisis del contexto de marketing de productos para la optimización"],"fr":["Auditing de la performance de SEO du site Web","Génération de recommandations techniques de SEO","Analyse du contexte de marketing de produits pour l''optimisation"],"de":["Prüfung der SEO-Leistung der Website","Erstellung technischer SEO-Empfehlungen","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für die Optimierung"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações técnicas de SEO","Análise do contexto de marketing de produto para otimização"],"ru":["Аудит производительности SEO сайта","Генерация технических рекомендаций SEO","Анализ контекста продуктивного маркетинга для оптимизации"],"ar":["تدقيق أداء SEO للموقع","توليد توصيات فنية لتحسين SEO","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` file","Limited to site context understanding"],"zh":["需要访问`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件","仅限于网站背景理解"],"ja":["`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルへのアクセスが必要","サイトの背景理解に限定"],"ko":["`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일에 접근해야 함","사이트 컨텍스트 이해에 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limitado a la comprensión del contexto del sitio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limité à la compréhension du contexte du site"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Begrenzt auf das Verständnis des Seitenkontexts"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao arquivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limitado à compreensão do contexto do site"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Ограничен пониманием контекста сайта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","محدود بفهم سياق الموقع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
