щими проектами"],"ar":["تطوير المكونات ذات التصميم المستجيب","تنفيذ الوضع المظلم","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة في المكونات","تصحيح أخطاء التخطيط والتباعد","استخدام فئات تيلويند سي إس إس لتنسيق HTML","التوافق مع المشاريع الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","响应式设计","暗黑模式","布局调试","CSS 框架","UI 组件","前端开发"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","レイアウトのデバッグ","CSS フレームワーク","UI コンポーネント","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","반응형 디자인","다크 모드","레이아웃 디버깅","CSS 프레임워크","UI 컴포넌트","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","diseño responsivo","modo oscuro","patrones de diseño","depuración de CSS","estilos web","framework de CSS"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","conception réactive","mode sombre","modèles de conception","débogage de CSS","styles web","framework CSS"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","responsives Design","Dunkelmodus","Designmuster","Fehlerbehebung von CSS","Webstyles","CSS-Framework"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","componentes responsivos","modo escuro","layout","espaçamento","classes CSS","projetos web","desenvolvimento front-end"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","компоненты с адаптивным дизайном","темный режим","макет","интервал","классы CSS","веб-проекты","фронтенд-разработка"],"ar":["تيلويند سي إس إس","تطوير الويب","المكونات ذات التصميم المستجيب","الوضع المظلم","التخطيط","التباعد","فئات سي إس إس","مشاريع الويب","تطوير الجانب الأمامي"]}},"owner":"NightingaleWK","repo":"lynx","repoPath":"NightingaleWK/lynx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.532Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:47:03.252Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents needing rapid UI styling with utility-first CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要快速 UI 样式和实用优先 CSS 的前端开发代理。","ja":"フロントエンド開発エージェントが迅速なUIスタイリングとユーティリティファーストCSSを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"급한 UI 스타일링 및 유틸리티 우선 CSS가 필요한 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo frontend que necesitan un estilo de interfaz de usuario rápido con CSS de utilidad primera.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement frontend ayant besoin d''un style d''interface utilisateur rapide avec du CSS à utilité première.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die ein schnelles UI-Styling mit Utility-First-CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que necessitam de estilização de UI rápida com CSS utility-first.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Frontend, которым требуется быстрая стилизация UI с помощью utility-first CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق واجهة المستخدم السريع مع CSS من الأولى الفائدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply responsive design patterns, implement dark mode, and debug layout issues using Tailwind CSS v4 classes. Directly integrates with component-based development workflows for extracting repeated patterns.","zh":"赋予代理应用响应式设计模式、实现暗黑模式并使用Tailwind CSS v4类调试布局问题的能力。直接与基于组件的开发工作流集成，用于提取重复的模式。","ja":"エージェントがレスポンシブデザインパターンを適用し、ダークモードを実装し、Tailwind CSS v4クラスを使用してレイアウトの問題をデバッグする力を与えます。コンポーネントベースの開発ワークフローと直接統合して、繰り返しのパターンを抽出します。","ko":"에이전트가 반응형 디자인 패턴을 적용하고 다크 모드를 구현하며 Tailwind CSS v4 클래스를 사용하여 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 컴포넌트 기반 개발 워크플로와 직접 통합하여 반복되는 패턴을 추출합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar patrones de diseño responsivo, implementar el modo oscuro y depurar problemas de diseño utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS v4. Se integra directamente con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo basados en componentes para extraer patrones repetidos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des modèles de conception responsifs, de mettre en œuvre le mode sombre et de déboguer les problèmes de disposition en utilisant des classes Tailwind CSS v4. S''intègre directement avec les flux de travail de développement basés sur les composants pour extraire les modèles répétitifs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, responsive Designmuster anzuwenden, einen Dark-Mode zu implementieren und Layoutprobleme mithilfe von Tailwind CSS v4-Klassen zu debuggen. Integriert sich direkt in komponentenbasierte Entwicklungsworkflows für das Extrahieren wiederkehrender Muster.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicarem padrões de design responsivo, implementarem o modo escuro e depurarem problemas de layout usando classes do Tailwind CSS v4. Integra-se diretamente com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento baseado em componentes para extrair padrões repetidos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять отзывчивые шаблоны дизайна, реализовывать темный режим и отлаживать проблемы макета с помощью классов Tailwind CSS v4. Прямо интегрируется с рабочими процессами разработки на основе компонентов для извлечения повторяющихся шаблонов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق أنماط التصميم الاستجابة وتطبيق وضع الظلام وتصحيح أخطاء التخطيط باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS v4. يتكامل مباشرة مع سير عمل التطوير المبني على المكونات لاستخراج الأنماط المكررة."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding styles to components or pages","Implementing responsive design breakpoints","Debugging spacing or layout inconsistencies","Extracting repeated patterns into reusable components","Applying dark mode styling conventions"],"zh":["向组件或页面添加样式","实现响应式设计断点","调试间距或布局不一致","提取重复的模式到可复用的组件","应用暗黑模式样式约定"],"ja":["コンポーネントまたはページにスタイルを追加する","レスポンシブデザインのブレークポイントを実装する","スペースやレイアウトの不一致をデバッグする","繰り返しのパターンを再利用可能なコンポーネントに抽出する","ダークモードのスタイル規則を適用する"],"ko":["컴포넌트 또는 페이지에 스타일을 추가하는 것","반응형 디자인 브레이크ポイント를 구현하는 것","공간 또는 레이아웃의 불일치를 디버깅하는 것","반복되는 패턴을 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트로 추출하는 것","다크 모드 스타일 규칙을 적용하는 것"],"es":["Agregar estilos a componentes o páginas","Implementar puntos de interrupción de diseño responsivo","Depurar inconsistencias de espaciado o diseño","Extraer patrones repetidos en componentes reutilizables","Aplicar convenciones de estilo de modo oscuro"],"fr":["Ajouter des styles aux composants ou aux pages","Mettre en œuvre des points d''arrêt de conception responsifs","Déboguer les incohérences d''espacement ou de disposition","Extraire des modèles répétitifs en composants réutilisables","Appliquer des conventions de style de mode sombre"],"de":["Stile zu Komponenten oder Seiten hinzufügen","Responsive Design-Breakpoints implementieren","Abstände oder Layout-Inkonsistenzen debuggen","Wiederkehrende Muster in wiederverwendbare Komponenten extrahieren","Dunkelmodus-Stilkonventionen anwenden"],"pt":["Adicionar estilos a componentes ou páginas","Implementar quebras de design responsivo","Depurar inconsistências de espaçamento ou layout","Extrair padrões repetidos em componentes reutilizáveis","Aplicar convenções de estilização de modo escuro"],"ru":["Добавление стилей к компонентам или страницам","Реализация отзывчивых шаблонов дизайна","Отладка пробелов или несоответствий макета","Извлечение повторяющихся шаблонов в переиспользуемые компоненты","Применение соглашений о стилизации темного режима"],"ar":["إضافة أنماط إلى المكونات أو الصفحات","تطبيق أنماط التصميم الاستجابة","تصحيح أخطاء التباعد أو التخطيط","استخراج الأنماط المكررة إلى مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تطبيق اتفاقيات التنسيق لوضع الظلام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Tailwind CSS project conventions","Needs search-docs access for v4 patterns","Must follow project-specific class naming conventions"],"zh":["需要现有的Tailwind CSS项目约定","需要搜索文档访问v4模式","必须遵循项目特定的类命名约定"],"ja":["既存のTailwind CSSプロジェクト規則が必要","v4パターンの検索ドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","プロジェクト固有のクラス命名規則に従う必要がある"],"ko":["既存의 Tailwind CSS 프로젝트 규칙이 필요","v4 패턴의 검색 문서 액세스가 필요","프로젝트 고유의 클래스命名 규칙을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere convenciones de proyecto existentes de Tailwind CSS","Necesita acceso a search-docs para patrones v4","Debe seguir convenciones de nombres de clases específicas del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite des conventions de projet existantes de Tailwind CSS","A besoin d''un accès search-docs pour les modèles v4","Doit suivre des conventions de nom de classe spécifiques au projet"],"de":["Benötigt bestehende Tailwind CSS-Projekt-Konventionen","Benötigt Zugriff auf search-docs für v4-Muster","Muss projekt-spezifische Klassen-Namenskonventionen befolgen"],"pt":["Requer convenções de projeto existentes do Tailwind CSS","Necessita acesso search-docs para padrões v4","Deve seguir convenções de nomenclatura de classe específicas do projeto"],"ru":["Требует существующих соглашений проекта Tailwind CSS","Требует доступа search-docs для шаблонов v4","Должно следовать соглашениям об именовании классов, специфичных для проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب اتفاقيات مشروع موجودة من Tailwind CSS","يتطلب وصول search-docs لنماذج v4","يجب اتباع اتفاقيات تسمية الفئة المحددة للمشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
