","de":"Bessere Authentifizierung mit Better Auth konfigurieren","pt":"Configuração de Autenticação Melhorada com Better Auth","ru":"Настройка лучшей аутентификации с Better Auth","ar":"تكوين مصادقة أفضل مع Better Auth","en":"configuring-better-auth"},"description":{"zh":"Better Auth提供MCP服务器，支持OAuth/OIDC，实现集中式身份验证。通过简单的配置，开发者可以轻松实现身份验证","ja":"Better AuthはMCPサーバーを提供し、OAuth/OIDCをサポートして集中式認証を実現します。シンプルな設定により、開発者は認証を簡単に実現できます","ko":"Better Auth는 MCP 서버를 제공하며 OAuth/OIDC를 지원하여集中식 인증을 구현합니다. 간단한 설정으로 개발자가 인증을 쉽게 구현할 수 있습니다","es":"Better Auth ofrece una forma sencilla de implementar la autenticación centralizada en tus aplicaciones, mejorando la seguridad y reduciendo la complejidad","fr":"Better Auth propose une façon simple de mettre en œuvre l''authentification centralisée dans vos applications, améliorant ainsi la sécurité et réduisant la co...","de":"Better Auth bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, die zentrale Authentifizierung in Ihren Anwendungen zu implementieren, wodurch die Sicherheit verbessert und di...","pt":"Better Auth fornece um servidor MCP para configuração guiada de autenticação OAuth/OIDC, permitindo a implementação de autenticação centralizada de forma efi...","ru":"Better Auth предоставляет сервер MCP для настройки аутентификации OAuth/OIDC, что позволяет реализовать централизованную аутентификацию эффективно.","ar":"يوفر Better Auth خادم MCP للتنفيذ الإرشادي لمصادقة OAuth/OIDC، و مما يسمح بتنفيذ مصادقة مركزية بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持OAuth/OIDC协议","提供MCP服务器","简单的配置过程","集中式身份验证","提高安全性和便捷性"],"ja":["OAuth/OIDCプロトコルをサポート","MCPサーバーを提供","シンプルな設定プロセス","集中式認証","セキュリティと便利性の向上"],"ko":["OAuth/OIDC 프로토콜 지원","MCP 서버 제공","간단한 설정 과정","중앙식 인증","보안 및 편의성 향상"],"es":["Autenticación centralizada","Soporte para OAuth y OIDC","Configuración guiada con MCP Server","Integración con Chonkie","Seguridad mejorada"],"fr":["Authentification centralisée","Prise en charge d''OAuth et d''OIDC","Configuration guidée avec le serveur MCP","Intégration avec Chonkie","Sécurité améliorée"],"de":["Zentrale Authentifizierung","Unterstützung für OAuth und OIDC","Guidierte Konfiguration mit MCP-Server","Integration mit Chonkie","Verbesserte Sicherheit"],"pt":["Implementação de autenticação centralizada com OAuth/OIDC","Servidor MCP para configuração guiada","Suporte a autenticação como servidor ou cliente SSO","Integração com Chonkie para configuração simplificada","Mecanismo de segurança robusto para proteger aplicações"],"ru":["Реализация централизованной аутентификации с использованием OAuth/OIDC","Сервер MCP для настройки аутентификации","Поддержка аутентификации как сервера или клиента SSO","Интеграция с Chonkie для упрощенной настройки","Робустный механизм безопасности для защиты приложений"],"ar":["تنفيذ مصادقة مركزية باستخدام OAuth/OIDC","خادم MCP للتنفيذ الإرشادي","دعم مصادقة كخادم أو عميل SSO","التكامل مع Chonkie للتنفيذ المبسّط","ميكانيزم أمان قوي لحماية التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","集中式身份验证","MCP服务器","身份验证解决方案"],"ja":["Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","集中式認証","MCPサーバー","認証ソリューション"],"ko":["Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","중앙식 인증","MCP 서버","인증 솔루션"],"es":["autenticación centralizada","Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","seguridad de aplicaciones","autenticación de usuarios","autorización de acceso"],"fr":["authentification centralisée","Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","sécurité des applications","authentification des utilisateurs","autorisation d''accès"],"de":["zentrale Authentifizierung","Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","Benutzerauthentifizierung","Zugriffsautorisation"],"pt":["autenticação centralizada","Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","servidor MCP","segurança de aplicações","autenticação como servidor","autenticação como cliente SSO"],"ru":["централизованная аутентификация","Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","сервер MCP","безопасность приложений","аутентификация как сервер","аутентификация как клиент SSO"],"ar":["مصادقة مركزية","Better Auth","OAuth","OIDC","خادم MCP","أمان التطبيقات","مصادقة كخادم","مصادقة كعميل SSO"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"Digital-FTE","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.532Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"configuring-better-auth","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Better Auth OAuth/OIDC\n\nImplement centralized authentication with Better Auth - either as an auth server or SSO client.\n\n## MCP Server Setup\n\nBetter Auth provides an MCP server powered by Chonkie for guided configuration:\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add --transport http better-auth https://mcp.chonkie.ai/better-auth/better-auth-builder/mcp\n```\n\nOr in `settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"better-auth\": {\n      \"type\": \"http\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.chonkie.ai/better-auth/better-auth-bui","body":"# Better Auth OAuth/OIDC\n\nImplement centralized authentication with Better Auth - either as an auth server or SSO client.\n\n## MCP Server Setup\n\nBetter Auth provides an MCP server powered by Chonkie for guided configuration:\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add --transport http better-auth https://mcp.chonkie.ai/better-auth/better-auth-builder/mcp\n```\n\nOr in `settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"better-auth\": {\n      \"type\": \"http\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.chonkie.ai/better-auth/better-auth-builder/mcp\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### When to Use the MCP\n\n| Task | Use MCP? |\n|------|----------|\n| Initial Better Auth setup | Yes - guided configuration |\n| Adding OIDC provider plugin | Yes - generates correct config |\n| Troubleshooting auth issues | Yes - can analyze setup |\n| Understanding auth flow | Yes - explains concepts |\n| Writing custom middleware | No - use patterns below |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ Better Auth SSO │ ← Central auth server (auth-server-setup.md)\n│  (Auth Server)  │\n└────────┬────────┘\n         │\n    ┌────┴────┐\n    ▼         ▼\n┌───────┐  ┌───────┐\n│ App 1 │  │ App 2 │ ← SSO clients (sso-client-integration.md)\n└───────┘  └───────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: Auth Server Setup\n\n```bash\nnpm install better-auth @better-auth/oidc-provider drizzle-orm\n```\n\n### Core Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/auth.ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\nimport { drizzleAdapter } from \"better-auth/adapters/drizzle\";\nimport { oidcProvider } from \"better-auth/plugins/oidc-provider\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  database: drizzleAdapter(db, { provider: \"pg\", schema }),\n  emailAndPassword: { enabled: true },\n  session: {\n    expiresIn: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 7 days\n    updateAge: 60 * 60 * 24,     // 1 day\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    oidcProvider({\n      loginPage: \"/sign-in\",\n      consentPage: \"/consent\",\n      // PKCE for public clients (recommended)\n      requirePKCE: true,\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n```\n\n### Register OAuth Clients\n\n```typescript\n// Register SSO client\nawait auth.api.createOAuthClient({\n  name: \"My App\",\n  redirectUris: [\"http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback\"],\n  type: \"public\", // Use ''public'' for PKCE\n});\n```\n\nSee [references/auth-server-setup.md](references/auth-server-setup.md) for complete setup with JWKS, email verification, and admin dashboard.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: SSO Client Integration\n\n```bash\nnpm install jose\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```env\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SSO_URL=http://localhost:3001\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SSO_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id\n```\n\n### PKCE Auth Flow\n\n```typescript\n// lib/auth-client.ts\nimport { generateCodeVerifier, generateCodeChallenge } from \"./pkce\";\n\nexport async function startLogin() {\n  const verifier = generateCodeVerifier();\n  const challenge = await generateCodeChallenge(verifier);\n\n  // Store verifier in cookie\n  document.cookie = `pkce_verifier=${verifier}; path=/; SameSite=Lax`;\n\n  const params = new URLSearchParams({\n    client_id: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SSO_CLIENT_ID!,\n    redirect_uri: `${window.location.origin}/api/auth/callback`,\n    response_type: \"code\",\n    scope: \"openid profile email\",\n    code_challenge: challenge,\n    code_challenge_method: \"S256\",\n  });\n\n  window.location.href = `${SSO_URL}/oauth2/authorize?${params}`;\n}\n```\n\n### Token Exchange (API Route)\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/auth/callback/route.ts\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const { searchParams } = new URL(request.url);\n  const code = searchParams.get(\"code\");\n  const verifier = cookies().get(\"pkce_verifier\")?.value;\n\n  const response = await fetch(`${SSO_URL}/oauth2/token`, {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" },\n    body: new URLSearchParams({\n      grant_type: \"authorization_code\",\n      client_id: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SSO_CLIENT_ID!,\n      code: code!,\n      redirect_uri: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/auth/callback`,\n      code_verifier: verifier!,\n    }),\n  });\n\n  const tokens = await response.json();\n\n  // Set httpOnly cookies\n  const res = NextResponse.redirect(\"/dashboard\");\n  res.cookies.set(\"access_token\", tokens.access_token, { httpOnly: true });\n  res.cookies.set(\"refresh_token\", tokens.refresh_token, { httpOnly: true });\n  return res;\n}\n```\n\nSee [references/sso-client-integration.md](references/sso-client-integration.md) for JWKS verification, token refresh, and global logout.\n\n---\n\n## PKCE Utilities\n\n```typescript\n// lib/pkce.ts\nexport function generateCodeVerifier(): string {\n  const array = new Uint8Array(32);\n  crypto.getRandomValues(array);\n  return base64UrlEncode(array);\n}\n\nexport async function generateCodeChallenge(verifier: string): Promise<string> {\n  const encoder = new TextEncoder();\n  const data = encoder.encode(verifier);\n  const hash = await crypto.subtle.digest(\"SHA-256\", data);\n  return base64UrlEncode(new Uint8Array(hash));\n}\n\nfunction base64UrlEncode(buffer: Uint8Array): string {\n  return btoa(String.fromCharCode(...buffer))\n    .replace(/\\+/g, \"-\")\n    .replace(/\\//g, \"_\")\n    .replace(/=+$/, \"\");\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### 1. Token Storage\n- Store tokens in **httpOnly cookies** (not localStorage)\n- Use SameSite=Lax for CSRF protection\n\n### 2. Token Refresh\n```typescript\nasync function refreshTokens() {\n  const response = await fetch(`${SSO_URL}/oauth2/token`, {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    body: new URLSearchParams({\n      grant_type: \"refresh_token\",\n      client_id: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SSO_CLIENT_ID!,\n      refresh_token: currentRefreshToken,\n    }),\n  });\n  return response.json();\n}\n```\n\n### 3. JWKS Verification\n```typescript\nimport { createRemoteJWKSet, jwtVerify } from \"jose\";\n\nconst JWKS = createRemoteJWKSet(\n  new URL(`${SSO_URL}/.well-known/jwks.json`)\n);\n\nexport async function verifyAccessToken(token: string) {\n  const { payload } = await jwtVerify(token, JWKS, {\n    issuer: SSO_URL,\n    audience: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SSO_CLIENT_ID,\n  });\n  return payload;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Global Logout\n```typescript\n// Logout from all apps\nconst logoutUrl = new URL(`${SSO_URL}/oauth2/logout`);\nlogoutUrl.searchParams.set(\"post_logout_redirect_uri\", window.location.origin);\nwindow.location.href = logoutUrl.toString();\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| PKCE verifier lost after redirect | Store in httpOnly cookie before redirect |\n| Token in localStorage | Use httpOnly cookies instead |\n| JWKS fetch fails | Check CORS on auth server |\n| Consent screen loops | Ensure consent page saves decision |\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\nRun: `python3 scripts/verify.py`\n\nExpected: `✓ configuring-better-auth skill ready`\n\n## If Verification Fails\n\n1. Check: references/ folder has both setup files\n2. **Stop and report** if still failing\n\n## References\n\n- [references/auth-server-setup.md](references/auth-server-setup.md) - Complete auth server with OIDC provider\n- [references/sso-client-integration.md](references/sso-client-integration.md) - Full SSO client implementation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:47:31.880Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Authentication Agents needing centralized OAuth/OIDC implementation and SSO client configuration.","zh":"非常适合需要集中式 OAuth/OIDC 实现和单点登录客户端配置的身份验证代理。","ja":"OAuth/OIDC の集中実装とシングルサインオン（SSO）クライアント構成を必要とする認証エージェントに最適です。","ko":"중앙 집중식 OAuth/OIDC 구현 및 SSO 클라이언트 구성이 필요한 인증 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Autenticación que necesitan implementación centralizada de OAuth/OIDC y configuración de cliente SSO.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Authentification ayant besoin d''une implémentation centralisée d''OAuth/OIDC et de configuration de client SSO.","de":"Perfekt für Authentifizierungsagenten, die eine zentralisierte OAuth/OIDC-Implementierung und SSO-Client-Konfiguration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Autenticação que necessitam de implementação centralizada de OAuth/OIDC e configuração de cliente SSO.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Аутентификации, которым требуется централизованная реализация OAuth/OIDC и настройка клиента единого входа (SSO).","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المصادقة الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ مركزي لـ OAuth/OIDC وتكوين عميل تسجيل الدخول الموحد (SSO)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables guided configuration of Better Auth through MCP server integration, providing centralized authentication setup either as an auth server or SSO client using HTTP transport protocol.","zh":"通过 MCP 服务器集成实现 Better Auth 的引导式配置，使用 HTTP 传输协议，提供作为身份验证服务器或 SSO 客户端的集中式身份验证设置。","ja":"MCP サーバー統合を通じて Better Auth のガイド付き構成を可能にし、HTTP トランスポートプロトコルを使用して、認証サーバーまたは SSO クライアントとしての集中認証設定を提供します。","ko":"MCP 서버 통합을 통해 Better Auth의 가이드 구성을 가능하게 하며, HTTP 전송 프로토콜을 사용하여 인증 서버 또는 SSO 클라이언트로서의 중앙 집중식 인증 설정을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la configuración guiada de Better Auth a través de la integración del servidor MCP, proporcionando una configuración de autenticación centralizada, ya sea como servidor de autenticación o cliente SSO utilizando el protocolo de transporte HTTP.","fr":"Permet la configuration guidée de Better Auth via l''intégration du serveur MCP, fournissant une configuration d''authentification centralisée, soit en tant que serveur d''authentification, soit en tant que client SSO utilisant le protocole de transport HTTP.","de":"Ermöglicht die guidierte Konfiguration von Better Auth durch die Integration des MCP-Servers, wodurch eine zentralisierte Authentifizierungskonfiguration bereitgestellt wird, entweder als Authentifizierungsserver oder SSO-Client unter Verwendung des HTTP-Transportprotokolls.","pt":"Permite a configuração guiada do Better Auth através da integração com servidor MCP, fornecendo uma configuração de autenticação centralizada como servidor de autenticação ou cliente SSO utilizando o protocolo de transporte HTTP.","ru":"Обеспечивает пошаговую настройку Better Auth через интеграцию с сервером MCP, предоставляя централизованную настройку аутентификации либо в качестве сервера аутентификации, либо в качестве клиента единого входа (SSO) с использованием транспортного протокола HTTP.","ar":"يتيح التكوين الموجه لـ Better Auth من خلال تكامل خادم MCP، مما يوفر إعداد مصادقة مركزي إما كخادم مصادقة أو كعميل لتسجيل الدخول الموحد (SSO) باستخدام بروتوكول النقل HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing OAuth/OIDC authentication flows","Configuring SSO client integrations","Setting up centralized auth servers","Managing MCP server connections"],"zh":["实施 OAuth/OIDC 身份验证流程","配置 SSO 客户端集成","设置集中式身份验证服务器","管理 MCP 服务器连接"],"ja":["OAuth/OIDC 認証フローの実装","SSO クライアント統合の構成","集中認証サーバーの設定","MCP サーバー接続の管理"],"ko":["OAuth/OIDC 인증 흐름 구현","SSO 클라이언트 통합 구성","중앙 집중식 인증 서버 설정","MCP 서버 연결 관리"],"es":["Implementar flujos de autenticación OAuth/OIDC","Configurar integraciones de cliente SSO","Configurar servidores de autenticación centralizados","Administrar conexiones del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre