ration 技术指南提供了将 Convex 作为实时数据库后端集成到 RFP Discovery 应用中的指导","ja":"Convex統合テクニックは、ConvexをリアルタイムデータベースバックエンドとしてRFP Discoveryアプリケーションに統合する方法を提供する","ko":"Convex 통합 기술은 Convex를 실시간 데이터베이스 백엔드로 RFP Discovery 애플리케이션에 통합하는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Convex Integration proporciona una guía para integrar Convex como base de datos backend en tiempo real. Incluye instalación y diseño de esquemas.","fr":"Convex Integration fournit un guide pour intégrer Convex comme base de données backend en temps réel. Il comprend l''installation et la conception de schémas.","de":"Convex-Integration bietet eine Anleitung zur Integration von Convex als Echtzeit-Datenbank-Backend. Enthält Installation und Schema-Design.","pt":"O Convex é uma solução de banco de dados em tempo real para aplicativos. Veja como integrá-lo ao RFP Discovery.","ru":"Convex - это решение базы данных реального времени для приложений. Узнайте, как интегрировать его с RFP Discovery.","ar":"Convex هو حل لقاعدة بيانات في الوقت الفعلي للتطبيقات. تعلم كيفية إدماجه مع RFP Discovery.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实时数据同步","灵活的 Schema 设计","高性能的数据存储","简单的安装和配置","支持 TypeScript"],"ja":["リアルタイムデータ同期","柔軟なスキーマ設計","高性能のデータストレージ","簡単なインストールと設定","TypeScript サポート"],"ko":["실시간 데이터 동기화","유연한 스키마 설계","고성능 데이터 저장","간단한 설치 및 구성","TypeScript 지원"],"es":["Instalación de Convex","Diseño de esquemas para la base de datos","Integración con la aplicación RFP Discovery","Soporte para datos en tiempo real","Flexibilidad en la configuración de la base de datos"],"fr":["Installation de Convex","Conception de schémas pour la base de données","Intégration avec l''application RFP Discovery","Prise en charge des données en temps réel","Flexibilité dans la configuration de la base de données"],"de":["Installation von Convex","Schema-Design für die Datenbank","Integration mit der RFP Discovery-Anwendung","Unterstützung für Echtzeit-Daten","Flexibilität bei der Konfiguration der Datenbank"],"pt":["Instalação simplificada com npm","Design de esquema personalizado com Convex","Suporte a aplicativos em tempo real","Integração com RFP Discovery","Desenvolvimento de backend eficiente"],"ru":["Упрощенная установка с помощью npm","Пользовательский дизайн схемы с Convex","Поддержка приложений реального времени","Интеграция с RFP Discovery","Эффективное развитие бэкенда"],"ar":["تثبيت مبسط مع npm","تصميم مخطط مخصص مع Convex","دعم تطبيقات الوقت الفعلي","إدماج مع RFP Discovery","تطوير خلفية فعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex Integration","实时数据库","RFP Discovery","TypeScript","数据同步","Schema 设计"],"ja":["Convex統合","リアルタイムデータベース","RFP Discovery","TypeScript","データ同期","スキーマ設計"],"ko":["Convex 통합","실시간 데이터베이스","RFP Discovery","TypeScript","데이터 동기화","스키마 설계"],"es":["Convex Integration","base de datos en tiempo real","RFP Discovery","desarrollo de aplicaciones","integración de bases de datos","Convex como backend"],"fr":["Intégration Convex","base de données en temps réel","RFP Discovery","développement d''applications","intégration de bases de données","Convex comme backend"],"de":["Convex-Integration","Echtzeit-Datenbank","RFP Discovery","Anwendungsentwicklung","Datenbank-Integration","Convex als Backend"],"pt":["Convex","banco de dados em tempo real","RFP Discovery","desenvolvimento de backend","integração de banco de dados","npm","typescript","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Convex","база данных реального времени","RFP Discovery","разработка бэкенда","интеграция базы данных","npm","typescript","разработчики"],"ar":["Convex","قاعدة بيانات في الوقت الفعلي","RFP Discovery","تطوير خلفية","إدماج قاعدة بيانات","npm","typescript","مطورين"]}},"owner":"Atemndobs","repo":"nebula-rfp","repoPath":"Atemndobs/nebula-rfp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Integration","description":"Guidelines for integrating Convex real-time database into the RFP Discovery application","bodyPreview":"# Convex Integration Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for integrating Convex as the real-time database backend for the RFP Discovery application.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install convex\nnpx convex dev\n```\n\n## Schema Design\n\nCreate `convex/schema.ts` with the following tables:\n\n### RFP Table\n```typescript\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  rfps: defineTable({\n    // Core fields\n    externalId: v.st","body":"# Convex Integration Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for integrating Convex as the real-time database backend for the RFP Discovery application.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install convex\nnpx convex dev\n```\n\n## Schema Design\n\nCreate `convex/schema.ts` with the following tables:\n\n### RFP Table\n```typescript\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  rfps: defineTable({\n    // Core fields\n    externalId: v.string(), // ID from source platform\n    source: v.string(),     // \"sam.gov\", \"rfpmart\", \"emma\", etc.\n    title: v.string(),\n    summary: v.string(),\n    url: v.string(),\n    \n    // Dates\n    postedDate: v.optional(v.string()),\n    deadline: v.optional(v.string()),\n    questionDeadline: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Location/Category\n    location: v.optional(v.string()),\n    category: v.optional(v.string()),\n    state: v.optional(v.string()),\n    country: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Budget\n    budget: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Eligibility\n    eligibility: v.optional(v.string()),\n    isUsaOnly: v.optional(v.boolean()),\n    requiresOnshore: v.optional(v.boolean()),\n    setAsideType: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Metadata\n    fetchedAt: v.number(),\n    rawData: v.optional(v.string()),\n  }).index(\"by_external_id\", [\"externalId\", \"source\"])\n    .index(\"by_source\", [\"source\"])\n    .index(\"by_deadline\", [\"deadline\"]),\n\n  evaluations: defineTable({\n    rfpId: v.id(\"rfps\"),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()), // Clerk user ID\n    \n    // Overall result\n    isFit: v.boolean(),\n    score: v.number(),\n    maxScore: v.number(),\n    \n    // Per-criterion results\n    technicalRelevance: v.object({\n      met: v.boolean(),\n      details: v.optional(v.string()),\n    }),\n    scopeFit: v.object({\n      met: v.boolean(),\n      details: v.optional(v.string()),\n    }),\n    categoryFocus: v.object({\n      met: v.boolean(),\n      details: v.optional(v.string()),\n    }),\n    clientProfile: v.object({\n      met: v.boolean(),\n      details: v.optional(v.string()),\n    }),\n    logistics: v.object({\n      met: v.boolean(),\n      details: v.optional(v.string()),\n    }),\n    skillSetAlignment: v.object({\n      met: v.boolean(),\n      details: v.optional(v.string()),\n    }),\n    \n    // AI analysis\n    aiProvider: v.optional(v.string()),\n    aiAnalysis: v.optional(v.string()), // JSON string\n    reasoning: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Timestamps\n    evaluatedAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_rfp\", [\"rfpId\"])\n    .index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"]),\n\n  pursuits: defineTable({\n    rfpId: v.id(\"rfps\"),\n    userId: v.string(), // Clerk user ID\n    \n    // Pipeline stage\n    stage: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"new\"),\n      v.literal(\"triage\"),\n      v.literal(\"bid\"),\n      v.literal(\"no_bid\"),\n      v.literal(\"capture\"),\n      v.literal(\"submitted\"),\n      v.literal(\"won\"),\n      v.literal(\"lost\")\n    ),\n    \n    // Decision tracking\n    decision: v.optional(v.union(\n      v.literal(\"pursue\"),\n      v.literal(\"partner_needed\"),\n      v.literal(\"reject\")\n    )),\n    decisionReason: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Notes\n    notes: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Timestamps\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n    updatedAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"])\n    .index(\"by_stage\", [\"stage\"]),\n\n  userSettings: defineTable({\n    userId: v.string(), // Clerk user ID\n    \n    // AI Settings\n    selectedAiProvider: v.string(),\n    aiProviderConfigs: v.optional(v.string()), // JSON\n    corePromptTemplate: v.optional(v.string()),\n    useAiForEvaluation: v.boolean(),\n    \n    // Criteria Config\n    criteriaConfig: v.optional(v.string()), // JSON\n    \n    // Refresh Settings\n    autoRefreshIntervalHours: v.number(),\n    \n    // UI Preferences\n    theme: v.union(v.literal(\"light\"), v.literal(\"dark\")),\n  }).index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"]),\n});\n```\n\n## Query Patterns\n\n### Fetching RFPs with Evaluations\n```typescript\n// convex/rfps.ts\nimport { query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const listWithEvaluations = query({\n  args: { \n    source: v.optional(v.string()),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()) \n  },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    let rfpsQuery = ctx.db.query(\"rfps\");\n    \n    if (args.source) {\n      rfpsQuery = rfpsQuery.withIndex(\"by_source\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"source\", args.source)\n      );\n    }\n    \n    const rfps = await rfpsQuery\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 50);\n    \n    // Fetch evaluations for each RFP\n    const rfpsWithEvals = await Promise.all(\n      rfps.map(async (rfp) => {\n        const evaluation = await ctx.db\n          .query(\"evaluations\")\n          .withIndex(\"by_rfp\", (q) => q.eq(\"rfpId\", rfp._id))\n          .first();\n        return { ...rfp, evaluation };\n      })\n    );\n    \n    return rfpsWithEvals;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Mutation Patterns\n\n### Saving an Evaluation\n```typescript\n// convex/evaluations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const saveEvaluation = mutation({\n  args: {\n    rfpId: v.id(\"rfps\"),\n    isFit: v.boolean(),\n    score: v.number(),\n    maxScore: v.number(),\n    criteriaResults: v.object({\n      technicalRelevance: v.object({ met: v.boolean(), details: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n      scopeFit: v.object({ met: v.boolean(), details: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n      categoryFocus: v.object({ met: v.boolean(), details: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n      clientProfile: v.object({ met: v.boolean(), details: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n      logistics: v.object({ met: v.boolean(), details: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n      skillSetAlignment: v.object({ met: v.boolean(), details: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n    }),\n    aiProvider: v.optional(v.string()),\n  },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    \n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"evaluations\", {\n      rfpId: args.rfpId,\n      userId: identity?.subject,\n      isFit: args.isFit,\n      score: args.score,\n      maxScore: args.maxScore,\n      ...args.criteriaResults,\n      aiProvider: args.aiProvider,\n      evaluatedAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Integration with Clerk\n\nWhen using Convex with Clerk, configure authentication in `convex/auth.config.js`:\n\n```javascript\nexport default {\n  providers: [\n    {\n      domain: \"https://your-clerk-domain.clerk.accounts.dev\",\n      applicationID: \"convex\",\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## React Hooks Usage\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction RfpList() {\n  const rfps = useQuery(api.rfps.listWithEvaluations, { limit: 50 });\n  const saveEvaluation = useMutation(api.evaluations.saveEvaluation);\n  \n  // Component implementation\n}\n```\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n1. **Phase 1**: Add Convex alongside existing localStorage\n   - Create Convex schema\n   - Add mutations to sync localStorage to Convex\n   - Keep localStorage as fallback\n\n2. **Phase 2**: Migrate reads to Convex\n   - Replace localStorage reads with Convex queries\n   - Add real-time subscriptions\n\n3. **Phase 3**: Remove localStorage\n   - Remove localStorage sync code\n   - Use Convex as single source of truth\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:48:25.584Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Real-Time Data Agents requiring seamless Convex database integration and schema management.","zh":"适用于需要无缝Convex数据库集成和模式管理的实时数据代理。","ja":"リアルタイムデータエージェントがシームレスなConvexデータベース統合とスキーマ管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"실시간 데이터 에이전트가 무결점의 Convex 데이터베이스 통합과 스키마 관리를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Datos en Tiempo Real que requieren una integración y gestión de esquemas de base de datos Convex sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de données en temps réel nécessitant une intégration et une gestion de schéma de base de données Convex sans heurts.","de":"Ideal für Echtzeit-Daten-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration und Schemaverwaltung der Convex-Datenbank erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Dados em Tempo Real que exigem integração perfeita com o banco de dados Convex e gerenciamento de esquema.","ru":"Идеально для агентов реального времени, требующих бесшовной интеграции с базой данных Convex и управления схемой.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء البيانات في الوقت الحقيقي الذين يتطلبون دمجًا سلسًا مع قاعدة بيانات Convex وإدارة مخطط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage real-time data with Convex, utilizing npm installation and TypeScript schema definition, enabling efficient data storage and retrieval through tables like the RFP Table.","zh":"赋予代理管理实时数据的能力，利用npm安装和TypeScript模式定义，通过表格（如RFP表格）实现高效的数据存储和检索。","ja":"エージェントがnpmのインストールとTypeScriptのスキーマ定義を利用してリアルタイムデータを管理できるようにし、RFPテーブルなどのテーブルを介した効率的なデータの保存と取得を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 npm 설치와 TypeScript 스키마 정의를 활용하여 실시간 데이터를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, RFP 표와 같은 표를 통해 효율적인 데이터 저장과 검색을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar datos en tiempo real con Convex, utilizando la instalación npm y la definición de esquema TypeScript, lo que permite un almacenamiento y recuperación de datos eficientes a través de tablas como la tabla RFP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des données en temps réel avec Convex, en utilisant l''installation npm et la définition de schéma TypeScript, ce qui permet un stockage et une récupération de données efficaces via des tables comme la table RFP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Echtzeit-Daten mit Convex zu verwalten, indem sie die npm-Installation und die TypeScript-Schemadefinition verwenden, was einen effizienten Datenspeicher und -abruf durch Tabellen wie die RFP-Tabelle ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar dados em tempo real com o Convex, utilizando a instalação npm e a definição de esquema TypeScript, permitindo o armazenamento e recuperação eficientes de dados por meio de tabelas como a Tabela RFP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять данными в реальном времени с помощью Convex, используя установку npm и определение схемы TypeScript, что позволяет эффективно хранить и извлекать данные через таблицы, такие как таблица RFP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة البيانات في الوقت الحقيقي مع Convex، باستخدام التثبيت npm وتعريف مخطط TypeScript، مما يسمح بتخزين واسترجاع البيانات بكفاءة من خلال جداول مثل جدول RFP."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing schemas for real-time applications","Integrating Convex with RFP Discovery applications","Managing data with Convex''s defineTable and defineSchema functions"],"zh":["为实时应用程序设计模式","将Convex与RFP发现应用程序集成","使用Convex的defineTable和defineSchema函数管理数据"],"ja":["リアルタイムアプリケーションのスキーマを設計する","ConvexをRFP Discoveryアプリケーションに統合する","ConvexのdefineTableとdefineSchema関数を使用してデータを管理する"],"ko":["실시간 애플리케이션을 위한 스키마 설계","Convex를 RFP 디스커버리 애플리케이션에 통합","Convex의 defineTable 및 defineSchema 함수를 사용하여 데이터 관리"],"es":["Diseñar esquemas para aplicaciones en tiempo real","Integrar Convex con aplicaciones de descubrimiento RFP","Gestionar datos con las funciones defineTable y defineSchema de Convex"],"fr":["Concevoir des schémas pour des applications en temps réel","Intégrer Convex avec des applications de découverte RFP","Gérer des données avec les fonctions defineTable et defineSchema de Convex"],"de":["Schemata für Echtzeit-Anwendungen entwerfen","Convex in RFP-Entdeckungsanwendungen integrieren","Daten mit den Funktionen defineTable und defineSchema von Convex verwalten"],"pt":["Projetar esquemas para aplicações em tempo real","Integrar Convex com aplicações de descoberta RFP","Gerenciar dados com as funções defineTable e defineSchema do Convex"],"ru":["Проектирование схем для приложений реального времени","Интеграция Convex с приложениями обнаружения RFP","Управление данными с помощью функций defineTable и defineSchema Convex"],"ar":["تصميم مخططات للتطبيقات في الوقت الحقيقي","دمج Convex مع تطبيقات اكتشاف RFP","إدارة البيانات باستخدام دوال defineTable و defineSchema من Convex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation","Needs Convex development server setup with npx convex dev","Limited to TypeScript schema definition"],"zh":["需要npm安装","需要使用npx convex dev设置Convex开发服务器","仅限TypeScript模式定义"],"ja":["npmのインストールが必要","npx convex devを使用してConvex開発サーバーを設定する必要がある","TypeScriptのスキーマ定義のみをサポート"],"ko":["npm 설치가 필요","npx convex dev를 사용하여 Convex 개발 서버를 설정해야 함","TypeScript 스키마 정의만 지원"],"es":["Requiere instalación npm","Necesita configuración del servidor de desarrollo Convex con npx convex dev","Limitado a la definición de esquema TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation npm","Nécessite une configuration du serveur de développement Convex avec npx convex dev","Limité à la définition de schéma TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Installation","Benötigt Convex-Entwicklungsserver-Setup mit npx convex dev","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-Schemadefinition"],"pt":["Exige instalação npm","Necessita de configuração do servidor de desenvolvimento Convex com npx convex dev","Limitado à definição de esquema TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует установки npm","Требует настройки сервера разработки Convex с npx convex dev","Ограничен определением схемы TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب التثبيت npm","يحتاج إلى إعداد خادم التطوير Convex مع npx convex dev","محدود بالتعريف المخطط TypeScript"]},"