dependências entre projetos","Migração para Nx"],"ru":["Настройка новых рабочих пространств Nx","Оптимизация непрерывной интеграции с помощью команд, влияющих на результат","Реализация удаленного кэширования","Управление зависимостями между проектами","Миграция на Nx"],"ar":["تكوين مساحات عمل Nx جديدة","تحسين التكامل المستمر باستخدام أوامر المتأثرة","تنفيذ ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت عن بعد","إدارة التبعيات بين المشاريع","هجرة إلى Nx"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nx 工作空间模式","monorepo 管理","CI 优化","依赖管理","远程缓存","Nx 教程","开发效率","代码管理"],"ja":["Nx ワークスペース パターン","monorepo 管理","CI 最適化","依存関係管理","リモート キャッシュ","Nx チュートリアル","開発効率","コード管理"],"ko":["Nx 작업공간 패턴","monorepo 관리","CI 최적화","의존성 관리","원격 캐싱","Nx 튜토리얼","개발 효율성","코드 관리"],"es":["patrones de espacio de trabajo nx","gestión de monorepos","optimización de ci","desarrollo de software","nx workspace","monorepo management"],"fr":["modèles d''espace de travail nx","gestion de monorepos","optimisation de l''ic","développement de logiciels","nx workspace","gestion de monorepo"],"de":["nx-arbeitsbereichsmuster","verwaltung von monorepos","optimierung von ci","software-entwicklung","nx-arbeitsbereich","monorepo-verwaltung"],"pt":["nx workspace","monorepo","gerenciamento de projetos","otimização de ci","cache remoto","dependências entre projetos","migração para nx"],"ru":["nx рабочее пространство","монорепозиторий","управление проектами","оптимизация ci","удаленный кэш","зависимости между проектами","миграция на nx"],"ar":["مساحة عمل nx","مستودع بسيط","إدارة المشاريع","تحسين التكامل المستمر","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت عن بعد","التبعيات بين المشاريع","هجرة إلى nx"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nx-workspace-patterns","description":"Configure and optimize Nx monorepo workspaces. Use when setting up Nx, configuring project boundaries, optimizing build caching, or implementing affected commands.","bodyPreview":"# Nx Workspace Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Nx monorepo management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Nx workspaces\n- Configuring project boundaries\n- Optimizing CI with affected commands\n- Implementing remote caching\n- Managing dependencies between projects\n- Migrating to Nx\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Nx Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── apps/              # Deployable applications\n│   ├── web/\n│   └── api/\n├── libs/              # Shared libraries\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── ui/","body":"# Nx Workspace Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Nx monorepo management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Nx workspaces\n- Configuring project boundaries\n- Optimizing CI with affected commands\n- Implementing remote caching\n- Managing dependencies between projects\n- Migrating to Nx\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Nx Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── apps/              # Deployable applications\n│   ├── web/\n│   └── api/\n├── libs/              # Shared libraries\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── ui/\n│   │   └── utils/\n│   └── feature/\n│       ├── auth/\n│       └── dashboard/\n├── tools/             # Custom executors/generators\n├── nx.json            # Nx configuration\n└── workspace.json     # Project configuration\n```\n\n### 2. Library Types\n\n| Type            | Purpose                          | Example             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **feature**     | Smart components, business logic | `feature-auth`      |\n| **ui**          | Presentational components        | `ui-buttons`        |\n| **data-access** | API calls, state management      | `data-access-users` |\n| **util**        | Pure functions, helpers          | `util-formatting`   |\n| **shell**       | App bootstrapping                | `shell-web`         |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: nx.json Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"npmScope\": \"myorg\",\n  \"affected\": {\n    \"defaultBase\": \"main\"\n  },\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"nx/tasks-runners/default\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\n          \"build\",\n          \"lint\",\n          \"test\",\n          \"e2e\",\n          \"build-storybook\"\n        ],\n        \"parallel\": 3\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"inputs\": [\"production\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\", \"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"e2e\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\"{projectRoot}/**/*\", \"sharedGlobals\"],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/jest.config.[jt]s\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": [\n      \"{workspaceRoot}/babel.config.json\",\n      \"{workspaceRoot}/tsconfig.base.json\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"generators\": {\n    \"@nx/react\": {\n      \"application\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\",\n        \"linter\": \"eslint\",\n        \"bundler\": \"webpack\"\n      },\n      \"library\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\",\n        \"linter\": \"eslint\"\n      },\n      \"component\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 2: Project Configuration\n\n```json\n// apps/web/project.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"web\",\n  \"$schema\": \"../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json\",\n  \"sourceRoot\": \"apps/web/src\",\n  \"projectType\": \"application\",\n  \"tags\": [\"type:app\", \"scope:web\"],\n  \"targets\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/webpack:webpack\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{options.outputPath}\"],\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"production\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"compiler\": \"babel\",\n        \"outputPath\": \"dist/apps/web\",\n        \"index\": \"apps/web/src/index.html\",\n        \"main\": \"apps/web/src/main.tsx\",\n        \"tsConfig\": \"apps/web/tsconfig.app.json\",\n        \"assets\": [\"apps/web/src/assets\"],\n        \"styles\": [\"apps/web/src/styles.css\"]\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"development\": {\n          \"extractLicenses\": false,\n          \"optimization\": false,\n          \"sourceMap\": true\n        },\n        \"production\": {\n          \"optimization\": true,\n          \"outputHashing\": \"all\",\n          \"sourceMap\": false,\n          \"extractLicenses\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"serve\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/webpack:dev-server\",\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"development\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"buildTarget\": \"web:build\"\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"development\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"web:build:development\"\n        },\n        \"production\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"web:build:production\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/jest:jest\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{workspaceRoot}/coverage/{projectRoot}\"],\n      \"options\": {\n        \"jestConfig\": \"apps/web/jest.config.ts\",\n        \"passWithNoTests\": true\n      }\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/eslint:lint\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{options.outputFile}\"],\n      \"options\": {\n        \"lintFilePatterns\": [\"apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 3: Module Boundary Rules\n\n```json\n// .eslintrc.json\n{\n  \"root\": true,\n  \"ignorePatterns\": [\"**/*\"],\n  \"plugins\": [\"@nx\"],\n  \"overrides\": [\n    {\n      \"files\": [\"*.ts\", \"*.tsx\", \"*.js\", \"*.jsx\"],\n      \"rules\": {\n        \"@nx/enforce-module-boundaries\": [\n          \"error\",\n          {\n            \"enforceBuildableLibDependency\": true,\n            \"allow\": [],\n            \"depConstraints\": [\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:app\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\n                  \"type:feature\",\n                  \"type:ui\",\n                  \"type:data-access\",\n                  \"type:util\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:feature\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\n                  \"type:ui\",\n                  \"type:data-access\",\n                  \"type:util\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:ui\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:ui\", \"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:data-access\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:data-access\", \"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:util\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:web\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:web\", \"scope:shared\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:api\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:api\", \"scope:shared\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:shared\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:shared\"]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Template 4: Custom Generator\n\n```typescript\n// tools/generators/feature-lib/index.ts\nimport {\n  Tree,\n  formatFiles,\n  generateFiles,\n  joinPathFragments,\n  names,\n  readProjectConfiguration,\n} from \"@nx/devkit\";\nimport { libraryGenerator } from \"@nx/react\";\n\ninterface FeatureLibraryGeneratorSchema {\n  name: string;\n  scope: string;\n  directory?: string;\n}\n\nexport default async function featureLibraryGenerator(\n  tree: Tree,\n  options: FeatureLibraryGeneratorSchema,\n) {\n  const { name, scope, directory } = options;\n  const projectDirectory = directory\n    ? `${directory}/${name}`\n    : `libs/${scope}/feature-${name}`;\n\n  // Generate base library\n  await libraryGenerator(tree, {\n    name: `feature-${name}`,\n    directory: projectDirectory,\n    tags: `type:feature,scope:${scope}`,\n    style: \"css\",\n    skipTsConfig: false,\n    skipFormat: true,\n    unitTestRunner: \"jest\",\n    linter: \"eslint\",\n  });\n\n  // Add custom files\n  const projectConfig = readProjectConfiguration(\n    tree,\n    `${scope}-feature-${name}`,\n  );\n  const projectNames = names(name);\n\n  generateFiles(\n    tree,\n    joinPathFragments(__dirname, \"files\"),\n    projectConfig.sourceRoot,\n    {\n      ...projectNames,\n      scope,\n      tmpl: \"\",\n    },\n  );\n\n  await formatFiles(tree);\n}\n```\n\n### Template 5: CI Configuration with Affected\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\nenv:\n  NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}\n\njobs:\n  main:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: 20\n          cache: \"npm\"\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Derive SHAs for affected commands\n        uses: nrwl/nx-set-shas@v4\n\n      - name: Run affected lint\n        run: npx nx affected -t lint --parallel=3\n\n      - name: Run affected test\n        run: npx nx affected -t test --parallel=3 --configuration=ci\n\n      - name: Run affected build\n        run: npx nx affected -t build --parallel=3\n\n      - name: Run affected e2e\n        run: npx nx affected -t e2e --parallel=1\n```\n\n### Template 6: Remote Caching Setup\n\n```typescript\n// nx.json with Nx Cloud\n{\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"nx-cloud\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\"build\", \"lint\", \"test\", \"e2e\"],\n        \"accessToken\": \"your-nx-cloud-token\",\n        \"parallel\": 3,\n        \"cacheDirectory\": \".nx/cache\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"nxCloudAccessToken\": \"your-nx-cloud-token\"\n}\n\n// Self-hosted cache with S3\n{\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"@nx-aws-cache/nx-aws-cache\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\"build\", \"lint\", \"test\"],\n        \"awsRegion\": \"us-east-1\",\n        \"awsBucket\": \"my-nx-cache-bucket\",\n        \"awsProfile\": \"default\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Generate new library\nnx g @nx/react:lib feature-auth --directory=libs/web --tags=type:feature,scope:web\n\n# Run affected tests\nnx affected -t test --base=main\n\n# View dependency graph\nnx graph\n\n# Run specific project\nnx build web --configuration=production\n\n# Reset cache\nnx reset\n\n# Run migrations\nnx migrate latest\nnx migrate --run-migrations\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Use tags consistently** - Enforce with module boundaries\n- **Enable caching early** - Significant CI savings\n- **Keep libs focused** - Single responsibility\n- **Use generators** - Ensure consistency\n- **Document boundaries** - Help new developers\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t create circular deps** - Graph should be acyclic\n- **Don''t skip affected** - Test only what changed\n- **Don''t ignore boundaries** - Tech debt accumulates\n- **Don''t over-granularize** - Balance lib count\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Nx Documentation](https://nx.dev/getting-started/intro)\n- [Module Boundaries](https://nx.dev/core-features/enforce-module-boundaries)\n- [Nx Cloud](https://nx.app/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:48:43.506Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents managing complex monorepo architectures with Nx.","zh":"适合用于DevOps自动化代理，管理复杂的Nx单体仓库架构。","ja":"DevOps自動化エージェントが、複雑なNxモノレポアーキテクチャを管理するのに最適。","ko":"DevOps 자동화 에이전트가 복잡한 Nx 모노레포 아키텍처를 관리하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de DevOps que administran arquitecturas de monorepo complejas con Nx.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps gérant des architectures de monorepo complexes avec Nx.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Automatisierungsagenten, die komplexe Monorepo-Architekturen mit Nx verwalten.","pt":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents managing complex monorepo architectures with Nx.","ru":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents managing complex monorepo architectures with Nx.","ar":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents managing complex monorepo architectures with Nx."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to configure project boundaries, optimize CI pipelines with affected commands, implement remote caching, and manage complex dependency graphs between applications and shared libraries. Provides structured patterns for workspace setup and migration strategies.","zh":"使代理能够配置项目边界，使用受影响的命令优化CI管道，实现远程缓存，并管理应用程序和共享库之间的复杂依赖图。提供工作空间设置和迁移策略的结构化模式。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトの境界を構成し、影響を受けるコマンドでCIパイプラインを最適化し、リモートキャッシュを実装し、アプリケーションと共有ライブラリの間の複雑な依存関係グラフを管理できるようにします。ワークスペースの設定と移行戦略の構造化パターンを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 경계를 구성하고 영향을 받는 명령으로 CI 파이프라인을 최적화하고 원격 캐싱을 구현하며 애플리케이션과 공유 라이브러리 간의 복잡한 의존성 그래프를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 작업 공간 설정 및 마이그레이션 전략에 대한 구조화된 패턴을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar límites de proyecto, optimizar tuberías de CI con comandos afectados, implementar caché remoto y administrar gráficos de dependencia complejos entre aplicaciones y bibliotecas compartidas. Proporciona patrones estructurados para la configuración del espacio de trabajo y las estrategias de migración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer les limites de projet, d''optimiser les pipelines de CI avec des commandes affectées, de mettre en œuvre un cache distant et de gérer des graphiques de dépendance complexes entre applications et bibliothèques partagées. Fournit des modèles structurés pour la configuration de l''espace de travail et les stratégies de migration.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Projektgrenzen zu konfigurieren, CI-Pipelines mit betroffenen Befehlen zu optimieren, Remote-Caching zu implementieren und komplexe Abhängigkeitsgraphen zwischen Anwendungen und freigegebenen Bibliotheken zu verwalten. Bietet strukturierte Muster für die Arbeitsbereichskonfiguration und Migrationsstrategien.","pt":"Enables agents to configure project boundaries, optimize CI pipelines with affected commands, implement remote caching, and manage complex dependency graphs between applications and shared libraries. Provides structured patterns for workspace setup and migration strategies.","ru":"Enables agents to configure project boundaries, optimize CI pipelines with affected commands, implement remote caching, and manage complex dependency graphs between applications and shared libraries. Provides structured patterns for workspace setup and migration strategies.","ar":"Enables agents to configure project boundaries, optimize CI pipelines with affected commands, implement remote caching, and manage complex dependency graphs between applications and shared libraries. Provides structured patterns for workspace setup and migration strategies."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new Nx workspace architectures","Configuring project boundaries for dependency management","Optimizing CI/CD pipelines with affected commands","Implementing remote caching for build acceleration","Managing library-to-application dependency graphs"],"zh":["设置新的Nx工作空间架构","配置项目边界以进行依赖管理","使用受影响的命令优化CI/CD管道","实现远程缓存以加速构建","管理库到应用程序的依赖图"],"ja":["新しいNxワークスペースアーキテクチャの設定","依存関係管理のためのプロジェクト境界の構成","影響を受けるコマンドでCI/CDパイプラインを最適化","ビルドの高速化のためのリモートキャッシュの実装","ライブラリからアプリケーションへの依存関係グラフの管理"],"ko":["新的 Nx 작업공간 아키텍처 설정","의존성 관리를 위한 프로젝트 경계 구성","영향을 받는 명령으로 CI/CD 파이프라인 최적화","빌드 가속을 위한 원격 캐싱 구현","라이브러리에서 애플리케이션으로의 의존성 그래프 관리"],"es":["Configuración de nuevas arquitecturas de espacio de trabajo Nx","Configuración de límites de proyecto para la administración de dependencias","Optimización de tuberías de CI/CD con comandos afectados","Implementación de caché remoto para la aceleración de compilación","Administración de gráficos de dependencia de biblioteca a aplicación"],"fr":["Configuration de nouvelles architectures d''espace de travail Nx","Configuration des limites de projet pour la gestion des dépendances","Optimisation des pipelines de CI/CD avec des commandes affectées","Mise en œuvre d''un cache distant pour l''accélération de la compilation","Gestion des graphiques de dépendance de bibliothèque à application"],"de":["Einrichtung neuer Nx-Arbeitsbereichsarchitekturen","Konfiguration von Projektgrenzen für die Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Optimierung von CI/CD-Pipelines mit betroffenen Befehlen","Implementierung von Remote-Caching für die Build-Beschleunigung","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeitsgraphen von Bibliothek zu Anwendung"],"pt":["Setting up new Nx workspace architectures","Configuring project boundaries for dependency management","Optimizing CI/CD pipelines with affected commands","Implementing remote caching for build acceleration","Managing library-to-application dependency graphs"],"ru":["Setting up new Nx workspace architectures","Configuring project boundaries for dependency management","Optimizing CI/CD pipelines with affected commands","Implementing remote caching for build acceleration","Managing library-to-application dependency graphs"],"ar":["Setting up new Nx workspace architectures","Configuring project boundaries for dependency management","Optimizing CI/CD pipelines with affected commands","Implementing remote caching for build acceleration","Managing library-to-application dependency graphs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Nx workspace or migration setup","Dependent on proper project boundary configuration","CI optimization requires integration with version control systems"],"zh":["需要现有的Nx工作空间或迁移设置","依赖于正确的项目边界配置","CI优化需要与版本控制系统集成"],"ja":["既存のNxワークスペースまたは移行設定が必要","正しいプロジェクト境界の構成に依存","CIの最適化にはバージョン管理システムとの統合が必要"],"ko":["기존의 Nx 작업공간 또는 마이그레이션 설정이 필요","올바른 프로젝트 경계 구성에 의존","CI 최적화에는 버전 관리 시스템과의 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un espacio de trabajo Nx existente o una configuración de migración","Dependiente de una configuración adecuada de límites de proyecto","La optimización de CI requiere una integración con sistemas de control de versiones"],"fr":["Nécessite un espace de travail Nx existant ou une configuration de migration","Dépendante d''une configuration appropriée des limites de projet","L''optimisation de CI nécessite une intégration avec des systèmes de contrôle de version"],"de":["Benötigt einen bestehenden Nx-Arbeitsbereich oder eine Migrationskonfiguration","Abhängig von einer ordnungsgemäßen Projektgrenzenkonfiguration","CI-Optimierung erfordert eine Integration mit Versionskontrollsystemen"],"pt":["Requires existing Nx workspace or migration setup","Dependent on proper project boundary configuration","CI optimization requires integration with version control systems"],"ru":["Requires existing Nx workspace or migration setup","Dependent on proper project boundary configuration","CI optimization requires integration with version control systems"],"ar":["Requires existing Nx workspace or migration setup","Dependent on proper project boundary configuration","CI optimization requires integration with version control systems"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
