nvolvimento Dirigido por Contexto: Guia de Implementação","ru":"Контекстно-ориентированное развитие: Руководство по реали...","ar":"التطوير الموجه بالسياق: دليل التنفيذ","en":"context-driven-development"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何在Conductor中实施和维护上下文，以实现一致的AI交互和团队协调","ja":"このガイドでは、Conductorでのコンテキストの実装と維持方法を紹介し、AIの相互作用とチームの調整を一貫性を持たせる","ko":"본 가이드는 Conductor에서 컨텍스트를 구현하고 유지하는 방법을介绍하며 일관된 AI 상호 작용과 팀 조정을 달성하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El desarrollo dirigido por contexto es una guía para implementar y mantener el contexto en proyectos de IA, mejorando la consistencia y la colaboración en eq...","fr":"Le développement piloté par le contexte est un guide pour mettre en œuvre et maintenir le contexte dans les projets d''IA, améliorant la cohérence et la colla...","de":"Die kontextgetriebene Entwicklung ist ein Leitfaden für die Implementierung und Pflege des Kontexts in IA-Entwicklungsprojekten, um die Konsistenz und Teamzu...","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por contexto é uma abordagem que permite a gestão de contextos como artefatos gerenciados ao lado do código, garantindo interações...","ru":"Контекстно-ориентированное развитие - это подход, который позволяет управлять контекстами как управляемыми артефактами наряду с кодом, обеспечивая согласован...","ar":"التطوير الموجه بالسياق هو نهج يسمح بإدارة السياقات كأشياء محددة جنباً إلى جنب مع الشفرة، مما يضمن تفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتسقة وتناسق الفريق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实施和维护上下文","实现一致的AI交互","团队协调和一致性","结构化项目文档","Conductor项目设置和维护"],"ja":["コンテキストの実装と維持","AIの相互作用の一貫性","チームの調整と一貫性","構造化プロジェクトドキュメント","Conductorプロジェクトの設定と維持"],"ko":["컨텍스트 구현 및 유지","일관된 AI 상호 작용","팀 조정 및 일관성","구조화된 프로젝트 문서","Conductor 프로젝트 설정 및 유지"],"es":["Implementación de contexto en proyectos de IA","Mantenimiento de la consistencia en sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA","Colaboración en equipo a través de la documentación de proyectos estructurada","Configuración de nuevos proyectos con Conductor","Actualización del contexto en proyectos existentes"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre du contexte dans les projets d''IA","Maintenance de la cohérence dans les séances de développement assistées par l''IA","Collaboration d''équipe à travers la documentation de projets structurée","Configuration de nouveaux projets avec Conductor","Mise à jour du contexte dans les projets existants"],"de":["Implementierung des Kontexts in IA-Entwicklungsprojekten","Pflege der Konsistenz in IA-gestützten Entwicklungs-Sitzungen","Teamzusammenarbeit durch strukturierte Projekt-Dokumentation","Einrichtung neuer Projekte mit Conductor","Aktualisierung des Kontexts in bestehenden Projekten"],"pt":["Implementação de contextos como artefatos gerenciados","Garantia de interações de IA consistentes","Alinhamento da equipe através de documentação de projeto estruturada","Onboarding de membros da equipe para projetos existentes","Decisão sobre quando atualizar contextos"],"ru":["Реализация контекстов как управляемых артефактов","Обеспечение согласованных взаимодействий ИИ","Выравнивание команды через структурированную документацию проекта","Ввод новых членов команды в существующие проекты","Решение о том, когда обновлять контексты"],"ar":["تنفيذ السياقات كأشياء محددة","ضمان تفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتسقة","تناسق الفريق من خلال توثيق مشروع منظم","تدريب أعضاء الفريق الجدد على المشاريع الحالية","التحديد متى يتم تحديث السياقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文驱动开发","AI交互","团队协调","结构化项目文档","Conductor","一致性","管理上下文"],"ja":["コンテキスト駆動開発","AIの相互作用","チームの調整","構造化プロジェクトドキュメント","Conductor","一貫性","コンテキストの管理"],"ko":["컨텍스트 주도 개발","AI 상호 작용","팀 조정","구조화된 프로젝트 문서","Conductor","일관성","컨텍스트 관리"],"es":["desarrollo de IA","contexto en desarrollo de IA","colaboración en equipo","documentación de proyectos","Conductor","consistencia en desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["développement d''IA","contexte dans le développement d''IA","collaboration d''équipe","documentation de projets","Conductor","cohérence dans le développement d''IA"],"de":["IA-Entwicklung","Kontext in der IA-Entwicklung","Teamzusammenarbeit","Projekt-Dokumentation","Conductor","Konsistenz in der IA-Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por contexto","contexto como artefato","interações de IA consistentes","alinhamento da equipe","documentação de projeto estruturada","onboarding de membros da equipe"],"ru":["контекстно-ориентированное развитие","контекст как артефакт","согласованные взаимодействия ИИ","выравнивание команды","структурированная документация проекта","ввод новых членов команды"],"ar":["التطوير الموجه بالسياق","السياق كشيء محدد","تفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتسقة","تناسق الفريق","توثيق مشروع منظم","تدريب أعضاء الفريق الجدد"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-driven-development","description":"Use this skill when working with Conductors context-driven development methodology, managing project context artifacts, or understanding the relationship between product.md, tech-stack.md, and workflow.md files.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Context-Driven Development\n\nGuide for implementing and maintaining context as a managed artifact alongside code, enabling consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new projects with Conductor\n- Understanding the relationship between context artifacts\n- Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions\n- Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project\n- Deciding when to update context d","body":"# Context-Driven Development\n\nGuide for implementing and maintaining context as a managed artifact alongside code, enabling consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new projects with Conductor\n- Understanding the relationship between context artifacts\n- Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions\n- Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project\n- Deciding when to update context documents\n- Managing greenfield vs brownfield project contexts\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\nContext-Driven Development treats project context as a first-class artifact managed alongside code. Instead of relying on ad-hoc prompts or scattered documentation, establish a persistent, structured foundation that informs all AI interactions.\n\nKey principles:\n\n1. **Context precedes code**: Define what you''re building and how before implementation\n2. **Living documentation**: Context artifacts evolve with the project\n3. **Single source of truth**: One canonical location for each type of information\n4. **AI alignment**: Consistent context produces consistent AI behavior\n\n## The Workflow\n\nFollow the **Context → Spec & Plan → Implement** workflow:\n\n1. **Context Phase**: Establish or verify project context artifacts exist and are current\n2. **Specification Phase**: Define requirements and acceptance criteria for work units\n3. **Planning Phase**: Break specifications into phased, actionable tasks\n4. **Implementation Phase**: Execute tasks following established workflow patterns\n\n## Artifact Relationships\n\n### product.md - Defines WHAT and WHY\n\nPurpose: Captures product vision, goals, target users, and business context.\n\nContents:\n\n- Product name and one-line description\n- Problem statement and solution approach\n- Target user personas\n- Core features and capabilities\n- Success metrics and KPIs\n- Product roadmap (high-level)\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Product vision or goals change\n- New major features are planned\n- Target audience shifts\n- Business priorities evolve\n\n### product-guidelines.md - Defines HOW to Communicate\n\nPurpose: Establishes brand voice, messaging standards, and communication patterns.\n\nContents:\n\n- Brand voice and tone guidelines\n- Terminology and glossary\n- Error message conventions\n- User-facing copy standards\n- Documentation style\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Brand guidelines change\n- New terminology is introduced\n- Communication patterns need refinement\n\n### tech-stack.md - Defines WITH WHAT\n\nPurpose: Documents technology choices, dependencies, and architectural decisions.\n\nContents:\n\n- Primary languages and frameworks\n- Key dependencies with versions\n- Infrastructure and deployment targets\n- Development tools and environment\n- Testing frameworks\n- Code quality tools\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Adding new dependencies\n- Upgrading major versions\n- Changing infrastructure\n- Adopting new tools or patterns\n\n### workflow.md - Defines HOW to Work\n\nPurpose: Establishes development practices, quality gates, and team workflows.\n\nContents:\n\n- Development methodology (TDD, etc.)\n- Git workflow and commit conventions\n- Code review requirements\n- Testing requirements and coverage targets\n- Quality assurance gates\n- Deployment procedures\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Team practices evolve\n- Quality standards change\n- New workflow patterns are adopted\n\n### tracks.md - Tracks WHAT''S HAPPENING\n\nPurpose: Registry of all work units with status and metadata.\n\nContents:\n\n- Active tracks with current status\n- Completed tracks with completion dates\n- Track metadata (type, priority, assignee)\n- Links to individual track directories\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- New tracks are created\n- Track status changes\n- Tracks are completed or archived\n\n## Context Maintenance Principles\n\n### Keep Artifacts Synchronized\n\nEnsure changes in one artifact reflect in related documents:\n\n- New feature in product.md → Update tech-stack.md if new dependencies needed\n- Completed track → Update product.md to reflect new capabilities\n- Workflow change → Update all affected track plans\n\n### Update tech-stack.md When Adding Dependencies\n\nBefore adding any new dependency:\n\n1. Check if existing dependencies solve the need\n2. Document the rationale for new dependencies\n3. Add version constraints\n4. Note any configuration requirements\n\n### Update product.md When Features Complete\n\nAfter completing a feature track:\n\n1. Move feature from \"planned\" to \"implemented\" in product.md\n2. Update any affected success metrics\n3. Document any scope changes from original plan\n\n### Verify Context Before Implementation\n\nBefore starting any track:\n\n1. Read all context artifacts\n2. Flag any outdated information\n3. Propose updates before proceeding\n4. Confirm context accuracy with stakeholders\n\n## Greenfield vs Brownfield Handling\n\n### Greenfield Projects (New)\n\nFor new projects:\n\n1. Run `/conductor:setup` to create all artifacts interactively\n2. Answer questions about product vision, tech preferences, and workflow\n3. Generate initial style guides for chosen languages\n4. Create empty tracks registry\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- Full control over context structure\n- Define standards before code exists\n- Establish patterns early\n\n### Brownfield Projects (Existing)\n\nFor existing codebases:\n\n1. Run `/conductor:setup` with existing codebase detection\n2. System analyzes existing code, configs, and documentation\n3. Pre-populate artifacts based on discovered patterns\n4. Review and refine generated context\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- Extract implicit context from existing code\n- Reconcile existing patterns with desired patterns\n- Document technical debt and modernization plans\n- Preserve working patterns while establishing standards\n\n## Benefits\n\n### Team Alignment\n\n- New team members onboard faster with explicit context\n- Consistent terminology and conventions across the team\n- Shared understanding of product goals and technical decisions\n\n### AI Consistency\n\n- AI assistants produce aligned outputs across sessions\n- Reduced need to re-explain context in each interaction\n- Predictable behavior based on documented standards\n\n### Institutional Memory\n\n- Decisions and rationale are preserved\n- Context survives team changes\n- Historical context informs future decisions\n\n### Quality Assurance\n\n- Standards are explicit and verifiable\n- Deviations from context are detectable\n- Quality gates are documented and enforceable\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nconductor/\n├── index.md              # Navigation hub linking all artifacts\n├── product.md            # Product vision and goals\n├── product-guidelines.md # Communication standards\n├── tech-stack.md         # Technology preferences\n├── workflow.md           # Development practices\n├── tracks.md             # Work unit registry\n├── setup_state.json      # Resumable setup state\n├── code_styleguides/     # Language-specific conventions\n│   ├── python.md\n│   ├── typescript.md\n│   └── ...\n└── tracks/\n    └── <track-id>/\n        ├── spec.md\n        ├── plan.md\n        ├── metadata.json\n        └── index.md\n```\n\n## Context Lifecycle\n\n1. **Creation**: Initial setup via `/conductor:setup`\n2. **Validation**: Verify before each track\n3. **Evolution**: Update as project grows\n4. **Synchronization**: Keep artifacts aligned\n5. **Archival**: Document historical decisions\n\n## Context Validation Checklist\n\nBefore starting implementation on any track, validate context:\n\n### Product Context\n\n- [ ] product.md reflects current product vision\n- [ ] Target users are accurately described\n- [ ] Feature list is up to date\n- [ ] Success metrics are defined\n\n### Technical Context\n\n- [ ] tech-stack.md lists all current dependencies\n- [ ] Version numbers are accurate\n- [ ] Infrastructure targets are correct\n- [ ] Development tools are documented\n\n### Workflow Context\n\n- [ ] workflow.md describes current practices\n- [ ] Quality gates are defined\n- [ ] Coverage targets are specified\n- [ ] Commit conventions are documented\n\n### Track Context\n\n- [ ] tracks.md shows all active work\n- [ ] No stale or abandoned tracks\n- [ ] Dependencies between tracks are noted\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\nAvoid these context management mistakes:\n\n### Stale Context\n\nProblem: Context documents become outdated and misleading.\nSolution: Update context as part of each track''s completion process.\n\n### Context Sprawl\n\nProblem: Information scattered across multiple locations.\nSolution: Use the defined artifact structure; resist creating new document types.\n\n### Implicit Context\n\nProblem: Relying on knowledge not captured in artifacts.\nSolution: If you reference something repeatedly, add it to the appropriate artifact.\n\n### Context Hoarding\n\nProblem: One person maintains context without team input.\nSolution: Review context artifacts in pull requests; make updates collaborative.\n\n### Over-Specification\n\nProblem: Context becomes so detailed it''s impossible to maintain.\nSolution: Keep artifacts focused on decisions that affect AI behavior and team alignment.\n\n## Integration with Development Tools\n\n### IDE Integration\n\nConfigure your IDE to display context files prominently:\n\n- Pin conductor/product.md for quick reference\n- Add tech-stack.md to project notes\n- Create snippets for common patterns from style guides\n\n### Git Hooks\n\nConsider pre-commit hooks that:\n\n- Warn when dependencies change without tech-stack.md update\n- Remind to update product.md when feature branches merge\n- Validate context artifact syntax\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n\nInclude context validation in pipelines:\n\n- Check tech-stack.md matches actual dependencies\n- Verify links in context documents resolve\n- Ensure tracks.md status matches git branch state\n\n## Session Continuity\n\nConductor supports multi-session development through context persistence:\n\n### Starting a New Session\n\n1. Read index.md to orient yourself\n2. Check tracks.md for active work\n3. Review relevant track''s plan.md for current task\n4. Verify context artifacts are current\n\n### Ending a Session\n\n1. Update plan.md with current progress\n2. Note any blockers or decisions made\n3. Commit in-progress work with clear status\n4. Update tracks.md if status changed\n\n### Handling Interruptions\n\nIf interrupted mid-task:\n\n1. Mark task as `[~]` with note about stopping point\n2. Commit work-in-progress to feature branch\n3. Document any uncommitted decisions in plan.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Read context first**: Always read relevant artifacts before starting work\n2. **Small updates**: Make incremental context changes, not massive rewrites\n3. **Link decisions**: Reference context when making implementation choices\n4. **Version context**: Commit context changes alongside code changes\n5. **Review context**: Include context artifact reviews in code reviews\n6. **Validate regularly**: Run context validation checklist before major work\n7. **Communicate changes**: Notify team when context artifacts change significantly\n8. **Preserve history**: Use git to track context evolution over time\n9. **Question staleness**: If context feels wrong, investigate and update\n10. **Keep it actionable**: Every context item should inform a decision or behavior\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:49:27.623Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Conductor, Cursor, and AutoGPT needing structured project documentation and context management for consistent interactions","zh":"适用于像 Conductor、Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要结构化的项目文档和上下文管理以实现一致的交互","ja":"Conductor、Cursor、AutoGPT などの構造化されたプロジェクト文書とコンテキスト管理が必要な AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Conductor, Cursor, AutoGPT와 같은AI 에이전트에게 구조화된 프로젝트 문서와 컨텍스트 관리가 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Conductor, Cursor y AutoGPT que necesitan documentación de proyecto estructurada y gestión de contexto para interacciones consistentes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Conductor, Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant une documentation de projet structurée et une gestion de contexte pour des interactions cohérentes","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Conductor, Cursor und AutoGPT, die strukturierte Projektdokumentation und Kontextverwaltung für konsistente Interaktionen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Conductor, Cursor e AutoGPT que precisam de documentação de projeto estruturada e gerenciamento de contexto para interações consistentes","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Conductor, Cursor и AutoGPT, которым необходима структурированная документация проекта и управление контекстом для последовательных взаимодействий","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Conductor و Cursor و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى توثيق مشروع منظم وإدارة السياق للتفاعلات الثابتة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain context as a managed artifact alongside code, ensuring consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation, utilizing context artifacts and Conductor projects, and enabling seamless onboarding and updates","zh":"赋予代理维持上下文作为代码旁边的管理工件，确保通过结构化的项目文档、利用上下文工件和 Conductor 项目，实现一致的 AI 交互和团队对齐，并实现无缝的入职和更新","ja":"エージェントがコンテキストをコードとともに管理されたアーティファクトとして維持できるようにし、構造化されたプロジェクト文書、コンテキストアーティファクト、Conductor プロジェクトを利用して一貫した AI のやり取りとチームの連携を実現し、スムーズなオンボーディングと更新を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 코드와 함께 관리되는 아티팩트로서의 컨텍스트를 유지할 수 있도록 하여 구조화된 프로젝트 문서, 컨텍스트 아티팩트 및 Conductor 프로젝트를 사용하여 일관된 AI 상호 작용 및 팀 정렬을 보장하고, 무서운 온보딩 및 업데이트를 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener el contexto como un artefacto administrado junto con el código, garantizando interacciones de IA coherentes y alineación del equipo a través de la documentación de proyecto estructurada, utilizando artefactos de contexto y proyectos de Conductor, y permitiendo una incorporación y actualización sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir le contexte comme un artefact géré aux côtés du code, garantissant des interactions IA cohérentes et une alignement d''équipe via la documentation de projet structurée, en utilisant des artefacts de contexte et des projets Conductor, et en permettant une intégration et des mises à jour sans heurts","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Kontext als ein verwaltetes Artefakt neben dem Code beizubehalten, um konsistente KI-Interaktionen und Teamausrichtung durch strukturierte Projektdokumentation sicherzustellen, indem Kontextartefakte und Conductor-Projekte verwendet und eine nahtlose Einbindung und Aktualisierung ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter o contexto como um artifact gerenciado ao lado do código, garantindo interações de IA consistentes e alinhamento da equipe por meio de documentação de projeto estruturada, utilizando artifacts de contexto e projetos Conductor, e permitindo integração e atualizações sem interrupções","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность поддерживать контекст в качестве управляемого артефакта наряду с кодом, гарантируя последовательные взаимодействия ИИ и согласование команды посредством структурированной документации проекта, использования артефактов контекста и проектов Conductor, а также обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию и обновления","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على السياق كartifact مراقب جنباً إلى جنب مع الكود، مما يضمن تفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي الثابتة وتنسيق الفريق من خلال توثيق المشروع المنظم، استخدام artifacts السياق ومشاريع Conductor، وتمكين التكامل والأمور المتعلقة بالتحديثات دون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new projects with structured context","Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions","Onboarding team members to existing Conductor projects","Deciding when to update context artifacts"],"zh":["设置具有结构化上下文的新项目","在 AI 辅助开发会话中保持一致性","将团队成员加入现有的 Conductor 项目","决定何时更新上下文工件"],"ja":["構造化されたコンテキストを持つ新しいプロジェクトを設定する","AI アシスト開発セッション全体で一貫性を維持する","チームメンバーを既存の Conductor プロジェクトにオンボードする","コンテキスト アーティファクトを更新するタイミングを決定する"],"ko":["구조화된 컨텍스트를 갖는 새로운 프로젝트 설정","AI 지원 개발 세션에서 일관성을 유지","팀원을 기존의 Conductor 프로젝트에 온보딩","컨텍스트 아티팩트를 업데이트할 때 결정"],"es":["Configuración de nuevos proyectos con contexto estructurado","Mantenimiento de la coherencia en sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA","Incorporación de miembros del equipo a proyectos de Conductor existentes","Decidir cuándo actualizar los artefactos de contexto"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux projets avec contexte structuré","Maintenance de la cohérence lors de sessions de développement assistées par IA","Intégration de membres d''équipe à des projets Conductor existants","Décider quand mettre à jour les artefacts de contexte"],"de":["Einrichtung neuer Projekte mit strukturiertem Kontext","Beibehaltung der Konsistenz in KI-unterstützten Entwicklungssitzungen","Einbindung von Teammitgliedern in bestehende Conductor-Projekte","Entscheidung darüber, wann Kontextartefakte aktualisiert werden sollen"],"pt":["Configurar novos projetos com contexto estruturado","Manter a consistência em sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA","Integrar membros da equipe em projetos Conductor existentes","Decidir quando atualizar artifacts de contexto"],"ru":["Настройка новых проектов со структурированным контекстом","Поддержание согласованности на протяжении сессий разработки с помощью ИИ","Интеграция членов команды в существующие проекты Conductor","Определение момента обновления артефактов контекста"],"ar":["إعداد مشاريع جديدة مع سياق منظم","الحفاظ على الاتساق عبر جلسات التطوير التي يصاحبها الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكامل أفراد الفريق في مشاريع Conductor الحالية","تحديد الوقت المناسب لتحديث artifacts السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Conductor project setup","Context artifacts must be managed and updated regularly"],"zh":["需要 Conductor 项目设置","上下文工件必须定期管理和更新"],"ja":["Conductor プロジェクトの設定が必要","コンテキスト アーティファクトを定期的に管理および更新する必要がある"],"ko":["Conductor 프로젝트 설정이 필요","컨텍스트 아티팩트를 정기적으로 관리 및 업데이트해야 함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de Conductor","Los artefactos de contexto deben administrarse y actualizarse regularmente"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Conductor","Les artefacts de contexte doivent être gérés et mis à jour régulièrement"],"de":["Benötigt Conductor-Projektkonfiguration","Kontextartefakte müssen regelmäßig verwaltet und aktualisiert werden"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto Conductor","Artifacts de contexto devem ser gerenciados e atualizados regularmente"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Conductor","Артефакты контекста должны быть управляемыми и регулярно обновляемыми"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Conductor","يجب إدارة artifacts السياق وتحديثها بانتظام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
