ur mesure analyse les descriptions de travail et crée des CV adaptés à chaque poste","de":"Der individuelle Lebenslauf-Generator analysiert Stellenbeschreibungen und erstellt passende Lebensläufe","pt":"O gerador de currículos personalizados analisa descrições de vagas e cria currículos customizados para aumentar as chances de aprovação.","ru":"Построитель резюме под заказ анализирует описания вакансий и создает индивидуальные резюме для увеличения шансов на одобрение.","ar":"مُحسّن سيرة ذاتية مُخصص يُحلّل وصفات الوظائف ويُنشئ سير ذاتية مُخصصة لزيادة فرص القبول.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分析职位描述","提取关键要求","创建多个简历版本","优化简历为ATS","突出相关经验","强调特定技能"],"ja":["求人描述を分析","重要な要件を抽出","複数のResumeバージョンを作成","ATS用にResumeを最適化","関連する経験を強調","特定のスキルを強調"],"ko":["직무 설명을 분석","핵심 요구 사항을 추출","複数의 이력서 버전을 생성","ATS용으로 이력서를 최적화","관련 경험을 강조","특정 스킬을 강조"],"es":["Análisis de descripciones de trabajo","Creación de currículums personalizados","Adaptación a diferentes sectores y puestos","Optimización para sistemas de seguimiento de aplicaciones","Creación de múltiples versiones de currículums"],"fr":["Analyse des descriptions de travail","Création de CV sur mesure","Adaptation à différents secteurs et postes","Optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","Création de multiples versions de CV"],"de":["Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Erstellung individueller Lebensläufe","Anpassung an verschiedene Branchen und Stellen","Optimierung für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme","Erstellung mehrerer Lebenslauf-Versionen"],"pt":["Análise de descrições de vagas","Criação de currículos customizados","Otimização para sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","Destaque de experiências relevantes","Criação de múltiplas versões de currículos"],"ru":["Анализ описаний вакансий","Создание индивидуальных резюме","Оптимизация для систем отслеживания кандидатов","Подчеркивание релевантного опыта","Создание нескольких версий резюме"],"ar":["تحليل وصفات الوظائف","إنشاء سير ذاتية مُخصصة","تحسين لأنظمة تتبع المرشحين","تأكيد الخبرات المُتعلقة","إنشاء نسخ متعددة من السيرة الذاتية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["个性化简历","简历生成器","工作搜索","ATS优化","简历创建","职位描述分析","关键要求提取"],"ja":["カスタムResume","Resume作成ツール","仕事検索","ATS最適化","Resume作成","求人描述分析","重要な要件抽出"],"ko":["맞춤형 이력서","이력서 생성기","작업 검색","ATS 최적화","이력서 생성","직무 설명 분석","핵심 요구 사항 추출"],"es":["generador de currículums","currículum personalizado","análisis de descripciones de trabajo","optimización para ATS","creación de currículums","sector laboral"],"fr":["générateur de CV","CV sur mesure","analyse des descriptions de travail","optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","création de CV","marché du travail"],"de":["Lebenslauf-Generator","individueller Lebenslauf","Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Optimierung für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme","Erstellung von Lebensläufen","Arbeitsmarkt"],"pt":["gerador de currículos","currículos personalizados","sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","otimização de currículos","destaque de experiências","criação de currículos"],"ru":["построитель резюме","индивидуальные резюме","системы отслеживания кандидатов","оптимизация резюме","подчеркивание опыта","создание резюме"],"ar":["مُحسّن سيرة ذاتية","سير ذاتية مُخصصة","أنظمة تتبع المرشحين","تحسين سيرة ذاتية","تأكيد الخبرات","إنشاء سيرة ذاتية"]}},"owner":"b08x","repo":"dots","repoPath":"b08x/dots","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailored-resume-generator","description":"Analyzes job descriptions and generates tailored resumes that highlight relevant experience, skills, and achievements to maximize interview chances","bodyPreview":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifi","body":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifications, and keywords from job postings\n2. **Identifies Priorities**: Determines what employers value most based on the job description language and structure\n3. **Tailors Content**: Reorganizes and emphasizes relevant experience, skills, and achievements\n4. **Optimizes Keywords**: Incorporates ATS-friendly keywords naturally throughout the resume\n5. **Formats Professionally**: Creates clean, professional resume layouts suitable for various formats\n6. **Provides Recommendations**: Suggests improvements and highlights gaps to address\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Usage\nProvide a job description and your background information:\n\n```\nI''m applying for this job:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nHere''s my background:\n- 5 years as software engineer at TechCorp\n- Led team of 3 developers on mobile app project\n- Expert in Python, JavaScript, React\n- Computer Science degree from State University\n```\n\n### With Existing Resume\nUpload or paste your current resume along with the job description:\n\n```\nPlease tailor my resume for this position:\n\nJob Description:\n[paste job description]\n\nMy Current Resume:\n[paste resume content]\n```\n\n### Career Transition\nWhen changing industries or roles:\n\n```\nI''m transitioning from marketing to product management.\nHere''s the job I''m applying for:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nMy transferable experience:\n- 7 years in digital marketing\n- Led cross-functional teams\n- Managed product launches\n- Data analysis and A/B testing\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User Request:**\n```\nI need a tailored resume for this job:\n\nSenior Data Analyst Position\n\nRequirements:\n- 5+ years experience in data analysis\n- Expert in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools\n- Experience with A/B testing and statistical analysis\n- Strong communication skills to present findings\n- Healthcare industry experience preferred\n\nMy background:\n- Data Analyst at RetailCo (2019-2024)\n- Created dashboards using Tableau and Power BI\n- Built Python scripts for data automation\n- Worked with marketing team on campaign analysis\n- Business Analytics degree\n- Also did 1 year internship at HealthPlus clinic\n```\n\n**Generated Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# JOHN DOE\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nResults-driven Data Analyst with 5+ years of experience leveraging SQL, Python, and advanced\nvisualization tools to deliver actionable insights. Proven track record in statistical analysis,\nA/B testing, and cross-functional collaboration. Healthcare industry experience with strong\nability to communicate complex data findings to stakeholders.\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n- **Data Analysis & Programming**: SQL, Python, Statistical Analysis, A/B Testing\n- **Visualization Tools**: Tableau, Power BI, Advanced Dashboard Development\n- **Data Management**: Data Automation, ETL Processes, Database Optimization\n- **Business Intelligence**: Campaign Analytics, Performance Metrics, KPI Tracking\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\n**Data Analyst** | RetailCo | 2019 - 2024\n- Designed and implemented 50+ SQL queries and Python automation scripts, reducing manual\n  data processing time by 60%\n- Conducted rigorous A/B testing and statistical analysis for marketing campaigns,\n  improving campaign ROI by 35%\n- Built interactive Tableau and Power BI dashboards for executive team, enabling\n  data-driven decision making\n- Presented analytical findings to cross-functional stakeholders including marketing,\n  operations, and executive leadership\n- Collaborated with marketing team to analyze customer behavior patterns and optimize\n  targeting strategies\n\n**Data Analysis Intern** | HealthPlus Clinic | 2018 - 2019\n- Supported healthcare analytics initiatives by analyzing patient data and operational metrics\n- Gained exposure to healthcare industry data management and HIPAA compliance requirements\n- Assisted in creating reports for clinical staff to improve patient care workflows\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Business Analytics**\nState University | Graduated 2018\n\n## KEY ACHIEVEMENTS\n- Reduced data processing time by 60% through Python automation\n- Improved marketing campaign ROI by 35% through A/B testing and optimization\n- Created data visualization system now used across entire organization\n```\n\n**Additional Recommendations:**\n- Consider adding any specific healthcare projects or certifications\n- Quantify more achievements with metrics when possible\n- If you have experience with R or advanced statistical methods, add them\n- Consider mentioning any familiarity with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests resume tailoring:\n\n### 1. Gather Information\n\n**Job Description Analysis**:\n- Request the full job description if not provided\n- Ask for the company name and job title\n\n**Candidate Background**:\n- If user provides existing resume, use it as the foundation\n- If not, request:\n  - Work history (job titles, companies, dates, responsibilities)\n  - Education background\n  - Key skills and technical proficiencies\n  - Notable achievements and metrics\n  - Certifications or awards\n  - Any other relevant information\n\n### 2. Analyze Job Requirements\n\nExtract and prioritize:\n- **Must-have qualifications**: Years of experience, required skills, education\n- **Key skills**: Technical tools, methodologies, competencies\n- **Soft skills**: Communication, leadership, teamwork\n- **Industry knowledge**: Domain-specific experience\n- **Keywords**: Repeated terms, phrases, and buzzwords for ATS optimization\n- **Company values**: Cultural fit indicators from job description\n\nCreate a mental map of:\n- Priority 1: Critical requirements (deal-breakers)\n- Priority 2: Important qualifications (strongly desired)\n- Priority 3: Nice-to-have skills (bonus points)\n\n### 3. Map Candidate Experience to Requirements\n\nFor each job requirement:\n- Identify matching experience from candidate''s background\n- Find transferable skills if no direct match\n- Note gaps that need to be addressed or de-emphasized\n- Identify unique strengths to highlight\n\n### 4. Structure the Tailored Resume\n\n**Professional Summary** (3-4 lines):\n- Lead with years of experience in the target role/field\n- Include top 3-4 required skills from job description\n- Mention industry experience if relevant\n- Highlight unique value proposition\n\n**Technical/Core Skills Section**:\n- Group skills by category matching job requirements\n- List required tools and technologies first\n- Use exact terminology from job description\n- Only include skills you can substantiate with experience\n\n**Professional Experience**:\n- For each role, emphasize responsibilities and achievements aligned with job requirements\n- Use action verbs: Led, Developed, Implemented, Optimized, Managed, Created, Analyzed\n- **Quantify achievements**: Include numbers, percentages, timeframes, scale\n- Reorder bullet points to prioritize most relevant experience\n- Use keywords naturally from job description\n- Format: **[Action Verb] + [What] + [How/Why] + [Result/Impact]**\n\n**Education**:\n- List degrees, certifications relevant to position\n- Include relevant coursework if early career\n- Add certifications that match job requirements\n\n**Optional Sections** (if applicable):\n- Certifications & Licenses\n- Publications or Speaking Engagements\n- Awards & Recognition\n- Volunteer Work (if relevant to role)\n- Projects (especially for technical roles)\n\n### 5. Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n\n- Use standard section headings (Professional Experience, Education, Skills)\n- Incorporate exact keywords from job description naturally\n- Avoid tables, graphics, headers/footers, or complex formatting\n- Use standard fonts and bullet points\n- Include both acronyms and full terms (e.g., \"SQL (Structured Query Language)\")\n- Match job title terminology where truthful\n\n### 6. Format and Present\n\n**Format Options**:\n- **Markdown**: Clean, readable, easy to copy\n- **Plain Text**: ATS-optimized, safe for all systems\n- **Tips for Word/PDF**: Provide formatting guidance\n\n**Resume Structure Guidelines**:\n- Keep to 1 page for <10 years experience, 2 pages for 10+ years\n- Use consistent formatting and spacing\n- Ensure contact information is prominent\n- Use reverse chronological order (most recent first)\n- Maintain clean, scannable layout with white space\n\n### 7. Provide Strategic Recommendations\n\nAfter presenting the tailored resume, offer:\n\n**Strengths Analysis**:\n- What makes this candidate competitive\n- Unique qualifications to emphasize in cover letter or interview\n\n**Gap Analysis**:\n- Requirements not fully met\n- Suggestions for addressing gaps (courses, projects, reframing experience)\n\n**Interview Preparation Tips**:\n- Key talking points aligned with resume\n- Stories to prepare based on job requirements\n- Questions to ask that demonstrate fit\n\n**Cover Letter Hooks**:\n- Suggest 2-3 opening lines for cover letter\n- Key achievements to expand upon\n\n### 8. Iterate and Refine\n\nAsk if user wants to:\n- Adjust emphasis or tone\n- Add or remove sections\n- Generate alternative versions for different roles\n- Create format variations (traditional vs. modern)\n- Develop role-specific versions (if applying to multiple similar positions)\n\n### 9. Best Practices to Follow\n\n**Do**:\n- Be truthful and accurate - never fabricate experience\n- Use industry-standard terminology\n- Quantify achievements with specific metrics\n- Tailor each resume to specific job\n- Proofread for grammar and consistency\n- Keep language concise and impactful\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Include personal information (age, marital status, photo unless requested)\n- Use first-person pronouns (I, me, my)\n- Include references (\"available upon request\" is outdated)\n- List every job if career is 20+ years (focus on relevant, recent experience)\n- Use generic templates without customization\n- Exceed 2 pages unless very senior role\n\n### 10. Special Considerations\n\n**Career Changers**:\n- Use functional or hybrid resume format\n- Emphasize transferable skills\n- Create compelling narrative in summary\n- Focus on relevant projects and coursework\n\n**Recent Graduates**:\n- Lead with education\n- Include relevant coursework, projects, internships\n- Emphasize leadership in student organizations\n- Include GPA if 3.5+\n\n**Senior Executives**:\n- Lead with executive summary\n- Focus on leadership and strategic impact\n- Include board memberships, speaking engagements\n- Emphasize revenue growth, team building, vision\n\n**Technical Roles**:\n- Include technical skills section prominently\n- List programming languages, frameworks, tools\n- Include GitHub, portfolio, or project links\n- Mention methodologies (Agile, Scrum, etc.)\n\n**Creative Roles**:\n- Include link to portfolio\n- Highlight creative achievements and campaigns\n- Mention tools and software proficiencies\n- Consider more creative formatting (while maintaining ATS compatibility)\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- **Be specific**: Provide complete job descriptions and detailed background information\n- **Share metrics**: Include numbers, percentages, and quantifiable achievements when describing your experience\n- **Indicate format preference**: Let the skill know if you need ATS-optimized, creative, or traditional format\n- **Mention constraints**: Share any specific requirements (page limits, sections to include/exclude)\n- **Iterate**: Don''t hesitate to ask for revisions or alternative approaches\n- **Multiple applications**: Generate separate tailored versions for different roles\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill processes your personal and professional information to generate tailored resumes. Always review the output before submitting to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Remove or modify any information you prefer not to share with potential employers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:49:33.641Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Career Guidance Agents seeking to optimize job application processes with tailored resume generation capabilities.","zh":"适合为职业指导代理优化工作申请流程的个性化简历生成能力","ja":"職業指導エージェントがジョブ申請プロセスを最適化するためのカスタマイズされた履歴書生成機能を求める場合に最適","ko":"커리어 가이던스 에이전트가 작업 신청 프로세스를 최적화하기 위한 맞춤형 이력서 생성 기능을 찾는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de orientación profesional que buscan optimizar los procesos de solicitud de empleo con capacidades de generación de currículums personalizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''orientation de carrière qui cherchent à optimiser les processus de candidature avec des capacités de génération de CV personnalisés.","de":"Ideal für Karriereberatungsagenten, die die Stellenbewerbungsprozesse mit maßgeschneiderten Lebenslaufgenerierungsfunktionen optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Orientação de Carreira que buscam otimizar os processos de candidatura a empregos com capacidades de geração de currículos personalizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по карьерному консультированию, стремящихся оптимизировать процессы подачи заявок на работу с возможностями генерации резюме, адаптированных к конкретным требованиям.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التوجيه الوظيفي الذين يبحثون عن تحسين عمليات التقديم لوظائف مع القدرات على توليد سيرة ذاتية مخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze job descriptions, extract key requirements, and generate customized resumes optimized for ATS and specific job postings, utilizing natural language processing and machine learning libraries.","zh":"赋予代理分析工作描述、提取关键要求并生成针对特定工作发布和申请跟踪系统的定制化简历，利用自然语言处理和机器学习库","ja":"エージェントにジョブの説明を分析し、重要な要件を抽出し、特定のジョブ投稿とATSに最適化されたカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成する機能を提供することで、自然言語処理と機械学習ライブラリを利用","ko":"에이전트가 작업 설명을 분석하고 주요 요구 사항을 추출하여 특정 작업 게시와 ATS에 최적화된 맞춤형 이력서를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 자연어 처리와 기계 학습 라이브러리를 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar descripciones de trabajo, extraer requisitos clave y generar currículums personalizados optimizados para ATS y ofertas de trabajo específicas, utilizando bibliotecas de procesamiento de lenguaje natural y aprendizaje automático.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les descriptions de travail, d''extraire les exigences clés et de générer des CV personnalisés optimisés pour les ATS et les offres d''emploi spécifiques, en utilisant des bibliothèques de traitement du langage naturel et d''apprentissage automatique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Stellenbeschreibungen zu analysieren, Schlüsselanforderungen zu extrahieren und maßgeschneiderte Lebensläufe zu generieren, die für ATS und bestimmte Stellenangebote optimiert sind, unter Nutzung von Bibliotheken für natürliche Sprachverarbeitung und maschinelles Lernen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem descrições de trabalho, extraiam requisitos-chave e gerem currículos personalizados otimizados para sistemas de rastreamento de candidaturas (ATS) e postagens de trabalho específicas, utilizando bibliotecas de processamento de linguagem natural e aprendizado de máquina.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать описания работы, извлекать ключевые требования и генерировать индивидуальные резюме, оптимизированные для систем отслеживания заявок (ATS) и конкретных вакансий, используя библиотеки обработки естественного языка и машинного обучения.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تحليل وصفات العمل، واستخراج المتطلبات الرئيسية، وتوليد سيرة ذاتية مخصصة محسّنة لبرامج تتبع الطلبات والوظائف المحددة، باستخدام مكتبات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وlibraries التعلم الاّلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating resume customization for different job applications","Generating keyword-optimized resumes for improved ATS compatibility","Creating multiple resume versions for career transitions and industry changes"],"zh":["为不同工作申请自动定制简历","生成关键词优化的简历以提高ATS兼容性","为职业转换和行业变化创建多个简历版本"],"ja":["異なるジョブ申請用の履歴書を自動カスタマイズする","ATSの互換性を向上させるためのキーワード最適化された履歴書を生成する","キャリア転換や業界変更用に複数の履歴書バージョンを作成する"],"ko":["다른 작업 신청을 위한 이력서 자동 맞춤","ATS 호환성을 개선하기 위한 키워드 최적화된 이력서 생성","커리어 전환 및 업계 변경을 위한 여러 이력서 버전 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la personalización de currículums para diferentes solicitudes de empleo","Generar currículums optimizados por palabras clave para una mejor compatibilidad con ATS","Crear varias versiones de currículums para transiciones de carrera y cambios de industria"],"fr":["Automatiser la personnalisation des CV pour différentes candidatures","Générer des CV optimisés par mots clés pour une meilleure compatibilité avec les ATS","Créer plusieurs versions de CV pour les transitions de carrière et les changements d''industrie"],"de":["Automatisieren der Anpassung von Lebensläufen für verschiedene Bewerbungen","Generieren von lebenslauf-optimierten Schlüsselwörtern für eine verbesserte ATS-Kompatibilität","Erstellen mehrerer Lebenslaufversionen für Karrierewechsel und Branchenwechsel"],"pt":["Automatizar a personalização de currículos para diferentes candidaturas a empregos","Gerar currículos otimizados por palavras-chave para melhor compatibilidade com sistemas de rastreamento de candidaturas (ATS)","Criar múltiplas versões de currículos para transições de carreira e mudanças de indústria"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку резюме для различных заявок на работу","Генерировать резюме, оптимизированные по ключевым словам, для улучшения совместимости с системами отслеживания заявок (ATS)","Создавать несколько версий резюме для карьерных переходов и изменений отрасли"],"ar":["توسيع تخصيص السيرة الذاتية للوظائف المختلفة","توليد سيرة ذاتية محسّنة بالكلمات الرئيسية لتحسين التوافق مع برامج تتبع الطلبات","إنشاء نسخ متعددة من السيرة الذاتية للتحولات الوظيفية وتغييرات الصناعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to job description data and resume templates","Limited to generating resumes in specific formats (e.g., PDF, Word)","May require additional integration with ATS systems for seamless compatibility"],"zh":["需要访问工作描述数据和简历模板","仅限生成特定格式的简历（例如PDF、Word）","可能需要与ATS系统进行额外集成以实现无缝兼容性"],"ja":["ジョブ説明データと履歴書テンプレートへのアクセスが必要","特定の形式（例：PDF、Word）の履歴書の生成のみ","ATSシステムとのシームレスな互換性を実現するために、追加の統合が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["작업 설명 데이터 및 이력서 템플릿에 대한 액세스가 필요","특정 형식(예: PDF, Word)의 이력서 생성만","무缝 호환성을实现하기 위해 ATS 시스템과의 추가 통합이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de descripciones de trabajo y plantillas de currículums","Limitado a la generación de currículums en formatos específicos (por ejemplo, PDF, Word)","Puede requerir una integración adicional con sistemas ATS para una compatibilidad perfecta"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de descriptions de travail et aux modèles de CV","Limité à la génération de CV dans des formats spécifiques (par exemple, PDF, Word)","Peut nécessiter une intégration supplémentaire avec les systèmes ATS pour une compatibilité sans faille"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Stellenbeschreibungsdaten und Lebenslaufvorlagen","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Lebensläufen in bestimmten Formaten (z.B. PDF, Word)","Kann eine zusätzliche Integration mit ATS-Systemen für eine nahtlose Kompatibilität erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de descrição de trabalho e modelos de currículos","Limitado a gerar currículos em formatos específicos (por exemplo, PDF, Word)","Pode requerer integração adicional com sistemas de rastreamento de candidaturas (ATS) para compatibilidade perfeita"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным описания работы и шаблонам резюме","Ограничен генерацией резюме в конкретных форматах (например, PDF, Word)","Может потребовать дополнительной интеграции с системами отслеживания заявок (ATS) для бесперебойной совместимости"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات وصف العمل ونماذج السيرة الذاتية","محدود بتوليد السيرة الذاتية في صيغ محددة (على سبيل المثال، PDF، Word)","يمكن أن يتطلب تكاملًا إضافيًا مع برامج تتبع الطلبات من أجل التوافق السلس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
