의미합니다","es":"La simplificación de código es fundamental para desarrollar soluciones mantenibles y eficientes. Nuestros principios y prácticas te ayudarán a lograrlo","fr":"La simplification de code est fondamentale pour développer des solutions maintenables et efficaces. Nos principes et pratiques vous aideront à y parvenir","de":"Die Code-Vereinfachung ist entscheidend für die Entwicklung von wartbaren und effizienten Lösungen. Unsere Prinzipien und Praktiken helfen Ihnen dabei","pt":"A simplificação de código é fundamental para tornar soluções complexas em códigos elegantes e manteníveis.","ru":"Упрощение кода является основой для превращения сложных решений в элегантные и поддерживаемые коды.","ar":"تبسيط الشفرة هو أساسي لجعل الحلول المعقدة شفرات أنيقة وقابلة للصيانة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["简化代码结构","消除不必要的复杂性","提高代码可维护性","提高开发效率","增强代码可读性"],"ja":["コード構造の簡略化","不必要な複雑さの排除","コードのメンテナンス性の向上","開発効率の向上","コードの可読性の向上"],"ko":["코드 구조의 간소화","불필요한 복잡성의 제거","코드의 유지 보수성 향상","개발 효율성 향상","코드의 가독성 향상"],"es":["Identificación y eliminación de la complejidad innecesaria","Desarrollo de soluciones elegantes y mantenibles","Principios de simplicidad para una mejor arquitectura de sistemas","Mejora de la eficiencia y la productividad","Reduciendo el tiempo de depuración y resolución de errores"],"fr":["Identification et élimination de la complexité inutile","Développement de solutions élégantes et maintenables","Principes de simplicité pour une meilleure architecture de systèmes","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la productivité","Réduction du temps de débogage et de résolution d''erreurs"],"de":["Identifizierung und Beseitigung von unnötiger Komplexität","Entwicklung von eleganten und wartbaren Lösungen","Prinzipien der Einfachheit für eine bessere Systemarchitektur","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Produktivität","Reduzierung der Fehlerbehebungs- und Debugging-Zeit"],"pt":["Simplicidade como princípio fundamental","Eliminação de complexidade desnecessária","Código mais fácil de manter","Melhoria da legibilidade do código","Redução de erros e bugs"],"ru":["Простота как основной принцип","Удаление ненужной сложности","Код более fácil де поддерживать","Улучшение читаемости кода","Сокращение ошибок и багов"],"ar":["البساطة كأصل أساسي","إزالة التعقيد غير الضروري","شفرة أكثر سهولة في الصيانة","تحسين قراءة الشفرة","تقليل الأخطاء والعيوب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码简化","软件开发原则","代码可维护性","代码可读性","开发效率","代码结构","代码优化"],"ja":["コード簡略化","ソフトウェア開発原則","コードのメンテナンス性","コードの可読性","開発効率","コード構造","コード最適化"],"ko":["코드 간소화","소프트웨어 개발 원칙","코드의 유지 보수성","코드의 가독성","개발 효율성","코드 구조","코드 최적화"],"es":["simplificación de código","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de sistemas","principios de simplicidad","mantenibilidad del código","eficiencia en el desarrollo","productividad en el desarrollo"],"fr":["simplification de code","développement de logiciels","architecture de systèmes","principes de simplicité","maintenabilité du code","efficacité dans le développement","productivité dans le développement"],"de":["Code-Vereinfachung","Software-Entwicklung","Systemarchitektur","Prinzipien der Einfachheit","Wartbarkeit des Codes","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Produktivität in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["simplificação de código","desenvolvimento de software","arquitetura de sistemas","princípios de codificação","legibilidade do código","manutenção de código"],"ru":["упрощение кода","разработка программного обеспечения","системная архитектура","принципы кодирования","читаемость кода","поддержка кода"],"ar":["تبسيط الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة النظم","مبادئ البرمجة","قراءة الشفرة","صيانة الشفرة"]}},"owner":"javierhbr","repo":"agnostic-agent-loop-example","repoPath":"javierhbr/agnostic-agent-loop-example","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-simplification","description":"Use this skill when you need to review and refactor code to make it simpler, more maintainable, and easier to understand. Helps with identifying overly complex solutions, unnecessary abstractions.","bodyPreview":"The information outlined here aims to help you become an expert system architect and developer with an unwavering commitment to code simplicity.\n\nWhen focusing on code simplification it is your mission to identify and eliminate unnecessary complexity wherever it exists, transforming convoluted solutions into elegant, maintainable code.\n\nYour core principles:\n- **Simplicity First**: Every line of code should have a clear purpose. If it doesn''t contribute directly to solving the problem, it should","body":"The information outlined here aims to help you become an expert system architect and developer with an unwavering commitment to code simplicity.\n\nWhen focusing on code simplification it is your mission to identify and eliminate unnecessary complexity wherever it exists, transforming convoluted solutions into elegant, maintainable code.\n\nYour core principles:\n- **Simplicity First**: Every line of code should have a clear purpose. If it doesn''t contribute directly to solving the problem, it shouldn''t exist.\n- **Readability Over Cleverness**: Code is read far more often than it''s written. Optimise for human understanding, not for showing off technical prowess.\n- **Minimal Abstractions**: Only introduce abstractions when they genuinely reduce complexity. Premature abstraction is a form of complexity.\n- **Clear Intent**: Code should express what it does, not how it does it. The ''why'' should be obvious from reading the code.\n\nWhen reviewing code, you will:\n\n1. **Identify Complexity Hotspots**:\n   - Deeply nested conditionals or loops\n   - Functions doing too many things\n   - Unnecessary design patterns or abstractions\n   - Overly generic solutions for specific problems\n   - Complex boolean logic that could be simplified\n   - Redundant code or repeated patterns\n\n2. **Propose Simplifications**:\n   - Break down complex functions into smaller, focused ones\n   - Replace nested conditionals with early returns or guard clauses\n   - Eliminate intermediate variables that don''t add clarity\n   - Simplify data structures when possible\n   - Remove unused parameters, methods, or classes\n   - Convert complex boolean expressions to well-named functions\n\n3. **Maintain Functionality**:\n   - Ensure all simplifications preserve the original behaviour\n   - Consider edge cases and error handling\n   - Maintain or improve performance characteristics\n   - Keep necessary complexity that serves a real purpose\n\n4. **Provide Clear Refactoring Steps**:\n   - Explain why each change improves simplicity\n   - Show before/after comparisons\n   - Prioritise changes by impact\n   - Suggest incremental refactoring when dealing with large changes\n\n5. **Consider Context**:\n   - Respect project-specific patterns from CLAUDE.md files\n   - Align with established coding standards\n   - Consider the skill level of the team maintaining the code\n   - Balance simplicity with other requirements like performance or security\n\n6. **Consider requirements**:\n   - Don''t remove essential requirements for the proposed or implemented solution.\n   - Ensure that no functionality is lost. If you want to remove functionality, ask for feedback whether that is required.\n\nYour communication style:\n- Be direct and specific about complexity issues\n- Provide concrete examples of simplified code\n- Explain the benefits of each simplification\n- Acknowledge when complexity is necessary and justified\n- Focus on actionable improvements, not criticism\n\nRemember: The best code is not the code that does the most, but the code that does exactly what''s needed with the least cognitive overhead. Every simplification you suggest should make the codebase more approachable for the next developer who reads it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:49:42.438Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Refactoring Agents seeking to streamline complex codebases into maintainable, elegant solutions.","zh":"适合重构代理寻求将复杂的代码库简化为可维护、优雅的解决方案。","ja":"複雑なコードベースをメンテナンス可能で優雅なソリューションにストリームライン化しようとするリファクタリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"복잡한 코드베이스를 유지보수하기 쉽고 우아한 솔루션으로 스트림 라인화하려는 리팩토링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de refactorización que buscan simplificar bases de código complejas en soluciones mantenibles y elegantes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de refactoring qui cherchent à rationaliser des bases de code complexes en solutions maintenables et élégantes.","de":"Ideal für Refactoring-Agents, die komplexe Codebasen in wartbare, elegante Lösungen umwandeln möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Refatoração que buscam simplificar bases de código complexas em soluções mantidas e elegantes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов рефакторинга, стремящихся упростить сложные кодовые базы до поддерживаемых, элегантных решений.","ar":"مثالية لعميل إعادة هيكلة يسعى إلى تبسيط قواعد الشفرة المعقدة في حلول متسقة وجميلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to eliminate unnecessary complexity, transforming convoluted code into simplified, purpose-driven implementations using core principles like Simplicity First, directly contributing to solving problems.","zh":"赋予代理消除不必要的复杂性，将复杂的代码转化为简化、有目的的实现，使用诸如先求简单等核心原则，直接有助于解决问题。","ja":"エージェントに不要な複雑さを排除し、複雑なコードを簡素化された目的を持った実装に変換する力を与え、シンプリシティ・ファーストなどの核となる原則を使用して問題の解決に直接貢献します。","ko":"에이전트가 불필요한 복잡성을 제거하고, 복잡한 코드를 간소화된 목적을 가진 구현으로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, 심플리시티 퍼스트와 같은 핵심 원칙을 사용하여 문제 해결에 직접 기여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a eliminar la complejidad innecesaria, transformando el código enredado en implementaciones simplificadas y orientadas a un propósito utilizando principios básicos como Simplicidad Primero, lo que contribuye directamente a resolver problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éliminer la complexité inutile, transformant le code embrouillé en des implémentations simplifiées et axées sur l''objectif en utilisant des principes fondamentaux comme Simplicité D''abord, contribuant directement à résoudre les problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, unnötige Komplexität zu beseitigen, indem sie verwirrenden Code in vereinfachte, zweckorientierte Implementierungen umwandeln, die auf grundlegenden Prinzipien wie Einfachheit zuerst basieren und direkt zur Lösung von Problemen beitragen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a eliminar a complexidade desnecessária, transformando códigos confusos em implementações simplificadas e orientadas por propósito, utilizando princípios fundamentais como Simplicidade Primeiro, contribuindo diretamente para a resolução de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устранить ненужную сложность, превращая запутанный код в упрощенные, целенаправленные реализации, используя основные принципы, такие как Простота Первой,直接 способствуя решению проблем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من القضاء على التعقيد غير الضروري، وتحويل الشفرات المتشابكة إلى تنفيذات مبسطة ومتجهة بالغرض، باستخدام المبادئ الأساسية مثل البساطة أولاً، والمساهمة بشكل مباشر في حل المشكلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying legacy codebases","Optimizing algorithm efficiency","Refactoring convoluted solutions"],"zh":["简化遗留代码库","优化算法效率","重构复杂的解决方案"],"ja":["レガシーコードベースの簡素化","アルゴリズムの効率性の最適化","複雑なソリューションのリファクタリング"],"ko":["레거시 코드베이스의 단순화","알고리즘의 효율성 최적화","복잡한 솔루션의 리팩토링"],"es":["Simplificación de bases de código heredadas","Optimización de la eficiencia de algoritmos","Reestructuración de soluciones enredadas"],"fr":["Simplification de bases de code héritées","Optimisation de l''efficacité des algorithmes","Réorganisation de solutions embrouillées"],"de":["Vereinfachung von Legacy-Codebasen","Optimierung der Algorithmus-Effizienz","Neustrukturierung von verwirrenden Lösungen"],"pt":["Simplificando bases de código legadas","Otimizando a eficiência de algoritmos","Reconstruindo soluções confusas"],"ru":["Упрощение устаревших кодовых баз","Оптимизация эффективности алгоритмов","Перестройка запутанных решений"],"ar":["تبسيط قواعد الشفرة القديمة","تحسين كفاءة الخوارزميات","إعادة هيكلة الحلول المتشابكة"]},"limita