точек входа для умных контрактов","ar":"محلل نقاط الدخول للعقود الذكية","en":"entry-point-analyzer"},"description":{"zh":"Entry Point Analyzer 是一个系统地识别智能合约代码库中的所有状态更改入口点的工具，用于指导安全审计","ja":"Entry Point Analyzer は、スマートコントラクトのコードベース内のすべての状態変更エントリーポイントを体系的に識別するツールです","ko":"Entry Point Analyzer는 스마트 계약 코드베이스 내의 모든 상태 변경 엔트리 포인트를 체계적으로 식별하는 도구입니다","es":"El analizador de puntos de entrada identifica puntos de entrada que cambian el estado en el código de contratos inteligentes para guiar auditorías de seguridad","fr":"L''analyseur de points d''entrée identifie les points d''entrée qui modifient l''état dans le code de contrats intelligents pour guider les audits de sécurité","de":"Der Einstiegspunkte-Analyse identifiziert Einstiegspunkte, die den Zustand in Smart-Contract-Code ändern, um Sicherheitsaudits zu leiten","pt":"O Analisador de Pontos de Entrada identifica systematicamente todos os pontos de entrada que alteram o estado em um código de smart contract, orientando audi...","ru":"Анализатор точек входа систематически определяет все точки входа, которые изменяют состояние в коде умного контракта, руководя аудитами безопасности.","ar":"يحدد محلل نقاط الدخول بشكل منهجي جميع نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة في قاعدة بيانات العقد الذكي، وتوجيه عمليات التدقيق الأمني.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["识别所有状态更改入口点","指导安全审计","分析访问控制模式","识别特权操作和角色限制函数","构建函数修改合约状态的理解"],"ja":["すべての状態変更エントリーポイントを識別","セキュリティ監査を支援","アクセス制御パターンを分析","特権操作と役割制限関数を識別","関数がコントラクト状態を変更することを理解する"],"ko":["모든 상태 변경 엔트리 포인트 식별","보안 감사를 지원","액세스 제어 패턴 분석","특권 연산 및 역할 제한 함수 식별","함수가 계약 상태를 변경할 수 있음을 이해"],"es":["Identifica puntos de entrada que cambian el estado","Guía auditorías de seguridad","Analiza patrones de control de acceso","Identifica operaciones privilegiadas","Identifica funciones restringidas por roles"],"fr":["Identifie les points d''entrée qui modifient l''état","Guide les audits de sécurité","Analyse les modèles de contrôle d''accès","Identifie les opérations privilégiées","Identifie les fonctions restreintes par rôles"],"de":["Identifiziert Einstiegspunkte, die den Zustand ändern","Leitet Sicherheitsaudits","Analyisiert Zugriffskontrollmuster","Identifiziert privilegierte Operationen","Identifiziert rollenbeschränkte Funktionen"],"pt":["Identificação sistemática de pontos de entrada que alteram o estado","Orientação de auditorias de segurança","Análise de padrões de controle de acesso","Identificação de operações privilegiadas e funções restritas por papel","Construção de um entendimento de quais funções podem modificar o contrato"],"ru":["Систематическое определение точек входа, которые изменяют состояние","Руководство аудитами безопасности","Анализ шаблонов контроля доступа","Определение привилегированных операций и функций, ограниченных по роли","Формирование понимания того, какие функции могут изменять контракт"],"ar":["تحديد منهجي لنقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة","توجيه عمليات التدقيق الأمني","تحليل أنماط التحكم بالوصول","تحديد العمليات المميزة والدالات المقيدة بالدور","بناء فهم للوظائف التي يمكنها تعديل العقد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能合约安全审计","入口点分析","状态更改入口点","访问控制模式","特权操作","角色限制函数"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトセキュリティ監査","エントリーポイント分析","状態変更エントリーポイント","アクセス制御パターン","特権操作","役割制限関数"],"ko":["스마트 계약 보안 감사","엔트리 포인트 분석","상태 변경 엔트리 포인트","액세스 제어 패턴","특권 연산","역할 제한 함수"],"es":["análisis de puntos de entrada","seguridad de contratos inteligentes","auditorías de seguridad","control de acceso","operaciones privilegiadas","contratos inteligentes"],"fr":["analyse de points d''entrée","sécurité de contrats intelligents","audits de sécurité","contrôle d''accès","opérations privilégiées","contrats intelligents"],"de":["Einstiegspunkte-Analyse","Sicherheit von Smart Contracts","Sicherheitsaudits","Zugriffskontrolle","privilegierte Operationen","Smart Contracts"],"pt":["analisador de pontos de entrada","smart contracts","segurança","auditoria","controle de acesso","operações privilegiadas","desenvolvimento de blockchain"],"ru":["анализатор точек входа","умные контракты","безопасность","аудит","контроль доступа","привилегированные операции","разработка блокчейна"],"ar":["محلل نقاط الدخول","العقود الذكية","الأمن","التدقيق","التحكم بالوصول","العمليات المميزة","تطوير البلوكشين"]}},"owner":"amano--","repo":"call-center","repoPath":"amano--/call-center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"entry-point-analyzer","description":"Analyzes smart contract codebases to identify state-changing entry points for security auditing. Detects externally callable functions that modify state, categorizes them by access level (public, admin, role-restricted, contract-only), and generates structured audit reports. Excludes view/pure/read-only functions. Use when auditing smart contracts (Solidity, Vyper, Solana/Rust, Move, TON, CosmWasm) or when asked to find entry points, audit flows, external functions, access control patterns, or privileged operations.","bodyPreview":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract st","body":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract state\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo NOT use this skill for:\n- Vulnerability detection (use audit-context-building or domain-specific-audits)\n- Writing exploit POCs (use solidity-poc-builder)\n- Code quality or gas optimization analysis\n- Non-smart-contract codebases\n- Analyzing read-only functions (this skill excludes them)\n\n## Scope: State-Changing Functions Only\n\nThis skill focuses exclusively on functions that can modify state. **Excluded:**\n\n| Language | Excluded Patterns |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| Solidity | `view`, `pure` functions |\n| Vyper | `@view`, `@pure` functions |\n| Solana | Functions without `mut` account references |\n| Move | Non-entry `public fun` (module-callable only) |\n| TON | `get` methods (FunC), read-only receivers (Tact) |\n| CosmWasm | `query` entry point and its handlers |\n\n**Why exclude read-only functions?** They cannot directly cause loss of funds or state corruption. While they may leak information, the primary audit focus is on functions that can change state.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Detect Language** - Identify contract language(s) from file extensions and syntax\n2. **Use Tooling (if available)** - For Solidity, check if Slither is available and use it\n3. **Locate Contracts** - Find all contract/module files (apply directory filter if specified)\n4. **Extract Entry Points** - Parse each file for externally callable, state-changing functions\n5. **Classify Access** - Categorize each function by access level\n6. **Generate Report** - Output structured markdown report\n\n## Slither Integration (Solidity)\n\nFor Solidity codebases, Slither can automatically extract entry points. Before manual analysis:\n\n### 1. Check if Slither is Available\n\n```bash\nwhich slither\n```\n\n### 2. If Slither is Detected, Run Entry Points Printer\n\n```bash\nslither . --print entry-points\n```\n\nThis outputs a table of all state-changing entry points with:\n- Contract name\n- Function name\n- Visibility\n- Modifiers applied\n\n### 3. Use Slither Output as Foundation\n\n- Parse the Slither output table to populate your analysis\n- Cross-reference with manual inspection for access control classification\n- Slither may miss some patterns (callbacks, dynamic access control)—supplement with manual review\n- If Slither fails (compilation errors, unsupported features), fall back to manual analysis\n\n### 4. When Slither is NOT Available\n\nIf `which slither` returns nothing, proceed with manual analysis using the language-specific reference files.\n\n## Language Detection\n\n| Extension | Language | Reference |\n|-----------|----------|-----------|\n| `.sol` | Solidity | [{baseDir}/references/solidity.md]({baseDir}/references/solidity.md) |\n| `.vy` | Vyper | [{baseDir}/references/vyper.md]({baseDir}/references/vyper.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `solana-program` | Solana (Rust) | [{baseDir}/references/solana.md]({baseDir}/references/solana.md) |\n| `.move` | Move (Aptos/Sui) | [{baseDir}/references/move.md]({baseDir}/references/move.md) |\n| `.fc`, `.func`, `.tact` | TON (FunC/Tact) | [{baseDir}/references/ton.md]({baseDir}/references/ton.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `cosmwasm-std` | CosmWasm | [{baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md]({baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md) |\n\nLoad the appropriate reference file(s) based on detected language before analysis.\n\n## Access Classification\n\nClassify each state-changing entry point into one of these categories:\n\n### 1. Public (Unrestricted)\nFunctions callable by anyone without restrictions.\n\n### 2. Role-Restricted\nFunctions limited to specific roles. Common patterns to detect:\n- Explicit role names: `admin`, `owner`, `governance`, `guardian`, `operator`, `manager`, `minter`, `pauser`, `keeper`, `relayer`, `lender`, `borrower`\n- Role-checking patterns: `onlyRole`, `hasRole`, `require(msg.sender == X)`, `assert_owner`, `#[access_control]`\n- When role is ambiguous, flag as **\"Restricted (review required)\"** with the restriction pattern noted\n\n### 3. Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\nFunctions callable only by other contracts, not by EOAs. Indicators:\n- Callbacks: `onERC721Received`, `uniswapV3SwapCallback`, `flashLoanCallback`\n- Interface implementations with contract-caller checks\n- Functions that revert if `tx.origin == msg.sender`\n- Cross-contract hooks\n\n## Output Format\n\nGenerate a markdown report with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Entry Point Analysis: [Project Name]\n\n**Analyzed**: [timestamp]\n**Scope**: [directories analyzed or \"full codebase\"]\n**Languages**: [detected languages]\n**Focus**: State-changing functions only (view/pure excluded)\n\n## Summary\n\n| Category | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Public (Unrestricted) | X |\n| Role-Restricted | X |\n| Restricted (Review Required) | X |\n| Contract-Only | X |\n| **Total** | **X** |\n\n---\n\n## Public Entry Points (Unrestricted)\n\nState-changing functions callable by anyone—prioritize for attack surface analysis.\n\n| Function | File | Notes |\n|----------|------|-------|\n| `functionName(params)` | `path/to/file.sol:L42` | Brief note if relevant |\n\n---\n\n## Role-Restricted Entry Points\n\n### Admin / Owner\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| `setFee(uint256)` | `Config.sol:L15` | `onlyOwner` |\n\n### Governance\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Guardian / Pauser\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Other Roles\n| Function | File | Restriction | Role |\n|----------|------|-------------|------|\n\n---\n\n## Restricted (Review Required)\n\nFunctions with access control patterns that need manual verification.\n\n| Function | File | Pattern | Why Review |\n|----------|------|---------|------------|\n| `execute(bytes)` | `Executor.sol:L88` | `require(trusted[msg.sender])` | Dynamic trust list |\n\n---\n\n## Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\n\nFunctions only callable by other contracts—useful for understanding trust boundaries.\n\n| Function | File | Expected Caller |\n|----------|------|-----------------|\n| `onFlashLoan(...)` | `Vault.sol:L200` | Flash loan provider |\n\n---\n\n## Files Analyzed\n\n- `path/to/file1.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n- `path/to/file2.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n```\n\n## Filtering\n\nWhen user specifies a directory filter:\n- Only analyze files within that path\n- Note the filter in the report header\n- Example: \"Analyze only `src/core/`\" → scope = `src/core/`\n\n## Analysis Guidelines\n\n1. **Be thorough**: Don''t skip files. Every state-changing externally callable function matters.\n2. **Be conservative**: When uncertain about access level, flag for review rather than miscategorize.\n3. **Skip read-only**: Exclude `view`, `pure`, and equivalent read-only functions.\n4. **Note inheritance**: If a function''s access control comes from a parent contract, note this.\n5. **Track modifiers**: List all access-related modifiers/decorators applied to each function.\n6. **Identify patterns**: Look for common patterns like:\n   - Initializer functions (often unrestricted on first call)\n   - Upgrade functions (high-privilege)\n   - Emergency/pause functions (guardian-level)\n   - Fee/parameter setters (admin-level)\n   - Token transfers and approvals (often public)\n\n## Common Role Patterns by Protocol Type\n\n| Protocol Type | Common Roles |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| DEX | `owner`, `feeManager`, `pairCreator` |\n| Lending | `admin`, `guardian`, `liquidator`, `oracle` |\n| Governance | `proposer`, `executor`, `canceller`, `timelock` |\n| NFT | `minter`, `admin`, `royaltyReceiver` |\n| Bridge | `relayer`, `guardian`, `validator`, `operator` |\n| Vault/Yield | `strategist`, `keeper`, `harvester`, `manager` |\n\n## Rationalizations to Reject\n\nWhen analyzing entry points, reject these shortcuts:\n- \"This function looks standard\" → Still classify it; standard functions can have non-standard access control\n- \"The modifier name is clear\" → Verify the modifier''s actual implementation\n- \"This is obviously admin-only\" → Trace the actual restriction; \"obvious\" assumptions miss subtle bypasses\n- \"I''ll skip the callbacks\" → Callbacks define trust boundaries; always include them\n- \"It doesn''t modify much state\" → Any state change can be exploited; include all non-view functions\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf a file cannot be parsed:\n1. Note it in the report under \"Analysis Warnings\"\n2. Continue with remaining files\n3. Suggest manual review for unparsable files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:50:15.591Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Smart Contract Analysis Agents needing advanced entry point identification and security audit capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级入口点识别和安全审计能力的智能合约分析代理。","ja":"高度なエントリーポイント識別とセキュリティ監査機能を必要とするスマートコントラクト分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 엔트리 포인트 식별 및 보안 감사 기능이 필요한 스마트 계약 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Contratos Inteligentes que necesitan una identificación avanzada de puntos de entrada y capacidades de auditoría de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Contrats Intelligents ayant besoin d''une identification avancée des points d''entrée et de capacités d''audit de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für Smart-Contract-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Identifizierung von Einstiegspunkten und Sicherheitsauditfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Contrato Inteligente que necessitam de identificação avançada de pontos de entrada e capacidades de auditoria de segurança.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Умных Контрактов, требующих продвинутой идентификации точек входа и возможностей аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل العقد الذكي التي تحتاج إلى تحديد متقدم لنقاط الدخول وقدرات تدقيق الأمان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically identify state-changing entry points in smart contract codebases, guiding security audits with access control pattern analysis and privileged operation identification using contract flows and external function mapping.","zh":"使代理能够系统地识别智能合约代码库中的状态改变入口点，并使用合约流和外部函数映射来指导安全审计，包括访问控制模式分析和特权操作识别。","ja":"エージェントがスマートコントラクトのコードベース内の状態変更エントリーポイントを体系的に識別できるようにし、コントラクトフローと外部関数マッピングを使用してセキュリティ監査をガイドし、アクセス制御パターン分析および特権操作識別を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 스마트 계약 코드베이스 내의 상태 변경 엔트리 포인트를 체계적으로 식별할 수 있도록 하며, 계약 흐름 및 외부 함수 매핑을 사용하여 보안 감사를 안내하고, 접근 제어 패턴 분석 및 특권 작업 식별을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar sistemáticamente los puntos de entrada que cambian el estado en las bases de código de los contratos inteligentes, guiando las auditorías de seguridad con análisis de patrones de control de acceso e identificación de operaciones privilegiadas utilizando flujos de contrato y mapeo de funciones externas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier systématiquement les points d''entrée qui modifient l''état dans les bases de code de contrats intelligents, guidant les audits de sécurité avec l''analyse de modèles de contrôle d''accès et l''identification d''opérations privilégiées en utilisant les flux de contrat et la mise en correspondance de fonctions externes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, systematisch die Einstiegspunkte zu identifizieren, die den Zustand in den Codebasen von Smart-Verträgen ändern, und leitet Sicherheitsaudits mit Zugriffskontrollmusteranalyse und Identifizierung privilegierter Operationen unter Verwendung von Vertragsflüssen und externer Funktionszuordnung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar sistematicamente os pontos de entrada que alteram o estado nos repositórios de código de contrato inteligente, orientando auditorias de segurança com análise de padrões de controle de acesso e identificação de operações privilegiadas usando fluxos de contrato e mapeamento de funções externas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически определять точки входа, изменяющие состояние, в кодовых базах умных контрактов, руководя аудитами безопасности с помощью анализа шаблонов контроля доступа и выявления привилегированных операций с использованием потоков контрактов и внешней функциональной карты.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة في مخازن الشفرة للعقد الذكي بشكل منهجي، وتوجيه التدقيقات الأمنية بتحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول وتحديد العمليات المميزة باستخدام تدفقات العقد والخريطة الوظيفية الخارجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating smart contract security audit entry point mapping","Identifying role-restricted functions and access control patterns","Debugging contract state modifications through entry point analysis"],"zh":["自动化智能合约安全审计入口点映射","识别角色限制函数和访问控制模式","通过入口点分析调试合约状态修改"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのセキュリティ監査のエントリーポイントマッピングを自動化する","ロール制限関数とアクセス制御パターンを識別する","エントリーポイント分析を使用してコントラクト状態の変更をデバッグする"],"ko":["스마트 계약 보안 감사 엔트리 포인트 매핑 자동화","역할 제한 함수 및 접근 제어 패턴 식별","엔트리 포인트 분석을 통해 계약 상태 수정 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del mapeo de puntos de entrada de la auditoría de seguridad de los contratos inteligentes","Identificación de funciones con restricciones de rol y patrones de control de acceso","Depuración de modificaciones del estado del contrato a través del análisis de puntos de entrada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la mise en correspondance des points d''entrée de l''audit de sécurité des contrats intelligents","Identification des fonctions à restrictions de rôle et des modèles de contrôle d''accès","Débogage des modifications d''état du contrat via l''analyse des points d''entrée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Zuordnung von Einstiegspunkten für die Sicherheitsauditierung von Smart-Verträgen","Identifizierung von rollenbeschränkten Funktionen und Zugriffskontrollmustern","Fehlerbehebung bei Änderungen des Vertragszustands durch Analyse der Einstiegspunkte"],"pt":["Automatizar o mapeamento de pontos de entrada da auditoria de segurança do contrato inteligente","Identificar funções com restrições de papel e padrões de controle de acesso","Depurar modificações de estado do contrato por meio da análise de pontos de entrada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать картографирование точек входа аудита безопасности умного контракта","Определить функции с ограничениями ролей и шаблоны контроля доступа","Отладить изменения состояния контракта с помощью анализа точек входа"],"ar":["تحويل مسار مapeamento نقاط الدخول لتدقيق أمان العقد الذكي إلى أتمتيك","تحديد الوظائف المقيدة بدور والأنماط للتحكم في الوصول","تصحيح الأخطاء في تعديلات حالة العقد من خلال تحليل نقاط الدخول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires smart contract codebase access","Limited to state-changing entry points","Needs understanding of contract flows and external functions"],"zh":["需要智能合约代码库访问","仅限于状态改变入口点","需要理解合约流和外部函数"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのコードベースへのアクセスが必要","状態変更エントリーポイントのみに限定される","コントラクトフローと外部関数の理解が必要"],"ko":["스마트 계약 코드베이스 액세스가 필요함","상태 변경 엔트리 포인트에만 제한됨","계약 흐름 및 외부 함수에 대한 이해가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código del contrato inteligente","Limitado a puntos de entrada que cambian el estado","Necesita comprensión de los flujos de contrato y las funciones externas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la base de code du contrat intelligent","Limité aux points d''entrée qui modifient l''état","Nécessite une compréhension des flux de contrat et des fonctions externes"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Codebasis des Smart-Vertrags","Begrenzt auf Zustandsändernde Einstiegspunkte","Benötigt Verständnis der Vertragsflüsse und externen Funktionen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à base de código do contrato inteligente","Limitado a pontos de entrada que alteram o estado","Necessita de compreensão dos fluxos de contrato e funções externas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе умного контракта","Ограничен только точками входа, изменяющими состояние","Требует понимания потоков контрактов и внешних функций"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للعقد الذكي","محدود بنقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة","يحتاج إلى فهم تدفقات العقد والوظائف الخارجية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('amano--/call-center/ask-questions-if-underspecified', 'community', 'amano--', 'call-center', 'amano--/call-center', 'ask-questions-if-underspecified', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z', '2026-02-18T14:50:25.850Z', NULL, '{"id":"amano--/call-center/ask-questions-if-underspecified","name":"ask-questions-if-underspecified","description":{"zh":"当请求不明确时，使用此技能提出最少的澄清问题，避免错误的工作","ja":"リクエストが不明確な場合に、このスキルを使用して最小限の質問をして、間違った作業を避けます","ko":"요청이 불명확할 때 이 기능을 사용하여 최소한의 질문을 통해 잘못된 작업을 피합니다","es":"La habilidad de preguntar si está subespecificado ayuda a evitar errores en el desarrollo al solicitar aclaraciones cuando una solicitud es ambigua.","fr":"La compétence de poser des questions en cas de sous-spécification aide à éviter les erreurs de développement en demandant des éclaircissements lorsque une demande est ambiguë.","de":"Die Fähigkeit zum Stellen von Fragen bei unvollständiger Spezifikation hilft, Entwicklungsfehler zu vermeiden, indem bei mehrdeutigen Anfragen Klarstellungen angefordert werden.","pt":"A habilidade de perguntar se estiver subespecificado é usada em projetos de IA quando uma solicitação tem múltiplas interpretações plausíveis ou detalhes-chave são incertos.","ru":"Навык задавания вопросов при неоднозначности используется в проектах ИИ, когда запрос имеет несколько возможных интерпретаций или ключевые детали неясны.","ar":"تُستخدم مهارة askingQuestionsIfUnderspecified في مشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي عندما تكون هناك طلبات متعددة التأويل أو غير واضحة التفاصيل الرئيسية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"提问以澄清不明确的请求","ja":"不明確なリクエストを質問する","ko":"불명확한 요청에 대한 질문","es":"Preguntar si está subespecificado","fr":"Poser des questions en cas de sous-spécification","de":"Fragen stellen bei unvollständiger Spezifikation","pt":"Pergunte se estiver subespecificado - Desenvolvimento de IA","ru":"Задавайте вопросы при н