pe","Réduit le risque de malentendus"],"de":["Vermeidet Entwicklungsfehler","Fordert Klarstellungen an, wenn eine Anfrage mehrdeutig ist","Hilft, die Anforderungen des Projekts zu verstehen","Verbessert die Kommunikation zwischen den Teammitgliedern","Reduziert das Risiko von Missverständnissen"],"pt":["Evita erros de implementação","Garante interpretações precisas","Reduz riscos de desenvolvimento","Melhora a eficiência do projeto","Fornece clareza nas solicitações"],"ru":["Избегает ошибок реализации","Обеспечивает точные интерпретации","Снижает риски разработки","Улучшает эффективность проекта","Предоставляет ясность в запросах"],"ar":["تجنب الأخطاء في التنفيذ","يكفل تفسيرات دقيقة","يقلل من مخاطر التطوير","يحسن كفاءة المشروع","يوفر وضوحا في الطلبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["提问以澄清不明确的请求","不明确的请求","澄清问题","避免错误的工作","工作效率","错误率","开发技能","软件开发"],"ja":["不明確なリクエストを質問する","不明確なリクエスト","質問を提案","間違った作業を避ける","作業効率","エラーレート","開発スキル","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["불명확한 요청에 대한 질문","불명확한 요청","질문 제안","잘못된 작업을 피함","작업 효율성","오류율","개발 스킬","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["preguntar si está subespecificado","desarrollo de software","evitar errores","solicitar aclaraciones","comunicación en equipo","requisitos del proyecto","malentendidos"],"fr":["poser des questions en cas de sous-spécification","développement de logiciels","éviter les erreurs","demander des éclaircissements","communication en équipe","exigences du projet","malentendus"],"de":["Fragen stellen bei unvollständiger Spezifikation","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungsfehler vermeiden","Klarstellungen anfordern","Teamkommunikation","Projektanforderungen","Missverständnisse"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia","habilidade de ia","perguntar se estiver subespecificado","projetos de ia","implementação de ia","desenvolvimento de software","ia e machine learning"],"ru":["разработка ии","навык ии","задавание вопросов при неоднозначности","проекты ии","реализация ии","разработка программного обеспечения","ии и машинное обучение"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","مهارة الذكاء الاصطناعي","طرح الأسئلة في caso غير محدد","مشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي والتعلم الآلي"]}},"owner":"amano--","repo":"call-center","repoPath":"amano--/call-center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ask-questions-if-underspecified","description":"Clarify requirements before implementing. Use when serious doubts araise.","bodyPreview":"# Ask Questions If Underspecified\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when a request has multiple plausible interpretations or key details (objective, scope, constraints, environment, or safety) are unclear.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo not use this skill when the request is already clear, or when a quick, low-risk discovery read can answer the missing details.\n\n## Goal\n\nAsk the minimum set of clarifying questions needed to avoid wrong work; do not start implementing until the must-have questions are ans","body":"# Ask Questions If Underspecified\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when a request has multiple plausible interpretations or key details (objective, scope, constraints, environment, or safety) are unclear.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo not use this skill when the request is already clear, or when a quick, low-risk discovery read can answer the missing details.\n\n## Goal\n\nAsk the minimum set of clarifying questions needed to avoid wrong work; do not start implementing until the must-have questions are answered (or the user explicitly approves proceeding with stated assumptions).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Decide whether the request is underspecified\n\nTreat a request as underspecified if after exploring how to perform the work, some or all of the following are not clear:\n- Define the objective (what should change vs stay the same)\n- Define \"done\" (acceptance criteria, examples, edge cases)\n- Define scope (which files/components/users are in/out)\n- Define constraints (compatibility, performance, style, deps, time)\n- Identify environment (language/runtime versions, OS, build/test runner)\n- Clarify safety/reversibility (data migration, rollout/rollback, risk)\n\nIf multiple plausible interpretations exist, assume it is underspecified.\n\n### 2) Ask must-have questions first (keep it small)\n\nAsk 1-5 questions in the first pass. Prefer questions that eliminate whole branches of work.\n\nMake questions easy to answer:\n- Optimize for scannability (short, numbered questions; avoid paragraphs)\n- Offer multiple-choice options when possible\n- Suggest reasonable defaults when appropriate (mark them clearly as the default/recommended choice; bold the recommended choice in the list, or if you present options in a code block, put a bold \"Recommended\" line immediately above the block and also tag defaults inside the block)\n- Include a fast-path response (e.g., reply `defaults` to accept all recommended/default choices)\n- Include a low-friction \"not sure\" option when helpful (e.g., \"Not sure - use default\")\n- Separate \"Need to know\" from \"Nice to know\" if that reduces friction\n- Structure options so the user can respond with compact decisions (e.g., `1b 2a 3c`); restate the chosen options in plain language to confirm\n\n### 3) Pause before acting\n\nUntil must-have answers arrive:\n- Do not run commands, edit files, or produce a detailed plan that depends on unknowns\n- Do perform a clearly labeled, low-risk discovery step only if it does not commit you to a direction (e.g., inspect repo structure, read relevant config files)\n\nIf the user explicitly asks you to proceed without answers:\n- State your assumptions as a short numbered list\n- Ask for confirmation; proceed only after they confirm or correct them\n\n### 4) Confirm interpretation, then proceed\n\nOnce you have answers, restate the requirements in 1-3 sentences (including key constraints and what success looks like), then start work.\n\n## Question templates\n\n- \"Before I start, I need: (1) ..., (2) ..., (3) .... If you don''t care about (2), I will assume ....\"\n- \"Which of these should it be? A) ... B) ... C) ... (pick one)\"\n- \"What would you consider ''done''? For example: ...\"\n- \"Any constraints I must follow (versions, performance, style, deps)? If none, I will target the existing project defaults.\"\n- Use numbered questions with lettered options and a clear reply format\n\n```text\n1) Scope?\na) Minimal change (default)\nb) Refactor while touching the area\nc) Not sure - use default\n2) Compatibility target?\na) Current project defaults (default)\nb) Also support older versions: <specify>\nc) Not sure - use default\n\nReply with: defaults (or 1a 2a)\n```\n\n## Anti-patterns\n\n- Don''t ask questions you can answer with a quick, low-risk discovery read (e.g., configs, existing patterns, docs).\n- Don''t ask open-ended questions if a tight multiple-choice or yes/no would eliminate ambiguity faster.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:50:25.850Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for autonomous coding agents like AutoGPT and Claude Code that must navigate ambiguous user requirements without human intervention.","zh":"对于像 AutoGPT 和 Claude Code 这样的自治编码代理至关重要，必须在没有人工干预的情况下导航模糊的用户需求。","ja":"AutoGPTやClaude Codeのような自律的なコーディングエージェントにとって不可欠であり、人間の介入なしに曖昧なユーザーの要件をナビゲートする必要がある。","ko":"AutoGPT와 Claude Code 같은 자율 코딩 에이전트에게 필수적이며, 인간의 개입 없이 모호한 사용자 요구사항을 탐색해야 한다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de codificación autónomos como AutoGPT y Claude Code que deben navegar por requisitos de usuario ambiguos sin intervención humana.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de codage autonomes comme AutoGPT et Claude Code qui doivent naviguer dans les exigences utilisateur ambiguës sans intervention humaine.","de":"Wesentlich für autarke Codierungsagenten wie AutoGPT und Claude Code, die unscharfe Benutzeranforderungen ohne menschliche Intervention navigieren müssen.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de codificação autônoma, como AutoGPT e Claude Code, que devem navegar em requisitos de usuário ambíguos sem intervenção humana.","ru":"Необходим для автономных агентов кодирования, таких как AutoGPT и Claude Code, которые должны ориентироваться в неоднозначных требованиях пользователя без вмешательства человека.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء المستقلين في الترميز مثل AutoGPT و Claude Code الذين يجب أن يتحركوا في متطلبات المستخدم الغامضة دون تدخل بشري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Prevents wasted cycles on incorrect implementations by proactively identifying underspecified objectives, scope constraints, and safety requirements before execution. Enables agents to maintain autonomy while minimizing rework through targeted clarification protocols.","zh":"通过在执行之前主动识别不明确定义的目标、范围约束和安全要求，防止在不正确的实现上浪费循环。使代理能够在保持自主性的同时，通过有针对性的澄清协议最小化返工。","ja":"実行前に明確に定義されていない目的、範囲の制約、および安全性の要件を積極的に識別することで、不正確な実装でのサイクルの浪費を防止します。エージェントが自律性を維持しながら、ターゲットを絞った明確化プロトコルを介して再作業を最小限に抑えることを可能にします。","ko":"실행 전 미지정된 목표, 범위 제약 및 안전 요구 사항을 적극적으로 식별하여 잘못된 구현에 대한 사이클 낭비를 방지한다. 에이전트가 자율성을 유지하면서 목표를 명확화하는 프로토콜을 통해 재작업을 최소화하는 것을 가능하게 한다.","es":"Evita ciclos desperdiciados en implementaciones incorrectas al identificar proactivamente objetivos poco especificados, restricciones de alcance y requisitos de seguridad antes de la ejecución. Permite a los agentes mantener la autonomía mientras minimizan la reprogramación a través de protocolos de aclaración dirigidos.","fr":"Évite les cycles gaspillés sur des mises en œuvre incorrectes en identifiant proactivement les objectifs mal spécifiés, les contraintes de portée et les exigences de sécurité avant l''exécution. Permet aux agents de maintenir l''autonomie tout en minimisant les reprises grâce à des protocoles de clarification ciblés.","de":"Verhindert verschwendete Zyklen bei fehlerhaften Implementierungen, indem sie vor der Ausführung proaktiv unklare Ziele, Umfangsbeschränkungen und Sicherheitsanforderungen identifiziert. Ermöglicht es Agenten, Autonomie beizubehalten, während sie durch gezielte Klärungsprotokolle Nacharbeiten minimieren.","pt":"Evita ciclos perdidos em implementações incorretas, identificando proativamente objetivos subespecificados, restrições de escopo e requisitos de segurança antes da execução. Permite que os agentes mantenham a autonomia, minimizando a retrabalho por meio de protocolos de esclarecimento direcionados.","ru":"Предотвращает потери циклов на неправильных реализациях, проактивно выявляя неоднозначные цели, ограничения области и требования безопасности до выполнения. Позволяет агентам сохранять автономию, минимизируя переделку через нацеленные протоколы разъяснения.","ar":"تمنع دورات باطلة على التنفيذات الخاطئة عن طريق تحديد الأهداف غير محددة بوضوح والمحددات المتعلقة بنطاق العمل ومتطلبات السلامة قبل التنفيذ. تمكن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على الاستقلالية مع التقليل من إعادة العمل من خلال بروتوكولات توضيح مستهدفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Resolving ambiguous API integration parameters","Clarifying safety constraints for code generation tasks","Defining scope boundaries for complex multi-step operations","Identifying missing environment variables for deployment workflows"],"zh":["解决模糊的 API 集成参数","为代码生成任务澄清安全约束","为复杂的多步骤操作定义范围边界","为部署工作流识别缺失的环境变量"],"ja":["曖昧なAPI統合パラメータを解決する","コード生成タスクの安全性の制約を明確にする","複雑なマルチステップ操作の範囲の境界を定義する","デプロイメントワークフローに欠けている環境変数を識別する"],"ko":["모호한 API 통합 매개 변수 해결","코드 생성 작업의 안전성 제약 명확화","복잡한 다단계 작업의 범위 경계 정의","배포 워크플로우에缺失 환경 변수 식별"],"es":["Resolver parámetros de integración de API ambiguos","Aclarar restricciones de seguridad para tareas de generación de código","Definir límites de alcance para operaciones complejas de varios pasos","Identificar variables de entorno que faltan para flujos de trabajo de implementación"],"fr":["Résoudre les paramètres d''intégration d''API ambigus","Clarifier les contraintes de sécurité pour les tâches de génération de code","Définir les limites de portée pour les opérations complexes multi-étapes","Identifier les variables d''environnement manquantes pour les flux de travail de déploiement"],"de":["Auflösen von mehrdeutigen API-Integrationsparametern","Klärung von Sicherheitseinschränkungen für Codegenerierungsaufgaben","Festlegung von Umfangsgrenzen für komplexe Mehrschrittoperationen","Identifizierung fehlender Umgebungsvariablen für Bereitstellungsworkflows"],"pt":["Resolução de parâmetros de integração de API ambíguos","Esclarecimento de restrições de segurança para tarefas de geração de código","Definição de limites de escopo para operações complexas de múltiplos passos","Identificação de variáveis de ambiente ausentes para fluxos de trabalho de implantação"],"ru":["Решение неоднозначных параметров интеграции API","Уточнение ограничений безопасности для задач генерации кода","Определение границ области для сложных многоступенчатых операций","Определение отсутствующих переменных среды для рабочих процессов развертывания"],"ar":["حل معلمات التكامل الغامضة لبروتوكول API","توضيح قيود السلامة لمهام توليد الشفرة","تحديد حدود النطاق للعمليات المعقدة متعددة المراحل","تحديد متغيرات البيئة المفقودة لتدفقات العمل للتثبيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear communication channel for question-answering","Ineffective when quick discovery reads can resolve ambiguity","Adds latency for time-sensitive operations"],"zh":["需要清晰的通信渠道用于问题回答","快速发现读取可以解决模糊性的情况下无效","为时间敏感的操作添加延迟"],"ja":["質問回答に明確なコミュニケーションチャネルが必要","曖昧性を迅速に解消できる場合には効果がない","時間に敏感な操作に遅延を加える"],"ko":["질문 응답을 위한 명확한 통신 채널 필요","빠른 발견 읽기가 모호성을 해결할 수 있는 경우에는 효과가 없음","시간에 민감한 작업에 대기 시간 추가"],"es":["Requiere un canal de comunicación claro para la respuesta a preguntas","Es ineficaz cuando la lectura rápida de descubrimiento puede resolver la ambigüedad","Agrega latencia para operaciones sensibles al tiempo"],"fr":["Nécessite un canal de communication clair pour la réponse aux questions","Est inefficace lorsqu''une lecture rapide de découverte peut résoudre l''ambiguïté","Ajoute de la latence pour les opérations sensibles au temps"],"de":["Benötigt einen klaren Kommunikationskanal für die Beantwortung von Fragen","Ist unwirksam, wenn schnelles Entdecken die Mehrdeutigkeit auflösen kann","Fügt Latenz für zeitkritische Operationen hinzu"],"pt":["Exige um canal de comunicação claro para questionamento e resposta","Ineficaz quando a leitura rápida de descoberta pode resolver a ambiguidade","Adiciona latência para operações sensíveis ao tempo"],"ru":["Требует четкого канала связи для вопросов и ответов","Неэффективен, когда быстрое чтение открытия может решить неоднозначность","Добавляет задержку для операций, чувствительных к времени"],"ar":["يتطلب قناة اتصال واضحة للاستفهام والإجابة","غير فعال عندما يمكن قراءة اكتشاف سريعة حل الغموض","يضيف تأخيرًا للعمليات الحساسة للزمن"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
