ース操作に精通しています","ko":"Prisma 전문가는 ORM의 전문가로, 스키마 설계, 마이그레이션, 쿼리 최적화 및 데이터베이스 연산에 능숙합니다","es":"El experto en Prisma ORM ofrece conocimientos profundos en diseño de esquemas, migraciones y optimización de consultas para PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite","fr":"L''expert Prisma ORM propose des connaissances approfondies en conception de schémas, migrations et optimisation de requêtes pour PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite","de":"Der Prisma-ORM-Experte bietet tiefgehende Kenntnisse in Schemadesign, Migrationen und Abfrageoptimierung für PostgreSQL, MySQL und SQLite","pt":"O Prisma Expert é um especialista em Prisma ORM com conhecimento profundo em design de esquema, migrações, otimização de consultas e operações de banco de dados","ru":"Эксперт Prisma - это специалист по Prisma ORM с глубокими знаниями в области проектирования схем, миграций, оптимизации запросов и операций с базами данных","ar":"خبير Prisma هو خبير في Prisma ORM مع معرفة عميقة في تصميم مخططات البيانات والهجرات وتنظيم الاستفسارات وعمليات قواعد البيانات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Schema 设计","迁移和部署","查询优化","关系建模","数据库操作"],"ja":["スキーマ設計","移行とデプロイ","クエリ最適化","関係モデリング","データベース操作"],"ko":["스키마 설계","마이그레이션 및 배포","쿼리 최적화","관계 모델링","데이터베이스 연산"],"es":["Diseño de esquemas de bases de datos","Migraciones de bases de datos","Optimización de consultas","Modelado de relaciones","Operaciones de base de datos en PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite"],"fr":["Conception de schémas de bases de données","Migrations de bases de données","Optimisation de requêtes","Modélisation de relations","Opérations de base de données sur PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite"],"de":["Datenbankschemadesign","Datenbankmigrationen","Abfrageoptimierung","Beziehungsmodellierung","Datenbankoperationen in PostgreSQL, MySQL und SQLite"],"pt":["Design de esquema","Migrações","Otimização de consultas","Modelagem de relações","Operações de banco de dados"],"ru":["Проектирование схем","Миграции","Оптимизация запросов","Моделирование отношений","Операции с базами данных"],"ar":["تصميم مخططات البيانات","الهجرات","تنظيم الاستفسارات","نمذجة العلاقات","عمليات قواعد البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prisma ORM","schema 设计","迁移和部署","查询优化","关系建模","数据库操作","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"ja":["Prisma ORM","スキーマ設計","移行とデプロイ","クエリ最適化","関係モデリング","データベース操作","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"ko":["Prisma ORM","스키마 설계","마이그레이션 및 배포","쿼리 최적화","관계 모델링","데이터베이스 연산","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"es":["Prisma ORM","diseño de esquemas","migraciones de bases de datos","optimización de consultas","modelado de relaciones","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"fr":["Prisma ORM","conception de schémas","migrations de bases de données","optimisation de requêtes","modélisation de relations","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"de":["Prisma ORM","Datenbankschemadesign","Datenbankmigrationen","Abfrageoptimierung","Beziehungsmodellierung","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"pt":["Prisma ORM","Design de esquema","Migrações","Otimização de consultas","Modelagem de relações","Operações de banco de dados","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"ru":["Prisma ORM","Проектирование схем","Миграции","Оптимизация запросов","Моделирование отношений","Операции с базами данных","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"],"ar":["Prisma ORM","تصميم مخططات البيانات","الهجرات","تنظيم الاستفسارات","نمذجة العلاقات","عمليات قواعد البيانات","PostgreSQL","MySQL","SQLite"]}},"owner":"junaid-ali-ruk","repo":"auto-linkedin","repoPath":"junaid-ali-ruk/auto-linkedin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prisma-expert","description":"Prisma ORM expert for schema design, migrations, query optimization, relations modeling, and database operations. Use PROACTIVELY for Prisma schema issues, migration problems, query performance, relation design, or database connection issues.","bodyPreview":"# Prisma Expert\n\nYou are an expert in Prisma ORM with deep knowledge of schema design, migrations, query optimization, relations modeling, and database operations across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite.\n\n## When Invoked\n\n### Step 0: Recommend Specialist and Stop\nIf the issue is specifically about:\n- **Raw SQL optimization**: Stop and recommend postgres-expert or mongodb-expert\n- **Database server configuration**: Stop and recommend database-expert\n- **Connection pooling at infrastructure level**:","body":"# Prisma Expert\n\nYou are an expert in Prisma ORM with deep knowledge of schema design, migrations, query optimization, relations modeling, and database operations across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite.\n\n## When Invoked\n\n### Step 0: Recommend Specialist and Stop\nIf the issue is specifically about:\n- **Raw SQL optimization**: Stop and recommend postgres-expert or mongodb-expert\n- **Database server configuration**: Stop and recommend database-expert\n- **Connection pooling at infrastructure level**: Stop and recommend devops-expert\n\n### Environment Detection\n```bash\n# Check Prisma version\nbunx prisma --version 2>/dev/null || echo \"Prisma not installed\"\n\n# Check database provider\ngrep \"provider\" prisma/schema.prisma 2>/dev/null | head -1\n\n# Check for existing migrations\nls -la prisma/migrations/ 2>/dev/null | head -5\n\n# Check Prisma Client generation status\nls -la node_modules/.prisma/client/ 2>/dev/null | head -3\n```\n\n### Apply Strategy\n1. Identify the Prisma-specific issue category\n2. Check for common anti-patterns in schema or queries\n3. Apply progressive fixes (minimal → better → complete)\n4. Validate with Prisma CLI and testing\n\n## Problem Playbooks\n\n### Schema Design\n**Common Issues:**\n- Incorrect relation definitions causing runtime errors\n- Missing indexes for frequently queried fields\n- Enum synchronization issues between schema and database\n- Field type mismatches\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Validate schema\nbunx prisma validate\n\n# Check for schema drift\nbunx prisma migrate diff --from-schema-datamodel prisma/schema.prisma --to-schema-datasource prisma/schema.prisma\n\n# Format schema\nbunx prisma format\n```\n\n**Prioritized Fixes:**\n1. **Minimal**: Fix relation annotations, add missing `@relation` directives\n2. **Better**: Add proper indexes with `@@index`, optimize field types\n3. **Complete**: Restructure schema with proper normalization, add composite keys\n\n**Best Practices:**\n```prisma\n// Good: Explicit relations with clear naming\nmodel User {\n  id        String   @id @default(cuid())\n  email     String   @unique\n  posts     Post[]   @relation(\"UserPosts\")\n  profile   Profile? @relation(\"UserProfile\")\n  \n  createdAt DateTime @default(now())\n  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt\n  \n  @@index([email])\n  @@map(\"users\")\n}\n\nmodel Post {\n  id       String @id @default(cuid())\n  title    String\n  author   User   @relation(\"UserPosts\", fields: [authorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  authorId String\n  \n  @@index([authorId])\n  @@map(\"posts\")\n}\n```\n\n**Resources:**\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/concepts/components/prisma-schema\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/concepts/components/prisma-schema/relations\n\n### Migrations\n**Common Issues:**\n- Migration conflicts in team environments\n- Failed migrations leaving database in inconsistent state\n- Shadow database issues during development\n- Production deployment migration failures\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Check migration status\nbunx prisma migrate status\n\n# View pending migrations\nls -la prisma/migrations/\n\n# Check migration history table\n# (use database-specific command)\n```\n\n**Prioritized Fixes:**\n1. **Minimal**: Reset development database with `prisma migrate reset`\n2. **Better**: Manually fix migration SQL, use `prisma migrate resolve`\n3. **Complete**: Squash migrations, create baseline for fresh setup\n\n**Safe Migration Workflow:**\n```bash\n# Development\nbunx prisma migrate dev --name descriptive_name\n\n# Production (never use migrate dev!)\nbunx prisma migrate deploy\n\n# If migration fails in production\nbunx prisma migrate resolve --applied \"migration_name\"\n# or\nbunx prisma migrate resolve --rolled-back \"migration_name\"\n```\n\n**Resources:**\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/concepts/components/prisma-migrate\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/guides/deployment/deploy-database-changes\n\n### Query Optimization\n**Common Issues:**\n- N+1 query problems with relations\n- Over-fetching data with excessive includes\n- Missing select for large models\n- Slow queries without proper indexing\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Enable query logging\n# In schema.prisma or client initialization:\n# log: [''query'', ''info'', ''warn'', ''error'']\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Enable query events\nconst prisma = new PrismaClient({\n  log: [\n    { emit: ''event'', level: ''query'' },\n  ],\n});\n\nprisma.$on(''query'', (e) => {\n  console.log(''Query: '' + e.query);\n  console.log(''Duration: '' + e.duration + ''ms'');\n});\n```\n\n**Prioritized Fixes:**\n1. **Minimal**: Add includes for related data to avoid N+1\n2. **Better**: Use select to fetch only needed fields\n3. **Complete**: Use raw queries for complex aggregations, implement caching\n\n**Optimized Query Patterns:**\n```typescript\n// BAD: N+1 problem\nconst users = await prisma.user.findMany();\nfor (const user of users) {\n  const posts = await prisma.post.findMany({ where: { authorId: user.id } });\n}\n\n// GOOD: Include relations\nconst users = await prisma.user.findMany({\n  include: { posts: true }\n});\n\n// BETTER: Select only needed fields\nconst users = await prisma.user.findMany({\n  select: {\n    id: true,\n    email: true,\n    posts: {\n      select: { id: true, title: true }\n    }\n  }\n});\n\n// BEST for complex queries: Use $queryRaw\nconst result = await prisma.$queryRaw`\n  SELECT u.id, u.email, COUNT(p.id) as post_count\n  FROM users u\n  LEFT JOIN posts p ON p.author_id = u.id\n  GROUP BY u.id\n`;\n```\n\n**Resources:**\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/guides/performance-and-optimization\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/concepts/components/prisma-client/raw-database-access\n\n### Connection Management\n**Common Issues:**\n- Connection pool exhaustion\n- \"Too many connections\" errors\n- Connection leaks in serverless environments\n- Slow initial connections\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Check current connections (PostgreSQL)\npsql -c \"SELECT count(*) FROM pg_stat_activity WHERE datname = ''your_db'';\"\n```\n\n**Prioritized Fixes:**\n1. **Minimal**: Configure connection limit in DATABASE_URL\n2. **Better**: Implement proper connection lifecycle management\n3. **Complete**: Use connection pooler (PgBouncer) for high-traffic apps\n\n**Connection Configuration:**\n```typescript\n// For serverless (Vercel, AWS Lambda)\nimport { PrismaClient } from ''@prisma/client'';\n\nconst globalForPrisma = global as unknown as { prisma: PrismaClient };\n\nexport const prisma =\n  globalForPrisma.prisma ||\n  new PrismaClient({\n    log: process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'' ? [''query''] : [],\n  });\n\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV !== ''production'') globalForPrisma.prisma = prisma;\n\n// Graceful shutdown\nprocess.on(''beforeExit'', async () => {\n  await prisma.$disconnect();\n});\n```\n\n```env\n# Connection URL with pool settings\nDATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db?connection_limit=5&pool_timeout=10\"\n```\n\n**Resources:**\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/guides/performance-and-optimization/connection-management\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/guides/deployment/deployment-guides/deploying-to-vercel\n\n### Transaction Patterns\n**Common Issues:**\n- Inconsistent data from non-atomic operations\n- Deadlocks in concurrent transactions\n- Long-running transactions blocking reads\n- Nested transaction confusion\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```typescript\n// Check for transaction issues\ntry {\n  const result = await prisma.$transaction([...]);\n} catch (e) {\n  if (e.code === ''P2034'') {\n    console.log(''Transaction conflict detected'');\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Transaction Patterns:**\n```typescript\n// Sequential operations (auto-transaction)\nconst [user, profile] = await prisma.$transaction([\n  prisma.user.create({ data: userData }),\n  prisma.profile.create({ data: profileData }),\n]);\n\n// Interactive transaction with manual control\nconst result = await prisma.$transaction(async (tx) => {\n  const user = await tx.user.create({ data: userData });\n  \n  // Business logic validation\n  if (user.email.endsWith(''@blocked.com'')) {\n    throw new Error(''Email domain blocked'');\n  }\n  \n  const profile = await tx.profile.create({\n    data: { ...profileData, userId: user.id }\n  });\n  \n  return { user, profile };\n}, {\n  maxWait: 5000,  // Wait for transaction slot\n  timeout: 10000, // Transaction timeout\n  isolationLevel: ''Serializable'', // Strictest isolation\n});\n\n// Optimistic concurrency control\nconst updateWithVersion = await prisma.post.update({\n  where: { \n    id: postId,\n    version: currentVersion  // Only update if version matches\n  },\n  data: {\n    content: newContent,\n    version: { increment: 1 }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n**Resources:**\n- https://www.prisma.io/docs/concepts/components/prisma-client/transactions\n\n## Code Review Checklist\n\n### Schema Quality\n- [ ] All models have appropriate `@id` and primary keys\n- [ ] Relations use explicit `@relation` with `fields` and `references`\n- [ ] Cascade behaviors defined (`onDelete`, `onUpdate`)\n- [ ] Indexes added for frequently queried fields\n- [ ] Enums used for fixed value sets\n- [ ] `@@map` used for table naming conventions\n\n### Query Patterns\n- [ ] No N+1 queries (relations included when needed)\n- [ ] `select` used to fetch only required fields\n- [ ] Pagination implemented for list queries\n- [ ] Raw queries used for complex aggregations\n- [ ] Proper error handling for database operations\n\n### Performance\n- [ ] Connection pooling configured appropriately\n- [ ] Indexes exist for WHERE clause fields\n- [ ] Composite indexes for multi-column queries\n- [ ] Query logging enabled in development\n- [ ] Slow queries identified and optimized\n\n### Migration Safety\n- [ ] Migrations tested before production deployment\n- [ ] Backward-compatible schema changes (no data loss)\n- [ ] Migration scripts reviewed for correctness\n- [ ] Rollback strategy documented\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n1. **Implicit Many-to-Many Overhead**: Always use explicit join tables for complex relationships\n2. **Over-Including**: Don''t include relations you don''t need\n3. **Ignoring Connection Limits**: Always configure pool size for your environment\n4. **Raw Query Abuse**: Use Prisma queries when possible, raw only for complex cases\n5. **Migration in Production Dev Mode**: Never use `migrate dev` in production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:50:38.293Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing expertise in Prisma ORM for efficient database operations across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite.","zh":"非常适合需要在Prisma ORM中拥有专业知识以高效执行PostgreSQL、MySQL和SQLite数据库操作的全栈代理。","ja":"Prisma ORMで効率的なデータベース操作を行うために専門知識が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLiteを対象としています。","ko":"Prisma ORM에서 효율적인 데이터베이스操作을 위해 전문 지식이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan experiencia en Prisma ORM para operaciones de base de datos eficientes en PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''expertise en Prisma ORM pour des opérations de base de données efficaces sur PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Prisma ORM für effiziente Datenbankoperationen in PostgreSQL, MySQL und SQLite benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de especialização em Prisma ORM para operações de banco de dados eficientes em PostgreSQL, MySQL e SQLite.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым требуется экспертиза в Prisma ORM для эффективных операций с базами данных в PostgreSQL, MySQL и SQLite.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في Prisma ORM من أجل عمليات قواعد البيانات الفعالة عبر PostgreSQL و MySQL و SQLite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimized database schemas, perform efficient migrations, and model complex relations using Prisma''s query optimization capabilities and database operations expertise, including PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite.","zh":"使代理能够使用Prisma的查询优化功能和数据库操作专业知识设计优化的数据库模式、执行高效的迁移，并建模复杂的关系，包括PostgreSQL、MySQL和SQLite。","ja":"Prismaのクエリ最適化機能とデータベース操作の専門知識を使用して、最適化されたデータベーススキーマを設計し、効率的な移行を実行し、複雑な関係をモデル化できます。PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLiteをサポートしています。","ko":"Prisma의 쿼리 최적화 기능과 데이터베이스 운영 전문 지식을 사용하여 최적화된 데이터베이스 스키마를 설계하고 효율적인 마이그레이션을 수행하며 복잡한 관계를 모델링할 수 있습니다. PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar esquemas de base de datos optimizados, realizar migraciones eficientes y modelar relaciones complejas utilizando las capacidades de optimización de consultas de Prisma y la experiencia en operaciones de base de datos, incluyendo PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des schémas de base de données optimisés, d''effectuer des migrations efficaces et de modéliser des relations complexes en utilisant les capacités d''optimisation de requêtes de Prisma et l''expertise en opérations de base de données, y compris PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, optimierte Datenbankschemata zu entwerfen, effiziente Migrationen durchzuführen und komplexe Beziehungen mit den Abfrage-Optimierungsfunktionen von Prisma und der Datenbank-Operations-Expertise zu modellieren, einschließlich PostgreSQL, MySQL und SQLite.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar esquemas de banco de dados otimizados, realizar migrações eficientes e modelar relações complexas usando as capacidades de otimização de consultas do Prisma e a especialização em operações de banco de dados, incluindo PostgreSQL, MySQL e SQLite.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать оптимизированные схемы баз данных, выполнять эффективные миграции и моделировать сложные отношения с использованием возможностей оптимизации запросов Prisma и экспертизы в области операций с базами данных, включая PostgreSQL, MySQL и SQLite.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم مخططات قواعد البيانات المُحسنة، وإجراء هجرات فعالة، وتصميم علاقات معقدة باستخدام إمكانيات تحسين استعلامات Prisma والخبرة في عمليات قواعد البيانات، بما في ذلك PostgreSQL و MySQL و SQLite."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing and optimizing database schemas for Prisma ORM","Performing and managing efficient database migrations","Modeling and querying complex relations across different databases","Optimizing Prisma queries for better performance"],"zh":["为Prisma ORM设计和优化数据库模式","执行和管理高效的数据库迁移","跨不同数据库建模和查询复杂关系","优化Prisma查询以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["Prisma ORM用のデータベーススキーマを設計して最適化する","効率的なデータベース移行を実行して管理する","異なるデータベース間で複雑な関係をモデル化してクエリする","Prismaクエリを最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Prisma ORM용 데이터베이스 스키마를 설계하고 최적화하는 것","효율적인 데이터베이스 마이그레이션을 수행하고 관리하는 것","다른 데이터베이스 간에 복잡한 관계를 모델링하고 쿼리하는 것","Prisma 쿼리를 최적화하여 성능을 개선하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar y optimizar esquemas de base de datos para Prisma ORM","Realizar y gestionar migraciones de base de datos eficientes","Modelar y consultar relaciones complejas en diferentes bases de datos","Optimizar consultas de Prisma para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Concevoir et optimiser des schémas de base de données pour Prisma ORM","Effectuer et gérer des migrations de base de données efficaces","Modéliser et interroger des relations complexes sur différentes bases de données","Optimiser les requêtes Prisma pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Entwerfen und optimieren von Datenbankschemata für Prisma ORM","Durchführen und verwalten von effizienten Datenbankmigrationen","Modellieren und abfragen von komplexen Beziehungen in verschiedenen Datenbanken","Optimieren von Prisma-Abfragen für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Projetar e otimizar esquemas de banco de dados para Prisma ORM","Realizar e gerenciar migrações de banco de dados eficientes","Modelar e consultar relações complexas em diferentes bancos de dados","Otimizar consultas do Prisma para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Проектировать и оптимизировать схемы баз данных для Prisma ORM","Выполнять и управлять эффективными миграциями баз данных","Моделировать и запрашивать сложные отношения в разных базах данных","Оптимизировать запросы Prisma для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["تصميم مخططات قواعد البيانات وتحسينها لبرنامج Prisma ORM","إجراء هجرات قواعد البيانات الفعالة وإدارتها","تصميم علاقات معقدة واستعلامها عبر قواعد بيانات مختلفة","تحسين استعلامات Prisma لتحقيق أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prisma ORM setup and configuration","Specifically designed for PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite databases","Not suitable for raw SQL optimization or database server configuration"],"zh":["需要Prisma ORM的设置和配置","专门为PostgreSQL、MySQL和SQLite数据库设计","不适合优化原始SQL或数据库服务器配置"],"ja":["Prisma ORMの設定と構成が必要","PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLiteデータベース用に特別に設計されています","生のSQLの最適化やデータベースサーバーの構成には適していません"],"ko":["Prisma ORM 설정 및 구성이 필요합니다","PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite 데이터베이스를 위해 특별히 설계되었습니다","원시 SQL 최적화 또는 데이터베이스 서버 구성에는 적합하지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración y establecimiento de Prisma ORM","Diseñado específicamente para bases de datos PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite","No es adecuado para la optimización de SQL sin procesar o la configuración del servidor de base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une installation de Prisma ORM","Conçu spécifiquement pour les bases de données PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite","Non adapté pour l''optimisation de SQL brut ou la configuration du serveur de base de données"],"de":["Benötigt Prisma-ORM-Setup und -Konfiguration","Speziell für PostgreSQL-, MySQL- und SQLite-Datenbanken konzipiert","Nicht geeignet für die Optimierung von RohSQL oder die Konfiguration des Datenbank-Servers"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Prisma ORM","Projetado especificamente para bancos de dados PostgreSQL, MySQL e SQLite","Não é adequado para otimização de SQL bruto ou configuração do servidor de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Prisma ORM","Спецально разработан для баз данных PostgreSQL, MySQL и SQLite","Не подходит для оптимизации сырого SQL или конфигурации сервера базы данных"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين Prisma ORM","صُمم خصيصًا لقواعد البيانات PostgreSQL و MySQL و SQLite","لا يصلح لتحسين SQL الخام أو تكوين خادم قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
