o":"qmd-converter는 PDF 또는 EPUB 파일을 Quarto 책 프로젝트로 변환하는 도구로, 텍스트 추출, 章節 분할, 이미지 관리, 설정 업데이트 기능을 지원","es":"El convertidor de libros Quarto convierte archivos PDF o EPUB en proyectos de libro Quarto estructurados","fr":"Le convertisseur de livres Quarto convertit des fichiers PDF ou EPUB en projets de livre Quarto structurés","de":"Der Quarto-Buch-Konverter konvertiert PDF- oder EPUB-Dateien in strukturierte Quarto-Buchprojekte","pt":"O qmd-converter é uma ferramenta que converte arquivos PDF ou EPUB em projetos de livro Quarto estruturados","ru":"qmd-converter - это инструмент, который преобразует файлы PDF или EPUB в структурированные проекты книг Quarto","ar":"مُحَوِّل كُتُب كُوارتو هو أداة لتحويل ملفات PDF أو EPUB إلى مشاريع كتاب كُوارتو ذات هيكل","en":"make quarto book from PDF or EPUB files"},"definition":{"en":"make quarto book from PDF or EPUB files"},"features":{"zh":["支持PDF和EPUB文件转换","自动文本提取和章节分割","图像管理和配置更新","支持Quarto书籍项目结构","简化开发流程"],"ja":["PDFとEPUBファイルの変換に対応","自動テキスト抽出と章分割","画像管理と設定更新","Quarto本プロジェクト構造に対応","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["PDF와 EPUB 파일 변환 지원","자동 텍스트 추출과 章節 분할","이미지 관리와 설정 업데이트","Quarto 책 프로젝트 구조 지원","개발 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Conversión de textos","División de capítulos","Gestión de imágenes","Actualizaciones de configuración","Compatibilidad con pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml y html2text"],"fr":["Conversion de textes","Division de chapitres","Gestion d''images","Mises à jour de configuration","Compatibilité avec pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml et html2text"],"de":["Textkonvertierung","Kapitelteilung","Bildverwaltung","Konfigurationsaktualisierungen","Kompatibilität mit pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml und html2text"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos PDF ou EPUB em projetos de livro Quarto","Extração de texto e divisão de capítulos","Gerenciamento de imagens e atualizações de configuração","Compatibilidade com pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml e html2text"],"ru":["Преобразование файлов PDF или EPUB в проекты книг Quarto","Извлечение текста и разделение глав","Управление изображениями и обновления конфигурации","Совместимость с pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml и html2text"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات PDF أو EPUB إلى مشاريع كتاب كُوارتو","استخراج النص وتقسيم الفصول","إدارة الصور وتحديث التكوين","توافق مع pymupdf و ebooklib و beautifulsoup4 و pyyaml و html2text"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Quarto书籍转换器","PDF转Quarto","EPUB转Quarto","结构化书籍项目","文本提取","章节分割","图像管理","配置更新"],"ja":["Quarto本コンバーター","PDFからQuarto","EPUBからQuarto","構造化されたQuarto本プロジェクト","テキスト抽出","章分割","画像管理","設定更新"],"ko":["Quarto 책 변환기","PDF를 Quarto로","EPUB를 Quarto로","구조화된 Quarto 책 프로젝트","텍스트 추출"," 章節 분할","이미지 관리","설정 업데이트"],"es":["convertidor de libros Quarto","quarto book converter","pdf a quarto","epub a quarto","conversión de libros","desarrollo de libros","herramientas de autor"],"fr":["convertisseur de livres Quarto","quarto book converter","pdf en quarto","epub en quarto","conversion de livres","développement de livres","outils d''auteur"],"de":["Quarto-Buch-Konverter","quarto book converter","pdf in quarto","epub in quarto","Buchkonvertierung","Buchentwicklung","Autorenwerkzeuge"],"pt":["conversor de livros quarto","qmd-converter","pdf para quarto","epub para quarto","ferramenta de conversão de arquivos","projeto de livro quarto","pymupdf","ebooklib","beautifulsoup4","pyyaml","html2text"],"ru":["преобразователь книг quarto","qmd-converter","pdf в quarto","epub в quarto","инструмент для преобразования файлов","проект книги quarto","pymupdf","ebooklib","beautifulsoup4","pyyaml","html2text"],"ar":["مُحَوِّل كُتُب كُوارتو","qmd-converter","pdf إلى كُوارتو","epub إلى كُوارتو","أداة لتحويل الملفات","مشروع كتاب كُوارتو","pymupdf","ebooklib","beautifulsoup4","pyyaml","html2text"]}},"owner":"partrita","repo":"quarto-converter","repoPath":"partrita/quarto-converter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qmd-converter","description":"Convert PDF/EPUB documents into multi-chapter Quarto book projects using Pixi. Use when the user asks to Convert this PDF/EPUB to a Quarto book or Make a qmd book from this file.","bodyPreview":"# Quarto Book Converter\n\nThis skill converts PDF or EPUB files into a structured Quarto book project (specifically targeting the `mybook/` directory). It handles text extraction, chapter splitting, image management, and configuration updates.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1.  **Check Environment**:\n    The script relies on `pymupdf`, `ebooklib`, `beautifulsoup4`, `pyyaml`, and `html2text`.\n    **ALWAYS** check if these are installed in the current `pixi` environment before running the script.\n    \n    If you ar","body":"# Quarto Book Converter\n\nThis skill converts PDF or EPUB files into a structured Quarto book project (specifically targeting the `mybook/` directory). It handles text extraction, chapter splitting, image management, and configuration updates.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1.  **Check Environment**:\n    The script relies on `pymupdf`, `ebooklib`, `beautifulsoup4`, `pyyaml`, and `html2text`.\n    **ALWAYS** check if these are installed in the current `pixi` environment before running the script.\n    \n    If you are unsure or if the user hasn''t explicitly set up the environment, run:\n    ```bash\n    pixi add pymupdf ebooklib beautifulsoup4 pyyaml html2text\n    ```\n\n2.  **Execute Conversion**:\n    Run the python conversion script. Assume the script is located at `scripts/convert_to_book.py` relative to this skill.\n    \n    ```bash\n    pixi run python <path-to-skill>/scripts/convert_to_book.py <input_file_path> --output-dir mybook\n    ```\n    *(Replace `<input_file_path>` with the actual file path provided by the user)*\n\n3.  **Verify Output**:\n    - List files in `mybook/` to confirm `.qmd` chapters were created.\n    - Check `mybook/images/` for extracted images.\n    - Read `mybook/_quarto.yml` to confirm the `chapters` list was updated.\n\n## Usage Guidelines\n\n- **Input Files**: Ensure the user provides a valid path to a `.pdf` or `.epub` file.\n- **Chapter Splitting**:\n    - **EPUB**: Splits automatically based on internal structure.\n    - **PDF**: Splits based on the Table of Contents (Outline). If no TOC exists, it creates a single large chapter.\n- **Images**: Images are extracted to `mybook/images/` and referenced in the Markdown as `![](images/filename.ext)`. \n    - **Note for PDF**: To avoid redundancy in OCR-ed PDFs, full-page background images are skipped if significant text is extracted from the same page. Only \"real\" images (diagrams, photos, etc.) that do not cover the whole page or pages without a text layer are saved.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **\"ModuleNotFoundError\"**: Run the `pixi add ...` command listed in Step 1.\n- **\"No chapters generated\"**: The PDF might be image-only (scanned) without OCR, or the EPUB structure is non-standard."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:50:44.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF and EPUB conversion capabilities to Quarto book format.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF和EPUB转换为Quarto书籍格式的文档分析代理。","ja":"ドキュメント分析エージェントがQuarto書籍形式へのPDFおよびEPUBの高度な変換機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 및 EPUB를 Quarto 책 형식으로 변환하는 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de conversión de PDF y EPUB al formato de libro Quarto.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents nécessitant des capacités de conversion PDF et EPUB avancées au format de livre Quarto.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF- und EPUB-Konvertierungsfunktionen zum Quarto-Buchformat benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de conversão de PDF e EPUB para o formato de livro Quarto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности преобразования PDF и EPUB в формат книги Quarto.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى возможности متقدمة لتحويل PDF و EPUB إلى تنسيق كتاب Quarto."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PDF or EPUB files into structured Quarto book projects, handling text extraction, chapter splitting, and image management using libraries like pymupdf, ebooklib, and beautifulsoup4.","zh":"使代理能够将PDF或EPUB文件转换为结构化的Quarto书籍项目，使用pymupdf、ebooklib和beautifulsoup4等库处理文本提取、章节分割和图像管理。","ja":"エージェントがPDFまたはEPUBファイルを構造化されたQuarto本プロジェクトに変換できるようにし、pymupdf、ebooklib、beautifulsoup4などのライブラリを使用してテキスト抽出、章分割、画像管理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 PDF 또는 EPUB 파일을 구조화된 Quarto 책 프로젝트로 변환할 수 있도록 하며 pymupdf, ebooklib 및 beautifulsoup4와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 텍스트 추출, 장 분할 및 이미지 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir archivos PDF o EPUB en proyectos de libro Quarto estructurados, manejando la extracción de texto, la división de capítulos y la gestión de imágenes utilizando bibliotecas como pymupdf, ebooklib y beautifulsoup4.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des fichiers PDF ou EPUB en projets de livre Quarto structurés, en gérant l''extraction de texte, la division de chapitres et la gestion d''images en utilisant des bibliothèques comme pymupdf, ebooklib et beautifulsoup4.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, PDF- oder EPUB-Dateien in strukturierte Quarto-Buchprojekte zu konvertieren, wobei Textextraktion, Kapitelunterteilung und Bildverwaltung mithilfe von Bibliotheken wie pymupdf, ebooklib und beautifulsoup4 gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter arquivos PDF ou EPUB em projetos de livro Quarto estruturados, lidando com extração de texto, divisão de capítulos e gerenciamento de imagens usando bibliotecas como pymupdf, ebooklib e beautifulsoup4.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать файлы PDF или EPUB в структурированные проекты книг Quarto, обрабатывая извлечение текста, разделение глав и управление изображениями с использованием библиотек seperti pymupdf, ebooklib и beautifulsoup4.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل ملفات PDF أو EPUB إلى مشاريع كتب Quarto منظمة، وتتولى استخراج النصوص وتنسيق الفصول وإدارة الصور باستخدام مكتبات مثل pymupdf و ebooklib و beautifulsoup4."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting large PDF documents to Quarto books","Automating EPUB to Quarto conversions for e-book publishing","Generating Quarto book projects from existing PDF or EPUB files for further editing"],"zh":["将大型PDF文档转换为Quarto书籍","自动将EPUB转换为Quarto以进行电子书出版","从现有的PDF或EPUB文件生成Quarto书籍项目以进行进一步编辑"],"ja":["大きなPDFドキュメントをQuarto本に変換する","電子書籍出版のためにEPUBをQuartoに自動変換する","既存のPDFまたはEPUBファイルからQuarto本プロジェクトを生成してさらに編集する"],"ko":["대형 PDF 문서를 Quarto 책으로 변환하는 것","전자책 출판을 위한 EPUB를 Quarto로 자동 변환하는 것","기존의 PDF 또는 EPUB 파일에서 Quarto 책 프로젝트를 생성하여 추가 편집하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de grandes documentos PDF a libros Quarto","Automatización de conversiones de EPUB a Quarto para la publicación de libros electrónicos","Generación de proyectos de libro Quarto a partir de archivos PDF o EPUB existentes para una posterior edición"],"fr":["Conversion de grands documents PDF en livres Quarto","Automatisation des conversions de EPUB en Quarto pour la publication de livres électroniques","Génération de projets de livre Quarto à partir de fichiers PDF ou EPUB existants pour une édition ultérieure"],"de":["Umwandlung großer PDF-Dokumente in Quarto-Bücher","Automatisierung von EPUB-zu-Quarto-Konvertierungen für die Veröffentlichung von E-Books","Erzeugung von Quarto-Buchprojekten aus vorhandenen PDF- oder EPUB-Dateien für weitere Bearbeitung"],"pt":["Conversão de grandes documentos PDF em livros Quarto","Automatização de conversões de EPUB para Quarto para publicação de e-books","Geração de projetos de livro Quarto a partir de arquivos PDF ou EPUB existentes para edição adicional"],"ru":["Преобразование больших документов PDF в книги Quarto","Автоматизация преобразований EPUB в Quarto для издания электронных книг","Генерация проектов книг Quarto из существующих файлов PDF или EPUB для дальнейшего редактирования"],"ar":["تحويل وثائق PDF الكبيرة إلى كتب Quarto","تحويلEPUB إلى Quarto آليًا لنشر الكتب الإلكترونية","إنشاء مشاريع كتاب Quarto من ملفات PDF أو EPUB الموجودة لتحرير إضافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml, and html2text libraries to be installed","Specifically targets the mybook/ directory for Quarto book project output"],"zh":["需要安装pymupdf、ebooklib、beautifulsoup4、pyyaml和html2text库","特别针对mybook/目录来输出Quarto书籍项目"],"ja":["pymupdf、ebooklib、beautifulsoup4、pyyaml、html2textライブラリをインストールする必要がある","特にmybook/ディレクトリをQuarto本プロジェクトの出力先として対象とする"],"ko":["pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml 및 html2text 라이브러리를 설치해야 함","특히 Quarto 책 프로젝트 출력을 위한 mybook/ 디렉토리를 대상으로 함"],"es":["Requiere que las bibliotecas pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml y html2text estén instaladas","Dirige específicamente la salida del proyecto del libro Quarto al directorio mybook/"],"fr":["Nécessite que les bibliothèques pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml et html2text soient installées","Cible spécifiquement le répertoire mybook/ pour la sortie du projet de livre Quarto"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der Bibliotheken pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml und html2text","Zielt speziell auf das Verzeichnis mybook/ für die Ausgabe des Quarto-Buchprojekts ab"],"pt":["Requer as bibliotecas pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml e html2text para serem instaladas","Destina especificamente o diretório mybook/ para a saída do projeto do livro Quarto"],"ru":["Требует установки библиотек pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml и html2text","Специально нацелен на директорию mybook/ для вывода проекта книги Quarto"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبات pymupdf و ebooklib و beautifulsoup4 و pyyaml و html2text","يستهدف بشكل خاص دليل mybook/ لإخراج مشروع كتاب Quarto"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('deadronos/gpu-conway-life/openspec-verify-change', 'community', 'deadronos', 'gpu-conway-life', 'deadronos/gpu-conway-life', 'openspec-verify-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z', '2026-02-18T14:51:40.782Z', NULL, '{"id":"deadronos/gpu-conway-life/openspec-verify-change","name":"openspec-verify-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能用于验证实现是否与变更文档匹配，确保开发准确性","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキルは、実装が変更ドキュメントと一致することを検証し、開発の正確性を確保する","ko":"openspec-verify-change 스킬은 구현이 변경 문서와 일치하는지 검증하여 개발 정확성을 보장한다","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração. Ele executa o comando openspec list --json para obter alterações disponíveis.","ru":"Openspec-verify-change — это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменения. Он выполняет команду openspec list --json, чтобы получить доступные изменения.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة لتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير. يقوم بتشغيل الأمر openspec list --json للحصول على التغييرات المتاحة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能：验证实现与变更","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキル：実装と変更の検証","ko":"openspec-verify-change 스킬: 구현과 변경 사항 검증","pt":"Verifique alterações com openspec-verify-change","ru":"Проверьте изменения с openspec-verify-change","ar":"تحقق من التغييرات باستخدام openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能用于验证实现是否与变更文档匹配，确保开发准确性","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキルは、実装が変更ドキュメントと一致することを検証し、開発の正確性を確保する","ko":"openspec-verify-change 스킬은 구현이 변경 문서와 일치하는지 검증하여 개발 정확성을 보장한다","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração. Ele executa o comando openspec list --jso...","ru":"Openspec-verify-change — это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменения. Он выполняет команду openspec list --json, чтоб...","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة لتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير. يقوم بتشغيل الأمر openspec list --json للحصول على التغييرات المتاحة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证实现与变更文档匹配","支持变更名称输入","自动推断变更名称","用户交互式变更选择"],"ja":["実装と変更ドキュメントの照合","変更名称の入力対応","変更名称の自動推定","ユーザーインタラクティブな変更選択"],"ko":["구현과 변경 문서의 일치 검증","변경 이름 입력 지원","변경 이름 자동 추론","사용자 상호작용 변경 선택"],"pt":["Verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração","Executa o comando openspec list --json para obter alterações disponíveis","Permite ao usuário selecionar a alteração desejada","Verifica se a alteração tem tarefas de implementação","Fornece uma lista de alterações disponíveis"],"ru":["Проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменения","Выполняет команду openspec list --json, чтобы получить доступные изменения","Позволяет пользователю выбрать необходимое изменение","Проверяет, имеет ли изменение задачи реализации","Предоставляет список доступных изменений"],"ar":["يتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير","يقوم بتشغيل الأمر openspec list --json للحصول على التغييرات المتاحة","يسمح للمستخدم باختيار التغيير المطلوب","يتحقق من وجود مهام تنفيذ للتغيير","يقدم قائمة بالتغييرات المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","验证实现","变更文档","开发效率","准确性","一致性"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","実装の検証","変更ドキュメント","開発効率","正確性","一致性"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","구현 검증","변경 문서","개발 효율성","정확성","일치성"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","arteatos de alteração","implementação","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","артефакты изменения","реализация","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","تحقق التغييرات","محددات التغيير","التنفيذ","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"deadronos","repo":"gpu-conway-life","repoPath":"deadronos/gpu-conway-life","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\", \"tdd\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:51:40.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise change verification and implementation validation.","zh":"适用于需要精确变更验证和实施验证的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが正確な変更の検証と実装の検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 변경 검증 및 구현 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una verificación de cambio precisa y una validación de implementación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une vérification de modification précise et une validation d''implémentation.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine präzise Änderungsverifizierung und Implementierungsvalidierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem verificação precisa de alterações e validação de implementação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих точной верификации изменений и валидации реализации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب التحقق الدقيق من التغييرات وتحقق التنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, ensuring accuracy by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling JSON data and potential ambiguity in change names.","zh":"使代理能够使用openspec验证实施是否与变更文档相符，通过运行`openspec list --json`确保准确性，并使用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户选择，同时处理JSON数据和潜在的变更名称模糊性。","ja":"エージェントがopenspecを使用して実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証できるようにし、`openspec list --json`の実行によって正確性を確保し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーの選択を行い、同時にJSONデータと変更名の潜在的な曖昧性を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 openspec를 사용하여 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 검증할 수 있도록 하며, `openspec list --json`을 실행하여 정확성을 보장하고, AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자 선택을 수행하며,同時에 JSON 데이터와 변경 이름의 잠재적인 모호성을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio utilizando openspec, asegurando la precisión al ejecutar `openspec list --json` y utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, todo mientras maneja datos JSON y la posible ambigüedad en los nombres de cambio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification en utilisant openspec, en garantissant l''exactitude en exécutant `openspec list --json` et en utilisant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, le tout en gérant les données JSON et la ambiguïté potentielle dans les noms de modification.","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, die Implementierung zu überprüfen, ob sie mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt, indem openspec verwendet wird, wodurch die Genauigkeit durch die Ausführung von `openspec list --json` und die Verwendung des AskUserQuestion-Tools für die Benutzerauswahl gewährleistet wird, während JSON-Daten und mögliche Mehrdeutigkeit in den Änderungsnamen gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração usando openspec, garantindo precisão executando `openspec list --json` e utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção do usuário, lidando com dados JSON e potencial ambiguidade nos nomes de alterações.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений, используя openspec, обеспечивая точность путем выполнения `openspec list --json` и использования инструмента AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, обрабатывая данные JSON и потенциальную неоднозначность в названиях изменений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير باستخدام openspec، وتأمين الدقة من خلال تشغيل `openspec list --json` واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، مع التعامل مع بيانات JSON والغموض المحتمل في أسماء التغييرات."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying implementation against change specifications","Validating design and task alignment with change artifacts","Prompting users for change selection when names are vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["验证实施是否与变更规格一致","验证设计和任务与变更文档的对齐","当变更名称模糊或不明确时提示用户选择变更"],"ja":["実装が変更仕様と一致することを検証する","設計とタスクが変更アーティファクトと整列することを検証する","変更名が漠然としたり曖昧な場合にユーザーに変更の選択を求める"],"ko":["구현이 변경 사양과 일치하는지 검증하는 것","디자인과 태스크가 변경 아티팩트와 정렬되는지 검증하는 것","변경 이름이 모호하거나 불분명한 경우 사용자에게 변경 선택을 제안하는 것"],"es":["Verificar la implementación contra las especificaciones de cambio","Validar el diseño y la tarea con los artefactos de cambio","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen un cambio cuando los nombres son vagos o ambiguos"],"fr":["Vérifier l''implémentation par rapport aux spécifications de modification","Valider la conception et la tâche avec les artefacts de modification","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner une modification lorsque les noms sont vagues ou ambigus"],"de":["Überprüfen der Implementierung gegen die Änderungsspezifikationen","Validieren des Designs und der Aufgabe mit den Änderungsartefakten","Auffordern der Benutzer, eine Änderung auszuwählen, wenn die Namen vage oder mehrdeutig sind"],"pt":["Verificar a implementação contra especificações de alterações","Validar o alinhamento do design e da tarefa com artefatos de alterações","Solicitar aos usuários a seleção de alterações quando os nomes são vagos ou ambíguos"],"ru":["Проверка реализации против спецификаций изменений","Проверка соответствия дизайна и задачи артефактам изменений","Привлечение пользователей к выбору изменений, когда названия неоднозначны или расплывчаты"],"ar":["التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل مواصفات التغيير","تحقيق توافق التصميم والمهمة مع محددات التغيير","طلب من المستخدمين اختيار التغييرات عندما تكون الأسماء غامضة أو غير واضحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Needs access to change artifacts and implementation details","May prompt for user input if change name is not provided or is ambiguous"],"zh":["需要openspec的安装和配置","需要访问变更文档和实施细节","可能会提示用户输入如果变更名称没有提供或是模糊的"],"ja":["openspecのインストールと設定が必要","変更アーティファクトと実装の詳細へのアクセスが必要","変更名が提供されていない場合や曖昧な場合にユーザー入力を求めることがある"],"ko":["openspec의 설치와 구성이 필요함","변경 아티팩트와 구현 세부 정보에 대한 접근이 필요함","변경 이름이 제공되지 않거나 모호한 경우 사용자 입력을 요구할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Necesita acceso a los artefactos de cambio y detalles de implementación","Puede solicitar la entrada del usuario si el nombre de cambio no se proporciona o es ambiguo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","A besoin d''un accès aux artefacts de modification et aux détails d''implémentation","Peut inviter l''utilisateur à entrer des données si le nom de modification n''est pas fourni ou est ambigü"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Benötigt den Zugriff auf die Änderungsartefakte und Implementierungsdetails","Kann die Eingabe des Benutzers anfordern, wenn der Änderungsname nicht angegeben wird oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Exige a instalação e configuração do openspec","Necessita acesso a artefatos de alterações e detalhes de implementação","Pode solicitar entrada do usuário se o nome da alteração não for fornecido ou for ambíguo"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки openspec","Требует доступа к артефактам изменений и деталям реализации","Может запрашивать ввод пользователя, если имя изменения не указано или является неоднозначным"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة openspec","يتطلب الوصول إلى محددات التغيير و細یات التنفيذ","يمكن أن يطلب إدخال المستخدم إذا لم يتم توفير اسم التغيير أو كان غامضًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
