","Recuperação filtrada","Crawler para descoberta de arquivos","Parser para extração de metadados","Chunker para divisão semântica"],"ru":["Семантическое разделение","Инкрементные обновления","Фильтрованная выборка","Краулер для обнаружения файлов","Парсер для извлечения метаданных","Чанкинг для семантического разделения"],"ar":["التقسيم الدلالي","التحديثات المتزايدة","الاسترجاع المفلتر","زاحف لاكتشاف الملفات","مُحلل لاستخراج البيانات الوصفية","تقسيم لتقسيم دلالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAG系统","语义分块","增量更新","过滤检索","OpenAI嵌入","Qdrant"],"ja":["RAGシステム","セマンティックチャンキング","インクリメンタル更新","フィルタードリトリーバル","OpenAIエンベッディング","Qdrant"],"ko":["RAG 시스템","시맨틱 청킹","증분 업데이트","필터링된 검색","OpenAI 임베딩","Qdrant"],"es":["sistemas RAG","chunking semántico","recuperación de información","desarrollo de software","OpenAI","Qdrant","indexación de información","optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["systèmes RAG","chunking sémantique","récupération d''informations","développement de logiciels","OpenAI","Qdrant","indexation d''informations","optimisation des performances"],"de":["RAG-Systeme","semantische Chunking","Information-Retrieval","Software-Entwicklung","OpenAI","Qdrant","Indexierung von Informationen","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Sistemas RAG","Recuperação de informações","Dividir semântico","Atualizações incrementais","Recuperação filtrada","Desenvolvimento de software","Tecnologia de informação"],"ru":["Системы RAG","Поиск информации","Семантическое разделение","Инкрементные обновления","Фильтрованная выборка","Разработка программного обеспечения","Технология информации"],"ar":["أنظمة RAG","استرجاع المعلومات","التقسيم الدلالي","التحديثات المتزايدة","الاسترجاع المفلتر","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"Digital-FTE","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-rag-systems","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Building RAG Systems\n\nProduction-grade RAG with semantic chunking, incremental updates, and filtered retrieval.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Dependencies\npip install qdrant-client openai pydantic python-frontmatter\n\n# Core components\n# 1. Crawler → discovers files, extracts path metadata\n# 2. Parser → extracts frontmatter, computes file hash\n# 3. Chunker → semantic split on ## headers, 400 tokens, 15% overlap\n# 4. Embedder → batched OpenAI embeddings\n# 5. Uploader → Qdrant upsert with indexed pa","body":"# Building RAG Systems\n\nProduction-grade RAG with semantic chunking, incremental updates, and filtered retrieval.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Dependencies\npip install qdrant-client openai pydantic python-frontmatter\n\n# Core components\n# 1. Crawler → discovers files, extracts path metadata\n# 2. Parser → extracts frontmatter, computes file hash\n# 3. Chunker → semantic split on ## headers, 400 tokens, 15% overlap\n# 4. Embedder → batched OpenAI embeddings\n# 5. Uploader → Qdrant upsert with indexed payloads\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ingestion Pipeline\n\n### Architecture\n\n```\n┌──────────┐    ┌────────┐    ┌─────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐\n│ Crawler  │ -> │ Parser │ -> │ Chunker │ -> │ Embedder │ -> │ Uploader │\n└──────────┘    └────────┘    └─────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘\n     │              │              │              │              │\nDiscovers      Extracts       Splits by     Generates      Upserts to\nfiles          frontmatter    semantic      vectors        Qdrant\n               + file hash    boundaries    (batched)      (batched)\n```\n\n### Semantic Chunking (NOT Fixed-Size)\n\n```python\nclass SemanticChunker:\n    \"\"\"\n    Production chunking:\n    - Split on ## headers (semantic boundaries)\n    - Target 400 tokens (NVIDIA benchmark optimal)\n    - 15% overlap for context continuity\n    - Track prev/next for context expansion\n    \"\"\"\n    SECTION_PATTERN = re.compile(r\"(?=^## )\", re.MULTILINE)\n    TOKENS_PER_WORD = 1.3\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        target_tokens: int = 400,\n        max_tokens: int = 512,\n        overlap_percent: float = 0.15,\n    ):\n        self.target_words = int(target_tokens / self.TOKENS_PER_WORD)\n        self.overlap_words = int(self.target_words * overlap_percent)\n\n    def chunk(self, content: str, file_hash: str) -> list[Chunk]:\n        sections = self.SECTION_PATTERN.split(content)\n        chunks = []\n\n        for idx, section in enumerate(sections):\n            content_hash = hashlib.sha256(section.encode()).hexdigest()[:16]\n            chunk_id = f\"{file_hash[:8]}_{content_hash}_{idx}\"\n\n            chunks.append(Chunk(\n                id=chunk_id,\n                text=section,\n                chunk_index=idx,\n                total_chunks=len(sections),\n                prev_chunk_id=chunks[-1].id if chunks else None,\n                content_hash=content_hash,\n                source_file_hash=file_hash,\n            ))\n\n            # Set next_chunk_id on previous\n            if len(chunks) > 1:\n                chunks[-2].next_chunk_id = chunk_id\n\n        return chunks\n```\n\n### Change Detection (Incremental Updates)\n\n```python\ndef compute_file_hash(file_path: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"SHA-256 for change detection.\"\"\"\n    with open(file_path, ''rb'') as f:\n        return hashlib.sha256(f.read()).hexdigest()\n\nclass QdrantStateTracker:\n    \"\"\"Query Qdrant payloads directly - no external state DB needed.\"\"\"\n\n    def get_indexed_files(self, book_id: str) -> dict[str, str]:\n        \"\"\"Returns {file_path: file_hash} from Qdrant.\"\"\"\n        indexed = {}\n        offset = None\n\n        while True:\n            points, next_offset = self.client.scroll(\n                collection_name=self.collection,\n                scroll_filter=Filter(must=[\n                    FieldCondition(key=\"book_id\", match=MatchValue(value=book_id))\n                ]),\n                limit=100,\n                offset=offset,\n                with_payload=[\"source_file\", \"source_file_hash\"],\n                with_vectors=False,\n            )\n\n            for point in points:\n                indexed[point.payload[\"source_file\"]] = point.payload[\"source_file_hash\"]\n\n            if next_offset is None:\n                break\n            offset = next_offset\n\n        return indexed\n\n    def detect_changes(self, current: dict[str, str], indexed: dict[str, str]):\n        \"\"\"Compare filesystem vs index.\"\"\"\n        new = [p for p in current if p not in indexed]\n        deleted = [p for p in indexed if p not in current]\n        modified = [p for p in current if p in indexed and current[p] != indexed[p]]\n        return new, modified, deleted\n```\n\n### Batched Embeddings\n\n```python\nclass OpenAIEmbedder:\n    def __init__(self, model: str = \"text-embedding-3-small\", batch_size: int = 20):\n        self.client = OpenAI()\n        self.model = model\n        self.batch_size = batch_size  # OpenAI recommendation\n\n    def embed_chunks(self, chunks: list[Chunk]) -> list[EmbeddedChunk]:\n        embedded = []\n        for i in range(0, len(chunks), self.batch_size):\n            batch = chunks[i:i + self.batch_size]\n            response = self.client.embeddings.create(\n                input=[c.text for c in batch],\n                model=self.model,\n            )\n            for chunk, data in zip(batch, response.data):\n                embedded.append(EmbeddedChunk(**chunk.dict(), embedding=data.embedding))\n        return embedded\n```\n\n### Qdrant Collection with Payload Indexes\n\n```python\ndef create_collection(self, recreate: bool = False):\n    \"\"\"Create collection with proper indexes for filtered retrieval.\"\"\"\n    self.client.create_collection(\n        collection_name=self.collection,\n        vectors_config=VectorParams(size=1536, distance=Distance.COSINE),\n    )\n\n    # Index ALL fields you filter by\n    indexes = [\n        (\"book_id\", PayloadSchemaType.KEYWORD),      # Tenant isolation\n        (\"module\", PayloadSchemaType.KEYWORD),       # Content filter\n        (\"chapter\", PayloadSchemaType.INTEGER),      # Range filter\n        (\"hardware_tier\", PayloadSchemaType.INTEGER),# Personalization\n        (\"proficiency_level\", PayloadSchemaType.KEYWORD),\n        (\"parent_doc_id\", PayloadSchemaType.KEYWORD),# Context expansion\n        (\"source_file_hash\", PayloadSchemaType.KEYWORD),  # Change detection\n    ]\n\n    for field, schema in indexes:\n        self.client.create_payload_index(\n            collection_name=self.collection,\n            field_name=field,\n            field_schema=schema,\n        )\n```\n\n---\n\n## Retrieval Patterns\n\n### Comprehensive Filter Builder\n\n```python\ndef build_filter(self, query: SearchQuery) -> Filter:\n    \"\"\"Build Qdrant filter with all conditions (AND logic).\"\"\"\n    conditions = []\n\n    # Required: Tenant isolation\n    conditions.append(FieldCondition(\n        key=\"book_id\", match=MatchValue(value=query.book_id)\n    ))\n\n    # Required: Hardware tier (lte = \"tier X or lower\")\n    conditions.append(FieldCondition(\n        key=\"hardware_tier\", range=Range(lte=query.hardware_tier)\n    ))\n\n    # Optional: Module exact match\n    if query.module:\n        conditions.append(FieldCondition(\n            key=\"module\", match=MatchValue(value=query.module)\n        ))\n\n    # Optional: Chapter range\n    if query.chapter_min or query.chapter_max:\n        chapter_range = Range()\n        if query.chapter_min:\n            chapter_range.gte = query.chapter_min\n        if query.chapter_max:\n            chapter_range.lte = query.chapter_max\n        conditions.append(FieldCondition(key=\"chapter\", range=chapter_range))\n\n    # Optional: Proficiency OR logic\n    if query.proficiency_levels:\n        conditions.append(FieldCondition(\n            key=\"proficiency_level\",\n            match=MatchAny(any=query.proficiency_levels),\n        ))\n\n    return Filter(must=conditions)\n```\n\n### Context Expansion (Walk Chunk Chain)\n\n```python\ndef expand_context(self, chunk_id: str, prev: int = 1, next: int = 1) -> list[Chunk]:\n    \"\"\"Walk prev_chunk_id/next_chunk_id chain for surrounding context.\"\"\"\n    current = self.get_chunk_by_id(chunk_id)\n    if not current:\n        return []\n\n    # Walk backwards\n    prev_chunks = []\n    prev_id = current.prev_chunk_id\n    for _ in range(prev):\n        if not prev_id:\n            break\n        chunk = self.get_chunk_by_id(prev_id)\n        if not chunk:\n            break\n        prev_chunks.insert(0, chunk)\n        prev_id = chunk.prev_chunk_id\n\n    # Walk forwards\n    next_chunks = []\n    next_id = current.next_chunk_id\n    for _ in range(next):\n        if not next_id:\n            break\n        chunk = self.get_chunk_by_id(next_id)\n        if not chunk:\n            break\n        next_chunks.append(chunk)\n        next_id = chunk.next_chunk_id\n\n    return prev_chunks + [current] + next_chunks\n```\n\n### Full Document Retrieval\n\n```python\ndef get_document_chunks(self, parent_doc_id: str) -> list[Chunk]:\n    \"\"\"Get all chunks for a document, ordered by chunk_index.\"\"\"\n    points, _ = self.client.scroll(\n        collection_name=self.collection,\n        scroll_filter=Filter(must=[\n            FieldCondition(key=\"parent_doc_id\", match=MatchValue(value=parent_doc_id))\n        ]),\n        limit=100,\n        with_payload=True,\n        with_vectors=False,\n    )\n\n    chunks = [self._to_chunk(p) for p in points]\n    chunks.sort(key=lambda c: c.chunk_index)\n    return chunks\n```\n\n---\n\n## Payload Schema\n\n```python\nclass ChunkPayload(BaseModel):\n    \"\"\"Complete payload for filtered retrieval and context expansion.\"\"\"\n\n    # Tenant isolation\n    book_id: str\n\n    # Content filters (all indexed)\n    module: str\n    chapter: int\n    lesson: int\n    hardware_tier: int\n    proficiency_level: str\n\n    # Display content\n    text: str\n    section_title: Optional[str]\n    source_file: str\n\n    # Context expansion\n    parent_doc_id: str\n    chunk_index: int\n    total_chunks: int\n    prev_chunk_id: Optional[str]\n    next_chunk_id: Optional[str]\n\n    # Change detection\n    content_hash: str\n    source_file_hash: str\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Do Instead |\n|-------|------------|\n| Fixed character chunking | Semantic boundaries (## headers) |\n| Position-based chunk IDs | Content hash for stable IDs |\n| No overlap between chunks | 10-20% overlap for continuity |\n| Full re-index on every change | Incremental with file hash detection |\n| Missing payload indexes | Index every field you filter by |\n| Synchronous embedding | Batch with background jobs |\n| External state database | Qdrant-native state tracking |\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\nRun: `python scripts/verify.py`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `scaffolding-fastapi-dapr` - API patterns for search endpoints\n- `streaming-llm-responses` - Streaming RAG responses\n\n## References\n\n- [references/ingestion-patterns.md](references/ingestion-patterns.md) - Full ingestion pipeline\n- [references/retrieval-patterns.md](references/retrieval-patterns.md) - Filter strategies, context expansion\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:51:31.267Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Retrieval Agents needing advanced semantic search capabilities with Qdrant and OpenAI integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级语义搜索功能的知识检索代理，支持Qdrant和OpenAI集成。","ja":"QdrantおよびOpenAIとの統合で高度なセマンティック検索機能を必要とするナレッジ・リトリーバル・エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Qdrant와 OpenAI 통합을 통해 고급 의미 검색 기능이 필요한 지식 검색 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de recuperación de conocimiento que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda semántica avanzada con integración de Qdrant y OpenAI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de récupération de connaissances nécessitant des capacités de recherche sémantique avancées avec une intégration de Qdrant et OpenAI.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensabrufagenten, die erweiterte semantische Suchfunktionen mit Qdrant- und OpenAI-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Recuperação de Conhecimento que necessitam de capacidades de busca semântica avançadas com integração do Qdrant e OpenAI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов поиска знаний, которым требуются продвинутые возможности семантического поиска с интеграцией Qdrant и OpenAI.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات استرجاع المعرفة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات بحث معنوي متقدمة مع تكامل Qdrant و OpenAI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-grade Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems with semantic chunking, incremental updates, and filtered retrieval using libraries like qdrant-client, openai, and pydantic.","zh":"赋予代理构建生产级检索增强生成（RAG）系统的能力，具有语义块、增量更新和使用类库如qdrant-client、openai和pydantic的过滤检索功能。","ja":"qdrant-client、openai、pydanticなどのライブラリを使用したセマンティック・チャンキング、インクリメンタル・アップデート、フィルタリング・リトリーバル機能により、エージェントが生产レベルのリトリーバル・オーグメンテーション・ジェネレーション（RAG）システムを構築できるようにします。","ko":"qdrant-client, openai, pydanticなどの 라이브러리를 사용하여语义 chunking, 증분 업데이트, 필터링 검색 기능을 통해 생산급 리트리발 오그멘테이션 생성(RAG) 시스템을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir sistemas de generación mejorada de recuperación (RAG) de grado de producción con chunking semántico, actualizaciones incrementales y recuperación filtrada utilizando bibliotecas como qdrant-client, openai y pydantic.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des systèmes de génération améliorée de récupération (RAG) de niveau production avec un chunking sémantique, des mises à jour incrémentielles et une récupération filtrée en utilisant des bibliothèques comme qdrant-client, openai et pydantic.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten zum Aufbau von Produktions-Grade-Retrieval-Augmented-Generation-(RAG)-Systemen mit semantischer Chunking, inkrementellen Updates und filterter Abrufverwendung mit Bibliotheken wie qdrant-client, openai und pydantic.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir sistemas de geração aumentada por recuperação (RAG) de produção com chunking semântico, atualizações incrementais e recuperação filtrada usando bibliotecas como qdrant-client, openai e pydantic.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать системы генерации, усиленной поиском (RAG), уровня производства с семантическим чанкингом, инкрементными обновлениями и фильтрованным поиском, используя библиотеки, такие как qdrant-client, openai и pydantic.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء أنظمة توليد محسّن بالاسترجاع (RAG) من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع تقطيع معنوي وتحديثات متزايدة واسترجاع مرشّح باستخدام مكتبات مثل qdrant-client و openai و pydantic."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating knowledge graph updates with incremental semantic chunking","Generating contextualized embeddings for filtered retrieval using OpenAI","Optimizing RAG system performance with batched embedding uploads to Qdrant"],"zh":["使用增量语义块自动更新知识图","使用OpenAI生成上下文化嵌入以进行过滤检索","使用批量嵌入上传到Qdrant优化RAG系统性能"],"ja":["インクリメンタル・セマンティック・チャンキングを使用してナレッジ・グラフを自動更新する","OpenAIを使用してフィルタリング・リトリーバル用のコンテキスト化された埋め込みを生成する","Qdrantへのバッチ埋め込み・アップロードを使用してRAGシステムのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["증분 의미 chunking을 사용하여 지식 그래프를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","OpenAI를 사용하여 필터링 검색을 위한 문맥화된 임베딩을 생성하는 것","Qdrant로의 일괄 임베딩 업로드를 사용하여 RAG 시스템의 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones del grafo de conocimiento con chunking semántico incremental","Generar incrustaciones contextualizadas para recuperación filtrada utilizando OpenAI","Optimizar el rendimiento del sistema RAG con cargas de incrustaciones por lotes en Qdrant"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour du graphique de connaissances avec un chunking sémantique incrémentiel","Générer des embeddings contextualisés pour une récupération filtrée en utilisant OpenAI","Optimiser les performances du système RAG avec des téléchargements d''embeddings par lots vers Qdrant"],"de":["Automatisieren von Wissensgraph-Aktualisierungen mit inkrementellem semantischem Chunking","Erzeugen von kontextualisierten Einbettungen für filterten Abruf unter Verwendung von OpenAI","Optimieren der Leistung des RAG-Systems mit Chargen-Uploads von Einbettungen in Qdrant"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de grafos de conhecimento com chunking semântico incremental","Gerar incorporações contextualizadas para recuperação filtrada usando OpenAI","Otimizar o desempenho do sistema RAG com uploads de incorporações em lotes para Qdrant"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления графов знаний с инкрементным семантическим чанкингом","Генерировать контекстуализированные вложения для фильтрованного поиска, используя OpenAI","Оптимизировать производительность системы RAG с пакетными загрузками вложений в Qdrant"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في تحديثات رسوم المعرفة بالتقطيع المعنوي المتزايد","توليد التضمينات الموضوعية لاسترجاع المرشّح باستخدام OpenAI","تحسين أداء نظام RAG باستخدام تحميل التضمينات المجمّعة إلى Qdrant"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key","Qdrant database setup needed","Python 3.x compatibility required for pydantic and python-frontmatter"],"zh":["需要OpenAI API密钥","需要Qdrant数据库设置","需要Python 3.x兼容性以用于pydantic和python-frontmatter"],"ja":["OpenAI APIキーが必要","Qdrantデータベースの設定が必要","pydanticおよびpython-frontmatter用のPython 3.xの互換性が必要"],"ko":["OpenAI API 키가 필요합니다","Qdrant 데이터베이스 설정이 필요합니다","pydantic 및 python-frontmatter를 사용하기 위한 Python 3.x 호환성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de OpenAI","Se necesita configuración de base de datos de Qdrant","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x para pydantic y python-frontmatter"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API OpenAI","Configuration de la base de données Qdrant nécessaire","Compatibilité Python 3.x requise pour pydantic et python-frontmatter"],"de":["Benötigt einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel","Qdrant-Datenbank-Setup erforderlich","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich für pydantic und python-frontmatter"],"pt":["Requer chave de API do OpenAI","Configuração do banco de dados Qdrant necessária","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária para pydantic e python-frontmatter"],"ru":["Тре