Mettez en œuvre la technique de Suspense pour améliorer le chargement initial","Optimisez le chargement de données avec Promise.all()","Évitez l''importation de fichiers barril","Appliquez la technique de tree shaking pour réduire la taille du bundle"],"de":["Eliminieren Sie die Abhängigkeitskaskaden","Implementieren Sie die Suspense-Technik, um die anfängliche Ladezeit zu verbessern","Optimieren Sie die Datenladung mit Promise.all()","Vermeiden Sie die Importierung von Barrel-Dateien","Wenden Sie die Tree-Shaking-Technik an, um die Bundle-Größe zu reduzieren"],"pt":["Eliminação de Waterfalls","Otimização de bundle e tree shaking","Implementação de Suspense boundaries","Uso de Promise.all() para busca de dados concorrente","Desferimento de await até a necessidade real de dados"],"ru":["Элиминация водопадов","Оптимизация bundle и tree shaking","Реализация границ Suspense","Использование Promise.all() для конкURENTной загрузки данных","Откладывание await до实际ной необходимости данных"],"ar":["إزالة الشلالات","تحسين حزمة و تقليل الشجرة","تنفيذ حدود التأخير","استخدام Promise.all() للبحث المتزامن عن البيانات","تأجيل await حتى الحاجة الفعلية للبيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React性能优化","Next.js性能优化","UI性能守护","性能优化工具","React优化","Next.js优化"],"ja":["Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","UIパフォーマンスガード","パフォーマンス最適化ツール","React最適化","Next.js最適化"],"ko":["React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","UI 성능 가드","성능 최적화 도구","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","Vercel"," Suspense","Promise.all()","tree shaking","rendimiento de la UI"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","Vercel","Suspense","Promise.all()","tree shaking","performances de l''UI"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Vercel","Suspense","Promise.all()","Tree Shaking","UI-Leistung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","renderização","latência","waterfalls","bundle","tree shaking","Suspense boundaries"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","рендеринг","задержка","водопады","bundle","tree shaking","границы Suspense"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","عرض","تأخير","شلالات","حزمة","تقليل الشجرة","حدود التأخير"]}},"owner":"infodungeon","repo":"keyforge","repoPath":"infodungeon/keyforge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"UI Performance Guard","description":"Enforces Vercel-standard performance optimizations for React and Next.js applications.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# UI Performance Guard\n\nEnforces Vercel-standard performance optimizations for React and Next.js applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Eliminate Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n- Defer `await` until the data is actually needed in the render tree.\n- Use `Promise.all()` for independent, concurrent data fetching.\n- Implement `Suspense` boundaries to unblock the initial paint of the shell.\n\n### 2. Bundle & Tree Shaking (CRITICAL)\n- AVOID barrel file imports (`import { x } from \"@/components\"`); use direct pa","body":"# UI Performance Guard\n\nEnforces Vercel-standard performance optimizations for React and Next.js applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Eliminate Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n- Defer `await` until the data is actually needed in the render tree.\n- Use `Promise.all()` for independent, concurrent data fetching.\n- Implement `Suspense` boundaries to unblock the initial paint of the shell.\n\n### 2. Bundle & Tree Shaking (CRITICAL)\n- AVOID barrel file imports (`import { x } from \"@/components\"`); use direct paths to ensure proper tree-shaking.\n- Use dynamic imports (`next/dynamic` or `React.lazy`) for heavy components or those below the fold.\n- Audit third-party libraries; prefer native browser APIs over heavy dependencies where possible.\n\n### 3. Render Optimization\n- Extract expensive computational work into memoized components or `useMemo`.\n- Use functional updates in `setState` (e.g., `setCount(c => c + 1)`) to avoid stale closure dependencies.\n- Deduplicate global event listeners and timers using `useRef` for persistence across renders.\n\n### 4. Asset Management\n- Optimize SVG precision and minimize path data.\n- Use `content-visibility: auto` for off-screen components in long lists.\n- Hoist static JSX elements out of the render loop to prevent unnecessary re-allocations.\n\n## Verification\n- Run `npm run lint` and check for performance-related warnings.\n- Verify that initial bundle size is within the project''s performance budget."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:51:45.841Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to optimize React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan optimizar el rendimiento de aplicaciones de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin d''optimiser les performances des applications React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die die Leistung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen optimieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que precisam otimizar o desempenho de aplicações React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимо оптимизировать производительность приложений React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لواجهات الويب الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى تحسين أداء تطبيقات React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce Vercel-standard performance optimizations, utilizing techniques like Suspense boundaries, Promise.all() for concurrent data fetching, and tree shaking to minimize bundle sizes.","zh":"赋予代理执行 Vercel 标准的性能优化，利用如 Suspense 边界、Promise.all() 进行并发数据获取以及 tree shaking 以最小化包大小的技术。","ja":"Vercel 標準のパフォーマンス最適化を実施するエージェントをEmpowerすることで、Suspense境界、Promise.all()による並行データ取得、tree shakingによるバンドルサイズの最小化などの技術を利用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Vercel 표준의 성능 최적화를 강제 실행할 수 있도록 하여, Suspense 경계, Promise.all()를 통한 병렬 데이터 가져오기, 트리 쉐이킹을 통한 번들 크기 최소화 등의 기술을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar optimizaciones de rendimiento estándar de Vercel, utilizando técnicas como límites de Suspense, Promise.all() para la recuperación de datos concurrente y tree shaking para minimizar los tamaños de los paquetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des optimisations de performances standard de Vercel, en utilisant des techniques comme les limites de Suspense, Promise.all() pour la récupération de données concurrente et tree shaking pour minimiser les tailles des paquets.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Vercel-Standardleistungsoptimierungen durchzusetzen, indem Techniken wie Suspense-Grenzen, Promise.all() für konkurrierende Datenabruf und Tree Shaking zur Minimierung der Paketgrößen verwendet werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a aplicar otimizações de desempenho padrão Vercel, utilizando técnicas como limites de Suspense, Promise.all() para busca de dados concorrente e tree shaking para minimizar o tamanho dos pacotes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять оптимизации производительности стандарта Vercel, используя такие методы, как границы Suspense, Promise.all() для параллельного получения данных и tree shaking для минимизации размеров сборки.","ar":"يمكن الواجهات من تطبيق تحسينات الأداء القياسية لـ Vercel، باستخدام تقنيات مثل حدود Suspense، وPromise.all() لجلب البيانات المتزامن، وهز الشجرة لتقليل أحجام الحزم."},"useCases":{"en":["Eliminating waterfalls in render trees","Implementing bundle and tree shaking for optimized code delivery","Debugging performance bottlenecks in React and Next.js applications"],"zh":["消除渲染树中的瀑布","实现包和树 shaking 以实现优化的代码交付","调试 React 和 Next.js 应用程序中的性能瓶颈"],"ja":["レンダリングツリー内のウォーターフォールを排除する","バンドルとツリーシェイキングを実施して最適化されたコードを配信する","React と Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスボトルネックをデバッグする"],"ko":["렌더링 트리 내의 폭포를 제거하는 것","번들 및 트리 쉐이킹을 구현하여 최적화된 코드 전달을 위한","React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능 병목 현상을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Eliminar cascadas en árboles de representación","Implementar bundle y tree shaking para una entrega de código optimizada","Depurar cuellos de botella de rendimiento en aplicaciones de React y Next.js"],"fr":["Éliminer les cascades dans les arbres de représentation","Mettre en œuvre le bundle et le tree shaking pour une livraison de code optimisée","Déboguer les goulots d''étranglement des performances dans les applications React et Next.js"],"de":["Beseitigen von Wasserfällen in Renderbäumen","Implementieren von Bundle und Tree Shaking für eine optimierte Codeauslieferung","Debuggen von Leistungsengpässen in React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Eliminação de cachoeiras (waterfalls) em árvores de renderização","Implementação de bundle e tree shaking para entrega de código otimizado","Depuração de gargalos de desempenho em aplicações React e Next.js"],"ru":["Устранение водопадов (waterfalls) в деревьях рендеринга","Внедрение bundle и tree shaking для оптимизированной доставки кода","Отладка узких мест производительности в приложениях React и Next.js"],"ar":["القضاء على الشلالات في أشجار التصيير","تنفيذ حزم وهز الشجرة لتسليم الكود المحسن","تصحيح اختناقات الأداء في تطبيقات React و Next.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application","Limited to Vercel-standard performance optimizations"],"zh":["需要 React 或 Next.js 应用程序","仅限 Vercel 标准的性能优化"],"ja":["React または Next.js アプリケーションが必要","Vercel 標準のパフォーマンス最適化のみ"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 애플리케이션이 필요함","Vercel 표준의 성능 최적화만 제한"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación de React o Next.js","Limitado a optimizaciones de rendimiento estándar de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite une application React ou Next.js","Limité aux optimisations de performances standard de Vercel"],"de":["Erfordert eine React- oder Next.js-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf Vercel-Standardleistungsoptimierungen"],"pt":["Requer aplicação React ou Next.js","Limitado às otimizações de desempenho padrão Vercel"],"ru":["Требует приложение React или Next.js","Ограничено оптимизациями производительности стандарта Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق React أو Next.js","يقتصر على تحسينات الأداء القياسية لـ Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
