성 향상"],"es":["Crea migraciones con timestamp","Sincroniza tipos de TypeScript","Auditoría de esquemas para políticas de seguridad","Genera definiciones de TypeScript","Proporciona pasos siguientes para la sincronización de tipos","Escanea migraciones para detectar políticas de seguridad de nivel de fila"],"fr":["Crée des migrations avec timestamp","Synchronise les types TypeScript","Audit de schémas pour les politiques de sécurité","Génère des définitions TypeScript","Fournit les étapes suivantes pour la synchronisation des types","Analyse les migrations pour détecter les politiques de sécurité de niveau de ligne"],"de":["Erstellt Migrationen mit Timestamp","Synchronisiert TypeScript-Typen","Schema-Audit für Sicherheitsrichtlinien","Generiert TypeScript-Definitionen","Bietet nächste Schritte für die Typsynchronisation","Scannen von Migrationen zur Erkennung von Sicherheitsrichtlinien auf Zeilenebene"],"pt":["Criação de migrações","Sincronização de tipos","Auditoria de esquema","Aplicação de padrões de segurança","Geração de definições de tipo","Suporte a Row Level Security (RLS)"],"ru":["Создание миграций","Синхронизация типов","Аудит схемы","Применение стандартов безопасности","Генерация определений типов","Поддержка Row Level Security (RLS)"],"ar":["إنشاء عمليات النقل","مزامنة الأنواع","فحص مخطط قاعدة البيانات","تطبيق معايير الأمان","إنشاء تعريفات النوع","دعم أمان مستوى الصف (RLS)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Supabase","数据库生命周期","自动化","安全标准","开发效率","迁移","类型同步","模式审计"],"ja":["Supabase","データベースライフサイクル","自動化","セキュリティ標準","開発効率","マイグレーション","タイプ同期","スキーマ監査"],"ko":["Supabase","데이터베이스 생명주기","자동화","보안 표준","개발 효율성","마이그레이션","타입 동기화","스키마 감사"],"es":["Supabase","arquitecto de Supabase","migraciones de base de datos","sincronización de tipos","seguridad de base de datos","Row Level Security","TypeScript","desarrollo de bases de datos"],"fr":["Supabase","architecte Supabase","migrations de base de données","synchronisation de types","sécurité de base de données","Row Level Security","TypeScript","développement de bases de données"],"de":["Supabase","Supabase-Architekt","Datenbankmigrationen","Typsynchronisation","Datenbanksicherheit","Row Level Security","TypeScript","Datenbankentwicklung"],"pt":["Supabase","Arquiteto Supabase","Automatização do ciclo de vida do banco de dados","Segurança do banco de dados","Migrações de banco de dados","Sincronização de tipos","Auditoria de esquema","Row Level Security (RLS)","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Supabase","Архитектор Supabase","Автоматизация жизненного цикла базы данных","Безопасность базы данных","Миграции базы данных","Синхронизация типов","Аудит схемы","Row Level Security (RLS)","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Supabase","معماري Supabase","تلقائي دورة حياة قاعدة البيانات","أمان قاعدة البيانات","نقل قاعدة البيانات","مزامنة الأنواع","فحص مخطط قاعدة البيانات","أمان مستوى الصف (RLS)","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"sf-bcca","repo":"PromptArchitect-Studio","repoPath":"sf-bcca/PromptArchitect-Studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-architect","description":"Automates Supabase workflows including migrations, type synchronization, and schema security audits. Use when creating new database tables, updating schemas, or ensuring RLS compliance.","bodyPreview":"# Supabase Architect\n\nThis skill automates the database lifecycle and enforces security standards for Supabase.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1.  **Create Migrations**: Generates timestamped migrations and provides next steps for type syncing.\n2.  **Synchronize Types**: Regenerates TypeScript definitions from the local Supabase instance.\n3.  **Audit Schema**: Scans migrations for missing Row Level Security (RLS) policies.\n\n## Usage\n\n### 1. Create a New Migration\nUse this to create a new schema change file.","body":"# Supabase Architect\n\nThis skill automates the database lifecycle and enforces security standards for Supabase.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1.  **Create Migrations**: Generates timestamped migrations and provides next steps for type syncing.\n2.  **Synchronize Types**: Regenerates TypeScript definitions from the local Supabase instance.\n3.  **Audit Schema**: Scans migrations for missing Row Level Security (RLS) policies.\n\n## Usage\n\n### 1. Create a New Migration\nUse this to create a new schema change file.\n```bash\nnode .gemini/skills/supabase-architect/scripts/create_migration.cjs <migration_name>\n```\n\n### 2. Sync Types\nRun this after applying migrations to update your TypeScript types.\n```bash\nnode .gemini/skills/supabase-architect/scripts/sync_types.cjs\n```\n\n### 3. Audit Migrations\nRun this to check for security anti-patterns like missing RLS.\n```bash\nnode .gemini/skills/supabase-architect/scripts/audit_schema.cjs\n```\n\n## Reference\nSee [conventions.md](references/conventions.md) for project-specific SQL standards and RLS patterns.\n\n## Workflow\n1. **Plan**: Define the schema change in your task''s `plan.md`.\n2. **Create**: Run `create_migration.cjs`.\n3. **Implement**: Add SQL to the generated file in `supabase/migrations/`.\n4. **Audit**: Run `audit_schema.cjs` to verify RLS.\n5. **Apply**: Run `npx supabase db reset` (local).\n6. **Sync**: Run `sync_types.cjs` to update `types_db.ts`."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:52:32.579Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","zh":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","ja":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","ko":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","es":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","fr":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","de":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","pt":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","ru":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase.","ar":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated database lifecycle management and security enforcement for Supabase."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, and audit schema for Row Level Security (RLS) policies, ensuring a secure and up-to-date Supabase instance using timestamped migrations and TypeScript definitions.","zh":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, and audit schema for Row Level Security (RLS) policies, ensuring a secure and up-to-date Supabase instance using timestamped migrations and TypeScript definitions.","ja":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, and audit schema for Row Level Security (RLS) policies, ensuring a secure and up-to-date Supabase instance using timestamped migrations and TypeScript definitions.","ko":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, and audit schema for Row Level Security (RLS) policies, ensuring a secure and up-to-date Supabase instance using timestamped migrations and TypeScript definitions.","es":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, and audit schema for Row Level Security (RLS) policies, ensuring a secure and up-to-date Supabase instance using timestamped migrations and TypeScript definitions.","fr":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, and audit schema for Row Level Security (RLS) policies, ensuring a secure and up-to-date Supabase instance using timestamped migrations and TypeScript definitions.","de":"Empowers agents to automate migrations, synchronize types, 