Markdownファイルを''ディスクワークメモリ''として使用","task_plan.md、findings.md、progress.mdファイルを作成して進度と研究を記録","タスク管理と記録の効率を向上","開発者のワークフローをサポート","使用しやすい","生産性を向上"],"ko":["영속적인 Markdown 파일을 ''디스크 작업 메모리''로 사용","task_plan.md, findings.md, progress.md 파일을 생성하여 진행 상황과 연구를 기록","작업 관리와 기록의 효율성을 향상","개발자의 워크플ロー 지원","사용하기 쉽고 이해하기 쉬움","생산성을 향상"],"pt":["Utilização de arquivos markdown como memória de trabalho","Organização de tarefas complexas em fases e progresso","Armazenamento de pesquisas e descobertas em arquivos","Registro de sessões e resultados de testes","Melhoria da produtividade e eficiência"],"ru":["Использование файлов markdown как рабочей памяти","Организация сложных задач в фазы и прогресс","Хранение исследований и открытий в файлах","Запись сессий и результатов тестов","Повышение производительности и эффективности"],"ar":["استخدام ملفات markdown كذاكرة عمل","تنظيم المهام المعقدة في مراحل و تقدم","تخزين البحوث والاكتشافات في الملفات","تسجيل الدورات و نتائج الاختبارات","تحسين الإنتاجية والكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文件规划","任务管理","Markdown文件","持久性存储","开发人员工具","生产力提高","工作流程优化","任务记录","研究管理"],"ja":["ファイル計画","タスク管理","Markdownファイル","持続性ストレージ","開発者ツール","生産性向上","ワークフロー最適化","タスク記録","研究管理"],"ko":["파일 계획","작업 관리","Markdown 파일","영속성 저장","개발자 도구","생산성 향상","워크플ロー 최적화","작업 기록","연구 관리"],"pt":["planejamento com arquivos","arquivos markdown","produtividade","eficiência","organização de tarefas","gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["планирование с помощью файлов","файлы markdown","производительность","эффективность","организация задач","управление проектами"],"ar":["التخطيط مع الملفات","ملفات markdown","الإنتاجية","الكفاءة","تنظيم المهام","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"amano--","repo":"call-center","repoPath":"amano--/call-center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"planning-with-files","description":"Implements Manus-style file-based planning for complex tasks. Creates task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md. Use when starting complex multi-step tasks, research projects, or any task requiring >5 tool calls.","bodyPreview":"# Planning with Files\n\nWork like Manus: Use persistent markdown files as your \"working memory on disk.\"\n\n## Core Principle\n\n```\nContext Window = RAM (volatile, limited)\nFilesystem = Disk (persistent, unlimited)\n\n→ Anything important gets written to disk.\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\nBefore ANY complex task, create these three files:\n\n1. **task_plan.md** — Track phases and progress\n2. **findings.md** — Store research and discoveries\n3. **progress.md** — Session log and test results\n\nSee references/ for s","body":"# Planning with Files\n\nWork like Manus: Use persistent markdown files as your \"working memory on disk.\"\n\n## Core Principle\n\n```\nContext Window = RAM (volatile, limited)\nFilesystem = Disk (persistent, unlimited)\n\n→ Anything important gets written to disk.\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\nBefore ANY complex task, create these three files:\n\n1. **task_plan.md** — Track phases and progress\n2. **findings.md** — Store research and discoveries\n3. **progress.md** — Session log and test results\n\nSee references/ for starting templates.\n\n## File Purposes\n\n| File | Purpose | When to Update |\n|------|---------|----------------|\n| `task_plan.md` | Phases, progress, decisions | After each phase |\n| `findings.md` | Research, discoveries | After ANY discovery |\n| `progress.md` | Session log, test results | Throughout session |\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. Create Plan First\nNever start a complex task without `task_plan.md`. Non-negotiable.\n\n### 2. The 2-Action Rule\n> \"After every 2 view/browser/search operations, IMMEDIATELY save key findings to text files.\"\n\nThis prevents visual/multimodal information from being lost.\n\n### 3. Read Before Decide\nBefore major decisions, read the plan file. This keeps goals in your attention window.\n\n### 4. Update After Act\nAfter completing any phase:\n- Mark phase status: `in_progress` → `complete`\n- Log any errors encountered\n- Note files created/modified\n\n### 5. Log ALL Errors\nEvery error goes in the plan file. This builds knowledge and prevents repetition.\n\n### 6. Never Repeat Failures\n```\nif action_failed:\n    next_action != same_action\n```\nTrack what you tried. Mutate the approach.\n\n## The 3-Strike Error Protocol\n\n```\nATTEMPT 1: Diagnose & Fix\n  → Read error carefully\n  → Identify root cause\n  → Apply targeted fix\n\nATTEMPT 2: Alternative Approach\n  → Same error? Try different method\n  → Different tool? Different library?\n  → NEVER repeat exact same failing action\n\nATTEMPT 3: Broader Rethink\n  → Question assumptions\n  → Search for solutions\n  → Consider updating the plan\n\nAFTER 3 FAILURES: Escalate to User\n  → Explain what you tried\n  → Share the specific error\n  → Ask for guidance\n```\n\n## When to Use This Pattern\n\n**Use for:**\n- Multi-step tasks (3+ steps)\n- Research tasks\n- Building/creating projects\n- Tasks spanning many tool calls\n\n**Skip for:**\n- Simple questions\n- Single-file edits\n- Quick lookups\n\n## Templates\n\n- references/task_plan.md — Phase tracking template\n- references/findings.md — Research storage template\n- references/progress.md — Session logging template\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n- **Manus Principles:** See references.md for complete context engineering patterns\n- **Real Examples:** See examples.md for practical implementations\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Do Instead |\n|-------|------------|\n| State goals once and forget | Re-read plan before decisions |\n| Hide errors and retry silently | Log errors to plan file |\n| Stuff everything in context | Store large content in files |\n| Start executing immediately | Create plan file FIRST |\n| Repeat failed actions | Track attempts, mutate approach |\n\n---\n\n**This pattern is why Manus went from launch to $2B acquisition in 8 months.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:52:33.645Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","zh":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","ja":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","ko":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","es":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","fr":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","de":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","pt":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","ru":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention.","ar":"Ideal for Productivity Agents leveraging markdown files for task management and knowledge retention."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","zh":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","ja":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","ko":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","es":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","fr":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","de":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","pt":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","ru":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage.","ar":"Empowers agents to utilize persistent markdown files as a working memory on disk, enabling efficient task planning with files like task_plan.md, findings.md, and progress.md, and seamlessly integrating with filesystems for unlimited storage."},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"zh":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"ja":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"ko":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"es":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"fr":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"de":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"pt":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"ru":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"],"ar":["Organizing complex tasks with task_plan.md","Storing research findings in findings.md","Logging session progress in progress.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"zh":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"ja":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"ko":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"es":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"fr":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"de":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"pt":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"ru":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"],"ar":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to markdown file format"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
