ute performance entre les environnements locaux et cloud","de":"Konfigurieren Sie die sichere und hochleistungsfähige Konnektivität zwischen lokalen und Cloud-Umgebungen","pt":"Configure redes de nuvem híbrida seguras e de alto desempenho para conectar ambientes locais e na nuvem.","ru":"Настройте безопасные и высокопроизводительные гибридные облачные сети для подключения локальных и облачных сред.","ar":"اكتشف كيفية تكوين شبكات سحابية гибريد آمنة وذات أداء عالي للاتصال بين البيئات المحلية وعلى السحاب.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持VPN、Direct Connect和ExpressRoute","实现本地数据中心与云提供商之间的安全可靠连接","支持混合云架构","满足合规性要求","渐进式迁移到云"],"ja":["VPN、Direct Connect、ExpressRouteをサポート","オンプレミスデータセンターとクラウドプロバイダー間の安全で信頼性の高い接続を実現","ハイブリッドクラウドアーキテクチャをサポート","コンプライアンス要件を満たす","クラウドへの段階的な移行"],"ko":["VPN, Direct Connect, ExpressRoute 지원","온프레미스 데이터 센터와 클라우드 제공업체 간의 보안 및 안정적인 연결을 구축","하이브리드 클라우드 아키텍처 지원","컴플라이언스 요구사항 충족","클라우드への渐进式 이전"],"es":["Conectividad segura con VPN","Conexión directa con Direct Connect","Ruta expresa con ExpressRoute","Configuración de redes híbridas activas-activas","Cumplimiento de requisitos de conformidad","Migración gradual a la nube"],"fr":["Connectivité sécurisée avec VPN","Connexion directe avec Direct Connect","Route express avec ExpressRoute","Configuration de réseaux hybrides actifs-actifs","Respect des exigences de conformité","Migration progressive vers le cloud"],"de":["Sichere Konnektivität mit VPN","Direkte Verbindung mit Direct Connect","Express-Route mit ExpressRoute","Konfiguration von Hybrid-Netzwerken aktiv-aktiv","Einhaltung von Konformitätsanforderungen","Schrittweise Migration in die Cloud"],"pt":["Conectividade segura via VPN","Conectividade direta via Direct Connect e ExpressRoute","Configuração de ambientes híbridos ativos","Atendimento aos requisitos de conformidade","Migração gradual para a nuvem"],"ru":["Безопасное подключение через VPN","Прямое подключение через Direct Connect и ExpressRoute","Настройка гибридных активных сред","Соблюдение требований соответствия","Постепенная миграция в облако"],"ar":["اتصال آمن عبر بروتوكول الانترنت الافتراضي","اتصال مباشر عبر الاتصال المباشر وطريق التعبير","تكوين بيئات هجينة نشطة","الامتثال لمتطلبات التوافق","هجرة تدريجية إلى السحاب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["混合云网络","本地数据中心","云提供商","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","混合云架构","合规性要求"],"ja":["ハイブリッドクラウドネットワーキング","オンプレミスデータセンター","クラウドプロバイダー","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","ハイブリッドクラウドアーキテクチャ","コンプライアンス要件"],"ko":["하이브리드 클라우드 네트워킹","온프레미스 데이터 센터","클라우드 제공업체","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","하이브리드 클라우드 아키텍처","컴플라이언스 요구사항"],"es":["redes híbridas en la nube","conectividad segura","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","migración a la nube","cumplimiento de requisitos de conformidad"],"fr":["réseaux hybrides cloud","connectivité sécurisée","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","migration vers le cloud","respect des exigences de conformité"],"de":["Hybrid-Cloud-Netzwerke","sichere Konnektivität","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","Migration in die Cloud","Einhaltung von Konformitätsanforderungen"],"pt":["rede de nuvem híbrida","conectividade segura","nuvem híbrida","ambientes locais","conectividade na nuvem","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute"],"ru":["гибридная облачная сеть","безопасное подключение","гибридное облако","локальные среды","облачное подключение","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute"],"ar":["شبكة سحابية гибريد","اتصال آمن","سحابية هجينة","بيئات محلية","اتصال السحاب","بروتوكول الانترنت الافتراضي","الاتصال المباشر","طريق التعبير"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hybrid-cloud-networking","description":"Configure secure, high-performance connectivity between on-premises infrastructure and cloud platforms using VPN and dedicated connections. Use when building hybrid cloud architectures, connecting data centers to cloud, or implementing secure cross-premises networking.","bodyPreview":"# Hybrid Cloud Networking\n\nConfigure secure, high-performance connectivity between on-premises and cloud environments using VPN, Direct Connect, and ExpressRoute.\n\n## Purpose\n\nEstablish secure, reliable network connectivity between on-premises data centers and cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Connect on-premises to cloud\n- Extend datacenter to cloud\n- Implement hybrid active-active setups\n- Meet compliance requirements\n- Migrate to cloud gradually\n\n## Connection Options\n\n###","body":"# Hybrid Cloud Networking\n\nConfigure secure, high-performance connectivity between on-premises and cloud environments using VPN, Direct Connect, and ExpressRoute.\n\n## Purpose\n\nEstablish secure, reliable network connectivity between on-premises data centers and cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Connect on-premises to cloud\n- Extend datacenter to cloud\n- Implement hybrid active-active setups\n- Meet compliance requirements\n- Migrate to cloud gradually\n\n## Connection Options\n\n### AWS Connectivity\n\n#### 1. Site-to-Site VPN\n\n- IPSec VPN over internet\n- Up to 1.25 Gbps per tunnel\n- Cost-effective for moderate bandwidth\n- Higher latency, internet-dependent\n\n```hcl\nresource \"aws_vpn_gateway\" \"main\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n  tags = {\n    Name = \"main-vpn-gateway\"\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_customer_gateway\" \"main\" {\n  bgp_asn    = 65000\n  ip_address = \"203.0.113.1\"\n  type       = \"ipsec.1\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_vpn_connection\" \"main\" {\n  vpn_gateway_id      = aws_vpn_gateway.main.id\n  customer_gateway_id = aws_customer_gateway.main.id\n  type                = \"ipsec.1\"\n  static_routes_only  = false\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. AWS Direct Connect\n\n- Dedicated network connection\n- 1 Gbps to 100 Gbps\n- Lower latency, consistent bandwidth\n- More expensive, setup time required\n\n**Reference:** See `references/direct-connect.md`\n\n### Azure Connectivity\n\n#### 1. Site-to-Site VPN\n\n```hcl\nresource \"azurerm_virtual_network_gateway\" \"vpn\" {\n  name                = \"vpn-gateway\"\n  location            = azurerm_resource_group.main.location\n  resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name\n\n  type     = \"Vpn\"\n  vpn_type = \"RouteBased\"\n  sku      = \"VpnGw1\"\n\n  ip_configuration {\n    name                          = \"vnetGatewayConfig\"\n    public_ip_address_id          = azurerm_public_ip.vpn.id\n    private_ip_address_allocation = \"Dynamic\"\n    subnet_id                     = azurerm_subnet.gateway.id\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. Azure ExpressRoute\n\n- Private connection via connectivity provider\n- Up to 100 Gbps\n- Low latency, high reliability\n- Premium for global connectivity\n\n### GCP Connectivity\n\n#### 1. Cloud VPN\n\n- IPSec VPN (Classic or HA VPN)\n- HA VPN: 99.99% SLA\n- Up to 3 Gbps per tunnel\n\n#### 2. Cloud Interconnect\n\n- Dedicated (10 Gbps, 100 Gbps)\n- Partner (50 Mbps to 50 Gbps)\n- Lower latency than VPN\n\n## Hybrid Network Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hub-and-Spoke\n\n```\nOn-Premises Datacenter\n         ↓\n    VPN/Direct Connect\n         ↓\n    Transit Gateway (AWS) / vWAN (Azure)\n         ↓\n    ├─ Production VPC/VNet\n    ├─ Staging VPC/VNet\n    └─ Development VPC/VNet\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Region Hybrid\n\n```\nOn-Premises\n    ├─ Direct Connect → us-east-1\n    └─ Direct Connect → us-west-2\n            ↓\n        Cross-Region Peering\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Cloud Hybrid\n\n```\nOn-Premises Datacenter\n    ├─ Direct Connect → AWS\n    ├─ ExpressRoute → Azure\n    └─ Interconnect → GCP\n```\n\n## Routing Configuration\n\n### BGP Configuration\n\n```\nOn-Premises Router:\n- AS Number: 65000\n- Advertise: 10.0.0.0/8\n\nCloud Router:\n- AS Number: 64512 (AWS), 65515 (Azure)\n- Advertise: Cloud VPC/VNet CIDRs\n```\n\n### Route Propagation\n\n- Enable route propagation on route tables\n- Use BGP for dynamic routing\n- Implement route filtering\n- Monitor route advertisements\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n1. **Use private connectivity** (Direct Connect/ExpressRoute)\n2. **Implement encryption** for VPN tunnels\n3. **Use VPC endpoints** to avoid internet routing\n4. **Configure network ACLs** and security groups\n5. **Enable VPC Flow Logs** for monitoring\n6. **Implement DDoS protection**\n7. **Use PrivateLink/Private Endpoints**\n8. **Monitor connections** with CloudWatch/Monitor\n9. **Implement redundancy** (dual tunnels)\n10. **Regular security audits**\n\n## High Availability\n\n### Dual VPN Tunnels\n\n```hcl\nresource \"aws_vpn_connection\" \"primary\" {\n  vpn_gateway_id      = aws_vpn_gateway.main.id\n  customer_gateway_id = aws_customer_gateway.primary.id\n  type                = \"ipsec.1\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_vpn_connection\" \"secondary\" {\n  vpn_gateway_id      = aws_vpn_gateway.main.id\n  customer_gateway_id = aws_customer_gateway.secondary.id\n  type                = \"ipsec.1\"\n}\n```\n\n### Active-Active Configuration\n\n- Multiple connections from different locations\n- BGP for automatic failover\n- Equal-cost multi-path (ECMP) routing\n- Monitor health of all connections\n\n## Monitoring and Troubleshooting\n\n### Key Metrics\n\n- Tunnel status (up/down)\n- Bytes in/out\n- Packet loss\n- Latency\n- BGP session status\n\n### Troubleshooting\n\n```bash\n# AWS VPN\naws ec2 describe-vpn-connections\naws ec2 get-vpn-connection-telemetry\n\n# Azure VPN\naz network vpn-connection show\naz network vpn-connection show-device-config-script\n```\n\n## Cost Optimization\n\n1. **Right-size connections** based on traffic\n2. **Use VPN for low-bandwidth** workloads\n3. **Consolidate traffic** through fewer connections\n4. **Minimize data transfer** costs\n5. **Use Direct Connect** for high bandwidth\n6. **Implement caching** to reduce traffic\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/vpn-setup.md` - VPN configuration guide\n- `references/direct-connect.md` - Direct Connect setup\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `multi-cloud-architecture` - For architecture decisions\n- `terraform-module-library` - For IaC implementation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T14:52:36.705Z","qualityScore":45}');
